l Graphic Design Exhibition）","name_en":"2000 Beijing International Graphic Design Exhibition","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["2000","平面设计","国际展览","中国美术馆","北京"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2000 年 12 月 15 日，“2000 北京国际平面设计展”在北京中国美术馆展出。来源只记日期、地点与展览名称，未记主办单位、参展国家与设计师、展品数量与观众。","path":"events/2000-beijing-intl-graphic-design-exhibition.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"2000 北京国际平面设计展是 C 维度下平面设计国际交流的节点，其设计产业与教育背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:2000-cad-industrial-design-conference","title":"第三届计算机辅助工业设计及计算机辅助概念设计国际会议（Third International Conference on Computer-Aided Industrial Design and Conceptual Design）","name_en":"Third International Conference on Computer-Aided Industrial Design and Conceptual Design","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["2000","计算机辅助设计","工业设计","国际会议","香港"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2000 年 11 月 26 至 28 日，第三届计算机辅助工业设计及计算机辅助概念设计国际会议在香港举行。来源只记会议名称、时间与地点，未记主办单位、议题、论文与参会人数。来源前文另称计算机辅助设计（CAD）已成为现代工业设计最重要的手段。","path":"events/2000-cad-industrial-design-conference.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"第三届 CAD 国际会议是 E 维度下计算机技术与工业设计结合的节点，其工业设计方法归 B/D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:2000-china-craft-art-exhibition","title":"中国工艺美术精品展（China Arts and Crafts Masterworks Exhibition）","name_en":"China Arts and Crafts Masterworks Exhibition","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["2000","中国工艺美术精品展","南京","中国艺术节","展览"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2000 年 9 月下旬，中国艺术节活动项目“中国工艺美术精品展”在南京举行。来源只记时间、地点、活动性质与名称，未记主办单位、展品数量与观众。","path":"events/2000-china-craft-art-exhibition.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国工艺美术精品展是 D 维度下工艺美术借中国艺术节展示的节点，其工艺本体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:2000-national-folk-craft-art-exhibition","title":"中国民族民间工艺美术大展（China Ethnic and Folk Arts and Crafts Exhibition）","name_en":"China Ethnic and Folk Arts and Crafts Exhibition","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["2000","民族民间工艺","成都","展览","工艺美术"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2000 年 5 月 14 日，“中国民族民间工艺美术大展”在四川成都举行。来源只记日期、地点与展览名称，未记主办单位、展品数量、参展地区与观众。","path":"events/2000-national-folk-craft-art-exhibition.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国民族民间工艺美术大展是 D 维度下民族民间工艺展示与保护的节点，其工艺本体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:2000-shanghai-eco-landscape-avenue","title":"上海生态景观大道建成（Completion of Shanghai's First Ecological Landscape Avenue）","name_en":"Completion of Shanghai's First Ecological Landscape Avenue","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["2000","上海","生态景观大道","城市设计","景观设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2000 年年初，上海建成中国第一条生态景观大道，来源称它是上海迎接新世纪的标志性工程。来源只给这一判断，未给道路名称、长度、设计单位、植物配置与建成验收信息。","path":"events/2000-shanghai-eco-landscape-avenue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"上海生态景观大道是 B 维度下城市道路与景观设计结合的节点，其城市现代化与生态观念归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:6th-century-fangzhi-jishu-waichuan","title":"中国纺织印染技术外传（Diffusion of Chinese Textile and Dyeing Technology Abroad）","name_en":"Diffusion of Chinese Textile and Dyeing Technology Abroad","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["魏晋南北朝","纺织技术","提花机","蚕种","和服"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖记我国先进的纺织印染技术随丝绸的远销而迅速向外传播。公元 6 世纪，脚踏纺车、提花机通过阿富汗、伊朗等国传到西方，一些熟练的工匠还到中亚、西亚传授纺织工艺。日本多次派专使到江浙一带寻求工匠传艺；至今日本寿命寺内还藏有东渡日本的中国纺织女工的画像；日本的民族服装“和服”早在三国时期就用江浙一带的丝绸制成，故亦称“吴服”。6 世纪时，波斯派人来中国学习养蚕丝织技术，临走时将蚕种装在竹筒里带回波斯","path":"events/6th-century-fangzhi-jishu-waichuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"纺织印染技术外传是 E 维度下中国技术跨文化传播的节点，其工具与工艺形制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:anshi-zhiluan","title":"安史之乱（An Lushan Rebellion）","name_en":"An Lushan Rebellion","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["唐代","战乱","中晚唐","五代十国","分期背景"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"安史之乱是唐中叶的战乱。田自秉记“安史之乱”后国势日衰，并以之为唐灭亡后五代十国分裂局面的背景；2016 版称其战火破坏唐朝社会安定与经济繁荣，使中晚唐地方割据势力抬头，最终形成五代十国。两册均未给具体年份。","path":"events/anshi-zhiluan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"安史之乱是 E 维度下唐代由盛转衰的分期事件，主要用于解释中晚唐工艺与地方窑业格局的变化。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:banama-saihui","title":"巴拿马赛会（Panama-Pacific International Exposition）","name_en":"Panama-Pacific International Exposition","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1915年","巴拿马赛会","博览会","中国参展","工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"巴拿马赛会全称“太平洋万国巴拿马博览会”，是美国为庆祝巴拿马运河正式通航举办的盛会，1915年2月20日开幕，历时280天，设美术、教育、工艺、制造等12个馆。中国展品重约1500吨，参加赛会的著名手工艺匠师和工场代表约300多人。2016 版同记名称、开幕日、280天、12馆与300多人，未记展品吨位。田自秉另从北京雕漆的角度记其事：北京雕漆由明代果园厂发展而来，明代永乐、清代乾隆两朝生产都曾兴","path":"events/banama-saihui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"巴拿马赛会是 E 维度下中国工艺参加国际博览会、进入跨文化展示体系的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:bauhaus-exhibition-hongkong-1989","title":"“包豪斯——现代艺术设计的革命”展览（Bauhaus: Revolution in Modern Art and Design Exhibition）","name_en":"Bauhaus: Revolution in Modern Art and Design Exhibition","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1989","包豪斯","现代艺术设计","香港","展览"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1989 年 2 月中旬，由德国史图嘉德海外文化关系部筹划、香港艺术中心等单位联合主办的“包豪斯——现代艺术设计的革命”在香港文化艺术中心展出。来源只记展览的筹划、主办、时间与地点，未记展品、图录与观众。","path":"events/bauhaus-exhibition-hongkong-1989.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"包豪斯展览是 E 维度下现代设计观念跨境传播的节点，其设计教育思想归 A/D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:beijing-ten-great-buildings","title":"北京十大建筑（The Ten Great Buildings of Beijing）","name_en":"The Ten Great Buildings of Beijing","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1958","1959","北京十大建筑","人民大会堂","室内设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"为迎接新中国成立 10 周年，中央人民政府从 1958 年 9 月确定国庆工程建设任务，决定在北京兴建人民大会堂等十项大型建筑项目。人民大会堂是新中国建筑设计和施工集体创造的典范，设计力图吸收中外建筑艺术精华，追求“中而新”的风格；民族文化宫是民族形式在高层建筑中的尝试；中国美术馆的彩画、木雕等装饰是传统工艺与现代建筑结合的成功范例。人民大会堂室内设计首次聘请装饰设计专家和画家、雕塑家配合建筑师，","path":"events/beijing-ten-great-buildings.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"北京十大建筑是 B 维度下新中国纪念性建筑与室内设计的核心样本，其国家意志与设计组织归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:boyan-collects-song-regalia","title":"1272年伯颜收取宋宫冕服图籍（Bayan Collects Song Court Regalia and Archives）","name_en":"Bayan Collects Song Court Regalia and Archives","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["元代","伯颜","冕服","图籍","汉制"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代男子服饰在至元十二年（1272）以前基本穿着原先的民族服装。到 1272 年，元代右丞相伯颜遣人入宋宫收取宋代的衮冕、圭壁、符玺及图籍、宝玩、车辂、仪仗等，来源称元代“开始借鉴汉代生活习俗才逐步改变服饰”。同段记蒙古男子发式：额上留一小绺如桃子，其余编成两条辫子，绕成两个大环垂在耳后，头戴笠子帽。","path":"events/boyan-collects-song-regalia.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"伯颜收取宋宫冕服图籍是 D 维度下元代宫廷服制与仪仗制度转向汉制的节点，其跨文化采纳属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:capital-ten-buildings-art-conference-1958","title":"首都十大建筑美术工作会议（Capital Ten Great Buildings Art Work Conference）","name_en":"Capital Ten Great Buildings Art Work Conference","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1958","首都十大建筑","美术工作会议","北京"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1958 年 11 月 10 日，“首都十大建筑美术工作会议”在北京举行。来源只记会议名称、时间与地点，未记主办单位、参加人员、议程与决议。它出现在 1958 年 9 月确定国庆工程之后，可与北京十大建筑的设计组织过程并置观察。","path":"events/capital-ten-buildings-art-conference-1958.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"首都十大建筑美术工作会议是 D 维度下国家大型建筑美术组织与协作的节点，其建筑与装饰成果归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:chenqiao-mutiny","title":"陈桥驿兵变（Chenqiao Mutiny）","name_en":"Chenqiao Mutiny","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["960","陈桥驿兵变","赵匡胤","北宋","杯酒释兵权"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记北宋的出现缘于后周大将赵匡胤于 960 年的陈桥驿兵变。赵匡胤痛感唐末以来藩镇割据、重将拥兵的流弊，以“杯酒释兵权”化解君臣矛盾，消除心腹之患，稳定政治时局；接着又以“守内虚外”的方针改革政权体制，使皇帝集大权于一身。来源未给兵变过程、拥立细节与杯酒释兵权的具体对话。田自秉另记公元 960 年后周大将赵匡胤夺取政权，建立宋朝，定都东京（今开封），历史上称作北宋，结束了唐末以来的分裂割据的局面","path":"events/chenqiao-mutiny.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陈桥驿兵变是 D 维度下北宋建立与中央集权体制形成的政治节点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:china-art-expo-design-1997","title":"“'97 中国艺术大展·中国当代艺术设计展”（1997 China Art Exhibition: Chinese Contemporary Art and Design Exhibition）","name_en":"1997 China Art Exhibition: Chinese Contemporary Art and Design Exhibition","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1997","中国艺术大展","当代艺术设计","中国美术馆","学术报告会"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1997 年 6 月 23 日至 7 月 3 日，由文化部主办、中国工业设计协会等协办的“'97 中国艺术大展·中国当代艺术设计展”在北京中国美术馆展出。6 月 29 日，由北京工业设计促进会、中央工艺美术学院联合主办的“中国当代艺术设计展学术报告会”在北京举行，来自美国、日本和中国香港地区的设计家先后作专题报告。","path":"events/china-art-expo-design-1997.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"“'97 中国艺术大展·中国当代艺术设计展”是 E 维度下中国当代设计整体展示与理论讨论的节点，其设计门类归 C/B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:computer-art-symposium-1995","title":"首届中国计算机艺术研讨会暨作品展示会（The First Chinese Computer Art Symposium and Exhibition）","name_en":"The First Chinese Computer Art Symposium and Exhibition","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1995","计算机艺术","数字媒体设计","中央工艺美术学院","研讨会"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1995 年 3 月 15 至 19 日，由国家科委和计算机学会主办，中央工艺美术学院、中国美术学院、东南大学等高校承办的“首届中国计算机艺术研讨会暨作品展示会”在北京举行。来源把它列为 1995 年设计界的事件之一。","path":"events/computer-art-symposium-1995.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"首届中国计算机艺术研讨会是 E 维度下数字技术与艺术设计结合的节点，其设计教育组织归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:craft-recovery-transformation-1950s","title":"新中国初期工艺美术生产的恢复与改造（Recovery and Reorganization of Arts and Crafts Production in the Early PRC）","name_en":"Recovery and Reorganization of Arts and Crafts Production in the Early PRC","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["新中国","工艺美术","生产自救","合作化","集体所有制"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"自 20 世纪 50 年代起，人民政府采取一系列措施，扶持手工业失业人员生产自救，将分散的民间艺人组织起来，走合作化道路，建社办厂，陆续建立一批具有典型示范性的工艺美术生产合作社。传统工艺美术技艺得以传承和保留；经过生产体制改造，形成以集体所有制经济形式为主体，城乡结合、专业生产与副业加工结合的生产体系。周恩来曾把传统工艺美术比作“石头加人工等于外汇”的行业。20 世纪 50 年代初，外贸口岸恢复","path":"events/craft-recovery-transformation-1950s.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"新中国初期工艺美术生产的恢复与改造是 D 维度下生产体制与行业组织的节点，其产品与技艺传承归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:crafts-artist-title-1979","title":"授予“工艺美术家”荣誉称号（Conferral of the Arts and Crafts Master Title）","name_en":"Conferral of the Arts and Crafts Master Title","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1979","工艺美术家","杨士惠","轻工业部","中国工艺美术学会"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1979 年 8 月 8 至 16 日，轻工业部在北京召开全国工艺美术艺人、创作设计人员代表大会，会议授予杨士惠等 34 人优秀艺人、设计人员“工艺美术家”荣誉称号。8 月 11 日，中国工艺美术学会在北京恢复。来源另记同年 1 月 19 日至 2 月 14 日中国工艺美术展览在日本东京、大阪举行。","path":"events/crafts-artist-title-1979.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"1979 年授予“工艺美术家”称号是 D 维度下工艺美术人才评价与行业组织恢复的节点，其艺人技艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:crafts-college-entrance-exam-resumption-1977","title":"工艺美术高等院校恢复统一招生考试（Restoration of Unified Admissions Examinations in Arts and Crafts Colleges）","name_en":"Restoration of Unified Admissions Examinations in Arts and Crafts Colleges","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1977","工艺美术教育","统一招生考试","高考恢复","研究生"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1977 年 12 月 10 日，全国多数设有工艺美术系科的高等院校恢复中断 10 年的全国统一招生考试，招收了“文革”后工艺美术本、专科生和研究生。来源把它置于 1977 年 3 月全国工艺美术工作会议、8 月国务院批转《关于进一步发展工艺美术品生产和扩大销售意见的报告》之后，作为行业与教育同时恢复的一环。","path":"events/crafts-college-entrance-exam-resumption-1977.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"工艺美术高等院校恢复统一招生考试是 D 维度下设计教育制度恢复的节点，其后续学科调整归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:cultural-revolution-crafts-four-olds","title":"“文化大革命”中传统工艺品被打成“四旧”（Traditional Crafts Denounced as the Four Olds during the Cultural Revolution）","name_en":"Traditional Crafts Denounced as the Four Olds during the Cultural Revolution","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1966","文化大革命","四旧","工艺美术","停产"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1966 年 5 月“文化大革命”开始后，全国工艺美术行业受到严重破坏，传统工艺品一律被打成“四旧”而遭禁锢。来源以景德镇重工粉彩瓷、陕西凤翔泥塑、福建寿山石雕、北京景泰蓝为例，记其停产、砸毁、艺人受批斗与题材政治化。据统计，到 1970 年全国有半数以上工艺美术企业转产或停产，生产产值下降 47%。","path":"events/cultural-revolution-crafts-four-olds.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"文革中传统工艺品被打成“四旧”是 D 维度下行业政策与生产秩序被破坏的节点，其具体工艺损失归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:da-shengchan-yundong","title":"大生产运动（The Great Production Campaign）","name_en":"The Great Production Campaign","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1941","大生产运动","解放区","陕甘宁边区","工艺美术"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记抗日战争前夕中国工农红军长征到达陕北，八路军、新四军深入敌后创立抗日根据地。1941 年到 1942 年，由于敌人残酷进攻和经济封锁，解放区经济生产和生活遭到极大困难；中共中央提出“发展生产，保障供给”的方针，号召解放区军民自己动手、丰衣足食，掀起轰轰烈烈的大生产运动，陕甘宁边区搞得最热烈，其他敌后根据地也在紧张战斗环境中开展。来源称大生产运动是一曲自力更生的凯歌，使解放区军民渡过严重困难","path":"events/da-shengchan-yundong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大生产运动是 D 维度下解放区经济自给与生产组织动员的节点，其染织、陶瓷等工艺兴起归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:dayu-flood-control","title":"大禹治水（Yu the Great Controls the Floods）","name_en":"Yu the Great Controls the Floods","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["传说夏代","大禹","治水","疏导","规划"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏的故事从大禹治水开始。赵农称大禹治水是中国先民改造自然本质力量的传说，大禹是“中华民族最早的规划设计师”。来源引《孟子·滕文公上》“禹疏九河”与“三过其门而不入”，引《孟子·滕文公下》洪水描述，又引《越绝书·卷十一》“夏禹之时，以铜为兵，以凿伊阙，通龙门，决江导河，东注于海”，据以说明治水使用了多种工具。大禹以疏导成功，其父鲧以堵失败而被舜斩首，来源由此提出“疏胜于堵”后来成为政治文化规范。","path":"events/dayu-flood-control.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大禹治水是 D 维度下传说时代治水规划与政治文化规范的节点，其工具与水利技术归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:deyang-xiaoquan-silver-find","title":"德阳孝泉镇宋代银器出土（Deyang Xiaoquan Silver Hoard）","name_en":"Deyang Xiaoquan Silver Hoard","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["北宋","四川","德阳","银器","熏炉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"discovery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1959 年，四川德阳孝泉镇清真寺发现宋代银器 117 件，有瓶、匜、钵、勺、杯、筷、钗、盒、执壶、茶托、熏炉等 24 种。其中银熏炉作圆球形，上面镂空成卷草纹，来源称还保存着一些唐代风格。同段记 1953 年起杭州老和山、广州小北登峰路、江西高安等地宋墓或遗址陆续出土金银器皿。","path":"events/deyang-xiaoquan-silver-find.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"德阳孝泉镇银器出土是 B 维度下宋代金银器器类与装饰风格的实物样本，其商品化生产属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:donghulin-muzang","title":"东胡林墓葬发现（Donghulin Burial Discovery）","name_en":"Donghulin Burial Discovery","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["新石器时代早期","北京","门头沟","东胡林","装饰品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"discovery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1966 年，北京门头沟东胡林村发现新石器时代早期墓葬。田自秉记一座少女遗骸的项部有小螺壳制成的项链，腕部有牛肋骨制成的骨镯，并称这些是“原始人们审美观念的反映，是装饰的萌芽”。","path":"events/donghulin-muzang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"东胡林墓葬发现是 B 维度下新石器时代早期身体装饰的实物证据，用于说明装饰的萌芽与审美功利性。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:dongnan-daxue-yishuxuexi-1994","title":"东南大学设立我国第一个艺术学系（Southeast University Establishes China's First Department of Art Studies）","name_en":"Southeast University Establishes China's First Department of Art Studies","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1994","东南大学","艺术学系","张道一","学科建设"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新记近几年来我国的艺术学研究和学科建设取得了一定的成就：1994 年 6 月，东南大学在著名学者张道一先生的倡导和组建下，率先设立了我国第一个艺术学系。之后，北京大学、浙江大学、厦门大学等一些综合性大学也先后组建了艺术学系和艺术学研究所。来源认为艺术学学科的建立奠定了艺术学在人文学科的地位，标志着我国艺术学研究进入到一个新的阶段，并促使各个艺术分支学科的建立和完善。来源未给系所规模、师资、课程","path":"events/dongnan-daxue-yishuxuexi-1994.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"东南大学艺术学系的设立是 D 维度下设计教育学科建制化的节点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:feishui-zhizhan","title":"淝水之战（Battle of Feishui）","name_en":"Battle of Feishui","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["383","淝水之战","前秦","东晋","南北朝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农两处记淝水之战：一处称“淝水之战”是以少胜多的典范，从另一角度说明南国士人的智慧；另一处记前秦与东晋在公元 383 年进行这次战争，南北两军对峙较量的结果形成了南北朝的局面。来源未给战场、兵力、将领与战役过程。","path":"events/feishui-zhizhan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"淝水之战是 D 维度下南北政权对峙与南北朝格局形成的军事政治节点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:fojiao-chuanru-zhongguo","title":"佛教传入中国（Buddhism Enters China）","name_en":"Buddhism Enters China","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["东汉","佛教传入","佛教艺术","尼雅遗址","造物设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新记佛教大盛于魏晋六朝，但其源头在东汉；佛教传入的路线按专家考证有三：一是沿丝绸之路经敦煌通过河西走廊抵达关内，二是经云南、四川沿长江沿岸进入内地，三是经海路传入。来源不着重早期传播线索，而要观察佛教传入与造物之间的关联：1959 年新疆民丰县尼雅遗址出土一块东汉时期的腊缬棉布，“蓝色印花，图案为一半身裸体人物像……具明显的佛教艺术色彩”；有学者认为画中人物为希腊丰收女神或西亚女神伊什塔尔，从","path":"events/fojiao-chuanru-zhongguo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"佛教传入是 E 维度下外来宗教艺术进入中国造物体系的节点，其造像与织物工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:founding-ceremony-tiananmen-decoration-1949","title":"开国大典天安门城楼布置装饰（Decoration of Tiananmen Rostrum for the Founding Ceremony）","name_en":"Decoration of Tiananmen Rostrum for the Founding Ceremony","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1949","开国大典","天安门城楼","宫灯","舞美设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1949 年 10 月 1 日开国大典之前，天安门国庆工程指挥部把城楼的装饰设计任务下达给了华北军区政治部宣传部。宣传部长张致祥把大红宫灯的设计工作交给了该部文工团的舞美队。当时参与开国大典天安门城楼装饰设计工作的有舞美队美工，还有两位身份特殊的日本美工师；这两位反战日本人早年被迫逃亡中国，后投奔八路军。接到设计任务后，大家忙碌起来，先后拿出天安门城楼的装饰设计方案和各式宫灯张挂草图 20 余幅。","path":"events/founding-ceremony-tiananmen-decoration-1949.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"开国大典天安门城楼布置装饰是 C 维度下国家典礼视觉与环境设计的起点，其政治制度背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:fucangshan-tomb","title":"浮仓山南宋墓（Fucangshan Southern Song Tomb）","name_en":"Fucangshan Southern Song Tomb","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["南宋","福建","浮仓山","女服","出土服饰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"discovery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1975 年，福建省浮仓山出土一座南宋贵族妇女墓，随葬衣饰齐全，有袍、袄、裙、衫、裤、肚兜、绶带、鞋、袜、香囊、粉扑、裹脚布、荷包等。来源称其为研究宋代女子衣饰、特别是贵妇与宫妃服饰的极好材料。同段记衣式为直领对襟、无带无扣、颈部外缘重叠缝制护领，衣袖相连裁剪，并以印金、刺绣、彩绘饰牡丹、山茶、梅花、百合等花卉。","path":"events/fucangshan-tomb.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"浮仓山南宋墓是 B 维度下宋代女子衣饰形制与装饰工艺的集中样本，其服饰等级属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:ganshi-battle","title":"甘泽之战（Battle of Ganshi）","name_en":"Battle of Ganshi","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["夏代","甘泽","车战","有扈氏","《尚书·甘誓》"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"甘泽之战是夏后启与有扈氏在甘泽进行的战争。《尚书·甘誓》载其誓师词，记夏代已用兵车作战并有一定阵法，来源称其为世界上最早的车战，比喜克索斯人使用战车早 300 年。《吕氏春秋·己篇》另记夏后启战而不胜、反躬修德、期年而有扈氏服的故事。同段述战车编制：一车三人，左持弓、右持戈、中驾马，称“甲士”，车下步兵称“徒卒”。","path":"events/ganshi-battle.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"甘泽之战是 B 维度下战车与车战编制的最早文献节点，其战争与方国关系属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:han-wudi-duzun-rushu","title":"汉武帝独尊儒术（Emperor Wu of Han Adopts Confucianism）","name_en":"Emperor Wu of Han Adopts Confucianism","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["西汉","汉武帝","董仲舒","儒学","服饰等级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汉代儒学受到统治者尊信，汉武帝罢黜百家、独尊儒术；董仲舒以儒家宗法思想为核心，结合阴阳五行学说，将神权、君权、父权、夫权结成一体，形成统一的封建思想体系。来源称在这种思想影响下，服装的形制与衣料质地、色彩、纹饰都形成森严的阶级等级。","path":"events/han-wudi-duzun-rushu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉武帝独尊儒术是 D 维度下思想制度与服饰等级形成的节点，其袍服形制属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:huangjin-uprising","title":"黄巾大起义（Yellow Turban Rebellion）","name_en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["东汉","黄巾起义","画像石","汉灵帝","社会动乱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在汉代画像石一节记山东地区画像石兴盛于东汉中期，汉和帝以后社会厚葬之风极盛，画像石制作极为流行；衰落在东汉末年，即汉灵帝以后，这与当时社会矛盾日益尖锐、爆发了黄巾大起义有关。来源只把黄巾大起义作为画像石衰落的社会原因提及，未给起义年份、领袖、规模与战事。","path":"events/huangjin-uprising.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"黄巾大起义是 D 维度下东汉末年社会动乱影响工艺生产的节点，其画像石衰落归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:hufu-qishe","title":"胡服骑射（Hufu Qishe Reform）","name_en":"Hufu Qishe Reform","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["战国","赵国","赵武灵王","胡服","服饰改革"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"胡服骑射是战国时期赵武灵王在赵国推行的服饰与军事改革。赵农记赵国地处北方，长年与草原游牧民族作战，服饰不便使战斗力受到影响；赵武灵王力排众议引进胡服骑射，提高战斗能力，并说服贵族王室，最终奠定赵国强盛的基础。来源未给具体年份。","path":"events/hufu-qishe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"胡服骑射是 E 维度下战国时期赵国引进北方游牧民族服饰的制度改革，用于说明服饰功能与跨文化采纳。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:icsid-1989-nagoya","title":"中国工业设计代表团首次参加 ICSID 年会（First Chinese Delegation to the ICSID Congress）","name_en":"First Chinese Delegation to the ICSID Congress","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1989","ICSID","工业设计","名古屋","国际交流"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1989 年 10 月 17 至 21 日，中国工业设计代表团一行三人首次参加在日本名古屋举行的第 16 届世界工业设计协会联合会年会（ICSID'89）。来源只记代表团人数、会议届次、时间与地点，未记参会论文、议题与后续加入情况。","path":"events/icsid-1989-nagoya.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国代表团首次参加 ICSID 年会是 D 维度下中国工业设计界国际组织化的节点，其设计观念交流归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:industrial-design-society-1985","title":"全国高校工业设计学会成立（Founding of the National Higher Education Industrial Design Society）","name_en":"Founding of the National Higher Education Industrial Design Society","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1985","工业设计","高校学会","学术交流会","设计教育"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1985 年 3 月 2 至 6 日，全国高校工业设计学会成立暨第一次全国工业设计教育学术交流会在北京召开。来源把它与 3 月中旬“书籍装帧艺术十人作品展”、5 月伊夫·圣·洛朗回顾展并列为 1985 年设计界的事件。","path":"events/industrial-design-society-1985.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"全国高校工业设计学会成立是 D 维度下工业设计教育组织化的节点，其工业设计观念归 A/E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:ji-zha-gift-sword","title":"季札赠剑（Ji Zha Presents His Sword）","name_en":"Ji Zha Presents His Sword","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["春秋","季札","赠剑","徐君","信义"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《史记·吴太伯世家》记吴国公子季札出使北方，途经徐国，徐君喜爱季札的剑而口不敢言；季札心里知道，因要出使上国，未献。返回时徐君已死，季札解下宝剑，系在徐君墓冢的树上而去。从者问徐君已死还给谁，季札答：“始吾心已许之，岂以死倍吾心哉！”赵农评之为“义薄云天、高古情怀的典故”“千古流传的佳话”，并据以说明长江地域车战简略、步兵与水战发达，青铜剑器在楚、吴、越较北方成就显著。","path":"events/ji-zha-gift-sword.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"季札赠剑是 A 维度下以剑器为载体的信义典故，其剑器工艺与地域分布归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:jianbian-yifu-1912","title":"1912年剪辫易服（The 1912 Queue-Cutting and Dress Reform）","name_en":"The 1912 Queue-Cutting and Dress Reform","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["民国","剪辫易服","服制条例","中山装","服制改革"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1912 年，民国政府首先颁行《剪辫通令》，随后又参照西洋诸国服饰制度发布《服制条例》，使五彩纷呈的现代服装冲垮历代积习下来的衣冠等级制度；传统袍、衫、袄、裤、裙越来越多地受到西方服饰影响，出现更多新款时装。同年，民国政府通令将中山装定为礼服；1929 年制定宪法时，规定一定等级文官宣誓就职一律穿中山装。来源另记孙中山限 20 天剪辫、提出“礼服在所必更，常服赐听民自便”。","path":"events/jianbian-yifu-1912.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"1912 年剪辫易服是 D 维度下近代服制政策与衣冠等级制度解体的节点，中山装形制归 B 维度、其象征意义归 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:jiawu-haizhan","title":"甲午海战（Naval Battle of the Jiawu Year）","name_en":"Naval Battle of the Jiawu Year","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["甲午海战","洋务运动","晚清","军事","近代转型"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农在总结中记“‘洋务运动’的失败，无论是军事意义的‘甲午海战’，还是官商一体的封建经济体系，都为后来中国经济改革带来无穷后患”。来源只把甲午海战作为洋务运动失败的军事标志，未给交战方、战场、舰船、兵力、年份与战役过程。","path":"events/jiawu-haizhan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"甲午海战是 E 维度下晚清对外战争与近代化受挫的节点，其洋务制度后果归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:jin-casting-legal-cauldron","title":"晋国铸刑鼎（Jin Casts the Legal Cauldron）","name_en":"Jin Casts the Legal Cauldron","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["春秋","晋国","刑鼎","生铁冶铸","铁器时代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"公元前 513 年，晋国在汝水旁筑城，从民间征收铁，“赋晋国一鼓铁，以铸刑鼎”，铸成一只铭刻法律条文的鼎。来源据以说明当时工匠已较好掌握生铁冶铸技术。同段述中国生铁铸造技术的发明、白口铁性能、排橐鼓风与铁农具的推广。","path":"events/jin-casting-legal-cauldron.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"晋国铸刑鼎是 B 维度下春秋生铁冶铸技术成熟的文献节点，其成文法与政权制度属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:jingkang-zhibian","title":"靖康之难（Jingkang Incident）","name_en":"Jingkang Incident","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["北宋","南宋","靖康之难","临安","分期"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1126—1127 年发生靖康之难，徽、钦二帝被金人掳去，宋室被迫南迁江南临安（今浙江杭州），与金以淮水、大散关为界，史称南宋。来源以宋代“崇文抑武”的国策解释其武备积弱，并以此作为宋代设计与社会转折的背景。田自秉另记公元 1125 年辽政权为黑龙江流域女真族建立的金政权所灭；公元 1127 年金兵南下攻破开封，宋室南下定都临安（今杭州），史称南宋，形成宋金对峙的局面；公元 1279 年南宋亡于元","path":"events/jingkang-zhibian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"靖康之难是 E 维度下宋代政权南迁与设计地理格局变化的分期事件，其官窑与织造制度属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:kangxi-abolish-loom-quota-1712","title":"康熙五十一年废除机户织机限额（Abolition of the Loom Quota in 1712）","name_en":"Abolition of the Loom Quota in 1712","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1712","康熙","机户","织机限额","染织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记清代染织在明代生产基础上又有进一步发展。清初在江南等地设置织造局，大批优秀染织工人被征在官营工场作工；同时对民营机户限制很严，规定机户每户织机不得超过百张，并且缴纳重税，因而极大地妨碍了民间纺织工业的发展。康熙五十一年（1712 年），由于纺织发展的需要，不得不废除这种限制，染织工艺才得以继续发展。来源未给限额设立年份、重税税率与废除后的产量变化。","path":"events/kangxi-abolish-loom-quota-1712.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"康熙五十一年废除机户织机限额是 D 维度下官营对民营纺织限制放松的制度节点，其染织生产归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:kangxi-ditu-cehui","title":"康熙时期中国地图测绘（Cartographic Survey of China under the Kangxi Emperor）","name_en":"Cartographic Survey of China under the Kangxi Emperor","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["康熙","地图测绘","传教士","测量","清初"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记康熙时期正是欧洲社会文艺复兴的鼎盛阶段，近代欧洲文明通过西方基督教传教士进入中国，如汤若望、南怀仁等；康熙还领导完成了中国地图的测绘工作，这在当时该图已具有世界先进水平。来源未给地图名称、测绘范围、参与人员分工、测量方法与完成年份。","path":"events/kangxi-ditu-cehui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"康熙时期地图测绘是 B 维度下国家测量与制图技术的节点，其国家工程属性归 D 维度、西方传教士参与归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:king-wu-conquers-zhou","title":"武王伐纣（King Wu Conquers Zhou）","name_en":"King Wu Conquers Zhou","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["商末","武王伐纣","孟津","舟船","车战"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《史记》载武王伐纣时率战车 300 辆、近卫军 3000 人、甲士 4.5 万人，在孟津渡过黄河。来源称这是关于船只用于战争的最早记载，说明商末车船制造已有很大发展。同段先述甲骨文“舟”字八种字形、商代舢板船结构，以及“舵桨”的最早记载。田自秉另记周文王时国势一天天强大，武王时联合反对商的各部落灭了商，建立周朝，并建都在西安西南的镐京。","path":"events/king-wu-conquers-zhou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"武王伐纣是 B 维度下商末车船制造与军事运输规模的节点，其王朝更替属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:li-lixin-doctoral-defense-2002","title":"李立新博士论文答辩（Li Lixin's Doctoral Dissertation Defense）","name_en":"Li Lixin's Doctoral Dissertation Defense","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["2002","李立新","博士论文","东南大学","学术史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新在后记中记：1998 年从苏州大学艺术学院研究生毕业后，经诸葛铠鼓励与举荐，于 1999 年 9 月考入东南大学，师从张道一攻读造物艺术方向的博士学位；入学伊始论文选题大致定在“造物艺术史”，按张道一计划由其带头、胡平与李立新参与合写一本《中国设计艺术史》，李立新先做资料归纳、分析与新出资料收集整理的前期工作。2002 年 6 月 15 日，论文在东南大学艺术学系通过答辩；同行评审专家为梁白","path":"events/li-lixin-doctoral-defense-2002.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"李立新博士论文答辩是 A 维度下设计史研究学术史与学科训练的节点，其学位教育背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:liuchao-buddhist-caves","title":"六朝佛教石窟开凿（Buddhist Cave Temple Carving in the Six Dynasties）","name_en":"Buddhist Cave Temple Carving in the Six Dynasties","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["六朝","佛教","石窟","云冈","龙门"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记六朝 360 多年的混乱局面使人民深受战争痛苦与赋税徭役压迫，精神苦闷给佛教以兴起和传播的机会；各族统治者又想利用宗教麻醉人民以巩固统治，于是佛教勃兴。北方大凿石窟，著名的大同云冈、洛阳龙门以及敦煌莫高窟，都是这一时期的伟大创造；南方则广建寺院，杜牧《江南春绝句》“南朝四百八十寺，多少楼台烟雨中”反映佛教流行盛况。因而各类工艺美术常体现浓厚宗教色彩，有些并直接为宗教服务。来源又记佛教流行促","path":"events/liuchao-buddhist-caves.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"六朝佛教石窟开凿是 B 维度下宗教造像与石窟工艺的节点，其佛教东传与犍陀罗艺术吸收归 E 维度、统治者宗教政策归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:ma-gaerni-shihua","title":"马葛尔尼使华（Macartney Embassy to China）","name_en":"Macartney Embassy to China","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1793","马葛尔尼","马戛尔尼","乾隆","通商"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记清代乾隆年间的中国还是世界上比较富裕的国家，但闭关锁国、狂妄自大的清政府蔑视其他民族国家的崛起。1793 年，英国使臣马葛尔尼乘“狮子号”军舰来到中国，要求与中国进行正常的通商贸易；为了表示友好，带来 600 箱英国各种工业科技产品。由于乾隆皇帝要求英国使臣跪拜，引起争议，后竟派宠臣和珅逐客使团，断然拒绝贸易活动。来源认为马葛尔尼看到的是挥霍无度的贪官、落后简陋的武器、专制残暴的政府，此后大","path":"events/ma-gaerni-shihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"马葛尔尼使华是 E 维度下清中叶中西通商冲突与外交礼仪争议的节点，其闭关锁国政策归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:mashan-yihao-mu-sichupin","title":"马山一号墓丝织品出土（Mashan Tomb No.1 Silk Textile Discovery）","name_en":"Mashan Tomb No.1 Silk Textile Discovery","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["战国","湖北","江陵","马山一号墓","丝织品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"discovery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1982 年 1 月，湖北江陵马山砖厂一号墓出土大批战国时期丝织品与刺绣。田自秉称其品种“几乎包括了战国时期的所有丝织品种”，并认为这是继湖南长沙马王堆汉墓以后丝织品方面的又一重大发现，超过了以前多次发现的战国丝织品的品种和数量。","path":"events/mashan-yihao-mu-sichupin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"马山一号墓丝织品出土是 B 维度下战国染织工艺的集中样本，覆盖丝织品种、织法与刺绣。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:mawangdui-yihao-mu-fajue","title":"马王堆一号汉墓发掘（Mawangdui Tomb No.1 Excavation）","name_en":"Mawangdui Tomb No.1 Excavation","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["西汉","湖南","长沙","马王堆","丝织品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"discovery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1972 年，湖南长沙东郊马王堆一号汉墓发掘，出土大量基本完整的丝织品，达 100 多件。田自秉记其中有匹端单幅的丝织物 46 段、成件衣服 58 件，并称其“如同打开了一座汉代的‘丝绸之库’”。同段又记墓中绒圈锦的特殊组织。","path":"events/mawangdui-yihao-mu-fajue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"马王堆一号汉墓发掘是 B 维度下汉代丝织工艺的集中样本，覆盖品种、织法与绒圈锦。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:mozi-zhi-chu-gong-song","title":"墨子止楚攻宋（Mozi Stops Chu from Attacking Song）","name_en":"Mozi Stops Chu from Attacking Song","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["战国","墨子","公输盘","云梯","墨守成规"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《墨子·公输》记约公元前 444 年，公输盘为楚造云梯预备攻宋，墨子前往制止：以带为城、以堞为械，公输盘九设攻城机变，墨子九距之，公输盘攻械尽而墨子守围有余；墨子又称弟子禽滑厘等 300 人已持守围之器在宋城上待楚寇。由此留下“墨守成规”的成语。","path":"events/mozi-zhi-chu-gong-song.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"墨子止楚攻宋是 B 维度下先秦攻守器械与防御技术的叙事节点，其兼爱非攻思想属 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:nanyang-quanyehui","title":"南洋劝业会（Nanyang Industrial Exposition）","name_en":"Nanyang Industrial Exposition","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1910年","南洋劝业会","南京丁家桥","博览会","实业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南洋劝业会于清宣统二年（1910）由南洋通商大臣倡办，原称“南洋第一次劝业会”，地址在南京丁家桥。全国选送展品100多万件，分24部420类，评出5269件产品获奖；因辛亥革命实际只办一届。2009 版另记江苏、广东获奖最多，2016 未记获奖省份。","path":"events/nanyang-quanyehui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"南洋劝业会是 D 维度下清末实业展览与产品评奖制度的条目，也是 `places/nanjing.md` 清末会场的制度背景。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:national-advertising-design-exhibition-1982","title":"第一届全国广告装潢设计展览（The First National Advertising and Display Design Exhibition）","name_en":"The First National Advertising and Display Design Exhibition","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1982","广告装潢","展览","中国美术馆","广告设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1982 年 2 月 21 至 28 日，由中华全国广告协会、中国工业美术协会和中国广告联合总公司主办的“第一届全国广告装潢设计展览”在北京中国美术馆举行。来源只记主办单位、时间、地点与展览名称，未记展品数量、参展单位与观众。","path":"events/national-advertising-design-exhibition-1982.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"第一届全国广告装潢设计展览是 C 维度下广告与商业视觉设计复兴的节点，其广告业制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:national-book-design-exhibition-1959","title":"第一届全国书籍装帧艺术展览会（The First National Book Design Exhibition）","name_en":"The First National Book Design Exhibition","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1959","书籍装帧","展览","莱比锡","平面设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"与设计关系密切的出版行业在 1959 年 4 月举办全国第一届书籍装帧艺术展览会，涌现一大批书籍装帧好作品，受到学界、读书界和社会各界关注。当年秋季，我国书装界首次组团参加在东德莱比锡举办的国际书籍装帧艺术展览会，获得 10 枚金质奖章和 9 枚银质奖章，来源据此判断其带动了我国平面设计的全面启动。","path":"events/national-book-design-exhibition-1959.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"第一届全国书籍装帧艺术展览会是 C 维度下书籍装帧与平面设计的展览节点，其出版制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:national-craft-artists-conference-1957","title":"全国工艺美术艺人代表会议（1957）（National Conference of Arts and Crafts Artisans (1957)）","name_en":"National Conference of Arts and Crafts Artisans (1957)","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1957","工艺美术","艺人代表会议","保护发展提高","适用经济美观"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1957 年 7 月 22 日，全国工艺美术艺人代表会议在北京举行，这是新中国建立以来第一次工艺美术界的盛大集会。会议提出对工艺美术行业实行“保护、发展、提高”的方针，以及“适用、经济、美观”的生产原则，为第二个五年计划的工艺美术发展指明方向。来源把这次会议与 1956 年中央工艺美术学院成立、1959 年北京十大建筑落成和全国工艺美术展览会并列为全面建设社会主义时期涉及工艺美术的几件大事。田自秉","path":"events/national-craft-artists-conference-1957.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"1957 年全国工艺美术艺人代表会议是 D 维度下行业方针与生产原则确立的节点，其产品与技艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:national-craft-exhibition-1972","title":"全国工艺美术展览会（1972）（National Arts and Crafts Exhibition (1972)）","name_en":"National Arts and Crafts Exhibition (1972)","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1972","全国工艺美术展览会","民族文化宫","青花天球瓶","友谊第一"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1972 年 9 月，北京举办新中国建立以来规模最大的“全国工艺美术展览会”，历时 4 个多月，取得广泛社会影响，对传统工艺美术的保护、发展和提高起促进作用。年表另记展览在北京民族文化宫展出，品种达 17000 余件。展品包括景德镇瓷器“青花天球瓶”、寿山石雕“花果篮”、浏阳菊花石雕“菊竹”、斑铜“孔雀瓶”、北京象牙雕刻“嫦娥奔月”和广东镂雕象牙球“友谊第一”等。","path":"events/national-craft-exhibition-1972.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"1972 年全国工艺美术展览会是 D 维度下文革期间工艺美术政策转向与行业恢复的节点，其展品工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:national-craft-exhibition-1978","title":"全国工艺美术展览（1978）（National Arts and Crafts Exhibition (1978)）","name_en":"National Arts and Crafts Exhibition (1978)","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1978","全国工艺美术展览","中国美术馆","105万","工艺美术复兴"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1978 年 2 至 5 月，全国工艺美术展览在北京中国美术馆举行，观众多达 105 万人，时任国务院副总理邓小平、李先念等观看展览。展览共展出 14 个大类、400 多个品种，参展作品 1 万多件，包括工艺花、工艺画、玉牙木石雕刻、织绣、编织、地毯、民间工艺、陶瓷玻璃、家具灯彩、金属工艺、漆器工艺等。来源认为展览对传统工艺美术的保护、发展和提高起巨大促进作用。","path":"events/national-craft-exhibition-1978.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"1978 年全国工艺美术展览是 D 维度下文革后工艺美术产业恢复与公众传播的节点，其展品工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:national-crafts-education-symposium-1982","title":"全国高等院校工艺美术教学座谈会（National Symposium on Arts and Crafts Teaching in Higher Education）","name_en":"National Symposium on Arts and Crafts Teaching in Higher Education","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1982","工艺美术教育","教学座谈会","中央工艺美术学院","文化部"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1982 年 4 月 16 至 28 日，由文化部和轻工业部联合委托中央工艺美术学院筹备召开的“全国高等院校工艺美术教学座谈会”在北京举行。来源只记会议名称、时间、地点、主办与筹备单位，未记议程、参加院校与决议。","path":"events/national-crafts-education-symposium-1982.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"全国高等院校工艺美术教学座谈会是 D 维度下设计教育课程与教学组织讨论的节点，其后续学科目录调整归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:national-lacquer-conference-1959","title":"1959年全国漆器交流参观会议（National Lacquerware Exchange Conference (1959)）","name_en":"National Lacquerware Exchange Conference (1959)","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1959","漆器","福州","交流会议","工艺美术"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记在漆器工艺中还有山西云雕漆器、贵州皮胎漆器、山东嵌银丝漆器，以及四川、云南、贵州、湖南等地兄弟民族的漆器；解放后党和政府重视漆器工艺生产，为了交流经验、互相学习，曾于 1959 年在福州召开“全国漆器交流参观会议”，19 个省市自治区的代表参加了会议。来源认为这次会议对推动我国漆器工艺生产起了重要作用，也是我国漆工艺史上的一件大事。来源未给会议议程、会期、主办机关与决议。","path":"events/national-lacquer-conference-1959.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"1959 年全国漆器交流参观会议是 D 维度下漆器行业跨地区经验交流的节点，其漆器工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:opium-war","title":"鸦片战争（Opium War）","name_en":"Opium War","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["清代","近代","鸦片战争","半殖民地","近代设计转型"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鸦片战争是 1840 年英国以鸦片贸易为借口对中国发动的战争。五册来源都把 1840 年作为中国近代史（或近代设计史）的开端，也都把战争的结果指向同一件事：中国被迫成为开放的国际市场，传统手工业与手工制瓷、手工纺织等部门在洋货倾销下解体或转型。各册对它的处理方式不同：高丰把它当成分期依据与设计衰退的起点，夏燕靖两版把它当成手工业转型的分界，田自秉把它当成工艺美术全面受摧残的开端，赵农把它当成白银回","path":"events/opium-war.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鸦片战争是 E 维度下中国设计现代化的分界事件，同时通过通商口岸、海关与官办企业构成 D 维度的制度起点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:pangeng-move-to-yin","title":"盘庚迁殷（Pangeng's Move to Yin）","name_en":"Pangeng's Move to Yin","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["商代","盘庚","殷墟","迁都","分期"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"盘庚迁殷是商王盘庚将都城迁至殷（今河南安阳）的事件。田自秉记其为公元前15世纪末商王盘庚最后一次迁都，并以此作为商代前期与后期的分界，此后商又称殷或商殷。2016 版记盘庚迁殷后商后期皆以殷为都，至纣亡共253年、八代十二王，约前1250—前1050年；殷墟发现宫殿、居民点、手工业作坊与墓葬区。原文同段又作“计73年”，与253年、八代十二王相矛盾，未改字。","path":"events/pangeng-move-to-yin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"盘庚迁殷是 E 维度下商代都邑迁移与商后期分期的锚点事件。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:party-third-plenum","title":"党的三中全会（The Party's Third Plenary Session）","name_en":"The Party's Third Plenary Session","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["三中全会","改革开放","拨乱反正","工艺美术","恢复"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在结语中记新中国的工艺美术取得巨大成就，虽然经过十年浩劫、遭受严重摧残，但在党的三中全会后，拨乱反正、改革开放，又迅速重新向前蓬勃发展；前言另有“党的十一届三中全会以来，经过拨乱反正，又在迅速恢复和发展”之语。来源把这一转折归因于社会主义制度、党对工艺美术的关怀与工艺美术工作者的劳动创造，未给会议届次、年份与具体政策条文。","path":"events/party-third-plenum.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"党的三中全会是 D 维度下文革后政策转折与工艺美术恢复的节点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:ping-wang-dong-qian","title":"平王东迁（King Ping Moves the Capital East）","name_en":"King Ping Moves the Capital East","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["西周","东周","平王东迁","洛邑","镐京"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记周朝实行分封制度，周王自称天子，西周盛时周王对诸侯拥有很大权威。公元前 771 年，周朝都城镐京被少数民族西戎攻破，周平王被迫把都城迁到洛邑（今洛阳）；历史上把迁都前的周称为西周，迁都后称为东周。来源未给迁都过程、随迁人口与洛邑营建细节。","path":"events/ping-wang-dong-qian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"平王东迁是 D 维度下西周与东周分期及都城迁移的节点，其都城营建归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:qianqiu-festival","title":"千秋节（Qianqiu Festival）","name_en":"Qianqiu Festival","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["唐代","千秋节","唐玄宗","铜镜","赠镜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农在唐代铜镜一节记传说唐玄宗将自己八月初五的生日定为“千秋节”，以铜镜为礼品广赠百官，流风遍及，民间百姓也以镜相赠。铜镜亦是出嫁女子的必备物品，铜镜的广泛使用成为唐时的一种社会风尚。来源明确称此事为“传说”，未给节日起始年份、仪式程序与赠镜数量。田自秉另记唐镜兴盛与这一社会风尚有关：相传盛唐时期定八月五日玄宗的生日为“千秋节”，据《唐书·礼乐志》，这一天群臣献甘露寿酒，并以制作的铜镜作为祝寿或互","path":"events/qianqiu-festival.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"千秋节是 D 维度下唐代宫廷节日与赠镜习俗的节点，其铜镜工艺与形制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:qin-mie-liuguo","title":"秦灭六国（Qin Conquers the Six States）","name_en":"Qin Conquers the Six States","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["秦代","统一","度量衡","文字","万里长城"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"公元前 221 年，秦灭六国，建立中国历史上第一个大一统的多民族封建帝国。为加强统治，秦统一文字、货币、度量衡，为经济文化发展提供重要条件；又修万里长城，营建庞大豪华的宫殿与陵墓。来源以秦俑与随葬品的品种、制作、材质说明其留下的文化遗产。田自秉另记战国时期社会生产力继续发展、人民迫切要求结束割据混战，秦国因商鞅变法比其他六国彻底而逐步最强盛，先后灭掉韩、赵、魏、楚、燕、齐六国；秦统一后吸收其他国家","path":"events/qin-mie-liuguo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秦灭六国是 D 维度下统一制度与大型工程组织的起点，其标准化措施同时作用于 B 维度生产。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:qin-qian-yetie-haozu","title":"秦迁六国冶铁豪族（Qin Relocates Iron-Making Clans）","name_en":"Qin Relocates Iron-Making Clans","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["秦代","冶铁","铁官","工匠迁移","卓氏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《史记》载秦每得一地，必先将该地冶铁业强迁到秦的大后方或统治稳固地区，如迁卓氏、程氏于四川，迁孔氏于南阳。来源称其目的在集中控制冶铁业、彻底缴除六国敌对势力的武装；客观上使各地冶铁技术得以交流和全面提高。","path":"events/qin-qian-yetie-haozu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秦迁六国冶铁豪族是 D 维度下官营手工业与工匠迁移政策的节点，其技术传播后果属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:qing-opens-sea-ban-1684","title":"1684年清廷开放海禁（Qing Opens the Sea Ban in 1684）","name_en":"Qing Opens the Sea Ban in 1684","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["清代","海禁","造船业","福建船厂","工场手工业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1684 年清廷开放海禁，造船业得到恢复和发展。清代官府造船以福建为中心，设福州、泉州、漳州、台湾 4 个船厂，为福建水师修造战船；民间造船主要在苏州、扬州、厦门等地，已发展到工场手工业阶段。同段记明清车船种类、郑和宝船尺度与明代官营船厂。","path":"events/qing-opens-sea-ban-1684.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"1684 年开放海禁是 D 维度下清代造船业政策与生产组织变化的节点，其船型与造船技术属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:qingli-xinzheng","title":"庆历新政（Qingli New Policies）","name_en":"Qingli New Policies","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["北宋","庆历新政","范仲淹","改革","士人"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农两处记庆历新政：一处称北宋中期先有庆历年间范仲淹的“庆历新政”，不能实施；后有神宗时长达 16 年的“王安石变法”，仍不得已而流产。结论又记“北宋中期范仲淹的庆历新政的‘流产’，使范氏的‘先天下之忧而忧，后天下之乐而乐’有了更深刻的内容”。来源未给新政条目、起止年、推行过程与失败原因。","path":"events/qingli-xinzheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"庆历新政是 D 维度下北宋中期改革失败的制度节点，其士人精神表达归 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:qingshousi-tomb-textiles","title":"1955年北京庆寿寺双塔出土丝织品（Qingshou Temple Textile Find）","name_en":"Qingshou Temple Textile Find","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["元代","北京","庆寿寺","纳石失","缂丝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"discovery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1955 年拆除北京西长安街庆寿寺及其双塔时，发现 4 片纳石失金锦，织有唐草纹，出土时“金光耀日”，旋渐褪色。塔内还出土一块紫阳荷花缂丝，紫地上有黄绿相间的水波纹与卧莲图案，卧莲之间有鹅浮泳；另有酱色素绸一片，以及酱色地上织四叶萼图案的织花绸。来源称元代丝织遗品现存不多。","path":"events/qingshousi-tomb-textiles.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"庆寿寺双塔丝织品出土是 B 维度下元代纳石失、缂丝与织花绸的实物样本，其寺院与宫廷消费属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:quanguo-gongyi-meishu-zhanlanhui-1959","title":"1959年全国工艺美术展览会（National Arts and Crafts Exhibition 1959）","name_en":"National Arts and Crafts Exhibition 1959","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1959年","工艺美术展览","故宫午门","轻工业部","全国手工业合作总社"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1959年10月3日，由轻工业部和全国手工业合作总社联合举办的“全国工艺美术展览会”在北京故宫午门开幕。展览展出11类工艺品3500余件作品。2016 版另称展览集中展出各地名师名家作品，推动当时工艺美术品的恢复和发展。","path":"events/quanguo-gongyi-meishu-zhanlanhui-1959.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本展览是 D 维度下 1950 年代工艺美术行业展示与生产恢复的制度性事件。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:quanguo-minjian-meishu-gongyipin-zhanlanhui","title":"全国民间美术工艺品展览会（National Folk Arts and Crafts Exhibition）","name_en":"National Folk Arts and Crafts Exhibition","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1953年","民间美术","工艺美术展览","文化部","巡展"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1953年12月至1954年1月，文化部主办的“全国民间美术工艺品展览会”在北京劳动人民文化宫举行，展出陶瓷、染织、刺绣、金属工艺、漆器、编织、雕塑、年画、剪纸、玩具等民间工艺品近3000件。1954年6月展览作品运往苏联、捷克斯洛伐克、匈牙利、保加利亚等国展出。2016 版另记：1953年12月7日开幕、1954年1月3日闭幕；1954年6—11月赴苏联、捷克斯洛伐克、匈牙利、保加利亚和缅甸巡回","path":"events/quanguo-minjian-meishu-gongyipin-zhanlanhui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本展览是 D 维度下 1950 年代民间工艺调查、展示与对外交流的制度性事件。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:queue-and-dress-edicts","title":"清初剃发易服（Queue and Dress Edicts of the Early Qing）","name_en":"Queue and Dress Edicts of the Early Qing","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["清初","剃发易服","十从十不从","金之俊","民族关系"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清初推行易服之令，采取“留头不留发，留发不留头”的极端措施，引起汉人强烈不满和抵制。康熙时期，为缓解民族矛盾，清廷采纳明遗臣金之俊“十从十不从”的建议，在服饰方面尽量保持明代汉制，缓解了民怨。来源列出十从十不从全文。","path":"events/queue-and-dress-edicts.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"清初剃发易服是 D 维度下国家强制服饰政策的节点，其满汉文化冲突与调适属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:shang-tang-overthrows-xia","title":"商汤灭夏（Shang Tang Overthrows the Xia）","name_en":"Shang Tang Overthrows the Xia","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["商代","商汤","灭夏","车战","良车七十乘"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商汤灭夏时，军中主力为“良车七十乘”（《吕氏春秋·简读》），来源据以说明商早期车战已具相当规模。同段并记薛部族善造车，奚仲任夏朝车正，传说其“挠曲为轮，因直为辕”，造车“机旋相得”“成器坚固”；由全木轮发展到有辐车轮，是造车史上的大变革。","path":"events/shang-tang-overthrows-xia.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"商汤灭夏是 B 维度下商早期战车规模与造车技术的节点，其王朝更替属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:shang-yang-reforms","title":"商鞅变法（Shang Yang's Reforms）","name_en":"Shang Yang's Reforms","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["战国","商鞅","变法","秦国","富国强兵"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农在“变法图强”节举商鞅变法为春秋战国富国强民改革政策的著名例子，并指出从艺术设计史角度看，春秋战国的霸业正建立在对许多武器的设计和研制的基础上。结论又记“改革是一条通往国强民富的道路。商鞅变法使秦国崛起”。来源未给变法条文、起止年、具体措施与秦国兵器形制。","path":"events/shang-yang-reforms.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"商鞅变法是 D 维度下战国政治经济改革与秦国崛起的节点，其武器设计与研制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:shanghai-expo-2010","title":"2010年上海世界博览会（Expo 2010 Shanghai）","name_en":"Expo 2010 Shanghai","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["2010","上海世博会","世界博览会","现代设计","1851"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农在后记中写“举世瞩目的世界博览会，即将在 2010 年的上海举行，159 年（1851—2010 年）的历史，也是中国从近代化到现代化的进程的一种证明，也是现代设计学科从诞生到壮大的过程”。来源写作于 2008 年，只记预期举办地与年份，未记实际开幕、主题、参展方、场馆与参观数据。本条照录来源的预期表述，不把 2010 年后的实际结果写入。","path":"events/shanghai-expo-2010.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"2010 年上海世界博览会是 E 维度下以国际博览会为尺度的现代设计进程节点，其设计教育学科线索归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:shanghai-shougongye-shouxian-dahui","title":"上海市首次手工业技艺人员授衔大会（Shanghai First Handicraft Artisan Title Conferral）","name_en":"Shanghai First Handicraft Artisan Title Conferral","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1964年","上海","手工业","工艺师","授衔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1964年2月6日，上海市首次手工业技艺人员授衔大会召开，全市手工业者1100人出席，会上共有112位人员受衔。工艺美术行业的61位艺术上有独特成就、创作上有重大贡献的著名艺人被授予“工艺师”称号。两册记载一致，2016 为压缩表述。","path":"events/shanghai-shougongye-shouxian-dahui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本事件是 D 维度下新中国工艺美术艺人职称制度的早期实践，可与 1950 年代的展览、合作社等制度条目并置。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:sheji-yishuxue-1998","title":"研究生专业目录以“设计艺术学”取代“工艺美术学”（Graduate Catalogue Replaces Arts and Crafts Studies with Design Art Studies）","name_en":"Graduate Catalogue Replaces Arts and Crafts Studies with Design Art Studies","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1998","设计艺术学","工艺美术学","研究生专业目录","国务院学位委员会"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新记 1998 年国务院学位委员会决定在研究生专业目录中用“设计艺术学”取代“工艺美术学”，认为这是依据现实需要所做的学科方向的重新调整，反映出新时期对与人民生活休戚相关的衣食住行用的设计艺术的重视和强化。来源强调这不只是名称的更换，重要的是概念、范围、命题的转变、扩大和提出，视野的扩展必然要对设计艺术自身的历史发展进行反思和重新认识；并据此判断史学研究薄弱会影响新学科发展，设计艺术史研究已是","path":"events/sheji-yishuxue-1998.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"研究生专业目录改名是 D 维度下设计教育学科制度的关键节点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:song-dai-huayuan-sheli","title":"宋代宫廷画院设立（Establishment of the Song Imperial Painting Academy）","name_en":"Establishment of the Song Imperial Painting Academy","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["宋代","宫廷画院","院体画","格法","形似"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新记宋代帝王奖励画艺，继五代西蜀、南唐之后皆设宫廷画院，大批画家入院供奉；画家既受皇家“赞助”，创作上必受制约，表现在内容与方法两方面：一是帝王偏爱名花珍禽，宫廷画家偏重花鸟画，为宫廷装饰和绘制敕建宫观壁画，界画也成熟起来；二是画院强调重视古人的“格法”和严遵自然现象的“形似”，“格法”与“形似”成为画院创作的一般特质。于是严守“格法”、写实“形似”并具“新意”的工笔花鸟画和界画逐渐发展，形成","path":"events/song-dai-huayuan-sheli.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宋代宫廷画院是 D 维度下宫廷艺术机构影响工艺生产的节点，其绘画与装饰风格归 C、B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:sui-conquers-chen","title":"隋灭陈统一（Sui Conquers Chen and Reunifies China）","name_en":"Sui Conquers Chen and Reunifies China","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["589","隋文帝","隋灭陈","统一","南北朝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记南北朝末期，大贵族杨坚夺取了北周政权，建立隋代；公元 589 年又灭了南朝的陈，结束了 260 多年南北分裂的局面，重新建立起统一的封建国家。隋代虽只有短短的 20 多年时间，但在完成统一事业以后，社会生产得到较大的发展，为唐代经济文化的繁荣打下了基础。来源未给灭陈战事、统一措施与人口数据。","path":"events/sui-conquers-chen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"隋灭陈统一是 D 维度下结束南北分裂、重建统一王朝的政治制度节点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:sui-pinghui-jiankang","title":"隋文帝平毁建康（Emperor Wen of Sui Destroys Jiankang）","name_en":"Emperor Wen of Sui Destroys Jiankang","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["589","隋文帝","建康","六朝古都","城市史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"公元 589 年隋文帝灭陈后，有感于南陈的腐朽奢侈，以及陈朝的复辟势力，下令将“建康城邑宫室，并平荡耕垦”（《资治通鉴·卷177》）。赵农认为这是中国古代城市建筑史上的悲剧，不是毁灭于临时战乱，而是政治性的根本摧毁。此前来源详记建康自三国吴以来为六朝古都，东晋时形成宫城、都城、南城商市格局，人口超过 100 万。","path":"events/sui-pinghui-jiankang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"隋文帝平毁建康是 D 维度下统一王朝对前朝都城实施政治性摧毁的节点，其城市建筑后果归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:taiping-tianguo","title":"太平天国（Taiping Heavenly Kingdom）","name_en":"Taiping Heavenly Kingdom","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["太平天国","工艺政策","诸匠营","百工衙","招贤榜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记太平天国是近代史上一次波澜壮阔的农民革命，先后经历十几年，势力几乎遍及全国，不仅建立革命政权，而且对经济、文化、工艺进行了巨大改革。文艺上要求“言贵从心”“文以纪实”，反对“徒事清谈”“吟花咏柳”，形式要求“朴实明晓”“一目了然”，并提出文艺“尤属政治所关”。太平天国每占领一地就恢复当地工艺生产，江南蚕丝业发展较快，生丝输出量由 1853 年以前 2 万多包增至 1860 年间 8 万多包","path":"events/taiping-tianguo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"太平天国是 D 维度下农民政权改革工艺组织与工艺政策的节点，其工艺生产与品种归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:tang-ban-jinyin-pingtuo","title":"唐肃宗、代宗禁止金银平脱（Tang Ban on Gold and Silver Pingtuo Lacquerware）","name_en":"Tang Ban on Gold and Silver Pingtuo Lacquerware","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["唐代","金银平脱","唐肃宗","唐代宗","漆器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在唐代漆器金银平脱一节记平脱作法是用薄金片或薄银片按装饰花纹剪成图案，粘贴在漆器上，加漆两三层后研磨显出金银花纹；这种研磨工艺又称推光，唐以前未见，是当时新创的制漆工艺法。唐代金银平脱极为盛行，充分体现富丽华美的艺术特色；据《酉阳杂俎》，唐玄宗和杨贵妃赐给安禄山的物品就有金银平脱馄饨盘、金平脱犀头汤筋、金平脱大盘、银平脱五斗淘饭魁、金平脱妆具玉盒、金平脱铁面碗、平脱锁子等多种；当时专为杨贵妃","path":"events/tang-ban-jinyin-pingtuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"唐肃宗、代宗禁止金银平脱是 D 维度下政令限制奢侈工艺的节点，其金银平脱工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:technical-aesthetics-symposium-1994","title":"全国技术美学研讨会（National Symposium on Technical Aesthetics）","name_en":"National Symposium on Technical Aesthetics","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1994","技术美学","设计理论","天津","研讨会"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1994 年 10 月下旬，“全国技术美学研讨会”在天津举行。来源称这是美学第一次对艺术设计进行理论思考的专题研讨会。同年 5 月浙江省举办乡镇企业优秀工艺美术品评选活动；12 月 27 日第八届全国美术作品展览·艺术设计优秀作品展在北京中国美术馆展出。","path":"events/technical-aesthetics-symposium-1994.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"全国技术美学研讨会是 A 维度下设计理论反思的节点，其技术美学与工业设计关系归 B/D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:united-nations-gift-1974","title":"我国政府向联合国总部赠送《长城》壁毯和牙雕《成昆铁路》（Gift of the Great Wall Tapestry and Chengdu-Kunming Railway Ivory Carving to the United Nations）","name_en":"Gift of the Great Wall Tapestry and Chengdu-Kunming Railway Ivory Carving to the United Nations","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1974","长城壁毯","成昆铁路","象牙雕刻","联合国"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1974 年 5 月，国务院下达设计和生产任务，制作大型艺术壁毯《长城》（高 5 米、宽 10 米）和大型象牙雕刻《成昆铁路》（高 1.10 米、长 1.50 米），作为国家礼品赠送联合国总部。年表记 1974 年 10 月 7 日我国政府向联合国总部赠送《长城》壁毯（天津生产）和牙雕《成昆铁路》（北京制作）。","path":"events/united-nations-gift-1974.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"1974 年向联合国赠送壁毯与牙雕是 B 维度下大型织造与牙雕工艺的代表事件，其国家礼品与文化外交属性归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:wang-anshi-reforms","title":"王安石变法（Wang Anshi's Reforms）","name_en":"Wang Anshi's Reforms","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["北宋","王安石变法","宋神宗","党争","改革"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记为了挽救已成颓败之势的北宋王朝，先有庆历年间范仲淹的“庆历新政”，不能实施；后有神宗时长达 16 年的“王安石变法”，仍不得已而流产。法无法行而党朋怨起，新、旧、蜀、洛诸党争执，虽多有君子亦不乏小人，搅得政体混乱、朝纲纷纭；知识分子的境遇亦多卷入朋党之争。结论又记“与其说变法坏于小人之手，不如说变法坏于制度之朽”。","path":"events/wang-anshi-reforms.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"王安石变法是 D 维度下北宋中期改革与党争的政治制度节点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:wangzichao-shijian","title":"王子朝事件（The Prince Zhao Incident）","name_en":"The Prince Zhao Incident","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["东周","王子朝","百工","食官制","工匠身份"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新在论述工艺匠人身份的三次重要变化时，把第一次系于春秋战国时期：“工商食官”制度在商品经济冲击下被打破，“百工”也起来冲破官府约束，尽力改变自己的身份，成为自由工匠。东周末年有著名的王子朝事件：周景王二十五年，景王去世，“王子朝因旧官百工之丧职秩者与灵景之族以作乱”。卫国也有过两次工匠暴动，他们包围宫门迫使卫侯和太子仓皇出逃。来源认为越来越多的闹事、暴动最终促使食官制衰落，大部分工艺匠人重又回","path":"events/wangzichao-shijian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"王子朝事件是 D 维度下工匠身份与官营手工业制度变化的节点，其造物生产后果归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:wen-jing-zhi-zhi","title":"文景之治（Reign of Emperor Wen and Jing）","name_en":"Reign of Emperor Wen and Jing","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["西汉","文景之治","休养生息","铁器时代","经济"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记刘汉王朝建立后，一方面休养生息、推行黄老之学、鼓励农桑、减轻赋税，另一方面汉承秦制、稳定政权；四五十年之后先有“文景之治”的铺垫，后有汉武帝时代的国威张扬。另一处又记西汉中期的“文景之治”鼓励民间经济行为，推动社会生产发展，使铁器时代全面到来，在生产工具和兵器方面从青铜技术转向钢铁制作技术。","path":"events/wen-jing-zhi-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"文景之治是 D 维度下西汉前期休养生息与经济恢复的节点，其铁器生产与兵器材料归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:xianrendong-taoci-chutu","title":"仙人洞陶器出土（Xianrendong Pottery Discovery）","name_en":"Xianrendong Pottery Discovery","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["新石器时代","江西","万年","仙人洞","陶器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"discovery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1962 年，江西万年县仙人洞出土距今 8000 多年的陶器。田自秉在“陶器的起源”一节称其“是我国目前发现的最早的陶器资料”。来源只给这一句，未记器形、数量、陶质、纹饰与发掘经过。","path":"events/xianrendong-taoci-chutu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"仙人洞陶器出土是 B 维度下中国陶器起源的时间锚点，用于说明新石器时代早期制陶的出现。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:xiao-wen-gai-zhi","title":"孝文改制（汉化政策）（Emperor Xiaowen's Sinicization Reform）","name_en":"Emperor Xiaowen's Sinicization Reform","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["北魏","孝文帝","汉化","冠服","民族融合"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"魏晋南北朝是北方草原游牧民族与南方中原汉族文化大融合大碰撞的时代，北魏孝文帝的汉化运动掀起民族大融合高潮。孝文帝推行汉化政策，改拓跋姓氏，并率“群臣皆服汉魏衣冠”，史称“孝文改制”，使秦汉以来冠服旧制得以继续，推动华夏服饰发展。","path":"events/xiao-wen-gai-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"孝文改制是 E 维度下北方政权主动采纳汉制服饰的跨文化事件，其官制与姓氏改革属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:xiaomingdi-fushi-gaige","title":"北魏孝明帝服饰改革（Emperor Xiaoming of Northern Wei's Dress Reform）","name_en":"Emperor Xiaoming of Northern Wei's Dress Reform","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["北魏","孝明帝","服饰改革","汉化","江表士庶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记北朝少数民族在中原执政时期，将自身民族服饰与汉族礼制服饰混合，形成既不同于汉、也不同于胡的混乱样式。《南齐书·魏虏传》称“佛狸已来，稍僭华典，胡风国俗，杂相揉乱”，当时文人有“帽上著笼冠，裤上著朱衣，不知是今是，不知非昔非”的描述。直至北魏后期的孝明帝进一步改革服饰，“羽仪服式，悉如魏法，江表士庶，竞相模楷，裹衣博带，被及秣陵”（《洛阳伽蓝记·城东》）。来源认为这印证了北魏汉化的历史进步意义","path":"events/xiaomingdi-fushi-gaige.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"孝明帝服饰改革是 E 维度下北朝服饰汉化与南北文化互动的节点，其服制形制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:xiaowendi-jiangquan-nongsang","title":"北魏孝文帝奖劝农桑（Emperor Xiaowen of Northern Wei Promotes Agriculture and Sericulture）","name_en":"Emperor Xiaowen of Northern Wei Promotes Agriculture and Sericulture","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["北魏","孝文帝","农桑","官营丝织","民间纺织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新记自东汉末年开始的动乱分裂一直延续三百余年，导致商业停顿、货币废弃、手工业生产普遍衰落；但衰极中藏有转机。北魏统一中原后，孝文帝奖劝农桑：一方面设立官营丝织作坊，平城宫中有“婢使千余人织绫锦”；另一方面又任民织造，一度遣散宫中机织工匠，使民间纺织业再度活跃。来源以新疆吐鲁番阿斯塔那古墓出土的大量北朝织锦作为验证。来源未给诏令年份、作坊数量、产量与除“千余人”外的工匠规模。","path":"events/xiaowendi-jiangquan-nongsang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"孝文帝奖劝农桑是 D 维度下北朝纺织生产组织调整的节点，其织造工艺与产品归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:xiaowendi-qian-du-luoyang","title":"北魏孝文帝迁都洛阳（Emperor Xiaowen Moves the Capital to Luoyang）","name_en":"Emperor Xiaowen Moves the Capital to Luoyang","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["北魏","孝文帝","迁都洛阳","平城","汉化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记北方地区是欧亚北大陆游牧民族向中原渗化的地带，许多民族积极而迅速地完成向农业文明的转化，迁徙改姓，进入中原选择定居生活；鲜卑拓跋氏的北魏孝文帝从平城（山西大同）迁都洛阳，就是一例。来源未给迁都年份、诏令、反对势力与迁都后的都城布局。","path":"events/xiaowendi-qian-du-luoyang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"孝文帝迁都洛阳是 E 维度下北方游牧政权进入中原、转向农业文明的跨文化节点，其官制与都城制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:xinhai-geming","title":"辛亥革命（Xinhai Revolution）","name_en":"Xinhai Revolution","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1911年","辛亥革命","孙中山","封建统治","近代工商业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"辛亥革命是1911年推翻中国几千年封建统治的革命。2016 版记其虽然没有改变我国半殖民地、半封建社会性质，但冲破了封建专制主义对国家的长期禁锢，资本主义生产关系和工商业得以发展。赵农记孙中山领导的辛亥革命一开始就提出“驱除鞑虏，恢复中华，创立合众政府”（兴中会语）的口号，并以之作为近代革命与《建国方略》构想的起点。","path":"events/xinhai-geming.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"辛亥革命是 E 维度下清末民初政治转折与近代工商业发展的分界事件。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:xinwenhua-yundong","title":"新文化运动（New Culture Movement）","name_en":"New Culture Movement","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["民国","新文化运动","陈独秀","胡适","白话文"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记陈独秀以《新青年》为阵地，积聚当时一批文化精英；陈独秀与留美归国的胡适等人积极宣传“民主”和“科学”，反对封建专制，“打倒孔家店”，提倡“白话文”，倡导新文化运动。来源认为中国现代文化的方向由此远离传统文明的轨迹，向着一种未知的方向转移；中国的艺术知识无法与当时欧美现代主义文化思潮对接，更多嫁接到古典主义的文化形态之中。","path":"events/xinwenhua-yundong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"新文化运动是 A 维度下中国现代文化方向转变的思想节点，其《新青年》等刊物版式归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:xixia-mausoleum","title":"西夏王陵发掘（Excavation of the Western Xia Mausoleums）","name_en":"Excavation of the Western Xia Mausoleums","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["西夏","王陵","丝织","棉织","茂花闪色绵"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"discovery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"20 世纪 70 年代初发掘的西夏王陵出土丝织品与棉织品，反映西夏时期纺织工艺已具备一定生产能力。丝织残片 10 余片，经分析鉴定可辨锦、罗两个品种，织造工艺有烟色素罗组织、棕色纹罗组织、棕色异向绫组织和工字绫组织；棉织品为茂花闪色绵 3 片，两片采用线扎染色工艺，另一片全用棕色经纬交织，组织经密纬疏、织物丰满厚实。","path":"events/xixia-mausoleum.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"西夏王陵发掘是 B 维度下西夏丝棉织工艺的实物证据，其畜牧业与贸易背景属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:xixiacun-canjian","title":"西阴村蚕茧发现（Xiyincun Silk Cocoon Discovery）","name_en":"Xiyincun Silk Cocoon Discovery","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["新石器时代","山西","夏县","西阴村","蚕茧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"discovery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1926 年，山西夏县新石器时代遗址中发现半个蚕茧。田自秉据此说明“我们的祖先在很古的年代里就已开始养蚕”。同段以钱山漾出土家蚕丝织物与青海柴达木盆地毛布并置，构成新石器时代染织技术的证据链。","path":"events/xixiacun-canjian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"西阴村蚕茧发现是 B 维度下新石器时代养蚕与丝织起源的早期实物证据。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:xu-shou-hua-hengfang-zhengqi-ji","title":"徐寿、华衡芳研制中国第一部蒸汽机（Xu Shou and Hua Hengfang Build China's First Steam Engine）","name_en":"Xu Shou and Hua Hengfang Build China's First Steam Engine","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["同治元年","徐寿","华衡芳","蒸汽机","技术引进"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新记早在明末，王征从传教士处获得风磨图样，设计过一种风磴，能“止借风力，省人之力”。同治元年，徐寿、华衡芳甚至研制成中国第一部蒸汽机，来源称已达当时世界水平。但这些技术发明由于造价昂贵（如龙尾车需百金），或缺乏金属材料和能源，以及旧有价值观的抵制和排斥，未能在实际生产中发挥多大作用。来源未给蒸汽机的形制、功率、材料、试验地点与制造费用细目。","path":"events/xu-shou-hua-hengfang-zhengqi-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"徐寿、华衡芳研制蒸汽机是 B 维度下晚清动力技术引进的节点，其技术来源与价值观冲突归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:yangjiacun-bronze-hoard-2003","title":"宝鸡眉县杨家村青铜器出土（Yangjiacun Bronze Hoard in Meixian, Baoji）","name_en":"Yangjiacun Bronze Hoard in Meixian, Baoji","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["2003","杨家村","青铜器","铭文","西周"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"discovery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2003 年 1 月，陕西宝鸡眉县杨家村出土 27 件青铜器，共有 4000 个铭文。赵农在钟鼎文一节记此事，认为这些铭文对西周历史有了进一步的明确记载。来源未给器类清单、铭文释文、器主与窖藏性质。","path":"events/yangjiacun-bronze-hoard-2003.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"杨家村青铜器出土是 B 维度下西周青铜器与铭文资料的考古发现，其文字内容归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:yangwu-yundong","title":"洋务运动（Self-Strengthening Movement）","name_en":"Self-Strengthening Movement","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["晚清","洋务运动","近代工业","中体西用","设计转型"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"洋务运动是晚清官员继承魏源思想、引进西方机器装备、技术和管理方法的经济变革。2016 版记曾国藩、左宗棠、李鸿章等办军民用工业、设船政局、制造局、招商局并派幼童留学，称其开启我国近代工业，是工业设计和现代设计孕育的土壤。赵农则认为其现实格局定位于“旧（中）学为体，西学为用”，“强国”实为“强政府”，很少关注“民生”根本利益。","path":"events/yangwu-yundong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"洋务运动是 E 维度下晚清引进西方技术、开启近代工业与设计转型的枢纽事件。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:yanyou-fuse","title":"延祐元年（1314）贵族夫人服色规定（Yanyou Sumptuary Regulations for Noblewomen）","name_en":"Yanyou Sumptuary Regulations for Noblewomen","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["元代","延祐","服色","浑金","织金"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"延祐元年（1314），元代对贵族夫人规定特殊服饰：一品至三品服浑金，四品五品服金答子，六品以下唯服销金并金纱答子。来源引《南熏殿画像考·引析津志》记袍多用大红织金缠身云龙，有珠翠云龙、浑然纳失石（金锦）、金翠描绣，春夏秋冬金线轻重、单夹不等，其制极宽阔。同段记顾姑冠与蒙汉女服。","path":"events/yanyou-fuse.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"延祐服色规定是 D 维度下元代品级服饰制度的节点，其浑金、金答子等材质属 B 维度织金工艺。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:ysl-retrospective-1985","title":"伊夫·圣·洛朗 25 年作品回顾展（Yves Saint Laurent 25-Year Retrospective）","name_en":"Yves Saint Laurent 25-Year Retrospective","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1985","伊夫·圣·洛朗","服装设计","回顾展","中国美术馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1985 年 5 月 7 日至 7 月 7 日，“法国服装设计家伊夫·圣·洛朗 25 年作品回顾展”在北京中国美术馆展出。同年 7 月《中国美术报》创刊，在创刊号上以整版篇幅介绍伊夫·圣·洛朗的服装设计和西德科拉尼的器皿设计。","path":"events/ysl-retrospective-1985.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"伊夫·圣·洛朗回顾展是 E 维度下西方时装设计与中国设计界互动的节点，其服装设计本体归 B/C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:yu-casts-nine-cauldrons","title":"禹铸九鼎（Nine Cauldrons of Yu）","name_en":"Nine Cauldrons of Yu","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["传说夏代","九鼎","九州","列鼎","礼器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"相传夏禹收九牧之金，在荆山之下铸九鼎，象征九州，并在鼎上镌刻魑魅魍魉图形，让人们警示。自此鼎由一般炊器发展为传国重器：夏亡鼎迁商都毫京，商亡鼎迁周都镐京；历商至周，定都或建立王朝称“定鼎”，“九鼎八簋”成为中央政权的象征。春秋时楚庄公向周定王使臣公孙满问鼎大小轻重，“问鼎”遂成觊觎国家权力的专用语。","path":"events/yu-casts-nine-cauldrons.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"禹铸九鼎是 B 维度下青铜礼器由实用炊器转为政权象征的传说节点，其列鼎等级属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:yu-chuan-qi","title":"禹传启（Yu Passes the Throne to Qi）","name_en":"Yu Passes the Throne to Qi","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["传说夏代","禹","启","禅让","世袭"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记“禹传位于启，不仅仅是禅让制度的终结，更是社会秩序的进步，既适应了当时的生产力水平，也是地理环境中人类生存制度的保证”。同章另记“大禹改变了远古的禅让制度，传位于儿子启，由启建立了夏代”。来源未给禅让与传子的具体过程、年份与反对者。","path":"events/yu-chuan-qi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"禹传启是 D 维度下传说时代王位继承制度由禅让转向世袭的节点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:yuan-abolish-keju","title":"元代科举废止（Abolition of the Imperial Examination in the Yuan）","name_en":"Abolition of the Imperial Examination in the Yuan","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["元代","科举","士人","民间工艺","文人"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元朝蒙古人入主中原后取消科举制度。来源称这对数量极多的汉族士人是致命打击：科举为民间士人提供仕途机会，一旦中举即可“衣锦还乡”“光宗耀祖”；废止后，一大批士人失去依靠，只能浪迹酒楼茶肆，填词作曲，敷衍故事，与民间艺人“打成一片”。来源认为这是元朝民间工艺发达的主要原因之一。","path":"events/yuan-abolish-keju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"元代科举废止是 D 维度下教育与选官制度变化的节点，其士人流向民间文艺的后果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:zenghouyi-mu-fajue","title":"曾侯乙墓发掘（Zenghouyi Tomb Excavation）","name_en":"Zenghouyi Tomb Excavation","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["战国","湖北","随县","曾侯乙墓","失蜡法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"discovery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1977 年，湖北随县战国时期曾侯乙墓出土铜尊与铜盘，其上玲珑透剔的装饰用失蜡法制作。田自秉在同一段又记 1979 年河南淅川下寺春秋墓出土铜禁与铜盏，其盖纽及腿足亦用失蜡法，并称这是目前所发现最早的失蜡法制件，把失蜡法的历史向前提早一百多年。","path":"events/zenghouyi-mu-fajue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"曾侯乙墓发掘是 B 维度下战国失蜡法铸造的实物证据，用于说明镂空铜器的工艺年代序列。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:zhangqian-chushi-xiyu","title":"张骞出使西域（Zhang Qian's Missions to the Western Regions）","name_en":"Zhang Qian's Missions to the Western Regions","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["西汉","张骞","西域","丝绸之路","跨文化交流"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"公元前 138 年和前 119 年，张骞两次出使西域，开辟了从长安直达中亚、西亚许多国家，直至地中海东岸的陆上“丝绸之路”。来源把此事放在秦汉农具、作坊与统一商业市场的叙述之间，用来说明各地区经济文化交流的发展。","path":"events/zhangqian-chushi-xiyu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"张骞出使西域是 E 维度下陆上丝绸之路开辟的节点，其贸易与市场组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:zhenghe-voyages","title":"郑和下西洋（Zheng He's Voyages to the Western Ocean）","name_en":"Zheng He's Voyages to the Western Ocean","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["明代","郑和","下西洋","贸易瓷","青花瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明永乐三年（1405）左右开始，郑和七下西洋，航程远至亚、非沿海诸国，在亚非掀起“中国风”，其重要内涵是对中国瓷器的热捧；来源称之为明清贸易瓷的第一次高峰。阿拉伯王宫贵族把中国瓷器镶嵌在殿堂壁或屋柱上作为财富象征，伊朗、印度、斯里兰卡、马来西亚、印尼、土耳其等地博物馆均藏有 15 世纪初传入的中国青花瓷。田自秉另记成祖时迁都北京、安定西北地区，并派太监郑和七下西洋，远到亚非等 30 多个国家，扩大","path":"events/zhenghe-voyages.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"郑和下西洋是 E 维度下中国瓷器跨文化流通与“中国风”形成的节点，其船队与官营船厂属 D、B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:zhongguo-gongyi-meishupin-baihuajiang","title":"中国工艺美术品百花奖（China Arts and Crafts Hundred Flowers Award）","name_en":"China Arts and Crafts Hundred Flowers Award","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["百花奖","工艺美术","金杯奖","北京玉器厂","苏绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖年表按届记中国工艺美术品百花奖。1981 年 8 月 10 日至 16 日，第一届评比在北京举行，同年 9 月举行颁奖，北京玉器厂王树森的“珍品翡翠玉佩”等六件作品获得金杯奖。1982 年 8 月 13 日至 19 日，第二届评比在北京举行，同年 9 月举行颁奖，江苏省工艺美术公司的“苏绣精品”等七件作品获得金杯奖。1983 年 8 月 3 日，第三届评比在北京举行，同年 9 月举行颁奖，北","path":"events/zhongguo-gongyi-meishupin-baihuajiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国工艺美术品百花奖是 D 维度下工艺美术品评奖与人才激励制度的节点，其获奖作品工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:zhongguo-gongyi-meishushi-completed","title":"《中国工艺美术史》编写完成（Completion of The History of Chinese Arts and Crafts）","name_en":"Completion of The History of Chinese Arts and Crafts","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1982","田自秉","中国工艺美术史","中央工艺美术学院","工艺美术史论"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在后记中记经过三十多年的探索和追求，这本《中国工艺美术史》总算编写完成，不久将和读者见面；他解放前在杭州国立艺术专科学校求学时常去浙江省图书馆阅览《格古要论》《骨董琐记》一类书籍，注意古代生活用品的制作特点；中央工艺美术学院筹备期间开始专门准备开《中国工艺美术史》课，因所见多为日、英、德、北欧出版物，本国系统著作仅见 1917 年许衍灼《中国工艺沿革史略》，遂立下编写中国自己的工艺美术史的决","path":"events/zhongguo-gongyi-meishushi-completed.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《中国工艺美术史》编写完成是 A 维度下中国工艺美术史学科自主著述的节点，其学院教学背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:zhou-enlai-handicraft-1972","title":"周恩来提出“手工艺要大力提倡”（Zhou Enlai's Call to Vigorously Promote Handicrafts）","name_en":"Zhou Enlai's Call to Vigorously Promote Handicrafts","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1972","周恩来","手工艺","广交会","工艺美术恢复"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1972 年 4 月 9 日，周恩来在广州接见广交会代表时指出“手工艺要大力提倡”。此后北京、上海、江苏、广东等地工艺美术行业开始出现转机，工艺美术生产逐步得到恢复。来源把它置于 1971 年 7 月李先念在全国日用工业品座谈会上的讲话之后、1972 年 9 月全国工艺美术展览会之前。","path":"events/zhou-enlai-handicraft-1972.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"周恩来 1972 年提出“手工艺要大力提倡”是 D 维度下文革期间工艺美术政策转向的节点，其行业生产恢复归 D 维度、产品工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:zhou-initial-wine-ban","title":"周初禁酒（Early Zhou Wine Ban）","name_en":"Early Zhou Wine Ban","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["周初","禁酒","酒诰","酒器","青铜器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记周人禁酒，认为商的亡国是由于统治者沉溺在酒里，连上天都发怒了，并引《尚书·酒诰》“群饮汝勿佚，尽执拘以归于周，予其杀”。因此，商代发达的酒器制造工艺到周时渐趋没落：爵在西周前期尚有制作，后期即消失；斝在周代已少见；觚西周前期与商代同，后期即已淘汰；觯、卣等盛酒器在西周后期亦已绝迹。来源另记周公令杀违禁饮酒的人，唯对手工业工人违禁则可以不杀。","path":"events/zhou-initial-wine-ban.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"周初禁酒是 D 维度下周代以政令约束饮酒的节点，其酒器工艺的衰落归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:anqing-junxiesuo","title":"安庆军械所（Anqing Arsenal）","name_en":"Anqing Arsenal","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1862","安庆","洋务运动","曾国藩","军事工业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“国外技术的引进与机器制造业的产生”一节记：清末洋务运动引进西方先进机器装备、技术和管理方法，开启我国近代工业的先河；兴办洋务的中兴诸臣中，曾国藩于 1862 年筹设我国第一家近代军事工业——安庆军械所，试制出我国第一台蒸汽机、第一艘木壳轮船“黄鹄号”，揭开我国自造轮船的序幕。来源把这件事列为曾国藩“功在后世的实事”第一项，并由此展开对江南机器制造总局、翻译馆、幼童留美等洋务活动的叙述。\n\n","path":"institutions/anqing-junxiesuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"安庆军械所是 D 维度下晚清洋务军事工业的机构条目，其蒸汽机与轮船制造归 B、西方技术引进归 E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:baigongya","title":"百工衙（Hundred Crafts Offices）","name_en":"Hundred Crafts Offices","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["太平天国","天京","百工衙","典织衙","缝衣衙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"百工衙是太平天国设立的工艺生产组织，以分工细致为特点。田自秉记：太平天国在设立“诸匠营”之外，“另外还设立了‘百工衙’，分工也很细”。来源按工业门类列举各衙：服用工业有典织衙（后改为织营）、缝衣衙、国帽衙（制冠帽）、金靴衙（作鞋靴）、梳篦衙、典妆衙（花粉装饰）等；建筑工业有典木衙、油漆衙等；日用品工业有典铜衙、典竹衙、典石衙、洋遮衙（制伞）等；印刷工业有镌刻衙、刷书衙等；美术工业有绣锦衙（包括画壁","path":"institutions/baigongya.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"百工衙是 D 维度下太平天国工艺生产组织的条目，其各衙所辖工艺归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:baoshi","title":"暴室（Baoshi Palace Workshop）","name_en":"Baoshi Palace Workshop","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["汉代","未央宫","暴室","染练","掖庭"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在汉代印染工艺一节记：汉代丝织的染色工艺，官方设有专管染色的机构。据《三辅黄图》记载：“未央宫有暴室，主掖庭织作染练之署。”《续汉书·百官志》也记载有“平准令”，就是主练染作彩色的。来源把暴室与平准令并列为汉代官方染色机构，但没有说明二者的隶属、层级与分工。本条只立暴室，平准令另条。\n\n来源只给暴室所在宫室与职掌一句，未给设置年代、隶属官署、员额、作坊规模、染练品种、工匠来源与产品去向。“暴","path":"institutions/baoshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"暴室是 D 维度下汉代宫廷染练官署的条目，其织作与染练工艺归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:bauhaus","title":"包豪斯（Bauhaus）","name_en":"Bauhaus","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1919","德国","包豪斯","现代设计","设计教育"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_school","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在第十章“现代”绪论记：西方社会此时已经完成了工艺美术和设计的学科剥离，这以 1919 年德国包豪斯（原文作“Bauhuas”）的成立为标志。当时的工艺美术在欧洲社会已趋向式微，即使介于工艺美术和现代设计之间的“装饰艺术运动”（Art Deco），在 20 世纪二三十年代出现时，也似乎和“工艺美术”拉开了距离。\n\n来源只给成立年份、国别与“学科剥离标志”的史学定位，没有给创办人、校址、课程、教","path":"institutions/bauhaus.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"包豪斯是 D 维度下现代设计教育的机构条目，其现代性与跨文化互动归 E、设计史观归 A；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:beijing-falangchang","title":"北京珐琅厂（Beijing Enamel Factory）","name_en":"Beijing Enamel Factory","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["北京","景泰蓝","珐琅","生产企业"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_workshop","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北京珐琅厂是北京规模较大的景泰蓝生产厂。田自秉在“景泰蓝”节记：“目前，景泰蓝仍以北京为生产中心。北京珐琅厂规模较大，北京工艺美术厂也设有景泰蓝车间。此外，上海等地也发展了景泰蓝工艺的生产。”\n\n来源只有这一句直接记载，没有给该厂的成立年份、厂址、隶属关系、所有制、职工人数、产品品种、产量、销售范围与存续时间；“规模较大”也没有量化标准。本条只登记北京珐琅厂，不把北京工艺美术厂的景泰蓝车间或上海等","path":"institutions/beijing-falangchang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"北京珐琅厂是 B 维度下景泰蓝生产的条目，其工厂建制与生产组织归 D 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:beiping-guoli-yizhuan","title":"北平国立艺术专科学校（Beiping National Art College）","name_en":"Beiping National Art College","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["北平","国立艺专","图案系","实用美术","设计教育"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_school","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“设计教育发展”一节记：至 1949 年以前，许多地方开办的美术学校中设立了“工艺”“实用美术”等专业，仅仅与绘画、雕塑专业平衡；其中以北平国立艺专的图案系和杭州国立艺专的图案系最具实力。来源只给这一句比较性判断，没有给北平国立艺专的创办年份、校址、学制、图案系课程、师资、学生数与停办或改组时间。\n\n来源在同一段先记蔡元培在民国初期《美术的起源》中确定“建筑、造像（雕刻）、图画与工艺美术（包","path":"institutions/beiping-guoli-yizhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"北平国立艺专是 D 维度下近代美术教育机构的条目，其图案系与实用美术教学归 C；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:bintieju","title":"镔铁局（Bintie Bureau）","name_en":"Bintie Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["元代","镔铁","矿冶","金属工艺","集宁路"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"镔铁局是元代官府管理镔铁生产与加工的机构，隶属关系只有夏燕靖两版给出（“工部总管府下”）。三册来源对它的职能说法不同：夏燕靖两版说它“专门冶炼铁铜等金属产品”，赵农说它“管理镔铁镂刻、镶嵌金银的制作”——一为冶铸，一为装饰加工，本 KU 并存。赵农另给出镔铁在元代铁器中的地位（“元代铁器中最著名的是以镔铁为材料的刀具”）。","path":"institutions/bintieju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"镔铁局是 D 维度下元代官府管理特种金属材料的机构节点，镔铁作为材料的稀缺性同时构成 B 维度刀具与饰件工艺的约束条件。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:central-academy-arts-design","title":"中央工艺美术学院（Central Academy of Arts and Design）","name_en":"Central Academy of Arts and Design","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["设计教育","工艺美术","1956","北京"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_school","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中央工艺美术学院是 1956 年经国务院批准成立的高等工艺美术院校，校址在北京马神庙白堆子，1999 年并入清华大学并更名为清华大学美术学院。五册来源都把它作为新中国综合性高等工艺美术教育全面启动的标志。","path":"institutions/central-academy-arts-design.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中央工艺美术学院是 D 维度（商业、制度与设计教育）下设计教育制度的锚点；其专业设置与 1999 年合并也涉及 E 维度的现代性转型。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:chengdu-cungu-shuju","title":"成都存古书局（Chengdu Cungu Book Bureau）","name_en":"Chengdu Cungu Book Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清末","成都","存古书局","官书局","说文解字注"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"publishing_house","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“清代印刷”官刻段记：清末，许多地方开设官方书局；成都存古书局出版了《说文解字注》，与金陵书局、湖南思贤书局、浙江书局等一并，“都对革故鼎新的晚清社会产生了积极影响”。\n\n来源只给书局名、所在城市与代表出版物，没有给设立年份、创办人、隶属、地址、员额、刻工与经费、刊刻书目、印量与流通范围；《说文解字注》的注者、印行年份、版本与校刻情况也未说明。本条目只登记成都存古书局作为清末成都官办书局的本","path":"institutions/chengdu-cungu-shuju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"成都存古书局是 C 维度下清末官办书局的条目，其官方出版制度归 D；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:chengyi-gongsuo","title":"成衣公所（Chengyi Guild）","name_en":"Chengyi Guild","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清代","苏州","长州县","成衣公所","行会"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_society","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新在讨论明清设计专业化与商品化时，引《明清苏州工商业碑刻集》所载《长州县禁止无业游民在成衣公所寻衅滋扰碑》，认为可见当时已有专业衣工和专门的成衣制作业行会。来源同段记：乾隆《常熟昭文合志》有“往时履袜之属，率妇女手制，今则取给于市”；明清江南服装以江宁、苏州、杭州三地最盛，江宁城内形成成衣制作的集中街区，苏州成衣制作量多质优、全国慕效；湖州双林镇清初有衣庄七十余所；鞋、袜、帽、履之类也有专门制","path":"institutions/chengyi-gongsuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下清代成衣业行会的锚点，其成衣制作与服装工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:china-commercial-art-writers-association","title":"中国商业美术作家协会（China Commercial Art Writers Association）","name_en":"China Commercial Art Writers Association","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1934","上海","商业美术","设计社团","工商业美术作品选集"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_society","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新在讨论 20 世纪 20、30 年代设计艺术的成效时记：1934 年上海成立“中国商业美术作家协会”，入会者多达 500 余人，同年举办展览会，先后出版工商业美术作品选集两辑。来源把该协会与 1923 年陈之佛创办的尚美图案馆、1932 年庞薰栗（原文如此）筹建的大熊工商美术社并列，说明设计事务所和设计社团的成立是这一时期设计发展的三个方面之一；来源还记这两个事务所维持时间很短，尚美图案馆仅","path":"institutions/china-commercial-art-writers-association.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下商业美术设计社团的锚点，其商业美术与广告设计内容归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:chuangong","title":"船宫（Chuangong Shipyard）","name_en":"Chuangong Shipyard","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["春秋战国","吴越","楚","造船","水军"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_workshop","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"船宫是春秋战国时期南方所建的造船作坊。赵农在“水战”段称南方吴、越、楚国与北方齐国造船业均非常发达，吴越建有“船宫”；夏燕靖 2016 称南方楚、吴、越出现专门的造船工场——船宫，与最早的水军舟师并见。","path":"institutions/chuangong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下先秦造船工场的锚点，其军事背景属于 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:ciyaoguan","title":"瓷窑官（Porcelain Kiln Officer）","name_en":"Porcelain Kiln Officer","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["辽代","瓷窑官","窑务","宋会要辑稿","太平兴国"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在辽代陶瓷一节记：由于辽代瓷业的兴起，设立了专管窑务的“瓷窑官”。来源引《宋会要辑稿》为证：太平兴国四年六月“二十六日幽州神武厅直乡岳四百余人来归山后八军伪瓷窑官三人以所授处牌印来献”。来源据此判断，瓷窑官的设置当在太平兴国以前。\n\n来源同段还记辽瓷的生产地区与主要产品：赤峰缸瓦窑屯辽窑，窑场很大、窑址也多，面积约二平方里，是辽瓷的主要产地，产品有仿定白瓷、辽三彩、茶叶末绿釉等单色釉陶；辽阳","path":"institutions/ciyaoguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"瓷窑官是 D 维度下辽代窑务管理官职的条目，其瓷器烧造与窑场产品归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:da-yuesi","title":"大乐司（Office of Great Music）","name_en":"Office of Great Music","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["西周","礼乐","大乐司","音乐教育","乐器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“乐器”一节记：西周有专门的音乐机构，属“大乐司”，成为最早的音乐教育管理部门。同段记周代乐器约有 70 种，《诗经》提及的乐器有 29 种，并以金、石、土、革、丝、木、匏、竹“八音”分类。\n\n来源只给机构名与“最早的音乐教育管理部门”这一定位，没有给大乐司的隶属、员额、职掌、乐师、教学内容与考核方式。本条目只登记机构名、时代与音乐教育定位，不写周代礼乐制度通史，也不把“大乐司”与后世太乐署","path":"institutions/da-yuesi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大乐司是 D 维度下周代音乐教育管理机构的条目；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:dasheng-shachang","title":"大生纱厂（Dasheng Cotton Mill）","name_en":"Dasheng Cotton Mill","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1899","南通","张謇","纺织","民族工业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大生纱厂是张謇于 1899 年在南通创办的近代纺织企业，后又办起大生二厂、三厂、八厂（高丰 2004）。赵农 2009 在“总结”中把张謇与大生纱厂当作“官商一体”的例证：张謇利用清政府官员的身份创办大生纱厂，自身获得可观经济效益，同时用各种手段压制其他私人企业的发展；来源据此判断这种官商一体的企业无法推动中国社会生产力的进步。\n\n两册对同一企业的叙述取向相反：高丰在张謇小传中把它列为实业成就，赵","path":"institutions/dasheng-shachang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大生纱厂是 D 维度下近代民族纺织企业的条目，其纺织生产与设备归 B；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:dechang-huabianzhuang","title":"德昌花边庄（Dechang Lace Workshop）","name_en":"Dechang Lace Workshop","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清末","青州","花边","抽纱","德昌花边庄"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_workshop","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源记：19 世纪末至 20 世纪初，编织业在民间已很普遍；据《益都县志》，编织业中以花边、发网著称，产品远销欧美、澳洲等地。来源又据《中国重要商品》记当时出品多有优良之品，通常有格子花边、网形花边两种，格子花边多销澳大利亚，网形花边以美国为主要市场；莱州（掖县）、青州（蓬莱）地方从事花边制作者颇多，殆已为山东特产物之一。来源接着说明：青州花边实则从意大利传入，原是一种以“码”为计算单位的带形花边","path":"institutions/dechang-huabianzhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"德昌花边庄是 E 维度下近代中西工艺技术传入的作坊条目，其经营与生产组织归 D、花边工艺归 B；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:dian-shizhai","title":"点石斋石印局（Dianshizhai Lithographic Press）","name_en":"Dianshizhai Lithographic Press","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1876","上海","石印","英商","蒸汽机"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"publishing_house","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“书籍装帧设计”之后的近代印刷段落记：中国是世界上最先发明印刷术的国家，但西方近代印刷工业的发展已大大超过我国；19 世纪下半叶，西方石印技术、珂罗版技术和纸型制铅版相继传入。书籍印刷方面，1876 年英商在上海创设的点石斋石印局，采用蒸汽机，雇佣 200 名工人，影印中国旧版书籍，并石印各种书籍。来源并记：当时上海、广州、杭州、北京等地创办的新式印刷厂有 10 多家，其中规模较大的有同文书","path":"institutions/dian-shizhai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"点石斋石印局是 C 维度下近代石印出版的机构条目，其外资经营归 D、西方印刷术传入归 E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:dian-si","title":"典丝（Dian Si）","name_en":"Dian Si","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["周代","考工记","典丝","丝织","职官"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“桑麻”一节记：商周有专营丝织的手工业机构，来管理纺织品生产。周代《考工记》中记有“典丝”一职，有“筐人”“慌人”“染人”“典妇功”来组织丝织生产。来源只列职名，没有给各职的员额、隶属、职掌细目与考核方式，也没有说明这些职官是同一官署的正副职还是并列工种。\n\n本条目以“典丝”立目，把同段的筐人、慌人、典妇功作为周代丝织职官登记；染人另有 `institutions/zhou-ranren-z","path":"institutions/dian-si.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"典丝是 D 维度下周代丝织职官的条目，其丝织生产归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:dier-qinggongyebu","title":"第二轻工业部（Second Ministry of Light Industry）","name_en":"Second Ministry of Light Industry","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1965","北京","工艺美术局","中央手工业管理总局","工艺美术创作设计会议"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"第二轻工业部于 1965 年初由国务院决定撤销中央手工业管理总局后改建成立，下设工艺美术局；同年 6 月在北京召开全国工艺美术创作设计会议。","path":"institutions/dier-qinggongyebu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下 1960 年代工艺美术行政机构的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:diyi-qiche-zhizaochang","title":"第一汽车制造厂（First Automobile Works）","name_en":"First Automobile Works","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1953","1956","长春","第一汽车制造厂","解放牌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“社会主义建设时期的工业产品设计”一节记：1950 年毛泽东访问苏联期间，中苏双方商定由苏联援助中国建设第一个载重汽车厂；同年 4 月重工业部成立汽车工业筹备组；经调查比较，中央财经委员会批准第一汽车制造厂在吉林省长春市兴建。1953 年初发布《中共中央关于力争三年建设长春汽车厂的指示》，汽车制造厂被列入第一个五年计划首批重点工程；同年 7 月 15 日，第一汽车制造厂奠基典礼在长春市西南孟","path":"institutions/diyi-qiche-zhizaochang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"第一汽车制造厂是 B 维度下新中国汽车产品设计与制造的机构条目，其五年计划与部委管理归 D、苏联技术转移归 E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:dongxi-zhishi","title":"长安东、西织室（Eastern and Western Weaving Rooms in Chang'an）","name_en":"Eastern and Western Weaving Rooms in Chang'an","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["汉代","长安","少府","织室","东织室令丞"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖 2016 在汉代丝织业兴盛处记：东汉时，成都已成为蜀锦的集散中心，在长安设有东、西织室，织作缯帛和文绣之服；在临淄和襄邑设服官，制丝织服物，织工多达数千人。官作坊织造的精美丝麻织物，除供皇室享用外，还作赏赐和对外贸易。来源把东、西织室系于东汉，并称其设于长安。\n\n田自秉 2010 在汉代染织工艺一节另引《汉书·百官公卿表》：在首都长安“少府属官有东织室令丞，西织室令丞。河平元年（公元前28","path":"institutions/dongxi-zhishi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"长安东、西织室是 D 维度下汉代少府属官营丝织机构的条目，其织造品种与工艺归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:dutch-east-india-company","title":"荷兰东印度公司（Dutch East India Company）","name_en":"Dutch East India Company","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["荷兰东印度公司","贸易瓷","克拉克瓷","青花瓷","中西贸易"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在明清贸易瓷与近代手工业两处记荷兰东印度公司。其一：明清两代青花瓷大量外销，仅荷兰东印度公司在 1602—1682 年的 80 年中，便贩运中国青花瓷 1,600 万件以上。其二：第二次贸易瓷高峰发生在 17—19 世纪的欧洲各国，哥伦布发现新大陆后，最早以荷兰东印度公司为主的西方贸易公司开始与东方各国建立贸易往来；17 世纪中国出口贸易鼎盛时期，南非博塔维尔注册的荷兰贸易中心文献显示，每年至","path":"institutions/dutch-east-india-company.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"荷兰东印度公司是 E 维度下中西贸易与设计互动的机构条目，其贸易制度归 D、外销瓷装饰归 C；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:fujian-chuanzhengju","title":"福建船政局（Fujian Naval Yard）","name_en":"Fujian Naval Yard","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清代","洋务运动","马尾","造船","左宗棠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"福建船政局是 1866 年由左宗棠奏请创办的近代官办造船与船政机构，设在福建马尾。三册来源对它的侧重完全不同：夏燕靖两版把它作为左宗棠洋务活动的核心事例，给出选址、人事接续、造船年限与艺局人数；李立新把它作为“近代工业化造物”的第一个标志，只取造船时间一点。夏燕靖一册内部有两处年代需要分开读：1866 年上奏创办，1872 年奏报创办意图。","path":"institutions/fujian-chuanzhengju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"福建船政局是 D 维度下洋务官办企业的组织样本，其技术引进与求实堂艺局的人才培养同时属 E 维度的跨文化技术转移。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:fuliang-ciju","title":"浮梁瓷局（Fuliang Porcelain Bureau）","name_en":"Fuliang Porcelain Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["元代","景德镇","官窑","青花瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"浮梁瓷局是元初设在景德镇的官方瓷业机构。四册来源都把它作为元代景德镇官营瓷业的起点，但对它的机构性质记述不一：高丰称其为“全国惟一的官营瓷器作坊”，夏燕靖两版则称其为“监督税收机构”。本 KU 并存两说，不调和。","path":"institutions/fuliang-ciju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"浮梁瓷局是 D 维度下元代官方介入景德镇瓷业生产的制度节点，也是 C 维度青花瓷视觉体系得以成立的制度前提。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:fuzhou-mawei-chuanzheng-xuetang-huishiyuan","title":"福州马尾船政学堂绘事院（Fuzhou Mawei Naval School Drawing Institute）","name_en":"Fuzhou Mawei Naval School Drawing Institute","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1867","福州","马尾","船政学堂","绘图教育"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_school","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“设计教育发展”一节开篇记：1867 年，在福州马尾船政学堂设立绘事院；1888 年，江南船政局开办工艺学堂；“中国设计教育出现并快速发展”。来源只给设立年份、所属学堂与“绘事院”这一名称，没有给创办人、学制、课程、招生对象、教员、学生数与停办时间。\n\n本条与既有 `institutions/fujian-chuanzhengju.md` 不重复：后者记福建船政局的创办、选址、造船年限、求实","path":"institutions/fuzhou-mawei-chuanzheng-xuetang-huishiyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"福州马尾船政学堂绘事院是 D 维度下近代设计教育起点的机构条目，其造船与制图技术背景归 B；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:getz-bros","title":"盖茨公司（Getz Bros. & Co.）","name_en":"Getz Bros. & Co.","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["20世纪初","上海","南京路","盖茨公司","装饰材料"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“近代室内设计的发展”一节记：20 世纪初，各地制造、经营或代理各类装饰材料的商家迅速发展；上海南京路上的盖茨公司（Getz Bros. & Co.）是当年上海滩规模较大的一家装饰材料供应商，主要代理各种名牌的石材、瓷砖、壁纸、夹板等建筑装饰建材。来源还据该公司刊登在《建筑月刊》上的广告指出：作为独家建筑装饰材料代理商，公司不仅为客户免费提供各类样品和报价，而且在施工过程中对外国监理给予技术","path":"institutions/getz-bros.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"盖茨公司是 D 维度下近代建筑装饰材料流通的机构条目，其材料品类归 B、外资代理归 E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:gongbu","title":"工部（Ministry of Works）","name_en":"Ministry of Works","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["隋唐","工部","尚书省","百工","屯田"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源据《唐六典》详记唐代工部的官职配备与职掌：工部尚书一人、侍郎一人、郎中一人、员外郎一人、主事三人、令史十二人、书令史二十一人、计史一人、亭长六人、掌固八人。工部尚书正三品，侍郎正四品下；工部尚书、侍郎“掌天下百工、屯田、山泽之政令”，其属有四：一曰工部，二曰屯田，三曰虞部，四曰水部。郎中从五品上，员外郎从六品上，主事从九品上；郎中、员外郎“掌经营兴造之众务，凡城池之修浚，土木之缮葺，工匠之程式","path":"institutions/gongbu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"工部是 D 维度下中央官手工业与营建管理机构的条目，其城池修浚、土木缮葺与工匠程式归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:guangdong-gongyiju","title":"广东工艺局（Guangdong Craft Bureau）","name_en":"Guangdong Craft Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清末","广东","工艺局","广货","粤绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在近代广东手工业与对外贸易一节记：在对外贸易中，洋人称从“广州工部”购得的货物为“广货”，对“刺绣”也称“广绣”或“粤绣”；据《岭南丛述》，“粤绣工人多是广东人和潮州人”。光绪年间，广东成立工艺局，为主管工艺品的生产机构，其工艺品种通过洋庄源源输向世界各地；潮州的刺绣则通过汕头口岸输向新加坡、泰国、马来西亚。1913 年《南洋劝业会研究报告》载：光绪二十六年（1900）经广东海关出口的绣品价值","path":"institutions/guangdong-gongyiju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"广东工艺局是 D 维度下清末地方工艺生产主管机构的条目，其外销网络归 E、刺绣工艺归 B；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:guangdong-nanhai-tengchang","title":"广东南海藤厂（Guangdong Nanhai Rattan Factory）","name_en":"Guangdong Nanhai Rattan Factory","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["广东","南海","藤编","藤器","工艺厂"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_workshop","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"广东南海藤厂是中华人民共和国成立后建立的大型藤编工艺厂之一。田自秉在“藤编”节记：“解放后，我国建立了许多大型的藤编工艺厂，广东南海藤厂就是其中的一个。”\n\n来源只有这一句直接记载，没有给该厂的成立年份、厂址、隶属关系、所有制、职工人数、产品品种、产量、销售范围与存续时间；“大型”也没有量化标准。同段所记藤编工艺的一般情况（藤丝分类、编织品类、机械化生产）不专属该厂，本条只作为工艺背景照录，不写成","path":"institutions/guangdong-nanhai-tengchang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"广东南海藤厂是 B 维度下藤编生产的条目，其工厂建制与生产组织归 D 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:guangzhou-zaozhichang","title":"广州造纸厂（Guangzhou Paper Mill）","name_en":"Guangzhou Paper Mill","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["民国","广州","造纸","新闻纸","进口纸浆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“纸张”一节记：民国时期的广州造纸厂能够生产一定数量的新闻纸张，但由于对进口纸浆的依赖，随着抗日战争的爆发，无法形成规模化生产。来源只给这一句，没有给创设年份、厂址、资本、设备、纸浆来源国、产量、产品规格与战后命运。\n\n本条目只登记广州造纸厂作为近代造纸厂的本体及其“进口纸浆依赖—抗战爆发—无法规模化”的产业处境，不写广州造纸工业通史或抗战时期工业内迁史。","path":"institutions/guangzhou-zaozhichang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"广州造纸厂是 B 维度下近代造纸厂的条目，其进口依赖与战时生产困境归 D；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:gugong-bowuyuan","title":"故宫博物院（The Palace Museum）","name_en":"The Palace Museum","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["博物院","藏品","西周织物","商代提花织物","纺织史证据"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"museum","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"故宫博物院在两册中都不是作为机构史对象出现，而是作为藏品来源：田自秉记其藏有周墓出土的玉刀，上面残留回纹图案的织花痕迹，是西周织物的间接实物证据；李立新记其收藏商代铜戈把和玉女戈（疑“玉援戈”）附着丝织品痕迹，并据以说明商代提花织物为平纹地起四成六枚斜纹花。","path":"institutions/gugong-bowuyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下博物馆机构的锚点，其实质内容服务于 B 维度的纺织技术史。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:guowuyuan-xuewei-weiyuanhui","title":"国务院学位委员会（Academic Degrees Committee of the State Council）","name_en":"Academic Degrees Committee of the State Council","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["国务院学位委员会","学科目录","艺术设计","设计艺术","艺术学"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新在讨论“艺术设计”与“设计艺术”两个名称时记：国务院学位委员会在本科的学科目录调整中使用“艺术设计”，在研究生专业目录中使用“设计艺术”；作者认为这两种表述是互证关系，内涵完全相同，只是表述与使用范围不同——前者在大的范围内使用，后者在艺术范围内使用。来源没有给该委员会成立年份、隶属、组成、章程，也没有给这两次目录调整的年份与文件名称；1998 年研究生专业目录以“设计艺术学”取代“工艺美术","path":"institutions/guowuyuan-xuewei-weiyuanhui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下学位与学科目录管理机构的锚点，其学科命名与目录调整同时属于 A 维度（设计史观与史学方法）的建制背景。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:guoyuanchang","title":"果园厂（Guoyuan Lacquer Workshop）","name_en":"Guoyuan Lacquer Workshop","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["明代","永乐","北京","果园厂","雕漆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"果园厂是明代宫廷设立的官营漆器生产机构。田自秉记：明代为宫廷服务的制漆机构，除了御用作、油漆作之外，永乐时期还开设“果园厂”，专门制造各种漆器，由元代著名漆艺家张成之子张德刚管理工艺事务，所出雕漆、填漆二种，制作精美，称为“厂制”。同书“果园厂雕漆”一节又称其为“明代封建官营的漆器生产机构”，制作雕漆、填漆等种，以雕漆最有特色；永乐时由张德刚和包亮掌理制漆技艺；嘉靖时又吸收了云南优秀的制漆艺人，明","path":"institutions/guoyuanchang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"果园厂是 D 维度下明代宫廷漆器生产机构的条目，其雕漆、填漆工艺归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:han-dai-guan-ying-sizhi-zuofang","title":"汉代官营丝织作坊（Han Dynasty State-Run Silk Workshops）","name_en":"Han Dynasty State-Run Silk Workshops","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["秦汉","官营手工业","丝织","提花织机","蜀锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“丝织业的兴盛与丝绸之路的开辟”一节记：自秦至汉，丝织业的生产技术和产量提升最为显著，缫丝工具和织机有很大改进；尤其是官营的丝织作坊规模扩大，已采用先进的提花织机，生产大量锦绣绮罗等精美丝织品。来源列当时丝织品种类繁多，有轻而薄的素纱，素色提花的绮、罗，彩色提花的锦，还有纨、纻、缣、缦、绢、绫、缟、绨、绣、毂等，并引王充《论衡》“齐部世刺绣，恒女无不能；襄邑俗织锦，钝妇无不巧”说明盛况。\n\n","path":"institutions/han-dai-guan-ying-sizhi-zuofang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉代官营丝织作坊是 D 维度下秦汉官营丝织生产网络的合并条目，其提花织机与织物品种归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:han-dai-qiqi-zuofang-guan-yuan","title":"汉代漆器作坊官员（Han Lacquer Workshop Officials）","name_en":"Han Lacquer Workshop Officials","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["秦汉","漆器","官营作坊","工官","八郡"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖 2016 记：从秦代开始就设有官府管理的漆器作坊；到了汉代，从朝廷到郡国又都设有管理漆器生产的作坊官员。当时漆器作坊分布于山东、河南、陕西、江苏、广东、广西等地，漆器成为牟取厚利的新兴商品。《史记·货殖列传》有“陈、夏千亩漆……木器髹者千枚……此亦比千乘之家”之语；蜀郡和广汉郡的金银饰和漆器最为著名，扬雄《蜀都赋》称“雕镌钿器，万技千工，三参带器，金银文华，无一不妙”。\n\n夏燕靖 2016","path":"institutions/han-dai-qiqi-zuofang-guan-yuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉代漆器作坊官员是 D 维度下官营漆器生产管理的条目，其胎体、髹饰与扣器工艺归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:hangzhou-guoli-yizhuan","title":"国立杭州艺术专科学校（Hangzhou National Art College）","name_en":"Hangzhou National Art College","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["杭州","国立艺专","图案系","实用美术","设计教育"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_school","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"国立杭州艺术专科学校是来源并列的两所“图案系最具实力”的美术院校之一（另一所为北平国立艺专）。赵农在同一节还记：该校聚集着一大批艺术设计的专业教师；1950 年改名为中央美术学院华东分院后，将其中的实用美术系合并入中央美术学院实用美术系；1956 年又成立中央工艺美术学院。田自秉记自己解放前在该校做学生，常去附近的浙江省图书馆阅览《格古要论》《骨董琐记》一类书籍，不是钻古董，而是注意古代人民生活用","path":"institutions/hangzhou-guoli-yizhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"国立杭州艺术专科学校是 D 维度下近代美术教育机构的条目，其图案系与实用美术教学归 C；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:hannuowei-gongye-sheji-luntan","title":"汉诺威工业设计论坛（Hannover Industrial Design Forum）","name_en":"Hannover Industrial Design Forum","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["2007","汉诺威","德国","工业设计","if设计奖"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_society","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“21 世纪初的设计”一节记：2007 年，李宁公司推出的半坡专业篮球鞋被德国历史最悠久的工业设计机构——汉诺威工业设计论坛举办的“if design award china 2007”评为设计大奖；同一段落还记北京奥运会吉祥物“福娃”、北京奥运会体育图标、火炬等设计，以及中国设计师在国际奖项中的表现。来源用“德国历史最悠久的工业设计机构”给汉诺威工业设计论坛定位，并把它与“if desig","path":"institutions/hannuowei-gongye-sheji-luntan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉诺威工业设计论坛是 E 维度下国际设计评奖机构的条目，其产品设计对象归 C、企业参赛与市场推广归 D；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:hengyuan-zhahuachang","title":"恒沅轧花厂（Hengyuan Cotton Ginning Factory）","name_en":"Hengyuan Cotton Ginning Factory","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清末","民国","上海","轧花业","恒沅轧花厂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在近代纺织印染业“轧花业”一节记：手工轧花历来是农民的家庭副业，鸦片战争后逐渐被淘汰。1895 年，上海商人陈悦周用国外输入的新式脚踏轧花机，开设恒沅轧花厂，将收购的籽棉加工成皮棉，获取厚利；此后资本主义的手工轧花工场陆续设立。1915 年，恒沅轧花厂又改用柴油机发动的轧花机，带动上海的手工轧花工场向近代轧花厂过渡。到 1936 年，上海川沙、南汇、奉贤三县 70 多家轧花工场，都已改用动力轧","path":"institutions/hengyuan-zhahuachang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"恒沅轧花厂是 B 维度下近代轧花机械与加工工艺的工场条目，其资本经营归 D、设备引进归 E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:houzhao-yecheng-zhijinshu","title":"后赵邺城织锦署（Later Zhao Yecheng Brocade Office）","name_en":"Later Zhao Yecheng Brocade Office","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["后赵","十六国","邺城","织锦署","邺中记"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在南北朝染织工艺一节引晋·陵朔《邺中记》所载：在后赵邺城设有织锦署，“锦有大登高、小登高、大明光、小明光、大博山、小博山、大茱萸、小茱萸、大交龙、小交龙、蒲桃文锦、斑文锦、凤凰朱雀锦、韬文锦、核桃文锦，或青绨、或白绨、或黄绨、或绿绨、或紫绨、或蜀绨，工巧百数，不可尽名”。来源据此判断，十六国期间后赵的丝织生产，其品种之繁多、纹样之复杂、色彩之丰富，已经非常可观。\n\n来源只给这一条转引，没有给","path":"institutions/houzhao-yecheng-zhijinshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"后赵邺城织锦署是 D 维度下十六国官营织锦机构的条目，其织锦品种、纹样与色彩归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:hubei-qiangpaochang","title":"湖北枪炮厂（Hubei Arsenal）","name_en":"Hubei Arsenal","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1891","湖北","洋务运动","军工","枪炮厂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“总结”记：江南制造总局（1865 年）、金陵机器局（1865 年）、福州船政局（1866 年）、天津机器局（1867 年）、湖北枪炮厂（1891 年）等企业的设立，虽使“洋务运动”有些许起色，但是，官商一体的制度，导致了资本主义进展的缓慢，也阻碍中国现代化的改革。\n\n来源只给厂名、设立年份与这一整体评价，没有给厂址、创办人、隶属、设备、产品、产量、经费与沿革；也没有说明湖北枪炮厂在五局中的","path":"institutions/hubei-qiangpaochang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"湖北枪炮厂是 D 维度下晚清洋务军工企业的条目，其枪炮制造技术归 B；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:huitongguan","title":"会通馆（Huitong Guan）","name_en":"Huitong Guan","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["明代","无锡","会通馆","铜活字","印刷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"publishing_house","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“明代印刷”一节记：明代中期，许多地方出现了铜活字印刷技术，苏州、无锡、常州、南京等地出现了铜活字印刷的书籍。其中，无锡华家“会通馆”印制的《宋诸臣奏议》为现存最早的铜活字印刷书籍。此后，华家的铜活字印刷延续下来，在镌刻、排字、施墨、印刷等过程中，形成了一套秩序化的操作方式。\n\n来源只给工坊名、地点、代表印本与工序概述，没有给会通馆的设立年代、主人姓名（同段只称“华家”）、员额、设备、活字数","path":"institutions/huitongguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"会通馆是 C 维度下明代铜活字印书工坊的条目，其家族出版经营归 D、铜活字刻制与排印工艺归 B；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:hunan-ciye-gongsi","title":"湖南瓷业公司（Hunan Porcelain Company）","name_en":"Hunan Porcelain Company","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清末民初","醴陵","湖南瓷业公司","熊希龄","釉下花瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“近代设计的艰难起步与发展”一节把湖南瓷业公司视为真正体现中国近代陶瓷设计新成就的机构。公司由熊希龄任总理，是官商合办的新式制瓷公司，设圆器厂、琢器厂、机械室、电灯室、化学室等，规模较大。其前身是 1906 年熊希龄以教育家眼光在醴陵姜湾创办的湖南瓷业学校，招收速成班学生，分陶画、辘轳、模型三科，聘请江西景德镇技师和日本技师为教员；随后又招足股本五万元创办公司，把速成班毕业学生派往实习。\n\n","path":"institutions/hunan-ciye-gongsi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"湖南瓷业公司是 B 维度下近代瓷业生产的机构条目，其官商合办与学校制度归 D、新法仿制与博览会获奖归 E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:hunan-sixian-shuju","title":"湖南思贤书局（Hunan Sixian Book Bureau）","name_en":"Hunan Sixian Book Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清末","湖南","思贤书局","官书局","王船山遗书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"publishing_house","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“清代印刷”官刻段记：清末，许多地方开设官方书局；湖南思贤书局出版了《王船山遗书》，对明末清初思想家王船山的遗著进行了整理出版，推动了清末的社会变革。\n\n来源只给书局名、所在省份、代表出版物与影响概述，没有给设立年份、创办人、隶属、地址、员额、刻工与经费、刊刻书目、印量与流通范围；《王船山遗书》的卷数、编纂者、印行年份与版本情况也未说明。本条目只登记湖南思贤书局作为清末湖南官办书局的本体，不","path":"institutions/hunan-sixian-shuju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"湖南思贤书局是 C 维度下清末官办书局的条目，其官方出版制度归 D；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:jiangnan-chuanzhengju-gongyi-xuetang","title":"江南船政局工艺学堂（Jiangnan Naval Yard Technical School）","name_en":"Jiangnan Naval Yard Technical School","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1888","江南","工艺学堂","设计教育","洋务"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_school","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“设计教育发展”一节记：1867 年，在福州马尾船政学堂设立绘事院；1888 年，江南船政局开办工艺学堂；“中国设计教育出现并快速发展”。来源只给开办年份、所属机构名与“工艺学堂”这一名称，没有给创办人、校址、学制、课程、招生与停办时间。\n\n“江南船政局”一名在来源中只此一见。既有 `institutions/jiangnan-zhizao-zongju.md` 记江南制造总局（1865 年","path":"institutions/jiangnan-chuanzhengju-gongyi-xuetang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"江南船政局工艺学堂是 D 维度下近代工艺教育机构的条目，其造船与工艺技术背景归 B；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:jiangnan-zhizao-zongju","title":"江南制造总局（Jiangnan Manufacturing Bureau）","name_en":"Jiangnan Manufacturing Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1865","上海","洋务运动","兵工厂","造船"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"江南制造总局于 1865 年在曾国藩支持下由李鸿章在上海创办，是当时我国最大的兵工厂，并开始造船和修船。赵农把“造船”视为晚清洋务运动中向西方科学技术学习、揭开中国近代工业和科技发展序幕的标志之一，而非把该局本身单独列为标志。夏燕靖《中国设计史》（2009）与《中国艺术设计史（升级版）》（2016）两处均记该局。2016 册进一步给出：1865 年 6 月，曾国藩同李鸿章共同筹建上海江南机器制造总","path":"institutions/jiangnan-zhizao-zongju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下晚清洋务工业机构的锚点，其造船技术属于 B 维度、中西技术互动属于 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:jiangning-zhizaoju","title":"江宁织造局（Jiangning Imperial Silk Manufactory）","name_en":"Jiangning Imperial Silk Manufactory","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清代","江宁","南京云锦","官营织造","曹氏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"江宁织造局是清代设在江宁（南京）的官营织造机构，与苏州、杭州合称三大织造中心，由内务府派员久任，以曹玺及其子孙的长期任职最为著名。三册来源都把它系在“云锦”这一品种上：夏燕靖两版说它“特织御用云锦”，田自秉说它管理织锦的生产。三册对曹氏任职年数的记法不一致，夏燕靖 2016 一册内部也有两处年数并存。赵农 2009 在“清代服饰”段以“江南织造”之名记本机构，称清政府“在南京设立了江南织造，采买丝","path":"institutions/jiangning-zhizaoju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"江宁织造局是 D 维度下清代内务府系统官营织造的机构锚点，其产品云锦同时是 B 维度织造技术与 C 维度宫廷纹样的载体。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:jiangzuojian","title":"将作监（Directorate of Imperial Construction）","name_en":"Directorate of Imperial Construction","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["官营手工业","唐代","宋代","土木营建"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"将作监是隋唐中央主管土木营建工程的官署，与少府监、军器监、都水监并列，下辖左校、右校、中校、甄官四署。其前身可追溯至汉至南北朝的将作大匠：高丰把这一时期工官分为两类，少府掌手工业产品，将作大匠掌土木建筑工程。六册来源一致记其土木工程职掌，但所记工匠规模从“八百多人”到“各万余人”到“15000 人”不等，本 KU 并存不裁定。","path":"institutions/jiangzuojian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"将作监是 D 维度下隋唐官营手工业体系中的土木营建主管机构，与少府监构成“大型工程／日常器具”的分工；其前身为汉至南北朝的将作大匠。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:jianhua-cichang","title":"建华瓷厂（Jianhua Porcelain Factory）","name_en":"Jianhua Porcelain Factory","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["关中","衣食村","解放区","陶瓷","细瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_workshop","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"建华瓷厂是关中衣食村设立的陶瓷厂。田自秉把解放区陶瓷生产的主要产地列为延安、子长、关中、磁州等地，并记：“关中衣食村的建华瓷厂，生产质地较好的细瓷，并有古铜、淡红、白、黑等色釉，产品除供应本区外，还运销陇东一带。”\n\n来源没有给该厂的创设年份、隶属关系、创办人、资本、规模、工人数、窑炉数量、产量、产品分配与存续时间；也没有给“建华”厂名的来历、细瓷的具体器类与色釉的配比、烧成温度。来源把建华瓷厂与","path":"institutions/jianhua-cichang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"建华瓷厂是 B 维度下解放区陶瓷生产的条目，其工厂组织与边区工业政策归 D 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:jiankanglu-zhiranju","title":"建康路织染局（Jiankang Route Weaving and Dyeing Bureau）","name_en":"Jiankang Route Weaving and Dyeing Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["元代","建康路","南京","织染局","东织染局"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源记：元代的染织工艺主要是官营手工业的一部分，官府曾在手工艺行业中专门设立管理染织生产的司局，织造规模相当可观，工匠队伍极为庞大。据《金陵新志》记载，仅建康路织染局的东织染局就有“管人匠三千六百户，织机一百五十四张，额造段匹四千五百二十七段”。来源据此判断，官府为满足贵族统治者奢华生活需要，投注极大精力办染织业，同时使元代染织工艺水平达到一个新高峰；官府扶植的染织工艺在金锦、刺绣、毡罽和棉织等项","path":"institutions/jiankanglu-zhiranju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"建康路织染局是 D 维度下元代官营染织司局的条目，其织造规模与品种归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:jianyang-shufang","title":"建阳书坊（Jianyang Bookshops）","name_en":"Jianyang Bookshops","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["明代","建阳","书坊","坊刻","插图本"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"publishing_house","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“明代印刷”一节记：建阳有 80 余家书坊，出版印刷诗文、通俗、小说、医学等类型的书籍。建阳的插图本书籍较多，此外，还出版有朱熹、吕祖谦等学者的理学、史学著作。同段以杭州 24 家书坊、徽州 10 余家书坊作比较：杭州以出版诗词类、名物类书籍闻名；徽州因具有纸、墨、雕版技术的优势，经史子集的典籍类刻印以及医书数量都有较大影响。\n\n来源只给书坊数量、出版类型与插图本特征，没有给各书坊名称、主人","path":"institutions/jianyang-shufang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"建阳书坊是 C 维度下明代坊刻与书籍设计的书坊群条目，其出版经营归 D；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:jiaoyubu","title":"教育部（Ministry of Education）","name_en":"Ministry of Education of the People's Republic of China","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["教育部","院系调整","工艺美术教育","艺术设计专业","本科专业目录"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“社会主义建设时期的工艺美术”与“21 世纪初的设计”两节三次记教育部：其一，1952 年 6 月中旬，教育部对全国高等院校进行院系调整，部分艺术院校和师范院校进行专业合并，建立实用美术系科；其二，1960 年 2 月 10 日至 28 日，文化部和教育部联合召开全国艺术教育工作会议，会议期间专门召开工艺美术教育工作会议；其三，1998 年 7 月，教育部颁布《普通高等学校本科专业目录》，将","path":"institutions/jiaoyubu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"教育部是 D 维度下设计教育制度的机构条目，其学科目录与史学归属归 A、国际接轨归 E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:jiaoziwu","title":"交子务（Jiaozi Office）","name_en":"Jiaozi Office","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["北宋","益州","交子","纸币","钱引"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“交子”一节记：四川出现了最早的纸币“交子”，最初由四川 16 家商人在宋真宗大中祥符四年（1011）根据经济利益自主发行，发行数额为 1,256,340 缗，三年更换一次，备有本钱 360,000 缗；交子既可购货，也可兑换铜币或铁币，兑换金属货币时 1 贯扣除 30 钱手续费。后来商人因破产失去兑换能力，改由政府发行。宋仁宗天圣元年（1023），在四川益州设置交子务，发行纸币，并用铁币作","path":"institutions/jiaoziwu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"交子务是 D 维度下北宋纸币发行机构的条目，其纸币图版与印刷归 C 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:jichanglong-sichang","title":"继昌隆缫丝厂（Jichanglong Silk Reeling Factory）","name_en":"Jichanglong Silk Reeling Factory","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1872","广东南海","陈启源","缫丝","机器工业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“步履维艰的近代设计”一节记西方近代纺织工业技术传入中国的过程：1862 年英国在华最大生丝出口商怡和洋行运入意大利式缫丝机器，在上海建立有 100 台缫丝机的机器缫丝厂；1872 年，侨商陈启源在广东南海创办继昌隆缫丝厂，使用法国的蒸气加热和机械缫丝直缫坐缫机，成为中国近代最早出现的民族资本机器工业。\n\n来源只给创办年份、创办人、地点、技术来源与“最早民族资本机器工业”的定位，没有给资本额","path":"institutions/jichanglong-sichang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"继昌隆缫丝厂是 B 维度下近代机器缫丝生产的机构条目，其民族资本经营归 D、法国技术引入归 E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:jiefangqu-diyige-taoci-yanjiusuo","title":"解放区第一个陶瓷研究所（First Ceramics Research Institute of the Liberated Areas in Cizhou）","name_en":"First Ceramics Research Institute of the Liberated Areas in Cizhou","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["磁州","解放区","陶瓷","研究机构"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"research_institute","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"解放区第一个陶瓷研究所是河北磁州解放后设立的陶瓷研究机构。田自秉记：“河北磁州解放以后，立即恢复了陶瓷生产，并成立了解放区第一个陶瓷研究所，为发展解放区陶瓷工艺生产作出了贡献。”\n\n来源没有给该所的正式名称、成立年份、隶属关系、所址、所长与研究人员、研究项目、成果与存续时间；也没有说明“第一个”的比较范围与依据。来源只用“解放区第一个陶瓷研究所”描述它，本条照录这一称法，不据描述补造正式所名。来源","path":"institutions/jiefangqu-diyige-taoci-yanjiusuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度下解放区陶瓷研究机构的条目，其陶瓷工艺生产归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:jiguge","title":"汲古阁（Jiguge）","name_en":"Jiguge","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["明末","常熟","毛晋","私家刻书","版刻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"publishing_house","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汲古阁是明末常熟的私家刻书坊。李立新把它作为明清著名私家刻书机构，用以说明明清书坊、私宅刻书遍及各地及刻工匠人集聚；夏燕靖 2016 记毛晋在此雇工刻书 30 年、刻书 600 余种，书板达 10 万余副，刻本远销国内外。","path":"institutions/jiguge.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下明清版刻出版机构的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:jingchang","title":"经厂（Jingchang Printing Office）","name_en":"Jingchang Printing Office","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["明代","经厂","司礼监","内府","刻书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"publishing_house","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“明代印刷”一节记：明代的官方书籍先由“内府”管理，随后由司礼监管理，成立了具有印刷出版性质的“经厂”。经厂挑选了技术精良的刻工、印工、折配工、装订工，出版了 200 余种的经厂本书籍，其纸张光洁，版式精美。但是，由于太监缺少文化，校勘水准有限，因而经厂本书籍的文字错误较多。\n\n来源只给隶属沿革、工种、出版种数与质量评价，没有给经厂的设立年代、地址、员额、内部机构、刻工与印工数量、纸张与装帧","path":"institutions/jingchang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"经厂是 C 维度下明代官方刻书与书籍设计的机构条目，其内府—司礼监制度归 D；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:jingdezhen-ciye-gongsi","title":"景德镇瓷业公司（Jingdezhen Porcelain Company）","name_en":"Jingdezhen Porcelain Company","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1910","景德镇","鄱阳","江西瓷业公司","陶业学堂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“近代设计的艰难起步与发展”一节记中国这个古老瓷器之国在西方近代瓷器工业技术传入和冲击下采用新法制瓷：1910 年，景德镇瓷业公司（亦称江西瓷业公司）正式成立。来源引《中国的瓷器》记该公司“设本厂与分厂二处，本厂设于景德镇，制造仍用旧法；分厂设于鄱阳，以便实验改良制造，并设立一陶业学堂，拟用机器制瓷，试验煤窑烧炼”。来源并记：几乎与此同时，湖南醴陵、江西萍乡、福建厦门也成立瓷业公司；至第一次","path":"institutions/jingdezhen-ciye-gongsi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"景德镇瓷业公司是 B 维度下近代瓷业改良的机构条目，其公司制度与陶业学堂归 D、机器制瓷与煤窑试验归 E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:jinling-jiqiju","title":"金陵机器局（Jinling Arsenal）","name_en":"Jinling Arsenal","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1865","金陵","南京","洋务运动","军工"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“总结”记：江南制造总局（1865 年）、金陵机器局（1865 年）、福州船政局（1866 年）、天津机器局（1867 年）、湖北枪炮厂（1891 年）等企业的设立，虽使“洋务运动”有些许起色，但是，官商一体的制度，导致了资本主义进展的缓慢，也阻碍中国现代化的改革。\n\n来源只给局名、设立年份与这一整体评价，没有给局址、创办人、隶属、设备、产品、产量、经费与沿革；也没有说明金陵机器局在五局中的","path":"institutions/jinling-jiqiju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金陵机器局是 D 维度下晚清洋务军工企业的条目，其机器制造技术归 B；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:jinling-shuju","title":"金陵书局（Jinling Book Bureau）","name_en":"Jinling Book Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清末","南京","金陵书局","官书局","二十四史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"publishing_house","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“清代印刷”官刻段记：清末，许多地方开设官方书局。其中，以同治年间曾国藩在南京开设的“金陵书局”最为著名，其与其他地方官书局联刻印刷《二十四史》，流布雅俗，开启民思。\n\n来源只给开设者、时代、地点、地位与代表出版物，没有给设立年份、隶属、地址、员额、刻工与经费、刊刻书目、印量与流通范围；“联刻”的具体分工、参与书局名单与版片归属也未说明。本条目只登记金陵书局作为清末南京官办书局的本体，不写清","path":"institutions/jinling-shuju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金陵书局是 C 维度下清末官办书局的条目，其官方出版制度归 D；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:jinshu","title":"锦署（Brocade Office）","name_en":"Brocade Office","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["东晋","南北朝","官营织造","蜀锦","提花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"锦署是晋室南渡后在江南设立的官营织锦机构。夏燕靖两版把它的设置系于刘裕灭后秦、迁关中织锦工匠至江南一事；李立新只记“晋室南渡后，成立锦署”，不给出自后秦的工匠来源。第四条来源（田自秉）提到的是后赵邺城的“织锦署”，与东晋锦署同名而异实，本 KU 把它作为同名机构的对照列入 sources，并在文中标明它不构成本实体的证据。","path":"institutions/jinshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"锦署是 D 维度下东晋官营织造的机构起点，其设置以工匠迁徙为手段，直接改变 B 维度江南织锦的技术构成。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:jinyin-zuofangyuan","title":"金银作坊院（Gold and Silver Workshop Institute）","name_en":"Gold and Silver Workshop Institute","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["唐代","官作","金银器","中尚署","行作"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金银作坊院是唐代“官作”金银器制作机构，设于中尚署之下，属少府监中尚署直属；与民间“行作”金银行、金银铺并存。非官方经营者称“行作”，质量差者称“行滥”。","path":"institutions/jinyin-zuofangyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下唐代官营金银器机构的锚点，其器物质地与工艺属于 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:jixia-xuegong","title":"稷下学宫（Jixia Academy）","name_en":"Jixia Academy","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["战国","齐国","临淄","稷下学宫","考工记"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"academy","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在讨论《考工记》作者与成书年代时记：目前多数学者认为《考工记》是齐国官书，作者为齐稷下学宫的学者；该书编纂时间大约从春秋末至战国初年，部分内容补于战国中晚期。来源据此把《考工记》的知识生产场所指向齐国稷下学宫。\n\n来源没有介绍稷下学宫的设立年代、宫室规模、学者员额、学派构成、经费来源与管理制度，也没有说明参与编纂《考工记》的学者是谁、编纂组织如何运作。本条目只登记“《考工记》作者为齐稷下学宫学","path":"institutions/jixia-xuegong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"稷下学宫是 A 维度下设计文献形成机制的条目，其官府手工业制度背景归 D 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:kezisi","title":"刻字司（Western Xia Block-Printing Office）","name_en":"Western Xia Block-Printing Office","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["西夏","刻字司","雕版印刷","活字印刷","佛经"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“西夏工艺技术成就”知识链接中记：西夏印刷业颇为发达，朝廷设有刻字司，专门印刷书籍，其中以佛经为最多，还刻印文学、法律、医术、日历、卜筮、咒文等书籍。来源还提到，宋朝发明的活字印刷术虽成为印刷史里程碑，却无一件流传下来；西夏文物中保存着与宋朝同时的西夏活字印本，并据此推见西夏活字印刷术在向西方传播过程中起到桥梁作用。\n\n来源没有给刻字司的设立年代、隶属、员额、内部工序、雕版与活字的具体分工，","path":"institutions/kezisi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"刻字司是 D 维度下西夏官府印刷机构的条目，其雕版、活字与书籍版式归 C 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:liangjiang-shifan-xuetang","title":"两江师范学堂（Liangjiang Normal College）","name_en":"Liangjiang Normal College","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清末","南京","张之洞","图画手工科","设计教育"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_school","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"两江师范学堂是清末设于南京的师范学堂，前身为 1902 年张之洞设立的三江师范学堂，1905 年更名。李立新记其 1906 年设图画手工科，采用日本教材并聘日本教习，为首次在中国设立美术与设计学科。赵农记 1905 年该校开设与设计有关的课程，但设计思想仍属“博物”“图画”“手工”等传统知识的范畴，并以此说明清末设计教育的过渡性质。高丰《中国设计史》（2004）补出更具体的设科过程：1906 年，","path":"institutions/liangjiang-shifan-xuetang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下清末设计教育机构的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:lingjinyuan","title":"绫锦院（Brocade and Silk Weaving Office）","name_en":"Brocade and Silk Weaving Office","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["官营纺织","宋代","辽代","金代","元代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绫锦院是宋、辽、金、元四朝都曾设置的官营丝织机构名称。六册来源分别在宋代少府监系统、辽代上京与祖州、金代五处、元代官匠局系统中提到它，建制与隶属各不相同。本 KU 把这些同名机构合并登记，并逐朝标注隶属差异，不假定其制度连续。\n\n田自秉 2010 在辽代染织工艺一节另记：辽代染织工艺也有发展，在上京、祖州等地设有绫锦院；《辽史》载灵、锦、显、霸四州植桑麻，宜州“民工织纴，多技巧”；辽代对外赠与的物","path":"institutions/lingjinyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"绫锦院是 D 维度下宋辽金元四朝官营丝织机构的同名制度，其跨朝代同名异制是制度史比较的样本。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:liubiju","title":"六必居（Liubiju）","name_en":"Liubiju","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["明代","北京","六必居","酱菜","招牌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“商业与民居”一节“市井”段记招牌：招牌是商铺的匾额，常常邀请名流雅士题写店名，将书法艺术和店铺信誉连接在一起，可以获得众人注目的广告效果，甚至成为历史的文化传说。如北京明代“六必居”的酱菜店铺，流传至今。\n\n来源只给店名、地点、时代、经营品类与“流传至今”的连续性，没有给创设年份、创始人、匾额题写者、店址、字号由来、经营规模与沿革；同书未给店面形制或招牌图版。本条目只登记六必居作为明清北京","path":"institutions/liubiju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"六必居是 C 维度下明清商业招牌与老字号店铺的条目，其商业经营归 D；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:longjiang-chuanchang","title":"龙江船厂（Longjiang Shipyard）","name_en":"Longjiang Shipyard","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["明代","南京","龙江船厂","官营造船","郑和宝船"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源记：明代内河漕运和近海航运日益兴旺，促使造船业蓬勃发展；明初官府造船厂兴旺一时，有轮班船木匠 2 万余人，年造船 3,000 余只。主要造船厂有南京龙江船厂、太仓刘家港船厂等。郑和下西洋时，最大的宝船长 150 米、宽 60 米，立 9 桅、挂 12 帆，可载 1,000 余人，船队有大宝船 40—60 艘；龙江船厂曾出土用铁木制作的宝船舵杆，长 11.07 米。来源另记江苏淮南清江船厂、仪征","path":"institutions/longjiang-chuanchang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙江船厂是 B 维度下明代官营造船与船舶设计的机构条目，其官营制度归 D 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:lunchuan-zhaoshangju","title":"轮船招商局（China Merchants Steam Navigation Company）","name_en":"China Merchants Steam Navigation Company","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1872","上海","李鸿章","轮船航运","洋务运动"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"轮船招商局于 1872 年由李鸿章创办，是当时国内最大的轮船航运公司，开机器内河航运之先。","path":"institutions/lunchuan-zhaoshangju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下晚清航运企业的锚点，其船舶与码头形制属于 B 维度、机器技术引入属于 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:lunzhang-zaozhi-ju","title":"纶章造纸局（Lunzhang Paper Mill）","name_en":"Lunzhang Paper Mill","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1891","李鸿章","造纸","引进技术","近代工场"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“纸张”一节记：1891 年李鸿章创建的“纶章造纸局”是中国近代第一家引进国外造纸技术的工场。来源只给创建年份、创建人与“第一家引进国外造纸技术”的定位，没有给地点、创办方式、资本、设备、原料、产品种类、产量、工人与沿革。\n\n既有 `procedures/xiandai-zaozhi-jishu.md` 亦记纶章造纸局，并在 location 字段把地点系于上海；本批来源 L8145 未给地","path":"institutions/lunzhang-zaozhi-ju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"纶章造纸局是 B 维度下近代机器造纸工场的条目，其官商关系与工业制度归 D；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:mumian-tijusi","title":"木棉提举司（Cotton Promotion Office）","name_en":"Cotton Promotion Office","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["元代","木棉提举司","都提举司","棉布","至元二十六年"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在元代棉织一节记：棉织是元代发展的一种新兴染织工艺。元代以前，在我国西北、西南以及岭南地区均有植棉，并有棉织品生产；到了元代，我国北方的陕西一带，南方的江苏、浙江、福建、广东等地，植棉已普遍发展。元代统治者为了获取这一新兴染织工艺的实益，至元二十六年（1289 年），在浙东、江东、江西、湖广、福建等地，设置了木棉提举司，以都提举司总管，每年上缴棉布 10 万匹。\n\n来源同段记这时江南一带的棉","path":"institutions/mumian-tijusi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"木棉提举司是 D 维度下元代棉织管理机构的条目，其棉布生产与纺织工具归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:nanchao-ranshu","title":"南朝染署（Southern Dynasties Dye Office）","name_en":"Southern Dynasties Dye Office","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["南朝","少府","平准令","染署","染织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在南北朝染织工艺一节记：南朝的染织工艺设少府，下有平准令，专门管理染织生产；后因避宋顺帝刘准的讳，将平准令改为染署。来源只给这一句沿革，没有给染署的设置年份、员额、内部作坊分工、产品与隶属层级的变化。\n\n来源在同节下一段另记北朝司染署，属拓跋魏太府，下属京坊、河东、信都三局；本条不把北朝司染署并入南朝染署，也不把南朝染署与隋唐织染署直接等同。三者名称相近，但来源分别系于不同政权与时段，沿革关","path":"institutions/nanchao-ranshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"南朝染署是 D 维度下南朝官营染织管理机构的条目，其染织生产归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:nanjing-yunjin-yanjiusuo","title":"南京市云锦研究所（Nanjing Yunjin Research Institute）","name_en":"Nanjing Yunjin Research Institute","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1957","南京","云锦","工艺美术研究机构","云锦口诀"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"research_institute","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南京市云锦研究所于 1957 年 7 月由江苏省人民政府批准建立，2009 称其为新中国第一家工艺美术研究机构，2016 照录该评价。田自秉另称其为“云锦研究所”，未给正式全名与建立年份，只记南京解放前夕云锦仅剩几架陈旧织机、生产十分衰落，解放后恢复和扩大生产并建立该所，由所总结云锦艺人创作经验、研究整理传统图案、开展创新工作。本条按同一机构合并记录三个来源，并在验证状态保留名实与系年差异。","path":"institutions/nanjing-yunjin-yanjiusuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下云锦研究机构的锚点，其建制过程属于 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:nashishiju","title":"纳失失局（Nasish Bureau）","name_en":"Nasish Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["元代","纳失失","纳石失","织金锦","弘州"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在元代染织工艺一节记：元代的丝织品中，织金最为有名，称为“纳石失”，或称“纳失失”、“纳失思”、“纳克实”等。此名可能是波斯语的讹译，当时波斯也盛产一种称为“纳石失”的金锦。元代在弘州和荨麻林等地都设有纳失失局；弘州即今原阳，荨麻林在今万全西北。据记载，元时曾从外地移入 3,300 多户回族工匠，他们都擅长织造纳失失的制作技术。\n\n来源又据《元史》记元代染织工艺在封建中央和地方设置的专门管理","path":"institutions/nashishiju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"纳失失局是 D 维度下元代官营织金锦机构的条目，其加金织造与金线工艺归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:neiwufu-zaobanchu","title":"内务府造办处（Imperial Household Department Workshops）","name_en":"Imperial Household Department Workshops","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清代","宫廷作坊","家具","珐琅作","乾隆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"内务府造办处是清代管理宫廷手工作坊的机构，下设木作、广木作及玻璃厂、珐琅作、金玉作、镶嵌作、漆作等众多作坊，集中全国挑选的匠师按宫廷要求制作家具与皇家用品。康熙、雍正时期有刘源、海望、年希尧等精通艺术的官员指导并参与家具设计，乾隆更逐件指示式样尺寸，其审美对清式家具的形成影响很大。2016 记其为清代宫廷制造皇家御用品的专门机构，康熙年间成立至 1924 年，先后设 60 多个专业作坊；珐琅彩在北","path":"institutions/neiwufu-zaobanchu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下清代宫廷造物管理机构的锚点，其作坊分工与工艺内容同时属于 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:pingzhunling","title":"平准令（Pingzhunling）","name_en":"Pingzhunling","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["汉代","平准令","练染","染色","官营染织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在汉代印染工艺一节记：汉代丝织的染色工艺，官方设有专管染色的机构；《续汉书·百官志》记载有“平准令”，就是主练染作彩色的。来源与《三辅黄图》所记未央宫暴室并列，二者同为汉代官方染色机构，但来源没有说明平准令的隶属、层级、员额，也没有说明它与暴室的分工。\n\n来源只给“主练染作彩色”一项职掌，未给平准令的其他职能。本条不据官名补入来源未记的平准物价、财政或市场管理内容；也不把汉代平准令与南朝少府","path":"institutions/pingzhunling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"平准令是 D 维度下汉代染练官署的条目，其练染作彩色工艺归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:qiaoergou-taocichang","title":"桥儿沟陶瓷厂（Qiao'ergou Ceramics Factory）","name_en":"Qiao'ergou Ceramics Factory","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["延安","桥儿沟","解放区","陶瓷","石膏模型"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_workshop","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"桥儿沟陶瓷厂是延安桥儿沟设立的陶瓷厂。田自秉记：“延安的桥儿沟设有陶瓷厂。1944 年 5 月 13 日《解放日报》曾报道该厂的‘陶瓷生产的一大特点，则为利用石膏模型，因而可出产各种花样的陶器；且由于窑炉经过改造，温度增高，故质量亦大改进。出品坚固、耐温，式样美观。现该厂所产之陶瓷用品已将近 200 余种，且能制造出细致的白瓷杯、碟，但原料却仍为本地的瓷土。’在党的第七次代表大会开幕期间，代表们使","path":"institutions/qiaoergou-taocichang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"桥儿沟陶瓷厂是 B 维度下延安解放区陶瓷生产的条目，其工厂组织与边区工业政策归 D 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:qin-gongshi-gongguan","title":"秦代工室与工官（Qin Workshops and Craft Officials）","name_en":"Qin Workshops and Craft Officials","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["秦代","官手工业","工室","工官","工师"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“秦汉时期的官手工业制度”知识链接中记：秦代官手工业包括采矿冶铸、铸铜钱、兵器、车辆、用具、漆器、陶器制造等，最重要的手工业是冶铁业；从朝廷到地方各级官府，管理分工相当明确。据秦简载，朝廷有工室，县有工官及附属的手工业机构。汉代官手工业较秦代发达，如长安的官手工业者集中在东西九市等商业区；《汉书》载张安世“夫人自纺绩，家僮七百人，皆有手技作事”。来源总述秦汉官手工业管理十分严格，如产品质量不","path":"institutions/qin-gongshi-gongguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秦代工室与工官是 D 维度下官手工业管理机构的条目，其冶铁、铸铜、漆器、陶器生产归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:qin-han-guan-ying-tao-yao","title":"秦汉官营陶窑（Qin and Han State Pottery Kilns）","name_en":"Qin and Han State Pottery Kilns","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["秦汉","官营陶窑","渭河","砖瓦","建筑材料"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_workshop","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源记秦汉时期渭河一带有官营陶窑成片，以烧制砖瓦等建筑材料为主；如始皇陵夔凤纹大瓦当直径约 40 厘米，形体之大为建筑瓦当中所少见；秦砖有纹饰、质地坚硬，有“铅砖”之美称。西汉中叶后，官营陶窑的烧制开始盛行。汉代官府制陶业主要是烧制建筑材料，供宫殿、官府衙门修造之用；《三国志》记载汉武帝时“杜陵南山下，有成瓦窑数千处”。民间砖瓦生产也十分发达，多用于民居和墓室建造。来源还记画像砖与瓦当生产具有很高","path":"institutions/qin-han-guan-ying-tao-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秦汉官营陶窑是 B 维度下官营建材生产的条目，其官府隶属与产品分配归 D 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:qinggongbu-qinggong-xueyuan","title":"轻工业部属四所轻工学院（Four Light Industry Colleges under the Ministry of Light Industry）","name_en":"Four Light Industry Colleges under the Ministry of Light Industry","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["轻工业部","轻工学院","工业产品设计","市场调研","设计教育"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_school","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在设计教育一节记：无锡轻工学院、大连轻工学院、北京轻工学院、西北轻工学院等院校，虽然和中央工艺美术学院统属轻工部管理，但它们从工业产品设计的角度，注重教学与市场调研；教学方向各有侧重，这使中国艺术设计发展出现了不同的选择。来源只给这一群体判断，没有给四校各自的成立年份、校址、专业设置、课程、师资与招生规模。\n\n本条是一个候选对应四所院校的群体条目，与建阳书坊群的立目方式同例：来源把四校作为一个","path":"institutions/qinggongbu-qinggong-xueyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"轻工业部属四所轻工学院是 D 维度下设计教育制度的院校群条目，其工业产品设计取向归 B；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:qingjiang-chuanchang","title":"清江船厂（Qingjiang Shipyard）","name_en":"Qingjiang Shipyard","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["明代","清江船厂","官营造船","漕船","工匠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新引《漕船志》记：明代清江船厂各类工匠人员总计八千八百七十三人，其中包括船工匠、舱匠、箬篷匠、竹匠、索匠、铁匠、油灰匠等各色行当；人员分别从苏州、淮安、扬州、济南、开封、凤阳等十六府和“军余工办”中征调而来。来源用此例说明传统造物生产的密集型特点：像造船这样大规模的生产，需要拥有大批熟练工匠同时操作才能完成；来源同时指出，许多官营器物制作行业不顾恶劣的工作条件，投入大量人力为政府官僚的奢侈消费","path":"institutions/qingjiang-chuanchang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代官营造船与船舶生产的机构条目，其官营制度与工匠征调归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:qiyi-gongsi","title":"奇异公司（Shanghai GE Lamp Works）","name_en":"Shanghai GE Lamp Works","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1917","上海","美商","灯泡","电光源"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“步履维艰的近代设计”一节先述西方电的发明与电灯的出现：19 世纪下半叶电灯开始传入我国，最早使用电灯的地区是上海租界，清宫也于稍后安装电灯；1882 年英国人李德立氏在上海租界内开办第一家电气公司；1930 年天津成立中外合资电灯公司，稍后北京成立京师华商电灯公司。接着记：1917 年，美商在上海开办奇异公司，这是我国最早的灯泡企业，我国近代的电光源工业开始建立。\n\n来源只给开办年份、美商","path":"institutions/qiyi-gongsi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"奇异公司是 B 维度下近代电光源制造的机构条目，其美商经营归 D、西方电灯技术传入归 E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:quanguo-gaoxiao-gongye-sheji-xuehui","title":"全国高校工业设计学会（National Higher Education Industrial Design Society）","name_en":"National Higher Education Industrial Design Society","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1985","北京","工业设计","高校","学术团体"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_society","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1985 年 3 月 2 日至 6 日，全国高校工业设计学会成立暨第一次全国工业设计教育学术交流会在北京召开。来源把这件事记在 1985 年设计界大事记中；同年条目还记 3 月中旬“书籍装帧艺术十人作品展”、4 月中国展览协会年会、5 月伊夫·圣·洛朗回顾展、7 月《中国美术报》创刊与 11 月全国美协四个艺术委员会成立。\n\n来源只有一句，未给发起院校、会员规模、章程、理事长、理事会、分支机构与会","path":"institutions/quanguo-gaoxiao-gongye-sheji-xuehui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"全国高校工业设计学会是 D 维度下工业设计教育组织化的机构条目，其工业设计观念与学科史归 A 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:sanfuguan","title":"三服官（Three-Season Silk Office）","name_en":"Three-Season Silk Office","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["汉代","官营染织","宫廷服饰","临淄","襄邑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三服官是汉代设置于襄邑、临淄一带的染织生产管理机构，负责采办宫廷服饰所需的丝绸。田自秉引《汉书·贡禹传》记齐三服官“作工各数千人，一岁数费巨万”，说明其规模。两册对“三服”的解释一致：指春、夏、秋三季所用的丝织物所对应的服色。","path":"institutions/sanfuguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下汉代官营染织机构的锚点，其生产规模同时属于 B 维度的织造组织问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:shang-royal-pottery-workshop","title":"商代王室制陶作坊（Shang Royal Pottery Workshop）","name_en":"Shang Royal Pottery Workshop","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["商代","制陶","郑州","王室作坊","陶窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_workshop","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商代制陶业虽没有遍布各地的专业作坊遗址发现，但从王室制陶作坊来看，其内部已有固定分工。来源以郑州商代窑场遗址为规模证据：遗址面积约 1400 平方米，有陶窑 14 座，发现几十万件陶器残片，多系泥质陶的盆、甑、簋、瓮，并出土陶杵、陶拍、陶印模，判断为大规模集体生产的作坊。制陶业除生产一般灰陶、红陶、黑陶外，还生产少量供奴隶主贵族使用的白陶，并出现专门生产随葬明器的分工；长江中下游地区则流行表面拍印","path":"institutions/shang-royal-pottery-workshop.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"商代王室制陶作坊是 D 维度下王室手工业组织与 B 维度陶器生产的交叠条目；当前只到 Dimension，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:shangfang","title":"尚方（Shangfang）","name_en":"Shangfang","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["汉代","少府","尚方令","左尚方","中尚方"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“造纸术”一节记：蔡伦为汉和帝时期尚方令，主要管理皇家工场，负责监制各种器械。来源引《后汉书·宦官传》：“加位尚方令。永元九年，监作秘剑及诸器械，莫不精工坚密，为后世法。”来源以尚方令的职掌说明蔡伦能利用地位和条件研制纸张，并把蔡伦视为器物监制的高级管理人员。\n\n田自秉在汉代铜器工艺一节另记：官方制铜的机构有少府属管的尚方令、考工令；汉武帝时又将尚方令分为左、中、右三官署，中尚方制造鼎壶等器","path":"institutions/shangfang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"尚方是 D 维度下汉代少府属皇家工场的条目，其秘剑、器械、鼎壶与铜镜等制作归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:shanghai-jiqi-zhibuju","title":"上海机器织布局（Shanghai Machine Weaving Mill）","name_en":"Shanghai Machine Weaving Mill","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1878","1890","上海","纺织","机器织布"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“步履维艰的近代设计”一节记：1878 年，由上海几个绅商集股创办了中国第一个近代纺织厂——上海机器织布局，购买英、美两国的机器，并于 1890 年（光绪十六年）开机织布。来源在讨论近代织物设计时又以“1890 年上海机器织布局开机织布”作为中国近代机器织布业的起点，接叙 20 世纪初从欧洲引进机械提花机、1919 年中国机器印花厂在上海创办、1920 年上海印染公司成立。\n\n来源只给创办年","path":"institutions/shanghai-jiqi-zhibuju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"上海机器织布局是 B 维度下近代机器纺织的机构条目，其绅商集股与洋务经营归 D、英美机器引入归 E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:shanghai-meishu-dianying-zhipianchang","title":"上海美术电影制片厂（Shanghai Animation Film Studio）","name_en":"Shanghai Animation Film Studio","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1957","上海","动画","中国动画学派","大闹天宫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"film_studio","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"上海美术电影制片厂于 1957 年建立，拍摄了不少动画影片并在国际电影节上获奖，形成被世界公认的“中国动画学派”。其代表作品包括《大闹天宫》《小蝌蚪找妈妈》《牧笛》等。2016 另记 1978 年底至 1989 年新动画片生产厂家涌现，改变了该厂一枝独秀的局面。","path":"institutions/shanghai-meishu-dianying-zhipianchang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下现代动画生产机构的锚点，其在 1980 年代的产业格局变化亦涉及 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:shanghai-zhuanwa-jumuchang","title":"上海砖瓦锯木厂（Shanghai Brick, Tile and Sawmill）","name_en":"Shanghai Brick, Tile and Sawmill","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1853","上海","租界","建筑材料","砖瓦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“近代室内设计的发展”一节记：西方现代建筑技术和材料传入的同时，推动了我国室内设计的发展；随着通商口岸开放和租界区形成，西方传统的砖石墙承重和木屋架屋盖结构开始在我国出现，至 19 世纪末钢铁、混凝土等新型建筑材料陆续出现。在各类新型建筑技术带动下，我国现代建筑材料制造业开始逐步发展：1853 年，英商在上海租界开设第一家近代大型建材工业——上海砖瓦锯木厂，专为租界内建筑提供建筑材料；此后又","path":"institutions/shanghai-zhuanwa-jumuchang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"上海砖瓦锯木厂是 B 维度下近代建筑材料生产的机构条目，其租界市场与外资经营归 D、E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:shanglin-sanguan","title":"上林三官（Three Offices of Shanglin）","name_en":"Three Offices of Shanglin","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["西汉","汉武帝","上林三官","五铢钱","铸币"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“货币”一节记：汉武帝时大力改革货币，禁止民间铸钱，成立了“上林三官”的铸币机构，而“罢半两钱，行五铢钱”。同段记五铢钱为国家统一铸造，利用铜质钱范浇铸，修整边缘时将钱币串叠、用锉刀统一锉平，使铸钱质量达到较高水平。\n\n来源只给“上林三官”这一总名，没有给三官的具体名称、分工、隶属、员额、铸钱量、钱范制度与流通范围。本条目只登记其为汉武帝货币改革所设的铸币机构，不把“三官”猜作三个具体官署，","path":"institutions/shanglin-sanguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"上林三官是 D 维度下汉武帝货币改革所设铸币机构的条目，其钱范与铸造工艺归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:shangmei-tuananguan","title":"尚美图案馆（Shangmei Pattern Studio）","name_en":"Shangmei Pattern Studio","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1923","上海","陈之佛","图案设计","染织纹样"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_firm","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"尚美图案馆于 1923 年由陈之佛在上海创办，从事工业产品的图案设计，并通过实际工作培养设计人员；仅维持 4 年，但其集体协调的设计形式产生相当反响。2016 称其为陈之佛在上海创办的图案设计机构，主要从事染织纹样设计。","path":"institutions/shangmei-tuananguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下近代设计事务所的锚点，其染织纹样业务属于 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:shangwu-yinshuguan","title":"商务印书馆（The Commercial Press）","name_en":"The Commercial Press","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["上海","1920","广告画家","商业招贴","出版机构"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"publishing_house","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商务印书馆是上海出版机构，对上海广告画家的培养起了很大作用。1920 年招收练习生，有李泳青、杭稚英、金梅生、金雪尘、鲁少飞、戈湘岚、陈在新、张荻寒等人，并聘请德国、日本画家授课，还请吴待秋传授中国画，这些人后来成长为中国早期商业招贴广告设计专家。","path":"institutions/shangwu-yinshuguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下近代商业美术人才培养机构的锚点，其企业办学方式属于 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:shaofujian","title":"少府监（Court of the Imperial Workshops）","name_en":"Court of the Imperial Workshops","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["官营手工业","唐代","宋代","百工","汉代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"7","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"少府监是唐代中央管理官方手工业的专设机构之一，掌“百工技巧之政”，直接负责宫廷与官府日用工业品的制造。汉代少府则是官营手工业的主管机构，属下设尚方、考工室、若庐、东织西织、东园匠等，分别负责制造皇宫所需器物、用具、兵器、纺织品、服饰与陵内器，并设有作坊。唐代少府监的完整职掌见《新唐书·百官志》，除五署外还总诸冶、铸钱、互市等监。其前身可上溯至三国两晋南北朝时期的少府系统，宋代仍沿设，辖绫锦院、染院","path":"institutions/shaofujian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"少府监是 D 维度（制度）下官营手工业管理机构的锚点，其工匠数量与技术训练内容同时属于 B 维度的生产组织问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:shenxin-fangzhi-gongsi","title":"申新纺织公司（Shenxin Textile Company）","name_en":"Shenxin Textile Company","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["民国","纺织","荣宗锦","荣宗铨","商标"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"申新纺织公司是荣宗锦、荣宗铨兄弟开办的当时全国最大的民营纺织企业，注册有“人钟”牌、“四平莲”牌、“宝塔”牌、“龙船”牌等近代名牌棉纱商标。","path":"institutions/shenxin-fangzhi-gongsi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下近代民族纺织企业的锚点，其商标设计属于 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:shibosi","title":"市舶司（Maritime Trade Office）","name_en":"Maritime Trade Office","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["北宋","泉州","市舶司","船政","海外贸易"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“车船”一节记：宋代政府鼓励船舶运输，造船业比较发达，开封、杭州、宁波、泉州、广州、扬州等地有官营造船场；宋太宗年间一年有时可造船“三千二百三十七艘”。泉州是唐朝、五代至宋时期的一个重要对外贸易港口，宋代泉州港“千舟竞发，风樯鳞集”；北宋政府在泉州港设置市舶司，管理船政和贸易。\n\n来源只给市舶司的设置地点与“管理船政和贸易”这一职能，没有给设置年份、隶属、员额、税则、抽解比例、仓储、口岸清单","path":"institutions/shibosi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"市舶司是 D 维度下北宋海外贸易与船政管理机构的条目，其跨海贸易与技术交流归 E 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:shiquge","title":"石渠阁（Shiqu Pavilion）","name_en":"Shiqu Pavilion","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["西汉","长安","石渠阁","藏书","地图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“宫殿”一节记：秦汉时期对地理知识非常重视；秦始皇收集各国地图，以备管理和战争使用；汉王朝有石渠阁所，珍藏了秦王朝留下的大量地图和书籍。\n\n来源只有一句，没有给石渠阁的建置年代、具体位置、隶属官署、员额、藏书目录与管理制度，也没有说明它是否兼有学术讨论功能。本条目只登记其“珍藏秦地图和书籍”的皇家藏书与档案职能，不把后世关于石渠阁会议、石渠阁藏书的叙述并入来源。","path":"institutions/shiquge.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"石渠阁是 D 维度下汉代皇家藏书与档案机构的条目，其地图、书籍的文字与图版形态归 C 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:shosoin","title":"正仓院（Shōsōin）","name_en":"Shōsōin","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["日本奈良","正仓院","东大寺","唐代","中国造物东传"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"museum","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新记：从日本奈良正仓院所藏中国设计物品与唐代佛教艺术品对照，可获知中国造物艺术东传日本的事实；图 2-23 所载阮咸即正仓院藏。该来源把正仓院放在“造物设计的交流与传播”一节，作为中国与外部世界造物交流的实物证据，没有给正仓院的创设年代、建筑、藏品总数与管理沿革。\n\n田自秉 2010 记正仓院藏唐代夹缬山水屏风、夹缬鸟木石屏风、夹缬鹿草木屏风等多种；又藏螺钿花鸟纹镜、螺钿紫檀琵琶、螺钿紫檀阮咸","path":"institutions/shosoin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下海外收藏机构的锚点，其藏品所涉纺织、螺钿、铜镜工艺归 B 维度，中国造物东传与跨文化收藏归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:shujun-chengdu-guanghanjun-gongguan","title":"蜀郡、成都、广汉郡工官（Craft Offices of Shu, Chengdu and Guanghan Commanderies）","name_en":"Craft Offices of Shu, Chengdu and Guanghan Commanderies","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["汉代","工官","蜀郡","成都","广汉郡"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在汉代铜器工艺一节记：官方制铜的机构有少府属管的尚方令、考工令，有蜀郡、成都、广汉郡的工官；其中以蜀郡、广汉所制最为精美。同册在漆器工艺一节又记：《汉书·地理志》载汉代设官管理漆器生产的八郡中，包括广汉郡、蜀郡；蜀郡、成都、广汉的工官每年各用费五百万。两条材料都把这些工官系于汉代，但一处置于制铜机构，一处置于漆器生产管理，来源没有说明同一批工官是否兼营铜器与漆器，也没有给出工官的设置年代、员","path":"institutions/shujun-chengdu-guanghanjun-gongguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蜀郡、成都、广汉郡工官是 D 维度下汉代郡国官手工业机构的条目，其铜器与漆器生产归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:sichuan-jinyuan","title":"四川锦院（Sichuan Brocade Institute）","name_en":"Sichuan Brocade Institute","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["宋代","四川","成都","锦院","蜀锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在宋代染织工艺一节记：宋代丝织的生产由锦院管理。汴梁曾于乾德四年（966 年）将平蜀时所获四川锦工 200 人置于绫锦院，成为这个锦院工艺生产的基本力量，有织机 400 多张，规模较大。本条所记的四川锦院是另一机构，不是汴梁绫锦院；来源在同一段先叙汴梁绫锦院，再叙四川锦院，未说明二者之间的隶属或沿革关系。\n\n在四川，元丰六年（1083 年）建立锦院，募军匠 500 人织造，用挽综工 164、","path":"institutions/sichuan-jinyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"四川锦院是 D 维度下宋代官营织锦机构的条目，其蜀锦品种、织机与用工分工归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:sinongsi","title":"司农司（Directorate of Agriculture）","name_en":"Directorate of Agriculture","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["元代","司农司","劝农官","农桑","农业行政"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“农具”一节“劝农官”段记：元朝政府重视农业生产，《元史·食货志》中有忽必烈“即位之初，首诏天下，国以民为本，民以衣食为本，衣食以农桑为本”的号召，农业成为元代立国的基础。官方设置了“司农司”，各地选派“劝农官”，鼓励开荒，禁止毁田，并且“诏诸路劝课农桑。命中书采农桑事，列为条目。仍令提刑按察司与州县官相风土之所宜，讲究可否，别颁行之”（《元史·世祖本纪》）。来源接着说，忽必烈接受身边汉儒谋","path":"institutions/sinongsi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"司农司是 D 维度下元代劝农与农业行政机构的条目，其推动的农具与农业技术归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:song-dai-huayuan","title":"宋代宫廷画院（Song Imperial Painting Academy）","name_en":"Song Imperial Painting Academy","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["宋代","宫廷画院","院体画","格法","形似"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新记宋代宫廷画院是继五代西蜀、南唐之后设立的宫廷绘画机构，大批画家入院供奉；画家的创作受皇家“赞助”制约，内容上偏重帝王喜爱的名花珍禽，方法上强调古人的“格法”和严遵自然现象的“形似”，形成以工笔花鸟画和界画为代表的“院体画”。来源认为这是画院制度对绘画艺术的贡献，同时指出它在相当程度上影响到文思院、甲库、文绣院、绫锦院等宫中制作工艺物品的机构和作坊的设计生产；《筠清轩秘录》所记绣品受“院体画","path":"institutions/song-dai-huayuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下宫廷绘画机构的锚点，其绘画与装饰风格归 C 维度、对宫中工艺作坊的影响归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:song-dai-ranzhi-guanli-jigou","title":"宋代染织管理机构（Song Dynasty Weaving and Dyeing Administration）","name_en":"Song Dynasty Weaving and Dyeing Administration","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["宋代","染织","文思院","绫锦院","裁造院"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源记：宋代的丝织工艺在唐代基础上又有更大发展；据史料记载，当时专门从事染织的管理机构相当庞大，分工更细，设有文思院、绫锦院、裁造院、文绣院等。此外，在洛阳、真州（今仪征）、定州、青州、益州（今成都）、苏州、杭州、润州（今镇江）、湖州等地，还设置官方派出的机构。民间织造作坊及家庭织造业则有“千室夜机鸣”的盛况。来源另据《宋会要辑稿》记“上供”丝织物北方各路仅占 1/4，江浙占 1/3 以上，丝绵超","path":"institutions/song-dai-ranzhi-guanli-jigou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宋代染织管理机构是 D 维度下宋代官营染织管理网络的合并条目，其丝织、染缬生产归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:southeast-university","title":"东南大学（Southeast University）","name_en":"Southeast University","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1994","东南大学","艺术学系","张道一","艺术学"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"academy","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新记 1994 年 6 月，东南大学在著名学者张道一先生的倡导和组建下，率先设立了我国第一个艺术学系；之后北京大学、浙江大学、厦门大学等一些综合性大学也先后组建了艺术学系和艺术学研究所。来源认为艺术学学科的建立奠定了艺术学在人文学科的地位，标志着我国艺术学研究进入到一个新的阶段，并促使各个艺术分支学科的建立和完善。\n\n李立新在后记中又记：1998 年从苏州大学艺术学院研究生毕业后，经诸葛铠鼓励","path":"institutions/southeast-university.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下艺术学与设计教育机构的锚点，其艺术学学科建制与学术史意义同时属于 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:suzhou-cixiu-yanjiusuo","title":"苏州刺绣研究所（Suzhou Embroidery Research Institute）","name_en":"Suzhou Embroidery Research Institute","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1957","苏州","苏绣","刺绣","双面绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"research_institute","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"苏州刺绣研究所于 1957 年成立。田自秉在“刺绣”节“苏绣”条下记：“苏绣，是我国从业人员最多的一个刺绣品种，解放后得到了极大的发展。1957 年，成立了苏州刺绣研究所，专门从事苏绣的传统技艺的研究和创新工作。欣赏品中的‘猫’和‘金鱼’，是近年来创造的代表作。小猫细毛松软，眼光灼灼传神，艺人根据瞳孔受光不同的色彩，就要选用 20 多种颜色的丝线。双面绣和乱针绣则是发展较快的两种针法。”\n\n来源没","path":"institutions/suzhou-cixiu-yanjiusuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"苏州刺绣研究所是 B 维度下苏绣技艺研究与创新的条目，其机构建制与设计教育职能归 D 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:swedish-museum-of-far-eastern-antiquities","title":"瑞典远东古物博物馆（Swedish Museum of Far Eastern Antiquities）","name_en":"Swedish Museum of Far Eastern Antiquities","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["瑞典","远东古物博物馆","青铜钺","丝织物","提花"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"museum","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新在讨论商代提花技术时记：瑞典远东古物博物馆藏有一把中国青铜钺，钺上的丝织物残痕为平纹底上起菱形花纹的提花织物。来源把它与故宫博物院所藏商代铜戈把、玉女戈上的丝织品痕迹并举，作为提花技术出现的重要实物证据；并据此说明提花技术丰富了丝织品的内容，自商代到春秋战国逐渐发展定型，至汉代成为标准化的提花织物，之后传至国外，对世界纺织技术的发展产生了很大影响。\n\n来源只给馆名、藏品与织物组织，没有给博物","path":"institutions/swedish-museum-of-far-eastern-antiquities.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下海外收藏机构的锚点，其丝织物与提花技术证据归 B 维度、中国造物外传与跨文化收藏归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:taifu-si","title":"太府寺（Taifu Si）","name_en":"Taifu Si","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["隋代","太府寺","工部","官手工业","工匠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源记“隋代官手工业主要由工部下设的太府寺掌管”，并引《隋书》称当时“征天下工匠，纤微之巧，无不毕集”。这是来源对隋代官手工业隶属关系的一句总述。\n\n通行制度史通常把太府寺列为九寺之一，与工部并非直接的上下级；来源“工部下设的太府寺”的表述与此存在张力。本条照录来源原句，并在 `parent_institution` 中标明“来源称‘工部下设’，与通行九寺制度有张力”，不替来源改隶属，也不据通行说","path":"institutions/taifu-si.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"太府寺是 D 维度下隋代官手工业管理机构的条目，其工匠技术训练与生产门类归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:taishiju","title":"太史局（Yuan Astronomical Bureau）","name_en":"Yuan Astronomical Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["元代","太史局","郭守敬","王恂","授时历"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源记：1276 年，忽必烈诏令编制新历法，为此设立专门机构太史局，任命王恂和郭守敬二人为主要负责人；先后参与改历工作的还有张文谦、张易、许衡、杨公懿等人，各尽所能，分工合作，终于在 1280 年编成新历法，即著名的授时历。在 4 年编历过程中，郭守敬共创制设计了简仪、高表等 17 种天文仪器；其中简仪简化了浑仪观测坐标系统，精度高于浑仪，并采用与近代滚珠轴承作用相同的圆柱体轴承。来源据此认为元代","path":"institutions/taishiju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"太史局是 B 维度下元代天文仪器设计与历法编制的机构条目，其设官与朝廷隶属归 D 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:taiwan-youzheng-zongju","title":"台湾邮政总局（Taiwan Postal Administration）","name_en":"Taiwan Postal Administration","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清末","台湾","邮政","邮票","刘铭传"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“钱币”一节“邮票”段记：中国独立开办邮政的第一人是清代台湾巡抚刘铭传。1888 年，刘铭传创办了“台湾邮政总局”，发行了“台湾邮票”和“邮政商票”两种官商形式的邮票。该邮票采取两联形式发售使用，一联用于信封，一联作为存根，这也是最早的商业邮政尝试，为近现代邮政业务的开展积累了经验。\n\n同段前文还记：中国清代的第一张邮票是外国人发行的“大龙邮票”；1858 年《中英南京条约》签订后，英国人赫","path":"institutions/taiwan-youzheng-zongju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"台湾邮政总局是 C 维度下清末邮政与邮票设计的机构条目，其邮政制度与官商经营归 D；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:tianjin-jiqiju","title":"天津机器局（Tianjin Arsenal）","name_en":"Tianjin Arsenal","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1867","天津","洋务运动","军工","机器局"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“总结”记：江南制造总局（1865 年）、金陵机器局（1865 年）、福州船政局（1866 年）、天津机器局（1867 年）、湖北枪炮厂（1891 年）等企业的设立，虽使“洋务运动”有些许起色，但是，官商一体的制度，导致了资本主义进展的缓慢，也阻碍中国现代化的改革。\n\n来源只给局名、设立年份与这一整体评价，没有给局址、创办人、隶属、设备、产品、产量、经费与沿革；也没有说明天津机器局在五局中的","path":"institutions/tianjin-jiqiju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"天津机器局是 D 维度下晚清洋务军工企业的条目，其机器制造技术归 B；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:wangmazi-jiandao-pu","title":"王麻子剪刀铺（Wang Mazi Scissors Shop）","name_en":"Wang Mazi Scissors Shop","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["明清","北京","王麻子","剪刀","招牌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“商业与民居”一节“市井”段两处提到本铺：图 9-15 的图题为“北京王麻子剪刀铺”；正文“招牌”段称“也有的店铺经过长年累月获得良好的商业信誉，如‘王麻子剪刀铺’”。\n\n来源只给店名、地点（据图题）、经营品类（剪刀，据店名）与“长年累月获得良好商业信誉”的概述，没有给创设年代、创始人、店址、招牌形制、产品种类、制作工艺、经营规模与沿革；图版未作视觉核验。本条目只登记王麻子剪刀铺作为明清北京","path":"institutions/wangmazi-jiandao-pu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"王麻子剪刀铺是 C 维度下明清商业招牌与老字号店铺的条目，其剪刀制作工艺归 B、商业经营归 D；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:wensiyuan","title":"文思院（Wensi Yuan）","name_en":"Wensi Yuan","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["唐代","宋代","官营手工业","金银器","42作"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"文思院是唐宋两代均设的官营手工业机构，两册分记不同朝代。田自秉记其为宋代工部所属官营手工业机构，掌金银犀玉工巧及采绘装钿之饰，其中金、银、牙、玉、织、绣等有 42 作；同段又称其为宋代少府监所属机构、染织生产部门之一，院下有 40 多种作，包括绣作、克丝作，42 作中有玉作、犀作、牙作、雕木作、琥珀作等。夏燕靖 2016 记其为唐代宫廷金银作坊，并据银熏炉铭文“咸通十年（869）文思院造”说明其对","path":"institutions/wensiyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下唐宋官营手工业机构的锚点，其金银器与织绣工艺属于 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:wucaixia-xiufang","title":"吴彩霞绣坊（Wucaixia Embroidery Workshop）","name_en":"Wucaixia Embroidery Workshop","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清末","光绪","长沙","司门口","湘绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_workshop","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"吴彩霞绣坊是清光绪年间胡莲仙在长沙司门口开设的刺绣作坊。田自秉记：对湘绣的发展有较大贡献的是胡莲仙和魏氏。胡莲仙是安徽人，随其父居住在江苏吴县，学会刺绣，也善于绘画，后与湖南湘阴人吴健生结婚，回到湖南；光绪年间，她迁居长沙，在司门口开设“吴彩霞绣坊”，湘绣之名逐渐为人们所知悉。魏氏是胡莲仙的朋友，长沙人，和胡莲仙结识以后，共同提高技艺，扩大了湘绣的影响；此外，她还在长沙附近的袁家坪、沙坪、渔湾市、","path":"institutions/wucaixia-xiufang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"吴彩霞绣坊是 D 维度下清末长沙湘绣作坊的条目，其刺绣技艺归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:wuyingdian-xiushuchu","title":"武英殿修书处（Wuyingdian Book Repair Office）","name_en":"Wuyingdian Book Repair Office","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清代","武英殿","内府","出版","官刻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"publishing_house","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“书籍装帧设计”一节记：清代书籍印刷进入又一个高峰期，从中央到地方、从作坊到私家形成庞大的出版印书网络；作为清政府的出版机构，武英殿修书处在康熙、雍正及乾隆三朝就出版了 500 余种书。活字版印刷在清代达到高潮：乾隆年间，武英殿修书处在金简主持下刻制枣木活字大小各一副，共 25.3 万个，用这批活字印成的《武英殿珍版丛书》有 134 种 2389 卷。来源在此处转引潘吉星《中国科学技术史·造","path":"institutions/wuyingdian-xiushuchu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"武英殿修书处是 C 维度下清代内府出版与书籍设计的机构条目，其内府与官刻制度归 D、活字刻制与雕版工艺归 B；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:xi-xia-guan-ying-shou-gong-ye-jigou","title":"西夏官营手工业机构（Western Xia State Handicraft Bureaus）","name_en":"Western Xia State Handicraft Bureaus","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["西夏","官营手工业","制金司","织绢院","铁工院"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源据《天盛律令》记：西夏曾设有制金司、织绢院、铁工院、木工院、纸工院、砖瓦院、造车院等，可见其专业分工相当细致。来源把西夏描述为先后与宋、辽、金形成三足鼎立局势，经历 10 代帝王、为时 190 年，占有广袤而稳定的西北疆域，具有完备的典章制度；并以游牧民族特有的毛毡说明西夏毛织工艺的发达。近年银川贺兰山下的西夏墓葬区出土各种金银器、铜器、石雕、竹雕和陶瓷，反映西夏艺术设计成就。\n\n田自秉 20","path":"institutions/xi-xia-guan-ying-shou-gong-ye-jigou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"西夏官营手工业机构是 D 维度下西夏官手工业组织群的条目，其金、绢、铁、木、纸、砖瓦、车等生产归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:xi-xia-wensiyuan","title":"西夏文思院（Western Xia Wensi Yuan）","name_en":"Western Xia Wensi Yuan","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["西夏","文思院","金银器","玉器","犀角"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“金银器具”一节记：西夏政府设置文思院，专门管理制作金、银、玉、犀等器具。西夏出土的金银器具中有金带饰、金鞍具、鎏金银饰、曲腹银钵、敞口银碗、银盒等；西夏时期，人们已能运用铸造、锻冶、焊接、抛光、切削、钻孔、鎏金等技术手法。\n\n来源只给机构名、职掌概述、出土器类与技术清单，没有给文思院的隶属、员额、内部作坊分工、产品清单、原料来源与管理制度。本条目以“西夏文思院”立目，与唐宋同名文思院区分；","path":"institutions/xi-xia-wensiyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"西夏文思院是 D 维度下西夏官营金银玉器作坊管理机构的条目，其金属与玉器工艺归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:xingwenshu","title":"兴文署（Xingwen Shu）","name_en":"Xingwen Shu","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["元代","官府刻书","雕版印刷","集贤院","秘书监"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"兴文署是元代官方刻书机构，与国子监、文艺监并列，为官府印刷的三大部门之一。三册来源都引同一批文献，但对它的上级归属给出两条互相冲突的记载：《元史·百官志》称其“属集贤院”，《元秘书监志》称其“属秘书监”。本 KU 并存两条引文，不裁定何者为准。","path":"institutions/xingwenshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"兴文署是 D 维度下元代官方出版管理制度的具体机构，其刊刻活动直接决定 C 维度书籍版面与字体的生产条件。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:xiuyuan","title":"绣院（Song Embroidery Institute）","name_en":"Song Embroidery Institute","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["宋代","绣院","刺绣","神针","画绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在宋代刺绣一节记：宋代设有绣院，有绣工 300 余人，制作人物花鸟、山水楼阁；用针纤细巧妙，针法极细密，称为神针。这时的刺绣除作服饰用品外，也和缂丝一样，向欣赏品发展，成为后来的画绣。\n\n来源引《筠清轩秘录》评论宋绣：“宋人之绣，针线细密，用绒止一二丝，用针如发细者为之，设色精妙，光采射目。山水分远近之趣，楼阁得深邃之体，人物具瞻眺生动之情，花鸟极绰约嗚嗚之态。佳者较画更胜，望之三趣悉备，十","path":"institutions/xiuyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"绣院是 D 维度下宋代官营刺绣机构的条目，其针法、题材与画绣转向归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:yanan-bolichang","title":"延安玻璃厂（Yan'an Glass Factory）","name_en":"Yan'an Glass Factory","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1941","延安","陕甘宁边区","玻璃","坩埚"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_workshop","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"延安玻璃厂是 1941 年在延安创建的玻璃厂。田自秉记：“在陕甘宁边区的历史上，陕北没有玻璃生产，然而，这里却蕴藏着丰富的玻璃原料，像关中、金盆湾的石英，桥儿沟的白土，西北的石碱等。1941 年，在延安白手起家，创建了第一个玻璃厂，经过反复试制实践，克服了原料调配和坩埚制作等重重困难，生产制作出第一批玻璃器，有各种杯、瓶、灯罩等日用器皿，因原料中含有少量铁质，器皿微带绿色，显得朴素大方，晶莹清澈。","path":"institutions/yanan-bolichang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"延安玻璃厂是 B 维度下解放区玻璃生产的条目，其工厂组织与边区工业政策归 D 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:yandao-muguan","title":"严道木官（Yandao Timber Office）","name_en":"Yandao Timber Office","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["汉代","严道","木官","木材运输","木器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉在汉代“其他工艺”一节记：汉代的木器制作已相当精良，且分工较细，官方设有专门机构，各司其职。《汉书·地理志》载“严道有木官”，是专事运输木材的官吏，足见规模很大，品种繁多。来源以“严道有木官”一句证明汉代木材采运已有专官，但没有给木官的隶属、员额、设置年代、运输路线与木材品种。\n\n来源的“足见规模很大，品种繁多”是作者由专官设置推及的判断，不是《汉书》原文；本条把这一句标为来源判断，不当作已","path":"institutions/yandao-muguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"严道木官是 D 维度下汉代木材运输专官的条目，其木器制作与材料供应归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:yaping-yishu-zhuangshi-gongsi","title":"亚平艺术装饰公司（Yaping Art Decoration Company）","name_en":"Yaping Art Decoration Company","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["上海","民国","商业美术","广告","装潢"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_firm","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"亚平艺术装饰公司是上海商业美术兴起时期出现的艺术设计企业，业务涵盖中西美术广告、商标盒样招贴图案、彩色封面及黑白画、活动或固定橱窗陈列、制绣及染织物图案、油漆路牌广告、舞台或会场布置、门面或室内装饰、撰编美术书籍、编辑宣传文稿、小工艺及玩具制作、家具设计、代制铜铅锌版等。同段还列有中国商务广告公司、活动广告影片公司、生生美术公司。","path":"institutions/yaping-yishu-zhuangshi-gongsi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下近代商业美术企业的锚点，其业务内容同时覆盖 C 维度的广告与装潢。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:yingmei-yancao-gongsi","title":"英美烟草公司（Yingmei Tobacco Company）","name_en":"Yingmei Tobacco Company","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["20世纪","上海","烟草","广告部","月份牌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"英美烟草公司是五册来源共同提及的近代外资烟草公司，也是中国近代商业广告史中出现频率最高的企业机构。赵农把它的招贴列为 20 世纪早期上海等大城市最引人注目的广告，并记其月份牌与包装；夏燕靖两版记其广告部“规模最大”，聘英、美、日、德画家后改聘中国画家；高丰记胡伯翔在该广告部任设计骨干、张光宇在此从事广告设计 7 年、丁悚亦为设计骨干；李立新把它列为设有“驻厂设计师”的三家烟草公司之一。\n\n五册的材","path":"institutions/yingmei-yancao-gongsi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"英美烟草公司是 C 维度下近代商业广告的机构条目，其外资经营与驻厂设计师制度归 D、E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:yiwensi-tushu-gongsi","title":"伊文思图书公司（Yiwensi Book Company）","name_en":"Yiwensi Book Company","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1926","上海","南京路","霓虹灯广告","打字机"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"伊文思图书公司是上海南京路上的一家图书公司，因 1926 年的一则打字机广告进入中国近代广告设计史。高丰 2004 记：霓虹灯广告 1907 年起源于法国，1926 年传入我国，最早出现在上海南京东路伊文思图书公司的橱窗内，作为“皇家牌”打字机的英文广告。赵农 2009 记：1926 年，上海南京路伊文思图书公司出现了销售打字机的吊灯广告，随后出现了大量的霓虹灯广告。\n\n两册记同一年、同一家公司、","path":"institutions/yiwensi-tushu-gongsi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"伊文思图书公司是 C 维度下近代霓虹灯／橱窗广告的机构条目，其商业经营归 D；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:yuan-dai-huaju","title":"元代画局（Yuan Painting Bureau）","name_en":"Yuan Painting Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["元代","至元十五年","将作院","画局","瓷器设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在讨论元代青花与釉里红时指出：元代文献明确记载了官方专门从事瓷器造型和装饰设计的机构——画局。据《元史·百官志四》，将作院属下的画局“秩从八品，掌描造诸色样制。至元十五年置，大使一员”。画局只设计、不制作，拥有“光画不造”的工匠百余户；将作院属下各局院的产品设计均由画局包揽。来源把这种画局比作现代的国家艺术设计院，把“光画不造”的工匠视为专职设计师：他们按统治者要求专门从事瓷器的造型和装饰设计","path":"institutions/yuan-dai-huaju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"元代画局是 D 维度下官方设计机构的条目，其瓷器造型与装饰设计归 B；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:yuan-dai-yizhan","title":"元代驿站（Yuan Dynasty Postal Relay Stations）","name_en":"Yuan Dynasty Postal Relay Stations","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["元代","驿站","急递铺","驿传","交通"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“车具”一节记：与车马交通工具相关的是元代的驿站，它是元代车马畅通的一个重要条件，官方运输传送的重要枢纽。元代地域辽阔，道路纵横，每隔 70 里设置一个驿站，全国共有驿站 1,500 个左右；驿站之间每隔 10 里到 20 里还有急递铺。这些驿站和急递铺有朝令夕至的便利，在政治、军事、经济、文化等方面起到了积极作用；但因开销耗资过大，元末许多驿站几乎瘫痪。\n\n来源只给驿站网络的间距、总数、急","path":"institutions/yuan-dai-yizhan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"元代驿站是 D 维度下元代驿传网络的条目，其车马与道路设施归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:yunjin-yanjiu-gongzuozu","title":"云锦研究工作组（Yunjin Research Working Group）","name_en":"Yunjin Research Working Group","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1954","南京","云锦","陈之佛","双面锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"research_institute","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"云锦研究工作组于 1954 年 6 月由南京市人民政府文化处组织云锦老艺人张福永、吉干臣和美术工作者成立，由陈之佛教授任组长，是新中国建立初期最早的工艺美术研究机构。工作组搜集整理云锦纹样画稿、培训艺徒，并恢复失传品种“双面锦”“凹凸锦”。","path":"institutions/yunjin-yanjiu-gongzuozu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下云锦工艺研究机构的锚点，其建制方式同时属于 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:yuqichang","title":"御器厂（Imperial Porcelain Factory）","name_en":"Imperial Porcelain Factory","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["明代","清代","景德镇","官窑","青花瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"御器厂是明初设在景德镇珠山的官窑。五册来源都提到它，但承担的功能各不相同：高丰与田自秉把它当成明代官窑的起点，赵农把它当成“不惜工本”的贡品生产组织，夏燕靖两版与田自秉另一处则把它当成唐代越窑“由官府督造”制度的后世归宿。三处年代与性质记载需要分开看：设置年代两册同作“洪武三十五年”，地点仅田自秉给出“珠山”，产品分工仅田自秉给出“钦限／部限”两分。\n\n夏燕靖 2016 另有一段以“官窑”统称明清","path":"institutions/yuqichang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"御器厂是 D 维度下官窑制度的实体机构，其原料、工匠与官搭民烧的调拨方式直接塑造 B 维度明清瓷器的工艺路线。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:zhejiang-shuju","title":"浙江书局（Zhejiang Book Bureau）","name_en":"Zhejiang Book Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["清末","浙江","浙江书局","官书局","二十二子"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"publishing_house","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“清代印刷”官刻段记：清末，许多地方开设官方书局；浙江书局出版了《二十二子》，与金陵书局、湖南思贤书局、成都存古书局等一并，“都对革故鼎新的晚清社会产生了积极影响”。\n\n来源只给书局名、所在省份与代表出版物，没有给设立年份、创办人、隶属、地址、员额、刻工与经费、刊刻书目、印量与流通范围；《二十二子》的编纂者、印行年份、版本与收录子目也未说明。本条目只登记浙江书局作为清末浙江官办书局的本体，不","path":"institutions/zhejiang-shuju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"浙江书局是 C 维度下清末官办书局的条目，其官方出版制度归 D；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:zhiranshu","title":"织染署（Weaving and Dyeing Bureau）","name_en":"Weaving and Dyeing Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["隋代","唐代","少府监","官营纺织","印染"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"织染署是隋唐时期设于少府监下的官营纺织与染练管理机构。田自秉给出它的来源：隋炀帝时少府监下有司染署与司织署，两署合并为织染署。其余四册只在唐代语境中提到它，各自强调一面：高丰把它列为少府监五署之一并注明“负责织造”，赵农引《新唐书·百官志》记其职掌并称其下分 25 个“作”，夏燕靖两版只引《唐六典》的“练染之作有六”。分工细目以田自秉所引《唐六典》最全，四类作数相加正好 25，与赵农的“25 个作","path":"institutions/zhiranshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"织染署是 D 维度下唐代官营手工业分工体系的机构样本，其二十五作的划分直接对应 B 维度织造与练染的工序分化。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:zhongguo-cansi-gongsi","title":"中国蚕丝公司（China Silk Company）","name_en":"China Silk Company","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["抗战胜利后","国民党","中国蚕丝公司","中支蚕丝组织","江浙"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国蚕丝公司是田自秉在叙述抗战胜利后工艺美术生产困境时提到的国民党控制蚕丝垄断企业。来源说：江浙一带的丝绸，在敌伪时期曾为“中支蚕丝组织”所掠夺；抗战胜利后，又为国民党的“中国蚕丝公司”所垄断；而著名的江苏盛泽产丝区已经完全没落。来源把“中支蚕丝组织”与“中国蚕丝公司”放在前后两句，只表示先后两个掠夺、垄断主体，没有说明二者之间是否有接收、继承或人员、资产的延续关系。\n\n来源只用这一句提到该公司，","path":"institutions/zhongguo-cansi-gongsi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国蚕丝公司是 D 维度下抗战胜利后国民党控制蚕丝业的条目；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:zhongguo-fangzhi-jianshe-gongsi","title":"中国纺织建设公司（China Textile Construction Company）","name_en":"China Textile Construction Company","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["抗战胜利后","官僚资本","四大家族","中国纺织建设公司","棉纺织"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国纺织建设公司是田自秉在叙述抗战胜利后工艺美术生产困境时提到的官僚资本纺织垄断企业。来源说：自抗战开始后，敌占区遭受日寇的蹂躏，国民党统治区则民不聊生；抗战胜利后，又由于国民党接收大员的无情搜刮、官僚资本的高度垄断，工艺美术生产几乎已陷入山穷水尽的绝境。来源接着举例：河北高阳、山东潍县原是著名的棉纺织地区，此时已完全停产；江南一些较大的棉纺织业，已为四大家族的“中国纺织建设公司”所垄断。\n\n来源","path":"institutions/zhongguo-fangzhi-jianshe-gongsi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国纺织建设公司是 D 维度下抗战胜利后官僚资本垄断纺织业的条目；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:zhongguo-gongyi-meishu-xuehui","title":"中国工艺美术学会（China Society of Arts and Crafts）","name_en":"China Society of Arts and Crafts","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1979","北京","工艺美术","民间工艺","学术团体"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"professional_society","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国工艺美术学会于 1979 年 8 月 11 日在北京恢复。2009 记其民间工艺美术委员会主办的《民间工艺》杂志于 1985 年 10 月创刊；2016 另记 1980 年派观察员小组出席维也纳第九届世界手工艺大会、1982 年在西安举行传统工艺美术学术讨论会、1988 年与轻工业部工艺美术总公司主办“首届中国陶艺壁饰展”。","path":"institutions/zhongguo-gongyi-meishu-xuehui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下当代工艺美术行业组织的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:zhongguo-gongyi-meishuguan","title":"中国工艺美术馆（China National Arts and Crafts Museum）","name_en":"China National Arts and Crafts Museum","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1989","北京","工艺美术","展览","博物馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"museum","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国工艺美术馆于 1989 年 11 月落成。同月 26 日至 12 月 6 日，“全国工艺美术展览会”在新落成的该馆举行，展出作品 5000 余件（套）。两版记载一致，2016 仅补出“11 月”。","path":"institutions/zhongguo-gongyi-meishuguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下当代工艺美术展示机构的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:zhongguo-meishuguan","title":"中国美术馆（National Art Museum of China）","name_en":"National Art Museum of China","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1962","北京","美术展览","工艺美术","全国美术作品展览会"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"museum","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国美术馆于 1962 年 5 月初建成，开始展出我国近现代美术作品，包括绘画、雕塑、版画、工艺美术、民间艺术品等。同年 5 月 23 日，文化部和全国美协举办的“全国美术作品展览会”在该馆开幕，展出包括工艺美术设计图稿在内的作品 355 件。2016 另记此后年表中大量工艺美术与设计展览均在此举办。","path":"institutions/zhongguo-meishuguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下国家级美术展示机构的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:zhongguo-renmin-yinhang","title":"中国人民银行（People's Bank of China）","name_en":"People's Bank of China","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1948","人民币","货币","防伪","中央银行"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“钱币”一节记：1948 年 12 月中国人民银行首次发行人民币以来，已发行 5 套人民币，以元、角、分为单位，采用十进位制，分铸币和纸币两种形式，按时更新钱币，不断引进国际先进技术，精心设计，采取了许多防伪措施，保证人民币流通正常。来源只给这一句，没有给银行成立经过、行址、隶属、发行准备制度、各套人民币的发行年份与版别、设计者与印制单位。\n\n同段前文记 20 世纪上半叶国民党政府除中央银行","path":"institutions/zhongguo-renmin-yinhang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国人民银行是 D 维度下国家货币发行机构的条目，其纸币与铸币设计归 C；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:zhongguo-yingzao-xueshe","title":"中国营造学社（Society for the Study of Chinese Architecture）","name_en":"Society for the Study of Chinese Architecture","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1925","1930","1946","朱启钤","梁思成"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"research_institute","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“营造学会”段记：北洋政府内务总长朱启钤退休之后，出于对北宋李诫《营造法式》的敬意，以整理建筑古籍文献为己任，于 1925 年开始发起组织了一个传统建筑研究的学术团体“营造学会”，后于 1930 年改名为“中国营造学社”。其中成员有梁思成、刘敦桢等人，发掘保护了许多传统建筑文化遗产，如整理出版了《园冶》《梓人遗制》等图书，并在河北、山西、山东等地进行实地测绘调查。尤其是在抗日战争时期，梁思成","path":"institutions/zhongguo-yingzao-xueshe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国营造学社是 D 维度下近代建筑研究机构的条目，其建筑史方法与古籍整理归 A；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:zhongshang-shu","title":"中尚署（Zhongshang Shu）","name_en":"Zhongshang Shu","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["唐代","中尚署","官作","金银作坊院","金银器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源记唐代金银器制作既有“官作”——中尚署下设的金银作坊院，又有“行作”——民间金银行、金银铺。中尚署由此被登记为唐代官营金银器生产体系中的上级官署，其下辖金银作坊院承担官作生产。\n\n来源只给这一句隶属关系，没有说明中尚署的上级官署、设官、品级、员额、职掌范围、产品种类与产品流向。通行制度史多以中尚署属少府监，但本条来源未明言，故 `parent_institution` 暂记“未详”，不把来源外","path":"institutions/zhongshang-shu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中尚署是 D 维度下唐代官营金银器生产官署的条目，其金银器制作工艺归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:zhongtian-dianjichang","title":"中天电机厂（Zhongtian Electric Motor Factory）","name_en":"Zhongtian Electric Motor Factory","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1932","天津","电话机","民族工业","西门子"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_enterprise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中天电机厂于 1932 年初由实业家周仁斋与王汰甄在天津创办，厂名寓意制造电机设备与西门子产品抗衡。当年 7 月制成两部军用携带机，年底生产我国第一部手摇磁石电话机；后测绘仿制西门子拨号盘，陆续生产 1000 部自动电话机，成为中国电话机工业的领头羊。2016 记其造出我国最早完全自行设计生产的通话机。","path":"institutions/zhongtian-dianjichang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下近代民族机电企业的锚点，其产品设计过程同时属于 B 维度的技术学习问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:zhongyang-gongyi-meishu-kexue-yanjiu-suo","title":"中央工艺美术科学研究所（Central Research Institute of Arts and Crafts Science）","name_en":"Central Research Institute of Arts and Crafts Science","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1956","北京","工艺美术","工艺美术通讯","研究机构"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"research_institute","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中央工艺美术科学研究所于 1956 年 11 月成立，与中央工艺美术学院同月，出版《工艺美术通讯》。","path":"institutions/zhongyang-gongyi-meishu-kexue-yanjiu-suo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下 1950 年代工艺美术研究机构的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:zhongyang-lishi-yuyan-yanjiusuo","title":"中央历史语言研究所（Central Institute of History and Philology）","name_en":"Central Institute of History and Philology","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["傅斯年","中央历史语言研究所","史料学","史料派","上穷碧落下黄泉"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"research_institute","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新在讨论设计史研究“对造物历史整体性把握”的原则时，举傅斯年主持中央历史语言研究所为例：该所倡导“上穷碧落下黄泉，动手动脚找东西”（包括实物和文献），穷尽所能地搜索考辨史料，企图以小见大、以局部见整体，科学地整体地把握中国的历史。来源又引“一分材料出一分货，十分材料出十分货”，称这一取向几乎支配和影响了半个多世纪最有成就的史家治学路向；并记傅斯年“史学便是史料学，史学本是史料学，史学只是史料学","path":"institutions/zhongyang-lishi-yuyan-yanjiusuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下史学方法与研究机构的锚点，其机构建制归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:zhongyang-meishu-xueyuan","title":"中央美术学院（Central Academy of Fine Arts）","name_en":"Central Academy of Fine Arts","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1950","北京","实用美术系","陶瓷","染织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_school","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中央美术学院于 1950 年 4 月 1 日成立，设实用美术系，分为陶瓷、染织和印刷三科。","path":"institutions/zhongyang-meishu-xueyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下新中国设计教育机构的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"institutions:zhongyang-shougongye-guanliju","title":"中央手工业管理局（Central Handicraft Administration）","name_en":"Central Handicraft Administration","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["1954","1961","1965","手工业","工艺美术"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在“社会主义建设时期的工艺美术”一节按时间顺序记中央手工业管理机构的沿革：1954 年 12 月 8 日，中央手工业管理局成立，之后举行第四次全国手工业生产合作会议；1955 年 1 月，在第四次会议结束之际，中华全国手工业合作社联合总社筹备委员会成立；1956 年 3 月 5 日，毛泽东在听取中央手工业管理局和全国手工业合作社联合总社筹备委员会汇报工作时发表谈话，后整理成《加快手工业的社会主","path":"institutions/zhongyang-shougongye-guanliju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中央手工业管理局是 D 维度下新中国手工业与工艺美术行政管理的机构条目，其行业生产归 B、社会主义改造与技术引进归 E；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:zhou-pottery-officials","title":"周代制陶职官（Zhou Pottery Officials）","name_en":"Zhou Pottery Officials","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["西周","制陶","土工","搏埴之工","陶人"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西周制陶手工业有一定发展，产品趋于规格化。来源记其制陶者称“土工”，亦称“搏埴之工”，分为两种：一是陶人，使用陶车制作甗、鬲等炊器；二是旅（fǎng）人，使用模型制作簋、豆等礼器。来源引《考工记》曰“搏埴之工，陶，旅”，并在《考工记》工种细目中把搏埴之工列为陶人、瓿（fǎng）人两个工种，陶人做甗、盆、甑、鬲等陶器，瓿人做簋、豆等陶器。\n\n来源把“土工”“搏埴之工”称为制陶者，又把陶人、旅人列为工","path":"institutions/zhou-pottery-officials.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"周代制陶职官是 D 维度下官府手工业分工的条目，其陶人、旅人的成形方法归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:zhou-ranren-zhangrancao","title":"周代染人与掌染草（Zhou Dyers and Dye-Plant Officers）","name_en":"Zhou Dyers and Dye-Plant Officers","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["周代","周礼","染人","掌染草","印染"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"来源在《诗经》蚕桑、丝织与染色的叙述中引《周礼》，记周代有“染人”和“掌染草”等职业名称，用以表示从事印染和染料生产的人。《周礼·考工记》还记载了缫丝、漂白、晾丝等操作方法。\n\n来源只把二者称为“职业名称”，没有给出员额、隶属、职掌细目与考核方式，也没有说明染人与掌染草是同一官署的正副职还是两个并列工种。本条目把两个候选合并登记，以“周代染人与掌染草”立目，保留“染人”“掌染草”为别名；不把《周礼","path":"institutions/zhou-ranren-zhangrancao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"周代染人与掌染草是 D 维度下周代印染职官与职业的条目，其染色工艺归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:zhujiangying","title":"诸匠营（Craftsmen Battalions）","name_en":"Craftsmen Battalions","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["太平天国","天京","诸匠营","军制","土营"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"诸匠营是太平天国把工艺工人组织起来、按军制编组从事专业生产的机构。田自秉记：太平天国非常尊重工艺工人，注意发挥他们的专长；每到一地就张贴《招贤榜》，招募有特长的工人参加生产，曾在江苏、浙江、安徽、湖北等地招收“各项匠作兄弟”。天京（今南京）的《招贤榜》写道：“江南人才最多，英雄不少，或木匠，或竹匠，或铜铁匠，你有那长，我便用你那长。”杭州并设有招贤馆，提倡自荐。太平天国对工艺美术生产组织进行了极大","path":"institutions/zhujiangying.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"诸匠营是 D 维度下太平天国工艺生产组织的条目，其各营所辖工艺归 B 维度；当前只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"institutions:zhujingju","title":"铸镜局（Mirror Casting Bureau）","name_en":"Mirror Casting Bureau","type":"institution","type_zh":"机构","color":"#8B5CF6","tags":["宋代","南宋","湖州","饶州","铜镜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"government_office","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铸镜局是宋代官办铜镜铸造机构。田自秉记南宋湖州、饶州所设铸镜机构，两地所产铜镜多有柄、素地无纹，镜背一旁有长方形阴刻款式注明铸镜地及名号；因宋时缺铜禁铜、官方严格管理生产，有刻款的才可携带。夏燕靖 2016 记宋代铜镜分官办“铸镜局”所造与民间作坊制作两类，官工镜制作较精巧，民间多素背薄镜。","path":"institutions/zhujingju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下宋代官营铜镜机构的锚点，其镜式与刻款属于 B、C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:anige","title":"阿尼哥（Anige）","name_en":"Anige","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["元代","尼泊尔","妙应寺白塔","喇嘛塔","司天台"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architect","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"阿尼哥是元代入仕元朝廷的尼泊尔工匠、建筑师。赵农记其设计北京妙应寺白塔（至元八年，1271），塔高 53 米，呈宝瓶塔身，是元大都建筑的喇嘛塔样式，并与郭守敬合作设计元大都司天台；夏燕靖 2016 记其为元世祖建万安寺（妙应寺）时设计大圣寿万安寺塔，即今妙应寺白塔，为覆钵式喇嘛塔。","path":"persons/anige.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"阿尼哥是 B 维度下元代藏传佛教建筑与跨文化工匠的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:bi-sheng","title":"毕昇（Bi Sheng）","name_en":"Bi Sheng","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["北宋","活字印刷","印刷设计","庆历"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"毕昇是北宋活字印刷术的发明者。赵农记其于北宋仁宗年间首创活字印刷，技术已接近铅活字印刷；李立新记其在宋仁宗庆历年间（1041—1048）创造活字印刷术，并将其列为中国印刷设计家集群向上追溯的起点。","path":"persons/bi-sheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"毕昇是 C 维度下活字印刷与印刷设计谱系的起点人物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:cao-xueqin","title":"曹雪芹（Cao Xueqin）","name_en":"Cao Xueqin","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清代","废艺斋集稿","南鹞北鸢考工志","风筝","工艺文献"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曹雪芹在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于书末工艺著作词条的《废艺斋集稿》条。原文的表述方式是**双重转述**：先说“传该书是曹雪芹的一部佚著”，再以“据吴先生说”引出八册内容。原文未对真伪表态，但把“在红学界引起轰动”这一反应也一并记下。","path":"persons/cao-xueqin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"曹雪芹在本册只以《废艺斋集稿》的“传说作者”身份出现，全文用“传该书是曹雪芹的一部佚著”限定，并转述吴恩裕 1973 年的发现与真伪争议。这属工艺文献的归属问题，归 A 维度（设计史如何被书写）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:chabi","title":"察必（Chabi）","name_en":"Chabi","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["元代","比甲","比肩","服饰设计","忽必烈皇后"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"察必在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于元代服饰“比肩”一段。原文把她写成一位**有明确设计动因、明确形制方案、明确社会效果**的服饰设计者，并给出《元史·后妃传》的引文与一条后世演变的推断。这是本册中少见的、以女性为主体的设计行为记述。","path":"persons/chabi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"察必是本册唯一被明确记为“设计者”的元代人物：为解决忽必烈骑马征战时的保暖与活动矛盾，改制出有裳无衽、后长于前的无领无袖“比甲”。她锚定 B 维度下“需求驱动的服饰改制”。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:chai-fei","title":"柴扉（Chai Fei）","name_en":"Chai Fei","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["民国","图案教学","染织纹样","上海美专","华丰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"educator","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"柴扉在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于民国时期染织图案与设计教育一节，与陈之佛、李有行同段。原文给出的信息分三层：学历与教职、企业兼职、纹样风格评价。其中教职与企业兼职的并列，是原文对民国图案教育者处境的直接描述。","path":"persons/chai-fei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"柴扉在本册是“图案教授 + 企业纹样设计师”的双重身份样本：既在上海美专任教图案画，又在华丰、永安等纺织企业兼任纹样设计。这一教—产兼任形态是民国设计教育的组织特征，归 D 维度（设计教育）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:chen-mingyuan","title":"陈鸣远（Chen Mingyuan）","name_en":"Chen Mingyuan","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清代","紫砂","宜兴","茶具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陈鸣远是宜兴紫砂名艺人，号壶隐。田自秉把他系于康熙时期，引《阳羡名陶录》说明其声名与文人延揽；夏燕靖 2016 则把他与供寿、时大彬并列为明代制壶名家。两册的时代定位不一致，本 KU 并存。","path":"persons/chen-mingyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陈鸣远是 B 维度下清代宜兴紫砂名家，其“文人学士争相延揽”的记载体现紫砂与文人趣味的结合。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:chen-zhifo","title":"陈之佛（Chen Zhifo）","name_en":"Chen Zhifo","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["近代","图案设计","染织纹样","书籍装帧","设计教育"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陈之佛（1896—1962），号雪翁，浙江余姚浒山（今慈溪）人，六册来源一致列为中国近代艺术设计教育与图案设计的开拓者。六册对他的叙述重心并不一致：高丰以设计教育家兼图案艺术家立传并附书籍装帧成就，赵农以书籍设计开拓者定位，夏燕靖 2016 以染织美术设计家定位，李立新把他放进设计事务所与驻厂设计师的产业脉络并记其 1961 年参与《中国工艺美术通史》编写，田自秉只记其云锦出版物。本 KU 合并登","path":"persons/chen-zhifo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陈之佛在六册中同时出现在书籍装帧（C）、染织纹样与图案（B）、设计教育（D）三条线上。本批按两册明确以书籍设计为中心的叙述归主维度 C，B/D 记为次要维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:confucius","title":"孔子（Confucius）","name_en":"Confucius","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["春秋","儒家","文质彬彬","造物观念"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"孔子（前551—前479），名丘，字仲尼，春秋后期鲁国人，儒家创始人。六册来源均把他作为中国早期造物与审美观念的关键论述者：其“文质彬彬”“绘事后素”“工欲善其事，必先利其器”等言论，被用来解释内容与形式、实用与审美、装饰与礼制之间的关系。","path":"persons/confucius.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"孔子不是工艺生产者，其设计史相关性在造物与器用观念层。暂以 B 为主导航，是因为 A 维度只处理设计史书写与方法，不承载设计思想本身；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize，故层级只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"persons:dayu","title":"大禹（Yu the Great）","name_en":"Yu the Great","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["传说夏代","治水","九鼎","规划"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"other","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大禹是介于神话与真实之间的传说人物，夏起源于禹。赵农称“大禹治水”是中国先民改造自然本质力量的传说，并评价“大禹是中华民族最早的规划设计师”；夏燕靖 2016 另记传说大禹收九牧之金铸九鼎于荆山，象征九州。","path":"persons/dayu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大禹是 D 维度下传说时代治水、规划与九鼎制度的源头人物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:ding-huan","title":"丁缓（Ding Huan）","name_en":"Ding Huan","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["西汉","长安","铜灯","香炉","被中香炉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"丁缓是西汉长安的巧工，三册来源都通过《西京杂记》征引他的四件制作。他在来源中的位置差别很大：高丰把他立为“青铜产品设计家”，是回答“中国古代有没有设计师”的关键例证；赵农把他放在秦汉香炉技术的谱系里，判断其贡献是恢复与延续而非首创；田自秉只把他作为汉代铜灯、铜炉制作精巧的旁证，不作主体叙述。**本 KU 记录的分歧有两处**：一是“七龙五凤”与“九龙五凤”、“常满灯”与“恒满灯”的字句差异；二是赵","path":"persons/ding-huan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"丁缓是 B 维度下汉代铜灯与熏炉的工艺样本，也是高丰“中国古代有没有设计师”这一 A 维度命题的主要例证。三册对他的身份定位不同：设计家、恢复者、巧工。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:ding-pei","title":"丁佩（Ding Pei）","name_en":"Ding Pei","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清代","刺绣","绣谱","苏绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"丁佩是清代道光年间的刺绣艺人、《绣谱》作者。两册来源都以《绣谱》为她的核心贡献：田自秉记其分章与“能、巧、妙、神”的美学原则，夏燕靖 2016 另记成书年代（道光元年，1821）、以绘画书法诗词建筑作比较的方法，以及“齐、光、直、匀、薄、顺、密”的苏绣特点。","path":"persons/ding-pei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"丁佩是 B 维度下清代刺绣工艺理论化的代表人物，其《绣谱》把刺绣经验整理为可传授的章法与品评标准。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:dou-shilun","title":"窦师纶（Dou Shilun）","name_en":"Dou Shilun","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["初唐","丝绸","陵阳公样","益州","图案设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"窦师纶（一作窦师伦）是初唐丝绸图案设计家，封陵阳公，曾任益州大行台检校修造。五册来源都以“陵阳公样”为核心：高丰据张彦远《历代名画记》卷十给出最完整的生平与纹样分析，夏燕靖 2009 记其纹样特征与团窠联珠形式，田自秉、李立新另记对称纹的题材与“个体设计上升为全国样式”的评价，夏燕靖 2016 则在《历代名画记》的引述之后附入太田英藏的日本藏品比对与萨珊波斯影响说。","path":"persons/dou-shilun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"窦师纶是 B 维度下初唐丝绸图案设计的代表性人物，“陵阳公样”把个体设计提升为全国性样式。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:du-jinsheng","title":"都锦生（Du Jinsheng）","name_en":"Du Jinsheng","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["民国","杭州","丝织","织锦","费城博览会"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"industrialist","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"都锦生（1897—1943）是杭州丝织工艺家、企业家。1921 年试织成功丝织西湖名景“九溪十八涧”，成为我国丝织风景的创始产品；次年创办丝织厂批量生产；1926 年其丝织风景参加美国费城国际博览会，获金质奖。","path":"persons/du-jinsheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"都锦生是 B 维度下民国丝织风景工艺与工商化生产的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:duan-fang","title":"端方（Duan Fang）","name_en":"Duan Fang","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清末","南洋劝业会","劝业会","博览会","两江总督"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"端方在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于清末实业与博览会一节。原文把他的欧洲考察经历与南洋劝业会的筹办直接连成因果：先出洋考察，再任两江总督兼南洋通商大臣，再上奏筹办，最后有 1910 年的实际举办与评奖。这条叙述把清末博览会制度的起点系于一次官员出访。","path":"persons/duan-fang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"端方在本册是南洋劝业会的奏办者：赴欧考察归来后任两江总督兼南洋通商大臣，上奏筹办劝业会并促成 1910 年南洋第一次劝业会。劝业会是清末以国家力量组织的展陈与产品评比制度，归 D 维度（商业、制度）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:feng-zikai","title":"丰子恺（Feng Zikai）","name_en":"Feng Zikai","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["民国","书籍装帧","插图","漫画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"丰子恺是民国时期书籍插图与书装设计家，以漫画笔法入书籍插图，形成活泼天真的童趣。赵农把他列为民国书籍插图有代表性的设计者；夏燕靖 2016 另记其采用漫画笔法与富有装饰性的构图，形成独特的书装特色。","path":"persons/feng-zikai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"丰子恺是 C 维度下民国书籍插图与书装设计的代表，连接漫画笔法与书籍装帧。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:gongchun","title":"供春（Gongchun）","name_en":"Gongchun","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["明代","紫砂","宜兴","茶具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"供春是明代正德年间宜兴紫砂制壶名家，原名龚春。田自秉记其出身与学艺经过、作品声价与传世情况，并把他列为时大彬、赵良璧、陈鸣远的师承起点；夏燕靖 2016 只把他与供寿、时大彬、陈鸣远并列为明代制壶名家，且“供春”写作“供寿”。","path":"persons/gongchun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"供春是 B 维度下明代宜兴紫砂壶工艺的早期名家锚点，其身份由书童而匠师的记载兼有工艺史与文人笔记色彩。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:gongshu-pan","title":"公输盘（Gongshu Pan）","name_en":"Gongshu Pan","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["春秋战国","木鹊","云梯","墨子","巧拙之辨"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"公输盘在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现两次，都在墨子条下：一次作为“利于人谓之巧，不利于人谓之拙”的反例（作会飞的木鹊而自以为巧），一次作为墨子止楚攻宋故事中的攻城器械设计者（为楚造云梯）。他一生的工艺成就，在本册里几乎全部以**被评价、被阻止**的方式出现。本条照录这一叙述位置。","path":"persons/gongshu-pan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"公输盘在本册是作为墨子的对照者出现的：他的木鹊被墨子评为“不利于人”的反例，他的云梯被墨子九距而止。他承载的是“巧”的形式标准与被否定的技术伦理，而非其自身的工艺成就。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:gu-jingzhou","title":"顾景舟（Gu Jingzhou）","name_en":"Gu Jingzhou","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["新中国","宜兴紫砂","提璧茶具","高庄","中央工艺美术学院"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"顾景舟在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于社会主义改造时期宜兴紫砂一节。原文在任淦庭、吴云根两位老艺人的叙述之后，用一句话记下他与学院教授的合作及其设计理念。这是本册中少见的“艺人 + 学院”协作设计个案。","path":"persons/gu-jingzhou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"顾景舟在本册是宜兴紫砂与学院合作设计的个案：20 世纪 50 年代与中央工艺美术学院高庄教授合作“提璧茶具”，开创玉文化与紫砂造型融合的理念。对象是器物造型，归 B 维度（造物、工艺与生产技术）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:gu-kai-zhi","title":"顾恺之（Gu Kaizhi）","name_en":"Gu Kaizhi","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["东晋","画家","斫琴图","佛教艺术","设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"artist","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"顾恺之是东晋画家，也被设计史来源记为早年擅长设计者。赵农记相传其作有《斫琴图》，可见南方制作乐器工序的严格；李立新把他与谢赫并列为魏晋南北朝擅长设计的艺术家，并列入当时著名佛教绘画和雕刻艺术家。","path":"persons/gu-kai-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"顾恺之是 B 维度下魏晋艺术与设计互动关系的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:guan-zhong","title":"管仲（Guan Zhong）","name_en":"Guan Zhong","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["春秋","齐国","设计经济","反雕饰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"管仲是春秋齐国政治家、军事家。四册来源把他放在两个不同的论述位置：夏燕靖两版以《管子·立政》“工事无刻镂，女事无文章”说明其反雕饰立场；李立新与夏燕靖 2016 则以《管子·侈靡》说明其赞赏侈靡消费以促进再生产，并称之为最早的设计经济学论述。两条主张方向相反，本 KU 并存，不调和。","path":"persons/guan-zhong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"管仲在来源中同时承载“废弃雕饰”与“侈靡消费”两条相反的经济—造物主张，是 A 维度设计观念讨论中的矛盾案例。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:guo-shoujing","title":"郭守敬（Guo Shoujing）","name_en":"Guo Shoujing","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["元代","天文仪器","简仪","授时历"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scientist","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"郭守敬是元代天文学家、水利专家与仪器设计者，字若思，顺德邢台（今河北邢台）人，1231—1316。四册来源都以简仪和《授时历》为他最重要的成就，并强调他对浑仪坐标系统的简化。","path":"persons/guo-shoujing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"郭守敬是 B 维度下元代天文仪器设计与水利工程的知识元，其简仪的坐标分解是仪器结构简化的典型案例。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:han-fei-zi","title":"韩非子（Han Feizi）","name_en":"Han Feizi","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["战国","法家","造物思想","以文害用","重本抑末"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosopher","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"韩非子是六册全有记载的战国思想家，但在各册中扮演两种不同角色。第一种是他本人的造物观：六册一致以“以文害用”“好质而恶饰”概括，并把他与墨子并置为“先实用后审美”一派。第二种是《韩非子》作为史料：五册分别从《十过》《五蠹》《外储说左上》《说林上》《安危》《外储说右上》《显学》中取证，用来讨论漆器起源、原始衣着、木鸢、豆荚、鲁人织屦、帛书、酒旗幌子与商品交易。两种角色的评价方向相反——作为思想家他被","path":"persons/han-fei-zi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"韩非子在六册中有双重身份：一是造物思想的提出者（A），二是被各册当作先秦造物史料的转引来源（A 之证据方法）。“以文害用”“好质而恶饰”涉及具体的质文关系与器物评价（B）；“重本抑末”涉及农商制度对造物的抑制（D）。本批按六册的共同用法归主维度 A。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:hang-zhiying","title":"杭穉英（Hang Zhiying）","name_en":"Hang Zhiying","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["民国","上海","月份牌","广告设计","穉英画室"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"杭穉英是近代上海月份牌广告设计家，与周慕桥、郑曼陀并称三大盟主。他早年在商务印书馆广告部从事设计，后创办“穉英画室”，与金雪尘、李慕白等合作，以旗袍美女为典型形象，20 世纪 30 年代领导上海工商广告设计潮流。","path":"persons/hang-zhiying.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"杭穉英是 C 维度下民国上海月份牌广告设计的核心人物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:hua-sui","title":"华燧（Hua Sui）","name_en":"Hua Sui","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["明弘治","铜活字","无锡","印刷","宋诸臣奏议"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"华燧在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现于明清印刷工艺一节。原文把他放在活字印刷的技术序列中：先述毕昇泥活字，再及木活字与铜活字，华燧是无锡铜活字的代表，其印本给出一个明确的“最早”定位。","path":"persons/hua-sui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"华燧在本册是明代铜活字印书的代表印书家，其 1490 年《宋诸臣奏议》被称为现存最早的铜活字印本。活字印刷决定书籍的物质形态与版面秩序，归 C 维度（视觉传达与文字设计）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:huang-dacheng","title":"黄大成（Huang Dacheng）","name_en":"Huang Dacheng","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["明代","髹漆","髹饰录","新安","漆艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黄大成是明代新安漆工、《髹饰录》作者。高丰记其字号、籍贯、隆庆年间的漆工身份、剔红技艺与杨明天启五年加注作序的成书经过；田自秉另记《髹饰录》的乾坤两集、十八章结构与“三法”原则，并称其为我国现存唯一的古代漆艺专著。","path":"persons/huang-dacheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"黄大成是 B 维度下明代漆艺由实践走向系统文本的关键人物，其《髹饰录》是现存唯一的古代漆艺专著。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:huang-daopo","title":"黄道婆（Huang Daopo）","name_en":"Huang Daopo","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["宋末元初","棉纺织","松江","技术革新"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黄道婆是宋末元初松江乌泥泾（今上海华泾镇）人，中国棉纺织史上的关键技术人物。她少年流落崖州（今海南），向黎族学习种棉与纺织技术，晚年返乡传授并改良捍、弹、纺、织工具，推动松江成为全国棉纺织业中心。","path":"persons/huang-daopo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"黄道婆是 B 维度下棉纺织技术与织造设计的代表人物；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize，故 primary_theme 与 topic_memberships 留空，属研究债务。"},{"id":"persons:huang-maijiu","title":"黄卖九（Huang Maijiu）","name_en":"Huang Maijiu","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["景德镇","青花","釉里红","青花大王","陶瓷彩绘"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黄卖九在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于清末民初景德镇陶瓷艺人序列。原文先列沈才田、陈柏亭、陈砚卿、罗兰舫、邵云如等人，再单独介绍黄卖九，给出称号、师承起点与笔法评价。他是该序列中唯一被展开描写技法特征的一位。","path":"persons/huang-maijiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"黄卖九在本册是景德镇青花与釉里红彩绘的民间艺人代表，被称“青花大王”。其价值在于说明民间绘画笔法如何进入瓷器装饰，归 B 维度（造物、工艺与生产技术）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:huangdi-legend","title":"黄帝（传说）（Huangdi, the Yellow Emperor）","name_en":"Huangdi","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["传说时代","黄河流域","华夏民族","垂衣裳而天下治"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"other","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黄帝在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现于两处语境，性质不同：L310 是原始社会章节的历史框架叙述，把他作为黄河流域原始部落联盟首领与华夏民族祖先；L533 则把《易·系辞》“黄帝、尧、舜垂衣裳而天下治”读作服饰制度成形的传说标志。两处都以“传说”“相传”限定，本条只记录传说层内容，不作史实认定。","path":"persons/huangdi-legend.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"黄帝在本册承担两个不同的叙事功能：一是原始社会章节的部落联盟首领与华夏民族祖先，二是服饰制度叙事里“垂衣裳而天下治”的传说主体。两者都在传说层，作者均以“传说”“相传”限定。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:ji-cheng","title":"计成（Ji Cheng）","name_en":"Ji Cheng","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["明代","园冶","造园","室内装修","掇山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"计成（字无否，吴江人，1582—？）是五册共同记载的明代造园设计家与理论家，因《园冶》一书立目。五册对他的取材呈三层：高丰给出唯一一段成体系的设计思想分析（含“三分匠，七分主人”的专门解释），赵农给出《园冶》的卷次结构、名句与日本流传，夏燕靖两版只作书目提要，田自秉仅在家具发展原因中以一句带过。李立新一册不提其人其书。来源分歧不在事实而在判断：《园冶》的地位被从“我国古代造园专著”一路抬到“世界上","path":"persons/ji-cheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"计成在五册中首先是造园理论的作者（A），《园冶》的屋宇、装折、掇山、选石诸篇同时是具体的造物与构造技术（B）。本批按五册共同的“理论家＋造园设计家”定位归主维度 A，与同节的文震亨、李渔保持同一处理。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:ji-ganchen","title":"吉干臣（Ji Ganchen）","name_en":"Ji Ganchen","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["新中国","南京云锦","云锦研究工作组","张福永","双面锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"吉干臣在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现两处：图 11-7 的图注（与陈之佛合影），以及 1954 年云锦研究工作组组建的正文。原文把他与张福永并列为“技艺水平较高的云锦老艺人”，是新中国初期云锦抢救工作的技艺侧代表。","path":"persons/ji-ganchen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"吉干臣在本册是南京云锦“云锦研究工作组”两位老艺人之一，参与抢救濒临消亡的云锦工艺并恢复失传品种。对象是织造工艺本身，归 B 维度（造物、工艺与生产技术）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:jianzhen","title":"鉴真（Jianzhen）","name_en":"Jianzhen","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["唐代","扬州","东渡日本","工匠传播","佛教"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"other","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鉴真是唐代高僧，扬州佛教文化中心的重要人物。赵农记其驻锡扬州多年、743 年首次准备东渡日本，前后六次终于抵达；夏燕靖 2016 据《唐大和尚东征传》记其天宝二年（743）第一次东渡时同行有玉作人、雕檀、刻镂等工手 85 人，作为唐代工匠名分与技艺外传的例证。","path":"persons/jianzhen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鉴真是 E 维度下唐代工艺技术跨海传播的枢纽人物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:jin-zhijun","title":"金之俊（Jin Zhijun）","name_en":"Jin Zhijun","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清康熙","十从十不从","易服","服饰制度"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金之俊在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于清代服饰一节。原文给他的身份是“明朝遗臣”，给他的事迹是在清康熙时期向清廷提出“十从十不从”的建议。这条建议的实质是用十条划线把易服政策的适用范围限缩，从而使明代汉制服饰在若干领域保留下来。本条的核心是这十条本身。","path":"persons/jin-zhijun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金之俊在本册是“十从十不从”建议的提出者。该建议不是设计本身，而是决定清代服饰形制边界的一项政策折中：男从女不从等十条划线，使明代汉制在女装、释道、优伶等范围内得以保留。故归 D 维度（制度）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:king-wen-of-zhou","title":"周文王（King Wen of Zhou）","name_en":"King Wen of Zhou","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["商末周初","丰京","丰镐","都城营建"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"周文王在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，是“周代都城镐京和丰镐”知识链接里的一句话：丰京由文王所建、镐京由武王所建，合称丰镐。本条只记录这一归属判断及其所在的双子都城叙述，不追加原文没有的营建细节。","path":"persons/king-wen-of-zhou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"周文王在本册的唯一功能是标记丰京的营建者，由此进入“丰镐—中国最早双子都城”的都城规划叙事。原文只有一句归属判断，无营建过程、形制或规划内容。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:king-wu-of-zhou","title":"周武王（King Wu of Zhou）","name_en":"King Wu of Zhou","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["商末周初","镐京","丰镐","都城营建"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"周武王在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，与周文王同句：丰京为文王所建、镐京为武王所建，两者合称丰镐，为中国古代第一个双子都城。本条只记录这一句及其所在的双子都城叙述，不追加原文没有的克商、分封或营建内容。","path":"persons/king-wu-of-zhou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"周武王在本册的唯一功能是标记镐京的营建者，与周文王所建丰京合为丰镐。原文对他的记载比对文王更薄：只有归属一句。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:king-zhuang-of-chu","title":"楚庄王（King Zhuang of Chu）","name_en":"King Zhuang of Chu","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["春秋","问鼎","九鼎","青铜礼器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"楚庄王在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现两次，都在讲九鼎的政权象征义：一次在“鼎的重要象征性”知识链接，一次在“九鼎八簋”知识链接。两处内容基本相同而人名写法不同——前处作“楚庄王”“王孙满”，后处作“楚庄公”“公孙满”。本条照录两种写法，不裁定何者为正。","path":"persons/king-zhuang-of-chu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"楚庄王在本册两处出现，均因“问鼎”一事：追问周王室九鼎轻重，使“问鼎”成为觊觎政权的代词。他锚定的是青铜礼器的政治象征功能，而非铸造或设计活动。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:laozi","title":"老子（Laozi）","name_en":"Laozi","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["春秋","道家","有无观","造物思想"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosopher","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"老子是春秋时期道家创始人，《道德经》的作者。四册来源都把他作为“有无相生”空间观与“大巧若拙”朴素造物观的源头，夏燕靖两版更直接称其“虚无观”就是设计上的空间观念。","path":"persons/laozi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"老子在来源中是“有无相生”空间观与“大巧若拙”造物观的思想锚点，属 A 维度的设计观念讨论。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:lei-fada","title":"雷发达（Lei Fada）","name_en":"Lei Fada","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清初","样式雷","样式房","紫禁城","圆明园"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architect","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"雷发达是清初工匠，被誉为“样式雷”。夏燕靖两版都记其应募赴北京修建紫禁城，从工匠升至工部样式负责人，康熙授予工部营造所长班，参与三大殿尤其是太和殿的修建，后调任圆明园楠木样式房掌案、担任工程总设计师，晚年著有《工部工程作法则例》《工程营造录》。","path":"persons/lei-fada.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"雷发达是 B 维度下清代样式房制度与皇家建筑设计谱系的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:lei-guiyuan","title":"雷圭元（Lei Guiyuan）","name_en":"Lei Guiyuan","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["20世纪","工艺美术教育","中央工艺美术学院","图案"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"雷圭元是 20 世纪工艺美术教育家、中央工艺美术学院副院长。高丰把他列为中国近代艺术设计教育的重要开拓者之一；夏燕靖 2016 记其为近现代设计教育奠基人之一、中央工艺美术学院副院长，并记 1992 年召开“雷圭元先生学术研讨会”纪念其逝世 3 周年。","path":"persons/lei-guiyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"雷圭元是 D 维度下新中国工艺美术教育制度与中央工艺美术学院建院谱系的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:leizu","title":"嫘祖（Leizu）","name_en":"Leizu","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["传说时代","养蚕缫丝","良渚文化","丝绸起源"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"other","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"嫘祖在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于良渚文化知识链接的末段，与“良渚文化期有大量丝织物出现”并置。原文对她的表述是**双重限定的**：既称“历来传说”，又称“是否属实无从稽考”，只把良渚丝织物当作旁证而非证明。本条按低置信度处理，不把传说当作工艺史事实。","path":"persons/leizu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"嫘祖在本册只作为养蚕缫丝起源的传说人物出现在良渚文化的知识链接里，作者已明言“是否属实无从稽考”。她锚定 B 维度丝绸工艺的传说起源端，不承担实证功能。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:li-cheng","title":"李诚（Li Cheng）","name_en":"Li Cheng","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["北宋","营造法式","建筑","模数制"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architect","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李诚（通行作李诫）是北宋建筑师，《营造法式》的编撰者。赵农记其书由宋哲宗时编著、宋徽宗时刊行，是官方建筑工程的专用书；夏燕靖 2016 记其收集汴京实际工程做法、与工匠详细研究后编成，并详列全书四部分。","path":"persons/li-cheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"李诚是 B 维度下宋代官方建筑规范与模数制度的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:li-chun","title":"李春（Li Chun）","name_en":"Li Chun","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["隋代","桥梁","石拱桥","赵州桥","敞肩拱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李春是六册中只见于隋代桥梁一条线的工匠，三册（夏燕靖 2009、赵农、夏燕靖 2016）提到他，高丰、田自秉、李立新三册完全不提，连赵州桥也不提。三册对其人的记载全部回溯到同一句唐代铭文，此外不载生卒、籍贯、师承与其他作品。本 KU 因此分为两层：一层是李春本人的可考信息（极薄），一层是赵州桥的技术叙述（三册均详，但取舍与数据不同）。来源分歧集中在建桥年代（595—605 年区间／605 年）、规","path":"persons/li-chun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"李春是 B 维度下隋代桥梁营造的条目；同时是 A 维度下“单条唐代铭文能否支撑一个人物条目”的证据样本——三册所记其人的全部信息都来自同一句唐铭。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:li-gao","title":"李皋（Li Gao）","name_en":"Li Gao","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["唐德宗","洪州观察使","车轮战舰","造船"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李皋在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于隋唐造船业一节，是本册少数被明确记入“技术首创”的唐代官员。原文给他的身份是洪州观察使，给他的成就是“挟两轮踏之”的车轮战舰，并附《册府元龟》《旧唐书》两条出处——这是本册造船段落中引用最具体的一条。","path":"persons/li-gao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"李皋在本册是唐代造船一节的技术转折点：车轮战舰以人力踏轮代替帆桨，被作者称为史籍记载最早的军用轮船。他的价值在技术方案，而非官职。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:li-hongzhang","title":"李鸿章（Li Hongzhang）","name_en":"Li Hongzhang","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清末","洋务运动","江南制造总局","轮船招商局","北洋海军"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李鸿章（1823—1901）是清末洋务派主将与官员。赵农记其 1891 年创建纶章造纸局，是中国近代第一家引进国外造纸技术的工场；夏燕靖 2016 记其 1862 年办上海洋炮局、1865 年办江南制造总局、1872 年办轮船招商局、1875—1888 年筹建北洋海军。","path":"persons/li-hongzhang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"李鸿章是 D 维度下洋务运动与近代工业、航运、海军制度建立的核心人物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:li-madou","title":"利玛窦（Matteo Ricci）","name_en":"Matteo Ricci","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["明代","传教士","自鸣钟","西学东渐","跨文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"利玛窦是明末来华的天主教传教士。赵农记其与同侪带来望远镜、自鸣钟、世界地图等，传入科学知识；李立新记其 1601 年向万历皇帝进献自鸣钟等欧洲新式物品，作为早期传教士携带西方奇器来华的例证。","path":"persons/li-madou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"利玛窦是 E 维度下明清中西器物与技术交流的早期节点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:li-xiannian","title":"李先念（Li Xiannian）","name_en":"Li Xiannian","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["新中国","工艺美术","日用工业品座谈会","出口生产","文化大革命"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李先念在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于“文革”期间工艺美术政策一节。原文引用他在 1971 年 7 月全国日用工业品座谈会上的讲话原文，并转述他驳斥“为资产阶级服务”“崇洋媚外”两种指责的言论。这是本册中唯一以较长直接引语记录的国家领导人工艺美术表态。","path":"persons/li-xiannian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"李先念在本册是 1971 年工艺美术出口生产恢复的政策推动者：以国务院副总理身份在全国日用工业品座谈会上定调，并主持纠正“为资产阶级服务”论。这是文化政策与产业政策的转折点，归 D 维度（商业、制度）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:li-youxing","title":"李有行（Li Youxing）","name_en":"Li Youxing","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["近代","染织图案","限色","设计教育"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李有行（1905—1982）是近代染织图案设计师与艺术设计教育家。早年毕业于国立北平艺专，后赴法国里昂美专留学；回国后任上海美亚丝绸厂图案设计室主任八年，其“限色”写生与变化方法为国内设计界首创。","path":"persons/li-youxing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"李有行是 C 维度下近代染织图案设计与“限色”教学法的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:li-yu","title":"李渔（Li Yu）","name_en":"Li Yu","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清初","闲情偶寄","室内设计","家具设计","造园"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李渔（1610—1680，字笠鸿、谪凡，号笠翁，浙江兰溪人）是四册共同记载的清初文人设计师与设计理论家，核心文本为 1671 年成书的《闲情偶寄》。四册对他的用法分三层：高丰给出唯一一段系统的设计思想分析（含暖椅、凉机的设计个案），赵农把他列入“一流的设计家”名单并从“机”“趣”读其器物观，夏燕靖两版只在工艺著作与版本提要中著录《闲情偶寄》。田自秉、李立新两册完全不提其人其书。来源分歧集中在三处：","path":"persons/li-yu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"李渔在四册中首先是“文人设计师”与设计理论家（A），其《闲情偶寄》的居室、器玩两部又是家具与室内器物的具体设计论述（B）；高丰另把他列为影响明式、清式家具形成的设计者之一，涉及造物谱系（D 之设计者身份）。本批按四册共同的“理论家＋实践者”定位归主维度 A。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:liang-sicheng","title":"梁思成（Liang Sicheng）","name_en":"Liang Sicheng","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["20世纪","建筑学","清华学派","国徽","中国建筑史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architect","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"梁思成是 20 世纪中国建筑学家、清华大学营建系主任、国徽设计组组长。赵农记其以“清华学派”重视古代建筑整理研究、强调现代建筑中的民族特色；夏燕靖 2016 记其主持清华国徽设计组，并于 1961 年发表《建筑和建筑艺术》，主张装饰应从建筑物功能和结构两方面考虑。","path":"persons/liang-sicheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"梁思成是 B 维度下近代至新中国建筑思想、建筑史研究与国徽设计的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:liu-zhiji","title":"刘知幾（Liu Zhiji）","name_en":"Liu Zhiji","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["唐代","史学方法","史识","再版序言"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"刘知幾在夏燕靖 2016 册中仅出现一次，位置是作者自撰的《再版序言》，用以论证设计史课程为何要“以修史见识的方式”揭示设计形态与观念。原文只给其朝代、身份与一句学说要旨，**没有任何生平、著作名或设计相关活动**，因此本条是低置信度的史学方法锚点，不能当作完整人物小传使用。","path":"persons/liu-zhiji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"刘知幾在本册只作为再版序言的史学方法论引证出现，用于说明“史识”对设计史书写的必要。他不进入造物谱系，只锚定 A 维度的修史立场。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:liu-zhou","title":"刘昼（Liu Zhou）","name_en":"Liu Zhou","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["北朝","北齐","刘子","施用有宜","设计思想"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosopher","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"刘昼是北朝／北齐文学家与设计思想论述者，所著《刘子》（又名《刘子新论》）直接讨论产品实用与审美的关系。他认为美丑相对，衡量标准在“施用有宜”，并以裘与蓑的比较说明适用高于材质贵贱与外表华美。","path":"persons/liu-zhou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"刘昼是 A 维度下魏晋南北朝设计思想“施用有宜”命题的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:liu-zongyuan","title":"柳宗元（Liu Zongyuan）","name_en":"Liu Zongyuan","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["唐代","梓人传","总体设计原则","营造","唐宋八大家"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"柳宗元在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现于三处：《唐代设计理论述要》一节的小说部分（L3020）、《梓人传》词条的标题（L3024）、以及书末《梓人传》词条的正文（L6193）。三处共同构成一条完整的“文本—释义”链：作者先以《梓人传》立论，再在词条中给出篇目说明。本条据此定位。","path":"persons/liu-zongyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"柳宗元在本书中因《梓人传》成为唐代设计理论的代表文本作者：杨氏都料匠的营造故事被用来阐明总体设计原则。他的设计史意义完全依附于这一篇，而非其文学或政治活动。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:lu-xun","title":"鲁迅（Lu Xun）","name_en":"Lu Xun","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["近代","书籍装帧","版式设计","新文化运动"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鲁迅是中国近代书籍装帧的开拓者与实践者。四册来源都不把他当作一般文学家处理，而是聚焦他在封面、题字、插图与版式上的具体设计工作，以及他对陶元庆、孙福熙等装帧设计家的提携。","path":"persons/lu-xun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鲁迅是 C 维度下近代书籍装帧与版式变革的实践锚点，其“中西融合”主张也涉及 E 维度的跨文化互动。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:lu-yanzhi","title":"吕彦直（Lu Yanzhi）","name_en":"Lu Yanzhi","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["民国","中山陵","中山纪念堂","建筑师","中国固有式"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architect","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"吕彦直是民国建筑师，1927 年中山陵建筑设计竞图首奖获得者，1929 年主持设计南京紫金山中山陵，同年完成广州中山纪念堂设计。中山陵以中国传统建筑风格为主线，吸收现代建筑手法，平面作钟形，被评“木铎警世”。","path":"persons/lu-yanzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"吕彦直是 B 维度下近代“中国固有式”建筑的代表，连接传统陵墓形制与现代建筑技术。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:lu-yu","title":"陆羽（Lu Yu）","name_en":"Lu Yu","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["唐代","茶经","茶器","饮茶用具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陆羽在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现于“陆羽《茶经》”知识链接，是本册少数给出完整字号、籍贯与著作结构的唐代人物之一。本条的核心不是茶文化，而是《茶经》“四之器”一节所记的 24 种饮茶用具——一份成体系的唐代器物清单。","path":"persons/lu-yu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陆羽在本册以《茶经》作者、“我国茶道奠基人”身份出现，其设计史意义集中在《茶经》‘四之器’所列 24 种饮茶用具——这是本册唐代器物叙述中最系统的一份器具清单。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:ma-jun","title":"马钧（Ma Jun）","name_en":"Ma Jun","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["三国","机械设计","提花绫机","翻车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"马钧是三国魏机械设计家，字德衡，扶风（今陕西兴平）人，有“巧思绝世”之誉。四册来源都以提花绫机的简化改造和“翻车”为他的核心成就，兼及指南车、连弩与发石车的改进。","path":"persons/ma-jun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"马钧是 B 维度下三国机械改良与织机结构简化的匠人锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:mao-jin","title":"毛晋（Mao Jin）","name_en":"Mao Jin","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["明代","汲古阁","刻书","毛边纸","毛抄"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"other","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"毛晋是四册中唯一以私人刻书业立目的明代人物，经营常熟汲古阁。四册各记一面：夏燕靖两版记其雇工规模、刻书种数、书板数量与外销纸张，并把它作为“文人刻书商业化”的实例；赵农单独立目，补出校刻书目、影抄宋本（毛抄）与刻版块数；李立新只在刻书机构名单中一笔带过，但给出了“出版家／刻工”的分辨框架。四册都不记生卒年，年代只有“明代后期”与“崇祯年间”两种定位。分歧集中在刻书持续年数（三十年／四十余年）、书板","path":"persons/mao-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"毛晋在四册中处于印刷与书籍生产（C）的主线上；夏燕靖两版明说“文人刻书也开始商业化”，把汲古阁作为出版经营（D）的样本；李立新则把汲古阁放在“书坊、私宅刻书”的刻工组织（B 之技艺与生产）叙述中。本批按四册共同的对象（刻书）归主维度 C。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:mao-zedong","title":"毛泽东（Mao Zedong）","name_en":"Mao Zedong","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["新中国","国徽","国旗","第一汽车制造厂","论十大关系"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"毛泽东在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现十一处，横跨 1949 至 1956 年。原文的记述分三类：**国家视觉标识的确认**（国旗、国徽）、**产业与文艺方向的定调**（论十大关系、手工业改造、百花齐放）、**具体工业项目的题词与到场**（一汽）。另有一处是他本人成为设计对象的记录（毛主席像章）。本条按此三类聚合，全部照录原文，不作整体评价。","path":"persons/mao-zedong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"毛泽东在本册以国家领导人身份出现在新中国设计的多个制度节点：国旗方案的取舍、国徽的公布、重工业与轻工业比例的定调、一汽的题词与命名、手工业改造的谈话、文艺方针的题词。这些是国家层面的方向设定，归 D 维度（商业、制度）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:mengzi","title":"孟子（Mencius）","name_en":"Mencius","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["战国","儒家","民本","与民同乐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosopher","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"孟子是战国儒家代表人物，名轲，字子舆。四册来源都把他作为“与民同乐”民本思想的设计转译者：由“民为贵，社稷次之，君为轻”推出一切事物（包括设计）应以民为本。夏燕靖两版同时指出，这一主张在封建社会里只是幻想。","path":"persons/mengzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"孟子在来源中是“与民同乐”“民为贵”民本观的设计转译者，属 A 维度的设计观念讨论。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:mozi","title":"墨子（Mozi）","name_en":"Mozi","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["先秦","墨家","造物思想","功能主义"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosopher","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"墨子名翟，春秋战国之际的工匠、学者与墨家创始人。六册来源都把他作为“先质而后文”“先实用后审美”设计观的代表，同时强调他本人精于机械制作、直接参与设计与手工劳动。夏燕靖 2009 另记“节用、节葬、非乐”三主张与“器完而不饰”“质真而素朴”的评判标准；赵农另记其推崇夏禹、墨家组织原则与《墨子》现存篇数。","path":"persons/mozi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"墨子作为先秦造物思想与工艺实践的代表进入 B 维度；其“利人乎即为”的功利判断也涉及设计评价标准问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:nie-chongyi","title":"聂崇义（Nie Chongyi）","name_en":"Nie Chongyi","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["宋代","三礼图","十二章纹","冕服"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"聂崇义在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于“纹饰十二章”知识链接，是作者解释十二章纹象征时有宋一代的引证来源：其《三礼图》中的“衮冕条”与“毳冕条”逐一说明日、月、星辰、龙、山、火、宗彝、藻、粉米、黼、黻等纹样的取义。本条只记录这一文献功能，不推断他的生平或绘图实践。","path":"persons/nie-chongyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"聂崇义在本册只以《三礼图》撰者身份出现，其“衮冕条”“毳冕条”是十二章纹象征意义的宋代释义来源。他的功能是纹样释义文献的作者，不是纹样的设计者。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:nuwa","title":"女娲（Nuwa）","name_en":"Nuwa","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["上古传说","中华民族始祖","母系社会","抟土造人","炼石补天"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"other","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"女娲是中国上古传说中的女性始祖，与伏羲并称中华民族始祖。赵农记其抟土造人、赋予人以生命，并熔炼五彩石补好天上的窟窿；传说包含着对母性的心理崇敬，缘于漫长母系社会形成的文化影响。同书另记传说女娲是竹笛和笙的创造者，引唐人王毂《吹笙引》“娲皇遗音寄玉笙，双成传得何凄清”。山东嘉祥汉画像石有女娲、伏羲蛇尾盘缠的形象，女娲持规为圆。","path":"persons/nuwa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"女娲是 B 维度下上古造物传说的人物条目：抟土造人、炼石补天与笙的创造都在此汇合。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:pang-xunqin","title":"庞薰琹（Pang Xunqin）","name_en":"Pang Xunqin","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["近现代","工艺美术教育","中央工艺美术学院","决澜社","工商美术"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"庞薰琹是六册中除陈之佛外被记述最详的近现代设计人物，六册全部有字面命中。他同时出现在四个位置上：1930 年代上海工商美术的实践者、1940 年代工艺美术教育的课程建设者、1950 年代中央工艺美术学院的筹建者与副院长、以及 1957 年被斗争的政治受难者。**本条最需要注意的是字形问题**：六册对他的姓名共出现 8 种不同字形（栞、琴、栗、琍、某、渠、桀、杲），无一处写作规范字“琹”；本 KU ","path":"persons/pang-xunqin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"庞薰琹是 D 维度下中国近代设计教育制度化的枢纽人物：从 1930 年代的工商美术事务所与课程，到 1950 年代中央工艺美术学院的筹建，再到 1957 年被定为“反党集团”首脑，制度线索完整。同时以 C 维度（装饰艺术与书籍装帧）与 B 维度（工艺美术研究组织）为副。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:pu-yuan","title":"蒲元（Pu Yuan）","name_en":"Pu Yuan","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["三国蜀汉","独轮车","木牛流马","鸡公车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蒲元是三国蜀汉工匠与车辆设计者。夏燕靖两版都记其为解决山道运粮困难发明独轮车，“廉仰双辕，人行六尺，牛行四步，人载一岁粮之也”，即所谓“木牛流马”；2016 同时指出汉魏时期已盛行独轮车，有的地方称“鸡公车”，早于欧洲千余年。","path":"persons/pu-yuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蒲元是 B 维度下三国车辆设计与独轮车谱系的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:qian-junfou","title":"钱君匋（Qian Junfou）","name_en":"Qian Junfou","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["民国","书籍装帧","钱封面","敦煌","汉代石刻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"钱君匋在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现两处：青年书装家群名单（L5017）与个人专段（L5032）。个人专段给出取材范围、封面手法、行业誉称、鲁迅评语四项，是本册民国书装段落中评价层级最高的一位。","path":"persons/qian-junfou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"钱君匋在本册是民国书装“民族艺术风格 + 古代纹样取材 + 传统书法题字”一支的代表，有“钱封面”之誉，鲁迅称其可与陶元庆媲美。书籍装帧归 C 维度（视觉传达与文字设计）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:rong-hong","title":"容闳（Rong Hong）","name_en":"Rong Hong","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清末","洋务运动","幼童留美","机器采买","江南机器制造总局"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"容闳在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现两次，都在曾国藩洋务“5 件实事”的清单内：第二件的主事者、第五件的建议者。原文没有为他立传，而是把他作为两项具体事务的执行人与提议人提及。理解本条的关键是**句子的主语是曾国藩，不是容闳**。","path":"persons/rong-hong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"容闳在本册以两项具体事务出现：1863 年赴美采买“制造机器”的机器（我国直接向西方购进的第一批工业机器）、建议选派幼童出国留学。二者都是洋务的**制度与人才通道**，归 D 维度（制度）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:shang-tang","title":"商汤（Shang Tang）","name_en":"Shang Tang","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["商代","王朝建立","青铜","矿产资源"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商汤（又称成汤）是商王朝建立者。赵农记约公元前 1711 年商汤在河南封丘一带击溃夏、建立商王朝，并称商朝对铜的充分认识是中国艺术设计史上的盛事；夏燕靖 2016 记约前 1600 年夏桀暴虐、成汤革夏立商。","path":"persons/shang-tang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"商汤是 D 维度下商王朝建立与青铜资源开发的制度背景人物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:shen-jinshui","title":"沈金水（Shen Jinshui）","name_en":"Shen Jinshui","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["1882-1967","苏州","缂丝","刻丝","民国"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"沈金水在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于民国丝织工艺一节。原文只给出生卒年与“著名的缂丝艺人”这一评价，未展开其作品与技法；他所在的句子承担的是**为苏州缂丝产品结构变化提供人物例证**的功能。","path":"persons/shen-jinshui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"沈金水在本册只作为苏州缂丝名匠被列名，与王茂仙并列，是“1911 年后苏州缂丝转向挂屏、被面、台毯、靠背与名画卷册引首”这一产品结构变化的代表人物。归 B 维度（造物、工艺与生产技术）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:shen-kuo","title":"沈括（Shen Kuo）","name_en":"Shen Kuo","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["北宋","梦溪笔谈","铜镜","科学技术"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scientist","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"沈括是北宋科学家、《梦溪笔谈》的作者。赵农称《梦溪笔谈》为百科全书，共 609 条，记载了许多艺术设计史史料；田自秉引其论铸鉴文字，说明铜镜镜面凸凹与照人面大小的关系。","path":"persons/shen-kuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"沈括是 B 维度下宋代科学著作记录工艺知识的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:shen-shou","title":"沈寿（Shen Shou）","name_en":"Shen Shou","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清末民初","刺绣","苏绣","雪宦绣谱","刺绣教育"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"artist","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"沈寿（1874—1921，字雪君，后改号雪宦，江苏吴县人）是四册共同记载的清末民初刺绣家与刺绣教育家，也是六册中唯一有国际获奖记录、有教育机构、有理论著作三类事迹同时齐备的工艺人物。高丰给出唯一一段完整小传并把她与张謇并列为近代织绣两位人物；夏燕靖两版只通过《雪宦绣谱》的版本提要写她，不作生平；田自秉一册在清代刺绣著作的脉络里提她，却不提张謇之名。来源分歧集中在两处：谁记录了《雪宦绣谱》（张謇／“","path":"persons/shen-shou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"沈寿的主体成就在刺绣工艺与绣稿设计（B）；高丰同时把她作为近代刺绣教育制度的创办者（D）叙述，并以她与张謇并列支撑“近代织绣两位人物”的判断（A 之史学分期）。本批按四册共同的工艺—教育双重身份归主维度 B。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:shen-zifan","title":"沈子蕃（Shen Zifan）","name_en":"Shen Zifan","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["南宋","缂丝","织绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"沈子蕃是南宋缂丝名手。田自秉把他与朱克柔、吴煦并列为南宋云间缂丝名家，称《梅鹊图》精美；李立新另记其《花鸟图》藏故宫博物院，并把他作为缂丝“直接将绘画引入设计”的代表。","path":"persons/shen-zifan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"沈子蕃是 B 维度下南宋缂丝名家，与朱克柔同属缂丝摹缂书画、走向观赏化的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:shi-dabin","title":"时大彬（Shi Dabin）","name_en":"Shi Dabin","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["明代","紫砂","宜兴","茶具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"时大彬是明代宜兴紫砂制壶名家，时朋之子、供春弟子。田自秉称他为明代紫砂名手中“成就最高”者，并记其泥料处理与形制风格；夏燕靖 2016 只把他列入明代制壶名家序列，未展开个体事迹。","path":"persons/shi-dabin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"时大彬是 B 维度下明代宜兴紫砂工艺成熟期的代表匠师，其泥料处理与形制风格可作为紫砂工艺史的具体标本。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:shun-legend","title":"舜（传说）（Shun, the Legendary Emperor）","name_en":"Shun","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["传说时代","陶器起源","陶河滨","禅让制"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"other","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"舜在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现三次，其中最重要的一次是陶器起源：作者以“在我国的古老传说中”明确限定，把舜列为陶器的最初设计制造者。另两处分别属于服饰制度（“垂衣裳”）与禅让谱系，都是历史框架叙述，不含工艺内容。本条按低置信度处理。","path":"persons/shun-legend.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"舜在本册三处出现：陶器起源的传说始造者（L422）、“垂衣裳而天下治”的传说主体之一（L533）、禅让谱系中的帝位承接者（L626）。三处都在传说层，且只有第一处与造物直接相关。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:si-tuqiao","title":"司徒乔（Situ Qiao）","name_en":"Situ Qiao","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["民国","书籍装帧","动与静的对比"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"司徒乔在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现两处，均极简：一处在“青年书装家群”的并列名单中（L5017），一处在“还有许多值得书写的设计家”一句里的风格评语（L5034）。原文未给他任何生平信息，只有一条形式判断。","path":"persons/si-tuqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"司徒乔在本册只有一句风格评语：书装设计“富有强烈的动与静的对比，韵味十足”。他在 L5017 的青年书装家群中被列名，是鲁迅提携路径的一员。书籍装帧归 C 维度（视觉传达与文字设计）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:song-yingxing","title":"宋应星（Song Yingxing）","name_en":"Song Yingxing","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["明代","天工开物","实学","工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋应星是明末《天工开物》的撰者，江西奉新人。五册来源都强调他科举失意后转向“实学”，通过广泛调查写成总结农业与手工业技术的综合性著作。","path":"persons/song-yingxing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宋应星是 B 维度下综合性技术著作作者与实学实践者的锚点；其科举失意转向实学的经历也可支持 A 或 D 维度的知识生产问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:su-shi","title":"苏轼（Su Shi）","name_en":"Su Shi","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["北宋","文人审美","平淡","造物评价"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"苏轼是北宋文学家、文人，其造物评价与审美主张被设计史来源引作宋代设计观念转折的证据。赵农称其为中国文化史上的杰出人物、士人的精神形象；李立新引其“百工之于艺，自三代历汉，至唐而备矣”与“渐老渐熟，乃造平淡”，并记其持有的“药玉盏”“荷叶杯”自然而朴澹。","path":"persons/su-shi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"苏轼是 A 维度下宋代文人造物评价与“平淡”审美的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:sun-fuxi","title":"孙福熙（Sun Fuxi）","name_en":"Sun Fuxi","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["民国","书籍装帧","未名社","国立杭州艺术专科学校","水彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"孙福熙在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现两处：一处在“青年书装家群”的概述中（L5017），一处在个人专段（L5030）。原文为他给出留学历程、任教机构、合作出版团体、代表封面与风格判断，是本册民国书装专段中信息较完整的一位。","path":"persons/sun-fuxi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"孙福熙在本册是民国书装“以绘画作品作封面”一支的代表：留法归国后在国立杭州艺专任教，为未名社设计版式与封面，《山野拾掇》《归航》采用水彩画、水墨画。书籍装帧归 C 维度（视觉传达与文字设计）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:sun-yat-sen","title":"孙中山（Sun Yat-sen）","name_en":"Sun Yat-sen","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清末民初","中山装","建国方略","剪辫易服"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"孙中山是清末民初革命家、民国临时大总统，中山装的设计者与提倡者。赵农记其 1919 年《建国方略》设计上海“东方大港”及“创造市宅中心于浦东”的计划；夏燕靖 2016 记其亲自设计并带头穿着中山装、颁布剪辫易服法令。","path":"persons/sun-yat-sen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"孙中山是 D 维度下近代服制改革与城市规划的代表人物，中山装是其设计史核心产物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:tao-yuanqing","title":"陶元庆（Tao Yuanqing）","name_en":"Tao Yuanqing","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["民国","书籍装帧","鲁迅","封面设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陶元庆是民国书籍装帧设计家。赵农记其《彷徨》《坟》等作品装帧含蓄深刻、饱满整洁，与鲁迅并列为对书籍装帧有独到见解的代表；夏燕靖 2016 记其早年在上海《时报》馆作杂志图案设计，1925 年结识鲁迅后为鲁迅著作设计大量封面，构图新颖精炼、色彩明快简洁而富装饰趣味。","path":"persons/tao-yuanqing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陶元庆是 C 维度下民国书籍装帧与鲁迅书装谱系的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:wan-chao-chen","title":"万超尘（Wan Chaochen）","name_en":"Wan Chaochen","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["动画","万氏兄弟","大闹画室","第一代动画人"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"artist","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"万超尘在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于“我国动画影片的发展历史”知识链接的首句，作为万氏兄弟之一被列名。**原文未给他任何个人事迹、作品或生卒年**，仅有合称定位。本条为保留原文的并列关系而设，不额外补充来源以外的信息。","path":"persons/wan-chao-chen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"万超尘在本册与万籁鸣、万古蟾并称万氏兄弟，被列为我国第一代动画人、动画影片的开山鼻祖。动画属动态视觉传达，归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:wan-gu-chan","title":"万古蟾（Wan Guchan）","name_en":"Wan Guchan","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["动画","万氏兄弟","大闹画室","第一代动画人"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"artist","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"万古蟾在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于“我国动画影片的发展历史”知识链接的首句，作为万氏兄弟之一被列名。**原文未给他任何个人事迹、作品或生卒年**，仅有合称定位。本条为保留原文的并列关系而设，不额外补充来源以外的信息。","path":"persons/wan-gu-chan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"万古蟾在本册与万籁鸣、万超尘并称万氏兄弟，被列为我国第一代动画人、动画影片的开山鼻祖。动画属动态视觉传达，归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:wan-lai-ming","title":"万籁鸣（Wan Laiming）","name_en":"Wan Laiming","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["动画","万氏兄弟","大闹画室","第一代动画人","上海美术电影制片厂"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"artist","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"万籁鸣在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于“我国动画影片的发展历史”知识链接的首句。原文以万氏三兄弟的合称方式给出，三人共享同一句定位与同一部代表作《大闹画室》，**原文未对三人作个别区分**。本条照录这一合称结构。","path":"persons/wan-lai-ming.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"万籁鸣在本册是万氏三兄弟之首，被列为我国第一代动画人、动画影片的开山鼻祖，三人合作的《大闹画室》（1926）为 1922—1945 年萌芽期的代表作。动画属动态视觉传达，归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:wang-maoxian","title":"王茂仙（Wang Maoxian）","name_en":"Wang Maoxian","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["1894-1969","苏州","缂丝","刻丝","民国"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"王茂仙在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于民国丝织工艺一节，与沈金水并列于同一句。原文只给出生卒年与“著名的缂丝艺人”这一评价。与沈金水条一样，他在原文中承担的是为苏州缂丝产品结构变化提供人物例证的功能。","path":"persons/wang-maoxian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"王茂仙在本册只作为苏州缂丝名匠被列名，与沈金水并列，代表“1911 年后苏州缂丝转向挂屏、被面、台毯、靠背与名画卷册引首”这一产品结构变化。归 B 维度（造物、工艺与生产技术）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:wang-zhen","title":"王祯（Wang Zhen）","name_en":"Wang Zhen","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["元代","农书","农器图谱","木活字","转轮排字"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"engineer","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"王祯是五册中元代条目最厚的人物，跨农具、农业机械与活字印刷两条技术线。五册对他的取材几乎不重叠：夏燕靖两版给出生平、《农书》的版本结构与一整段秧马材料的批判性讨论；赵农给出最详的农器图谱解读、水轮三事与水转连磨的设计，以及木活字的具体工艺；高丰只用他两句——《布机篇》的一句诗和“转轮排字盘”一条；李立新只取他作为印刷设计家集群的枢纽，并指出现代记住的是《农书》、忘记的是他的活字。田自秉一册完全不提","path":"persons/wang-zhen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"王祯是 B 维度下农具、农业机械与活字印刷两条技术线的交会人物；夏燕靖两版围绕秧马展开的一整段材料批判属于 A 维度的方法论内容；其县尹劝农政绩属 D 维度的地方制度实践。本批按五册共同的技术设计主体归主维度 B。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:wei-gai","title":"卫改（Wei Gai）","name_en":"Wei Gai","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["东汉","画像石","武氏祠","石工"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"卫改是东汉武氏祠画像石工匠，姓名见于武氏家族墓地碑文与石刻题记。田自秉把他与孟孚、李弟卯、孙宗并列，视为留下姓名的石工；李立新引碑文“良匠卫改，雕文刻画，罗列成行，摅骋技巧，委蛇有章”，并据题记讨论高平、山阳的画像石工匠集群。","path":"persons/wei-gai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"卫改是 B 维度下汉代画像石工匠留名与地域工匠集群的实例。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:wen-yiduo","title":"闻一多（Wen Yiduo）","name_en":"Wen Yiduo","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["民国","书籍装帧","插图","比亚兹莱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"闻一多是文学家、美术家，也是民国时期书籍装帧设计者。赵农记其经常为文学作品设计封面，如《冯小青》的装帧及插图；夏燕靖 2016 记其明显受比亚兹莱绘画影响，所绘书籍插图及封面设计具有西方气息，将现代艺术与东方艺术手法自然结合。","path":"persons/wen-yiduo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"闻一多是 C 维度下民国书籍装帧与插图设计的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:wen-zhenheng","title":"文震亨（Wen Zhenheng）","name_en":"Wen Zhenheng","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["明代","长物志","园林","室内陈设","明式家具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"文震亨在五册来源中的位置相当整齐：高丰为他单设一节“文震亨的设计思想”，并在“文人设计师”名单、明式家具文人的参与、室内环境设计理论著作三处反复引用；夏燕靖两版把他作为《长物志》的撰者作文献条目；赵农在造园家名单与《长物志》的卷目两处提及；李立新只在参考书目中列《长物志校注》。**同一著作在两类来源中被读出两种主旨**：高丰读作雅俗与古雅的鉴赏体系，夏燕靖两版读作“以用为本”的实用性。本 KU 只","path":"persons/wen-zhenheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"文震亨是 A 维度下文人设计观的样本：《长物志》提供了一套以雅俗为轴的器物评价标准，与同时期计成《园冶》、李渔《闲情偶寄》同属明末清初的室内与园林设计理论。B 维度上则承载明式家具式样与灯具品评的具体材料。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:xi-zhong","title":"奚仲（Xi Zhong）","name_en":"Xi Zhong","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["夏代","造车","车正","薛部族","传说人物"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"奚仲是五册来源共同记载的造车传说人物，出身薛部族，任夏朝“车正”（掌管造车的工官）。五册的分歧不在“有没有奚仲”，而在三处：车的发明权究竟归黄帝还是奚仲、由全木轮改为有辐轮是否应记在奚仲名下、以及这类古籍记载能否直接当作设计史事实。第一处由高丰提出并悬置，第二处赵农与夏燕靖两版取向相反，第三处李立新明确给出了否定性警告。","path":"persons/xi-zhong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"奚仲是 B 维度下车辆设计的起源叙事，也是 A 维度下“传说能否作为设计史证据”的方法论样本：五册对同一传说的采信程度差异明显。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:xia-qi","title":"夏启（Qi of Xia）","name_en":"Qi of Xia","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["夏代","禅让制","朝代分期"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏启在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于“先秦与先秦三代”知识链接的朝代分期段落。原文只给两件事：启是禹之子；启建立夏王朝、结束禅让制。他没有被描述为任何器物的设计者或工艺的组织者，本条因此不承担造物内容，只作为夏代分期起点的低置信度锚点。","path":"persons/xia-qi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"夏启在本册只出现在“先秦与先秦三代”的知识链接里，功能是把夏代从禅让谱系中切出、确立为中国第一个传说中的朝代。这是分期叙事，不是造物叙事，故归 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:xie-he","title":"谢赫（Xie He）","name_en":"Xie He","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["南朝齐梁","气韵生动","绘画理论","设计思想"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"谢赫在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于魏晋南北朝“设计思想的多样性”一节。原文只提他一项主张——气韵生动——并把它从绘画评论标准扩展到古代设计思想。**原文未提“六法”，也未提《古画品录》**，本条不代补。","path":"persons/xie-he.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"谢赫在本册只以“气韵生动”的提出者出现，作者随即把这一绘画标准延伸到设计：器物装饰与绘画合流后，装饰也要经过同样的艺术构思。他属于“美术命题向设计迁移”的叙述节点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:xunzi","title":"荀子（Xunzi）","name_en":"Xunzi","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["战国","儒家","工艺美学","装饰观"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosopher","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"荀子是战国末期儒家思想家，名况（一说字卿）。四册来源都把他列为先秦诸子工艺美学诸家之一，重点在于他与墨子“非乐”相反的立场：不否认装饰的价值，而把装饰看作“养目”之物，主张内质与外形并重。","path":"persons/xunzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"荀子在来源中作为先秦诸子工艺美学的论述者出现，其“养目”说支撑 A 维度的设计观念讨论；同时其“以玉比德”涉及 B 维度的器物评价。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:yan-lide","title":"阎立德（Yan Lide）","name_en":"Yan Lide","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["唐初","洪州","造船","大海船"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architect","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"阎立德在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于隋唐造船业一节的第一句实例。原文只给三件事：唐初、洪州、造大海船 500 艘。**名字写作“闫立德”**，且未给官职与船制细节，因此本条按低置信度处理，只记录规模数字与所在叙述。","path":"persons/yan-lide.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"阎立德在本册只有一句：唐初在洪州造大海船 500 艘。原文作“闫立德”，未给官职、未给船制。他代表唐代官营造船的规模一端，与同段李皋的技术一端成对。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:yan-su","title":"燕肃（Yan Su）","name_en":"Yan Su","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["北宋","宋仁宗","漏刻","莲花漏","指南车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scientist","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"燕肃是北宋仁宗时期的官吏、画家、机械学家、天文学家，山东益都人。赵农两处记其技术贡献：改进漏壶、修正记时标准；研制指南车，恢复汉魏以来屡造屡湮的形制；研制莲花漏，采用漫流系统稳定水流速度与压力，惜被朝廷冷落而未获使用。今传《寒岩积雪图》等绘画作品。","path":"persons/yan-su.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"燕肃是 B 维度下北宋机械与记时装置的人物条目：漏刻、莲花漏与指南车复原都归于其名下。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:yang-mao","title":"杨茂（Yang Mao）","name_en":"Yang Mao","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["元代","雕漆","剔红","嘉兴","髹漆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"杨茂是元代嘉兴府西塘杨汇（一作扬汇）的雕漆名家，与张成齐名。田自秉记其故宫藏品与明人评骘；李立新补充《剔红花卉渣斗》的尺寸、纹饰与风格评价。","path":"persons/yang-mao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"杨茂是 B 维度下元代嘉兴雕漆（剔红）名家，与张成并称，其作品与“堆朱杨成”的日本谱系构成漆艺史的具体链条。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:ye-lingfeng","title":"叶灵凤（Ye Lingfeng）","name_en":"Ye Lingfeng","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["民国","书籍装帧","唯美主义","现代主义","出版"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"叶灵凤在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于民国书装专段的末句。原文把他写成唯一同时具备三重身份的人：小说家、出版人、书装设计者，并给出两项风格判断——唯美主义倾向、现代主义艺术设计的代表人物。","path":"persons/ye-lingfeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"叶灵凤在本册被列为民国书装“唯美主义倾向、现代主义代表”一支，且兼有小说家与出版人身份。书籍装帧归 C 维度（视觉传达与文字设计）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:yuwen-kai","title":"宇文恺（Yuwen Kai）","name_en":"Yuwen Kai","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["隋代","建筑家","大兴城","东都洛阳","里坊制"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architect","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宇文恺是隋代建筑家，官至工部尚书，三册来源都以大兴城为核心案例记述他。夏燕靖 2009 与 2016 两版的叙述几乎逐句相同，把大兴城拆成选址、规模、区划、里坊、街制五条来论证其规划才能，并在 2016 版增设“知识链接：宇文恺”小传，给出字号、籍贯、族属与官阶。赵农的写法完全不同：他先引《隋书》三句原文立其人，再以“揣摩皇帝的心思”与魏征“危乱之源，抑亦此之由”的评语作结，把同一批工程读作皇权工","path":"persons/yuwen-kai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宇文恺是 D 维度下国家工程与都城制度的设计者样本：其作品由朝廷下令、以工官体系实施，设计能力与皇权意志不可分割。夏燕靖两版给出完整的规划方法（选址、分区、里坊、街制），赵农给出制度批评视角（揣摩帝心、魏征评语）。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zeng-guofan","title":"曾国藩（Zeng Guofan）","name_en":"Zeng Guofan","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清末","洋务运动","江南机器制造总局","安庆军械所"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曾国藩是清末洋务派官员。赵农记其与左宗棠、李鸿章、张之洞继承魏源思想、开始洋务运动；夏燕靖 2016 列其兴办洋务的五件实事，并称其为“第一个尝螃蟹的人”。","path":"persons/zeng-guofan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"曾国藩是 D 维度下洋务运动与近代工业制度建立的核心人物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zeng-liansong","title":"曾联松（Zeng Liansong）","name_en":"Zeng Liansong","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["1949","五星红旗","国旗设计","现代经济通讯社"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曾联松在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于“国旗图案设计”知识链接。原文用一段话交代了征集的缘起、稿件数量、落选与再发现的过程、修改内容与通过时间。曾联松是这段流程的终点与关键，但原文对他的介绍仅一句：单位与职务。","path":"persons/zeng-liansong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"曾联松在本册是五星红旗图案的设计者，身份为上海“现代经济通讯社”文书——一个非专业设计者的投稿者。国旗属国家视觉标识，归 C 维度（视觉传达与文字设计）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhang-cheng","title":"张成（Zhang Cheng）","name_en":"Zhang Cheng","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["元代","雕漆","剔红","嘉兴","髹漆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"张成是元代嘉兴府西塘杨汇（一作扬汇）的雕漆名家，以剔红最得名。田自秉记其作品形制、涂漆层数、铭文与明人评骘；李立新补充作品尺寸、剔犀刀口深度、其子张德刚承业入明以及嘉兴漆艺东传日本的谱系。","path":"persons/zhang-cheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"张成是 B 维度下元代嘉兴雕漆（剔红、剔犀）的代表匠师，其作品、铭文与东传日本“堆朱杨成”的记载构成漆艺史的具体链条。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhang-ding","title":"张仃（Zhang Ding）","name_en":"Zhang Ding","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["新中国","国徽设计","中央美术学院","工艺美术教育","民间美术"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"张仃在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现两处：国徽设计竞赛中中央美术学院设计组的成员名单（L5158），以及全国民间美术工艺品展览会期间与民间艺人、工艺美术教育家的座谈名单（L5177）。两处都是名单式提及，合起来勾出他在新中国初期设计体制中的位置。","path":"persons/zhang-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"张仃在本册以两个身份出现：中央美术学院国徽设计组成员、全国民间美术工艺品展览会座谈的工艺美术专家。二者都指向新中国设计事业的组织与教育层面，归 D 维度（制度与设计教育）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhang-guang-yu","title":"张光宇（Zhang Guangyu）","name_en":"Zhang Guangyu","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["20世纪","书籍装帧","万象","装饰","字体设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"张光宇是 20 世纪书籍与杂志装帧设计家、工艺美术设计家与教育家。赵农记其《万象》杂志封面装饰风格显著、大方得体、民族气息浓郁，1949 年后《装饰》等字体设计仍保持风格；夏燕靖 2016 记 1992 年《装饰》第 4 期出“纪念张光宇特刊”。","path":"persons/zhang-guang-yu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"张光宇是 C 维度下民国至新中国书籍装帧与字体设计的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhang-heng","title":"张衡（Zhang Heng）","name_en":"Zhang Heng","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["东汉","地动仪","浑天仪","浑天说","科学仪器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scientist","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"张衡是东汉科学家与仪器设计者。赵农记其制造地动仪、提出浑天说，并在地图、指南车等方面有贡献；夏燕靖 2016 记其用青铜制作浑天仪、制成世界上第一架候风地动仪，并详述地动仪的机械结构与艺术化造型。","path":"persons/zhang-heng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"张衡是 B 维度下汉代科学仪器设计与青铜工艺结合的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhang-jian","title":"张謇（Zhang Jian）","name_en":"Zhang Jian","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["晚清民国","实业家","纺织教育","大生纱厂","南通"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"industrialist","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"张謇在四册来源中出现，位置分两类：高丰用整段为他立传，把张謇与沈寿并列为中国近代织绣史上的两位人物，称其为“中国近代纺织教育和纺织工业的先驱”；夏燕靖两版只在《雪宦绣谱》的文献条目与丝织科技文献清单中记他是该书的记录整理者与作序者；赵农则把他当作“官商一体”的**反例**，用以论证近代民族工业的结构性困境。**四册合计没有一处提出与他生平相悖的事实**，但评价取向从“先驱”到“压制其他私人企业”之","path":"persons/zhang-jian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"张謇是 D 维度下实业办学模式的样本：以企业收益支撑技术教育，形成“工厂—学校—传习所”的闭环。同时是 B 维度刺绣工艺文献《雪宦绣谱》得以成书的关键人物（记录整理者与作序者）。四册评价相反：高丰作“先驱”，赵农作“官商一体”的反例。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhang-xuan","title":"张萱（Zhang Xuan）","name_en":"Zhang Xuan","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["唐代","捣练图","风俗画","图像史料","印染"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"artist","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"张萱在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现两次，两次都是他的《捣练图》被当作证据使用：一次在印染业一节，证明唐代宫中染坊的捣练操作已专业化；一次在女装一节，作为考察唐 300 年裙装变化的绘画序列之一。本条按“图像史料提供者”定位，不虚构其生平或画学成就。","path":"persons/zhang-xuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"张萱在本册承担的是图像史料功能：《捣练图》被用来证明唐代宫中染坊存在“专业捣练”的分工，也被列入考察唐代裙装变化的一组绘画。他不是被研究的设计者，而是提供视觉证据的画家。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhang-yanyuan","title":"张彦远（Zhang Yanyuan）","name_en":"Zhang Yanyuan","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["唐代","历代名画记","瑞锦宫绫","陵阳公样","文献史料"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"张彦远在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于“唐代设计理论述要”一节，是作者为论述唐代纺织品图案设计而引用的文献作者。《历代名画记》在本段承担了两件事：记下窦师纶所织锦绫的图案名目；引出日本学者太田英藏关于法隆寺与正仓院藏品的技术来源推断。本条按“文献史料提供者”定位。","path":"persons/zhang-yanyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"张彦远在本册是唐代图案设计唯一的直接文献来源：《历代名画记》记窦师纶所织瑞锦、宫绫的图案名目。他提供的是史料，不是设计实践，故归 A 维度（设计史如何被文献支撑）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhang-zhidong","title":"张之洞（Zhang Zhidong）","name_en":"Zhang Zhidong","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["晚清","洋务运动","癸卯学制","工艺学堂","中体西用"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"张之洞在三册来源中的分量差别很大：高丰把他写作中国近代艺术设计教育的**创始人**，用两整段铺陈其学制、学堂与奏议，是六册中对张之洞评价最高的一处；李立新把他放进设计教育史的制度线索，但只给压缩版的事实，并把同期的赵尔巽并列；赵农只在三处提及——生卒年与洋务官员名单（总结章），以及一句“两广总督张之洞利用机器铸制了‘龙洋’银圆”。夏燕靖两版、田自秉册无字面命中。**本 KU 的核心是三组来源间的对","path":"persons/zhang-zhidong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"张之洞是 D 维度下中国近代设计教育制度化的关键推手：癸卯学制把工艺与设计纳入国家学制，三江师范图画手工科培养出第一批师资。同时也是“中体西用”这一设计思想框架的命名者，属 A 维度边界。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhao-guo","title":"赵过（Zhao Guo）","name_en":"Zhao Guo","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["汉代","农具","耧车","三脚耧","耦犁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"engineer","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵过是六册中记载最薄的汉代人物之一：三册提到他，高丰、田自秉、李立新三册完全不提，且三册的全部材料都集中在一段农具叙述里。夏燕靖两版把他写成“三脚耧”的设计发明者，赵农把他写成耧车与耦犁的推行者并补出耧车的构造与效率数据。三册都不记生卒、籍贯、师承与其他事迹；通行的“代田法”在六册中一次也没有出现。本 KU 因此以两说的分工差别为主，而不勉强补足生平。","path":"persons/zhao-guo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"赵过在三册中只出现于汉代农具一条线（B）；其搜粟都尉身份与“主持农业生产”“负责推行”的叙述属官职与推广制度（D）。本批按三册共同的农具设计主体归主维度 B。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zheng-guanying","title":"郑观应（Zheng Guanying）","name_en":"Zheng Guanying","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清末","盛世危言","工艺","商战","实业救国"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"郑观应（1842—1922）是清末改良主义思想家。赵农引其《盛世危言》“工艺一道，为国家致富之基。工艺既兴，物产即因之饶裕”，并主张“设工艺专科”“开工艺学堂”“派人游学各国”“设博览会以励百工”；李立新引其分析洋货入华导致女红失业、主张以“商战”对抗西方，视为“实业救国论”先声。","path":"persons/zheng-guanying.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"郑观应是 D 维度下晚清“工艺／实业”思潮与设计教育主张的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zheng-mantuo","title":"郑曼陀（Zheng Mantu）","name_en":"Zheng Mantu","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["民国","上海","月份牌","擦笔水彩法","广告设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"designer","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"郑曼陀是近代上海月份牌广告设计家，首创“擦笔水彩法”。高丰记其用炭精粉擦出人物图像明暗变化、再用水彩层层渲染，风格风靡上海并为同行仿效，与周慕桥、杭穉英并称三大盟主；赵农将其列为月份牌代表设计者之一。","path":"persons/zheng-mantuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"郑曼陀是 C 维度下月份牌“擦笔水彩法”与上海广告设计谱系的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhou-enlai","title":"周恩来（Zhou Enlai）","name_en":"Zhou Enlai","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["新中国","国务院总理","人民大会堂","景泰蓝","定瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"周恩来在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现六处，覆盖 1949 至 1976 年间新中国设计的多个关键节点。原文对他的记述都是**具体决策或具体场合**，而非生平：选定宫灯、抹去彩球、比作外汇行业、参观云锦、分包厅室、劝解红卫兵、答复定瓷。本条把这些分散的决策点聚在一处，不改写原文评价。","path":"persons/zhou-enlai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"周恩来在本册是新中国设计事务的最高层决策者与保护者：开国大典天安门装饰的拍板、人民大会堂厅室分包体制的决定、“石头加人工等于外汇”的行业定位、广交会现场为景泰蓝解禁、定瓷恢复的关怀。这些均属国家层面的制度与决策，归 D 维度（商业、制度）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhou-fang","title":"周昉（Zhou Fang）","name_en":"Zhou Fang","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["唐代","簪花仕女图","女装","宽袖","图像史料"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"artist","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"周昉在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现三次，都围绕《簪花仕女图》：一次作为中晚唐妇女袖宽超过四尺的例证，一次进入考察裙装变化的绘画序列，一次作为图 6-24 的图注。原文称他“中唐画家”，是本册少数给出时代限定语的人物。","path":"persons/zhou-fang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"周昉在本册是唐代中晚唐女装“宽衫大袖”一说的图像证据提供者：《簪花仕女图》被用来说明贵族妇女袖宽超过四尺。他有明确的时代与画家身份，比对张萱多一句“中唐”。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhou-jiazhou","title":"周嘉胄（Zhou Jiazhou）","name_en":"Zhou Jiazhou","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["明末","装潢志","书画装裱","设计理论"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"周嘉胄在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现两次：一次在明清设计理论著作的书目列举中（L4659），一次是《装潢志》的专门介绍（L4685）。后者给出篇幅、结构、各节标题与评价，是本册论述最细的明清工艺专著之一。","path":"persons/zhou-jiazhou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"周嘉胄在本册是《装潢志》的作者，该书被作者称为“设计理论的经典著作”，记述古代书画装裱的完整工艺。装裱是书籍与书画的物质呈现环节，归 C 维度（视觉传达与文字设计的物质基础）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhou-renzhai","title":"周仁斋（Zhou Renzhai）","name_en":"Zhou Renzhai","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["民国","中天电机厂","电话机","天津","民族工业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"industrialist","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"周仁斋在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于民国电信工业一节。原文把他写成“不忍坐视中国工业落后”而创业的实业家，并给出一串明确的产品里程碑：军用携带机、手摇磁石电话机、拨号盘仿制与 1000 部自动电话机。这是本册民国工业叙事中产品节点最密集的一段。","path":"persons/zhou-renzhai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"周仁斋在本册是民族电机工业的创办者：1932 年与王汰甄在天津创办中天电机厂，造出我国最早的自行设计生产通话机与第一部手摇磁石电话机。产品工业的创办与市场对抗（与西门子竞争）归 D 维度（商业、制度）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhu-bishan","title":"朱碧山（Zhu Bishan）","name_en":"Zhu Bishan","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["元代","银器","银槎杯","嘉兴"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"朱碧山是元代江南著名银工，字华玉，嘉兴人。四册来源都以虾杯、蟹杯与银槎杯为他代表作，并记其槎杯传世仅四件，分藏北京故宫、台北故宫等四处。夏燕靖两版另记虾杯、蟹杯注入热酒后在桌上滑行，并给银槎杯的尺寸、铭文与“龙槎杯”之名。","path":"persons/zhu-bishan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"朱碧山是 B 维度下元代江南银工与槎杯器物传统的匠人锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhu-kerou","title":"朱克柔（Zhu Kerou）","name_en":"Zhu Kerou","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["南宋","缂丝","云间","织绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craftsman","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"朱克柔是南宋缂丝名手。田自秉把她与沈子蕃、吴煦并列为南宋云间（今松江）缂丝名家，称其作品古澹清雅；李立新另记其活动于南宋高宗时，并给出《莲塘乳鸭图》《牡丹》的收藏地，把她作为缂丝“直接将绘画引入设计”的代表。","path":"persons/zhu-kerou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"朱克柔是 B 维度下南宋缂丝名家，其作品体现缂丝由实用织造向书画摹缂、观赏化发展的阶段。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhu-qijian","title":"朱启钤（Zhu Qiqian）","name_en":"Zhu Qiqian","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["近现代","营造学会","中国营造学社","髹饰录"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"朱启钤是北洋政府内务总长、近现代官员与学者。赵农记其 1925 年发起“营造学会”、1930 年改名“中国营造学社”；夏燕靖 2016 记其 1927 年据流传日本的钞本刊刻《髹饰录》。","path":"persons/zhu-qijian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"朱启钤是 D 维度下近代建筑研究制度与漆艺文献整理的枢纽人物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhu-xi","title":"朱熹（Zhu Xi）","name_en":"Zhu Xi","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["南宋","理学","简易","致用","道器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosopher","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"朱熹是南宋理学家，其服饰观与“简易”“致用”主张被设计史来源引作宋代设计思想的代表。赵农引其“男子有三紧”说明服饰与人格合一；李立新引其“去其重复，使之简易”与“道即器，器即道”，说明理学并不导致全面复古，而强调制度器物的简便实用。","path":"persons/zhu-xi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"朱熹是 A 维度下宋代“简易”“致用”设计思想的代表，连接理学、服饰规范与器物观。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhu-yan","title":"朱琰（Zhu Yan）","name_en":"Zhu Yan","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["清乾隆","陶说","陶瓷史","景德镇","文献史料"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scholar","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"朱琰在夏燕靖 2016 册中出现一次，位于明清设计理论著作的知识链接中。《陶说》是本册列举的陶瓷类著作（《陶说》《陶雅》《陶录》《古窑器考》《说瓷》《瓷史》）之首，也是唯一被展开介绍的一部。原文给出版本、卷次、四大部分结构与“第一部陶瓷史著作”的评价。","path":"persons/zhu-yan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"朱琰在本册是《陶说》的作者，该书被作者称为“我国第一部陶瓷史著作”。他的设计史意义在于提供了一部以景德镇为中心的陶瓷通史文本，属 A 维度（设计史如何被书写）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zhuangzi","title":"庄子（Zhuangzi）","name_en":"Zhuangzi","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["战国","道家","造物思想","反雕饰","漆园吏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosopher","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"庄子在六册中从不是被叙述的造物者，而是被反复征引的**思想来源**。他的出现方式分两类：一类是设计史观层面的正面论述——高丰、李立新、夏燕靖 2016 把他与老子并列为“反雕饰、尚自然”设计观的代表，赵农单设《庄子》一节论其器具认识；另一类是技术史层面的零散引证——田自秉引《庄子·秋水》释夔纹、引《史记》述漆园吏、引“虚室生白”溯吉祥图案，赵农引《庄子》论剑器、铜镜重影、毛笔、跪坐、音乐、园林。两","path":"persons/zhuangzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"庄子是 A 维度下先秦造物思想的条目：他不从事造物，其价值在于为设计提供目的论与评价标准（素朴、自然、技进乎道）。同时是 B 维度诸条（漆器、铜镜、毛笔、夔纹）的古籍引证来源。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"persons:zuo-zongtang","title":"左宗棠（Zuo Zongtang）","name_en":"Zuo Zongtang","type":"person","type_zh":"人物","color":"#3B82F6","tags":["晚清","洋务运动","福建船政局","兰州制造局","甘肃织呢局"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"statesman","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"左宗棠在六册中的相关文本很少，但分布很不均衡：夏燕靖 2009 与 2016 两版各有一段完整的洋务活动叙述，把他与曾国藩、李鸿章并列，逐条记福建船政局、求实堂艺局、兰州制造局、甘肃织呢局；赵农只在近代史总结里把他列入洋务官员名单，给出“强政府”而非“民生”的评价框架，不展开他的具体事迹；高丰、田自秉、李立新三册无字面命中。**本 KU 只做人物层面的身份、动因与评价合成**，福建船政局的局址、船","path":"persons/zuo-zongtang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"左宗棠是 D 维度下洋务官员推动近代工业设计的样本：其活动以海防与军需为动因，以官办局厂为组织形式。夏燕靖两版把他列为洋务派三大人物之一作技术引进叙述，赵农仅在总结中列入洋务官员名单并给出“强政府非民生”的批判框架。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:asitana-gumu","title":"阿斯塔那古墓（Astana Cemetery）","name_en":"Astana Cemetery","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["北朝","吐鲁番","织锦","云气动物纹","花鸟纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"阿斯塔那古墓位于新疆吐鲁番，是北朝至唐代墓葬群。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》用该墓出土的大量北朝织锦验证北魏孝文帝奖劝农桑的政策效果：一方面设立官营丝织作坊，平城宫中有“婢使千余人织绫锦”；另一方面任民织造，一度遣散宫中机织工匠，使民间纺织业再度活跃。图2-1 为云气动物纹织锦（北朝，新疆吐鲁番阿斯塔那古墓出土），图2-27 为花鸟纹锦（阿斯塔那北区三八一号墓出土）。\n\n来源未给墓葬分期、墓主、织物","path":"places/asitana-gumu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"阿斯塔那古墓是 B 维度下北朝织锦与纺织生产条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:banpo-site","title":"半坡遗址（Banpo Site）","name_en":"Banpo Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["新石器时代","仰韶文化","彩陶","半地穴式建筑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"半坡遗址是陕西西安东郊浐河旁的仰韶文化聚落遗址，距今约六七千年。六册来源把它用作多处论证的实物依据：石器与农具、尖底瓶的力学设计、人面鱼纹彩陶盆的图像解释、半地穴式建筑的构造、以及“半坡型”彩陶的类型命名。本 KU 把这些不同层面的引用合并登记。","path":"places/banpo-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"半坡遗址是 B 维度下新石器时代聚落与器物群的综合锚点，同时是彩陶类型学的命名来源（半坡型）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:baoshan-chumu","title":"包山楚墓（Baoshan Chu Tomb）","name_en":"Baoshan Chu Tomb","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["战国","楚墓","漆奁","车马人物出行图","漆器设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"包山楚墓位于湖北荆门（包山大冢）。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》以该墓漆奁盖圈上的《车马人物出行图》为例，讨论战国漆器装饰如何把使臣出访情节的不同时间跨度组织在同一空间中，形成“有机整体”，表现时间中的空间连续变化。\n\n来源给出该图绘制在直径28厘米的奁盖圈上，展开后长87.4厘米、高5.2厘米。作者称多数学者认为图形空间只能表现静止性与瞬间性，而此图成为特例。来源未给墓葬发掘年份、墓主、随葬品总数与","path":"places/baoshan-chumu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"包山楚墓是 B 维度下战国漆器与连续叙事图像条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:beijing","title":"北京（Beijing）","name_en":"Beijing","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["明代","中轴线","北平","十大建筑","大屋顶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北京在赵农的叙述中跨两个时段。明代北京城是在国都向北京转移的背景下规划设计的，其设计思想与明代国家制度的需求关系密切：城市中轴线确立，城市营造的规模与水平较之前代有明显进步，宫苑、庙坛、城门的精心设计与布局强化了北京作为都城的政治意义，也形成浓郁深厚的文化氛围；满清入关定都北京后只作局部修缮，没有改变城市根本格局，使北京城完整延续下来，“为后人提供了一座古都的文化标本”。\n\n近现代部分则是另一条线","path":"places/beijing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"北京是 D 维度下都城制度与近现代城市改造条目；明代宫苑庙坛城门的营造接到 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:beiyinyangying-site","title":"北阴阳营遗址（Beiyinyangying Site）","name_en":"Beiyinyangying Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["新石器时代","七孔石刀","玉石器","玛瑙","南京"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北阴阳营遗址位于江苏南京，是新石器时代玉石器与多孔石刀的重要出土地。高丰把该遗址所出七孔石刀定为新石器时代多孔石刀的代表作，并据穿孔方式讨论其功能与形式美感；田自秉记该遗址出土玉和玛瑙制品多达 280 多件，是六册中唯一给出该遗址玉石器数量的来源；李立新以图版收录同一件七孔石刀。田自秉一处把遗址名写作“阴阳营”，省略“北”字，本条照录并保留异写。","path":"places/beiyinyangying-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"北阴阳营遗址是 B 维度下新石器时代多孔石刀与玉石装饰品的实物落点，七孔石刀的穿孔功能与形式美讨论也触及 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:biandun-xizhou-tomb","title":"金坛鳖墩西周墓（Jintan Biandun Western Zhou Tomb）","name_en":"Jintan Biandun Western Zhou Tomb","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["西周","原始瓷器","瓷盖碗","绞丝系","江苏金坛"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金坛鳖墩西周墓位于江苏金坛。田自秉在列举周代原始瓷器出土地时把江苏金坛与安徽屯溪、丹徒烟墩山等并列，并称“以安徽屯溪的最为重要”；随后单独记鳖墩的材料：1975 年发现 29 件原始瓷器，器类有瓷罐、瓷碗、瓷盂。瓷罐有两个小耳，肩部饰水波纹、腹部饰编织纹，有盖，盖上立一只形象简练的小鸟；器物内外满釉，釉呈青黄色。小瓷盂小口、腹下垂宽大、肩上两个绞丝小系，釉色青灰。瓷盖碗有两个倒 U 字形耳，碗内有","path":"places/biandun-xizhou-tomb.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金坛鳖墩西周墓是 B 维度下西周原始瓷器器形细节最完整的一处墓葬落点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:changsha-chumuqun","title":"长沙楚墓群（Changsha Chu Tombs）","name_en":"Changsha Chu Tombs","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["战国","楚国","丝织品","刺绣","漆器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"长沙楚墓群是战国楚国在湖南长沙一带的墓葬集中区，广济桥、左家塘、烈士公园等地均有发现。田自秉据这批墓葬记战国丝织、刺绣、麻布、漆器与琉璃璧五类材料，其中左家塘一地所出战国中期丝织品品种最全，烈士公园出龙凤刺绣，长沙楚墓中琉璃璧的出土比例极高。\n\n本条只覆盖**先秦楚墓**。长沙的汉墓（马王堆、五里牌、子弹库等）另属汉代条目，见 `places/mawangdui-hanmu.md`、`places","path":"places/changsha-chumuqun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"长沙楚墓群是 B 维度下战国丝织、刺绣、漆器与琉璃璧的区域性墓葬集合。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:changsha-wujialing","title":"长沙伍家岭（Wujialing, Changsha）","name_en":"Wujialing, Changsha","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["汉代","木船模型","造船设计","标准化","木桨"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"长沙伍家岭是湖南长沙的汉代木船模型出土地点。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》记该地出土汉代木船模型一件，船舷上沿和首尾平板上均有排列有序的细小圆孔，应是起加固作用的铁钉或竹木钉孔；据散落构件复原为三间舱房，有舱门及窗户凹槽，顶盖呈方形坡状。随船出土十六根形制相同的木桨，每根长52.8厘米，桨叶长25.6厘米，对称，中间起脊；船尾另有长桨一件，长约100厘米，用于控制航向。\n\n来源以该模型与广州东汉、西汉","path":"places/changsha-wujialing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"长沙伍家岭是 B 维度下汉代造船设计与标准化条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:chenliu","title":"陈留（Chenliu）","name_en":"Chenliu","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["汉代","陈留郡","种蓝","染绀","染料"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陈留是汉代陈留郡，既是当时丝织品的著名产地，也是染料工艺原料的生产地。田自秉在同段先记汉代丝织染色有官方专管机构——《三辅黄图》载“未央宫有暴室，主掖庭织作染练之署”，《续汉书·百官志》载“平准令”主练染作彩色——随即记陈留的双重身份，并引赵岐《蓝赋》序：“余就医偃师，道经陈留，此境人皆以种蓝染绀为业，蓝田弥望，黍稷不植。”来源只此一段，未给陈留的辖县、城址与染料产量。","path":"places/chenliu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陈留是 B 维度下汉代染料原料产地条目；官营染色机构（暴室、平准令）归 institutions/pingzhunling.md，本条只记民间种蓝染绀。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:chifeng-gangwayaotun-liaoyao","title":"赤峰缸瓦窑屯辽窑（Chifeng Gangwayaotun Liao Kiln）","name_en":"Chifeng Gangwayaotun Liao Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["辽代","辽瓷","仿定白瓷","辽三彩","茶叶末绿釉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赤峰缸瓦窑屯辽窑是辽代主要瓷窑，位于内蒙古赤峰缸瓦窑屯。田自秉据近年考古发掘与出土器物记辽瓷的生产地区及主要产品：赤峰缸瓦窑屯辽窑窑场很大、窑址也多，面积约二平方里，是辽瓷的主要产地；此地产品有仿定白瓷、辽三彩、茶叶末绿釉等单色釉陶。同段另列辽阳江官屯辽窑、辽上京瓷窑、辽上京白音高劳窑、辽上京南山窑四处，并判断辽代陶瓷主要是仿定窑瓷系的。","path":"places/chifeng-gangwayaotun-liaoyao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"赤峰缸瓦窑屯辽窑是 B 维度下辽瓷主要产地条目；瓷窑官与辽代官窑的设立归 institutions/ciyaoguan.md。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:cizhou-kiln","title":"磁州窑（Cizhou Kiln）","name_en":"Cizhou Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["宋代","民窑","白地黑花","河北"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"磁州窑是宋元时期北方规模最大的民间瓷窑体系，窑址集中在河北磁县、邯郸一带漳河两岸。五册来源都以白地釉下黑（褐）花和强烈的绘画性装饰为其标志，并把它看作中国瓷器由刻划装饰转向毛笔彩绘的关键节点。","path":"places/cizhou-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"磁州窑是 B 维度下民窑体系与白地黑花装饰传统的锚点，其绘画性装饰也涉及 C 维度的视觉表现问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:dadiwan-site","title":"大地湾遗址（Dadiwan Site）","name_en":"Dadiwan Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["新石器时代","马家窑文化","建筑","料礓石","彩陶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大地湾遗址位于甘肃秦安，马家窑文化时期出现面积达420平方米的套房，有主室、后室、侧室。地面处理具有防潮、保温、抗压功能，房屋有料礓石面装饰，赵农称其几乎接近现代水泥材料的硬质。李立新记遗址出土人头形彩陶瓶。","path":"places/dadiwan-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大地湾遗址是 B 维度下史前建筑技术与彩陶条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:danyang","title":"丹阳（Danyang Copper Region）","name_en":"Danyang Copper Region","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["汉代","铜矿","善铜","镜铭","铜官"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"丹阳是汉代著名铜产地，汉代早期有“铜出丹阳”之说。《汉书·地理志》记丹阳郡设铜官；郡治在今安徽宣城，辖十七县，丹阳县即今安徽当涂。汉代镜铭屡屡称丹阳铜：“汉有善铜出丹阳，炼冶银锡清而明”，又有“杜氏作镜大毋伤，新有嘉铜出丹阳”。丹阳铜因此被誉称“善铜”“嘉铜”，是六册中唯一以镜铭证铜料产地的材料；来源另称后期铜料改称“铜出徐州”。","path":"places/danyang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"丹阳是 B 维度下汉代铜料产地与铜质评价的地理锚点；丹阳郡铜官属 D 维度制度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:daxing-cheng","title":"大兴城（Daxing City）","name_en":"Daxing City","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["隋代","唐代","都城","里坊制","宇文恺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大兴城是隋开皇二年（582）隋文帝下令营建的新都，命高颎、宇文恺为正副监，宇文恺选定长安城东南龙首川一带平原为城址并主持规划。全城南北长8600米、东西长9700多米，总面积约84平方公里，有12座城门，由宫城、皇城、郭城组成，按里坊制分为108坊；有南北大街11条、东西大街14条，朱雀大街宽150米。开皇二年六月营建、当年十二月基本竣工，次年三月迁入，前后仅9个月。\n\n大兴城也就是唐长安城。李立","path":"places/daxing-cheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大兴城是 D 维度下隋唐都城规划与里坊制条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:dehua-yao","title":"德化窑（Dehua Kiln）","name_en":"Dehua Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["明代","白瓷","中国白","瓷塑","何朝宗"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"德化窑是福建德化县的明代白瓷名窑。田自秉记：明代以生产白瓷为有名，釉色温润如玉、微带牙黄，法国人称为“中国白”；器形有碗、杯、瓶、壶、炉等；犀角杯仿犀角雕，当时甚为流行；而最有特色的是瓷塑作品，特别是以佛像如观音、达摩、弥陀等最为杰出；著名艺人何朝宗是当时的瓷塑名手。","path":"places/dehua-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"德化窑是 B 维度下明代白瓷与瓷塑窑口条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:dengxian-xuezhuang-huaxiangzhuan-mu","title":"邓县学庄画像砖墓（Dengxian Xuezhuang Pictorial Brick Tomb）","name_en":"Dengxian Xuezhuang Pictorial Brick Tomb","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["六朝","画像砖","浅浮雕","填染七色","车骑出行"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"邓县学庄画像砖墓是 1957 年在河南邓县学庄发现的六朝画像砖墓。田自秉把邓县列为六朝画像砖在北方的发现地，南方则以江苏最集中，有南京西善桥、油坊村、佛心桥，丹阳胡桥、建山、仙塘湾，镇江，常州戚家村等地。画像砖内容丰富，题材可分三类：车骑出行、神话传说与孝子故事、飞天供养与珍禽瑞兽。制作上采用浅浮雕手法，具有立体感，线条飘舞潇洒；画像砖烧成后还在部分画面上填染颜色，有的多达七种（插图 9、插图 1","path":"places/dengxian-xuezhuang-huaxiangzhuan-mu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"邓县学庄画像砖墓是 B 维度下六朝画像砖的北方标尺条目；题材的图像志分析属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:deqing-yao","title":"德清窑（Deqing Kiln）","name_en":"Deqing Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["六朝","青瓷","黑瓷","东苕溪","德清"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"德清窑是六朝浙江四大瓷窑系统之一，位于浙江北部东苕溪地区，德清、余杭等地均有窑址。田自秉把浙江六朝瓷窑分为四个系统：曹娥江地区的越窑、东部瓯江地区的瓯窑、西部金、衢地区的婺窑、北部东苕溪地区的德清窑。德清窑除烧制青瓷外还烧造黑瓷；六朝时期浙江的德清窑以烧制黑瓷著名，其黑釉并没有达到完全纯黑的程度，但丰富了瓷釉的色彩，为后来的乌金釉、铁锈花釉等奠定了基础。黑瓷制品有盘口壶、天鸡壶、双耳罐、薰炉、灯台","path":"places/deqing-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"德清窑是 B 维度下六朝青瓷与黑瓷兼烧的窑口条目；黑釉含铁量与呈色的对应关系归 terms/black-porcelain.md。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:ding-kiln","title":"定窑（Ding Kiln）","name_en":"Ding Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["宋代","五大名窑","白瓷","覆烧","印花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"定窑位于河北曲阳（宋属定州），以白瓷为主，是宋代五大名窑中唯一被六册来源一致归为“民窑出身”的窑口。它的工艺标志是覆烧（因而碗盘口沿无釉，称芒口）与印花装饰；它的制度特征是产品被宫廷选用而窑本身仍属民营。六册来源在这一点上大体一致，但在**断代下限**与**款识清单**上分歧明显：田自秉记“唐至北宋”，赵农记“宋代”而未及下限，夏燕靖 2009 与 2016 则给出“始烧于唐、兴盛于宋、失传于元”","path":"places/ding-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"定窑是 B 维度下白瓷体系与覆烧、印花工艺的关键窑口，其“民窑而供御”的身份又落在 D 维度的官民关系上。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:dong-yao","title":"董窑（Dong Kiln）","name_en":"Dong Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["宋代","董窑","东窑","东青","淡青"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"董窑是宋代瓷窑，窑址未发现。田自秉引《格古要论》：“董窑，淡青色，细纹，多有紫口铁足，比官窑无红色，质粗而不细润，不逮官窑多矣。”来源另记：有人以为董窑即“东西二务”的东窑；清代亦有“东青”的釉色；窑址有待以后的调查。本条的全部内容来自这一部文献与来源的两句附注，没有任何器物或窑址材料。","path":"places/dong-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"董窑是 B 维度下仅见于文献、窑址未发现的宋代瓷窑条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:dongyang","title":"东阳（Dongyang）","name_en":"Dongyang","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["现代","东阳","木雕","雕花之乡","满花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"东阳是浙江木雕的传统产地，被称为“雕花之乡”。田自秉记：东阳木雕的影响范围较广，属于这一工艺系统的有上海、杭州、广州，以至南洋一带；在内容上，多以历史故事和民间传说为题材；图案组织常采用“满花”的方法，画面布满花纹，形成一种独特的艺术风格；品种有柜、桌、灯台、屏风等，樟木箱更是人们喜爱的产品。","path":"places/dongyang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"东阳是 B 维度下东阳木雕产地条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:duanzhou","title":"端州（Duanzhou）","name_en":"Duanzhou","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["唐代","清代","端州","肇庆","端砚"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"端州即今广东肇庆市，是端砚的产地。田自秉把端砚列为清代著名石雕之一，记其产于广东端州（今肇庆市），是历史悠久的一种石雕工艺，唐代即已成为著名的产品。唐代诗人李贺《杨生青花紫石砚歌》以“端州石工巧如神，踏天磨刀割紫云”称之。清代端砚制作已达到登峰造极的地步，闻名国内外，雕刻题材有花鸟、虫鱼、云龙、丹凤、蝠鼠、山水、人物等。清代端砚的作坊有玉铨斋、绿石斋等，均在端州城内；著名端砚艺人有善刻云龙的黄纯甫","path":"places/duanzhou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"端州是 B 维度下端砚产地与作坊的城市条目；砚种、石品与雕工归 terms/duan-yan.md。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:dunhuang-mogao-ku","title":"敦煌莫高窟（Mogao Grottoes）","name_en":"Mogao Grottoes","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["石窟寺","北朝","壁画","塑像","窟檐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"敦煌莫高窟位于甘肃敦煌。李立新记其壁画塑像经编号的有492个，与云冈、龙门、麦积山、响堂山、栖霞山同为魏晋南北朝重要石窟寺院；窟前建木构殿阁，一般分前室窟檐与主室佛窟，图2-13为敦煌莫高窟窟檐建筑。2016 版将其与云冈、龙门并列为北朝石刻艺术精品。","path":"places/dunhuang-mogao-ku.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"敦煌莫高窟是 B 维度下石窟寺建筑与壁画塑像条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:erlitou-site","title":"二里头遗址（Erlitou Site）","name_en":"Erlitou Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["夏代","商代早期","青铜时代","宫殿遗址","铸铜遗址"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"二里头遗址位于河南偃师，是二里头文化中范围最大、遗物最丰富、最具代表性的一处，文化命名即由此而来。六册来源都把它当作中国青铜时代开端的实物依据，理由集中在三点：出现了中国最早的宫殿建筑，发现了铸铜作坊（陶范、坩埚、铜渣），出土了最早的青铜容器。但六册对它的**年代与朝代归属给出三种互不相容的定性**——夏代晚期（高丰、夏燕靖两版）、夏文化但存疑（田自秉）、商代早期（赵农）——本 KU 三种并列，不","path":"places/erlitou-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"二里头遗址是 B 维度下中国青铜时代起点的遗址锚点：最早的青铜容器、最早的宫殿建筑、最早的铸铜作坊都在此汇合。遗址的年代归属争议同时构成 E 维度“何为中国文明开端”的叙述分歧。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:famen-si-digong","title":"法门寺塔基地宫（Crypt of the Famen Temple Pagoda）","name_en":"Crypt of the Famen Temple Pagoda","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["唐代","法门寺","扶风","曼荼罗","秘色瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"法门寺塔基地宫位于陕西法门寺，是唐代佛塔塔基地宫。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》两处集中讨论：其一以地宫的实物与放置程序说明汉化密宗曼荼罗形式，并分析八重宝函、捧真身菩萨莲花底座、鎏金卧龟莲花纹朵带五足银熏炉、鎏金飞鸿球路纹银笼子、鎏金茶罗子与贴花盘口琉璃瓶；其二记地宫出土20件伊斯兰玻璃器，并以描金刻花蓝玻璃盘（图5-14）为例，说明唐代玻璃器所受萨珊波斯风格影响。来源另记1987年地宫发现13件“","path":"places/famen-si-digong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"法门寺塔基地宫是 B 维度下唐代佛教造物、金银器与玻璃器条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:fenghao","title":"丰镐（Fenghao）","name_en":"Fenghao","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["西周","丰京","镐京","宗周","双子都城"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"丰镐是西周都城，由周文王所建丰京与周武王所建镐京合称，在今西安与咸阳之间：丰京在沣河西、镐京在沣河东。夏燕靖称其为“我国古代第一个双子都城”，记西周建都并非只在镐京一地，而是“连同丰镐一起，建都历时 289 年”。镐京又称宗周，周平王迁洛后改称西都。\n\n遗址分两片：丰镐遗址在沣河西岸的客省庄、马王村、张家坡、大原村、曹家寨、新旺村、冯村一带；镐京遗址在沣河东岸的落水村、泉北村、花园村、普渡村、斗门","path":"places/fenghao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"丰镐是 D 维度下西周双子都城与城制等级的条目；沣河两岸的遗址分布与城墙做法属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:fuhao-tomb","title":"妇好墓（Tomb of Fu Hao）","name_en":"Tomb of Fu Hao","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["商代","殷墟","青铜器","玉器","治玉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"妇好墓位于安阳殷墟。出土商代铜铲7件，其中有装饰性铲与实用青铜铲；所出双虎食人青铜钺重达9公斤，是已出土青铜钺中最重者。墓中纺织品遗物表明当时已有简单提花器具和羊毛纤维织物；陪葬饰物仅玉器就有426件，含头饰、腕饰、坠饰、项链等。2016 版记墓中出4件以鸟兽浮雕和圆雕为主要装饰的酒器——铜鸮尊、偶方彝、圈足觥，标志青铜工艺与设计达到新高峰。\n\n李立新《中国设计艺术史论》则记殷墟妇好墓出土755件","path":"places/fuhao-tomb.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"妇好墓是 B 维度下商代青铜、玉器与纺织造物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:fushun-daguantun-yao","title":"抚顺大官屯窑（Fushun Daguantun Kiln）","name_en":"Fushun Daguantun Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["金代","抚顺","大官屯","胎质粗糙","四系"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"抚顺大官屯窑是金代前期陶瓷生产地之一，位于辽宁抚顺。田自秉把金代陶瓷分为两期：迁都燕京以前在东北地区生产的陶瓷为前期，迁都燕京以后管辖北方广大地区（河北、陕西、河南、安徽等）生产的陶瓷为后期。前期陶瓷生产地有辽宁抚顺大官屯窑和辽阳江官屯窑，这些窑也是在辽代窑址的基础上发展起来的。但早期陶瓷生产胎质粗糙、釉色不匀、装饰很少，多实用器皿；器物多附有双系、三系或四系，这也是金瓷早期的一个特点，和女真族的","path":"places/fushun-daguantun-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"抚顺大官屯窑是 B 维度下金代前期陶瓷生产地条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:gansu-qingyang","title":"甘肃庆阳（Qingyang, Gansu）","name_en":"Qingyang, Gansu","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["旧石器时代","石核","石片","桑志华"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"甘肃庆阳是李立新《中国设计艺术史论》举出的中国早期旧石器发现地点。1920年，法国古生物学家桑志华在甘肃庆阳找到一件石核和两件石片，这两件（组）标本发现于黄土底部的砾石层中。来源用它论证中国旧石器同样以砾石为主要原料。\n\n来源只给发现年份、发现者、器物数量与地层位置，未给具体遗址名、经纬度、共存动物群与后续研究。本条按“发现地点”登记，不冒充正式命名的考古遗址。","path":"places/gansu-qingyang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"甘肃庆阳是 B 维度下旧石器发现地点条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:gaocheng-taixicun-site","title":"藁城台西村商代遗址（Gaocheng Taixicun Site）","name_en":"Gaocheng Taixicun Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["商代","漆器","镶嵌","金箔","河北藁城"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"藁城台西村商代遗址位于河北藁城。1973 年，遗址发现几十片漆器残片：木胎都已腐烂，但仍可看出盘、盒等造型；漆片红地黑花，装饰饕餮纹、夔纹、蕉叶纹、回纹等，基本和青铜器相似；有的在花纹中间镶嵌绿松石，或贴以金箔（后来称为平脱），金箔厚不到 0.1 厘米。田自秉据此判断当时已有卓越的制漆水平与相应发展的镶嵌装饰技术。同址商墓 1972 年出土铁刃铜钺，该事实已由 `procedures/ye-tie","path":"places/gaocheng-taixicun-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"藁城台西村遗址是 B 维度下商代漆器镶嵌与贴金箔工艺的关键实物落点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:gaoyang","title":"高阳（Gaoyang）","name_en":"Gaoyang","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["民国","抗日战争","解放区","高阳","棉纺织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"高阳是河北（来源另称冀中）著名的棉纺织地区，染织工艺相当发达。田自秉记：自抗战开始后，敌占区遭受日寇的蹂躏，国民党统治区则民不聊生；抗战胜利后，又由于国民党接收大员的无情搜刮、官僚资本的高度垄断，工艺美术生产几乎已陷入山穷水尽的绝境。如河北高阳、山东潍县，原是著名的棉纺织地区，染织工艺相当发达，此时已完全停产。来源另记解放区大生产运动开展以后，冀中的高阳成了纺织中心，几乎“家家纺纱，村村织布”。","path":"places/gaoyang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"高阳是 D 维度下近现代棉纺织产地的兴衰条目，其织造工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:gongyi-shiku-si","title":"巩义石窟寺（Gongyi Grottoes Temple）","name_en":"Gongyi Grottoes Temple","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["石窟寺","北魏","东魏","北齐","隋唐"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"巩义石窟寺位于河南巩义市城东北邙山南麓，为北魏时期开凿，其后东魏、北齐至隋唐时期不断修凿建构，造像风格受龙门石窟的影响。赵农把它列在“其他石窟”一节，与河北南北响堂山、辽宁义县万佛堂、南京栖霞山千佛崖并列，作为丝绸之路上新疆、甘肃石窟带之外的补充。\n\n来源对该寺只有两句：位置与始凿朝代、续凿朝代与风格来源。窟龛数量、规模、平面形制、造像题材均未记，本条只登记来源所记，不作推补。","path":"places/gongyi-shiku-si.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"巩义石窟寺是 B 维度下北朝石窟寺谱系中的次级样本，其续凿序列与风格来源触及 D 维度的营造组织。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:guangzhou-qin-han-zaochuan-gongchang-yizhi","title":"广州秦汉造船工场遗址（Guangzhou Qin-Han Shipyard Site）","name_en":"Guangzhou Qin-Han Shipyard Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["秦代","造船工场","船台","滑道","广州"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"广州秦汉造船工场遗址在广州市中山四路，1974 年冬发现。来源两处均记此事：一处称“有学者认为，广州发掘的一处遗址是秦汉时的造船工场”，另一处知识链接以“秦汉造船业遗址”为题，直接称“发现了一处规模很大的秦代造船工场遗址”。遗址有 3 个造船平台，船台与滑道相结合，来源评价为“在当时已是相当先进”。\n\n两处对可造船体的分析不一致：一处称可造宽 8 米、长 30 米、载重 60 吨的船舶；另一处称可","path":"places/guangzhou-qin-han-zaochuan-gongchang-yizhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下秦汉造船工场遗址的实物落点，其军事与海外交通背景属 D 维度。遗址性质尚有争议，confidence 不高于 medium。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:guangzhou","title":"广州（Guangzhou / Canton）","name_en":"Guangzhou","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["汉代","明代","清代","近代","广州"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"广州在夏燕靖《中国艺术设计史（升级版）》中是贯穿汉、明、清、近代四段的一条城市线索。它最集中的定位在贸易瓷一节：“广州（Canton）因其便利的海外交通与卓越的贸易成就，17 世纪以来一直都是中西文化物质交流的重要港口与通商口岸。无论是在‘西学东渐’还是‘东风西渐’的潮流中，广州一直充当着先锋的角色。”\n\n来源据此把广州列为设计史上西式影响的最早入口：“西洋文化最先在广州口岸与澳门为人们所认识与接","path":"places/guangzhou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"广州是 D 维度下自汉至近代的通商口岸与外来设计影响条目；汉代船模、明代造船、外销瓷与广式家具的造物面属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:han-chang-an","title":"汉长安城（Han Chang'an）","name_en":"Han Chang'an","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["西汉","都城","未央宫","长安九市","夯土板筑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汉长安城是西汉都城，在今陕西西安。赵农记其背依渭水、南临秦岭、雄踞关中，城墙为夯土板筑技术，周长 25 公里；城内纵横巷陌、略呈方正，长安九市经济活动发达，以“东市”“西市”最为著名。田自秉另记少府属东织室、西织室设于长安，并给两织室的罢省年表与耗费。\n\n本条同时登记该城在东汉至北周的命运：东汉时以京兆府名义维持，董卓之乱后不复西汉繁荣；永嘉之乱时“户不盈百”；后赵以 16 万人重修未央宫和长安城","path":"places/han-chang-an.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉长安城是 D 维度下西汉都城市场制度、官营织室与城制条目；夯土板筑与未央宫木构属 B 维度的营造技术。本条同时登记东汉至北周该城的衰落与重修，作为都城生命周期的样本。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:hejiacun-jiaocang","title":"何家村窖藏（Hejiacun Hoard）","name_en":"Hejiacun Hoard","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["唐代","金银器","窖藏","何家村","银熏球"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"何家村窖藏是唐代金银器的埋藏地点，在陕西西安。1970 年 10 月出土，夏燕靖 2016 记该窖藏出土金银器 270 件，赵农则以《刻花金碗》《刻花银碗》《金花银碗》《鎏金舞马衔杯银壶》《金花八曲银杯》《金花鹦鹉提梁银罐》《镂空银熏球》七件为例，称其“精美绝伦，令人叹为观止”。\n\n两册的取材角度不同：赵农取单件器物的构造与工艺细节（尤其银熏球的机环结构、舞马银壶的皮囊壶型），夏燕靖 2016 取","path":"places/hejiacun-jiaocang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"何家村窖藏是 B 维度下唐代金银器实物群与工艺技术条目；其萨珊波斯与契丹造型渊源接到 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:helin","title":"和林（Karakorum）","name_en":"Karakorum","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["蒙古国","成吉思汗","万安宫","鄂尔浑河","回鹘古城"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"和林是蒙古国都，在鄂尔浑河上游东岸，建于回鹘古城和林的基础之上。赵农记成吉思汗战胜西夏、金等国之后，按汉族城市的规模修建此城，主要建筑为大汗宫殿万安宫；参与建筑的除汉族和西域工匠外，还有从巴黎掳来的一部分工匠。\n\n来源只有三句话，但其信息结构在六册中很特殊：它同时给出了城址的旧基础（回鹘古城）、规划范式（汉族城市规模）、核心建筑（万安宫）与工匠来源（汉族、西域、巴黎）四项，是六册中唯一把欧洲工匠列","path":"places/helin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"和林是 D 维度下蒙古国都城与宫殿制度条目；汉族、西域与巴黎工匠同场施工的记载接到 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:hemudu-site","title":"河姆渡遗址（Hemudu Site）","name_en":"Hemudu Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["新石器时代","河姆渡文化","干栏式建筑","稻作农业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"河姆渡遗址在浙江余姚，是长江下游新石器时代的重要聚落遗址，距今约 7000 年。六册来源主要用它论证四件事：干栏式木构建筑与榫卯、稻作农业的起源地位、陶器与骨器工艺、以及中国已知最早的漆器。本 KU 合并登记这四条论述线。","path":"places/hemudu-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"河姆渡遗址是 B 维度下长江下游新石器时代木构建筑、稻作与漆器起源的综合锚点，与黄河流域半坡构成南北对照。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:houma-zhutong-site","title":"侯马周代铸铜遗址（Houma Bronze Foundry Site）","name_en":"Houma Bronze Foundry Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["春秋战国","晋国","铸铜","母范","分模分范"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"侯马周代铸铜遗址位于山西侯马晋国都城遗址，是六册中分工证据最具体的铸铜作坊。田自秉据残铜模记产品专门化（专作食器、带钩、钱币）与多工种协作，并记工师、巫、工三级管理；高丰据附件单独母范记分模分范、分铸嵌入、分铸焊接与方模印纹法，并推断作坊内存在“流水线”式分工。两册一记产品分工、一记工序分工，方向互补，本条并列登记。","path":"places/houma-zhutong-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"侯马铸铜遗址是 B 维度下春秋战国分模分范与产品专门化的作坊锚点；工师、巫、工三级管理落在 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:huating-mudi","title":"花厅墓地（Huating Cemetery）","name_en":"Huating Cemetery","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["大汶口文化","良渚文化","玉器","文化交流","新石器时代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花厅墓地位于江苏新沂，是著名的大汶口文化墓地，处于大汶口文化与良渚文化的交界处。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》记考古发掘发现许多良渚文化输入品：在陶器、石器、玉器、彩绘木器中，陶器和玉器均具良渚文化因素；陶器中的 T 字形足鼎、双鼻壶、宽把带流杯、饰瓦楞纹或竹节纹的豆和圈足罐等，就是良渚文化的器物；其余斧、钺、锛、琮、锥形器、琮形管、璜、环、珠、管、指环、耳坠等500余件玉器与良渚所产也完全相同。\n\n","path":"places/huating-mudi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花厅墓地是 B 维度下新石器文化交流与器物输入条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:huixian-zhanguo-mudi","title":"辉县战国墓地（Huixian Warring States Cemetery）","name_en":"Huixian Warring States Cemetery","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["战国","魏国","刻纹铜鉴","宴乐射猎","雕金镶玉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"辉县战国墓地位于河南辉县，是田自秉书中战国工艺材料最集中的一处墓地：赵固镇 1950—1953 年发掘的墓中出土刻纹铜鉴，鉴壁线刻宴乐射猎、鸟兽草木，线条细如发丝；固围村 1953 年出土雕金镶玉银带钩，包金镶嵌、浮雕蟠龙与鹦鹉。此外来源还记该地出土战国大玉璜、彩绘陶，以及固围村的镂花银片与银制小人。\n\n本条**不含汲县山彪镇**。山彪镇水陆攻战纹鉴在六册中与辉县材料同段并出，但分属两地，来源未把","path":"places/huixian-zhanguo-mudi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"辉县战国墓地是 B 维度下战国刻纹铜器、错金银镶嵌与彩绘陶的墓葬落点；带钩的等级与服饰制度属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:huoqubing-mu","title":"霍去病墓（Tomb of Huo Qubing）","name_en":"Tomb of Huo Qubing","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["西汉","石雕","马踏匈奴","循石造型","陕西兴平"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"霍去病墓位于陕西兴平，是西汉名将霍去病的墓葬，属茂陵陪葬墓。田自秉记墓上及墓区石雕一组：石人、石鼠、卧虎、卧马、卧牛、奔马、马踏匈奴、猩猩抱熊、怪兽吞羊、石鱼，共十类。其制法为圆雕，利用石料的自然形状，只在关键处寥寥数笔，风格质朴古拙。","path":"places/huoqubing-mu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"霍去病墓是 B 维度下西汉大型石雕循石造型的代表，石雕依石料自然形状略加雕凿。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:huoshaogou-site","title":"火烧沟遗址（Huoshaogou Site）","name_en":"Huoshaogou Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["新石器时代","象生器","人形罐","彩陶"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"火烧沟遗址位于甘肃玉门。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》以该遗址出土的人形罐为例，说明新石器中后期“象生器”的出现：罐口仍作双肩耳短领，罐底座设计成象形的双足，整体形成鼓腹站立的人形。来源借此说明象生器并非突然出现，而是在几何化器物传统中局部生出象生形。\n\n来源只给器形描述，未给遗址年代、文化归属、墓葬或房址背景、器物尺寸与现藏地。本条只登记该遗址与这件人形罐，不据来源外材料补写四坝文化等内容。","path":"places/huoshaogou-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"火烧沟遗址是 B 维度下新石器象生陶器条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:jian-kiln","title":"建窑（Jian Kiln）","name_en":"Jian Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["宋代","黑釉","兔毫","油滴","鹧鸪斑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"建窑是宋代黑釉瓷窑。赵农记其在福建建阳，建阳为南宋富裕之地，以黑瓷著名、以碗盏为主，利用特殊温度烧制使铁质结晶成油滴圆纹点或细兔毫状条纹，胎体紫黑、釉色厚重，宋人喜用建窑兔毫盏饮茶品茗。田自秉记其在福建建瓯、水吉一带，黑釉中铁成分因烧制火度不同形成兔毫、鹧鸪斑、油滴等褐色斑纹；因宋徽宗及大臣蔡襄提倡黑瓷饮茶而受重视，产品多碗盏茶具，碗底刻“供御”“进盏”“才”等字样，为贡品。","path":"places/jian-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"建窑是 B 维度下宋代黑釉瓷窑与茶器条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:jiangling-chumuqun","title":"江陵楚墓群（Jiangling Chu Tombs）","name_en":"Jiangling Chu Tombs","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["战国","春秋","楚国","漆器","漆座屏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"江陵楚墓群位于湖北江陵（今荆州），是战国楚国都城郢附近的墓葬区。田自秉记其自 1960 年代至 1980 年代持续发掘：望山一号墓 1965 年、拍马山墓 1972—1973 年、马山砖厂一号墓 1982 年 1 月、天星观墓 1978 年（出器物 2500 多件）、雨台山墓 1980 年。这批墓葬以漆器最富特色，彩绘漆座屏、漆双凤悬鼓、彩绘鹿鼓、漆鸳鸯形豆与漆蛋形杯均出于此。\n\n本条是**墓群层","path":"places/jiangling-chumuqun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"江陵楚墓群是 B 维度下战国楚国漆器造型与数量的墓葬集合，尤以漆座屏、鹿鼓、鸳鸯形豆等异形器著称。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:jiangling-fenghuangshan-qinmu","title":"江陵凤凰山秦墓（Jiangling Fenghuangshan Qin Tomb）","name_en":"Jiangling Fenghuangshan Qin Tomb","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["秦代","漆绘","木梳","木篦","人物画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"江陵凤凰山秦墓位于湖北江陵，1975 年出土木梳、木篦各一件。两器上部作弧形，正反两面以黑漆勾线、红黄敷彩绘人物。木梳正面绘宴饮：两人席地对坐，两侍女梳髻着裙、足穿尖头鞋；反面绘歌舞：舞女、歌女与男子奏乐。木篦正面绘送别，反面绘相扑。田自秉另给插图 2-①、2-② 两幅。\n\n本条是六册中**以梳篦为画面载体**的唯一材料。秦代漆器制度见 `places/shuihudi-qinmu.md`，本条不","path":"places/jiangling-fenghuangshan-qinmu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"江陵凤凰山秦墓是 B 维度下秦代漆绘人物图像最具体的单件器物落点，木梳木篦正反两面分绘宴饮、歌舞、送别、相扑四景。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:jiangling-mashan-yihao-chumu","title":"江陵马山一号楚墓（Mashan Tomb No. 1 at Jiangling）","name_en":"Mashan Tomb No. 1 at Jiangling","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["战国","楚墓","动物纹样","人物纹样","神怪观念"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"江陵马山一号楚墓位于湖北江陵，是战国楚墓。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》在讨论“与天地人有关的神怪观念”时，把该墓中的动物、人物纹样与长沙子弹库战国帛书神怪图纹、大量青铜器纹饰并列，作为反映天神、地祇、人鬼观念的实物材料。\n\n来源只列墓名与纹样类别，未给墓葬年代、墓主、棺椁结构、织物或漆器细节。本条按“纹样所出的墓葬”登记，不把马山一号墓的丝织品研究史与神怪图像讨论混为一体。","path":"places/jiangling-mashan-yihao-chumu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"江陵马山一号楚墓是 B 维度下战国楚墓纹样条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:jiangzhai-site","title":"姜寨遗址（Jiangzhai Site）","name_en":"Jiangzhai Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["仰韶文化","新石器时代","聚落布局","黄铜片","编织席印痕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"姜寨遗址位于陕西临潼，属新石器时代仰韶文化。它在本库的三册来源中都不是以“遗址本体”被叙述，而是各自被调用为一条论据：赵农用它证明仰韶聚落的圆形向心布局与早期书写工具，李立新用它证明纹饰已进入造物、以及中国最早的黄铜制品，夏燕靖（2016）用它证明编织席纹在陶器上的留存。因此本 KU 的价值在于**同一遗址被三条不同论证路径征用**这一事实本身。","path":"places/jiangzhai-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"姜寨遗址是 B 维度下新石器时代聚落布局、编织与早期冶铜证据的样本点，其在设计史叙述中的功能是证明纹饰与向心布局先于青铜时代出现。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:jiaxing-xitang-yanghui","title":"嘉兴西塘扬汇（Xitang Yanghui, Jiaxing）","name_en":"Xitang Yanghui, Jiaxing","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["元代","嘉兴","髹漆","雕漆","剔红"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"嘉兴西塘扬汇位于元代嘉兴府城东北，是元代最著名的漆器产地与髹漆设计中心。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》记元代民间漆器产地有杭州、温州、福州、庐陵、嘉兴等，其中嘉兴最为著名，其漆器业中心即在西塘扬汇；靖康之乱后髹漆工匠随宋南迁，西塘扬汇成为著名漆器产地。元代雕漆名家有张成、杨茂、彭君宝三人。《格古要论》称：“元朝嘉兴府西塘扬汇有张成、杨茂者，剔红最得名。”\n\n来源以张成剔红栀子花圆盘、剔犀漆盒，杨茂剔红","path":"places/jiaxing-xitang-yanghui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"嘉兴西塘扬汇是 B 维度下元代髹漆产地与雕漆工艺条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:jingdezhen-kiln","title":"景德镇窑（Jingdezhen Kiln）","name_en":"Jingdezhen Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["青白瓷","影青","粉定","覆烧","浮梁瓷局"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"景德镇窑是六册共同承认的宋代以来最重要的瓷窑，也是本库中少数需要与“地名”分开建条的窑口：地名条记建制、人口、产量与产业形态，本条只记窑场、釉色、装饰、窑具与款识。六册对它的技术定位相当一致——北宋中期创烧青白瓷（影青），南宋接受定窑的支圈覆烧，元代设浮梁瓷局并以枢府、太禧铭记进御器，元后期青花成熟，明清成为官窑与民窑并行的全国制瓷中心。**本 KU 记录的分歧集中在两处**：一是“枢府”“太禧”","path":"places/jingdezhen-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"景德镇窑是 B 维度下青白瓷—影青—青花—釉里红这条釉色与彩绘技术线的枢纽，浮梁瓷局与枢府铭记又把它接到 D 维度的官营手工业，钴料进口与外销接到 E 维度。地名与产业形态归 places/jingdezhen.md。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:jingdezhen","title":"景德镇（Jingdezhen）","name_en":"Jingdezhen","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["瓷都","江西","御器厂","浮梁瓷局","青花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"景德镇在六册来源中的身份不是一个窑口，而是一座因瓷而立的城市：它由镇而“瓷都”，由官监民烧而御器厂，再而近代瓷业公司、国营瓷厂与今日的“地方传统工业和城市的象征”。正因为如此，六册对它的叙述重心各不相同——高丰重官窑建制与近代转型，田自秉重产量与工匠规模，夏燕靖两版重工艺与“瓷都／陶都”格局，赵农重得名经过与仿定渊源，李立新重手工工场与战争破坏。**本 KU 记录的核心分歧有三处**：得名的具体说","path":"places/jingdezhen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"景德镇是 D 维度下“官监民烧—御器厂—手工工场—近代瓷业公司—国营瓷厂”这条生产组织链条的完整样本，其瓷土与窑炉条件落在 B 维度，外销与外来钴料落在 E 维度。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:jingshan","title":"景山（Jingshan）","name_en":"Jingshan","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["明清","北京","万岁山","煤山","万春亭"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"景山在紫禁城北面，是北京城中心的制高点。它是利用挖浚筒子河及西苑诸湖池的泥土堆积而成的人工山，又称万岁山，高约 50 米；相传山中有煤堆，故也称煤山；又有镇压城池以求永固之意，故亦称镇山。乾隆年间在山上设置五座重檐亭，成为紫禁城的屏障，其中万春亭为三重檐的四角攒尖方亭，上铺黄色琉璃瓦。\n\n在赵农的叙述里，景山不是一个孤立的景点，而是明清北京城整体设计的一环：它由城内水利工程的弃土堆成，又反过来充当","path":"places/jingshan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"景山是 D 维度下明清北京城制与皇家园林条目（作为紫禁城的屏障与全城制高点）；土方工程与亭式属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:jizhou-kiln","title":"吉州窑（Jizhou Kiln）","name_en":"Jizhou Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["宋代","民窑","黑釉","玳瑁釉","剪纸贴花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"吉州窑在江西吉安永和镇，是宋代著名民窑，以黑釉瓷著称。使用剔花、印花、洒釉、贴花等方法，吸收民间剪纸纹饰，将剪纸纹样贴印在胎质上，形成新的制瓷装饰手法；烧制出称为“玳瑁釉”的黑褐色釉瓷。田自秉记其与北方磁州窑并称两大民窑体系，遗址面积20余亩、较大瓷片堆积18处。","path":"places/jizhou-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"吉州窑是 B 维度下宋代民窑与黑釉装饰工艺条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:jun-kiln","title":"钧窑（Jun Kiln）","name_en":"Jun Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["宋代","窑变","铜红釉","五大名窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"钧窑是宋代以铜红釉窑变为特征的瓷窑，窑址在河南禹县。六册来源在“钧瓷是否属于青瓷系统”上有实质分歧：高丰主张它是独立的“窑变花瓷”，田自秉、赵农仍归青瓷系统。本 KU 并存两说。","path":"places/jun-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"钧窑是 B 维度下宋代铜红釉窑变工艺的窑口锚点，其“是否属于青瓷系统”的归类分歧是陶瓷分类标准的样本。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:junshan-yao","title":"均山窑（Junshan Kiln）","name_en":"Junshan Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["六朝","青瓷","宜兴","均山","还原焰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"均山窑是江苏宜兴均山一带的六朝青瓷窑址群。田自秉记：1959 年在江苏宜兴均山发现了三处六朝青瓷窑；1975 年又在宜兴的大松园、六十头、马屁股等处发现了六朝时期的青瓷窑群。据分析，烧制温度为 1200℃ 左右，用还原焰烧成；品种有盘口壶、双系罐、盆、洗、钵等。来源另称江西丰城、四川成都、福建福州、广东广州也都有青瓷窑址。","path":"places/junshan-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"均山窑是 B 维度下六朝青瓷窑址群条目；窑炉属 terms/longyao.md。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:kaifeng","title":"开封（Kaifeng）","name_en":"Kaifeng","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["北宋","东京","三重城","四水贯都","夜市"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"开封是北宋首都，称东京开封府，与西京洛阳、南京应天府（商丘）、北京大名府（大名）相对应。它在战国时为魏国都城大梁，因临汴河而兴，隋代大运河开凿后重新繁荣，隋唐为汴州，五代后梁设开封府。北宋时城市扩大至周围 50 余里，街市有 160 行、行户 6400 多户，取消夜禁后出现夜市，成为当时最大的商业交易中心。\n\n开封在城制史上的位置由赵农点明：御道成为全城中轴、大内设在城市中心，这一格局不同于隋唐以","path":"places/kaifeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"开封是 D 维度下北宋都城制度、市场管理与城市商业条目；三重城与四水贯都的工程面、开封官窑的窑业面属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:kongwangshan-moya-zaoxiang","title":"孔望山摩崖造像（Kongwangshan Cliff Carvings）","name_en":"Kongwangshan Cliff Carvings","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["东汉","佛教艺术","摩崖造像","佛教传入"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"孔望山摩崖造像位于江苏连云港。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》在讨论佛教传入与造物的关系时，把连云港孔望山摩崖造像与山东沂南东汉画像石墓八角擎天柱佛像、四川彭山崖墓一佛二菩萨像并列，作为东汉时期佛教艺术品的发现，并称佛教艺术品的发现标志着佛教的传入。\n\n来源只有一句列举，未给造像年代、数量、题材、尺寸、崖面布局与研究史。本条按“佛教造像地点”登记，不展开孔望山造像是否为中国最早佛教造像的学术争论。","path":"places/kongwangshan-moya-zaoxiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"孔望山摩崖造像为 E 维度下佛教传入与造像艺术条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:lelang","title":"乐浪（Lelang）","name_en":"Lelang","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["汉代","乐浪郡","漆器铭文","王盱墓","玳瑁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"乐浪是汉代乐浪郡，郡治在朝鲜平壤附近，是六册中汉代漆器铭文最集中的出土地。1932 年在平壤附近出土的乐浪汉代漆器上多见铭文，记地点、年月、分工与工官；铭文年代约当公元前 85 年至前 69 年。乐浪王盱墓另出罗、绢、缅等丝织品，并出大量漆器；王盱为乐浪太守属下六百石官吏。此外乐浪还出玳瑁小盒，以玳瑁片镶嵌漆器。\n\n本条只记**地点、年代与器物群**。漆器铭文所见的十一工种分工与职掌另见 `pro","path":"places/lelang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"乐浪是 B 维度下汉代漆器铭文与玳瑁镶嵌的出土落点；漆器十一工种的分工职掌归 procedures/han-dai-qiqi-zhizuo-fengong.md，本条只记地点、年代与器物群。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:liangchengzhen-site","title":"两城镇遗址（Liangchengzhen Site）","name_en":"Liangchengzhen Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["新石器时代","龙山文化","玉器","玉锛","石器"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"两城镇遗址位于山东日照，属龙山文化。田自秉在两处提到它：一处把它与龙山文化灵宝并列为石器石材选择的例证；一处记遗址中曾发现成坑的半成品玉材，其中一件玉锛厚 0.2～0.5 厘米，顶端刻着极为精细的花纹。六册中只有田自秉提到该遗址，且两处都是一句话级的材料，来源未给遗址面积、地层与发掘经过。","path":"places/liangchengzhen-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"两城镇遗址是 B 维度下龙山文化玉器半成品与石器石材选择的一处实物落点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:liangzhu-gucheng","title":"良渚古城（Liangzhu City Site）","name_en":"Liangzhu City Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["良渚文化","史前城址","城墙","中华第一城","新石器时代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"良渚古城是本册讨论良渚文化时给出的城址材料。原文记：对良渚文化遗址全貌的考察发现这一区域有座古城，东西长约 1500—1700 米、南北长约 1800—1900 米，略呈圆角长方形，正南北方向；城墙部分地段残高 4 米多，做法考究，底部先垫石块、宽度达 40—60 米，上面堆筑纯净的黄土夯实。原文称其为目前所发现的新石器时代我国最大城址，堪称“中华第一城”，年代上限很可能是公元前 2600—前 2","path":"places/liangzhu-gucheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度史前城址与夯筑技术的锚点。原文只给平面尺度与城墙做法，未涉及城内功能分区，故不构成绩能或规划制度判断。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:liling","title":"醴陵（Liling）","name_en":"Liling","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["釉下彩","湖南","近现代","湘瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"醴陵是湖南的陶瓷产地，位于湖南东部渌水之滨，以釉下彩著名，并凭借自身优势成为南方著名的陶瓷工业重镇。赵农将其列为现代中国陶瓷业的重要基地之一；田自秉记其为湘瓷的代表，解放前釉下彩技艺几乎失传、色料仅5种，解放后研制新色料并能烧100多种复色。","path":"places/liling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"醴陵是 B 维度下近现代釉下彩瓷产区条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:linan","title":"临安（Lin'an / Hangzhou）","name_en":"Lin'an (Hangzhou)","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["南宋","临安","杭州","西湖","御道"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"临安即杭州，南宋行在。它地处钱塘江杭州湾、京杭大运河最南端，五代吴越国已建都于此（称西府）；靖康之变后宋高宗赵构南渡立国，称临安，取“临时安居”之意，不忘国耻而期盼回师中原。城市建于江湖之间的南北狭长地带，宫城在城南凤凰山东麓，御道在和宁门外，御道两边成为商业中心，南宋后期人口 120 多万。\n\n在赵农的叙述里，临安是开封的南方对应物：商业经营“效仿开封”，出现早市与夜市；瓦舍 24 所与开封 5","path":"places/linan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"临安是 D 维度下南宋行在的城市格局、御道商业与市场制度条目；西湖水利与房屋形制属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:linzi","title":"临淄（Linzi）","name_en":"Linzi","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["春秋战国","齐国都城","城制","官营手工业","纺织贸易"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"临淄是春秋战国时期齐国都城（今山东淄博），战国时形成大城、小城二城制。小城北部为宫殿区、南部为官营手工业作坊区（青铜、冶铁、铸钱）；大城北部为平民手工业作坊。2016 版另记其布帛、衣物买卖发达，是纺织贸易与官府织造作坊集中的城市。田自秉另记汉代齐郡临淄以染织著称、设服官，并以《论衡》“齐郡世刺绣，恒女无不能；襄邑俗织锦，钝妇无不巧”把临淄的刺绣与襄邑的织锦对举。","path":"places/linzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"临淄是 D 维度下先秦都城城制、手工业分区与汉代齐郡官营纺织的条目；刺绣与织锦技艺属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:liuyang","title":"浏阳（Liuyang）","name_en":"Liuyang","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["清代","浏阳","菊花石","永和镇","方解石"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"浏阳是湖南菊花石的产地。田自秉记：菊花石是湖南浏阳的特产，生长在浏阳永和镇浏阳河一带，以河底的石质最佳。菊花石系一种方解石，石质中有一种球形放射状的集合体，如菊花花朵，故名。菊花形有绣球菊、竹叶菊、蟹爪菊、金钱菊、蒲叶菊等多种。乾隆时期开始用它作为雕刻材料，制作笔筒、水池等文具用品；清末发展为花屏、桌面等家具装饰。著名艺人有欧锡潘、程维达等。","path":"places/liuyang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"浏阳是 B 维度下清代菊花石雕产地条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:longmen-grottoes","title":"龙门石窟（Longmen Grottoes）","name_en":"Longmen Grottoes","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["石窟寺","北魏","唐代","佛教艺术","奉先寺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙门石窟位于河南洛阳伊水两岸，东为香山，西为龙门山，北魏迁都洛阳后开凿，历东魏、北齐、隋、唐续凿，是六册共同举出的中国石窟寺代表之一。它在设计史叙述中的功能随册而异：高丰把它与克孜尔、敦煌、云冈并列，作为佛教艺术进入造物纹样的时代标记；夏燕靖两版关注它的建筑与石刻纹饰（藻井莲花、卷草边饰）；赵农给出最完整的窟名、尺寸、功数与造像体系；田自秉把它放在石雕工艺与卷草纹的两条线索里；李立新则从“窟前木构","path":"places/longmen-grottoes.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙门石窟是 B 维度下石雕工艺、窟龛形制与宗教装饰纹样的最大实物群，其造像样式的犍陀罗渊源与中原化过程又落在 E 维度的跨文化互动；六册对它的取舍差异则构成 A 维度“设计史如何处理宗教美术”的样本。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:longquan-kiln","title":"龙泉窑（Longquan Kiln）","name_en":"Longquan Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["青瓷","粉青","梅子青","石灰碱釉","龙窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙泉窑是宋元两代南方青瓷的主干产区，也是六册共同用来论证“宋代青瓷最高成就”的窑口。它的技术标志是石灰碱釉与多次施釉所得的粉青、梅子青；它的经济标志是宋时出口最多的青瓷产地与元代成批外销；它的史学标志是与哥窑的纠缠——章生一、章生二的兄弟传说被三册同时引用，又被三册同时标为不可考。**本 KU 记录的分歧有三处**：创烧年代（北宋早期／五代／宋代）、元代窑址数量（一百数十处／约 150 处）与“龙","path":"places/longquan-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙泉窑是 B 维度下石灰碱釉与粉青、梅子青的技术代表，也是宋元外销瓷数量最大的青瓷产区（D 维度的市场与港口条件、E 维度的海外流通）。其与哥窑的关系又牵动“五大名窑”的构成。Theme/Topic 均未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:luoyang-cheng","title":"隋唐洛阳城（Sui-Tang Luoyang City）","name_en":"Sui-Tang Luoyang City","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["隋代","唐代","东都","宇文恺","应天门"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"隋唐洛阳城是隋唐时期的东都，起陪都作用，以便管理江南及山东诸地。赵农记其舍弃魏晋洛阳故城而西移至今日洛阳城址，并用《新唐书·地理志》“都城前直伊阙，后据邙山，左瀍右涧，洛水贯其中，以象河汉”说明选址与形胜：利用伊水两边的香山和龙门山为阙，背依邙山，洛水贯流城中。\n\n它的规划与长安相反：面积仅相当长安城的一半，宫城不在城市中心而在西北角，中轴线也不在中央。来源认为这可能是都城工程未能最后完成所致。西","path":"places/luoyang-cheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"隋唐洛阳城是 D 维度下陪都制度与非对称都城规划的条目；应天门、明堂的形制与尺度属 B 维度。汉魏洛阳故城另址，见 places/luoyang.md。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:luoyang","title":"洛阳（Luoyang）","name_en":"Luoyang","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["东周","魏晋","北魏","都城","金墉城"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"洛阳是东周以来的国都，也是魏晋时期与建康、长安并称的三大名城之一。赵农记其南临洛水、北依邙山、西据秦岭余脉熊耳山，东面朝向中原的广阔地带，可进可退，北部黄河漕运为社会经济发展提供保障。东汉末年董卓纵兵焚烧汉洛阳城后，魏晋在原址基础上重修并调整格局，尤其在西北隅修建城中之城金墉城；北魏建都后加以修建扩充，宫城位于城市中轴线的北部，形成左祖右社、官府外置的格局。\n\n田自秉另记洛阳作为**汉代彩绘陶的主","path":"places/luoyang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"洛阳是 D 维度下汉魏都城城制、防御系统、里坊制度与地方手工业的条目；城垣、护城河与宫城轴线属 B 维度，汉代彩绘陶与烧沟壶式亦属 B 维度。隋唐洛阳城另址另建，见 places/luoyang-cheng.md。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:maijishan-shiku","title":"麦积山石窟（Maijishan Grottoes）","name_en":"Maijishan Grottoes","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["石窟寺","后秦","北朝","泥塑","壁画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"麦积山石窟位于甘肃天水南 35 公里的秦岭余脉之中，山势巍峨，因形如民间麦垛而得名。天水为古秦州，传为“羲皇故里”，是丝绸之路必经之地，也是陕、甘与巴、蜀交通的交汇地。石窟开凿于十六国后秦时期，略晚于敦煌；现存窟龛 194 个、壁画 1000 多平方米，北朝作品占绝大多数。因岩石松软不便于雕刻，以泥塑和壁画为主，洞窟由栈道连接、环绕悬崖峭壁。\n\n来源对它的设计史意义有两条独立判断：一是材料决定形态","path":"places/maijishan-shiku.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"麦积山石窟是 B 维度下北朝石窟寺泥塑、壁画与栈道工程的条目；其作为佛教由西向东传播出口的位置属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:mancheng-hanmu","title":"满城汉墓（Mancheng Han Tombs）","name_en":"Mancheng Han Tombs","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["西汉","铜器","金银器","长信宫灯","博山炉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"满城汉墓是河北满城西汉中山靖王刘胜夫妇墓，出土长信宫灯、错金博山炉、长乐宫钟、错金银鸟篆文壶、单流银盒等，是汉代铜器与金银器工艺的重要出土地。李立新亦以长信宫灯为例。","path":"places/mancheng-hanmu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"满城汉墓是 B 维度下汉代铜器与金银器造物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:mawangdui-hanmu","title":"马王堆汉墓（Mawangdui Han Tombs）","name_en":"Mawangdui Han Tombs","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["西汉","漆器","丝织品","素纱禅衣","六博"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"马王堆汉墓是湖南长沙东郊的西汉墓葬群，1972—1974年发掘。高丰记1号墓出漆器184件、3号墓316件，合计500余件；1号墓出丝织品与服饰100多件（46幅、50余件衣物），并出素纱禅衣、双层九子奁、莞席、丝绸帷帐等，3号墓出龙纹漆几。田自秉记1号墓出基本完整的丝织品100多件，包括匹端单幅丝织物46段、成件衣服58件，被称为汉代“丝绸之库”；3号墓出全套六博博具，博局上有TLV规矩纹；同墓","path":"places/mawangdui-hanmu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"马王堆汉墓是 B 维度下西汉漆器与丝织造物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:miaodigou-site","title":"庙底沟遗址（Miaodigou Site）","name_en":"Miaodigou Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["新石器时代","仰韶文化","庙底沟类型","早期龙山","建筑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"庙底沟遗址位于河南三门峡。早期龙山文化（或称“庙底沟第二期文化”）即据该遗址的发现而确定，主要分布在豫西、晋南、关中一带。2016 版记其为仰韶文化庙底沟类型所在遗址，房屋墙上和屋内留有许多柱洞、垫以天然砾石和白石灰，并发现长达10多米的房基；庙底沟类型的尖底瓶被列为汲水器，马家窑文化上承庙底沟类型。","path":"places/miaodigou-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"庙底沟遗址是 B 维度下新石器时代建筑与陶器类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:minfeng-hanmu","title":"民丰汉墓（Minfeng Han Tombs）","name_en":"Minfeng Han Tombs","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["汉代","印花布","丝绣","刺绣","新疆民丰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"民丰汉墓位于新疆民丰，是六册中西域织物材料最集中的一处汉代墓葬。田自秉记三类材料：一是蓝白印花布残片两片，一片作三角格子纹并加圈点花边，一片作龙纹、鸟纹、棋格与人物；二是汉代丝绣品，色彩有大红、绛紫、茄酱、藕荷、古铜、绿蓝、翠蓝、湖蓝、香色、浅驼、黄等数十种；三是刺绣小件，有绣花镜袋、绣花粉袋、袜带与裤管边饰，花纹作卷草、如意与动物纹。","path":"places/minfeng-hanmu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"民丰汉墓是 B 维度下汉代西域印花、丝绣与刺绣三类织物工艺的墓葬落点。与 places/niya-site.md 的关系存疑，两条并列不合并。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:nanjing","title":"南京（Nanjing）","name_en":"Nanjing","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["六朝古都","建康","明初都城","琉璃窑","大报恩寺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南京是明初都城应天府所在，设琉璃窑72座并建大报恩寺琉璃塔；清末南洋劝业会会场设于南京丁家桥。赵农记其在1949年以前作为江南政治文化中心占据特殊地位，1928年民国政府定都并制定“首都计划”，但除中山陵、总统府大门、中央博物院等中西融合建筑外，缺乏规模和数量，尤其对普通民众生存环境缺乏必要改善；南京依山临水，80年代初出现金陵饭店等高层建筑，标志城市新格局。\n\n六朝一段原先未入本条：赵农在“魏晋","path":"places/nanjing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"南京是 D 维度下都城制度、博览会场与近代城市规划条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:nanyang-huaxiangshi-qu","title":"南阳画像石分布区（Nanyang Pictorial Stone Region）","name_en":"Nanyang Pictorial Stone Region","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["东汉","画像石","浅浮雕","剔地衬线","汉画馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南阳画像石分布区以河南南阳为中心，是东汉画像石最集中的地域之一。田自秉记其背景：东汉南阳经济文化发达，《盐铁论》称“宛周齐鲁，商遍天下，富冠海内”；南阳是光武帝刘秀故乡，号“南都”“帝乡”，厚葬成风，故画像石遗存极富，南阳博物馆藏 1000 多块并建汉画馆。技法上画像微凸、剔地衬线，即浅浮雕加线衬托，风格粗略豪放、简朴，动物性格与动态的刻画成就最高。来源另把南阳画像石分早、中、晚三期。\n\n本条是*","path":"places/nanyang-huaxiangshi-qu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"南阳画像石分布区是 B 维度下东汉画像石浅浮雕加线衬的地域性分布条目；南都帝乡的厚葬风气属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:niya-site","title":"尼雅遗址（Niya Site）","name_en":"Niya Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["东汉","腊缬棉布","佛教艺术","东西文化交流","尼雅"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"尼雅遗址位于新疆民丰。1959年该遗址出土一块东汉时期的腊缬棉布，蓝色印花，图案为一半身裸体人物像，来源称其“具明显的佛教艺术色彩”。有学者认为画中人物为希腊丰收女神或西亚女神伊什塔尔；从画面狮尾、角杯、葡萄、半裸和头后背光等文化因素看，是东西外来文化融合所形成的独自特色。图2-8 即此腊缬棉布。\n\n来源只给发现年份、织物工艺、图像描述与一种解释，未给织物尺寸、出土情境、染料检测与图像考释的完整论","path":"places/niya-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"尼雅遗址为 E 维度下东西造物交流与佛教艺术线索条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:olduvai-gorge","title":"奥杜韦峡谷（Olduvai Gorge）","name_en":"Olduvai Gorge","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["旧石器时代","砾石石器","砾石文化","坦桑尼亚"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"奥杜韦峡谷位于坦桑尼亚，是李立新《中国设计艺术史论》讨论砾石选材时举出的非洲旧石器遗址。来源称该地发现的距今200万年前最典型的石器工具也是选择砾石打制的；图1-3 标为“砾石砍斫器（奥杜韦文化）”。同段把这类以砾石为原料的石器传统称为“砾石文化”，并强调其产生并非突进而是渐进的。\n\n来源只给年代、原料选择与器类名称，未记发现者、发掘年份、地层序列、石器组合比例与遗址面积。本条不把它写成完整的奥杜","path":"places/olduvai-gorge.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"奥杜韦峡谷是 B 维度下旧石器砾石工具与技术条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:ou-kiln","title":"瓯窑（Ou Kiln）","name_en":"Ou Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["青瓷","六朝","唐代","缥瓷","瓯江"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"瓯窑是浙江温州等地生产青瓷的窑口，古称东瓯窑，分布于永嘉、温州一带。赵农记其胎质与釉色结合紧密，釉色温润如玉、淡雅清脆；田自秉记其制品含铁量较越窑低、胎色较白、釉呈淡青，即晋代诗文所称“缥瓷”，并引“杜毓《薈赋》‘器择陶拣，出自东瓯’”（原文如此，书名 OCR 疑为《荈赋》）。","path":"places/ou-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"瓯窑是 B 维度下六朝至唐青瓷窑系条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:pingshan-zhongshanguo-wangmu","title":"平山中山王墓（Pingshan Zhongshan Royal Tomb）","name_en":"Pingshan Zhongshan Royal Tomb","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["战国","中山国","错金银","龙凤鹿方案","河北平山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"平山中山王墓位于河北平山，是战国中山国王陵区。1977 年发掘的中山王1号墓出土错金银龙凤鹿方案，是六册中结构描述最细的战国青铜方案：四鹿承圈、四龙蟠曲成镂空球体、龙隙间立凤鸟、龙头承斗拱托起案框。田自秉记其高 37.4 厘米、长宽各 48 厘米，并指出案面可能为漆木而早已朽失（L1774），构件“铆口光滑，焊缝无痕”（L1776）。来源另给彩版 10。\n\n夏燕靖 2016 版几近逐句复述同一段结","path":"places/pingshan-zhongshanguo-wangmu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"平山中山王墓是 B 维度下战国错金银镶嵌与多材质构件复合的墓葬落点；王陵等级属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:qianling","title":"乾陵（Qianling Mausoleum）","name_en":"Qianling Mausoleum","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["唐代","唐高宗","武则天","唐十八陵","无字碑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"乾陵是唐高宗李治与武则天的合葬陵，在陕西乾县梁山，与昭陵相望。甬道两边设置大量石狮、石马、石人、鸵鸟、华表及无字碑，现仍存石刻作品 100 余件。赵农把它与昭陵并列为唐陵地表构筑的代表，并给出两者石刻风格的对照：昭陵洗练刚健，乾陵典雅华美。\n\n乾陵也是唐陵中唯一可由陪葬墓外推地宫形制的陵：唐代帝王陵墓尚未发掘，只有乾陵陪葬的章怀太子、懿德太子、永泰公主三墓及昭陵等处的贵妃、公主、大臣墓被发掘。此点","path":"places/qianling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"乾陵是 B 维度下唐陵石刻（蹲狮、翼马、鸵鸟、无字碑）与陵园布局的条目；合葬制度与陪葬墓等级属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:qingtian","title":"青田（Qingtian）","name_en":"Qingtian","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["清代","青田","石雕","松鼠葡萄","葡萄山"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青田是浙江的青田石雕产地。田自秉把青田石雕列入清代著名石雕，与端砚、歙砚、寿山石雕、菊花石雕并列；记其“产于浙江青田，清时极为盛行。以雕刻松鼠葡萄闻名，别称‘葡萄山’，葡萄结实累累，娇嫩欲滴”。来源只此一句，未给石矿、艺人、作坊与器物类型。","path":"places/qingtian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青田是 B 维度下清代青田石雕产地条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:qishan-fengchucun-yizhi","title":"岐山凤雏村西周建筑遗址（Western Zhou Building Site at Fengchu Village, Qishan）","name_en":"Western Zhou Building Site at Fengchu Village, Qishan","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["西周","建筑遗址","院落布局","宫室建筑","岐山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"岐山凤雏村西周建筑遗址位于陕西岐山，是西周早期建筑遗址。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》称其为十分气派的大型建筑（图5-9 复原图），遗存是一座四周通行、前中后三进、左右对称、格局规整的大院落，由屏、门、塾、中庭、大室、东西庭、寝、闱、东西厢、阙、庑共十一个部分组成。作者据此判断，这种建筑已脱离“茅茨土阶”的民居形式，演化为宫室建筑。\n\n来源只给布局组成与性质判断，未给遗址面积、年代分期、夯土台基尺寸、","path":"places/qishan-fengchucun-yizhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"岐山凤雏村西周建筑遗址是 B 维度下西周宫室建筑与院落布局条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:qixiashan-qianfoya","title":"南京栖霞山千佛崖（Qixiashan Thousand Buddha Cliff）","name_en":"Qixiashan Thousand Buddha Cliff","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["南朝","齐梁","石窟寺","佛教","重凿"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南京栖霞山千佛崖是南朝齐梁时期陆续开凿形成的石窟群，赵农记其标志着南朝佛教的兴盛；但大部分佛造像在明朝后期被人重新雕凿修改，令后人遗憾不已。李立新把栖霞山石窟与敦煌、云冈、龙门、麦积山、响堂山并列，作为魏晋南北朝重要石窟寺院之一；田自秉在列举六朝著名石窟时也列入南京栖霞山。\n\n本条与 `places/nanjing.md`（南京城）分工：城市条目记明初都城、琉璃窑、南洋劝业会与民国首都计划，本条只","path":"places/qixiashan-qianfoya.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"栖霞山千佛崖是 B 维度下南朝石窟造像条目；明代重凿造成的原作丧失触及 D 维度的文物保护与续修问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:rongchang","title":"荣昌（Rongchang）","name_en":"Rongchang","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["现代","荣昌","陶器","泡菜坛","铁线划花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"荣昌是四川（来源写法）西南较大的产陶区，附近的隆昌等地均有陶器生产，而以荣昌安富镇鸦屿村出品最精。产品有壶、瓶、罐、坛、茶具、酒具以及玩具等，而以泡菜坛闻名中外。荣昌陶土有红、白两色，艺人们巧妙地运用了两色泥土，创造了各种装饰方法：红泥陶胎用白泥贴花或嵌花，或用两色泥混合而成金黄色；在装饰手法上，除画花、堆贴外，铁线划花最有特色，线条优美流畅，多用单线卷草为题材。","path":"places/rongchang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"荣昌是 B 维度下西南产陶区与双色泥装饰的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:rongcheng-songguojia-site","title":"荣成松郭家村遗址（Songguojia Site at Rongcheng）","name_en":"Songguojia Site at Rongcheng","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["新石器时代","独木舟","榫卯","舟船技术","规范化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"荣成松郭家村遗址位于山东荣成。1979年该地出土一件距今4000年前新石器时期的独木舟，壁厚约5厘米，板面平整光洁，留有榫卯孔眼。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》以此论证其时舟船技术中简化、统一、协调的规范化原理已在发挥作用。\n\n来源只给出土年份、年代、地点与独木舟的壁厚、表面和孔眼特征，未给舟体长度、宽度、树种、共存器物与现藏地。本条不补写遗址的文化命名与聚落结构。","path":"places/rongcheng-songguojia-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"荣成松郭家村遗址是 B 维度下新石器舟船技术条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:ru-kiln","title":"汝窑（Ru Kiln）","name_en":"Ru Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["宋代","官窑","青瓷","五大名窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汝窑是北宋为宫廷烧造青瓷的窑场，“五大名窑”之首。六册来源一致把它列为宋代最重要的青瓷名窑，但在三处关键事实上分歧明显：窑址所在（宝丰清凉寺／河南临汝县）、始烧时间（北宋初期／北宋后期宋徽宗年间）、装饰面貌（印花刻花／素面无过多装饰）。本 KU 三处并存，不裁定。","path":"places/ru-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汝窑是 B 维度下宋代青瓷官窑的窑口锚点，其“窑址在宝丰还是在临汝”的分歧同时构成 E 维度的考古学证据史问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:sanmenxia-guoguo-tomb","title":"三门峡虢国墓地（Sanmenxia Guoguo Cemetery）","name_en":"Sanmenxia Guoguo Cemetery","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["春秋","虢国","车马坑","战车","车制"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三门峡虢国墓地位于河南三门峡，是春秋时期虢国墓地。赵农只用它一件事：车马坑中曾出土 25 辆战车，以此作为春秋战国车制的实物依据。来源未记墓区范围、墓葬数量、车马坑形制与车马配置，本条只登记来源所记，并把同段的车制描述作为该批战车所属的技术背景并列。\n\n田自秉另记墓中漆器：在三门峡上村岭虢国墓中发现的漆器，器形有豆和盘两种，都是仿铜器的；同段把它列在陕西长安、河南洛阳、溶县等西周墓漆器之后。上村岭","path":"places/sanmenxia-guoguo-tomb.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"三门峡虢国墓地是 B 维度下春秋车制与战车结构的实物证据单位；车马坑作为随葬制度则触及 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:sanshan-wuyuan","title":"三山五园（Three Hills and Five Gardens）","name_en":"Three Hills and Five Gardens","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["清代","北京","皇家园林","三山五园","颐和园"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖《中国设计史》在明清园林设计段记：明清两代是我国古代园林设计的顶峰时期，保存至今的园林尤以清代最多；明清皇家园林大多在北京一带。明代在元大都太液池基础上建成西苑（今北京北、中海），并扩大西苑水面、增南海。清代康熙、乾隆年间掀起皇家园林设计建设高潮，在北京筑有“三山五园”，即万寿山清漪园（后改名颐和园）、玉泉山静明园、香山静宜园以及圆明园（包括圆明、长春、万春三园）。\n\n来源把三山五园置于“明","path":"places/sanshan-wuyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下清代皇家园林群的锚点，其园林建筑与叠山理水工艺同时属于 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:sanxingdui-altar-pit","title":"三星堆祭坛坑（Sanxingdui Altar Pit）","name_en":"Sanxingdui Altar Pit","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["商代","三星堆","祭祀","玉石器","燔燎"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三星堆祭坛坑位于四川广汉三星堆遗址内，赵农把它记作商代玉石礼器的一次性埋藏单位：出土玉石器具约 300 件，主要是礼器和工具，有璋、琮、璧、环、戈、刀、矛、凿、锛、锄、斧、铲、珠、管等。因为祭天之后将玉器埋入地下，玉器表面有火烧痕迹；这种仪式当时被称为“燔燎”，埋入地下称为“瘗地”，是祭地的作用。\n\n田自秉另记同一遗址的青铜器材料：1986 年在四川广汉的两座祭祀坑中，发现约为商末周初的大批具有地","path":"places/sanxingdui-altar-pit.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"三星堆祭坛坑是 B 维度下商代玉石礼器的埋藏单位，其燔燎、瘗地程序与器类组合又反映 E 维度的区域祭祀传统。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:sanxingdui","title":"三星堆（Sanxingdui）","name_en":"Sanxingdui","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["商代","蜀国都邑","青铜人像","巴蜀文化","城市遗址"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三星堆位于四川广汉，是商代早期的蜀国都邑，城市面积约220万平方米。居住区域内有住宅、制陶与玉石作坊及墓地，其中地面木结构房屋为贵族居所。2016 版将其作为巴蜀文化遗址，称所出商代青铜人雕像为商代服饰文物中最具代表者。\n\n夏燕靖《中国设计史》（2009）在“服饰的制式与设计”段给出同一判断的早期版本：在为数不多的商代服饰文物中，以四川广汉三星堆（巴蜀文化遗址）发现的商代青铜人雕像最具代表；从殉葬","path":"places/sanxingdui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"三星堆是 B 维度下商代蜀国都邑与青铜造物遗址的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:shandingdong-site","title":"山顶洞遗址（Shandingdong Site）","name_en":"Shandingdong Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["旧石器时代晚期","骨针","装饰品","原始宗教"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山顶洞遗址位于北京周口店，属旧石器时代晚期。遗址已使用钻孔、刮削、磨光、刻纹工艺，出土8厘米骨针及石块、骨片、兽牙、海贝等装饰品，被视为我国最早工艺品之一；随葬品与尸体撒红色粉粒反映原始宗教观念。赵农另记自1933年山顶洞遗址出土骨针以来，南北许多石器时期遗址都发现骨针，甚至发现了用较粗动物骨制作的保存骨针的贮藏管。","path":"places/shandingdong-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"山顶洞遗址是 B 维度下旧石器时代晚期工艺与装饰条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:shandong-boshan","title":"山东博山（Boshan, Shandong）","name_en":"Boshan, Shandong","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["玻璃器","博山","元末明初","清代","宫廷玻璃厂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山东博山是元末明初以来中国玻璃生产的重要地点。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》记唐之后中国玻璃设计转入低潮，宫廷玩赏几乎以进口为主；直到元末明初，才在山东博山出现玻璃生产作坊。到清代，博山玻璃器生产作坊达百余家；康熙时设立宫廷玻璃厂，雇用欧洲工匠制造精细工艺品，玻璃器生产又恢复起来。近代汉口、上海、北京、福州、秦皇岛等地设立大型玻璃生产工厂，新式玻璃器生产从此开始。\n\n来源只给产业兴起的朝代、作坊数量级","path":"places/shandong-boshan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"山东博山是 B 维度下元明清玻璃生产与工艺复兴条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:shanghai","title":"上海（Shanghai）","name_en":"Shanghai","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["晚清","民国","租界","东方大港","浦东"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"上海是赵农笔下“在现代城市建筑中最重要的城市”。从晚清开始它成为南方发展最迅速的城市，很快取代南京、扬州、苏州等江南传统城市的地位。鸦片战争后西方列强以租界名义从上海划割大片地区，设行政、警察、监狱机构并驻军，还在租界建银行、洋行、工厂、仓库、教堂；1949 年前上海城市极度不平衡，租界地带高楼林立，周边则是缺乏规划、居住条件恶劣的棚户区。孙中山 1919 年《建国方略》设计上海“东方大港”及“创","path":"places/shanghai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"上海是 D 维度下近代开埠城市、租界制度与城市规划条目；租界的西方建筑输入接到 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:shangyu-yaozhi","title":"上虞窑址（Shangyu Kiln Sites）","name_en":"Shangyu Kiln Sites","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["东汉","瓷窑","黑瓷","上浦小仙坛","帐子山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"上虞窑址位于浙江上虞，是六册中东汉瓷窑最集中的一处：东汉窑址 30 余处，早期陶、瓷共烧，后来出现专门烧瓷的瓷窑；以高岭土为胎，氧化铁含量较高，用龙窑烧成，温度在 1300℃ 左右。产品有壶、钟、罐、碗、洗、盘，另有五联罐、耳杯、唾壶；施釉多不到底，饰弦纹与水波纹。\n\n1972—1977 年调查发掘的帐子山瓷窑出黑瓷：胎深灰，釉黑如漆，器类有黑瓷壶、黑瓷印纹罍、黑瓷双耳罐。田自秉据此把黑瓷的历史从","path":"places/shangyu-yaozhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"上虞窑址是 B 维度下东汉专门瓷窑与黑瓷起源的窑业落点。三国两晋的窑址数量归 places/yue-kiln.md，窑炉形制归 terms/longyao.md，本条只记东汉一段与帐子山黑瓷。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:shaoxing-fusheng-yaozhi","title":"绍兴富盛战国窑址（Shaoxing Fusheng Kiln Site）","name_en":"Shaoxing Fusheng Kiln Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["战国","原始青瓷","印纹硬陶","龙窑","托珠叠烧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绍兴富盛战国窑址位于浙江绍兴富盛，是六册中唯一明确记“五窑叠压”的战国窑址：窑址堆积叠压至五层，先后五座窑，同时烧造原始青瓷与几何印纹硬釉陶，火度在 1200℃ 以上。田自秉据其胎质记瓷土细腻坚硬、胎色灰白或灰，据器底记辘轳拉坯留下的螺旋纹，并记托珠叠烧法；同段称萧山等地亦有同类窑址。\n\n同地点的绍兴战国墓另出原始青瓷 130 多件，器类有罐、鼎、盘、杯、盂、匜、碗、钵，其中杯、碗最多，多为素面，","path":"places/shaoxing-fusheng-yaozhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"绍兴富盛战国窑址是 B 维度下战国原始青瓷与印纹硬陶同窑共烧、托珠叠烧的窑业落点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:shenzhen","title":"深圳（Shenzhen）","name_en":"Shenzhen","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["1980年代","经济特区","现代化城市","股市","房地产业"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农在讲当代城市时以深圳为改革开放后新兴城市的代表：1980 年以后广东沿海崛起深圳、珠海等城市，为现代化的城市建设提供了新思路；深圳的公司、股市、银行、电子市场、房地产业熙熙攘攘，以“时间就是金钱，效率就是生命”为现代时尚，“一座座新城拔地而起”。\n\n来源只有三句话，不含规划、建筑与制度的任何细节。本条因此只保留其作为“新思路”样本的位置，不填补来源以外的城市史。","path":"places/shenzhen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"深圳是 D 维度下改革开放后新兴城市条目；对外开放与现代化范式接到 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:shiwan-yao","title":"石湾窑（Shiwan Kiln）","name_en":"Shiwan Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["明代","清代","现代","陶器","泥钧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"石湾窑在广东佛山镇附近，是明代两个生产精陶的名窑之一（另一为宜兴窑）。田自秉记：所制以陶器为主，当时多仿制钧窑，釉色浓厚，称为“泥钧”；品种有碗、盘、瓶、洗等。来源另记现代石湾仍是广东陶器的著名产地，以陶塑最有名，常采取部分上釉、局部露胎的表现方法，使陶胎和釉色形成不同色泽的对比，具有独特的艺术效果；近年来还发展了各种花釉瓷，瓷釉彩色斑斓、变化万千，石湾已成为我国南方重要的陶瓷产地。明代“石湾窑”","path":"places/shiwan-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"石湾窑是 B 维度下明代精陶与近现代陶塑产地条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:shuihudi-qinmu","title":"睡虎地秦墓（Shuihudi Qin Tomb）","name_en":"Shuihudi Qin Tomb","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["秦代","漆器","秦简","漆工管理","湖北云梦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"睡虎地秦墓位于湖北云梦，1975 年发掘。田自秉据这批墓葬记秦代漆器：器类 10 多种，有圆盒、盂、双耳长盒、方盒、圆奁、椭圆奁、壶、卮、樽、耳杯（来源作“耳环”，疑误，照录不改）、勺、凤鸟勺、匕；木胎，红里黑外，黑漆上绘红、赭纹样。33 号墓漆盂底绘两鱼一鹭，34 号墓凤鸟勺高 14 厘米。\n\n同出的《睡虎地秦简》另记漆工管理：漆工到别县领取漆料，运到官府后要经测试。本条把器物与制度两面并列登记","path":"places/shuihudi-qinmu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"睡虎地秦墓是 B 维度下秦代漆器器类与纹样的墓葬落点；漆工领料与官府测试的制度证据属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:song-official-kiln","title":"宋代官窑窑址（Song Official Kiln Sites）","name_en":"Song Official Kiln Sites","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["宋代","官窑","青瓷","粉青","紫口铁足"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋代官窑窑址指北宋与南宋先后设立的官办青瓷窑。田自秉记：官窑是北宋官窑在汝窑影响下产生的另一青瓷窑，大观、政和年间在汴京所造，窑址迄今未发现；宋室南渡后制瓷技术力量随之南移，又在杭州凤凰山下和郊坛下先后设立官窑。据《坦斋笔衡》“中兴渡江……袭故京遗制，置窑于修内司，造青器，名内窑”，凤凰山下的官窑又称修内司窑或内窑；之后在郊坛下设的新窑，称为郊坛下官窑。宋代官窑的釉色以粉青为代表，紫口铁足，往往有","path":"places/song-official-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宋代官窑窑址是 B 维度下两宋官办青瓷窑的产地与产品条目；官窑的制度义与宋瓷谱系归 terms/guan-yao.md。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:songjiang-fu","title":"松江府（Songjiang Prefecture）","name_en":"Songjiang Prefecture","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["元代","明代","清代","松江府","棉纺织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"松江府在元代设治，府境在今上海松江一带，是本书棉纺织一线贯穿元、明、清三代的府级产地。元初长江流域的松江府制棉生产技术发展迅速，“竟超越闽、广两地以及北方地区，走在全国棉纺织业的前列，逐渐成为全国棉纺织业的中心”，有“衣被天下”之誉；元时仅松江一地以棉织为副业者就有 1000 多家，《至元嘉禾志》记当时已不是“闽广来者尤为丽密”，而是“松江者佳”。\n\n明代松江府仍为全国棉织业中心，民谣作“买不尽松","path":"places/songjiang-fu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"松江府是 B 维度下元至清棉纺织与踹染产地中心的府级条目；踹染业的地域转移与产业组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:suzhou-wangshiyuan","title":"苏州网师园（Master of the Nets Garden）","name_en":"Master of the Nets Garden","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["清代","苏州园林","园林设计","湖石"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"苏州网师园是李立新《中国设计艺术史论》所举的清代园林设计实例。该书图注称其“布局巧妙，结构紧凑，湖石与树木参差错落，疏朗闲适，为中国园林设计中的精品”，并注明引自《中国古建筑》。\n\n来源只给景观评价与朝代标注，未记建园年代、园主、面积、平面布局、叠山理水手法与现存状况。本条只登记图注可证的园林实体与设计评价，不据来源外常识补写沿革。","path":"places/suzhou-wangshiyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"苏州网师园是 D 维度下清代园林设计条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:suzhou","title":"苏州（Suzhou）","name_en":"Suzhou","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["春秋","宋代","平江府","平江图","水陆并行"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"苏州是春秋吴国伍子胥所建阊阖城的延续，隋开皇年间因城西姑苏山得名苏州，宋代称平江府，南宋时确立为陪都。它临近太湖、大运河从城西穿过，经唐宋经营成为鱼米之乡，丝绸生产天下闻名，城市形成“水陆并行，河街相临”的特点。南宋《平江图》碑刻保存了宋代苏州的城市格局，是六册中少见的以石刻地图为城市设计证据的案例。\n\n赵农把苏州与开封、临安并列为五代至宋代“最为著名”的三座城市：开封是北宋都城，临安是南宋都城，","path":"places/suzhou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"苏州是 D 维度下宋代地方城市与水域城制条目；丝绸生产与河街格局的工艺面属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:tianjin","title":"天津（Tianjin）","name_en":"Tianjin","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["金代","直沽","租界","引滦入津","海河"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"天津是北京的门户，有着重要的战略位置，从金代“直沽”逐渐形成一座以商业为主的城市。1949 年以前城区多为外国人的租界，是下野军阀官宦的退养之地，普通民众的生活环境无法得到改善；1980 年以后城市建设加快，引滦入津和海河治理为民众带来巨大生活变化。\n\n赵农把天津写作“与上海发展相似的还有天津”，但随即给出两者的差别：上海的重心在租界的制度与建筑，天津的重心在租界的社会构成（下野军阀官宦的退养之地","path":"places/tianjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"天津是 D 维度下近代租界城市与新中国城市水利改造条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:tianjing","title":"天京（Tianjing）","name_en":"Tianjing","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["太平天国","天京","南京","招贤榜","诸匠营"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"天京即今南京，是太平天国的都城。田自秉记：太平天国十分重视工艺美术，每占领一地就着手恢复当地的工艺生产；在他们管辖的江南广大产丝地区，蚕丝业得到较快发展，生丝输出量 1853 年以前只有 2 万多包，1860 年间猛增到 8 万多包。太平天国非常尊重工艺工人，注意发挥他们的专长，每到一地就张贴《招贤榜》，招募有特长的工人参加生产，曾在江苏、浙江、安徽、湖北等地都招收过“各项匠作兄弟”。在天京的《招","path":"places/tianjing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"天京是 D 维度下太平天国工艺生产组织所在都城的条目；诸匠营、百工衙的机构职掌分别归 institutions/zhujiangying.md 与 institutions/baigongya.md。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:tunxi-xizhou-tomb","title":"屯溪西周墓（Tunxi Western Zhou Tombs）","name_en":"Tunxi Western Zhou Tombs","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["西周","原始瓷器","高岭土","青绿薄釉","安徽屯溪"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"屯溪西周墓位于安徽屯溪，是田自秉判断西周原始瓷器发展水平时最重要的一处墓葬材料。墓中出土原始瓷器 70 多件，器类有瓷碗、瓷盂、瓷豆、瓷尊、瓷盉、瓷盘等，以瓷豆为多；胎质灰白，用高岭土烧成，敷黄绿或青绿薄釉。田自秉把屯溪与西安张家坡、普渡村，信阳孙砦，江苏金坛、丹徒烟墩山等地并列，并以长安张家坡残瓷片的科学分析作技术判断：烧成温度约 1200℃、吸水性弱，因在弱还原焰中烧制而不能把胎料中的钛、铁成","path":"places/tunxi-xizhou-tomb.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"屯溪西周墓是 B 维度下西周原始瓷器最重要的一处墓葬落点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:wuguancun-tomb","title":"安阳武官村大墓（Wuguancun Tomb, Anyang）","name_en":"Wuguancun Tomb, Anyang","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["商代晚期","殷墟","王陵","司母戊鼎","虎纹大石磬"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"武官村大墓位于河南安阳殷墟王陵区。田自秉在多处提到它：1939 年墓中出土司母戊鼎，现陈列于中国历史博物馆，是商代晚期最大的青铜礼器；1950 年出土虎纹大石磬，双钩线刻一个张口伸腰的虎形；墓中铜戈上发现极细的绢纹痕迹；墓中大量雕花木器印痕被考古学家称为“花土”，朱红漆色印在夯土中，纹饰有饕餮纹、龙纹、虎纹、回纹；墓中还曾出土环状金片。器物本身的形制、合金比例与铸造工艺分别留在 `works/si","path":"places/wuguancun-tomb.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"安阳武官村大墓是 B 维度下商代晚期王陵出土多类工艺证据的集合点；王陵等级与器用礼制一层可触及 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:wuliangci","title":"武梁祠（Wuliang Shrine）","name_en":"Wuliang Shrine","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["汉代","画像石","伏羲女娲","规矩","石刻"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"武梁祠是李立新《中国设计艺术史论》讨论汉代“物”的规范与“道”的规范时所用的石刻图像出处。图1-32 标为“伏羲女娲手执规矩图（规被人形化）（武梁祠石刻）”。该图紧接孟子以“规矩”“准绳”论方圆平直、并把造物语汇引入儒家经典的讨论。\n\n来源只给图注，未记祠堂所在地、祠主、营造年代、石刻形制与图像尺寸。本条按“石刻图像所出的祠堂”登记，不据来源外常识补写武梁祠的画像石组合与建筑沿革。","path":"places/wuliangci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"武梁祠是 C 维度下汉代画像石中“规矩”图像条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:wunijing","title":"乌泥泾（Wunijing）","name_en":"Wunijing","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["元代","松江","棉纺织","木棉","黄道婆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"乌泥泾是松江府东去五十里许的地名，黄道婆的故乡（原文注今上海县）。据《辍耕录》，闽广多种木棉，纺绩为布，名曰吉贝；松江府东去五十里许曰乌泥泾，其地土田硗瘠、民食不给，因谋树艺以资生业，遂从闽广觅种木棉。初无踏车椎弓之制，率用手剖去其子，线弦竹弧置案间，振掉成剂，厥功甚艰。元初有一妪名黄道婆者自崖州来，教以做造杆弹纺织之具；至于错纱、配色、综线、絜花，各有其法。以故织成被褥带帨，其上折枝、团凤、棋局","path":"places/wunijing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"乌泥泾是 B 维度下元代棉纺织产地与黄道婆技术输入的地点条目；黄道婆生平与工具改良归 persons/huang-daopo.md。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:wushi-ci","title":"武氏祠（Wushi Shrines）","name_en":"Wushi Shrines","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["东汉","画像石","石祠","武梁祠","平面剔地法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"武氏祠位于山东嘉祥县城南 15 公里，是东汉武氏家族的石祠群，宋代已有学者研究著录，是六册中最著名的汉画像石地点。田自秉记四座石室及其位置：武梁祠居右，武开明祠（武梁之弟）居后，武班祠（武开明长子）居左，武荣祠（武开明次子）居前。画像内容有荆轲刺秦王、孔子见老子、泗水捞鼎、西王母与东王父、古代帝王、烈女孝子、刺客义士、宴饮车骑、舞乐战斗与祥瑞。技法为平面剔地法，多层构图、人物取正侧面、关键情节集中","path":"places/wushi-ci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"武氏祠是 B 维度下东汉画像石平面剔地法与多层构图的代表，四祠的家族次序属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:wutaishan","title":"五台山（Mount Wutai）","name_en":"Mount Wutai","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["明清","佛教","四大名山","五大禅处","佛光寺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"五台山在山西，是明清时期佛法大盛的佛教圣地。赵农记其寺院在明清屡次重修，形成香火缭绕的局面，其中显通寺、塔院寺、菩萨顶、殊像寺、罗睺寺有“五大禅处”的称誉；五台山与峨眉山、九华山、普陀山合称佛教四大名山。\n\n五台山在六册中还承担另一重角色：它是唐代木构建筑的现存地点。赵农在讲唐代寺院时以“五台山佛光寺大殿”与西安大慈恩寺塔并举，称其“气象雄伟，法度庄严”。本 KU 因此同时记明清寺院群与唐代木构两","path":"places/wutaishan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"五台山是 D 维度下佛教名山与寺院群制度条目；唐代木构佛光寺大殿的营造属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:wuwei-leitai-hanmu","title":"武威雷台汉墓（Wuwei Leitai Han Tomb）","name_en":"Wuwei Leitai Han Tomb","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["东汉","铜奔马","马踏飞燕","铜车马","甘肃武威"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"武威雷台汉墓位于甘肃武威，1969 年发掘，出铜奔马，即通常所称“马踏飞燕”。田自秉记其造型：抬头扬尾，三足腾空，右后腿踏在一只飞燕背上。同段另举甘肃武威铜马群、广西合浦铜屋、河南偃师铜奔羊与甘肃灵台铜俑，作为汉代铜塑动物的并例。","path":"places/wuwei-leitai-hanmu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"武威雷台汉墓是 B 维度下汉代铜塑动物最著名的单墓落点，铜奔马以三足腾空、一足踏燕解决奔马的支撑与动势。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:wuzhou-kiln","title":"婺州窑（Wuzhou Kiln）","name_en":"Wuzhou Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["青瓷","六朝","唐代","浙江","南青"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"婺州窑是浙江金华一带生产青瓷的窑口。田自秉把浙江六朝瓷窑分为四个系统：曹娥江地区的越窑、东部瓯江地区的瓯窑、西部金、衢地区的婺窑、北部东苕溪地区的德清窑；婺窑系统的制品含铁量较高，故胎色泛红，为了取得较好的色彩效果，运用了化妆土。赵农则把它与瓯窑、岳州窑并列，作为越窑之外“南青”系统的另外几支：与越窑、瓯窑的温润不同，婺州窑的胎釉特征是质地厚重、釉色深暗，釉色中带点状白斑。两册一以六朝窑系的地域分","path":"places/wuzhou-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"婺州窑是 B 维度下六朝至唐青瓷窑口条目；化妆土的工艺定义归 terms/huazhuangtu.md。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xian","title":"西安（Xi'an）","name_en":"Xi'an","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["建都","明代城墙","城市拆迁","旅游文化","西北"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西安是世界上建都时间最长、建立朝代最多的城市，但在宋元以后仅成为西北的重要城市。赵农记其 1980 年以前发展速度很慢，仍然保留着许多旧城老街；进入 1990 年以后，大规模的城市拆迁使其有了明显变化。由于文物古迹众多，保留了完整的明代城墙，加之层出不穷的地下文物，西安已经形成了旅游文化特征的城市形象。\n\n本条的价值在于它给出了一种与上海、天津、深圳都不同的城市类型：西安的当代城市形象不是由租界、","path":"places/xian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"西安是 D 维度下古都与当代城市形象条目；明代城墙的实体与地下文物接到 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xianggang","title":"香港（Hong Kong）","name_en":"Hong Kong","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["1997","回归","东方明珠","西方文化参照","中银大厦"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农对香港只写了一句：1997 年回归祖国的香港有近百年发展历史，具有“东方明珠”的盛誉，为中国城市的现代化建设提供了一种西方文化和技术的参照。\n\n这一句的价值不在城市本身，而在它的功能定位：香港在六册的当代城市序列里是唯一被明确写作“参照”的外部样本——不是租界（上海、天津），不是古都（西安、北京），不是新特区（深圳），而是一个可供中国城市现代化取用的西方文化与技术的参照系。来源没有说明参照的具","path":"places/xianggang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"香港是 E 维度下西方文化与技术参照条目；城市现代化与制度层面接到 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xiangtangshan-shiku","title":"响堂山石窟（Xiangtangshan Grottoes）","name_en":"Xiangtangshan Grottoes","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["魏晋南北朝","石窟","卷草纹","邯郸","河北"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"响堂山石窟在夏燕靖《中国艺术设计史（升级版）》中只以一条图注出现：图 5-30“魏晋南北朝 邯郸响堂山卷草纹饰石窟”。它所在的段落论北朝石刻与纹饰设计：大同云岗石窟、洛阳龙门石窟和敦煌莫高窟都开凿于北朝，早期造像风格基本模仿印度犍陀罗，其后创造出中国形式的造像艺术；南朝陵墓石雕形体巨大、雕刻细致；与建筑浑然一体的浮雕纹饰设计“如藻绘边饰，以莲花、卷草纹样最为出色”，并以洛阳龙门宾阳洞的窟室装饰（穹","path":"places/xiangtangshan-shiku.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"响堂山石窟在 B 维度下只以“卷草纹饰”的图版例证出现，材料不足以支撑窟群本体叙述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xiangyi-chenliu","title":"襄邑（Xiangyi）","name_en":"Xiangyi","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["春秋战国","汉代","陈留郡","织锦","染织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"襄邑是汉代陈留郡属县，以织锦与染织著称。田自秉据《论衡》记“襄邑俗织锦，钝妇无不巧”，说明当地织锦是普遍的家庭技艺而非少数工匠专长；又据左思《魏都赋》“锦绣襄邑，罗绮朝歌”，把襄邑的锦绣与朝歌的罗绮并列，作为魏晋人对汉代纺织名产的回溯。田自秉同段称“在齐郡临淄，陈留郡襄邑，都是染织生产的著名地区”，紧接“汉代统治者并在这里设有三服官”，所指范围含混；所引《汉书·贡禹传》只称“齐三服官”。\n\n夏燕靖","path":"places/xiangyi-chenliu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"襄邑是 B 维度下汉代织锦与染织产地条目；三服官的职掌归 institutions/sanfuguan.md，本条只记产地与民间织技。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xianrendong-site","title":"仙人洞遗址（Xianrendong Site）","name_en":"Xianrendong Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["新石器时代","陶器起源","洞穴遗址","江西万年"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"仙人洞遗址位于江西万年县，1962年出土距今8000多年的陶器。田自秉称为我国目前发现最早的陶器资料；2016 版同记陶器与年代，并注明同章另处误作“江西万县仙人洞”，地名前后不一致。","path":"places/xianrendong-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"仙人洞遗址是 B 维度下陶器起源与史前造物遗址条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xianyang","title":"咸阳（Qin Xianyang）","name_en":"Qin Xianyang","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["秦代","都城","制铜工场","制陶作坊","蒜头瓶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"咸阳是秦国与秦朝的都城，在今陕西咸阳。田自秉据咸阳的考古材料记秦代官府手工业：制铜工场占地 900 平方米；官营与私营制陶作坊并存，产品有固定品种；陶器上多见“咸亭”“咸鄙里骄”一类陶文。秦器形制方面，来源记鼎腹浅、矮蹄足、饰弦纹，簋口敛、耳小无垂饰，另有夔纹敦、蒜头瓶与鏊。\n\n本条只覆盖**咸阳城址内的作坊与产品**。临潼兵马俑坑不属咸阳城，其陶塑材料另属秦代陶塑条目，本条不并入。","path":"places/xianyang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"咸阳是 B 维度下秦代官营制铜、制陶作坊与秦器形制的都城落点；官私营并存与陶文署名的制度面属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xiaotangshan","title":"孝堂山郭巨祠（Xiaotangshan Shrine）","name_en":"Xiaotangshan Shrine","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["东汉","画像石","石祠","郭巨祠","阴线刻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"孝堂山位于山东肥城（今长清），其石刻画像在六册中主要指“郭巨祠”。田自秉记其为小石室，三面墙壁以阴线刻人物车骑：后壁以楼阁为中心，楼上端坐、楼下行礼、最上层为车骑；左右壁刻周公辅成王、歌舞百戏、战斗狩猎、伏羲女娲、西王母与日月星辰祥瑞。风格以线表现，清秀质朴。\n\n本条只记**石祠本体与画面内容**。画像石的雕刻技法（平面剔地法等）见 `procedures/pingmian-tidi-fa.md`","path":"places/xiaotangshan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"孝堂山郭巨祠是 B 维度下东汉石祠阴线刻画像的代表，画面以楼阁为中心作多层组织。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xiaotun-beixinzhuang-site","title":"小屯北辛庄商代遗址（Xiaotun Beixinzhuang Site）","name_en":"Xiaotun Beixinzhuang Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["商代晚期","牙骨作坊","骨料坑","安阳"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"小屯北辛庄商代遗址位于河南安阳小屯一带。田自秉在记商代牙骨作坊时，以它作为晚期代表，与商代早期的郑州紫荆山并列举出：遗址发现骨料坑一个，所存骨料及半成品达 5000 多件，还有制牙骨用的青铜小刀、锯、钻以及砺石等工具。六册中只有这一句话提到该遗址，来源未给遗址面积、作坊布局与骨料种属，也未说明北辛庄与小屯、殷墟遗址的隶属或距离。","path":"places/xiaotun-beixinzhuang-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"小屯北辛庄商代遗址是 B 维度下商代晚期牙骨作坊规模的实物落点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xichuan-xiasi-chumu","title":"淅川下寺楚墓（Xichuan Xiasi Chu Tombs）","name_en":"Xichuan Xiasi Chu Tombs","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["春秋","楚国","失蜡法","铜禁","蚀花石髓"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"淅川下寺楚墓位于河南淅川，1979 年发掘，是田自秉论断“失蜡法最早实物”的依据：墓中铜禁、铜盏的盖纽与腿足用失蜡法铸成。来源据此把失蜡法的历史向前提早一百多年，称其为目前所发现的最早的失蜡法制件。同地春秋楚墓另出蚀花石髓，来源称为最早实物。\n\n夏燕靖 2016 版把淅川下寺放进失蜡法来源之争，作为“中原古老技术”一说的证据组之一：同书“失蜡法的西域传入与本土既有技术的争辩”一节记“1977 年湖","path":"places/xichuan-xiasi-chumu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"淅川下寺楚墓是 B 维度下失蜡法最早实物与蚀花石髓最早实物的墓葬落点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xihoudu-site","title":"西侯度遗址（Xihoudu Site）","name_en":"Xihoudu Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["旧石器时代","三棱尖状石器","芮城","山西"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西侯度遗址位于山西芮城，是夏燕靖《中国艺术设计史（升级版）》所记旧石器时代遗址中年代最早的一处。来源三处提及，三处的年代与归类并不一致：L308 把“西侯度文化”列为黄河流域旧石器时代**中晚期**文化的代表之一，与蓝田文化、大荔文化并列；L330 在旧石器文化序列中称“距今 100 万年前的旧石器文化就有西侯度文化、元谋人石器、监河文化、蓝田人文化以及东谷坨文化”；L359 则在“三棱尖状石器”","path":"places/xihoudu-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"西侯度遗址是 B 维度下中国旧石器早期石器工艺的最早落点之一，其价值在于三棱尖状石器的形制与打制方法，而非遗址本身的聚落形态。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xincun-xizhou-tomb","title":"濬县辛村西周墓（Xincun Western Zhou Cemetery）","name_en":"Xincun Western Zhou Cemetery","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["西周","漆器","蚌泡镶嵌","螺钿","车轮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"濬县辛村西周墓位于河南浚县（田自秉作“濬县”，夏燕靖两版作“浚县”，同地异写）。田自秉两处提到它：一处记墓中漆器除朱色、黑色外还发现白色漆料，但不知用什么原料调制，并以《春秋·穀梁传》“天子丹，诸侯黝垩，大夫苍”说明漆色已受礼制规定；一处记墓中以数枚蚌泡镶嵌在一个圆盒的边缘上，属周代流行的蚌泡镶嵌漆器，是后来螺钿的前身。夏燕靖 2009、2016 两版各收一幅“西周 河南浚县辛村出土的车轮（复原图","path":"places/xincun-xizhou-tomb.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"濬县辛村西周墓是 B 维度下西周漆器蚌泡镶嵌的关键出土地；漆色受礼制规定一层落在 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xing-kiln","title":"邢窑（Xing Kiln）","name_en":"Xing Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["唐代","白瓷","河北","南青北白"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"邢窑是唐代北方白瓷的代表性窑口，与南方越窑青瓷并称“南青北白”。五册来源都引陆羽《茶经》“邢瓷类银，越瓷类玉”“邢不如越”与李肇《国史补》“内丘白瓷瓯……天下无贵贱通用之”来说明其地位，但对其主要窑址是否已经确认，说法不一致。","path":"places/xing-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"邢窑是 B 维度下唐代白瓷体系与“南青北白”格局的窑口锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xingan-dayangzhou-site","title":"新干大洋洲遗址（Xingan Dayangzhou Site）","name_en":"Xingan Dayangzhou Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["商代","青铜犁","江西新干","犁耕","农具"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"新干大洋洲（来源作“江西新赣大洋州”）在夏燕靖《中国艺术设计史（升级版）》中只出现一次，位置在“原始农业生产器具设计”一节讨论良渚文化石犁是否用于犁耕的段落里。来源记“近年在江西新赣大洋州发现了两件商代的青铜犁”，据此推测南方犁耕比北方更早；随后把良渚文化的三角形石犁与这两件青铜犁作形制类比，认为良渚石犁“很可能是犁铧”。\n\n本条只记**出土地与两件青铜犁**，以及来源借它建立的南北犁耕比较。良渚","path":"places/xingan-dayangzhou-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"新干大洋洲是 B 维度下商代青铜犁出土地与南方犁耕讨论的落点，材料只有一句，不足以支撑聚落形态。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xinyang-chumu","title":"信阳楚墓（Xinyang Chu Tomb）","name_en":"Xinyang Chu Tomb","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["战国","楚国","漆器","漆案","鸟首木豆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"信阳楚墓位于河南信阳，是战国时期楚国的北方重镇。1957 年发掘的大型墓出漆器 300 多件，是六册中按用途分类最完整的战国漆器材料：日用器皿有耳杯、豆、勺、盒、箱；家具有木俎、床、榻、几、案；乐器有钟架、瑟、鼓架；车马饰有车盖、车栏、当卢；另有漆饰镇墓神、木俑与漆绘铜镜。\n\n本条以**器类清单**为主要内容。漆器工艺与胎骨做法不在此展开。","path":"places/xinyang-chumu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"信阳楚墓是 B 维度下战国楚国漆器器类最全的单墓落点：日用、家具、乐器、车马、明器五类同出。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xishan-chengzhi","title":"郑州西山城址（Xishan City Site）","name_en":"Xishan City Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["仰韶文化","新石器时代","城堡","夯土","板筑"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"郑州西山城址是赵农《中国艺术设计史》举出的中国最早城堡遗存，年代定为公元前 3000 年左右的仰韶文化晚期。来源以它为“村落扩大后即出现城堡”这一转折的实证：城墙尚残存少许，用方块板筑法夯筑，现存最高处约 3 米。来源未给城址面积、平面形状、城门数量与发掘经过，本条只登记来源所记。","path":"places/xishan-chengzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"西山城址是 D 维度下聚落向城堡转折的早期城制证据，其方块板筑法同时属 B 维度的夯筑技术。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xishuipo-site","title":"西水坡遗址（Xishuipo Site）","name_en":"Xishuipo Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["新石器时代","蚌塑","龙虎图","原始宗教","张光直"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西水坡遗址位于河南濮阳，属新石器时代遗址。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》记该遗址有三组蚌壳摆塑，其中一组作龙背骑有一人，并引张光直的研究，认为这表现巫觋与神兽的“巫跻”关系。图1-21 标为“龙虎蚌塑（河南濮阳西水坡遗址出土）”。\n\n来源进一步引张光直的高见：濮阳三组蚌塑不用真兽随葬，而以艺术品表示，表明“艺术形象似乎也可以发挥实际的作用”。本条照录这一解释，不把它当作已定论的宗教制度描述。","path":"places/xishuipo-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"西水坡遗址是 B 维度下新石器蚌塑与宗教造物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:xuejiagang-site","title":"薛家岗遗址（Xuejiagang Site）","name_en":"Xuejiagang Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["新石器时代","石钺","朱绘有孔石斧","原始宗教","磨制石器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"薛家岗遗址位于安徽潜山，属新石器时代遗址。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》以该遗址出土的朱绘有孔石斧（图1-7）与精细石钺为证，讨论磨制石器中非实用工具的通体磨光、规则化与装饰化，以及石器刻画痕迹所体现的“适应”概念。\n\n来源还称考古学者在这些文化遗址发现原始祭坛，石器大都置放在祭坛周围，或作为部族首领的随葬品，因而推测其中一部分是原始宗教礼器。该判断在来源中带“推测”“比较可信”的限定，本条照录，不作","path":"places/xuejiagang-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"薛家岗遗址是 B 维度下新石器磨制石器与礼器条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:yangzhou","title":"扬州（Yangzhou）","name_en":"Yangzhou","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["隋唐","大运河","对外贸易","盐业","鉴真"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"扬州是隋唐时期的重要城市。赵农先给名称沿革：《尚书·禹贡》“淮海惟扬州”、《周礼·职方》“东南曰扬州”；春秋时吴王夫差在此开凿邗沟、筑邗城；秦置广陵县；汉代为封地吴国首府，开山铸铜、引海水煮盐，成为经济兴盛的城市。\n\n隋代大运河开通后，扬州成为长江与大运河的交通枢纽，也成为江南贸易经济中心；曾有大食、波斯商人在此买卖珠宝，是当时对外贸易的商埠。扬州还是江南佛教文化中心，鉴真和尚于此驻锡多年，公元 ","path":"places/yangzhou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"扬州是 D 维度下运河交通、盐业与对外贸易城市条目；鉴真东渡所涉的佛教文化传播属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:yanshi-shangcheng","title":"偃师商城（Yanshi Shang City）","name_en":"Yanshi Shang City","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["商代","都邑","城墙","给排水","城市遗址"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"偃师商城是商代都邑遗址，面积190万平方米，筑长方形城墙、有7座城门，城外有10多米宽的护城河。城区有系统的排水与饮水井，宫城居中偏南，北部为居住和墓区，制陶作坊密集分布。赵农将其与郑州商城、安阳殷墟并称王邑；2016 版称其与二里头遗址共同佐证文献所记夏商两个王朝的政权更迭。","path":"places/yanshi-shangcheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"偃师商城是 B 维度下商代都邑遗址条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:yaozhou-kiln","title":"耀州窑（Yaozhou Kiln）","name_en":"Yaozhou Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["唐代","宋代","青瓷","刻花","黄堡镇"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"耀州窑在陕西铜川。赵农记唐代主要烧白、黑釉瓷及关中西北生活用瓷；宋代以刻花青瓷闻名，同时生产白瓷、黑瓷、三彩等，广泛吸收不同生产技术并形成自身优势，在北方有明显制瓷特色。田自秉记其在同官县（今铜川）黄堡镇，因同官旧属耀州得名，沿漆河上下十里都是瓷窑，称“十里窑场”；釉色青中微带黄，装饰有刻花（偏刀）、剔花、印花、镂空，题材多牡丹、菊花、忍冬、莲荷及凤鹤鸭鱼、婴戏，碗多喇叭形、莲瓣状。","path":"places/yaozhou-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"耀州窑是 B 维度下唐至宋北方青瓷窑条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:yecheng","title":"邺城（Yecheng）","name_en":"Yecheng","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["曹魏","北朝","都城","铜雀台","建安七子"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"邺城在今河北临漳，为曹操所经营并定都于此。赵农记其宫苑分为外朝、内朝、后宫三部分，并给出一个与别的都城不同的判断：邺城“不是军事性质的都城，而是作后花园的布置”，为后来动乱年代的朝代迭换、北朝军阀享乐生活留下参照。曹丕即位后迁都洛阳，邺城转为北方军事、经济重镇；后赵时期先毁后修，前燕、东魏、北齐不断修建，规模超越以往，直至北周外戚杨坚执政，将居民迁徙安阳并拆除毁灭邺城。","path":"places/yecheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"邺城是 D 维度下曹魏宫苑三分格局与北朝都城兴废的条目；宫苑空间组织属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:yinan-huaxiangshi-mu","title":"沂南画像石墓（Yinan Pictorial Stone Tomb）","name_en":"Yinan Pictorial Stone Tomb","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["东汉","画像石","石墓","平面剔地法","百戏图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"沂南画像石墓位于山东沂南北寨村，属东汉末期。田自秉记石墓有前、中、后三座主室与五座侧室，画像石 42 块。画像题材有宴饮、出行、讲学、宅院、战争、历史故事与神话；其中前室献祭图与中室百戏图为巨幅大场面。技法为平面剔地法加刻细线。来源另给插图 28、29 两幅。\n\n本条只记**墓葬形制与画面**。平面剔地法的技法总述见 `procedures/pingmian-tidi-fa.md`，本条不重复。","path":"places/yinan-huaxiangshi-mu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"沂南画像石墓是 B 维度下东汉末期画像石墓室形制与巨幅场面的代表。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:yinxu","title":"殷墟（Yinxu）","name_en":"Yinxu","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["商代后期","王都","甲骨文","铸铜遗址","妇好墓"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"殷墟是商代后期王都，位于河南安阳小屯一带，沿洹水而建，六册来源一致以它作为商代物质文化的中心遗址。它同时是甲骨文的出土地、商代最大的铸铜作坊所在、妇好墓的所在地，因此在六册中承担着“商代造物总账”的功能：青铜器、玉器、白陶、车马、丝麻织物的证据多从此处出。**本 KU 记录的核心分歧有两个**：一是《竹书纪年》年数在同一段内即自相矛盾（二百五十三年／七十三年），且赵农所引作“二百七十三年”；二是妇","path":"places/yinxu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"殷墟是 B 维度下商代青铜铸造、玉器、白陶与车马工艺的最大实物容器，其王都身份与作坊分区又落在 D 维度的官营手工业组织上。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:yixing","title":"宜兴（Yixing）","name_en":"Yixing","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["紫砂","北宋","明代","清代","龙窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宜兴是江苏太湖南岸的产陶区，被誉为“陶都”。田自秉记宜兴窑在江苏宜兴县的丁山和蜀山镇，以制作紫砂陶为最具特色，并把宜兴窑与石湾窑并列为“明代两个生产精陶的名窑”；紫砂陶所用原料为紫砂泥，色泽紫红故名，不挂釉而充分利用陶泥本色，多施浅刻、以刀代笔，以造型取胜。他引宋代诗人梅尧臣“小石冷泉留早味，紫泥新品泛春华”一诗，认为这反映宜兴在北宋时期就已生产紫砂陶；明代正德年间出现匠师供春，此后名手辈出，时大","path":"places/yixing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宜兴是 B 维度下紫砂陶产地与窑业条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:yong-cheng","title":"雍城（Yong City）","name_en":"Yong City","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["秦国","都城","选址","陵区","离宫别馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"雍城是秦国历史上极为重要的一座都城，位于汧山山脉，南濒雍水、西依灵山、东接广袤的关中平原。西有大道直通甘肃，南经宝鸡可抵巴蜀，东流渭水能泛舟楫，形胜冲要、易守难攻；四周宽阔平坦、土地肥沃、河水密布、植被茂盛。雍城建置经过精心选择，总体格局由城址、陵区、墓地及郊外离宫别馆四部分组成，雍水之南为墓地，旁有秦公陵园。","path":"places/yong-cheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"雍城是 D 维度下秦国都城选址与格局条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:yuan-dadu","title":"元大都（Yuan Dadu）","name_en":"Yuan Dadu","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["元代","都城规划","中轴线","周礼考工记","刘秉忠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元大都是忽必烈于至元八年（1271）以燕京为基地建立的首都，其规划被四册来源共同视为中国都城设计史的里程碑：方形城郭、棋盘形街道、九经九纬、明确的中轴线与左祖右社。它同时是明清北京城的直接基础。四册的叙述重点不同——夏燕靖两版重规划礼制，赵农重设计者（刘秉忠）与水利（郭守敬），田自秉重琉璃与铜镜等实物出土——本 KU 合并而不抹平。**须注意的是，夏燕靖两版给出的“面积50余万平方公里”与同一段城","path":"places/yuan-dadu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"元大都是 D 维度下“以礼制规划都城”的制度性样本，其九经九纬与左祖右社直接落实《周礼·考工记》；城市的给排水与漕运又属于 B 维度的工程条件。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:yue-kiln","title":"越窑（Yue Kiln）","name_en":"Yue Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["青瓷","浙江","唐代","秘色瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"越窑是浙江境内以青瓷为主的窑系，因唐代属越州而得名，古称会稽窑。其窑址以曹娥江流域为中心，涵盖上虞、余姚、绍兴、萧山等地，是中国青瓷发源地与唐代“南青北白”格局中青瓷的代表。","path":"places/yue-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"越窑作为陶瓷生产地点进入 B 维度；其唐代贡瓷与宫廷制度内容也可支持 D 维度，但当前只选定 B 为暂定主导航。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:yuezhou-kiln","title":"岳州窑（Yuezhou Kiln）","name_en":"Yuezhou Kiln","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["青瓷","唐代","湖南","匣钵","冰裂片"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"岳州窑是唐代青瓷系统的窑口。赵农给它的两项判断使它区别于浙江诸窑：一是最早利用匣钵烧制青瓷、提高了制瓷效率，二是产品的胎釉与越窑相反——胎质轻巧、釉色泛白、多有冰裂片、玻璃质感明显。来源只有这一段，未给窑址地点、窑炉形制与器物清单。","path":"places/yuezhou-kiln.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"岳州窑是 B 维度下唐代青瓷窑口与匣钵装烧工艺条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:yungang-shiku","title":"云冈石窟（Yungang Grottoes）","name_en":"Yungang Grottoes","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["石窟寺","北魏","佛教艺术","犍陀罗风格","石刻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"云冈石窟位于山西大同西北武州山，因山势连绵如云而得“云冈”之名。北魏道武帝拓跋珪于398年定都平城（大同）后开凿，现存大中小石窟编号53个、大小佛像51000躯以上；因凿于流沙岩层，风化腐蚀严重。李立新将其与敦煌、龙门、麦积山、响堂山、栖霞山并列为石窟寺，窟前建木构殿阁。","path":"places/yungang-shiku.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"云冈石窟是 B 维度下北朝石窟寺与石刻造物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:zenghouyi-tomb","title":"曾侯乙墓（Tomb of Marquis Yi of Zeng）","name_en":"Tomb of Marquis Yi of Zeng","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["战国早期","青铜器","编钟","漆器","天象图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曾侯乙墓位于湖北随县，战国早期曾国墓葬，出土青铜器群数量多、品种全；墓中曾侯乙编钟65枚，铜尊、铜盘透空附饰纤细齐整。李立新另记墓中出土漆衣箱天象图，原文未记墓葬地点。田自秉记该墓铜尊、铜盘的玲珑透剔装饰用失蜡法铸成，并把年代记作1977年；夏燕靖2016则记1978年5月发掘。两说并列，本条不裁定。\n\n田自秉另记随县出金匙、金盏，属该墓区的金器材料。本条只记**墓葬与出土物群**；铜尊盘的结构与","path":"places/zenghouyi-tomb.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"曾侯乙墓是 B 维度下战国青铜与漆器造物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:zhangjiapo-site","title":"张家坡遗址（Zhangjiapo Site）","name_en":"Zhangjiapo Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["西周","丰京","包铜漆木方盒","原始瓷","打锻工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"张家坡遗址位于西周都城丰京范围内，今属陕西西安。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》两处引用该遗址：一是西周都城丰京张家坡墓地出土的包铜漆木方盒，被举为商代已出现、西周普遍应用于金属加工的打锻、锤揲工艺实例；二是张家坡遗址所出青、黄绿釉标本，经化学及物理性测定，烧成温度已达1200℃，矿物成分已近瓷器性质，被称为原始瓷。\n\n来源只给器物与检测结论，未给墓葬编号、器物尺寸、检测机构与报告出处。本条不补写丰京城","path":"places/zhangjiapo-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"张家坡遗址是 B 维度下西周金属加工与原始瓷条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:zhangzhou-pinghe","title":"漳州平和（Zhangzhou Pinghe）","name_en":"Zhangzhou Pinghe","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["明万历","清康熙","克拉克瓷","青花","外销瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"漳州平和（福建省漳州市平和县）在夏燕靖《中国艺术设计史（升级版）》的“克拉克瓷”一节中，被定为克拉克瓷的原产地：“据考证，克拉克瓷原产地为福建漳州的平和”。同节记其古窑址群有五寨洞口陂沟窑、花仔楼窑、田坑窑、大垅窑、三垅窑等。\n\n“克拉克瓷”之名来自 1602 年荷兰东印度公司在海上捕获的一艘葡萄牙商船“克拉克号”：船上装有大量来自中国的青花瓷，因不明瓷器产地，欧洲人便把这种瓷器命名为“克拉克瓷”","path":"places/zhangzhou-pinghe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"漳州平和是 B 维度下克拉克瓷原产地与窑址群的产地条目；欧洲命名与外销市场属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:zhaoling","title":"昭陵（Zhaoling Mausoleum）","name_en":"Zhaoling Mausoleum","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["唐代","唐太宗","唐十八陵","昭陵六骏","高浮雕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"昭陵是唐太宗的陵墓，地处陕西礼泉九峻山，是唐太宗生前自己选择、自己规划的墓地，因山为陵，气象宏伟。陵周围有贵妃、公主、近臣的陪葬墓约 190 座，呈众星捧月之势；陵前祭殿曾有著名石刻“昭陵六骏”。\n\n赵农把昭陵放在“唐陵”这一节之首。唐陵的总体格局是：关中平原渭河北面的山地耸立着 18 座唐朝帝王陵及大量王公贵族陪葬墓，从唐太宗开始，唐朝历代帝王以山为陵；地表有庞大的建筑，甬道两旁有数量颇多的石刻","path":"places/zhaoling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"昭陵是 B 维度下唐陵石刻与高浮雕工艺的条目；帝王陵寝制度与陪葬制度属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:zhenghan-gucheng-taofang-yizhi","title":"郑韩故城制陶作坊遗址（Pottery Workshop Site at the Zheng-Han Capital）","name_en":"Pottery Workshop Site at the Zheng-Han Capital","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["东周","郑韩故城","新郑","制陶作坊","窑址"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖《中国设计史》在春秋战国青铜装饰之后设“知识链接：制陶作坊”，记在郑韩故城新郑发掘的东周时期罕见的大型制陶作坊遗址：其区域内有窑址群、作坊建筑群、陶制排水管道、陶洗池等各种丰富遗迹；同时出土多种大型存储类陶器与多件带有印证的筒板瓦。来源只给遗迹类型与出土物类别，未给发掘年份、遗址面积、窑址数量、作坊布局、产品谱系、工匠组织与存续时间，也未说明“郑韩故城”与“新郑”的行政沿革及郑、韩两都的沿用","path":"places/zhenghan-gucheng-taofang-yizhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下东周制陶作坊遗址的锚点，其城市手工业组织与遗址建制同时属于 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:zhengzhou-shangcheng","title":"郑州商城（Zhengzhou Shang City）","name_en":"Zhengzhou Shang City","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["商代","王邑","郭城","夯土城墙","宫室"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"city","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"郑州商城是商代前期的王邑，赵农把它与偃师商城、安阳殷墟并列为“王邑”。城址面积 317 万平方米，墓区和作坊移置城外，并出现郭城结构；有 11 座城门，居住者达数万人。宫室集中在北部，占地 38 万平方米，有三座以上宫室建筑群，最大一座长约 65 米以上。城外分布铸铜、制陶等官营手工业作坊。\n\n赵农在论城池起源的段落另称“郑州古城就有可能是商前期的毫都”，并以此说明最早的商代城墙为夯土城；本条把“","path":"places/zhengzhou-shangcheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"郑州商城是 D 维度下商代前期王邑的城制与功能分区条目；夯土城墙、石础与人地关系属 B 维度的营造技术。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:zhengzhou-zijingshan-site","title":"郑州紫荆山商代遗址（Zhengzhou Zijingshan Site）","name_en":"Zhengzhou Zijingshan Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["商代早期","冶铜遗址","牙骨作坊","陶范","郑州"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"郑州紫荆山商代遗址位于河南郑州，田自秉在两处提到它：一处记紫荆山北与南关外发现两处较大的冶铜遗址，出土熔铜炉、坩埚、木炭、铜渣、砺石与铸造青铜器的各种陶范；一处记商代早期的牙骨作坊，出土制牙骨的工具砺石、骨料以及经过磨制或锯制的骨制成品、半成品 1000 多件。两处合起来，使该遗址成为六册中少数同时具备“铸铜”与“牙骨”两类作坊实物的商代早期遗址。","path":"places/zhengzhou-zijingshan-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"郑州紫荆山遗址是 B 维度下商代早期冶铜与牙骨两类作坊同一遗址并存的实物落点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:zhoukoudian-site","title":"周口店遗址（Zhoukoudian Site）","name_en":"Zhoukoudian Site","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["旧石器时代","北京人","山顶洞人","用火","石制品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"周口店遗址是北京房山的石灰岩山洞遗址，约50万年前的“北京人”（中国猿人）与17000多年前的“山顶洞人”均发现于此，是旧石器时代石器与用火材料的重要出土地。李立新记第一地点十年发掘的石制品（石器、石片、原料）达10万件，是“北京人模式”的依据。","path":"places/zhoukoudian-site.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"周口店遗址是 B 维度下旧石器时代石器与用火证据条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"places:zidanku-chumu","title":"子弹库楚墓（Zidanku Chu Tomb）","name_en":"Zidanku Chu Tomb","type":"place","type_zh":"地点","color":"#06B6D4","tags":["战国","楚墓","楚帛书","神怪图纹"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_site","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"子弹库楚墓位于湖南长沙，是战国楚墓。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》在讨论天神、地祇、人鬼观念时，提到长沙子弹库战国帛书上的神怪图纹；图1-26 标为“楚帛书（湖南长沙子弹库楚墓出土）”。\n\n来源只给墓葬地点、时代、帛书图像性质与图版，未给墓葬发掘年份、墓主、帛书尺寸、文字内容与图像考释。本条只登记该墓与楚帛书神怪图纹，不展开帛书研究史。","path":"places/zidanku-chumu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"子弹库楚墓是 B 维度下战国楚帛书与神怪图像条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:bai-lian-gang","title":"百炼钢（Repeated Forging Steel）","name_en":"Repeated Forging Steel","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["秦汉","百炼钢","块铁","锻打","百炼成钢"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记在秦汉时期普遍出现了百炼钢的技术，即将块铁进行多次锻打：加热的次数越多，锻打的次数越频繁，块铁里的杂质就会越少，体积也会逐渐变小，而韧度和强度则不断加大；在这个过程中，块铁转化为钢，成语中的“百炼成钢”即出于此意。来源称这种炼钢方法对铁器质量的提高有着重要的帮助，兵器和农具加工技术的提高促进了社会生活的进步；但对于大批量的铁制器具，炼钢的劳动强度太大、生产速度也太慢，因此西汉中期发明了炒钢技","path":"procedures/bai-lian-gang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"百炼钢是 B 维度下秦汉炼钢工序的条目，其兵器与农具器形归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:bangpao-xiangqian","title":"蚌泡镶嵌（Shell Boss Inlay）","name_en":"Shell Boss Inlay","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["周代","西周","漆器","蚌泡","镶嵌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记用蚌泡作为镶嵌，是周代漆器工艺的一种非常流行的装饰手法；在西安普渡村、濬县辛村、宝鸡斗鸡台、洛阳庞家沟等地的周代墓葬中，都发现有大量用蚌泡镶嵌工艺制作的漆器出土。来源称虽未见到完整的器形，但可知确为漆器的镶嵌物；推测有的漆器是以木质或编织物为胎，外涂漆液，再镶以蚌泡。濬县辛村西周墓发现有用数枚蚌泡镶在一个圆盒的边缘上；洛阳庞家沟西周墓则是以蚌泡镶在漆器托上。来源认为这种蚌泡镶嵌实际是现今漆","path":"procedures/bangpao-xiangqian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蚌泡镶嵌是 B 维度下周代漆器表面嵌饰工序的条目，其器形与纹饰归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:bian-xiu","title":"辫绣（Braid Stitch）","name_en":"Braid Stitch","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["战国","汉代","北魏","唐代","清代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记辫绣是战国以来传统的刺绣针法：战国时期刺绣已很精美，且都用辫绣针法，长沙烈士公园楚墓绣品绣龙凤图案，巴泽雷克古墓绣品绣凤栖树间图案；湖北江陵马山砖厂一号墓出土大批战国刺绣，针法主要为辫绣，局部间以平绣。汉代刺绣针法主要运用辫绣，或称锁子绣，针法整齐牢固，有开口和闭口之分，开口用以填充装饰花纹，闭口适于表现线条。北魏敦煌莫高窟 125—126 窟发现刺绣残片，为北魏时期一佛二菩萨说法图，在黄","path":"procedures/bian-xiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"辫绣是 B 维度下战国至清刺绣针法的条目，其纹样题材与服用功能归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:bianzhi","title":"编织（Basketry and Cordage）","name_en":"Basketry and Cordage","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["新石器时代","编织","苇席","竹编","绳索"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记纺织的前身应该是编织，在浙江余姚河姆渡遗址上发现了大量的苇席残片，其中残存最大的可达 1 平方米，从上面可以看出编织技术的运用；发现的绳索中，粗的直径是 1.2 厘米，细的是 2—3 毫米。稍后的良渚文化遗址中出现了竹编的席子、箩筐、簸箕、篮子等，编织技术已经十分高明，其中有十字纹、人字纹、梅花眼、辫子口等花样的变化，说明原始先民对编织技术的丰富和发展。黄河流域的仰韶文化遗址中出土的苇席，其","path":"procedures/bianzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"编织是 B 维度下新石器时代编结工序的条目，其纹样与器物类型归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:bo-lou","title":"拨镂（Dyed-and-Carved Ivory Decoration）","name_en":"Dyed-and-Carved Ivory Decoration","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["唐代","牙雕","拨镂","象牙","染牙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ivory_carving_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记唐代牙雕十分精美，创造了拨镂的方法：将象牙染成红绿诸色，表面再刻以花纹；更有在刻纹上涂以其他色彩的，倍增华美。例如红牙拨镂尺、绿牙拨镂尺，都是拨镂技法镌刻出凤凰、鸳鸯、雁、绶带鸟、飞马、麟、鹿，以及折枝花、宝相花等；有的花鸟间列，作为尺寸的界格，设计巧妙。来源又把拨镂与平脱、平文、螺钿、木画并列为唐代多种装饰技法之一。来源未给象牙染色所用的染料与温度、刻刀形制、刻纹深度、涂色材料，也未给拨","path":"procedures/bo-lou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"拨镂是 B 维度下唐代牙雕染色与刻花工序的条目，其纹样与尺制功能归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:bo-rou-diao","title":"薄肉雕（Low Relief Carving）","name_en":"Low Relief Carving","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["北朝","麦积山","薄肉雕","泥塑","飞天"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sculpture_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记麦积山岩石松软，不便于雕刻，以泥塑和壁画为主；泥塑历经 1500 余年而坚硬如石，这是因为当时的工匠研制出了一种特殊的胶泥。在麦积山上七佛阁的长廊上方，有一种“薄肉雕”技术表现的“飞天”，将浮雕和绘画巧妙地结合起来；由于“飞天”的衣裙飘带飞舞、鲜花散浮，上七佛阁亦称散花楼。来源只记薄肉雕的所在、题材与浮雕加绘画的结合效果，未给胶泥配方、薄肉雕的起伏厚度、制作工具与工序。","path":"procedures/bo-rou-diao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"薄肉雕是 B 维度下北朝麦积山泥塑浮雕工序的条目，其造像题材与石窟形制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:caihui-tao-zhizuo","title":"彩陶制作工艺（Painted Pottery Production）","name_en":"Painted Pottery Production","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["新石器时代","彩陶","仰韶文化","半坡","手制"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记新石器时代晚期制陶技术已发展到很高水平，能够制作出非常优美的“彩陶”。所谓彩陶，是指一种绘有黑色、红色装饰花纹的红褐色或棕黄色的陶器；这个时期的文化称之为“彩陶文化”，因彩陶最早在河南渑池仰韶村发现，所以也称“仰韶文化”。彩陶用手捏制，先民凭着灵巧的双手和熟练的技巧，能够制作出圆而工整的各种造型；当陶坯还未全干的时候，用木片、卵石等工具把陶坯的表里打磨光滑，然后画上装饰花纹，再入陶窑烧制，","path":"procedures/caihui-tao-zhizuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"彩陶制作工艺是 B 维度下新石器时代彩陶成形、打磨、绘彩与烧成工序的条目，其纹样与器形归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:chao-gang","title":"炒钢（Puddling Steel）","name_en":"Puddling Steel","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["西汉","炒钢","生铁","脱碳","矿石"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记百炼钢对大批量铁制器具而言劳动强度太大、生产速度也太慢，因此西汉中期发明了炒钢技术，即将生铁加热，添入矿石搅拌，以降低生铁的含炭程度，然后在锻制中，提高了百炼钢制器的速度和质量。来源把炒钢置于百炼钢的局限之后叙述，作为提高产量与质量的后续技术；未给炉温、矿石种类与配比、搅拌工具、脱碳终点判断与一次炒炼的产量。","path":"procedures/chao-gang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"炒钢是 B 维度下西汉炼钢工序的条目，其兵器与农具器形归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:chelun-jiance-fa","title":"车轮检测法（Wheel Inspection Methods）","name_en":"Wheel Inspection Methods","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["春秋战国","考工记","制车","车轮","检测"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"woodworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在“车辆制造技术”一节引《考工记》：其中记载有一套比较完备的制车工艺及规范，仅对车轮一项的检测方法就有两条。其一曰“萬（通‘矩’）之，以眡其匡也”，即把轮子平放在与轮子等大的平整圆盘上，以检测轮子是否与圆盘彼此密合。其二曰“县之，以眡其辐之直也”，即用悬线检测车轮中相对应的辐条是否平直。\n\n来源只给这两条检测方法及其白话解释，没有说明“萬”或“矩”的具体量具形制、圆盘的材质与制作、悬线的固定","path":"procedures/chelun-jiance-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"车轮检测法是 B 维度下《考工记》制车工序的条目，其车制规范与器物形态归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:chromate-oxidation-treatment","title":"铬盐氧化防锈处理（Chromate Oxidation Anti-Rust Treatment）","name_en":"Chromate Oxidation Anti-Rust Treatment","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["秦代","青铜剑","铬盐氧化","防锈","秦始皇兵马俑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记秦始皇兵马俑坑中曾出土许多精美的青铜兵器，如青铜剑，剑刃变细加长，一般长在 90 厘米，为近身防卫的格杀利器；剑身的脊刃对称，表面经过了铬盐氧化防锈处理，2000 年后被发掘出土后，仍然寒光闪烁，锋利无比。来源只记处理后的表面状态与出土效果，未给铬盐种类、浓度、温度、浸泡或涂刷时间、膜层厚度与检测数据，也未给处理的工具与场所。","path":"procedures/chromate-oxidation-treatment.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铬盐氧化防锈处理是 B 维度下秦代青铜兵器表面处理工序的条目，其剑器形制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:chuai-ran","title":"踹染（Calendering）","name_en":"Calendering","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["明清","苏州","松江","踹染","踹布"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在明清棉织与印染条下记踹染，2016 版说明最完整：踹染又称“踹布”“踏布”，古时经营棉布整理加工的手工业作坊一般以此方式进行生产。其方法是，工人操作时足踏四字形大石，左右滚动，使石下漂染过的棉布紧密光滑。来源引清叶廷琯《鸥陂渔话·观音峰》：“东园相传是前明徐太僕别墅，距上津桥西北半里，地久废为踹坊。”\n\n2016 版又记踹染工匠来源与规模：清代苏州府的踹染工匠主要系江宁、太平、宁国等地人，","path":"procedures/chuai-ran.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"踹染是 B 维度下明清棉布染后整理的工序条目，其染坊分工与踹坊规模归纺织业生产组织相关条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:chuihui-fa","title":"吹灰法（Cupellation）","name_en":"Cupellation","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["唐代","炼银","灰窠","金属提纯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"吹灰法是唐代已广泛应用的炼银工艺，现存唐代炼银渣块表明其提高了银的纯度和回收率。田自秉记其具体做法：用上等炉灰作成灰窠，将含银铅砣置于窠中加热熔化，铅入灰中，纯银留存灰窠上；出土银器测定纯度很高。","path":"procedures/chuihui-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"吹灰法是 B 维度下唐代炼银提纯工序的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:chuiyou-fa","title":"吹釉法（Blown Glazing）","name_en":"Blown Glazing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["明代","景德镇","施釉","吹釉法","竹筒"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在明代瓷器工艺条下记：明代制瓷技术的最大成就，是高质量白釉的烧制成功；工匠掌握了釉料中氧化铝和二氧化硅的比例，使釉色纯白如奶、晶莹明亮，为颜色釉和彩瓷的发展创造了条件。明清瓷器制作工艺的进步与讲究的制作方法分不开：官窑原料精制，采用过箩和绢袋淘炼法，淘炼出的瓷土颗粒精细，又增加高岭土比重，因而瓷胎坚实、透光性好，白度超过 75℃（原文单位照录），烧成温度可达 1310℃；明代已创“利刀”法，","path":"procedures/chuiyou-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"吹釉法是 B 维度下明代景德镇瓷器施釉工序的条目，其白釉品种与彩瓷装饰归陶瓷品种相关条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:ci-huazi","title":"瓷活字（Porcelain Movable Type）","name_en":"Porcelain Movable Type","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["清代中期","瓷活字","徐志定","泰安","周易说略"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记清代的活字印刷有泥、木、铜、铅、瓷活字等技术；清代中期，山东泰安徐志定在泥活字上挂釉，烧成瓷活字，成为最早的瓷活字样式，并印有《周易说略》等书籍。同一段还记李瑶印制的《南疆绎史勘本》上有“仿宋胶泥版印法”字样，以及安徽泾县翟金生用 30 余年积聚 10 余万泥活字、完全遵循毕昇方法制字印诗集的泥活字路线；来源称翟氏先制成阴文正面活字的陶质范母，再以范母翻制反刻成阳文泥活字，这也是近代欧洲铅字","path":"procedures/ci-huazi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"瓷活字是 C 维度下清代中期陶瓷活字制作工序的条目，其印本书籍归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:ci-xiu-hua","title":"瓷绣花（Needle-pricked Porcelain Decoration）","name_en":"Needle-pricked Porcelain Decoration","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["宋代","陶瓷装饰","绣花","针刺纹","刻花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉把宋代陶瓷的装饰方法概括为刻花、印花、绣花、画花等多种，并说明刻花、印花是传统方法，绣花则是用针刺出花纹，画花为后来的绘瓷开创了新的纪元。来源只给这一句工序定义，未记针具形制、刺孔深浅、是否填色，也未指认具体窑口与器物。本 KU 据此立条，与纺织刺绣严格区分。","path":"procedures/ci-xiu-hua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"瓷绣花是 B 维度下宋瓷表面装饰的工序条目，与纺织刺绣分属不同材料谱系。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:cuanbian","title":"攒边（Frame-and-panel Joinery）","name_en":"Frame-and-panel Joinery","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["明代","家具","攒边","格角榫","榫卯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"woodworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉说明代家具的“攒边”技法颇具特色：在四边用 45 度格角榫攒起来，中心板四周出榫装入四边的通槽。来源指出这一做法不仅使木板的结构加固，而且使木板有伸缩的余地，同时也可使木板不露截板纹，增加美观。来源未给格角榫的榫头尺寸、通槽宽度与深度、芯板材质与含水率处理、加工工具与工序顺序。","path":"procedures/cuanbian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"攒边是 B 维度下明式家具框架与芯板结合的工序条目，其家具风格与品类归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:cuo-jin-yin-cuo-tong","title":"错金银与错铜（Gold, Silver and Copper Inlay）","name_en":"Gold, Silver and Copper Inlay","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["春秋战国","青铜器","错金","错铜","镶嵌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖记商周青铜器上开始出现镶嵌绿松石，稍后产生的错金银工艺在春秋中期有所发展。来源以春秋时期“栾书缶”上的错金铭文 40 余字为例；同期燕、赵、蔡等国又相继出现用红铜在铜器表面镶嵌各种图案（错铜）的新工艺。来源未展开错金银与错铜的刻槽、嵌入、磨错等具体工序，也未区分错金、错银、错铜三者在材料与工艺上的差异。\n\n赵农记错金银技术是春秋时期创立的一种技术：用金银或其他金属丝、片镶嵌入铜器表面，形成纹","path":"procedures/cuo-jin-yin-cuo-tong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"错金银与错铜是 B 维度下春秋战国青铜器表面镶嵌工序的条目，其纹饰与器物装饰归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:daogeng-huozhong","title":"刀耕火种（Slash-and-Burn Cultivation）","name_en":"Slash-and-Burn Cultivation","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["新石器时代","刀耕火种","烈山氏","烧荒","石斧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记刀耕火种的劳动方法，是在大面积砍伐森林之后，将林木晒干，然后放火烧荒，使土地自然形成一种条件，用木棒的尖头点孔种植；传说中的“烈山氏”时期就是这种耕作方式，因此石斧的需求量特别大。来源把原始社会的耕作分为前后两期：前期采用“烈山氏”的办法，经常是种完一茬庄稼就将土地放弃，再寻找新的森林放火烧山；后期则对土地实行翻耕，即培育土地的养分、进行土地加工、连续耕作、稳定收成，石锄在这一阶段的作用很重","path":"procedures/daogeng-huozhong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"刀耕火种是 B 维度下新石器时代耕作工序的条目，其农具类型与器形归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:daolian-fa","title":"捣练法（Silk Scouring by Pounding）","name_en":"Silk Scouring by Pounding","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["汉代","丝精练","脱胶","草木灰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"捣练法是汉代丝的精练方法，据班婕妤《捣练赋》所述，已能利用砧杵的机械作用和草木灰的化学作用相结合。这种方法提高了生丝的脱胶效率，缩短了工艺时间。","path":"procedures/daolian-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"捣练法是 B 维度下汉代丝精练工序条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:dianzi-zhaopai","title":"电子照排（Electronic Phototypesetting）","name_en":"Electronic Phototypesetting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["20世纪末","电子照排","桌面印刷","计算机排版","喷绘"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记电子照排随着计算机桌面印刷系统的普及而出现，解决了许多设计印刷的难题，使印刷技术产生了巨大的飞跃；在 20 世纪末期的中国社会，电子排版、喷绘技术以及复印机技术已经逐渐改变了现代印刷技术中的许多制作观念和方法；印刷技术的革新促进了版面设计的发展，也推动了中国现代文化的发展。来源只给技术出现条件、效果与相邻技术，未给系统型号、字体格式、输出精度与时间节点。","path":"procedures/dianzi-zhaopai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"电子照排是 C 维度下 20 世纪末计算机排版工序的条目，其版面设计与印刷观念归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:diao-you","title":"雕釉（Sgraffito Glaze Carving of Cizhou Ware）","name_en":"Sgraffito Glaze Carving of Cizhou Ware","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["宋代","磁州窑","雕釉","剔花","胎釉对比"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记磁州窑系以黑白对比为装饰路线，其中画花和雕釉两种最流行。雕釉是在瓷胎上先施白釉或黑釉，然后按花纹要求剔刻去花纹以外的空间，露出瓷胎，使形成胎与釉的色泽对比；更有在釉上加以刻划，以增加层次感。画花与雕釉普遍见于以磁州窑为中心的附近各窑，如修武当阳峪窑、河南登封窑、禹县扒村窑、山西介休窑等；其中当阳峪窑运用多层色釉进行剔划，显出多色釉的装饰花纹，是在陶瓷装饰上具有独创性的作法。来源未给釉层厚度","path":"procedures/diao-you.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"雕釉是 B 维度下宋代磁州窑系剔刻装饰工序的条目，其纹样与器形归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:diaoban-yinshua","title":"雕版印刷（Woodblock Printing）","name_en":"Woodblock Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["唐代","宋代","佛经","宋版书","版画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_technique","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"雕版印刷是唐代发明、宋代成熟的印刷技术。高丰记其发明时间尚无定论：明胡应麟《少室山房笔丛》称“雕本肇于隋时，行于唐世”，但隋代雕版印刷实物至今尚未发现；1974 年西安唐墓出土唐初（7 世纪初）梵文陀罗尼咒单张印刷品，1906 年吐鲁番出土唐武周《妙法莲华经》残卷（不晚于 690—699 年），表明雕版印刷术最迟在唐初 7 世纪初已发明。高丰另记工艺程序为制备木板、图文稿反贴于木板、雕刻反体图文、","path":"procedures/diaoban-yinshua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"雕版印刷是 C 维度下唐宋印刷技术条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:die-shao","title":"叠烧（Stack Firing）","name_en":"Stack Firing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["金代","定窑","叠烧","砂圈叠烧","砂圈叠烧法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记金代定窑大体和北宋相似，制作工整，釉色乳白，装饰精巧；除采用宋代的覆烧技术外，还运用了叠烧的方法。叠烧的具体做法是在器物的内底刮去一圈釉，然后使另一器皿的足放置在无釉圈内。来源据此判断这样可以增加烧制的产量、降低成本。\n\n夏燕靖 2016 在“金瓷的工艺特色”条下给出同一做法的另一名称与更完整的工序位置：金代定窑是北宋定瓷的直接继续，唯有不同的是金代定瓷除一部分产品继续采用宋代的“覆烧”工","path":"procedures/die-shao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"叠烧是 B 维度下陶瓷装烧工序的条目，与覆烧同属定窑窑具与装烧技术谱系。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:diezhu-jishu","title":"叠铸技术（Stack Casting）","name_en":"Stack Casting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["东汉","叠铸","层叠铸造","泥范","温县"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在秦汉铁器铸造处记：东汉时已熟练地掌握了层叠铸造的先进技术。在河南温县发现的一座烘范窑，出土了 500 多套铸造车马器零件的叠铸泥范；把若干个泥范叠合起来，装配成套，一次就能铸造几个或几十个铸件。同时，叠铸技术有重大改进，由原来的双孔浇铸改为单孔浇铸。来源称叠铸技术的改进进一步提高了生产效率，节省了原料。\n\n来源没有说明叠铸泥范的单片尺寸、叠合层数、套接与定位方式、涂料与焙烧温度、浇口与流道","path":"procedures/diezhu-jishu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"叠铸技术是 B 维度下东汉铁器批量铸造工序的条目，其车马器零件与生产效率归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:divination","title":"占卜（Divination）","name_en":"Divination","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["商代","占卜","龟甲","牛肩胛骨","蓍草"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记商人利用占卜巫术企求与神灵相通，主要方式就是用龟甲卜筮；当时中原地带气候湿润、河流众多，有利于龟的生长，而商人在贸易中，对龟的收购是其中的一项内容。占卜的过程是先将龟壳的腹甲和背甲分开、打磨清洁，将牛肩胛骨的骨臼去掉、刮磨整齐，然后在龟骨的背面多处钻孔，但不能穿透，再用蓍草在钻孔处烧灼；于是正面的地方会出现裂纹，常常是一横一竖、纹路变化多端，成为卜形，称为“兆璽”（原文如此），兆璽的方向就是","path":"procedures/divination.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"占卜是 B 维度下商代卜筮工序的条目，其卜甲卜骨与青铜礼器形制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:duanban-taoyin","title":"短版套印（Duoban Color Printing）","name_en":"Duoban Color Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["明代","清代","短版","套印","拱花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_technique","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"高丰记使用多色套印是清代书籍装帧的一大特色，多色套印书籍在清代后期更加盛行。清刻戏曲唱本《劝善金科》用五色套印。清道光十四年（1834）涿州卢坤所刊《杜工部集》25 卷用六色套印，正文用墨笔，眉批、注、标点等分别用紫、绿、黄、蓝、红等色，是我国古代使用色彩最多的彩色套印刻本。清康熙至嘉庆年间刻印的《芥子园画传》则采用了明代创造的短版套印工艺，并有所发展。\n\n赵农把明末短版技术的出现视为明代书籍印刷","path":"procedures/duanban-taoyin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"短版套印是 C 维度下明清书籍彩色套印工序的条目，其书籍装帧与版式归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:dyeing","title":"染色（Dyeing）","name_en":"Dyeing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["上古","商周","草染","石染","媒染"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记中国上古的染色技术，利用草本植物的染色特性，称为“草染”，同时也发现了矿物色的颜料，称为“石染”；于是染色技术可以有线染、匹染、多次浸染、媒染等方法。对染料的观察和研制提高了衣料的色彩变化程度，获得了制衣的基本材料，染色成为社会生产的职业。来源并记葛麻是一种粗纤维、含有植物胶质，需要漂染才能适应纺织，一般采取沤泡的办法，便于剥取、纺织，成为商周时期平民的服装材料；商周有专营丝织的手工业机构来","path":"procedures/dyeing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"染色是 B 维度下上古纺织染色工序的条目，其色彩与服饰等级归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:erci-shaocheng-fa","title":"二次烧成法（Twice-Fired Glazing）","name_en":"Twice-Fired Glazing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["唐代","唐三彩","二次烧成","素烧","釉烧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在唐三彩条下记其烧造分两个步骤，即素烧和釉烧。2009 版称唐三彩为低温釉陶器，用白色瓷土作胎，以含铜、铁、钴、锰等元素的矿物作釉料着色剂；素烧将成型晾干后的坯体入窑烧到 1000℃ 或 1100℃ 左右，凉却后在白色胎体表面施以配好的釉汁，第二次入窑经 900℃ 烧成。来源并解释：工匠对焙烧火候控制得当、窑内火焰辐射均匀、釉汁与胎体膨胀系数均衡，器物冷却时收缩趋向一致，因而不易变形。\n\n2","path":"procedures/erci-shaocheng-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"二次烧成法是 B 维度下唐代低温铅釉陶的胎体与釉层分两次烧成的工序条目，其品种与器类归唐三彩 term。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:fenben-fuzhi","title":"粉本复制（Pounce Transfer）","name_en":"Pounce Transfer","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["唐宋","粉本","刺绣","缂丝","画绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reproduction_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新把粉本解释为“绘画施粉上样的稿本”。宋代工笔绘画直接进入设计领域，使造物设计的目的脱离原来实用性的发展、以表现绘画为目的，虽然只限于刺绣、陶瓷等领域，但宋之后的设计者已自觉不自觉地认同这种以写实描绘、粉本摹写为主要方式的做法，于是汉代以来中国造物意匠化的设计到宋代画上了句号。\n\n来源记粉本移用于刺绣、缂丝的方法：将画稿经扎孔、扑粉、勾勒而将画稿印漏，完成复制过程。来源判断：经复制所得的纹样束","path":"procedures/fenben-fuzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"粉本复制是 B 维度下画稿移写工序的条目，其纹样风格与写实化倾向牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:fengxiang-nisu","title":"凤翔泥塑（Fengxiang Clay Sculpture）","name_en":"Fengxiang Clay Sculpture","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["凤翔","泥塑","民间工艺","彩绘","虎脸"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sculpture_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在“文革时期的工艺美术”一节记陕西凤翔泥塑：凤翔泥塑源于汉唐，盛于宋元，历史渊源已久。其工艺严谨，有选土、和泥、制坯、阴干、粉洗、描线、上色、涂油等十多道工序（2016 作“10 多道工序”）。凤翔泥塑品种有上千之多，分浮雕类挂件与圆雕类摆件：浮雕类代表作如虎脸、牛面、蟾蜍等；圆雕类如坐虎、坐狮、斗牛以及生肖马、生肖羊、生肖猪等，都是人民群众喜闻乐见的。\n\n两版均接记“文革”遭遇：到了“文革","path":"procedures/fengxiang-nisu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"凤翔泥塑是 B 维度下陕西凤翔民间彩绘泥塑的制作工序条目，其题材与民俗功能归民间美术相关条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:fengyao-jishu","title":"封窑技术（Kiln Sealing and Reduction Firing）","name_en":"Kiln Sealing and Reduction Firing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["新石器时代","父系氏族社会","封窑","还原烧成","灰陶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记父系氏族社会的手工业得到更迅速发展，制陶工艺技术也更为提高，采用封窑技术和轮制是其突出的成就。烧制陶器时严密封窑，使陶坯中的铁元素还原，从而制成硬度较高的灰陶；并能通过控制烧制末期的窑内空气和温度制成黑陶。此外，除了用天然粘土外，还开始用瓷土作原料，烧制成白陶。来源另记黑陶时期的陶窑有很大的改进，例如火口很小、有较窄较深的火膛，这能加强窑室的温度，也便于在烧时封闭而使之还原，提高器物的烧成","path":"procedures/fengyao-jishu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"封窑技术是 B 维度下新石器时代晚期陶器还原烧成工序的条目，其陶色与器类归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:fenshi-fa","title":"焚失法（Burn-Out Casting）","name_en":"Burn-Out Casting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["商代","焚失法","失蜡法","铸造","技术起源"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在“失蜡法的西域传入与本土既有技术的争辩”知识链接中，转述主张失蜡法为中原独立创造的一方所举的证据：有学者提出失蜡法源于焚失法，而焚失法最早见于商代中晚期，这种技术是在失蜡法出现之后才逐渐消亡的，这说明失蜡法是延续而来的创新技术。\n\n来源只给焚失法的名称、最早出现时代、与失蜡法的先后及“逐渐消亡”的判断，没有解释焚失法的工艺过程，没有说明“焚”的对象是蜡、油脂还是其他可焚材料，也没有给出焚失","path":"procedures/fenshi-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"焚失法是 B 维度下商代铸造工序的条目，其与失蜡法的源流关系归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:fenzhu-fa","title":"分铸法（Sectional Casting）","name_en":"Sectional Casting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["青铜铸造","商周","合范法","浑铸法","焊接"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"分铸法是把器物上过分复杂或突出的部件先单独铸出、再与主体合铸的青铜铸造方法，与“一次铸成”的浑铸法相对。四册来源都在合范法的框架内提到它，但**对它与浑铸法、焊接法的先后关系给出两套不相容的说法**：田自秉作“浑铸→分铸→焊接”三段递进，李立新作“分铸法最初是浑铸……后改为焊接”，把分铸法的起点放回浑铸。本 KU 把两套说法并列，不裁定先后。","path":"procedures/fenzhu-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"分铸法是 B 维度下商周青铜铸造工序分化的关键环节，其成立与否直接决定器物附件能否脱离主体范型单独成形。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:fu-shao-fa","title":"覆烧法（定窑与景德镇）（Inverted Firing）","name_en":"Inverted Firing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["北宋中期","定窑","景德镇","汝窑","覆烧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记北宋中期定窑采取了覆烧的方法：不再采用一个匣钵烧制一件瓷器的方式，而是增加瓷坯的数量，将瓷坯反扣于垫圈上，组装成大型的匣钵，以提高产量和质量。覆烧的缺点是碗盘口沿无釉，但这也形成其自身的特征。来源又记宋代景德镇的烧制技术在拉坯、过内范、修足等工序中，从仿定窑的“覆烧法”到形成自己的技术细密的特点，不断提高生产质量。来源只给两处覆烧的装烧方式、目的与口沿缺陷，未给垫圈与匣钵的材质尺寸、装烧层数","path":"procedures/fu-shao-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"覆烧法是 B 维度下北宋定窑及景德镇装烧工序的条目，其窑具与瓷器口沿特征归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:gong-hua","title":"拱花（Embossed Printing）","name_en":"Embossed Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["明代","拱花","压印","笺谱","吴发祥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记吴发祥和胡正言在印制笺谱的过程中，还采取了拱花印刷技术：用刻版压印，使花纹凸显，犹如后来的钢印；来源称这种“化旧翻新，穷工极变”的创造思想，正是明代书籍印刷不断进步的根本原因。来源只给拱花的压印方式、凸起效果与所用笺谱，未给刻版深度、压印压力、纸张湿度、拱花与短版套色的先后关系。","path":"procedures/gong-hua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"拱花是 C 维度下明代笺谱压印花纹工序的条目，其笺谱版式与图样归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:guan-gang-fa","title":"灌钢法（Co-fusion Steel Making）","name_en":"Co-fusion Steel Making","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["隋唐","灌钢法","鼓风","炼炉","冶铁"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农在隋唐冶铁技术处记“冶铁技术由于有了鼓风和炼炉的出现，灌钢法得以推广”。来源只给灌钢法推广的技术条件与时代语境，未给灌钢法的原料配比、生铁与熟铁的合炼方式、操作步骤、产品性能与产地。本条照录这一句，不据来源外材料补写灌钢工序。","path":"procedures/guan-gang-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"灌钢法是 B 维度下隋唐冶铁工序的条目，其铁器与农具器形归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:han-dai-qiqi-zhizuo-fengong","title":"汉代漆器制作分工（Han Lacquerware Division of Labor）","name_en":"Han Lacquerware Division of Labor","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["汉代","漆器","分工","素工","髹工"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记作为家具、食具的漆器在汉代非常发达，且品类繁多、质量精良，制作过程有着细致的分工。在汉代的漆器铭文中可以看到素工、髹工、上工、黄涂工、画工、雕工、清工、供工、造工等不同工序的技术工匠，分工之细说明了漆器的合理制作过程，而当时的漆器制作成为了一种高超技艺的体现。来源并以西汉马王堆出土的大量漆器为例，称其光泽如新、艳丽耀人，在生活器皿的制形上也满足了不同阶层人们生活的需要，漆制的碗、盘、碟、筷、","path":"procedures/han-dai-qiqi-zhizuo-fengong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉代漆器制作分工是 B 维度下汉代漆器工序组织的条目，其器形与纹样归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:han-dai-zhijin-cixiu","title":"汉代织锦与刺绣工艺（Han Brocade and Embroidery）","name_en":"Han Brocade and Embroidery","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["汉代","织锦","经锦","蜀锦","刺绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖记汉代织锦仍为经线显花，图案有云气纹、鸟兽纹、文字、几何形纹、人物骑猎纹等；汉锦用色多达五种以上，东汉时蜀锦开始采用加金技术，色彩效果更趋富丽。汉代刺绣技术亦很高超，针法有平针、锁绣、钉线绣等，善于用简练的“线”来表现图案。来源同段还记秦汉纺织机械的改进（手摇纺车、脚踏提综斜织机、提花机）与马王堆一号汉墓丝织品，但本条只取织锦与刺绣的工艺特征，机械另见相关条目。","path":"procedures/han-dai-zhijin-cixiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉代织锦与刺绣工艺是 B 维度下汉代织造与绣制工序的条目，其纹样与用途归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:hanjie","title":"焊接（Bronze Soldering and Joining）","name_en":"Bronze Soldering and Joining","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["春秋战国","青铜器","焊接","浑铸法","分铸法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记焊接是将器物的部件或局部在制作过程中用热加工方法连接在主体上。来源称青铜器的制作最早是运用浑铸法，即器物用范块组合一次铸成；以后又创造了分铸法，即将部件或局部先铸出，然后和主体一次铸成；而焊接则可以在主体铸成后，将部件或局部补接上去。焊接方法的应用，既便利铸制过程，也可以丰富器体的造型，提高了青铜器的艺术效果。来源未给焊料成分、加热方式与温度、接头形式、焊接强度与焊缝处理，也未给焊接与分铸","path":"procedures/hanjie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"焊接是 B 维度下春秋战国青铜器部件连接工序的条目，其器形与装饰归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:hefan-fa","title":"合范法（Piece-Mold Casting）","name_en":"Piece-Mold Casting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["青铜铸造","商周","泥模","外范","内范"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖记青铜器制作由冷煅发展到熔铸，再从用单扇范制作简单工具和乐器发展到能制作空体容器，是工艺技术上的一次飞跃。空体容器须用合范法：先用细泥做成器物泥模，在模上雕刻纹饰，凹下部分用刀直接刻划、凸出部分用泥贴塑；泥模烘干后制作浇铸用的内、外范。外范用调和拍打成扁平状的细泥捺在陶模上，使原模纹饰衬印在泥片上，干后按器物形体特点分成若干块，并在相邻两片间做出若干三角形榫。内范可将原泥模刮去一层，刮去厚度","path":"procedures/hefan-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"合范法是 B 维度下商周青铜器铸造的核心工序，其器形与纹饰归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:hua-hua","title":"画花（Painted Decoration of Cizhou Ware）","name_en":"Painted Decoration of Cizhou Ware","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["宋代","磁州窑","画花","铁锈花","白地黑花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记河北彭城磁州窑胎质粗松，有白釉、黑釉各种瓷器；磁州窑系运用黑白对比的装饰方法，其中以画花和雕釉两种最流行。画花是在白釉上画出黑色花纹；在黑釉上画褐色花纹的，称为铁锈花。画花笔力豪放洗练，别具一格，来源称这种画花开创了后世着重花绘的装饰领域。画花与雕釉普遍见于以磁州窑为中心的附近各窑，如修武当阳峪窑、河南登封窑、禹县扒村窑、山西介休窑等。来源未给画笔材质、色料成分、画花与施釉的先后、烧成温度","path":"procedures/hua-hua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"画花是 B 维度下宋代磁州窑系彩绘装饰工序的条目，其纹样与器形归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:hualuo-zhiji","title":"花罗织机与织造（Flower Luo Loom and Weaving）","name_en":"Flower Luo Loom and Weaving","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["宋代","花罗","织机","斫刀","绞综"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记宋代花罗的织造非常复杂，并据宋人薛景石《梓人遗制》描述花罗织机：不用梭子，也不用筘，而利用斫刀来代替投杼和打纬；斫刀呈梳形，背有 3 个直槽，可安杼子，旁开小孔用以引杼；织花不用花楼，而是另挂绞综，以脚踏带动。来源又记花罗利用罗组织孔眼的疏密变化织出几何图案与牡丹、茶花等花纹，并列出宋代罗的众多名目。来源未给斫刀的尺寸与材质、绞综片数、经纬密度和织造工时。","path":"procedures/hualuo-zhiji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花罗织机与织造是 B 维度下宋代丝织机具与提花工序的条目，其织物名目与纹样归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:hunzhu-fa","title":"浑铸法（Whole-Piece Casting）","name_en":"Whole-Piece Casting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["春秋战国","曾侯乙编钟","浑铸","整体浇铸","分范合铸"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在春秋战国青铜冶铸技术处记：1978 年 5 月湖北随县战国早期曾侯乙墓出土青铜器群，其中曾侯乙编钟共 65 枚，“都是采用浑铸法（整体浇铸）”，并娴熟地运用了分范合铸、复印花纹等技艺，形制精确，保证了音律的准确，至今仍可演奏悦耳动听的乐曲。来源据此称曾国仅为诸侯小国，能够铸造如此精湛的青铜器物，说明当时冶铜业的规模和推广程度已经相当普及。\n\n来源另在失蜡法来源争辩的知识链接中把浑铸法列为中","path":"procedures/hunzhu-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"浑铸法是 B 维度下春秋战国青铜器整体浇铸工序的条目，其钟律与器形归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:huo-pao-zhuzao","title":"火炮铸造（Cannon Casting）","name_en":"Cannon Casting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["明代","清代","火炮","铸造","锻造"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记明代火炮研制有一定水平，现存最早的是洪武年间的“大碗口铳”铁炮，证明了明代大炮从铜制到铁制的过程；明清时期的大炮主要采用锻造和铸造制造技术。锻造是将熟铁锻造成为瓦片状，然后用铁钉连接，锻造后再严格锉磨，使内壁光滑，保证大炮的使用质量。铸造则通过铸型、铣模、合模、化料、浇注、起模、验膛、齐口、镟膛、钻火门、制铳车等一系列过程完成。来源又记明代正德年间传入“佛朗机炮”并立即仿制，称佛朗机是波斯文","path":"procedures/huo-pao-zhuzao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"火炮铸造是 B 维度下明清火器制造工序的条目，其军事制度与战争背景归 D、E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:huodong-lianchuang-zhimo","title":"活动帘床纸模抄纸法（Movable Mould Papermaking）","name_en":"Movable Mould Papermaking","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["魏晋南北朝","造纸","帘床纸模","纸药","剡藤纸"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"papermaking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记造纸技术在三国以后迅速提高，纸张成为书写的基本材料；造纸技术中出现了活动的帘床纸模，即将竹帘放在框架中，不断连续地抄捞出湿纸，然后通过晾晒，获得成千上万张纸张。来源引西晋张华《博物志》：“剡溪古藤甚多，可造纸，故即名纸为剡藤。”剡溪在浙江嵊县，从西晋到唐代剡藤纸驰名数百年。此时的造纸在纸浆中加入植物粘液，以改变纤维的悬浮性能，并加强湿纸的韧性，易于湿纸分揭，提高了纸张的内在结构稳定性；这种技","path":"procedures/huodong-lianchuang-zhimo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"活动帘床纸模抄纸法是 B 维度下魏晋造纸工序的条目，其纸张用途与书写材料归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:huozi-yinshua","title":"活字印刷（Movable-Type Printing）","name_en":"Movable-Type Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["北宋","元代","庆历","毕昇","王祯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记活字印刷是宋代一个极为重要的创造发明：隋唐时期的雕版印刷虽有开天辟地之功，但仅在上层社会和宗教活动中流布；北宋活字印刷的出现，不仅提高了印刷速度，而且应用范围广泛，对传播和普及文化知识有着根本的意义。活字印刷是北宋时期平民毕昇设计研制出的一种便捷、高效的印刷技术。赵农引沈括《梦溪笔谈·卷十八》记其法：“庆历中，有布衣毕昇，又为活版。其法用胶泥刻字，薄如钱唇，每字为一印，火烧令坚。先设一铁版，","path":"procedures/huozi-yinshua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"活字印刷是 C 维度下北宋至元代单字排印工序的条目，其书籍版式与字体归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:jian-yin","title":"碱印（Alkali Resist Printing）","name_en":"Alkali Resist Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["唐代","印染","碱印","碱缬","防染"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记碱印也可称为碱缬，是利用碱对织物的化学作用，经染后产生不同色彩的花纹。由于染料物理性质不同，有的能溶于酸性，有的能溶于碱性；同时碱剂能脱去丝胶，使织物松软，较多地吸收染料。所以碱剂印出的花纹能形成深浅不同的色调，例如浅地深花或深地浅花。碱缬用纸板镂刻花纹，套色碱印是更为精美的一种。来源未给碱剂种类与浓度、纸板厚度、镂花刀法、印碱后染色温度与时间，也未给碱印与其他防染法的工序组合。","path":"procedures/jian-yin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"碱印是 B 维度下唐代碱剂防染印花工序的条目，其纹样与织物用途归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:jiazhu-tai","title":"夹纻胎（Jiazhu Lacquer Body）","name_en":"Jiazhu Lacquer Body","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["战国","漆器","纻麻","脱胎法","胎骨"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware_technique","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夹纻胎是战国时期出现的漆器胎体工艺：以纻麻为胎骨，用生漆将纻麻逐层贴在泥或木胎上形成外胎，干实后去掉内胎，再加以髹漆。其原理相当于后世“脱胎法”，是脱胎漆器的前身，胎体轻巧牢固，被视为中国漆器工艺的独特创造。","path":"procedures/jiazhu-tai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"夹纻胎是 B 维度下战国漆器胎骨成形工艺条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:jiezhi-yinhua","title":"介质印花（Medium Printing）","name_en":"Medium Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["唐代","印染","介质印花","碱剂印花","媒染剂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在唐代印染工艺中列“介质印花”，两版文字基本相同：介质印花是以助剂为印染原料，不能直接印染，须根据染料的性能进行浸染。来源给出两条路径。\n\n其一是碱剂印花：着碱处生丝胶膨胀，印花后水洗，丝胶脱落，显出白色花纹；也可再次入染，利用生熟丝吸色率的不同产生深浅不一的色泽效果。\n\n其二是媒染剂印花：用明矾胶浆粉之类的媒染剂印花，或清除媒染剂印花，可利用酸碱中和印染绛地白花。来源判断介质印花是我国古代","path":"procedures/jiezhi-yinhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"介质印花是 B 维度下唐代印染助剂工艺的条目，其纹样与服用方式归纺织与服饰相关条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:jingtailan-zhizuo","title":"景泰蓝制作七过程（Seven-stage Cloisonné Making）","name_en":"Seven-stage Cloisonné Making","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["明代","景泰蓝","铜胎掐丝珐琅","掐丝","点蓝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记景泰蓝的制作较为复杂，大体分为七个过程，并逐一说明：制胎、掐丝、烧焊、点蓝、烧蓝、磨光、镀金。来源同时指出景泰蓝的正式学名为铜胎掐丝珐琅，“景泰蓝”一词辛亥革命前后才采用，以北京为生产中心。本 KU 只承载工序，名物定义、明清生产史与品种分类归 `terms/jingtai-lan.md`。来源未给铜胎厚度、焊药与釉料配方、烧成温度与时间、镀金厚度。","path":"procedures/jingtailan-zhizuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"景泰蓝制作七过程是 B 维度下铜胎掐丝珐琅的工序条目；其名物、历史与品种归 terms/jingtai-lan.md。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:jintong-fa","title":"浸铜法（Copper Cementation）","name_en":"Copper Cementation","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["宋元","元代","炼铜","浸铜法","水法冶金"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在元代兵器条下记：元代兵器业是元代优先发展的行业；元灭南宋后，为巩固统治并继续进行对内对外战争，急需先进兵器，朝廷从组织管理机构方面予以保证，并对制造技术进行督导，因此兵器制造技术有较大提高。元代火铳设计科学，用材选择优质铜，铸造工艺讲究，铸出的铜质火铳表面光净、质地细腻，符合兵器技术要求。与此同时，提炼铜的方法也大有改进，已运用“化学方法”（2016 另一处平行段落作“科学方法”），这是世","path":"procedures/jintong-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"浸铜法是 B 维度下宋元炼铜工序的条目，其矿冶管理制度归镔铁局等机构条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:jinyin-pingtuo","title":"金银平脱（Gold and Silver Pingtuo Inlay）","name_en":"Gold and Silver Pingtuo Inlay","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["唐代","漆艺","金银工艺","铜镜装饰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金银平脱是唐代盛行的漆器装饰工艺：把金银薄片剪刻成花纹，粘贴在髹漆胎体上，再加髹漆数层，最后研磨推光，使金银花纹与漆底齐平并显露出来。五册来源有直接记载（李立新全书未见此项），但\"平脱\"与\"贴金银／包金银\"是否同一工艺，来源间存在实质分歧。","path":"procedures/jinyin-pingtuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金银平脱是 B 维度下唐代漆器装饰技法的代表工序，同时牵涉铜镜装饰与金银器工艺的交叉。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:juan-su-tai-gu-hei-guang","title":"卷素胎骨与黑光（Juan-su Lacquer Body and Black Lacquer Finish）","name_en":"Juan-su Lacquer Body and Black Lacquer Finish","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["元代","漆器","卷素","梢当","黑光"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉引《辍耕录》详记元代漆器的制作过程，称其非常复杂。胎骨由梓人将脆松劈成薄片，在旋床上胶粘而成，名曰“卷素”；髹工买来后刀刳胶缝，使干净平正，夏天不致有胶汛之患，再用牛皮胶和生漆微嵌缝中，名曰“梢当”；然后胶漆布之，依次加粗灰、中灰、细灰，灰为砖瓦捣屑筛过，分粗、中、细；粗灰过后停令日久坚实，砂皮擦磨，再加中灰、细灰，砖石车磨去灰浆，候干后漆之，谓之“糙漆”；再停数月，车磨糙漆，才用黑光。来源","path":"procedures/juan-su-tai-gu-hei-guang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"卷素胎骨与黑光是 B 维度下元代漆器制胎与髹饰工序的条目，其上灰、糙漆、揩光程序归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:kehua","title":"刻划（Engraving Decoration）","name_en":"Engraving Decoration","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["战国","青铜器","刻划","刻纹","铁工具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记刻划的装饰是随铁工具的提高而出现的，因为铁质坚韧，易于刻铜。在战国时期，产生了许多著名的刻划装饰青铜工艺品，如辉县的刻纹宴乐铜鉴、长治的刻纹铜匜、琉璃阁的刻纹铜奁、上海博物馆所藏的刻纹铜杯等；这些刻纹细如毫发，线条流畅，像一幅幅精巧的线纹装饰画。来源未给刻刀形制与材质、刻线宽度与深度、刻划工序、铁工具普及的时间，也未给刻划与铸造纹饰的工效比较。","path":"procedures/kehua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"刻划是 B 维度下战国青铜器表面线刻工序的条目，其纹样与器物归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:la-ran","title":"蜡染（Wax Resist Dyeing）","name_en":"Wax Resist Dyeing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["秦汉","东汉","唐代","宋代","蜡染"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"高丰记新疆民丰县尼雅出土了东汉的蜡染花布，洛甫县也出土了汉代的蓝印花布，并据此判断汉代蜡染和蓝印花布的工艺技术已经成熟。该册只给出这两件出土实物作为证据，未记蜡染的防染材料、绘蜡工具、染色流程与纹样细节。夏燕靖 2009 另记西南地区的少数民族在秦汉时期已掌握蜡染（蜡缬）技术，当时称“阑干斑布”；蜡染布面上设计者巧妙运用点、线的结合，图像色彩饱满、层次丰满、疏密有致、生动朴实；蜡染技术后来逐步传入","path":"procedures/la-ran.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蜡染是 B 维度下跨秦汉至现代的防染印花工艺的条目，其纹样与织物用途归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:lan-yinhua-bu","title":"蓝印花布（Blue Calico）","name_en":"Blue Calico","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["汉代","宋代","元代","清代","蓝印花布"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"高丰记洛甫县出土了汉代的蓝印花布，与新疆民丰县尼雅出土的东汉蜡染花布同条并记，并据此判断汉代蜡染和蓝印花布的工艺技术已经成熟。田自秉则引康熙《松江府志》“药斑布俗名浇花布，近年所在皆有”及《长洲县志》所记浇花布染法，说明清代刮印花的具体工序：以灰粉渗矾涂作花样，然后随作者意图加染颜色，晒干后刮去灰粉，白色花纹灿然出现；来源明确说前者实际上是今天所通称的“蓝印花布”。两册一记汉代实物、一记清代工序与","path":"procedures/lan-yinhua-bu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蓝印花布是 B 维度下防染印花织物的条目，其刮印花工序、名称与宋代、清代产地归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:lian-gang-ji-shu","title":"炼钢技术（Steelmaking）","name_en":"Steelmaking","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["春秋战国","钢剑","块炼铁渗碳","中碳钢","楚地"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖记春秋战国时期冶铁术的另一项重大发展是炼钢技术。长沙杨家山出土的春秋晚期钢剑经检验含碳量为 0.5%～0.6%，属中碳钢；河北易县燕下都出土的战国晚期钢剑（长 104 厘米）、钢戟和钢矛，经检验是块炼铁渗碳后锻打而成的。来源称这些兵器比青铜制品要锋利得多，尤其是战国时楚地出产的钢铁兵器更是闻名遐迩。","path":"procedures/lian-gang-ji-shu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"炼钢技术是 B 维度下春秋战国钢铁兵器材料工序的条目，其兵器形制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:liuchao-qingci-zhuangshi-liufa","title":"六朝青瓷装饰六法（Six Decorative Methods of Six Dynasties Celadon）","name_en":"Six Decorative Methods of Six Dynasties Celadon","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["六朝","青瓷","压印","刻花","堆贴"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记六朝青瓷的装饰方法有压印、刻花、堆贴、塑饰、雕镂、釉彩等。压印用刻花印模在瓷坯未干时印压花纹，如同盖图章，承东南地区印纹陶传统；六朝压印只放在视线接触到的主要部位，如瓷罐多在肩部压印几何纹，组成一圈二方连续饰带。刻花用较硬工具在瓷坯上刻划装饰线纹。堆贴用瓷泥捏塑物象贴饰在瓷坯上，形成浮雕效果，如铺首纹、花朵纹。塑饰用瓷泥捏塑物象装饰瓷坯，具有立体效果，如瓷盒盖纽作鸟形、瓷尊三足作熊形，魂瓶","path":"procedures/liuchao-qingci-zhuangshi-liufa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"六朝青瓷装饰六法是 B 维度下六朝青瓷表面装饰工序的条目，其器形与纹样题材归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:liujin","title":"鎏金（Amalgam Gilding）","name_en":"Amalgam Gilding","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["战国","金汞齐","铜器装饰","镀金"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鎏金是把金溶于水银形成金汞齐、涂于铜器表面后加热使水银蒸发、金固着于器表的镀饰工艺，又称火镀金。赵农记战国中期鎏金技术已应用于制器；田自秉记其操作为将金箔剪碎入坩埚加热、按一比七比例加入水银熔成金泥，蘸盐、矾等物涂于铜器，经炭火温烤使水银蒸发。","path":"procedures/liujin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鎏金是 B 维度下战国金属镀饰工艺条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:liuli-shaozhao","title":"琉璃烧造（Glazed Architectural Ceramics）","name_en":"Glazed Architectural Ceramics","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["明清","铅釉陶器","十样","门头沟","法华器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"琉璃烧造是以铅釉陶器烧造建筑琉璃瓦脊、面砖和日用器皿的工艺。明代采用高岭土制胎，明清琉璃砖瓦有10种规格、称“十样”；明初南京设琉璃窑72座，迁都后移至门头沟琉璃渠村，清代与海王村琉璃厂合并为厂官窑。门头沟琉璃渠村的窑场“从元到明清两朝一直用此处九龙山下质地良好的黑格土烧制琉璃，又称黑窑、御窑”（2009、2016 同文）。2016 版另记其产品含建筑瓦脊、面砖与日用器皿。","path":"procedures/liuli-shaozhao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"琉璃烧造是 B 维度下明清建筑琉璃工艺条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:lost-wax-casting","title":"失蜡法（Lost-wax Casting）","name_en":"Lost-wax Casting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["青铜铸造","春秋战国","精密铸造"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"失蜡法是以蜡制模、外敷泥范、加热排蜡后浇注铜液以获得复杂镂空铸件的一种精密铸造工艺，又称蜡模法、拔蜡法、出蜡法。五册来源都以曾侯乙墓尊盘为标志性实物，说明其在中国青铜铸造史上的技术地位。田自秉又引宋人赵希鹄《洞天清禄集》，逐句记录了宋代铜器以蜡为模、外敷澄泥与黄土、留窍泻铜汁的完整程序，是来源中时代最晚而步骤最详的一条记载。","path":"procedures/lost-wax-casting.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"失蜡法是 B 维度下精密铸造工艺的程序性锚点，其镂空效果同时决定了器物形态的可能性。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:lunzhi-fa","title":"轮制法（Wheel Throwing）","name_en":"Wheel Throwing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["新石器时代","陶器","陶轮","慢轮","轮纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在“新石器时代陶器制作工艺”知识链接中记陶器制作有手制和轮制两种。最初陶坯放在木板或竹席上以便移动旋转，有的还垫以树叶；后来逐渐采用转动的轮盘（幔轮），既便于制陶时的盘筑和加印纹饰，又可利用旋转修整器口。这一方法大约开始于仰韶文化中期，为轮制陶器的发展奠定基础。轮制法把泥料放在陶轮上，借快速转动的力量用提拉方式使之成形，主要流行于黄河流域和长江中下游；其特点是器形规整、厚薄均匀，器表里有平行","path":"procedures/lunzhi-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"轮制法是 B 维度下新石器时代陶器成形工序的条目，其器形与纹饰归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:ming-changcheng-qiangti-gouzhu","title":"明长城墙体构筑（Ming Great Wall Construction）","name_en":"Ming Great Wall Construction","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["明代","万里长城","山海关","墙体构筑","巨砖"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"construction_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记明代重修的万里长城西起嘉峪关，东达山海关，并延伸修筑“辽东边墙”直至鸭绿江畔，其中部分地区还修筑了内长城，全长 12700 多里，合 6000 多公里，俗称“万里长城”；明代政府以长城为依托，沿线设置九所边镇，进行持久的军事防御。其中山海关到山西段的墙体修筑，以巨砖和石条为外表的包裹，而内部以黄土、石灰、江米质黏合一体；外墙有垛口，作为防御设施，相隔不远建有烽火台，以备防御了望；许多地方山势","path":"procedures/ming-changcheng-qiangti-gouzhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明长城墙体构筑是 B 维度下明代军事防御墙体工序的条目，其边镇制度与防御体系归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:ming-qing-caici-zhuangshi","title":"明清彩瓷装饰技法（Ming-Qing Polychrome Porcelain Decoration）","name_en":"Ming-Qing Polychrome Porcelain Decoration","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["明代","清代","斗彩","五彩","粉彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖记明代釉上彩也很流行，后期彩瓷有斗彩和五彩。斗彩创始于成化年间（又称逗彩）：先在瓷胎上用青料绘花纹轮廓，加白釉高温烧成后，再在釉上填绘红、黄、绿、紫等彩料，再入炉焙烧；釉下青花与釉上多彩结合、相互辉映，故称“斗彩”。斗彩主要作为宫廷赏玩品，一对瓷杯值银一百两。正德时“素三彩”以黄、绿、蓝、紫为主，不用红色。嘉靖、万历时用红、黄、绿、紫、孔雀蓝等多种彩料直接在烧成的瓷器上描绘花纹，焙烧成五彩，","path":"procedures/ming-qing-caici-zhuangshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明清彩瓷装饰技法是 B 维度下明清景德镇等地釉上彩工序的条目，其器形与纹样归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:mosu-jiehe-zhi-taoyong","title":"模塑结合制陶俑（Mold-and-Model Terracotta Figures）","name_en":"Mold-and-Model Terracotta Figures","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["秦代","兵马俑","陶俑","陶马","模塑结合"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记秦始皇陵兵马俑多用模塑结合的方法制成：先用陶模作出初胎，再覆盖一层细泥，然后进行加工刻划着彩。彩绘有朱红、枣红、绿、粉绿、紫、蓝、湖蓝、中黄、橘黄、赭、黑、白等十多种，以朱红、粉绿、赭色为主；不同部位用不同色彩以体现质感，如面部和手用粉红表示肤色，铠甲用褐色、甲扣用朱红，战袍和行縢用同一色以在对比色调中取得统一。陶俑、陶马的头、身、腿都是分模制作后粘接，有的先烧后接，有的先接后烧；烧成火候","path":"procedures/mosu-jiehe-zhi-taoyong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"模塑结合制陶俑是 B 维度下秦代陶俑成型与装配工序的条目，其俑像造型与彩绘纹样归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:mozhi-shiqi","title":"磨制石器（Ground Stone Tools）","name_en":"Ground Stone Tools","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["新石器时代","石器","研磨","打击","作窝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stoneworking_technique","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖记磨制石器是新石器时代普遍采用的石器加工技术：先选取石块，打制成石斧、石刀、石锛、石铲、石凿等工具的粗坯，再用研磨的方法进一步加工，使器形更加规整、尖端与刃口更加锋利、表面更加光洁，更符合使用要求。这一技术约在 10000 多年前开始普遍采用，来源称磨制石器极大促进了生产力提高，先民由此踏入新石器时代，史学家称之为“新石器革命”。来源另在知识链接中记带柄工具：峙峪文化部分旧石器已装木柄，带柄","path":"procedures/mozhi-shiqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"磨制石器是 B 维度下旧石器时代至新石器时代石器加工工序的条目，其器形与功能分化归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:muye-jianzhi-tiehua","title":"木叶与剪纸贴花（Leaf and Paper-cut Decoration）","name_en":"Leaf and Paper-cut Decoration","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["宋代","吉州窑","木叶纹","剪纸纹","玳瑁斑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉把吉州窑置于宋瓷诸窑中叙述，称其在瓷种与装饰两方面都可与其他宋窑相比。吉州窑除生产青瓷、白瓷、黑瓷外，还生产彩瓷和绿釉瓷；在瓷胎上常用木叶和剪纸粘贴，然后施釉，经烧制形成花纹，来源称这是一种独创。同段还记黑釉斑纹以玳瑁斑最著名，常用洒釉方法形成活泼自然的效果。来源未给树叶与剪纸的处理方式、粘贴介质、釉料配方和烧成参数。","path":"procedures/muye-jianzhi-tiehua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"木叶与剪纸贴花是 B 维度下吉州窑陶瓷表面装饰的工序条目，其纹样与窑口风格归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:ni-tiao-panzhu","title":"泥条盘筑法（Coil Building）","name_en":"Coil Building","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["新石器时代","陶器成形","几何印纹硬陶","变形"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"泥条盘筑法是把泥搓成条、盘筑成器形的陶器成形工艺。田自秉记较大陶器搓成泥条盘筑成器形，或几部分相接后表里抹平修整。2016 版记几何印纹硬陶采用此法成形，器形常不甚规整，存在器身歪斜、高低不等和圆器不圆等缺陷，因高温烧成与成形工艺掌握不好而容易变形，大型器物变形概率更高。","path":"procedures/ni-tiao-panzhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"泥条盘筑法是 B 维度下史前至先秦陶器成形工艺条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:nian-ya","title":"碾轧（Calendering）","name_en":"Calendering","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["宋代","丝织","碾轧","浆料","整理"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉把宋代丝织的制造加工大致分为两种方法：一是经纬线的加拈，以不同拈度使织物幅面产生绉纹变化，并利用不同拈向产生不同光泽反射，如绉与闪光缎；二是碾轧技术的应用。碾轧有两种路线：丝织物织造完工后放入浆桶浸泡，经过捣杵后再碾轧；或在织物未下机前涂上浆液，然后再下机碾轧。来源称经过碾轧的织物幅面平整、光泽增强、织花装饰感提高，达到光、平、洁、满的效果。","path":"procedures/nian-ya.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"碾轧是 B 维度下丝织后整理工序的条目，与加拈并列构成宋代丝织制造加工的两类方法。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:nianjin-pianjin","title":"捻金与片金（Twisted Gold and Flat Gold）","name_en":"Twisted Gold and Flat Gold","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["元代","织金锦","纳失失","畏兀兀","捻金"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记元代染织工艺在封建中央和地方设有专门管理机构并各有分工，主要生产金锦等高级染织品；这种丝织加金工艺在元代非常盛行。织金锦原称“纳失失”，元代改译为“畏兀兀”，擅长这种工艺的多是回鹘族人。生产织金锦的机构几乎遍布全国，新疆也设有“别失八里局”和“忽丹八里局”（忽丹即今和田）。近年乌鲁木齐盐湖元墓发现的织金锦遗物，采用捻金和片金两种加工方法织造：捻金是将薄金片缠在线上捻成金线；片金又称平金，是","path":"procedures/nianjin-pianjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"捻金与片金是 B 维度下元代织金锦加金工序的条目，其生产机构与织物名目归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:paituo-gufeng","title":"排橐鼓风（Box-Bellows Air Blast）","name_en":"Box-Bellows Air Blast","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["春秋","冶铁","鼓风","排橐","皮囊"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在“生铁冶铸技术”一节记：中国在较短时间里实现由块炼铁到生铁冶铸的技术突破，与商周高度发展的青铜冶铸技术分不开，其中最关键的设备是鼓风技术的进步。春秋末年，冶铁炉已使用巨大的鼓风设备——排橐（tuó）。这是一种采用牛皮特制的大皮囊，囊上有柄，以人力推动，有竹管通往冶铁炉，是鼓风吹火器。较大的冶铁炉“鼓橐装炭”需用 300 人进行操作。使用排橐可将冶炼温度提高，使生铁冶铸的效率和质量都大大推进","path":"procedures/paituo-gufeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"排橐鼓风是 B 维度下春秋末年冶铁炉鼓风工序的条目，其生铁冶铸效率归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:pearl-ground-sgraffito","title":"珍珠地划花（Pearl-Ground Sgraffito）","name_en":"Pearl-Ground Sgraffito","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["宋代","磁州窑系","划花","珍珠纹","瓷器装饰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在“宋瓷的装饰手法”一节列印花、刻花、划花、剔花、贴花、镂花、弦纹、春字纹与珍珠地划花九种。珍珠地划花一条只一句：在主题纹样空隙处划饰又细又密的珍珠纹，是磁州窑系装饰方法之一。来源未展开工具、工序与烧成，也未给具体器物实例。","path":"procedures/pearl-ground-sgraffito.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"珍珠地划花是 B 维度下宋代磁州窑系瓷器装饰工序的条目，其纹样与器形归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:pingmian-tidi-fa","title":"平面剔地法（Flat Relief with Background Cut Away）","name_en":"Flat Relief with Background Cut Away","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["汉代","东汉","画像石","石雕","平面剔地"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sculpture_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉把汉代平雕（平面浅雕）分为平面阴刻与平面阳刻：平面阴刻在平面上阴刻线条，用线表现物象动态，以孝堂山石刻为代表；平面阳刻保留物象的线或面，将空余地方刻去，以武氏祠石刻为代表；南阳石刻同属平面阳刻，但陪衬地子用粗犷线条表现，形成面与线的对比。山东画像石的主要表现方法有阴线刻、平面剔地刻与平面剔地加线。武氏祠石刻用平面剔地法：保留图像石面，将空余部分浅刻剔去，多层构图、物象多作正侧面描写，装饰性极","path":"procedures/pingmian-tidi-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"平面剔地法是 B 维度下汉代画像石雕刻工序的条目，其图像题材与建筑载体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:pinhe-liang","title":"拼合梁（Built-up Beam）","name_en":"Built-up Beam","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["宋代","营造法式","拼合梁","拼合柱","缴背"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"woodworking_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在宋代家具条下记：宋代家具制作出现木结构拼合构件。这一做法原本是建筑梁上为了节约木材，用小料拼成大料，常用的有拼合梁和拼合柱。其好处（2009 作“其好处是”，2016 作“其做法好处是”）是，拼合梁在大梁上加“缴背”，用来补救大梁断面不足，更减轻下面大梁的负重；《营造法式》中有专门记述。宋代家具中的大件物就有采用此法加工而成。\n\n来源给出一个实物例证：现藏于镇江博物馆（2016 作“江苏省","path":"procedures/pinhe-liang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"拼合梁是 B 维度下宋代木作小料拼大的构件制作条目，其家具形制与建筑制度归家具与《营造法式》相关条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:qianzhu-maozhu","title":"嵌铸法与铆铸法（Inlay and Riveted Casting）","name_en":"Inlay and Riveted Casting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["商代","三星堆","青铜铸造","嵌铸","铆铸"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新《中国设计艺术史论》在三星堆太阳形器图版下记：三星堆文化，直径 85cm，青铜；器物正中阳部突起，周围五芒呈放射状，芒外围以晕圈；“该器用嵌铸法和铆铸法分五部分二次铸成”；太阳形器表现了蜀人对太阳神的崇敬（商），图注注明引自《三星堆祭祀坑》。\n\n来源只存这一条图注，未定义嵌铸法与铆铸法，未说明五部分如何划分、哪一部分用何法、二次铸成的先后与接合方式，也未给该器的出土地点、共存关系与年代测定。","path":"procedures/qianzhu-maozhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"嵌铸法与铆铸法是 B 维度下三星堆青铜器成形的工序条目，其器物形态与信仰含义归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:qianzi-yinshua","title":"铅字印刷（Letterpress Printing）","name_en":"Letterpress Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["19世纪末","近代","铅字印刷","凸版","活铅字"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记现代印刷技术在 19 世纪末期随西方石版印刷和铅字印刷技术传入中国，这也是西方社会对中国印刷技术的发展；中国明清时期的雕版印刷，铜、铅、木、泥、陶等传统印刷方法面临被淘汰的危机。铅字印刷在很长的时间内对中国文化的传播有着积极的作用：采用凸版的形式，将活铅字排版组合，利用轮转机印刷，这种方法在 1980 年前的杂志、报刊印刷中广泛采用。来源只给铅字印刷的传入时段、凸版排字与轮转机印刷，未给铅字","path":"procedures/qianzi-yinshua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铅字印刷是 C 维度下近代凸版印刷工序的条目，其信息传播与出版制度归 C、D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:qingtong-xiangqian","title":"青铜镶嵌（Bronze Inlay）","name_en":"Bronze Inlay","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["春秋战国","青铜器","镶嵌","松石","红铜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记镶嵌是在青铜器上嵌饰其他物质材料，或松石，或红铜，或金银丝；这是春秋战国时期流行的装饰手法。来源称春秋时期多用红铜镶嵌，使在青铜的器体上出现红铜，产生色彩对比，有一种和谐的金属光泽感；以后在战国时期盛行的金银错，则更具有富丽辉煌的艺术效果。来源未给嵌槽的开凿方法、槽形与深度、嵌料的固定方式、磨错工序，也未区分松石、红铜、金银丝三类镶嵌在工艺上的差异。","path":"procedures/qingtong-xiangqian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜镶嵌是 B 维度下春秋战国青铜器表面嵌饰工序的条目，其纹样与器物归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:qiqi-mutai-san-zuofa","title":"漆器木胎三作法（Three Methods of Wooden Lacquer Bodies）","name_en":"Three Methods of Wooden Lacquer Bodies","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["汉代","漆器","木胎","旋制","剜削"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记汉代漆器的胎有木胎、竹胎、夹纻等种，主要的是木胎；木胎有三种作法：旋制、剜削和卷制。旋制和剜削多用于大件器物或不规则器形，胎体较重；卷制则是以薄木板圈卷，如奁、卮等圆形器物，胎体较轻。来源只给三种制胎方式与适用器形、胎体轻重的比较，未给旋制与剜削的工具、木材种类与干燥处理，未给卷制的薄板厚度、圈卷层数、粘接材料与裱糊工序。","path":"procedures/qiqi-mutai-san-zuofa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"漆器木胎三作法是 B 维度下汉代漆器胎骨成型工序的条目，其器形与装饰归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:quan-die-fa","title":"圈叠法（Coiled-Layer Wood Core Technique）","name_en":"Coiled-Layer Wood Core Technique","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["唐代","宋代","漆器","木胎","圈叠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"高丰记圈叠法是宋代实用漆器的木胎成型工艺：用易弯曲的杉木切成约 0.2 厘米厚的薄长条，卷制成胎，是在汉代薄片卷木胎的基础上发展而来。制成的胎型轻薄结实、不易变形，在宋代的实用漆器上已广泛运用。来源以湖北监利县福田寺宋墓出土的花瓣形圈足黑漆碗为实例：造型采用自唐代以来流行的花瓣形，器表髹黑褐色漆，器内髹朱漆，胎骨即用 0.2 厘米厚的杉木薄长条卷制而成。\n\n田自秉 2010 记我国漆器制胎传统有木","path":"procedures/quan-die-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"圈叠法是 B 维度下宋代漆器木胎成型的工序条目，其器形与装饰归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:rammed-earth-board-construction","title":"夯土板筑（Rammed-Earth Board Construction）","name_en":"Rammed-Earth Board Construction","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["商代","春秋战国","夯土","板筑","城墙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"construction_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记中国古代城市的特征是城与池的修筑，最早的商代城墙为夯土城，郑州古城就有可能是商前期的毫都，而在湖北黄陂发现的商前期城垣还存有一段护城河。现存的春秋战国城池遗址中，陕西凤翔雍城遗址是秦国早期的城池，东西长约 3300 米、南北长约 3200 米，是采用夯土板筑技术的方式构筑：构筑时先处理地基，将地面挖出凹槽，夯土坚实，然后板筑；这种方法在后来的筑墙过程中一直延续使用，只是将木板换成了木棍，用圆","path":"procedures/rammed-earth-board-construction.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"夯土板筑是 B 维度下先秦城墙构筑工序的条目，其城池形制与城市布局归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:ran-zhi","title":"染纸（潢纸）（Paper Dyeing）","name_en":"Paper Dyeing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["东汉","魏晋","染纸","潢纸","黄柏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"papermaking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记“染色”技术从东汉时期就已开始：一般将黄柏皮中的柏碱作为染料，加入纸浆中，使纸张不但增添美观，还能防止虫蛀。中原自古崇尚黄色，黄纸最为人们喜爱，“装潢”一词的“潢”的使用，即与造纸中的染纸有关。来源引贾思勰《齐民要术》：“凡潢纸，灭白便是。不宜太深，深色年旧色暗也。”并称亦见人们对造纸染纸及使用的深入认识。来源未给柏碱浓度、染液配比、染色时间、温度与色差标准，也未给染纸与抄纸的先后关系。","path":"procedures/ran-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"染纸（潢纸）是 B 维度下东汉以来纸张染色工序的条目，其纸张用途与装潢归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:san-die-fa","title":"三叠法（Three-Layer Ornament）","name_en":"Three-Layer Ornament","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["商代","青铜器","三层花纹","主纹","地纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记商代铜器装饰方法早期脱胎于陶器的拍印，后期则运用刻花的方法；这种刻花在后期已达到细致精巧的程度，且多用三层花纹，增加了层次感。所谓三层花纹，就是除主纹和地纹外，还在较粗的花纹或主体花纹上，再勾刻以细线；这种方法有人又称为“三叠法”。来源未给勾刻工具、细线宽度与深度、三层纹样的先后次序、主纹与地纹的具体配置，也未给三叠法的器物实例。","path":"procedures/san-die-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"三叠法是 B 维度下商代后期青铜器纹饰层次处理的装饰工序，其纹样与器物归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:sao-si-piaobai","title":"缫丝漂白与晾丝法（Silk Reeling, Bleaching and Drying）","name_en":"Silk Reeling, Bleaching and Drying","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["周代","考工记","缫丝","漂白","晾丝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记《考工记》还记载了缫丝、漂白、晾丝等科学方法。来源称“以说水沤其丝”，说水即是一种灰水，能使丝柔软；“以栏为灰，渥淳其帛，实诸泽器，淫之以蜃”，是用栏木灰和蜃灰作为漂白剂；晒丝则应“去地尺暴之”，将丝挂在离地一尺左右的地方，太高丝易干脆，太低则接近潮气，丝不易干。来源称这些都是可贵的生产实践经验的总结。来源未给灰水浓度、浸泡时长与温度、栏木灰与蜃灰的配比、漂白次数、丝帛种类与晾晒时长。","path":"procedures/sao-si-piaobai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"缫丝漂白与晾丝法是 B 维度下周代丝帛处理工序的条目，其丝织品与服饰归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:sheng-tie-rou-hua-ji-shu","title":"生铁柔化技术（Malleable Cast Iron）","name_en":"Malleable Cast Iron","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["战国","可锻铸铁","白心铸铁","黑心铸铁","退火"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖记生铁柔化（锻化）技术是中国冶铁史上的一项重大发明，出现于战国早期。洛阳出土的战国早期铁锛和铁镈农具都经过柔化处理，成为白心和黑心可锻铸铁；湖北大冶铜绿山战国古矿井出土的六角锄、河北易县出土的铁鐏（类似镐的农具）同为例证。来源据此称中国生产黑、白心铸铁的历史早于欧洲 1700 年以上。可锻铸铁的性能介于钢和铸铁之间，具有比铸铁更好的强度和韧性。战国中晚期以后，铸铁广泛用作农具和手工业工具，加","path":"procedures/sheng-tie-rou-hua-ji-shu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"生铁柔化技术是 B 维度下战国铸铁后处理工序的条目，其农具与工具归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:sheng-tie-ye-zhu-ji-shu","title":"生铁冶铸技术（Cast Iron Smelting）","name_en":"Cast Iron Smelting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["春秋","生铁","块炼铁","白口铁","排橐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖记中国在商代就能利用陨铁锻制铁刃铜钺等器具，《禹贡》有梁州贡铁的记载；三门峡市出土的西周晚期虢国国君随葬玉柄铁剑是人工冶铁制品，说明至迟在西周晚期已有人工冶铁。春秋中期之前，冶铁技术尚未成熟，生产的都是海绵状的块炼铁，质量不高；到春秋中期，中国已发明生铁铸造技术。来源以公元前 513 年晋国在汝水旁筑城、“赋晋国一鼓铁，以铸刑鼎”为文献证据，说明当时工匠已较好掌握生铁冶铸技术；南京六合程桥东","path":"procedures/sheng-tie-ye-zhu-ji-shu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"生铁冶铸技术是 B 维度下春秋铁器铸造工序的条目，其器具与农具归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:shiqi-dazhi-sanfa","title":"石器打制三法（Three Methods of Stone Flaking）","name_en":"Three Methods of Stone Flaking","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["旧石器时代","北京人","砸击法","锤击法","碰砧法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stoneworking_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新据北京猿人石制品，把我国打击石片技术归为三种主要方法：砸击法、锤击法和碰砧法，并称其中体现了北京人设计能力的发展（图 1-4）。来源详述砸击法：在平地置放扁平砾石作石砧，将石核垂直置于石砧上，一手握石核、一手握石锤反复砸击石核上端，产生石片；石片两端因受砸击力和石砧反击力影响，呈薄而锐的状态；长度在 20—40 毫米、宽度在 10—20 毫米之间、厚度在 10 毫米以下；所得石片无台面、疤痕","path":"procedures/shiqi-dazhi-sanfa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"石器打制三法是 B 维度下旧石器时代早期石片剥制工序的条目，其器类分工与设计能力判断归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:shiyin-ben","title":"石印本（Lithographic Printing）","name_en":"Lithographic Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["晚清","石印","石印本","药纸","油水分离"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记晚清时期出现了一种石印书籍，这是从西方传过来的印刷形式，大大提高了书籍图版的质量。石印书籍简称“石印本”，是以石材制版，用胶性药墨将原稿过写在药纸上，然后将药纸覆于石面，再揭去药纸；沾有药墨的石版不溶水，没有药墨的石版不溶油，根据油水分离的道理印成书籍。来源只给石印制版与转印的基本原理，未给石版材质、药墨配方、压印机具、印刷遍数与成本。","path":"procedures/shiyin-ben.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"石印本是 C 维度下晚清石版印刷工序的条目，其书籍图版与版本归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:shua-yin-fa","title":"刷印法（Colour Calico Brush Printing）","name_en":"Colour Calico Brush Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["清代","刷印法","彩印花布","浇花布","木版印花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉引康熙《长洲县志》记浇花布染法有二：其一以灰粉渗矾涂作花样，染色后刮去灰粉，白色花纹显现，称刮印花；其二用木板刻花卉、人物、鸟兽等形，蒙于布上，用各种染色搓抹处理后，华彩如绘，称刷印法。来源称后者可称为“彩印花布”，是蓝印花布的进一步发展，清代多产于河南及河北高阳等地。来源未给木板材质与刻版刀法、染色浆料、搓抹工具与遍数、固色与后整理工序。","path":"procedures/shua-yin-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"刷印法是 B 维度下清代织物直接印花工序的条目，其产品彩印花布与产地归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:shuili-gufeng","title":"水力鼓风冶铁（Water-Powered Iron Smelting）","name_en":"Water-Powered Iron Smelting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["东汉","南阳","冶铁","水力","鼓风炉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在秦汉冶铁遗址处记：考古发现许多汉代冶铁遗址，如东汉初年南阳有了铁制鼓风炉，即利用水力转动机械，使鼓风皮囊张缩，不断给高炉加氧。来源称水力鼓风炉的发明，是我国冶炼技术史上的一大进步。\n\n来源在同一段先说“铁制鼓风炉”，后说“水力鼓风炉”，两个名称并见，未说明二者是同一设备的不同称法还是两种设备。来源没有说明水力机械的类型（如水排、水碓式或立轮式）、传动结构、皮囊数量与排列、水头与流量要求，也","path":"procedures/shuili-gufeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"水力鼓风冶铁是 B 维度下东汉冶铁鼓风工序的条目，其水力机械与高炉冶炼归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:siwang-yinshua","title":"丝网印刷（Screen Printing）","name_en":"Screen Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["现代","丝网印刷","照相感光","漏版"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记丝网印刷是利用照相感光的方法在丝网上制成漏版，进行细致地印刷。来源只有这一句，未给丝网材料、感光胶、刮板、套色与干燥工序。","path":"procedures/siwang-yinshua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"丝网印刷是 C 维度下现代漏版印刷工序的条目，其印刷品与版面归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:song-dai-jianzhu-caihua","title":"宋代建筑彩画（Song Architectural Polychrome Painting）","name_en":"Song Architectural Polychrome Painting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["宋代","营造法式","彩画","五彩遍装","碾玉装"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"construction_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在宋代建筑装修条下记：这一时期建筑装修在色彩运用上有较大发展，增强了装饰效果；各种花纹的彩画和琉璃瓦使建筑外观格外豪华绮丽。此点见于北宋李诚编著、朝廷（2009 作“政府”）颁布的《营造法式》。来源把漆绘彩画的全部施工过程归纳为六种类型：（1）五彩遍装；（2）碾玉装；（3）青绿叠罩绫间装；（4）解绿装；（5）丹粉刷装；（6）杂间装。制作程序分为“衬地”“衬色”“细色”“贴金”四个步骤。其中梁","path":"procedures/song-dai-jianzhu-caihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宋代建筑彩画是 B 维度下宋代建筑装修的彩绘工序条目，其建筑制度与构件归建筑与《营造法式》相关条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:sunmao-jiegou","title":"榫卯结构（Mortise-and-Tenon Joint）","name_en":"Mortise-and-Tenon Joint","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["新石器时代","干栏式建筑","木构","榫卯","长江流域"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"woodworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在“原始居住设计的雏形”一节记：生活在长江流域水网地带的人们设计建造了下层架空、上层居住的干栏式建筑，“并且采用了榫卯结构”。来源以这一句概括木构件的连接方式，随即判断这些早期原始木构架建筑奠定了未来木构架建筑的雏形，揭开了中国建筑设计的序幕。\n\n来源没有说明榫卯的类型（如燕尾榫、企口榫、穿榫等）、构件部位、加工工具与制作步骤，也没有给出采用榫卯的具体遗址、构件实物或年代测定。本 KU 只登","path":"procedures/sunmao-jiegou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"榫卯结构是 B 维度下新石器时代木构连接工序的条目，其建筑形态与居住方式归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:ta-ben","title":"拓本（Rubbing）","name_en":"Rubbing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["隋唐","拓本","石经","造纸","印刷术前史"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reproduction_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农在述石经与印刷术产生的条件时记：由于石经对读书人有着特别的经典意义，抄录就是一件迫切而细致的工作；于是，随着造纸水平的提高，以及纸张在人们生活中的应用，拓本技术的出现就有了可能性，这也为印刷术的产生提供了必要的条件。来源只在印刷术前史的因果链中记拓本的出现条件与意义，未给拓本的纸墨、拓包、上纸、捶拓、揭取等工序，也未给拓本形制与年代实例。","path":"procedures/ta-ben.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"拓本是 C 维度下石经复制与印刷术前史工序的条目，其石经文本与书法归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:ta-yin-yinhua","title":"拓印（印花）（Stamp Printing）","name_en":"Stamp Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["唐代","印染","拓印","印花","印花模"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记唐代印染方法很多，著名的有夹缬、蜡缬、绞缬、碱印、拓印等种。其中拓印是刻出印花模，涂上染色，像盖图章一样印出花纹；来源并明确“以上除拓印外，均为防染的印染方法”，即拓印属于直接印花而非防染。来源只给印花模与盖印方式，未给模材、刻模刀法、色浆配方、盖印压力与定位方法，也未给拓印的织物品种与纹样实例。","path":"procedures/ta-yin-yinhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"拓印是 B 维度下唐代直接印花工序的条目，其纹样与织物用途归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:tao-se-yinshua","title":"套色印刷（Color Printing）","name_en":"Color Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["元代","1341","套色印刷","金刚经注","中兴路"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记元代的印刷技术出现了套色书籍：现存台湾的最早套印本，是 1341 年中兴路（湖北江陵）无闻和尚注释的《金刚经注》，扉页中有黑红套色图画，经文为红色正文、黑色注文。来源只给这一件套印本的年代、地点、注释者、扉页与正文的用色，未给分版、套准、颜料与印刷工序。","path":"procedures/tao-se-yinshua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"套色印刷是 C 维度下元代书籍多色印制的条目，其版式与图文关系归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:taoliao","title":"套料（Layered Glass Overlay）","name_en":"Layered Glass Overlay","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["清代","料器","玻璃","套料","搅料"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"glassmaking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记料器即玻璃器，但它含铅量较高、熔点低，适于制作各种欣赏品；清代料器是新兴发展的一个品种，制作甚发达，康熙时期在造办处设玻璃厂进行生产，除北京外山东博山料器也有名，广东、云南等地也有生产。料器装饰方法有套料、搅料、刻纹、金星料等。套料是用几种不同色彩的原料套烧，然后磨出花纹；套在外面的是花纹的色彩，套在里面的是地色。来源未给套烧温度、两种玻璃的膨胀系数匹配、磨花工具与深度。","path":"procedures/taoliao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"套料是 B 维度下清代料器装饰工序的条目，其器形、色彩与产地归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:tiaohua-jieben","title":"挑花结本（Pattern-Heddle Drafting）","name_en":"Pattern-Heddle Drafting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["明清","南京云锦","挑花结本","花本","大花楼提花机"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在南京云锦条下记：南京云锦主要的生产工具是长 5.6 米、高 4 米、宽 1.4 米的大花楼木质提花机，由上、下两人配合操作，一天仅能织出云锦 5—6 厘米（2009 作“五至六厘米”），故有“寸锦寸金”之称。一件云锦从图案设计到最后织成产品，生产工序极为复杂，其中“挑花结本”是我国云锦生产的关键环节。\n\n挑花结本要求工匠按照画师设计的画稿花纹图案，用经纬线交织挑制出花纹样板“花本”，编结成","path":"procedures/tiaohua-jieben.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"挑花结本是 B 维度下明清南京云锦织造的前置工序条目，其织物品种与生产机构分别归南京云锦 term 与江宁织造局 institution。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:tiefan-zhuzao","title":"铁范铸造（Iron Mold Casting）","name_en":"Iron Mold Casting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["战国","铁范","兴隆","磁县","铸造"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铁范铸造是我国铸造技术从泥范（陶范）铸造改进而来的金属范铸造工艺。河北兴隆、磁县出土的战国铁范有镰、锄、双镰、斧、双凿范和车具范，是目前已发现最早的金属范；铁范外形与铸件形状相似、壁厚均匀、收缩一致，可重复使用，铸件规整而少加工，有的能同时浇铸两个以上铸件，薄壁件壁厚不过3毫米。","path":"procedures/tiefan-zhuzao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铁范铸造是 B 维度下战国金属范铸造工艺条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:tiehua-zhizuo","title":"铁画制作（Iron Painting）","name_en":"Iron Painting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["清代","康熙","铁画","铁花","汤天池"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记铁画又称铁花，是以低碳钢为材料、依据画稿制成的一种装饰画。据记载，清代“康熙间，有汤天池者”，“少为铁工，与画室为邻，日窥其泼墨势”，受到启示，于是用铁片仿制成各种书画，如山水、松鹰、竹石、败荷、衰柳、花卉以及书法等。铁画要用铁片经过剪花、锻打、焊接、退火、烘漆等多种制作手续。来源称制出的铁画苍劲有力、古朴大方，作为装饰画衬托在白色墙面上，黑白分明、虚实相生，既是画又具有立体感。","path":"procedures/tiehua-zhizuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铁画制作是 B 维度下清代金属装饰画工艺的条目，其题材与艺术效果归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:tihua-jishu","title":"提花技术（Figured Weaving）","name_en":"Figured Weaving","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["商代","汉代","提花","织造","花楼"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新在汉代造物技术成熟一节以丝织为例：古代织造最初是“手经指挂”，后使用原始腰机；河姆渡出土踞织机机件，包括机刀、卷布轴、梭子、分经木等，织者席地而坐、腰系卷布轴、拉直径线，用分经木与机刀协助织造。吴兴钱山漾出土的麻布，每平方英寸经线七十八根、纬线五十根。到殷商时织造技术有了很大发展，河北藁城出土的商代铜觥上可辨出纨、绡、纱、罗、绉五种织物痕迹。\n\n来源称“最重要的是提花技术的出现”：瑞典远东古","path":"procedures/tihua-jishu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"提花技术是 B 维度下织造显花工序的条目，其织物纹样与织机设备分属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:tongban-yinshua","title":"铜版印刷（Copperplate Printing）","name_en":"Copperplate Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["现代","铜版印刷","蚀刻","蜡层","酸腐蚀"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记铜版是将蜡涂抹在铜版上，用刻刀刻画，再利用酸腐蚀的原理，加深线条的程度，去掉铜版上的蜡层后，用油墨印刷。来源只给涂蜡、刻画、酸腐蚀、去蜡与油墨印刷的基本流程，未给铜版厚度、刻刀、酸液配方、腐蚀时间与压印机具。本条所记为铜版蚀刻印刷，与铜活字排印不是同一工序。","path":"procedures/tongban-yinshua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铜版印刷是 C 维度下现代铜版蚀刻印刷工序的条目，其版面与图像归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:turquoise-inlay","title":"错石工艺（Turquoise Inlay）","name_en":"Turquoise Inlay","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["春秋战国","错石","绿松石","漆汁","越王勾践剑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记错石工艺是将绿松石用漆汁粘嵌在铜器錾槽中打磨，成为错石；湖北江陵楚墓中出土的越王勾践剑，其剑格上的兽面纹错石，就是错石工艺在剑器中应用的典型。来源把错石与错金银、错铜并置在青铜装饰工艺的脉络中叙述，但未给錾槽工具、绿松石的切割与加工方式、漆汁配方与打磨工序。","path":"procedures/turquoise-inlay.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"错石工艺是 B 维度下春秋战国青铜器表面镶嵌工序的条目，其纹饰与剑器装饰归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:xian-zhuang","title":"线装（Thread Binding）","name_en":"Thread Binding","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["明代中期","线装","书籍装帧","四孔装订","包角"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bookbinding_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记线装书在明代中期很受重视：将封面和封底的纸张剪裁成书籍大小，再将天头、地脚和右边书页一起裁齐，用丝线装订成四孔形式；在装订线的上下角，用厚纸包角，保护书籍，以防磨损；在封面上贴好书目标签。来源只给线装的书页裁切、四孔丝线装订、包角与标签，未给线材、孔距、打孔与穿线次序，也未给线装与包背装、蝴蝶装的演变关系。","path":"procedures/xian-zhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"线装是 C 维度下明代中期书籍装订工序的条目，其封面与书目标签归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:xiandai-zaozhi-jishu","title":"现代造纸技术（Modern Papermaking）","name_en":"Modern Papermaking","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["近代","现代","造纸技术","纶章造纸局","硫酸盐法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"papermaking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记中国发明了造纸技术，但近代造纸技术已落后于西方诸国，除宣纸上保持一定优势外，工业用纸和生活用纸与欧洲社会相差很多。1891 年李鸿章创建的“纶章造纸局”是中国近代第一家引进国外造纸技术的工场；民国时期的广州造纸厂能够生产一定数量的新闻纸张，但由于对进口纸浆的依赖，随着抗日战争爆发，无法形成规模化生产；1949 年后造纸技术进一步提高，能够生产造纸机械和纸浆，各种工业用纸和生活用纸的生产数量基","path":"procedures/xiandai-zaozhi-jishu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"现代造纸技术是 B 维度下近代以来造纸工序的条目，其工业制度与中外技术关系归 D、E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:xiu-qi","title":"髹漆（Lacquer Coating）","name_en":"Lacquer Coating","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["战国","漆器","描彩漆","镶嵌","针刻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖在战国漆器装饰特色的知识链接中记：战国是漆器制作的繁荣时期，出现了大量实用与观赏的漆器制品。这一时期的髹漆工艺主要有描彩漆、镶嵌、针刻等，装饰纹样盛行动物纹、云纹、几何图案；其特点是色彩丰富、线条奔放、勾勒交错、气韵生动。来源只作总述，未展开各工艺的具体操作。","path":"procedures/xiu-qi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"髹漆是 B 维度下战国漆器表面涂饰与装饰工序的条目，其器形与纹样归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:ye-tie-shu-qi-yuan","title":"冶铁术在中国的出现（Emergence of Iron Smelting in China）","name_en":"Emergence of Iron Smelting in China","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["冶铁","商代","春秋战国","铁刃铜钺","铁器时代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖记中国是最早出现冶铁术的国家，但冶铁术在中国出现的时间历来有不同说法：史学界据《尚书》《诗经》《左传》等文献，一说商代已有铁器、进而推断西周开始使用铁器，一说冶铁术发明于春秋、战国之交。来源认为考古资料表明后一判断成立：1972 年河北藁城县台西村商代墓葬出土随葬铁刃铜（原文作“铁刃铜”，末字缺），1977 年北京平谷县刘家河早期商墓出土铁刃铜，同期陕西雍城秦公墓出土铁器。来源据此认为商代已","path":"procedures/ye-tie-shu-qi-yuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"冶铁术在中国的出现是 B 维度下铁器技术起源的条目，其年代与器具归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:yin-jing","title":"印经（Warp Printing）","name_en":"Warp Printing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["西夏","印经","茂花闪色锦","经线染色","回鹘"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记 1975 年在宁夏银川市郊的西夏陵区发现一批丝织物，其中最为突出的是一种“茂花闪色锦”，经纬组织和织造方法都比较特别。其经线先经过分段染色：按照设色要求，把不需染色的区段用包裹物包扎，再进行染色，使经线呈现一段一段不相同的色彩效果；用这种经线织造，织物上便产生直向参差不齐的彩色斑纹。来源称这种方法类似现代新疆和田地区所产的印经，并推测织物可能由中原传入，具体生产地点至今不得而知、也无文字","path":"procedures/yin-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"印经是 B 维度下丝织经线局部染色的工序条目，其织物实例与产地推测归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:yin-wen-mo-yin","title":"印纹（模印）装饰（Stamp Impression Decoration）","name_en":"Stamp Impression Decoration","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["春秋战国","青铜器","印模","四方连续","纹样"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖记从设计角度审视春秋战国青铜器装饰，技术进步显而易见：商周时期是在器模上雕纹，到春秋时期进入印纹阶段，这是装饰工艺的一大革新。所谓印纹，就是用一块印花的模子刻出基本花纹，然后趁模胎尚未冷却时用印模在上面盖出花纹；一模多用、连续运用，既省工省时，又取得统一的艺术效果。由于采用模印方法产生装饰花纹，刻花模时需考虑四周相互衔接，上下左右盖印后才能产生整体效果。来源并记纹样格式的变化：商代装饰纹样是","path":"procedures/yin-wen-mo-yin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"印纹（模印）装饰是 B 维度下春秋战国青铜器纹饰复制工序的条目，其纹样格式与器物装饰归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:yin-xunlu-zhizuo","title":"银熏炉制作工序（Silver Censer Manufacturing）","name_en":"Silver Censer Manufacturing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["唐代","法门寺","金银器","钣金","浇铸"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"李立新以法门寺地宫出土的鎏金卧龟莲花纹朵带五足银熏炉为例，观察佛教供具的汉化。来源记该炉“高 295cm，腹深 70cm，炉重 5363 克，钣金成型，附件浇铸，纹饰涂金”。炉盖宽沿平下折，与炉身扣合；沿面錾饰背分式忍冬纹；高隆的盖面底缘饰莲瓣纹一周，面上设计五朵莲花，每朵莲花上卧一龟，龟首反顾、口衔瑞草，莲花以枝蔓相连绕；下层莲瓣镂孔，便于烟香溢出；腹壁饰流云纹，并铆接五只独角天龙兽足，以销钉套","path":"procedures/yin-xunlu-zhizuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"银熏炉制作工序是 B 维度下唐代金银器成形与装饰的工序条目，其器形与佛教供具含义归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:yudiao-taocai-qiaose","title":"玉雕套裁与巧色（Jade Interlocking Cutting and Colour Adaptation）","name_en":"Jade Interlocking Cutting and Colour Adaptation","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["新中国","玉雕","套裁","巧色","因材施艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stoneworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉称玉雕的高度技巧在于“套裁”和“巧色”。套裁是在设计上充分利用刻制器物的余料，再刻成器体的部件；如有的玉瓶上，一对对连环相套的链条长短相称、大小一致，又与器体连接成一个整体，展开之后使人感到比原材料的体积大得多，原来链条的玉材是从瓶腹内挖出来的。巧色则是巧妙根据玉石里外不同的色泽表现不同形象，去瑕显瑜、因材施艺；整个制作过程也就是设计过程。来源未给掏膛、链条环数与接口、巧色选料的具体工序与工","path":"procedures/yudiao-taocai-qiaose.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"玉雕套裁与巧色是 B 维度下玉器加工的两种设计性工序，其产地与作品归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:yun-jian-xiu","title":"纭裥绣（Graded-Shading Embroidery）","name_en":"Graded-Shading Embroidery","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["唐代","刺绣","纭裥绣","退晕绣","抢针绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记唐代刺绣针法除了运用战国以来传统的辫绣外，还采用了平绣、打点绣、纭裥绣等多种针法。纭裥绣又称退晕绣，或即现代所称的抢针绣；它可以表现出具有深浅变化的不同的色阶，使描写的对象色彩富丽，具有浓厚的装饰效果。来源只给针法名称、别名、色阶表现与视觉效果，未给针法起落、行针方向、色线排列与过渡方法，也未给具体绣品实例。","path":"procedures/yun-jian-xiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"纭裥绣是 B 维度下唐代刺绣针法的条目，其纹样题材与服用功能归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:zao-jia","title":"造甲（Armor Making）","name_en":"Armor Making","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["宋代","造甲","铠甲","强弩","梦溪笔谈"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"armor_making","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记造弩技术提高必然影响当时的造甲水平：造甲能够达到“去之五十步，强弩射之不能入。尝有一矢贯札，乃是中其钻空，为钻空所刮，铁皆反卷，其坚如此”（《梦溪笔谈·卷十九》）的地步，意即铠甲的硬度太高，仅能在缀孔中钻穿。来源只在兵器制造的上下文中记造甲的坚固程度与缀孔穿箭的现象，未给甲片形制、材料、层数、编缀方式与打制工序。","path":"procedures/zao-jia.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"造甲是 B 维度下宋代甲胄制造工序的条目，其甲片形制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:zao-jian","title":"造剑（Sword Making）","name_en":"Sword Making","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["宋代","造剑","柔铁","百炼钢","弹力"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalworking_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记宋代人们已经认识到造剑不能用太钢劲的钢材，否则“剑之钢者，刃多毁缺”。剑身以“柔铁”为主，百炼成钢化为绕指柔，钢质以弹力和韧性为显著特色。来源只给宋代造剑的材料选择原则与柔铁、百炼钢的性能判断，未给剑身与刃部的复合结构、锻打次数、淬火与热处理制度，也未给具体剑例与尺寸。","path":"procedures/zao-jian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"造剑是 B 维度下宋代剑器材料与锻制工序的条目，其剑身形制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:zaozhishu","title":"造纸术（Paper Making）","name_en":"Paper Making","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["汉代","造纸术","蔡伦","蔡侯纸","灞桥纸"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"papermaking_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记造纸术是中华民族对人类作出的最杰出贡献。东汉蔡伦的造纸发明，为后来中国文化的传播产生了极其广泛的影响；来源引《后汉书·宦官传》：“自古书契多编以竹简，其用缣帛者谓之为纸。缣贵而简重，并不便于人。伦乃造意，用树肤、麻头及敝布、鱼网以为纸。元兴元年奏上之，帝善其能，自是莫不从用焉，故天下咸称蔡侯纸”。来源并记造纸术在西汉时期已经出现，1933 年在新疆罗布泊、1957 年在西安灞桥相继发现了西汉","path":"procedures/zaozhishu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"造纸术是 B 维度下汉代造纸工序的条目，其纸张用途与书写材料归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:zhaoxiang-zhiban","title":"照相制版（Photomechanical Plate Making）","name_en":"Photomechanical Plate Making","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["现代","照相制版","胶片感光","图像制版","图文并茂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记照相制版的出现，进一步弥补了铅字印刷简单的缺陷，可进行复杂的插图，达到图文并茂的效果；照相制版是采用胶片感光的原理，将细致的图像制作成版式加以印刷。来源只给感光原理与图文效果，未给网线、感光材料、制版流程与设备。","path":"procedures/zhaoxiang-zhiban.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"照相制版是 C 维度下现代图像制版工序的条目，其版面设计与图文关系归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:zhi-quan-fu-shao","title":"支圈覆烧（Ring-Supported Inverted Firing）","name_en":"Ring-Supported Inverted Firing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["北宋中期","南宋","定窑","磁州窑","景德镇窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖 2009 记南宋中期景德镇等窑出现支圈覆烧工艺，开始在南方推广使用。这种窑具一次性使用，可以保证质量、减少变形、提高装烧密度。来源只作一句总述，未展开支圈形制、装烧流程与覆烧器物的口沿处理。\n\n夏燕靖 2016 补足形制、装烧流程与来源地：支圈是覆烧窑具，以瓷土制作，呈圆圈状，圈内侧有垫阶；使用时平放一枚支圈，将一个口沿无釉的芒口碗与待烧器物坯体扣置在支圈内的垫阶上，再叠置规格相同的支圈，","path":"procedures/zhi-quan-fu-shao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"支圈覆烧是 B 维度下北宋定窑始创、南宋传至景德镇等窑的装烧工序条目，其窑具与瓷器质量归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:zhiding-zhishao","title":"支钉支烧法（Spurred Firing）","name_en":"Spurred Firing","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["晚唐","宋代","秘色瓷","汝窑","官窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖先在唐代秘色瓷条下记：1987 年 6 月陕西扶风县法门寺地宫发现唐代供奉的佛指骨和大批文物，其中有 16 件晚唐越窑秘色瓷，器类有碗、盘、碟等，颜色天青、如玉一般青翠；其烧制方法是“支钉撑烧法”，此法比北宋汝窑提早百余年。来源据此判断秘色瓷是唐代越窑精品、数量极少，并进一步证实“秘色瓷”在民间不能使用的说法。2009 作“提早了 100 余年”，2016 作“提早了百余年”。\n\n2009 ","path":"procedures/zhiding-zhishao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"支钉支烧法是 B 维度下晚唐至宋瓷器装烧工序的条目，与覆烧、叠烧同属窑具与装烧技术谱系。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:zhitao","title":"制陶（Pottery Making）","name_en":"Pottery Making","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["新石器时代","陶器","陶泥","盘泥","拉坯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记陶是黏土与水、火复合而形成的新材料，它的形成改变了原始先民的制器思维方式。陶器从无到有、再发展到用，从一些黏土、砂子开始，通过水的调和成为陶泥，其后需要个人的设计来完成，拌泥、淘洗、加料、盘泥、拉坯、制器，每一个环节都是一种创造性的设计意识。来源称陶器的出现一般认为受藤器粘附泥胎被烘烤之后的成形所启示，并强调原始先民对石质、砂质、黏土认识的不断增强以及火的广泛使用，必然导致新材质器具的出现；","path":"procedures/zhitao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"制陶是 B 维度下新石器时代陶器成器工序的条目，其器形与纹样归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:zhuanlun-paizifa","title":"转轮排字法（Rotary Type Setting）","name_en":"Rotary Type Setting","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["元代","王祯","木活字","排字","印刷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"转轮排字法是元代王祯发明的活字排字方法，大大减轻了排字工人的劳动强度。王祯在安徽旌德县任县尹时请木匠制作木质活字30000多个，试印自纂《大德旌德县志》，全书6万余字不到一个月印出百部。","path":"procedures/zhuanlun-paizifa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"转轮排字法是 C 维度下元代活字排字工序条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:zhubian-yishu-jiagong","title":"竹编艺术加工方法（Bamboo Weaving Techniques）","name_en":"Bamboo Weaving Techniques","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["新中国","竹编","车花","拼花","穿珠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bamboo_weaving_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"田自秉记竹编的艺术加工方法十分丰富，列出五种：编织，即用竹丝、篾片以挑和压的方法构成经纬交织；车花，是将竹节车成一定形状和装饰；拼花，是利用竹的表面或断面拼成花型或器皿；穿珠，是将竹节制成小段进行穿结；翻簧，是利用竹簧加工制成各种器皿。竹编上的装饰还有刻花、烫花、彩漆等。来源称我国竹编工艺遍布南方各省，以四川、浙江、福建、湖北等地最有名，并记四川多种竹编品类与自贡龚扇。来源未给竹材种类与处理、篾丝","path":"procedures/zhubian-yishu-jiagong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"竹编艺术加工方法是 B 维度下竹材编织与装饰工序的条目，其地方品类与名匠归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"procedures:zhuo-yu","title":"琢玉（Jade Working）","name_en":"Jade Working","type":"procedure","type_zh":"程序","color":"#EC4899","tags":["商周","琢玉","铊子","砣机","和田玉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stoneworking_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农记人们对玉料的选择、切割、磨制、钻孔、雕刻等技术的提高，成为商周时期玉器制作的特点。商代玉器以绿、青、褐色为主，还包括灰、白、黄、黑等颜色，从玉器的材质可以鉴定，大多是新疆和田玉石以及河南南阳玉；从商代玉器的制器中得知，琢玉的金属工具已广泛使用，这对玉器的成形有很大的作用。在一些玉器花纹的琢磨中，铊子发挥了作用：铊子又称砣机，是一种圆形工具，可以安装在车床上，用脚踏产生转动，是制玉不可缺少的工","path":"procedures/zhuo-yu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"琢玉是 B 维度下商周玉器加工工序的条目，其器形与礼制用途归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:baitong","title":"白虎通（Baitong）","name_en":"Baitong","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["东汉","班固","辟雍","三纲六纪"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《白虎通》又称《白虎通义》《白虎通德论》，为东汉白虎观经学会议文献汇编，班固撰。2016 册称其有专门章节讨论“辟雍”学宫的技艺教育，并以“三纲六纪”影响当时造园思想与古典园林规划理论。","path":"publications/baitong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:bamboo-annals","title":"竹书纪年（Bamboo Annals）","name_en":"Bamboo Annals","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","编年史","夏商","盘庚迁殷","离宫别馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"history","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《竹书纪年》是战国时期成书的编年史。赵农引以说明夏桀“作琼宫瑶台”的推想，以及夏朝后期天降陨石、地震、伊洛枯竭等灾异；又引古本记商代“在汤灭夏以至纣之灭，二十九王，用岁四百九十六年”，“自盘庚迁殷，至纣之灭，二百七十三年更不徙都”。2016 记自盘庚迁殷至纣之亡二百五十三年、更不徙都，纣时稍大其邑，南距朝歌、北距邯郸及沙丘皆为离宫别馆。","path":"publications/bamboo-annals.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下先秦编年史的锚点，其宫室记载同时服务 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:beiping-jianpu","title":"北平笺谱（Beiping Jianpu）","name_en":"Beiping Jianpu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","鲁迅","书籍装帧","笺谱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"print_album","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《北平笺谱》是鲁迅运用线装书传统形式设计的书籍：暗蓝色宣纸封面、签条书名、沈兼士题字、白色宣纸加框、黑字朱印、粘贴于书面右边偏上角、粗线装订，风格清丽悦目。2016 册以其为例说明鲁迅对书籍装帧与封面设计的提倡。","path":"publications/beiping-jianpu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下视觉传达与出版物的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:bowu-yaolan","title":"博物要览（Bowu Yaolan）","name_en":"Bowu Yaolan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","谷应泰","窑器","古器物"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《博物要览》为明代谷应泰撰，天启年间（1621-1627）刊行，16 卷，论古器物、字画、织绣、印宝，详记柴窑、定窑、修内司官窑、哥窑、官窑、建窑、弟窑、汝窑等。","path":"publications/bowu-yaolan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:cansang-cuibian","title":"蚕桑萃编（Cansang Cuibian）","name_en":"Cansang Cuibian","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清末","卫杰","蚕书","丝织纹样","吉祥图案"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agronomic_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《蚕桑萃编》是清末卫杰所撰的蚕书，高丰称其为我国古代篇幅最大的一部蚕书。书中记载的清代丝织品纹样按贡货、时新、官服、吏服、商服、农服、僧道服式分类列举，几乎全部体现“图必有意，意必吉祥”的装饰原则。田自秉称其为摘录清代服用织花纹样的依据，所记分贡货、时新、官服、吏服、商服、农服、僧道七类；并指出其中许多纹样不知具体形象、也有错别字。","path":"publications/cansang-cuibian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下清末蚕桑与丝织文献的锚点，也涉及 D 维度的服色等级。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:chajing","title":"茶经（The Classic of Tea）","name_en":"The Classic of Tea","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","陆羽","茶具","茶器","越窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《茶经》是唐代陆羽所著的茶学专著，三册中都不是作为茶文化史的对象，而是作为**唐代茶具设计的文献依据**出现：高丰用它判断茶碗品第并核对法门寺出土银茶具，田自秉用它确认唐代青瓷窑口与“邢不如越”的评价，夏燕靖 2016 用它给全书结构并把它列为茶艺著作之首。**三册没有一册给出成书年代、版本或陆羽生卒**。","path":"publications/chajing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《茶经》在三册中都是茶具与茶器条目：茶碗品第、茶器与法门寺银茶具的对应、饮茶方式对器类的影响构成主体（B），贡茶与官督造秘色瓷属制度面（D），本书作为设计史文献的使用方式属方法面（A）为次。候选组另含夏燕靖 2009，该册全文无“茶经”“陆羽”，故不计入来源。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:changwu-zhi","title":"长物志（Zhang Wu Zhi）","name_en":"Zhang Wu Zhi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","文震亨","室内设计","园林","陈设"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《长物志》是明末文震亨所撰的十二卷笔记体著作，六册来源一致把它当作理解明代文人园林室内陈设设计的核心理论文本。六册的用法分三层：高丰把它读作室内环境设计专著并大量引录原文；夏燕靖两版概括其\"以用为本\"的思想取向（2016 另补\"长物\"的典源与文人品格读法）；赵农提炼其\"宁古勿时\"的审美取向，田自秉则从陶瓷史角度记其载有柴窑材料。李立新一册仅见于参考文献，不支撑内容论断。","path":"publications/changwu-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《长物志》在六册中被用作文人园林室内陈设的设计理论文本，归 B 维度造物与工艺理论；其“以用为本”的读法另涉器物观念。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:chengshi-moyuan","title":"程氏墨苑（Chengshi Moyuan）","name_en":"Chengshi Moyuan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","万历","徽州","程大约","丁云鹏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《程氏墨苑》是明万历年间徽州程大约（滋兰堂）刊行的墨谱，在五册中一律作为**中国彩色套印的最早标本**出现。五册的分工是：夏燕靖两版给年份与中西比较，高丰给套印色数与具体图例，李立新给刻工姓名，赵农给编纂、绘画、刻工三者的分工。**五册没有一册说明本书的墨样内容、卷册结构或与《方氏墨谱》的关系**。","path":"publications/chengshi-moyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《程氏墨苑》在五册中都是印刷技术条目：四色、五色套印与“比欧洲早百余年”的比较构成主体（C），徽州刻工、滋兰堂刊行与出版组织属 D，墨谱本身的墨样与图样属 B 为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:china-art-newspaper","title":"中国美术报（China Art Newspaper）","name_en":"China Art Newspaper","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1985","美术报刊","工业设计","设计讨论"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"newspaper","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国美术报》1985 年 7 月创刊，创刊号以整版篇幅介绍伊夫·圣·洛朗的服装设计和西德科拉尼的器皿设计；1986 年 4 月 28 日、1988 年 1 月 4 日均以整版发表工业设计发展问题讨论，1988 年 9-11 月又用 3 期 5 个版面专题讨论工艺美术与工业设计的发展问题。","path":"publications/china-art-newspaper.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下视觉传达与出版物的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:chuantong-gongyi-meishu-baohu-tiaoli","title":"传统工艺美术保护条例（Regulations on the Protection of Traditional Arts and Crafts）","name_en":"Regulations on the Protection of Traditional Arts and Crafts","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1997","国务院","工艺美术","保护条例","制度"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regulation","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《传统工艺美术保护条例》是 1997 年 5 月由国务院颁布的法规，规定国家对传统工艺美术品种和技艺实行保护、发展、提高的方针，地方各级政府应采取措施扶持。此后江苏、河北、浙江、上海、北京、广东、四川、安徽、重庆等九省市先后制定地方条例；2006 年依据该条例评出 161 名新一届中国工艺美术大师。","path":"publications/chuantong-gongyi-meishu-baohu-tiaoli.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下工艺美术保护制度的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:chuci","title":"楚辞（Chuci）","name_en":"Chuci","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","屈原","宋玉","器物","羽觞"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"anthology","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《楚辞》是与《诗经》并举的文学作品集，被赵农视为反映春秋战国时期器具在生活、战争中状态的资料性文献；他认为文学的情节性描写有助于还原《周礼》等典籍中器具的应用情景。田自秉多次引用《楚辞》：以“集芙蓉以为裳”“临曲池些，芙蓉始发”等句论证四叶纹可能为荷花；以“瑶浆密勺，实羽觞些”说明羽觞为饮器；以“陆离”一词联系琉璃；并在结语中以《楚辞》“回荡法”与战国工艺缠绕穿插的装饰风格相比。","path":"publications/chuci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下先秦器物文献的锚点，也涉及 C 维度的纹样解释。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:chuxueji","title":"初学记（Chuxueji）","name_en":"Chuxueji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","类书","徐坚","名物"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《初学记》为唐代徐坚等编撰的类书，30 卷，分 23 部 313 类目。2016 册称其“岁时”“居处”“器物”“服馔”“果木”等部可见唐代社会生活与名物种类。","path":"publications/chuxueji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:contemporary-china-crafts-book","title":"当代中国的工艺美术（Contemporary China's Arts and Crafts）","name_en":"Contemporary China's Arts and Crafts","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1983","1984","工艺美术","出版"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《当代中国的工艺美术》编委会于 1983 年 3 月中旬在北京成立，1984 年正式出版该书。2016 册年表仅记编委会成立与出版年份，未展开内容。","path":"publications/contemporary-china-crafts-book.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:danqian-zonglu","title":"丹铅总录（Danqian Zonglu）","name_en":"Danqian Zonglu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","杨慎","笔记","印染"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《丹铅总录》二十七卷，明杨慎撰，为其考辨群书异同的笔记汇编，分天文、地理、冠服等二十六类。2016 册引其“元时，染工有夹缬之名，别有檀缬、蜀缬诸名”，说明元代印染名目。原文记杨慎生卒作“1488-1459”，卒年与通行说法不合，照录标疑。","path":"publications/danqian-zonglu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:daodejing","title":"道德经（Daodejing）","name_en":"Daodejing","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["春秋","老子","无为","埏埴以为器","有器之用"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《道德经》是老子所著的道家经典，主张“无为”的行为，符合“道”的规律。赵农举书中“埏埴以为器”“当其无，有器之用”“朴散则为器”“大器晚成”“民多利器”等器具议论，视为艺术设计的精神资源。2016 记其分《道经》37 章、《德经》，是我国历史上首部完整哲学著作，其民本与契约思想与设计民本意识相联系。","path":"publications/daodejing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下先秦造物思想文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:daolianfu","title":"捣练赋（Daolian Fu）","name_en":"Daolian Fu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["汉代","班婕妤","捣练","丝织"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《捣练赋》在 2016 册中被系于班婕妤名下，用以说明汉代丝的精练已能利用砧杵的机械作用和草木灰的化学作用相结合的捣练法，提高生丝脱胶效率、缩短工艺时间。原文未展开赋文内容；“班婕妤《捣练赋》”之名待核，传世另有题班婕妤《捣素赋》。","path":"publications/daolianfu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:dianshizhai-huabao","title":"点石斋画报（Dianshizhai Pictorial）","name_en":"Dianshizhai Pictorial","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1884","石版印刷","上海","画报","书籍装帧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《点石斋画报》是 1884 年由点石斋印书局石版印刷的上海画报。它与《申报》、同文书局出版的绣像小说、《吴友如画报》等一起改变了我国书籍装帧设计的面貌。","path":"publications/dianshizhai-huabao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下近代画报的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:dongjing-menghua-lu","title":"东京梦华录（Dongjing Menghua Lu）","name_en":"Dongjing Menghua Lu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北宋","开封","城市史","商业","民俗"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《东京梦华录》是北宋孟元老追忆东京汴梁繁盛的城市笔记。三册对它的用法与写法分层明显：夏燕靖两版给了两份彼此不重合的条目（正文一处、书末知识链接一处），赵农一册只在正文里把它当作街市、夜市、瓦舍与园林四组数据的取证来源，并另在参考文献列出李士彪注本。三册均不给全书卷目的完整结构，也不引原书序文全文。","path":"publications/dongjing-menghua-lu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《东京梦华录》在六册中不是工艺专著，而是被反复征引的都市史料：行户、夜市、瓦舍、服饰与幌子诸条都靠它取证，故归主维度 D（商业、制度与设计教育），其服饰与市招的记述兼及 B（造物）与 A（史料方法）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:ducheng-jisheng","title":"都城纪胜（Ducheng Jisheng）","name_en":"Ducheng Jisheng","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["南宋","临安","城市","瓦舍"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《都城纪胜》为南宋灌圃耐得翁撰，1 卷，端平二年（1235）成书，分市井、诸行、酒肆、食店、茶坊、四司六局、瓦舍众伎等 14 门，记临安街坊、店铺、学校、寺观、名园等，与《梦粱录》《武林旧事》同为研究南宋临安的重要文献。","path":"publications/ducheng-jisheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:feiyizhai-jigao","title":"废艺斋集稿（Feiyizhai Jigao）","name_en":"Feiyizhai Jigao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","曹雪芹","佚著","工艺"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《废艺斋集稿》传为曹雪芹佚著，吴恩裕 1973 年《文物》第 2 期发文。据吴恩裕说，全书 8 册，含金石、风筝《南鹞北鸢考工志》、编织、脱胎、织补、印染、雕刻与烹调。","path":"publications/feiyizhai-jigao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:fuzhi-tiaoli","title":"服制条例（Fuzhi Tiaoli）","name_en":"Fuzhi Tiaoli","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","服饰制度","法规","西洋服饰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regulation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《服制条例》是 1912 年民国政府参照西洋诸国服饰制度发布的服制法规。2016 册称其使现代服装冲破历代衣冠等级制度，传统袍、衫、袄、裤、裙越来越多受西方服饰影响。","path":"publications/fuzhi-tiaoli.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:gegu-yaolun","title":"格古要论（Gegu Yaolun）","name_en":"Gegu Yaolun","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","曹昭","王佐","鉴赏","青花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"connoisseurship_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《格古要论》是明代曹昭所撰、王佐增补的古物鉴赏专著，3 卷。全书分古铜器、古画、古墨迹、古碑法帖、古琴、古砚、珍奇、金铁、古窑器、古漆器、锦绮、异木、异石诸论，记青花及彭均（君）宝仿定等窑口。高丰将其列入明代手工业设计专著群。","path":"publications/gegu-yaolun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代鉴赏文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:gongcheng-zuofa","title":"工程做法（Gongcheng Zuofa）","name_en":"Gongcheng Zuofa","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","建筑规范","清工部","营造"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regulation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《工程做法》是清雍正十二年（1734）清工部颁布的建筑规范，共 74 卷。2016 册正文称其列举 27 种建筑物各种构件的准确尺寸与作法，并规定斗拱、装修、石作、瓦作、土作等用工用料，可加快设计施工但不利于建筑多样化；文献索引列其卷目，并称其与《营造法式》为古代官方建筑标准仅有的两部古籍。","path":"publications/gongcheng-zuofa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:guanzi","title":"管子（Guanzi）","name_en":"Guanzi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","管仲","齐国","工具","城市选址"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《管子》是先秦典籍，相传为春秋时期齐国政治家管仲的著作，今存 76 篇；2016 称其为战国时各学派言论汇编，内容庞杂，包括法家、儒家、道家、阴阳家、名家、兵家和农家观点，传说根本为春秋初期管仲言论。赵农引《管子·轻重乙》说明农、车、女所需工具：齐国种田男子必须有一犁、一耙、一把锄等，造车木匠必须有斧、锯、锥、凿等，妇女必须有针、刀等；又引《管子·乘马》“凡立国都，非于大山之下必于广川之上……”说","path":"publications/guanzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下先秦造物与城市思想文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:gujin-tushu-jicheng","title":"古今图书集成（Gujin Tushu Jicheng）","name_en":"Gujin Tushu Jicheng","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","类书","铜活字","宋体字","插图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《古今图书集成》是清代内府用铜活字排印的大型类书，也是六册中唯一被反复用来标定“铜活字印刷最高成就”的书。三册对它的取材同为印刷技术条目，但取舍不同：高丰给它字数、册数、字体与插图四项，赵农给卷数、字数、册数、函数、印数与性质定位，夏燕靖 2016 只给卷数、册数、印数与排印年。三册都不记编纂者、成书经过与全书部类结构。","path":"publications/gujin-tushu-jicheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《古今图书集成》在三册中都是印刷技术条目：铜活字排印、铜活字宋体字、雕版插图三类事实构成其主体，故归主维度 C（视觉传达与文字设计）；其官修性质与内府刻书规模属 D，开本与装帧材料属 B。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:gutong-ciqi-kao","title":"古铜瓷器考（Gutong Ciqi Kao）","name_en":"Gutong Ciqi Kao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","梁同书","铜器","瓷器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《古铜瓷器考》为清代梁同书撰，2 卷。卷 1 论古铜色辨、鉴古审款识、三代古器等，卷 2 论古今诸窑、釉水、火候窑变、以旧补旧、制瓷器不裂法等。","path":"publications/gutong-ciqi-kao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:haiguo-tuzhi","title":"海国图志（Haiguo Tuzhi）","name_en":"Haiguo Tuzhi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["晚清","魏源","世界地理","变法","仿造"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geography","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《海国图志》是晚清魏源的著作，书中初步介绍了西方民主政治制度，赵农将其作为魏源放眼世界、主张变法的著述依据。李立新记其建议仿造量天尺、千里镜、龙尾车、风锯、水锯、火轮机、火轮舟、自来火、自转礁、千斤秤等“有益民用者”。","path":"publications/haiguo-tuzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 E 维度下晚清西器东传文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:hanfeizi","title":"韩非子（Han Feizi）","name_en":"Han Feizi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","韩非","法家","买椟还珠","反文饰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《韩非子》是战国末年思想家韩非的著作，韩非是荀子的学生，后以法家思想著称。他反对文饰、崇尚功用，以器具说明思想，如“买椟还珠”（《韩非子·外储说左上》）的故事从侧面反映物品的用途和装饰的意义；又引“竽先，则钟瑟皆随；竽唱，则诸乐皆和”。2016 引《韩非·五蠹篇》“古者丈夫不耕，草木之实足食也；妇人不织，禽兽之皮是衣也”，用以说明纺织品出现以前的衣着状况；并称其提出“法”“术”“势”相结合的法治理","path":"publications/hanfeizi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下先秦造物思想文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:hongqi","title":"红旗（Hongqi）","name_en":"Hongqi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["文革","期刊","装帧设计","政治出版"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《红旗》是“文革”时期期刊装帧设计的代表。2016 册称其版式主要参照毛泽东著作和马恩列斯著作进行设计，与《解放军文艺》同为代表；图注 11-34 为《红旗》封面，图版未视觉核验。","path":"publications/hongqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下视觉传达与出版物的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:huainanzi","title":"淮南子（Huainanzi）","name_en":"Huainanzi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["西汉","刘安","淮南鸿烈","五行"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《淮南子》又名《淮南鸿烈》《刘安子》，西汉淮南王刘安招集宾客集体编撰。2016 册正文引《精神》《主术》《本经》诸篇，说明其主张上古帝王住房崇尚朴素自然、不事过分装饰，并把设计门类与五行学说相联系；文献索引概括其“器以载道”的造物观。原文作“西代淮南王刘安”，“西代”疑为“西汉”之讹。","path":"publications/huainanzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jianbian-tongling","title":"剪辫通令（Jianbian Tongling）","name_en":"Jianbian Tongling","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","服饰改制","法令","剪辫"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regulation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《剪辫通令》是 1912 年民国政府首先颁行的剪辫法令。2016 册将其与随后发布的《服制条例》并提，说明二者共同推动近代服饰改制，冲垮历代衣冠等级制度。","path":"publications/jianbian-tongling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jiangning-zhizao-yu-caojia","title":"江宁织造与曹家（Jiangning Zhizao yu Caojia）","name_en":"Jiangning Zhizao yu Caojia","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","江宁织造","曹雪芹","官营织造"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《江宁织造与曹家》是周汝昌、严中合著、中华书局 2006 年出版的专著，探讨江宁织造与曹雪芹家世。2016 册据其梳理曹玺至曹颙、曹頫承袭江宁织造 58 年并兼理巡盐、承办铜斤等经济要务。原文作“曹頡”，疑为“曹頫”之讹。","path":"publications/jiangning-zhizao-yu-caojia.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jiefangjun-wenyi","title":"解放军文艺（Jiefangjun Wenyi）","name_en":"Jiefangjun Wenyi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["文革","期刊","装帧设计","复刊"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《解放军文艺》是“文革”时期期刊装帧设计的代表之一。2016 册称其与《红旗》同为主要参照毛泽东著作和马恩列斯著作的版式进行设计；图注 11-35 为 1972 年 5 月复刊的封面，图版未视觉核验。","path":"publications/jiefangjun-wenyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下视觉传达与出版物的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jieziyuan-huazhuan","title":"芥子园画传（Jieziyuan Huazhuan）","name_en":"Jieziyuan Huazhuan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","画谱","短版套印","王概","中国画教材"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"print_album","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《芥子园画传》是清康熙至嘉庆年间刻印的画谱，采用明代创造的短版套印工艺并有所发展。它由李渔女婿请画家王概等人编绘，初期有山水卷、梅兰竹菊卷、草虫花鸟卷，后来加进人物卷；整部书编辑详备、体例得当、印制清晰、文风典雅，是清代以来中国画学的基础课本。","path":"publications/jieziyuan-huazhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下清代画谱的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jifufu","title":"机妇赋（Jifu Fu）","name_en":"Jifu Fu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["东汉","王逸","提花机","织造","赋"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"rhapsody","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《机妇赋》是东汉王逸所作赋文，以文学语言描绘提花机生产情形。李立新引“兔耳跄伏……猛犬相守……高楼双峙，下临清池”，并释兔耳、猛犬、高楼为提花机部件；2016 引作“兔耳踆伏，若安若危。猛犬相守，窜身匿蹄。高楼双峙，下临清池。游鱼衔饵，瀲澔其陂”。","path":"publications/jifufu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下汉代织机文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jingdezhen-taolu","title":"景德镇陶录（Jingdezhen Taolu）","name_en":"Jingdezhen Taolu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","景德镇","陶瓷","窑业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《景德镇陶录》为清代兰浦著、郑廷桂补辑，10 卷，分《图说》《国朝御窑厂恭纪》《镇器原始》《陶务条目》《陶务方略》《景德镇历代窑考》《镇仿古窑考》《古窑考》《陶说杂编》上下与《陶录余论》。原文作“兰浦”，通行多作“蓝浦”，照录标疑。","path":"publications/jingdezhen-taolu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jingshi-dadian","title":"经世大典（Jingshi Dadian）","name_en":"Jingshi Dadian","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","官修","建筑制度","工典","奎章阁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"official_compendium","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《经世大典》是元代官方编纂的政书，又名《皇朝经世大典》，元文宗至顺元年由奎章阁学士院编纂，赵世延总撰、虞集副总撰，次年 5 月成书；全书 880 卷、目录 12 卷，分君事 4 篇、臣事 6 篇，工典列 22 目，保存元代建筑与工艺制度。夏燕靖 2009 称其记述元代建筑的详细方式，使这一时期的建筑特色得以流传，并把它作为建筑兴盛促进较完整建筑学著作出现的例证。","path":"publications/jingshi-dadian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下元代官修营造文献的锚点，也涉及 D 维度的官修制度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:kaogongji-tu","title":"考工记图（Kaogongji Tu）","name_en":"Kaogongji Tu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","戴震","考工记","图录","尺度"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"illustrated_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《考工记图》是清代戴震对《考工记》的自注并绘图说明，为清乾隆年间《戴氏遗书》所收。戴震对《考工记》中的礼乐、车舆、宫室、武器等进行图录式说明，对后人正确理解《考工记》内容有一定指导意义。李立新引其中“考工诸篇，高庫广狭有度”，以说明“度”兼为尺度与适度。","path":"publications/kaogongji-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下清代《考工记》研究文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:kaogongji","title":"考工记（Kaogongji）","name_en":"Kaogongji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["工艺典籍","先秦","百工","齐国官书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《考工记》是先秦工艺文献，今本通常作为《周礼》的一部分流传，故又称《周礼·考工记》或《周礼·冬官考工记》。它系统记载百工分工、器物形制、材料选择与工艺规范，是六册来源共同引用、用以说明中国早期造物与设计制度的核心文本。","path":"publications/kaogongji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"只在 pilot 维度 B 下完成暂定主导航；Theme 与 Topic 尚未 materialize，故 primary_theme 与 topic_memberships 留空。该缺口是研究债务，不是已完成的层级映射。"},{"id":"publications:liangyou","title":"良友（Liangyou）","name_en":"Liangyou","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1926","上海","画报","明星广告","月份牌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《良友》是 1926 年 2 月创刊的大型画报，以令人耳目一新的形式轰动上海滩。它曾聘请郑君里作美丽牌香烟广告、白杨作美勃丹化妆品广告、兰心作宝昌首饰广告、王人美作广东兄弟橡皮公司球鞋广告，明星效应使商品成为二三十年代上海抢手品牌。","path":"publications/liangyou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下近代画报广告的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:lidai-minghua-ji","title":"历代名画记（Lidai Minghua Ji）","name_en":"Lidai Minghua Ji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","张彦远","画史","宣纸","瑞锦宫绫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《历代名画记》是唐代张彦远所著画史文献。张彦远是唐代晚期人，曾在咸通三年任舒州刺史。书中记“江南地润无尘，人多精艺”“好事家宜置宣纸百幅，用法蜡之，以备摹写”，说明纸张在当时的使用状态；又记初唐益州艺匠窦师纶所织锦绫有双雉、斗羊、翔凤、游麟等图案，即“瑞锦”“宫绫”。","path":"publications/lidai-minghua-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代工艺史料的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:liji","title":"礼记（Liji）","name_en":"Liji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","礼制","服饰等级","深衣","器物等级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《礼记》是先秦礼制文献。田自秉引其规定天子龙衮、诸侯黼、大夫黻、士玄衣纁裳及天子之豆二十六等服饰器物等级，说明周代等级制在服饰器物上的体现。夏燕靖 2016 两引《礼运篇》：以“未有麻丝，衣其羽皮”说明纺织出现前的衣着，以“昔者先王，未有宫窑，冬则居管窑，夏则居槽巢……”（原文如此，疑有 OCR 异文）说明原始穴居、巢居；并记《礼记》有深衣篇载制作规范，《礼记·玉藻》称深衣为诸侯大夫家居便服、庶人","path":"publications/liji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下先秦礼制文献的锚点，其服饰与居住材料亦服务 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:liuzi","title":"刘子（Liuzi）","name_en":"Liuzi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北齐","刘昼","适用","审美"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《刘子》（又名《刘子新论》）为北齐刘昼所著。2016 册引“物有美恶，施用用宜”一段，以裘、蓑为例说明美丑相对、适用为均，视其为古代审美应用学重视实用传统的体现。","path":"publications/liuzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:lubanjing","title":"鲁班经（Luban Jing）","name_en":"Luban Jing","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","木工","营造","家具","匠家镜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_manual","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《鲁班经》是明代刊行的民间木工行业技术书籍，全称《鲁班经匠家镜》，2016 记其原名《工师雕新正式鲁班木经匠家镜》或《鲁班经匠家镜》，是我国古代营造房屋和日常生活用具的实用指南通书。该书对房舍施工构筑、建筑工具和定位技术、常用建筑的类型尺寸以及生活工具、家具的形制都有详细说明；2016 记其图 1 卷、文 3 卷，并称有说系年荣汇编的托名之作。","path":"publications/lubanjing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代民间匠作文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:lunyu","title":"论语（Lunyu）","name_en":"Lunyu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["春秋","孔子","语录体","文质彬彬","工欲善其事"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《论语》是孔子弟子及再传弟子编撰的语录体经典，记孔子及其弟子言行。赵农引其论器与论服饰颜色的言论，如“工欲善其事，必先利其器”（《论语·卫灵公》）、“君子不器”（《论语·为政》）、“质胜文则野，文胜质则史”“文质彬彬”（《论语·雍也》）；2016 称其“文质观”具审美意蕴。","path":"publications/lunyu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下先秦造物思想文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:luoxuan-biangu-jianpu","title":"萝轩变古笺谱（Luoxuan Biangu Jianpu）","name_en":"Luoxuan Biangu Jianpu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","吴发祥","恒版拱花","饾版","笺谱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"print_album","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《萝轩变古笺谱》是明代笺谱，1626 年刊刻。李立新记吴发祥用“恒版拱花”印制，是明代印刷设计的重要例证；2016 称其为现存最早的饾版、拱花印本。","path":"publications/luoxuan-biangu-jianpu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下明代笺谱的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:lvshi-chunqiu","title":"吕氏春秋（Lüshi Chunqiu）","name_en":"Lüshi Chunqiu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","杂家","吕不韦","乐器","青铜器纹样"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classic","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《吕氏春秋》是战国末年秦国吕不韦门客集体编纂的杂家著作，又名《吕览》。**六册全部引用**，是六册中覆盖面最宽的先秦文献之一。但六册的用法彼此几乎不重叠：高丰与田自秉用它给青铜器纹样定名，赵农用它取乐器起源、城市与邑制、云梯战例，夏燕靖两版用它取车战规模，李立新用它校读“大器免成”的语义，夏燕靖 2016 另用它取工艺制度语汇。全书篇数、十二纪月令结构与编纂经过，六册均不记。","path":"publications/lvshi-chunqiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《吕氏春秋》在六册中的用法可归四簇：青铜器纹样定名（高丰、田自秉）、乐器起源（赵农）、车战规模（夏燕靖两版）、城市与工艺制度语汇（赵农、夏燕靖 2016），另李立新以“成”的二解作造物训诂。四簇中三簇落在造物与工艺一侧，故归主维度 B；A 与 D 为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:makeboluo-youji","title":"马可·波罗游记（The Travels of Marco Polo）","name_en":"The Travels of Marco Polo","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","马可·波罗","游记","中西交流","大都"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《马可·波罗游记》是五册共用的**域外史料**：田自秉用它证琉璃瓦与金锦采运，高丰用它证元代金银器之盛，夏燕靖两版用它证西夏毛织、质孙服与大都市制，赵农用它证海外贸易、造船、大都人口与卢沟桥。两册另为本书立了专条（夏燕靖 2009、2016）。**五册对作者生平、书名与成书方式的记载差别最大**，是本批中“同一书在不同册中面貌不同”最明显的一例。","path":"publications/makeboluo-youji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《马可·波罗游记》在五册中是元代造物与城市的域外史料：金银器、驼毛布、质孙服与金锦、琉璃瓦、造船、卢沟桥构成主体（B），大都的街巷、坊数、市集与“百物输入”属商业与城市制度面（D），引起欧洲对东方的向往与中西交流史价值属跨文化面（E）为次。李立新册中的“波罗子”是法门寺器物名，与本条无关，已排除。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:menglianglu","title":"梦粱录（Mengliang Lu）","name_en":"Mengliang Lu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["南宋","吴自牧","临安","商业","夜市"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"miscellany","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《梦粱录》是南宋吴自牧所著笔记，成书于南宋末年，20 卷 169 目，体例仿《东京梦华录》。全书叙临安（今浙江杭州）繁华，详记淳佑至咸淳（1241—1274）社会风貌，保存不少民俗民艺材料。书中“铺席”节记杭州茶坊、酒肆、面店、果子、彩帛、绒线、香烛、油酱、食米、下饭鱼内鳖腊等铺，“夜市”节记杭城大街买卖昼夜不绝，并记瓦舍定义、影戏羊皮雕形与傀儡戏。","path":"publications/menglianglu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下南宋城市商业文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:mengxi-bitan","title":"梦溪笔谈（Mengxi Bitan）","name_en":"Mengxi Bitan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北宋","沈括","透光镜","铸鉴","科技文献"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"miscellany","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《梦溪笔谈》是北宋沈括所著的百科全书式著作，共 609 条，涉及面非常广泛，是中国古代科学技术和艺术设计史方面的重要文献。田自秉引其论透光镜“世有透光鉴（镜）……”及铸时薄处先冷、背文差厚后冷铜缩多的解释，用以说明透光镜原理；又引其论铸鉴“鉴大则平，鉴小则凸”，说明唐镜镜面微凸可照全人面的光学原理。","path":"publications/mengxi-bitan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代科技文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:mengzi","title":"孟子（Mengzi）","name_en":"Mengzi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","儒家","规矩准绳","造物规范","民本"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classic","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《孟子》是战国中期孟轲及其门人著述的儒家经典。四册对它的用法集中在两处：一是把“规矩”“准绳”这类造物语汇引入儒家规范论，二是把“与民同乐”“民为贵”的民本观读作设计应以民为本。赵农是唯一大量按篇引用的来源（滕文公上／下、公孙丑上、梁惠王上／下、离娄上），且另记《孟子》入十三经的经过；李立新是唯一给出篇名与另一套引文用字的来源。**本条只写典籍**，孟轲其人的生卒、身份与学派位置见 `person","path":"publications/mengzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《孟子》在四册中的设计史价值有两簇：其一，把“规矩”“准绳”这类造物语汇引入儒家规范论（李立新、赵农），属 A；其二，“与民同乐”“民为贵”的民本观被读作设计应以民为本（赵农、田自秉、夏燕靖 2016），属 D 与 A 之间。器物层面的用鼎等级、弋射、箪食壶浆散见于赵农、田自秉，归 B 为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:mingshi-jiaju-yanjiu","title":"明式家具研究（Mingshi Jiaju Yanjiu）","name_en":"Mingshi Jiaju Yanjiu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","家具","王世襄","鸡翅木"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《明式家具研究》是王世襄的专著。2016 册引其将鸡翅木分为老鸡翅木与新鸡翅木，并描述二者在纹理、木质上的差异，用以说明明式家具用材的鉴别。","path":"publications/mingshi-jiaju-yanjiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:mo-jing","title":"墨经（Mo Jing）","name_en":"Mo Jing","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","墨家","墨翟","几何学","力学"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classic","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《墨经》是战国前期记载墨家学说的著作，三册都把它与《考工记》并置，作为先秦造物科学知识的第二极。三册的取材分工清晰：夏燕靖两版给总论与几何、力学条目，赵农给三条具体原理的原文（秤、滑轮、车梯）。本书的**边界**在三册中并不一致：夏燕靖两版正文把几何、光学、力学全数归入《墨经》，夏燕靖 2016 的书末条目却把“墨经”限定为六篇论认识论与逻辑的篇目，并把工艺思想另归《墨子·节用》。","path":"publications/mo-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《墨经》在三册中都是“造物的科学知识”条目：几何概念、力学条目、杠杆与滑轮、车梯原理构成主体，故归主维度 B；其“可与《考工记》相媲美”的定位属史学评价，归 A 为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:mozi-jieyong","title":"墨子·节用（Mozi Jieyong）","name_en":"Mozi Jieyong","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","墨家","墨子","节用"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《墨子·节用》是《墨子》中的一篇。2016 册称其包含墨子的工艺思想，强调“节用”当为制造日用器物的原则和要求；同条又述《墨子》原 71 篇、现存 53 篇，及《经上》《经下》等 6 篇称墨辩或墨经。","path":"publications/mozi-jieyong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:nancun-chuogenglu","title":"南村辍耕录（Nancun Chuogenglu）","name_en":"Nancun Chuogenglu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","陶宗仪","笔记","工艺史料"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《南村辍耕录》又名《辍耕录》，元末明初陶宗仪撰，30 卷 585 条 20 余万字，记元代掌故、典章、文物及古玩鉴赏、书画、工艺史料。2016 册又引其记黄道婆教人做造捍弹纺织之具。","path":"publications/nancun-chuogenglu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:nanyao-biji","title":"南窑笔记（Nanyao Biji）","name_en":"Nanyao Biji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","景德镇","陶瓷","札记"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《南窑笔记》为清代景德镇窑瓷器业札记，约成书于乾隆年间，作者佚名，不分卷，315 条，记古窑 7 条、明窑 6 条，另述釉炉、彩色、官窑、高岭、合泥、釉、坯胎、圆器、琢器、匣钵、窑等。原文“成宠窑”疑为“成化窑”之讹。","path":"publications/nanyao-biji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:nongsang-jizao","title":"农桑辑要（Nongsang Jizao）","name_en":"Nongsang Jizao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","农书","棉花","司农司"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agronomic_treatise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《农桑辑要》是元初司农司编写的官修农书，至元十年（1273）颁行。2016 册引其卷 2 令陕西劝种棉花的诏谕“木棉亦西域所产”，说明棉花由西北传入关内、在渭水流域开始种植。","path":"publications/nongsang-jizao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:on-ten-great-relationships","title":"论十大关系（On the Ten Major Relationships）","name_en":"On the Ten Major Relationships","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1956","毛泽东","工业调整","重工业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"policy_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《论十大关系》是毛泽东 1956 年 4 月的著作。2016 册述其强调适当调整重工业与农业、轻工业的投资比例，更多发展农业、轻工业，并引“重工业是我国建设的重点”一段，说明其对工业调整的论述。","path":"publications/on-ten-great-relationships.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:putong-gaoxiao-benke-zhuanye-mulu","title":"普通高等学校本科专业目录（Putong Gaodeng Xuexiao Benke Zhuanye Mulu）","name_en":"Putong Gaodeng Xuexiao Benke Zhuanye Mulu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1998","教育部","专业目录","艺术设计"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regulation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《普通高等学校本科专业目录》由教育部 1998 年 7 月颁布，将“工艺美术专业”改为“艺术设计专业”。2016 册年表以此为 1998 年设计教育制度变化的关键节点。","path":"publications/putong-gaoxiao-benke-zhuanye-mulu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:qiminyaoshu","title":"齐民要术（Qimin Yaoshu）","name_en":"Qimin Yaoshu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北魏","贾思勰","农书","潢纸","手工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agronomic_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《齐民要术》是北魏农学家贾思勰所著，是我国现存最完整的古代农书之一，约写于东魏武定二年（544）以后（一说 533—544 年）；全书 10 卷 92 篇，记黄河流域下游农业生产，涉及园艺、造林、蚕桑、畜牧、酿造、烹饪、储备、治荒等，引古籍 200 余种，其中许多内容记述古代手工艺。赵农引其潢纸之法：“凡潢纸，灭白便是。不宜太深，深色年旧色暗也”，据此说明当时人们对造纸、染纸及使用已有深入认识。","path":"publications/qiminyaoshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下北魏农工文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:qinggongbu-zaobanchchu-dangan","title":"清宫内务府造办处档案总汇（Qinggongbu Zaobanchchu Dangan Zonghui）","name_en":"Qinggongbu Zaobanchchu Dangan Zonghui","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","造办处","档案","宫廷工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archive","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《清宫内务府造办处档案总汇》共 55 卷，为清廷造办处文献汇编。造办处康熙年间成立，营运至 1924 年，先后设 60 多个专业作坊，档案记制品名称、来源、时间、规格、用料、开销、工序、去处及皇帝旨意。原文又记第 1 期档簿类出版 111 册、第 2 期折件类 90 册，与“全书共 55 卷”并置，卷册口径不一，照录。","path":"publications/qinggongbu-zaobanchchu-dangan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:qingmi-cang","title":"清秘藏（Qingmi Cang）","name_en":"Qingmi Cang","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","张应文","张谦德","鉴赏","玩好"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"connoisseurship_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《清秘藏》是明代张应文所撰、其子张谦德润色的古物鉴赏专著，2 卷。上卷 20 门、下卷 10 门，杂论玩好赏鉴诸物，是我国古代工艺美术鉴赏著作。高丰将其列入明代手工业设计专著群。","path":"publications/qingmi-cang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代鉴赏文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:sanli-tu","title":"三礼图（Sanli Tu）","name_en":"Sanli Tu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["宋代","聂崇义","十二章纹","礼服"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《三礼图》为宋代聂崇义所撰。2016 册引其《衮冕条》《毳冕条》，说明日月星辰、山龙华虫、宗彝藻火粉米黼黻等十二章纹的象征意义，是理解古代礼服纹样等级的重要文献。","path":"publications/sanli-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shanghai-center-plan","title":"上海市市中心区域规划（Shanghai Shi Shizhongxin Quyu Guihua）","name_en":"Shanghai Shi Shizhongxin Quyu Guihua","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","上海","城市规划","中国固有式建筑"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"plan","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《上海市市中心区域规划》是 20 世纪二三十年代的上海城市规划文件。2016 册引其“为提倡国粹起见，市府新屋应用中国式建筑”，说明中国固有式建筑兴起的原因。","path":"publications/shanghai-center-plan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shanghai-xinbao","title":"上海新报（Shanghai Xinbao）","name_en":"Shanghai Xinbao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清末","报纸广告","香皂广告","上海"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"newspaper","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《上海新报》于清同治元年（1862）刊登香皂广告，2016 册称其为我国报纸广告的滥觞。这类广告以大幅文字叙述为主，附带一幅实物照片，版式设计虽简陋，但文字内容翔实。","path":"publications/shanghai-xinbao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下视觉传达与出版物的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shangjunshu","title":"商君书（Shangjun Shu）","name_en":"Shangjun Shu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","法家","商鞅","纺织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《商君书》是先秦法家著作。2016 册引《商君书·画策篇》“神农之也，男耕而食，妇织而衣”，用以说明新石器时代已出现纺织与丝织衣料。原文「神农之也」疑为「神农之世」之讹，照录标疑。","path":"publications/shangjunshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shangshu","title":"尚书（Shangshu）","name_en":"Shangshu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["上古","儒家五经","甘誓","车战"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《尚书》又称《书》《书经》，为记载上古历史的文献，分《虞书》《夏书》《商书》《周书》，汉代改称《尚书》，列为儒家五经之一。2016 册既引《尚书·甘誓》所载夏启与有扈氏甘泽之战的誓师词，说明夏代已用兵车作战；又在文献索引中概述其内容真伪与“天”“帝”观念，指出可据以认识先秦器物设计从“帝”到“天”的宗教观念演变。","path":"publications/shangshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shanhai-jing","title":"山海经（Shan Hai Jing）","name_en":"Shan Hai Jing","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","地理志","神话","夔纹","凤皇"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classic","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《山海经》是先秦的地理与神话名物之书，五册（夏燕靖 2009 除外）都引用它，但**没有两册引同一段**：高丰引夔与奚仲造车，田自秉引夔与鸾鸟，赵农引凤皇与地理著述，李立新引“人身龙面”山神，夏燕靖 2016 只引铁矿山一处。五册的引用都属**以书证物**，而不讨论本书本身的性质、篇目与成书。成书年代只有夏燕靖 2016 一册给出（战国）。","path":"publications/shanhai-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《山海经》在五册中不是工艺专著，而是被征引的**名物与矿产文献**：夔、凤皇、鸾鸟三种神鸟异兽用于青铜器与铜镜纹样的释读，铁矿山一项用于冶铁规模，神怪图像一项用于春秋战国的观念背景。四册的用法都落在名物取证，故归主维度 B；图像与观念归 C、A 为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shenbao","title":"申报（Shenbao）","name_en":"Shenbao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1872","美查","上海","报纸广告","图文广告"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"newspaper","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《申报》是 1872 年 3 月 27 日由英商美查创办于上海的报纸。创刊号上刊登广告 20 则，商品形象和推销口号并重，文字叙述趋向简洁，版式装帧颇为讲究，被视为现代图文广告的原形；2016 将其与《点石斋画报》等同列为改变我国书籍装帧设计面貌的近代出版物。","path":"publications/shenbao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下近代报纸广告的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shenghuo-weekly","title":"生活周刊（Shenghuo Zhoukan）","name_en":"Shenghuo Zhoukan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","邹韬奋","书刊广告","装帧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《生活周刊》是邹韬奋主办的刊物。2016 册称其起初以图书广告为主，每幅列出详尽书目梗概并配卷草纹样；20 世纪 30 年代开始接受商品广告，设计含书卷气，形式类似书封装帧。","path":"publications/shenghuo-weekly.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下视觉传达与出版物的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shengshi-weiyan","title":"盛世危言（Shengshi Weiyan）","name_en":"Shengshi Weiyan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["晚清","郑观应","商战","工艺教育","博览会"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reform_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《盛世危言》是晚清郑观应的著作，提出“工艺一道，为国家致富之基。工艺既兴，物产即因之饶裕”，并主张设工艺专科、开工艺学堂、派人游学各国、设博览会以励百工。李立新记其分析洋货入华致女红失业、柏树弃为不材、冶者无事投闲，指出外国用机制故工致价廉、中国用人工故工笨价费，主张“商战”。","path":"publications/shengshi-weiyan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下晚清工艺制度文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shiji","title":"史记（Shiji）","name_en":"Shiji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["西汉","司马迁","纪传体","史学","战车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"history","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《史记》是西汉司马迁所著的纪传体史书。司马迁忍辱负重、发愤著述而成，鲁迅评为“千古之绝唱，无韵之离骚”；东汉班固的《汉书》延续司马迁所开拓的史学工作，开始形成历朝断代史的著述。《史记》载武王伐纣时率战车 300 辆、近卫军 3000 人、甲士 4.5 万人，在孟津渡过黄河，是关于船只用于战争的最早记载。","path":"publications/shiji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下正史文献的锚点，其车船记载同时服务 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shijing","title":"诗经（Classic of Poetry）","name_en":"Classic of Poetry","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","诗歌总集","史料","器用","风雅颂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classic","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《诗经》是六册**全部引用**的典籍之一，但六册的用法完全不同：赵农把它单列为“**资料性文献**”，以四十余处引诗系统支撑农具、兵器、车马、建筑等器类；田自秉用它论雕刻工序、织锦名称与纹样形式法则；高丰取五条单证（纺织、蔽膝、车较、蓝草、广告）；夏燕靖两版取六条且两版近乎逐字相同；李立新只取“道”的语义。**六册没有一册给出成书年代、编订过程或注疏系统**，故本 KU 的重心不是文本学而是“**","path":"publications/shijing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《诗经》是六册全部引用的少数典籍之一，用法以“引诗证器”为主体（B）：农具、兵器、车马、建筑、服饰、丝织、乐器、饮食器、灯具、舟桥、园林、雕刻、纹样、广告共十余类；赵农的“资料性文献”定位与田自秉的形式法则类比属方法面（A），车舆服饰的等级与十三经、监本、四书五经的经典化属制度面（D）为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shiming","title":"释名（Shiming）","name_en":"Shiming","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["东汉","刘熙","名物","训诂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《释名》为东汉刘熙撰，8 卷 27 篇，篇目自释天、释地至释车、释船、释疾病、释丧制，所释名物典礼千余条，2016 册称其为考证名物的百科书。","path":"publications/shiming.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shiwu-jiyuan","title":"事物纪原（Shiwu Jiyuan）","name_en":"Shiwu Jiyuan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["宋代","高承","事物起源","独轮车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《事物纪原》为宋代高承撰，10 卷，记 1765 事，分 55 部，叙事物起源，含民俗民艺多条。2016 册又引其将造独轮车之功归于诸葛亮。","path":"publications/shiwu-jiyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shiwu-yuanshi","title":"事物原始（Shiwu Yuanshi）","name_en":"Shiwu Yuanshi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","徐炬","事物起源","发式"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《事物原始》为明代徐炬辑，30 卷，明万历二十一年刻本，记日常事物缘起，如堕马髻、新兴髻、椎髻等发式，是认识古代事物历史渊源的文献。","path":"publications/shiwu-yuanshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shizeng","title":"释缯（Shizeng）","name_en":"Shizeng","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","任大椿","丝织物","考证"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《释缯》为清代任大椿著，乾隆年间刊，对历代文献所记丝织物分类，并考证丝绸发展问题；收入《皇清经解》《燕禧堂五种》。","path":"publications/shizeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shizhuzhai-huapu","title":"十竹斋画谱（Shizhuzhai Huapu）","name_en":"Shizhuzhai Huapu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","饾版","彩色套印","画谱","胡正言"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"print_album","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《十竹斋画谱》是明代胡正言刻印的画谱，用“恒版”（李立新）／“短版”（夏燕靖 2016）彩色套印，是明代彩色套印设计的重要例证。两处版名均疑为“饾版”之 OCR 误写，本 KU 照录原文并标注。它与《十竹斋笺谱》同为该版代表作，色彩艳丽、浓淡分明、阴阳向背酷似原画，被称为画、刻、印三绝。","path":"publications/shizhuzhai-huapu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下明代彩色套印的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shujin-pu","title":"蜀锦谱（Shujin Pu）","name_en":"Shujin Pu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","蜀锦","费著","织锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《蜀锦谱》为元代费著撰，不分卷。首叙北宋元丰六年（1083）吕大防建成都府锦院规模及沿革，后列宋元织锦名目，包括“上贡锦”“官告锦”“臣僚袄子锦”“广西锦”及 19 种“细色锦名色”。","path":"publications/shujin-pu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shuowen-jiezi","title":"说文解字（Shuowen Jiezi）","name_en":"Shuowen Jiezi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["东汉","许慎","六书","文字设计","字书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lexicographic_work","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《说文解字》是东汉许慎编纂的字书，四册来源引用它，用法分两类：一是作为\"六书\"体系的权威出处，被高丰直接读作汉字的设计手法；二是作为名物训释的引据，被赵农、李立新、夏燕靖 2016 用来解释钺、踞、凭几、尺、缶等具体器物与尺度概念。赵农另记许慎的字号、籍贯、官职与\"五经无双许叔重\"之誉。夏燕靖 2009 与田自秉两册全书未见\"说文解字\"字样，故 source_count 为 4。","path":"publications/shuowen-jiezi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《说文解字》在六册来源中主要作为汉字构形法则（六书）的权威出处，兼作器物名物训释的引用来源。前一条属 C 维度文字设计，后一条跨 B 维度器物考释。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:simin-yueling","title":"四民月令（Simin Yueling）","name_en":"Simin Yueling","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["东汉","崔寔","家庭生产","女红"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agronomic_treatise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《四民月令》为东汉崔寔撰，按一年 12 个月安排家庭生产、交换、生活与交往。2016 册称其中所列风俗与纺织、染缝等“女红”手艺，与民间手工艺生产关系密切。","path":"publications/simin-yueling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:sixiu-biji","title":"丝绣笔记（Sixiu Biji）","name_en":"Sixiu Biji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["丝绣","缂丝","织成","刺绣","工艺文献"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《丝绣笔记》是朱启钤辑、阚铎校的丝绣专著，上下两卷。卷上“纪闻”含锦绫、刻丝、刺绣 3 种，辑织作技法、各地纺织产品、丝帛时价、用料数量、历代丝绣制度与禁令等；卷下“辨物”含锦绫、织成、刻丝、刺绣 4 种，辑各种名锦、刻丝织物、刺绣作品、《蜀锦谱》及日本古染物等。田自秉引其说，谓缂丝与织成“是一是二，尚待论定”。","path":"publications/sixiu-biji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下丝绣工艺文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:song-huiyao-jigao","title":"宋会要辑稿（Song Huiyao Jigao）","name_en":"Song Huiyao Jigao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["宋代","徐松","史料","丝织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《宋会要辑稿》是清代徐松据《永乐大典》所收宋代官修《宋会要》辑录而成，全书 366 卷，分 17 类。2016 册既在知识链接中概述其体例与史料价值，又引其“上供”丝织物记载说明江浙丝织业比重。","path":"publications/song-huiyao-jigao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:suijin","title":"碎金（Suijin）","name_en":"Suijin","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","明代","通俗读物","染色"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《碎金》是元明之际的通俗读物，1935 年故宫博物院文献馆以影印本重版。2016 册称其《蚕织篇》第 15、《彩色篇》第 20 记纺织名物与百余种染色名目，沈从文《中国古代服饰研究》多次引用；又记其最初版本或为唐代《字宝碎金》，并出土西夏文《碎金》残页。","path":"publications/suijin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:taiping-yulan","title":"太平御览（Taiping Yulan）","name_en":"Taiping Yulan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["宋代","类书","李昉","设计文献"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《太平御览》是宋代李昉等奉敕编纂的类书。2016 册称其工艺部、器物部、舟部、车部、珍宝部等随类相从，可归属设计门类。","path":"publications/taiping-yulan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:tang-liudian","title":"唐六典（Tang Liudian）","name_en":"Tang Liudian","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","行政法典","官营手工业","工匠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regulation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《唐六典》全称《大唐六典》，是唐代行政法典，旧题唐玄宗撰、李林甫等注，实为张说、张九龄等编纂，成书于开元二十六年（738）。2016 册据其记载说明玄宗时少府监、将作监各有工匠万余人，并规定不同工种 9 个月到 4 年不等的技术训练与季考、年考制度。","path":"publications/tang-liudian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:tao-shuo","title":"陶说（Tao Shuo）","name_en":"Tao Shuo","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","朱琰","陶瓷史","景德镇","仿制瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《陶说》是清代朱琰所撰的陶瓷史，四册对它的用法分成两路：一路把它当**史料**——高丰和田自秉各自引同一句论乾隆仿制瓷，田自秉另引它评成化鸡缸杯；一路把它当**著作**——夏燕靖两版给作者、卷次结构，2016 另给初刻年份与“第一部陶瓷史”的定位。**四册都没有给朱琰的生平，也没有给成书年**（只有刻年）。","path":"publications/tao-shuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《陶说》在四册中是陶瓷史与仿制瓷的文献依据：乾隆仿制瓷引文、成化鸡缸杯评语、景德镇官搭民烧构成主体（B），卷次结构与“第一部陶瓷史”的定位属著作史层面（A），官搭民烧与御窑制度属制度面（D）为次。赵农、李立新无本书条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:tiangong-kaiwu","title":"天工开物（Tiangong Kaiwu）","name_en":"Tiangong Kaiwu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","技术典籍","宋应星","工艺百科全书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《天工开物》是明末宋应星撰写的综合性技术著作，1637 年（崇祯十年）刊行。全书分上、中、下三篇，按“贵五谷而贱金玉”的顺序记述谷物、蚕桑纺织、染色、制盐、制糖、陶瓷、冶铸、舟车、造纸、兵器、珠玉等生产全过程，被外国学者誉为“中国 17 世纪的工艺百科全书”。","path":"publications/tiangong-kaiwu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《天工开物》是 B 维度下综合性技术典籍的锚点；其版本、卷数与插图数在来源间不一致。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize，故层级只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"publications:tiansheng-lvling","title":"天盛律令（Tiansheng Lvling）","name_en":"Tiansheng Lvling","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["西夏","法典","官营手工业","专业分工"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regulation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《天盛律令》是西夏法典。2016 册据其记载，西夏设制金司、织绢院、铁工院、木工院、纸工院、砖瓦院、造车院等，说明其官营手工业专业分工细致。","path":"publications/tiansheng-lvling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:unesco-ich-convention","title":"保护非物质文化遗产公约（Convention for the Safeguarding of the Intangible Cultural Heritage）","name_en":"Convention for the Safeguarding of the Intangible Cultural Heritage","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["非物质文化遗产","联合国教科文组织","公约","传统技艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"convention","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《保护非物质文化遗产公约》由联合国教科文组织通过。2016 册引其定义，说明“非物质文化遗产”指被各群体、团体、有时为个人视为其文化遗产的各种实践、表演、表现形式、知识体系和技能及其有关工具、实物、工艺品和文化场所，并列出五类范围。","path":"publications/unesco-ich-convention.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wang-zhen-nongshu","title":"王祯农书（Wang Zhen Nongshu）","name_en":"Wang Zhen Nongshu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","农学","农器图谱","王祯","秧马"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《王祯农书》是元代王祯编撰的农学专著，四册都把它当作元代农具与农业技术的总汇。夏燕靖两版给全书结构与版本，赵农给成书背景、农器图谱的分卷与王祯本人的农具设计，高丰只取两条：一条把书名误作《农布》，一条记转轮排字盘的年份。**四册对卷数、部分名、字数的写法互不相同**，是本批分歧最密的一个条目。","path":"publications/wang-zhen-nongshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《王祯农书》在四册中都是农具与农业技术条目：农器图谱、搅车、经架、水力大纺车、耧锄、秧马构成主体（B），王祯的县尹身份、劝农措施、刊刻与版本属制度与流传面（D）。田自秉与李立新无本书条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wujing-zongyao","title":"武经总要（Wujing Zongyao）","name_en":"Wujing Zongyao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北宋","军事","火药","火器","筏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"military_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《武经总要》是北宋军事著作。赵农称其中有许多关于火器和火药制造的记录，如火药中引火球、蒺藜火球、毒药烟球的配方，已具有近代黑色火药的比例；李立新引其蒲筏、木罂、械筏的编排规范。","path":"publications/wujing-zongyao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代军事技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wulin-jiushi","title":"武林旧事（Wulin Jiushi）","name_en":"Wulin Jiushi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["南宋","临安","周密","城市"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《武林旧事》为周密撰，成书于元至元二十七年（1290）之前，52 篇，记南宋临安山水名胜、城郭宫殿、皇家园林、典章制度、节日民俗与市肆商品。","path":"publications/wulin-jiushi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xianqing-ouji","title":"闲情偶寄（Xianqing Ouji）","name_en":"Xianqing Ouji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","李渔","居室","器玩","暖椅"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"life_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《闲情偶寄》是李渔所著，成书于 1671 年（清康熙十年），全书分声容、居室、器玩、饮馔、种植、颐养六卷。居室部论房舍构筑、窗栏图式、墙壁、联匾、山石等园林营造与室内装饰；器玩部论几椅、床帐、橱柜、箱笼、茶酒具、灯烛、笺简的设计制作。书中提出注重功能、实用第一，崇尚俭朴、创异标新，以及“宜简不宜繁，宜自然不宜雕斫”等设计思想，并记录李渔自创的暖椅与凉机。赵农称其以“机”“趣”为出发点，细致观察器物","path":"publications/xianqing-ouji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下清代居室与器玩文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xin-qingnian","title":"新青年（New Youth）","name_en":"New Youth","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","陈独秀","新文化运动","刊物","版式"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《新青年》是陈独秀宣传“民主”和“科学”、倡导新文化运动的阵地，积聚了当时一批文化精英。2016 将其版式与《域外小说集》、严复《天演论》及当时刊印的书刊并列为同一种设计形式，并以图注 10-32 收录《新青年》创刊号（图版未视觉核验）。","path":"publications/xin-qingnian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下近代期刊版式的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xiu-shi-lu","title":"髹饰录（Xiu Shi Lu）","name_en":"Xiu Shi Lu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","漆艺","黄成","工艺专著"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《髹饰录》是明代漆工黄成所撰的漆艺专著，天启五年（1625）由杨明逐条加注并作序，分乾、坤两集共十八章。田自秉称其为“我国现存唯一古代漆艺专著”，高丰则通过王世襄的整理本说明其价值。","path":"publications/xiu-shi-lu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《髹饰录》是 B 维度下漆艺工艺知识体系化的著作锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xiupu","title":"绣谱（Xiupu）","name_en":"Xiupu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","丁佩","苏绣","刺绣","能巧妙神"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《绣谱》是清代苏绣艺人丁佩所著刺绣专著，成书于道光元年（1821）。全书分择地、选样、取材、辨色、程工（2016 作“工程”）、论品 6 章，提出“能、巧、妙、神”的美学原则与苏绣“齐、光、直、匀、薄、顺、密”的特点。田自秉称其为清道光时丁佩所著刺绣专著。","path":"publications/xiupu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下清代刺绣文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xuehuan-xiupu","title":"雪宦绣谱（Xuehuan Xiupu）","name_en":"Xuehuan Xiupu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清末民初","刺绣","苏绣","沈寿","张謇"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《雪宦绣谱》是清末沈寿口述、张謇记录整理的刺绣工艺专著。四册对它的处理分成三层：夏燕靖两版给**完整的章目与数值**（八章、十八种针法、八十八种色线、七百四十五种因染而别），田自秉给**著作谱系中的位置**并只列章名，高丰只给**成书经过与一句性质判断**。**四册都没有给出初版年份或出版者**，田自秉册末另列一个 2004 年现代版本。","path":"publications/xuehuan-xiupu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《雪宦绣谱》在四册中是刺绣工艺著作：八章章目、十八种针法、八十八种色线与七百四十五种“因染而别”构成主体（B），沈寿在南通女工传习所的授绣与张謇的记录整理属制度与教育面（D），其“系统而完整的理论著作”定位属著作史层面（A）为次。赵农、李立新无本书条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xunzi","title":"荀子（Xunzi）","name_en":"Xunzi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","荀子","荀况","以玉比德","天行有常"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《荀子》是战国末年儒家思想家荀况的著作。荀子重视美感和教育功能，在议论中常以器具比喻说明道理，书中提出“以玉比德”（《荀子·法行》）的思想。2016 记其据《史记·孟子荀卿列传》为荀况晚年总结百家争鸣与自身学术思想而编；《天论》《非相》反映其唯物主义自然观，提出“天行有常”“天人相分”“制天命而用之”；《玉制》（疑为《王制》之讹）《富国》《天论》《宥坐》强调等级不同者的衣着、居住规制。","path":"publications/xunzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下先秦造物思想文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yangxian-mingtaolu","title":"阳羡名陶录（Yangxian Mingtao Lu）","name_en":"Yangxian Mingtao Lu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","吴骞","紫砂","宜兴"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《阳羡名陶录》为清代吴骞撰，2 卷，上卷原始、选材、本艺、家溯，下卷丛谈、文翰，记宜兴紫砂陶起源、选材、工艺与名家。","path":"publications/yangxian-mingtaolu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yangzhou-huafanglu","title":"扬州画舫录（Yangzhou Huafang Lu）","name_en":"Yangzhou Huafang Lu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","扬州","园林","市井"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《扬州画舫录》为清代李斗撰，18 卷，记康乾年间扬州园林名胜、民间艺术、营造法式、市井风俗、寺观祠宇及戏曲小说史料，是研究扬州园林与民俗的重要典籍。原文“是研究”一句在 L6275 处被页眉行截断，L6279 接“扬州园林、园亭奇观和民俗事象的重要典籍”。","path":"publications/yangzhou-huafanglu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yanji-tu","title":"燕几图（Yanji Tu）","name_en":"Yanji Tu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["宋代","家具","黄伯思","组合设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《燕几图》为宋代黄伯思撰，2016 册称其记述两宋家具从实践到理论，述几桌相互搭配拼接成各种形式，揭示设计颇具巧思的观点。","path":"publications/yanji-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yantielun","title":"盐铁论（Yantielun）","name_en":"Yantielun","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["西汉","桓宽","盐铁会议","本末"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《盐铁论》是西汉桓宽依据汉昭帝时盐铁会议记录整理而成的著作，共 60 篇。2016 册正文引《本议第一》中“崇本退末”“工不作无用之器”等辩论，说明本末观念对手工业的制约；文献索引则记其对当时手工业生产状况与朝野经济观点的记述。","path":"publications/yantielun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yanxian-qingshang-jian","title":"燕闲清赏笺（Yanxian Qingshang Jian）","name_en":"Yanxian Qingshang Jian","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","高濂","漆器","雕漆","刺绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"connoisseurship_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《燕闲清赏笺》是明代高濂的鉴赏著作。田自秉三处引用：一记宋漆盒、漆盘、漆匣的多种造型；一记宋人雕漆朱厚堆至数十层、有锡胎者、有葛地者等；一评元绣“便不及宋，以其用绒粗肥，落针不密”，田自秉认为这种说法不公正。高丰将其列入明代手工业设计专著群。","path":"publications/yanxian-qingshang-jian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代鉴赏文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yaoqi-shuo","title":"窑器说（Yaoqi Shuo）","name_en":"Yaoqi Shuo","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","瓷器","残句"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《窑器说》在 2016 册中仅存残句“清代所出之瓷器进行论述，有极高的参考价值”，作者、卷数、成书年代等信息均缺失。本 KU 只记录该残存表述，不补外部信息。","path":"publications/yaoqi-shuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yijia-yan","title":"一家言·居室器玩部（Yijia Yan）","name_en":"Yijia Yan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","李渔","居室","器玩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《一家言·居室器玩部》为清代李渔撰，记房舍构筑、山石布置、营造园艺、窗栏图式、墙壁联匮、几椅、床帐、橱柜、箱笼、茶酒具、灯烛、笺筒等制作，卷首有近人阐铎《识语》一篇。原文“阐铎”疑为“阚铎”之讹。","path":"publications/yijia-yan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yingzao-fashi","title":"营造法式（Yingzao Fashi）","name_en":"Yingzao Fashi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北宋","建筑规范","李诫","官书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《营造法式》是北宋官方颁布的建筑设计与施工规范书，由李诫（来源另作“李诚”）编修，成书于元符三年（1100），刊行于崇宁二年（1103）。全书分名例、制度、工限料例、图样四部分，详述大木作、石作、砖作、小木作、雕木作与彩画作，是研究宋代建筑与室内设计最重要的技术文献之一。","path":"publications/yingzao-fashi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《营造法式》是 B 维度下建筑与室内装修规范的锚点；其官方制度内容未来可与 D 维度交叉。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yinliuzhai-shuoci","title":"饮流斋说瓷（Yinliuzhai Shuoci）","name_en":"Yinliuzhai Shuoci","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","许之衡","陶瓷","说窑","款识"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramics_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《饮流斋说瓷》是许之衡所著陶瓷专著，分上下两卷共 10 节，成书于 20 世纪 20 年代。上卷为概说、说窑、胎釉、彩色、花绘，下卷为款识、瓶罐、杯盘、杂具、疵伪。该书以分类、排比方法总结前人知识与个人见闻，保存大量古陶瓷学名和俗称；书前附《书成自题六十韵》。","path":"publications/yinliuzhai-shuoci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下近代陶瓷文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yishu-yu-sheji","title":"艺术与设计（Yishu yu Sheji）","name_en":"Yishu yu Sheji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1998","期刊","艺术设计","创刊"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《艺术与设计》是由国家新闻出版总署主管的杂志，1998 年 2 月创刊。2016 册年表仅记创刊时间与主管单位。","path":"publications/yishu-yu-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下视觉传达与出版物的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yiwen-leiju","title":"艺文类聚（Yiwen Leiju）","name_en":"Yiwen Leiju","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","类书","欧阳询","设计文献"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《艺文类聚》是唐代欧阳询等编纂的类书。2016 册在讨论设计文献范围时指出，其中居处部、产业部、服饰部、舟车部、巧艺部等部卷涉及设计，可据以检索古代造物与生活器用的分类记载。","path":"publications/yiwen-leiju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yuan-ye","title":"园冶（Yuan Ye）","name_en":"Yuan Ye","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","园林","计成","造园理论"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《园冶》是明代计成所撰的造园专著，崇祯四年（1631）成稿、崇祯七年刊行，三卷，附图二百余幅。夏燕靖 2016 称其为“我国第一本园林艺术理论的专著”，田自秉把它与《营造法式》并提，视作明代园林艺术的总结。","path":"publications/yuan-ye.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《园冶》是 B 维度下造园工艺理论化的著作锚点，其“虽由人作，宛自天成”的命题也涉及 A 维度的设计观念问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yugong","title":"禹贡（Yugong）","name_en":"Yugong","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","尚书","九州","物产","染织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《禹贡》是《尚书》中的地理篇。田自秉据《禹贡》等书记载春秋战国染织生产分布，列举冀州、并州、青州、兖州、徐州、扬州、荆州、豫州的布帛、丝、纨、绮、绣、玄织缟、玄纁等物产，并引“青州贡盐緝海物”“厥贡漆丝”等句；2016 记《禹贡》有梁州（秦岭以南、陕南川东地区）贡铁的记载。","path":"publications/yugong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下先秦物产地理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhongguo-gongyi-yange-shilue","title":"中国工艺沿革史略（Zhongguo Gongyi Yange Shilue）","name_en":"Zhongguo Gongyi Yange Shilue","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["工艺美术史","史学史","1917","商务印书馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国工艺沿革史略》是许衍灼撰著的工艺美术史，1917 年出版。田自秉在后记中称，该书是作者当时在国内仅发现的一本中国自己出版的工艺美术史书籍；李立新记其由商务印书馆出版，并将其视为中国工艺美术通史、断代史、专史编撰的起点。","path":"publications/zhongguo-gongyi-yange-shilue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下近代工艺史写作的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhongguo-shejishi-gaofeng","title":"中国设计史（高丰）（The Design History of China (Gao Feng)）","name_en":"The Design History of China (Gao Feng)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["设计史","通史","高丰","2004","广西美术出版社"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国设计史》是高丰著、广西美术出版社出版的中国设计史专著。正文由绪论和九章组成，从原始时代述至清末民国；绪论讨论中国设计史的研究课题、发生发展与若干规律。书名页附英文题名 THE DESIGN HISTORY OF CHINA。","path":"publications/zhongguo-shejishi-gaofeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下现代设计通史的文献锚点，同时是本语料第 1 册的来源书目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhongguo-shejishi-xiayanjing","title":"中国设计史（夏燕靖）（Zhongguo Shejishi (Xia Yanjing)）","name_en":"Zhongguo Shejishi (Xia Yanjing)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["设计史","教材","夏燕靖","2009","上海人民美术出版社"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textbook","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国设计史》是夏燕靖编著，许平、李新主编“中国高等院校艺术设计学系列教材”之一种，由上海人民美术出版社 2009 年 1 月出版。CIP 数据标明 ISBN 978-7-5322-5618-1、分类号 J509.2；版本记录载明开本 787×1092 1/18、印张 15.34、印数 0001-3300、定价 40.00 元。","path":"publications/zhongguo-shejishi-xiayanjing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下现代设计史教材的文献锚点，同时是本语料第 2 册的来源书目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhongguo-yishu-shejishi-upgraded","title":"中国艺术设计史（升级版）（Chinese Design History (Upgraded Edition)）","name_en":"Chinese Design History (Upgraded Edition)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["设计史","教材","夏燕靖","2016","上海人民美术出版社"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textbook","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国艺术设计史（升级版）》是夏燕靖著、许平与李新主编的艺术设计史教材，2016 年 6 月由上海人民美术出版社出版。CIP 数据标明 ISBN 978-7-5322-9726-9、分类号 J509.2，版本记录载明开本 787×1092 1/18、18 印张、定价 48.00 元。作者后记称此次为“历时十年修订五次”的升级版，新增原始农业生产器具设计、漆工艺、唐代设计理论、明清贸易瓷与社会主义建","path":"publications/zhongguo-yishu-shejishi-upgraded.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhouli","title":"周礼（Rites of Zhou）","name_en":"Rites of Zhou","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","官书","礼制","职官"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classic","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《周礼》是六册来源共同征引的先秦官书。夏燕靖 2016 另记其为儒家经典，相传为西周周公所著。本 KU 只登记《周礼》本体：书名与篇目沿革、六官体系与职官规模、以及来源据《周礼》征引的职官与礼制材料。其《冬官》补篇《考工记》的工艺文本（百工分工、制车、六齐、营国、四要素等）已由 `publications/kaogongji.md` 承担，本 KU 不重复登记，只在必要处指向该条。","path":"publications/zhouli.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《周礼》是 D 维度下先秦职官与礼制制度的文献依据，其《冬官》补篇《考工记》的工艺内容归 B 维度并已单独成 KU。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhouyi","title":"周易（Zhouyi）","name_en":"Zhouyi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","易经","易传","卦爻象","制器尚象"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《周易》是由《易经》与《易传》组成的典籍。《易经》含卦爻象符号系统与卦辞，高丰称多数专家认为约西周前期由巫史集体创造；《易传》十篇又称“十翼”，约成书于战国晚期。高丰把卦爻象视为平面构成设计，并从中提炼制器尚象、道器统一、文质统一等设计思想。2016 记其又名《易经》，约成书于西周初年，以六十四卦和阴阳之道说明万物变化，“道”与“器”的关系成为传统造物思想与设计方法的主题。2016 册还引《易·系","path":"publications/zhouyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下造物观念文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhuanghuang-zhi","title":"装潢志（Zhuanghuang Zhi）","name_en":"Zhuanghuang Zhi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明末","周嘉胄","书画装裱","装潢","42节"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《装潢志》是明末周嘉胄撰写的书画装裱专著，完整记述古代书画装裱理论，全书 4000 余字，分序言和 42 小节，介绍“洗”“揭”“补”“衬边”“小托”“全”“式”“镶攒”“覆”“上壁”“下壁”“安轴”等步骤要领与装潢用料知识；2016 另列“上杆”“上贴”“贴签”“染古绢托纸”等步骤。","path":"publications/zhuanghuang-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代装裱文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhuangshi-zazhi","title":"装饰杂志（Zhuangshi Magazine）","name_en":"Zhuangshi Magazine","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1958","设计期刊","中央工艺美术学院","工业设计","张光宇"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《装饰》杂志于 1958 年 9 月在北京创刊，1980 年 6 月复刊。1988 年第 2 期发表广州美术学院设计研究室专稿《中国工业设计怎么办》；1989 年第 4 期以专辑讨论室内艺术设计；1992 年第 4 期推出“纪念张光宇特刊”；1996 年发表纪念陈之佛诞辰 100 周年的文章。","path":"publications/zhuangshi-zazhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下当代中国设计期刊的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhuangzi","title":"庄子（Zhuangzi）","name_en":"Zhuangzi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","庄子","南华经","以器喻事","轮扁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《庄子》是庄子及其后学所著的道家典籍。赵农称其以器喻事、议论风生，对器具的认识具体而完整：《养生主》有“所好者道也，进乎技矣”；《知北游》记 80 余岁工匠“臣之年二十而好捶钩，于物无视也，非钩无察也”；《天道》记轮扁制轮“不徐不疾，得之于手而应于心，口不能言”；《天运》论乐有“惧”“怠”“惑”的递进。2016 记其又称《南华经》，原有 52 篇，内篇一般认为庄子所作，含“天人合一”“以天合天”“","path":"publications/zhuangzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下造物思想文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhuyuan-taoshuo","title":"竹园陶说（Zhuyuan Taoshuo）","name_en":"Zhuyuan Taoshuo","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["近代","刘子芬","陶瓷","瓷史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《竹园陶说》为近人刘子芬撰，1 卷，分述学、索原、说器、辨色、汝窑、广窑、美人醉、杂说八节。","path":"publications/zhuyuan-taoshuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:ziren-yizhi","title":"梓人遗制（Ziren Yizhi）","name_en":"Ziren Yizhi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","木工","织机","车制","薛景石"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《梓人遗制》是元代木工技术专著，四册都把它系于薛景石名下，但四册写的**不是同一本书**：赵农写的是两部分的完整体（先车制、后织机），夏燕靖两版写的是“规范制作织机的木工技术的专著”，田自秉只取其中花罗织机的一段机构说明。断代也有分歧——田自秉作“宋人”，其余三册作元代。","path":"publications/ziren-yizhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《梓人遗制》在四册中都是木工技术专著：织机四类、零件与总装图、用材与工时构成主体（B），刊行年、《永乐大典》收录、中国营造学社整理出版属流传与制度面（D）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:ziren-zhuan","title":"梓人传（Ziren Zhuan）","name_en":"Ziren Zhuan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","柳宗元","营造","匠师","设计思想"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"essay","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《梓人传》是唐代柳宗元所著文章，通过对一位自荐的杨氏木匠营造思想的分析和营造行为的实地观察描述，阐明设计构思及运用法则的重要作用。文章提出营造工艺的总体准则“规矩绳墨以定制”“善运众工而不伐艺”，即以合理的预设布局调整各项具体技术工作并完成整个设计意图；原文评价其以“相道”联系工匠经验论述工艺设计思想具有独到性。","path":"publications/ziren-zhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下唐代设计思想文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zunsheng-bajian","title":"遵生八笺（Zunsheng Bajian）","name_en":"Zunsheng Bajian","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","高濂","养生","岁时风俗","玉器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"life_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《遵生八笺》是明代高濂所撰的养生专著，1591 年刊，20 卷 8 笺，含大量岁时风俗与实用艺术考据资料。田自秉引其“上古用玉，珍重似不敢亵”一语，说明周代玉器因与伦理道德联系而受社会特别重视。","path":"publications/zunsheng-bajian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代生活与器物文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zuozhuan","title":"左传（Zuozhuan）","name_en":"Zuozhuan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","编年体","青铜器","鼎"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《左传》是先秦编年体史书。2016 册引宣公三年“桀有昏德，鼎迁于商”“商纣暴虐，迁鼎于周”，说明青铜器被用作统治权力更替的象征。","path":"publications/zuozhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:an-furniture","title":"案（An (Table)）","name_en":"An (Table)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","矮足","承具","漆案"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"案是春秋战国主要家具，本义为木制盛食物的矮脚托盘，亦代桌。《考工记·玉人》“案十有二寸”；战国至两汉多木制髹漆饰彩纹，后演变为书案、平头案等长形承具，按材料有陶案、木案、漆案、铜案。","path":"terms/an-furniture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"案是 B 维度下先秦两汉承具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:badayun","title":"八达晕（Badayun (Eight-Pointed Medallion Pattern)）","name_en":"Badayun (Eight-Pointed Medallion Pattern)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐宋","元代","明代","纹样","八达晕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"八达晕是传统装饰纹样的一种：以八边形为中心向外展开，图案中心为主花，周边以各种几何纹作装饰。2016 册记这种纹样在古代织锦中最流行，唐宋时称八达晕锦，元代称八搭韵锦，近代称天华锦；在明锦几何纹中运用最多。","path":"terms/badayun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"八达晕是 B 维度下织锦几何纹样的条目，其纹样组织与装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:baici","title":"白瓷（White Porcelain）","name_en":"White Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北齐","低铁胎釉","邢窑","青白两大体系"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"白瓷是用低含铁量胎釉烧成、釉色乳白的瓷器，北齐发明，胎料较细腻，釉薄而滋润、呈乳白色，釉厚处泛青；白瓷出现后瓷分青、白两大体系。隋代已烧制成功并大量生产，唐代成为重要品种，邢窑为代表，邢瓷洁白如银雪，釉白而微闪淡黄或淡青。","path":"terms/baici.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"白瓷是 B 维度下瓷器类型与胎釉技术的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:baigong","title":"百工（Baigong / Hundred Craftsmen）","name_en":"Baigong","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","考工记","官营手工业","工匠","六职"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_system","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"百工是先秦文献中对手工业者与官营手工业制度的称法。《考工记》说“国有六职，百工与居一焉”，把百工列为王公、士大夫、百工、商旅、农夫、妇功六职之一；又说“凡攻木之工七，攻金之工六，攻皮之工五，设色之工五，刮摩之工五，抟埴之工二”，共 30 个工种。高丰把“百工”释为“直接服务于王室的、有官长率领的官府手工业者”，并把“政府建立的整套官营手工业制度”也称为“百工”制度；李立新同样把“百工”制度释为“整","path":"terms/baigong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"百工是 D 维度下官营手工业制度与工匠身份的术语锚点；工种分工、材料与工艺规范属 B。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bandixue-shi-jianzhu","title":"半地穴式建筑（Semi-Subterranean Dwelling）","name_en":"Semi-Subterranean Dwelling","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","仰韶文化","半坡","木骨草泥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"半地穴式建筑是黄河流域仰韶文化遗址中大量存在的一种泥木房屋：先挖成半人高的坑，中心支木柱，屋顶沿坑周围用木椽架棚、再铺厚草泥土，木头用藤条捆扎。形状有方形和圆形，门朝南并有斜坡式或阶梯式门道，房子中间为灶坑。","path":"terms/bandixue-shi-jianzhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"半地穴式建筑是 B 维度下新石器时代居住建筑的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bao-yi-bo-dai","title":"褒衣博带（Baoyi Bodai (Loose Robe, Broad Sash)）","name_en":"Baoyi Bodai (Loose Robe, Broad Sash)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","竹林七贤","云冈石窟","佛像服饰","玄学"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"褒衣博带原指魏晋南北朝宽衫大袖、衣带宽博的服饰风尚。南朝时王公、名士、百姓都以宽衫大袖、褒衣博带为时髦；文人受佛道两教影响崇尚玄学，衣着突破礼法，敞领宽衫、袒胸露怀成为习俗，可从《竹林七贤画像砖》得到佐证。赵农则以“褒衣博带”指云冈石窟所采用的中原样式佛像服饰，它取代了早期佛像“偏袒右肩式”及“通肩式”的服饰。","path":"terms/bao-yi-bo-dai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"褒衣博带是 E 维度下服饰风尚与佛教造像中国化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:baomaizhu","title":"包买主（Baomaizhu (Putting-Out Merchant)）","name_en":"Baomaizhu (Putting-Out Merchant)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清末民初","棉布","换棉","出机","资本主义萌芽"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"economic_role","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"包买主是清末民初出现的社会新阶层，主要收购农副产品再转售给大城市的棉布批发行，以“换棉”和“出机”方式控制生产和流通。之后包买主设立自己直接经营的手工工场，从农家招募“机织下女”从事生产，到民国年间已较广泛发展。","path":"terms/baomaizhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"包买主是 D 维度下清末民初手工业组织与商业资本的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:baoxianghua-wen","title":"宝相花纹（Baoxianghua Wen (Baoxiang Flower Motif)）","name_en":"Baoxianghua Wen (Baoxiang Flower Motif)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","染织纹样","宝相花","莲花","佛教"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"由莲花等花头变形并程式化的唐代装饰纹样。2016 册把它与唐草纹并列为唐代染织纹样中使用最多的两种：宝相花纹源于佛教题材，是自然界花卉（主要是莲花）的花头作变形的艺术处理，使之趋于程式化。来源按形式分两种：一种为平面团形，以8片平展的莲瓣构成花头，莲瓣尖端呈五曲形，各瓣内又填饰三曲小莲瓣，花心由8个小圆珠和8瓣小花组成，多见于唐三彩器上；另一种是立面层叠形，以层层绽开的半侧面勾莲瓣构成。","path":"terms/baoxianghua-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下唐代染织纹样的条目，其织造与印染载体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:beijingren","title":"北京人（Peking Man）","name_en":"Peking Man","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器时代早期","周口店","直立人","石器","用火"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hominin","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北京人是晚期直立人的代表，20 世纪 20 年代发现于北京房山区周口店龙骨山，生活在距今 60 万至 23 万年前。石器原料以石英脉为主，普遍使用捶击法、砸击法打片；石器已有类型和分工，除刮削器外还有尖状器、砍砸器、雕刻器和石锤。","path":"terms/beijingren.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"北京人是 B 维度下旧石器时代早期人类与石器技术的核心条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:belt-hook","title":"带钩（Belt Hook）","name_en":"Belt Hook","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","服饰配件","胡服","青铜工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"clothing_accessory","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"带钩是春秋战国时期连接革带两端的钩形配件；田自秉记其\"约始于春秋初期\"，广泛流行于战国，直到西汉。六册一致认为它与胡服配套使用、自北方民族传入。分歧不在起源，而在两处：一是带钩是否只与胡服配套，二是带钩是否承担身份等级标示的功能。六册在这两点上的表述并不一致，本 KU 并列。","path":"terms/belt-hook.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"带钩是 B 维度下春秋战国服饰配件与青铜装饰工艺的交汇条目，其来源问题同时牵涉服饰史（胡服）与工艺史（错金银、嵌玉）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bianxian-ao","title":"辫线袄（Bianxian Ao (Braid-Line Robe)）","name_en":"Bianxian Ao (Braid-Line Robe)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","明代","服饰","辫线袄","曳撒"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"辫线袄是元代皇帝骑射时所穿袍式：交领窄袖，腰间打成细褶，用红紫线横向缝衲固定，使腰间紧束，便于骑射。2016 册在质孙服与大朝会段记此袍，并说明此种款式到明代称为「曳撤」（通行作「曳撒」），仍作为出外骑乘之服。","path":"terms/bianxian-ao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"辫线袄是 B 维度下元代骑射袍服的条目，其与明代曳撒的承袭属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bianzhong","title":"编钟（Bianzhong (Chime Bells)）","name_en":"Bianzhong (Chime Bells)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","西周","礼乐","青铜","一套八钟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"编钟是按大小排列成组的礼仪乐器，周代一系列大小不等的钟挂在一个架上、能发出不同音律，与单独悬挂的特钟相对，是周代礼乐制度的器物体现。赵农记商代编钟三个一组；商代铙到周代成为钟，铙柄保留为钟甬，钟甬侧加环为钟旋，钟偏挂并按大小排列成编钟；西周编钟八个钟一套，可演奏许多乐律，春秋战国时期达到高峰。","path":"terms/bianzhong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"编钟是 B 维度下先秦青铜乐器的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:black-porcelain","title":"黑瓷（Black Porcelain）","name_en":"Black Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","晋代","德清窑","建窑","吉州窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黑瓷是以含铁量较高的釉料在还原焰中烧成的黑釉瓷器，汉代出现、晋代成熟，以浙江德清最负盛名，宋代因斗茶而大盛，建窑兔毫、吉州窑玳瑁是代表。五册的记载可分三层：**化学层**（田自秉给出氧化亚铁含量与呈色的对应）、**窑口层**（德清、建窑、吉州窑及其产品）、**风俗层**（斗茶与黑盏）。分歧在**德清黑釉是否达到纯黑**与**建窑所在政区**的写法。","path":"terms/black-porcelain.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"黑瓷是 B 维度下以高铁釉呈色的瓷种条目：氧化亚铁的配比与还原焰烧成属工艺，乌黑、兔毫、油滴、玳瑁等釉面肌理属装饰。斗茶风尚牵涉生活习俗，本 KU 只作动因记录。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:blue-and-white-porcelain","title":"青花瓷（Blue-and-white Porcelain）","name_en":"Blue-and-white Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","宋代","元代","明代","清代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青花瓷是以钴料在瓷胎上绘纹、罩透明釉、高温一次烧成的釉下彩瓷器，因白地蓝花又称青花。五册都把它当作中国瓷器的主干品种，元代景德镇作品是共同焦点。**分歧集中在起源**：高丰、赵农主唐，田自秉主宋而判\"开始流行在元代中期以后\"，夏燕靖两版则明说\"我国青花起源于何时一直是个未获澄清的问题\"。本 KU 并列四说，不裁定。\n\n**立条说明**：候选索引里\"青花\"（`xdup-0141`：赵农 `cand-","path":"terms/blue-and-white-porcelain.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青花瓷是 B 维度下以钴料呈色的釉下彩瓷种条目：钴料、施彩、罩釉与高温一次烧成属工艺，白地蓝花的色彩与纹饰体系属装饰。其外销与官民窑分工另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:boshanlu","title":"博山炉（Boshan Incense Burner）","name_en":"Boshan Incense Burner","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","青铜器","熏炉","香薰","仙山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"博山炉是汉代薰炉（香薰）中最著名的一种，炉盖高而尖、雕镂成山峦形，象征海上仙山\"博山\"，山间有孔，燃香时烟气从镂孔冒出；炉座作盘形盛水，以助蒸香气。三册都把它与汉人的仙山信仰、羽化登仙观念联系起来，但叙述重心不同：高丰以两件纪年明确的实物（满城刘胜墓错金铜博山炉、茂陵鎏金银铜竹节熏炉）为主，赵农以形制与《薰炉铭》为主，田自秉以名实、神话文献与《考古图》为主。本 KU 合并三册，器物数据与文献引文分","path":"terms/boshanlu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"博山炉是 B 维度下汉代青铜熏炉的器形条目；仙山造型与羽化登仙观念牵涉 C 维度。形制、铸造与错金工艺属 B，图像与信仰属 C。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:buzi","title":"补子（Rank Badge）","name_en":"Rank Badge","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","清代","官服","品级标识","刺绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"official_insignia","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"补子是明清官服上缀于胸前、背后的方形绣片，以文禽武兽区分品级。四册来源有直接记载（高丰、李立新两册无\"补子\"字样）。来源在三点上不一致：明代始定的年份（洪武二十四年／二十五年）、明制与清制品级表的具体分配、以及清代武官六七品至九品的纹样归属。夏燕靖两版各自在同书相邻两段中给出不同年份，赵农与田自秉的清代武官表亦互不相同。本 KU 全部并列。","path":"terms/buzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"补子是 D 维度下明清官服品级制度的标识件，其禽兽纹样的符号语义属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:caihui-tao","title":"彩绘陶（Caihui Tao）","name_en":"Caihui Tao","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋","战国","两汉","明器","陶器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彩绘陶是春秋兴起、战国大发展、延续至两汉的陶器，主要用作明器陪葬。**四册对它的工序定义分成相反的两组**：田自秉与高丰都说是**在烧成的陶坯上画花**，田自秉并明确以\"在名称中加一绘字\"与彩陶相区别；夏燕靖两版却写成\"**在陶胎上绘出花纹后再进行烧制**\"，而那正是彩陶的工序。两组表述不能同时成立，本 KU 并列原话，不裁定；分歧同时记入本批工作包。`consensus` 仍为 `tentati","path":"terms/caihui-tao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"彩绘陶是 B 维度下战国至两汉明器类型条目：彩绘层与陶胎的结合方式属工艺，纹样与设色属装饰。其明器用途另涉丧葬制度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:cangli-yuqi","title":"藏礼于器（Ritual Embedded in Vessels）","name_en":"Ritual Embedded in Vessels","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","礼制","青铜礼器","九鼎","等级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_concept","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“藏礼于器”指青铜礼器承载礼制等级观念：西周奴隶主规定一整套礼制，对祭祀和典礼使用礼器的数量和规格作严格限制，使贵贱有等、上下有别。《周礼》载“礼祭，天子九鼎，诸侯七鼎，大夫五鼎，士三鼎”，《左传·庄公十八年》有“名位不同，礼亦异数”。","path":"terms/cangli-yuqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"藏礼于器是 A 维度下西周礼制与器物观念的核心条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chai-yao","title":"柴窑（Chai Kiln）","name_en":"Chai Kiln","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["五代后周","传说","雨过天青","郑州","窑址未发现"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_kiln","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"柴窑是传说后周创建的瓷窑，窑址在郑州，柴世宗批其款式“雨过天青云破处，者般颜色作将来”；记载最早见于明代陶瓷著作，实物未见，窑址从未发现，是否存在至今悬而未决。","path":"terms/chai-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"柴窑是 B 维度下文献记载而未证实的瓷窑条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:changjian-gong","title":"敞肩拱（Changjian Gong (Open-Spandrel Arch)）","name_en":"Changjian Gong (Open-Spandrel Arch)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["隋代","赵州桥","李春","敞肩拱","石拱桥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge_structure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"主拱肩部开设小拱以泄洪减重的桥型。2016 册记工匠李春于595-605年设计修建的赵州桥，是现存最早的双曲石拱桥；桥长50余米，宽9米多，桥拱跨度37米多，无桥墩，坡度小，便于车辆行走；大桥拱两端各有两个小拱，是世界上首创“敞肩拱”桥型，既可协助泻洪，也减轻了桥身的自重。来源并记该桥迄今历时1300多年仍基本完好，从建筑设计角度说，赵州桥在选择桥址、建筑材料、力学性能等方面都达到了当时建桥的最高","path":"terms/changjian-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下隋代桥梁结构的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chanheliao","title":"羼和料（Temper (Ceramic Additive)）","name_en":"Temper (Ceramic Additive)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["陶土","砂粒","耐热急变","新石器时代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"羼和料是制陶时有意掺入陶土的砂粒、石灰粒、稻草末和碎陶末等，以砂粒为主。除少量砂粒为陶土固有外，大多是有意填入的；羼和料能提高陶器的耐热急变性能，避免容器在火上加热时破裂。","path":"terms/chanheliao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"羼和料是 B 维度下早期制陶材料配方的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chaoju","title":"巢居（Chaoju (Nest Dwelling)）","name_en":"Nest Dwelling","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["原始居住","槽巢","窝棚","干栏式建筑","礼记"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"巢居是原始居住形式之一，指在树上或以柴草堆成的窝棚居住。2016 册引《礼记·礼运篇》“夏则居槽巢”，称槽巢为用柴草堆成的窝棚，并把干栏式建筑视为巢居的继承和发展。","path":"terms/chaoju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下原始居住形态的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chengshi-jianzhu-huanjing-sheji","title":"城市建筑环境设计（Chengshi Jianzhu Huanjing Sheji (Urban Architectural Environment Design)）","name_en":"Chengshi Jianzhu Huanjing Sheji (Urban Architectural Environment Design)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["城市环境","建筑色彩","环境设计","色彩设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_discipline","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"城市建筑环境设计是在建筑设计和环境设计基础上产生的细化设计。2016 册称其设计对象除单体建筑的色彩以外，更重要的是与周围环境色彩形成一种协调的基调设计，创造和谐的美感；它对建筑环境的色彩进行比对分析与整合，重点落实在绿化、铺路、水体、景观，乃至雕塑、壁画以及光环境的色彩设计，这些环境因素的色彩设计与建筑共同形成不可分割的色彩整体。","path":"terms/chengshi-jianzhu-huanjing-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"城市建筑环境设计是 D 维度下现代设计领域的条目，其建筑与环境色彩对象属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chikou","title":"侈口（Chikou (Flared Mouth)）","name_en":"Flared Mouth","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["器形术语","口沿","广口","陶瓷","青铜器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"container_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"侈口是古汉语专业术语，多用于指陶瓷、金属器皿的口形，又称广口，形状一般为口沿外倾。2016 册另引《汉书·王莽传中》说明其又指大口之意，并引申为夸大其言。","path":"terms/chikou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下器形描述术语的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chunqiu-zhanguo-qingtong-chuishiqi","title":"春秋战国青铜炊食器（Chunqiu Zhanguo Qingtong Chuishiqi (Bronze Cooking and Food Vessels)）","name_en":"Chunqiu Zhanguo Qingtong Chuishiqi (Bronze Cooking and Food Vessels)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","青铜器","炊食器","鼎","鬲"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_category","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2016 册以表列形式记春秋战国青铜炊食器的设计特征及演变，列鼎、鬲、甗、簋、敦、簠、豆、壶、钫、鉴盘十类。来源先总述青铜器应用转向「钟鸣鼎食」的组合，失去祭祀和礼器的特性，向生活日用型器物发展；表内逐器记形制变化，图例未视觉核验。","path":"terms/chunqiu-zhanguo-qingtong-chuishiqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下春秋战国青铜炊食器类别的条目，不拆分具体器物 KU。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chunqiu-zhanguo-zhanche-zhonglei","title":"春秋战国战车种类（Chunqiu Zhanguo Zhanche Zhonglei (Types of War Chariots)）","name_en":"Chunqiu Zhanguo Zhanche Zhonglei (Types of War Chariots)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","战车","轻车","阙车","苹车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2016 册知识链接列春秋战国战车类型，以轻车（驰车、攻车）为主，另有阙车、苹车、广车，并引郑玄、孙诒让、高诱、杜预诸家注。来源总述车战延自商周战车形制，骑兵成熟以前战车以肉搏、防御、机动能力成为不可替代的快速突击兵种；正文又记国君、统帅乘戎路车，并称《考工记》把造车列为官手工业之首。","path":"terms/chunqiu-zhanguo-zhanche-zhonglei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下春秋战国战车类型的条目，其造车制度另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chunqiu-zhanguo-zhanchuan-zhonglei","title":"春秋战国战船种类（Chunqiu Zhanguo Zhanchuan Zhonglei (Types of Warships)）","name_en":"Chunqiu Zhanguo Zhanchuan Zhonglei (Types of Warships)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","战船","楼船","冒突","赤马"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2016 册知识链接列春秋战国战船四类：楼船、冒突、赤马、斗舰，并引杜佑《通典》《释名》。来源正文另记南方楚、吴、越建立最早的水军舟师与造船工场船宫，吴国水师有三翼、突冒、楼舡、桥舡等舰种，大战舰长九丈余、载百余人，春秋末期越国造出巨型战船楼船。","path":"terms/chunqiu-zhanguo-zhanchuan-zhonglei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下春秋战国战船类型的条目，其水军制度另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:cishan-wenhua","title":"磁山文化（Cishan Wenhua (Cishan Culture)）","name_en":"Cishan Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器早期","磁山","农业起源","农作物遗迹","生产工具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"磁山文化是距今 8000—7000 年的新石器时代早期文化。2016 册以农作物遗迹及农业生产工具为其特点，认为它表明生活方式已从狩猎采集过渡到早期农业，并把 20 世纪 70 年代末发掘的磁山、裴李岗文化并列为新石器时代早期代表。","path":"terms/cishan-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下新石器时代早期农业文化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:copper-stone-period","title":"铜石并用时期（Tongshi Bingyong Shiqi (Copper-Stone Period)）","name_en":"Copper-Stone Period","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["铜石并用","红铜","黄铜片","齐家文化","青铜时代之前"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜石并用时期是青铜时代以前的阶段，指夏代以前利用铜矿物制造器具、技术与经验逐步成熟的历史。2016 册以仰韶文化半坡遗址黄铜片、河北大城山与甘肃齐家文化的红铜制品为据，判定这一阶段被称作铜石并用时期。","path":"terms/copper-stone-period.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下铜器使用早期阶段的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:daibing-gongju","title":"带柄工具（Hafted Tools）","name_en":"Hafted Tools","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器时代","峙峪文化","复合工具","木柄"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"带柄工具是在石器上加装木柄以省力的复合工具。考古发现峙峪文化部分旧石器已装木柄，带柄工具可上推到旧石器时代晚期乃至中期；但当时制作水平原始、劳动尚未产生迫切需求，其大规模使用要待新石器时代加工技术进步、特别是农耕兴起后才可能。","path":"terms/daibing-gongju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"带柄工具是 B 维度下旧石器时代工具结构的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:danding-fangche","title":"单锭纺车（Danding Fangche (Single-Spindle Spinning Wheel)）","name_en":"Danding Fangche (Single-Spindle Spinning Wheel)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西汉","纺织工具","纺车","单锭","纺轮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"以绳轮转动、可加拈并合并丝弦的单锭手摇纺车。2016 册记新石器时代已有纺轮，后发展为单锭手摇纺车；西汉杨雄（原文，通行作「扬雄」）《方言》是最早的记载；临沂银雀山帛画、画像石中有纺车图像，图 4-37 为示意。来源称纺车通过绳轮转动带动锭子加拈，并可合并丝弦、卷绕于纡子，效率高于纺轮，汉代民间已普遍使用。","path":"terms/danding-fangche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下纺织工具的条目，其纺织产品归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:danke-heitao","title":"蛋壳黑陶（Eggshell Black Pottery）","name_en":"Eggshell Black Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["龙山文化","轮制","薄胎","山东"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蛋壳黑陶是典型龙山文化最具特征的器物，薄而光亮，大量出现于轮制盛行的陶器群中。典型龙山文化以山东为中心，轮制陶器约占全部陶器一半以上，常见器形有鬶、鬼脸式腿鼎、高圈足镂孔豆和杯、盘等。","path":"terms/danke-heitao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蛋壳黑陶是 B 维度下龙山文化陶器类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dark-pattern-pottery","title":"暗纹陶（Dark-pattern Pottery）","name_en":"Dark-pattern Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋","战国","中原地区","陶器","压花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"暗纹陶是春秋兴起、战国大发展、流行于中原地区的陶器，特征是在陶坯未干透前压出浅细花纹，仅在光线斜射时隐约可见，故称暗纹，又称砑花陶。三册的正文高度重合，分歧集中在**别称用字**（砑花陶／研花陶）与**中心产地**（中原／以河南为中心）两处。三册都没有给压花工具的形制，也没有给暗纹与磨光陶、彩绘陶的工序关系。","path":"terms/dark-pattern-pottery.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"暗纹陶是 B 维度下战国中原陶器类型条目：压花工序与胎质属工艺，隐约可见的线纹效果属装饰。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dawenkou-culture","title":"大汶口文化（Dawenkou Culture）","name_en":"Dawenkou Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","父系氏族","黄河下游","海岱地区","考古学文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大汶口文化是黄河下游新石器时代中晚期的考古学文化，因山东泰安大汶口遗址而得名（六册均未记发现年份）。六册都把它放在**母系氏族向父系氏族转化**的节点上，但只有田自秉给出分布与转化关系的完整表述，高丰、赵农、李立新分别从陶器造型、陶文符号与手工业分化三个方向取材。本 KU 只登记文化层面的命名、分期位置、工艺特征与争论点；陶器、象牙梳等单件器物的细节不在此重复。","path":"terms/dawenkou-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大汶口文化是 B 维度下黄河下游新石器时代中晚期、由母系向父系过渡的考古学文化条目；陶文符号牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dian-la-man","title":"点蜡幔（Dianla Man (Wax-Printed Curtain)）","name_en":"Dianla Man (Wax-Printed Curtain)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","苗族","西南少数民族","蜡染","点蜡幔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西南少数民族蜡染幔帐的古称。2016 册“知识链接”记：这是西南少数民族、尤其是苗族地区流行的一种蜡染品种的古称，又叫“蜡缁”，即用蜡染的方式印染幔帐；并引宋代朱辅《溪蛮丛笑》“溪洞爱铜鼓，甚于金玉，模取古文，以蜡刮板印布，入靛缸渍染，名点蜡幔”。同册后文又记西南少数民族的蜡染工艺在南宋时已见于广西瑶族地区，称为“瑶斑布”，当时蜡染技术已有很大发展，具备成批生产的条件，并制作了许多驰名全国的产品，","path":"terms/dian-la-man.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代西南少数民族蜡染织物的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dianquan","title":"垫圈（Dianquan (Kiln Setter Ring)）","name_en":"Dianquan (Kiln Setter Ring)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东汉","窑具","垫圈","耐火黏土","间隔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_furnishing","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"瓷器焙烧时用于器物与器物、器物与匣钵之间间隔的环形耐火黏土窑具。2016 册“垫圈”专条记：垫圈以耐火黏上（疑为「耐火黏土」）制作，呈环形，上、下面较平整；直径略等于或小于所承托器物的足（底）直径，厚度则随间隔器物的不同而有所差别；垫圈出现于东汉晚期或稍后，后来逐渐流行。来源并作优劣比较：垫圈较垫饼直接接触器物面小，用料小而轻，支点均匀、稳定性能好、取放方便，但加工费时，容易损坏。同册“支钉支烧法","path":"terms/dianquan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下陶瓷窑具的条目，其装烧工序见 `procedures/fu-shao-fa.md`、`procedures/zhiding-zhishao.md`。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:diao-qi","title":"雕漆（Diaoqi (Carved Lacquer)）","name_en":"Diaoqi (Carved Lacquer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["剔红","剔犀","剔彩","张成","杨茂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"雕漆是在漆层上雕刻而非在胎体雕镂的漆器工艺，使漆色呈现具有立体感的浮雕效果。唐代新创：先在漆胎上涂漆数十层，待一定厚度再雕刻；此前漆雕是在木胎上先雕后漆，此作法今称剔红，唐代实物至今未发现。宋代包括剔红、剔犀、剔彩，多以金银为胎、朱漆堆至数十层，剔犀需两种以上色漆反复重叠；宋代雕漆多在宫中内府修内司制造。元代张成、杨茂（嘉兴西塘人）最负盛名，作品造型多为普通圆盘圆盒，特色在“漆”与“雕”，张成盒漆","path":"terms/diao-qi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"雕漆是 B 维度下髹漆雕刻工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ding","title":"鼎（Ding Cauldron）","name_en":"Ding Cauldron","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","青铜器","礼器","列鼎","炊煮器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鼎是圆体三足、双耳（方鼎则四足）的煮食器，陶鼎早于青铜鼎，青铜鼎在商周成为最重要的礼器与政权象征。六册均有字面记载，其中五册有实质论述（高丰、夏燕靖两版、赵农、田自秉），李立新一册仅在年表中列\"列鼎\"、以《天工开物》\"铸鼎图\"说明分工，属旁证。来源在**列鼎制度的等级数字**上有实质分歧，在**礼器分类的名称**上给出两套互不对应的系统。本 KU 并列，不裁定。","path":"terms/ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鼎是 B 维度下由陶鼎到青铜鼎、由炊煮器到礼器的器形条目，其列鼎等级制度属 D 维度，纹饰与铭文属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dingcun-wenhua","title":"丁村文化（Dingcun Culture）","name_en":"Dingcun Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器时代中期","山西襄汾","石器","第二步加工"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"丁村文化是中国旧石器时代中期的典型遗存，位于山西襄汾丁村。石器以砍砸器、三棱大尖状器、球状器为主，重要的是少量石器开始第二步修整加工；丁村人多用“互交打击法”制造砍砸器。","path":"terms/dingcun-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"丁村文化是 B 维度下旧石器时代中期石器技术的关键遗存。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dou-vessel","title":"豆（Dou）（Dou (Stemmed Serving Vessel)）","name_en":"Dou (Stemmed Serving Vessel)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","春秋","盛食器","陶豆","有盖豆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"豆为盛食器，用于盛调味品，由陶豆演变而来，铜豆始见西周后期。形制分三层，上有盘、中有柄、底为圈足；早期盘浅、柄短而粗，春秋出现有盖豆，盖与器身相合呈球体，盖有四钮、器身有四环耳。春秋战国时期的豆把手细而高，便于拿取，并增加了盖，盖翻置时可当盘使用，大大提高了实用性；豆的造型亦为曲线的球体所组成，形式优美。","path":"terms/dou-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"豆是 B 维度下商周盛食器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:doucai","title":"斗彩（Doucai）","name_en":"Doucai","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","成化","景德镇","釉上彩","青花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"斗彩是釉下青花与釉上彩绘相结合的瓷器装饰技法，成化时期最精。五册来源有直接记载（李立新一册无\"斗彩\"字样）。来源在三处结构性问题上的说法互相冲突：名称由何而来、斗彩与五彩是并列还是包含、以及斗彩是否创始于成化。这三处都不是措辞差异，而是分类体系层面的分歧，本 KU 并列。","path":"terms/doucai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"斗彩是 B 维度下明代景德镇釉上彩与釉下青花结合的装饰技法，其色彩与纹饰效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dougong","title":"斗拱（Dougong (Bracket Set)）","name_en":"Dougong (Bracket Set)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["木构建筑","商周雏形","一斗二升","唐宋结构","明清装饰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_component","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"斗拱是我国古代木构建筑的特有构件，位于柱子承接屋顶的部分，由若干方木与横木垒叠而成，用以支撑伸出的屋檐并将重量转移到柱子上。商周时期已见雏形，可在青铜器上见到样式；汉代有直拱、人字拱、单层拱、多层拱，并出现一斗二升、一斗三升，东汉还有一斗四升。唐宋时期主要为结构构件，到明清演变为以装饰构件为主。","path":"terms/dougong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"斗拱是 B 维度下木构建筑构件的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:duan-yan","title":"端砚（Duan Inkstone）","name_en":"Duan Inkstone","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["端州","肇庆","鸲鹆眼","唐代","清代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inkstone_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"端砚石出自广东肇庆斧柯山中，肇庆属端州管辖，山中有端溪蜿蜒，砚石即在水畔山间。端砚石从唐代武德年间开采以来闻名天下，宋代时山体崩塌几乎湮没，明代后期开始复采，清代端砚重新复兴，其砚石古朴典雅，深受文人喜爱。","path":"terms/duan-yan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"端砚是 B 维度下文房砚台的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:duanao-taoqun","title":"短袄套裙（Duan'ao Taoqun (Short Jacket with Skirt)）","name_en":"Duan'ao Taoqun (Short Jacket with Skirt)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["民国","女装","短袄套裙","文明新装","高领"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"短袄套裙是民国初年流行的女子装束，形制为上衣下裙。上衣多为短袄，样式有对襟、琵琶襟、斜襟等；领、袖、襟、摆很少施镶滚花边或刺绣纹样，朴素无华；袖有长过手腕，亦有短至露肘；领形为高领，袖形与衣摆宽瘦长短略有变化。因受西式服饰尤其是日本女生校服装束的影响，袄形多呈现为窄而修长。下裙式样比较单一，多为黑色长裙，大多不施质纹，下摆通常覆盖脚面。穿着者少佩簪钗、手镯、耳环、戒指等首饰，以示区别于清代皇宫贵族","path":"terms/duanao-taoqun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"短袄套裙是 E 维度下民国女子服饰变革的条目，其形制属 B 维度服饰工艺。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dui-vessel","title":"敦（Dui (Ritual Vessel)）","name_en":"Dui (Ritual Vessel)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","青铜器","食器","瓜鼎","球形"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"敦是战国时期新创的器种，由两个半球合成一球形。夏燕靖称其为盛黍稷的食器，三足和盖的三钮也都是圆形，整个器体构成圆的统一体；赵农称其为圆球体的炖肉器具，上下各为半球体，上半部压力较重，能加快肉食熟烂速度。春秋战国敦非常兴盛，一般大口、圆腹、二环耳、三短足，与簋作用相似但取代簋的地位，后人俗称“瓜鼎”。","path":"terms/dui-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"敦是 B 维度下春秋战国青铜器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dulunche","title":"独轮车（Wheelbarrow）","name_en":"Wheelbarrow","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西汉","诸葛亮","鹿车","山地运输","杠杆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"独轮车是以独轮为标志的手推车，车轮多为木制，利用杠杆原理把负载抗力点靠近车轮，载货载人平稳轻巧，适合崎岖路面；大约西汉晚期出现，西汉时类似鹿车或辘轳车，木牛流马据考即独轮车。赵农记其重心低、操作灵活，便于山地运输，诸葛亮在蜀国山地军事运输中推广使用，后成为蜀地及北方许多地区的家常运输工具。","path":"terms/dulunche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"独轮车是 B 维度下古代运输工具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:duozi-he","title":"多子盒（Duozi Box (Compartmented Container)）","name_en":"Duozi Box (Compartmented Container)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","漆器","宋代","耀州窑","多格食器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"container_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"多子盒在六册中有两种所指：一是与食案合用的多格食器，将深盘分割为许多空格以装载不同食物，携带方便、保存食品干净整洁；二是宋代瓷盒，一盒之中有数个小杯，子母口，中间以瓷条分割固定小杯、避免碰撞，以耀州窑产品最具特色。田自秉另记汉代漆器中的多件套盒，大盒内容纳九子、十一子等小盒。","path":"terms/duozi-he.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"多子盒是 B 维度下多格容器与成套组合设计的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ehuang","title":"额黄（Ehuang (Forehead Yellow)）","name_en":"Ehuang (Forehead Yellow)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["南北朝","唐代","宋代","面妆","额黄"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cosmetic_custom","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"额间涂黄的唐代面妆。2016 册记唐女妆容极富想象：额头上喜欢点画额黄，一种半月形的图案，或是贴花钿，谓之佛妆；所谓“额黄”又叫“鸦黄”，是在额间涂上黄色。来源记这种化妆据说起源于南北朝、盛行于唐，其产生与佛教流行有关系：南北朝时佛教在我国进入盛期，妇女们从涂金的佛像上受到启发，将额头涂成黄色，渐成风习。来源并引南朝简文帝《美女篇》“约黄能效月，裁金巧作星”说明约黄效月的化妆方式，引温庭筠“额黄无","path":"terms/ehuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代面妆习俗的条目，其额饰纹样与佛教图像来源牵涉 C、E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fahua-qi","title":"法华器（Fahua Qi (Fahua Ware)）","name_en":"Fahua Qi (Fahua Ware)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","山西","陶瓷","法华器","珐华"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"法华器是明代山西晋南发展起来的釉陶品种，又称法花、珐华。2016 册记其做法是「在陶胎表面勾勒成凸线轮廓」，再「用助溶剂为牙硝的彩色釉料填底和花纹施彩后烧造」；西安、洛阳等地也烧造，景德镇还用瓷胎仿烧。田自秉记其花纹轮廓用高起的凸线，再饰以蓝、紫、绿等釉彩，产地主要在山西阳城、长治、平阳一带，兴起于明代早期，此后河南、陕西等地也有生产而时间稍晚；有认为其制作与佛教有关，以万历时期所制最佳。","path":"terms/fahua-qi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"法华器是 B 维度下明代山西釉陶品种的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:falangcai","title":"珐琅彩（Falangcai）","name_en":"Falangcai","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","康熙","雍正","乾隆","景德镇"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"珐琅彩是康熙时期出现的清代宫廷釉上彩瓷，又称瓷胎画珐琅、洋瓷，旧俗称古月轩。景德镇制胎、运京施加彩绘并二次烧成，是四册共同给出的生产分工。**四册对\"珐琅彩\"这一条目所定义的对象并不一致**：赵农把定义落在彩料的制作上，田自秉与夏燕靖两版把定义落在瓷器品种上。本 KU 并列，不据一说改写另一说。","path":"terms/falangcai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"珐琅彩是 B 维度下清代宫廷釉上彩条目：景德镇制胎、内务府或北京二次彩绘烧成的分工属工艺与生产组织，华丽稠厚的彩绘效果属装饰。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fangsongti","title":"仿宋体（Fangsong Typeface）","name_en":"Fangsong Typeface","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","雕版印刷","刻书","图案字"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"typeface","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"仿宋体是明代仿刻宋版书成风后形成的印刷字体。刻工为施刀方便使字体渐趋方正，后发展为横轻直重的“图案字”，与手写体全然不同，即后世所称“仿宋体”。清代印刷业发达的城市中，刻字铺鳞次栉比，刻字甚至成为城市居民的家庭副业。","path":"terms/fangsongti.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"仿宋体是 C 维度下雕版印刷字体的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:feiyi","title":"非物质文化遗产（Intangible Cultural Heritage）","name_en":"Intangible Cultural Heritage","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["UNESCO","活态传承","口传","传统手工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"heritage_concept","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"非物质文化遗产指被各群体、团体或个人视为其文化遗产的各种实践、表演、表现形式、知识体系和技能及有关的工具、实物、工艺品和文化场所，包括口头传统、表演艺术、社会风俗礼仪节庆、有关自然界和宇宙的知识和实践、传统手工艺技能五类。它依托人本身存在、以身口相传延续，是“活”的文化中最脆弱的部分。","path":"terms/feiyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"非物质文化遗产是 D 维度下遗产制度与设计教育语境的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fencai","title":"粉彩（Fencai）","name_en":"Fencai","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","康熙","雍正","景德镇","釉上彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"粉彩是康熙时期出现、雍正时期最盛的清代釉上彩瓷，以玻璃白打底、油料调色、渲染出浓淡为特征，又称软彩。四册都把它列为清代彩瓷的主要品种，分歧在**起点措辞**（发展／始／创造）与**烧成温度**：田自秉给 700℃ 左右，夏燕靖两版给釉上彩的 750～860℃ 红炉彩烧，两版并未为粉彩单列温度，两个数值区间不重合。本 KU 并列。","path":"terms/fencai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"粉彩是 B 维度下清代釉上彩装饰类型条目：玻璃白打底、油料调色与烘烧温度属工艺，柔和淡雅的色彩效果属装饰。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fengli-guafan-dulunche","title":"风力挂帆独轮车（Fengli Guafan Dulunche (Wind-Sail Wheelbarrow)）","name_en":"Fengli Guafan Dulunche (Wind-Sail Wheelbarrow)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","交通工具","独轮车","加帆车","风帆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"风力挂帆独轮车是明清时期出现的、同时利用风力和人力的独轮车，又称「加帆车」。2016 册记其道理来自利用风力推车前进；我国早在汉代就开始在船舶上使用风帆，三国时期已逐步采用双帆、三帆、四帆甚至七帆，各帆交错布置以增加受风面积、提高风帆效率，帆多而风压中心低又使船舶获得较大稳定性，明清挂帆独轮车正是受此启发。","path":"terms/fengli-guafan-dulunche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"风力挂帆独轮车是 B 维度下明清风力车辆的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fota","title":"佛塔（Fota (Pagoda)）","name_en":"Fota (Pagoda)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东汉以后","佛教建筑","佛塔","窣堵波","Stupa"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"埋藏舍利、供绕塔礼拜的圣墓式建筑，传入中国后与中国木构楼阁结合形成中国式木塔。2016 册记佛塔源于印度梵文 Stupa（窣堵波），本为埋藏舍利、供信徒绕塔礼拜的圣墓；传入中国后缩小为塔刹，并与东汉木构楼阁结合，形成中国式木塔，后有石塔、砖塔。来源另记嵩岳寺塔为北魏正光四年（523）建、高 41 米、15 层密檐砖塔，是我国现存最早的高层砖石建筑。","path":"terms/fota.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下佛教建筑的条目，其宗教制度另涉 A/D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fou-vessel","title":"缶（Fou (Fou Jar)）","name_en":"Fou Jar","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","陶器","盛酒器","乐器","栾书缶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"缶是古代陶质器皿，类似瓦罐，形状像小缸或钵，用于盛水或酒，圆腹有盖、肩上有环耳，也有方形，盛行于春秋战国。2016 册兼论缶作为乐器的用法，并记栾书缶、蔡侯缶等有铭实例。","path":"terms/fou-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下陶质盛酒器与乐器器名的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fu-vessel","title":"簠（Fu (Ritual Food Vessel)）","name_en":"Fu (Ritual Food Vessel)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","食器","稻粱","仿竹器","菱形"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"簠是西周后期新增食器，仿竹器，浅腹，侧视呈斜边菱形状，用以盛稻粱。《周礼》称“簠，稻粱器也”，与盛黍稷的簋在器形上相区别。2016 记其形体长方形，盖打开后为相同两器，器身与器盖各有四个短足；早期斜壁浅腹，后期变为直壁深腹。","path":"terms/fu-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"簠是 B 维度下西周青铜食器的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fubo-shi-ta","title":"覆钵式塔（Fuboshi Ta (Stupa-Form Pagoda (Lama Pagoda))）","name_en":"Fuboshi Ta (Stupa-Form Pagoda (Lama Pagoda))","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","明清","佛塔","覆钵式塔","喇嘛塔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"覆钵式塔是塔身作覆钵形的佛塔，与印度窣堵坡相似，元代称喇嘛塔。2016 册记：元世祖忽必烈建大圣寿万安寺塔时，请入仕元廷的尼泊尔匠师阿尼哥设计，此塔与窣堵坡相似，在我国叫覆钵式塔；因唐代以后喇嘛寺一般建此塔形，故亦称喇嘛塔。元明清时期多为佛舍利塔、高僧墓塔与风景塔。","path":"terms/fubo-shi-ta.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"覆钵式塔是 B 维度下元代传入的佛塔形制的条目，其印度窣堵坡来源与尼泊尔工匠属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fudao","title":"复道（Fudao (Elevated Corridor)）","name_en":"Fudao (Elevated Corridor)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","宫殿","复道","阁道","飞阁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宫殿楼阁之间架空的走廊。2016 册记复道是空中走廊，又称阁道、飞阁，两旁遮木板以防被人看见；引杜牧《阿房宫赋》“复道行空，不霁何虹”与《史记·秦始皇本纪》始皇三十五年“周驰为阁道，自殿下直抵南山”“为复道，自阿房渡渭，属之咸阳”；并以梁山宫故事说明其保密功能，称复道象征天上阁道六星，体现君权神授。","path":"terms/fudao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下秦汉宫殿建筑的条目，其君权象征另涉 A/D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:futou","title":"幞头（Futou Headwrap）","name_en":"Futou Headwrap","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["头饰","隋唐","宋代","软脚幞头","硬脚幞头"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"headwear_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"幞头是隋唐男服中的头巾类首服，以黑色纱、罗制成，四角成带，两角向前系住发髻、两角在脑后系结，余端自然垂下。三册的叙述分工是：夏燕靖两版给形制结构、软脚与硬脚的做法以及翘脚、展脚等名目；赵农给源流（汉代幅巾）、唐太宗\"起于后周\"的引文、盛唐加衬木藤皮革、唐代帝王专用与宋代软脚改硬脚。两册对源流的表述有一处不一致——夏燕靖说\"由汉代的幞头、幅巾等演变而来\"，赵农说\"从汉代的幅巾演变过来\"。本 KU 并","path":"terms/futou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"幞头是 B 维度下隋唐至宋代首服的形制条目；巾帛裁剪、软硬脚构造属 B，服色等级与帝王专用制度牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gaiji","title":"改机（Gaiji）","name_en":"Gaiji","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","弘治","丝织","福建","织机"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"改机是明代弘治年间福建织工林洪把缎机由五层改为四层而形成的丝织工艺，所织丝绸两面有花纹、多用中小型花朵。四册来源有直接记载（高丰、赵农两册无\"改机\"字样）。材料密度低：夏燕靖两版与田自秉共用同一段引文，李立新只有一句概述，此外仅《天水冰山录》的品种名录另有一处著录。改机的技术细节（四层与两面花纹之间的因果关系）四册均未解释，本 KU 不代为补足。","path":"terms/gaiji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"改机是 B 维度下明代福建丝织技术的单点条目。材料密度低，四册中三册共用同一段引文。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ganlan-shi-jianzhu","title":"干栏式建筑（Ganlan Building / Stilt House）","name_en":"Ganlan Building","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","长江流域","河姆渡","巢居","榫卯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"干栏式建筑是中国南方新石器时代的一种木构建筑类型：以桩木为基础，构成高于地面的基座，用桩柱绑扎方式立柱、架梁、盖顶，形成下层架空、上层居住的半楼式房屋。四册都把它说成“巢居的继承和发展”，并以浙江余姚河姆渡遗址为典型。差异在范围与强度：高丰说“在木(竹)柱底架上建筑的高出地面(或水上)的房子”，并把河姆渡定为“目前发现年代最早的、最具典型性的干栏式建筑”；夏燕靖两版的知识链接说“河姆渡遗址发现的干","path":"terms/ganlan-shi-jianzhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"干栏式建筑是 B 维度下史前木构建筑类型的术语锚点。本条只记类型定义、地域分布、构造特征与各册分歧；河姆渡遗址的具体尺寸、稻作、陶器与漆器留在 `places/hemudu-site.md`，河姆渡文化的命名、年代与工艺留在 `terms/hemudu-culture.md`。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gao-shuyao-deng","title":"高束腰凳（Gao Shuyao Deng (High-Waisted Stool)）","name_en":"Gao Shuyao Deng (High-Waisted Stool)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","家具","高束腰凳","腰鼓形","西厢记插图"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"高束腰凳是元代新出现的家具之一，形呈腰鼓，凳部中间雕饰有纹样，形成可观的花饰。2016 册把它与罗涡椅、霸王椅并列为元代家具的新设计制作方法，并记《西厢记》明弘治十一年北京书肆重刻本插图中有描绘。","path":"terms/gao-shuyao-deng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"高束腰凳是 B 维度下元代家具新制的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gaoxing-jiaju","title":"高型家具（Gaoxing Jiaju (High-Form Furniture)）","name_en":"Gaoxing Jiaju (High-Form Furniture)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","家具","高型家具","梁柱式框架","束腰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋代普及的高型家具。2016 册记宋代家具较唐代在品种上增添了许多，有床、桌、椅、凳、高几、长案、柜、衣架、巾架、屏风、曲足盆架、镜台等，日常生活所需的家具此时已基本完备；从风格特点说，宋代家具属高型家具，并且这类家具在民间得到普及使用。来源的核心判断是：家具设计受建筑结构影响较大，主要是梁柱式的框架结构在家具中的运用，出现模仿建筑木构架的式样和做法，使家具造型以梁柱式的框架结构代替了以前的箱形壶","path":"terms/gaoxing-jiaju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代家具形态与结构的条目，其室内布置格局牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gaozu-bei","title":"高足杯（Gaozu Bei (Stem Cup)）","name_en":"Gaozu Bei (Stem Cup)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","瓷器","高足杯","竹节式高足","元代瓷器"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"高足杯是元代瓷器中最为流行的器物，为杯的代表形态。2016 册记其形制：口微撇，近底处较为丰厚，承以上小下大的竹节式高足。来源只给这一句形制描述，未分窑口、尺寸与用途。","path":"terms/gaozu-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"高足杯是 B 维度下元代瓷杯代表器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ge-yao","title":"哥窑（Ge Kiln）","name_en":"Ge Kiln","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","五大名窑","开片","金丝铁线","紫口铁足"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_kiln","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"哥窑是宋代五大名窑之一，以釉面开片为主要特征，有鱼子纹、蟹爪纹、百圾碎及“金丝铁线”等名称；釉色有粉青、米色，胎呈黑褐色，器皿边缘显褐色边称“紫口铁足”。窑址至今未发现，宋墓未见典型器皿。夏燕靖《中国设计史》另录章生一、章生二兄弟在两浙路处州、龙泉县各建一窑的传说（兄窑称哥窑，弟窑称弟窑、也称章窑、龙泉窑），并记有专家认为传世宫藏哥窑瓷实为南宋时修内司官窑烧制；釉为失透乳浊釉，釉色以灰青为主。赵农","path":"terms/ge-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"哥窑是 B 维度下宋代名窑的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:geometric-stamped-hard-pottery","title":"几何印纹硬陶（Geometric Stamped Hard Pottery）","name_en":"Geometric Stamped Hard Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","西周","春秋战国","长江以南","陶器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"几何印纹硬陶是长江以南流行的高温印纹陶，胎骨坚致，呈紫或紫黑色，器表拍印几何纹。它是 `terms/geometric-stamped-pottery.md`（几何印纹陶）的下位类别，田自秉把上位类别分为印纹软陶与印纹硬陶\"两种\"。四册都把它当作独立品种，但**时代、成型法与纹样成因三处互相打架**：夏燕靖两版系于春秋，田自秉说战国窑址且\"长期流行\"，高丰说商代、西周已盛；成型法两作\"泥条盘筑\"、","path":"terms/geometric-stamped-hard-pottery.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"几何印纹硬陶是 B 维度下高温陶器类型条目：胎料成分、烧成温度与成型工艺是主问题，拍印几何纹的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:geometric-stamped-pottery","title":"几何印纹陶（Geometric Stamped Pottery）","name_en":"Geometric Stamped Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代晚期","商周","春秋战国","长江以南","陶器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"几何印纹陶是长江以南新石器时代晚期兴起、以印模在陶坯上压印几何纹为特征的陶器类别，按烧成火度分为几何印纹软陶与几何印纹硬陶两档。三册都把它作为独立品种叙述，但在分部省份、胎色与年代下限上写法不一致。本 KU 只承担上位类别；硬陶另有 `terms/geometric-stamped-hard-pottery.md` 专条，田自秉明言二者是\"印纹软陶和印纹硬陶两种\"，属上下位关系而非同物异名。","path":"terms/geometric-stamped-pottery.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"几何印纹陶是 B 维度下陶器类型条目的上位类别：胎料、火度与成型属工艺，几何纹的排布属装饰效果。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:glass","title":"玻璃（Glass）","name_en":"Glass","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["硅酸盐","吹制","模压","近代工业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玻璃通常以石英砂、纯碱、长石、石灰石等为重要原料，并加入澄清剂、着色剂、乳浊剂，经混合、熔化、澄清、匀化、退火处理而成。玻璃多为硅酸盐玻璃，多以吹塑和模压技术为主，广泛用于建筑、包装、生活用品、照明；中国玻璃制造业从上海开始，1949 年后北京、上海、大连、山东、四川北碚等地建造玻璃厂。","path":"terms/glass.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"玻璃是 B 维度下硅酸盐材料与成型工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gong-vessel","title":"觥（Gong (Gong Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Gong Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","饮酒器","兽头盖","牛角"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"觥是青铜盛酒、饮酒器皿，最早的觥以牛角制成，商代和西周盛行铜铸。2016 册记其形制为椭圆形腹或方形腹、有盖、盖作有角兽头形，有些觥内附酌酒用的勺，西周晚期绝迹。","path":"terms/gong-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gongyi-meishu","title":"工艺美术（Arts and Crafts）","name_en":"Arts and Crafts","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清末民初","学科","实用经济美观","1998","艺术设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_discipline","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"工艺美术是清末民初艺术革命中形成的学科概念：在建筑、绘画、雕塑之外成为一种体系，利用古籍中“工艺”一词加上“美术”，形成复合概念。1920 年蔡元培《美术的起源》中已有“建筑、造像（雕刻）、图画、工艺美术”的并称；1949 年以后工艺美术成为手工业管理局、轻工业部所属范围，工艺美术教育以“实用、经济、美观”为目标；1998 年教育部高等教育专业目录中“艺术设计”替代了“工艺美术”。","path":"terms/gongyi-meishu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"工艺美术是 D 维度下设计学科名称与教育体制的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gu-vessel","title":"觚（Gu (Gu Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Gu Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","饮酒器","五爵","喇叭口","圈足小铃"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"觚是青铜饮酒器，常与爵在考古发掘时同出。2016 册记其形制为长身、束腰、侈口、口足部均成喇叭口状，造型最早仿自陶器，商早期始有铜铸并加圈足，有的圈足下还系小铃。","path":"terms/gu-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜饮酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guan-yao","title":"官窑（Guan Kiln (Official Kiln)）","name_en":"Guan Kiln (Official Kiln)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","青瓷","汴梁","冰裂纹","皇室"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_kiln","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"官窑是宋代官方开办、利用垄断优势采用优质瓷土、釉色和良好烧制技术、供奉皇室生活需要的窑场。2016 记宋徽宗政和年间在汴梁建造的窑场，窑址至今未发现；主要烧青瓷，器形有瓶、尊、洗、盘、碗及仿周汉青铜器，釉色以月色、粉青、大绿流行。","path":"terms/guan-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"官窑是 B 维度下宋代官办瓷窑的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guanwu-bide","title":"观物比德（Guanwu Bide (Observing Things to Compare Virtues)）","name_en":"Guanwu Bide (Observing Things to Compare Virtues)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","美学","观物比德","岁寒三友","松竹梅"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosophical_proposition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"观物比德是 2016 册所称的古典美学命题。来源在元代瓷器装饰纹样段说，主纹中的松竹梅又称「岁寒三友」，是古典美学「观物比德」的体现。来源只作这一句判断，未解释命题来源、比德方式与纹样选择之间的具体关系。","path":"terms/guanwu-bide.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"观物比德是 A 维度下古典美学命题的条目，其在元瓷松竹梅纹样上的体现属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guanying-shougongye","title":"官营手工业（State-Run Handicraft Industry）","name_en":"State-Run Handicraft Industry","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["工商食官","官府工匠","皇室","商周至明清"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_system","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"官营手工业是由官府设立、使用官府工匠、产品主要供皇室官僚的生产体系。商周“工商食官”为开端，集中优秀工匠、不惜工本，覆盖建筑、车驾、礼器、织造、陶瓷等门类。春秋战国各国官方经营的手工业以陶器上刻“相邦”“守相”“左陶户”等字铭为标志，与之并存的是私营个体手工业。","path":"terms/guanying-shougongye.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"官营手工业是 D 维度下官府生产体制的总纲条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gugu-guan","title":"顾姑冠（Gugu Hat）","name_en":"Gugu Hat","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","蒙古","妇女首服","黑鞑事略","孛黑塔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"headwear","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"顾姑冠又写作“姑姑冠”“罟罟冠”，为元代蒙古族妇女首服。《黑鞑事略》记其“画木为骨，包以红绢金帛”，顶用四五尺长柳条或银枝包青毡，地位高者用翠花或五彩帛饰之，下人用野鸡毛。有爵命的蒙古族妇女和已婚女子戴此冠，《蒙古秘史》中蒙古语称“孛黑塔”。","path":"terms/gugu-guan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"顾姑冠是 B 维度下元代蒙古族首服的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gui-vessel","title":"簋（Gui (Gui Grain Vessel)）","name_en":"Gui Grain Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛食器","圈足","双耳","九鼎八簋"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"簋是青铜盛食器，始见于殷商、沿用至春秋，基本形体为圆腹、侈口圈足，早期无耳。2016 册记西周后常带盖、有双耳或四耳、出现方座，春秋有三足式或无足式，并常以偶数与鼎配置陈设。","path":"terms/gui-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜盛食器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guiwu","title":"贵无（Guiwu (Valuing Non-Being)）","name_en":"Guiwu (Valuing Non-Being)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋","玄学","何晏","王弼","贵无"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosophical_proposition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"魏晋玄学以“无”为天地万物之本的思想命题。2016 册在“设计思想的多样性”一节把它作为魏晋南北朝服饰与器物观念变化的思潮背景：何晏、王弼重新打起老庄的旗帜，倡导“贵无”，将“无”抬到至高无上的地位，并认为“天地万物皆以‘无’为本”。来源随即把这一思潮落到生活方式与服饰装扮上，以“竹林七贤”为例，说当时“崇尚自然、清淡放达、超然物外”成为流行的人生观念，服饰上出现随心所欲、袒胸露脐的取向。","path":"terms/guiwu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下魏晋设计思想背景命题的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gusuo","title":"骨梭（Gusuo (Bone Shuttle)）","name_en":"Bone Shuttle","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器晚期","龙山文化","织布工具","骨器","纺织"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"骨梭是新石器晚期龙山文化中出现的织布工具。2016 册以骨梭的出现说明人类已结束「手经指挂」的原始状态，进入纺织工艺的新阶段。","path":"terms/gusuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下新石器晚期织布工具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hanjing","title":"汉镜（Han Mirror）","name_en":"Han Mirror","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","铜镜","规矩镜","铭文","透光镜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汉镜是汉代铜镜的断代称谓。三册对它的处理方式不同：夏燕靖两版把它作为\"铜器的分类型设计\"下的第一个类型，给\"体薄、平边、圆钮\"的总特点与西汉、西汉末至王莽、东汉三期演变；赵农把它列为\"制器与文化的充分结合\"的典范，给镜体加厚、半球钮、柿蒂纹钮座、铭文镜、规矩四神镜、制镜人商标与透光镜。两册在最基本的一点上相反——夏燕靖说汉镜\"体薄\"，赵农说汉镜\"比战国铜镜加大增厚\"。本 KU 两说并列，不替作者弥","path":"terms/hanjing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉镜是 B 维度下汉代铜镜的断代器物条目；铭文的吉祥语与楚辞风格、四神方位观念牵涉 C 维度。铸造、纹样与分期属 B。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:he-cai","title":"褐彩（Brown Splash Decoration）","name_en":"Brown Splash Decoration","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西晋","东晋","氧化铁","点彩","龙泉窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"褐彩是西晋晚期已在瓷器上出现、东晋时期最为流行的釉上彩装饰，以含多量氧化铁的釉料在瓷上点成几何纹或花瓣纹，具有锦上添花之妙；为浙江地区六朝瓷窑所创，后为宋代龙泉窑继承。田自秉称其为瓷上彩釉装饰的先声。","path":"terms/he-cai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"褐彩是 B 维度下西晋至东晋瓷器装饰的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:he-vessel","title":"盉（He (He Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"He Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","调酒","扁圆体","茶壶雏形"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"盉是青铜盛酒器，开始也仿自陶器。2016 册记其形制一般为深腹、圆口、有盖，早商始有铜铸，西周晚期至春秋体成扁圆形，自商早期至春秋未曾中绝，春秋盉形已略可看出后世茶壶的雏形。","path":"terms/he-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:he-wool","title":"褐（He (Coarse Woolen Cloth)）","name_en":"He (Coarse Woolen Cloth)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","诗经","毛织品","平民","染色"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"褐是《诗经》中所见平民穿的粗制毛织物。原文以“无衣无褐，何以卒岁？”说明当时毛织品不只是少量生产；又以“毳衣如，毳衣如瑞”说明能将毛织品染成绿或红色之类鲜艳色彩。","path":"terms/he-wool.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"褐是 B 维度下先秦毛织品类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hemudu-culture","title":"河姆渡文化（Hemudu Culture）","name_en":"Hemudu Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","长江下游","干栏式建筑","稻作","骨器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"河姆渡文化是长江下游地区的新石器时代考古学文化，因发现于浙江余姚河姆渡而得名。五册来源有直接记载（李立新一册无\"河姆渡文化\"字样，仅以遗址与木器材料出现）。本 KU 只登记文化层面的命名、年代、分布与工艺特征；同一遗址的建筑尺寸、骨耜数量、朱漆木碗等实物细节已登记在 `places/hemudu-site.md`，此处不重复。","path":"terms/hemudu-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"河姆渡文化是 B 维度下长江下游新石器时代的类型学条目，与 `places/hemudu-site.md`（遗址本体）分工：本 KU 记文化命名、年代、分布与工艺特征，遗址 KU 记建筑、器物与遗物细节。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hexi-caihua","title":"和玺彩画（Hexi Caihua (Hexi Architectural Painting)）","name_en":"Hexi Caihua (Hexi Architectural Painting)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","建筑","彩画","和玺彩画","龙凤枋心"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architectural_painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"和玺彩画是清代建筑彩画北派三类之一，沿明代程式略有变化，属以梁枋为主的彩画。枋心主花多龙凤、夔凤番莲、吉祥草等图案，分「龙凤枋心」「夔凤番莲枋心」「金线海曼龙枋心」三类；用色以「碾玉装」为主，青绿色上加入大量金、黄、朱、白等色，色彩较明快且多变化。","path":"terms/hexi-caihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"和玺彩画是 B 维度下清代官式建筑彩画的条目，其纹样与用色属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hong-haiyang","title":"红海洋（Hong Haiyang (Red Ocean)）","name_en":"Hong Haiyang (Red Ocean)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["文革","政治宣传画","红海洋","红、光、亮","书籍设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_style","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"红海洋是 2016 册所记“文革”时期政治宣传画的视觉特点。来源称这一时期政治宣传设计是一大特点，政治招贴作为宣传武器得到空前发展，其设计与创作形式大多源于苏联及东欧社会主义国家的政治宣传画，同时吸收年画造型方式以形成民族特色；另一特点便是“红海洋”，整幅画面均以“红、光、亮”突出宣传主题，红色成为唯一象征革命的颜色。来源并称“红、光、亮”审美原则主宰了当时的书籍设计，书籍装帧呈现空洞、单调、贫乏","path":"terms/hong-haiyang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"红海洋是 C 维度下文革时期政治宣传与书籍设计的视觉原则条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hongmu","title":"红木（Hongmu (Rosewood)）","name_en":"Hongmu (Rosewood)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["硬木","酸枝","明清家具","树种统称"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"红木是明清以来对稀有硬木的统称，从一开始就不是某一特定树种的家具；红木性脆、味酸，南方又称“酸枝”，纹理有清晰如行云流水者，也有细腻近紫檀者。赵农另记“红木”是 20 世纪末期中国社会重新出现的传统家具时尚，普通民众也重新崇尚实木家具。","path":"terms/hongmu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"红木是 B 维度下家具用材与材料名的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hongshan-culture","title":"红山文化（Hongshan Culture）","name_en":"Hongshan Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","北方地区","玉器","玉龙","女神庙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"红山文化是分布于内蒙古东南、辽宁西部与河北北部一带的新石器时代考古学文化，因内蒙古赤峰红山而得名。六册中有五册提及，**夏燕靖 2009 一册完全未出现**；田自秉给出发现时间、分布与玉龙尺寸，赵农、李立新、夏燕靖 2016 与高丰只截取玉器、祭祀遗迹或龙纹起源的某一侧面。本 KU 登记文化命名、分布、玉器特征与区域设计定位，不重复单件玉器的形制描述。","path":"terms/hongshan-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"红山文化是 B 维度下北方燕山南北长城地带的新石器时代考古学文化条目；玉龙与祭祀遗迹同时牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hu-vessel","title":"壶（Hu (Hu Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Hu Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","瓜瓢","贯耳","莲鹤方壶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"壶是青铜盛酒器，始见于殷商，形制仿自陶壶，而陶壶又仿自天然瓜瓢。2016 册记其基本形制为盖、耳、圈足和圆腹，早期贯耳、西周中期后半环耳，春秋晚期更盛行华丽，并以莲鹤方壶为代表作。同册汉代段又记铜壶商代即有，春秋战国制作极盛；汉代大体继承传统形式而名称不同，圆壶称钟、方壶称钫，除盛酒或水外兼作量器，并已形成鼓腹、小颈口向外移、圈足、腹侧多铺首衔环的设计定式。","path":"terms/hu-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜壶器形与汉代钟、钫定式的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huadian","title":"花钿（Huadian (Forehead Ornament)）","name_en":"Huadian (Forehead Ornament)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","面妆","金箔","梅花妆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cosmetic_accessory","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花钿是唐代女子贴于额上或两眉之间的面部妆饰，式样繁多，质料有金箔、彩纸、翠鸟羽毛、鱼鳃骨及颜料等着彩。其源出南北朝寿阳公主梅花落额的传说；唐代除用颜色染绘外，还有用金属制造。","path":"terms/huadian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花钿是 B 维度下唐代面妆饰物的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huangzi","title":"幌子（Huangzi / Shop Banner）","name_en":"Huangzi","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商业美术","广告","招幌","酒旗","望子"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"advertising_form","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"幌子是中国古代店铺悬挂的招徕标识，最典型的形态是布幔酒旗，后泛指酒店、茶舍、布店、药铺等行业的悬挂广告。四册的外延并不一致：高丰把“招幌”分为“招牌”与“幌子”两类，招牌宋代流行，幌子可追溯到春秋战国酒旗；夏燕靖两版把幌子说成“我国土生土长的‘广告’形式”，宋代称“望子”；赵农把幌子定义为“商家店铺中的悬挂广告，如酒帘”，却又把墙面上的“茶”“當”“药”“布”单字也纳入；夏燕靖 2016 在近代上","path":"terms/huangzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"幌子是 C 维度下店铺标识与商业广告的术语锚点；其商业功能、行业分工与市镇制度属 D；布幔、木幌、模型幌的制作属 B。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huapendi-xie","title":"花盆底鞋（Huapendi Xie (Flowerpot-Sole Shoes)）","name_en":"Huapendi Xie (Flowerpot-Sole Shoes)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","服饰","旗女","花盆底","马蹄底"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"footwear_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花盆底鞋是清代旗女所穿高木底鞋。2016 册记旗女天足，鞋装高木底，前圆后方为「马蹄底」，侧面为内弧线，又称「花盆底」；绸缎面绣花纹，镶有珠宝。同段并记汉族妇女缠足也影响旗女，「弓鞋」尖头也装木底，行走辄作响。","path":"terms/huapendi-xie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花盆底鞋是 B 维度下清代旗女鞋式的条目，其与汉族缠足弓鞋的关系属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huayou","title":"花釉（Huayou (Splashed Glaze)）","name_en":"Huayou (Splashed Glaze)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","黑釉","斑纹","腰鼓","鲁山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花釉是唐瓷新品种，在黑釉、黄釉、天蓝釉基础上再施蓝白或灰白釉，形成大小斑纹，或规则排列或任意飘洒如波浪、树叶、云彩。烧造地点有河南郏县、鲁山、内乡、禹县等，代表作是河南出土的“花釉腰鼓”。","path":"terms/huayou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花釉是 B 维度下唐代瓷釉类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huazhuangtu","title":"化妆土（Slip (Ceramic Coating)）","name_en":"Slip (Ceramic Coating)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","六朝","婺窑","胎色"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"化妆土是施于陶器或瓷器表面、用以改善呈色或装饰的涂层。田自秉记母系氏族社会制陶已在陶器表面施化妆土，并进行彩画、刻镂、堆贴等装饰；夏燕靖记婺窑因制品含铁量较高、胎色泛红，为取得较好色彩效果而在烧制中运用化妆土。","path":"terms/huazhuangtu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"化妆土是 B 维度下陶瓷胎釉工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huchuang","title":"胡床（Folding Stool）","name_en":"Folding Stool","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东汉","魏晋南北朝","唐代","家具","坐具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"胡床是东汉以后传入的可折叠坐具，即后世的马扎。六册均有直接记载，但它在各册中的重要性不在器物本身，而在坐姿与坐礼的改变：席地跽坐转为垂足而坐，进而导向高型家具与椅子。来源在四处不一致：传入方向、改称\"绳床\"的时点、绳床与胡床是否同物、胡床的社会评价。赵农一册内部对绳床的解释亦不自一致。本 KU 全部并列，不裁定。","path":"terms/huchuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"胡床是 B 维度下的坐具形制条目，其坐礼与礼制变动属 D 维度，其自域外传入并本土化属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hudie-zhuang","title":"蝴蝶装（Butterfly Binding）","name_en":"Butterfly Binding","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","册页装","雕版印刷","包背装"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_binding","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蝴蝶装是宋代出现的中国古代册页装订最早形式，也是雕版印刷发展的结果：每页从中缝对折，按页码将折口逐页粘在包背纸上，再装上硬封面而成一册；版心向内、版外空白可裁，阅读翻检与保存较便。叶德辉《书林清话》形容“揭之若蝴蝶翼”；其缺陷是书页均为单页、翻阅不便，南宋因此创包背装，元代广泛应用。","path":"terms/hudie-zhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蝴蝶装是 C 维度下古代书籍装帧形式的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hufu","title":"胡服（Hu Dress (Nomadic Costume)）","name_en":"Hu Dress (Nomadic Costume)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["赵武灵王","胡服骑射","短衣长裤","带钩","跨文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"胡服本是北方草原游牧民族部落的服装，特征是短衣、长裤、靴子；古代中原民族用以总称西域和北方各族胡人所穿服饰，即塞外民族西戎和东胡的服饰。衣身紧窄、活动便利，便于生活与骑射；胡服进入中原始于赵武灵王胡服骑射。","path":"terms/hufu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"胡服是 E 维度下跨文化服饰传播的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:humen-an","title":"壶门案（Humen An (Humen-Leg Table)）","name_en":"Humen An (Humen-Leg Table)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","家具","案","壶门","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"带壶门装饰的唐代案类家具。2016 册唐代家具正文列几、案、挟轼、箱、柜、胡床、屏风以及晚期出现的桌椅，未单列壶门案；壶门案只出现在图 6-36 的图注“唐代 壶门案、腰圆凳”中。因此本条只能确认：来源把壶门案作为唐代家具的图例之一，与腰圆凳同图；不能确认其形制、尺寸、壶门轮廓与使用场景。图版未视觉核验，本条不据图像下判断。","path":"terms/humen-an.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代家具器形的条目，证据仅及图注。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hundred-schools","title":"百家争鸣（Baijia Zhengming (Hundred Schools of Thought)）","name_en":"Hundred Schools of Thought","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","思想多元","诸子","工艺文献","设计思想"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"intellectual_movement","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"百家争鸣是春秋战国时期文化开放背景下思想活跃的局面，各家纷纷提出主张，代表人物有孔子、孟子、老子、庄子、墨子、荀子等。2016 册认为这一思想多元局面促成了许多工艺文献的产生，集中体现当时设计思想多元和探索的科学精神。同册另记“诸子百家”之名本于《汉书·艺文志》，列儒家、墨家、道家、法家、阴阳家、名家、农家、纵横家、杂家、小说家，还有兵家等；并记士阶层兴起、打破“学在官府”局面的社会条件，“用与美","path":"terms/hundred-schools.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下春秋战国思想潮流的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huohua","title":"火花（Matchbox Label）","name_en":"Matchbox Label","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["火柴商标","收藏","文革","商品设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"advertising_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"火花即火柴商标的设计。火柴 19 世纪中期由英国传入中国，随后许多地方开设火柴生产厂商；火花为收藏家带来艺术欣赏天地，但随着打火机流行，火柴在 20 世纪末慢慢退出生活范围。文革时期火花是重要收藏对象，设计内容含毛主席语录、革命圣地、工农兵形象、向日葵、三面红旗、长江大桥等“革命性”图案。","path":"terms/huohua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"火花是 C 维度下近现代商业标识与收藏印刷品的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:industrial-design","title":"工业设计（Industrial Design）","name_en":"Industrial Design","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["现代设计","产品设计","学科","工业化","设计教育"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_discipline","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"工业设计是 20 世纪 80 年代初引入中国并逐步制度化的现代设计门类。夏燕靖两版把它定义为“在有序与无序之间，在科技与艺术之间进行的交叉设计活动”，核心是批量生产的工业产品设计，并给出五阶段流程、相关学科与 CAD 手段；李立新则从学科命名出发，指出“工业设计”一词外延含糊，容易把工业布局、工厂管理乃至传统造物排除在外，主张用“艺术设计”或“设计艺术”来限定艺术性造物。三册不是在给同一个定义：前","path":"terms/industrial-design.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"工业设计是 D 维度下现代设计学科与设计教育的术语锚点；批量生产、产品结构与材料工艺属 B；工业化、现代性与中西设计概念移植属 E。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:iron-farm-tools","title":"铁制农具（Tiezhi Nongju (Iron Farm Tools)）","name_en":"Iron Farm Tools","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","铁农具","耒耜","铁犁","冶铁遗址"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铁制农具是春秋战国时期随冶铁业兴起而推广的农业生产工具。2016 册记其种类有耒、耜、铫、镰、耨、铚、铲、鐮、锄、耙、缶等，并称铸铁农具的推广为农业和手工业提供了廉价高效的生产工具。","path":"terms/iron-farm-tools.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下春秋战国铁农具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:iron-three-brothers","title":"铁氏三兄弟（Tieshi Sanxiongdi (The Three Iron Brothers)）","name_en":"The Three Iron Brothers","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["生铁","熟铁","钢","含碳量","块炼铁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铁氏三兄弟是 2016 册对生铁、熟铁和钢三种铁碳合金的通俗称谓。来源以含碳量区分三者，并据三门峡西周晚期铜柄铁剑、六合程桥东周墓铁丸、洛阳铁锛铁铲、长沙战国铁铲等实物，说明块炼法与生铁冶铸同时发展是中国古代钢铁冶金技术的独特途径。","path":"terms/iron-three-brothers.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下铁碳合金分类概念的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ji-furniture","title":"几（Ji Table）","name_en":"Ji Table","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["家具","坐具","凭几","榫卯","春秋战国"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"几是中国先秦至后世低型家具的一种，由几面、腿、足座三部分以榫卯结合，表面少装饰、多呈黑色。三册对它的定性不完全相同：夏燕靖两版以\"凭几\"为核心，描述春秋时期横跗单足与栅形直足两式及江陵九店出土实例；赵农把它与席、床、屏风、案、箱并列，强调它是\"放置东西或者可以倚伏在上面\"的家具，战国墓出土较多、多带漆绘；夏燕靖 2016 另设\"案与几\"知识链接，用《说文》《周礼》界定几、案、桌、俎的差别。本 KU","path":"terms/ji-furniture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"几是 B 维度下低型坐卧家具的条目；三册集中在春秋战国楚地漆木家具，形制与榫卯属造物层，凭几的礼制用法牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jia-vessel","title":"斝（Jia (Jia Wine Warmer)）","name_en":"Jia Wine Warmer","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","温酒器","五爵","锥足","祭祀"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"斝是青铜温酒器，形制除无流无尾外与爵基本相同。2016 册记其在殷商时是祭祀时盛酒洒地的礼器，容量比爵大，早期陶制，商早期始有铜铸，为锥足平底，殷商时平底向下凸出，西周后绝迹。","path":"terms/jia-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜温酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jian-basin","title":"鉴（Jian (Jian Basin)）","name_en":"Jian Basin","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","水器","盛水","圆鉴","方鉴"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鉴是青铜盛水器，形体较大，有圆和方两种形式。2016 册把鉴列为水器之首，并在缶器条以曾侯乙铜鉴缶作为战国鉴缶实例。","path":"terms/jian-basin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜水器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jianghu","title":"匠户（Jianghu (Artisan Household)）","name_en":"Jianghu (Artisan Household)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","明代","匠籍","世袭","系官人匠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_system","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"匠户是元代对军匠、系官人匠等工匠的统称，身份世袭，子孙不能脱籍、婚嫁不得自由。元政府将被俘工匠分配给政府和贵族使用，制造兵器者编为“军匠”，有其他技艺者为“系官人匠”或“官匠”；《元典章》载系官诸色正匠免差，实际是一种工奴。明代改称匠籍，工匠须按规定时间轮班赴京服役。","path":"terms/jianghu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"匠户／匠籍是 D 维度下元明工匠户籍与官营手工业制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiangren-yingguo","title":"匠人营国（Jiangren Yingguo / Capital Planning Doctrine）","name_en":"Jiangren Yingguo","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","考工记","都城规划","礼制","营造制度"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"planning_doctrine","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"匠人营国是《考工记》中关于都城营建的核心条文，字面为“匠人营建都城”。三册的用法有两层：夏燕靖 2016 的知识链接把“匠人营国”释为“建造都城的营建师”，即指人；夏燕靖 2009 与 2016 正文、赵农则把它作为一套都城规划制度来引述，即指营建规范。三册都引“方九里，旁三门，国中九经九纬，经涂九轨，左祖右社，面朝后市，市朝一夫”，并以道路宽度、居住尺度、奇数与“九”解释其等级秩序。本 KU 兼","path":"terms/jiangren-yingguo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"匠人营国是 B 维度下都城营造制度与空间秩序的术语锚点；其礼制等级、道路分级与王城—诸侯城尺度关系属 D。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jianzhi","title":"剪纸（Papercut）","name_en":"Papercut","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东晋","窗花","镂金剪彩","民间工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"folk_craft","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"剪纸是先剪彩、后称窗花的民间剪刻艺术，起源于东晋的民间礼佛活动，即在佛陀涅槃日剪出通草花祭献佛陀。南北朝时期剪纸风行，荆楚一带有“镂金剪彩”的习俗；唐代立春用丝织品剪出春幡和首饰，后来改丝织品剪彩为剪纸。","path":"terms/jianzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"剪纸是 B 维度下民间剪刻工艺的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiao-vessel","title":"角（Jiao (Jiao Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Jiao Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","饮酒器","温酒器","五爵","兽角"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"角是青铜饮酒器，又作温酒用，为五爵中的配器。2016 册记其形制为无柱无流、口沿前后有对称的两尾，其余与爵相似；最初的角以兽角制成，殷商始有铜铸但发现很少，西周后期绝迹。","path":"terms/jiao-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜饮酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiaota-tizong-xiezhi-ji","title":"脚踏提综斜织机（Jiaota Tizong Xiezhi Ji (Treadle Pattern-Lifting Slant Loom)）","name_en":"Jiaota Tizong Xiezhi Ji (Treadle Pattern-Lifting Slant Loom)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","秦汉","斜织机","脚踏提综","慈母投杼图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"以脚踏提综、双手引纬打纬的斜式织机。2016 册以江苏泗洪曹庄出土汉代画像石《慈母投杼图》为图像证据，记图中织工用脚踏一长一短两块踏板（杆）分别带动综线；据史籍记载，从战国开始直至秦汉之际，这种织机在黄河流域广大地区已比较普遍地使用。同册秦汉段又记布机已广泛使用脚踏提综斜织机，大大提高织布速度和质量；秦汉之际长江流域和黄河流域已普遍采用，效率比腰机高 10 倍以上。","path":"terms/jiaota-tizong-xiezhi-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下织造设备的条目，其织物产品归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiaoxie","title":"绞缬（Jiaoxie (Tie-Resist Dyeing)）","name_en":"Jiaoxie (Tie-Resist Dyeing)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["防染","扎结","晕色","鹿胎缬","鱼子缬"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绞缬又称“撮缬”“撮晕缬”，民间又称“撮花”，是我国古代纺织品的一种“防染法”染花工艺：按花纹用针线缝扎或直接捆扎，抽紧使织物皱拢，染色时折叠处不易上染，形成晕色效果。魏晋南北朝应用广泛，花纹疏大者有鹿胎缬、玛瑙缬，细密者有鱼子缬等。","path":"terms/jiaoxie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"绞缬是 B 维度下防染印花技术的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiaxie","title":"夹缬（Jiaxie (Clamp-Resist Dyeing)）","name_en":"Jiaxie (Clamp-Resist Dyeing)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["镂空版","防染印花","秦汉","唐代","宋代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夹缬是我国一种古老的镂空型版双面防染印花技术：将织物夹持于两块镂空版之间紧固，于镂空处涂刷或注入色浆，解开型版花纹即现；涂防白浆则染色后搓去白浆得色底白花。源流分层：2016 称历史可上溯东汉，唐代趋于成熟；高丰引《事物纪原》转引《二仪实录》称“秦汉间已有之，陈梁间贵贱通服之”，并记盛唐时流行于宫廷；田自秉记隋开皇六年（586）吐鲁番已有夹缬，盛唐极流行。宋代朝廷指定复色夹缬为宫室专用，洛阳染工李","path":"terms/jiaxie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"夹缬是 B 维度下防染印花技术的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jifang","title":"机房（Jifang (Weaving Workshop)）","name_en":"Jifang (Weaving Workshop)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","江南","苏州","杭州","丝织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"workshop_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"机房是明中后期江南苏州、杭州等地丝织业中出现的手工工场，采取「机房出资、机工出力」的生产方式。2016 册在明中晚经济状况段记：手工业发达、商品经济活跃、白银成为普遍流通货币之后，苏杭丝织业出现带有手工工场性质的机房，来源称其「可谓是资本主义雇佣剥削的生产关系萌芽」。","path":"terms/jifang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"机房是 D 维度下明中后期江南丝织生产组织的条目，其织造技术与产品属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiguang-hu","title":"鸡冠壶（Chicken-Crest Ewer）","name_en":"Chicken-Crest Ewer","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","契丹","瓷器","皮囊壶","马背生活"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鸡冠壶是辽代瓷器中最具契丹族特征的壶式，仿皮囊壶而制，上部有孔式或提梁式。五册来源有直接记载（李立新一册无\"鸡冠壶\"字样）。来源对名称的合理性、器形分类的层级两处不一致：高丰认为\"鸡冠壶\"之名并不贴切、只是 20 世纪 30 年代以来的习惯提法，田自秉则按鸡冠形有孔大鼻直接释名；高丰分两大类型，田自秉分五种式样。本 KU 并列。","path":"terms/jiguang-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鸡冠壶是 B 维度下辽代瓷器的代表性器形，其皮囊原型、马背功能与定居化改造属 E 维度的跨文化互动。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jili-guche","title":"记里鼓车（Odometer Chariot）","name_en":"Odometer Chariot","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","宋代","制车","机械设计","计程装置"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"记里鼓车是汉代以后按里程自动击鼓计程的机械车，又名记道车、大章车。五册的分工比同批的指南车条更散：**夏燕靖两版给定义、齿轮组原理与“里程表、减速器先驱”的判断**，**高丰给凸轮杠杆的实现方式与李约瑟的评断（附书名、版次、页码）**，**赵农给《晋书·舆服志》引文与宋代改进**，**李立新给“与现代计程表完全相同”的判断与汉代石刻的图像依据**。五册在传动方式（齿轮组／凸轮杠杆）与击打方式（鼓或","path":"terms/jili-guche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"记里鼓车是 B 维度下机械制车类型的条目：齿轮组或凸轮杠杆的传动方式、里程—击鼓的计数逻辑与历代沿革都在此汇合。“汉代官府制车业”一侧归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jin-dai-tongjin","title":"金代铜禁（Jindai Tongjin (Jin Bronze Prohibition)）","name_en":"Jindai Tongjin (Jin Bronze Prohibition)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["金代","铜禁","官营作坊","检校","上京巡警院"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"resource_prohibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金代禁止民间铸造铜器、将民间铜器拘括入官的政策。2016 册记金代禁止民间铸造铜器，并把民间铜器拘括入官；旧有铜器除腰束带、鱼袋、神佛像等以外，必须全部卖给官府，由官营作坊铸造大批铜器。来源以黑龙江阿城出土的“童子攀枝镜”边款“上京巡警院”、另一枚“牡丹花纹镜”边款“上京宜春县”为证，判断这些器物都是在官府控制下的铸铜作坊生产并经过官府“检校”的。来源并记尽管官府铜禁甚严，民间仍私铸出许多铜器，尤","path":"terms/jin-dai-tongjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下金代铜料管制政策的条目，其铸铜工艺与器物归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jindai-ranchou-ye","title":"近代染绸业（Jindai Ranchou Ye (Modern Silk-Dyeing Industry)）","name_en":"Jindai Ranchou Ye (Modern Silk-Dyeing Industry)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["近代","上海","染绸业","染绸工场","蒸汽锅炉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_industry","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"近代染绸业是 2016 册所记上海开埠后由手工染绸工场向机器生产过渡的行业形态。来源称上海开埠后绸庄开设日渐增多、染绸业务日益增加：1890 年上海有手工染绸工场 9 家，如从苏州迁来的张玉堂染绸坊雇工 20 多人、分工较细。1920 年后，有的染绸工场开始改用蒸汽锅炉、电动甩水机、整理机，向近代染绸厂过渡，生产效率提高 10 倍，质量也有提高；到 1928 年，上海规模较大的染绸工场都已向近代染","path":"terms/jindai-ranchou-ye.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"近代染绸业是 B 维度下近代纺织印染生产形态的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jingjin","title":"经锦（Warp-Faced Brocade）","name_en":"Warp-Faced Brocade","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","经线显花","三色经","马王堆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"经锦是汉代“经丝彩色显花”的锦，纬线只用一色，经线多至三色：一种作地色、一种织花纹、一种织轮廓线；同一图案、同一色彩形成直行排列。马王堆汉墓出土多种经锦；高丰记同出的绒圈锦具立体效果，被视为近代漳绒或天鹅绒前身。","path":"terms/jingjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"经锦是 B 维度下汉代提花织锦技术的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jingtai-lan","title":"景泰蓝（Cloisonné）","name_en":"Cloisonné","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["铜胎掐丝珐琅","明代","景泰","北京","掐丝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"enamelware_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"景泰蓝是明代著名金属工艺，正式学名为铜胎掐丝珐琅。“景泰蓝”一词辛亥革命前后才采用，“蓝”非专指蓝色而是“发蓝”的简称；除万历外各代几乎都有生产，以景泰年间最精。其工序涉及掐丝、点蓝，品种含盘、瓶、炉、罐等欣赏品和台灯、果盘、文具、烟具、小盒等实用品，以北京为生产中心。","path":"terms/jingtai-lan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"景泰蓝是 B 维度下金属胎掐丝珐琅工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jinxi-gongyi","title":"金细工艺（Jinxi Gongyi (Fine Goldwork)）","name_en":"Jinxi Gongyi (Fine Goldwork)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","金属工艺","金细工艺","掐","累"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalwork_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金细工艺是元代金器工艺中以掐、累、镶嵌技术为尖端的部分。2016 册记元代金属工艺以金、银、铜、铁、锡为主要原料，以铸、锤、錾、刻、编、累、掐、嵌等技术制成日用器物和高级工艺美术品；贵族阶层和酒楼饭庄普遍使用金、银器，而朝廷对金器如同玉器一样控制极严，只准五品以上官员使用金、玉茶酒器。","path":"terms/jinxi-gongyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金细工艺是 B 维度下元代金器细工的条目，其五品以上用金玉茶酒器的限制属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jixiang-tu-an","title":"吉祥图案（Auspicious Motifs）","name_en":"Auspicious Motifs","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["图必有意","意必吉祥","明清","象征","谐音"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"吉祥图案是以“图必有意，意必吉祥”为核心的装饰图案体系。高丰称其起源可追溯到原始社会、真正形成于汉代，经长期发展至清代达到高潮；通过象征、比拟、隐喻、谐音、寓意等手法或直接用文字传达吉祥意念，被视为中国古代富有鲜明民族特色的平面创意设计。","path":"terms/jixiang-tu-an.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"吉祥图案是 C 维度下传统装饰纹样体系的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jizuo","title":"跽坐（Jizuo (Kneeling Seated Posture)）","name_en":"Jizuo (Kneeling Seated Posture)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","战国","汉代","跽坐","跪坐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"posture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国古代两膝着地、臀部坐在小腿肚上的跪坐姿势。2016 册引《说文》《史记·范雎蔡泽列传》释“跽”，并列跽受、跽跪、跽跗、跽拜等词；以 1976 年安阳殷墟妇好墓商代跽坐玉人、1974 年三门峡上村岭战国跽坐人漆绘铜灯、汉代跽坐俑与跽坐古玉乐俑为实物例证，并判断跪坐姿势决定我国早期家具的低矮形制。来源又记“两膝相并”的正坐规范与箕踞的礼法禁忌。","path":"terms/jizuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下起居姿势与家具形制关系的条目，其礼法含义另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jue-vessel","title":"爵（Jue (Jue Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Jue Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","饮酒器","温酒器","五爵","二里头"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"爵是青铜饮酒器，也用作温酒，并作为饮酒器的总称，与斝、觚、觯、角合称五爵。2016 册记其基本形制为圆腹、前流后尾、腹侧有鋬、腹下三锥足，铜爵始见于二里头遗址，是发现最早的青铜容器。","path":"terms/jue-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜饮酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:juzhiji","title":"踞织机（Juzhiji (Backstrap Loom)）","name_en":"Backstrap Loom","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器","织布机","腰机","骨梭","石寨山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"踞织机是我国最早的织布机，又称腰机。2016 册记其以足抵一端、以颈套另一端使经线平直，腾出双手穿梭纬线；因席地而坐、双腿分开的踞姿得名。来源另以云南晋宁石寨山汉代铜贮贝器盖图像说明其操作方式。","path":"terms/juzhiji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下原始织布机设备的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kaipian","title":"开片（Crackle Glaze）","name_en":"Crackle Glaze","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","哥窑","汝窑","金丝铁线","缺陷转化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"开片是瓷器釉面裂纹，因釉与胎的收缩率不同而在冷却过程中形成。最先原是烧制缺陷，因纹理具有特殊效果，以后人为地使它形成自然装饰。哥窑按开片形状大小命名鱼子纹、蟹爪纹、百圾碎，并有“金丝铁线”之称；汝窑釉面也有冰裂纹。","path":"terms/kaipian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"开片是 B 维度下陶瓷釉面装饰与缺陷转化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kesi","title":"缂丝（Kesi）","name_en":"Kesi","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","丝织","通经断纬","定州"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"缂丝是以生丝作经、各色熟丝作纬，采用“通经断纬”织法织造的丝织品。因纬丝在图案边界处断开、形成细密裂痕，迎光看去如雕镂之像，故又称刻丝、克丝。五册来源都以宋代为缂丝的成熟与鼎盛期，并记其多用于摹织名人书画。","path":"terms/kesi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"缂丝是 B 维度下丝织工艺的术语锚点，其以书画为蓝本的生产方式也涉及 C 维度的图像转译问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kouqi","title":"扣器（Kouqi Lacquerware）","name_en":"Kouqi Lacquerware","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["漆器","战国","金属附件","铜箍","胎骨"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"扣器是战国漆器中以金属附件加固器身的一类。高丰的定义最宽：\"在卷木胎的和夹纻胎的漆器上加以金属口及铺首、合页、盖纽、足等金属附件……使用这种金属附件的漆器，称之为扣器\"，并把它定为\"战国漆器的一个特色\"。夏燕靖两版的定义较窄：战国末期出现，\"在器物口沿、底、腹部镶套铜箍（扣）以加固器身\"，耳、钮、足等附件用金属制作后再用漆胶住。两义不是互相否定，而是总类与典型形制的关系；本 KU 并列，不合并为单","path":"terms/kouqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"扣器是 B 维度下战国漆器的加固与装饰类型条目；金属附件的功能与工艺属 B，铺首等附件的图像含义牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kuduan","title":"库缎（Kuduan (Self-Colored Satin)）","name_en":"Kuduan (Self-Colored Satin)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","锦缎","库缎","摹本缎","本色花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"库缎是明代锦缎三大类中的“本色花”，通称库缎，又称摹本缎：在缎地上起本色花，依织纹组织变化分亮花、暗花两种。2016 册把明代丝织品种分为妆花、本色花（库缎）与织金银三类，本条只记本色花一类。","path":"terms/kuduan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"库缎是 B 维度下明代锦缎品种的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lanran-gongyi","title":"蓝染工艺（Lanran Gongyi (Indigo Resist Dyeing)）","name_en":"Lanran Gongyi (Indigo Resist Dyeing)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","印染","蓝染","夹缬","蜡防"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蓝染工艺是 2016 册所记元代民间沿用的印染方法：「以蓝染布为斑，其纹极细」。做法是以两片木板镂成细孔夹布，把熔蜡灌入镂孔，释板取布投入蓝靛中，布受蓝后再煮布去蜡，遂成极细斑花。来源判断此法源自唐代夹缬，只是元代把丝绢换成了棉布。","path":"terms/lanran-gongyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蓝染工艺是 B 维度下元代民间防染印花工序的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lantianren","title":"蓝田人（Lantian Man）","name_en":"Lantian Man","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器时代早期","陕西蓝田","打制石器","中更新世"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hominin","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蓝田人是旧石器时代早期人类，1963—1964 年发现于今陕西蓝田县，属中更新世。遗址发掘和采集石器 50 余件，有刮削器、厚重尖状器、多边或单边砍砸器、球形器等，打制和修理均采用捶击法；石器虽粗糙，但已具一定设计形态和加工方法。","path":"terms/lantianren.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蓝田人是 B 维度下旧石器时代早期人类与石器的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lei-vessel","title":"罍（Lei (Lei Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Lei Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","盛水器","小口广肩","陶罍"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"罍是青铜盛酒器皿，可盛水或贮酒，形制始于陶罍。2016 册记殷商晚期有铜铸但数量极少，造型多小口扩肩、下腹瘦、小平地、肩部有两耳、耳前有鼻，商代有圆形和方形两种，西周多为圆形；原文“小平地”疑为「小平底」，照录不改。","path":"terms/lei-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜盛酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:leisi","title":"耒耜（Leisi (Digging Tool)）","name_en":"Leisi (Digging Tool)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["神农氏","斲木为耜","商周","牛耕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"耒耜是神农氏制作的农具。《周易·系辞传下》称“斲木为耜，揉木为耒，耒耨之利，以教天下”，赵农称耒耜之具的制作是神农氏生产实践经验的总结和发明。2016 记直到商周时期我国大部分农业区域还只是用耒耜而没有犁耕，并引“冉伯牛名耕”推测春秋已有牛耕。","path":"terms/leisi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"耒耜是 B 维度下原始农具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:li-cauldron","title":"鬲（Li Cauldron）","name_en":"Li Cauldron","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["陶器","青铜器","炊煮器","袋足","三足器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鬲（音力）是中国史前至青铜时代的三足炊煮器，特征为三足上部肥大中空、下部收为锥足，即《尔雅》所谓\"款足\"、《汉书·郊祀志上》所谓\"空足\"。六册都把它作为独立器形处理，但**起源说法不一**：夏燕靖两版与田自秉、高丰都说由鼎改进而来，夏燕靖 2016 在同册内又有\"从陶鬲再由鼎演变而来\"的表述，李立新则说原形是斝形器或釜。本 KU 以器形为条目，把陶鬲与青铜鬲的形制演变放在一条线上，起源三说并列。","path":"terms/li-cauldron.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鬲是 B 维度下陶器与青铜器共有的三足袋足炊煮器形条目；从新石器晚期到战国、再到龙泉窑仿古器的形制延续牵涉 B/C 两个维度。"},{"id":"terms:liangzhu-culture","title":"良渚文化（Liangzhu Culture）","name_en":"Liangzhu Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","长江下游","黑陶","玉琮","玉璧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"良渚文化是长江下游太湖周围地区的新石器时代晚期考古学文化，1936 年发现于浙江余杭良渚、瓶窑、安溪三镇之间（夏燕靖两版）。六册都承认它是黑陶与玉器高度发达的文化，但**分类归属相互冲突**：田自秉与夏燕靖两版把它列为龙山文化四类型之一，李立新把\"东南良渚文化设计区\"列为六大原生设计区之一，赵农、高丰则按独立文化处理。本 KU 以\"良渚文化\"为条目名，把两种归属并列登记，不合并为单一定性。","path":"terms/liangzhu-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"良渚文化是 B 维度下长江下游太湖地区的新石器时代晚期考古学文化条目；玉琮、神人兽面纹与古城同时牵涉 B/C 两个维度。分类归属（独立文化／龙山文化四类型之一）存在册级分歧。"},{"id":"terms:liangzhu-shili","title":"良渚石犁（Liangzhu Shili (Liangzhu Stone Plough)）","name_en":"Liangzhu Stone Plough","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["良渚文化","石犁","犁耕","稻作农业","破土器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"良渚石犁是良渚文化的三角形石犁。2016 册称江浙良渚文化区为我国最早实现犁耕的地区，许多遗址发现石犁等耘田器；但石犁是否真正用于犁耕、良渚文化是否有犁耕农业，学界尚有争议。","path":"terms/liangzhu-shili.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下良渚文化农具与犁耕争议的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lianzhu-wen","title":"联珠纹（Linked-Pearl Motif）","name_en":"Linked-Pearl Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["萨珊","唐代","联珠圈","丝绸之路","唐锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"联珠纹是以圆圈为基本单位、外圈饰联珠、内圆填对称动物纹样的装饰构成，是唐代丝织品对称式构成的典型。高丰认为联珠纹与动物纹在中国原始彩陶已见，但二者组合最早见于公元 3 世纪前后波斯萨珊王朝丝织品，南北朝经丝绸之路传入；唐代一部分直接照搬，一部分融合中国吉祥动物与汉代变形手法，形成中国式联珠纹。田自秉则反对其从波斯传入之说，举中国彩陶、北魏石砚、隋锦、敦煌藻井等说明中国联珠纹历史悠久。","path":"terms/lianzhu-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"联珠纹是 C 维度下唐代装饰纹样的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liao-ci","title":"辽瓷（Liao Ci (Liao Ceramics)）","name_en":"Liao Ci (Liao Ceramics)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","辽瓷","白瓷","鸡冠壶","凤首瓶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"辽代烧造的瓷器。2016 册记从已发现的大量辽代器物看，辽瓷与邢窑、定窑关系最为密切；辽白瓷和邢瓷、定瓷一样胎质细、釉色纯、瓷化程度高。来源把器形分两大类：一类模仿中原传统形式的碗、盘、瓶、罐、盂、壶等，具有定瓷风格；另一类是具有契丹族独特风格的三角碟、四方碟、海棠盘、长颈瓶、凤首瓶、鸡冠壶、鸡腿坛等。装饰设计分素胎装饰与釉色装饰两种，素胎装饰使用划花、印花、堆花等技法，与北宋诸窑相仿，纹样有游鱼","path":"terms/liao-ci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下辽代瓷器的条目，其契丹族器形与中原窑口关系牵涉 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liao-sancai","title":"辽三彩釉陶（Liao Sancai Youtao (Liao Sancai Glazed Earthenware)）","name_en":"Liao Sancai Youtao (Liao Sancai Glazed Earthenware)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","辽三彩","低温铅釉","唐三彩","宋三彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"继承唐、宋三彩技术的辽代釉陶。2016 册在辽瓷一节记：辽瓷中还有在继承唐、宋三彩釉陶技术基础上发展起来的辽三彩釉陶。来源未为辽三彩单列段落，其釉色装饰的说明与辽瓷共用：釉色装饰有多种色釉施于一器，如三彩、两彩或单色釉加彩方法，还有用色釉描绘器皿。同册唐三彩条记唐三彩是低温铅釉陶器，因在色釉中加入不同的金属氧化物，经焙烧形成以黄、赭、绿为基本釉色；辽三彩是否同属低温铅釉，来源在辽瓷段未复述，本条不","path":"terms/liao-sancai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下辽代低温铅釉陶的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lieding-system","title":"列鼎制度（Graduated Ding System）","name_en":"Graduated Ding System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","礼制","鼎","簋","等级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_system","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"列鼎制度是西周早期形成的以鼎的数量标示社会等级的用鼎制度：天子九鼎、诸侯七、卿大夫五、元士三。鼎用单数，盛饭食的簋用偶数（天子八、诸侯六、大夫四、士二）；九鼎第一鼎盛牛肉称大牢，五鼎第一鼎盛羊肉称小牢。","path":"terms/lieding-system.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"列鼎制度是 D 维度下西周礼制与器物等级制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lifang-zhi","title":"里坊制（Lifang Ward System）","name_en":"Lifang Ward System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北魏洛阳","隋大兴城","108坊","坊墙","城市规划"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"urban_system","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"里坊制是以方格形里坊组织城市居住区的规划制度。北魏洛阳“方三百步为一里，里开四门，门置里正二人，门士八人，合有二百二十里”（《洛阳伽蓝记·城北》），整齐化一、管理方便；里坊居民有 500 户至 1000 户，贵族王室有自己的庄园，不受里坊限制。市东、市南、市西、市北各分布工商业者聚居的里，城南另有四夷馆和四夷里。隋大兴城以东西、南北大街纵横交错将全城分为 108 个方块，每块称“里”（唐称“坊”）","path":"terms/lifang-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"里坊制是 D 维度下古代城市规划制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ling-silk","title":"绫（Ling (Twill Silk)）","name_en":"Ling (Twill Silk)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["斜纹提花","唐代","贡绫","缭绫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绫是以素地起两至三枚经斜纹提花的丝织品，也可染成红、黄、绿、紫等色。唐绫品种最多、产量高，据《新唐书》有 24 处贡绫，并出现整幅大花纹“可幅盘缔缭绫”。","path":"terms/ling-silk.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"绫是 B 维度下丝织品类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lingyang-gong-pattern","title":"陵阳公样（Lingyang Gong Pattern）","name_en":"Lingyang Gong Pattern","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","织锦","联珠纹","对称构图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_pattern","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陵阳公样是唐太宗时期由益州大行台检校修造窦师伦创制的瑞锦宫绫纹样，因窦师伦封陵阳公而得名。五册来源都以“对雉、对羊、翔凤、游麟”等成对动物纹与对称构图为特征，并把它视为唐代织锦吸收波斯等外来纹样又承续本土传统的代表。","path":"terms/lingyang-gong-pattern.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陵阳公样是 B 维度下唐代织锦纹样体系的术语锚点，其对称动物纹与联珠纹的组合同时是 E 维度跨文化互动的典型案例。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liuqi","title":"六齐（Six Bronze Alloy Formulas）","name_en":"Six Bronze Alloy Formulas","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","青铜","考工记","合金配比"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"alloy_formula","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"\"六齐\"是《考工记》所记的六种青铜合金配比，按器物用途规定铜锡比例。六册来源全部有直接记载，但引述方式差异明显：两册逐条引全六种，另四册只取一句或只作概括。更重要的是，各册对\"六分其金而锡居一\"中\"金\"的所指（合金总量还是纯铜）从未明说，而这一读法直接决定配比能否与实测青铜器成分对应。本 KU 并列原文与解释，不裁定。","path":"terms/liuqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"六齐是 B 维度下先秦青铜合金配比规范，其文献出处属 `publications/kaogongji.md`，本条只登记配比本身及其解释分歧。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:longshan-culture","title":"龙山文化（Longshan Culture）","name_en":"Longshan Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","黑陶","蛋壳陶","城址","考古学文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙山文化是新石器时代晚期以黑陶为标志的考古学文化；田自秉把它定为\"进入父系氏族社会后\"黄河中下游产生的文化，因最早发现于山东历城（今属章丘）龙山镇而得名（六册均未记发现年份）。六册来源一致把它当作彩陶衰落之后的技术转折点：快轮制陶、蛋壳黑陶、早期城址与凿井都集中在这一时期。来源间的差异主要在它的\"位置\"——是仰韶之后的同一序列阶段，还是与仰韶并存的东方区域文化。","path":"terms/longshan-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙山文化是 B 维度下新石器时代晚期黑陶工艺与早期城址的类型学锚点，兼涉快轮制陶这一关键工艺转折。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:longyao","title":"龙窑（Dragon Kiln）","name_en":"Dragon Kiln","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["依山而上","火膛","分段烧成","投柴孔","1300℃"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_kiln","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙窑是依山而上的特殊窑形，从战国秦汉出现以来一直为人们利用，因窑身依山而上、形似火龙而得名。青瓷的出现与窑形改变有很大关系：魏晋南北朝的龙窑已能充分采用火膛与窑室连接的方式，使升焰速度加快、温度提高，获得高温烧瓷的条件，并能一次容纳大量瓷器、增加生产数量；魏晋时期开始改进龙窑形制，以“分段烧成”的方法在窑顶或窑身两侧设置投柴孔，保证烧制温度的平均，防止发生生烧现象。田自秉记汉代早期青瓷使用的窑型烧","path":"terms/longyao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙窑是 B 维度下陶瓷窑炉类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:louchuan","title":"楼船（Tower Ship）","name_en":"Tower Ship","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","战船","多层","水军","女墙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"楼船是春秋战国时期战船的一种，结构一般为三层，也有的达 5 层甚至 10 层，是当时水军的主力船型。杜佑《通典》称其“船上建楼三重，列女墙，战格、树幡帜，开驾窗矛穴，置抛车、垒石、铁斗，状如城垒”。汉代广州船舶以楼船为最大，高三四层，设女墙战格，篙、桨、橹、帆、舵、碇俱全。","path":"terms/louchuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"楼船是 B 维度下先秦两汉战船类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lu-chou","title":"潞绸（Lu Chou (Lu Silk)）","name_en":"Lu Chou (Lu Silk)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","清代","山西","长治","高平"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"潞绸是明代山西长治、高平、潞卫三处所产丝织品。2016 册引清代《潞安府志》记三处共有绸机一万三千余张（来源标明所记为明代数字）；又引明郭子章《郭青螺先生遗书》卷十六称「潞城机杼斗巧，织作纯丽，衣天下」，产品因此称为潞绸。","path":"terms/lu-chou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"潞绸是 B 维度下明代山西潞安一带丝织品的条目，其织机数与产地组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lubu","title":"卤薄（Lubu (Ritual Procession Paraphernalia)）","name_en":"Lubu (Ritual Procession Paraphernalia)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["古代","仪仗","卤薄","卤簿","车舆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_paraphernalia","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"古代仪仗器物的总称。2016 册记卤薄共 35 类，包括辇、辂、舆、车、拂尘、提炉、香盒、盥盆、唾壶、水瓶、马机、交椅、仪刀、橐鞬、豹尾枪、戟、殳、盖、撒、扇、幢、幡、旌、节、氅、麾、纛、钺、星、瓜、仗、灯、象、静鞭、仗马等，并以纹饰区别等级或使用场合，如玉辇、金辇、凤辇之别，黄龙大纛、五色金龙纛、八旗骁骑纛等旗类，旗的纹饰多达 80 种。来源另记西晋大驾卤薄是最早的完整记录，有金银车驾六马、属车","path":"terms/lubu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下仪仗制度的条目，其器物形制另涉 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:luowo-yi","title":"罗涡椅（Luowo Yi (Luowo Chair)）","name_en":"Luowo Yi (Luowo Chair)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","宋代","家具","罗涡椅","弓背椅"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"罗涡椅是元代在宋代家具基础上发展而来的弓背椅，名称采自民间俗语，形容弓背的罗涡形。2016 册称其充分体现人体尺度，「看形制便有一种舒适之感」，并记《西厢记》插图庭院内廊中常见此椅。","path":"terms/luowo-yi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"罗涡椅是 B 维度下元代弓背椅的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lvse-sheji","title":"绿色设计（Green Design）","name_en":"Green Design","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["3R","生态","环保","可持续"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_concept","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绿色设计源于对现代技术文化引起环境及生态破坏的反思，核心是“3R”，即 Reduce（节能）、Recycle（再利用）和 Reuse（循环），要求减少物质能源消耗和有害排放，使产品及零部件便于分类回收再生。夏燕靖认为它不仅是技术考量，更是观念变革，要求把重点放在真正环保意义上的创新。","path":"terms/lvse-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"绿色设计是 D 维度下现代设计观念与方法的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:majiayao-culture","title":"马家窑文化（Majiayao Culture）","name_en":"Majiayao Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","黄河上游","彩陶","甘肃仰韶文化","舞蹈纹盆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"马家窑文化是黄河上游新石器时代晚期的考古学文化，因最早在甘肃临洮县瓦家坪马家窑遗址发现而得名，又称\"甘肃仰韶文化\"。田自秉另记半山型以甘肃宁定县半山地区首次发现得名，马厂型发现于青海乐都县马厂沿的新石器时代晚期墓葬。六册都把它作为中国史前彩陶的最高峰之一，但**分类口径不一致**：夏燕靖两版按考古学文化处理，分为马家窑、半山、马厂三个类型；田自秉按彩陶类型处理，把\"马家窑型\"\"半山型\"\"马厂型\"与","path":"terms/majiayao-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"马家窑文化是 B 维度下黄河上游新石器时代晚期的彩陶文化条目；陶器纹饰与舞蹈纹盆的仪式含义牵涉 C 维度。文化分期与彩陶类型两套分类口径并存。"},{"id":"terms:maoyi-ci","title":"贸易瓷（Maoyi Ci (Trade Porcelain)）","name_en":"Maoyi Ci (Trade Porcelain)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋元","对外贸易","市舶司","泉州","萍洲可谈"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"trade_goods","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋元时期销往海外的瓷器商品。2016 册“知识链接”专条记：瓷器是宋元对外贸易的重要商品之一，在海外市场上享有很高的声誉；宋代瓷器的运销范围包括亚洲、非洲和欧洲，东南亚诸国因地缘与转运地位成为主要地区，福建泉州港的输出极为方便，这一地区的窑址便与我国外销东南亚瓷器关系密切。来源引朱彧《萍洲可谈》两则说明贸易瓷的厚利与装船方式，引《宋史·食货志》记开宝四年（971）置市舶司于广州及诸番贸易货单，并记","path":"terms/maoyi-ci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下宋元瓷器对外贸易的条目，其跨文化流通归 E 维度、器物生产归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:meijin-ejin","title":"美金与恶金（Meijin and Ejin (Good and Bad Metal)）","name_en":"Meijin and Ejin (Good and Bad Metal)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","铜","铁","块炼铁","礼器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_concept","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"春秋战国时人称铜为“美金”，用以制作礼器；称铁为“恶金”，用以制作工具。称铁为恶金的原因是当时人工冶铁所得均为块炼铁，色泽发黑、质地较为低劣；随着冶铁技术迅速提高，这一名称逐渐淘汰。","path":"terms/meijin-ejin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"美金与恶金是 B 维度下先秦材料观念与冶铁技术的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:meiping","title":"梅瓶（Meiping (Plum Vase)）","name_en":"Meiping (Plum Vase)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","盛酒器","小口丰肩","定窑","龙泉窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"梅瓶是宋代瓷瓶形制，小口、短颈、圆肩、长身，尤以小口窈窕为特色，有秀丽媚妩之韵、梅骨清像之姿；深腹稳重、容量颇大，多为盛酒器。高丰记其通高一般约 40 厘米、口径仅 4—5 厘米，挺拔刚劲、峻峭雄健；宋以后梅瓶与玉壶春瓶一直沿用，成为中国古代传统酒瓶造型的典型式样。","path":"terms/meiping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"梅瓶是 B 维度下宋代瓷酒器造型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ming-style-furniture","title":"明式家具（Ming-style Furniture）","name_en":"Ming-style Furniture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","家具","硬木","榫卯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_style","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明式家具指明代中期至清代早期（约 15—17 世纪）形成的硬木家具式样，以线形造型、木构架结构、榫卯连接和不施重漆显露木纹为特征。五册来源都把它视为中国传统家具的高峰，并注意到“明式”是一个以时代命名样式的风格概念，而非严格的朝代断代。","path":"terms/ming-style-furniture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明式家具是 B 维度下木作工艺与器物风格命名的术语锚点，其“以时代命名式样”的命名史也涉及 A 维度的史学概念问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mingdai-sizhi-sida-changu","title":"明代丝织四大产区（Mingdai Sizhi Sida Changu (Four Major Silk-Weaving Regions of the Ming Dynasty)）","name_en":"Mingdai Sizhi Sida Changu (Four Major Silk-Weaving Regions of the Ming Dynasty)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","丝织","江浙","四川","山西"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2016 册把明代丝织分为四大产区：一是江浙地区，为全国丝织生产中心，苏州、杭州、嘉兴之外还有吴江震泽镇、盛泽镇等新兴市镇；二是四川地区，蜀锦历史悠久，保宁有丝绫文锦之饶，阆中家种桑而人饲蚕；三是山西地区，长治、高平、潞卫三处绸机众多，产品称潞绸；四是闽广地区，福建改机、漳州天鹅绒、广东纱均全国闻名。","path":"terms/mingdai-sizhi-sida-changu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明代丝织四大产区是 B 维度下明代丝织生产地理格局的条目，其官营与市场组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mingguang-kai","title":"明光铠（Mingguang Armor）","name_en":"Mingguang Armor","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北周","铠甲","圆护","护心镜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"armor_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明光铠是北周新兴的铠甲形制，胸前背后装左右两块“圆护”，由铜铁制成或打磨光亮似镜，俗称“护心镜”。它与晋“筒袖铠”、南北朝“衲裆铠”并列为三种基本铠甲形制。","path":"terms/mingguang-kai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明光铠是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝铠甲形制的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mingqi","title":"明器（Mingqi (Burial Goods)）","name_en":"Mingqi (Burial Goods)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["随葬","冥器","盟器","模型"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"burial_good","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明器是我国古代专为随葬而制作的器物，又称“冥器”或“盟器”。它通常模仿各种礼器或日用器皿、工具、兵器的形状制成，除器皿外还有人、家畜及鸟兽形象，以及车船、家具、建筑物等模型，从新石器时代开始历代墓中都有发现。","path":"terms/mingqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明器是 B 维度下随葬器物与模型化设计的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mise-porcelain","title":"秘色瓷（Mise Porcelain）","name_en":"Mise Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","五代","越窑","吴越","贡瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秘色瓷是唐五代越窑烧造的高等级青瓷，长期只见于文献，1987 年法门寺地宫出土实物后始得确认。五册来源有直接记载（高丰一册无\"秘色瓷\"字样）。来源在两点上不一致：法门寺地宫所出秘色瓷的件数，以及秘色瓷主要归属唐代还是五代吴越。另外\"秘色\"之名各册均未解释，只记陆龟蒙\"秘色越器\"之称与\"千峰翠色\"之诗。本 KU 并列。","path":"terms/mise-porcelain.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秘色瓷是 B 维度下唐五代越窑贡瓷的品种条目，其官府督造、贡奉与外交用途属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:muban-nianhua","title":"木版年画（Woodblock New Year Picture）","name_en":"Woodblock New Year Picture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["雕版印刷","年画","招贴画","民间美术","清代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"print_genre","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"木版年画是用雕版印刷的民间画，题材多为世俗生活、吉祥人物与节令风俗，因常在岁末新春张贴而得名。四册中只有高丰给出定义与源流：宋代茶肆酒馆张挂名人绘画，南宋出现“纸画儿”行业，民间画家创作后雕版印刷千百张，世俗题材者“人们一般把这些画称之为木版年画”；他还特别指出，其中一些木版年画“并不限于岁末新春时才张贴”，平时也用于商业场合，“已带有招贴画的意味”。夏燕靖两版与赵农只在清代印刷段列产地与外销，不","path":"terms/muban-nianhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"木版年画是 C 维度下民间雕版印刷品与商业招贴的术语锚点；雕版、套色与拱花工艺属 B；产地、作坊与外销属 D。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:nanjing-yunjin","title":"南京云锦（Nanjing Yunjin Brocade）","name_en":"Nanjing Yunjin Brocade","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","官营织造","妆花缎","库锦","库缎"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南京云锦是官营织造生产的提花多彩丝织物，晚清时因花纹绚烂如云彩得名，包括妆花缎、库锦、库缎。其生产用长 5.6 米、高 4 米、宽 1.4 米的大花楼木质提花机，上下两人操作，一天仅织五至六厘米，故称“寸锦寸金”。","path":"terms/nanjing-yunjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"南京云锦是 B 维度下明清官营织造与提花丝织的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:nashishi","title":"纳石失（Nasish）","name_en":"Nasish","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","织金锦","丝织","官匠局","波斯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"纳石失是元代对加金织物（织金锦）的称法，以片金线或圆金线作纹纬织成，供蒙古贵族制衣与佩饰。五册来源有直接记载（李立新一册无\"纳石失\"字样）。来源在语源的确定程度上不一致：赵农直接释为波斯语译音，田自秉称\"可能是波斯语的讹译\"。高丰对元代大量加金的风气给出六册中唯一的负面评价。本 KU 并列。\n\n夏燕靖 2016 另补加金织物兴盛的三项原因：除蒙古民族的习俗喜好之外，更重要的是国力扩张时从被征服区域","path":"terms/nashishi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"纳石失是 B 维度下元代织金锦的代表品种，其波斯语源、西域工匠与官方匠局的管理方式属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:nazi-daiyi","title":"纳资代役（Nazi Daiyi (Commutation of Corvée into Payment)）","name_en":"Nazi Daiyi (Commutation of Corvée into Payment)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","中晚唐","纳资代役","力役","庶族地主"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tax_labor_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代中晚期工匠以缴纳资财代替官府力役的制度。2016 册把纳资代役的发生系于庶族地主所有制的确立：中晚唐商品经济在封建经济领域内明显抬头，工匠无须在官府服役，终于可以“纳资代役”。来源给出三层判断：对工匠而言获得较大程度的自由；对经济而言是更便利的生产形式；对劳动生产率而言意味着提高，同时也是一种剥削量的增加，并认为唐中期实行的纳资代役在一定程度上是促进手工业行会自身改进的动力。","path":"terms/nazi-daiyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下唐代工匠役制与商品经济关系的条目，其工艺生产影响归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:oracle-bone-script","title":"甲骨文（Oracle Bone Script）","name_en":"Oracle Bone Script","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","占卜","龟甲","汉字体系","贞人"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"script_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"甲骨文是商代刻写在龟甲、兽骨上的占卜文字，完整规范，使中国汉字第一次成为系统的文化体系。商朝用龟甲卜筮，占卜过程包括打磨龟腹甲背甲、去牛肩胛骨骨臼、钻孔、以蓍草烧灼，正面出现兆纹，“龟曰卜、蓍曰筮”；甲骨文内容广泛、记载明确，常见“王占曰”。","path":"terms/oracle-bone-script.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"甲骨文是 C 维度下商代文字体系的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:painted-pottery","title":"彩陶（Painted Pottery）","name_en":"Painted Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","仰韶文化","马家窑","陶器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彩陶指新石器时代在打磨光滑的陶坯上用矿物颜料绘纹、再入窑烧成，使纹样固着于器表的陶器。五册来源都把它作为中国史前装饰艺术的主要载体，重点讨论仰韶文化与马家窑文化的纹样。","path":"terms/painted-pottery.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"彩陶是 B 维度下新石器时代陶器装饰工艺的术语锚点，其纹样母题也涉及 C 维度的视觉符号问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:paleolithic-period","title":"旧石器时代（Paleolithic Period）","name_en":"Paleolithic Period","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["石器时代","打制石器","设计起源","原始社会","考古学分期"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"旧石器时代是以打制石器为标志的人类物质文化发展阶段，分早、中、晚三期。在六册设计史中，它不是单纯的年代背景，而是**设计起源叙事的起点**：夏燕靖两版与李立新都把石器视为人类最早的造物产品，高丰称\"旧石器时代生产工具的设计，是人类最早的设计\"，赵农称\"人类的历史就是从设计和制造器具开始的\"，田自秉则把它作为石器时代两阶段中的第一阶段。本 KU 登记定义、分期、中国境内主要遗存、石器技术演进与设计起","path":"terms/paleolithic-period.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"旧石器时代是 B 维度下的史前技术—造物分期条目，同时是六册设计起源叙事的共同起点；石器作为'物质与精神双重特性产品'的判断牵涉 C 维度。"},{"id":"terms:pan-basin","title":"盘（Pan (Pan Basin)）","name_en":"Pan Basin","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盥洗器","沃盥之礼","虢季子白盘","匜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"盘是青铜盥洗器，与匜配合用于沃盥之礼。2016 册记盘为圆形浅腹，商早期数量较少、西周中期逐渐增多，商代无耳圈足、西周中期后加耳并出现长方形盘，虢季子白盘即属此类。","path":"terms/pan-basin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜盥洗器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pei-huang","title":"佩璜（Peihuang (Ornamental Jade Pendant)）","name_en":"Peihuang (Ornamental Jade Pendant)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","佩玉","人纹璜","鸟纹璜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_ornament","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"佩璜是一种玩赏性的佩玉，与礼器上的璜无关。商代佩璜已由素面无纹演变为人纹璜、鸟纹璜、色纹璜、兽纹璜等；其他玉佩有象纹佩、牛纹佩、兔纹佩、龟纹佩、鹿纹佩、鸟纹佩、凤纹佩等，形式变化比较自由。","path":"terms/pei-huang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"佩璜是 B 维度下商代佩玉的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:peiligang-wenhua","title":"裴李岗文化（Peiligang Wenhua (Peiligang Culture)）","name_en":"Peiligang Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器早期","裴李岗","农业起源","农作物遗迹","生产工具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"裴李岗文化是距今 8000—7000 年的新石器时代早期文化。2016 册以农作物遗迹及农业生产工具为其特点，认为它表明生活方式已从狩猎采集过渡到早期农业，并把 20 世纪 70 年代末发掘的磁山、裴李岗文化并列为新石器时代早期代表。","path":"terms/peiligang-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下新石器时代早期农业文化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:piao-ci","title":"缥瓷（Piao Porcelain）","name_en":"Piao Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["晋代","青瓷","瓯窑","淡青釉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"缥瓷是魏晋南北朝时期出现的淡青色玻璃釉青瓷，即青白色瓷器。田自秉引晋潘岳《笙赋》“倾缥瓷以酌酝”，并称瓯窑胎白釉淡青的制品即晋代诗文所称缥瓷。李立新记当时青瓷胎含铁量增加，出现以淡青色玻璃釉青瓷的“缥瓷”，并形成浙江与河北为中心的南北两大青瓷体系。","path":"terms/piao-ci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"缥瓷是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝青瓷类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pibo","title":"披帛（Pibo (Silk Shawl)）","name_en":"Pibo (Silk Shawl)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["隋唐","女装","纱罗","长条"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_accessory","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"披帛是隋唐女子衣着的组成部分，一般用轻薄的纱、罗或绢裁成长条，长度在两米以上，绕缠于两臂之间，行走时随手臂摆动飘舞；讲究者加饰彩画。","path":"terms/pibo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"披帛是 B 维度下隋唐女子服饰配件的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ping-feng","title":"屏风（Folding Screen）","name_en":"Folding Screen","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","春秋战国","魏晋南北朝","家具","隔档"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"屏风是起隔档、挡风作用的家具，并延伸到室内空间的分割。赵农记其在西周出现，称“扆”“黼扆”，张置于主人座位后面；春秋战国时放置在床后，屏风上附有彩绘，并有铜构件镶嵌。魏晋南北朝时屏风有完整的制法，也有多扇组合，形态包括围屏、座屏、板屏、插屏、挂屏、折屏。与屏风接近的步障用于室外临时遮蔽。","path":"terms/ping-feng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"屏风是 B 维度下家具形制的条目：隔档、挡风与室内空间分割的形制演变在此汇合。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ping-ji","title":"凭几（Pingji (Arm Rest)）","name_en":"Pingji (Arm Rest)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","魏晋","席地而坐","三足几"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"凭几又称倚几、隐几，是席地跪坐疲倦时供胳臂和肘部扶倚、以分散压力的家具。汉代马王堆三号汉墓出土龙纹漆几，几面扁平，下部安高矮两对足；魏晋时期凭几为三足形，几面呈扁平圆弧形，安徽马鞍山东吴朱然墓黑红漆几即此类。","path":"terms/ping-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"凭几是 B 维度下汉魏席坐家具的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pinse-yi","title":"品色衣（Pinse Yi (Rank-Coloured Robe)）","name_en":"Pinse Yi (Rank-Coloured Robe)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北周","唐代","品色衣","品服","公服"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"dress_regulation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"封建时代按官品规定颜色的公服。2016 册记品色衣又名“品服”，最早源于北周时期侍卫官的礼服，并引《周书·宣帝纪》原文。来源给出制度沿革：起始于北周，形成于唐朝，宋元明清时沿用，但在局部作了些调整。以唐代为例，官分九品，有着不同品级的服色；着紫穿红者身居高位，穿青色衣者官卑职微；来源以白居易“江州司马青衫湿”说明贬官后的卑微，并记后世以红色为发达标志、以紫色为皇帝之下高官的色彩观念，形成“红得发紫","path":"terms/pinse-yi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下官服等级制度的条目，其服色与形制归 B、C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:plastic","title":"塑料（Plastic）","name_en":"Plastic","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["高分子材料","热塑性","热固性","1958"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"塑料是以天然或合成树脂为基本原料，含填料、增塑剂、着色剂等成分，可在一定条件下塑化成形的材料，分热塑性和热固性两类。具有材质轻巧、绝缘性强、耐腐蚀、颜色美观、易加工等特点；塑型方法有注塑、搪塑、模塑、吹塑、压塑和挤塑。","path":"terms/plastic.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"塑料是 B 维度下现代人工材料与成型工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pointed-bottom-jar","title":"尖底瓶（Pointed-bottom Jar）","name_en":"Pointed-bottom Jar","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","仰韶文化","汲水器","力学设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"尖底瓶是新石器时代仰韶、半坡、北首岭、庙底沟等类型的汲水器，小口、尖底、腹部双耳。六册来源一致把它当作\"功能决定造型\"的典型例证，但在其力学原理的解释路径上分成三种说法，且对尖底的用途给出了不止一种功能。本 KU 合并登记这些解释，不裁定。","path":"terms/pointed-bottom-jar.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"尖底瓶是 B 维度下新石器时代汲水器形制的代表条目，六册一致用它论证功能决定造型的设计逻辑。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:proto-porcelain","title":"原始青瓷（Proto-porcelain）","name_en":"Proto-porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","战国","瓷器起源","青釉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"原始青瓷是商周至战国时期介于陶与瓷之间的青釉器，用高岭土作胎、经 1100—1200℃ 高温烧成、表面有玻璃釉质，但工艺尚未成熟，故称\"原始\"。六册来源均有直接记载，并用它来确定中国瓷器发明的年代上限；高丰一册另用\"原始瓷器\"一名，并记商代至东汉成熟瓷器之间约 1000 多年的过渡时长。来源在\"何时开始\"上给出的时间点不同，本 KU 并存。","path":"terms/proto-porcelain.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"原始青瓷是 B 维度下陶—瓷过渡阶段的技术类型条目，五册来源用以确定中国瓷器发明的上限年代。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pulu","title":"氆氇（Pulu (Tibetan Woollen Cloth)）","name_en":"Pulu (Tibetan Woollen Cloth)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西夏","毛织","氆氇","羊毛","毛褐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"羊毛织品，西夏畜产品加工品种之一。2016 册记西夏畜牧业继续发展，牲畜皮原料相当丰富，使党项人在西夏建立之前就已有发达的畜产品加工业，主要有鞣皮、纺毛线，织造氆氇（pǔ lū，羊毛织品）、毛褐、毡、毯等，产量可观；但早期畜产品仍以牧民就地自行加工为主，专门的皮匠、织匠、裁缝数量很少，生产规模有限。来源并引《马可·波罗游记》记额里合牙（即宁夏）阿剌筛城的驼毛布，作为西夏毛织生产水平较高的旁证。","path":"terms/pulu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西夏毛织品的条目，其畜产品加工与对外贸易牵涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qian-you-tao","title":"铅釉陶（Lead-Glazed Pottery）","name_en":"Lead-Glazed Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["低温铅釉","汉代","银釉","黄绿釉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铅釉陶是涂有黄绿色低温铅釉的陶器。铅釉熔点低，约 700℃~800℃ 即可烧成，并能薄薄匀挂在胎上；釉中混有不同金属元素则形成黄、绿、褐、土红等多种色彩。铅釉陶是汉代陶瓷工艺的代表，因釉面泛出银色光彩，又称银釉。","path":"terms/qian-you-tao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铅釉陶是 B 维度下汉代低温釉陶的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qiangjin","title":"戗金（Qiangjin (Engraved Gold Lacquer)）","name_en":"Qiangjin (Engraved Gold Lacquer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["漆器","针刻","填金","戗银","辍耕录"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"戗金是在漆面雕刻花纹、在刻纹中上漆后再填金粉的漆器装饰技法，起源于战国针刻。填银称戗银、填彩漆称填彩，花纹仍呈刻划的阴文；与描金同属金漆主要品种。《辍耕录》记戗金戗银法：以黑漆为地、针刻画，再以新罗漆调雌黄（金）或韶粉（银）嵌缝，铺金银薄揩实。","path":"terms/qiangjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"戗金是 B 维度下漆器装饰技法的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qijia-wenhua","title":"齐家文化（Qijia Culture）","name_en":"Qijia Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["黄河上游","甘肃广河","铜器","双耳罐","马鞍口陶罐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"齐家文化是黄河上游在马家窑、半山、马厂型之后兴起的文化，时间约等于龙山文化时期，基本上和夏代相始终；彩陶不多，装饰纹样以菱形纹、棋格纹、网格纹为最多，器形以双耳罐和马鞍口式陶罐为典型。2016 记其为黄河上游新石器中晚期文化，位于甘肃广河县齐家坪，并称其出现铜器；马家窑文化在时间顺序上下接齐家文化。","path":"terms/qijia-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"齐家文化是 B 维度下黄河上游新石器时代文化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qin-zhuan-han-wa","title":"秦砖汉瓦（Qin Bricks and Han Tiles）","name_en":"Qin Bricks and Han Tiles","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","建筑材料","画像砖","瓦当","陶制砖瓦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_component","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦砖汉瓦是秦汉陶制砖瓦的合称，涵盖画像砖、砌墙砖、铺地砖、空心砖、条砖、筒瓦、板瓦与圆瓦当。三册的叙述位置不同：夏燕靖两版把它放在\"陶瓷设计\"的彩绘陶之后，以画像砖的图像价值与瓦当的纹饰文字为主，并给出\"烧成后吸水有声，故后世有'秦砖汉瓦'之称\"的得名解释；赵农把它放在\"建筑\"的砖瓦段，以陶制砖瓦技术对土木建筑屋顶与中原建筑样式成型的作用为主，另记楔形、榫头形异形砖与方位性瓦当。本 KU 以两套叙","path":"terms/qin-zhuan-han-wa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秦砖汉瓦是 B 维度下秦汉建筑材料的合称条目；制坯、烧造、砌拱与瓦当方位属 B，画像砖的社会图像与四神方位观念牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qing-ci","title":"青瓷（Celadon）","name_en":"Celadon","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东汉","越窑","瓯窑","婺窑","德清窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青瓷是我国最早出现的瓷器品种，东汉末年出现，浙江越窑的青瓷成就体现了最高水平；江苏宜兴、江西、湖南、四川等地都出现了早期青瓷的窑址。三国两晋南北朝时期瓷器出现北方白瓷和南方青瓷的分流。魏晋时期青瓷产地主要集中在浙江上虞、永嘉、萧山、余姚、绍兴、临海、丽水、吴兴、德清等地，大体分四个系统：曹娥江地区的越窑、瓯江地区的瓯窑、金衢地区的婺窑、浙北东苕溪地区的德清窑。青瓷常常以动物为造型，增加了青瓷的美感","path":"terms/qing-ci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青瓷是 B 维度下瓷器类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qing-style-furniture","title":"清式家具（Qing-style Furniture）","name_en":"Qing-style Furniture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["家具","清代","广作","苏作","京作"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_style","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清式家具是相对于明式家具的风格概念，指康熙晚期至乾隆近百年间形成的、以广式、苏式、京式三大产地风格共同构成的家具类型。高丰给三期说、造办处背景、三作分工与三条整体风格；田自秉给\"明式简练，清式繁琐\"的总判断与苏作、广作、京作在榫、雕、鳔上的工艺差别；赵农给\"繁琐雕琢、富丽华贵\"的定性，并以太师椅、架子床、宝座、鹿角椅、玫瑰椅、摇椅等具体品类展开。三册对清式的评价一致偏低，但落点不同：高丰着眼于宫廷","path":"terms/qing-style-furniture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"清式家具是 B 维度下明清高型家具的风格条目；造型、榫卯、雕刻与镶嵌工艺属 B，宫廷威权与满族政治象征牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingdai-jiaju-sanda-mingzuo","title":"清代家具三大名作（Three Great Qing Furniture Styles）","name_en":"Three Great Qing Furniture Styles","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","苏作","广作","京作","地方风格"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_style","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清代家具以苏作、广作和京作为代表，被称为清代家具三大名作。三者造型与装饰设计各具地方特色，并且一直保持到现在。","path":"terms/qingdai-jiaju-sanda-mingzuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"清代家具三大名作是 B 维度下清代家具地域风格的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-jiuqi","title":"青铜酒器（Bronze Wine Vessels）","name_en":"Bronze Wine Vessels","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["尊","彝","壶","爵","五爵"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_category","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜酒器分盛酒器和饮酒器两类：盛酒器有尊、彝、壶、卣、罍、觥、盉等，饮酒器有爵、斝、角、觚、觯等。尊由陶尊演变而来，彝与尊同作祭奠使用物，壶仿陶壶、陶壶又仿天然瓜瓢；爵、斝、觚、觯、角合称五爵，其中爵是发现最早的青铜容器，始见于二里头遗址。","path":"terms/qingtong-jiuqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜酒器是 B 维度下商周青铜器类的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-liqi","title":"青铜礼器（Bronze Ritual Vessels）","name_en":"Bronze Ritual Vessels","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","祭祀","典礼","等级","奴隶主"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_category","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜礼器是商周时期用于祭祀和典礼的青铜日用器。其造型设计除实用外，多考虑放置祭坛上的陈设效果，因而日用器物造型有了不同因素的观念与审美追求，尤其成为奴隶主阶级表达观念、实行统治的重要工具。西周以成套礼制规定使用数量和规格，使贵贱有等、上下有别。","path":"terms/qingtong-liqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜礼器是 B 维度下商周青铜器类的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-shidai","title":"青铜时代（Bronze Age）","name_en":"Bronze Age","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["夏商周","三代","礼器","公元前2000年"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜时代是继旧石器时代、新石器时代后第三个文明期。书中把夏商周时期称为“青铜时代”；中国青铜时代从公元前 2000 年左右开始形成，历时大约 15 个世纪。其特点包括使用大量青铜生产工具、兵器和礼器，且在进入青铜时代以前已有漫长的利用铜矿物制造器具的历史。","path":"terms/qingtong-shidai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜时代是 B 维度下技术史分期的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-shiqi","title":"青铜食器（Bronze Food Vessels）","name_en":"Bronze Food Vessels","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["鼎","鬲","甗","簋","簠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_category","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜食器分煮食器和盛食器两类：煮食器有鼎、鬲、甗等，盛食器有簋、簠、盌、豆等。鬲最初由陶鬲、再经鼎演变而来，三足上部肥大内空以增加受热面积；甗由上部甑和下部鬲结合而成，中间隔穿孔铜片；簋圆腹侈口圈足，常以偶数与鼎配置；簠为长方形，盌为方中带圆的椭圆形，豆则上有盘、中有柄、底为圈足。","path":"terms/qingtong-shiqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜食器是 B 维度下商周青铜器类的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-shuiqi","title":"青铜水器（Bronze Water Vessels）","name_en":"Bronze Water Vessels","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["鉴","盘","匜","盂","沃盥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_category","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜水器主要有鉴、盘、匜、盂、缶、瓿等。匜是西周后出现的盥洗器，器形仿自瓜瓢，前有流、后有鋬，与盘配合用于沃盥之礼；盘为圆形浅腹，商代无耳圈足，西周中期后加耳，虢季子白盘即著名盥洗器；鉴形体较大，有圆、方两种；盂为圆腹深腹附耳盛水器。","path":"terms/qingtong-shuiqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜水器是 B 维度下商周青铜器类的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong","title":"青铜（Bronze）","name_en":"Bronze","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["铜锡合金","六齐","红铜","铜石并用"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜是铜、锡、铅等元素的合金，较纯铜熔点低、硬度高，具有较好的铸造与机械性能。田自秉定义为用红铜加锡的一种合金，因颜色灰青故名；红铜指天然铜。并指出青铜时代之前应当还有一个红铜时代，历史学家称为铜石并用时代。高丰引《考工记》“金有六齐”，指出含锡约 17% 的青铜色泽美观、声音好、可铸精细花纹，一般青铜鼎即用此配方。","path":"terms/qingtong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜是 B 维度下金属材料的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qipao","title":"旗袍（Qipao）","name_en":"Qipao","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","民国","近代","女装","满族"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"旗袍是清代满族妇女长袍演变而来的女装形制，近代经收紧腰身等改造后成为流行时装。四册来源有直接记载（田自秉、李立新两册无\"旗袍\"字样）。来源对\"旗袍\"之名系于何时、清代形态由谁影响谁、以及近代流行由什么媒介推动，三处表述不同。本 KU 并列，不裁定。","path":"terms/qipao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"旗袍是 E 维度下近代女装改良的代表条目，其礼装规定与满汉服制属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qushui-liushang","title":"曲水流觞（Qushui Liushang (Floating Cups on Winding Water)）","name_en":"Qushui Liushang (Floating Cups on Winding Water)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东晋","兰亭","曲水流觞","修禊","王羲之"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"literati_custom","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"上流置酒杯顺流而下、停于谁前谁饮酒的文人修禊聚会活动。2016 册记东晋永和九年（353）三月三日王羲之与谢安、孙绰等在会稽山阴兰亭修禊，于水边置杯顺流而下，杯停在谁面前谁就饮酒；参加者 41 人，其中 11 人各成两篇、15 人各成一篇、16 人未能成诗各罚酒三觥；王羲之为诗集作序，即《兰亭集序》，被誉为“天下第一行书”，又称“禊帖”。","path":"terms/qushui-liushang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下文人士族礼俗的条目，其书法与器物另涉 C/B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:rendong-wen","title":"忍冬纹（Honeysuckle Scroll Motif）","name_en":"Honeysuckle Scroll Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["六朝","卷草","植物纹","敦煌","石刻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"忍冬纹是六朝流行的卷草状植物纹，通称卷草。纹样取忍冬花（金银花）枝叶变化或莲叶演变，一般三叶片与一叶片相对排列，有单叶双叶、顺向相背等变化；东晋北魏之后与莲花纹一起渗透于铜器、金银器、砖瓦、石刻、藻井、柱础等造物类型，唐代演变为繁复的卷草，成为中国造物装饰的主题。","path":"terms/rendong-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"忍冬纹是 C 维度下六朝外来植物纹样的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:rumo-zhizheng","title":"儒墨之争（Rumo zhi Zheng (Confucian-Mohist Debate)）","name_en":"Rumo zhi Zheng (Confucian-Mohist Debate)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","儒家","墨家","显学","仁爱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"intellectual_debate","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"春秋末至战国初儒家与墨家在思想主张上的对立。2016 册引《韩非子·显学篇》称儒、墨为“世之显学”，指出两家分歧集中在“仁爱”与“兼爱”，并引《淮南子·要略》说明墨家背周道而用夏政的三条理由，引《孟子·滕文公下》记孟子对墨子的批评。来源未给两派在工艺与器物制度上的具体分歧。","path":"terms/rumo-zhizheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下先秦思想论争的条目，其审美取向另涉 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ruqun","title":"襦裙（Ruqun (Jacket and Skirt)）","name_en":"Ruqun (Jacket and Skirt)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","襦裙","女服","深衣","短衣"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汉代女服中上穿短襦、下系长裙的组合。2016 册记汉代女子的襦裙由深衣演变而来，一般上襦极短，只到腰间，而裙子很长，下垂至地；同段并列汉代服装的袍、襜褕（直身的单衣）、襦（短衣）、裙四类。来源未给襦裙的裁片、尺寸、面料与穿着场合，也未给图像或出土实物。","path":"terms/ruqun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下汉代女服组合的条目，其裁剪与穿着制度归 B/D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sanleng-jianzhuang-shiqi","title":"三棱尖状石器（Sanleng Jianzhuang Shiqi (Three-Edged Point)）","name_en":"Three-Edged Point","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器","新石器","棱背状","挖掘工具","西侯度"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三棱尖状石器是旧石器和新石器时期都存在的棱尖状石器，主要用于挖掘根茎类植物。2016 册记其以巨厚石片打制、器身呈棱背状，最早发现于山西芮城西侯度，并引贾兰坡的“苍河—丁村文化系”命名。","path":"terms/sanleng-jianzhuang-shiqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下旧石器代表性石器类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shachuan","title":"沙船（Shachuan (Sand Ship)）","name_en":"Shachuan (Sand Ship)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["崇明","平底","多桅多帆","海船"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"沙船是江苏崇明创制的多桅多帆平底船，便于掌握风向，吃水浅、速度快，可载重 5000 石左右；赵农记其为宋代海船制造中出现的一种平底船样式。","path":"terms/shachuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"沙船是 B 维度下古代海船类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shandingdong-ren-guzhen","title":"山顶洞人骨针（Shandingdongren Guzhen (Shandingdong Bone Needle)）","name_en":"Shandingdong Bone Needle","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器晚期","骨针","缝纫","山顶洞人","制衣工具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山顶洞人骨针是旧石器晚期用于缝缀皮衣的骨制工具。2016 册记其采用鱼刺或鸟兽骨头刮磨钻孔制成，并以此说明制衣工具、缝纫方法与制衣材料已经形成。","path":"terms/shandingdong-ren-guzhen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下旧石器晚期缝纫工具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shandingdongren","title":"山顶洞人（Shandingdongren (Shandingdong Man (Upper Cave Man))）","name_en":"Shandingdong Man (Upper Cave Man)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器晚期","晚期智人","周口店","钻孔石珠","骨针"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hominin","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山顶洞人是旧石器晚期的晚期智人，1930—1934 年发现于北京房山周口店龙骨山山顶洞穴，距今约 1.8 万年。2016 册以山顶洞人的石器与遗物判断审美观念、弓箭使用、缝纫技术与人工取火四项能力，是旧石器晚期造物水平的关键证据。","path":"terms/shandingdongren.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下旧石器晚期人类造物能力的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shangbiao","title":"商标（Shangbiao (Trademark)）","name_en":"Shangbiao (Trademark)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["近代","商标","津沪","商标注册","马头牌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"trademark_design","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商标是近代商品标记。2016 册称我国近代商标设计的出现，目前可查到的是清末与英、美、日和葡萄牙等国在签订通商条约中写有相互保护商标的条文，因此基本可以认定是受外国产品商标影响所致。当初对商标一词的译法很不固定，有译成“牌子”“牌号”，还有译成“货牌”或“贸易牌号”，到清末光绪皇帝钦定后才统一使用“商标”一词。近代商标设计主要集中于津、沪两地：津、沪海关的商标挂号制度实施，政府商标管理体制出现，清","path":"terms/shangbiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"商标是 D 维度下近代商业制度与设计实践的条目，其标记的视觉设计属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shanrang-system","title":"禅让制（Shanrangzhi (Abdication System)）","name_en":"Abdication System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["禅让","尧舜禹","君位继承","传说时代","制度"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"political_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"禅让制是传说时代君位传承的制度，指在位者将君位让与继承人。2016 册记约公元前 5700 年至约公元前 2100 年的约 3600 年间国君产生均采用禅让制，尧禅位于舜、舜禅位于禹，禹之子启建立夏王朝后结束禅让制。","path":"terms/shanrang-system.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下上古君位继承制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:she-yan","title":"歙砚（She Inkstone）","name_en":"She Inkstone","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["婺源","龙尾砚","眉子","罗纹","金星"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inkstone_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"歙砚相传开采于唐代开元年间的婺源山中，此地属歙州管辖，宋代就颇具规模，当时的歙砚中有“龙尾砚”与南唐澄心堂纸齐名。元末至清初一度停止开采，乾隆年间重新恢复采石制砚的活动；歙砚粒度细腻、匀称密实，质地泛青灰色，并有眉子、罗纹、金星、金纹等天然花纹。","path":"terms/she-yan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"歙砚是 B 维度下文房砚台的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shenyi","title":"深衣（Shenyi）","name_en":"Shenyi","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","秦汉","服饰","礼服制度","礼记"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"深衣是先秦至汉代的主要服装形制，把上衣与下裳连为一体、衣襟绕身、以带束腰。五册来源有直接记载（田自秉一册无\"深衣\"字样）。来源在三个点上不一致：起始时代（春秋战国／周代／商代）、直裾是否属深衣、以及服用者的等级范围。本 KU 并列，不裁定。","path":"terms/shenyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"深衣是 B 维度下的服装形制条目，其制度面（礼记规范、等级服用）属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shese-zhigong","title":"设色之工（Shese zhi Gong (Dyeing and Painting Trades)）","name_en":"Shese zhi Gong (Dyeing and Painting Trades)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["考工记","设色之工","染色","画缋","钟氏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_division","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《考工记》六类工种之一，指染色、画绘与刺绣的工种组合。2016 册记设色之工共分四节，其中“筐人”一节阙：画绩之事论五色方位观念与纹章象征，画、绩分为两个工种而此处合并，并包括刺绣；钟氏染羽掌羽毛染色的官职与工匠，记染色方法、次数、名称与技术要求；筐人原文阙，孙诒让疑为治丝帛布帛之工；慌氏涑丝为漂练丝帛的官职与工匠，涑同练。同册另一处又把五工种列作画、缋、钟氏、覩（dǔ）氏、筐人，用字与本节不同，","path":"terms/shese-zhigong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下《考工记》工种分工的条目，其染色与画绘工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shi-class","title":"士（Shi (Scholar-Gentry)）","name_en":"Shi (Scholar-Gentry)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","社会阶层","学在官府","知识分子"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"social_group","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"士是我国古代社会中具有一定身份地位的特定社会阶层，后演变为对知识分子的泛称。它原指原始社会末期与氏族部落首领和显贵同族的武士，进入阶级社会后成为统治阶级的一部分；因古代学在官府，只有士以上的贵胄子弟才有文化知识，故士又成了有一定知识和技能之人的称呼。","path":"terms/shi-class.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"士是 D 维度下先秦社会阶层与知识制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shikusi","title":"石窟寺（Shikusi (Grotto Temple)）","name_en":"Shikusi (Grotto Temple)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋以后","佛教建筑","石窟寺","敦煌","云岗"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"在山崖上开凿出的窟洞型佛寺。2016 册记石窟寺是佛教建筑的一种，随佛教东传在魏晋以后兴起；最早出现在新疆，其次为敦煌莫高窟，后有云岗、龙门、天龙山等；多由皇室贵族出资开凿，窟外常加木构建筑以保护，窟内保存大量雕刻与绘画，是研究当时建筑、雕塑与绘画的重要实物。","path":"terms/shikusi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下佛教建筑的条目，其宗教与赞助制度另涉 A/D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shilian","title":"石镰（Shilian (Stone Sickle)）","name_en":"Stone Sickle","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器","收割农具","龙山文化","良渚文化","石制工具"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"石镰是新石器时代的收割农具。2016 册把镰与刀并列为收割器具，并在龙山文化、良渚文化的农具组合中记石镰，图 1-6 为石镰。","path":"terms/shilian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下原始收割农具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shiliu-qun","title":"石榴裙（Pomegranate Skirt）","name_en":"Pomegranate Skirt","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","红裙","石榴花","女装"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"石榴裙是唐代流行的鲜艳红裙，其色如石榴之红、绘石榴大花。一般百姓穿不起安乐公主式百鸟毛裙，遂以颜色和式样取胜，石榴裙因而流行；敦煌壁画与唐代绘画可见裙制变化。另有“拜倒在石榴裙下”俗语与唐明皇、杨贵妃传说。","path":"terms/shiliu-qun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"石榴裙是 B 维度下唐代女装裙式的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shimopan-mobang","title":"石磨盘和磨棒（Shimopan he Mobang (Stone Quern and Grinder)）","name_en":"Stone Quern and Grinder","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器","加工器具","石磨盘","石磨棒","原始农业"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"石磨盘和磨棒是新石器时代加工食物的石器组合。2016 册把二者列为原始农业的加工器具，与农耕器具、收割器具并列，图 1-8 为石磨盘和磨棒。","path":"terms/shimopan-mobang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下原始农业加工器具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shishizhuang","title":"时世装（Modern Dress）","name_en":"Modern Dress","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["民国","女装","时世装","Modern Dress","裤装"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"时世装是 2016 册所记民国初年标榜新颖的女子时装，即上衣下裤的装束。来源称其在当时较为另类，却广受青睐；民国时期出现这种女子衣装实属不易，因为传统衣着观念中裤子素来不为女子所穿，良家女子成年出门或在正式场合露面皆须系裙；直至民初风气开化，裤装外穿才不分性别和阶层。1912 年开始流行这种上衣下裤的女子着装，时称“Modern Dress”，一时成为女子服饰变革的最大亮点。","path":"terms/shishizhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"时世装是 E 维度下民国女子服饰变革的条目，其上衣下裤形制属 B 维度服饰工艺。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shiyu-wenhua","title":"峙峪文化（Shiyu Wenhua (Shiyu Culture)）","name_en":"Shiyu Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器晚期","细石器","峙峪","复合工具","装柄"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"峙峪文化是旧石器晚期的细石器文化，位于山西朔县峙峪村，年代为距今 28135±1330 年。2016 册把它列为细石器初期的发生阶段，以细小石器、小石片和复合工具为特征。","path":"terms/shiyu-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下旧石器晚期细石器文化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shougongye-hanghui","title":"手工业行会（Shougongye Hanghui (Craft Guild)）","name_en":"Shougongye Hanghui (Craft Guild)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","行会","作铺","行首","匠籍"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"guild_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代城市手工业按行业组成的团体。2016 册在隋唐手工业一节分三层记述：先记城市中的手工业作坊又称“作铺”，如染行、织锦行、金银行、绢行，规模相当大；再记唐代出现行业性质的社会组织，协调内部各种关系，规定产销条例，甚至涉及价格竞争，并得到官府承认和保护；最后归纳唐代手工业行会组织的三个显著特征——按“团伙”编籍于地方州县的在册匠作户籍、官私营从业者都受地方州县匠作制度约束、通过纳资代役使工匠获得较","path":"terms/shougongye-hanghui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下唐代手工业行业组织的条目，其作坊生产与工艺传承归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shu-brocade","title":"蜀锦（Shu Brocade）","name_en":"Shu Brocade","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["四川","成都","三国","经锦","加金"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蜀锦是四川生产的高级织锦，三国时为蜀国主要军费来源，魏、吴争求；两晋仍以蜀锦著名，左思《蜀都赋》描写成都织造盛况。具有千年左右历史，按图案组织分方方、雨丝、条花、散花；保持唐代以前经锦传统，是现今唯一用多色经丝与纬线交织起花的织锦。","path":"terms/shu-brocade.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蜀锦是 B 维度下四川织锦类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuilu-gongzhan-tu","title":"水陆攻战图（Shuilu Gongzhan Tu (Water-Land Battle Scene)）","name_en":"Shuilu Gongzhan Tu (Water-Land Battle Scene)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","水陆攻战","铜鉴","铜壶","战船"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"战国铜鉴、铜壶上以水陆战事为题材的图像。2016 册以图 3-32「战国 水陆攻战图（模绘图）」与战国铜鉴、铜壶上的水陆攻战图为据，说明当时战船有两层，上层载士兵，下层载划桨手，行船不靠风帆，全凭划桨。来源未给所据铜器的名称、出土单位、尺寸与摹绘者，图版未视觉核验。","path":"terms/shuilu-gongzhan-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下战国铜器叙事图像的条目，其图像组织另涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuimi-cang","title":"水密舱（Shuimi Cang (Watertight Bulkhead)）","name_en":"Shuimi Cang (Watertight Bulkhead)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","造船","水密舱","扬州施桥","桐油石灰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_structure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"以隔舱板分隔船体、提高抗沉性的结构。2016 册在唐代造船业一节记唐代造船的密封技术相当发达，已用桐油石灰糊缝；扬州施桥镇出土的唐代木船是世界最早的水密舱结构的实物，也是世界造船史上的创举，对于增强船只远洋航行中的安全性起了很大作用，同时也增强了船体的横向强度。来源把水密舱与同段所记“海鹘”战船的浮板、沙船的多桅多帆并列为唐代造船设计的三项结构成就。","path":"terms/shuimi-cang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代造船结构的条目，其远洋贸易背景牵涉 D、E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuiniaoxing-taohu","title":"水鸟形陶壶（Shuiniaoxing Taohu (Waterbird-Shaped Pottery Hu)）","name_en":"Waterbird-Shaped Pottery Hu","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["良渚文化","陶壶","仿生造型","水鸟","黑皮陶"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"水鸟形陶壶是良渚文化以水鸟形态为造型依据的陶壶。2016 册把它与鱼鳍形足陶鼎并提，认为二者都是模拟自然形态、按生活需要创造人工形态的例证。","path":"terms/shuiniaoxing-taohu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下良渚文化陶壶器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuzi-meiti-sheji","title":"数字媒体设计（Shuzi Meiti Sheji (Digital Media Design)）","name_en":"Shuzi Meiti Sheji (Digital Media Design)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["数字媒体","艺术与科技","动画影片","现代设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_discipline","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"数字媒体设计是 2016 册所记计算机技术对人类生活介入和影响后产生的一种新的设计艺术语言。来源称数字媒体设计是在科技发展日新月异的信息时代中产生的；它是艺术与科技联姻的产物，在数字媒体设计中艺术与技术交汇融合、相互促进，以艺术形式表达科学，以科学方式体现艺术，艺术的韵味与科学的严谨相互辉映。目前，数字媒体设计比较突出的项目是动画影片（或动漫电影）的创作和生产。","path":"terms/shuzi-meiti-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"数字媒体设计是 D 维度下现代设计领域的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sichou-zhilu","title":"丝绸之路（Silk Road）","name_en":"Silk Road","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","隋唐","丝织","西域","海上丝绸之路"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"trade_route","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"丝绸之路是汉代开通的、以丝绸贸易为主的东西方交通通道。五册给出两条不完全重合的定义线：夏燕靖两版以 1877 年李希霍芬、1910 年赫尔曼的命名为核心，把它定为“中国古代经由中亚通往南亚、西亚以及欧洲、北非的陆上贸易交往的通道”；赵农与高丰则同时记陆上干道、西南通道与“海上丝绸之路”，外延大于夏燕靖的陆上定义。田自秉不记命名，只记汉代丝织品作为赏赐、商品与文化交流物品的外销及国外出土。本 KU ","path":"terms/sichou-zhilu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"丝绸之路是 D 维度下汉代丝织品贸易与跨区域流通的术语锚点；丝织生产与织物品种属 B，中西物质文化交流属 E。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sida-chuanxing","title":"四大船型（Sida Chuanxing (Four Major Ship Types)）","name_en":"Sida Chuanxing (Four Major Ship Types)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","造船","沙船","鸟船","福船"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四大船型是 2016 册对明清航海木帆船的四大分类：沙船、鸟船、福船和广船。来源记明清两代为满足漕运和远洋贸易需要，造船设计业达到顶峰；明永乐年间郑和七次下西洋，出动船舰一两百艘，其中宝船 60 多艘，共载 2.7 万多人，宝船长约 150 米、舵杆长 11 米、张 12 帆；各种性能的船型总数有 1000 种左右，仅海洋渔船就有三四百种。","path":"terms/sida-chuanxing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"四大船型是 B 维度下明清航海木帆船分类的条目，其漕运与远洋贸易背景属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:song-ci-zhuangshi-shoufa","title":"宋瓷装饰手法（Song Ci Zhuangshi Shoufa (Song Ceramic Decoration Techniques)）","name_en":"Song Ci Zhuangshi Shoufa (Song Ceramic Decoration Techniques)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","瓷器","印花","刻花","划花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decoration_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋代瓷器九种装饰技法的合称。2016 册以“宋瓷的装饰手法”为小节，先总举印花、刻花、划花、剔花、贴花、镂花、弦纹、春字纹、珍珠地划花九种，再逐一说明工具、工序与代表窑口。来源的总判断是：宋代瓷器不仅在烧制技术上超越前代，装饰设计的水准也堪称为杰出代表；北宋末期至南宋又出现更多手法，并在刻花或印花的花纹上用梳栉状工具划出线条，还发展了多种辅助纹饰，磁州窑、耀州窑可谓首开这类装饰纹样之先河。","path":"terms/song-ci-zhuangshi-shoufa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代制瓷装饰技法的清单级条目，其纹样组织与视觉效果牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:song-jin","title":"宋锦（Song Jin (Song Brocade)）","name_en":"Song Jin (Song Brocade)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","苏州","宋锦","织锦","丝织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋代在苏州织造的锦类丝织品。2016 册在宋代丝织工艺一节记：宋代在苏州织造的宋锦（或织锦），在南京织造的云锦，在四川织造的蜀锦，都是闻名全国的丝织品。来源只用这一句交代宋锦的产地与地位，未给组织规格、纹样题材、用途与传世实物。同段另记宋代染织管理机构庞大、分工更细，设文思院、绫锦院、裁造院、文绣院，并在洛阳、真州、定州、青州、益州、苏州、杭州、润州、湖州等地设官方派出机构；民间织造有“千室夜机鸣","path":"terms/song-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代丝织品种的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:songban-shu","title":"宋版书（Song Dynasty Block-Printed Books）","name_en":"Song Dynasty Block-Printed Books","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","雕版印刷","汴本","浙本","建本"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"print_genre","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋版书是宋代雕版印刷的书籍，有雕刻精湛、校对细心、印制清晰等优点，书体整齐规范，主要用皮纸和麻纸，后世成为收藏极品。它在京城开封、浙江杭州、福建建阳、四川眉山等地形成刻印中心，简称汴本、浙本、建本、蜀本，其中以浙江水平最好；又有官刻、家刻、坊刻三种生产方式。","path":"terms/songban-shu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宋版书是 C 维度下雕版印刷书籍与版本类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:songti-zi","title":"宋体字（Songti Typeface）","name_en":"Songti Typeface","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["雕版印刷","宋版书","明体字","老宋字"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"typeface","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋体字是宋代雕版印书上出现的印刷字体，结构严谨紧密、端正整齐，笔画横平竖直、横细直粗、起落笔有棱角。其形成综合欧、柳、颜体书法风格，尤其受颜体影响，并适应雕版快速刻字的实际需要。学界有宋体字始于明万历年间、日本称“明体字”的不同看法；高丰据宋版字体特征主张宋体字始创于宋、成熟于明。","path":"terms/songti-zi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宋体字是 C 维度下印刷字体的核心条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:suniboqing","title":"苏泥勃青（Sumali Blue (Cobalt Pigment)）","name_en":"Sumali Blue (Cobalt Pigment)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","青花","钴料","宣德","波斯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_material","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"苏泥勃青是明代景德镇青花采用的青料，来自波斯（赵农）或南洋输入（田自秉）；宣德青花用之，色调深沉雅静，浓厚处与釉汁渗合形成斑点，产生深浅浓淡的自然美。使用这种青料使瓷器呈现深蓝、淡蓝、紫蓝等不同效果。","path":"terms/suniboqing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"苏泥勃青是 B 维度下青花钴料的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sushi-caihua","title":"苏式彩画（Suzhou-Style Architectural Painting）","name_en":"Suzhou-Style Architectural Painting","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","建筑彩画","烟云退晕","枋心","拙政园"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architectural_painting","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"苏式彩画是清代建筑彩画南派，最大特征是枋心轮廓作烟云式退晕，黑、白、灰由外到内、由深到浅画出起伏弧线；枋心主花为山水、人物、花草、鸟兽的中国画形式，藻头、箍头以鱼子纹、鱼鳞纹、万字流水等几何纹衬托。它适宜装饰园林亭榭楼阁，苏州拙政园、北京颐和园长廊和谐趣园、香山见心斋为代表。","path":"terms/sushi-caihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"苏式彩画是 B 维度下清代建筑彩画的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tang-dai-qingci-yao","title":"唐代著名青瓷窑（Tangdai Zhuming Qingci Yao (Famous Tang Celadon Kilns)）","name_en":"Tangdai Zhuming Qingci Yao (Famous Tang Celadon Kilns)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","青瓷","瓯窑","婺州窑","岳州窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_group","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2016 册“知识链接”以“唐代著名青瓷窑”为题，逐一记瓯窑、婺州窑、岳州窑、长沙窑、洪州窑、寿州窑、邛窑七个窑场，并在正文另段记越窑与秘色瓷。来源的总判断是：唐代形成我国陶瓷史上第一个高峰，青瓷是主流，窑场众多，南方几乎各省区皆有，尤以浙江、江西、湖南、福建、广东为盛，北方青瓷也得到发展；青瓷器仍是唐代居民最钟爱、使用最普遍的瓷器。同段还记越窑“几乎是专供宫廷的用品，由官府督造”，是之后历代御器","path":"terms/tang-dai-qingci-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代青瓷窑场的清单级条目，其官窑性质与贡御关系牵涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tang-sancai","title":"唐三彩（Tang Sancai）","name_en":"Tang Sancai","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","铅釉陶","明器","低温釉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐三彩是唐代盛行的低温铅釉陶器，以白（黄）色黏土或高岭土制胎，施以铜、铁、钴、锰等金属氧化物着色的铅釉，经约 900℃ 低温烧成。五册来源都强调其釉色以黄、绿、赭（褐）、白为主并可出现蓝彩，产品主要用作随葬明器。","path":"terms/tang-sancai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"唐三彩是 B 维度下低温铅釉陶工艺与唐代明器体系的术语锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tangcao-wen","title":"唐草纹（Tangcao Wen (Tang Scroll Motif)）","name_en":"Tangcao Wen (Tang Scroll Motif)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","染织纹样","唐草纹","卷草纹","忍冬"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"以“S”形波状曲线组织的传统装饰纹样。2016 册记唐草纹是我国传统图案之一，多取忍冬、荷花、兰花、牡丹等花草，经处理后作“S”形波状曲线排列，构成二方连续图案花草造型，多曲卷圆润，通称卷草纹；因盛行于唐代故名唐草纹。来源并记唐代以后唐草纹传承不断，素材除忍冬、牡丹以外，又有石榴、荷花、菊花、兰花等。","path":"terms/tangcao-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下唐代染织纹样的条目，其织造与印染载体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tangci","title":"搪瓷（Enamelware）","name_en":"Enamelware","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["珐琅","金属胎","洋瓷","1958","脸盆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"enamelware_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"搪瓷是在金属表面附有珐琅质层的制品，瓷釉以铅、锡、硼砂、石英等制成。制造先冲压金属坯胎，利用洒喷、浸渍等方法涂敷一层或多层珐琅浆，采用印花、喷花、描花、贴花、洒花等装饰，经干燥、烧制而成；瓷釉和金属坯胎的热涨系数应相同，否则会出现珐琅质龟裂。","path":"terms/tangci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"搪瓷是 B 维度下金属胎珐琅制品的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tangjing","title":"唐镜（Tang Mirror）","name_en":"Tang Mirror","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","铜镜","扬州","金银平脱","螺钿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代铜镜的断代条目。2016 册记唐代铜器制造业主要是佛像和铜镜，铜镜属日常生活用品，各地均有出产，扬州铸镜十分著名，浑厚富丽，是重要的贡品。来源给出兴盛原因：许多铜制生活用品已为瓷器替代，金属工艺技术集中到铜镜上；唐代又形成以铜镜作为献礼和馈赠的社会风尚。装饰加工方法有金银平脱、鎏金、错金银、镶嵌、螺钿、著彩与涂珐琅。来源另记唐镜“非常符合科学原理”：铜锡铅比例约70:25:5，加锡量较多故一般","path":"terms/tangjing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代铜镜的断代条目，其纹样与外来工艺因素牵涉 C、E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tao-gui","title":"陶鬶（Pottery Gui (Tripod Pourer)）","name_en":"Pottery Gui (Tripod Pourer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["龙山文化","款足","鸟喙流","炊煮器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陶鬶是龙山文化常见炊煮器，由陶鼎演变而来，以三条肥大中空的款足代替鼎的实心足，扩大受热面积；颈部高拔，口前部有冲天鸟喙状长流，形似昂首挺胸的大鸟。书中认为其形态别致，体现陶匠师实用与美观有机结合的造型设计思想。","path":"terms/tao-gui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陶鬶是 B 维度下龙山文化炊器的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tao-zeng","title":"陶甑（Pottery Zeng (Steamer)）","name_en":"Pottery Zeng (Steamer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["河姆渡","蒸食","蒸汽孔","炊器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陶甑是底部有通蒸汽小孔的蒸食器，功能类似“蒸屉”。河姆渡文化陶甑有盆形或罐形，两侧有耳，底部有许多通蒸汽的小孔；其功能是利用蒸汽熟化食物。书中认为陶甑的出现促进了人类从煮食向蒸食的过渡，是陶器功能设计的一项重要进展。","path":"terms/tao-zeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陶甑是 B 维度下新石器时代炊器的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:taotie-motif","title":"饕餮纹（Taotie Motif）","name_en":"Taotie Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","青铜器","兽面纹","纹样","礼器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"饕餮纹是商代至西周早期青铜器上最有代表性的兽面纹样，通常表现为被夸张或幻想的动物头部正面：横眉咧口、宽鼻瞪眼、口中有獠牙或锯齿形牙，额上有一对立耳或大犄角，并有一对利爪；也有用相对的两个夔纹组成一个兽面。四册的界定有宽窄：高丰与田自秉把它定为商代至西周早期或殷代青铜器的主纹；夏燕靖 2016 把商早期纹饰主体称为“兽面纹”，到殷商早期才说“饕餮纹处于松散状态”，把饕餮纹作为后段名称；赵农只给图题与","path":"terms/taotie-motif.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"饕餮纹是 B 维度下商周青铜器装饰母题的术语锚点；其图像构成、对称与地纹处理属 C；礼器制度与祭祀功能可在后续 Topic 中与 D 连接。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tianji-hu","title":"天鸡壶（Tianji Ewer (Chicken-Head Ewer)）","name_en":"Tianji Ewer (Chicken-Head Ewer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["六朝","隋代","鸡首","壶式"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"天鸡壶是六朝至隋代流行的壶式。它在盘口壶基础上，于肩部一面加鸡头、另一面安把手接盘口：早期鸡头纯作装饰，东晋以后鸡头加长，也有改作羊头、牛头、虎头或两侧刻双翅者，壶体渐高瘦长，至唐代演变为龙耳壶。与六朝相比，隋代天鸡壶腹部修长、上圆下瘦，鸡头雄健，鸡颈较粗；六朝则腹矮底大、鸡头较小、鸡颈呈管状。另有“一边鸡头、一边龙柄、颈部作竹节形”的壶式描述，见于隋和初唐。","path":"terms/tianji-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"天鸡壶是 B 维度下六朝隋代壶式的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tianshi-diqi-caimei-gongqiao","title":"天时地气材美工巧（Tianshi Diqi Caimei Gongqiao (Timing, Terrain, Materials and Craftsmanship)）","name_en":"Tianshi Diqi Caimei Gongqiao (Timing, Terrain, Materials and Craftsmanship)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["考工记","工艺原则","天时","地气","材美"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_principle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《考工记》提出的四项造物条件与优质产品标准。2016 册引原文“天有时，地有气，材有美，工有巧，合此四者方可为良”，逐项释义为季节气候、地理环境、材料质地与制作技艺，指出四者合一方为良器；并称这一原则含阴阳五行思想，是第一次提出朴素的工艺观，把“材美工巧”作为衡量优质产品的标准。","path":"terms/tianshi-diqi-caimei-gongqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下《考工记》造物原则的条目，其思想史评价另涉 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tianzu-yundong","title":"天足运动（Tianzu Yundong (Anti-Footbinding Movement)）","name_en":"Tianzu Yundong (Anti-Footbinding Movement)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["近代","缠足","天足运动","女权运动","女学"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"social_movement","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"天足运动是辛亥革命前后与思想解放、女权运动、女学兴起相呼应的放足运动。2016 册称西方传教士、商人、革命党人竞相创办女学，向寻求解放的女性灌输新潮观念；妇女从缠足陋习中被彻底解放出来，时称“天足运动”。来源只给这一句判断，未及推行组织、章程与过程。","path":"terms/tianzu-yundong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"天足运动是 E 维度下近代妇女解放与社会变革的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tieqi-shidai","title":"铁器时代（Iron Age）","name_en":"Iron Age","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["赫梯","陨铁","铸铁鼎","生产力"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铁器时代是人类文明史中的重要转折时期。人们最早知道的铁是陨石中的铁，古埃及人称之为神物；世界上最早制造铁器的是小亚细亚的赫梯人，约在公元前 1400 年左右。我国最早使用铁制工具的文字记载是春秋《左传》中的晋国铸铁鼎；铁器广泛使用使工具制造进入全新领域，生产力极大提高。","path":"terms/tieqi-shidai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铁器时代是 B 维度下技术史分期的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tihuaji","title":"提花机（Figured Loom）","name_en":"Figured Loom","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","多综多蹑","花楼","束综","马王堆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"提花机是按花纹要求提综开口、织造复杂织物的织机。汉代已普遍使用，出现多综多蹑织机，能织复杂花纹；蹑为脚踏杆，汉时已达 120 蹑。东汉还发明花楼式束综提花机，以线综调配提花经线，提高图案质量，使纹饰有大面积花样变化。","path":"terms/tihuaji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"提花机是 B 维度下织造设备的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tongjing","title":"铜镜（Bronze Mirror）","name_en":"Bronze Mirror","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","梳妆用具","战国","唐代","鉴"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜镜是以铜（及锡、铅等合金）铸造、用以梳妆照脸的生活日用品。三册对它的起点判断不一致：夏燕靖两版说\"铜镜从战国时期开始出现并流行\"；赵农说铜镜\"起源是在新石器时期晚期的齐家文化\"，商周已开始发达、战国初步兴盛。本 KU 把两套起点并列，并以战国形制、唐代繁盛两段为主体；汉代一段另立 `terms/hanjing.md`，本条只作过渡。","path":"terms/tongjing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铜镜是 B 维度下青铜生活用具的器类条目；从鉴水到鉴镜的观念转变、镜背纹样的信仰含义牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:touguang-jing","title":"透光镜（Light-Transmitting Mirror）","name_en":"Light-Transmitting Mirror","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","铜镜","铸造应力","光学"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"透光镜是西汉出现的一种特殊铜镜，外形与普通镜相同，并非真正透光；日光照射镜面时，对面墙上能映出镜背花纹的影像。赵农把它列为汉代铜镜技术中最令人叹为观止的品种，并记其工艺与样式在隋唐仍有流传；田自秉记近代研究以铸造应力和研磨压应力造成的镜面曲率解释这一效应。","path":"terms/touguang-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"透光镜是 B 维度下汉代铜镜铸造与光学效应结合的专门条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tuotai-qiqi","title":"脱胎漆器（Tuotai (Bodiless) Lacquerware）","name_en":"Tuotai (Bodiless) Lacquerware","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["夹纻","乾隆","福州","三宝","轻巧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"脱胎漆器是以泥作模型、再用布或绸粘贴、然后上漆的夹纻技法制成的漆器，色泽华美、器体轻巧；乾隆时期由沈沼安创造，作法一直沿袭至今。2016 记其为福州传统漆器工艺，作品造型古朴大方、工艺精巧细致，大型脱胎漆器“荷叶瓶”“提篮仙子”“竹节瓶”被称为福州脱胎漆器“三宝”。","path":"terms/tuotai-qiqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"脱胎漆器是 B 维度下夹纻漆器类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:twelve-symbols","title":"纹饰十二章（Wenshi Shier Zhang (Twelve Ornamental Symbols)）","name_en":"Twelve Ornamental Symbols","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["十二章纹","冕服","礼服","政治象征","虞舜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"纹饰十二章又称十二章纹，是商周奴隶主阶级专用服饰纹样冕服上的十二种纹样。2016 册记前六种绘于服装、后六种绣于服装，并称其自出现后历经两千多年朝代更替而意义与图形始终保持原状。","path":"terms/twelve-symbols.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下服饰纹样制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:underglaze-color","title":"釉下彩（Underglaze Color）","name_en":"Underglaze Color","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["三国","唐代","长沙窑","瓷器装饰","釉下彩绘"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"釉下彩（又称窑彩）是在素坯上绘纹、罩透明或浅色面釉、经高温一次烧成的瓷器装饰类别，青花、釉里红、釉下三彩、釉下五彩都属其下品种。五册都把它当作彩瓷的两大工序类型之一（与釉上彩对举）。分歧有两处：**三国时期的点彩算不算釉下彩的起点**，以及**唐代釉下彩的窑口范围**。本 KU 并列，不裁定。\n\n**立条类型说明**：本 KU 定为 `term` 而非 `procedure`。赵农一册的候选（`2","path":"terms/underglaze-color.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"釉下彩是 B 维度下瓷器装饰分类条目：施彩与罩釉的工序、烧成温度属工艺，纹饰被釉膜覆盖的视觉效果属装饰。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wadang","title":"瓦当（Tile End）","name_en":"Tile End","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","战国","秦汉","建筑陶饰","文字瓦当"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_component","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"瓦当是覆于屋面筒瓦前端的陶制构件，起装饰作用，别称\"瓦头\"。六册中高丰最详，田自秉次之，夏燕靖两版与李立新各取一面，赵农另有形制、护椽功能与燕下都大瓦的文字论述。来源间的实质差异在汉代瓦当的分类体系：高丰分三类、田自秉分四类，两套分类并非同一标准的加细。","path":"terms/wadang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"瓦当是 C 维度下汉代图案与文字装饰的代表载体，同时是 B 维度建筑陶构件。本批按六册讨论的重心（装饰纹样与文字设计）归主维度 C。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wailaishi-jianzhu","title":"外来式建筑（Wailaishi Jianzhu (Foreign-Style Architecture)）","name_en":"Wailaishi Jianzhu (Foreign-Style Architecture)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["近代","租界","外来式建筑","折中主义","钢筋混凝土"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"外来式建筑是外国列强在中国各租界按照他们的建筑传统和审美观念建造、异于中国传统式的建筑。来源称这类建筑模仿欧洲文艺复兴风格和具有折中主义风格的西方建筑形式，虽采用现代建筑的钢筋混凝土材料和钢结构，却往往用石头墙面将建筑包砌起来，以体现西方古典建筑的庞大气势；设计师大多为西方建筑师。此类建筑在当时上海和天津等地各国租界盛行，上海汇丰银行、沙逊大厦、百老汇大厦、雅斯脱饭店，天津德界市议会、英界戈登堂，","path":"terms/wailaishi-jianzhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"外来式建筑是 E 维度下近代跨文化建筑输入的条目，其材料与结构属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:weft-brocade","title":"纬锦（Weft-faced Brocade）","name_en":"Weft-faced Brocade","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","丝织","织锦","纬线显花","经锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"纬锦是以纬线显花的锦，与唐以前以经线显花的经锦相对。四册都把“汉锦/经锦”与“唐锦/纬锦”作为一对技术—时代类型：经锦以经线起花，纬锦以纬线起花；唐代的锦以纬锦为主，织物因此能织出更繁复的花纹、更宽幅的面料和更华丽的色彩。差异在出现时间与技术描述：夏燕靖两版说“南北朝后出现斜纹的纬线显花的纬锦，以两组纬线与一组经线交织而成”；高丰说“唐代新创造了纬锦。纬锦是利用多重多色的纬线起花”；田自秉说“唐锦","path":"terms/weft-brocade.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"纬锦是 B 维度下丝织工艺与织物类型的术语锚点；唐代织造机构、生产规模与外销属 D。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:weizhang","title":"帷帐（Curtain and Canopy）","name_en":"Curtain and Canopy","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","室内分隔","马王堆","防尘避风"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"interior_textile","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"帷帐是汉代室内空间分隔与组织的主要手段之一。帷多单幅横面，用于分隔堂、室；帐笼罩四面，施于床上。湖南长沙马王堆一号汉墓出土丝绸帷帐全长约 7.3 米、宽约 1.45 米；帷帐移动方便、可开可合，兼有保暖、避虫、挡风、防尘和装饰功能。","path":"terms/weizhang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"帷帐是 B 维度下汉代室内空间分隔的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wenzhi","title":"文质（Wen and Zhi (Ornament and Substance)）","name_en":"Wen and Zhi (Ornament and Substance)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["孔子","论语","文采","实质","设计准则"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"aesthetic_concept","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"文质是我国古代文论的基本概念，包括“文”与“质”两个方面：文指文采，质指实质。出典为孔子《论语·雍也》“质胜文则野，文胜质则史，文质彬彬，然后君子”，意即只有学问而无文采则粗野，过分渲染文采而无内涵实质则虚饰，君子须文采与内涵兼具。后世文论多指语言风格的华美与质朴。","path":"terms/wenzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"文质是 A 维度下先秦设计审美观念的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wucai","title":"五彩（Wucai (Polychrome Porcelain)）","name_en":"Wucai (Polychrome Porcelain)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明嘉靖万历","釉上彩","景德镇","彩瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"五彩是明嘉靖、万历时期盛行的釉上彩瓷，用红、黄、绿、紫、孔雀蓝等多种彩料直接在烧成瓷器上描绘花纹、再经焙烧而成。赵农把它列为明清白瓷、青花之外的瓷器品种之一；2016 称其色调多变、富丽堂皇，具有浓郁民族风格。","path":"terms/wucai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"五彩是 B 维度下明代釉上彩瓷的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wuda-mingyao","title":"五大名窑（Five Great Kilns）","name_en":"Five Great Kilns","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","官窑","汝窑","钧窑","哥窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_kiln_group","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"五大名窑是宋瓷中“官、汝、钧、哥、定”五个窑系的合称。赵农指出这仅仅是一种习惯说法，不同地域的窑制自然体现区域特点；2016 以汝窑、官窑、定窑、钧窑、哥窑概括宋代制瓷业的地域流派与工艺成就。","path":"terms/wuda-mingyao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"五大名窑是 B 维度下宋瓷分类的总目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wudai-shiguo","title":"五代十国（Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms）","name_en":"Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐末宋初","五代","十国","分期"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_period","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"五代十国是唐亡后北方五个短命王朝与南方十个地方政权并立的时期。赵农记五代共 53 年、两宋 319 年，合计 372 年；2016 记其历时约半个世纪，南方十国经济文化胜于北方。","path":"terms/wudai-shiguo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"五代十国是 B 维度下的历史分期框架，用于安放唐宋之间的工艺与设计史材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xi-mat","title":"席（Mat (Seating Mat)）","name_en":"Mat (Seating Mat)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","坐卧铺垫","礼制","连席"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"席是中国古代古老而原始的家具，供坐卧铺垫。商代席的使用逐渐普及，周代已有莞席、藻席、次席、蒲席、熊席等名称，并设专掌五席的官吏；席的材质、装饰和使用方式在礼制中有严格等级规定。春秋战国人们以坐席形式接人待客，铺席设筵，席上置案、几等低矮家具。","path":"terms/xi-mat.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"席是 B 维度下先秦起居家具的原点条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiaguo-jian","title":"夏国剑（Xiaguo Jian (Xia State Sword)）","name_en":"Xiaguo Jian (Xia State Sword)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西夏","兵器","夏国剑","鎏金","文献记载"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西夏典籍记载的质地精良的武器。2016 册在“西夏工艺技术成就”知识链接中记：西夏银器、铜器铸造加工以及鎏金技术有较高的水平，西夏典籍中记载的质地精良的武器——“夏国剑”，便是极好的印证；据说宋朝高官以及文人雅士，往往以得到该剑为荣；该剑不仅外表美观，而且犀利无比，不仅铸造技术高超，而且剑把上的鎏金装饰更是精美绝妙，可称得上是西夏铜制器中的珍宝。来源未给剑的尺寸、形制、出土或传世实例，本条只作名物","path":"terms/xiaguo-jian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西夏金属工艺名物的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiangxie","title":"相缬（Xiangxie (Xiangzhou Resist Dye)）","name_en":"Xiangxie (Xiangzhou Resist Dye)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["金代","相州","防染","贡品","套染"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"相缬是金代纺织工艺品种，继承古代纺织品“防染法”染花工艺“缬”，多为民间所用，一般作单色加工，朴实大方；少数供官府呈作贡品的相缬加工复杂，套染出多彩纹样，具晕渲烂漫、变幻迷离的装饰效果。相州产相缬。","path":"terms/xiangxie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"相缬是 B 维度下金代防染印花品种的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xianqin-sandai","title":"先秦三代（Xianqin Sandai (Pre-Qin Three Dynasties)）","name_en":"Pre-Qin Three Dynasties","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","夏商周","三代","青铜时代","历史分期"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_period","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"先秦三代是先秦史内部的分期概念，特指秦朝以前的夏、商、周三代，周包括西周与东周的春秋、战国两个时期。2016 册先界定先秦为公元前 221 年秦统一以前的历史，再以先秦三代指夏商周的时段，并把这一时期定为继旧石器、新石器之后的第三个文明期“青铜时代”。","path":"terms/xianqin-sandai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下中国上古史分期的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiaozhuan","title":"小篆（Small Seal Script）","name_en":"Small Seal Script","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦代","书同文","李斯","标准文字","汉字设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calligraphy_script","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"小篆是秦始皇“书同文”所确立的规范书体，由大篆演变而来。字形规整修长、笔画匀称圆润，具线条化、符号化、规律化特点，是古文字阶段最后一种字体；高丰视其为汉字设计走向成熟的标志。赵农记秦始皇统一六国后采用丞相李斯创意的小篆并颁布全国，以《泰山刻石碑》《峄山刻石碑》《会稽刻石碑》石刻确立规范。","path":"terms/xiaozhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"小篆是 C 维度下秦代标准书体与文字设计的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiapei","title":"霞帔（Xiapei Stole）","name_en":"Xiapei Stole","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["服饰","明代","宋代","命妇","禽纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"clothing_accessory","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"霞帔是宋明女性服饰中的披挂类附件。三册对它的时代、形态与制度属性说法不同：夏燕靖两版只说明代，称其为\"'恩赐贵妇专用'饰品\"，记深青缎地、云霞禽纹与一至七品的禽纹等级；赵农把霞帔列为宋代一般女服的组成（\"大袖、长裙、霞帔\"），又在明清段称其为\"佩带的饰物，是用彩带连缀的金玉坠子，多为贵族妇女所佩\"。两套描述不仅时代不同，形态也不同：一为绣禽纹的深青缎饰，一为彩带连缀金玉坠子。本 KU 并列，不合并","path":"terms/xiapei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"霞帔是 B 维度下宋明女性服饰附件的条目；织物、绣纹与佩挂结构属 B，命妇品级与恩赐制度牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiehong","title":"斜红（Xiehong (Slant Red)）","name_en":"Xiehong (Slant Red)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","面妆","斜红","太阳穴","魏文帝"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cosmetic_custom","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"太阳穴处涂一抹斜红的唐代面妆。2016 册在唐女面妆一段记：还有在太阳穴各涂一抹斜红；据说这是魏文帝爱妃夜来误撞屏风，明明破了相，却被魏文帝以为是特地涂的妆容，后遂被嫔妃效仿。来源只用一句话交代部位与传说来源，未给形制、颜色深浅与流行时段，也未说明“斜红”与额黄、花钿的搭配规则。","path":"terms/xiehong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代面妆习俗的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xikesuosi-ren","title":"喜克索斯人（Hyksos）","name_en":"Hyksos","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["古埃及","前17世纪","马拉战车","复合弓","技术传播"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"social_group","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"喜克索斯人是古代亚洲西部的一个混合民族，于前 17 世纪进入埃及东部，建立第十五和第十六王朝（约前 1674 年至前 1548 年），统治中埃及和下埃及一百多年，并将复合弓、马和马拉战车等新技术引入埃及。","path":"terms/xikesuosi-ren.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"喜克索斯人是 E 维度下古代跨文化技术传播的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xingsheng-zhidu","title":"行省制度（Xingsheng Zhidu (Provincial Administration System)）","name_en":"Xingsheng Zhidu (Provincial Administration System)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","行省","中书省","地方行政","制度形态"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"administrative_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代创设的地方行政制度。2016 册在元代一章开篇记：元朝在中央设中书省，左右丞相和平章政事处理政务，地方实行行省制度，此政体对后世影响极大，乃至明清两朝皆仿其制。同章“元朝制度形态”知识链接把“立行省”列为采行汉唐旧制、随时变通的三项之一，称“立行省，为全国行省制度的创始”。来源随即把制度条件与手工业联系起来：元代对手工业采取鼓励和保护政策，大一统条件下各地各类手工业得到较充分的汇集与交流，许多","path":"terms/xingsheng-zhidu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下元代地方行政制度的背景条目，与工艺生产的制度条件相关而非工艺本体。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xinshiqi-shidai","title":"新石器时代（Neolithic Period）","name_en":"Neolithic Period","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["磨制石器","农业","定居","制陶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"新石器时代是以使用磨制石器为标志的石器时代最后阶段，约从距今 1 万至 8 千年开始，结束于距今 5000 至 2000 多年不等；出现农业、牧业、定居村落和制陶。田自秉以磨制石器的工艺特征定义该时代：把经过选择的石头打成石斧、石刀、石锛、石铲、石凿，并磨光、钻孔、装柄或穿绳。","path":"terms/xinshiqi-shidai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"新石器时代是 B 维度下的考古分期框架，用于安放农业、聚落与制陶材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xipi","title":"犀皮（Xipi (Marbled Lacquer)）","name_en":"Xipi (Marbled Lacquer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["斑纹漆","六朝","宋代","虎皮漆","菠萝漆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"犀皮是以多层色漆形成凹凸漆层、打磨后显出斑纹的漆器品种。田自秉记其做法：先用稠厚色漆在器胎上涂出凹凸不平漆层，干后用对比鲜明的色漆分层涂，最后用磨炭打磨，因漆层高度不同显出片云、圆花、松鳞等斑纹；实为六朝斑漆的发展，俗称虎皮漆或菠萝漆，宋时有犀皮行专门生产、成本低廉。高丰记安徽马鞍山东吴朱然墓出土的一对犀皮鎏金铜扣漆耳杯，为迄今所发现最早的犀皮实物。","path":"terms/xipi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"犀皮是 B 维度下斑纹漆器工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xishiqi","title":"细石器（Microlith）","name_en":"Microlith","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器晚期","峙峪文化","下川文化","复合工具","镶嵌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"细石器是旧石器晚期器形普遍变小的石器类型，造型设计趋于多样化和复杂化。山西朔县峙峪文化属细石器初期（距今 28135±1330 年），发现石箭头、钺形小石刀等复合工具；山西沁水下川文化（距今 23900 年）出土上万件石制品，细石器镶嵌在木棍上使用。","path":"terms/xishiqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"细石器是 B 维度下旧石器晚期石器类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xu-vessel","title":"盨（Xu (Xu Food Vessel)）","name_en":"Xu Food Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛食器","西周","兽耳","圈足"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"盨是西周后新增的青铜盛食器，与簠同类。2016 册记其形状方中带圆而似椭圆形，两旁有兽耳或附耳，下为圈足或四足，有盖；原文器名作“盞（xǔ）”，据读音与器类当为「盨」。","path":"terms/xu-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西周青铜盛食器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuan-zhi","title":"宣纸（Xuan Paper）","name_en":"Xuan Paper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","明清","安徽泾县","宣州","青檀皮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宣纸是宋代具有区域特色的纸张之一，与蜀纸、越纸并称；明清时期与湖笔、徽墨、歙砚并列为文房四宝名品。赵农记其产地在安徽泾县，泾县为宣州府辖，宣纸因此得名；属皮纸类，主要原料是榆科类青檀皮。宣纸因配料分为绵料、净皮、特净，因厚度分为夹宣、单宣，因工序分为生宣、熟宣、笺纸。同书另记五代南唐李煜汲取四川造纸技术改进宣纸技术，用楮皮制成澄心堂纸。","path":"terms/xuan-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宣纸是 B 维度下造纸材料与工艺的条目：产地、原料、分类与明清书画用途在此汇合。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuanzi-caihua","title":"旋子彩画（Xuanzi Caihua (Xuanzi Architectural Painting)）","name_en":"Xuanzi Caihua (Xuanzi Architectural Painting)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","建筑","彩画","旋子彩画","漩涡团花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architectural_painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"旋子彩画是清代建筑彩画北派三类之一。藻头均用漩涡团花一个或一个半，多用「碾玉装」，以金、黄、朱红、白粉、墨色勾边，边线凸起；有「金琢黑石碾玉」「雄黄碾玉」等 7 种。枋心主纹有升龙、降龙、夔、花鸟等图案。","path":"terms/xuanzi-caihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"旋子彩画是 B 维度下清代官式建筑彩画的条目，其纹样与用色属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuejiagang-wenhua","title":"薛家岗文化（Xuejiagang Wenhua (Xuejiagang Culture)）","name_en":"Xuejiagang Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器晚期","薛家岗","七孔石刀","穿孔技术","砍杀长兵器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"薛家岗文化是距今约 5500 年的新石器时代晚期文化，因安徽潜山薛家岗遗址得名。2016 册以 1980 年出土的七孔石刀为该文化代表性器物，并据形制推测其为装柄的砍杀长兵器。","path":"terms/xuejiagang-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下新石器晚期石器文化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xueju","title":"穴居（Xueju (Cave Dwelling)）","name_en":"Cave Dwelling","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["原始居住","天然洞穴","半地穴式","仰韶文化","庙底沟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"穴居是原始居住形式之一，指以天然洞穴为栖身之处，并逐步过渡到半地穴式房屋。2016 册引《礼记·礼运篇》“冬则居管窑”，记黄河流域仰韶文化遗址中大量半地穴式泥木房屋的构造。","path":"terms/xueju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下原始居住形态的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yan-steamer","title":"甗（Yan (Yan Steamer)）","name_en":"Yan Steamer","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","煮食器","蒸锅","甑","鬲"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"甗是青铜煮食器，功能与蒸锅相似。2016 册记其由上部甑与下部鬲结合而成，中间隔以穿孔铜片，有方、圆两种，流行于商周至春秋，春秋时出现上下分铸的形制。","path":"terms/yan-steamer.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜炊器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yangshao-culture","title":"仰韶文化（Yangshao Culture）","name_en":"Yangshao Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","彩陶","黄河中游","考古学文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"仰韶文化是中国新石器时代黄河中游的核心考古学文化，因 1921 年发现于河南渑池仰韶村而得名，以彩陶为标志性器物。六册来源都用它作为彩陶工艺、聚落建筑与早期造物观念的类型学基准。名称层面存在一个需要辨析的问题：六册中有来源把\"仰韶文化\"与\"彩陶\"直接等同，另一来源则分设两条并给出独立的年代与分布。","path":"terms/yangshao-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"仰韶文化是 B 维度下黄河中游新石器时代彩陶工艺与聚落形态的类型学锚点，同时是'彩陶文化'这一旧称的所指。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yanju-fu","title":"燕居服（Yanju Fu (Dwelling Robe)）","name_en":"Yanju Fu (Dwelling Robe)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","常服","燕居服","服色","明黄色"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋代男子闲居常服。2016 册记宋代男子常服时称“燕居服”（即闲居服饰），宋官与平民百姓的燕居服形式上没有太大区别，只是在用色上有较为明显的规定和限制；其依据是自隋代开始的帝王统用明黄色制衣、官宦不得乱用。来源又记宋朝廷内赐佩金银鱼袋的公服以紫、绯色原料制作，故一般低级官吏不得乱用，只可服用黑白两种服色。同节另记宋代平民百姓的服饰大多是短衣、紧腿、缚鞋、褐布，便于劳作；其他工商各行均有特定服饰，素","path":"terms/yanju-fu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代男子常服的条目，其服色等级与行业服饰规定牵涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yaobian","title":"窑变（Kiln Transmutation）","name_en":"Kiln Transmutation","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["钧窑","铜红","还原焰","紫红斑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"窑变是钧瓷釉中铜元素经还原焰烧制呈现绿或紫红斑，在青釉上打破一色釉的单调、形成对比妍丽效果；最初可能偶然形成，后在实践中认识规律、人工安排达到预期效果。2016 记钧窑烧制过程中因配料掺入铜的气化物（原文如此）而产生釉色变化，使红、蓝、青、白、紫交相融汇、灿若云霞，称此为我国制瓷史上的一大发明。","path":"terms/yaobian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"窑变是 B 维度下钧窑呈色工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yaoyuan-deng","title":"腰圆凳（Yaoyuan Deng (Waist-Round Stool)）","name_en":"Yaoyuan Deng (Waist-Round Stool)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","家具","凳","腰圆","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"腰圆形的唐代坐凳。2016 册唐代家具正文列几、案、挟轼、箱、柜、胡床、屏风以及晚期出现的桌椅，未单列腰圆凳；腰圆凳只出现在图 6-36 的图注“唐代 壶门案、腰圆凳”中。因此本条只能确认：来源把腰圆凳作为唐代家具的图例之一，与壶门案同图；不能确认其座面尺寸、腿式、有无托泥与使用场合。图版未视觉核验，本条不据图像下判断。","path":"terms/yaoyuan-deng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代家具器形的条目，证据仅及图注。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yi-pourer","title":"匜（Yi (Pouring Vessel)）","name_en":"Yi (Pouring Vessel)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","水器","沃盥之礼","青铜器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"匜是周代新增的水器、注水器皿，形如瓢，四足一鋬、有流，后由有足变无足；最早似由觥演变，常与盘组合用于沃盥之礼。2016 记其器身长椭圆形，前有流、后有鋬，少量带盖，西周多为四足，至春秋出现三足或无足且数量大增。","path":"terms/yi-pourer.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"匜是 B 维度下周代青铜水器的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yi-vessel","title":"彝（Yi (Yi Ritual Vessel)）","name_en":"Yi Ritual Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","方彝","祭器","扉棱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彝是青铜礼器，与尊同为祭奠用器，鸟兽尊也以彝相称。2016 册另记方彝为盛酒器，商代与西周较多，西周中期以后少见，形制为高方身、带盖、盖似大屋顶、顶部有钮、器身多带扉棱。","path":"terms/yi-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜礼器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yichi-sanshan","title":"一池三山（Yichi Sanshan (One Pond, Three Mountains)）","name_en":"Yichi Sanshan (One Pond, Three Mountains)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","皇家园林","一池三山","蓬莱","方丈"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden_layout","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"皇家园林中一池象征大海、池中设三座仙山的布局范式。2016 册记秦始皇上林苑开一池三山之滥觞，引《三秦记》“作长池，引渭水，筑土为蓬莱山”；汉武帝修复并扩大上林苑，建章宫太液池中设蓬莱、方丈、瀛洲三岛，又称“一池三岛”。来源称这一布局模仿海上仙山，是秦汉园林设计的重要主题。","path":"terms/yichi-sanshan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下秦汉皇家园林布局的条目，其神仙思想另涉 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yingqing","title":"影青（Yingqing (Qingbai Ware)）","name_en":"Yingqing (Qingbai Ware)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","北宋","景德镇","青白瓷","映青"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"影青是宋代盛行的青白釉瓷，特征是釉厚处或花纹凹线处微呈淡青色，又称“映青”“隐青”“罩青”；烧造地点遍及江西、福建、广东、广西、安徽、浙江、云南，景德镇影青为代表作品。因胎质白薄、透光玉润而有「假玉」之说；宋代景德镇吸收定窑方法，在青白釉下刻画花卉纹饰，形成「影青刻花」。\n\n夏燕靖 2016 补出更完整的品名与断代：影青又称映青瓷，前身是青白瓷，又称「色白花青」；该瓷是北宋中期景德镇所独创，釉色青","path":"terms/yingqing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"影青是 B 维度下宋代青白瓷类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yishu-sheji","title":"艺术设计（Art Design）","name_en":"Art Design","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["1980年代","现代设计","1998","学科目录"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_discipline","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"艺术设计是中国真正的现代设计运动在 1980 年以后逐步形成的学科与行业概念。文化思想解禁、现代主义文艺引进使设计运动及成就引起设计家重视，人们对住宅、服饰、家具、电器等生活用品的需求从外观装饰转向功能要求；1998 年教育部高等教育专业目录以“艺术设计”替代“工艺美术”。夏燕靖另把艺术设计界定为“人类有意识的、用艺术创造力所体现的造物活动”。","path":"terms/yishu-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"艺术设计是 D 维度下现代设计学科名称与教育体制的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yisilan-wenhua","title":"伊斯兰文化（Yisilan Wenhua (Islamic Culture)）","name_en":"Yisilan Wenhua (Islamic Culture)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","元代","明代","伊斯兰","釉彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cultural_influence","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2016 册所论唐代起影响中国设计的西域文化因素。来源的总判断是：伊斯兰文化自唐代开始对我国设计产生较大影响，主要在釉彩工艺、金银工艺、纺织工艺、建筑工艺，以及各类装饰艺术领域中留下持久的痕迹。论证分三支：其一，将青瓷与同时代伊斯兰釉彩器比较，认为釉料配制上存在联系；我国传统高温釉彩经1250℃以上焙烧颜色不甚鲜艳，而伊斯兰釉彩呈色鲜艳丰富，故学界公认高温釉彩中釉色鲜艳者可能受伊斯兰釉彩工艺影响。","path":"terms/yisilan-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 E 维度下跨文化工艺影响的条目，其釉彩、钴料与纹样机制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yiyi","title":"祎衣（Yiyi (Empress's Ceremonial Robe)）","name_en":"Yiyi (Empress's Ceremonial Robe)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","服饰","祎衣","皇后","命妇"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"祎衣是明代皇后及命妇在受册、朝会时所穿的礼服。2016 册记皇后冠服「冠上饰九龙四凤」，穿祎衣，配素纱中单、玉革带与青色加金饰的袜、舄；同段并记皇帝衮冕与皇后常服。","path":"terms/yiyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"祎衣是 B 维度下明代皇后礼服的条目，其冠服制度属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:you-vessel","title":"卣（You (You Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"You Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","秬鬯","提梁","鸮卣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"卣是青铜盛酒器，专盛高级酒类。2016 册引青铜铭文“秬鬯一卣”，记其形制多为圆或椭圆形口、深腹、圈足、有盖和提梁，基本形体源于瓜瓢，殷商长颈、晚商短颈椭圆，西周中期以后少见。","path":"terms/you-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜盛酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:youlihong-ci","title":"釉里红瓷（Underglaze Red Porcelain）","name_en":"Underglaze Red Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["铜红","高温还原焰","景德镇","元代","青花釉里红"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"釉里红瓷以铜红料为呈色剂，在瓷胎上彩绘后施透明釉，于窑中经 1300℃ 左右高温一次烧成的釉下彩瓷器。其烧造工艺源于唐代长沙窑，元代江西景德镇烧造出釉里红瓷并创制青花釉里红。元代釉里红有线条描绘、拔白、涂绘三种装饰特征，后两种能减少飞红现象，形成期应早于线绘。","path":"terms/youlihong-ci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"釉里红瓷是 B 维度下元代釉下彩瓷的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:youlihong","title":"釉里红（Underglaze Red）","name_en":"Underglaze Red","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","明代","景德镇","铜红","釉下彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"釉里红是以铜红料在瓷胎上绘纹、施透明釉后高温还原焰一次烧成的釉下彩瓷，元代景德镇烧造成功。六册均有直接记载。来源对它的**工艺来源**给出三种互不相同的说法（唐代长沙窑／钧瓷紫红釉／元代景德镇创烧），对元代产品的**质量评价**亦正反并存。本 KU 并列，不裁定。","path":"terms/youlihong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"釉里红是 B 维度下元代景德镇铜红釉下彩的品种条目，其白底红彩的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:youshang-cai","title":"釉上彩（Overglaze Decoration）","name_en":"Overglaze Decoration","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["红炉","低温彩烧","五彩","粉彩","珐琅彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"釉上彩是在已烧成的瓷器釉面上用彩料绘饰，再经 750～860℃ 红炉彩烧的装饰品种。烤烧温度不高，可用色料很多、色彩丰富，但画面在釉上，使用中摩擦、接触酸碱后易褪损变色。釉上彩包括红彩、红绿彩、五彩、粉彩、珐琅彩、墨彩、广彩、新彩等。","path":"terms/youshang-cai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"釉上彩是 B 维度下瓷器彩饰工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yu-basin","title":"盂（Yu (Yu Basin)）","name_en":"Yu Basin","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛水器","附耳","方盂","圆盂"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"盂是青铜盛水器，形制为圆腹、侈口、圈足、深腹、有附耳，主要见于商和西周，除圆形外还有方盂。","path":"terms/yu-basin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜水器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yu-dai","title":"鱼袋（Fish Tally Bag）","name_en":"Fish Tally Bag","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","官服","章服","佩鱼","品级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"official_accessory","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鱼袋是宋代官服配饰。北宋初年沿袭唐朝章服佩鱼遗制；有资格穿紫、绯色公服的官员都须在腰间佩挂“鱼袋”，袋内装有金、银、铜制成的鱼，以区别官品。此制仅用于官服中的礼服，一般人很少穿着。","path":"terms/yu-dai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鱼袋是 D 维度下宋代官服配饰制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuan-dai-jianzhu-caihua","title":"元代建筑彩画（Yuan Dai Jianzhu Caihua (Yuan Dynasty Architectural Painting)）","name_en":"Yuan Dai Jianzhu Caihua (Yuan Dynasty Architectural Painting)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","建筑","彩画","拐子纹","直棂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architectural_painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代建筑彩画是元代梁枋等建筑构件的彩绘装饰。2016 册记其留存至今较少，只能从永乐宫壁画分析其绘制手法：仍大量运用唐宋以来的图案形式，梁枋上彩画图案连续转折、难分彼此，反映中原传统纹样在整体上的统一性；纹样结构以拐子纹、直棂、菱花、几何纹为主，表现手法吸取唐宋织锦纹彩或民间印花纹饰的造型特点，注重赋色的层叠丰厚与线条勾勒的层次。","path":"terms/yuan-dai-jianzhu-caihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"元代建筑彩画是 B 维度下元代建筑装饰做法的条目，其纹样形式属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuanling-paoshan","title":"圆领袍衫（Round-Collar Robe）","name_en":"Round-Collar Robe","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["隋唐","男子服饰","横襕","六合靴"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"圆领袍衫是隋唐男子的主要服装：小圆领、窄袖，袍长至膝下，齐膝处设横襕。腰系红鞏带，足登乌皮六合靴。从皇帝到官吏样式几乎相同，差别只在材料、颜色和皮带头的装饰。","path":"terms/yuanling-paoshan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"圆领袍衫是 B 维度下隋唐男子服饰形制的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuanmouren","title":"元谋人（Yuanmou Man）","name_en":"Yuanmou Man","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器时代早期","云南元谋","直立人","打制石器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hominin","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元谋人是我国发现最早的直立人，距今约 170 万年，1965 年发现于云南元谋县。1973 年在其化石层位发现 6 件石器，后增至 22 件，以石英、石英岩、砾石为原料，包括刮削器、尖状器、石片和石核，均为轻型工具，外貌简单、不规范。","path":"terms/yuanmouren.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"元谋人是 B 维度下中国旧石器时代早期人类与最早石器的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuanshi-fuzhuang","title":"原始服装（Yuanshi Fuzhuang (Prehistoric Clothing)）","name_en":"Prehistoric Clothing","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器","新石器","上衣下裳","衣其羽皮","骨针"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"原始服装指纺织品出现以前的衣着方式及其向成形衣服的过渡。2016 册记人类最初以动物羽毛、兽皮遮身御寒，夏天用树叶或野草披身；新石器时代中晚期开始有纺织衣料，黄帝、尧、舜时代有成形的衣服，服装形式定形为上衣下裳。","path":"terms/yuanshi-fuzhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下服饰起源与上衣下裳形制的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuanshi-nongju","title":"原始农具（Yuanshi Nongju (Prehistoric Farm Tools)）","name_en":"Prehistoric Farm Tools","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["原始农业","农具","石骨蚌木","良渚文化","农耕收割加工"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"原始农具是原始农业所用器具的总称。2016 册记原始农业为粗放式生产，农具材料以石、骨、蚌、木为主，按用途分为农耕、收割和加工三类，良渚文化遗址发现石犁、石镰、石刀等成套农具。","path":"terms/yuanshi-nongju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下原始农业器具总类的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuefenpai","title":"月份牌（Yuefenpai Calendar Poster）","name_en":"Yuefenpai Calendar Poster","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["上海","商业广告","水彩","石印","郑曼陀"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"advertising_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"月份牌是把中国传统农历本形式与商业广告相结合、把传统木版年画与西方水彩技法相结合而形成的广告形式。最早产生于 19 世纪末的上海，流行于 20 世纪上半叶；最早标有“月份牌”字样者为 1896 年上海鸿福来票行随彩票赠送的《沪景开彩图》，二三十年代达到鼎盛。","path":"terms/yuefenpai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"月份牌是 C 维度下近代商业广告形式的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuexiu","title":"粤绣（Yue Embroidery）","name_en":"Yue Embroidery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["广东","潮州","百鸟","马尾缀绣","广绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"粤绣是广东刺绣，花纹繁缛、喜用百鸟鸡、色彩浓艳对比强烈，用马尾于轮廓缀绣并绣“间道风”飞白花纹，富有广东地方特色；潮州刺绣别称潮绣，另有高绣与金线勾边特点。洋人称从广州工部购得的货物为“广货”，对刺绣也称“广绣”或“粤绣”。","path":"terms/yuexiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"粤绣是 B 维度下地方刺绣工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuhuchun-ping","title":"玉壶春瓶（Yuhuchun Vase）","name_en":"Yuhuchun Vase","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","元代","喇叭口","长颈","圈足"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玉壶春瓶是宋代典型瓷瓶造型，口部外斜、长颈削肩、鼓腹圆足；2016 记其为元代最有特色的瓶式，口部呈喇叭形，颈部修长，腹圆圈足，稳重优美，其他各种瓶类大多由玉壶春为基本形态变化而成，如蒜头瓶、凤尾瓶等。","path":"terms/yuhuchun-ping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"玉壶春瓶是 B 维度下宋元瓷瓶造型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuqixingzu-taoding","title":"鱼鳍形足陶鼎（Yuqixingzu Taoding (Fish-Fin-Leg Pottery Ding)）","name_en":"Fish-Fin-Leg Pottery Ding","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["良渚文化","陶鼎","鱼鳍形足","仿生造型","黑皮陶"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鱼鳍形足陶鼎是良渚文化的代表性陶鼎，以鱼鳍形鼎足得名。2016 册称其具有代表性并显示南方地方色彩，并与水鸟形陶壶一起被视为模拟自然形态、按生活需要造型的例证。","path":"terms/yuqixingzu-taoding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下良渚文化陶鼎器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zaju-chuishao-fu","title":"杂裾垂髾服（Zaju Chuishao Fu (Layered Skirt Robe)）","name_en":"Zaju Chuishao Fu (Layered Skirt Robe)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","女服","深衣","杂裾垂髾","纤髯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"魏晋南北朝女服中由深衣下摆尖角加长、去曳地长带形成的样式。2016 册记深衣至晋有“纤髯”之美称，下摆三角形上宽下尖、层层相叠为“髯”，围裳中伸出的长带为“纤”，行走时如燕飞舞，称“华带飞髯”；南北朝时去曳地长带，尖角加长，形成“杂裾垂髯”。来源同段记同期女装衫、袄、襦、裙宽博，褒衣博带，条纹间色裙与帔子流行，北魏则左衽窄袖。","path":"terms/zaju-chuishao-fu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝女服的条目，其服制等级另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhao-tie","title":"招贴（Poster）","name_en":"Poster","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","广告","年画","四美图","宣传画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"advertising_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"招贴是一种海报形式，与广告关系密切，分商业类、文化类、政治类、风俗类等，渐渐成为极具独立价值的设计形式。赵农记招贴在宋代已经出现，应为年画性质的文化广告，以《四美图》为著名例证；宋代主要的广告形式即招贴广告，包括店堂门脸匾额、布幌子与悬挂菜单。20 世纪中国因政治、经济活动的不同需要，招贴形成此起彼伏的浪潮。","path":"terms/zhao-tie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"招贴是 C 维度下广告形式的条目：宋代年画性文化广告与 20 世纪分类体系在此汇合。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhi-vessel","title":"觯（Zhi (Zhi Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Zhi Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","饮酒器","五爵","小瓶形","方柱形觯"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"觯是青铜饮酒器，形制为圆腹、侈口束颈鼓腹、圈足、有盖，整器似一小瓶。2016 册记其始见于商，西周时发现方柱形觯，于西周晚期绝迹；原文“解始见于商”的“解”当为“觯”。","path":"terms/zhi-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜饮酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhijin-yin","title":"织金银（Zhijin Yinyin (Brocade with Gold and Silver Threads)）","name_en":"Zhijin Yinyin (Brocade with Gold and Silver Threads)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","锦缎","织金银","金线","银线"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"织金银是明代锦缎三大类中的第三类：在缎地上用金线或银线织出花纹的锦缎。2016 册与妆花、本色花（库缎）并列，作为明代丝织品种分类的第三类，未展开金线制法、织物组织与用途。","path":"terms/zhijin-yin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"织金银是 B 维度下明代锦缎品种的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhijin","title":"织锦（Zhijin (Brocade)）","name_en":"Zhijin (Brocade)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["丝织","织锦","蜀锦","宋锦","云锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"织锦是丝织品中的精品，为我国传统工艺之一。2016 册记民国年间四川的蜀锦、苏州的宋锦、南京的云锦仍保持着传统的势头，流传极盛。同段交代丝织工艺仍以苏州、杭州、四川、福建、广东以及南京等地为主要产区，保持明清以后南方为中心的特点；并由织锦带出苏州缂丝的新面貌，称缂丝又名刻丝、与织锦不同，可根据需要投梭挖花，制作山水、花鸟、人物等各种图像，在丝织工艺中具有极强的艺术观赏价值。","path":"terms/zhijin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"织锦是 B 维度下丝织品类的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhinan-che","title":"指南车（South-pointing Chariot）","name_en":"South-pointing Chariot","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","魏晋南北朝","宋代","制车","机械设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"指南车是汉代以来屡次研制、屡次失传又屡次重造的指向机械车，又称司南车。四册的关注点各不相同：**夏燕靖两版给装置原理与李约瑟的评断**（联合运用车轮、滑轮、各种齿轮和绳索；人类历史上第一架有共协稳定的机械），**赵农给机械原理与宋代燕肃的复原形制**（引《宋史·舆服志》），**李立新给历代复制的失败谱系**（《宋书·礼志》周公始作，张衡再造，马钧恢复，令狐生再造，祖冲之复制）。**四册在“指南车与","path":"terms/zhinan-che.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"指南车是 B 维度下机械制车类型的条目：指向原理、历代重造谱系与宋代复原形制都在此汇合。“官府制车业”一侧归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhisun-fu","title":"质孙服（Zhisun Robe）","name_en":"Zhisun Robe","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","官服","一色衣","蒙古","等级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"质孙服是元代官服，汉语称“一色衣”，为较短的长袍，较紧较窄，腰部多衣褶，便于骑马上下。1321 年元英宗参照古制制定为上衣连下裳、上紧下短，腰间加襞积、肩背挂大珠。冬服 11 等、夏服 15 等，含衣帽带靴，仅皇帝即位、寿诞、册立、朝会等场合穿用；它是糅合汉族与蒙古民族特点的服制。","path":"terms/zhisun-fu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"质孙服是 D 维度下元代官服制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongguo-donghua-xuepai","title":"中国动画学派（Zhongguo Donghua Xuepai (Chinese Animation School)）","name_en":"Zhongguo Donghua Xuepai (Chinese Animation School)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["动画","上海美术电影制片厂","1957-1965","中国动画学派","大闹天宫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"style_school","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国动画学派是 2016 册所记 1957—1965 年我国动画片第一个繁荣时期形成的创作群体与风格。来源称 1957 年上海美术电影制片厂建立，拍摄了不少动画影片在国际电影节上获奖，成为被世界公认的“中国动画学派”。这一时期生产出《大闹天宫》（上、下集），成为经典作品；1961 年第一部水墨动画片《小蝌蚪找妈妈》诞生，为动画影坛增添了最能代表中国风格的新片种；1963 年拍摄的水墨动画片《牧笛》","path":"terms/zhongguo-donghua-xuepai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国动画学派是 C 维度下现代影视动画风格的条目，其国际获奖与影响属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongguo-gongyi-meishu-dashi","title":"中国工艺美术大师（Zhongguo Gongyi Meishu Dashi (Master of Chinese Arts and Crafts)）","name_en":"Zhongguo Gongyi Meishu Dashi (Master of Chinese Arts and Crafts)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["工艺美术","大师评审","传统工艺美术保护条例","2006","第五届"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"honor_title","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国工艺美术大师是依据《传统工艺美术保护条例》评审产生的国家级工艺美术人才称号。2016 册记根据《条例》规定，2006 年经国务院批准，国家发展和改革委员会会同国家民委、监察部、民政部、财政部、人事部、国土资源部、文化部、国资委组成第五届中国工艺美术大师评审工作领导小组，本着客观公正、公平公开、科学规范的原则，组织专家评审产生了 161 名新一届中国工艺美术大师。来源称这次评审激发了传统工艺美术","path":"terms/zhongguo-gongyi-meishu-dashi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国工艺美术大师是 D 维度下当代工艺美术人才制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongguo-gudai-leishu","title":"类书（Leishu (Leishu (Encyclopedic Compendium))）","name_en":"Leishu (Encyclopedic Compendium)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["类书","设计史料","艺文类聚","太平御览","古今图书集成"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"类书是按类编排、分类辑录文献的古代工具书。2016 册在说明中国设计史料的来源时指出，数千年来中国文化典籍中的类书记载条目数千；若按传统学科分类法，设计当属“技艺”与“营造”诸门类。来源以唐《艺文类聚》、宋《太平御览》、清《古今图书集成》为例，说明设计史料在类书中的分布。","path":"terms/zhongguo-gudai-leishu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下设计史料文献类型的条目，说明设计知识在传统类书中的分布方式。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongguo-guyou-shi-jianzhu","title":"中国固有式建筑（Chinese Inherent-Style Architecture）","name_en":"Chinese Inherent-Style Architecture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["20世纪二三十年代","民族形式","折中主义","上海"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国固有式建筑是五四运动以来伴随反帝爱国情绪和民族意识高涨而发展起来的建筑形式，主要建于 20 世纪二三十年代。它并非纯传统的“宫室式”，而是受西方建筑思潮强烈影响、近于折衷主义的新形式；《上海市市中心区域规划》明确规定市府新屋应用中国式建筑。","path":"terms/zhongguo-guyou-shi-jianzhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国固有式建筑是 B 维度下近代民族形式建筑的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongshanzhuang","title":"中山装（Zhongshan Suit）","name_en":"Zhongshan Suit","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["民国","孙中山","礼服","五权分立","四口袋"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中山装是由孙中山亲自设计并带头穿着的男装，被誉为“中山国服”，1912 年民国政府通令定为礼服。其形制以日本陆军士官服装和南洋华侨的“企领文装”为参照，直翻领、四口袋、前襟五纽、袖口三纽；相传最初制作者为上海南京路“荣昌祥呢绒西服店”裁缝王才运。","path":"terms/zhongshanzhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中山装是 D 维度下民国服制改革与政治象征设计的代表条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongshiqi-shidai","title":"中石器时代（Zhongshiqi Shidai (Mesolithic Period)）","name_en":"Mesolithic Period","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["中石器时代","细石器","渔猎采集","黄河流域","过渡阶段"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中石器时代是旧石器时代与新石器时代之间的过渡阶段，约距今 1.5 万—1 万年，以石片石器和细石器为代表工具。2016 册强调其特征是渔猎与采集经济、尚未出现农业，并认为黄河流域自中石器时代起成为远古文化发展的中心。","path":"terms/zhongshiqi-shidai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下石器时代分期的过渡阶段条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongxi-hunheshi-jianzhu","title":"中西混合式建筑（Zhongxi Hunheshi Jianzhu (Sino-Western Hybrid Architecture)）","name_en":"Zhongxi Hunheshi Jianzhu (Sino-Western Hybrid Architecture)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清末民初","建筑类型","中西混合式","现代中国式"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中西混合式建筑是清末民初西方建筑样式和建筑技术传入后形成的建筑类型之一，又称现代中国式。2016 册称清末民初西方建筑样式和建筑技术开始传入我国，使几千年发展而来的传统建筑形式发生急剧变化，其间形成 3 种类型的建筑风格，即外来式建筑、中国固有式建筑及中西混合式建筑（又称现代中国式），而民初年间以前两种为多见。来源只列名，未给形制、实例与设计师。","path":"terms/zhongxi-hunheshi-jianzhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中西混合式建筑是 E 维度下近代跨文化建筑类型的条目，其建造技术属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhu-ding-xiang-wu","title":"铸鼎象物（Casting Ding to Image Things）","name_en":"Casting Ding to Image Things","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["左传","鼎","德行","造物观念","象征"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_concept","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“铸鼎象物”是《春秋左氏传》记载的当时流行造物观点，也可以说是指导器物制作的方法核心。当时人认为鼎的大小、轻重象征统治者的德行、地位，因而具有很强的精神作用。","path":"terms/zhu-ding-xiang-wu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铸鼎象物是 A 维度下先秦造物观念的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhuanghua","title":"妆花（Zhuanghua (Polychrome Brocade Weave)）","name_en":"Zhuanghua (Polychrome Brocade Weave)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","云锦","过管","挖花回纬","金宝地"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"妆花是明代锦缎三类之一，用许多不同色线织成的多彩丝织物，花纹色彩异常丰富、花纹一般较大，有“走马看妆花”之喻。它是云锦中最华美的一种，用“过管”方法边织边配色，彩色一般 6 或 9 色、多至 18 色，同一排花朵可出现完全不同色彩。","path":"terms/zhuanghua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"妆花是 B 维度下明代提花丝织工艺与品种的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhuangjin","title":"壮锦（Zhuang Brocade）","name_en":"Zhuang Brocade","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["壮族","广西","菱形几何","棉经丝纬"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"壮锦是广西壮族地区的民族民间织锦。装饰构成以菱形几何图案为骨架，以粗线条菊、梅等花卉作主题花填充，或用回纹、字纹、波纹作地纹，龙凤鸟作有规则的散点排列；色彩对比强烈，风格端庄大方又浓艳粗犷，用于衣裙、中被、背包、台布等。","path":"terms/zhuangjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"壮锦是 B 维度下少数民族织锦的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zikou-tiezu","title":"紫口铁足（Purple Mouth, Iron Foot）","name_en":"Purple Mouth, Iron Foot","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["哥窑","官窑","黑褐胎","边缘呈色"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"紫口铁足是宋代官窑、哥窑的特征之一：瓷胎呈黑褐色，器皿的足部和口沿因釉薄而露出铁褐色胎质，形成一条褐色的边。赵农记其为哥窑南宋官窑产品的样式。","path":"terms/zikou-tiezu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"紫口铁足是 B 维度下宋瓷外观特征的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zisha-tao","title":"紫砂陶（Zisha Pottery）","name_en":"Zisha Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宜兴","紫砂泥","不挂釉","茶具","顾景舟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"紫砂陶是宜兴窑的特色产品，原料紫砂泥色泽紫红，另有白泥、绿泥、大红泥；深藏岩层下，风化研磨制器，经 1000 多度烧成，不挂釉，以造型取胜，“方非一式，圆不一样”。多做茶具，紫砂壶有泡茶色纯、隔夜不馊、用久味永、泥色生辉的特点。","path":"terms/zisha-tao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"紫砂陶是 B 维度下宜兴陶器类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zu-ritual-vessel","title":"俎（Zu (Ritual Chopping Stand)）","name_en":"Zu (Ritual Chopping Stand)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["礼器","祭祀","家具雏形","商代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"俎是古代祭祀时切牲、陈牲的礼器。考古所见较早实物有辽宁义县商代青铜俎和河南安阳大司空村商代石俎；其整体造型已具有后世几、案、桌类家具的雏形。2016 记其历史最久，传说有虞氏时已有，为后世桌、案、几、椅、凳等家具奠定基础。","path":"terms/zu-ritual-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"俎是 B 维度下礼器—家具过渡形态的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zun-vessel","title":"尊（Zun (Zun Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Zun Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","鸟兽尊","圈足","祭器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"尊是青铜盛酒器，青铜铭文中常与彝统称整个青铜礼器。2016 册记其始见于商早期，一般为圆形、侈口、圈足，由陶尊演变而来；另有鸟兽形尊，以动物造型为体，背部开口有盖，是专用祭器。","path":"terms/zun-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜盛酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zuopu","title":"作铺（Zuopu (Tang Urban Workshop)）","name_en":"Zuopu (Tang Urban Workshop)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","城市手工业","作坊","行"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_system","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"作铺是唐代城市手工业作坊的称谓，如染行、织锦行、金银行、绢行等，规模相当大，大城市往往有一至两个以上行当。","path":"terms/zuopu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"作铺是 D 维度下唐代城市手工业组织条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zuosichou","title":"柞丝绸（Zuosichou (Tussah Silk (Shandong Silk))）","name_en":"Zuosichou (Tussah Silk (Shandong Silk))","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","山东","柞蚕","柞丝绸","山东绸"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明清时期山东蚕农掌握成熟柞蚕方法后所产的柞蚕丝织品，驰名中外，被称为「山东绸」。2016 册在明清纺织印染业段记：明代江南区域、珠江三角洲逐渐成为主要养蚕区，山东蚕农「甚至已掌握一套成熟的柞蚕方法」，柞丝绸由此得名；明末清初柞蚕放养又传到河南、陕西、云贵和辽东地区，进一步推广了养蚕织绸业。","path":"terms/zuosichou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"柞丝绸是 B 维度下明清山东柞蚕丝织品的条目，其产地传播与明清丝绸经济属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zuyongdiao","title":"租庸调（Zu-Yong-Diao Tax System）","name_en":"Zu-Yong-Diao Tax System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐初","均田制","绢绵","输庸代役"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tax_system","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"租庸调是唐初的租赋劳役制度，与均田制并行。每丁年纳绢 2 丈、绵 3 两，或麻布 2 丈 5 尺、麻 3 斤；唐创制“输庸代役”法以减轻民众负担。田自秉称其对经济发展起一定促进作用。","path":"terms/zuyongdiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"租庸调是 D 维度下唐代赋役制度与纺织生产的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:anle-gongzhu-yuqun","title":"安乐公主羽裙（Princess Anle's Feather Skirt）","name_en":"Princess Anle's Feather Skirt","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","安乐公主","羽裙","百鸟毛裙","服饰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐中宗李显幼女安乐公主的羽裙，见《旧唐书·五行志》与《朝野佥载》。原文记其“正看为一色，侧看为一色，目中为一色，影中为一色，百鸟之状，尽在裙中”，并记贵族纷纷效仿，“以至奇禽异鸟毛羽，采之殆尽”。女服段又以安乐公主所穿羽裙为例，与民间流行的石榴裙对举：一般百姓穿不起这种昂贵的百鸟毛裙，只能以颜色和式样取胜。","path":"works/anle-gongzhu-yuqun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代服饰的文献锚点，材料为史书转述两处。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:baici-tiehua-dou","title":"白瓷贴花豆（White Porcelain Dou with Applied Decoration）","name_en":"White Porcelain Dou with Applied Decoration","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","白瓷","贴花","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-8. 唐代 白瓷贴花豆”。图注所在的段落却属隋代“1）造型设计的特点”：原文先论隋代陶瓷的器形和装饰设计基本上与前代相似而仍有明显变化，以桥形耳和钮状耳较多、最富于特色，纹饰也增加了几何纹、弦纹、绳纹、双圈纹、联珠纹与莲瓣、忍冬、葵瓣、团花、宝相花、梅花、树叶等植物纹及龙纹、凤纹、蟠螭、象首等动物纹；随后记当时陶瓷的制作技术也有较大改进，洁白的胎体薄而细腻，护胎釉不仅可以掩盖胎体的细孔","path":"works/baici-tiehua-dou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代白瓷的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:baidum","title":"《白度母》唐卡（Thangka of White Tara）","name_en":"Thangka of White Tara","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","唐卡","白度母","藏族","宗教艺术"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"thangka","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐卡作品，图11-40 的图注为：11-40. 新中国 唐卡《白度母》。正文在 2005 年全国工艺美术产业统计一段末以（图11-38、11-39、11-40）并引三图，但该段只记企业与产值数据，未描述此唐卡；少数民族工艺品一段（L5243）只列织锦、地毯、花帽、蜡染等实用品，未及唐卡。原文未记尺寸、作者、绘制年代、产地与藏地。","path":"works/baidum.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国唐卡艺术的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:baolian-zaojing","title":"宝莲藻井（Lotus Caisson Ceiling at Binyang Cave）","name_en":"Lotus Caisson Ceiling at Binyang Cave","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","龙门石窟","宾阳洞","藻井","莲花纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cave_ceiling","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"洛阳龙门宾阳洞窟室装饰。原文在“石刻与纹饰设计”一节把北朝石窟造像与南朝陵墓石雕并论之后，特别提出与建筑浑然一体的浮雕纹饰设计，其中藻绘边饰以莲花、卷草纹样最为出色，举例即宾阳洞：窟顶中部藻井为一重瓣莲花，围绕流苏构成莲花宝盖。图5-29 图注作“魏晋南北朝 宝莲藻井”。","path":"works/baolian-zaojing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度北朝石窟装饰的器物锚点，材料为正文一句加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:beijing-olympic-poster-2008","title":"2008年北京奥运会海报（Poster for the 2008 Beijing Olympic Games）","name_en":"Poster for the 2008 Beijing Olympic Games","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["2008","北京奥运会","海报","广告设计"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"poster","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2008年北京奥运会海报，图11-44 图注作“新中国 2008 北京奥运会海报”。本条可用的材料只有这一行图注：原文在“广告设计信息语意传达”一段末以（图11-44）回指，但该段讲的是广告设计信息语意传达的一般过程与要素，未描述海报本身。原文未记设计者、尺寸、印制数量与系列构成。","path":"works/beijing-olympic-poster-2008.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度当代海报设计的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:beijing-zijincheng","title":"北京紫禁城（The Forbidden City in Beijing）","name_en":"The Forbidden City in Beijing","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明清","北京","紫禁城","宫殿","明史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palace_complex","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明清北京紫禁城，图9-35、9-36 所附为明故宫城址与皇城复原模型。原文以《明史·地理志》《明太祖实录》《明史·舆服志》引文梳理营建过程：洪武元年（1368）以应天府为南京而建都；吴元年（1367）新内城，正殿奉天殿，前为奉天门，后为华盖殿、谨身殿，左右文楼武楼，谨身殿之后为宫，前乾清宫、后坤宁宫；洪武八年改建大内宫殿，十年告成；永乐元年（1403）建北京于顺天府称行在，四年建成北京宫殿并修城垣","path":"works/beijing-zijincheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明清宫殿建筑的器物锚点，材料为《明史》等引文一段加图注两行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:beiyang-jiqiju-biaozhi","title":"北洋机器局标志（Beiyang Machinery Bureau Emblem）","name_en":"Beiyang Machinery Bureau Emblem","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","标志","北洋机器局","机构标识"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"logo","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北洋机器局标志，图10-2 图注作“民国 北洋机器局标志”。原文在“近现代史上的设计更新”一章开篇以（图10-1、10-2）统摄两图，正文只述近代工业与商业美术的转折，未描述标志本身。图注标“民国”，而北洋机器局为清末机构，图注年代与机构名称所指的时段需按原书核对。","path":"works/beiyang-jiqiju-biaozhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度近代机构标志的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:bronze-ewer","title":"宋代铜执壶（Song Bronze Ewer）","name_en":"Song Bronze Ewer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","铜器","执壶","山西襄汾","葫芦宝顶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_ewer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋代日用铜器。原文在“1）铜器工艺”一节先总述宋代的日用品铜器多为杯、盘、罐、壶、盒、炉之类，出土较有代表性的有杭州老和山宋墓、长沙宋墓、苏州虎丘云岩寺塔、山西忻县宋墓，以及1975年在山西襄汾县赵康镇东汾阳村陶罐内埋藏的几件铜器，特点表现出质朴的风格。随后举两件为例：其一是这把铜执壶，鼓肩收颈，细长的流插入成八棱的流座，把手精巧，与盖用活扣相连，壶的造型和瓷器执壶有共同之处，盖钮作葫芦宝顶形也和","path":"works/bronze-ewer.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代铜器的器物锚点，材料为正文一段形制描述加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:bronze-owl-zun","title":"铜鸮尊（Bronze Owl-Shaped Zun）","name_en":"Bronze Owl-Shaped Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["妇好墓","殷墟","青铜酒器","鸮形","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜鸮尊见于本册对殷墟妇好墓青铜器的评述：妇好墓出土 4 件以鸟兽浮雕和圆雕为主要装饰的酒器——铜鸮尊、偶方彝、圈足觥，标志着青铜工艺与设计达到新高峰。同段括注图为 2-6、2-7、2-8。原文未单列形制描述。","path":"works/bronze-owl-zun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度商代鸟兽形青铜酒器的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:budala-gong","title":"布达拉宫（Potala Palace）","name_en":"Potala Palace","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西藏","宫堡式建筑","藏族建筑","清代","政教合一"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palace_complex","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"布达拉宫在拉萨玛布日山（红山）上，是宫堡式建筑群。三册的用法很不对称：**夏燕靖两版给规模数字**（999 间、占地 41 万平方米、建筑面积 13 万平方米、主楼 13 层 115 米），**赵农给历史层累与形制构成**（原建、被毁、清初重建，白宫红宫，碉楼与住宅的融合），两者**在高度与结构表述上并不一致**。高丰一册只在唐代铜镜一节提到布达拉宫壁画中的“金城公主照容图”，是铜镜史证据而非建筑","path":"works/budala-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"布达拉宫是 B 维度下宫堡式建筑群的形制样本：碉楼与住宅形式的融合、白宫红宫的分区、石木与土木石两种结构表述都在此汇合。宫顶镏金铜瓦与金顶归 C 维度；五世达赖受册封后重建与政教合一中心地位归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:buniantu","title":"《步辇图》（Emperor Taizong Receiving the Tibetan Envoy）","name_en":"Emperor Taizong Receiving the Tibetan Envoy","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","阎立本","舆服","幞头袍衫","品色衣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代阎立本画作，图6-22。原文两处引用：男服“品色衣”段记唐代官员袍衫主要是以颜色来区别等级，据《旧唐书·舆服志》列出贞观四年（630）与高宗上元元年（674）两套规定，随后以《步辇图》为证——画中描绘吐蕃丞相禄东赞晋见唐太宗李世民的故事，汉族男子（包括太宗）都着幞头袍衫，只以颜色为别，可佐证上述记载。女服段又把《步辇图》与张萱《捣练图》、周昉《簪花仕女图》、顾闳中《韩熙载夜宴图》并列，说明可以","path":"works/buniantu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代服饰制度的图像锚点，材料为正文两处引用加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:caiqi-mudiao-dongwu-zuoping","title":"彩漆木雕动物座屏（Painted Lacquered Animal Screen）","name_en":"Painted Lacquered Animal Screen","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","江陵望山","透雕","楚漆器","50余动物"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_furniture","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彩漆木雕动物座屏是江陵望山出土的战国漆器，透雕和浮雕有蛇、鹿、凤、雀、蛙等 50 余个形态逼真的动物形象，周身以黑漆为底，彩绘朱红、金银、灰绿等漆色。它被用作战国漆器种类繁多、纹饰精细、色彩艳丽的代表，也是楚国髹漆业高超水平的例证。","path":"works/caiqi-mudiao-dongwu-zuoping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下战国楚国漆器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:caitao-tiaowen-hu","title":"彩陶条纹壶（Striped Painted Pottery Jar）","name_en":"Striped Painted Pottery Jar","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["仰韶文化","彩陶","图版著录","新石器时代"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painted_pottery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彩陶条纹壶在本册卷一出现于图版，图注为“1-10. 仰韶文化 彩陶条纹壶”。正文在仰韶文化彩陶一节讨论彩陶的纹样母题与器形系列，但没有对这一件作单独描述：器形、尺寸、出土单位、收藏地、条纹的排列方式均未交代。","path":"works/caitao-tiaowen-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新石器彩陶的图版锚点，材料只有一行图注。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:changxin-palace-lamp","title":"长信宫灯（Changxin Palace Lamp）","name_en":"Changxin Palace Lamp","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","青铜器","鎏金","环保设计","满城汉墓"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_lamp","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"长信宫灯是西汉青铜鎏金宫灯，1968 年出土于河北满城中山靖王刘胜之妻窦绾墓。五册来源都以它为中国古代灯具设计的代表作，强调其可拆卸清洗、可调节光照、以烟道净化烟气的结构设计。","path":"works/changxin-palace-lamp.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"长信宫灯是 B 维度下汉代青铜灯具结构与消烟设计的器物锚点，其整体造型的人物化处理也涉及 C 维度的形态表现问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chengkun-tielu","title":"《成昆铁路》象牙雕刻（Ivory Carving 'Chengdu-Kunming Railway'）","name_en":"Ivory Carving 'Chengdu-Kunming Railway","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1974","象牙雕刻","成昆铁路","联合国","国家礼品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ivory_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1974年制作的大型象牙雕刻《成昆铁路》。原文记 1974年5月由国务院下达设计和生产任务，制作大型艺术壁毯《长城》和大型象牙雕刻《成昆铁路》（高1.10米、长1.50米），作为国家礼品赠送联合国总部。原文未给该牙雕的图版（图11-32 图注只标壁毯），也未记设计者与制作单位。","path":"works/chengkun-tielu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国牙雕工艺的器物锚点，材料为正文一句。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:cimu-touzhu-tu","title":"慈母投杼图（Picture of a Mother Throwing the Shuttle）","name_en":"Picture of a Mother Throwing the Shuttle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","画像石","斜织机","踏板","纺织技术"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_relief","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《慈母投杼图》是本册论证脚踏提综斜织机普及的画像石证据。原文称在江苏泗洪曹庄出土的汉代画像石上刻有《慈母投杼图》，图上就有脚踏提综斜织机的机型，图中的织工用脚踏一长一短两块踏板（杆）分别带动综线；并据史籍记载，从战国开始直至秦汉之际，这种织机在我国黄河流域的广大地区已经比较普遍地使用。","path":"works/cimu-touzhu-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度汉代纺织机械的图像锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:cuo-jinyi-longfenglu-fangan","title":"错金银龙凤鹿方案（Gold- and Silver-Inlaid Dragon-Phoenix-Deer Stand）","name_en":"Gold- and Silver-Inlaid Dragon-Phoenix-Deer Stand","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","青铜器","家具","错金银","中山国"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_furniture","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"错金银龙凤鹿方案是战国中山王墓出土的青铜方案（案面为漆木，已朽），以四只卧鹿为足、四条有翼飞龙蟠曲成镂空球状、龙体空隙处各出一凤、每龙头顶一斗拱形饰件承托案框。四册对**结构**的描述高度一致，几乎可以逐句对应；分歧集中在三处：**出土年份**（1977／1997）、**尺寸**（长 47.5×高 36.2 与高 37.4×长宽 48 两套数字）、**案面材质**（高丰作“以青铜材料为主”而“可镶","path":"works/cuo-jinyi-longfenglu-fangan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"错金银龙凤鹿方案是 B 维度下战国青铜家具的结构锚点：以鹿为足、龙凤盘绕成镂空球、龙头承斗拱托案框，四册对结构的描述高度一致。其错金银工艺与造型装饰归 C；以斗拱承案框所反映的建筑与家具关系归 D（制度与技术传承）为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:cuojin-boshanlu","title":"错金博山炉（Gold-Inlaid Boshan Censer）","name_en":"Gold-Inlaid Boshan Censer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","满城汉墓","错金","博山","云气纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_censer","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"错金博山炉是河北满城汉墓（西汉中山靖王墓）出土的铜薰炉，炉柄镂空，炉体饰错金云气纹，造型庄重饱满、线条优美，是汉代博山炉的典型作品。李立新将其作为帝王贵族奢侈性造物消费的例证。","path":"works/cuojin-boshanlu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西汉铜薰炉的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:da-ke-ding","title":"大克鼎（Da Ke Ding）","name_en":"Da Ke Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","青铜鼎","兽蹄足","半球腹","毛公鼎"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_ding","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大克鼎是西周青铜鼎。2016 记其为西周后期鼎耳渐外移、口渐敞、下腹内收使器身成半球形、足成兽蹄形的代表器之一，与毛公鼎并举；田自秉仅以“插图 1 大克鼎（周）”图注形式收录，作为西周鼎形演变的示例。","path":"works/da-ke-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西周青铜鼎的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:da-nao-hua-shi","title":"《大闹画室》（Uproar in the Studio）","name_en":"Uproar in the Studio","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1926","万氏兄弟","动画","中国动画学派","默片"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"animation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1926年万氏兄弟绘制的动画片。原文在“我国动画影片的发展历史”知识链接中把我国动画影片分为6个发展时期：1922-1945年为萌芽和探索时期，以万籁鸣、万古蟾、万超尘为代表的我国第一代动画人，成为我国动画影片的开山鼻祖，万氏兄弟于1926年绘制动画片《大闹画室》为这一时期的代表作品。原文未记片长、出品机构、放映情况与图版。","path":"works/da-nao-hua-shi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度中国早期动画的影片锚点，材料为正文一段。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:da-nao-tian-gong","title":"《大闹天宫》（Uproar in Heaven）","name_en":"Uproar in Heaven","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1960年代","上海美术电影制片厂","动画","中国动画学派","经典作品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"animation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"动画长片《大闹天宫》（上、下集），图11-43 图注作“动画片《大闹天宫》”。原文记 1957-1965年是我国动画片第一个繁荣时期，1957年上海美术电影制片厂建立，拍摄了不少动画影片在国际电影节上获奖，成为被世界公认的“中国动画学派”，这一时期生产出的《大闹天宫》（上、下集）成为经典作品。原文未记完成年份、片长、主创名单与获奖明细。","path":"works/da-nao-tian-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度中国动画繁荣期的影片锚点，材料为正文一句加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:da-yu-ding","title":"大盂鼎（Da Yu Ding）","name_en":"Da Yu Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周早期","青铜器","康王","铭文","金文"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大盂鼎是西周康王时期铸作的有铭铜鼎，清道光年间出土于陕西郿县礼村，今陈列于中国历史博物馆。四册来源分工清楚：田自秉一册给出制作年代、出土、收藏、铭文结构与赏赐奴隶数；赵农两处以它为金文范本，给字数与文献价值，另有一处器影；夏燕靖两版只把它当作西周中期后鼎腹变浅、足跟外延这一形制趋势的代表器。**四册均未给尺寸、重量、纹饰与铸造方法**，铭文只给字数与大意，不录原文。来源之间另有一处时间张力：田自秉","path":"works/da-yu-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大盂鼎是 B 维度下西周早期有铭铜鼎的标本，四册对它的用法集中在两处：铭文（金文的字数、内容与文献价值，属 C 维度）与鼎形演变序列中的位置（属 B）。铭文所记“商亡由于百官沉溺于饮酒”“用德治为规范”涉及周初政治伦理，归 D 维度为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dabaoensi-liuli-ta","title":"大报恩寺琉璃塔（Porcelain Tower of Dabao'en Temple）","name_en":"Porcelain Tower of Dabao'en Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","南京","琉璃","佛塔","大报恩寺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明初南京大报恩寺九层琉璃塔，图9-29 为复原图。原文在琉璃烧造一节记明初在南京设琉璃窑72座，用于建造宫殿和大报恩寺九层琉璃塔，迁都北京后窑址移至门头沟琉璃渠村。知识链接“明大报恩寺”补充：永乐十年（1412）重建，寺址在南京中华门外东侧秦淮河畔长干里；寺内有殿阁20多座、画廊118处、经房38间；历时19年建造，耗银250万两，征调工役10多万人。塔为九层八面，高达78.2米，数十里外长江上也","path":"works/dabaoensi-liuli-ta.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代琉璃建筑的器物锚点，材料为正文一段、知识链接一段、另一节一句与图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:daiyuegui","title":"《戴月归》彩锦绣（Colored Silk Embroidery 'Returning Under the Moon'）","name_en":"Colored Silk Embroidery 'Returning Under the Moon","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","彩锦绣","南通","刺绣","戴月归"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"江苏彩锦绣作品，图11-36 的图注为：11-36. 新中国 江苏彩锦绣《戴月归》。原文在列江苏工艺美术品种时提到南通彩锦绣（L5230，该段并引图11-11、11-12、11-13），未单述此作；另在 1978 年全国工艺美术展览一段末以（图11-36、11-37）回指（L5407）。两处均未记这件作品本身，尺寸、作者、制作年代与藏地皆缺。","path":"works/daiyuegui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国刺绣工艺的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:daming-gong","title":"大明宫（Daming Palace）","name_en":"Daming Palace","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","长安","龙首原","含元殿","麟德殿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palace_complex","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大明宫是唐代长安城禁苑宫殿，位于城东北龙首原，原名永安宫，唐太宗时为太上皇李渊建造，高宗迁入执政。赵农记其原是太极宫的一处，后加修成大型宫殿，地处龙首原上，在唐高宗时加以扩建，成为后来唐朝历代帝王理朝和居住之处；含元殿为其前殿。2016 记遗址范围相当于北京故宫面积 3 倍多，由 30 多所宫殿组成，麟德殿面积约太和殿 3 倍、5000 多平方米、可宴 3500 人。","path":"works/daming-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代宫殿建筑的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:daolian-tu","title":"《捣练图》（Court Ladies Preparing Newly Woven Silk）","name_en":"Court Ladies Preparing Newly Woven Silk","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","张萱","风俗画","捣练","披帛"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代张萱风俗画，图注作“6-6. 唐代 风俗画《捣练图》(张萱作)”。原文三处引用：印染业段记宫中亦有染坊，“著名的张萱《捣练图》中描绘的就是专业捣练的操作情景”；女服段把《捣练图》与《步辇图》《簪花仕女图》《韩熙载夜宴图》并列，说明可以间接看出唐300年来裙子的变化；披帛段记“《捣练图》《宫乐图》等绘画作品中女子肩上均有披帛”，陶俑、唐三彩、墓室壁画、石刻画也能见到众多披帛样式。","path":"works/daolian-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代织造与服饰的图像锚点，材料为图注一行加正文三处引用。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dayan-ta-652","title":"大雁塔（Giant Wild Goose Pagoda）","name_en":"Giant Wild Goose Pagoda","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","佛塔","楼阁式砖塔","慈恩寺","玄奘"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大雁塔在西安大慈恩寺内，原名慈恩寺塔，唐永徽三年（652）为安置玄奘自印度带回的经籍而建。三册的用法分成两层：夏燕靖两版给**形制与尺寸**（初建五层土心、重建十层、武则天改为七层，塔基与塔身的分项尺度，明代包砖，两通褚遂良碑），赵农给**缘起与观感**（雁故事、玄奘生平、岑参诗、方形角锥与内部楼梯），另有图版两幅。**两版夏燕靖几乎逐字相同**，赵农与它们不冲突，但各给一部分细节，合起来才完整。","path":"works/dayan-ta-652.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大雁塔是 B 维度下唐代楼阁式砖塔的形制与结构样本：塔基塔身的尺寸、砖砌扁柱与大斗、明代包砖都在此汇合。塔基座南侧褚遂良书两碑与石门楣线刻画归 C 维度；慈恩寺与玄奘译经、皇家追念母后的建塔缘起归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dayunhe","title":"大运河（Grand Canal）","name_en":"Grand Canal","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋代","五大水系","扬州","漕运","人工河流"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"waterway_engineering","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大运河是隋炀帝开凿的水利交通工程，将海河、黄河、淮河、长江、钱塘江五大水系连结起来，促进了南北文化经济的交流和发展，是世界上最长的一条人工河流。隋代大运河开通后，扬州成为长江和大运河的交通枢纽；2016 称其“为南北沟通与经济繁荣开创了新的局面”。","path":"works/dayunhe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下隋代水利工程的器物锚点，也涉及 D 维度的漕运制度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dingxian-kaiyuansi-liaodi-pagoda","title":"定县开元寺瞭敌塔（Liaodi Pagoda, Kaiyuan Temple, Dingxian）","name_en":"Liaodi Pagoda, Kaiyuan Temple, Dingxian","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","砖石建筑","佛塔","84米","最高古建筑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"定县开元寺瞭敌塔高达 84 米，相当于一座 20 层的高楼，是现存我国古代最高的建筑物，属宋代砖石建筑中以佛塔最为突出的代表。","path":"works/dingxian-kaiyuansi-liaodi-pagoda.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代砖石佛塔的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dingyao-haier-zhen","title":"定窑孩儿枕（Ding Ware Boy Pillow）","name_en":"Ding Ware Boy Pillow","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","定窑","瓷枕","瓷塑","故宫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_pillow","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"定窑孩儿枕是宋代定窑瓷枕，故宫博物院所藏一件塑一卧着的小孩，神态天真活泼；原文称它既是一件生活用品，也是一件瓷塑珍品。赵农以图 7-45“宋 定窑孩儿枕”收录，并在定窑部分述及其刻花、划花、印花装饰与覆烧法。","path":"works/dingyao-haier-zhen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代定窑瓷枕的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dongfeng-sedan","title":"东风牌小轿车（Dongfeng Sedan）","name_en":"Dongfeng Sedan","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1958","长春","第一汽车制造厂","轿车","仿制与自行设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"automobile","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1958年5月5日，我国第一辆自己制造的小轿车在一汽诞生，牌名“东风”，图11-27。原文记 1957年5月一机部向长春一汽下达设计轿车的命令，样车设计在1957年11月开始；车身底盘参考法国希姆卡维迪蒂（Simca Vedetee）车型，发动机参考奔驰190，变速器为三档、属自行设计；没有零件时工程师到本溪钢铁厂的进口废钢中找适合的零件测绘，在卡车总装配车间用玻璃隔出场地，设计处4个昼夜绘出样车","path":"works/dongfeng-sedan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国轿车试制的器物锚点，材料为正文一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:donghan-qingci-gaozu-wan","title":"东汉青瓷高足碗（Eastern Han Celadon Bowl with High Foot）","name_en":"Eastern Han Celadon Bowl with High Foot","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","青瓷","瓷器起源","高足碗"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"东汉青瓷高足碗见本册图版 4-18，图注为“东汉 青瓷高足碗”。原文在瓷器一节称我国瓷器真正出现是在东汉时期，主要依据浙江绍兴上虞上浦小仙坛发现的东汉晚期瓷窑址和青瓷：瓷片质地细腻，釉面有光泽，胎釉结合紧密牢固，青瓷残片釉下已无残留石英，这种釉已摆脱原始青瓷的本性，符合真正瓷器的标准；早期青瓷的品种有壶、钟、罐、碗、洗、盘，还有五联罐、耳杯、唾壶等，这些瓷器往往挂釉不到底，有弦纹、波纹等简朴的装饰","path":"works/donghan-qingci-gaozu-wan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度瓷器起源的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:erlitou-long-spout-jue","title":"二里头青铜长流爵（Long-Spouted Bronze Jue from Erlitou）","name_en":"Long-Spouted Bronze Jue from Erlitou","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["二里头","青铜爵","商代早期","饮酒器","中国最早青铜器之争"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"二里头青铜长流爵是本册讨论中国青铜器起源时举出的两说之一。原文先述甘肃东乡林家村出土的马家窑文化青铜刀具（约公元前 3000 年）为“最早青铜器”一说，再述商代早期遗址出土较大型青铜器，即 1975 年偃师二里头遗址出土的这件长流爵。原文对它的形制与尺寸交代得比较具体。","path":"works/erlitou-long-spout-jue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度青铜器起源问题的器物锚点。原文把它放在“最早青铜器两说”的争点上，本条只记器物，不裁定哪一说成立。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fanchuan-tujing-cipan","title":"帆船图景瓷盘（Pair of Plates with Dutch East India Company Ship）","name_en":"Pair of Plates with Dutch East India Company Ship","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","乾隆","外销瓷","东印度公司","中西合璧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清乾隆后期外销瓷盘一对，图9-34 图注作“清代 帆船图景的中西合璧图案”。原文记其为上海博物馆揭幕的“海帆留踪——荷兰倪汉克捐赠明清贸易瓷展”展品，是中西合璧之作：盘壁图案是典型的中国传统纹样，上面画有青鱼、白鱼、鳜鱼各1条和3名手执莲花的童子，原文括注明清时期景德镇瓷器上常见有青、白、鲤、鳜4种鱼，象征士人标榜的清高气节；盘心所绘帆船是荷兰东印度公司的海船形式，当时的东印度公司就是用这样的帆船","path":"works/fanchuan-tujing-cipan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代外销瓷中西合璧纹样的器物锚点，材料为正文一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fengshou-longbing-hu","title":"凤首龙柄壶（Ewer with Phoenix Head and Dragon Handle）","name_en":"Ewer with Phoenix Head and Dragon Handle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","青瓷","越窑","凤首","龙柄"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-9. 唐代 凤首龙柄壶”。正文在青瓷一节的越窑段末，以（图6-9）系于“越窑的特点是胎骨较薄，施釉均匀，釉色青翠莹润，光彩照人”之后。前文记越窑窑址地处浙江、唐代称越州，是我国青瓷的发源地与主要产地，自商、周、战国、秦、汉至六朝烧制不断，被称为“诸窑之冠”；后文记唐代越窑几乎专供宫廷，由官府督造，是历代御器厂或官窑的前身，成品称秘色瓷。原文没有明言此壶即越窑产品，图注也只标“唐代”。","path":"works/fengshou-longbing-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代越窑青瓷的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行加越窑通说。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:flying-pigeon-bicycle","title":"飞鸽牌自行车（Flying Pigeon Bicycle）","name_en":"Flying Pigeon Bicycle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1950","天津","自行车","飞鸽","轻工业产品设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bicycle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"新中国第一代自行车，图11-10 的图注为：11-10. 新中国 天津“飞鸽”牌自行车标志和“飞鸽”牌第一代自行车。原文记该车于1950年4月开始研制，是天津自行车厂在开展“造新中国一代坚固、耐用、美观、轻快的自行车”活动中，由20多名工人和技术人员组成的试制组设计制造；设计时解剖分析了荷兰菲利浦、日本堀井和英国凤头等各国名牌车，取其所长、避其所短；技术人员用木板当图板，综合各方人士上百条建议制订","path":"works/flying-pigeon-bicycle.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国轻工业产品设计的器物锚点，材料为正文一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:foguang-si-dadian","title":"佛光寺大殿（Main Hall of Foguang Temple）","name_en":"Main Hall of Foguang Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","五台山","木构","斗拱","单檐庑殿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"timber_architecture","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"佛光寺大殿位于山西五台山，建于公元 857 年（唐宣宗大中十一年），面宽七间、进深四间，是以立柱、斗拱、梁枋等组成的梁柱式木结构典型建筑。整个建筑以榫卯衔接，严谨规范、稳定坚固；屋顶为单檐庑殿式，屋檐由斗拱挑撑、翼角上翘，殿内结构合理，宽敞明亮，朴素大方。","path":"works/foguang-si-dadian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代木构建筑的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fu-geng-zisun-gu","title":"父庚子孙觚（Gu Vessel Inscribed Fu Geng Zi Sun）","name_en":"Gu Vessel Inscribed Fu Geng Zi Sun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商","青铜觚","族徽铭文","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"父庚子孙觚见本册图版 2-12，图注为“商 父庚子孙觚”。原文未展开形制描述。器名含“父庚子孙”，属铭文内容进入器名的情形，本条照录器名，不对铭文作释读。","path":"works/fu-geng-zisun-gu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度商代饮酒器的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fuhao-jade-figure","title":"妇好墓玉雕人俑（Jade Figure from the Tomb of Fu Hao）","name_en":"Jade Figure from the Tomb of Fu Hao","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","妇好墓","玉雕","深衣","服饰史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_figure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"妇好墓玉雕人俑是本册讨论深衣起源与商代服饰的实物证据。原文论上衣下裳相连接一段的句首为“的基础上将上衣和下裳围裙连接起来”，其前被两行图版及图注 2-36 隔断，句首残缺，据文义当是“在此基础上…”；本条照录残句并标疑。该段称这种连接成为我国历代服装的基本特征，也是上衣下裳形制与冠服制度、服章制度逐步确立的时期；并称在商代妇好墓中发现的一件玉雕人物俑，可见到深衣服饰的样式，衣服上刻有清晰的龙纹和云","path":"works/fuhao-jade-figure.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度商代服饰史的实物锚点。原文用它支持深衣起源判断，本条只记材料，不裁定深衣成立年代。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:gao-yi-que","title":"高颐阙（Gaoyi Que (Pillar Gate)）","name_en":"Gaoyi Que (Pillar Gate)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","汉阙","石构建筑","汉代建筑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_architecture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"高颐阙见本册图版 4-28，图注为“东汉 高颐阙”。原文在汉代建筑一节称历史上的汉代建筑早已荡然无存，但现存的大量汉代建筑遗址，如汉阙等石结构建筑以及房基地下的建筑遗址仍可佐证；另外从墓葬遗存的陶楼看，汉代建筑以楼阁形式较为典型，一般由台基、门楼和五层楼阁组成，各层门窗、屋脊、栏杆等部位都饰有人物、花鸟等装饰纹样，楼阁与底部基座、栏杆、门楼浑然一体、结构严谨、装饰繁多。原文未单独描述高颐阙的形制与","path":"works/gao-yi-que.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度汉代建筑遗存的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:gaoyi-tu","title":"《高逸图》（Gao Yi Tu, Lofty Scholars）","name_en":"Gao Yi Tu (Lofty Scholars)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","孙位","家具","琴几","图像资料"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-35. 唐代 孙位《高逸图》中的琴几”。图注在唐代家具段末，与图6-36“唐代 壶门案、腰圆凳”、图6-37“唐代箱”同被（图6-35、6-36、6-37）统摄。原文论几、案、挟轼都是传统家具，几发展为凭几、挟轼，用于身体前伏或侧身依靠，并借图6-35 的琴几作形象证据；画作本身未作介绍，作者孙位只见于图注。","path":"works/gaoyi-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代家具的图像锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:great-wall-tapestry","title":"大型壁毯《长城》（Large Tapestry 'The Great Wall'）","name_en":"Large Tapestry 'The Great Wall","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1974","壁毯","长城","联合国","国家礼品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tapestry","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1974年制作的大型艺术壁毯《长城》，图11-32 图注作“文革期间天津织成的大型壁毯《长城》”。原文记 1974年5月由国务院下达设计和生产任务，制作大型艺术壁毯《长城》（高5米、宽10米）和大型象牙雕刻《成昆铁路》，作为国家礼品赠送联合国总部。原文同节另记 1973年全国工艺美术企业达2000余家、产值15亿元以上、出口值14亿元，1976年全国工艺美术产值23.4亿元。","path":"works/great-wall-tapestry.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国织毯工艺的器物锚点，材料为正文两句加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:guangxu-caiyou-diaoci-fangping","title":"清光绪彩釉雕瓷四季花鸟纹方瓶（Carved Porcelain Square Vase with Four Seasons Flowers and Birds）","name_en":"Carved Porcelain Square Vase with Four Seasons Flowers and Birds","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","光绪","雕瓷","彩釉","外销瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清光绪彩釉雕瓷方瓶，图9-33。原文在明清贸易瓷一节记：此瓶外销以后被欧洲人改为台灯底座使用，原文称之为颇为有趣的移植设计品种。图注文字与图9-34 的说明在源文同一行交错，图版与图注的对位需按原书核对。原文未记瓶的尺寸、款识、雕瓷工序与改造的具体做法。","path":"works/guangxu-caiyou-diaoci-fangping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代外销瓷二次改制的器物锚点，材料为正文一句加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:guiguxiashan-qinghua-guan","title":"元代“鬼谷下山”青花瓷罐（Yuan \"Guiguxiashan\" Blue-and-White Jar）","name_en":"Yuan \"Guiguxiashan\" Blue-and-White Jar","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","青花","拍卖","克里斯蒂","埃斯凯纳齐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_jar","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代“鬼谷下山”青花瓷罐高 27.5 厘米、直径 33 厘米，是目前世间仅存的 8 件同类古董之一。2005 年 7 月 12 日，古董商埃斯凯纳齐在伦敦克里斯蒂拍卖行以 1568.8 万英镑（约 2.45 亿人民币）投得，创下历来亚洲艺术品拍卖的最高成交价。西方收藏家自 1968 年克利夫兰美术馆举办蒙古统治下的中国艺术展览后开始青睐元代瓷器。","path":"works/guiguxiashan-qinghua-guan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下元代青花瓷器的器物锚点，也涉及 D 维度的艺术市场。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:guo-shoujing-jianyi","title":"郭守敬简仪（Guo Shoujing's Abridged Armilla）","name_en":"Guo Shoujing's Abridged Armilla","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","郭守敬","天文仪器","简仪","授时历"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"astronomical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代郭守敬创制的天文仪器简仪，图8-34 图注作“元代 郭守敬发明的简仪模型（现设在南京紫金山天文台）”。原文记 1276 年忽必烈诏令编制新历法，设太史局，以王恂与郭守敬为主要负责人，1280 年编成授时历；在 4 年编历过程中，郭守敬共创制设计了简仪、高表等 17 种天文仪器。原文评简仪“非但简化了浑仪观测坐标系统，而且精度也高于浑仪”，并采用“与近代滚珠轴承作用相同的圆柱体轴承”。同段另记郭","path":"works/guo-shoujing-jianyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代天文仪器设计的器物锚点，材料为正文一段仪器评述加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:guohui-1950","title":"中华人民共和国国徽（National Emblem of the People's Republic of China）","name_en":"National Emblem of the People's Republic of China","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","国徽","标志设计","天安门","梁思成"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"national_emblem","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中华人民共和国国徽于 1950 年 9 月 20 日公布。三册的覆盖极不平衡：**夏燕靖两版给完整过程**（1949 年 7 月征集启事与三项要求、清华大学营建系与另一设计组并行、图案要素、1950 年 6 月与 9 月两道程序），**赵农只给一幅图题和一句总评**（“应是中国 20 世纪设计作品中最重要的一个”）。**“另一设计组”的机构名在 2009 版同一段内就不统一**：前句作“国立北平艺","path":"works/guohui-1950.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"国徽是 C 维度下国家标志设计的核心样本：征集要求的三项、两个设计组的并行、齿轮麦稻穗五星绶带与天安门的组合都在此汇合。1949—1950 年的征集与通过程序归 D 维度；“中国特征”如何被转译为图形语汇归 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:guoji-zibai-pan","title":"虢季子白盘（Guoji Zibai Basin）","name_en":"Guoji Zibai Basin","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周晚期","青铜器","宣王","铭文","盥洗器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"虢季子白盘是西周宣王时期铸作的长方形青铜大盘，今陈列于中国历史博物馆，铭文 111 字，记虢季子白抗击外族有功、王设宴庆功。四册对它的定位沿两条线分开：夏燕靖两版把它当作**盥洗器**（盘、匜配合的沃盥之礼）中“长方形盘”的代表，完全不提铭文；赵农在**食器**一节内列“盘”，正文却明确说盘是“盛水或沐浴的器具”，并给出四册中唯一的尺寸“长有 1.5 米”；田自秉把它列在周代长篇铭文诸器之间，给年","path":"works/guoji-zibai-pan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"虢季子白盘在四册中承担两重角色：作为盥洗器样本，它是西周中期后盘类加耳、出现长方形大盘的形制证据（B）；作为有铭重器，它提供宣王时期抗击外族与庆功宴飨的史料（C 之铭文，D 之礼制）。四册均不描述纹饰。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:haigu-zhanchuan","title":"海鹘战船（Haigu Warship）","name_en":"Haigu Warship","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","战船","浮板","抗沉性","稳定性"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"warship","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"海鹘战船是唐代出现的战船，造型独特，头低尾高、前大后小，船舷两侧设浮板起平衡作用；如此设计使船具有良好的抗沉性和稳定性。","path":"works/haigu-zhanchuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代战船的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:houfeng-dizhenyi","title":"候风地动仪（Houfeng Seismograph）","name_en":"Houfeng Seismograph","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","张衡","铜制","都柱","八道"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scientific_instrument","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"候风地动仪是东汉张衡等制成的世界上第一架候风地动仪。原文引《后汉书·张衡传》称其“以精铜制成，圆径八尺，合盖隆起，形似酒尊”；内部有“都柱”“八道”等机械装置，尊外八条含铜珠的龙及龙头下面设置的相应蟾蜍，使整个地动仪如精巧工艺品。","path":"works/houfeng-dizhenyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下东汉铜制科学仪器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huangdi-chuiyishang-sculpture","title":"黄帝垂衣裳雕塑（Modern Sculpture of the Yellow Emperor）","name_en":"Modern Sculpture of the Yellow Emperor","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["黄帝","垂衣裳","今雕塑","图版著录","传说"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"modern_sculpture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"本册图版 1-18 是一件今人所作雕塑，图注为“新石器时代，黄帝垂衣裳而天下治（今雕塑作品）”。图注把“新石器时代”与“今雕塑作品”并列，时代口径本身是矛盾的：题材属于传说时代，作品是当代创作。原文未注明作者、年代、尺寸与收藏地，也未在正文讨论这件雕塑。","path":"works/huangdi-chuiyishang-sculpture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度“传说如何被图像化”的样本，不是史前器物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huaniao-renwu-luodian-jing","title":"花鸟人物螺钿镜（Mother-of-Pearl Mirror with Figures and Birds）","name_en":"Mother-of-Pearl Mirror with Figures and Birds","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","洛阳","螺钿","平脱","人物"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花鸟人物螺钿镜是 1956 年洛阳唐墓出土的螺钿铜镜。镜面花树下老者弹琴、另一老者持杯倾听、后立侍童，镜纽下刻山石、鸳鸯、小鸟、仙鹤，人物衣纹、鸟羽、叶脉均细线刻划，螺片空间似用松石屑填饰且多脱落。李立新将其作为青铜器失去礼制作用后转向日用、仍有珍稀之品的例证之一。","path":"works/huaniao-renwu-luodian-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代铜镜的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huayou-yaogu","title":"花釉腰鼓（Mottled-Glaze Waist Drum）","name_en":"Mottled-Glaze Waist Drum","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","花釉","腰鼓","河南","陶瓷器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_drum","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花釉是唐瓷中的新品种，原文在“重要的陶瓷类别”之下把它与青瓷、白瓷、唐三彩并列。其法是在黑釉、黄釉、天蓝釉的基础上再装饰另外一种色釉，一般以蓝白、灰白釉为多，形成大小不同的斑纹；烧造地点有河南的郏县、鲁山、内乡、禹县等地，品种大部分是罐、壶、瓶等，代表作举出河南出土的花釉腰鼓。原文记其造型设计是鼓形两头大、中间纤细，整器施黑釉，装饰月白色大斑纹，并以“如夏日夜空，醒目生动”状其效果。原文没有交代本","path":"works/huayou-yaogu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代花釉陶瓷的器物锚点，材料为正文一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:human-face-bronze-yue","title":"人面纹铜钺（Bronze Yue with Human-Face Motif）","name_en":"Bronze Yue with Human-Face Motif","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["殷商","青铜兵器","人面纹","造型怪诞"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"人面纹铜钺与食人卣并列，是本册说明殷商青铜器“被夸张到怪诞的程度，给人以神秘，甚至恐怖之感”的例证。原文未描述钺的形制、尺寸与人面纹构图。","path":"works/human-face-bronze-yue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度殷商青铜兵器的评述性锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huntianyi","title":"浑天仪（Armillary Sphere）","name_en":"Armillary Sphere","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","张衡","铜制科学仪器","天文仪器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scientific_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"浑天仪是本册“铜制科学仪器”一节的例子。原文称漏壶、圭表、浑天仪以及地动仪、指南车等铜制科学仪器，都是融艺术与实用技术相结合的“产品”；东汉时张衡等用青铜制作浑天仪，能演示天象，并制成世界上第一架候风地动仪；原文接着引《后汉书·张衡传》“以精铜制成，圆径八尺，合盖隆起，形似酒尊”，并描述中间的“都柱”“八道”等机械装置与尊外八条含铜珠的龙、龙头下设置的蟾蜍——这一段实际描述的是地动仪，原文在浑天仪","path":"works/huntianyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度铜制科学仪器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huwen-da-shiqing","title":"虎纹大石磬（Tiger-Engraved Stone Chime）","name_en":"Tiger-Engraved Stone Chime","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","安阳武官村","石磬","双钩线刻","编磬"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"虎纹大石磬是 1950 年安阳武官村大墓出土的商代石磬，长 84 厘米、高 42 厘米、厚 2.5 厘米。用双钩线刻表现一个张口伸腰的虎形，虎身布满装饰斑纹，原文称是一件精巧的石雕珍品，制作水平较高。同时已有三枚组成的编磬；夏代已有石磬，但大多制器粗糙。","path":"works/huwen-da-shiqing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下商代石制乐器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:iron-blade-bronze-yue","title":"铁刃铜钺（Bronze Yue with Iron Blade）","name_en":"Bronze Yue with Iron Blade","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","冶铁起源","陨铁","兵器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铁刃铜钺是本册讨论冶铁术起源的考古证据。原文先列史学界两说：一说据《尚书》《诗经》《左传》判断商代已有铁器、西周开始使用铁器，一说冶铁术发明于春秋战国之交；随后以考古资料为证——1972 年河北藁城台西村一座商代墓葬发掘 1 件随葬铁刃铜钺，1977 年北京平谷刘家河一座早期商墓也发掘 1 件铁刃铜钺，同时期陕西雍城秦公墓内出土铁器。原文据此判断商代已有金属铁的生产，是把铁加热锻打后制成器件加以利","path":"works/iron-blade-bronze-yue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度冶铁技术起源的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jade-handle-iron-sword","title":"玉柄铁剑（Iron Sword with Jade Handle）","name_en":"Iron Sword with Jade Handle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周晚期","人工冶铁","虢国墓","块炼铁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"iron_sword","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玉柄铁剑是本册判定人工冶铁起始年代的实物依据。原文称三门峡市出土的西周晚期虢国国君随葬玉柄铁剑就是人工冶铁制品，说明至迟在西周晚期我国已有人工冶铁；此前春秋中期之前我国冶铁技术尚未成熟，生产的都是海绵状的块炼铁，质量不高。同章“铁氏三兄弟”知识链接则称河南三门峡出土的西周晚期铜柄铁剑，是采用铁矿石多次加热、反复锤打、排出铁中杂质的方法制成——同一地点的西周晚期剑在正文与知识链接中分别作“玉柄”“铜","path":"works/jade-handle-iron-sword.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度冶铁技术史的断代锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jiefang-truck","title":"解放牌载重卡车（Jiefang (Liberation) Truck）","name_en":"Jiefang (Liberation) Truck","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1956","长春","第一汽车制造厂","载重汽车","工业产品设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"truck","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1956年7月13日，第一辆被毛泽东命名为“解放”牌的载重卡车在长春第一汽车制造厂总装线试制成功，首批12辆驶下装配线，结束了我国不能批量设计和制造汽车的历史，图11-26。原文记该车以苏联生产的吉斯150型汽车为范本，根据我国实际情况改进部分结构后设计与制造；装备90匹马力6缸汽油发动机，最高时速可达到65公里，载重量为4吨；适合当时国内道路和桥梁的负荷条件，并能根据需要改装成适合各种特殊用途的","path":"works/jiefang-truck.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国汽车工业产品设计的器物锚点，材料为正文两段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jin-wudi-simayan-mianfu","title":"晋武帝司马炎冕服（Ceremonial Robe of Emperor Wu of Jin）","name_en":"Ceremonial Robe of Emperor Wu of Jin","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晋代","冕服","冠服制度","帝王服饰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceremonial_robe","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"晋武帝司马炎冕服见本册图版 5-14，图注为“晋代 晋武帝司马炎冕服”。原文在男装部分讨论晋代以后“汉装”与“胡服”的交融演变，记“禅衣”仍为仕宦礼服、“长袍”为交领右衽式、“大衫”袖口宽敞且领袖有缘边，未对冕服形制作单独描述。本条只记图注给出的时代、人物与服类。","path":"works/jin-wudi-simayan-mianfu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度冠服制度的图版锚点，只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jinan-liujia-zhenpu-tongban","title":"济南刘家功夫针铺铜版（Jinan Liu Family Needle Shop Copper Printing Plate）","name_en":"Jinan Liu Family Needle Shop Copper Printing Plate","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","印刷","商标","广告","铜版"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"copper_print_block","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"济南刘家功夫针铺铜版是北宋济南一家针铺的印刷广告铜版，今藏中国国家博物馆。四册的写法差别极大：**夏燕靖 2016 给版面分层、逐字铭文与制作方法**（双线为框、内分三层、28 字全文），**高丰给尺寸、构图评析与中西印刷广告的年代比较**（欧洲 1480 年第一张印刷广告、领先至少 400 年），**赵农只给商标功能与两句铭文**（白兔为记、钢针精制），**夏燕靖 2009 在本条只存一条图题，","path":"works/jinan-liujia-zhenpu-tongban.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"济南刘家功夫针铺铜版是 B 维度下宋代印刷与商业设计的实物锚点：铜版雕刻、版面分层与图文编排都在此可量。版面构成与黑白对比归 C 维度，商标与广告的经营功能归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jinci-shengmu-dian","title":"晋祠圣母殿（Hall of the Holy Mother at Jinci Temple）","name_en":"Hall of the Holy Mother at Jinci Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","木构建筑","太原","晋祠","秀丽风格"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"timber_frame_hall","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山西太原晋祠圣母殿，图7-30。原文在“1）建筑与建筑彩绘设计”一节把宋代建筑技术与艺术定位为已经达到成熟的阶段：两宋的建筑设计规模虽不及唐代，但风格已趋于秀丽和多样化，在建筑布局和造型设计上出现了若干新手法。举例即北宋京城汴梁改变汉以来历代都城采用的封闭式里坊制，改为沿街设店的方式，更加有利于商业和手工业的发展；又举遗存至今的两宋木构架建筑，如现存的山西太原晋祠圣母殿具有的秀丽风格。同段记北方辽","path":"works/jinci-shengmu-dian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代木构建筑的器物锚点，材料为正文一句风格评语加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jinxing-pen","title":"金星牌金笔（Jinxing Gold Pen）","name_en":"Jinxing Gold Pen","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1956","上海","金笔","轻工业产品","造型设计"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pen","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"上海产金笔。原文在社会主义建设时期工业产品设计一段记：轻工业产品的设计到1956年初有所调整，此时期上海生产的金星牌金笔开始讲究造型设计；随之火柴、塑料、制笔、食品、印刷、纸盒、皮革、文教等轻工业领域也开始提倡产品的造型或是包装设计，以适销市场；当时上海轻工业行业所属的数十家企业都配备有专门的设计室和产品设计人员。本条无图版，原文未记笔的型号、材质与设计者。","path":"works/jinxing-pen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国轻工业产品造型设计的器物锚点，材料只有正文一句。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jiulongbi","title":"九龙壁（Nine-Dragon Wall）","name_en":"Nine-Dragon Wall","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","琉璃","照壁","九龙壁","建筑琉璃"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"glazed_tile_wall","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清代琉璃照壁，图9-31 图注作“清代 九龙壁琉璃建筑”。原文在琉璃烧造一节记：山西也是出产琉璃制品的重要地方，至今遗存一些完全用琉璃砖瓦建造的宝塔、楼阁、照壁等大型建筑，如山西太原的晋祠、大同和北京的九龙壁等。原文未说明图注所指为大同或北京，也未记尺寸、建造年代与龙数。","path":"works/jiulongbi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代琉璃照壁的器物锚点，材料为同段列名加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jiuxi-shibajian","title":"都锦生丝织风景《九溪十八涧》（Du Jinsheng Silk Tapestry of Nine Creeks and Eighteen Gullies）","name_en":"Du Jinsheng Silk Tapestry of Nine Creeks and Eighteen Gullies","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","都锦生","丝织风景","杭州","费城博览会"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"woven_picture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"民国丝织风景，图10-12 图注作“民国 都锦生织品”。原文记杭州的都锦生（1897-1943）在丝织工艺上有突出成就：他在1921年试织成功的丝织西湖名景“九溪十八涧”，成为我国丝织风景的创始产品；第二年，都锦生创办的丝织厂正式投入批量生产；1926年，他创作的丝织风景参加美国费城国际博览会，获金质奖，使我国的丝织工艺享誉中外。","path":"works/jiuxi-shibajian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度民国丝织风景的器物锚点，材料为正文一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:kaifeng-xiangguosi-pagoda","title":"开封相国寺塔（Pagoda of Xiangguo Temple, Kaifeng）","name_en":"Pagoda of Xiangguo Temple, Kaifeng","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","琉璃砖塔","仿木楼阁式","飞天","50多种纹样"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"开封相国寺塔是宋代仿木楼阁式砖塔，造型高耸挺秀；塔身采用 28 种琉璃砖砌造，雕刻有飞天、麒麟、菩萨、力士、狮子等 50 多种纹样，雕工精细，整座塔宛如一件大型的琉璃工艺品。","path":"works/kaifeng-xiangguosi-pagoda.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代琉璃砖塔的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:kongzi-shengjitu","title":"《孔子圣迹图》（Illustrated Life of Confucius）","name_en":"Illustrated Life of Confucius","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["席","跽坐","低型家具","图像资料"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《孔子圣迹图》见本册图版 3-35，图注作“春秋《孔子圣迹图》”。原文在“席”一节称春秋战国时人们通常以坐席形式接人待客，铺席设筵，席上设低矮家具如案和几；席的形状大小多样，长的可坐多人甚至几十人，称“连席”，长者或尊者单人单坐或坐头排，称首席；《孔子圣迹图》就形象地描绘了孔子跽坐在席上游说诸侯王的情景。同节“跽坐”知识链接解释跪坐姿势，并指出跪坐决定了我国早期家具低矮的形制、这一形制一直延续至汉","path":"works/kongzi-shengjitu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度先秦起居方式与低型家具的图像锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lanbai-yinhuabu","title":"新疆民丰蓝白印花布（Blue-and-White Printed Cloth from Minfeng, Xinjiang）","name_en":"Blue-and-White Printed Cloth from Minfeng, Xinjiang","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","蜡染","蜡缬","阑干斑布","新疆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_textile","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"新疆民丰蓝白印花布是本册判断汉代蜡染水平的实物证据。原文称凸版印花技术在西汉时达到相当水平，当时印工已熟练掌印染涂料配制与多套色印花技术，并兼用印花、刺绣和绘画；西南地区少数民族在秦汉时期已掌握蜡染（蜡缬）技术，当时称“阑干斑布”，蜡染布面上设计者巧妙运用点、线结合，图像色彩饱满、层次丰满、疏密有致；蜡染技术后来逐步传入中原，再传到亚洲各国。新疆民丰出土的汉代蓝白印花布反映出当时蜡染工艺已相当精湛","path":"works/lanbai-yinhuabu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度汉代印染工艺的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lenovo-et960","title":"联想ET960智能手机（Lenovo ET960 Smartphone）","name_en":"Lenovo ET960 Smartphone","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["2005","联想","智能手机","IDSA","工业设计奖"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mobile_phone","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"联想ET960智能手机，图11-41 图注记 2005年联想凭借ET960智能手机被美国工业设计协会（IDSA）和《商业周刊》联合评选为年度“全球工业产品杰出设计奖”铜奖。原文在工业设计一节以该机为国内工业设计获奖之例，同段述工业设计的范围、流程与相关学科，并称计算机辅助设计（CAD）已成为现代工业设计最重要的手段。原文未记产品参数、设计团队与上市时间。","path":"works/lenovo-et960.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度当代中国工业设计产品的器物锚点，材料为图注一行加同段工业设计通说。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:li-ning-banpo-basketball-shoe","title":"李宁半坡专业篮球鞋（Li-Ning Banpo Professional Basketball Shoe）","name_en":"Li-Ning Banpo Professional Basketball Shoe","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["2007","李宁","篮球鞋","iF设计奖","工业设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"footwear","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2007年李宁公司推出的半坡专业篮球鞋。原文只有一句：2007年，李宁公司的半坡专业篮球鞋被德国历史最悠久的工业设计机构——汉诺威工业设计论坛举办的“if design award china 2007”评为设计大奖。原文未记产品参数、设计说明、上市时间与图版。","path":"works/li-ning-banpo-basketball-shoe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度当代中国工业设计产品的器物锚点，材料只有正文一句。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:liangtou-jian-chuan","title":"两头尖船（Double-Ended Boat）","name_en":"Double-Ended Boat","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋唐","造船","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-34. 隋唐 两头尖船”，与图6-33 同摄于造船业段末（图6-33、6-34），正文未作描述。图注行插入家具业段中：L2864 起为“2）家具业”，图注位于“家具逐渐向高型、成套化发展，其种类也有增加”一句与所用木料一段之间，与家具文字交错。","path":"works/liangtou-jian-chuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度隋唐造船的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lianhe-fanghu","title":"莲鹤方壶（Lotus and Crane Square Hu）","name_en":"Lotus and Crane Square Hu","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋","青铜器","新郑","方壶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"莲鹤方壶是河南新郑出土的一对春秋青铜方壶，因壶顶莲瓣中立一展翅欲飞的鹤而得名。六册来源都把它视为青铜器由商周静态、肃穆、礼制化风格转向轻巧活泼风格的代表作，是中国设计史叙述中春秋青铜器设计转变的关键物证。","path":"works/lianhe-fanghu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"莲鹤方壶是 B 维度下春秋青铜器设计转变的代表作；年代、尺寸与收藏信息在来源间不完全一致。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lianhua-qingci-tuowan","title":"莲花青瓷托碗（Lotus-Shaped Celadon Bowl with Stand）","name_en":"Lotus-Shaped Celadon Bowl with Stand","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["五代十国","青瓷","莲花纹","托碗","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-47. 五代十国 莲花青瓷托碗”。正文在五代木漆工艺段之后总述五代十国时期的艺术设计：由于各地区发展不甚平衡，总的气势与唐代已无法相比；从艺术风格上讲，已经失去了初唐的清秀、盛唐的华丽，而只继承了中、晚唐的洗练和沉稳，随后便渐渐形成比较拘谨、秀气、柔弱的时代风格，并以（图6-50）统摄。图注编号6-47 至6-50 与正文引用的（图6-50）不衔接。","path":"works/lianhua-qingci-tuowan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度五代青瓷的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lianhua-zaoxing-wenjiuqi","title":"莲花造型温酒器（Lotus-Shaped Wine Warmer）","name_en":"Lotus-Shaped Wine Warmer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["五代十国","莲花造型","温酒器","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-48. 五代十国 莲花造型温酒器”。图注夹在“## 9. 唐代设计理论述要”标题与《唐六典》一段之间，前后没有对应的正文叙述；同页图注序列为6-47 莲花青瓷托碗、6-48 莲花造型温酒器、6-49 金耳环、6-50 螺钿花鸟纹经函。","path":"works/lianhua-zaoxing-wenjiuqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度五代器物造型的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lianhua-zun","title":"莲花尊（Lotus Zun）","name_en":"Lotus Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南北朝","青瓷","仰覆莲瓣","佛教","七层"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"莲花尊是南北朝时期（主要是齐、梁和北魏）的特殊青瓷品种，设计别致、意匠新颖，具有较高艺术性。尊体以腹为中心，上下部塑饰成各为相向的三层莲花瓣，层层相接，故又名仰覆莲花瓷尊；尊底也塑成莲花瓣形，全尊共 7 层，肩部有耳，颈部塑出花鸟云龙。此尊高 66.5 厘米、口径 19.2 厘米，现陈列于北京故宫博物院。河北景县出土四件仰覆莲花尊，最高 40 厘米，综合印贴、刻划、堆塑；南京林山梁代大墓出土两件同","path":"works/lianhua-zun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下南北朝青瓷的器物锚点，也涉及 E 维度的佛教艺术传播。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lianzhu-luwen-jin","title":"联珠鹿纹锦（Brocade with Linked-Pearl Roundels and Deer）","name_en":"Brocade with Linked-Pearl Roundels and Deer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","织锦","联珠纹","纬锦","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-15. 唐代 联珠鹿纹锦”。正文没有对这件锦作单独描述，只在“锦”一节总述：唐代的锦以纬锦为主，达到很高的水平；唐锦的艺术风格以“富丽绚烂，清新流畅”为特征，图案花纹多以各种花草禽兽几何图案及文字为题材，又可分为联珠纹、团窠纹（团花）、对称纹、散花、几何纹、对称纹、晕绸等，段末以（图6-15、6-16）统摄本图与联珠野猪头纹锦。","path":"works/lianzhu-luwen-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代织锦的图版锚点，材料为图注一行加同节通说。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lianzhu-yezhutou-wen-jin","title":"联珠野猪头纹锦（Brocade with Linked-Pearl Roundels and Boar-Head Motif）","name_en":"Brocade with Linked-Pearl Roundels and Boar-Head Motif","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","织锦","联珠纹","纬锦","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-16. 唐代 联珠野猪头纹锦”，与图6-15 同被“锦”节段末（图6-15、6-16）统摄。原文在这一节先论锦是古代丝织品中最精美、最贵重的品种，早期为平纹经线显花，南北朝后出现斜纹纬线显花的纬锦；随重型打纬机的出现和多色大花织造的需要，纬显花织法逐渐占据优势，多综多蹑和束综提花相结合，能织出更为丰富多彩的花纹和宽幅织物，唐代的锦以纬锦为主，达到很高的水平。随后总述唐锦风格与联珠纹、团","path":"works/lianzhu-yezhutou-wen-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代织锦的图版锚点，材料为图注一行加同节通说。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lindian","title":"麟德殿（Lindian Hall）","name_en":"Lindian Hall","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","大明宫","宫殿建筑","宴飨","复原图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palace_hall","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐长安大明宫内宫殿。原文记麟德殿的面积约是故宫太和殿的3倍，宫殿分为上下两层，有前中后3殿，面积5000多平方米，可一次宴请3500人之多。同段记大明宫位于城东北部的龙首原，是唐代乃至当时世界上最宏伟的宫殿建筑群，原名永安宫，唐太宗时建造，初衷是为给太上皇李渊居住，未建成而李渊离世，之后扩建，唐高宗迁入执政；现存遗址范围相当于北京故宫面积的3倍多，由30多所宫殿组成。原文并指出这时候的宫殿与陵墓建","path":"works/lindian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代宫殿建筑的器物锚点，母体为大明宫。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:liu-guandao-xiaoxia-tujuan","title":"刘贯道《消夏图卷》（Liu Guandao's Handscroll of Summer Leisure）","name_en":"Liu Guandao's Handscroll of Summer Leisure","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","刘贯道","家具","榻","屏风"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代画家刘贯道所绘《消夏图卷》，图8-46。原文以此画为元代家具的图像证据：画中出现榻、桌、屏风、足承等多种家具样式；其中桌和足承非常有特色——桌结合案几制作，呈四角回形，并且在回形结构内饰有弧形嵌板，表面刻有复线，整个桌形给人稳重精致的感觉；足承既是居室中与榻相伴的用品，又是大户人家居室中的主要点缀饰品，原本起着盆架的作用，但在此画幅中装饰成分强烈，表明元代的家具雕饰工艺仍然发达。原文同段另述高","path":"works/liu-guandao-xiaoxia-tujuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代家具的图像证据，材料为正文一段形制描述加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:liujin-wuma-xianbei-yinhu","title":"鎏金舞马衔杯银壶（Gilt Silver Ewer with Dancing Horse）","name_en":"Gilt Silver Ewer with Dancing Horse","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["盛唐","何家村","皮囊壶","鎏金","舞马"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silverware","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鎏金舞马衔杯银壶是盛唐银器，1970 年 10 月西安何家村唐代窖藏出土，通高 18.5 厘米。器腹两面锤出马衔杯纹，仿北方游牧民族皮囊与马镫综合形状，圈足墨书“十三两半”。舞马部分采取鎏金技术，使银壶与鎏金相互辉映。","path":"works/liujin-wuma-xianbei-yinhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下盛唐金银器的器物锚点，也涉及 E 维度的游牧文化影响。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:longhu-zun","title":"龙虎尊（Dragon-Tiger Zun）","name_en":"Dragon-Tiger Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["殷商","青铜酒器","凝重浑厚","龙虎纹"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙虎尊是本册说明殷商青铜器“给人以凝重、浑厚之感”一类的例证，与司母戊鼎、四羊尊并列。原文未描述其形制与纹饰。","path":"works/longhu-zun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度殷商青铜酒器的评述性锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:longwen-kuihua-jing","title":"龙纹葵花镜（Mallow-Shaped Mirror with Dragon Design）","name_en":"Mallow-Shaped Mirror with Dragon Design","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","铜镜","葵花形","龙纹","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-4. 唐代 龙纹葵花镜”，位置在“隋唐文化”章首图组，前为图6-3“五代十国 历史地图”，后为图6-5“唐代 三彩”，不在铜镜专节。正文铜镜专节（L2821-L2847）讨论唐镜兴盛的原因、装饰加工方法（金银平脱、贴金银或称包金银、鎏金、错金银、镶嵌、螺钿、著彩、涂珐琅）以及铜锡铅配比与镜面微凸之理，但没有回指本图。","path":"works/longwen-kuihua-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代铜镜的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:luanshu-fou","title":"栾书缶（Luan Shu Fou）","name_en":"Luan Shu Fou","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋","错金铭文","错金银","青铜缶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"栾书缶是春秋时期青铜缶，上有错金铭文 40 余字，被用作春秋中期错金银工艺有所发展的例证；该器铭文是说明当时错金技术水平的实物材料。","path":"works/luanshu-fou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下春秋青铜器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:luodian-huaniao-wen-jinghan","title":"螺钿花鸟纹经函（Mother-of-Pearl Sutra Box with Bird-and-Flower Design）","name_en":"Mother-of-Pearl Sutra Box with Bird-and-Flower Design","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["五代十国","螺钿","漆器","经函","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_box","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-50. 五代十国 螺钿花鸟纹经函”。正文在五代木漆工艺一段只记前蜀王建墓出土门、棺、椁、册匣、宝盌、镜盒等6种漆器，其中银铅胎漆碟为这一类器物中最引人注意者；又记1975年蔡庄五代墓出土44个木俑（男俑、女俑、生肖俑、镇墓兽及人首蛇身、人首鱼身、人首龙身、人首兽身等），均以桫木雕刻。原文没有提到经函，也没有描述螺钿工艺。","path":"works/luodian-huaniao-wen-jinghan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度五代漆器的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lv-you-tao-lou","title":"绿釉陶楼（Green-Glazed Pottery Tower）","name_en":"Green-Glazed Pottery Tower","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","明器","楼阁式建筑","庄园坞堡","绿釉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tomb_model","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绿釉陶楼是汉代墓葬出土的绿釉陶质明器，能体现汉代楼阁式建筑式样。汉代建筑以楼阁形式较为典型，一般由台基、门楼和五层楼阁组成，各层门窗、屋脊、栏杆等部位饰有人物、花鸟等纹样；绿釉陶楼直观再现建筑的形制特征和建造技巧，是汉代陶塑中不可多得的上乘之作，并反映东汉末年皇室衰微、地方豪强构筑庄园坞堡、拥兵自卫的社会现实。","path":"works/lv-you-tao-lou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下东汉建筑明器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:man-eating-you","title":"食人卣（You Vessel with Human Figure）","name_en":"You Vessel with Human Figure","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["殷商","青铜酒器","造型怪诞","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"食人卣是本册讨论殷商与西周青铜器造型差别时举出的例子。原文称殷商时期超出实用功能的审美追求异常强烈但缺乏统一标准：一部分器物给人以凝重、浑厚之感，如司母戊鼎、四羊尊、龙虎尊；另一部分则被夸张到怪诞的程度，给人以神秘甚至恐怖之感，如食人卣、人面纹铜钺。原文没有展开这一件的形制。","path":"works/man-eating-you.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度殷商青铜器审美评价的样本，只有一句评述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:mao-badge","title":"毛主席像章（Mao Zedong Badges）","name_en":"Mao Zedong Badges","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["文革","像章","政治宣传","徽章","毛泽东"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"badge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“文革”时期的毛泽东像章，原文在“文革时期的政治宣传设计和书籍设计”一节记：作为政治宣传的有效形式，这一时期风靡全国的“毛主席像章”设计是一项代表；像章大小不一，花色品种繁多；据统计，仅“文革”期间制作的各种不同类型、不同图案和不同材质的毛泽东像章就超过4万余种。原文未给具体某枚像章的图版、尺寸、材质分类与制作单位。","path":"works/mao-badge.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度文革政治宣传品设计的品类锚点，材料为正文一段。本条记品类而非单件实物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:mao-gong-ding","title":"毛公鼎（Mao Gong Ding）","name_en":"Mao Gong Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","青铜鼎","长篇铭文","479字","兽蹄足"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_ding","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"毛公鼎是西周青铜鼎。2016 在叙述西周后期鼎形演变时，以耳渐外移、口渐敞、下腹内收使器身成半球形、足成兽蹄形为特征，将毛公鼎与大克鼎并举为这一形制的代表器。赵农以图 2-42“西周 毛公鼎”收录，称其长篇铭文是西周珍贵文献，与《史墙盘》《大盂鼎》《虢季子白盘》《多友鼎》并列；《毛公鼎》有 479 个文字，记述当时复杂的社会事件。","path":"works/mao-gong-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西周青铜鼎的器物锚点，铭文内容另涉 A 维度的文献价值。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:mengtian-jiangjun-yuhuchun-ping","title":"蒙恬将军玉壶春瓶（Yuhuchun Vase with the Story of General Meng Tian）","name_en":"Yuhuchun Vase with the Story of General Meng Tian","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","青花","玉壶春瓶","历史故事纹","瓷器装饰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代瓷器，图8-12 的图注为：8-12. 元代“蒙恬将军”玉壶春瓶。原文在元代瓷器装饰纹样一段说元代瓷品的装饰对历史故事题材的创作十分重视，如萧何月下追韩信、蒙恬将军等，这对明清两代瓷器上人物故事的题材有重大影响，句末以（图8-11、8-12）统摄两器。原文未描述此瓶的尺寸、窑口、出土与藏地，也未展开画面情节。","path":"works/mengtian-jiangjun-yuhuchun-ping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代瓷器装饰题材的器物锚点，材料为图注一行加同段题材列举。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:miaoying-si-baita","title":"北京妙应寺白塔（Miaoying Temple White Stupa）","name_en":"Miaoying Temple White Stupa","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","阿尼哥","覆钵式塔","尼泊尔","铜华盖"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"religious_architecture","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北京妙应寺白塔建于至元八年（1271），由尼泊尔名匠阿尼哥设计，为覆钵式塔（喇嘛塔），年代最早、规模最大。塔高 50.9 米，塔基三层、平面呈亚字形、须弥座式，砖雕莲座承塔身；塔肚顶部华盖由 40 块铜板瓦构成，四周悬 36 只铜质透雕流苏和风铃，刹顶置铜制小喇嘛塔高 5 米、重约 40 吨。","path":"works/miaoying-si-baita.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下元代宗教建筑的器物锚点，也涉及 E 维度的跨文化技术流动。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:minzu-wenhua-gong","title":"民族文化宫（Cultural Palace of Nationalities）","name_en":"Cultural Palace of Nationalities","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1959","北京","十大建筑","民族形式","高层建筑"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"public_building","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北京国庆十大建筑之一的民族文化宫，图11-24 图注作“新中国 北京十大建筑（民族文化宫）”。原文记：为迎接新中国成立10周年，中央人民政府从1958年9月确定国庆工程的建设任务，决定在北京兴建人民大会堂等十项大型建筑项目；人民大会堂是新中国建筑设计和施工集体创造的典范，追求“中而新”的设计风格；民族文化宫建筑则是民族形式在高层建筑中的尝试，具有现代建筑亮丽亲和特色；中国美术馆的建筑装饰如彩画、木","path":"works/minzu-wenhua-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国国庆工程的建筑锚点，材料为正文一句加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:mozi-jiu-song-tu","title":"《墨子救宋图》（Mozi Saving Song）","name_en":"Mozi Saving Song","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["墨子","公输","云梯","守城器械","图像资料"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《墨子救宋图》见本册图版 3-38。原文在“墨家思想”知识链接中引《墨子·公输》记约公元前 444 年公输盘为楚造云梯预备攻宋、被墨子制止的事迹：“子墨子解带为城，以堞为械，公输盘九设攻城之机变，子墨子九距之，公输盘之攻械尽，子墨子守围有余……臣之弟子禽滑厘等三百人，已持臣守围之器，在宋城上而待楚寇矣”，由此留下“墨守成规”的成语；随后插图 3-38。图注只作“墨子救宋图”，未标时代、绘者与材质。","path":"works/mozi-jiu-song-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度兵器与设计思想交叉处的图像锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:muniu-liuma","title":"木牛流马（Wooden Ox and Flowing Horse）","name_en":"Wooden Ox and Flowing Horse","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["三国","诸葛亮","蒲元","独轮车","山地运输"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"transport_device","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"木牛流马是三国时期蜀汉在山地军事运输中使用的独轮车。赵农记诸葛亮在蜀国山地军事运输中推广使用，被传奇地称为“木牛流马”，它利用独轮车的结构改善山地长途运输功能，提高蜀国军队的战斗供需能力；《三国志·蜀书·诸葛亮传》载“九年，亮复出祁山，以木牛运……十二年春，亮悉大众由斜谷出，以流马运”，木牛“载一岁粮，日行二十里，而人不大劳”。夏燕靖则记其为蜀汉蒲元为解决山道运粮困难而发明，称“廉仰双辕，人行六尺","path":"works/muniu-liuma.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下三国运输工具的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:namo-shakyamuni-fo","title":"《南无释迦牟尼佛》夹缬（Woodblock-Resist Print of Sakyamuni Buddha）","name_en":"Woodblock-Resist Print of Sakyamuni Buddha","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["辽代","夹缬","应县","佛画","印染"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_textile","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山西应县出土的辽代夹缬品《南无释迦牟尼佛》，纵65.8厘米、横82厘米。原文记其上佛像众多，且层次分明，染印清晰，足可看出当时染工的技术水平已经相当高超。同段先论辽代纺织业主要是纺麻和织麻，技术基础承自东北地区（原渤海国属地）与燕云十六州的汉人地区；契丹得燕云十六州后丝织业渐成规模，辽都上京有绫锦院诸工作坊，织工主要是汉人，祖州绫锦院有契丹、汉、肃慎（渤海）等族手工业者300人纺织，供辽皇室需用；","path":"works/namo-shakyamuni-fo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度辽代印染织物的器物锚点，材料为正文一段含尺寸与工艺评价。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:nanchan-si-dadian","title":"南禅寺大殿（Main Hall of Nanchan Temple）","name_en":"Main Hall of Nanchan Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","五台山","木构","现存最古","782年"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"timber_architecture","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南禅寺大殿位于山西五台山，建于公元 782 年，是目前现存最古老的木结构建筑。大殿为长宽各三间的格式，四周以 12 根列柱环绕、略微内收，使梁柱枋结构稳定严密；屋顶舒缓，椽檐以斗拱上挑、出檐深远，气象浑厚，殿内无柱，佛坛上还保存着唐代佛像精品。","path":"works/nanchan-si-dadian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代木构建筑的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:nanhai-one","title":"南海一号（Nanhai One Shipwreck）","name_en":"Nanhai One Shipwreck","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","沉船","阳江","海上丝绸之路","尖头船"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"shipwreck","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南海一号是南宋时期的木质古沉船，沉没于广东阳江市东平港以南约 20 海里处，1987 年在广东阳江海域发现。为尖头船，船长 30.4 米、宽 9.8 米，船身（不算桅杆）高 8 米，排水量估计可达 600 吨，载重可能近 800 吨，是我国目前发现的最大的宋代船只。船体保存相当完好，专家推测其从中国驶出，赴新加坡、印度等东南亚地区或中东地区进行海外贸易。","path":"works/nanhai-one.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下南宋沉船的器物锚点，也涉及 E 维度的海上贸易。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:niutou-lujiao-jin-shijian","title":"牛头鹿角金饰件（Gold Ornament with Ox Head and Deer Antlers）","name_en":"Gold Ornament with Ox Head and Deer Antlers","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["三国","金银细工","花丝","错采镂金","饰件"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"gold_ornament","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"牛头鹿角金饰件见本册图版 5-21，图注为“三国 牛头鹿角金饰件”。原文在“金银细工设计的进步”一节称此时期金银细工有很大发展，统治阶层争相豪奢以致“斗富”赌盛，金银器物设计与用金银装饰器物竟成风气；三国东吴有“花形金饰”（南昌出土）雕有“大吉”文字，西晋盛行花丝首饰，洛阳金村出土“金狮子”“金簪”“金叶”，金制首饰达 60 多种，多用金银细丝盘绕成各种花形纹样；这时期金银装（首）饰工艺以“错采镂","path":"works/niutou-lujiao-jin-shijian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度三国金银细工的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ou-fangyi","title":"偶方彝（Ou Fangyi (Paired Square Ritual Vessel)）","name_en":"Ou Fangyi (Paired Square Ritual Vessel)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","妇好墓","青铜酒器","斗拱雏形","鸟兽浮雕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_wine_vessel","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"偶方彝是安阳殷墟妇好墓出土的青铜酒器，与铜鸮尊、圈足觥同出，器身饰鸟兽浮雕／圆雕，标志青铜工艺与设计的新高峰。赵农另记妇好墓“偶方彝”上有斗的雏形，作为商周斗拱已见雏形的青铜器例证。","path":"works/ou-fangyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下商代青铜酒器的器物锚点，斗拱雏形说另涉建筑史。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:prc-national-flag","title":"中华人民共和国国旗（五星红旗）（National Flag of the People's Republic of China）","name_en":"National Flag of the People's Republic of China","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1949","国旗","五星红旗","曾联松","国家象征"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"national_symbol","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中华人民共和国国旗，图11-1 图注作“中华人民共和国国旗”。知识链接“国旗图案设计”记：国旗图案的征集在1949年6月由新政协发出，收到海内外的应征稿件3012份，许多图稿未获国旗、国徽方案征集筹备小组认可；毛泽东原来主张采用一颗星加一条象征黄河的黄线方案，张治中等委员表示另选方案；后来田汉从淘汰的图案中看中了上海“现代经济通讯社”文书曾联松设计的五星红旗，大家表示同意，只是去掉了原设计中大五星","path":"works/prc-national-flag.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度新中国国家象征物设计的锚点，材料为知识链接一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:prince-ziwu-ding","title":"王子午鼎（Ding of Prince Ziwu）","name_en":"Ding of Prince Ziwu","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋","青铜鼎","图版著录","楚国"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"王子午鼎见本册图版 2-11，图注为“春秋 王子午鼎”。原文未展开形制描述；器名中的“王子午”是春秋楚国的人物，本条只记图注给定的时代与器名，不代补铭文或出土信息。","path":"works/prince-ziwu-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度春秋青铜鼎的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qikong-shidao","title":"七孔石刀（Seven-Holed Stone Knife）","name_en":"Seven-Holed Stone Knife","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["薛家岗文化","新石器时代","长兵器","钻孔","绑缚"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_tool","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"七孔石刀是 1980 年安徽潜山薛家岗出土的新石器时代石器，属距今约 5500 年的薛家岗文化。器略呈长方形，长 325 毫米、宽 95 毫米、厚约 10 毫米，刀背平直，沿背排列 7 个圆孔。原文推测以木柄开槽嵌刀背，用麻绳或皮革穿孔绑缚，为作战用砍杀长兵器。","path":"works/qikong-shidao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下新石器时代石质兵器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qin-bing-ma-yong","title":"秦兵马俑（Terracotta Army）","name_en":"Terracotta Army","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦代","秦始皇陵","陶塑","模塑结合","写实"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tomb_figurines","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦兵马俑是 1974 年秦始皇陵东侧出土的陶制兵马俑群，共 7000 余件（一说推测约 8000 余件），身高 1.75–1.85 米、最高 1.98 米。采用模塑结合、分工制作、套合粘接初胎，再覆细泥并综合塑、堆、贴、刻、画技法，兼具整体造型与局部刻画。一号坑东西长 230 米、南北宽 62 米，为步兵和战车混编的主力部队；二号坑是战车、射手、骑兵混编；三号坑是统帅指挥部。兵马俑造型以写实为主，","path":"works/qin-bing-ma-yong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下秦代陶俑群的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qin-shi-huang-ling","title":"秦始皇陵（Mausoleum of the First Qin Emperor）","name_en":"Mausoleum of the First Qin Emperor","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦代","临潼","水银","覆斗形封丘","70万人"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mausoleum","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦始皇陵位于陕西临潼，是秦代最具代表性的营造之作。陵区规模宏大，墓冢高 76 米、底边宽 485 米、长 515 米；据史料记载征用民夫 70 万人、用 37 年建成。陵内宛如地下宫殿，棺椁周围铸满铜汁，设百官、摆珍宝，以人鱼膏为烛，宫室之外灌输水银象征江河湖海，“上具天文，下具地理”；陵墓南屏骊山、北临渭水，陵东 1.5 公里处为兵马俑坑。","path":"works/qin-shi-huang-ling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下秦代陵墓的器物锚点，也涉及 A 维度的帝王观念。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qinghua-wugu-fengdeng-tu-pan","title":"青花五谷丰登图盘（Blue-and-White Plate with Bumper Harvest Design）","name_en":"Blue-and-White Plate with Bumper Harvest Design","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","万历","青花","五谷丰登","吉祥纹样"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明代青花瓷盘，图9-5-2 的图注为：9-5-2. 明万历 青花五谷丰登图盘。本章明代丝织品种一段（L4155）在段末以（图9-5-1、图9-5-2）并引两图，但该段讲的是丝织品种，未描述此盘；盘为瓷器，与该段丝织主题并不相称。原文未记尺寸、款识、窑口与纹样细节。","path":"works/qinghua-wugu-fengdeng-tu-pan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代青花瓷纹样的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qingming-shanghe-tu","title":"清明上河图（Along the River During the Qingming Festival）","name_en":"Along the River During the Qingming Festival","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","张择端","汴梁","商业美术","幌子"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清明上河图是宋代张择端所绘长卷，描绘汴梁繁华社会景象，绘城楼、桥梁、船只、车马、旅店、酒肆、商铺、寺院及各类人物 810 多个，是研究宋代城市和环境设计的重要资料。图中还可见商业广告幌子、虹桥、折叠桌、大小船 28 余艘等细节。2016 记其描绘东京汴梁商号店铺、招牌、幌子、横匾、对联等商业设计，以及数百名各行各业人士的各异服式，是研究宋代商业美术与服饰的重要图像材料。","path":"works/qingming-shanghe-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下宋代商业美术图像的器物锚点，也涉及 B 维度的城市与家具。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qinling-tongchema","title":"秦陵铜车马（Bronze Chariots and Horses from the Qin Mausoleum）","name_en":"Bronze Chariots and Horses from the Qin Mausoleum","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦代","青铜器","车制","系驾","秦始皇陵"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_carriage","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦陵铜车马是秦始皇陵西侧出土的两乘青铜车马，1980 年发掘，各按真车真马约二分之一缩制。五册的关注点分化明显：**夏燕靖两版逐车给车舆、伞盖、门窗与随车器物的尺寸**（2009 与 2016 近乎逐字相同，2016 另补破碎块数与修复年数），**高丰给形制与《考工记》的对读**（辐条 30 根、盖弓 22 根、伞通高 114 厘米、立车 3064 件与安车 3462 件），**赵农给整体尺寸与御","path":"works/qinling-tongchema.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秦陵铜车马是 B 维度下秦代车制的实物锚点：车舆尺度、系驾方式、伞盖与门窗构造、分铸组装工艺都在此可量。它同时是“以明器证车制”这一研究方法的样本，方法论一侧归 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qiyingshao","title":"耆英号（Qiyingshao, Guangzhou-Type Ship）","name_en":"Qiyingshao, Guangzhou-Type Ship","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋唐","广船","图版著录","船名待考"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-33. 隋唐 广船耆英号”。图注所在造船业段末以（图6-33、6-34）统摄本图与两头尖船。正文论隋唐造船业的兴旺与技术水平：举隋代五牙大战舰，唐代在扬子县、浙东、洪州、嘉州、金陵等地设船场，崇明创制多桅多帆平底沙船，德宗时李皋造车轮战舰，唐代出现头低尾高的海鹘战船，造船已用桐油石灰糊缝，扬州施桥镇出土的唐代木船是世界最早的水密舱结构实物。原文未及“耆英号”。图注以“隋唐”系年、以“耆","path":"works/qiyingshao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度隋唐造船的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:quanzhou-qingjing-si","title":"泉州清净寺（Quanzhou Qingjing Mosque）","name_en":"Quanzhou Qingjing Mosque","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","泉州","伊斯兰教建筑","清净寺","色目人"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mosque","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代伊斯兰教建筑遗存之一，图8-38 图注作“元代 伊斯兰泉州清净寺”。原文在“元时随着色目人（外国人）移民遍布全国，伊斯兰教建筑层出不穷”一段列出三处遗存：新疆霍城的吐虎鲁克麻札、泉州清净寺、杭州真教寺；随后总述其建筑风格，称既有保持中亚风格形式的建筑，又出现了以汉族传统建筑布局和结构体系为基础、结合伊斯兰教特有功能要求的中国的伊斯兰教建筑形式。原文未描述清净寺的形制、创建年代、尺寸与现状。","path":"works/quanzhou-qingjing-si.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代伊斯兰教建筑的遗存锚点，材料只有同段列名加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:renmin-dahuitang-1959","title":"人民大会堂（Great Hall of the People）","name_en":"Great Hall of the People","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","国庆工程","十大建筑","室内设计","中而新"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"public_building","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"人民大会堂是为迎接新中国成立 10 周年而建的“国庆工程”十项大型建筑之一，1958 年 9 月确定任务。三册的写法差别很大：**夏燕靖两版给组织过程与室内设计**（1958 年 9 月确定任务、首次聘请装饰设计专家与画家雕塑家配合建筑师、“水天一色”天花、周恩来把近 30 个厅分包各省市、梁思成 1961 年文章的引文），**赵农只把它放进“十大建筑”与天安门广场改造的框架里**，并给出一幅华灯","path":"works/renmin-dahuitang-1959.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"人民大会堂是 B 维度下国家大型公共建筑的样本：1958 年国庆工程的十项建筑之列、室内设计首次引入装饰专家与画家雕塑家协作、万人大会堂的天花处理都在此汇合。“中而新”与民族形式的取向归 A 维度；国家任务与各省市分包的组织方式归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ring-foot-gong","title":"圈足觥（Ring-Footed Guang Vessel）","name_en":"Ring-Footed Guang Vessel","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["妇好墓","殷墟","青铜酒器","鸟兽形装饰","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"圈足觥见本册图版 2-8，图注为“商周 圈足觥”。正文在讨论殷墟妇好墓青铜器时称：妇好墓出土的 4 件以鸟兽浮雕和圆雕为主要装饰的酒器——铜鸮尊、偶方彝、圈足觥，标志着青铜工艺与设计达到新高峰。原文写“4 件”而只列出三名，第四件未举。","path":"works/ring-foot-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度商代鸟兽形青铜酒器的锚点。原文只作类属性评述，未展开单件形制。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ruding-shishi-liujin-yinzhan","title":"乳钉狮纹鎏金银盏（Gilt Silver Cup with Bosses and Lion Design）","name_en":"Gilt Silver Cup with Bosses and Lion Design","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","金银器","鎏金","乳钉纹","狮纹"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silver_cup","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“7-29. 宋代 乳钉狮纹鎏金银盏”。图注嵌在金银器段一句之中：L3391 以“据文献记载，宋”收尾，L3393 为图注，L3395 续以“代金银制器仍作为财富宝藏”，一句话被图注与断行隔开，图版行也未见于相邻位置。正文金银器段记宋代金银器工艺随地区性经济中心城市的出现而发展，大中城市均有专门的店铺交易金银制器；引《梦梁录》记南宋临安自五间楼北至官巷南街、两行多是金银盐钞引交易铺，前列金银","path":"works/ruding-shishi-liujin-yinzhan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代金银器的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sajia-si","title":"萨迦寺（Sakya Monastery）","name_en":"Sakya Monastery","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","西藏","萨迦派","萨迦寺","元代壁画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monastery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代西藏萨迦寺，图8-36 图注作“元代 西藏萨迦寺”。原文记寺位于现今西藏自治区萨迦县的仲曲河两岸，创建于宋熙宁六年（1073），由西藏喇嘛教萨迦派（俗称花教）创始人衮却杰布主持建造，后多次修建；分南寺与北寺，殿宇宏伟、布局紧凑，富有元代建筑风格。寺庙内有大批关于萨迦派创始人萨班与八思巴等形象的造像，以及反映早期坛城的巨幅元代壁画，壁画画工精细、色彩鲜明；寺庙门廊、佛龛底座等的装饰纹样，大量吸收","path":"works/sajia-si.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代藏传佛教建筑的遗存锚点，材料为正文两段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:san-jiao-lou","title":"三脚耧（Three-Legged Seed Drill）","name_en":"Three-Legged Seed Drill","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","赵过","播种机","开沟","下种"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_machine","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三脚耧是汉武帝时搜粟都尉赵过在一脚耧、二脚耧基础上设计发明的播种工具，大大提高播种效率，是现代播种机的雏形。现代全功能播种机把开沟、下种、覆盖、压实四道工序接连完成，而我国两千年前的三脚耧已能把前三道工序合并于一机完成。","path":"works/san-jiao-lou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西汉农业机械的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sancai-shuangyu-hu","title":"三彩双鱼壶（Sancai Double-Fish Ewer）","name_en":"Sancai Double-Fish Ewer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","唐三彩","双鱼","冥器","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sancai_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-13. 唐代 三彩双鱼壶”。唐三彩一节以（图6-12、6-13）统摄本图与图6-12“唐代 三彩（黄、绿、紫）”。正文没有对双鱼造型作描述，只总述三彩的二次烧成（素胎经1000℃-1100℃素烧，施釉后再以850℃-950℃釉烧）、以黄、赭、绿为基本釉色、题材范围（人物、动物、碗盘、水器、酒器、文具、家具、房屋、骨灰壶坛）以及冥器性质：三彩曾列入官府丧葬的明文规定，按品级不同配不同随葬","path":"works/sancai-shuangyu-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐三彩的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行加三彩通说。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sandian-jiaota-fangmianche","title":"三锭脚踏纺棉车（Three-Spindle Treadle Cotton Spinning Wheel）","name_en":"Three-Spindle Treadle Cotton Spinning Wheel","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","黄道婆","棉纺","纺车","松江"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"spinning_wheel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代棉纺织工具。原文在黄道婆一节记：黄道婆是江苏松江乌泥泾人，生于宋末元初，小时为童养媳，逃到崖州（今海南）向黎族人学习种棉纺织技术，晚年回乡推广；其业绩载于元代陶宗仪《辍耕录》、王逢《梧溪集》及明代徐启光《农政全书》。原文引《辍耕录》“黄道婆教以做造捍弹纺织之具，至于错纱配色，综线挈花，各有其法”，并称这表明黄道婆对纺织技术、工具进行了变革；特别是黄道婆和木匠将纺丝麻的三锭脚踏纺车，改革成三锭脚","path":"works/sandian-jiaota-fangmianche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代棉纺工具的器物锚点，材料只有正文一句技术改进记述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sanxingdui-bronze-statue","title":"三星堆青铜人雕像（Bronze Figure from Sanxingdui）","name_en":"Bronze Figure from Sanxingdui","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","三星堆","巴蜀文化","青铜人像","服饰等级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_figure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三星堆青铜人雕像是本册讨论商代服饰与身份等级时最重要的形象材料。原文称在为数不多的商代服饰文物中，以四川广汉三星堆（巴蜀文化遗址）发现的商代青铜人雕像最具代表；从殉葬俑的形象看，商代人的身份有等级区别，衣着的材料、式样及配饰随之有差异，并反映商代衣服材料主要以皮、革、丝、麻为主；由于纺织技术进步，商代人已能织造极薄的绸和提花几何纹的锦、绮，奴隶主和贵族以穿着此类材质为荣。","path":"works/sanxingdui-bronze-statue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度商代服饰与身份等级的图像锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sanzu-jia","title":"三足斝（Three-Legged Jia Vessel）","name_en":"Three-Legged Jia Vessel","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["龙山文化","陶斝","袋足","轮制","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三足斝见于本册图版 1-12，图注为“龙山文化 三足斝”。正文在河南、陕西龙山文化一节把斝列入常见陶器组合（鼎、鬲、斝、豆、甑、盆与双耳罐），并记当地制陶大量使用轮制技术；同节还记制陶工艺使用空心锥体形陶内模，或以原有陶器袋足为模、外部敷泥拍打，制作鬲、斝、鬶、盉等器的袋足部分。原文没有对图版这一件作单独描述。","path":"works/sanzu-jia.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度龙山陶器的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sassoon-house","title":"沙逊大厦（Sassoon House）","name_en":"Sassoon House","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","上海","外滩","外来式建筑","芝加哥学派"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_building","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"上海沙逊大厦，图10-39、10-40。原文在“外来式建筑”一节先总述此类建筑：外国列强在租界按本国建筑传统与审美建造，模仿欧洲文艺复兴与折中主义风格，采用钢筋混凝土与钢结构而用石头墙面包砌，设计师大多为西方建筑师。随后记上海沙逊大厦是钢架结构的10层大楼，建于1926-1928年间，平面布局为“A”字形，立面外形前部耸立一座高达19米的锥字体屋顶的装饰物，墙面贴以花岗石，简洁而明朗，吸取了当时美","path":"works/sassoon-house.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度近代外来式建筑的器物锚点，材料为正文一段加图注两行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shang-elephant-zun","title":"商代象尊（Shang Elephant Zun）","name_en":"Shang Elephant Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","湖南醴陵","鸟兽形尊","祭器","象鼻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_ritual_vessel","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商代象尊是湖南醴陵出土的鸟兽形青铜尊，整器形象逼真而具装饰性，满身饰纹，象鼻外雕一虎形兽，器盖为一小象，体现工匠高超技艺。象尊属鸟兽形尊，背部凿口并加盖以注酒，是当时专用祭器。","path":"works/shang-elephant-zun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下商代鸟兽形青铜器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shanghai-expo-china-pavilion-2010","title":"2010年上海世博会中国馆（China Pavilion, Expo 2010 Shanghai）","name_en":"China Pavilion, Expo 2010 Shanghai","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["2010","上海","世博会","中国馆","国家展馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition_pavilion","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2010年上海世博会中国馆是赵农《中国艺术设计史》中以图版出现的当代建筑。导论图导论-6 与第十章图10-67 两处图注均以该馆为题，图10-67 图注作“东方既白，知者创物”。两处均只有图注，来源未记设计者、尺寸、材料、结构等信息；两幅图版均未做视觉核验。本条只登记来源可证的图注信息，不据外部知识补全。","path":"works/shanghai-expo-china-pavilion-2010.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本项目是 B 维度下当代国家展馆建筑的图注条目：仅登记赵农两处图版所标对象与图注文字。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shanghai-huifeng-yinhang","title":"上海汇丰银行（HSBC Building, Shanghai）","name_en":"HSBC Building, Shanghai","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["外滩","公和洋行","古典主义","钢筋混凝土","1923"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architecture","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"上海汇丰银行由英商公和洋行设计，建于 1921～1923 年间，地处上海外滩，高 8 层、占地 14 亩，建筑为钢筋混凝土浇灌、外观仿砖石结构。整个造型中部圆顶高耸，内部为爱奥尼柱式的柱廊和藻井式天花，是典型的古典主义样式建筑。","path":"works/shanghai-huifeng-yinhang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下近代外滩建筑的器物锚点，也涉及 D 维度的通商口岸制度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shenren-shoumianwen-yucong","title":"神人兽面纹玉琮（Jade Cong with Deity-and-Animal Mask）","name_en":"Jade Cong with Deity-and-Animal Mask","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["良渚文化","玉琮","神人兽面纹","原始宗教","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_ritual_object","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"神人兽面纹玉琮见于本册图版 1-14，图注为“良渚文化 神人兽面纹玉琮”。正文在良渚文化的知识链接中讨论良渚玉器的整体情况：仅反山墓地就出土 1100 余件组，按单件计 3200 余件，其中有作仪仗的斧钺、用于宗教法事的琮与璧、用于装饰的璜、珠、项饰、佩饰、手镯、带钩等，并记线割、锯切、管钻、抛光等加工手段，以及有学者判断高档玉器上可能使用了砣具。原文没有对图版这一件玉琮作单独描述。","path":"works/shenren-shoumianwen-yucong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度良渚玉器的图版锚点，正文只提供同类器群的统计与工艺判断。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shiwu-lianzhan-tongdeng","title":"十五连盏铜灯（Fifteen-Lamp Bronze Lamp）","name_en":"Fifteen-Lamp Bronze Lamp","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","中山国","树形灯","河北平山","可调节"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_lamp","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"十五连盏铜灯是河北平山出土的战国中山国铜灯，高达 84.5 厘米，以树形灯架为主体，上饰有龙、鸟、猴、人物等形象，造型奇特；15 盏灯可聚可散，可根据照明需要加以调节。田自秉记其一树为灯杆，上有 15 个灯盏，树身塑造一群动态各异的猴子，称其意趣盎然、生动可爱。","path":"works/shiwu-lianzhan-tongdeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下战国青铜灯具的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shizhuzhai-jianpu","title":"《十竹斋笺谱》（Shizhuzhai Jianpu (Ten Bamboo Studio Letter Paper Album)）","name_en":"Shizhuzhai Jianpu (Ten Bamboo Studio Letter Paper Album)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","十竹斋","饾版","拱花","彩色套印"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明末《十竹斋笺谱》，图9-52 图注作“明代《十竹斋笺谱》”。原文在明清印刷工艺一节记：明代后期发明了分色分版套印与用雕版压印凸出花纹的拱花，南京是彩色套印的中心；1626年刊刻的《萝轩变古笺谱》是现存最早的短版、拱花印本；明末用短版印的《十竹斋画谱》和用短版、拱花印的《十竹斋笺谱》，色彩艳丽、浓淡分明，阴阳向背酷似原画，可谓画、刻、印三绝的短版代表作。原文该段六次用“短版”、一处用“饱版”，均未","path":"works/shizhuzhai-jianpu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度明代彩色套印的代表作，材料为正文一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuanglu-wadang","title":"双鹿瓦当（Roof-Tile End with Twin Deer）","name_en":"Roof-Tile End with Twin Deer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","瓦当","建筑材料","模印纹样"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"roof_tile_end","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"双鹿瓦当见本册图版 3-27，图注为“战国 双鹿瓦当”。原文在“建筑材料”一节记春秋战国为适应城市与宫室建筑需要，砖、瓦、瓦当、瓦钉、下水管道等大量使用陶制材料，洛阳、邯郸、易县、曲阜、临淄、侯马、江陵等地都发现各种瓦件和陶制下水管道；瓦的结构有所改进，瓦钉与瓦身分离，使瓦的固定连接增强、瓦坯制作也较容易；瓦当一般呈半圆形、模印装饰花纹，主要有涡状纹、“r”形纹、对鸟兽纹、树木纹、几何纹、星云纹、","path":"works/shuanglu-wadang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度战国建筑材料的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuangluan-ruishou-kuihua-jing","title":"双鸾瑞兽葵花镜（Mallow-Shaped Mirror with Double Phoenixes and Auspicious Beasts）","name_en":"Mallow-Shaped Mirror with Double Phoenixes and Auspicious Beasts","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","铜镜","葵花形","双鸾","瑞兽"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-32. 唐代 双鸾瑞兽葵花镜”。图注前为“伊斯兰文化”一节，图注后紧接唐镜工艺的总结：唐镜制作非常符合科学原理，铜锡铅的比例约为70:25:5，由于加锡量较多所以一般呈白色，花纹清晰、表面匀净；为了能在小小的镜面上照到人的全脸，将镜面微向外凸，类似现代汽车的反光镜，并引宋代沈括《梦溪笔谈》“鉴大则平，鉴小则凸”一段申说。图6-31 图注只作“唐代 铜镜”，与本条同页。","path":"works/shuangluan-ruishou-kuihua-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代铜镜的器物锚点，材料为图注一行加唐镜工艺总结一段。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shui-dui","title":"水碓（Water-Powered Trip Hammer）","name_en":"Water-Powered Trip Hammer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","西汉末年","水力","齿轮","舂米"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"grain_machine","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"水碓是以水为动力的粮食加工机械。2016 记其为西汉末年出现，利用水力驱动碓头舂米，极大提高了舂米效率，图 4-35 为西汉水碓模型。赵农记东汉时期出现水碓和畜力碓，利用自然和牲畜的力量加工粮食作物：水碓将水流作为动力，带动齿轮旋转，然后用杵棒敲击谷物，减轻了人们的劳作；东汉《新语》有“及役水而舂，其利乃百倍”的说法。","path":"works/shui-dui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下汉代粮食加工机械的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuilu-gongzhan-jian","title":"水陆攻战纹鉴（Water-Land Battle Scene Jian）","name_en":"Water-Land Battle Scene Jian","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","汲县山彪镇","红铜镶嵌","战船","约300人"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_basin","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"水陆攻战纹鉴是战国青铜鉴，1935 年河南汲县山彪镇出土。外壁用红铜镶嵌水陆射杀、格斗等战争场面，战士束腰佩剑，有张弓、持戟、架梯、荡桨、首级落地、奔跑呼叫等姿态，共约 300 人；器现藏台湾省。李立新据其纹样说明战船分两层、上层作战下层划桨、船底双层。","path":"works/shuilu-gongzhan-jian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下战国青铜鉴的器物锚点，纹样内容另涉 C 维度的叙事图像。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuxia-duiniao-duiyang-wenjin","title":"树下对鸟对羊纹锦（Brocade with Trees, Paired Birds and Paired Sheep）","name_en":"Brocade with Trees, Paired Birds and Paired Sheep","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北魏","织锦","对鸟对羊","中西交流","锦纹"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"树下对鸟对羊纹锦见本册图版 5-11，图注原文作“北魏 树下对乌对羊纹锦和树纹锦”，“对乌”疑为“对鸟”之讹，本条按候选名“对鸟”建档并保留原文说明。原文在北朝纺织一节称北魏统一中原后设立官营丝织作坊，平城宫中“婢使千余人织绫锦”；孝文帝重视农桑，遣宫中机织工匠帮助民间织造；当时锦的织造和锦纹设计多为平纹经线彩锦、兼有纬线起花，还引进了中亚、西亚的织锦纹样，如“菱纹锦”“龙纹锦”“瑞兽锦”“狮纹锦","path":"works/shuxia-duiniao-duiyang-wenjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度北朝织锦的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuxia-liyang-tu-jiaxie-pingfeng","title":"树下立羊图夹缬屏风（Woodblock-Resist Screen with a Standing Ram under a Tree）","name_en":"Woodblock-Resist Screen with a Standing Ram under a Tree","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","夹缬","屏风","印染","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_textile","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-17. 唐代 树下立羊图夹缬屏风”。图注与6-18“唐代 蜡染屏风的纺织纹样”、6-19“唐代 夹缬”同被印染业段末（图6-17、6-18、6-19）统摄。正文记隋唐印染业空前发展，官府掌管其事，据《唐六典》织染署下设练染之作有六：青、绛、黄、白、皂、紫，染大抵以草木而成，有以花叶、有以茎叶、有以根皮，出有方土，采以时月；宫中亦有染坊；染料以植物染料为主，靛蓝等已作为外贸商品出口到西亚","path":"works/shuxia-liyang-tu-jiaxie-pingfeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代印染织物的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:simajinlong-mu-qi-pingfeng","title":"司马金龙墓漆屏风（Lacquer Screen from the Tomb of Sima Jinlong）","name_en":"Lacquer Screen from the Tomb of Sima Jinlong","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北魏","漆器","彩绘","司马金龙墓","大同"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_screen","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"司马金龙墓漆屏风是本册北魏漆器的代表。原文称北魏时期最著名的漆器就是 1965 年在山西大同司马金龙墓出土的漆屏风：屏风的主色调为红色，上有彩绘，用黄、白、青、绿、橙等颜色绘有许多历史故事，还题有墨书文字；有学者认为这些彩绘是用核桃油调制漆色制作，《北齐书·祖传》中记载“善为胡桃油以涂画”。原文推测这件漆屏风很可能是主人生前使用过的心爱之物，因而随葬入土。","path":"works/simajinlong-mu-qi-pingfeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度北朝漆器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:simei-tu","title":"四美图（Four Beauties Print）","name_en":"Four Beauties Print","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["金代","平阳","姬家雕印","招贴","年画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"print_poster","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四美图是金代平阳府（今山西临汾）姬家刻印的雕版印刷招贴画，高 57.5 厘米、宽 32.5 厘米；画面为王昭君、赵飞燕、班姬（婕妤）、绿珠四位美人，花冠绣裳、体姿生动、线条流畅、刻工精细。画面上方刻“随朝窈窕呈倾国之芳容”楷书字样，并有“平阳姬家雕印”题识。赵农另记其高二尺五寸、宽一尺多，并推测为北宋末年山西临汾商家印制的年画、“对屏”中左边一幅。","path":"works/simei-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下金代雕版印刷招贴的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:simuwu-ding","title":"司母戊大方鼎（Simuwu Ding）","name_en":"Simuwu Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代晚期","青铜器","殷墟","方鼎","铸造工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"司母戊大方鼎是商代晚期殷墟出土的巨型青铜方鼎，重 875 公斤、通高 133 厘米，为已知最大的商代青铜器。五册来源有直接记载（李立新一册无\"司母戊\"字样）。尺寸与重量五册完全一致，但**范铸方式的记述互不相同**：腹范究竟是四块（每块内嵌六块分范）、鼎身八块外范，还是每边八块外范；鼎耳是\"接铸\"、在鼎上加范浇铸，还是\"单独铸造后再合铸（分铸法）\"。这些不是措辞差异，而是工艺复原层面的分歧，本 K","path":"works/simuwu-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"司母戊大方鼎是 B 维度下商代晚期青铜铸造规模与范铸技术的器物锚点，其兽面纹、夔纹与虎食人耳纹饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:siyang-fangzun","title":"四羊方尊（Four-Ram Square Zun）","name_en":"Four-Ram Square Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","青铜尊","四羊","图注","年代分歧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_ritual_vessel","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四羊方尊是商代青铜尊，见于赵农图 2-10（图注“商 四羊方尊”）与夏燕靖 2016 图 2-5（图注作西周器）。两册正文均未对其器形、纹饰、尺寸作进一步说明，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/siyang-fangzun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下商周青铜礼器的器物锚点，证据仅到图注层级。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:songyue-si-ta-523","title":"嵩岳寺塔（Songyue Temple Pagoda）","name_en":"Songyue Temple Pagoda","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北魏","佛塔","密檐式砖塔","十二边形","登封"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"嵩岳寺塔在河南登封嵩岳寺，建于公元 523 年（北魏），是中国现存最古老的砖塔。四册里三册给描述，李立新一册以图版图注加塔的类型分类出现。**赵农给的结构细节最细**（首层十二边形、塔室八角形、厚壁空心式木板楼、空筒状至塔顶），**夏燕靖两版给的地位判断最直**（现存最早高层砖石建筑），**三册在高度上分成 41 米与 39.5 米两说**。李立新正文只谈塔的材料与形式分类，把本塔作插图，故本 K","path":"works/songyue-si-ta-523.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"嵩岳寺塔是 B 维度下北魏密檐式砖塔的结构样本：十二边形首层、八角形塔室、厚壁空心式木板楼、空筒状塔身都在此汇合。北魏佛教寺院数量与舍宅为寺的制度背景归 D 维度。李立新一册只提供塔的类型分类与图版图注，不含该塔的描述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:susha-chanyi","title":"素纱禅衣（Plain Silk Gauze Robe）","name_en":"Plain Silk Gauze Robe","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","马王堆","丝织","服饰","纱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silk_garment","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"素纱禅衣是湖南长沙马王堆一号汉墓出土的西汉单衣，衣长 128 厘米、重 49 克。三册的用法不同：**高丰给形制、镶缘与礼制出处**（领边袖边 5.6 厘米夹层绢缘，引《礼记·玉藻》郑玄注），**田自秉给织造组织与感官评价**（方孔平纹，类似现今的乔其纱，引“轻薄如空”“举之若无”），**赵农两处提到而只给数据与赞叹**（一处引“其水平之精湛，令人叹为观止”，一处给尺寸与重量）。**袖长在两册间相","path":"works/susha-chanyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"素纱禅衣是 B 维度下汉代丝织与服饰工艺的器物锚点：纱的平纹组织、单衣形制与不足一两的重量都在此可量。其“轻薄如空”“举之若无”的感官评价与后世纱罗的形态关联归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tang-yin-xiangnang","title":"唐代银香囊（Tang Silver Perfume Pouch）","name_en":"Tang Silver Perfume Pouch","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","何家村","法门寺","平衡环","陀螺仪原理"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silverware","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代银香囊是唐代银质熏香器，几乎均出自以西安为中心的陕西关中地区，计 1963 年西安沙坡村 4 件、1970 年西安何家村窖藏 1 件、1987 年扶风法门寺地宫两件；除最大一件（法门寺出土）直径 12.8 厘米外，其余直径大多在五厘米左右。通体圆球状，上半球为盖、顶部铆接环钮并置长链，下半球为身，子母口扣合、铰链相连，通体镂空。内有平衡环及焚香盂，两个同心圆环之间及内圆环与焚香盂之间均以对称短","path":"works/tang-yin-xiangnang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代金银器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ti-hua-ling-ji","title":"提花绫机（马钧改进）（Improved Pattern Loom of Ma Jun）","name_en":"Improved Pattern Loom of Ma Jun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["三国魏","马钧","提花机","织机","踏板"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"loom","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"提花绫机（马钧改进）见本册图版 5-10，图注为“魏国 马钧改进的提花绫机”。原文称魏国的马钧是一位杰出的机械发明家，他根据当时织锦的需要改进提花绫机，即用 12 根踏杆控制 60 片综，操作简易方便，效率大为提高，且织出的花纹变幻无穷，使魏国的提花织物质量堪与蜀锦媲美。","path":"works/ti-hua-ling-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度织机技术的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tibi-chaju","title":"提璧茶具（Tibi Tea Set）","name_en":"Tibi Tea Set","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["紫砂","顾景舟","高庄","1950年代","玉文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"teaset","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"提璧茶具是 20 世纪 50 年代紫砂工艺师顾景舟与中央工艺美术学院高庄教授合作创作的紫砂茶具，开创了玉文化与紫砂造型艺术融于一体的设计新理念。","path":"works/tibi-chaju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下现代紫砂茶具的器物锚点，也涉及 D 维度的工艺美术教育合作。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tong-niu-deng","title":"铜牛灯（Bronze Ox Lamp）","name_en":"Bronze Ox Lamp","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","长沙","虹管灯","虹吸","灯烟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_lamp","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜牛灯是长沙出土的汉代铜灯，灯体为牛形，以两角顺背向上做成虹吸管，有一向下的碗状灯罩以吸收灯烟。原文以此说明虹管灯利用虹吸原理防止烟尘污染空气的设计。","path":"works/tong-niu-deng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下汉代青铜灯具的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tongbenma","title":"铜奔马（Galloping Horse in Bronze）","name_en":"Galloping Horse in Bronze","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","武威雷台墓","青铜器","汉代冶铜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_sculpture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜奔马是本册举出的汉代青铜器实例。原文在“冶铜业的发展与青铜制器的提升”一节称汉代冶铜业仍然兴盛，举例 1968 年出土于河北满城中山靖王刘胜之妻窦绾墓的长信宫灯（原文作“西代青铜鎏金灯具”，疑为“汉代”之讹），以及 1969 年在甘肃武威雷台墓出土的“铜奔马”，为东汉青铜器。原文只作举例，未展开造型描述。","path":"works/tongbenma.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度汉代青铜器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wangchengtu-dai-zhen","title":"王城图（戴震）（Plan of the Royal Capital by Dai Zhen）","name_en":"Plan of the Royal Capital by Dai Zhen","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","考工记","王城图","营国制度","复原图"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reconstruction_drawing","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"王城图（戴震）见本册图版 3-29，图注为“清代学者戴震根据《考工记》所绘的王城图”。原文以图 3-28、3-29 两幅后人依《考工记》所绘的王城图，作为“匠人营国”制度的示意；同节并记《考工记》对居住尺度的规定（“室中度以几，堂上度以寻，野度以步，涂度以轨”）与营国数量多用奇数、最高等级用“九”的做法。本条只记图注给出的绘者、时代与依据。","path":"works/wangchengtu-dai-zhen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史文献与图式传统的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wangchengtu-nie-chongyi","title":"王城图（聂崇义）（Plan of the Royal Capital by Nie Chongyi）","name_en":"Plan of the Royal Capital by Nie Chongyi","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["五代","考工记","王城图","营国制度","复原图"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reconstruction_drawing","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"王城图（聂崇义）见本册图版 3-28，图注为“五代学官聂崇义根据《考工记》所绘的王城图”。原文在“营造制度”一节引《考工记》“匠人营国，方九里，旁三门。国中九经九纬，经涂九轨。左祖右社，面朝后市……”说明按封建等级需求建立与等级秩序吻合的城市空间格局：王宫建在国都中心或城市中轴线上，主要殿堂形制与体量最高最大，强调左右对称、前后有序、宫城居中、划分整齐；并以图 3-28、3-29 两幅后人依《考工","path":"works/wangchengtu-nie-chongyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史文献与图式传统的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wangdafan-fugui-shoukao-ciban","title":"王大凡《富贵寿考瓷板》（Wang Dafan's Porcelain Plaque of Wealth and Longevity）","name_en":"Wang Dafan's Porcelain Plaque of Wealth and Longevity","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","王大凡","瓷板画","巴拿马赛会","博览会"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_plaque","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"民国瓷板画，图10-5 的图注为：10-5. 民国 参加“巴拿马赛会”的王大凡《富贵寿考瓷板》作品。原文在巴拿马赛会一节记：全称“太平洋万国巴拿马博览会”，是美国为庆祝巴拿马运河正式通航而举办；1912年我国表示参加，各地经两年筹备于1914年5月至7月在江苏、浙江、山东等15个地区预展；1914年年底全国展品分两批、重约1500吨海运至美国；赛会1915年2月20日开幕，历时280天，陈列馆有美","path":"works/wangdafan-fugui-shoukao-ciban.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度民国瓷板画的器物锚点，材料为图注一行加赛会背景一段。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wei-ding","title":"卫鼎（Wei Ding）","name_en":"Wei Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","青铜鼎","鼎腹演变","兽蹄足"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"卫鼎是本册讨论青铜鼎形制演变的代表器之一。原文记西周中期后鼎腹进一步趋浅、下腹趋于平底、下腹壁外移、柱足上端渐粗而足跟部有外延成兽蹄形的趋势，以“大盂鼎”“卫鼎”为代表；西周后期又变为耳渐外移、口渐敞、下腹内收使器身成半球形、足成兽蹄形，以“大克鼎”“毛公鼎”为代表。","path":"works/wei-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度西周青铜鼎形制序列的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wensiyuan-yin-xunlu","title":"文思院造鎏金朵带银熏炉（Gilt Silver Censer Made by the Wensiyuan Workshop）","name_en":"Gilt Silver Censer Made by the Wensiyuan Workshop","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","金银器","法门寺","文思院","咸通十年"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silver_censer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代文思院所造鎏金熏炉，图6-28。原文给出较完整的实测与工艺记录：炉通高29.5厘米，盖径25.9厘米，腹深7厘米，重5.363千克；银板锤鑠成型，附件浇铸，纹饰鎏金。炉体由盖、身两部分构成，直口、平折沿、方唇、深腹、平底，盖面高隆呈覆碗状，宽平折沿与炉身口沿相扣合；莲花形盖钮，钮底镂刻莲瓣一周，瓣尖上翘，呈瓣状气孔，便于烟香外熏。盖面饰缠枝莲一周，五朵莲花上各卧有一龟，龟首反顾、口衔瑞草；腹壁","path":"works/wensiyuan-yin-xunlu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代金银器的器物锚点，材料为正文一段实测记录加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wu-zixu-huaxiang-jing","title":"伍子胥画像镜（Wu Zixu Portrait Mirror）","name_en":"Wu Zixu Portrait Mirror","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["六朝","铜镜","画像镜","绍兴","上海博物馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"伍子胥画像镜是六朝时期浙江绍兴一带铸造的画像镜，镜背以浮雕手法表现吴王、伍子胥、越王、范蠡、越女等人物，所取为春秋吴越争霸的历史故事。三册来源分工恰好互补：夏燕靖两版给**地位与收藏**（“魏晋南北朝时期最为突出的铜镜”，现藏上海博物馆，“所表现的重大历史题材，尚属首见”），田自秉给**产地、工艺与图像内容**（绍兴、浮雕、立体感、五名人物），并把伍子胥谏吴王的历史本事与“反映人民对他的追念……反","path":"works/wu-zixu-huaxiang-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"伍子胥画像镜是 B 维度下六朝铜镜的工艺样本（绍兴铸镜、浮雕手法、立体感），其以历史故事为镜背图像、人物多达五名，归 C 维度的图像叙事。四册均不描述其纹样布局与铭文。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wudao-renwu-dongwu-wen-sanse-jin","title":"舞蹈人物动物纹三色锦（Three-Color Brocade with Dancers and Animals）","name_en":"Three-Color Brocade with Dancers and Animals","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","江陵","提花机","经纬密度","7单元"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"舞蹈人物动物纹三色锦是湖北江陵出土的战国锦，为其中纹样最复杂者。它由 7 个单元组成横贯全幅的花纹，经向长 5.5 厘米、纬向宽 49.1 厘米，经纬密度为 156×52 根/平方厘米，表明战国时已有较先进的提花机和熟练的织造技术。","path":"works/wudao-renwu-dongwu-wen-sanse-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下战国织锦的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wudaowen-caitao-pen","title":"舞蹈纹彩陶盆（Painted Pottery Basin with Dancing Figures）","name_en":"Painted Pottery Basin with Dancing Figures","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时代","马家窑文化","彩陶","舞蹈纹","青海大通"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painted_pottery_basin","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"舞蹈纹彩陶盆是青海大通上孙家寨马家窑型墓葬出土的彩陶盆，内壁绘三组各五人的集体舞蹈图像。五册用到它的方式差别很大：田自秉给**尺寸与纹样结构**，细到“盆里盛的水到四道圈纹的部位，我们将会看到水面反映出的舞蹈人的倒影”；夏燕靖两版给**五种文化解释**，把学界对舞蹈纹的分歧一次列出；赵农给**图像读法与艺术源流**（“为现代舞蹈、音乐、武术、杂技等艺术形式提供了源头”）；高丰只给一句**艺术评价*","path":"works/wudaowen-caitao-pen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"舞蹈纹彩陶盆是 B 维度下新石器时代彩陶的器形与装饰样本（马家窑型、内彩、舞蹈人三组五人），其人物纹的构图与人像解读归 C；夏燕靖两版所列五种文化解释涉及原始宗教与氏族制度，归 D 为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wugu-fengdeng-denglongwen-zhijin","title":"五谷丰登灯笼纹织锦（Brocade with Lantern and Bumper Harvest Motifs）","name_en":"Brocade with Lantern and Bumper Harvest Motifs","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","织锦","灯笼纹","五谷丰登","吉祥纹样"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明代织锦，图9-5-1 的图注为：9-5-1. 明代 五谷丰登灯笼纹织锦。本章明代丝织品种一段（L4155）在段末以（图9-5-1、图9-5-2）并引两图，但该段讲的是妆花、本色花、织金银三类与织造特点，未描述此锦。原文未记尺寸、产地、组织与纹样寓意。","path":"works/wugu-fengdeng-denglongwen-zhijin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代织锦纹样的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wuya-dazhanjian","title":"五牙大战舰（Five-Toothed Great Warship）","name_en":"Five-Toothed Great Warship","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋代","造船","战舰","隋炀帝","龙舟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"warship","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"隋代水师战舰，原文作为隋唐造船技术水平的例证之一列出：五牙大战舰高10余丈，可乘800人；同段并记隋炀帝下江南时随行船只有数千艘，龙舟上有4层殿堂，长20余丈。原文没有说明“五牙”是单船之名还是船型等级，也未给船长、船宽、用材与建造地点。","path":"works/wuya-dazhanjian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度隋代造船技术的器物锚点，材料为正文一句列尺度与载员。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiangyun-huoju","title":"北京奥运会火炬“祥云”（Beijing 2008 \"Xiangyun\" Olympic Torch）","name_en":"Beijing 2008 \"Xiangyun\" Olympic Torch","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["2008奥运","祥云","纸卷轴","铝材","丙烷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"product_design","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北京奥运会火炬“祥云”造型灵感来自中国传统纸卷轴，长 72 厘米、重 985 克，燃烧时间 15 分钟，零风速火焰高度 25 至 30 厘米。采用锥体曲面异形一次成型和铝材腐蚀、着色技术，燃料为丙烷，外形材料可回收；火炬能在每小时 65 公里强风和每小时 50 毫米大雨下保持燃烧，是我国自主设计研发、拥有完全知识产权的产物。","path":"works/xiangyun-huoju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下当代中国产品设计与国家形象工程的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiao-ke-dou-zhao-ma-ma","title":"《小蝌蚪找妈妈》（Where Is Mama (Little Tadpoles Searching for Mother)）","name_en":"Where Is Mama (Little Tadpoles Searching for Mother)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1961","水墨动画","上海美术电影制片厂","中国动画学派","片种"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"animation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1961年诞生的我国第一部水墨动画片《小蝌蚪找妈妈》。原文记 1961年第一部水墨动画片《小蝌蚪找妈妈》诞生，为动画影坛增添了最能代表中国风格的新片种；1963年拍摄的水墨动画片《牧笛》，用水墨表现人物、家畜和山水，扩大了水墨动画片的表现领域。原文未记片长、主创名单、出品机构与图版。","path":"works/xiao-ke-dou-zhao-ma-ma.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度水墨动画片种的影片锚点，材料为正文一句。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xinzhui-fushi","title":"马王堆贵夫人辛追服饰（Garments of Lady Xinzhui of Mawangdui）","name_en":"Garments of Lady Xinzhui of Mawangdui","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","马王堆","深衣","女服","绕襟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"马王堆贵夫人辛追服饰见本册图版 4-17，图注为“西汉 马王堆贵夫人辛追服饰”。原文在“秦汉女服”一节称秦汉妇女的礼服仍承古仪、以深衣为尚；《后汉书》记载贵妇入庙助蚕之服“皆深衣制”，但衣襟绕襟层数有所增加，下摆部分肥大，腰身裹得很紧，衣襟角处缝一根绸带系在腰或臀部；并称长沙马王堆汉墓女主人在帛画中的穿着服式是可信的具体形象资料。","path":"works/xinzhui-fushi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度汉代服饰的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xique-dengmei","title":"《喜鹊登梅》大挂屏（Large Hanging Screen 'Magpies on Plum Branches'）","name_en":"Large Hanging Screen 'Magpies on Plum Branches","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","雕漆","嵌玉","挂屏","喜鹊登梅"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_screen","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"新中国雕漆嵌玉挂屏，图11-6 的图注为：11-6. 新中国 雕漆嵌玉《喜鹊登梅》大挂屏。正文在“全国民间美术工艺品展览会”一段末以（图11-5、11-6）并引两图，但该段只记展览时间、地点、展品数与巡展国家，未描述挂屏本身。原文未记尺寸、作者、制作单位与工艺细节。","path":"works/xique-dengmei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国雕漆嵌玉工艺的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xixia-movable-type-print","title":"西夏活字印本（Tangut Movable-Type Printings）","name_en":"Tangut Movable-Type Printings","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西夏","活字印刷","印刷史","传播"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"原文在“西夏工艺技术成就”一节把西夏砖雕、金银铜制器、雕版印刷工艺列为重要部分，随后指出：宋朝发明的活字印刷术虽成为印刷史上伟大的里程碑，然而却无一件流传下来；西夏文物中保存着与宋朝同时的西夏活字印本。又从时间的演进和交流地域推见，西夏的活字印刷术在向西方传播过程中起到了桥梁的作用。原文未记具体件名、文种、装帧、行款与藏地，也未举实物编号。","path":"works/xixia-movable-type-print.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度西夏印刷技术的类别锚点，材料为一段论断，无单件实物记录。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xuwen-jin","title":"续纹锦（Xu-Pattern Brocade, Fragment）","name_en":"Xu-Pattern Brocade, Fragment","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","织锦","绫","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-14. 唐代 续纹锦（局部）”。图注系于“绫”段末：原文记绫一般为素地起两至三枚经斜纹提花，也有染成红、黄、绿、紫等色，引《释名》“其纹望之似冰凌之理”；唐代各类丝织品中绫的品种最多、产量很高，许多地方以绫作贡品，据《新唐书》载共有24处之多；唐绫开始追求大花纹的艺术形式，出现“可幅盘缔缭绫”，即整幅的大花纹，段末以（图6-14）统摄。图注称“锦”，所系段落在论“绫”，绫锦类别不衔接；","path":"works/xuwen-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代丝织品的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yannian-yishou-jin","title":"“延年益寿大宜子孙”锦（Yannian Yishou Brocade）","name_en":"Yannian Yishou Brocade","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","织锦","吉祥文字","新疆民丰","茱萸纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“延年益寿大宜子孙”锦是新疆民丰出土的汉代织锦。它在卷曲的茱萸纹和云气纹之间穿插七八种奇禽异兽，运用装饰的添加手法表现理想世界，是汉代织物动物纹与吉祥图案的实例；李立新又以它说明汉字进入设计、与图形纹样结合，在织物上表现对世间生活幸福的企盼。","path":"works/yannian-yishou-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下汉代织锦文字纹样的器物锚点，同时涉及 B 维度的织造工艺。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yiheyuan","title":"颐和园（Summer Palace (Yiheyuan)）","name_en":"Summer Palace (Yiheyuan)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","皇家园林","清漪园","长廊","十七孔桥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"imperial_garden","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"颐和园的前身是乾隆年间建成的清漪园，清漪园原为金元时期的行宫，明代为“好山园”；乾隆年间大肆修复构筑、扩建湖面水域，改瓮山为万寿山，成为清漪园。1860 年英法联军入侵北京，清漪园与圆明园同时被掠夺毁灭，1893 年修复后称为颐和园，1900 年八国联军又毁坏此园，1905 年清政府重新修复。颐和园以东宫门内仁寿殿为中心，形成寝宫乐寿堂、戏楼德和园等建筑群；万寿山下有 728 米长的彩画长廊，南面","path":"works/yiheyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下清代皇家园林的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yin-xunlu","title":"银熏炉（Silver Censer）","name_en":"Silver Censer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","宋代","文思院","德阳","同名异器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silverware","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"银熏炉在本批来源中指两件不同器物。其一为唐代文思院造鎏金银熏炉：通高 29.5 厘米、盖径 25.9 厘米、腹深 7 厘米、重 5.363 千克；银板锤揲成型，盖面缠枝莲上五朵莲花各卧一龟，腹壁流云纹并铆五兽足，器内錾“咸通十年（公元 869 年）文思院造”等 40 余字。其二为宋代银器：1959 年四川德阳孝泉镇清真寺出土的 117 件宋代银器之一，设计作圆球形，上面镂空成卷草纹，还保存着一些唐","path":"works/yin-xunlu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐宋银熏炉的器物锚点，因同名而合条，内部按唐器／宋器分列。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yongle-gong","title":"永乐宫（Yongle Palace）","name_en":"Yongle Palace","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","道观","三清殿","朝元图","迁建"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"taoist_temple","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"永乐宫位于山西永济，是元代著名的道观。三清殿是永乐宫的重要建筑，为七间阔单檐四坡顶结构，因供奉玉清元始天尊、上清灵宝天尊、太清道德天尊而名“三清殿”；四壁绘有著名壁画《朝元图》，绘画面积达 400 多平方米。永乐宫因 20 世纪 50 年代修建黄河三门峡水库而迁移到山西芮城。2016 记其为元代为皇帝祈福而建的道教建筑群，宫墙基座、门廊、石阶石雕融会道佛纹饰，既有道家植物花草，又有西汉以来西域忍冬","path":"works/yongle-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下元代道教建筑的器物锚点，也涉及 E 维度的纹样传播。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yongzheng-fencai-sangnv-pan","title":"清雍正粉彩仕女采桑图盘（Famille Rose Plate with Ladies Gathering Mulberry Leaves）","name_en":"Famille Rose Plate with Ladies Gathering Mulberry Leaves","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","雍正","粉彩","外销瓷","贸易瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清雍正粉彩外销瓷盘，图9-32 图注作“清代 雍正粉彩仕女采桑图盘”。原文在明清贸易瓷一节举为清代高档外销瓷之例：该盘曾在首都博物馆举办的“清代外销瓷展”中展出，绘图极其精美，众多仕女神形兼备，配景中的房舍器具、树石围栏无不精细入微，画工水平堪比官窑，原文称可说是很高明的画家作品。原文未记尺寸、款识、收藏单位与画稿来源。","path":"works/yongzheng-fencai-sangnv-pan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代外销瓷的器物锚点，材料为正文一段评述加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yu-pingtuo-shuang-putao-jing","title":"玉平脱双葡萄镜（Jade Pingtuo Double-Grape Mirror）","name_en":"Jade Pingtuo Double-Grape Mirror","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["五代","前蜀王建墓","平脱","漆","玉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玉平脱双葡萄镜是五代平脱器中的精美者，在前蜀王建墓出土镜匣中得见；其做法是在铜镜背面用漆平脱出双玉葡萄，可知当时在铜器上也可髹漆并平嵌宝石花纹。","path":"works/yu-pingtuo-shuang-putao-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下五代铜镜的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuan-huoqiang","title":"元代火铳（Yuan Dynasty Hand Cannon）","name_en":"Yuan Dynasty Hand Cannon","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","兵器","火铳","铜铸","浸铜法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"firearm","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代铜质火铳，图8-27 图注作“元代 火铳”。原文在“元代兵器”一节以火铳为元代兵器制造技术提高的例证：火铳设计科学，用材选择优质铜，且铸造工艺十分讲究，铸造出来的铜质火铳表面光净、质地细腻，符合兵器的技术要求。同段另记提炼铜的方法大有改进，已运用科学方法，原文称之为世界上最早用浸铜法生产铜的工艺方法，也是水法冶金技术的起源。原文未记火铳的口径、长度、重量、出土、藏地与铭文。","path":"works/yuan-huoqiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代兵器铸造的器物锚点，材料为正文一段工艺评语加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuan-yinjingjia","title":"元代银镜架（Yuan Silver Mirror Stand）","name_en":"Yuan Silver Mirror Stand","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元末","苏州","张士诚","折叠式","银皮雕镂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silverware","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代银镜架 1964 年出土于苏州盘门外吴门桥东南元末吴王张士诚之父母合葬墓，现藏苏州博物馆。镜架作折叠式，由前后两个支架构成，通高 32.8 厘米、宽 17.8 厘米，仿木制框架结构，在整体支架上镶三片经过雕镂的银皮。","path":"works/yuan-yinjingjia.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下元代银器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuanmingyuan","title":"圆明园（Old Summer Palace (Yuanmingyuan)）","name_en":"Old Summer Palace (Yuanmingyuan)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","皇家园林","西洋楼","英法联军","三山五园"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"imperial_garden","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"圆明园原为雍正皇帝做皇子时赐获的花园，后经乾隆扩建，加修长春园和绮春园。长春园的一部分是欧洲风格的花园，俗称“西洋楼”；圆明园后被英法联军火烧而毁。2016 记其为清代皇家园林，属“三山五园”之一，包括圆明、长春、万春三园。","path":"works/yuanmingyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下清代皇家园林的器物锚点，也涉及 E 维度的跨文化造园。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuehan-tielu-huizhang","title":"粤汉铁路徽章（Yuehan Railway Badge）","name_en":"Yuehan Railway Badge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","徽章","粤汉铁路","标志设计"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"badge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"民国时期徽章，图10-1 图注作“民国 粤汉铁路徽章”。原文在“近现代史上的设计更新”一章开篇，以（图10-1、10-2）统摄两图，正文只述鸦片战争后手工业的转折、清政府创办机器生产企业、辛亥革命后资本主义工商业与机器印花、流行时装、商业美术等线索，未描述徽章本身。","path":"works/yuehan-tielu-huizhang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度民国徽章设计的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuewang-goujian-jian","title":"越王勾践剑（Sword of Goujian, King of Yue）","name_en":"Sword of Goujian, King of Yue","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋晚期","青铜器","兵器","剑","江陵"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_weapon","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"越王勾践剑是春秋晚期吴越之地的青铜剑，湖北江陵出土，剑格嵌饰、剑身铸菱形花纹并错金鸟篆铭文，埋藏两千四百余年仍完好锋利。五册对它的用法分三路：夏燕靖两版给兵器工艺与防锈原理（成分、剑鞘密封、地下水浸泡），赵农给剑格兽面纹的错石工艺，高丰与田自秉各给一句“剑柄嵌有珐琅釉料”，且都用在**景泰蓝／珐琅源流**的论证里。**五册对剑格与剑柄的装饰说法不一**：同一件器物，一处说剑格嵌蓝色琉璃与绿松石，一","path":"works/yuewang-goujian-jian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"越王勾践剑在五册中承担三重论证：兵器形制与冶铸水平（B）、剑格镶嵌与错金鸟篆铭文的装饰与文字（C）、珐琅釉料用于金属器的早期例证（B 之材料工艺，并被高丰、田自秉两册用于景泰蓝源流之争）。五册均不描述剑身尺寸与整体造型。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yunwen-tongjin","title":"云纹铜禁（Bronze Altar (Jin) with Cloud Patterns）","name_en":"Bronze Altar (Jin) with Cloud Patterns","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋中晚期","楚墓","分铸焊接","镂空"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_furniture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"云纹铜禁是本册说明春秋战国青铜冶铸技术提高的实物例证。原文称此时期青铜器使用转向“钟鸣鼎食”器具的组合，失去祭祀和礼器特性而转向日用生活器具；铸造技术提高，普遍采用器身与耳、足、钮等附件分铸，再用熔铸或焊接加工成器，铸件器壁变薄、一般在 2 厘米左右。1978 年河南淅川下寺楚墓出土的、由多层镂空云纹铜梗组成的铜禁（桌），便是春秋中晚期使用青铜冶铸技术制作的实物例证。同段以 1978 年 5 月湖","path":"works/yunwen-tongjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度春秋战国青铜铸造技术的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zanhua-shinv-tu","title":"《簪花仕女图》（Court Ladies Adorning Their Hair with Flowers）","name_en":"Court Ladies Adorning Their Hair with Flowers","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","周昉","女服","广眉","披帛"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中唐周昉画作，图6-24。原文三处引用：女服段记盛唐以后衣袖放大，到中晚唐一般妇女服装“袖宽超过四尺”，举例即“中唐画家周昉的《簪花仕女图》中所描绘的贵族妇女及南唐二陵出土的陶塑妇女服式”；裙装段把《簪花仕女图》列入唐300年裙子变化的图像序列；面妆段记唐代妇女黛眉名目甚多，“《簪花仕女图》中贵族妇女的眉饰，就是一种广眉”。","path":"works/zanhua-shinv-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代女服与妆容的图像锚点，材料为正文三处引用加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zenghouyi-bianzhong","title":"曾侯乙编钟（Bells of Marquis Yi of Zeng）","name_en":"Bells of Marquis Yi of Zeng","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国早期","青铜器","编钟","曾侯乙墓","礼乐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_bell_set","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曾侯乙编钟是 1978 年湖北随县（今随州）曾侯乙墓出土的成套青铜编钟，分上中下三层悬挂，是先秦乐器中体量与音律规模最大的一例。来源之间首先在**件数**上不一致：高丰作“64 件之多”，夏燕靖两版与赵农均作“65 枚”。其次在**论证用途**上分流：夏燕靖两版用它证青铜冶铸的规模与推广（浑铸法、分范合铸、复印花纹），赵农用它证音律成就（五个八度、五声七声音阶、十二个半音）与同墓乐器的组合规模，高","path":"works/zenghouyi-bianzhong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"曾侯乙编钟是 B 维度下战国青铜铸造与乐器设计的规模锚点：件数、层次、音域与铸造工艺在此汇合。其“钟鸣鼎食”的礼乐组合、用钟的等级规定归 D 维度；钟体铭文作为乐律与文字资料归 C 维度。田自秉一册只给编钟作为器类的形制术语，全册未提曾侯乙。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zenghouyi-bronze-jianfou","title":"曾侯乙铜鉴缶（Bronze Jian-Fou from the Tomb of Marquis Yi of Zeng）","name_en":"Bronze Jian-Fou from the Tomb of Marquis Yi of Zeng","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","曾侯乙墓","鉴缶","缶","乐器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曾侯乙铜鉴缶出现在本册“缶器”一节。原文从 2008 年北京奥运会开幕式“击缶而歌”说起，指出其中的缶并非真正的乐器缶：缶作为乐器在我国古代大多为陶制，同时又是食物器皿，如战国曾侯乙铜鉴缶。原文随后引《说文解字》《谏逐客令》《史记·廉颇蔺相如列传》说明缶的形制（圆腹、有盖、肩上有环耳，也有方形）与用途（盛水或酒），并记其盛行于春秋战国。","path":"works/zenghouyi-bronze-jianfou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度战国青铜容器与“缶”类器物概念的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zenghouyi-zunpan","title":"曾侯乙尊盘（Zenghouyi Zun and Pan）","name_en":"Zenghouyi Zun and Pan","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","曾侯乙墓","透雕","熔模铸造","失蜡法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_ritual_vessel","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曾侯乙尊盘出土于湖北随县曾侯乙墓，尊立于盘上。尊盘上下以繁缛的透雕处理，体现了春秋战国时期的熔模设计技术；2016 记墓中出土铜尊、铜盘均由内外两层铜梗组成，透空附饰纤细齐整，是春秋战国青铜冶铸与设计精品。","path":"works/zenghouyi-zunpan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下战国青铜礼器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhaozhou-qiao-595-605","title":"赵州桥（Zhaozhou Bridge）","name_en":"Zhaozhou Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋代","石拱桥","敞肩拱","李春","赵县"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_arch_bridge","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵州桥在河北赵县南洨河上，隋代李春造，又称安济桥。三册都把它当技术史的高点，但**给数的口径不同**：夏燕靖两版给约数（长 50 余米、跨度 37 米多、1300 多年），赵农给精确值（52.82 米、37.4 米、28 道狭拱各 43 块石、9 道铁拉杆）并附唐碑引文。**年代一说 595～605 年设计修建、一说建于 605 年**，两说可相容但不能互证。","path":"works/zhaozhou-qiao-595-605.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"赵州桥是 B 维度下石拱桥的结构样本：敞肩拱、并列式砌筑、铁拉杆、跨高比都在此汇合，也是“结构即形式”的设计观念样本（A 维度）。来源在年代、尺寸、类型名三处均不一致，KU 并列不裁。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhenghe-baochuan","title":"郑和宝船（Zheng He's Treasure Ship）","name_en":"Zheng He's Treasure Ship","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","造船","航海","郑和下西洋","沙船"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"郑和宝船是明永乐至宣德年间郑和七下西洋船队中最大的船。四册的记载角度不同：**夏燕靖两版给主尺度、桅帆数与船队编制**（长 150 米、宽 60 米、9 桅 12 帆、可载 1000 余人），**赵农给出使年表与船上仪器**（1405—1433、28 年、七次、27000 余人、30 余国，配水密隔舱与牵星板等），**高丰只给一句总评与米制尺寸**（146.7 米 × 60 米，“中国古代船舶设计","path":"works/zhenghe-baochuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"郑和宝船是 B 维度下明代造船设计的器物锚点：主尺度、桅帆数、舵杆与船队编制都在此汇合。远洋出使的组织与国家造船业归 D 维度，海禁前后的技术进退归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhongshan-ling-1929","title":"中山陵（Sun Yat-sen Mausoleum）","name_en":"Sun Yat-sen Mausoleum","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","陵墓建筑","中国固有式","吕彦直","南京"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mausoleum","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中山陵在南京紫金山南麓，吕彦直设计，是近代中国以公开竞图方式选定方案的大型纪念建筑群。三册的关注点不同：**夏燕靖两版抄录征稿条例与评判报告**（含“木铎警世”的钟形释义，并判为近代建筑史上首次具有规划设计意识的大型建筑群组），**赵农给年代、空间序列与风格评断**（1929 年设计、“晨钟暮鼓”、传统陵墓设计的“一曲绝唱”）。**两册对“设计”与“征图”的年份记载不一致**，且钟形平面在两册中的","path":"works/zhongshan-ling-1929.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中山陵是 B 维度下近代纪念性建筑群的样本：牌坊—墓道—陵门—碑亭—石阶—祭堂—墓室的空间序列与钟形平面都在此汇合。竞图制度、征稿条例与评判报告归 D 维度；“中国固有式”“民族形式”的取向归 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhu-bishan-yincha","title":"朱碧山银槎（龙槎杯）（Silver Raft Cup by Zhu Bishan）","name_en":"Silver Raft Cup by Zhu Bishan","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","朱碧山","银器","槎杯","至正乙酉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silver_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代银工朱碧山所制银槎杯，图8-28 图注作“元代 银龙槎”。原文称银槎为一件酒器，又称槎杯：杯高15.2厘米，长19.8厘米；造型作枝干杈桠的老树，树皮纹理清丽细密，有一老者坐于槎内，手持长石，石上有篆书“支机”二字。槎底刻篆书“槎杯”和“至正乙酉（1345）造”年款，另有七言诗一首：“欲造银河隔上阑，时人浪说贯银湾，如何不觅天孙锦，止带支机片石还。”诗下镌“碧山子”印。原文说乘槎老者的形象与纹","path":"works/zhu-bishan-yincha.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代金银器的器物锚点，材料为正文一段实测记录加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhui-hanxin-tu-meiping","title":"追韩信图梅瓶（Meiping Vase with the Story of Xiao He Pursuing Han Xin）","name_en":"Meiping Vase with the Story of Xiao He Pursuing Han Xin","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","青花","梅瓶","历史故事纹","瓷器装饰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代瓷器，图8-11 的图注为：8-11. 元代“追韩信图”梅瓶。原文在元代瓷器装饰纹样一段说元代瓷品的装饰对历史故事题材的创作十分重视，如萧何月下追韩信、蒙恬将军等，这对明清两代瓷器上人物故事的题材有重大影响，句末以（图8-11、8-12）统摄两器。原文未描述此瓶的尺寸、窑口、出土与藏地，也未展开画面情节。","path":"works/zhui-hanxin-tu-meiping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代瓷器装饰题材的器物锚点，材料为图注一行加同段题材列举。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhui-pian","title":"追篇（Zhui Vessel (as Captioned)）","name_en":"Zhui Vessel (as Captioned)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","青铜器","图版著录","器名存疑"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"追篇见本册图版 2-9，图注仅一行“西周 追篇”。原文未在任何段落讨论此器，形制、尺寸、铭文、出土与收藏均无着落。器名“篇”在此语境下可疑：西周青铜器通行器名有“簋”而无“篇”，“追簋”是常见器名，故“篇”很可能是形近讹字或排版误植，但原文没有其他线索可以确证，本条只标疑不改字。","path":"works/zhui-pian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度西周青铜器的图版锚点，材料只有一行图注且器名存疑。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhulin-qixian-huaxiang-zhuan","title":"竹林七贤画像砖（Brick Relief of the Seven Sages of the Bamboo Grove）","name_en":"Brick Relief of the Seven Sages of the Bamboo Grove","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晋代","画像砖","文人服饰","玄学","褒衣博带"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brick_relief","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"竹林七贤画像砖是本册论证晋代文人衣着的图像证据。原文称晋代后“汉装”与“胡服”虽各有承袭，但交融演变、样式复杂：“禅衣”仍为仕宦礼服，“长袍”为交领右衽式、袖端收有祛口或为窄袖，“大衫”为袖口宽敞、领和袖都有缘边、衣衫肥长到膝部并束大带；文人则受佛道两教的影响崇尚玄学，衣着突破礼法，敞领宽衫、袒胸露怀成为习俗，这从《竹林七贤画像砖》中可以得到佐证。","path":"works/zhulin-qixian-huaxiang-zhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度魏晋服饰与士人文化的图像锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhuozhengyuan","title":"拙政园（Humble Administrator's Garden）","name_en":"Humble Administrator's Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","苏州园林","文征明","远香堂","72亩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"拙政园是明代中期修筑的苏州园林，“拙政”出自西晋潘岳《闲居赋》“灌园鬻蔬，以供朝夕之膳，是亦拙者之为政也”。明代大画家文征明绘有《拙政园图》并著《拙政园记》；园分中、西、东三部分，占地 72 亩，为最大的苏州园林，中部以远香堂为中心，有倚玉轩、小飞虹、香洲、见山楼、雪香云蔚亭、梧竹幽居、荷风四面亭及枇杷园等。","path":"works/zhuozhengyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代私家园林的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhuwen-heitao-bo","title":"猪纹黑陶钵（Black Pottery Bowl with Pig Motif）","name_en":"Black Pottery Bowl with Pig Motif","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["河姆渡文化","黑陶","猪纹","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"猪纹黑陶钵见于本册图版 1-16，图注为“河姆渡文化 猪纹黑陶钵”。原文没有展开描述：器形、尺寸、陶质、出土层位、猪纹的构图与刻画方式均未交代，正文也未在河姆渡文化段落提到这一件。","path":"works/zhuwen-heitao-bo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度河姆渡文化陶器的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zisha-donglinggua","title":"紫砂“东陵瓜”（Yixing Zisha 'Dongling Melon' Vessel）","name_en":"Yixing Zisha 'Dongling Melon' Vessel","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","宜兴","紫砂","东陵瓜","紫砂壶"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"teapot","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清代宜兴紫砂器，图9-27 的图注为：9-27. 清代 紫砂“东陵瓜”。原文在同段总述紫砂陶：紫砂陶是宜兴最有名的陶器，多做茶具；紫砂壶有泡茶色纯、隔夜不馊、用久味永、泥色生辉的特点；陶色有赤褐、淡黄、紫黑等，由紫砂细泥、白泥、绿泥、大红泥等高温烧成；质地本色自然纯朴，以造型取胜，“方非一式，圆不一样”，塑造精致，浅刻花卉、文字装饰。原文未单独描述“东陵瓜”的形制、作者与尺寸。","path":"works/zisha-donglinggua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代宜兴紫砂的器物锚点，材料为图注一行加同段紫砂通说。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"}],"links":[],"structure":{"domains":[],"dimensions":[],"themes":[],"topics":[]},"stats":{"total_nodes":1277,"total_links":0,"relation_index_total":0,"skipped_non_unit_relations":0,"by_type":{"person":119,"institution":144,"place":149,"work":182,"publication":126,"term":321,"procedure":121,"event":115},"hierarchy":{"domain_assigned":1277,"dimension_assigned":1277,"theme_assigned":0,"topic_assigned":0},"structure_nodes":{"domains":0,"dimensions":0,"themes":0,"topics":0}}};
+window.KNOWLEDGE_GRAPH_DATA={"nodes":[{"id":"events:1851-wanguo-bolanhui","title":"1851年英国万国博览会（The Great Exhibition of 1851）","name_en":"The Great Exhibition of 1851","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["1851","万国博览会","水晶宫","工业革命","现代设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵农两处记 1851 年英国博览会：总结处称“在 1851 年英国‘万国博览会’中，钢铁、玻璃结构的‘水晶宫’的出现，揭开了现代艺术设计的序幕”；后记处称“1851 年的英国世界博览会，展示着工业革命的成果，并由此带来了现代设计文化的兴盛”。来源未给举办城市、展馆尺寸、参展国数量、展品清单与参观人数。","path":"events/1851-wanguo-bolanhui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"1851 年英国万国博览会是 E 维度下现代设计诞生的跨文化节点，其钢铁玻璃建筑技术归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:1972-1976-dingci-huifu","title":"定瓷恢复（Revival of Ding Ware Production）","name_en":"Revival of Ding Ware Production","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","color":"#EF4444","tags":["定瓷","定窑","曲阳","周恩来","田中角荣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_event","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏燕靖记“文革”极左思潮下工艺美术生产瘫痪，到 1970 年全国有半数以上工艺美术企业转产或停产，产值下降 47%，许多传统产品销声匿迹。从 1971 年到 1972 年，周恩来总理和国务院其他领导人开始力争扭转这一混乱局面。1972 年，日本首相田中角荣访华时向周恩来询问定瓷的烧制状况，周恩来回答说正在恢复之中。1974 年，在周恩来的关怀下，河北保定地区工艺美术定瓷厂在曲阳建立。两年后，定瓷恢","path":"events/1972-1976-dingci-huifu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"定瓷恢复是 B 维度下失传名瓷工艺复原的节点，其政府推动与工厂建制归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"events:1998-moe-major-catalog","title":"1998 年教育部本科专业目录调整（1998 Adjustment of the Ministry of Education Undergraduate Program Catalogue）","name_en":"1998 Adjustment of the Ministry of Education Undergraduate Program Catalogue","type":"event","type_zh":"事件","