 维度下设计教育教材丛书的条目；其设计学知识体系属 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:gegu-yaolun","title":"格古要论（Gegu Yaolun）","name_en":"Gegu Yaolun","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","曹昭","王佐","鉴赏","青花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"connoisseurship_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《格古要论》是明代曹昭所撰、王佐增补的古物鉴赏专著，3 卷。全书分古铜器、古画、古墨迹、古碑法帖、古琴、古砚、珍奇、金铁、古窑器、古漆器、锦绮、异木、异石诸论，记青花及彭均（君）宝仿定等窑口。高丰将其列入明代手工业设计专著群。","path":"publications/gegu-yaolun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代鉴赏文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:gong-yi-mei-shu-yu-jian-zhu-de-feng-ge","title":"《工艺美术与建筑的风格》（Style in the Applied Arts and Architecture）","name_en":"Style in the Applied Arts and Architecture","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["19世纪","欧洲","森珀","设计史","风格论"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_theory_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《工艺美术与建筑的风格》是森珀的重要著作。李立新记其探讨从远古至当代的艺术历史，认为这是连续的、线性的发展过程，风格定型变化由地域、气候、时代、习俗，特别是材料、工具等多种因素造成；森珀从建筑和工艺品设计在功能、材料技术与装饰的联系入手探讨历史风格演变，为设计史研究在美术史研究领域赢得地位。来源未给出版年份、出版地、原书名与版本。","path":"publications/gong-yi-mei-shu-yu-jian-zhu-de-feng-ge.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度下欧洲设计史风格论的文献条目，其材料、工具与功能分析归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:gongcheng-zuofa","title":"工程做法（Gongcheng Zuofa）","name_en":"Gongcheng Zuofa","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","建筑规范","清工部","营造"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regulation","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《工程做法》是清雍正十二年（1734）清工部颁布的建筑规范，共 74 卷。2016 册正文称其列举 27 种建筑物各种构件的准确尺寸与作法，并规定斗拱、装修、石作、瓦作、土作等用工用料，可加快设计施工但不利于建筑多样化；文献索引列其卷目，并称其与《营造法式》为古代官方建筑标准仅有的两部古籍。2009 册作《工程作法》，同样记其于清雍正十二年颁行，列举 27 种建筑物各种构件的准确尺寸与作法，并对斗","path":"publications/gongcheng-zuofa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:gongye-shejixue-gailun","title":"《工业设计学概论》（Introduction to Industrial Design）","name_en":"Introduction to Industrial Design","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["改革开放","柳冠中","工业设计","著述","工业设计学概论"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_theory_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《工业设计学概论》是柳冠中的工业设计理论著述。赵农在“设计研究”段将其列入十余年来有影响的设计著述。来源未给出版社、出版年、卷册与内容结构。","path":"publications/gongye-shejixue-gailun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《工业设计学概论》是 A 维度下工业设计理论著述的条目；其出版与教育传播属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:gongyi-meishu-cankao","title":"工艺美术参考（Gongyi Meishu Cankao）","name_en":"Gongyi Meishu Cankao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1982","中央工艺美术学院","工艺美术","工业设计教育","设计教育"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《工艺美术参考》是中央工艺美术学院编辑出版的期刊，1982 年 7 月 1 日出版。2009 册记，从 1983 年开始，该刊重点发表有关工业设计教育的文论，引发全国设计教育培养方向的讨论。\n\n来源只给出版日期、编辑出版者与 1983 年的内容转向，未给刊期、主编、栏目、篇幅或具体文章。","path":"publications/gongyi-meishu-cankao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下设计教育与专业期刊的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:guanzi","title":"管子（Guanzi）","name_en":"Guanzi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","管仲","齐国","工具","城市选址"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《管子》是先秦典籍，相传为春秋时期齐国政治家管仲的著作，今存 76 篇；2016 称其为战国时各学派言论汇编，内容庞杂，包括法家、儒家、道家、阴阳家、名家、兵家和农家观点，传说根本为春秋初期管仲言论。赵农引《管子·轻重乙》说明农、车、女所需工具：齐国种田男子必须有一犁、一耙、一把锄等，造车木匠必须有斧、锯、锥、凿等，妇女必须有针、刀等；又引《管子·乘马》“凡立国都，非于大山之下必于广川之上……”说","path":"publications/guanzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下先秦造物与城市思想文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:gujin-tushu-jicheng","title":"古今图书集成（Gujin Tushu Jicheng）","name_en":"Gujin Tushu Jicheng","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","类书","铜活字","宋体字","插图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《古今图书集成》是清代内府用铜活字排印的大型类书，也是六册中唯一被反复用来标定“铜活字印刷最高成就”的书。三册对它的取材同为印刷技术条目，但取舍不同：高丰给它字数、册数、字体与插图四项，赵农给卷数、字数、册数、函数、印数与性质定位，夏燕靖 2016 只给卷数、册数、印数与排印年。三册都不记编纂者、成书经过与全书部类结构。","path":"publications/gujin-tushu-jicheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《古今图书集成》在三册中都是印刷技术条目：铜活字排印、铜活字宋体字、雕版插图三类事实构成其主体，故归主维度 C（视觉传达与文字设计）；其官修性质与内府刻书规模属 D，开本与装帧材料属 B。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:guo-shi-bu","title":"《国史补》（Guoshi Bu (Supplement to the History of the Tang)）","name_en":"Guoshi Bu (Supplement to the History of the Tang)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","李肇","越州","纺织","民间纺织业"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"notebook","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《国史补》是唐代李肇所著之书。赵农 2009 册在隋唐第六章第八节民间设计行业述纺织业时，引其中一则故事：越州妇女本来不会织布，浙江东道节度使出钱让未婚士兵到北方娶回会纺织的媳妇，每年使数百名北方纺织巧手来到南方，促进了浙江地区民间纺织业发展。来源未给成书年代、卷数、体例与版本，也未说明该故事出自哪一篇。赵农册内《国史补》仅此一见。","path":"publications/guo-shi-bu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下唐代文献的条目，其所记越州纺织技术传播归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:guoji-guanggao","title":"《国际广告》（Guoji Guanggao (International Advertising)）","name_en":"Guoji Guanggao (International Advertising)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["改革开放","广告业","专业杂志","国际广告"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"trade_periodical","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《国际广告》是 1992 年以后中国探讨广告业的专业杂志之一。赵农在广告复兴段，将其与《中国广告》并称，并记中国艺术设计界引入 CI 设计、建立标准化企业识别系统。来源未给创办单位、创刊年、刊期与主编。","path":"publications/guoji-guanggao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《国际广告》是 C 维度下广告专业杂志的条目；其行业组织与专业教育属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:gutong-ciqi-kao","title":"古铜瓷器考（Gutong Ciqi Kao）","name_en":"Gutong Ciqi Kao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","梁同书","铜器","瓷器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《古铜瓷器考》为清代梁同书撰，2 卷。卷 1 论古铜色辨、鉴古审款识、三代古器等，卷 2 论古今诸窑、釉水、火候窑变、以旧补旧、制瓷器不裂法等。","path":"publications/gutong-ciqi-kao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:haiguo-tuzhi","title":"海国图志（Haiguo Tuzhi）","name_en":"Haiguo Tuzhi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["晚清","魏源","世界地理","变法","仿造"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geography","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《海国图志》是晚清魏源的著作，书中初步介绍了西方民主政治制度，赵农将其作为魏源放眼世界、主张变法的著述依据。李立新记其建议仿造量天尺、千里镜、龙尾车、风锯、水锯、火轮机、火轮舟、自来火、自转礁、千斤秤等“有益民用者”。","path":"publications/haiguo-tuzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 E 维度下晚清西器东传文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:han-shu","title":"汉书（Han Shu / Book of Han）","name_en":"Han Shu / Book of Han","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["秦汉","东汉","班固","正史","断代史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"history","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《汉书》是东汉班固所撰的史书。来源称“东汉班固（公元32—公元92年）的《汉书》延续了司马迁所开拓的史学工作，开始形成了历朝断代史的著述”（L2517）。在本章中，来源把它作为汉武帝货币改革、汉五铢、驰道与汉代度量衡的引文出处，涉及《武帝本纪》《食货志》《贾山传》《律历志》四个篇目；来源没有介绍全书卷数、体例、成书年代与版本。","path":"publications/han-shu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《汉书》是 A 维度下东汉正史文献的锚点，其《食货志》《律历志》等篇同时为 B 维度货币与度量衡叙述提供引文。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:hanfeizi","title":"韩非子（Han Feizi）","name_en":"Han Feizi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","韩非","法家","买椟还珠","反文饰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《韩非子》是战国末年思想家韩非的著作，韩非是荀子的学生，后以法家思想著称。他反对文饰、崇尚功用，以器具说明思想，如“买椟还珠”（《韩非子·外储说左上》）的故事从侧面反映物品的用途和装饰的意义；又引“竽先，则钟瑟皆随；竽唱，则诸乐皆和”。2016 引《韩非·五蠹篇》“古者丈夫不耕，草木之实足食也；妇人不织，禽兽之皮是衣也”，用以说明纺织品出现以前的衣着状况；并称其提出“法”“术”“势”相结合的法治理","path":"publications/hanfeizi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下先秦造物思想文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:hansheng","title":"《汉声》（Hansheng (Echo Magazine)）","name_en":"Hansheng (Echo Magazine)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["台湾","民间艺术","杂志","书籍装帧","汉声"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《汉声》是台湾杂志。赵农称其以现代文化的视野，对传统民间艺术进行梳理，装帧设计也别具匠心，并与香港商业文化书籍装帧的明快醒目并论。来源未给创刊年、创办人、刊期与开本。","path":"publications/hansheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《汉声》是 C 维度下传统民间艺术杂志装帧的条目；其现代视野与传统题材的张力属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:hongloumeng","title":"《红楼梦》（Dream of the Red Chamber）","name_en":"Dream of the Red Chamber","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明清","小说","曹雪芹","大观园","园林描写"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"literary_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《红楼梦》是曹雪芹的小说。赵农在园林章节末尾谈文人小说中的园林描写，称《红楼梦》为明清时期小说之冠，其对大观园的景致进行了细致刻画。来源未给成书年代、版本、回数与大观园描写的具体章回。","path":"publications/hongloumeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《红楼梦》是 A 维度下以小说保存园林描写的文献条目；其文本描写兼及 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:hongqi","title":"红旗（Hongqi）","name_en":"Hongqi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["文革","期刊","装帧设计","政治出版"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《红旗》是“文革”时期期刊装帧设计的代表。2016 册称其版式主要参照毛泽东著作和马恩列斯著作进行设计，与《解放军文艺》同为代表；图注 11-34 为《红旗》封面，图版未视觉核验。","path":"publications/hongqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下视觉传达与出版物的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:huainanzi","title":"淮南子（Huainanzi）","name_en":"Huainanzi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["西汉","刘安","淮南鸿烈","五行"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《淮南子》又名《淮南鸿烈》《刘安子》，西汉淮南王刘安招集宾客集体编撰。2016 册正文引《精神》《主术》《本经》诸篇，说明其主张上古帝王住房崇尚朴素自然、不事过分装饰，并把设计门类与五行学说相联系；文献索引概括其“器以载道”的造物观。原文作“西代淮南王刘安”，“西代”疑为“西汉”之讹。","path":"publications/huainanzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jiaguwen-bian","title":"甲骨文编（Jiaguwen Bian）","name_en":"Jiaguwen Bian","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["甲骨文","孙海波","字书","文字统计"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palaeographic_catalogue","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《甲骨文编》是孙海波所编的甲骨文字书。赵农在记甲骨文发现与研究时，据孙海波《甲骨文编》给出字数：甲骨前后发现约15万片，其中一部分有文字刻画，经过整理确定约4672个文字，能够确认的约1723个。来源只把该书作为字数统计的依据，没有介绍其编纂体例、出版信息与收字范围。","path":"publications/jiaguwen-bian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"甲骨文编是 C 维度下甲骨文字统计所据的字书条目，来源只引其字数，未给版本与体例。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jianbian-tongling","title":"剪辫通令（Jianbian Tongling）","name_en":"Jianbian Tongling","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","服饰改制","法令","剪辫"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regulation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《剪辫通令》是 1912 年民国政府首先颁行的剪辫法令。2016 册将其与随后发布的《服制条例》并提，说明二者共同推动近代服饰改制，冲垮历代衣冠等级制度。","path":"publications/jianbian-tongling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jiangning-zhizao-yu-caojia","title":"江宁织造与曹家（Jiangning Zhizao yu Caojia）","name_en":"Jiangning Zhizao yu Caojia","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","江宁织造","曹雪芹","官营织造"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《江宁织造与曹家》是周汝昌、严中合著、中华书局 2006 年出版的专著，探讨江宁织造与曹雪芹家世。2016 册据其梳理曹玺至曹颙、曹頫承袭江宁织造 58 年并兼理巡盐、承办铜斤等经济要务。原文作“曹頡”，疑为“曹頫”之讹。","path":"publications/jiangning-zhizao-yu-caojia.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jianguo-fanglue","title":"《建国方略》（Jianguo Fanglue (The International Development of China)）","name_en":"Jianguo Fanglue (The International Development of China)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","1919","孙中山","东方大港","浦东"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"planning_program","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《建国方略》是孙中山 1919 年完成的著作。赵农记书中设计了上海“东方大港”及在浦东创造市宅中心的计划，并称这一计划在 20 世纪末才初步完成；来源以此说明上海早期无规划的自发性发展为后续规划带来难度。来源未给全书卷数、篇目结构与港口、市宅的具体技术方案。","path":"publications/jianguo-fanglue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《建国方略》是 D 维度下近代建国规划文献的条目；其城市空间构想属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jiating-siyouzhi-guojia-de-qiyuan","title":"《家庭、私有制和国家的起源》（The Origin of the Family, Private Property and the State）","name_en":"The Origin of the Family, Private Property and the State","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["恩格斯","陶器起源","原始社会","家庭、私有制和国家的起源"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"theoretical_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《家庭、私有制和国家的起源》是恩格斯的著作。田自秉在陶器起源段引其关于陶器制造起因的论述：陶器的制造都是由于在编制的或木制的容器上涂上粘土使之能够耐火而产生的。来源未给译者、出版社、出版年与版本。","path":"publications/jiating-siyouzhi-guojia-de-qiyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度下工艺史理论引证的文献条目；其陶器起源论述属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jiefang-ribao","title":"《解放日报》（Jiefang Ribao (Liberation Daily)）","name_en":"Jiefang Ribao (Liberation Daily)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["解放区","延安","机关报","纺织社论","陶瓷报道"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"newspaper","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《解放日报》是中共中央机关报。田自秉两处引用它：一处记它曾三次发表有关纺织的社论，并列出《自己种棉花，自己织布穿》《论自纺自织》《自卫战争中的民间纺织》三篇的日期；一处记 1944 年 5 月 13 日它报道延安桥儿沟陶瓷厂利用石膏模型、改造窑炉而提高产量与质量。来源未给创刊与终刊年份、社长与主编、发行范围。","path":"publications/jiefang-ribao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度解放区报刊的文献条目，社论所涉纺织与陶瓷生产属 A、B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jiefangjun-wenyi","title":"解放军文艺（Jiefangjun Wenyi）","name_en":"Jiefangjun Wenyi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["文革","期刊","装帧设计","复刊"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《解放军文艺》是“文革”时期期刊装帧设计的代表之一。2016 册称其与《红旗》同为主要参照毛泽东著作和马恩列斯著作的版式进行设计；图注 11-35 为 1972 年 5 月复刊的封面，图版未视觉核验。","path":"publications/jiefangjun-wenyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下视觉传达与出版物的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jiegou-renleixue-de-lishi","title":"《结构人类学的历史》（The History of Structural Anthropology）","name_en":"The History of Structural Anthropology","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["结构人类学","马克·加博里约","历史解释","史学理论"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"academic_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《结构人类学的历史》是马克·加博里约的著作。李立新引其中一句“人们在声称以‘实在的’历史为依据时，实际上是在运用某种‘解释’”，用来论证设计史的真实须经研究主体的理解而复现，不能把史料堆积等同于历史。原著版本、译者与出版信息未载。","path":"publications/jiegou-renleixue-de-lishi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度史学理论的著作条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jieziyuan-huazhuan","title":"芥子园画传（Jieziyuan Huazhuan）","name_en":"Jieziyuan Huazhuan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","画谱","短版套印","王概","中国画教材"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"print_album","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《芥子园画传》是清康熙至嘉庆年间刻印的画谱，采用明代创造的短版套印工艺并有所发展。它由李渔女婿请画家王概等人编绘，初期有山水卷、梅兰竹菊卷、草虫花鸟卷，后来加进人物卷；整部书编辑详备、体例得当、印制清晰、文风典雅，是清代以来中国画学的基础课本。赵农在园林章节另把李渔的芥子园与参与编撰的《芥子园画谱》中的树石山水并提，称其对造园艺术有着深远影响；该句只说参与编撰，未明言编撰者为准。","path":"publications/jieziyuan-huazhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下清代画谱的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jifufu","title":"机妇赋（Jifu Fu）","name_en":"Jifu Fu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["东汉","王逸","提花机","织造","赋"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"rhapsody","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《机妇赋》是东汉王逸所作赋文，以文学语言描绘提花机生产情形。李立新引“兔耳跄伏……猛犬相守……高楼双峙，下临清池”，并释兔耳、猛犬、高楼为提花机部件；2016 引作“兔耳踆伏，若安若危。猛犬相守，窜身匿蹄。高楼双峙，下临清池。游鱼衔饵，瀲澔其陂”。","path":"publications/jifufu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下汉代织机文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jijiu-pian","title":"《急就篇》（Jijiu Pian）","name_en":"Jijiu Pian","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["汉代","启蒙读本","韵文","染织纹样","颜师古注"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"primer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《急就篇》是汉代启蒙读本，史游所作。来源录其韵文“锦绣缦纯离云爵，乘风县钟华洞乐，豹首落莫兔双鹤，春草鸡翘凫翁濯”，并录唐代颜师古注释，认为可侧面反映汉代染织物图案的生动复杂。来源未给成书年代、篇目、版本与注本。","path":"publications/jijiu-pian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《急就篇》是 C 维度下汉代启蒙读本与染织纹样文献的条目，其织物图案的物质面向归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jingangjing-868","title":"《金刚经》（868年敦煌本）（Diamond Sutra, 868 Dunhuang Edition）","name_en":"Diamond Sutra, 868 Dunhuang Edition","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","咸通","雕版印刷","佛经","敦煌藏经洞"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_sutra","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《金刚经》868年敦煌本是1900年敦煌藏经洞出土的一卷完整雕版印刷佛经。来源记其以7张纸连接而成，高1尺、长16尺，扉页有佛祖说法木刻画，卷尾题王玠为二亲敬造普施，年代为唐咸通九年（公元868年）。来源又以此卷刻制精美、技术成熟，提出或许有更早印刷品的疑问。绪论亦以此卷为唐代雕版印刷的代表。图6-22图版未核，本条不据图补写扉页构图与人物数量。李立新另称此卷首图为木刻版画，记佛前有一带盖香炉、左","path":"publications/jingangjing-868.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《金刚经》868年敦煌本是 B 维度下唐代雕版印刷技术的代表性印本，其扉页木刻与文字版面归 C 维度；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jingangjing-zhu","title":"《金刚经注》（Commentary on the Diamond Sutra）","name_en":"Commentary on the Diamond Sutra","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","套色印刷","金刚经","中兴路","无闻和尚"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《金刚经注》是现存最早的套印本。赵农记元代印刷出现套色书籍，现存台湾的最早套印本为 1341 年中兴路（湖北江陵）无闻和尚注释的《金刚经注》，扉页有黑红套色图画，经文为红色正文、黑色注文。来源未给版式、套版数与印本藏地细节。","path":"publications/jingangjing-zhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《金刚经注》是 C 维度下元代套色印刷的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jingdezhen-taolu","title":"景德镇陶录（Jingdezhen Taolu）","name_en":"Jingdezhen Taolu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","景德镇","陶瓷","窑业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《景德镇陶录》为清代兰浦著、郑廷桂补辑，10 卷，分《图说》《国朝御窑厂恭纪》《镇器原始》《陶务条目》《陶务方略》《景德镇历代窑考》《镇仿古窑考》《古窑考》《陶说杂编》上下与《陶录余论》。原文作“兰浦”，通行多作“蓝浦”，照录标疑。","path":"publications/jingdezhen-taolu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jingshi-dadian","title":"经世大典（Jingshi Dadian）","name_en":"Jingshi Dadian","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","官修","建筑制度","工典","奎章阁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"official_compendium","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《经世大典》是元代官方编纂的政书，又名《皇朝经世大典》，元文宗至顺元年由奎章阁学士院编纂，赵世延总撰、虞集副总撰，次年 5 月成书；全书 880 卷、目录 12 卷，分君事 4 篇、臣事 6 篇，工典列 22 目，保存元代建筑与工艺制度。夏燕靖 2009 称其记述元代建筑的详细方式，使这一时期的建筑特色得以流传，并把它作为建筑兴盛促进较完整建筑学著作出现的例证。","path":"publications/jingshi-dadian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下元代官修营造文献的锚点，也涉及 D 维度的官修制度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jingxing-ji","title":"《经行记》（Jingxing Ji）","name_en":"Jingxing Ji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","杜环","大食","工艺工匠","中外交流"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"travel_record","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《经行记》是唐代杜环天宝年间出国后所写的游记。田自秉引其中一条：杜环在大食首都见到京兆人樊淑、刘泚作画，河东人乐环、吕礼织络，用以说明唐代工艺工匠曾到国外传艺。原书未在来源中展开，条目只记录这一转引及其论证用途。","path":"publications/jingxing-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《经行记》是 E 维度下唐代中外工艺交流的文献条目，其工匠身份与官方出使背景属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jinwen-bian","title":"金文编（Jinwen Bian）","name_en":"Jinwen Bian","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["金文","容庚","字书","青铜器铭文"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palaeographic_catalogue","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《金文编》是容庚所编的金文字书。赵农在记钟鼎文时，据容庚《金文编》给出字数：历代出土青铜器上共有15000个铭文，删除重复后单个文字约3772个，能够阅读的有2000个左右。来源只把该书作为金文字数统计的依据，没有介绍其编纂体例、出版信息与收字范围。","path":"publications/jinwen-bian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金文编是 C 维度下金文字统计所据的字书条目，来源只引其字数，未给版本与体例。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jinzang","title":"《金藏》（Jin Canon）","name_en":"Jin Canon","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["金代","雕版印刷","佛藏","解州天宁寺","开宝藏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"buddhist_canon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《金藏》是金代民间募捐雕造的大藏经。赵农记《金藏》由解州（山西运城）天宁寺主持开雕，前后共用 30 年，资金来自民间募捐；传说发起人为一位崔姓妇女，曾断臂立志奉佛，后崔氏将《金藏》送于燕京，受金世宗护封；原书 1934 年发现时已残缺，剩 4900 卷，估计原有 7000 卷，为金代以前佛教典籍的总汇；《金藏》为卷轴装，是北宋《开宝藏》的翻刻本，保留了许多已散失的《开宝藏》经卷特点。来源未给开雕与","path":"publications/jinzang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《金藏》是 C 维度下金代雕版佛藏的条目；其民间募捐与官方护封背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jinzhi","title":"《金枝》（The Golden Bough）","name_en":"The Golden Bough","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["弗雷泽","巫术","宗教","宗教学"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《金枝》是弗雷泽的著作。李立新引其论述：巫术“借符咒魔法的力量来使自然界符合人的愿望”，巫术的方式是“强迫或压制这些神灵”，宗教则是“取悦或讨好它们”，弗雷泽认为后者才是真正的宗教形态。来源未给版本、译者、出版年与出版地。","path":"publications/jinzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度宗教学著作的条目，其宗教形态判断用于解释三代造物，属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:jiujing","title":"《九经》（Nine Classics）","name_en":"Nine Classics","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["五代","儒家经典","国子监","监本","雕版印刷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"confucian_classics","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《九经》是《诗经》《尚书》《易经》《周礼》《仪礼》《礼记》《春秋公羊传》《春秋谷梁传》《春秋左氏传》九部儒家经典的合称。赵农记五代时期的唐、晋、汉、周四个不同时期连续22年（公元932—953年）印制《九经》，由当时国子监校勘，俗称儒家经典的“监本”。来源把《九经》作为政府雕版印书的早期大规模工程，未给各经卷数、版式与存世印本。","path":"publications/jiujing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《九经》是 C 维度下五代官方雕版印本的条目；其国子监校勘与政府出版制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:kaibao-zang","title":"《开宝藏》（Kaibao Canon）","name_en":"Kaibao Canon","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北宋","开宝四年","雕版印刷","佛经","扉画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"buddhist_canon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《开宝藏》是北宋开宝四年（971）雕印的佛教藏经。2009 册在宋版书插图一段记其中《佛说阿惟越政遮经》卷首扉画：它继承唐五代经卷扉画的形式，但雕刻技法更细致工丽。来源以《开宝藏》扉画为宋版书插图更为工整的例证，并与南宋《佛国禅师文殊指南图赞》的 56 幅连环版画、《六经图》《列女传》《梅花喜神谱》《忘忧清乐集》并列为宋代版画的代表作。\n\n同段先概括宋版书版式、字体、用纸、插图四项特点：北宋刻本大","path":"publications/kaibao-zang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度北宋雕版佛藏的出版物锚点，其扉画与宋版书插图同属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:kaiyuan-zabao","title":"《开元杂报》（Kaiyuan Zabao）","name_en":"Kaiyuan Zabao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","开元","报纸","邸报","印刷术"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"official_gazette","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《开元杂报》是来源所述唐玄宗开元年间由唐朝官方出版的中国最早报纸。来源记其始于公元713年，属政府公文邸报性质，数量不多，但标志着印刷术进入新闻领域。来源未给报纸的形制、发行周期、单页尺寸与存世实物，本条不补。其印刷属性是来源论断，本条照录。","path":"publications/kaiyuan-zabao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《开元杂报》是 D 维度下唐代官方新闻出版制度的条目，其印刷手段归 B 维度；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:kaogongji-tu","title":"考工记图（Kaogongji Tu）","name_en":"Kaogongji Tu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","戴震","考工记","图录","尺度"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"illustrated_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《考工记图》是清代戴震对《考工记》的自注并绘图说明，为清乾隆年间《戴氏遗书》所收。戴震对《考工记》中的礼乐、车舆、宫室、武器等进行图录式说明，对后人正确理解《考工记》内容有一定指导意义。李立新引其中“考工诸篇，高庫广狭有度”，以说明“度”兼为尺度与适度。","path":"publications/kaogongji-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下清代《考工记》研究文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:kaogongji","title":"考工记（Kaogongji）","name_en":"Kaogongji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["工艺典籍","先秦","百工","齐国官书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《考工记》是先秦工艺文献，今本通常作为《周礼》的一部分流传，故又称《周礼·考工记》或《周礼·冬官考工记》。它系统记载百工分工、器物形制、材料选择与工艺规范，是六册来源共同引用、用以说明中国早期造物与设计制度的核心文本。","path":"publications/kaogongji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"只在 pilot 维度 B 下完成暂定主导航；Theme 与 Topic 尚未 materialize，故 primary_theme 与 topic_memberships 留空。该缺口是研究债务，不是已完成的层级映射。"},{"id":"publications:lao-fangzi","title":"《老房子》（Lao Fangzi (Old Houses)）","name_en":"Lao Fangzi (Old Houses)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["改革开放","1993","江苏美术出版社","书籍装帧","老房子"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《老房子》是江苏美术出版社 1993 年出版的图集。赵农在改革开放后书籍装帧恢复段，将其与《中国历代绘画》《陈寅恪文集》《读书》《装饰》《老照片》并列为封面装帧焕然一新的出版物。来源未给编者、册数、开本与印数。","path":"publications/lao-fangzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《老房子》是 C 维度下建筑图集装帧的条目；江苏美术出版社的出版组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:lao-zhaopian","title":"《老照片》（Lao Zhaopian (Old Photographs)）","name_en":"Lao Zhaopian (Old Photographs)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["改革开放","山东画报出版社","书籍装帧","老照片"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_series","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《老照片》是山东画报出版社出版的图文书。赵农在改革开放后书籍装帧恢复段，将其与《中国历代绘画》《陈寅恪文集》《读书》《装饰》《老房子》并列为封面装帧焕然一新的出版物。来源未给出版年、编者、辑数、开本与印数。","path":"publications/lao-zhaopian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《老照片》是 C 维度下图文书装帧的条目；山东画报出版社的出版组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:laocan-youji","title":"《老残游记》（The Travels of Lao Can）","name_en":"The Travels of Lao Can","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["小说","刘鹗","济南","大明湖"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"literary_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《老残游记》是刘鹗的小说。赵农在园林章节末尾谈文人小说中的园林描写，称其生动刻画了济南大明湖四面荷花三面柳、一城山色半城湖的秀丽景象，并记济南以泉城著名。来源未给成书年代、版本、回数与所写园林的具体段落。","path":"publications/laocan-youji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《老残游记》是 A 维度下以小说保存城市景观描写的文献条目；其文本描写兼及 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:leisi-jing","title":"《耒耜经》（Leisi Jing (Classic of Plowing Tools)）","name_en":"Leisi Jing (Classic of Plowing Tools)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","陆龟蒙","农书","农具","耒耜经"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_treatise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《耒耜经》是唐代陆龟蒙所著农具书。来源称其为中国最早记载和研究农具的书籍，并记书中载有爬（耙）、砺、夯等农具，以及耙碎土除草、砺夯平整土地使土质细腻的作用。来源对作者的介绍只有一句：陆龟蒙为姑苏人，唐代著名诗人，与皮日休齐名，并称皮陆；生卒年写作问号起首、约终于 881 年。来源未载成书年代、卷数、篇目、版本、流传情况与书中农具的尺寸形制，也未附书影或农具图。本条只整理来源已有的书名、作者、性质与","path":"publications/leisi-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《耒耜经》是 B 维度唐代农具文献的条目；来源对其性质的判断属农书内容，不涉及设计史书写或史学方法，故不指派 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:liangyou","title":"良友（Liangyou）","name_en":"Liangyou","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1926","上海","画报","明星广告","月份牌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《良友》是 1926 年 2 月创刊的大型画报，以令人耳目一新的形式轰动上海滩。它曾聘请郑君里作美丽牌香烟广告、白杨作美勃丹化妆品广告、兰心作宝昌首饰广告、王人美作广东兄弟橡皮公司球鞋广告，明星效应使商品成为二三十年代上海抢手品牌。赵农在记民国书籍与杂志设计时，也把当时的《良友画报》列为有一定影响者。","path":"publications/liangyou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下近代画报广告的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:liangzhou-jinwen-ci-daxi-tulu-kaoshi","title":"《两周金文辞大系图录考释》（Liangzhou Jinwen Ci Daxi Tulu Kaoshi）","name_en":"Liangzhou Jinwen Ci Daxi Tulu Kaoshi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["周代","青铜铭文","金文著录","两周金文辞大系图录考释"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《两周金文辞大系图录考释》是田自秉引用的周代青铜铭文著录。来源据其所载 167 篇周代青铜铭文统计，作器记事以祭祖先的有 85 篇，用以论证周代制器服从礼的需要。来源未给作者、编者、出版年、出版社与成书经过；本条不据来源外材料补作者。","path":"publications/liangzhou-jinwen-ci-daxi-tulu-kaoshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《两周金文辞大系图录考释》是 A 维度下工艺史研究所用金文著录的文献条目；其统计所证礼制属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:liaozang","title":"《辽藏》（Liao Canon）","name_en":"Liao Canon","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["辽代","雕版印刷","佛藏","应县木塔","卷轴装"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"buddhist_canon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《辽藏》是辽代在南京（今北京）印经院雕印的佛藏。赵农记《辽藏》分大小字两种，大字本 5000 卷；1974 年应县木塔发现大字本残卷 12 卷，每卷数十张纸连接，卷首粘贴印好的书签，采卷轴装，以《千字文》字韵编号，并有很高的防蛀水平；雕版《辽藏》与北京房山云居寺石刻本《辽藏》文体相同、同出一源。来源未给刊刻年代、主持者与版式尺寸。","path":"publications/liaozang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《辽藏》是 C 维度下辽代雕版印刷与书籍装帧的条目；其官方印经院背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:lidai-minghua-ji","title":"历代名画记（Lidai Minghua Ji）","name_en":"Lidai Minghua Ji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","张彦远","画史","宣纸","瑞锦宫绫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《历代名画记》是唐代张彦远所著画史文献。张彦远是唐代晚期人，曾在咸通三年任舒州刺史。书中记“江南地润无尘，人多精艺”“好事家宜置宣纸百幅，用法蜡之，以备摹写”，说明纸张在当时的使用状态；又记初唐益州艺匠窦师纶所织锦绫有双雉、斗羊、翔凤、游麟等图案，即“瑞锦”“宫绫”。","path":"publications/lidai-minghua-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代工艺史料的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:lienv-zhuan","title":"《列女传》（Biographies of Exemplary Women）","name_en":"Biographies of Exemplary Women","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["汉代","宋代","刘向","列女传","插图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"illustrated_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《列女传》是汉代刘向所著、宋代刊行的插图本。赵农记宋仁宗嘉祐八年（公元1063年）绘制的插图本全书8篇123节、插图123幅，文图并茂；东晋顾恺之曾绘制《列女仁智图》为其作插图；宋版体现出民间刻工的朴素观念，书上标有“晋大司马参军顾恺之图画”字样，实以宋代绘画技巧和生活场景刻画古代列女形象；上图下文的排版成为后来书籍插图的基本形式。来源未给宋插图本的刻工、刊刻地点与存世状况。","path":"publications/lienv-zhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《列女传》是 C 维度下宋代插图本典籍的条目，材料限于插图本结构与版式影响。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:liji","title":"礼记（Liji）","name_en":"Liji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","礼制","服饰等级","深衣","器物等级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《礼记》是先秦礼制文献。田自秉引其规定天子龙衮、诸侯黼、大夫黻、士玄衣纁裳及天子之豆二十六等服饰器物等级，说明周代等级制在服饰器物上的体现。夏燕靖 2016 两引《礼运篇》：以“未有麻丝，衣其羽皮”说明纺织出现前的衣着，以“昔者先王，未有宫窑，冬则居管窑，夏则居槽巢……”（原文如此，疑有 OCR 异文）说明原始穴居、巢居；并记《礼记》有深衣篇载制作规范，《礼记·玉藻》称深衣为诸侯大夫家居便服、庶人","path":"publications/liji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下先秦礼制文献的锚点，其服饰与居住材料亦服务 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:liuzi","title":"刘子（Liuzi）","name_en":"Liuzi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北齐","刘昼","适用","审美"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《刘子》（又名《刘子新论》）为北齐刘昼所著。2016 册引“物有美恶，施用用宜”一段，以裘、蓑为例说明美丑相对、适用为均，视其为古代审美应用学重视实用传统的体现。","path":"publications/liuzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:long-zongxin-zhongguo-gongyi-meishu-shi","title":"中国工艺美术史（龙宗鑫）（Chinese History of Arts and Crafts (Long Zongxin)）","name_en":"Chinese History of Arts and Crafts (Long Zongxin)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["工艺美术史","通史","龙宗鑫","1985","陕西人民出版社"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国工艺美术史》是龙宗鑫著、陕西人民出版社 1985 年出版的中国工艺美术史通史著作，列入夏燕靖《中国设计史》（2009）参考书目。来源只记作者、书名、出版者与出版年，未记卷章结构、内容提法或版本信息。","path":"publications/long-zongxin-zhongguo-gongyi-meishu-shi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下中国工艺美术通史写作的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:lubanjing","title":"鲁班经（Luban Jing）","name_en":"Luban Jing","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","木工","营造","家具","匠家镜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_manual","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《鲁班经》是明代刊行的民间木工行业技术书籍，全称《鲁班经匠家镜》，2016 记其原名《工师雕新正式鲁班木经匠家镜》或《鲁班经匠家镜》，是我国古代营造房屋和日常生活用具的实用指南通书。该书对房舍施工构筑、建筑工具和定位技术、常用建筑的类型尺寸以及生活工具、家具的形制都有详细说明；2016 记其图 1 卷、文 3 卷，并称有说系年荣汇编的托名之作。","path":"publications/lubanjing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代民间匠作文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:lun-heng","title":"论衡（Lun Heng）","name_en":"Lun Heng","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["秦汉","东汉","王充","文章观","司南"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"essay_collection","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《论衡》是东汉王充的著作。本章指定材料只有两处提及：一处称“王充（公元 27—约公元 97 年）著述的《论衡》，以高屋建瓴的学术姿态，推崇文章的情感真实”（L2525）；另一处据“司南之杓，投之于地，其柢指南”（《论衡·是应篇》）说明秦汉时期人们对司南的认识（L3161）。来源未给篇目总数、卷数、版本与成书年代。","path":"publications/lun-heng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《论衡》是 A 维度下东汉文献的薄证据条目，来源只取其文章观与《是应篇》司南引文。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:lunyu","title":"论语（Lunyu）","name_en":"Lunyu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["春秋","孔子","语录体","文质彬彬","工欲善其事"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《论语》是孔子弟子及再传弟子编撰的语录体经典，记孔子及其弟子言行。赵农引其论器与论服饰颜色的言论，如“工欲善其事，必先利其器”（《论语·卫灵公》）、“君子不器”（《论语·为政》）、“质胜文则野，文胜质则史”“文质彬彬”（《论语·雍也》）；2016 称其“文质观”具审美意蕴。","path":"publications/lunyu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下先秦造物思想文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:luo-yang-qie-lan-ji","title":"洛阳伽蓝记（Luoyang Qielan Ji (Record of Buddhist Monasteries in Luoyang)）","name_en":"Luoyang Qielan Ji / Record of Buddhist Monasteries in Luoyang","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北魏","洛阳","里坊","佛寺","市场"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geography","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《洛阳伽蓝记》在本册出现于第五节「建筑与园林」的「城市」条与第七节「石窟与雕刻」的「佛寺」条。来源引其记北魏洛阳里坊的规模与管理、市里按行业分区的布局，以及洛阳佛寺的数量，作为城市格局与佛教兴盛的文献依据。来源未署撰人，也未给成书年代、卷数、体例与版本。图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"publications/luo-yang-qie-lan-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《洛阳伽蓝记》在本条落在 A 维度，是北魏洛阳城市与佛寺叙述的文献依据；D 维度涉及里坊制、市场行业分区与商住管理，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:luoxuan-biangu-jianpu","title":"萝轩变古笺谱（Luoxuan Biangu Jianpu）","name_en":"Luoxuan Biangu Jianpu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","吴发祥","恒版拱花","饾版","笺谱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"print_album","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《萝轩变古笺谱》是明代笺谱，1626 年刊刻。李立新记吴发祥用“恒版拱花”印制，是明代印刷设计的重要例证；2016 称其为现存最早的饾版、拱花印本。","path":"publications/luoxuan-biangu-jianpu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下明代笺谱的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:luoyang-mingyuan-ji","title":"《洛阳名园记》（Record of Famous Gardens in Luoyang）","name_en":"Record of Famous Gardens in Luoyang","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北宋","园林","洛阳名园记","李格非","洛阳"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden_record","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《洛阳名园记》是北宋李格非记载洛阳私人园林的著作。赵农记宋代洛阳有诸多私人园林，在李格非的《洛阳名园记》中记载有19所；同段又记《东京梦华录》记载京城开封有园林18处，散见其他著作的园林也有近百座，分布于寺院、酒肆、官第等地方。来源未给卷数、成书年代、版本与各园条目内容。","path":"publications/luoyang-mingyuan-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《洛阳名园记》是 C 维度下北宋园林著录的条目；其记录的园林归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:lvshi-chunqiu","title":"吕氏春秋（Lüshi Chunqiu）","name_en":"Lüshi Chunqiu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","杂家","吕不韦","乐器","青铜器纹样"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classic","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《吕氏春秋》是战国末年秦国吕不韦门客集体编纂的杂家著作，又名《吕览》。**六册全部引用**，是六册中覆盖面最宽的先秦文献之一。但六册的用法彼此几乎不重叠：高丰与田自秉用它给青铜器纹样定名，赵农用它取乐器起源、城市与邑制、云梯战例，夏燕靖两版用它取车战规模，李立新用它校读“大器免成”的语义，夏燕靖 2016 另用它取工艺制度语汇。全书篇数、十二纪月令结构与编纂经过，六册均不记。","path":"publications/lvshi-chunqiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《吕氏春秋》在六册中的用法可归四簇：青铜器纹样定名（高丰、田自秉）、乐器起源（赵农）、车战规模（夏燕靖两版）、城市与工艺制度语汇（赵农、夏燕靖 2016），另李立新以“成”的二解作造物训诂。四簇中三簇落在造物与工艺一侧，故归主维度 B；A 与 D 为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:makeboluo-youji","title":"马可·波罗游记（The Travels of Marco Polo）","name_en":"The Travels of Marco Polo","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","马可·波罗","游记","中西交流","大都"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《马可·波罗游记》是五册共用的**域外史料**：田自秉用它证琉璃瓦与金锦采运，高丰用它证元代金银器之盛，夏燕靖两版用它证西夏毛织、质孙服与大都市制，赵农用它证海外贸易、造船、大都人口与卢沟桥。两册另为本书立了专条（夏燕靖 2009、2016）。**五册对作者生平、书名与成书方式的记载差别最大**，是本批中“同一书在不同册中面貌不同”最明显的一例。","path":"publications/makeboluo-youji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《马可·波罗游记》在五册中是元代造物与城市的域外史料：金银器、驼毛布、质孙服与金锦、琉璃瓦、造船、卢沟桥构成主体（B），大都的街巷、坊数、市集与“百物输入”属商业与城市制度面（D），引起欧洲对东方的向往与中西交流史价值属跨文化面（E）为次。李立新册中的“波罗子”是法门寺器物名，与本条无关，已排除。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:maozedong-xuanji","title":"《毛泽东选集》（Mao Zedong Xuanji (Selected Works of Mao Zedong)）","name_en":"Mao Zedong Xuanji (Selected Works of Mao Zedong)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["新中国","集体设计","书籍装帧","政治出版","毛泽东选集"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"collected_works","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《毛泽东选集》是赵农在 1949 年后书籍装帧段举为保持风格的少数作品之一，称其封面为集体设计，与张光宇的《装饰》字体设计、任意的《中国历代货币大系》并列。来源未给卷数、出版社、出版年与设计者名单。","path":"publications/maozedong-xuanji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《毛泽东选集》是 C 维度下政治文献装帧的条目；其出版组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:meishu-de-qiyuan","title":"《美术的起源》（Meishu de Qiyuan (The Origin of Fine Arts)）","name_en":"Meishu de Qiyuan (The Origin of Fine Arts)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","1920","蔡元培","工艺美术","美术"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"essay","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《美术的起源》是蔡元培 1920 年的文章。赵农在第十章绪论谈工艺美术复合概念的形成时，引其文中「建筑、造像（雕刻）、图画、工艺美术」的并称，作为工艺美术在建筑、绘画、雕塑之外成为体系、并由「工艺」加「美术」构成复合学科概念的文献例证。来源未给文章出处、发表刊物与全文论点。","path":"publications/meishu-de-qiyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《美术的起源》是 D 维度下工艺美术学科命名文献的条目；工艺美术作为学科核心概念的形成属 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:menglianglu","title":"梦粱录（Mengliang Lu）","name_en":"Mengliang Lu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["南宋","吴自牧","临安","商业","夜市"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"miscellany","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《梦粱录》是南宋吴自牧所著笔记，成书于南宋末年，20 卷 169 目，体例仿《东京梦华录》。全书叙临安（今浙江杭州）繁华，详记淳佑至咸淳（1241—1274）社会风貌，保存不少民俗民艺材料。书中“铺席”节记杭州茶坊、酒肆、面店、果子、彩帛、绒线、香烛、油酱、食米、下饭鱼内鳖腊等铺，“夜市”节记杭城大街买卖昼夜不绝，并记瓦舍定义、影戏羊皮雕形与傀儡戏。","path":"publications/menglianglu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下南宋城市商业文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:mengqiu","title":"《蒙求》（Mengqiu (Primer)）","name_en":"Mengqiu (Primer)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["辽代","雕版印刷","启蒙教材","应县木塔","丝漏印刷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"primer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《蒙求》是应县木塔出土的辽代雕版书籍。赵农记其为唐代李翰编写的四言韵语启蒙识字教材；同出佛教版画 6 幅，其中 3 幅为彩色绢画，以丝漏形式印制——在线描部分印成修改后将丝绢对折，一次印刷后颜色渗漏到下面的绢上，事半功倍、左右对称；据记载辽代印刷多在燕京一地印制。来源未给《蒙求》的版式、卷数与刊刻年代。","path":"publications/mengqiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《蒙求》是 C 维度下辽代雕版书籍与启蒙教材的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:mengxi-bitan","title":"梦溪笔谈（Mengxi Bitan）","name_en":"Mengxi Bitan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北宋","沈括","透光镜","铸鉴","科技文献"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"miscellany","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《梦溪笔谈》是北宋沈括所著的百科全书式著作，共 609 条，涉及面非常广泛，是中国古代科学技术和艺术设计史方面的重要文献。田自秉引其论透光镜“世有透光鉴（镜）……”及铸时薄处先冷、背文差厚后冷铜缩多的解释，用以说明透光镜原理；又引其论铸鉴“鉴大则平，鉴小则凸”，说明唐镜镜面微凸可照全人面的光学原理。","path":"publications/mengxi-bitan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代科技文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:mengzi","title":"孟子（Mengzi）","name_en":"Mengzi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","儒家","规矩准绳","造物规范","民本"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classic","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《孟子》是战国中期孟轲及其门人著述的儒家经典。四册对它的用法集中在两处：一是把“规矩”“准绳”这类造物语汇引入儒家规范论，二是把“与民同乐”“民为贵”的民本观读作设计应以民为本。赵农是唯一大量按篇引用的来源（滕文公上／下、公孙丑上、梁惠王上／下、离娄上），且另记《孟子》入十三经的经过；李立新是唯一给出篇名与另一套引文用字的来源。**本条只写典籍**，孟轲其人的生卒、身份与学派位置见 `person","path":"publications/mengzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《孟子》在四册中的设计史价值有两簇：其一，把“规矩”“准绳”这类造物语汇引入儒家规范论（李立新、赵农），属 A；其二，“与民同乐”“民为贵”的民本观被读作设计应以民为本（赵农、田自秉、夏燕靖 2016），属 D 与 A 之间。器物层面的用鼎等级、弋射、箪食壶浆散见于赵农、田自秉，归 B 为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:miaofa-lianhua-jing","title":"《妙法莲花经》（Lotus Sutra, Turpan Print）","name_en":"Lotus Sutra, Turpan Print","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","吐鲁番","雕版印刷","佛经","黄麻纸"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_sutra","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《妙法莲花经》吐鲁番本是新疆吐鲁番出土的一卷雕版印刷佛经。来源记其印在黄麻纸上，其中有武则天时期创造的新字，以欧体字形刻印，风格与韩国出土的《无垢净光大陀罗尼经》相同，因而认为有可能是同时期的印刷品。来源未给卷数、尺寸、译者、刻工与现藏地，本条不补。经名用字照原文，另作标疑。","path":"publications/miaofa-lianhua-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《妙法莲花经》吐鲁番本为 B 维度下唐代雕版印刷佛经的实物条目；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:mingshi-jiaju-yanjiu","title":"明式家具研究（Mingshi Jiaju Yanjiu）","name_en":"Mingshi Jiaju Yanjiu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","家具","王世襄","鸡翅木"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《明式家具研究》是王世襄的专著。2016 册引其将鸡翅木分为老鸡翅木与新鸡翅木，并描述二者在纹理、木质上的差异，用以说明明式家具用材的鉴别。","path":"publications/mingshi-jiaju-yanjiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:mo-jing","title":"墨经（Mo Jing）","name_en":"Mo Jing","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","墨家","墨翟","几何学","力学"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classic","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《墨经》是战国前期记载墨家学说的著作，三册都把它与《考工记》并置，作为先秦造物科学知识的第二极。三册的取材分工清晰：夏燕靖两版给总论与几何、力学条目，赵农给三条具体原理的原文（秤、滑轮、车梯）。本书的**边界**在三册中并不一致：夏燕靖两版正文把几何、光学、力学全数归入《墨经》，夏燕靖 2016 的书末条目却把“墨经”限定为六篇论认识论与逻辑的篇目，并把工艺思想另归《墨子·节用》。","path":"publications/mo-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《墨经》在三册中都是“造物的科学知识”条目：几何概念、力学条目、杠杆与滑轮、车梯原理构成主体，故归主维度 B；其“可与《考工记》相媲美”的定位属史学评价，归 A 为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:mozi-jieyong","title":"墨子·节用（Mozi Jieyong）","name_en":"Mozi Jieyong","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","墨家","墨子","节用"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《墨子·节用》是《墨子》中的一篇。2016 册称其包含墨子的工艺思想，强调“节用”当为制造日用器物的原则和要求；同条又述《墨子》原 71 篇、现存 53 篇，及《经上》《经下》等 6 篇称墨辩或墨经。","path":"publications/mozi-jieyong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:mujing","title":"《木经》（Mujing (Woodwork Classic)）","name_en":"Mujing (Woodwork Classic)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北宋","建筑","木经","喻皓","上分中分下分"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architecture_manual","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《木经》是相传北宋匠师俞皓（喻皓）所撰的建筑著作。赵农引《梦溪笔谈·卷十八》记其“营舍之法”有“凡屋有三分：自梁以上为‘上分’；地以上为‘中分’；阶为‘下分’”的说法，称这是普通建造房屋的规范。来源未给卷数、成书年代、传本与全书内容，且人名在前后文分别作“俞皓”“喻皓”，本条照录并标异。","path":"publications/mujing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《木经》是 C 维度下北宋建筑著作的条目；其屋分三分的营造技术归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:nahan","title":"《呐喊》（Nahan (Call to Arms)）","name_en":"Nahan (Call to Arms)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","鲁迅","书籍装帧","新文化运动","呐喊"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"short_story_collection","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《呐喊》是鲁迅的小说集。赵农在记鲁迅书籍装帧意见时，称《呐喊》简洁朴素、明快大方，有着中国传统书籍与西方书籍装帧结合的特色。来源未给出版年、出版社、开本与设计者署名。","path":"publications/nahan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《呐喊》是 C 维度下鲁迅小说集装帧的条目；来源只作装帧评语，未及出版机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:nancun-chuogenglu","title":"南村辍耕录（Nancun Chuogenglu）","name_en":"Nancun Chuogenglu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","陶宗仪","笔记","工艺史料","织锦名目"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《南村辍耕录》又名《辍耕录》，元末明初陶宗仪撰，30 卷 585 条 20 余万字，记元代掌故、典章、文物及古玩鉴赏、书画、工艺史料。2016 册又引其记黄道婆教人做造捍弹纺织之具。田自秉册据《辍耕录》记元代织锦花纹名目、黄道婆棉纺织、浙西银工名手、卷素黑光髹漆工序与嘉兴斜塘杨汇戗金银法，五处引文构成本库所见最集中的《辍耕录》工艺史料摘录。","path":"publications/nancun-chuogenglu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:nanjiang-yishi-kanben","title":"《南疆绎史勘本》（Nanjiang Yishi Kanben）","name_en":"Nanjiang Yishi Kanben","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","李瑶","泥活字","仿宋胶泥版","印本"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_edition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《南疆绎史勘本》是李瑶印制的书籍。赵农记其上有“仿宋胶泥版印法”的字样，是清代泥活字印刷的例证。来源未给卷数、编者、刊印年代、版式与印本存世情况。","path":"publications/nanjiang-yishi-kanben.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《南疆绎史勘本》是 C 维度下清代泥活字印本的条目；其仿宋胶泥版工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:nanyao-biji","title":"南窑笔记（Nanyao Biji）","name_en":"Nanyao Biji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","景德镇","陶瓷","札记"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《南窑笔记》为清代景德镇窑瓷器业札记，约成书于乾隆年间，作者佚名，不分卷，315 条，记古窑 7 条、明窑 6 条，另述釉炉、彩色、官窑、高岭、合泥、釉、坯胎、圆器、琢器、匣钵、窑等。原文“成宠窑”疑为“成化窑”之讹。","path":"publications/nanyao-biji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:nongsang-jizao","title":"农桑辑要（Nongsang Jizao）","name_en":"Nongsang Jizao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","农书","棉花","司农司"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agronomic_treatise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《农桑辑要》是元初司农司编写的官修农书，至元十年（1273）颁行。20