","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1956","毛泽东","工业调整","重工业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"policy_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《论十大关系》是毛泽东 1956 年 4 月的著作。2016 册述其强调适当调整重工业与农业、轻工业的投资比例，更多发展农业、轻工业，并引“重工业是我国建设的重点”一段，说明其对工业调整的论述。","path":"publications/on-ten-great-relationships.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:panghuang","title":"《彷徨》（Panghuang (Wandering)）","name_en":"Panghuang (Wandering)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","鲁迅","陶元庆","书籍装帧","彷徨"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"short_story_collection","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《彷徨》是鲁迅的小说集，由陶元庆装帧。赵农称陶元庆的《彷徨》《坟》等作品装帧具有含蓄深刻、饱满整洁的特点。来源未给出版年、出版社与开本。","path":"publications/panghuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《彷徨》是 C 维度下鲁迅小说集装帧的条目；来源只作装帧评语，未及出版机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:putong-gaoxiao-benke-zhuanye-mulu","title":"普通高等学校本科专业目录（Putong Gaodeng Xuexiao Benke Zhuanye Mulu）","name_en":"Putong Gaodeng Xuexiao Benke Zhuanye Mulu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1998","教育部","专业目录","艺术设计"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regulation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《普通高等学校本科专业目录》由教育部 1998 年 7 月颁布，将“工艺美术专业”改为“艺术设计专业”。2016 册年表以此为 1998 年设计教育制度变化的关键节点。","path":"publications/putong-gaoxiao-benke-zhuanye-mulu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:qiminyaoshu","title":"齐民要术（Qimin Yaoshu）","name_en":"Qimin Yaoshu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北魏","贾思勰","农书","潢纸","手工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agronomic_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《齐民要术》是北魏农学家贾思勰所著，是我国现存最完整的古代农书之一，约写于东魏武定二年（544）以后（一说 533—544 年）；全书 10 卷 92 篇，记黄河流域下游农业生产，涉及园艺、造林、蚕桑、畜牧、酿造、烹饪、储备、治荒等，引古籍 200 余种，其中许多内容记述古代手工艺。赵农引其潢纸之法：“凡潢纸，灭白便是。不宜太深，深色年旧色暗也”，据此说明当时人们对造纸、染纸及使用已有深入认识。","path":"publications/qiminyaoshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下北魏农工文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:qingbo-zazhi","title":"《清波杂志》（Qingbo Zazhi (Clear Wave Miscellany)）","name_en":"Qingbo Zazhi (Clear Wave Miscellany)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["南宋","周煇","清波杂志","官窑","玛瑙末"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"notes","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《清波杂志》是南宋周煇的笔记著作。赵农在官窑段引其中一条：“内有玛瑙末为釉，唯供御拣退，方许出卖，近尤难得”，用来说明官窑瓷器制作精良、朝廷供奉之物引发好奇；同段说南宋时期一般人对官窑产品都有难得见之的感慨。来源未给卷数、成书年代、版本与全书内容。","path":"publications/qingbo-zazhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《清波杂志》是 B 维度下南宋笔记史料的条目；其作为官窑记载的史料来源归 A 维度（史料基础，非史学方法）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:qinggongbu-zaobanchchu-dangan","title":"清宫内务府造办处档案总汇（Qinggongbu Zaobanchchu Dangan Zonghui）","name_en":"Qinggongbu Zaobanchchu Dangan Zonghui","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","造办处","档案","宫廷工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archive","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《清宫内务府造办处档案总汇》共 55 卷，为清廷造办处文献汇编。造办处康熙年间成立，营运至 1924 年，先后设 60 多个专业作坊，档案记制品名称、来源、时间、规格、用料、开销、工序、去处及皇帝旨意。原文又记第 1 期档簿类出版 111 册、第 2 期折件类 90 册，与“全书共 55 卷”并置，卷册口径不一，照录。","path":"publications/qinggongbu-zaobanchchu-dangan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:qingmi-cang","title":"清秘藏（Qingmi Cang）","name_en":"Qingmi Cang","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","张应文","张谦德","鉴赏","玩好"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"connoisseurship_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《清秘藏》是明代张应文所撰、其子张谦德润色的古物鉴赏专著，2 卷。上卷 20 门、下卷 10 门，杂论玩好赏鉴诸物，是我国古代工艺美术鉴赏著作。高丰将其列入明代手工业设计专著群。","path":"publications/qingmi-cang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代鉴赏文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:quan-tangshi","title":"《全唐诗》（Quan Tangshi）","name_en":"Quan Tangshi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","康熙","曹寅","雕版","唐诗"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"poetry_anthology","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《全唐诗》是康熙年间曹寅编纂的唐诗总集，为清代地方官员印书的代表。赵农记曹寅政务之余浸沉诗书、淘检诗翰，编成唐诗巨册；《全唐诗》采用浙江开化生产的纸张，印制大方、装帧精美，是清代雕版书籍的典范。来源未给卷数、收诗数、诗人小传与刊刻机构。","path":"publications/quan-tangshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《全唐诗》是 C 维度下清代雕版书籍的条目；其地方官员刻书制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:sancai-tuhui","title":"《三才图会》（Sancai Tuhui (Illustrated Compendium of the Three Powers)）","name_en":"Sancai Tuhui (Illustrated Compendium of the Three Powers)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","嘉靖","类书","图录","三才图会"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"encyclopedia","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《三才图会》是明代嘉靖年间由王圻、王思义编纂的类书，共 106 卷，分天文、地理、人物、时令、宫室、器用、身体、衣服、人事、仪制、珍宝、文史、鸟兽、草木 14 门类。其特点是一事一图、说明详细；来源称其出版对理解明代社会文化风气有说明作用，其中宫室、器用、衣服、珍宝等对设计史研究有重要帮助，而明代书籍印刷的昌盛为此类类书提供了技术保证。来源未给编纂始末、版本与图幅数。","path":"publications/sancai-tuhui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《三才图会》是 B 维度下明代图录类书的条目；其图像体例与印刷出版分别归 C、D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:sanli-tu","title":"三礼图（Sanli Tu）","name_en":"Sanli Tu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["宋代","聂崇义","十二章纹","礼服"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《三礼图》为宋代聂崇义所撰。2016 册引其《衮冕条》《毳冕条》，说明日月星辰、山龙华虫、宗彝藻火粉米黼黻等十二章纹的象征意义，是理解古代礼服纹样等级的重要文献。","path":"publications/sanli-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shanghai-center-plan","title":"上海市市中心区域规划（Shanghai Shi Shizhongxin Quyu Guihua）","name_en":"Shanghai Shi Shizhongxin Quyu Guihua","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","上海","城市规划","中国固有式建筑"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"plan","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《上海市市中心区域规划》是 20 世纪二三十年代的上海城市规划文件。2016 册引其“为提倡国粹起见，市府新屋应用中国式建筑”，说明中国固有式建筑兴起的原因。","path":"publications/shanghai-center-plan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shanghai-xinbao","title":"上海新报（Shanghai Xinbao）","name_en":"Shanghai Xinbao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清末","报纸广告","香皂广告","上海"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"newspaper","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《上海新报》于清同治元年（1862）刊登香皂广告，2016 册称其为我国报纸广告的滥觞。这类广告以大幅文字叙述为主，附带一幅实物照片，版式设计虽简陋，但文字内容翔实。","path":"publications/shanghai-xinbao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下视觉传达与出版物的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shangjunshu","title":"商君书（Shangjun Shu）","name_en":"Shangjun Shu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","法家","商鞅","纺织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《商君书》是先秦法家著作。2016 册引《商君书·画策篇》“神农之也，男耕而食，妇织而衣”，用以说明新石器时代已出现纺织与丝织衣料。原文「神农之也」疑为「神农之世」之讹，照录标疑。","path":"publications/shangjunshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shangshu","title":"尚书（Shangshu）","name_en":"Shangshu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["上古","儒家五经","甘誓","车战"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《尚书》又称《书》《书经》，为记载上古历史的文献，分《虞书》《夏书》《商书》《周书》，汉代改称《尚书》，列为儒家五经之一。2016 册既引《尚书·甘誓》所载夏启与有扈氏甘泽之战的誓师词，说明夏代已用兵车作战；又在文献索引中概述其内容真伪与“天”“帝”观念，指出可据以认识先秦器物设计从“帝”到“天”的宗教观念演变。","path":"publications/shangshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shanhai-jing","title":"山海经（Shan Hai Jing）","name_en":"Shan Hai Jing","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","地理志","神话","夔纹","凤皇"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classic","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《山海经》是先秦的地理与神话名物之书，五册（夏燕靖 2009 除外）都引用它，但**没有两册引同一段**：高丰引夔与奚仲造车，田自秉引夔与鸾鸟，赵农引凤皇与地理著述，李立新引“人身龙面”山神，夏燕靖 2016 只引铁矿山一处。五册的引用都属**以书证物**，而不讨论本书本身的性质、篇目与成书。成书年代只有夏燕靖 2016 一册给出（战国）。","path":"publications/shanhai-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《山海经》在五册中不是工艺专著，而是被征引的**名物与矿产文献**：夔、凤皇、鸾鸟三种神鸟异兽用于青铜器与铜镜纹样的释读，铁矿山一项用于冶铁规模，神怪图像一项用于春秋战国的观念背景。四册的用法都落在名物取证，故归主维度 B；图像与观念归 C、A 为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:sheji-gailun","title":"《设计概论》（Introduction to Design）","name_en":"Introduction to Design","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["改革开放","赵农","设计理论","著述","设计概论"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_theory_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《设计概论》是赵农的设计理论著述。赵农在“设计研究”段将其本人此书列入十余年来有影响的设计著述。来源未给出版社、出版年、卷册与内容结构。","path":"publications/sheji-gailun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《设计概论》是 A 维度下设计理论著述的条目；其出版与教育传播属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shenbao","title":"申报（Shenbao）","name_en":"Shenbao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1872","美查","上海","报纸广告","图文广告"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"newspaper","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《申报》是 1872 年 3 月 27 日由英商美查创办于上海的报纸。创刊号上刊登广告 20 则，商品形象和推销口号并重，文字叙述趋向简洁，版式装帧颇为讲究，被视为现代图文广告的原形；2016 将其与《点石斋画报》等同列为改变我国书籍装帧设计面貌的近代出版物。","path":"publications/shenbao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下近代报纸广告的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:sheng-wu-ai-le-lun","title":"声无哀乐论（Sheng Wu Aile Lun (Music Has No Sorrow or Joy)）","name_en":"Sheng Wu Aile Lun / Music Has No Sorrow or Joy","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["三国","曹魏","嵇康","音乐理论","玄学"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"treatise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《声无哀乐论》在本册只出现于第六节「家具与乐器」的「乐器」条，且书名被分页隔断：L3876 段末止于“如在《声无哀乐”，L3878 以“论》中”接续。来源在嵇康所提音乐理论之下举此书为例，并摘其关于“和”与“和声无象”的观点。来源未给篇卷、成书年代、版本与全文结构。图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"publications/sheng-wu-ai-le-lun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《声无哀乐论》在本条落在 A 维度，其和声无象说属设计史观与音乐思想背景；材料两行且书名跨页，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shenghuo-weekly","title":"生活周刊（Shenghuo Zhoukan）","name_en":"Shenghuo Zhoukan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","邹韬奋","书刊广告","装帧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《生活周刊》是邹韬奋主办的刊物。2016 册称其起初以图书广告为主，每幅列出详尽书目梗概并配卷草纹样；20 世纪 30 年代开始接受商品广告，设计含书卷气，形式类似书封装帧。","path":"publications/shenghuo-weekly.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下视觉传达与出版物的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shengshi-weiyan","title":"盛世危言（Shengshi Weiyan）","name_en":"Shengshi Weiyan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["晚清","郑观应","商战","工艺教育","博览会"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reform_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《盛世危言》是晚清郑观应的著作，提出“工艺一道，为国家致富之基。工艺既兴，物产即因之饶裕”，并主张设工艺专科、开工艺学堂、派人游学各国、设博览会以励百工。李立新记其分析洋货入华致女红失业、柏树弃为不材、冶者无事投闲，指出外国用机制故工致价廉、中国用人工故工笨价费，主张“商战”。","path":"publications/shengshi-weiyan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下晚清工艺制度文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shiji","title":"史记（Shiji）","name_en":"Shiji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["西汉","司马迁","纪传体","史学","战车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"history","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《史记》是西汉司马迁所著的纪传体史书。司马迁忍辱负重、发愤著述而成，鲁迅评为“千古之绝唱，无韵之离骚”；东汉班固的《汉书》延续司马迁所开拓的史学工作，开始形成历朝断代史的著述。《史记》载武王伐纣时率战车 300 辆、近卫军 3000 人、甲士 4.5 万人，在孟津渡过黄河，是关于船只用于战争的最早记载。李立新《中国设计艺术史论》另引《史记·夏本纪》大禹治水用“准绳”“规矩”一类有刻度的仪器测量事物","path":"publications/shiji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下正史文献的锚点，其车船记载同时服务 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shijie-xiandai-pingmian-shejishi","title":"《世界现代平面设计史》（World History of Modern Graphic Design）","name_en":"World History of Modern Graphic Design","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["改革开放","王受之","平面设计史","著述","世界现代平面设计史"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_history_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《世界现代平面设计史》是王受之的平面设计史著述。赵农在“设计研究”段将其与《世界现代设计史》并列，称这些著述十余年来已有着广泛的社会影响。来源未给出版社、出版年、卷册与内容结构。","path":"publications/shijie-xiandai-pingmian-shejishi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《世界现代平面设计史》是 A 维度下平面设计史著述的条目；其出版与教育传播属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shijie-xiandai-shejishi","title":"《世界现代设计史》（World History of Modern Design）","name_en":"World History of Modern Design","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["改革开放","王受之","设计史","著述","世界现代设计史"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_history_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《世界现代设计史》是王受之的设计史著述。赵农在“设计研究”段将其与《世界现代平面设计史》并列，称这些著述十余年来已有着广泛的社会影响。来源未给出版社、出版年、卷册与内容结构。","path":"publications/shijie-xiandai-shejishi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《世界现代设计史》是 A 维度下设计史著述的条目；其出版与教育传播属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shijing","title":"诗经（Classic of Poetry）","name_en":"Classic of Poetry","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","诗歌总集","史料","器用","风雅颂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classic","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《诗经》是六册**全部引用**的典籍之一，但六册的用法完全不同：赵农把它单列为“**资料性文献**”，以四十余处引诗系统支撑农具、兵器、车马、建筑等器类；田自秉用它论雕刻工序、织锦名称与纹样形式法则；高丰取五条单证（纺织、蔽膝、车较、蓝草、广告）；夏燕靖两版取六条且两版近乎逐字相同；李立新只取“道”的语义。**六册没有一册给出成书年代、编订过程或注疏系统**，故本 KU 的重心不是文本学而是“**","path":"publications/shijing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《诗经》是六册全部引用的少数典籍之一，用法以“引诗证器”为主体（B）：农具、兵器、车马、建筑、服饰、丝织、乐器、饮食器、灯具、舟桥、园林、雕刻、纹样、广告共十余类；赵农的“资料性文献”定位与田自秉的形式法则类比属方法面（A），车舆服饰的等级与十三经、监本、四书五经的经典化属制度面（D）为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shiming","title":"释名（Shiming）","name_en":"Shiming","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["东汉","刘熙","名物","训诂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《释名》为东汉刘熙撰，8 卷 27 篇，篇目自释天、释地至释车、释船、释疾病、释丧制，所释名物典礼千余条，2016 册称其为考证名物的百科书。","path":"publications/shiming.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shiwu-jiyuan","title":"事物纪原（Shiwu Jiyuan）","name_en":"Shiwu Jiyuan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["宋代","高承","事物起源","独轮车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《事物纪原》为宋代高承撰，10 卷，记 1765 事，分 55 部，叙事物起源，含民俗民艺多条。2016 册又引其将造独轮车之功归于诸葛亮。","path":"publications/shiwu-jiyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shiwu-yuanshi","title":"事物原始（Shiwu Yuanshi）","name_en":"Shiwu Yuanshi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","徐炬","事物起源","发式"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《事物原始》为明代徐炬辑，30 卷，明万历二十一年刻本，记日常事物缘起，如堕马髻、新兴髻、椎髻等发式，是认识古代事物历史渊源的文献。","path":"publications/shiwu-yuanshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shizeng","title":"释缯（Shizeng）","name_en":"Shizeng","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","任大椿","丝织物","考证"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《释缯》为清代任大椿著，乾隆年间刊，对历代文献所记丝织物分类，并考证丝绸发展问题；收入《皇清经解》《燕禧堂五种》。","path":"publications/shizeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shizhuzhai-huapu","title":"十竹斋画谱（Shizhuzhai Huapu）","name_en":"Shizhuzhai Huapu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","饾版","彩色套印","画谱","胡正言"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"print_album","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《十竹斋画谱》是明代胡正言刻印的画谱，用“恒版”（李立新）／“短版”（夏燕靖 2016、赵农 2009）彩色套印，是明代彩色套印设计的重要例证。两处版名均疑为饾版之 OCR 误写，本 KU 照录原文并标注。它与《十竹斋笺谱》同为该版代表作，色彩艳丽、浓淡分明、阴阳向背酷似原画，被称为画、刻、印三绝。赵农称其为《十竹斋书画谱》，记全书分书画谱、墨花谱、果谱、翎毛谱、兰谱、竹谱、梅谱、石谱 8 部分，","path":"publications/shizhuzhai-huapu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下明代彩色套印的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shoushi-li","title":"《授时历》（Shoushi Calendar）","name_en":"Shoushi Calendar","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","历法","郭守敬","授时历","天文"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calendar","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《授时历》是元代郭守敬制定的历法。赵农记郭守敬制定了《授时历》，采用了宋人研制的一年为 365.2425 日的计算方法，与现代年历的时间相同，使元代的天文水平居世界领先水平。来源未给编订年份、推步方法、卷数、参编人员与施行年限。","path":"publications/shoushi-li.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《授时历》是 B 维度下元代历法成果的条目；其国家修历制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shui-jing-zhu","title":"水经注（Shui Jing Zhu (Commentary on the Water Classic)）","name_en":"Shui Jing Zhu / Commentary on the Water Classic","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北魏","郦道元","地理","云冈石窟","佛教寺院"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《水经注》在本册只出现于第七节「石窟与雕刻」的「云冈」条。来源称“北魏地理学家郦道元在其《水经注》中描绘道”，引其记武州川水、石祗园舍、灵岩与山堂水殿的文字，并称“亦可见当时佛教寺院的繁盛”。来源未给卷数、成书年代与版本，也未说明注文与经文的关系。图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"publications/shui-jing-zhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《水经注》在本条落在 A 维度，其武州川水条为云冈石窟寺院景观提供文献记述；B 维度只涉及凿石开山与寺院的营造描述，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shujin-pu","title":"蜀锦谱（Shujin Pu）","name_en":"Shujin Pu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","蜀锦","费著","织锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《蜀锦谱》为元代费著撰，不分卷。首叙北宋元丰六年（1083）吕大防建成都府锦院规模及沿革，后列宋元织锦名目，包括“上贡锦”“官告锦”“臣僚袄子锦”“广西锦”及 19 种“细色锦名色”。","path":"publications/shujin-pu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:shuowen-jiezi","title":"说文解字（Shuowen Jiezi）","name_en":"Shuowen Jiezi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["东汉","许慎","六书","文字设计","字书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lexicographic_work","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《说文解字》是东汉许慎编纂的字书，四册来源引用它，用法分两类：一是作为\"六书\"体系的权威出处，被高丰直接读作汉字的设计手法；二是作为名物训释的引据，被赵农、李立新、夏燕靖 2016 用来解释钺、踞、凭几、尺、缶等具体器物与尺度概念。赵农另记许慎的字号、籍贯、官职与\"五经无双许叔重\"之誉。夏燕靖 2009 与田自秉两册全书未见\"说文解字\"字样，故 source_count 为 4。","path":"publications/shuowen-jiezi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《说文解字》在六册来源中主要作为汉字构形法则（六书）的权威出处，兼作器物名物训释的引用来源。前一条属 C 维度文字设计，后一条跨 B 维度器物考释。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:simin-yueling","title":"四民月令（Simin Yueling）","name_en":"Simin Yueling","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["东汉","崔寔","家庭生产","女红"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agronomic_treatise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《四民月令》为东汉崔寔撰，按一年 12 个月安排家庭生产、交换、生活与交往。2016 册称其中所列风俗与纺织、染缝等“女红”手艺，与民间手工艺生产关系密切。","path":"publications/simin-yueling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:sixiu-biji","title":"丝绣笔记（Sixiu Biji）","name_en":"Sixiu Biji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["丝绣","缂丝","织成","刺绣","工艺文献"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《丝绣笔记》是朱启钤辑、阚铎校的丝绣专著，上下两卷。卷上“纪闻”含锦绫、刻丝、刺绣 3 种，辑织作技法、各地纺织产品、丝帛时价、用料数量、历代丝绣制度与禁令等；卷下“辨物”含锦绫、织成、刻丝、刺绣 4 种，辑各种名锦、刻丝织物、刺绣作品、《蜀锦谱》及日本古染物等。田自秉引其说，谓缂丝与织成“是一是二，尚待论定”。","path":"publications/sixiu-biji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下丝绣工艺文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:song-huiyao-jigao","title":"宋会要辑稿（Song Huiyao Jigao）","name_en":"Song Huiyao Jigao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["宋代","徐松","史料","丝织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《宋会要辑稿》是清代徐松据《永乐大典》所收宋代官修《宋会要》辑录而成，全书 366 卷，分 17 类。2016 册既在知识链接中概述其体例与史料价值，又引其“上供”丝织物记载说明江浙丝织业比重。","path":"publications/song-huiyao-jigao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:song-xinwen-bao","title":"《“新闻”报》（Song Dynasty 'News' Gazette）","name_en":"Song Dynasty 'News' Gazette","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["南宋","印刷","报纸","新闻","书坊"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"newspaper","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“新闻”报是宋代末期社会上出现的一种报纸。赵农记其由下层官吏和书坊老板刻印发行，报道政府文件和人事变动的消息，也刊登一些揭露上层黑暗的材料；这种报纸发行非常有限，而且不为宋代政府承认，反而对编辑发行报纸的人员予以悬赏通缉。来源把“新闻”报与政府发行的邸报对举，未给报头、刊期、版式与现存原件。","path":"publications/song-xinwen-bao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"“新闻”报是 C 维度下宋末非官方印刷报纸的条目；其发行者与政府压制归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:suijin","title":"碎金（Suijin）","name_en":"Suijin","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","明代","通俗读物","染色"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《碎金》是元明之际的通俗读物，1935 年故宫博物院文献馆以影印本重版。2016 册称其《蚕织篇》第 15、《彩色篇》第 20 记纺织名物与百余种染色名目，沈从文《中国古代服饰研究》多次引用；又记其最初版本或为唐代《字宝碎金》，并出土西夏文《碎金》残页。","path":"publications/suijin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:sun-zi-bing-fa","title":"孙子兵法（Sunzi Bingfa / The Art of War）","name_en":"Sunzi Bingfa (The Art of War)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["春秋","孙武","兵书","13篇","战略"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《孙子兵法》又称《孙子》，是赵农所记春秋时期军事家和思想家孙武的著作，传世13篇。来源说孙子与孔子同时代，书中针对春秋争霸的现实提出“令民与上同意”“厚爱其民”“知彼知己”等战略观点，并在兵器的配制和运用中提出独到思想，对理解春秋时期的兵器设计知识有极大帮助。来源没有展开各篇内容，也没有给版本、注家与成书过程。","path":"publications/sun-zi-bing-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《孙子兵法》是 A 维度下先秦兵学与造物思想文献的条目，其兵器配制与运用的内容涉及 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:taiping-yulan","title":"太平御览（Taiping Yulan）","name_en":"Taiping Yulan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["宋代","类书","李昉","设计文献"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《太平御览》是宋代李昉等奉敕编纂的类书。2016 册称其工艺部、器物部、舟部、车部、珍宝部等随类相从，可归属设计门类。","path":"publications/taiping-yulan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:tang-liudian","title":"唐六典（Tang Liudian）","name_en":"Tang Liudian","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","行政法典","官营手工业","工匠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regulation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《唐六典》全称《大唐六典》，是唐代行政法典，旧题唐玄宗撰、李林甫等注，实为张说、张九龄等编纂，成书于开元二十六年（738）。2016 册据其记载说明玄宗时少府监、将作监各有工匠万余人，并规定不同工种 9 个月到 4 年不等的技术训练与季考、年考制度。","path":"publications/tang-liudian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:tao-shuo","title":"陶说（Tao Shuo）","name_en":"Tao Shuo","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","朱琰","陶瓷史","景德镇","仿制瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《陶说》是清代朱琰所撰的陶瓷史，四册对它的用法分成两路：一路把它当**史料**——高丰和田自秉各自引同一句论乾隆仿制瓷，田自秉另引它评成化鸡缸杯；一路把它当**著作**——夏燕靖两版给作者、卷次结构，2016 另给初刻年份与“第一部陶瓷史”的定位。**四册都没有给朱琰的生平，也没有给成书年**（只有刻年）。","path":"publications/tao-shuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《陶说》在四册中是陶瓷史与仿制瓷的文献依据：乾隆仿制瓷引文、成化鸡缸杯评语、景德镇官搭民烧构成主体（B），卷次结构与“第一部陶瓷史”的定位属著作史层面（A），官搭民烧与御窑制度属制度面（D）为次。赵农、李立新无本书条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:taoya","title":"《陶雅》（Tao Ya (Ceramic Elegance)）","name_en":"Tao Ya (Ceramic Elegance)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","陶瓷","品评","粉彩","雍正"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_treatise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《陶雅》是田自秉清代陶瓷段引用的陶瓷品评文献。田自秉两处引其评语：一评雍正粉彩为最美，一以质白、胎薄、露光与茸毛、蝇头题字四项称雍正脱胎器为四绝。来源未给作者、成书年代、卷数与版本，本条只登记被引文句。","path":"publications/taoya.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代陶瓷品评文献的锚点，其品评体例与史料价值归 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:tian-zizhu-zhongguo-gongyi-meishu-shi","title":"中国工艺美术史（田自秉）（Chinese History of Arts and Crafts (Tian Zizhu)）","name_en":"Chinese History of Arts and Crafts (Tian Zizhu)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["工艺美术史","通史","田自秉","1985","知识出版社"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国工艺美术史》是田自秉著、知识出版社 1985 年出版的中国工艺美术史通史著作，列入夏燕靖《中国设计史》（2009）参考书目。来源只记作者、书名、出版者与出版年，未记卷章结构、内容提法或版本信息。\n\n本库来源文档另有田自秉《中国工艺美术史（修订本）》（东方出版中心，2010）；本条只记 1985 年知识出版社版，两版关系未在来源中说明，不合并。","path":"publications/tian-zizhu-zhongguo-gongyi-meishu-shi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下中国工艺美术通史写作的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:tiangong-kaiwu","title":"天工开物（Tiangong Kaiwu）","name_en":"Tiangong Kaiwu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","技术典籍","宋应星","工艺百科全书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《天工开物》是明末宋应星撰写的综合性技术著作，1637 年（崇祯十年）刊行。全书分上、中、下三篇，按“贵五谷而贱金玉”的顺序记述谷物、蚕桑纺织、染色、制盐、制糖、陶瓷、冶铸、舟车、造纸、兵器、珠玉等生产全过程，被外国学者誉为“中国 17 世纪的工艺百科全书”。","path":"publications/tiangong-kaiwu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《天工开物》是 B 维度下综合性技术典籍的锚点；其版本、卷数与插图数在来源间不一致。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize，故层级只到 Dimension。"},{"id":"publications:tiansheng-lvling","title":"天盛律令（Tiansheng Lvling）","name_en":"Tiansheng Lvling","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["西夏","法典","官营手工业","专业分工"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regulation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《天盛律令》是西夏法典。2016 册据其记载，西夏设制金司、织绢院、铁工院、木工院、纸工院、砖瓦院、造车院等，说明其官营手工业专业分工细致。","path":"publications/tiansheng-lvling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:tianshui-bingshanlu","title":"《天水冰山录》（Tianshui Bingshan Lu (Confiscation Inventory)）","name_en":"Tianshui Bingshan Lu (Confiscation Inventory)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","嘉靖","严嵩","抄家账簿","丝织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"miscellany","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《天水冰山录》是记载嘉靖时严嵩抄家所没珍宝器物与织绣锦缎的账簿。田自秉册据以列出明代染织物的品种、缎的细类、花纹名目与色彩，认为它从侧面反映了明代丝织的概貌。来源未给作者、成书年、卷数、抄家年份与账簿体例。","path":"publications/tianshui-bingshanlu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度明代工艺史料文献的锚点，所列丝织品种、花纹与色彩属 B 维度，抄家与消费制度属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:tuoluoni-jingzhou","title":"《陀罗尼经咒》（Dharani Charm Scroll）","name_en":"Dharani Charm Scroll","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","成都","雕版印刷","经咒","蚕茧纸"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_charm","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《陀罗尼经咒》成都唐墓本是1944年在四川成都东门望江楼唐墓出土的单页印刷品。来源记其约1尺见方，印在蚕茧纸上，上有佛像与梵文经咒，旁有卞家印卖咒本题记。来源又据成都府于唐肃宗至德二年设立，推算此经咒约在公元800年印刷。图6-23图版未核，本条不据图补写佛像布局与咒文行款。","path":"publications/tuoluoni-jingzhou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《陀罗尼经咒》成都唐墓本为 B 维度下唐代单页雕版印刷品的实物条目；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:unesco-ich-convention","title":"保护非物质文化遗产公约（Convention for the Safeguarding of the Intangible Cultural Heritage）","name_en":"Convention for the Safeguarding of the Intangible Cultural Heritage","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["非物质文化遗产","联合国教科文组织","公约","传统技艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"convention","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《保护非物质文化遗产公约》由联合国教科文组织通过。2016 册引其定义，说明“非物质文化遗产”指被各群体、团体、有时为个人视为其文化遗产的各种实践、表演、表现形式、知识体系和技能及其有关工具、实物、工艺品和文化场所，并列出五类范围。","path":"publications/unesco-ich-convention.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下制度与设计管理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wang-jiashu-zhongguo-gongyi-meishu-shi","title":"中国工艺美术史（王家树）（Chinese History of Arts and Crafts (Wang Jiashu)）","name_en":"Chinese History of Arts and Crafts (Wang Jiashu)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["工艺美术史","通史","王家树","1994","文化艺术出版社"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国工艺美术史》是王家树著、文化艺术出版社 1994 年出版的中国工艺美术史通史著作，列入夏燕靖《中国设计史》（2009）参考书目。来源只记作者、书名、出版者与出版年，未记卷章结构、内容提法或版本信息。","path":"publications/wang-jiashu-zhongguo-gongyi-meishu-shi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下中国工艺美术通史写作的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wang-renxu-qieyun","title":"《王仁昫刊谬补缺切韵》（Wang Renxu's Corrected and Supplemented Qieyun）","name_en":"Wang Renxu's Corrected and Supplemented Qieyun","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","韵书","旋风装","故宫博物院","王仁昫"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"rhyme_dictionary","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《王仁昫刊谬补缺切韵》是故宫博物院所藏唐抄本，赵农在述旋风装时举其为典型实例。来源称其书页折起成为双面文字，从右向左排压，后一页在前一页下面，留出页边以便检索，所有书页装裱在一张长纸上，可以卷起。来源只在旋风装条中提到此书，未给卷数、编撰年代、内容、递修与版式细节，本条不补。","path":"publications/wang-renxu-qieyun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《王仁昫刊谬补缺切韵》是 B 维度下唐代旋风装书籍的实物实例，其韵书文字与检索界面归 C 维度；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wang-zhen-nongshu","title":"王祯农书（Wang Zhen Nongshu）","name_en":"Wang Zhen Nongshu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","农学","农器图谱","王祯","秧马"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《王祯农书》是元代王祯编撰的农学专著，四册都把它当作元代农具与农业技术的总汇。夏燕靖两版给全书结构与版本，赵农给成书背景、农器图谱的分卷与王祯本人的农具设计，高丰只取两条：一条把书名误作《农布》，一条记转轮排字盘的年份。**四册对卷数、部分名、字数的写法互不相同**，是本批分歧最密的一个条目。","path":"publications/wang-zhen-nongshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《王祯农书》在四册中都是农具与农业技术条目：农器图谱、搅车、经架、水力大纺车、耧锄、秧马构成主体（B），王祯的县尹身份、劝农措施、刊刻与版本属制度与流传面（D）。田自秉与李立新无本书条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wanxiang","title":"《万象》（Wanxiang (All Phenomena)）","name_en":"Wanxiang (All Phenomena)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","张光宇","杂志","封面设计","万象"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《万象》是张光宇设计封面的杂志。赵农称其封面装饰风格显著、大方得体、民族气息浓郁。来源未给创刊年、出版地、主编与刊期。","path":"publications/wanxiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《万象》是 C 维度下张光宇设计封面的杂志的条目；来源只作封面评语，未及出版机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:weimojie-suoshuo-jing","title":"《维摩诘所说经》（Vimalakirti Sutra）","name_en":"Vimalakirti Sutra","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["西夏","活字印刷","佛经","武威","梵夹本"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"buddhist_sutra","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《维摩诘所说经》是甘肃武威出土的西夏活字印刷佛经。赵农记西夏引进雕版印刷技术，在国都兴庆府设纸工院与刻印司管理书籍纸张，1085 年最早刊印佛经；1972 年武威出土的西夏佛经残本为梵夹本形式；西夏印刷除雕版外已使用活泥字，《维摩诘所说经》即西夏活字印刷。来源未给该经的卷数、版式、字数与出土编号。","path":"publications/weimojie-suoshuo-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《维摩诘所说经》是 C 维度下西夏活字印刷的条目；其纸工院与刻印司背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wen-hua-de-jin-hua","title":"《文化的进化》（The Evolution of Culture）","name_en":"The Evolution of Culture","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["进化论","人类学","造物更迭","皮特·里弗斯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"academic_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《文化的进化》是李立新《中国设计艺术史论》所引皮特·里弗斯的著作。李立新称里弗斯在书中根据工业时代之前的人造物品，描述了整合智力成就与技术成就的造物更迭理论，并引“世世代代的人们不经预先思考或设计……”一段，随后指出把这一无意识选择概念移用到中国古代造物设计史时须有界定和修改。来源未给原书名、出版社、初版年份、译本与全书结构。","path":"publications/wen-hua-de-jin-hua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度造物更迭理论著作的条目，其经验对象属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wen-xin-diao-long","title":"《文心雕龙》（The Literary Mind and the Carving of Dragons）","name_en":"The Literary Mind and the Carving of Dragons","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["南朝","刘勰","八体说","文论","风格论"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《文心雕龙》是南朝刘勰所著文论。李立新引其“八体说”，即典雅、远奥、精约、显附、繁缛、壮丽、新奇、轻靡，认为这八种艺术类型与现代风格概念较为接近、很具学术色彩；又比较说八体说揭示艺术的精神审美性，与沃尔夫林五对概念的形式性不同。来源未给成书年代、篇目结构、版本与注疏，本条只登记与风格论相关的这一处。","path":"publications/wen-xin-diao-long.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度下中国古代风格类型论的文献条目，其八体名目与审美面向归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wugou-jingguang-daluoni-jing","title":"《无垢净光大陀罗尼经》（Korean Bulguksa Edition）","name_en":"Korean Bulguksa Edition","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","佛经","雕版印刷","韩国佛国寺","楮纸"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_sutra","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《无垢净光大陀罗尼经》佛国寺本是1966年在韩国佛国寺发现的雕版印刷佛经。来源称其无年代注明，只有武则天在位期间创新的几个文字，因而推断为唐代盛期印刷品，比咸通九年《金刚经》本早100余年。来源记其用12块木刻雕版印在楮纸上，长6.6米、高0.08米，并称这应是发现最早的印刷品。以上年代与最早地位均为来源的推测语气，本条照录，不写成定论。","path":"publications/wugou-jingguang-daluoni-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《无垢净光大陀罗尼经》佛国寺本是 B 维度下早期雕版印刷佛经的实物条目；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wujing-zongyao","title":"武经总要（Wujing Zongyao）","name_en":"Wujing Zongyao","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北宋","军事","火药","火器","筏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"military_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《武经总要》是北宋军事著作。赵农称其中有许多关于火器和火药制造的记录，如火药中引火球、蒺藜火球、毒药烟球的配方，已具有近代黑色火药的比例；李立新引其蒲筏、木罂、械筏的编排规范。","path":"publications/wujing-zongyao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代军事技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wulin-jiushi","title":"武林旧事（Wulin Jiushi）","name_en":"Wulin Jiushi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["南宋","临安","周密","城市"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《武林旧事》为周密撰，成书于元至元二十七年（1290）之前，52 篇，记南宋临安山水名胜、城郭宫殿、皇家园林、典章制度、节日民俗与市肆商品。","path":"publications/wulin-jiushi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wuyingdian-juzhenban-chengshi","title":"《武英殿聚珍版程式》（Wuyingdian Juzhenban Chengshi）","name_en":"Wuyingdian Juzhenban Chengshi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","乾隆","木活字","金简","印刷程式"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printing_manual","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《武英殿聚珍版程式》是乾隆时期金简为《武英殿聚珍版丛书》木活字印刷所撰的程式。赵农记乾隆时期木活字印刷以刻印《武英殿聚珍版丛书》著名，编纂者金简撰文对该程式作详细绘图说明，可以看出人们已经改进了元代王祯的木活字印制方法。来源未给卷数、成书年代、图幅数与版本。","path":"publications/wuyingdian-juzhenban-chengshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《武英殿聚珍版程式》是 C 维度下清代印刷技术文献的条目；其木活字工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wuyue-chunqiu","title":"《吴越春秋》（Wu Yue Chunqiu (Annals of Wu and Yue)）","name_en":"Wu Yue Chunqiu (Annals of Wu and Yue)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["吴越春秋","吴国","战船","三翼","大翼"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"history","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《吴越春秋》是李立新引以说明吴国战船“三翼”形制与尺寸的史书。来源记三翼即大翼、中翼、小翼，以陆军重车、轻车比附而称“翼船”，并给三船的长宽与载员配置；同段又据战国铜壶、铜鉴纹样判断战船分两层、船底双层。来源未给作者、成书年代、版本、卷次与记载的上下文。","path":"publications/wuyue-chunqiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度下战船文献的锚点，其船型与尺度记载服务 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:wuzhong-qiyuan","title":"《物种起源》（On the Origin of Species）","name_en":"On the Origin of Species","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["达尔文","进化论","自然选择","适应"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scientific_treatise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《物种起源》是达尔文的著作。李立新在讨论适应性时引其说：生命形态的特殊形式是进化的结果，是动物利用各种线索实行遗传变异和自然选择的结果，目的是求得适应。来源只给书名、作者与这一句转述，未给版本、译者与出版信息。","path":"publications/wuzhong-qiyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计理论援引的生物学著作，其适应概念被用于解释造物，属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xi-zhou-shi","title":"《西周史》（Western Zhou History）","name_en":"Western Zhou History","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["许倬云","西周","文化演进","推背行"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《西周史》是许倬云的著作。李立新引其研究：追溯新石器时代，以新出考古资料为据，认为文化现象是一波接一波的“推背行”，是“接触→冲突→交流→融合→整合”的运动过程。来源未给版本、出版社、出版年与页码。","path":"publications/xi-zhou-shi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度史学著作的条目，其文化演进概括用于解释早期设计，属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xiandai-sheji-daxi","title":"《现代设计大系》（Modern Design Compendium）","name_en":"Modern Design Compendium","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["改革开放","潘公凯","卢辅圣","设计","现代设计大系"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_series","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《现代设计大系》是潘公凯、卢辅圣主编的设计丛书。赵农在“设计研究”段将其列入十余年来有影响的设计著述。来源未给出版社、出版年、卷册数与各卷作者。","path":"publications/xiandai-sheji-daxi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《现代设计大系》是 A 维度下设计丛书的条目；其主编组织与出版属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xianqing-ouji","title":"闲情偶寄（Xianqing Ouji）","name_en":"Xianqing Ouji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","李渔","居室","器玩","暖椅"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"life_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《闲情偶寄》是李渔所著，成书于 1671 年（清康熙十年），全书分声容、居室、器玩、饮馔、种植、颐养六卷。居室部论房舍构筑、窗栏图式、墙壁、联匾、山石等园林营造与室内装饰；器玩部论几椅、床帐、橱柜、箱笼、茶酒具、灯烛、笺简的设计制作。书中提出注重功能、实用第一，崇尚俭朴、创异标新，以及“宜简不宜繁，宜自然不宜雕斫”等设计思想，并记录李渔自创的暖椅与凉机。赵农称其以“机”“趣”为出发点，细致观察器物","path":"publications/xianqing-ouji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下清代居室与器玩文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xiaobinlu-kangyi","title":"《校邠庐抗议》（Xiaobinlu Kangyi (Protest from the Xiaobin Hut)）","name_en":"Xiaobinlu Kangyi (Protest from the Xiaobin Hut)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["晚清","冯桂芬","自强","校邠庐抗议"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reform_treatise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《校邠庐抗议》是冯桂芬的著述。赵农引其“始则师而法之，继则比而齐之，终则驾而上之，自强之道，实在乎是”，用以说明洋务运动前后的自强理想。来源未给成书年份、卷数、刊本与全书结构。","path":"publications/xiaobinlu-kangyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《校邠庐抗议》是 D 维度下晚清改革著述的条目；其学习西方与自强的跨文化取向属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xiechawei-suanjing","title":"《谢察微算经》（Xie Chawei's Mathematical Classic）","name_en":"Xie Chawei's Mathematical Classic","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["宋代","数学","谢察微算经","算盘","横梁隔木"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mathematics_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《谢察微算经》是宋代记载算盘形制的数学著作。赵农记只有到了宋代典籍中，才明确记载算盘有“横梁隔木”的形状，并括注《谢察微算经》；从造型上看这已经与近代算盘非常相似。来源只给书名、一条引文与作者名，未给卷数、成书年代、版本与作者生平。","path":"publications/xiechawei-suanjing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《谢察微算经》是 C 维度下宋代算学著作的条目；其算盘形制记载归 B 维度。材料仅书名与一条引文，confidence 取 low。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xijing-zaji","title":"西京杂记（Xijing Zaji / Miscellanies of the Western Capital）","name_en":"Xijing Zaji / Miscellanies of the Western Capital","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["秦汉","西汉","丁缓","香炉","灯具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"essay_collection","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《西京杂记》是来源用来记载西汉长安工匠丁缓与相关器物的书。来源三处引用：丁缓制卧褥香炉的故事（L3113）、记里鼓车的“记道车，驾四，中道”记载（L3171），以及丁缓为常满灯的记载（L3199）。来源没有给作者、卷数、成书年代与版本。","path":"publications/xijing-zaji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《西京杂记》是 A 维度下被来源用作西汉工匠与器物记载的文献，其丁缓香炉、常满灯与记里鼓车材料兼及 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xin-qingnian","title":"新青年（New Youth）","name_en":"New Youth","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","陈独秀","新文化运动","刊物","版式"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《新青年》是陈独秀宣传“民主”和“科学”、倡导新文化运动的阵地，积聚了当时一批文化精英。2016 将其版式与《域外小说集》、严复《天演论》及当时刊印的书刊并列为同一种设计形式，并以图注 10-32 收录《新青年》创刊号（图版未视觉核验）。","path":"publications/xin-qingnian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下近代期刊版式的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xin-quanxiang-sanguozhi-pinghua","title":"《新全相三国志平话》（New Fully Illustrated Romance of the Three Kingdoms）","name_en":"New Fully Illustrated Romance of the Three Kingdoms","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","封面","版权","建安","虞氏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"illustrated_fiction","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《新全相三国志平话》是元代出现书籍封面形式的代表。赵农记元英宗至治年间的《新全相三国志平话》封面有插图和文字，文字中出现出版时间（至治）、地点（建安）、出版者（虞氏）、特点（新全相）等版权内容，是元代图书的首创；书籍上图下文，通俗明晰、老少咸宜。来源未给版式尺寸、页数与存本。","path":"publications/xin-quanxiang-sanguozhi-pinghua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《新全相三国志平话》是 C 维度下元代书籍封面与插图版式的条目；其出版者与版权信息归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xiqing-yanpu","title":"《西清砚谱》（Xiqing Yanpu）","name_en":"Xiqing Yanpu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","乾隆","砚谱","清宫","文房"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inkstone_catalog","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《西清砚谱》是清乾隆年间编撰的清宫藏砚谱录。赵农记其对清宫内藏的名砚进行了整理品玩，与高凤翰《砚史》同为石砚品评风气的例证。来源未给卷数、编者、著录砚数与版本。","path":"publications/xiqing-yanpu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《西清砚谱》是 B 维度下清代砚谱文献的条目；其图录与书法形式归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xiu-shi-lu","title":"髹饰录（Xiu Shi Lu）","name_en":"Xiu Shi Lu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","漆艺","黄成","工艺专著"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《髹饰录》是明代漆工黄成所撰的漆艺专著，天启五年（1625）由杨明逐条加注并作序，分乾、坤两集共十八章。田自秉记其“是我国现存唯一的古代漆艺专著”，高丰则通过王世襄的整理本说明其价值。","path":"publications/xiu-shi-lu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《髹饰录》是 B 维度下漆艺工艺知识体系化的著作锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xiupu","title":"绣谱（Xiupu）","name_en":"Xiupu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","丁佩","苏绣","刺绣","能巧妙神"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《绣谱》是清代苏绣艺人丁佩所著刺绣专著，成书于道光元年（1821）。全书分择地、选样、取材、辨色、程工（2016 作“工程”）、论品 6 章，提出“能、巧、妙、神”的美学原则与苏绣“齐、光、直、匀、薄、顺、密”的特点。田自秉称其为清道光时丁佩所著刺绣专著。","path":"publications/xiupu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下清代刺绣文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xuanhe-huapu","title":"《宣和画谱》（Xuanhe Huapu (Xuanhe Painting Catalogue)）","name_en":"Xuanhe Huapu (Xuanhe Painting Catalogue)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北宋","宣和","宣和画谱","画院","书画目录"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"art_catalog","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《宣和画谱》是宋代宣和画院编纂的画目。赵农记宣和画院编纂的《宣和画谱》《宣和书谱》分类细致、搜罗完整，足见宋代书画家对书画艺术研究的水平；同段又记书画创作促进装裱技术发展，宋代有专门官员管理、装裱书画，宋裱“宣和装”广泛流行于后世。来源未给卷数、著录画家数与编撰过程。","path":"publications/xuanhe-huapu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《宣和画谱》是 C 维度下北宋官修画目的条目；其宣和画院与装裱管理制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xuehuan-xiupu","title":"雪宦绣谱（Xuehuan Xiupu）","name_en":"Xuehuan Xiupu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清末民初","刺绣","苏绣","沈寿","张謇"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《雪宦绣谱》是清末沈寿口述、张謇记录整理的刺绣工艺专著。四册对它的处理分成三层：夏燕靖两版给**完整的章目与数值**（八章、十八种针法、八十八种色线、七百四十五种因染而别），田自秉给**著作谱系中的位置**并只列章名，高丰只给**成书经过与一句性质判断**。**四册都没有给出初版年份或出版者**，田自秉册末另列一个 2004 年现代版本。","path":"publications/xuehuan-xiupu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《雪宦绣谱》在四册中是刺绣工艺著作：八章章目、十八种针法、八十八种色线与七百四十五种“因染而别”构成主体（B），沈寿在南通女工传习所的授绣与张謇的记录整理属制度与教育面（D），其“系统而完整的理论著作”定位属著作史层面（A）为次。赵农、李立新无本书条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:xunzi","title":"荀子（Xunzi）","name_en":"Xunzi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","荀子","荀况","以玉比德","天行有常"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《荀子》是战国末年儒家思想家荀况的著作。荀子重视美感和教育功能，在议论中常以器具比喻说明道理，书中提出“以玉比德”（《荀子·法行》）的思想。2016 记其据《史记·孟子荀卿列传》为荀况晚年总结百家争鸣与自身学术思想而编；《天论》《非相》反映其唯物主义自然观，提出“天行有常”“天人相分”“制天命而用之”；《玉制》（疑为《王制》之讹）《富国》《天论》《宥坐》强调等级不同者的衣着、居住规制。","path":"publications/xunzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下先秦造物思想文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yangxian-mingtaolu","title":"阳羡名陶录（Yangxian Mingtao Lu）","name_en":"Yangxian Mingtao Lu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","吴骞","紫砂","宜兴"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《阳羡名陶录》为清代吴骞撰，2 卷，上卷原始、选材、本艺、家溯，下卷丛谈、文翰，记宜兴紫砂陶起源、选材、工艺与名家。","path":"publications/yangxian-mingtaolu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yangzhou-huafanglu","title":"扬州画舫录（Yangzhou Huafang Lu）","name_en":"Yangzhou Huafang Lu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","扬州","园林","市井"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《扬州画舫录》为清代李斗撰，18 卷，记康乾年间扬州园林名胜、民间艺术、营造法式、市井风俗、寺观祠宇及戏曲小说史料，是研究扬州园林与民俗的重要典籍。原文“是研究”一句在 L6275 处被页眉行截断，L6279 接“扬州园林、园亭奇观和民俗事象的重要典籍”。","path":"publications/yangzhou-huafanglu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yanji-tu","title":"燕几图（Yanji Tu）","name_en":"Yanji Tu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["宋代","家具","黄伯思","组合设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《燕几图》为宋代黄伯思撰，2016 册称其记述两宋家具从实践到理论，述几桌相互搭配拼接成各种形式，揭示设计颇具巧思的观点。","path":"publications/yanji-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yantielun","title":"盐铁论（Yantielun）","name_en":"Yantielun","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["西汉","桓宽","盐铁会议","本末"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《盐铁论》是西汉桓宽依据汉昭帝时盐铁会议记录整理而成的著作，共 60 篇。2016 册正文引《本议第一》中“崇本退末”“工不作无用之器”等辩论，说明本末观念对手工业的制约；文献索引则记其对当时手工业生产状况与朝野经济观点的记述。","path":"publications/yantielun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yanxian-qingshang-jian","title":"燕闲清赏笺（Yanxian Qingshang Jian）","name_en":"Yanxian Qingshang Jian","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","高濂","漆器","雕漆","刺绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"connoisseurship_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《燕闲清赏笺》是明代高濂的鉴赏著作。田自秉三处引用：一记宋漆盒、漆盘、漆匣的多种造型；一记宋人雕漆朱厚堆至数十层、有锡胎者、有葛地者等；一评元绣“便不及宋，以其用绒粗肥，落针不密”，田自秉认为这种说法不公正。高丰将其列入明代手工业设计专著群。","path":"publications/yanxian-qingshang-jian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代鉴赏文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yaoqi-shuo","title":"窑器说（Yaoqi Shuo）","name_en":"Yaoqi Shuo","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","瓷器","残句"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《窑器说》在 2016 册中仅存残句“清代所出之瓷器进行论述，有极高的参考价值”，作者、卷数、成书年代等信息均缺失。本 KU 只记录该残存表述，不补外部信息。","path":"publications/yaoqi-shuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yijia-yan","title":"一家言·居室器玩部（Yijia Yan）","name_en":"Yijia Yan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["清代","李渔","居室","器玩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《一家言·居室器玩部》为清代李渔撰，记房舍构筑、山石布置、营造园艺、窗栏图式、墙壁联匮、几椅、床帐、橱柜、箱笼、茶酒具、灯烛、笺筒等制作，卷首有近人阐铎《识语》一篇。原文“阐铎”疑为“阚铎”之讹。","path":"publications/yijia-yan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yingzao-fashi","title":"营造法式（Yingzao Fashi）","name_en":"Yingzao Fashi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["北宋","建筑规范","李诫","官书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《营造法式》是北宋官方颁布的建筑设计与施工规范书，由李诫（来源另作“李诚”）编修，成书于元符三年（1100），刊行于崇宁二年（1103）。全书分名例、制度、工限料例、图样四部分，详述大木作、石作、砖作、小木作、雕木作与彩画作，是研究宋代建筑与室内设计最重要的技术文献之一。","path":"publications/yingzao-fashi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《营造法式》是 B 维度下建筑与室内装修规范的锚点；其官方制度内容未来可与 D 维度交叉。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yinliuzhai-shuoci","title":"饮流斋说瓷（Yinliuzhai Shuoci）","name_en":"Yinliuzhai Shuoci","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["民国","许之衡","陶瓷","说窑","款识"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramics_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《饮流斋说瓷》是许之衡所著陶瓷专著，分上下两卷共 10 节，成书于 20 世纪 20 年代。上卷为概说、说窑、胎釉、彩色、花绘，下卷为款识、瓶罐、杯盘、杂具、疵伪。该书以分类、排比方法总结前人知识与个人见闻，保存大量古陶瓷学名和俗称；书前附《书成自题六十韵》。","path":"publications/yinliuzhai-shuoci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下近代陶瓷文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yishu-fazhanshi","title":"《艺术发展史》（The Story of Art）","name_en":"The Story of Art","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["艺术发展史","贡布里奇","排除法原则","艺术史分期"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"academic_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《艺术发展史》是贡布里奇的著作。李立新称贡布里奇以“排除法原则”把艺术史分为“古典的”和“非古典的”两段，并称该书几乎是以地域和纪元划出艺术特征及各个发展时期；举此以说明国外艺术史分期的一种做法，并认为中国设计史很难照搬。原著版本、译者与出版信息未载。","path":"publications/yishu-fazhanshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度艺术史著作的条目，艺术风格分期涉及 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yishu-shejixue","title":"《艺术设计学》（Art Design Studies）","name_en":"Art Design Studies","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["改革开放","凌继尧","徐恒醇","艺术设计学","著述"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_theory_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《艺术设计学》是凌继尧、徐恒醇合著的艺术设计理论著述。赵农在“设计研究”段将其列入十余年来有影响的设计著述。来源未给出版社、出版年、卷册与内容结构。","path":"publications/yishu-shejixue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《艺术设计学》是 A 维度下艺术设计理论著述的条目；其出版与教育传播属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yishu-yu-sheji","title":"艺术与设计（Yishu yu Sheji）","name_en":"Yishu yu Sheji","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1998","期刊","艺术设计","创刊"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《艺术与设计》是由国家新闻出版总署主管的杂志，1998 年 2 月创刊。2016 册年表仅记创刊时间与主管单位。","path":"publications/yishu-yu-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下视觉传达与出版物的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yiwen-leiju","title":"艺文类聚（Yiwen Leiju）","name_en":"Yiwen Leiju","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","类书","欧阳询","设计文献"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《艺文类聚》是唐代欧阳询等编纂的类书。2016 册在讨论设计文献范围时指出，其中居处部、产业部、服饰部、舟车部、巧艺部等部卷涉及设计，可据以检索古代造物与生活器用的分类记载。","path":"publications/yiwen-leiju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yongle-beizang","title":"《永乐北藏》（Yongle Northern Canon）","name_en":"Yongle Northern Canon","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","永乐","大藏经","佛经","官刻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"buddhist_canon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《永乐北藏》是明初第三次印刷的《大藏经》。赵农记其收集 1621 种佛经，编为 6361 卷，分装 636 函，随后又陆续补充印制加入其中；同段结语并称明代官方雕版印刷的实力，兼指《永乐北藏》与《道藏》。来源未给开雕与完成年代、主持者、版式与存世情况。","path":"publications/yongle-beizang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《永乐北藏》是 C 维度下明代官刻佛藏的条目；其雕版工艺归 B 维度，官方印经制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yongle-dadian","title":"《永乐大典》（Yongle Dadian）","name_en":"Yongle Dadian","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","永乐","类书","写本","朱棣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"encyclopedia","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《永乐大典》是明成祖朱棣于 1408 年编纂的大型类书。赵农记其利用官方图书资源优势，广泛收集各类图书共 22937 卷、约 3.7 亿字；没有印刷，仅缮写两部，是中国历史上最大的类书。来源未给编纂者名单、装帧形式、存世卷数与散佚经过。","path":"publications/yongle-dadian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《永乐大典》是 C 维度下明代大型写本的条目；其官修制度归 D 维度，书写装帧工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:youyang-zazu","title":"《酉阳杂俎》（Youyang Zazu (Miscellaneous Morsels from Youyang)）","name_en":"Youyang Zazu (Miscellaneous Morsels from Youyang)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["酉阳杂俎","汉代","造船","豫章大船","楼船"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"notes","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《酉阳杂俎》是李立新引以说明汉代造船规模的笔记，其中记汉武帝所造豫章大船可载千人。李立新接称“汉承秦制”，船舶的结构形式及标准规范与秦代相似，并以楼船、多桨流体形船、桨形舵与锚具说明汉代形制的完善。来源未给作者、成书年代、版本、卷次与豫章大船的尺寸。","path":"publications/youyang-zazu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度下造船记载的文献锚点，其船型与标准服务 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yuan-ye","title":"园冶（Yuan Ye）","name_en":"Yuan Ye","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","园林","计成","造园理论"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《园冶》是明代计成所撰的造园专著，崇祯四年（1631）成稿、崇祯七年刊行，三卷，附图二百余幅。夏燕靖 2016 称其为“我国第一本园林艺术理论的专著”，田自秉把它与《营造法式》并提，视作明代园林艺术的总结。","path":"publications/yuan-ye.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《园冶》是 B 维度下造园工艺理论化的著作锚点，其“虽由人作，宛自天成”的命题也涉及 A 维度的设计观念问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yuanxi-qiqitu-shuo","title":"《远西奇器图说》（Illustrated Treatise on Western Machines (Yuanxi Qiqitu Shuo)）","name_en":"Illustrated Treatise on Western Machines (Yuanxi Qiqitu Shuo)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明末","王征","邓玉函","奇器图说","西学"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mechanical_treatise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《远西奇器图说》是明末论西方机械与民生日用器具的著作。李立新在 L1226 把它系于王征，并引其论诸器为“人世所急需之物”；又在 L1236 记 1627 年传教士邓玉函写了《奇器图说》《诸图说》等工艺技术书籍。来源对作者与书名的记载不一致，本条并列两说，并以“奇器图说”为别名，不据来源外知识判定。","path":"publications/yuanxi-qiqitu-shuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 E 维度下明末西学机械著作的条目，其机械技术面向归 B 维度，传教士知识网络归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yue-ji","title":"乐记（Yue Ji / Record of Music）","name_en":"Yue Ji (Record of Music)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["儒家","音乐理论","物感心动","礼乐","先秦典籍"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《乐记》是赵农所引的儒家音乐理论文献。来源用《乐记》的“音之起，由人心生也；人心之动，物使之然也。感于物而动，故形于声”说明“物感心动”的理论，又引“乐者为同，礼者为异”说明音乐与政治制度的关联，并称《乐记》是一部对于中国音乐有极大影响的著作。来源没有交代《乐记》的作者、篇数、成书年代与版本。","path":"publications/yue-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《乐记》是 A 维度下先秦音乐思想文献的条目，其乐器内容涉及 B 维度、礼乐制度内容涉及 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yue-lun","title":"乐论（Yue Lun (Discourse on Music)）","name_en":"Yue Lun / Discourse on Music","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["三国","曹魏","阮籍","音乐理论","玄学"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"treatise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《乐论》在本册只出现一次，见于第六节「家具与乐器」的「乐器」条末句。来源记“与嵇康交好的诗人阮籍”在其《乐论》中以音乐为天地的本体、万物的本性。来源未给篇卷、成书年代、版本与全书结构。本条与同段所记《声无哀乐论》分列，不合并。图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"publications/yue-lun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《乐论》在本条落在 A 维度，其音乐本体说属设计史观与音乐思想背景；材料只有一行，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yuelv-quanshu","title":"《乐律全书》（Yuelü Quanshu）","name_en":"Yuelü Quanshu","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","郑藩","朱载堉","藩王刻本","乐律"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"music_treatise","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《乐律全书》是明郑藩朱载堉的著作，以印刷精良著称。赵农记其是明代藩王刻本的例子，并称一些藩王文化水平精深，使书籍印刷质量有了根本保障。来源未给卷数、成书年代、刊刻时间与版本。","path":"publications/yuelv-quanshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《乐律全书》是 C 维度下明代藩王刻本的条目；其乐律内容归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yugong","title":"禹贡（Yugong）","name_en":"Yugong","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","尚书","九州","物产","染织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"geographical_text","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《禹贡》是《尚书》中的地理篇。田自秉据《禹贡》等书记载春秋战国染织生产分布，列举冀州、并州、青州、兖州、徐州、扬州、荆州、豫州的布帛、丝、纨、绮、绣、玄织缟、玄纁等物产，并引“青州贡盐緝海物”“厥贡漆丝”等句；2016 记《禹贡》有梁州（秦岭以南、陕南川东地区）贡铁的记载。赵农则把《尚书·禹贡》与《管子·地员》《山海经》并列为春秋战国地理知识拓展后出现的专门著述，并接记齐人驺衍的“大九州说”。三册","path":"publications/yugong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下先秦物产地理文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:yuhai","title":"《玉海》（Yuhai (Jade Sea)）","name_en":"Yuhai (Jade Sea)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","庆元路","王应麟","类书","刻书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"encyclopedia","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《玉海》是元代庆元路刻印的类书。赵农记 1340 年庆元路（浙江宁波）刻印宋代王应麟的大类书《玉海》，共 204 卷，称其为贯串奥博的古今奇书；同段记元代官方以兴文署最著名，地方多为儒学书院刻书，兴文署印胡三省《音注资治通鉴》、郑樵《通志》最有名，元代印制《大藏经》估计 6500 卷。来源未给《玉海》的版式、行款与刻工。","path":"publications/yuhai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《玉海》是 C 维度下元代地方刻书的条目；其官刻与书院刻书格局归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zaowu-zhi-ji","title":"《造物之迹——中国设计艺术史引论》（Zaowu Zhi Ji (An Introduction to the History of Chinese Design Art)）","name_en":"Zaowu Zhi Ji (An Introduction to the History of Chinese Design Art)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["李立新","博士论文","东南大学","2002","造物艺术史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"doctoral_dissertation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《造物之迹——中国设计艺术史引论》是李立新的博士论文，2002 年 6 月 15 日在东南大学艺术学系通过答辩。同行评审专家为梁白泉、奚传绩、徐湖平、凌继尧、诸葛铠、张朋川、陶思炎、万书元；答辩委员会由奚传绩、梁白泉、诸葛铠、陶思炎、万书元组成。后记称《中国设计艺术史论》即在此论文基础上修改完成。来源未给论文完成年、导师署名、摘要、目录、出版信息与答辩决议。","path":"publications/zaowu-zhi-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史学术史与学位论文的文献锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhongguo-baozhuang","title":"《中国包装》（Zhongguo Baozhuang (China Packaging)）","name_en":"Zhongguo Baozhuang (China Packaging)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["改革开放","包装业","专业杂志","中国包装"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"trade_periodical","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国包装》是包装行业的刊物。赵农称其与《包装年鉴》同为包装行业权威信息发布的刊物。来源未给创办单位、创刊年、刊期与主编。","path":"publications/zhongguo-baozhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《中国包装》是 C 维度下包装行业刊物的条目；其行业组织属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhongguo-gongyi-meishu-congshu","title":"《中国工艺美术丛书》（Chinese Arts and Crafts Series）","name_en":"Chinese Arts and Crafts Series","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["工艺美术","丛书","庞薰栗","中国工艺美术丛书"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_series","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国工艺美术丛书》是庞薰栗主编的工艺美术丛书。来源只在内容介绍中记《中国工艺美术史》曾收入该丛书，未给出版社、出版年、书目种数与各册作者。","path":"publications/zhongguo-gongyi-mei