ntative","sub_type":"architectural_history","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国建筑史》是梁思成在抗日战争时期西南后方困难条件下撰写的著作。赵农在中国营造学社段记梁思成等人继续开展研究，梁思成撰写《中国建筑史》等著作，为中国古代建筑的研究奠定了基础。来源未给成书年份、卷数、章节结构与版本。","path":"publications/zhongguo-jianzhushi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《中国建筑史》是 B 维度下中国建筑史研究著作的条目；其建筑史书写与分期属 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhongguo-lidai-huihua","title":"《中国历代绘画》（Zhongguo Lidai Huihua (Chinese Painting Through the Ages)）","name_en":"Zhongguo Lidai Huihua (Chinese Painting Through the Ages)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["改革开放","1978","人民美术出版社","书籍装帧","中国历代绘画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"art_album","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国历代绘画》是人民美术出版社 1978 年出版的大型绘画图录。赵农称其与上海古籍出版社 1980 年的《陈寅恪文集》古朴沉稳、风格典雅。来源未给编者、卷数、开本与印数。","path":"publications/zhongguo-lidai-huihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《中国历代绘画》是 C 维度下大型绘画图录装帧的条目；人民美术出版社的出版组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhongguo-lidai-huobi-daxi","title":"《中国历代货币大系》（Zhongguo Lidai Huobi Daxi (Compendium of Chinese Currency Through the Ages)）","name_en":"Zhongguo Lidai Huobi Daxi (Compendium of Chinese Currency Through the Ages)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["新中国","任意","货币","书籍装帧","中国历代货币大系"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_series","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国历代货币大系》是赵农在 1949 年后书籍装帧段举为保持风格的少数作品之一，与张光宇的《装饰》字体设计、集体设计的《毛泽东选集》并列，署名为任意。来源未给卷数、出版社、出版年与设计分工。","path":"publications/zhongguo-lidai-huobi-daxi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《中国历代货币大系》是 C 维度下大型货币图录装帧的条目；其出版组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhongguo-sheji-yishu-shi","title":"《中国设计艺术史》（Zhongguo Sheji Yishu Shi (History of Chinese Design Art)）","name_en":"Zhongguo Sheji Yishu Shi (History of Chinese Design Art)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["张道一","胡平","李立新","计划合写","设计史"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_history_monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国设计艺术史》是李立新 2011 册后记所记的一部计划合写的设计史著作，由张道一带头，胡平与李立新参与。后记称李立新入学伊始论文选题大致定在“造物艺术史”上，为配合这一计划，对已有资料重新做了归纳、分析，对新出资料做了收集、整理，博士论文即在这一前期工作基础上撰成。原文未记该书的出版信息、成书状态与章节结构，只能确认写作计划与前期工作。书名与本书《中国设计艺术史论》不同，勿混。","path":"publications/zhongguo-sheji-yishu-shi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史著作计划的文献锚点，其未出版状态使 confidence 取 low。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhongguo-shejishi-gaofeng","title":"中国设计史（高丰）（The Design History of China (Gao Feng)）","name_en":"The Design History of China (Gao Feng)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["设计史","通史","高丰","2004","广西美术出版社"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国设计史》是高丰著、广西美术出版社出版的中国设计史专著。正文由绪论和九章组成，从原始时代述至清末民国；绪论讨论中国设计史的研究课题、发生发展与若干规律。书名页附英文题名 THE DESIGN HISTORY OF CHINA。","path":"publications/zhongguo-shejishi-gaofeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下现代设计通史的文献锚点，同时是本语