 Nong, 2009)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["设计史","教材","赵农","2009","高等教育出版社"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textbook","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国艺术设计史》是赵农编著、高等教育出版社 2009 年 4 月第 1 版第 1 次印刷的设计史教材。CIP 数据标明 ISBN 978-7-04-015040-7、分类号 J509.2、中国版本图书馆 CIP 数据核字 (2009) 第 013177 号；版本记录载明开本 787×1092 1/16、24 印张、500,000 字、定价 49.80 元。全书分十章，按历史时间沿革论述石器、玉器","path":"publications/zhongguo-yishu-shejishi-zhaonong-2009.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下设计史教材与文献的锚点，记录赵农 2009 年教材的版本信息、章节结构与编写意图。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhouli","title":"周礼（Rites of Zhou）","name_en":"Rites of Zhou","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","官书","礼制","职官"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classic","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《周礼》是六册来源共同征引的先秦官书。夏燕靖 2016 另记其为儒家经典，相传为西周周公所著。本 KU 只登记《周礼》本体：书名与篇目沿革、六官体系与职官规模、以及来源据《周礼》征引的职官与礼制材料。其《冬官》补篇《考工记》的工艺文本（百工分工、制车、六齐、营国、四要素等）已由 `publications/kaogongji.md` 承担，本 KU 不重复登记，只在必要处指向该条。","path":"publications/zhouli.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《周礼》是 D 维度下先秦职官与礼制制度的文献依据，其《冬官》补篇《考工记》的工艺内容归 B 维度并已单独成 KU。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhouyi","title":"周易（Zhouyi）","name_en":"Zhouyi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","易经","易传","卦爻象","制器尚象"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《周易》是由《易经》与《易传》组成的典籍。《易经》含卦爻象符号系统与卦辞，高丰称多数专家认为约西周前期由巫史集体创造；《易传》十篇又称“十翼”，约成书于战国晚期。高丰把卦爻象视为平面构成设计，并从中提炼制器尚象、道器统一、文质统一等设计思想。2016 记其又名《易经》，约成书于西周初年，以六十四卦和阴阳之道说明万物变化，“道”与“器”的关系成为传统造物思想与设计方法的主题。2016 册还引《易·系","path":"publications/zhouyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下造物观念文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhuanghuang-zhi","title":"装潢志（Zhuanghuang Zhi）","name_en":"Zhuanghuang Zhi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明末","周嘉胄","书画装裱","装潢","42节"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《装潢志》是明末周嘉胄撰写的书画装裱专著，完整记述古代书画装裱理论，全书 4000 余字，分序言和 42 小节，介绍“洗”“揭”“补”“衬边”“小托”“全”“式”“镶攒”“覆”“上壁”“下壁”“安轴”等步骤要领与装潢用料知识；2016 另列“上杆”“上贴”“贴签”“染古绢托纸”等步骤。","path":"publications/zhuanghuang-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代装裱文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhuangshi-zazhi","title":"装饰杂志（Zhuangshi Magazine）","name_en":"Zhuangshi Magazine","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["1958","设计期刊","中央工艺美术学院","工业设计","张光宇"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"periodical","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《装饰》杂志于 1958 年 9 月在北京创刊，1980 年 6 月复刊。1988 年第 2 期发表广州美术学院设计研究室专稿《中国工业设计怎么办》；1989 年第 4 期以专辑讨论室内艺术设计；1992 年第 4 期推出“纪念张光宇特刊”；1996 年发表纪念陈之佛诞辰 100 周年的文章。赵农两次提到《装饰》：1949 年后书籍装帧段举“张光宇的《装饰》等字体设计”为少数保持风格者，改革开放后","path":"publications/zhuangshi-zazhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下当代中国设计期刊的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhuangzi","title":"庄子（Zhuangzi）","name_en":"Zhuangzi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["战国","庄子","南华经","以器喻事","轮扁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《庄子》是庄子及其后学所著的道家典籍。赵农称其以器喻事、议论风生，对器具的认识具体而完整：《养生主》有“所好者道也，进乎技矣”；《知北游》记 80 余岁工匠“臣之年二十而好捶钩，于物无视也，非钩无察也”；《天道》记轮扁制轮“不徐不疾，得之于手而应于心，口不能言”；《天运》论乐有“惧”“怠”“惑”的递进。2016 记其又称《南华经》，原有 52 篇，内篇一般认为庄子所作，含“天人合一”“以天合天”“","path":"publications/zhuangzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下造物思想文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhupu","title":"《竹谱》（Bamboo Manual (Zhupu)）","name_en":"Bamboo Manual (Zhupu)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","李衍","画谱","墨竹","延祐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting_manual","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《竹谱》是元代画家李衍编绘的画竹图谱。赵农记《竹谱》分 7 卷，以画竹谱、墨竹谱、竹态谱、墨竹态谱、竹品谱等介绍墨竹画法；印制于元代延祐末年，原本已失传，仅传清代嘉庆年间刻本。来源未给版式、图幅数与印本藏地。","path":"publications/zhupu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《竹谱》是 C 维度下元代画谱编绘与刊印的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zhuyuan-taoshuo","title":"竹园陶说（Zhuyuan Taoshuo）","name_en":"Zhuyuan Taoshuo","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["近代","刘子芬","陶瓷","瓷史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《竹园陶说》为近人刘子芬撰，1 卷，分述学、索原、说器、辨色、汝窑、广窑、美人醉、杂说八节。","path":"publications/zhuyuan-taoshuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下工艺技术文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:ziren-yizhi","title":"梓人遗制（Ziren Yizhi）","name_en":"Ziren Yizhi","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["元代","木工","织机","车制","薛景石"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monograph","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《梓人遗制》是元代木工技术专著，四册都把它系于薛景石名下，但四册写的**不是同一本书**：赵农写的是两部分的完整体（先车制、后织机），夏燕靖两版写的是“规范制作织机的木工技术的专著”，田自秉只取其中花罗织机的一段机构说明。断代也有分歧——田自秉作“宋人”，其余三册作元代。","path":"publications/ziren-yizhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《梓人遗制》在四册中都是木工技术专著：织机四类、零件与总装图、用材与工时构成主体（B），刊行年、《永乐大典》收录、中国营造学社整理出版属流传与制度面（D）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:ziren-zhuan","title":"梓人传（Ziren Zhuan）","name_en":"Ziren Zhuan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["唐代","柳宗元","营造","匠师","设计思想"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"essay","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《梓人传》是唐代柳宗元所著文章，通过对一位自荐的杨氏木匠营造思想的分析和营造行为的实地观察描述，阐明设计构思及运用法则的重要作用。文章提出营造工艺的总体准则“规矩绳墨以定制”“善运众工而不伐艺”，即以合理的预设布局调整各项具体技术工作并完成整个设计意图；原文评价其以“相道”联系工匠经验论述工艺设计思想具有独到性。","path":"publications/ziren-zhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下唐代设计思想文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zizheng-xinpian","title":"《资政新篇》（Zizheng Xinpian (A New Treatise on Statecraft)）","name_en":"Zizheng Xinpian (A New Treatise on Statecraft)","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["太平天国","工艺政策","益民","专利","资政新篇"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_document","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《资政新篇》是太平天国刊行的政论文献，田自秉两处引用它说明太平天国的工艺观与工艺政策。工艺观上要求以有用之物为宝、精奇利便、以坚固轻便捷巧为妙；工艺政策上准造精奇利便者自售，他人仿造则收为己有或招为徒，并按器之大小与益民多寡给赏，无益之物有责无赏，限满他人仿做。来源称这已提出保护创造发明者利益的版权问题。来源未给作者、成书年代、卷数与版本。","path":"publications/zizheng-xinpian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度近代工艺政策的文献条目，其奖励与仿造条款属 B、A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zunsheng-bajian","title":"遵生八笺（Zunsheng Bajian）","name_en":"Zunsheng Bajian","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["明代","高濂","养生","岁时风俗","玉器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"life_treatise","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《遵生八笺》是明代高濂所撰的养生专著，1591 年刊，20 卷 8 笺，含大量岁时风俗与实用艺术考据资料。田自秉引其“上古用玉，珍重似不敢亵”一语，说明周代玉器因与伦理道德联系而受社会特别重视。","path":"publications/zunsheng-bajian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代生活与器物文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"publications:zuozhuan","title":"左传（Zuozhuan）","name_en":"Zuozhuan","type":"publication","type_zh":"出版物","color":"#6366F1","tags":["先秦","编年体","青铜器","鼎"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classical_text","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《左传》是先秦编年体史书。2016 册引宣公三年“桀有昏德，鼎迁于商”“商纣暴虐，迁鼎于周”，说明青铜器被用作统治权力更替的象征。","path":"publications/zuozhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下古代设计文献的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:an-furniture","title":"案（An (Table)）","name_en":"An (Table)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","矮足","承具","漆案"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"案是春秋战国主要家具，本义为木制盛食物的矮脚托盘，亦代桌。《考工记·玉人》“案十有二寸”；战国至两汉多木制髹漆饰彩纹，后演变为书案、平头案等长形承具，按材料有陶案、木案、漆案、铜案。","path":"terms/an-furniture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"案是 B 维度下先秦至魏晋南北朝承具的条目，其功能分化与办公、祭祀礼俗相关，旁及 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:anle-yi","title":"安乐椅（Rocking Chair）","name_en":"Rocking Chair","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["晚清","家具","摇椅","西式输入","扶手椅"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"chair_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"安乐椅是晚清出现的椅型，又称摇椅。赵农记其主要将椅足设置如弧形，借助摇动产生惯性摇晃，增加使用者的舒适和快感；安乐椅从西方传入中国，是结合中国扶手椅形制演变出的新形式。来源未给尺寸、用材、传入路径与制作实例。","path":"terms/anle-yi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"安乐椅是 B 维度下晚清摇椅的条目；其西式输入与中西结合归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ao-qin-tongqi","title":"鏊（秦代铜器）（Ao (Qin Bronze Cauldron)）","name_en":"Ao (Qin Bronze Cauldron)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦代","铜器","炊器","环耳","叶脉纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鏊是秦代具有浓厚地方艺术特色的铜器，是一种锅：扁圆腹、圜底、敛颈而口沿外张，曲线流畅，造型优美。肩腹交接处附环耳，或对称，或一大一小，或仅一耳；耳上常饰叶脉纹。","path":"terms/ao-qin-tongqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鏊是 B 维度下秦代铜炊器的术语条目；环耳与叶脉纹的造型装饰归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ao","title":"袄（Ao (Lined Short Coat)）","name_en":"Ao (Lined Short Coat)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北朝","南北朝","服饰","袄","游牧民族"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"袄是来源在便装一节与襦并述的短衣。来源仅一句半：L3586 行末只到「襦与袄相」，L3591 行首接「近」，中间被「图 5-23 北齐 黄釉扁瓶」图注隔断。来源称袄早期应为北朝的皮制短袄，袖口窄紧，为北方游牧民族打扮，南北朝时期广泛流传于南方。来源未给袄的裁片、尺寸、具体材质变化与唐宋以后形制，本条不补写。","path":"terms/ao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的服饰形制条目，记录袄的早期形制与南传；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ba-cai","title":"八材（Eight Materials）","name_en":"Eight Materials","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","史记","材料分类","八材","珠玉石器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_classification","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"八材是《史记》所记周代对珠、玉、石、象（牙）、木、金、革、羽八种材料的分类。田自秉把它紧接在《考工记》六工三十工种之后列出，作为周代工艺材料知识的另一体系。来源只列八材名目，未给各材的用途、对应的加工工种与分类原则。","path":"terms/ba-cai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"八材是 B 维度下周代工艺材料分类的术语条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ba-ti-shuo","title":"八体说（Eight-Style Theory (Ba Ti Shuo)）","name_en":"Eight-Style Theory (Ba Ti Shuo)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["南朝","刘勰","文心雕龙","风格论","艺术类型"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"八体说是南朝刘勰《文心雕龙》提出的八种艺术类型区分，即典雅、远奥、精约、显附、繁缛、壮丽、新奇、轻靡。李立新认为这八种类型与现代风格概念较为接近、很具学术色彩，并把八体说与沃尔夫林五对概念对举：沃尔夫林揭示艺术风格的形式性，八体说揭示艺术的精神审美性。来源未给八体的具体界定、排序原则与后世注疏。","path":"terms/ba-ti-shuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度下中国古代风格类型论的条目，其八体名目与审美面向归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ba-yin","title":"八音（Eight Tones）","name_en":"Eight Tones","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","乐器分类","周礼","金石英丝","编钟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"instrument_classification","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"八音是《周礼·春官》按制作材料性质划分的八类乐器：金、石、土、革、丝、木、匏、竹。赵农称材料性质不同则制成的乐器音质也不同；同段记周代乐器约70种、《诗经》提及29种，周朝乐器仍以敲击乐中的编磬和编钟最为重要，弦乐器中的琴较普遍，常以独奏、伴奏、合奏等形式出现。","path":"terms/ba-yin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"八音是 B 维度下西周乐器材料分类的条目，其官制背景见来源同段。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:babu-chuang","title":"拔步床（Babu Bed）","name_en":"Babu Bed","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","家具","床","围廊","私密性"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bed_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"拔步床是有踏廊、帐、床几部分的巨型床具。赵农记其体形巨大，木房中有围廊、平台，床前开阔，豪华富丽；并认为床的隐蔽性反映了明代社会心态的封闭性以及对享乐生活的追求。来源未给尺寸、构件名称、用材与传世实例。","path":"terms/babu-chuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"拔步床是 B 维度下明代大型卧具的条目；其反映的社会心态归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:badayun","title":"八达晕（Badayun (Eight-Pointed Medallion Pattern)）","name_en":"Badayun (Eight-Pointed Medallion Pattern)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐宋","元代","明代","纹样","八达晕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"八达晕是传统装饰纹样的一种：以八边形为中心向外展开，图案中心为主花，周边以各种几何纹作装饰。2016 册记这种纹样在古代织锦中最流行，唐宋时称八达晕锦，元代称八搭韵锦，近代称天华锦；在明锦几何纹中运用最多。","path":"terms/badayun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"八达晕是 B 维度下织锦几何纹样的条目，其纹样组织与装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bagua","title":"八卦（Bagua (Eight Trigrams)）","name_en":"Bagua (Eight Trigrams)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["伏羲","易","符号","十言","书契"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"symbolic_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"八卦是赵农在第一章“上古传说的设计”一节中与伏羲相联系的符号系统。来源称“伏羲作十言（乾、坤、震、巽、坎、离、艮、兑、消、息）之教”，把八卦视为对宇宙万物进行归纳、寻找自然变化规律的智慧总结；又引《白虎通·卷一》称伏羲仰观象于天、俯察法于地，画八卦以治下，是从蒙昧走向文明的开端。导论另引《尚书·序》“始画八卦，造书契”，把八卦与书契并列为文字前史。","path":"terms/bagua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"八卦是 C 维度下符号归纳与宇宙图式的条目，其与书契、文字起源的关系亦牵涉 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bai-tao","title":"白陶（White Pottery）","name_en":"White Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","陶器","高岭土","白陶","刻纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"白陶是商代制陶工艺中的特殊产品，用高岭土制成。田自秉记其器形有壶、罍、觯、卣、簋等，雕刻饕餮纹、夔纹、回纹，装饰基本与青铜器相似；殷墟等地出土不多、完整者更少，为奴隶主享用的珍品。有人推测白陶系北方制陶工人模仿南方硬陶所作，烧制火度不如硬陶高、器壁不如硬陶薄；商代以后不复发现。","path":"terms/bai-tao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"白陶是 B 维度下商代陶器类型的术语条目；其刻纹装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:baibaoqian","title":"百宝嵌（Baibaoqian (Hundred-Treasure Inlay)）","name_en":"Baibaoqian (Hundred-Treasure Inlay)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","清代","扬州","百宝嵌","周制"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"百宝嵌是以金银宝石、珊瑚、翡翠、玛瑙、螺甸、象牙、沉香等多种珍贵材料雕成山水人物、树木楼台、花草翎毛，镶嵌于檀梨漆器的装饰工艺，又称周制。来源记扬州周翥最著名，其作法成为独特系统；《骨董琐记》称周制唯扬州有之、明末周姓所创。清代扬州仍以百宝嵌著称，钱咏《履园丛话》记乾隆中王国琛、卢映之辈精于此技，卢映之孙卢葵生亦能之。来源未给嵌料配比、胎骨、粘接材料与工序。","path":"terms/baibaoqian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代至清代百宝嵌漆艺的术语条目，嵌料与山水人物题材属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:baici","title":"白瓷（White Porcelain）","name_en":"White Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北齐","低铁胎釉","邢窑","青白两大体系"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"白瓷是用低含铁量胎釉烧成、釉色乳白的瓷器，北齐发明，胎料较细腻，釉薄而滋润、呈乳白色，釉厚处泛青；白瓷出现后瓷分青、白两大体系。隋代已烧制成功并大量生产，唐代成为重要品种，邢窑为代表，邢瓷洁白如银雪，釉白而微闪淡黄或淡青。田自秉补记隋代白瓷的烧成条件：由青瓷演变而来，通过精炼瓷土减少铁分并掌握火度，烧成白度较高的瓷器；隋代胎体洁白、薄而细腻，护胎釉既掩盖细孔斑点又提高洁白度。白瓷创始的确切年代，田","path":"terms/baici.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"白瓷是 B 维度下瓷器类型与胎釉技术的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:baidie-bu","title":"白叠布（Baidie Cloth）","name_en":"Baidie Cloth","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","棉布","白叠","长安","商店"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cotton_cloth","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"白叠布是唐代棉布。《东城老父传》记唐玄宗时长安有专门卖白叠布的商店。田自秉把这条记载放在唐代棉织段，但未直接用棉布二字定义白叠布，也未释白叠的语源、产地、幅宽与织法。","path":"terms/baidie-bu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"白叠布是 B 维度下唐代棉布的品种条目，其长安商店记载属 D 维度的商业流通。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:baigong","title":"百工（Baigong / Hundred Craftsmen）","name_en":"Baigong","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","考工记","官营手工业","工匠","六职"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_system","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"百工是先秦文献中对手工业者与官营手工业制度的称法。《考工记》说“国有六职，百工与居一焉”，把百工列为王公、士大夫、百工、商旅、农夫、妇功六职之一；又说“凡攻木之工七，攻金之工六，攻皮之工五，设色之工五，刮摩之工五，抟埴之工二”，共 30 个工种。高丰把“百工”释为“直接服务于王室的、有官长率领的官府手工业者”，并把“政府建立的整套官营手工业制度”也称为“百工”制度；李立新同样把“百工”制度释为“整","path":"terms/baigong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"百工是 D 维度下官营手工业制度与工匠身份的术语锚点；工种分工、材料与工艺规范属 B。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ban-qi","title":"斑漆（Ban Lacquer (Mottled Lacquer)）","name_en":"Ban Lacquer (Mottled Lacquer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["六朝","漆器","斑纹","彩漆","变涂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"斑漆是六朝时期新创造的漆器类型：用几种颜色漆交混而产生斑纹，或用单色漆显出深浅不同的斑纹；前者实际是一种彩漆。来源称斑漆仅见于文献记载，尚未有遗物发现，并判断它应是现在漆器制作中变涂技法的前身。来源未给斑漆的胎体、器形、色料与工序。","path":"terms/ban-qi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"斑漆是 B 维度下六朝漆器类型的条目，其变涂源流涉及髹漆工艺技术谱系。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bandixue-shi-jianzhu","title":"半地穴式建筑（Semi-Subterranean Dwelling）","name_en":"Semi-Subterranean Dwelling","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","仰韶文化","半坡","木骨草泥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"半地穴式建筑是黄河流域仰韶文化遗址中大量存在的一种泥木房屋：先挖成半人高的坑，中心支木柱，屋顶沿坑周围用木椽架棚、再铺厚草泥土，木头用藤条捆扎。形状有方形和圆形，门朝南并有斜坡式或阶梯式门道，房子中间为灶坑。赵农 2009 册另记西安半坡建筑以穴居方式构造、以半地穴式居多，后来一方面发展成为黄河中上游的窑洞，另一方面成为地面土木建筑的雏形，到龙山文化时期逐渐消失；半坡住房分圆形和方形，一般分入口走","path":"terms/bandixue-shi-jianzhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"半地穴式建筑是 B 维度下新石器时代居住建筑的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bandu-wooden-tablet","title":"版牍（Wooden Tablet (Bandu)）","name_en":"Wooden Tablet (Bandu)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","书籍","薄木板","封缄","封泥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"writing_medium","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"版牍是春秋战国时期用来写字的薄木板。赵农记未写字的木板称为“版”，写了文字的称为“牍”；版为方形，也叫“方”，版牍多是短小的文章。来源又说版牍多作公文、书信或诏令，需要封缄，有“检”作护封，写上收件人姓名、地址的称为“署”，绑绳处加封泥；版牍后来常用于绘制地图，因而有“版图”的说法。","path":"terms/bandu-wooden-tablet.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"版牍是 B 维度下先秦书籍与文书载体的条目，薄木板形制、封缄与封泥属造物层。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:banpo-kehua-fuhao","title":"半坡刻画符号（Banpo Incised Symbols）","name_en":"Banpo Incised Symbols","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","半坡","陶器","刻画符号","文字雏形"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"proto_writing","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"半坡刻画符号是赵农在第一章“文字”一节中论述的陶器符号。来源称新石器时期的半坡陶器上出现过许多刻画符号，被人们认为是一种早期的文字雏形；其内容应是一种记事，符号有松散的特点，表示一些具体的数字概念，也与一些其他民族初期的记事方式相似。来源又引《易经·系辞传下》“上古结绳而治，后世圣人易之以书契”，称“书契”即刻画符号，逐渐改变了结绳记事的习惯，从半坡刻画符号中可以看到原始先民正试图越过结绳记事的阶","path":"terms/banpo-kehua-fuhao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"半坡刻画符号是 C 维度下文字前史与符号记事的条目，其与结绳、书契的连续性问题属 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:banpo-xing-caitao","title":"半坡型彩陶（Banpo-Type Painted Pottery）","name_en":"Banpo-Type Painted Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["仰韶文化","半坡","彩陶","鱼纹","人面纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painted_pottery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"半坡型彩陶是仰韶文化彩陶的一种类型，分布在渭河流域，以陕西关中平原为中心，向西达到甘肃陇东的天水、平凉地区。田自秉记其早期以红陶为主、晚期灰黑陶增多，典型器为卷唇圜底盆，鱼纹和人面形花纹最具代表性，纹样一般用直线组成直边三角形，很少运用曲线；年代约 7000—6000 年前，风格朴质。","path":"terms/banpo-xing-caitao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"半坡型彩陶是 B 维度下仰韶文化彩陶类型的术语条目；其鱼纹与人面纹母题属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:banshan-xing-caitao","title":"半山型彩陶（Banshan-Type Painted Pottery）","name_en":"Banshan-Type Painted Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["半山","彩陶","旋涡纹","葫芦纹","锯齿纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painted_pottery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"半山型彩陶是首次发现于甘肃宁定县半山地区的彩陶类型，典型器为短颈广肩鼓腹彩陶罐，器体近似球形、底部微收。田自秉记其装饰分旋涡纹与葫芦形纹分割两类，多以曲线为主，流行锯齿纹，红黑相间；造型与装饰为彩陶工艺中最精美，风格富丽、精巧；年代约 4500 年前。","path":"terms/banshan-xing-caitao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"半山型彩陶是 B 维度下甘青地区彩陶类型的术语条目；其旋涡纹与葫芦纹属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:banshi-jiegou","title":"板式结构（Panel Construction）","name_en":"Panel Construction","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","家具","板式","框式","人造板"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_structure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"板式结构是新中国家具由传统框式转变而来的结构方式。来源记随着家具材料从天然木材转为人造板、钢管和塑料，家具结构也开始由传统的框式向板式结构发展，使家具工艺设计能做到更省工、轻便，而又具有简洁、明快的艺术效果。来源未给板式家具的节点做法、连接件与板材厚度。","path":"terms/banshi-jiegou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度家具结构的条目，简洁明快的视觉取向属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bantong","title":"斑铜（Bantong (Mottled Copper)）","name_en":"Bantong (Mottled Copper)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["云南","铜器","斑铜","生斑","熟斑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalwork_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"斑铜是云南铜器中具有独特风格的一个品种，因表面显现有光泽闪烁的自然结晶斑纹而得名，分生斑与熟斑两种：生斑是铜料中含有其他金属杂质的自然斑纹，熟斑是在铜液溶化时人工加入锌等其他金属原料形成。它的制作与古代青铜器基本相同，经塑型、制模、浇铸、打磨、着色等工序，多制作虎、牛等动物，风格庄重浑厚。","path":"terms/bantong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度云南铜器品种的条目，动物造型与斑纹效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bao-yi-bo-dai","title":"褒衣博带（Baoyi Bodai (Loose Robe, Broad Sash)）","name_en":"Baoyi Bodai (Loose Robe, Broad Sash)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","竹林七贤","云冈石窟","佛像服饰","玄学"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"褒衣博带原指魏晋南北朝宽衫大袖、衣带宽博的服饰风尚。南朝时王公、名士、百姓都以宽衫大袖、褒衣博带为时髦；文人受佛道两教影响崇尚玄学，衣着突破礼法，敞领宽衫、袒胸露怀成为习俗，可从《竹林七贤画像砖》得到佐证。赵农则以“褒衣博带”指云冈石窟所采用的中原样式佛像服饰，它取代了早期佛像“偏袒右肩式”及“通肩式”的服饰。","path":"terms/bao-yi-bo-dai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"褒衣博带是 E 维度下服饰风尚与佛教造像中国化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:baobei-zhuang","title":"包背装（Wrapped-Back Binding）","name_en":"Wrapped-Back Binding","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["南宋","书籍装帧","包背装","纸捻","蝴蝶装"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bookbinding","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"包背装是南宋出现、与蝴蝶装相对的书籍装帧形式。赵农记蝴蝶装的缺点在于单页正文对折后页间空白造成阅读不便，且版心背面用糨糊黏连容易脱落；包背装将书页背折、版心在外，正文左右半页分开，书页合起后在右面空余处打孔，以纸捻装订，再用厚纸封面包装，封面与书背粘连。来源并记包背装在南宋以后多用于官方政府文件，长期翻阅仍有不便。","path":"terms/baobei-zhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"包背装是 C 维度下南宋书籍装帧形式的条目，材料为结构流程与使用评价。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:baomaizhu","title":"包买主（Baomaizhu (Putting-Out Merchant)）","name_en":"Baomaizhu (Putting-Out Merchant)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清末民初","棉布","换棉","出机","资本主义萌芽"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"economic_role","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"包买主是清末民初出现的社会新阶层，主要收购农副产品再转售给大城市的棉布批发行，以“换棉”和“出机”方式控制生产和流通。之后包买主设立自己直接经营的手工工场，从农家招募“机织下女”从事生产，到民国年间已较广泛发展。","path":"terms/baomaizhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"包买主是 D 维度下清末民初手工业组织与商业资本的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:baoxianghua-wen","title":"宝相花纹（Baoxianghua Wen (Baoxiang Flower Motif)）","name_en":"Baoxianghua Wen (Baoxiang Flower Motif)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","染织纹样","宝相花","莲花","佛教"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_motif","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"由莲花等花头变形并程式化的唐代装饰纹样。2016 册把它与唐草纹并列为唐代染织纹样中使用最多的两种：宝相花纹源于佛教题材，是自然界花卉（主要是莲花）的花头作变形的艺术处理，使之趋于程式化。来源按形式分两种：一种为平面团形，以8片平展的莲瓣构成花头，莲瓣尖端呈五曲形，各瓣内又填饰三曲小莲瓣，花心由8个小圆珠和8瓣小花组成，多见于唐三彩器上；另一种是立面层叠形，以层层绽开的半侧面勾莲瓣构成。李立新另把","path":"terms/baoxianghua-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下唐代染织纹样的条目，其织造与印染载体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:basiba-zi","title":"八思巴字（蒙古国字）（Phags-pa Script）","name_en":"Phags-pa Script","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","八思巴字","蒙古国字","藏文字母","官印"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"script","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"八思巴字是忽必烈时期创制的蒙古国字。赵农记忽必烈任命吐蕃僧人八思巴为国师，依据藏文字母并参考畏兀儿文字和汉文字的结构创制蒙古新字，共 40 余个字母，拼写蒙古语和汉语，方体字形，从右向左、从上向下书写；元代八思巴文字、汉文字、回回文字成为通行文字样式。来源另记元代官印曾将八思巴文字入印，或与汉文字混用，图8-40 为八思巴文漆碗。来源未给字母表与拼写规则。","path":"terms/basiba-zi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"八思巴字是 C 维度下元代官方文字设计的条目；其国字地位与官印使用归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bei-xue","title":"碑学（Epigraphy (Beixue)）","name_en":"Epigraphy (Beixue)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","石刻","碑刻","墓志","书法"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calligraphy_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"碑学是来源对魏晋以来石刻文字的统称。来源仅一句，称石刻文字广为流行，其中分为墓志和碑刻，后人统称为碑学。来源未再展开碑学的内涵。来源未给碑学的提出者、年代下限、代表碑刻、书学主张及其与帖学的关系。本条只记这一句，不引入来源之外的碑学运动内容。","path":"terms/bei-xue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"C 维度下的书学概念条目，记录来源对魏晋以来石刻文字的统称；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:beibi","title":"贝币（Cowrie Money）","name_en":"Cowrie Money","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","商代","货币","海贝","齿贝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"currency","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"贝币是赵农在第一章“饰物”与第二章“金属货币”部分论述的早期货币。第一章称新石器时期开始出现贝币，即贝壳成为具有交换意义的货币；1973年以来青海东部马家窑文化遗址陆续出现许多海贝和石贝，海贝作为稀有物品在一定时间内成为相对稳定的特殊商品。第二章称海贝是中国历史上最早的实物货币，直至商代后期贝币一直是稳定的货币方式，以“朋”为计算单位，一朋被认为值20贝或5贝；齿贝是最常见的货币形式，“货币”名称","path":"terms/beibi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"贝币是 D 维度下商业制度与等价交换的条目，其海贝、仿贝材质与穿孔工艺属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:beijingren-moshi","title":"北京人模式（Peking Man Model）","name_en":"Peking Man Model","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["中国设计史","旧石器时代","设计起源","元模式"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_history_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北京人模式是李立新为解释中国设计起源而命名的概念。他以周口店第一地点十年发掘所得 10 万件石制品为依据，认为北京猿人石器数量多、造物稳定、持续时间长，故暂且命名为“北京人模式”，并以此作为设计展开的“元模式”。来源作“命之日”，疑为命之曰之误，本条照录不改。该概念只在第一章出现一次，未再展开定义。","path":"terms/beijingren-moshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史解释框架的条目，其经验依据属 B 维度旧石器技术。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:beijingren","title":"北京人（Peking Man）","name_en":"Peking Man","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器时代早期","周口店","直立人","石器","用火"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hominin","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北京人是晚期直立人的代表，20 世纪 20 年代发现于北京房山区周口店龙骨山，生活在距今 60 万至 23 万年前。石器原料以石英脉为主，普遍使用捶击法、砸击法打片；石器已有类型和分工，除刮削器外还有尖状器、砍砸器、雕刻器和石锤。","path":"terms/beijingren.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"北京人是 B 维度下旧石器时代早期人类与石器技术的核心条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:beilei-mao","title":"贝雷帽（Beilei Mao (Beret)）","name_en":"Beilei Mao (Beret)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["20世纪","帽饰","贝雷帽","服饰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hat_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"贝雷帽在三四十年代的艺术界比较流行，到 20 世纪末又开始回流，为一部分少女喜爱，并演化为时装帽样式。来源只给流行群体与两次流行，未给形制、材质、产地与设计者。","path":"terms/beilei-mao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"贝雷帽是 B 维度下 20 世纪帽饰样式的条目；来源只作帽式列举与分期，未及制度或机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:beizi","title":"背子（Beizi (Straight-Front Robe)）","name_en":"Beizi (Straight-Front Robe)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","明代","服饰","背子","褙子"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"clothing","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"背子也称褙子，是宋代男女通服的服饰。赵农记其为帝王及士大夫闲居时喜爱的服饰，大多数贵族妇女及侍从也喜穿背子；形制是前襟无纽，平行下垂，衣襟长过膝下，袖长；一种为宽大样式，一种为窄细样式；也有短袖的“半背”，或无袖的“背心”；背子腋下往往开长衩，便于行走。来源又在明代民服节记褙子为常见服饰，称人们身份不同、样式也不同，贵族的合领大袖对襟与庶民的直领小袖对襟有细微区别；该段起句作“褥子”，下文均作“褙","path":"terms/beizi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"背子是 B 维度下宋明服饰形制的条目；其男女通服与阶层差异归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:belt-hook","title":"带钩（Belt Hook）","name_en":"Belt Hook","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","服饰配件","胡服","青铜工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"clothing_accessory","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"带钩是春秋战国时期连接革带两端的钩形配件；田自秉记其\"约始于春秋初期\"，广泛流行于战国，直到西汉。六册一致认为它与胡服配套使用、自北方民族传入。分歧不在起源，而在两处：一是带钩是否只与胡服配套，二是带钩是否承担身份等级标示的功能。六册在这两点上的表述并不一致，本 KU 并列。","path":"terms/belt-hook.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"带钩是 B 维度下春秋战国服饰配件与青铜装饰工艺的交汇条目，其来源问题同时牵涉服饰史（胡服）与工艺史（错金银、嵌玉）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:benyuan-tezheng","title":"本元特征（Benyuan Tezheng (Origin-Source Characteristic)）","name_en":"Benyuan Tezheng (Origin-Source Characteristic)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["设计史观","造物设计","始源性","母体","实用"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_history_theory","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"本元特征是李立新在结论章归纳的中国传统设计艺术八项特质之七，指造物设计在艺术历史中的始源性。来源认为艺术常被看成历史的奇迹，实际源自实用器物，最初依附于器物及其实用性而展现，并不独立；设计史复现的正是艺术历史的原初存在。从史前石器陶器到青铜丝织品，实用物质与审美精神两种特性统一融合而可相互转化，其转化路径是从实用转化为鉴赏、从器物表面的纹饰到从器物造型中分离，逐渐形成独立的绘画、雕塑等艺术形式。造","path":"terms/benyuan-tezheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史特质的理论条目，其论据取自 B 维度的造物实例。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bi-li","title":"筚篥（Bili (Reed Pipe)）","name_en":"Bili (Reed Pipe)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","乐器","龟兹","吹奏","芦哨"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"筚篥是木制吹奏乐器，有九孔，管上装芦哨，与笳近似，原为龟兹乐器，南北朝传入中原，并有大筚篥、小筚篥、竖小筚篥、桃皮筚篥、双筚篥等形式（L3893）。来源小标题段首字误作「算篥」，同段后文自用「筚篥」正字；本条以正字立目，原文照录标疑，不径改。来源又将其列入魏晋新见并广为流行的乐器群（L3872）。来源未载尺寸、管长、孔位、哨材与图像，图版未核。","path":"terms/bi-li.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"筚篥是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝吹奏乐器形制的条目，其龟兹来源与南北朝传入属 E 维度跨文化互动。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bi","title":"璧（Bi Disc）","name_en":"Bi Disc","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","玉礼器","尔雅","苍璧","系璧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_jade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"璧是周代玉礼器的一种。《周礼》记“璧羡度尺，好三寸以为度”，《尔雅》称“肉倍好谓之璧”；边与孔相等称环，孔倍于边称瑗。田自秉另记天子礼天用大璧（苍璧），子执穀璧，男执蒲璧，另有专作佩饰的系璧，并引《说文》“石之次玉者，以为系璧”。来源未给实物尺寸、玉料与出土单位。","path":"terms/bi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"璧是 B 维度下周代玉礼器的术语条目；其礼天与执玉等级属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bian-yu-tong","title":"变与统（Bian Yu Tong (Change and Continuity)）","name_en":"Bian Yu Tong (Change and Continuity)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["设计史观","变与统","阴阳两极","阶段性突破","近代转型"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_history_theory","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"变与统是李立新在结论章提出的第八项中国传统设计艺术特质，指构成设计史发展的阴阳两极。来源认为与中国封建社会长期停滞不前的结论不同，不断变化才是中国造物艺术的特点；变不是抛弃原来的传统，而是变其刻板、变其烦琐，是适应工艺制作条件与社会时势要求的过程；统也不完全是“一统而死”，而是化凌乱为协调，是整合、延续的过程，在整合中融入外来、民族、地域性因素，在延续中保持中国造物设计艺术的特有面貌。来源认为变与","path":"terms/bian-yu-tong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史运行机制的理论条目，其近代转型部分牵涉 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bianxian-ao","title":"辫线袄（Bianxian Ao (Braid-Line Robe)）","name_en":"Bianxian Ao (Braid-Line Robe)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","明代","服饰","辫线袄","曳撒"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"辫线袄是元代皇帝骑射时所穿袍式：交领窄袖，腰间打成细褶，用红紫线横向缝衲固定，使腰间紧束，便于骑射。2016 册在质孙服与大朝会段记此袍，并说明此种款式到明代称为「曳撤」（通行作「曳撒」），仍作为出外骑乘之服。","path":"terms/bianxian-ao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"辫线袄是 B 维度下元代骑射袍服的条目，其与明代曳撒的承袭属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bianzhong","title":"编钟（Bianzhong (Chime Bells)）","name_en":"Bianzhong (Chime Bells)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","西周","礼乐","青铜","一套八钟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"编钟是按大小排列成组的礼仪乐器，周代一系列大小不等的钟挂在一个架上、能发出不同音律，与单独悬挂的特钟相对，是周代礼乐制度的器物体现。赵农记商代编钟三个一组；商代铙到周代成为钟，铙柄保留为钟甬，钟甬侧加环为钟旋，钟偏挂并按大小排列成编钟；西周编钟八个钟一套，可演奏许多乐律，春秋战国时期达到高峰。","path":"terms/bianzhong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"编钟是 B 维度下先秦青铜乐器的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bijia","title":"比甲（Bijia (Sleeveless Front-Opening Jacket)）","name_en":"Bijia (Sleeveless Front-Opening Jacket)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","明代","对襟衣","无袖无领","女装"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"比甲是一种无袖无领的对襟衣。赵农记其原为元代服饰，在明代中期也非常流行，年轻女性是比甲的主要购买者。来源未给比甲的衣长、面料、缘饰与穿法。","path":"terms/bijia.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"比甲是 B 维度下元代起源、明代流行的对襟衣条目；其流行与购买人群属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:black-porcelain","title":"黑瓷（Black Porcelain）","name_en":"Black Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","晋代","德清窑","建窑","吉州窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黑瓷是以含铁量较高的釉料在还原焰中烧成的黑釉瓷器，汉代出现、晋代成熟，以浙江德清最负盛名，宋代因斗茶而大盛，建窑兔毫、吉州窑玳瑁是代表。五册的记载可分三层：**化学层**（田自秉给出氧化亚铁含量与呈色的对应）、**窑口层**（德清、建窑、吉州窑及其产品）、**风俗层**（斗茶与黑盏）。分歧在**德清黑釉是否达到纯黑**与**建窑所在政区**的写法。","path":"terms/black-porcelain.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"黑瓷是 B 维度下以高铁釉呈色的瓷种条目：氧化亚铁的配比与还原焰烧成属工艺，乌黑、兔毫、油滴、玳瑁等釉面肌理属装饰。斗茶风尚牵涉生活习俗，本 KU 只作动因记录。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:blue-and-white-porcelain","title":"青花瓷（Blue-and-white Porcelain）","name_en":"Blue-and-white Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","宋代","元代","明代","清代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青花瓷是以钴料在瓷胎上绘纹、罩透明釉、高温一次烧成的釉下彩瓷器，因白地蓝花又称青花。五册都把它当作中国瓷器的主干品种，元代景德镇作品是共同焦点。**分歧集中在起源**：高丰、赵农主唐，田自秉主宋而判\"开始流行在元代中期以后\"，夏燕靖两版则明说\"我国青花起源于何时一直是个未获澄清的问题\"。本 KU 并列四说，不裁定。\n\n**立条说明**：候选索引里\"青花\"（`xdup-0141`：赵农 `cand-","path":"terms/blue-and-white-porcelain.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青花瓷是 B 维度下以钴料呈色的釉下彩瓷种条目：钴料、施彩、罩釉与高温一次烧成属工艺，白地蓝花的色彩与纹饰体系属装饰。其外销与官民窑分工另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:boshanlu","title":"博山炉（Boshan Incense Burner）","name_en":"Boshan Incense Burner","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","青铜器","熏炉","香薰","仙山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"博山炉是汉代薰炉（香薰）中最著名的一种，炉盖高而尖、雕镂成山峦形，象征海上仙山\"博山\"，山间有孔，燃香时烟气从镂孔冒出；炉座作盘形盛水，以助蒸香气。三册都把它与汉人的仙山信仰、羽化登仙观念联系起来，但叙述重心不同：高丰以两件纪年明确的实物（满城刘胜墓错金铜博山炉、茂陵鎏金银铜竹节熏炉）为主，赵农以形制与《薰炉铭》为主，田自秉以名实、神话文献与《考古图》为主。本 KU 合并三册，器物数据与文献引文分","path":"terms/boshanlu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"博山炉是 B 维度下汉代青铜熏炉的器形条目；仙山造型与羽化登仙观念牵涉 C 维度。形制、铸造与错金工艺属 B，图像与信仰属 C。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:bu-bi","title":"布币（Spade Money）","name_en":"Spade Money","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","象形币","镈","空首布","方足布"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"currency","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"布币是春秋战国时期与钱铲并列的象形铸币，由农具“镈”演变而来。赵农称商业贸易促进货币发展，春秋战国开始布币等象形币的交易并长期盛行；镈布同音，镈是人们喜爱的农具，人们将镈形铸成象形的布，上部模仿安装木柄的农具空首，称空首布，后来去掉空首，成为方足或异形的布。来源称布币可以看出耒耜、镈铲等原始形象：从钱发展来的多为平肩钝足，从镈演变的则耸肩尖足；这是利用人们熟悉的形象替代实物价值的形象化货币。","path":"terms/bu-bi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"布币是 D 维度下春秋战国象形铸币的条目，其空首、方足、耸肩尖足的器形属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:buzi","title":"补子（Rank Badge）","name_en":"Rank Badge","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","清代","官服","品级标识","刺绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"official_insignia","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"补子是明清官服上缀于胸前、背后的方形绣片，以文禽武兽区分品级。四册来源有直接记载（高丰、李立新两册无\"补子\"字样）。来源在三点上不一致：明代始定的年份（洪武二十四年／二十五年）、明制与清制品级表的具体分配、以及清代武官六七品至九品的纹样归属。夏燕靖两版各自在同书相邻两段中给出不同年份，赵农与田自秉的清代武官表亦互不相同。本 KU 全部并列。","path":"terms/buzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"补子是 D 维度下明清官服品级制度的标识件，其禽兽纹样的符号语义属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:caihui-tao","title":"彩绘陶（Caihui Tao）","name_en":"Caihui Tao","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋","战国","两汉","明器","陶器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彩绘陶是春秋兴起、战国大发展、延续至两汉的陶器，主要用作明器陪葬。**四册对它的工序定义分成相反的两组**：田自秉与高丰都说是**在烧成的陶坯上画花**，田自秉并明确以\"在名称中加一绘字\"与彩陶相区别；夏燕靖两版却写成\"**在陶胎上绘出花纹后再进行烧制**\"，而那正是彩陶的工序。两组表述不能同时成立，本 KU 并列原话，不裁定；分歧同时记入本批工作包。`consensus` 仍为 `tentati","path":"terms/caihui-tao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"彩绘陶是 B 维度下战国至两汉明器类型条目：彩绘层与陶胎的结合方式属工艺，纹样与设色属装饰。其明器用途另涉丧葬制度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:cangli-yuqi","title":"藏礼于器（Ritual Embedded in Vessels）","name_en":"Ritual Embedded in Vessels","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","礼制","青铜礼器","九鼎","等级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_concept","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“藏礼于器”指青铜礼器承载礼制等级观念：西周奴隶主规定一整套礼制，对祭祀和典礼使用礼器的数量和规格作严格限制，使贵贱有等、上下有别。《周礼》载“礼祭，天子九鼎，诸侯七鼎，大夫五鼎，士三鼎”，《左传·庄公十八年》有“名位不同，礼亦异数”。","path":"terms/cangli-yuqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"藏礼于器是 A 维度下西周礼制与器物观念的核心条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:central-axis","title":"中轴线（Central Axis）","name_en":"Central Axis","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["夏商西周","宫室建筑","坐北朝南","二里头","岐山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architectural_planning_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中轴线是赵农记夏商西周宫室建筑时使用的布局概念：主体建筑坐北朝南，南北中轴线与经度方向一致，商周宫殿基本确定这一特点；陕西岐山西周早期宫室在夯土台基上建门厅、前堂、过道、后室，形成中轴线结构，东西两侧为门房、厢房。来源把坐北朝南的方向感与“南面朝天下”的政治意识相连，认为它形成了中国历代宫殿建筑的基本立场。\n\n赵农记明清北京时又以南北中轴线为都城的标志：南起永定门至正阳门为外城；从正阳门穿越承天门","path":"terms/central-axis.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中轴线是 B 维度下宫室建筑布局的条目，含商周宫室与明清北京两段，其与面南政治意识的关联见来源的论述，本条只登记布局事实。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chai-yao","title":"柴窑（Chai Kiln）","name_en":"Chai Kiln","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["五代后周","传说","雨过天青","郑州","窑址未发现"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_kiln","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"柴窑是传说后周创建的瓷窑，窑址在郑州，柴世宗批其款式“雨过天青云破处，者般颜色作将来”；记载最早见于明代陶瓷著作，实物未见，窑址从未发现，是否存在至今悬而未决。","path":"terms/chai-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"柴窑是 B 维度下文献记载而未证实的瓷窑条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chang-deng","title":"长灯（Chang Deng / Multi-branch Lamp）","name_en":"Chang Deng / Multi-branch Lamp","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","灯具","长灯","东宫旧事","金涂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"长灯是《东宫旧事》所记汉代灯具名，见于太子纳妃物单中的“金涂四足长灯”。高丰据此把长灯释为能燃多枝光的灯，并与“连盘短灯”并提，说明汉代灯具已有长、短两类；同段又指出有的灯具以祥禽瑞兽为装饰、以鎏金方法加工制作。","path":"terms/chang-deng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"长灯是 B 维度下汉代灯具的器名条目，其金涂装饰旁及 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:changjian-gong","title":"敞肩拱（Changjian Gong (Open-Spandrel Arch)）","name_en":"Changjian Gong (Open-Spandrel Arch)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["隋代","赵州桥","李春","敞肩拱","石拱桥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge_structure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"主拱肩部开设小拱以泄洪减重的桥型。2016 册记工匠李春于595-605年设计修建的赵州桥，是现存最早的双曲石拱桥；桥长50余米，宽9米多，桥拱跨度37米多，无桥墩，坡度小，便于车辆行走；大桥拱两端各有两个小拱，是世界上首创“敞肩拱”桥型，既可协助泻洪，也减轻了桥身的自重。来源并记该桥迄今历时1300多年仍基本完好，从建筑设计角度说，赵州桥在选择桥址、建筑材料、力学性能等方面都达到了当时建桥的最高","path":"terms/changjian-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下隋代桥梁结构的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:changshiduan","title":"长时段（Longue Durée）","name_en":"Longue Durée","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["长时段","布罗代尔","年鉴学派","历史深层结构"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historiographical_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"长时段是法国年鉴学派布罗代尔在《地中海和菲力浦二世的地中海世界》中用以说明历史深层结构的理论。李立新在设计史分期的讨论中举其为国外已有的一种处理方式，但未展开其内容，也未说明本书是否采用。","path":"terms/changshiduan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度史学理论的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:changshou-xiu","title":"长寿绣（Changshou Embroidery）","name_en":"Changshou Embroidery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西汉","马王堆","刺绣","云纹","花蕾"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"长寿绣是马王堆汉墓出土的著名刺绣品种，纹样主要为云纹、花蕾和叶瓣，来源判断“实即茱萸纹”；纹样变形优美、线条流畅，富于装饰性。来源以插图20著录，未给件数、尺寸、底料与针法。","path":"terms/changshou-xiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"长寿绣是 B 维度下西汉刺绣类型的条目，其云纹、花蕾、叶瓣与茱萸纹的视觉组织归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chanheliao","title":"羼和料（Temper (Ceramic Additive)）","name_en":"Temper (Ceramic Additive)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["陶土","砂粒","耐热急变","新石器时代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"羼和料是制陶时有意掺入陶土的砂粒、石灰粒、稻草末和碎陶末等，以砂粒为主。除少量砂粒为陶土固有外，大多是有意填入的；羼和料能提高陶器的耐热急变性能，避免容器在火上加热时破裂。","path":"terms/chanheliao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"羼和料是 B 维度下早期制陶材料配方的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chanyi","title":"禅衣（Chan Yi (Unlined Robe)）","name_en":"Chan Yi (Unlined Robe)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","服饰","单衣","禅衣"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"dress_term","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"禅衣是一种衬衣样式，为有面无里的单衣（L3063）。来源原句作“应为一种衬衣的样式”，语气不确定，本条照录。来源只有这一句，未给禅衣的形制、尺寸、材质、裁法与出土实物；马王堆素纱禅衣的尺寸与重量见既有 `works/susha-chanyi.md`，本条不并入，也不补实物数据。","path":"terms/chanyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"禅衣是 B 维度下汉代衣制的条目，其服用身份与礼制场合属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chaoju","title":"巢居（Chaoju (Nest Dwelling)）","name_en":"Nest Dwelling","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["原始居住","槽巢","窝棚","干栏式建筑","礼记"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"巢居是原始居住形式之一，指在树上或以柴草堆成的窝棚居住。2016 册引《礼记·礼运篇》“夏则居槽巢”，称槽巢为用柴草堆成的窝棚，并把干栏式建筑视为巢居的继承和发展。","path":"terms/chaoju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下原始居住形态的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chatu","title":"插图（Book Illustration）","name_en":"Book Illustration","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["隋唐","宋代","插图","书籍装帧","版式"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_illustration","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"插图是书籍装帧设计的重要内容。赵农记插图在隋唐时期已经出现，“图书”一词本是图文并茂、左图右史，但手绘插图影响范围很小；直至宋代大规模雕版印刷后，图书发行量增加，图文形式才产生广泛影响。宋版插图有上文下图、上图下文、左图右文、前文后图等形式，图中有方框，刻有人物、器皿、花草名称；宋仁宗嘉祐八年（1063）插图本《列女传》全书8篇123节、插图123幅。","path":"terms/chatu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"插图是 C 维度下书籍图像版式的条目；其雕版刻印工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:che-tong-gui","title":"车同轨（Che Tong Gui (Standardized Track Width)）","name_en":"Che Tong Gui (Standardized Track Width)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","车辆","标准化","驰道"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"institution_term","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"车同轨是秦王朝统一车辆零件与车轨宽度的政策，属于秦统一六国后的政治规划。来源把它的目的归为军事与政治需要，认为它提高了运输能力、加强了国防，并直接带来驰道的统一修建。来源另记车轨以六尺为准、约合今1.66米，但未给秦尺长度与换算依据。","path":"terms/che-tong-gui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的车辆标准化术语条目，其军事与政治制度面向列为 D 维度辅助；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chelun","title":"车轮（Wheel）","name_en":"Wheel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","商周","车辆","轮毂","辐条"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle_component","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"车轮是赵农论车辆设计时首先提出的核心构件，来源称对轮子的创造性制作是人类想象力的飞跃，对轮子的认识和利用标志着人类生产技术和设计思想的飞跃。轮子的出现是为了减轻车体对地面的摩擦、提高运行速度并合理解决快速前进中的稳定感；新石器时期广泛使用的陶轮提高了对转动原理的理解，运输大型物件时铺垫圆木所产生的滚动又启发了车轮设计的意识。车子发明传说归于夏代奚仲，来源称他将板轮改为辐轮；商代车轮已由毂、辐、牙、","path":"terms/chelun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"车轮是 B 维度下车辆设计的核心构件条目，其转动原理的认识与辐轮结构属生产技术。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:cheng-chen","title":"承尘（Chengchen (Dust Canopy)）","name_en":"Chengchen (Dust Canopy)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","陈设","床榻","防尘","席"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furnishing","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"承尘是在室内床榻上方悬挂的席子或木板，用以防止灰尘下落到居住者身上（L3825）。来源在陈设一节只给这一句定义，未载材质、尺寸、悬挂构件、使用场合差异与图像。图版未核，不据图补写形制。本条证据仅一句，confidence 定 low。","path":"terms/cheng-chen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"承尘是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝床榻上方防尘悬挂物的陈设条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chengni-yan","title":"澄泥砚（Chengni Inkstone）","name_en":"Chengni Inkstone","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","文房四宝","砚","澄泥","烧制"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inkstone","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"澄泥砚是利用河中澄泥淘洗制砚、烧制而成的砚台。赵农记明清时期许多地方流行澄泥砚，自唐至清制作此起彼伏、连绵不断。来源未给澄泥配方、烧成温度、砚式与产地名录。","path":"terms/chengni-yan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"澄泥砚是 B 维度下明清陶砚的条目；其书写功能归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chengshi-diaosu","title":"城市雕塑（Chengshi Diaosu (Urban Sculpture)）","name_en":"Chengshi Diaosu (Urban Sculpture)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","公共空间","城市雕塑","广场雕塑","文化景观"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"public_art_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"城市雕塑是公共空间艺术中极其重要的组成部分，其规模往往与公共空间息息相关。赵农记从 1950 年代起，中国现代城市依照前苏联城市建筑模式创作和设置了许多广场雕塑，如北京农展馆群雕、毛主席纪念堂前广场的大型雕塑群；改革开放以后，城市雕塑进入中国城市街头，构成现代城市的文化景观。来源未给城市雕塑的定义式界说、材质、尺度规范与管理制度。","path":"terms/chengshi-diaosu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"城市雕塑是 B 维度下城市公共雕塑的条目；其作为城市规划与公共文化设施的组织属性归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chengshi-jianzhu-huanjing-sheji","title":"城市建筑环境设计（Chengshi Jianzhu Huanjing Sheji (Urban Architectural Environment Design)）","name_en":"Chengshi Jianzhu Huanjing Sheji (Urban Architectural Environment Design)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["城市环境","建筑色彩","环境设计","色彩设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_discipline","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"城市建筑环境设计是在建筑设计和环境设计基础上产生的细化设计。2016 册称其设计对象除单体建筑的色彩以外，更重要的是与周围环境色彩形成一种协调的基调设计，创造和谐的美感；它对建筑环境的色彩进行比对分析与整合，重点落实在绿化、铺路、水体、景观，乃至雕塑、壁画以及光环境的色彩设计，这些环境因素的色彩设计与建筑共同形成不可分割的色彩整体。","path":"terms/chengshi-jianzhu-huanjing-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"城市建筑环境设计是 D 维度下现代设计领域的条目，其建筑与环境色彩对象属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chengxin-tang-zhi","title":"澄心堂纸（Chengxin Tang Paper）","name_en":"Chengxin Tang Paper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["五代","南唐","李煜","澄心堂纸","楮皮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"澄心堂纸是五代南唐后主李煜汲取四川造纸技术、改进宣纸技术，用楮皮制成的高级纸张。赵农记其经过打磨、上光等工序，成为官方专用高级纸张，即南京的“澄心堂纸”；又说它被宋代蔡襄列为纸中名品，相传欧阳修撰写《五代史》时即用此纸，并引梅尧臣诗“一幅百金曾不疑”。来源把澄心堂纸放在宣纸技术演进的脉络里，未给纸幅尺寸、帘纹与现存实物。","path":"terms/chengxin-tang-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"澄心堂纸是 B 维度下五代高级纸张的条目；其被列为纸中名品与用于书写归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chengyun-xiu","title":"乘云绣（Chengyun Embroidery）","name_en":"Chengyun Embroidery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西汉","马王堆","刺绣","云气纹","神兽"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"乘云绣是马王堆汉墓出土的著名刺绣品种，在卷曲缭绕的云气纹中表现一只眼的神兽，作乘云状。来源与信期绣、长寿绣并称，未给件数、尺寸、底料与针法；神兽的具体名目也未载。","path":"terms/chengyun-xiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"乘云绣是 B 维度下西汉刺绣类型的条目，其云气纹与乘云神兽的视觉组织归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chihui","title":"赤绘（Chihui (Export Red-Painted Porcelain)）","name_en":"Chihui (Export Red-Painted Porcelain)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","外销瓷","赤绘","红彩","日本"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赤绘是明代专供外销的彩绘瓷，因以红色为特点而由日本人得名。来源记其图案题材多为山水、花鸟、鱼、兽、人物，也有少数用回教经文，以鱼类等水族动物及蓬莱仙山题材最有特色；产地未定，有人认为在浙江温州窑、福建漳州与石码窑等沿海地区。来源另记其红彩为主或红彩勾轮廓的两种做法、锦地开光手法及在日本、南洋、欧洲的发现。","path":"terms/chihui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代外销彩瓷的类型条目，红色主调与锦地开光属 C 维度，日本与欧洲的外销流向属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chikou","title":"侈口（Chikou (Flared Mouth)）","name_en":"Flared Mouth","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["器形术语","口沿","广口","陶瓷","青铜器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"container_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"侈口是古汉语专业术语，多用于指陶瓷、金属器皿的口形，又称广口，形状一般为口沿外倾。2016 册另引《汉书·王莽传中》说明其又指大口之意，并引申为夸大其言。","path":"terms/chikou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下器形描述术语的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chong-huan-wen","title":"重环纹（Double-Ring Motif）","name_en":"Double-Ring Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","青铜器","装饰纹样","重环纹","带状纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"重环纹是周代青铜器的带状装饰纹样。田自秉记其以一个成椭圆形的环为单位，连续组成带状；环的一端成圆形，一端成两锐角；有一重、两重、三重之分。来源未给各重式的年代、器物分布与单元尺寸。","path":"terms/chong-huan-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"重环纹是 C 维度下周代青铜装饰纹样的术语条目；其青铜器载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chouti-zhuo","title":"抽屉桌（Drawer Table）","name_en":"Drawer Table","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","家具","抽屉","拉环","高型家具"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"抽屉桌是元代新出现的桌类家具类型。高丰记山西文水北峪口元墓壁画《备餐图》中有抽屉桌的图式：桌面下安有两个抽屉，并带有拉环。来源把抽屉桌列为元代桌类家具的“新创造”，与宋代组合家具、《燕几图》以及辽金元其他家具并置叙述；除壁画图式外，来源未给实物、尺寸或藏地。","path":"terms/chouti-zhuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"抽屉桌是 B 维度下元代桌类家具的类型条目，其抽屉与拉环属收纳功能设计，壁画图式另涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chu-ju","title":"储具（Storage Furniture）","name_en":"Storage Furniture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","家具","储物","漆器","竹木"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_category","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"储具是魏晋南北朝用于收藏与储存物品的家具类目。来源以“储具的使用是社会生活富裕的象征”总起，分述橱、柜、匣、箱、箧五类及其用途与材料差异（L3809-L3821）。来源未载各类储具的尺寸、数量、出土地、收藏地与图像细节；图 5-40 为西魏敦煌壁画，图版未核，不据图补写形制。本条为类目条，五个子类并列，不互相替代。","path":"terms/chu-ju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"储具是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝收藏与储存类家具的类目条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chuanche","title":"串车（Chuanche (Linked Wheelbarrow)）","name_en":"Chuanche (Linked Wheelbarrow)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","交通工具","串车","独轮车","清明上河图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"transport","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"串车是宋代用于货物运输的独轮车。赵农记货物运输主要靠一种独轮车，前面用驴拉，前后左右均有人力扶持，成为“串车”；《清明上河图》中多有平民生活用车的生动写照。来源未给串车的尺寸、载重、结构与使用区域。","path":"terms/chuanche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"串车是 B 维度下宋代独轮货运车的条目，材料限于形制、牵引与图像证据。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chuantong-sheji","title":"传统设计（Traditional Design）","name_en":"Traditional Design","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["传统设计","现代设计","手工艺","设计史分期"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historiographical_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"传统设计是李立新为古代造物设立的大概念，与“现代设计”两相对应。他认为古代中国造物具有明显特殊的设计艺术形态，不能因无“设计”之名而判为只有手工艺；“手工艺”与“设计”是认识方法的差异而不是时代概念。传统设计向现代设计的转变是所有民族或迟或早必经的历史性跨越。","path":"terms/chuantong-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史分期概念的条目，手工艺与工业生产方式属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chui-lin-wen","title":"垂鳞纹（Hanging-Scale Motif）","name_en":"Hanging-Scale Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","青铜器","装饰纹样","垂鳞纹","鳞片纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"垂鳞纹是周代青铜器的装饰纹样。田自秉记其组成类似鳞片状的装饰，大体构成 U 字纹带状，成错位重叠排列。来源未给单元形制、年代序列与器物分布。","path":"terms/chui-lin-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"垂鳞纹是 C 维度下周代青铜装饰纹样的术语条目；其青铜器载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chunqiu-zhanguo-qingtong-chuishiqi","title":"春秋战国青铜炊食器（Chunqiu Zhanguo Qingtong Chuishiqi (Bronze Cooking and Food Vessels)）","name_en":"Chunqiu Zhanguo Qingtong Chuishiqi (Bronze Cooking and Food Vessels)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","青铜器","炊食器","鼎","鬲"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_category","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2016 册以表列形式记春秋战国青铜炊食器的设计特征及演变，列鼎、鬲、甗、簋、敦、簠、豆、壶、钫、鉴盘十类。来源先总述青铜器应用转向「钟鸣鼎食」的组合，失去祭祀和礼器的特性，向生活日用型器物发展；表内逐器记形制变化，图例未视觉核验。\n\n田自秉 2010 册把同一转变拉成三段：商代以酒器组合为主、具宗教性质，周代以食器组合为主、具人事意义，春秋战国则为钟鸣鼎食的组合。三段说给 2016 册的“失去祭","path":"terms/chunqiu-zhanguo-qingtong-chuishiqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下春秋战国青铜炊食器类别的条目，不拆分具体器物 KU。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chunqiu-zhanguo-zhanche-zhonglei","title":"春秋战国战车种类（Chunqiu Zhanguo Zhanche Zhonglei (Types of War Chariots)）","name_en":"Chunqiu Zhanguo Zhanche Zhonglei (Types of War Chariots)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","战车","轻车","阙车","苹车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2016 册知识链接列春秋战国战车类型，以轻车（驰车、攻车）为主，另有阙车、苹车、广车，并引郑玄、孙诒让、高诱、杜预诸家注。来源总述车战延自商周战车形制，骑兵成熟以前战车以肉搏、防御、机动能力成为不可替代的快速突击兵种；正文又记国君、统帅乘戎路车，并称《考工记》把造车列为官手工业之首。","path":"terms/chunqiu-zhanguo-zhanche-zhonglei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下春秋战国战车类型的条目，其造车制度另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chunqiu-zhanguo-zhanchuan-zhonglei","title":"春秋战国战船种类（Chunqiu Zhanguo Zhanchuan Zhonglei (Types of Warships)）","name_en":"Chunqiu Zhanguo Zhanchuan Zhonglei (Types of Warships)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","战船","楼船","冒突","赤马"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2016 册知识链接列春秋战国战船四类：楼船、冒突、赤马、斗舰，并引杜佑《通典》《释名》。来源正文另记南方楚、吴、越建立最早的水军舟师与造船工场船宫，吴国水师有三翼、突冒、楼舡、桥舡等舰种，大战舰长九丈余、载百余人，春秋末期越国造出巨型战船楼船。赵农第三章另列大翼、中翼、小翼、楼船、桥船、戈船等船型，并给吴国大翼“长十丈，阔一丈五尺二寸”的尺度与越国战船 300 艘的规模。李立新据《吴越春秋》补三","path":"terms/chunqiu-zhanguo-zhanchuan-zhonglei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下春秋战国战船类型的条目，其水军制度另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:chunqiu-zhanguo","title":"春秋战国（Spring and Autumn and Warring States Period）","name_en":"Spring and Autumn and Warring States Period","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东周","春秋五霸","战国七雄","百家争鸣","冶铁业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"春秋战国是赵农《中国艺术设计史》第三章论述的历史时期，始于公元前770年周平王东迁洛阳，止于公元前221年秦朝建立，共549年（L1772）。来源把它概括为巨大的转型时期，以诸侯争霸为主调，兼及百家争鸣、变法图强、冶铁业、商业贸易与自然探索（L1774-L1798）。来源强调春秋战国的霸业建立在对许多武器的设计和研制的基础上，冶铁与器具设计共同推动了社会生活质量的提升（L1788-L1807）。","path":"terms/chunqiu-zhanguo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"春秋战国是 B 维度下第三章的时代背景条目，统摄诸侯争霸、百家争鸣、变法图强、冶铁业、商业贸易、自然探索与器具设计等线索。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:cishan-wenhua","title":"磁山文化（Cishan Wenhua (Cishan Culture)）","name_en":"Cishan Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器早期","磁山","农业起源","农作物遗迹","生产工具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"磁山文化是距今 8000—7000 年的新石器时代早期文化。2016 册以农作物遗迹及农业生产工具为其特点，认为它表明生活方式已从狩猎采集过渡到早期农业，并把 20 世纪 70 年代末发掘的磁山、裴李岗文化并列为新石器时代早期代表。","path":"terms/cishan-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下新石器时代早期农业文化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:city-walls-and-moats","title":"城池（City Walls and Moats）","name_en":"City Walls and Moats","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","春秋战国","城墙","城壕","都城规划"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"settlement","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"城池是城垣与城壕共同构成的设防聚落。赵农在第三章「城市与建筑」一节的「城池」目下，从商代夯土城墙、郑州古城与湖北黄陂商前期城垣、护城河讲起，论春秋战国城墙为国家堡垒、燕赵秦魏边界城墙为秦万里长城奠基。来源又记凤翔雍城、咸阳、临淄等城址的规模、夯筑技术与布局，引《考工记》《管子·乘马》的营国与立都原则，并及燕下都陶排水管与都、州、县的阶梯型城市管理。","path":"terms/city-walls-and-moats.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"城池是 B 维度下设防聚落的条目，城墙、城壕、夯筑、都城布局与规划文献见来源“城池”目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:cloud-ladder","title":"云梯（Cloud Ladder）","name_en":"Cloud Ladder","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","攻城器械","墨子","公输般","车梯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"云梯是战国时期用于攻城的器械。赵农在第三章工具部分引《墨子·墨经》的车梯原理、公输般为楚造云梯攻宋的故事，以及《吕氏春秋·开春》九攻九却的结局，最后判断云梯在战国是战争的必备器具。来源只记文献故事与原理，没有描述云梯的梯身构造、尺寸或操作方式。","path":"terms/cloud-ladder.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"云梯是 B 维度下战国攻城器械的条目，来源以《墨子》《吕氏春秋》的攻宋故事为证。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:cong","title":"琮（Cong Tube）","name_en":"Cong Tube","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","玉礼器","祭地","周礼","车釭"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_jade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"琮是周代祭地的玉器。《周礼》注以“琮之言宗也，八方所宗故”解释，称外八方象地之形、中虚圆象地之德，故以祭地；田自秉称这也是儒家的一种解释。形制为圆筒形，而外呈方形，如同车釭。来源未给尺寸、玉料、出土实物与年代序列。","path":"terms/cong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"琮是 B 维度下周代玉礼器的术语条目；其祭地之义与礼制解释属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:copper-stone-period","title":"铜石并用时期（Tongshi Bingyong Shiqi (Copper-Stone Period)）","name_en":"Copper-Stone Period","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["铜石并用","红铜","黄铜片","齐家文化","青铜时代之前"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜石并用时期是青铜时代以前的阶段，指夏代以前利用铜矿物制造器具、技术与经验逐步成熟的历史。2016 册以仰韶文化半坡遗址黄铜片、河北大城山与甘肃齐家文化的红铜制品为据，判定这一阶段被称作铜石并用时期。","path":"terms/copper-stone-period.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下铜器使用早期阶段的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:da-a-fu","title":"大阿福（Da Afu (Huishan Lucky Figure)）","name_en":"Da Afu (Huishan Lucky Figure)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","无锡","惠山","泥人","大阿福"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"clay_figurine_subject","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大阿福是惠山泥人最著名的传统题材，因此惠山泥人又被称为大阿福或惠山泥阿福。清代段记惠山泥人因以制作阿福最有特色而得名，以大胆夸张和强烈色彩取胜。新中国段记早期多制作小花囡、车老虎、大阿福一类，大阿福是著名的传统题材，故又称惠山泥阿福，惠山泥人的特点可用简、满、明三字形容。","path":"terms/da-a-fu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度泥塑题材的条目，夸张造型与强烈色彩属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:da-chang","title":"大氅（Dachang (Cloak)）","name_en":"Dachang (Cloak)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋","服饰","大氅","披风","名士"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大氅是来源在「裘和氅」小标题下所记的御寒衣物。来源仅一句，称大氅一般无袖，比皮裘宽敞肥大，后来亦称披风。来源称其着衣行走、飘逸欲仙，成为魏晋名士冬季喜爱的衣物。来源未给大氅的裁片、尺寸、材质与图像实例。本条只此一句，不补写来源之外的形制演变。","path":"terms/da-chang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的服饰形制条目，记录大氅的无袖形制与名士服用；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dafangche","title":"大纺车（Large Spinning Frame）","name_en":"Large Spinning Frame","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","元代","纺织","大纺车","32锭"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_machine","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大纺车是宋代出现的多锭纺纱机械。赵农记宋代出现了32锭大纺车，利用水转或畜力提高纺织技术，尤其是水力转动的大纺车对麻质的长纤维纺织有积极作用；同段又记提花机运用双经轴及十片综的技术，两人操作，一边提综，一边引纬。同册元代纺织段另据《王祯农书》记大纺车分为加捻卷绕、传动、原动三部分结构，增加纱锭数量、提高加捻速度，并以水力为动力。来源未给大纺车的尺寸、锭数排布、传动结构与产地。","path":"terms/dafangche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大纺车是 B 维度下宋元纺织机械的条目，材料限于锭数、动力、三部分结构与提花机操作。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dai","title":"黛（Dai (Eyebrow Pigment)）","name_en":"Dai (Eyebrow Pigment)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","妆饰","眉毛","颜料","粉黛"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cosmetic","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黛是魏晋南北朝妇女妆饰中用于描眉的青黑色颜料与技术。来源称“黛原指将眉毛剃去，而以青黑色的颜料描出眉毛”，并引陶渊明《闲情赋》与南朝、北朝诗歌说明当时的妆饰风气（L3629）。同段又记“粉黛连称，后来引以为妇女的代称”，并把黛的使用与白粉、红粉并列为化妆技术兴盛的标志（L3627、L3629）。来源未载黛的原料、产地、制作方法、色阶与使用者身份差异，图版未核，不据图补写妆面。","path":"terms/dai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"黛是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝妇女描眉妆饰与颜料使用的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:daibing-gongju","title":"带柄工具（Hafted Tools）","name_en":"Hafted Tools","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器时代","峙峪文化","复合工具","木柄"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"带柄工具是在石器上加装木柄以省力的复合工具。考古发现峙峪文化部分旧石器已装木柄，带柄工具可上推到旧石器时代晚期乃至中期；但当时制作水平原始、劳动尚未产生迫切需求，其大规模使用要待新石器时代加工技术进步、特别是农耕兴起后才可能。","path":"terms/daibing-gongju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"带柄工具是 B 维度下旧石器时代工具结构的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:daming-tongxing-baochao","title":"大明通行宝钞（Da Ming Tongxing Baochao）","name_en":"Da Ming Tongxing Baochao","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","纸币","洪武","宝钞","货币"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper_currency","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大明通行宝钞是明洪武八年（1375）政府发行的纸币。赵农记明代禁止金银买卖，宝钞币形长 36.4 厘米、宽 22 厘米，是中国古代最大的钞币；面值为一百文至一贯，共分六种面值，并可以和铜钱混用。来源未给版式、印造机构、发行总额与回收贬值过程。","path":"terms/daming-tongxing-baochao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大明通行宝钞是 D 维度下明代货币制度的条目；其票面设计与印制工艺归 C、B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:danding-fangche","title":"单锭纺车（Danding Fangche (Single-Spindle Spinning Wheel)）","name_en":"Danding Fangche (Single-Spindle Spinning Wheel)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西汉","纺织工具","纺车","单锭","纺轮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"以绳轮转动、可加拈并合并丝弦的单锭手摇纺车。2016 册记新石器时代已有纺轮，后发展为单锭手摇纺车；西汉杨雄（原文，通行作「扬雄」）《方言》是最早的记载；临沂银雀山帛画、画像石中有纺车图像，图 4-37 为示意。来源称纺车通过绳轮转动带动锭子加拈，并可合并丝弦、卷绕于纡子，效率高于纺轮，汉代民间已普遍使用。","path":"terms/danding-fangche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下纺织工具的条目，其纺织产品归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:danke-heitao","title":"蛋壳黑陶（Eggshell Black Pottery）","name_en":"Eggshell Black Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["龙山文化","大汶口文化","轮制","快轮","薄胎"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蛋壳黑陶是典型龙山文化最具特征的器物，薄而光亮，大量出现于轮制盛行的陶器群中。典型龙山文化以山东为中心，轮制陶器约占全部陶器一半以上，常见器形有鬶、鬼脸式腿鼎、高圈足镂孔豆和杯、盘等。高丰补出胎壁数据：宽沿的蛋壳黑陶高柄杯轮制后胎壁仅厚 0.3 毫米，陶土经精细淘洗、质地细腻，表面乌黑发亮。三个来源对厚度只有高丰一处给出数值，2009 与 2016 两册未给。","path":"terms/danke-heitao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蛋壳黑陶是 B 维度下龙山文化陶器类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dao-bi","title":"刀币（Knife Money）","name_en":"Knife Money","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","象形币","刀币","赵","齐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"currency","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"刀币是赵农所记象形币的一种，以赵、齐、燕国的刀币为主，也称刀。来源说刀币传说是从“削”一类器形演变而来，但仍借用战争武器的形象，具有尖刃、弧背、环首等刀具特征，又分大刀和小刀；后期刀币体轻背直，铸刻精细文字，制形趋于圆润。来源把刀币的流行归因于北方国家战争武器观念的深入，以及长期与草原游牧民族交换过程中对中原刀器的重视。","path":"terms/dao-bi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"刀币是 D 维度下春秋战国象形铸币的条目，其尖刃、弧背、环首的器形与铸刻文字属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dao-knife","title":"刀（Knife）","name_en":"Knife","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器晚期","新石器时期","石刀","骨刀","蚌刀"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"刀是赵农在第一章“刀矛”一节中论述的器具。来源称刀矛的大量出现除了生产狩猎之外，也是一种战争的利器；旧石器时期晚期开始出现制刀，是削刮器、砍砸器的良性发展，新石器时期刀具磨制水平已大大提升，出现骨刀、蚌刀、石刀。来源又记制刀时把锋利石片镶嵌在骨柄中，成为复合工具或武器，这种技术在匕首中多处出现，材料有石、骨、玉、角、陶，亦有骨石复合型，如马家窑文化的石刃骨身匕首；陶质刀具可以成为独立器具。刀具与其","path":"terms/dao-knife.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"刀是 B 维度下旧石器晚期至新石器时期的多功能工具与武器条目，其复合装柄技术是设计史重点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:daoliu-hu","title":"倒流壶（Inverted-Flow Ewer）","name_en":"Inverted-Flow Ewer","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","耀州窑","瓷器","倒流壶","水流力学"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"倒流壶是耀州窑的青釉壶产品。赵农记其为盛酒器，无颈，圆腹，上部有壶嘴，酒水从底面小口灌入，利用壶腹的内壁分割形成循环流水的结构，充分利用水流力学的原理，为宋代制瓷中的奇异造型；图7-48为耀州窑青瓷倒流壶。来源未给壶的高度、腹径、容量、内管结构与制作工序。","path":"terms/daoliu-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"倒流壶是 B 维度下耀州窑瓷器形制的条目，材料限于外形、灌注方式与内部结构判断。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:daoqi-tongyi","title":"道器统一（Daoqi Tongyi (Unity of Dao and Qi)）","name_en":"Daoqi Tongyi (Unity of Dao and Qi)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","周易","易传","道器","设计思想"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosophical_proposition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"道器统一是高丰从《易传·系辞上传·第十二章》“形而上者谓之道，形而下者谓之器”一段中提出的设计思想，列为《周易》设计思想三条之二。他把道与器读作相互依存的辩证关系：器是道的载体，道是器的升华，二者须经“变”“通”才能成就事业。据此他给出两层意义——强调物质形态的重要性，强调器物设计要符合和体现客观自然发展的规律——并指出后世理学影响下的“重道轻器”与本义相违背。\n\n来源还把明代黄大成《髹饰录》“巧","path":"terms/daoqi-tongyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"道器统一是 A 维度下《周易》设计思想的条目，为高丰所举三条中的第二条；其两层意义直接落在物质形态与器物设计上，故兼有 B 维度成分。本条只记高丰的阐释框架，赵农对“道器在形内”的整体理解留在 `publications/zhouyi.md`。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:daqi-miancheng","title":"大器免成（Da Qi Mian Cheng (The Great Vessel Is Unfinished)）","name_en":"Da Qi Mian Cheng (The Great Vessel Is Unfinished)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["老子","帛书乙本","大器晚成","免饰","造物观念"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textual_reading","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大器免成是李立新据《帛书》乙本对“大器晚成”的读法。他引“晚者，免之借，免成，犹无成”，并据《吕氏春秋》“成”的层、调和二解，把“器外之层”解为饰层，因而把“免成”释为免饰；又称老子的“天道”用于“人道”，器物的繁缛精细不为老子所喜，故“大器晚成”实有大器免饰之意，追求一种不装饰的装饰。来源未给《帛书》乙本的版本、释文与“免成”训释的学术史。","path":"terms/daqi-miancheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度文本训释与造物观念的条目，其免饰判断属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dark-pattern-pottery","title":"暗纹陶（Dark-pattern Pottery）","name_en":"Dark-pattern Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋","战国","中原地区","陶器","压花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"暗纹陶是春秋兴起、战国大发展、流行于中原地区的陶器，特征是在陶坯未干透前压出浅细花纹，仅在光线斜射时隐约可见，故称暗纹，又称砑花陶。三册的正文高度重合，分歧集中在**别称用字**（砑花陶／研花陶）与**中心产地**（中原／以河南为中心）两处。三册都没有给压花工具的形制，也没有给暗纹与磨光陶、彩绘陶的工序关系。","path":"terms/dark-pattern-pottery.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"暗纹陶是 B 维度下战国中原陶器类型条目：压花工序与胎质属工艺，隐约可见的线纹效果属装饰。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dashiguan","title":"大历史观（Macro-History Perspective）","name_en":"Macro-History Perspective","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["大历史","黄仁宇","中国大历史","设计史分期"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historiographical_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大历史观是李立新借自黄仁宇《中国大历史》的治史框架，主张用归纳法高度压缩史料，先构成简明而前后连贯的纲领，再作比较研究。李立新以之为本书框架，用来打通古代与现代、中国与外国设计史以及工艺史与设计史，并在其下采用“宜粗不宜细”的分期方法。","path":"terms/dashiguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史观的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dawenkou-culture","title":"大汶口文化（Dawenkou Culture）","name_en":"Dawenkou Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","父系氏族","黄河下游","海岱地区","考古学文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大汶口文化是黄河下游新石器时代中晚期的考古学文化，因山东泰安大汶口遗址而得名（六册均未记发现年份）。六册都把它放在**母系氏族向父系氏族转化**的节点上，但只有田自秉给出分布与转化关系的完整表述，高丰、赵农、李立新分别从陶器造型、陶文符号与手工业分化三个方向取材。本 KU 只登记文化层面的命名、分期位置、工艺特征与争论点；陶器、象牙梳等单件器物的细节不在此重复。","path":"terms/dawenkou-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大汶口文化是 B 维度下黄河下游新石器时代中晚期、由母系向父系过渡的考古学文化条目；陶文符号牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dengdun","title":"凳墩（Stools and Drum Stools）","name_en":"Stools and Drum Stools","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","家具","凳","墩","坐具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"seat_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"凳墩是凳与墩两类日常坐器的合称。赵农记凳有方凳、长凳、圆凳，制作材料有明显区别：方凳腿部吸收木构建筑特点，常用券门形牙板或细木连接支撑凳面；长凳有长方凳与长条凳；圆凳也称鼓凳，有撇腿与圈足等形式。墩以鼓形圆墩为主，俗称鼓墩，按材质分木、石、瓷、竹、藤、漆等，占用空间小而移动方便。来源未给尺寸、用材比例与产地。","path":"terms/dengdun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"凳墩是 B 维度下明式坐具类型的条目；当前只到 Dimension。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:di","title":"笛（Di (Transverse Flute)）","name_en":"Di (Transverse Flute)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","魏晋南北朝","乐器","横吹","荀勖"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"笛是汉代的横吹乐器，来源称其原本是在张骞出使西域时带回吹笛经验的基础上重新研制（L3866）。来源以横吹、竖吹区分笛与羌笛，并记魏晋时期荀勖在公元274年制成12支高音笛、完善乐律要求（L3866）。秦汉乐器群中已见笛（L3850）。来源未载笛的孔数、管长、材质、指法与实物，图版未核；本条不补孔制等来源外形制。","path":"terms/di.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"笛是 B 维度下汉代至魏晋横吹管乐器的乐器条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dian-la-man","title":"点蜡幔（Dianla Man (Wax-Printed Curtain)）","name_en":"Dianla Man (Wax-Printed Curtain)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","苗族","西南少数民族","蜡染","点蜡幔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西南少数民族蜡染幔帐的古称。2016 册“知识链接”记：这是西南少数民族、尤其是苗族地区流行的一种蜡染品种的古称，又叫“蜡缁”，即用蜡染的方式印染幔帐；并引宋代朱辅《溪蛮丛笑》“溪洞爱铜鼓，甚于金玉，模取古文，以蜡刮板印布，入靛缸渍染，名点蜡幔”。同册后文又记西南少数民族的蜡染工艺在南宋时已见于广西瑶族地区，称为“瑶斑布”，当时蜡染技术已有很大发展，具备成批生产的条件，并制作了许多驰名全国的产品，","path":"terms/dian-la-man.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代西南少数民族蜡染织物的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dianben","title":"殿本（Palace Edition）","name_en":"Palace Edition","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","官刻","内府本","武英殿","十三经"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"edition_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"殿本是清代初期官刻书籍的统称，由内府本与武英殿本最后合称而来。赵农记先有内务府管理的内府本，再有武英殿管理的英武殿本，最后合为殿本；殿本由翰林学士负责，雕刻精良、编排得当，其《十三经》《二十一史》为清代官方雕版印刷书籍的杰作。来源未给殿本总数、版式、纸张与装帧。","path":"terms/dianben.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"殿本是 C 维度下清代官刻版本的条目；其内府与武英殿制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dianluo","title":"点螺（Dianluo (Fine Mother-of-Pearl Inlay)）","name_en":"Dianluo (Fine Mother-of-Pearl Inlay)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","扬州","螺钿","百宝嵌","点螺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"点螺是扬州螺钿工艺中最精巧的一种。它用彩色的鲍鱼贝壳切成细片，镶嵌成各种纤细的花纹，并显出五彩的光泽。来源把扬州漆器的螺钿、百宝嵌并列，以螺钿最有特色，点螺则是螺钿中最精巧者。来源未给点螺的胎骨、嵌片厚度、工序与存世器例。","path":"terms/dianluo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度漆器镶嵌工艺的条目，五彩光泽与纤细花纹的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dianqi","title":"电器（Electrical Appliances）","name_en":"Electrical Appliances","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["现代","电器","生活现代化","电视机","电冰箱"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"appliance_category","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"电器用品被赵农视为生活现代化的一种标志，满足人类的物质和精神需求。电视机、电冰箱、电暖气、空调等专业性强的电器还需请专业人员维修。来源未给电器的品类谱系、设计史、国产化进程与具体品牌。","path":"terms/dianqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"电器是 B 维度下现代家用电器类别的条目；其生活现代化标志意义属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dianquan","title":"垫圈（Dianquan (Kiln Setter Ring)）","name_en":"Dianquan (Kiln Setter Ring)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东汉","窑具","垫圈","耐火黏土","间隔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_furnishing","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"瓷器焙烧时用于器物与器物、器物与匣钵之间间隔的环形耐火黏土窑具。2016 册“垫圈”专条记：垫圈以耐火黏上（疑为「耐火黏土」）制作，呈环形，上、下面较平整；直径略等于或小于所承托器物的足（底）直径，厚度则随间隔器物的不同而有所差别；垫圈出现于东汉晚期或稍后，后来逐渐流行。来源并作优劣比较：垫圈较垫饼直接接触器物面小，用料小而轻，支点均匀、稳定性能好、取放方便，但加工费时，容易损坏。同册“支钉支烧法","path":"terms/dianquan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下陶瓷窑具的条目，其装烧工序见 `procedures/fu-shao-fa.md`、`procedures/zhiding-zhishao.md`。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:diao-qi","title":"雕漆（Diaoqi (Carved Lacquer)）","name_en":"Diaoqi (Carved Lacquer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["剔红","剔犀","剔彩","张成","杨茂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"雕漆是在漆层上雕刻而非在胎体雕镂的漆器工艺，使漆色呈现具有立体感的浮雕效果。唐代新创：先在漆胎上涂漆数十层，待一定厚度再雕刻；此前漆雕是在木胎上先雕后漆，此作法今称剔红，唐代实物至今未发现。宋代包括剔红、剔犀、剔彩，多以金银为胎、朱漆堆至数十层，剔犀需两种以上色漆反复重叠；宋代雕漆多在宫中内府修内司制造。元代张成、杨茂（嘉兴西塘人）最负盛名，作品造型多为普通圆盘圆盒，特色在“漆”与“雕”，张成盒漆","path":"terms/diao-qi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"雕漆是 B 维度下髹漆雕刻工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:diaolou","title":"碉楼（Tibetan Watchtower Dwelling）","name_en":"Tibetan Watchtower Dwelling","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","民居","西藏","土木结构","防御"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"fortified_dwelling","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"碉楼是青藏高原贵族的民居样式。赵农记其坚固高大、采光合理、防寒性能较强，也能有效防止高原阳光辐射，往往在部落战争中成为战斗堡垒；碉楼为土木结构，外墙常用石块加固，楼层用木梁柱和木板架隔，以楼梯连接，包括仓库、厨房、客厅、卧室、厕所等空间，还设有供奉佛像的佛堂和经堂。来源未给层数、高度、墙体厚度与实例。","path":"terms/diaolou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"碉楼是 B 维度下青藏高原防御性民居的条目；其贵族居住与部落战争背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dibao","title":"邸报（Dibao (Court Gazette)）","name_en":"Dibao (Court Gazette)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","印刷","邸报","新闻","政府公文"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"news_publication","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"邸报是宋代政府按时发行的一种新闻载体。赵农记其中有镂版印制，京城还有卖邸报的小贩；邸报刊载政府的诏书、公文，报道社会上的各种消息。来源把邸报放在宋版书与印刷业兴盛的脉络中，未给邸报的发行机构、刊期、版式与现存原件。","path":"terms/dibao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"邸报是 C 维度下宋代政府印刷新闻载体的条目；其政府发行与消息控制归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ding","title":"鼎（Ding Cauldron）","name_en":"Ding Cauldron","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","青铜器","礼器","列鼎","炊煮器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鼎是圆体三足、双耳（方鼎则四足）的煮食器，陶鼎早于青铜鼎，青铜鼎在商周成为最重要的礼器与政权象征。六册均有字面记载，其中五册有实质论述（高丰、夏燕靖两版、赵农、田自秉），李立新一册仅在年表中列\"列鼎\"、以《天工开物》\"铸鼎图\"说明分工，属旁证。来源在**列鼎制度的等级数字**上有实质分歧，在**礼器分类的名称**上给出两套互不对应的系统。本 KU 并列，不裁定。","path":"terms/ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鼎是 B 维度下由陶鼎到青铜鼎、由炊煮器到礼器的器形条目，其列鼎等级制度属 D 维度，纹饰与铭文属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dingcun-wenhua","title":"丁村文化（Dingcun Culture）","name_en":"Dingcun Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器时代中期","山西襄汾","石器","第二步加工"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"丁村文化是中国旧石器时代中期的典型遗存，位于山西襄汾丁村。石器以砍砸器、三棱大尖状器、球状器为主，重要的是少量石器开始第二步修整加工；丁村人多用“互交打击法”制造砍砸器。","path":"terms/dingcun-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"丁村文化是 B 维度下旧石器时代中期石器技术的关键遗存。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ditan","title":"地毯（Carpet）","name_en":"Carpet","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","西北","北京","天津","栽绒"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"地毯是清代在西北流行、中叶由西北传入北京与天津的铺地织物。来源记咸丰、同治年间喇嘛僧胡其昌携徒二人设地毯织制公司于报国寺，二徒分东西二门出入，遂有东门法与西门法之分；花纹新疆多为几何骨架，北京多为花草并八宝八仙题材；制作方法主要是栽绒，也有编织和刺绣。来源另记西藏氆氇为富有地方特色的毛织品。","path":"terms/ditan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度毛织工艺的条目，帮派与公司组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dongwuxing-dengju","title":"动物形灯与树形灯（Animal-shaped and Tree-shaped Lamps）","name_en":"Animal-shaped and Tree-shaped Lamps","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","灯具","青铜器","动物形灯","树形灯"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lighting_device","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"动物形灯与树形灯是秦汉灯具中的类型，包括牛灯、羊灯、朱雀灯、树形灯，造型优美、功能明确（L3208）。动物形灯具把动物姿态与灯具结合，如朱雀衔环；羊形铜灯在羊背开盖，羊身内部盛油燃芯；牛形铜灯在牛身另置灯具，灯罩可自由旋转，利用虹吸原理使油烟经通管进入牛腹（L3208）。来源未给尺寸、材质（仅称铜灯）、出土墓葬、收藏地与实物图，图版未核。","path":"terms/dongwuxing-dengju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"动物形灯与树形灯是 B 维度下秦汉灯具类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dou-vessel","title":"豆（Dou）（Dou (Stemmed Serving Vessel)）","name_en":"Dou (Stemmed Serving Vessel)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","春秋","盛食器","陶豆","有盖豆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"豆为盛食器，用于盛调味品，由陶豆演变而来，铜豆始见西周后期。形制分三层，上有盘、中有柄、底为圈足；早期盘浅、柄短而粗，春秋出现有盖豆，盖与器身相合呈球体，盖有四钮、器身有四环耳。春秋战国时期的豆把手细而高，便于拿取，并增加了盖，盖翻置时可当盘使用，大大提高了实用性；豆的造型亦为曲线的球体所组成，形式优美。","path":"terms/dou-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"豆是 B 维度下商周盛食器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:doucai","title":"斗彩（Doucai）","name_en":"Doucai","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","成化","景德镇","釉上彩","青花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"斗彩是釉下青花与釉上彩绘相结合的瓷器装饰技法，成化时期最精。五册来源有直接记载（李立新一册无\"斗彩\"字样）。来源在三处结构性问题上的说法互相冲突：名称由何而来、斗彩与五彩是并列还是包含、以及斗彩是否创始于成化。这三处都不是措辞差异，而是分类体系层面的分歧，本 KU 并列。","path":"terms/doucai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"斗彩是 B 维度下明代景德镇釉上彩与釉下青花结合的装饰技法，其色彩与纹饰效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dougong","title":"斗拱（Dougong (Bracket Set)）","name_en":"Dougong (Bracket Set)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["木构建筑","商周雏形","一斗二升","唐宋结构","明清装饰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_component","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"斗拱是我国古代木构建筑的特有构件，位于柱子承接屋顶的部分，由若干方木与横木垒叠而成，用以支撑伸出的屋檐并将重量转移到柱子上。商周时期已见雏形，可在青铜器上见到样式；汉代有直拱、人字拱、单层拱、多层拱，并出现一斗二升、一斗三升，东汉还有一斗四升。唐宋时期主要为结构构件，到明清演变为以装饰构件为主。","path":"terms/dougong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"斗拱是 B 维度下木构建筑构件的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:duan-yan","title":"端砚（Duan Inkstone）","name_en":"Duan Inkstone","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["端州","肇庆","鸲鹆眼","唐代","清代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inkstone_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"端砚石出自广东肇庆斧柯山中，肇庆属端州管辖，山中有端溪蜿蜒，砚石即在水畔山间。端砚石从唐代武德年间开采以来闻名天下，宋代时山体崩塌几乎湮没，明代后期开始复采，清代端砚重新复兴，其砚石古朴典雅，深受文人喜爱。","path":"terms/duan-yan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"端砚是 B 维度下文房砚台的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:duanao-taoqun","title":"短袄套裙（Duan'ao Taoqun (Short Jacket with Skirt)）","name_en":"Duan'ao Taoqun (Short Jacket with Skirt)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["民国","女装","短袄套裙","文明新装","高领"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"短袄套裙是民国初年流行的女子装束，形制为上衣下裙。上衣多为短袄，样式有对襟、琵琶襟、斜襟等；领、袖、襟、摆很少施镶滚花边或刺绣纹样，朴素无华；袖有长过手腕，亦有短至露肘；领形为高领，袖形与衣摆宽瘦长短略有变化。因受西式服饰尤其是日本女生校服装束的影响，袄形多呈现为窄而修长。下裙式样比较单一，多为黑色长裙，大多不施质纹，下摆通常覆盖脚面。穿着者少佩簪钗、手镯、耳环、戒指等首饰，以示区别于清代皇宫贵族","path":"terms/duanao-taoqun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"短袄套裙是 E 维度下民国女子服饰变革的条目，其形制属 B 维度服饰工艺。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dugout-canoe","title":"独木舟（Dugout Canoe）","name_en":"Dugout Canoe","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","河姆渡","江苏武进","山东荣城","船壳式"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"独木舟是船只早期的基本形式之一。赵农引《易经·系辞传下》“刳木为舟”，说明将大树砍刨成独木舟的方法；来源记河姆渡遗址出土最早的独木舟及木桨、陶模型，江苏武进与山东荣城出土春秋独木舟并给出尺寸。来源并称竹木筏和独木舟是船只早期的基本形式，也是最原始的制船方式。","path":"terms/dugout-canoe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"独木舟是 B 维度下新石器时期至春秋时期船体形式的条目，其船壳式造型与整木加工工艺属造物技术。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dui-vessel","title":"敦（Dui (Ritual Vessel)）","name_en":"Dui (Ritual Vessel)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","青铜器","食器","瓜鼎","球形"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"敦是战国时期新创的器种，由两个半球合成一球形。夏燕靖称其为盛黍稷的食器，三足和盖的三钮也都是圆形，整个器体构成圆的统一体；赵农称其为圆球体的炖肉器具，上下各为半球体，上半部压力较重，能加快肉食熟烂速度。春秋战国敦非常兴盛，一般大口、圆腹、二环耳、三短足，与簋作用相似但取代簋的地位，后人俗称“瓜鼎”。","path":"terms/dui-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"敦是 B 维度下春秋战国青铜器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:duiqian","title":"对钱（Duiqian (Paired Coins)）","name_en":"Duiqian (Paired Coins)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北宋","货币","对钱","淳化元宝","书体"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"coin_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"对钱是宋代钱币中重量、铜质、大小相同而钱文书体不同、可以两两相对的钱币形式。赵农记宋代货币年号钱有40余种，钱币文字书写真、草、隶、篆、行各种书体，并出现“对钱”；举例宋太宗书写的“淳化元宝”有行书、草书、楷书几种字样。来源把对钱作为宋代钱币设计的特点，未给对钱的具体配对规则、铸行年代与存世品目。","path":"terms/duiqian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"对钱是 C 维度下宋代钱币书体设计的条目；其铸造与货币制度归 B、D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dulunche","title":"独轮车（Wheelbarrow）","name_en":"Wheelbarrow","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西汉","东汉","鹿车","鸡公车","山地运输"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle_type","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"独轮车是以独轮为标志的手推车，车轮多为木制，利用杠杆原理把负载抗力点靠近车轮，载货载人平稳轻巧，适合崎岖路面；大约西汉晚期出现，西汉时类似鹿车或辘轳车，木牛流马据考即独轮车。赵农记其重心低、操作灵活，便于山地运输，诸葛亮在蜀国山地军事运输中推广使用，后成为蜀地及北方许多地区的家常运输工具。高丰记其又名鹿车、鸡公车、羊角车，汉代画像砖、画像石上已出现其形象，并引欧洲技术史家范罢览的长段描写说明其构造","path":"terms/dulunche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"独轮车是 B 维度下古代运输工具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:dunhuangxue","title":"敦煌学（Dunhuang Studies）","name_en":"Dunhuang Studies","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","莫高窟","敦煌学","文献","学术史"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"academic_field","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"敦煌学是来源在莫高窟一节提到的现代学术名目，来源未给学科定义。来源只记唐代莫高窟保存了许多唐代社会文献资料，这些文物经近代西方学者发掘利用后引起中国学术界重视，成为现代敦煌学的学术基础。来源未给形成年代、代表人物、研究机构与学科分支。条目所述限于该段两句，不补敦煌学史的其他说法。","path":"terms/dunhuangxue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"敦煌学是 A 维度下以敦煌文献文物为学术基础的学科条目，其跨文化学术互动归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:duoxiao-zhuangshi-fa","title":"多效装饰法（Multi-View Decoration Method）","name_en":"Multi-View Decoration Method","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["装饰手法","彩陶","半山型","马厂型","多效装饰法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_method","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"多效装饰法是田自秉自创的装饰术语，指可使器皿装饰具有正视、俯视等多角度欣赏效果的方法：一种图案组织正视时是完整装饰体，俯视时也是完整装饰体。田自秉称此名是创新的名词，并不一定十分妥帖；半山型彩陶成就最高，马厂型也有应用。","path":"terms/duoxiao-zhuangshi-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"多效装饰法是 C 维度下多视角装饰构图的术语条目；其彩陶载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:duozi-he","title":"多子盒（Duozi Box (Compartmented Container)）","name_en":"Duozi Box (Compartmented Container)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","漆器","宋代","耀州窑","多格食器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"container_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"多子盒在六册中有两种所指：一是与食案合用的多格食器，将深盘分割为许多空格以装载不同食物，携带方便、保存食品干净整洁；二是宋代瓷盒，一盒之中有数个小杯，子母口，中间以瓷条分割固定小杯、避免碰撞，以耀州窑产品最具特色。田自秉另记汉代漆器中的多件套盒，大盒内容纳九子、十一子等小盒。","path":"terms/duozi-he.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"多子盒是 B 维度下多格容器与成套组合设计的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ehuang","title":"额黄（Ehuang (Forehead Yellow)）","name_en":"Ehuang (Forehead Yellow)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["南北朝","唐代","宋代","面妆","额黄"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cosmetic_custom","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"额间涂黄的唐代面妆。2016 册记唐女妆容极富想象：额头上喜欢点画额黄，一种半月形的图案，或是贴花钿，谓之佛妆；所谓“额黄”又叫“鸦黄”，是在额间涂上黄色。来源记这种化妆据说起源于南北朝、盛行于唐，其产生与佛教流行有关系：南北朝时佛教在我国进入盛期，妇女们从涂金的佛像上受到启发，将额头涂成黄色，渐成风习。来源并引南朝简文帝《美女篇》“约黄能效月，裁金巧作星”说明约黄效月的化妆方式，引温庭筠“额黄无","path":"terms/ehuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代面妆习俗的条目，其额饰纹样与佛教图像来源牵涉 C、E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fahua-qi","title":"法华器（Fahua Qi (Fahua Ware)）","name_en":"Fahua Qi (Fahua Ware)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","山西","陶瓷","法华器","珐华"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"法华器是明代山西晋南发展起来的釉陶品种，又称法花、珐华。2016 册记其做法是「在陶胎表面勾勒成凸线轮廓」，再「用助溶剂为牙硝的彩色釉料填底和花纹施彩后烧造」；西安、洛阳等地也烧造，景德镇还用瓷胎仿烧。田自秉记其花纹轮廓用高起的凸线，再饰以蓝、紫、绿等釉彩，产地主要在山西阳城、长治、平阳一带，兴起于明代早期，此后河南、陕西等地也有生产而时间稍晚；有认为其制作与佛教有关，以万历时期所制最佳。","path":"terms/fahua-qi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"法华器是 B 维度下明代山西釉陶品种的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:falangcai","title":"珐琅彩（Falangcai）","name_en":"Falangcai","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","康熙","雍正","乾隆","景德镇"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"珐琅彩是康熙时期出现的清代宫廷釉上彩瓷，又称瓷胎画珐琅、洋瓷，旧俗称古月轩。景德镇制胎、运京施加彩绘并二次烧成，是四册共同给出的生产分工。**四册对\"珐琅彩\"这一条目所定义的对象并不一致**：赵农把定义落在彩料的制作上，田自秉与夏燕靖两版把定义落在瓷器品种上。本 KU 并列，不据一说改写另一说。","path":"terms/falangcai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"珐琅彩是 B 维度下清代宫廷釉上彩条目：景德镇制胎、内务府或北京二次彩绘烧成的分工属工艺与生产组织，华丽稠厚的彩绘效果属装饰。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fang-vessel","title":"钫（Fang (Square Hu)）","name_en":"Fang (Square Hu)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国末期","酒壶","方壶","几何纹样","青铜器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"钫是一种方口大腹的酒壶，战国末期出现的新样式壶具。2009 册释其因壶体正方而得名，意即方壶，并记其常用三角形、菱形等几何图案装饰。","path":"terms/fang-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"钫是 B 维度下战国末期青铜壶具的器形条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fanglun","title":"纺轮（Spindle Whorl）","name_en":"Spindle Whorl","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","石纺轮","陶纺轮","纺锤","拈杆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"纺轮是赵农在第一章中论述的原始纺线工具，有石质与陶质两种。来源称在磨制技术中出现了制作精致的石纺轮，其利用圆及其螺旋运转的原理使纺织技术得到提高；陶纺轮的出现改变了石质纺轮制作的粗糙，使纺线技术有了进一步提高的可能。纺轮一般与拈杆组成纺锤，操作时手提拈杆、转动纺轮，将麻或葛的纤维绞成线并缠绕到拈杆上。来源把纺轮视为手工业纺织时代不可缺少的工具。","path":"terms/fanglun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"纺轮是 B 维度下新石器时期纺织工具的条目，其转动成线的原理与纺锤结构是设计史重点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fangsongti","title":"仿宋体（Fangsong Typeface）","name_en":"Fangsong Typeface","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","雕版印刷","刻书","图案字"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"typeface","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"仿宋体是明代仿刻宋版书成风后形成的印刷字体。刻工为施刀方便使字体渐趋方正，后发展为横轻直重的“图案字”，与手写体全然不同，即后世所称“仿宋体”。清代印刷业发达的城市中，刻字铺鳞次栉比，刻字甚至成为城市居民的家庭副业。","path":"terms/fangsongti.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"仿宋体是 C 维度下雕版印刷字体的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fanhuang","title":"翻簧（Fanhuang (Bamboo-Skin Ware)）","name_en":"Fanhuang (Bamboo-Skin Ware)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","乾隆","竹刻","翻簧","竹簧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bamboo_carving_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"翻簧是取竹簧经煮压平后制成器皿并在其上雕刻的竹工艺。清代把它与竹刻、留青并列为竹雕制作技法之一，乾隆后期流行，成品因簧色温润而有象牙质感。新中国段把它列为竹编五种艺术加工方法之一，称翻簧竹刻为特殊的竹制品，用单刀或双刀雕刻，或以火绘、电绘装饰，产地有湖南邵阳、浙江黄岩、四川江安。","path":"terms/fanhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度竹材加工技法的条目，簧片色泽与雕刻纹样属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fanjia-zhuang","title":"梵夹装（Palm-Leaf Binding）","name_en":"Palm-Leaf Binding","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["隋代","印度","佛经","贝多树叶","木板"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bookbinding","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"梵夹装是隋代从印度传入的佛经装帧形制，来源又称梵荚装。其做法将在贝多树叶上抄写的佛经用木板或竹板夹住，并以绳子穿串一起。来源把“梵夹”“梵荚”两种写法并用于相邻两行，本条照录，不统一改字。来源只说传入时代与做法，未给夹板尺寸、叶数、穿孔方式、实例与存世实物，confidence 记为 low。","path":"terms/fanjia-zhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"梵夹装是 B 维度下隋代自印度传入的佛经夹板装帧形制，其跨文化传入归 E 维度；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fanjiang","title":"蕃匠（Fanjiang (Corvée Artisan)）","name_en":"Fanjiang (Corvée Artisan)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["隋唐","蕃匠","短蕃匠","长上匠","明资匠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"artisan_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蕃匠是隋唐时期被征调入官营手工业服徭役的工匠。李立新记武后垂拱初尚方监有短蕃匠五千二十九人，上蕃期从魏晋时的半年缩短为二十多天；活儿不多时可“纳资代役”。供奉内庭的“长上匠”需注入户籍、终年服役，领取由“代役资”发放的“帮贴钱”，工资及其他待遇较短期蕃匠高。同期还出现政府出资雇用的“明资匠”“巧儿匠”“和雇匠”：明资匠与长上匠方式相近而性质不同，长上匠为服役性质，明资匠为和雇性质；但唐代徭役工匠与","path":"terms/fanjiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度下隋唐工匠徭役制度的术语条目，其官营生产与工艺供给属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:feiqian","title":"飞钱（Flying Money）","name_en":"Flying Money","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","货币","汇票","金融","唐宪宗"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"financial_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"飞钱是唐代类似汇票的金融交易方式。来源记其出现是由于地方政府要保障本阜商人的利益；唐宪宗年间（公元 806 至 820 年），有些地方政府在京城设立进凑院，商人可将钱币存入京城进凑院领取凭证，返乡后在当地政府凭证领取现钱。来源评价这是早期的汇票性质的金融流通，在货币发展中是一件重要的事情，并称这种汇票多少有些纸币的意思。来源未载飞钱凭证的形制、联单编号、兑换比例、手续费、经营主体与法律依据，也未附","path":"terms/feiqian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"飞钱是 D 维度唐代汇兑与商业制度的条目，凭证与钱币的实物属性属 B 维度，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:feitian-ji","title":"飞天髻（Feitian Ji (Flying-Heaven Bun)）","name_en":"Feitian Ji (Flying-Heaven Bun)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","发髻","飞天髻","邓县画像砖","假髻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hairstyle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"飞天髻是魏晋南北朝时期流行的发髻之一。李立新记邓县画像砖中女子发式直向上升，被认为是飞天髻；并引“民间妇人结发者，三分发，抽其环直向上，谓之飞天髻，始自东府，流被民庶”解释结发方式与来源。同段列灵蛇髻、撷子髻、流苏髻、双螺髻、双环髻与假髻。来源未给飞天髻的尺寸、流行年代上限与图像细部，图2-11 未视觉核验。","path":"terms/feitian-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度下魏晋南北朝发式的条目，其时尚与风俗背景另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:feiyi","title":"非物质文化遗产（Intangible Cultural Heritage）","name_en":"Intangible Cultural Heritage","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["UNESCO","活态传承","口传","传统手工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"heritage_concept","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"非物质文化遗产指被各群体、团体或个人视为其文化遗产的各种实践、表演、表现形式、知识体系和技能及有关的工具、实物、工艺品和文化场所，包括口头传统、表演艺术、社会风俗礼仪节庆、有关自然界和宇宙的知识和实践、传统手工艺技能五类。它依托人本身存在、以身口相传延续，是“活”的文化中最脆弱的部分。","path":"terms/feiyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"非物质文化遗产是 D 维度下遗产制度与设计教育语境的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fencai","title":"粉彩（Fencai）","name_en":"Fencai","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","康熙","雍正","景德镇","釉上彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"粉彩是康熙时期出现、雍正时期最盛的清代釉上彩瓷，以玻璃白打底、油料调色、渲染出浓淡为特征，又称软彩。四册都把它列为清代彩瓷的主要品种，分歧在**起点措辞**（发展／始／创造）与**烧成温度**：田自秉给 700℃ 左右，夏燕靖两版给釉上彩的 750～860℃ 红炉彩烧，两版并未为粉彩单列温度，两个数值区间不重合。本 KU 并列。","path":"terms/fencai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"粉彩是 B 维度下清代釉上彩装饰类型条目：玻璃白打底、油料调色与烘烧温度属工艺，柔和淡雅的色彩效果属装饰。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:feng-ge-maniera","title":"风格（Style (Maniera)）","name_en":"Style (Maniera)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["风格","maniera","类型论","艺术史","设计史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"风格是李立新追溯 maniera 在现代汉语中的对应语。来源记现代汉语“风格”一语是 maniera 的反映，中国古代文论已有相应的类型论思想；西方自古把风格作为研究对象，亚里士多德、西塞罗和昆提利安视为思维的恰当修饰，14至15世纪法语 manière 与意大利语 maniera 又有优美高贵的风度和精于世故的举止之意，1442年阿诺罗·加利或奥塔维亚诺·乌巴迪尼首次将此词用于艺术，瓦萨里又引入","path":"terms/feng-ge-maniera.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度下风格概念与风格论学术史的条目，其形式描述面向归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:feng-sui","title":"烽燧（Feng Sui (Beacon Tower)）","name_en":"Feng Sui (Beacon Tower)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","长城","烽燧","军事防御","报警"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architecture_term","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"烽燧是秦汉长城沿线设置的报警设施。来源记长城“以筑板夯土技术构建”，在不同地区因地制宜利用草木、芦苇、石块等材料夯土垒集，并“设置了许多烽燧，有着明确的防御和报警的作用”（L2926）。边界战乱时“只见大漠尘烟，滚滚高悬，十里一报，信号竞传”（L2926）。来源未给烽燧的形制、高度、间距、燃料、燧卒编制与具体地点。","path":"terms/feng-sui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"烽燧是 B 维度下秦汉长城防御设施的条目，其军事组织与边防制度属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:feng-wen","title":"凤纹（Phoenix Motif）","name_en":"Phoenix Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","青铜器","凤","鸟纹","纹样"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"凤纹是吸取各种鸟禽特点组成的装饰图案，应用很广。田自秉记青铜器上有的凤尾明显可见孔雀尾羽的翎眼。来源未给凤纹的类型划分、年代序列与器物分布。","path":"terms/feng-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"凤纹是 C 维度下青铜装饰纹样的术语条目；其青铜器载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fengli-guafan-dulunche","title":"风力挂帆独轮车（Fengli Guafan Dulunche (Wind-Sail Wheelbarrow)）","name_en":"Fengli Guafan Dulunche (Wind-Sail Wheelbarrow)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","交通工具","独轮车","加帆车","风帆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"风力挂帆独轮车是明清时期出现的、同时利用风力和人力的独轮车，又称「加帆车」。2016 册记其道理来自利用风力推车前进；我国早在汉代就开始在船舶上使用风帆，三国时期已逐步采用双帆、三帆、四帆甚至七帆，各帆交错布置以增加受风面积、提高风帆效率，帆多而风压中心低又使船舶获得较大稳定性，明清挂帆独轮车正是受此启发。","path":"terms/fengli-guafan-dulunche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"风力挂帆独轮车是 B 维度下明清风力车辆的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fengshou-hu","title":"凤首壶（Phoenix-Head Ewer）","name_en":"Phoenix-Head Ewer","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","辽瓷","凤首壶","仿唐式","器形"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"凤首壶是辽瓷中常见的品种。来源把它与有系扁提壶并列，称凤首壶的式样显然是仿唐式演变而来。来源未给辽代凤首壶的具体尺寸、釉色、出土实例与与唐代凤首壶的形制差异。","path":"terms/fengshou-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度辽瓷器形的条目，凤首装饰属 C 维度，仿唐式演变涉及跨代与跨族交流属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fengzheng","title":"风筝（Kite）","name_en":"Kite","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","风筝","纸鸢","游艺","竹篾"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"toy","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"风筝也称纸鸢，是宋代人们喜爱的游艺活动。赵农记旧传风筝是韩信所制，为战争报警传递消息之用；宋代的风筝成为人们喜爱的游艺活动，人们用细竹篾扎绑出风筝的形状，糊以花纸，用细线放飞，如纸鸢在天空飘舞，寄寓了人们的一种渴望的心情；并引陆游诗“竹马踉跄冲淖去，纸鸢跋扈挟风鸣”。","path":"terms/fengzheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"风筝是 C 维度下宋代游艺器具的条目；其竹篾扎绑与糊纸工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:folangji-pao","title":"佛朗机炮（Folangji Pao (Frankish Cannon)）","name_en":"Folangji Pao (Frankish Cannon)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","正德","火炮","佛朗机炮","葡萄牙"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"佛朗机炮是明代正德年间传入、明政府立即仿制的火炮。赵农称佛朗机为波斯文字对葡萄牙的译音，也泛指西班牙和法兰西，佛朗机炮指葡萄牙人制造的火炮；末句“后成为俗称‘红夷炮’的荷兰火炮”句意不完整，来源未明言二者的称名关系。来源未给炮身尺寸、装填方式与仿制数量。","path":"terms/folangji-pao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"佛朗机炮是 B 维度下明代传入火炮类型的条目；其葡萄牙来源与跨文化传播归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fota","title":"佛塔（Fota (Pagoda)）","name_en":"Fota (Pagoda)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东汉以后","佛教建筑","佛塔","窣堵波","Stupa"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"埋藏舍利、供绕塔礼拜的圣墓式建筑，传入中国后与中国木构楼阁结合形成中国式木塔。2016 册记佛塔源于印度梵文 Stupa（窣堵波），本为埋藏舍利、供信徒绕塔礼拜的圣墓；传入中国后缩小为塔刹，并与东汉木构楼阁结合，形成中国式木塔，后有石塔、砖塔。来源另记嵩岳寺塔为北魏正光四年（523）建、高 41 米、15 层密檐砖塔，是我国现存最早的高层砖石建筑。赵农 2009 册补出语源与形制层次：佛塔原称浮图","path":"terms/fota.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下佛教建筑的条目，其宗教制度另涉 A/D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fou-vessel","title":"缶（Fou (Fou Jar)）","name_en":"Fou Jar","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","陶器","盛酒器","乐器","栾书缶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"缶是古代陶质器皿，类似瓦罐，形状像小缸或钵，用于盛水或酒，圆腹有盖、肩上有环耳，也有方形，盛行于春秋战国。2016 册兼论缶作为乐器的用法，并记栾书缶、蔡侯缶等有铭实例。","path":"terms/fou-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下陶质盛酒器与乐器器名的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fozhuang","title":"佛妆（Buddha Makeup (Fozhuang)）","name_en":"Buddha Makeup (Fozhuang)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","契丹","妇女","面妆","佛妆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cosmetic","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"佛妆是契丹贵族妇女的面妆。赵农记契丹民族头饰非常讲究，皇帝有金冠、硬帽，贵族官员有皮帽、毡帽、头巾；有钱人要交纳一定数量的马驼才能裹以头巾；贵族妇女戴瓜皮帽并喜欢“贴面花”，面部涂深黄色、红眉黑吻，称之为“佛妆”，作者判断其实际是一种因北地风寒而产生的用植物色保养皮肤的方法。来源未给植物色配方、流行阶层与图像实例。","path":"terms/fozhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"佛妆是 B 维度下辽代妇女面妆的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fu-che","title":"斧车（Fu Che (Ax Chariot)）","name_en":"Fu Che (Ax Chariot)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","仪仗车","双辕车","大钺斧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"斧车又称轻车，是汉代双辕马车中的仪仗车，因车舆中间竖立一柄大钺斧而得名。2009 册把它列入汉代双辕马车的细分种类，与轺车、施輜车、轩车、軏车、辎车、栈车并列。来源未给斧车的尺寸、驾马数、舆服制度与具体使用场合。","path":"terms/fu-che.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"斧车是 B 维度下汉代双辕车的车种条目，其仪仗与身份功能属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fu-li-zeng","title":"釜、鬲、甑（Fu, Li and Zeng）","name_en":"Fu, Li and Zeng","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","陶器","炊器","蒸食","釜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cooking_vessel_set","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"釜、鬲、甑是赵农在第一章陶器造型部分并列的三种炊器。来源称釜是大锅的造型，成语“釜底抽薪”的釜即指这种炊器；鬲是有足的炊器；甑是屉状的圆筒形炊器，屉中有一些小孔，套在釜、鬲、鼎上面，起“蒸”食品的作用。来源认为甑器的出现使食品加工从烧、烤、熏扩展到煮、蒸、烫，改变了原始先民的饮食水平，并因此促进身体发育、延长寿命；又指出尊、皿、盂、簋等陶器造型为青铜文化的到来奠定了器形基础。","path":"terms/fu-li-zeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"釜、鬲、甑是 B 维度下新石器时期陶制炊器的清单级聚合条，其蒸食技术与器形组合是设计史重点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fu-vessel","title":"簠（Fu (Ritual Food Vessel)）","name_en":"Fu (Ritual Food Vessel)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","食器","稻粱","仿竹器","菱形"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"簠是西周后期新增食器，仿竹器，浅腹，侧视呈斜边菱形状，用以盛稻粱。《周礼》称“簠，稻粱器也”，与盛黍稷的簋在器形上相区别。2016 记其形体长方形，盖打开后为相同两器，器身与器盖各有四个短足；早期斜壁浅腹，后期变为直壁深腹。","path":"terms/fu-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"簠是 B 维度下西周青铜食器的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fubo-shi-ta","title":"覆钵式塔（Fuboshi Ta (Stupa-Form Pagoda (Lama Pagoda))）","name_en":"Fuboshi Ta (Stupa-Form Pagoda (Lama Pagoda))","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","明清","佛塔","覆钵式塔","喇嘛塔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"覆钵式塔是塔身作覆钵形的佛塔，与印度窣堵坡相似，元代称喇嘛塔。2016 册记：元世祖忽必烈建大圣寿万安寺塔时，请入仕元廷的尼泊尔匠师阿尼哥设计，此塔与窣堵坡相似，在我国叫覆钵式塔；因唐代以后喇嘛寺一般建此塔形，故亦称喇嘛塔。元明清时期多为佛舍利塔、高僧墓塔与风景塔。","path":"terms/fubo-shi-ta.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"覆钵式塔是 B 维度下元代传入的佛塔形制的条目，其印度窣堵坡来源与尼泊尔工匠属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fuchuan","title":"福船（Fuchuan (Fujian Sea-Going Ship)）","name_en":"Fuchuan (Fujian Sea-Going Ship)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","造船","海船","尖底船","福船"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"福船是宋代海船制造中出现的尖底海船样式。赵农在“车船”一节把海船分为尖底福船与平底沙船两类，称二者由不同航行需要而设计：福船乘风破浪，沙船可以坐滩。来源只给这一组性能对举，未给福船的尺度、水密隔舱、舵帆构造与具体船厂；本条只立样式级条目，不把后世的福船形制追加进来。","path":"terms/fuchuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"福船是 B 维度下宋代尖底海船样式的条目；其海上贸易背景归 D 维度。来源只给分类与性能，故 confidence 取 low。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fudao","title":"复道（Fudao (Elevated Corridor)）","name_en":"Fudao (Elevated Corridor)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","宫殿","复道","阁道","飞阁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宫殿楼阁之间架空的走廊。2016 册记复道是空中走廊，又称阁道、飞阁，两旁遮木板以防被人看见；引杜牧《阿房宫赋》“复道行空，不霁何虹”与《史记·秦始皇本纪》始皇三十五年“周驰为阁道，自殿下直抵南山”“为复道，自阿房渡渭，属之咸阳”；并以梁山宫故事说明其保密功能，称复道象征天上阁道六星，体现君权神授。","path":"terms/fudao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下秦汉宫殿建筑的条目，其君权象征另涉 A/D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fudou-xing-fengtu-fangzhong","title":"覆斗形封土（方中）（Fudou-shaped Burial Mound (Fangzhong)）","name_en":"Fudou-shaped Burial Mound (Fangzhong)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","陵墓","封土","方中","丧葬制度"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"burial_term","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"覆斗形封土是战国以后帝王陵墓多见的封土形制：“底边呈正四边形，向上内收，层层夯土筑成，成为下大上小的形状”，讳称“方中”，寓意地方（L2999）。方形封土坟丘为帝王规格，除个别合葬的后妃与亲王之外，一般人仍为圆形（L2999、L3004）。秦始皇陵的内、外两重夯土围墙及外围墙尺寸是本条所述帝王陵墓形制的实例，不是覆斗形封土自身的尺寸（L3008-L3010）。来源未给封土的高度、体积、夯层厚度与坡","path":"terms/fudou-xing-fengtu-fangzhong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"覆斗形封土是 B 维度下战国秦汉陵墓封土形制的条目，其等级礼制与丧葬观念牵涉 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:fujin","title":"幅巾（Fujin Headcloth）","name_en":"Fujin Headcloth","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉魏","首服","幅巾","名士","缣巾"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"headwear_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"幅巾是汉魏之际代替冠帽的头巾。2009 册记汉魏之际战事频繁、社会财力艰难，由两汉冠服沿革的制度已难维持，以往的冠帽多被文人沿用的幅巾代替；不仅文人使用巾子表示名士风流，身为将帅亦头着缣巾，三国诸葛亮纶巾羽扇指挥战事的故事流传千古。同段记魏初曹丕采纳陈群建议制定九品官位制度，“以紫绯绿三色为九品之别”，并依战事提倡从俭。","path":"terms/fujin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"幅巾是 B 维度下汉魏首服的形制条目，其名士身份与冠服制度背景属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:futou","title":"幞头（Futou Headwrap）","name_en":"Futou Headwrap","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["头饰","隋唐","宋代","软脚幞头","硬脚幞头"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"headwear_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"幞头是隋唐男服中的头巾类首服，以黑色纱、罗制成，四角成带，两角向前系住发髻、两角在脑后系结，余端自然垂下。三册的叙述分工是：夏燕靖两版给形制结构、软脚与硬脚的做法以及翘脚、展脚等名目；赵农给源流（汉代幅巾）、唐太宗\"起于后周\"的引文、盛唐加衬木藤皮革、唐代帝王专用与宋代软脚改硬脚。两册对源流的表述有一处不一致——夏燕靖说\"由汉代的幞头、幅巾等演变而来\"，赵农说\"从汉代的幅巾演变过来\"。本 KU 并","path":"terms/futou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"幞头是 B 维度下隋唐至宋代首服的形制条目；巾帛裁剪、软硬脚构造属 B，服色等级与帝王专用制度牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gaiji","title":"改机（Gaiji）","name_en":"Gaiji","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","弘治","丝织","福建","织机"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"改机是明代弘治年间福建织工林洪把缎机由五层改为四层而形成的丝织工艺，所织丝绸两面有花纹、多用中小型花朵。四册来源有直接记载（高丰、赵农两册无\"改机\"字样）。材料密度低：夏燕靖两版与田自秉共用同一段引文，李立新只有一句概述，此外仅《天水冰山录》的品种名录另有一处著录。改机的技术细节（四层与两面花纹之间的因果关系）四册均未解释，本 KU 不代为补足。","path":"terms/gaiji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"改机是 B 维度下明代福建丝织技术的单点条目。材料密度低，四册中三册共用同一段引文。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gaitou","title":"盖头（Gaaitou (Head Covering)）","name_en":"Gaaitou (Head Covering)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","女服","头饰","盖头","皂色"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"headwear","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"盖头是宋代普通妇女佩戴的皂色头饰。赵农记贵族妇女的头冠装饰复杂、花色繁多，如后妃有“花钗冠”，以花钗装饰，也有用白角冠梳、白玉龙簪作装饰的；而普通妇女多戴皂色“盖头”，尤其是出门的时候，盖头成为一种头饰。来源未给盖头的尺寸、材料、形制与佩戴方式。","path":"terms/gaitou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"盖头是 B 维度下宋代女服头饰的条目；其阶层差异归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ganlan-shi-jianzhu","title":"干栏式建筑（Ganlan Building / Stilt House）","name_en":"Ganlan Building","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","长江流域","河姆渡","巢居","榫卯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"干栏式建筑是中国南方新石器时代的一种木构建筑类型：以桩木为基础，构成高于地面的基座，用桩柱绑扎方式立柱、架梁、盖顶，形成下层架空、上层居住的半楼式房屋。四册都把它说成“巢居的继承和发展”，并以浙江余姚河姆渡遗址为典型。差异在范围与强度：高丰说“在木(竹)柱底架上建筑的高出地面(或水上)的房子”，并把河姆渡定为“目前发现年代最早的、最具典型性的干栏式建筑”；夏燕靖两版的知识链接说“河姆渡遗址发现的干","path":"terms/ganlan-shi-jianzhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"干栏式建筑是 B 维度下史前木构建筑类型的术语锚点。本条只记类型定义、地域分布、构造特征与各册分歧；河姆渡遗址的具体尺寸、稻作、陶器与漆器留在 `places/hemudu-site.md`，河姆渡文化的命名、年代与工艺留在 `terms/hemudu-culture.md`。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gao-shuyao-deng","title":"高束腰凳（Gao Shuyao Deng (High-Waisted Stool)）","name_en":"Gao Shuyao Deng (High-Waisted Stool)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","家具","高束腰凳","腰鼓形","西厢记插图"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"高束腰凳是元代新出现的家具之一，形呈腰鼓，凳部中间雕饰有纹样，形成可观的花饰。2016 册把它与罗涡椅、霸王椅并列为元代家具的新设计制作方法，并记《西厢记》明弘治十一年北京书肆重刻本插图中有描绘。","path":"terms/gao-shuyao-deng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"高束腰凳是 B 维度下元代家具新制的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gaoxing-jiaju","title":"高型家具（Gaoxing Jiaju (High-Form Furniture)）","name_en":"Gaoxing Jiaju (High-Form Furniture)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","家具","高型家具","梁柱式框架","束腰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋代普及的高型家具。2016 册记宋代家具较唐代在品种上增添了许多，有床、桌、椅、凳、高几、长案、柜、衣架、巾架、屏风、曲足盆架、镜台等，日常生活所需的家具此时已基本完备；从风格特点说，宋代家具属高型家具，并且这类家具在民间得到普及使用。来源的核心判断是：家具设计受建筑结构影响较大，主要是梁柱式的框架结构在家具中的运用，出现模仿建筑木构架的式样和做法，使家具造型以梁柱式的框架结构代替了以前的箱形壶","path":"terms/gaoxing-jiaju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代家具形态与结构的条目，其室内布置格局牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gaozu-bei","title":"高足杯（Gaozu Bei (Stem Cup)）","name_en":"Gaozu Bei (Stem Cup)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","瓷器","高足杯","竹节式高足","元代瓷器"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"高足杯是元代瓷器中最为流行的器物，为杯的代表形态。2016 册记其形制：口微撇，近底处较为丰厚，承以上小下大的竹节式高足。来源只给这一句形制描述，未分窑口、尺寸与用途。","path":"terms/gaozu-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"高足杯是 B 维度下元代瓷杯代表器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ge-dagger-axe","title":"戈（Ge Dagger-Axe）","name_en":"Ge Dagger-Axe","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["夏商西周","青铜兵器","车战","直内戈","曲内戈"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"戈是商周时期受镰形农具启发而成的青铜长兵器，适应车战需要。赵农记青铜戈由戈头、帽、秘柄、镈几部分组成，帽和镈套在秘柄两端；戈头有援、内、胡三部分，援是横出的锋刃，内是援后面绑柄的地方，胡是援下刃的弧形部分。石戈在新石器时期晚期已出现，青铜戈在河南偃师二里头遗址发现，来源定为商王朝遗物；河南安阳出土320件青铜戈；商代流行直内戈和曲内戈，通长20厘米以上，西周出现改进的胡戈，戈援翘上。","path":"terms/ge-dagger-axe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"戈是 B 维度下商周青铜长兵器的条目，其车战用途与仪仗含义见来源论述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ge-yao","title":"哥窑（Ge Kiln）","name_en":"Ge Kiln","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","五大名窑","开片","金丝铁线","紫口铁足"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_kiln","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"哥窑是宋代五大名窑之一，以釉面开片为主要特征，有鱼子纹、蟹爪纹、百圾碎及“金丝铁线”等名称；釉色有粉青、米色，胎呈黑褐色，器皿边缘显褐色边称“紫口铁足”。窑址至今未发现，宋墓未见典型器皿。夏燕靖《中国设计史》另录章生一、章生二兄弟在两浙路处州、龙泉县各建一窑的传说（兄窑称哥窑，弟窑称弟窑、也称章窑、龙泉窑），并记有专家认为传世宫藏哥窑瓷实为南宋时修内司官窑烧制；釉为失透乳浊釉，釉色以灰青为主。赵农","path":"terms/ge-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"哥窑是 B 维度下宋代名窑的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:geometric-stamped-hard-pottery","title":"几何印纹硬陶（Geometric Stamped Hard Pottery）","name_en":"Geometric Stamped Hard Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","西周","春秋战国","长江以南","陶器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"几何印纹硬陶是长江以南流行的高温印纹陶，胎骨坚致，呈紫或紫黑色，器表拍印几何纹。它是 `terms/geometric-stamped-pottery.md`（几何印纹陶）的下位类别，田自秉把上位类别分为印纹软陶与印纹硬陶\"两种\"。四册都把它当作独立品种，但**时代、成型法与纹样成因三处互相打架**：夏燕靖两版系于春秋，田自秉说战国窑址且\"长期流行\"，高丰说商代、西周已盛；成型法两作\"泥条盘筑\"、","path":"terms/geometric-stamped-hard-pottery.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"几何印纹硬陶是 B 维度下高温陶器类型条目：胎料成分、烧成温度与成型工艺是主问题，拍印几何纹的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:geometric-stamped-pottery","title":"几何印纹陶（Geometric Stamped Pottery）","name_en":"Geometric Stamped Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代晚期","商周","春秋战国","长江以南","陶器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"几何印纹陶是长江以南新石器时代晚期兴起、以印模在陶坯上压印几何纹为特征的陶器类别，按烧成火度分为几何印纹软陶与几何印纹硬陶两档。三册都把它作为独立品种叙述，但在分部省份、胎色与年代下限上写法不一致。本 KU 只承担上位类别；硬陶另有 `terms/geometric-stamped-hard-pottery.md` 专条，田自秉明言二者是\"印纹软陶和印纹硬陶两种\"，属上下位关系而非同物异名。","path":"terms/geometric-stamped-pottery.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"几何印纹陶是 B 维度下陶器类型条目的上位类别：胎料、火度与成型属工艺，几何纹的排布属装饰效果。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gewu-zhizhi","title":"格物致知（Gewu Zhizhi (Investigating Things to Extend Knowledge)）","name_en":"Gewu Zhizhi (Investigating Things to Extend Knowledge)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋明理学","格物致知","慎独","设计思想","明清"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosophical_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"格物致知是宋明理学的观念。赵农在第九章末记它与慎独的行为规范一起，使许多知识分子对社会生活观察细微，以获得对事物、对人事的深度认识；明清之际对器具设计思想的研究因此成为热点的学术话题。来源未给格物致知的经典出处、语义流变与具体治学方法。","path":"terms/gewu-zhizhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"格物致知是 A 维度下宋明理学观念与明清器具设计思想研究背景的条目；来源以它解释研究热点形成的思想条件。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:glass","title":"玻璃（Glass）","name_en":"Glass","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["硅酸盐","吹制","模压","近代工业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玻璃通常以石英砂、纯碱、长石、石灰石等为重要原料，并加入澄清剂、着色剂、乳浊剂，经混合、熔化、澄清、匀化、退火处理而成。玻璃多为硅酸盐玻璃，多以吹塑和模压技术为主，广泛用于建筑、包装、生活用品、照明；中国玻璃制造业从上海开始，1949 年后北京、上海、大连、山东、四川北碚等地建造玻璃厂。","path":"terms/glass.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"玻璃是 B 维度下硅酸盐材料与成型工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gong-shang-shi-guan","title":"工商食官（Gong Shang Shi Guan (Official Support of Artisans and Merchants)）","name_en":"Gong Shang Shi Guan (Official Support of Artisans and Merchants)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","春秋战国","工商食官","食官制","百工"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"artisan_institution","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"工商食官是周代由官府供养、控制工商的制度。李立新记官营手工业出现于商周，所谓“工商食官”，手工业工匠成为官府的世袭奴隶；西周青铜器铭文“仆驭百工，牧臣妾”被称为史籍记载官营手工业的开端。周代对被征服的百工管制严厉，《尚书·酒诰》记周公对被迁徙殷商手工业者的严厉态度，部分百工被安置在“东圉”生产，附庸国工匠管理稍宽。“食官”百工社会地位低人一等，但又不是奴隶，与仆驭、牧、臣妾并列，介于自由者与非自由","path":"terms/gong-shang-shi-guan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度下周代工商食官制度的术语条目，其百工身份与生产组织属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gong-vessel","title":"觥（Gong (Gong Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Gong Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","饮酒器","兽头盖","牛角"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"觥是青铜盛酒、饮酒器皿，最早的觥以牛角制成，商代和西周盛行铜铸。2016 册记其形制为椭圆形腹或方形腹、有盖、盖作有角兽头形，有些觥内附酌酒用的勺，西周晚期绝迹。","path":"terms/gong-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gong-zu-tu","title":"工、卒、徒（Craftsmen, Conscripts and Slaves）","name_en":"Craftsmen, Conscripts and Slaves","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","官营手工业","工奴","工巧奴","手工业管理"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"labor_institution","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"工、卒、徒是汉代官营手工业的三种工人。工来自农民与小市民；卒来自戍边戍卒与践更更卒；徒为奴隶，其中具有工艺技巧者称工巧奴。来源称他们都是最无人身自由的工奴。","path":"terms/gong-zu-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"工、卒、徒是 D 维度下汉代官营手工业劳动制度的术语条目；其工艺生产面向归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gongfu","title":"公服（Official Court Dress）","name_en":"Official Court Dress","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","服饰","公服","品色衣","革带"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"clothing_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"公服是宋代官员的制服。赵农引《宋史·舆服志》记“宋因唐制，三品以上服紫，五品以上服朱，七品以上服绿，九品以上服青。其制，曲领大袖，下施横襕，束以革带，幞头，乌皮靴。自王公至一命之士，通服之”，并说只是官服要求更为严格，制型更为规范。来源未给各品服色对应的具体场合、面料与制作尺寸。","path":"terms/gongfu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"公服是 D 维度下宋代官员服饰制度的条目；其服色与形制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gonggong-qiju","title":"公共器具（Public Facilities and Furniture）","name_en":"Public Facilities and Furniture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["现代","公共器具","办公家具","公共场所","家具社会化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_category","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"公共器具可分为办公家具与公共场所器具两类。办公家具包括办公桌椅、文件柜、文件箱、文件盒、沙发、折叠椅、电脑桌、电脑椅、会议桌等；公共场所器具包括影剧院、火车站、汽车站、公共汽车、出租车、飞机、火车、法庭、医院、公园等场所的座椅，以及学校教室的桌椅、黑板、幕布与餐饮住宿场所的椅凳、沙发、茶几、时钟等。公共器具的充分使用形成家具社会化的景象，并按场合区分木材、塑料、压缩板材等材料与款式、色泽。铅笔、钢","path":"terms/gonggong-qiju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"公共器具是 B 维度下办公与公共场所家具器用的条目；其机构配置与家具社会化属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gongjian","title":"弓箭（Bow and Arrow）","name_en":"Bow and Arrow","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器","新石器","狩猎","复合工具","弓弦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"弓箭是赵农在第一章中反复论述的原始复合武器。来源把它描述为人类借鉴抛掷石块的经验、利用树枝未干时的弹性，将藤条或兽皮条与光滑树枝绑连成弓，再以石质或骨质箭镞联结木条成箭。赵农称“一个标志着人类想象力的武器弓箭就出现了”，是人类以智慧与大自然搏斗的开始，也是积极进攻的手段和安全保护方式。","path":"terms/gongjian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"弓箭是 B 维度下原始狩猎与战争器具的复合工具条，其“由近及远”的设计思维亦牵涉 A 维度的方法叙述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gongquan","title":"拱券（Arch）","name_en":"Arch","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","桥梁","拱券","石材","筑桥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge_structure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"拱券是宋代筑桥常用的石材结构。赵农记筑桥多以石材建造拱券，拱券能分流河水，既方便河船过往，又方便行人通行；宋代留下了许多著名的桥梁。来源未给拱券的跨度、矢高、砌筑方式与实例尺寸。","path":"terms/gongquan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"拱券是 B 维度下宋代桥梁结构的条目，材料限于材料、功能与时代判断。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gongshan","title":"龚扇（Gong Fan (Gong Family Bamboo-Silk Fan)）","name_en":"Gong Fan (Gong Family Bamboo-Silk Fan)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","自贡","竹丝扇","龚扇","龚玉璋"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bamboo_craft_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龚扇是自贡竹丝扇的专称，产生于清代末年，为龚姓一家所创。来源记它薄如蝉翼、光泽似绢，扇面可织出精细的图案和字画；编织一把要用几百以至上千根细匀的竹丝，每穿一根纬丝至少也要穿几百次到一千次以上，图案复杂处还须把细竹丝再劈破分开。","path":"terms/gongshan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度竹编器类的条目，薄如蝉翼的视觉与扇面字画属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gongyi-meishu","title":"工艺美术（Arts and Crafts）","name_en":"Arts and Crafts","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清末民初","学科","实用经济美观","1998","艺术设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_discipline","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"工艺美术是清末民初艺术革命中形成的学科概念：在建筑、绘画、雕塑之外成为一种体系，利用古籍中“工艺”一词加上“美术”，形成复合概念。1920 年蔡元培《美术的起源》中已有“建筑、造像（雕刻）、图画、工艺美术”的并称；1949 年以后工艺美术成为手工业管理局、轻工业部所属范围，工艺美术教育以“实用、经济、美观”为目标；1998 年教育部高等教育专业目录中“艺术设计”替代了“工艺美术”。","path":"terms/gongyi-meishu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"工艺美术是 D 维度下设计学科名称与教育体制的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gongzixing-jiegou","title":"工字形结构（I-Shaped Structure (Dumbbell Structure)）","name_en":"I-Shaped Structure (Dumbbell Structure)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["手工业结构","官营手工业","民营手工业","家庭手工业","哑铃式结构"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_structure_model","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"工字形结构是李立新概括的中国古代手工业经营结构：家庭手工业、民营手工业、官府手工业三种基本类型中，民营手工业非常弱，两头的官府手工业与家庭手工业则很强，形如哑铃，故又称“哑铃式结构”。李立新以欧洲中世纪城市手工业集中于城市、两头弱中间强的“十字形”结构作对比，并指出官营手工业的强盛使民营手工业长期受到挤压，只在隋唐、宋明时略有转换。来源把家庭一端的特点归为与小农业结合、自给自足、束缚较小，一旦脱离","path":"terms/gongzixing-jiegou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度下手工业经营结构的模型条目，其家庭作坊生产属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gou-xiang","title":"钩镶（Gou Xiang (Hooked Shield)）","name_en":"Gou Xiang (Hooked Shield)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","东汉","兵器","盾牌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"钩镶是东汉出现的特殊盾牌，把缩小的铁盾、盾中短锥、上下铁钩与盾后手柄合为一体，既可进攻亦可防御。来源在盾牌材质与类型的段落中记其构造，未给尺寸、重量与出土实物。图版未核。","path":"terms/gou-xiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的兵器术语条目，关注盾与钩锥结合的攻防构造；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:goulan","title":"勾栏（Goulan (Balustrade)）","name_en":"Goulan (Balustrade)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","建筑","勾栏","栏杆","钩阑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architectural_element","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"勾栏是宋代的栏杆，也称钩阑。赵农在营造技术段记大型建筑物中勾栏已经普及，勾栏即栏杆，有单勾栏和重台勾栏的区分，宋画中常有勾栏的描绘。来源未给勾栏的高度、构件、材料与做法。","path":"terms/goulan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"勾栏是 B 维度下宋代建筑栏杆的条目；其宋画形象归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gu-cai","title":"古彩（Gu Cai (Hard Polychrome)）","name_en":"Gu Cai (Hard Polychrome)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","康熙","古彩","硬彩","五彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"古彩是康熙时期的重要彩绘品种。它继承明代五彩的传统技法而发展，因笔力健劲又称硬彩，多用单线平涂，色彩浓艳，较之明代五彩又有深浅层次之分。来源未给古彩的彩料成分、烧成温度、具体器例与产量。","path":"terms/gu-cai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代康熙釉上彩的品种条目，单线平涂与色彩浓艳的装饰效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gu-embroidery","title":"顾绣（Gu Embroidery）","name_en":"Gu Embroidery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","嘉靖","顾绣","露香园绣","韩媛绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_genre","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"顾绣是明代嘉靖时上海顾名世一家几代所作的刺绣，因居露香园又称露香园绣。来源记顾氏一门善绣，顾汇海妾缪氏所绣字画气韵生动，顾寿僭妻韩希孟谙通六法、所绣古今名画称画绣又称韩媛绣，顾兰玉以刺绣为生；顾绣花卉翎毛山水人物劈丝细过于发、针如毫，名噪一时，各地店铺常以顾绣为标榜而称顾绣庄。来源未给顾绣的针法谱系、作品清单与传承代数。","path":"terms/gu-embroidery.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代刺绣品类的条目，画绣的构图与装饰属 C 维度，顾绣庄的市场经营属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gu-vessel","title":"觚（Gu (Gu Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Gu Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","饮酒器","五爵","喇叭口","圈足小铃"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"觚是青铜饮酒器，常与爵在考古发掘时同出。2016 册记其形制为长身、束腰、侈口、口足部均成喇叭口状，造型最早仿自陶器，商早期始有铜铸并加圈足，有的圈足下还系小铃。","path":"terms/gu-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜饮酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guan-da-min-shao","title":"官搭民烧（Official Quota Fired in Private Kilns）","name_en":"Official Quota Fired in Private Kilns","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","景德镇","民窑","官窑","御器厂"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“官搭民烧”在高丰册中只出现一次，用于说明清代官窑设计脱离实用之后，景德镇民窑“上行下效”，也大量烧造高档非实用瓷。来源把它写作民窑的限定语（“官搭民烧”的民窑），没有给出制度定义、施行年代、搭烧比例或官民结算方式。本条因此只记录该词在来源中的语境与用法，制度内容留待后续来源补充。","path":"terms/guan-da-min-shao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"官搭民烧是 D 维度下官窑与民窑关系的制度性用语，来源仅作评价性使用。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guan-yao","title":"官窑（Guan Kiln (Official Kiln)）","name_en":"Guan Kiln (Official Kiln)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","青瓷","汴梁","冰裂纹","皇室"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_kiln","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"官窑是宋代官方开办、利用垄断优势采用优质瓷土、釉色和良好烧制技术、供奉皇室生活需要的窑场。2016 记宋徽宗政和年间在汴梁建造的窑场，窑址至今未发现；主要烧青瓷，器形有瓶、尊、洗、盘、碗及仿周汉青铜器，釉色以月色、粉青、大绿流行。","path":"terms/guan-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"官窑是 B 维度下宋代官办瓷窑的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guangcai","title":"广彩（Guangcai (Canton Painted Porcelain)）","name_en":"Guangcai (Canton Painted Porcelain)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","广州","外销瓷","织金","景德镇"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"广彩是清代中期为适应外销而在广州发展起来的彩瓷。它采用景德镇生产的瓷胎，在广州进行装饰加工，色彩浓艳、对比强烈，并多用金线勾边，称为织金。来源未给起始年代、外销地区、作坊与器类。","path":"terms/guangcai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度外销彩瓷的品种条目，外销与口岸分工归 D、E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guanmao-yi","title":"官帽椅（Official's Hat Chair）","name_en":"Official's Hat Chair","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","家具","扶手椅","四出官帽椅","南官帽椅"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"chair_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"官帽椅是一种扶手椅，有四出官帽椅和南官帽椅两种样式。赵农记四出官帽椅的搭脑两端和扶手前面伸出，形成变化；南官帽椅的搭脑和扶手均为圆润的斜角；官帽椅重心较低、椅背较高，椅腿有横挡的脚踏，椅背通过背板处理呈现曲线，使人的背部有舒适依靠。来源未给尺寸、用材、年代与产地。","path":"terms/guanmao-yi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"官帽椅是 B 维度下明式坐具类型的条目；当前只到 Dimension。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guanwu-bide","title":"观物比德（Guanwu Bide (Observing Things to Compare Virtues)）","name_en":"Guanwu Bide (Observing Things to Compare Virtues)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","美学","观物比德","岁寒三友","松竹梅"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosophical_proposition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"观物比德是 2016 册所称的古典美学命题。来源在元代瓷器装饰纹样段说，主纹中的松竹梅又称「岁寒三友」，是古典美学「观物比德」的体现。来源只作这一句判断，未解释命题来源、比德方式与纹样选择之间的具体关系。","path":"terms/guanwu-bide.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"观物比德是 A 维度下古典美学命题的条目，其在元瓷松竹梅纹样上的体现属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guanying-shougongye","title":"官营手工业（State-Run Handicraft Industry）","name_en":"State-Run Handicraft Industry","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["工商食官","官府工匠","皇室","商周至明清"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_system","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"官营手工业是由官府设立、使用官府工匠、产品主要供皇室官僚的生产体系。商周“工商食官”为开端，集中优秀工匠、不惜工本，覆盖建筑、车驾、礼器、织造、陶瓷等门类。春秋战国各国官方经营的手工业以陶器上刻“相邦”“守相”“左陶户”等字铭为标志，与之并存的是私营个体手工业。","path":"terms/guanying-shougongye.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"官营手工业是 D 维度下官府生产体制的总纲条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guapi-mao","title":"瓜皮帽（Guapi Mao (Melon-Cap)）","name_en":"Guapi Mao (Melon-Cap)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["男服","头帽","瓜皮帽","长袍马褂","马甲"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"headwear_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"瓜皮帽是庶民男服所戴的头帽。赵农记其与长袍马褂、束腰、宽裆长裤、白布袜、黑布鞋相配；一般劳力者则穿短衣长裤、系腿带、罩马甲，便于劳作。来源未给瓜皮帽的形制、材质、颜色与时代。","path":"terms/guapi-mao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"瓜皮帽是 B 维度下庶民男服头帽的条目；其与长袍马褂、马甲的配套属 D 维度的服制与阶层观察。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gudi","title":"骨笛（Bone Flute）","name_en":"Bone Flute","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","河南舞阳","河姆渡","猛禽肢骨","七孔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"骨笛是赵农在第一章“乐器”一节中论述的新石器时期吹奏乐器。来源称1986年至1987年在河南舞阳新石器时期遗址中出土18支骨笛，用猛禽肢骨钻孔制成，以七孔为多，距今约8000年；1973年在浙江余姚河姆渡遗址也曾发现骨笛数十支，长约4至12厘米，一般有二孔或三孔。来源把这些骨笛视为早期原始先民的遗物，认为它们对早期人类生活有积极意义。","path":"terms/gudi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"骨笛是 B 维度下新石器时期乐器与骨器钻孔工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gugu-guan","title":"顾姑冠（Gugu Hat）","name_en":"Gugu Hat","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","蒙古","妇女首服","黑鞑事略","孛黑塔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"headwear","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"顾姑冠又写作“姑姑冠”“罟罟冠”，为元代蒙古族妇女首服。《黑鞑事略》记其“画木为骨，包以红绢金帛”，顶用四五尺长柳条或银枝包青毡，地位高者用翠花或五彩帛饰之，下人用野鸡毛。有爵命的蒙古族妇女和已婚女子戴此冠，《蒙古秘史》中蒙古语称“孛黑塔”。","path":"terms/gugu-guan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"顾姑冠是 B 维度下元代蒙古族首服的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gui-vessel","title":"簋（Gui (Gui Grain Vessel)）","name_en":"Gui Grain Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛食器","圈足","双耳","九鼎八簋"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"簋是青铜盛食器，始见于殷商、沿用至春秋，基本形体为圆腹、侈口圈足，早期无耳。2016 册记西周后常带盖、有双耳或四耳、出现方座，春秋有三足式或无足式，并常以偶数与鼎配置陈设。","path":"terms/gui-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜盛食器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gui","title":"圭（Gui Tablet）","name_en":"Gui Tablet","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","玉礼器","命圭","考工记","等级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_jade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"圭是周代玉礼器的一类，分大圭、琬圭、琰圭、穀圭，形体和使用都有严格规定。田自秉另记《考工记》的命圭等级：镇圭尺有二寸为天子所守，桓圭九寸为公，信圭七寸为侯，躬圭六寸为伯；天子用纯玉，上公四玉一石，侯三玉二石，伯玉石各半。来源未给圭的出土实物、尺寸实测与年代序列。","path":"terms/gui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"圭是 B 维度下周代玉礼器的术语条目；其命圭等级与朝见用途属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guifanhua","title":"规范化（Standardization）","name_en":"Standardization","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["规范化","标准化","造物原则","考工记","船舶设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_principle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"规范化是李立新所论造物设计的重要原则：通过规范、标准的制定和贯彻，对生产作规划、组织、安排、管理、监督和检测，以保证产品的速度、质量和实效。李立新把它的历史上溯到新石器时代晚期民间工匠的“约定俗成”，以人体为最初尺度，经周代设官整顿、战国制度化到秦汉完善统一，并以船舶设计的雏形、初创、完善三阶段为例证。来源未给“规范化”一词的界定史、各时期规范的具体条文与现代标准化理论的出处。","path":"terms/guifanhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下造物规范与标准化原则的概念条目，其制度史与史学评价另涉 A、D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guiguan-bu","title":"桂管布（Guiguan Cloth）","name_en":"Guiguan Cloth","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","岭南","桂管","棉布","夏侯考"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cotton_cloth","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"桂管布是唐代岭南桂管地区所产棉布，因产地得名，布厚可御寒。田自秉引《太平广记》夏侯考着桂管布衫朝谒、文宗问其粗涩、答以此布厚可以欺寒、文宗仿著而满朝效仿的故事；又引白居易桂布白似雪。来源称桂布或桂管布就是棉布。","path":"terms/guiguan-bu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"桂管布是 B 维度下唐代岭南棉布的品种条目，其朝谒与仿著故事属 D 维度的服饰等级与消费风气。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guijujing","title":"规矩镜（TLV Mirror）","name_en":"TLV Mirror","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西汉","新莽","铜镜","TLV","四神"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mirror_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"规矩镜是汉代中期（西汉末至王莽时期）流行的铜镜，因镜纹有规则的 TLV 形装饰格式而得名，外国学者称 TLV 镜。镜上一般用青龙、白虎、朱雀、玄武四神图案，故也称规矩四神镜；镜缘常见锯齿纹、卷云纹或卷草纹，方座纽、八乳丁。来源引《古博经》释 TLV 为古代六博棋格，并称规矩镜是汉镜中流行时间最长的一种。","path":"terms/guijujing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"规矩镜是 B 维度下汉代铜镜类型的术语条目；TLV 纹样与四神图像的视觉组织归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:guiwu","title":"贵无（Guiwu (Valuing Non-Being)）","name_en":"Guiwu (Valuing Non-Being)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋","玄学","何晏","王弼","贵无"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosophical_proposition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"魏晋玄学以“无”为天地万物之本的思想命题。2016 册在“设计思想的多样性”一节把它作为魏晋南北朝服饰与器物观念变化的思潮背景：何晏、王弼重新打起老庄的旗帜，倡导“贵无”，将“无”抬到至高无上的地位，并认为“天地万物皆以‘无’为本”。来源随即把这一思潮落到生活方式与服饰装扮上，以“竹林七贤”为例，说当时“崇尚自然、清淡放达、超然物外”成为流行的人生观念，服饰上出现随心所欲、袒胸露脐的取向。","path":"terms/guiwu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下魏晋设计思想背景命题的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gusi","title":"骨耜（Bone Si）","name_en":"Bone Si","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","河姆渡","农具","耒耜","水牛肩胛骨"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"farming_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"骨耜是赵农在第一章“骨耜”一节中论述的新石器时期农耕工具，是木质耒耜发展的结果。来源称耒最初是木棍，一端削尖便于插土，下端绑横木便于脚踏；后来改进为双齿，耜冠与木棍成为两部分、通过捆绑联结，最终成为板状刃具，称作耜，耒耜联称即原始先民翻地农耕的基本器具。骨耜利用水牛等大型动物的肩胛骨与木棍联结，与石铲、石锄相比加工方便、使用轻巧；浙江余姚河姆渡新石器遗址曾一次出土170余件骨耜等农具。","path":"terms/gusi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"骨耜是 B 维度下新石器时期农耕工具的条目，其耒耜演进与河姆渡出土材料是设计史重点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:gusuo","title":"骨梭（Gusuo (Bone Shuttle)）","name_en":"Bone Shuttle","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器晚期","龙山文化","织布工具","骨器","纺织"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"骨梭是新石器晚期龙山文化中出现的织布工具。2016 册以骨梭的出现说明人类已结束「手经指挂」的原始状态，进入纺织工艺的新阶段。","path":"terms/gusuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下新石器晚期织布工具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:haijin","title":"海禁（Haijin (Maritime Trade Ban)）","name_en":"Haijin (Maritime Trade Ban)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","海禁","航海","造船","制度"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"maritime_policy","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"海禁是明代限制航海与造船的制度。赵农记明代造船与航海技术本处领先地位，却因海禁逐渐衰退；从朱元璋立国初即有海禁诏令，宣德年间郑和七下西洋之后彻底实行，甚至出现因制造双桅大船而使工匠和船主遭遇逮捕的现象，内河小船也受限制。来源未给诏令原文、执行年限与处罚条文。","path":"terms/haijin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"海禁是 D 维度下明代限制航海与造船的制度的条目；其技术后果属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:haishou-putao-wen","title":"海兽葡萄纹（Sea-Beast and Grape Motif）","name_en":"Sea-Beast and Grape Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","铜镜","纹样","葡萄","海兽"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"海兽葡萄纹是唐镜背面的外来意匠纹样，流行于武周时期，至盛唐仍为重要品种。镜背饰繁密葡萄图案，空间点缀海兽，满花构图；内区有圆圈纹，串枝葡萄跨过圆圈者称过梁葡萄。来源未给葡萄与海兽的数目、镜径、布局尺寸与年代序列。","path":"terms/haishou-putao-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐镜纹样的条目，构图与装饰属 C 维度，葡萄东传与外来意匠属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:han-armor","title":"汉代铠甲（Han Dynasty Armor）","name_en":"Han Dynasty Armor","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","汉代","铠甲","服饰","兵马俑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"armor","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汉代铠甲以铁甲为主，普遍装备士兵，类型见鱼鳞甲与札甲。来源另有一处从秦始皇兵马俑与汉代兵马俑的将士服饰讨论甲衣、等级与防护设计，该段属服饰叙述，与前一处的兵器叙述主题不同。本条合并两段，但分别标明来源层次，不把服饰描述当作铠甲类型描述，也不据图补写甲片形制；图版未核。","path":"terms/han-armor.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的铠甲术语条目，兼及将士服饰的等级与防护设计；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:han-badao","title":"汉八刀（Han Badao (Eight-Cut Technique)）","name_en":"Han Badao (Eight-Cut Technique)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","玉琀","蝉形","刻玉","葬玉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汉八刀是汉代玉琀刻制技法的俗称，因多用八刀刻成而得名。玉琀作蝉形置于死者口中，取蝉蜕再生的吉祥意义。来源未给“八刀”的具体刀法、工序、尺寸与实例，只把它与玉琀形制、用途并述。","path":"terms/han-badao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉八刀是 B 维度下汉代玉琀刻制技法的条目，其蝉形与再生观念归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:han-dai-jia-ju","title":"汉代家具（Han Dynasty Furniture）","name_en":"Han Dynasty Furniture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","家具","席地而坐","胡床","竹木制品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汉代家具是秦汉竹木作业的一部分。2009 册记木结构为主的建筑结构体系在秦汉时已初步形成，斗栱与硬山、悬山、歇山、庑殿顶及板门、交棂窗广泛出现，东汉多层建筑与叠架技术有重大发展。汉代尚无椅、凳，人们只是席地而坐；汉代后期从北方传入一种胡床，很像后世的交椅。除几、案外，衣架、柜、箱、床、榻、笥、奁、屏风等常用家具均是竹木制品，有的柜门上还有暗锁；大量明器有木船、木仓、木房及木雕牲畜等。","path":"terms/han-dai-jia-ju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉代家具是 B 维度下秦汉竹木作业与起居方式的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:han-dai-jin-bi","title":"汉代金币（马蹄金、麟趾金、金五铢）（Han Gold Currency）","name_en":"Han Gold Currency","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","金币","马蹄金","麟趾金","金五铢"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"currency","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汉代金币是汉代以黄金为币材的货币总称。本条由候选“马蹄金”建立并合并写回，同时承载马蹄金、麟趾金、金五铢三种汉代金币（L2635）。黄金在汉代有赏赐、库存、朝贡等作用；汉武帝时朝廷黄金库存有50万斤，为当时全国黄金数量的一半；秦汉黄金制形以金饼、金钣为主，《汉书·食货志》称“黄金方寸，而重一斤”；汉武帝时铸过马蹄金、麟趾金与“金五铢”，黄金一斤等于铜钱一万；东汉黄金的货币功能减退，转为金银器皿制作","path":"terms/han-dai-jin-bi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉代金币是 D 维度下汉代黄金货币的条目，其黄金材质与铸形工艺属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:han-dai-pao-fu","title":"汉代袍服（Han Dynasty Robe）","name_en":"Han Dynasty Robe","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","袍服","礼服","祛","袂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汉代袍服是汉代男子以袍为贵的礼服。2009 册记秦始皇时不同等级官员的袍服颜色不同，但衣料都是绢织；汉代 400 年间，官员一直以袍为礼服，样式以大袖为多，袖口收紧部分称祛、全袖称袂，宽大衣袖常被夸张为“张袂成荫”。领口、袖口绣夔纹或方格纹，大襟斜领、衣襟开得很低、领口露出内衣；下摆以花饰边缘、密裥或月牙弯曲，分为曲裾与直裾。","path":"terms/han-dai-pao-fu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉代袍服是 B 维度下的男子礼服形制条目，其官员服色等级属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:han-ta","title":"榻（Ta (Low Couch)）","name_en":"Ta (Low Couch)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","魏晋南北朝","家具","榻","席地而坐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"榻是汉代供坐卧的低型家具，实际是一种小床，比床更矮、更窄，有两人坐的，更多是一人独坐。高丰据文献、出土文物与汉代壁画、画像砖、画像石中榻与人的比例，推测汉榻的一般尺度为长 75－100 厘米、宽 60－100 厘米、高 12－28 厘米，并认为这种尺度适合单人独坐。赵农补述魏晋南北朝榻承此形制而分化：榻仍称小床，可合坐、可独坐，独坐者称独榻，另有连榻；考古所见最早者为河南郸城西汉晚期墓石质坐榻明器","path":"terms/han-ta.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"榻是 B 维度下汉至魏晋南北朝起居家具的形制条目，其尺度、坐姿与礼俗相关，旁及 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:han-wu-zhu","title":"汉五铢（Han Wu Zhu）","name_en":"Han Wu Zhu","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","西汉","货币","五铢","上林三官"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"currency","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汉五铢是汉武帝货币改革后取代半两钱的铜钱，来源记其行用“直至隋代”（L2637）。赵农把它放在汉承秦制的货币体系、汉半两的轻小化、白金与皮币的短暂尝试以及上林三官专铸的脉络中叙述。来源未给五铢钱的实测直径、重量与钱范实物，图版未核。","path":"terms/han-wu-zhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"D 维度下的货币术语条目，其铸造形制与工艺面向列为 B 维度辅助；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:handai-guanzhi","title":"汉代冠制（Han Dynasty Headgear System）","name_en":"Han Dynasty Headgear System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","冠制","服饰制度","等级","冠帻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"dress_term","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汉代冠制是社会人士身份的标志，冠与帻关系密切而分别标志不同身份（L3052、L3054）。文官进贤冠配介帻，武将武弁大冠配平巾帻；进贤冠前有梁，以梁数区分等级；武弁大冠以漆纱制成，又称笼冠；冕冠为帝王冠，长冠为宦官内侍所佩，法官有法冠；帻即头巾，普通人不能戴冠，只能戴帻，并有平巾帻与介帻之别（L3054）。来源未给冠的尺寸、梁数等级序列、各冠使用场合细则与图像实物。","path":"terms/handai-guanzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉代冠制是 D 维度下汉代服饰制度的条目，其冠式形制与制作工艺属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hanhe","title":"函盒（Book Box）","name_en":"Book Box","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","书籍保护","楠木","樟木","防蛀"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_box","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"函盒是用于包装贵重书籍的木盒。赵农记其有楠木盒和樟木盒，楠木名贵、樟木幽香，对于书籍的保护有防蛀防潮作用。来源未给尺寸、形制与使用范围。","path":"terms/hanhe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"函盒是 C 维度下明清书籍保护装具的条目；其木作工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hanjing","title":"汉镜（Han Mirror）","name_en":"Han Mirror","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","铜镜","规矩镜","铭文","透光镜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汉镜是汉代铜镜的断代称谓。三册对它的处理方式不同：夏燕靖两版把它作为\"铜器的分类型设计\"下的第一个类型，给\"体薄、平边、圆钮\"的总特点与西汉、西汉末至王莽、东汉三期演变；赵农把它列为\"制器与文化的充分结合\"的典范，给镜体加厚、半球钮、柿蒂纹钮座、铭文镜、规矩四神镜、制镜人商标与透光镜。两册在最基本的一点上相反——夏燕靖说汉镜\"体薄\"，赵农说汉镜\"比战国铜镜加大增厚\"。本 KU 两说并列，不替作者弥","path":"terms/hanjing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"汉镜是 B 维度下汉代铜镜的断代器物条目；铭文的吉祥语与楚辞风格、四神方位观念牵涉 C 维度。铸造、纹样与分期属 B。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hantao","title":"函套（Book Slipcase）","name_en":"Book Slipcase","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","书籍保护","四合套","六合套","装帧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_case","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"函套是将数本书籍合装在一起的书套，一般分四合套和六合套。赵农记四合套由五块薄木板或硬纸板制成，其中三块锯成书籍封面大小、两块锯成数本书籍的厚度，用布或锦裱糊做成连折书套，以骨签系结并贴书目标签；六合套在四合套基础上加天头和地脚，使包裹更结实。来源未给尺寸、材料配比与地域差异。","path":"terms/hantao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"函套是 C 维度下明清书籍保护装具的条目；其木工与裱糊工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:he-cai","title":"褐彩（Brown Splash Decoration）","name_en":"Brown Splash Decoration","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西晋","东晋","氧化铁","点彩","龙泉窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"褐彩是西晋晚期已在瓷器上出现、东晋时期最为流行的釉上彩装饰，以含多量氧化铁的釉料在瓷上点成几何纹或花瓣纹，具有锦上添花之妙；为浙江地区六朝瓷窑所创，后为宋代龙泉窑继承。田自秉称其为瓷上彩釉装饰的先声。","path":"terms/he-cai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"褐彩是 B 维度下西晋至东晋瓷器装饰的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:he-vessel","title":"盉（He (He Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"He Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","调酒","扁圆体","茶壶雏形"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"盉是青铜盛酒器，开始也仿自陶器。2016 册记其形制一般为深腹、圆口、有盖，早商始有铜铸，西周晚期至春秋体成扁圆形，自商早期至春秋未曾中绝，春秋盉形已略可看出后世茶壶的雏形。","path":"terms/he-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:he-wool","title":"褐（He (Coarse Woolen Cloth)）","name_en":"He (Coarse Woolen Cloth)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","诗经","毛织品","平民","染色"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"褐是《诗经》中所见平民穿的粗制毛织物。原文以“无衣无褐，何以卒岁？”说明当时毛织品不只是少量生产；又以“毳衣如，毳衣如瑞”说明能将毛织品染成绿或红色之类鲜艳色彩。","path":"terms/he-wool.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"褐是 B 维度下先秦毛织品类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hegu-zhi","title":"和雇制（Hegu System (Hired Labor)）","name_en":"Hegu System (Hired Labor)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","隋唐","制度","和雇制","徭役制"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"labor_system","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"和雇制是以短期雇佣代替无偿劳役的工匠使用形式。赵农在《营造法式》段记随着宋代劳作制度的改变——由唐代的“徭役制”到宋代的“和雇制”，工匠的劳动观念也随之改变，官方根据工匠的手艺水平来判定其价值；尤其是建筑业的标准，更需要不同的认定标准。李立新则把短期“和雇”追溯到隋唐：官营工匠不愿作无偿劳役，或选择短期的“和雇”形式，或宁愿自设作坊；到宋明时期，和雇制的普遍采用改变了生产关系，官营手工业在整个手工","path":"terms/hegu-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"和雇制是 D 维度下工匠劳动制度的条目，时段由隋唐短期和雇延伸至宋明普遍采用；其与建筑标准的关系归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:heiche-baizhang","title":"黑车白帐（Black Carts and White Tents）","name_en":"Black Carts and White Tents","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","蒙古族","游牧","牛车","勒勒车"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"dwelling_vehicle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黑车白帐是蒙古族早年游牧生活的用车与居所。赵农记蒙古族早年的游牧生活中主要使用黑车白帐，黑车即牛车、俗称勒勒车，白帐即蒙古包；家具有柜、箱、矮桌等实用器具，小型器具以金、银、铜、铁金属制品居多。来源只有这一句半，未给车制尺寸、毡帐构造与配色缘由，故置信度取 low。","path":"terms/heiche-baizhang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"黑车白帐是 B 维度下蒙古族游牧用车与居所的条目。来源单句，confidence 取 low。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:heitao","title":"黑陶（Black Pottery）","name_en":"Black Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","龙山文化","大汶口文化","渗炭","镂孔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黑陶是赵农在第一章陶器技术部分论述的一种陶器类型。来源在陶质分类中提到“渗炭技术的黑陶”，又在比较南北制陶时称晚期的龙山文化黑陶壁质坚硬、壁厚只有1毫米至3毫米、薄犹蛋壳、技术高超；山东龙山文化的黑陶以光洁亮丽的乌黑陶质和镂孔手法获得奇特的装饰效果，来源把这种“寓减于增”的手法称为制器观念上的减法，并认为新石器时期制陶技术对后来中国长期作为陶瓷大国有积极而深远的影响。\n\n田自秉把新石器时代晚期黄河","path":"terms/heitao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"黑陶是 B 维度下新石器时期陶器类型的条目，其乌黑质感与镂孔装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hemudu-culture","title":"河姆渡文化（Hemudu Culture）","name_en":"Hemudu Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","长江下游","干栏式建筑","稻作","骨器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"河姆渡文化是长江下游地区的新石器时代考古学文化，因发现于浙江余姚河姆渡而得名。五册来源有直接记载（李立新一册无\"河姆渡文化\"字样，仅以遗址与木器材料出现）。本 KU 只登记文化层面的命名、年代、分布与工艺特征；同一遗址的建筑尺寸、骨耜数量、朱漆木碗等实物细节已登记在 `places/hemudu-site.md`，此处不重复。","path":"terms/hemudu-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"河姆渡文化是 B 维度下长江下游新石器时代的类型学条目，与 `places/hemudu-site.md`（遗址本体）分工：本 KU 记文化命名、年代、分布与工艺特征，遗址 KU 记建筑、器物与遗物细节。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hengqi-balance","title":"权衡秤器（Balance and Steelyard）","name_en":"Balance and Steelyard","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋","称量器具","等臂秤","衡木","权"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"measuring_device","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"权衡秤器是赵农第三章“工具”一节所述的称量器具，来源先引《史记·夏本记》的“（禹）声为律，身为度，称以出”，指出“称”即权衡的器具（L1996）。来源记长沙楚墓出土春秋时期等臂秤具实物，证明春秋时人已利用杠杆原理制作秤具（L1996）。来源又引《墨子·墨经》的秤杆原理长文，解释衡木、本、标、权等概念，并称秤的原理后来发展成铢秤（L1996）。","path":"terms/hengqi-balance.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"权衡秤器是 B 维度下春秋称量器具的条目，属于杠杆原理在称重上的应用。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hexi-caihua","title":"和玺彩画（Hexi Caihua (Hexi Architectural Painting)）","name_en":"Hexi Caihua (Hexi Architectural Painting)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","建筑","彩画","和玺彩画","龙凤枋心"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architectural_painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"和玺彩画是清代建筑彩画北派三类之一，沿明代程式略有变化，属以梁枋为主的彩画。枋心主花多龙凤、夔凤番莲、吉祥草等图案，分「龙凤枋心」「夔凤番莲枋心」「金线海曼龙枋心」三类；用色以「碾玉装」为主，青绿色上加入大量金、黄、朱、白等色，色彩较明快且多变化。","path":"terms/hexi-caihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"和玺彩画是 B 维度下清代官式建筑彩画的条目，其纹样与用色属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:high-terrace-architecture","title":"高台建筑（High-Terrace Architecture）","name_en":"High-Terrace Architecture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","宫殿","夯土台","债台高筑","中心观念"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"高台建筑是春秋战国宫殿的显著特征，以雄伟壮丽的建筑格局突出于其他建筑群之上。赵农记河北邯郸、山东淄博均有高大的土台遗存，现存高度均在十几米，并说“债台高筑”的成语来自东周末年周赧王负债累累、常驻高台的尴尬。来源又论宫殿布局体现国中之“中”的中心观念与天地人一位的宇宙中心意识，举陕西凤翔秦都遗址为例。","path":"terms/high-terrace-architecture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"高台建筑是 B 维度下春秋战国宫殿形制的条目，土台遗存与中心观念见来源同段。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hong-guan-deng","title":"虹管灯（Hongguan Lamp (Siphonic Smoke Lamp)）","name_en":"Hongguan Lamp (Siphonic Smoke Lamp)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","铜灯","虹吸","消烟","缸灯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"虹管灯又称缸灯，是灯体设导烟管、体腔盛水的汉代铜灯。2009 册记其利用虹吸原理，将灯烟送入灯座并溶于水中，防止烟尘污染空气；长沙出土的铜牛灯即以牛形灯体、两角顺背向上作虹吸管、碗状灯罩吸收灯烟。2004 册高丰补其定名与结构：缸灯因弯形中空导烟管“如同车缸”得名，体腔中空贮清水，导烟管分单、双两种，像生形灯具以人的手臂、牛角、凤雁鹅颈等形体作管；同段还记灯罩挡风调光的屏板与凹槽构造，并以达·芬奇","path":"terms/hong-guan-deng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"虹管灯是 B 维度下汉代铜灯的器类条目，其造型与动物形象结合的部分兼涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hong-haiyang","title":"红海洋（Hong Haiyang (Red Ocean)）","name_en":"Hong Haiyang (Red Ocean)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["文革","政治宣传画","红海洋","红、光、亮","书籍设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_style","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"红海洋是 2016 册所记“文革”时期政治宣传画的视觉特点。来源称这一时期政治宣传设计是一大特点，政治招贴作为宣传武器得到空前发展，其设计与创作形式大多源于苏联及东欧社会主义国家的政治宣传画，同时吸收年画造型方式以形成民族特色；另一特点便是“红海洋”，整幅画面均以“红、光、亮”突出宣传主题，红色成为唯一象征革命的颜色。来源并称“红、光、亮”审美原则主宰了当时的书籍设计，书籍装帧呈现空洞、单调、贫乏","path":"terms/hong-haiyang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"红海洋是 C 维度下文革时期政治宣传与书籍设计的视觉原则条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hongmu","title":"红木（Hongmu (Rosewood)）","name_en":"Hongmu (Rosewood)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["硬木","酸枝","明清家具","树种统称"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"红木是明清以来对稀有硬木的统称，从一开始就不是某一特定树种的家具；红木性脆、味酸，南方又称“酸枝”，纹理有清晰如行云流水者，也有细腻近紫檀者。赵农另记“红木”是 20 世纪末期中国社会重新出现的传统家具时尚，普通民众也重新崇尚实木家具。","path":"terms/hongmu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"红木是 B 维度下家具用材与材料名的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hongshan-culture","title":"红山文化（Hongshan Culture）","name_en":"Hongshan Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","北方地区","玉器","玉龙","女神庙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"红山文化是分布于内蒙古东南、辽宁西部与河北北部一带的新石器时代考古学文化，因内蒙古赤峰红山而得名。六册中有五册提及，**夏燕靖 2009 一册完全未出现**；田自秉给出发现时间、分布与玉龙尺寸，赵农、李立新、夏燕靖 2016 与高丰只截取玉器、祭祀遗迹或龙纹起源的某一侧面。本 KU 登记文化命名、分布、玉器特征与区域设计定位，不重复单件玉器的形制描述。","path":"terms/hongshan-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"红山文化是 B 维度下北方燕山南北长城地带的新石器时代考古学文化条目；玉龙与祭祀遗迹同时牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hongwei-fu","title":"红卫服（Hongwei Fu (Red Guard Suit)）","name_en":"Hongwei Fu (Red Guard Suit)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["文化大革命","红卫服","毛服","军便服","全民服装"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"红卫服是文化大革命时期由军便服改造而成的全民化服装，也称「毛服」。草绿色、灰蓝色甚至黑色的毛服成为男女老少的基本服饰；工人以灰蓝色工作服为主，也有背带工装连衣裤，农民以对襟盘扣的黑蓝布衫为主。赵农称当时城市一片灰蓝绿的人群，加上红色巨幅标语，形成惨淡的社会景象。来源未给红卫服的形制细节、面料、设计者与命名由来。","path":"terms/hongwei-fu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"红卫服是 B 维度下文革时期全民服装的条目；其政治动员与全民化穿着属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hongxian-tan","title":"红线毯（Red-Thread Carpet）","name_en":"Red-Thread Carpet","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","宣州","丝毯","贡品","白居易"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_product","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"红线毯是唐代宣州所产丝毯，以丝为原料，不是毛毯。白居易《红线毯》写择茧缫丝、红蓝染线、织作披香殿毯，并称其比太原毛毯、蜀都锦毯更温且柔；田自秉据此称其为披香殿的重要贡品，并说它就是现代所称的丝毯。","path":"terms/hongxian-tan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"红线毯是 B 维度下唐代宣州丝毯的品种条目，其贡品性质与宣城太守加样织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hongyi-pao","title":"红夷炮（Hongyi Pao (Red-Barbarian Cannon)）","name_en":"Hongyi Pao (Red-Barbarian Cannon)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["火炮","红夷炮","荷兰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"红夷炮是荷兰火炮的俗称。赵农在叙佛朗机炮之后，以“后成为俗称‘红夷炮’的荷兰火炮”一语带出，未另段说明其传入年代、形制与战例。来源未给炮身尺寸、射程与铸造地。","path":"terms/hongyi-pao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"红夷炮是 B 维度下荷兰火炮俗称的条目；其跨海传入与中西火器交流归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hongyou","title":"红釉（Red Glaze）","name_en":"Red Glaze","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","铜红釉","还原焰","宝石红"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"红釉是明清瓷器釉色之一。赵农记红釉将铜元素配入釉中，在素坯上釉后经还原焰烧制，使铜元素在釉色中产生变化，呈现宝石红效果。来源未给红釉的创烧年代、典型器物、铜含量与烧成温度。","path":"terms/hongyou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"红釉是 B 维度下明清铜红釉瓷的术语条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hu-jia","title":"胡笳（Hu Jia (Reed Horn)）","name_en":"Hu Jia (Reed Horn)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","魏晋南北朝","乐器","芦苇","角"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"胡笳是秦汉笳几乎失传后，以芦苇制哨装于管上而成的吹奏乐器，来源称记载中的“芦笳”是用芦叶卷起吹奏（L3868）。同段并记角原为天然动物角制成，后来用竹、木、皮、铜加工；本条分列笳与角，不以标题混同二者。来源未载管长、孔数、哨制细节、角的大小与图像，图版未核；本条不补《胡笳十八拍》等来源外内容。","path":"terms/hu-jia.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"胡笳是 B 维度下秦汉至魏晋笳类吹奏乐器与角类乐器的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hu-vessel","title":"壶（Hu (Hu Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Hu Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","瓜瓢","贯耳","莲鹤方壶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"壶是青铜盛酒器，始见于殷商，形制仿自陶壶，而陶壶又仿自天然瓜瓢。2016 册记其基本形制为盖、耳、圈足和圆腹，早期贯耳、西周中期后半环耳，春秋晚期更盛行华丽，并以莲鹤方壶为代表作。同册汉代段又记铜壶商代即有，春秋战国制作极盛；汉代大体继承传统形式而名称不同，圆壶称钟、方壶称钫，除盛酒或水外兼作量器，并已形成鼓腹、小颈口向外移、圈足、腹侧多铺首衔环的设计定式。","path":"terms/hu-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜壶器形与汉代钟、钫定式的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hua-falang","title":"画珐琅（Painted Enamel）","name_en":"Painted Enamel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","康熙","乾隆","画珐琅","铜胎"],"confidence":"high","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"enamel_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"画珐琅又称铜胎画珐琅，是与明代铜胎掐丝珐琅相比较而言的珐琅工艺。两者的区别在于一为掐丝显现花纹后填珐琅料，一为涂珐琅后再画花纹；田自秉认为画珐琅实为掐丝珐琅的一种演进，并非外来。清代画珐琅产生于康熙而兴盛于乾隆，装饰多为绘画式，器表白珐琅、器里蓝珐琅、器底白珐琅成为制作通例。","path":"terms/hua-falang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度珐琅工艺的条目，绘画式装饰与西洋风格属 C、E 维度，造办处与广东两处产地属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hua-si-gong-yi","title":"花丝工艺（Filigree）","name_en":"Filigree","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["三国","西晋","南朝","金银细工","花丝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalwork_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花丝工艺是西晋盛行的金银细工技艺，以金银细丝盘绕成各种花形纹样，雍容华贵、细致精巧。2009 册记西晋花丝工艺在继承汉代基础上有所发展并取得突出成就，同段又记三国东吴南昌出土的“花形金饰”上雕有“大吉”文字，以及南朝金环、金珠、金戒指、六瓣花形金饰等小品，虽属小品而錾刻雕镂颇为精巧；来源总称这一时期金银装饰工艺以“错采镂金”著称。\n\n来源所列实物包括：洛阳金村出土金狮子、金簪、金叶，金制首饰达 6","path":"terms/hua-si-gong-yi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花丝工艺是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝金银细工的技艺条目，其首饰形制与纹样同属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hua-tu","title":"花土（Huatu (Imprint in Earth)）","name_en":"Huatu (Imprint in Earth)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","考古术语","印痕","麻布","漆器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_term","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花土是考古学家对商代遗存中印痕的称名。田自秉在染织段记大司空村殷墓发现一块“花土”，是较粗的麻布残痕，黑白相间颜色上可看出黑色画成的类似饕餮图案，可能是仪仗物品；在漆器段又记殷墟武官村大墓发现许多雕花木器印痕，考古学家称为“花土”，是木器雕花后涂朱红漆、木器腐烂后漆印留在夯土中形成，纹饰有饕餮纹、龙纹、虎纹、回纹。同一名词指麻布印痕与漆器印痕两类对象，来源未说明二者是否为同一术语的两种用法。","path":"terms/hua-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花土是 B 维度下商代考古遗存术语；其纹饰与织物、漆器工艺属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huadeng","title":"花灯（Festive Lantern）","name_en":"Festive Lantern","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","盛唐","元宵节","灯彩","民俗"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"festival_object","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花灯又叫灯彩，是汉代以来元宵节挂灯观赏的民俗活动。赵农 2009 册在隋唐第六章第七节「杂品」的门神、剪纸之后记花灯，先述灯彩与元宵节的由来，再记佛教燃灯与盛唐上元灯节的盛况。来源未记灯的制作材料、尺寸、灯市制度与灯样的具体形制，汉文帝与正月十五日的关系也只用“相传”引出。图 6-66 走马灯图版未核，本条不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"terms/huadeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花灯是 B 维度下节令灯具与民俗造物的条目；元宵起源只见以“相传”引出的传说性叙述，未涉及设计史观或史学方法，故不指派 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huadian","title":"花钿（Huadian (Forehead Ornament)）","name_en":"Huadian (Forehead Ornament)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","面妆","金箔","梅花妆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cosmetic_accessory","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花钿是唐代女子贴于额上或两眉之间的面部妆饰，式样繁多，质料有金箔、彩纸、翠鸟羽毛、鱼鳃骨及颜料等着彩。其源出南北朝寿阳公主梅花落额的传说；唐代除用颜色染绘外，还有用金属制造。","path":"terms/huadian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花钿是 B 维度下唐代面妆饰物的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huan-dai-wen","title":"环带纹（Wave-Band Motif）","name_en":"Wave-Band Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","青铜器","装饰纹样","环带纹","带状纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"环带纹是周代应用较多的青铜器装饰纹样。田自秉记其组成波状连续的带状，以上下左右的反复产生节奏感和秩序感，常用于器物的主要部位。来源未给单元形制、型式分类、年代序列与器物分布。","path":"terms/huan-dai-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"环带纹是 C 维度下周代青铜装饰纹样的术语条目；其青铜器载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huan-qian","title":"圜形钱（Round Coin）","name_en":"Round Coin","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","货币","纺轮","圆形圆孔","圆形方孔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"currency","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"圜形钱是战国时期出现的圆形钱币。赵农认为圆形钱从纺轮演变而来，战国开始出现规范的圆形圆孔钱币、圆形方孔钱币与圜环钱；环形圜钱便于长途携带和交流，制钱容易规范，大小、重量、质量与制形趋向标准化，方孔钱则便于铸造后打磨。来源还以秦国半两钱为简洁标准的代表。原文标题、正文与后文对同一钱型有“圜形钱”“圓形钱”「圆形钱」「圜环钱」「环形圜钱」等不同写法。","path":"terms/huan-qian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"圜形钱是 D 维度下战国圆形铸币的货币条目，其纺轮起源、圆孔方孔与打磨工艺属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huan-shou-dao","title":"环首刀（Ring-Pommel Saber）","name_en":"Ring-Pommel Saber","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","汉代","兵器","刀"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"环首刀是汉代刀柄铸成环形的长刀。赵农记其刀长达100厘米，便于骑兵和步兵手持，并称汉代刀具逐渐代替铁剑，铁剑不再是士兵的主要武器，只作为少数官员的佩饰。来源未给材质、装具、刀鞘与出土实物，图版未核。","path":"terms/huan-shou-dao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的兵器术语条目，关注刀柄环形构造与对铁剑的替代；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huangyou","title":"黄釉（Yellow Glaze）","name_en":"Yellow Glaze","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","低温釉","氧化焰","锑","铅"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黄釉是明清瓷器釉色之一。赵农记黄釉将锑与铅合理配制，加入氧化锌等多种原料，涂在白瓷上，再用氧化焰低温烧制成黄色器物。来源未给黄釉的创烧年代、典型器物、各原料配比与烧成温度。","path":"terms/huangyou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"黄釉是 B 维度下明清低温黄釉瓷的术语条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huangzi","title":"幌子（Huangzi / Shop Banner）","name_en":"Huangzi","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商业美术","广告","招幌","酒旗","望子"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"advertising_form","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"幌子是中国古代店铺悬挂的招徕标识，最典型的形态是布幔酒旗，后泛指酒店、茶舍、布店、药铺等行业的悬挂广告。四册的外延并不一致：高丰把“招幌”分为“招牌”与“幌子”两类，招牌宋代流行，幌子可追溯到春秋战国酒旗；夏燕靖两版把幌子说成“我国土生土长的‘广告’形式”，宋代称“望子”；赵农把幌子定义为“商家店铺中的悬挂广告，如酒帘”，却又把墙面上的“茶”“當”“药”“布”单字也纳入；夏燕靖 2016 在近代上","path":"terms/huangzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"幌子是 C 维度下店铺标识与商业广告的术语锚点；其商业功能、行业分工与市镇制度属 D；布幔、木幌、模型幌的制作属 B。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huapendi-xie","title":"花盆底鞋（Huapendi Xie (Flowerpot-Sole Shoes)）","name_en":"Huapendi Xie (Flowerpot-Sole Shoes)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","服饰","旗女","花盆底","马蹄底"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"footwear_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花盆底鞋是清代旗女所穿高木底鞋。2016 册记旗女天足，鞋装高木底，前圆后方为「马蹄底」，侧面为内弧线，又称「花盆底」；绸缎面绣花纹，镶有珠宝。同段并记汉族妇女缠足也影响旗女，「弓鞋」尖头也装木底，行走辄作响。","path":"terms/huapendi-xie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花盆底鞋是 B 维度下清代旗女鞋式的条目，其与汉族缠足弓鞋的关系属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huasha","title":"花纱（Figured Gauze）","name_en":"Figured Gauze","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","纺织","印染","绞缬","夹缬"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花纱是来源使用的唐代织物名称，与纬锦并列为唐代纺织技术进步后产量明显提高的品种。来源对花纱的说明限于纱质中的印染，并列举绞缬、夹缬、蜡缬、介质印花四类技术。来源又以南北朝纬锦数量不多作对照，说明纬锦以纬线显花、改换花色所受限制较小。来源未给花纱的纱线密度、幅宽、染料种类与配比、完整工艺流程及各缬法的年代序列。图 6-39 绿色印花纱、图 6-40 连珠对鸭纹织锦图版未核，不据图补写纹样与尺寸。","path":"terms/huasha.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花纱是 B 维度下唐代纱质印染织物类型的条目，来源同时以纬锦作对照。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huashigang","title":"花石纲（Huashigang (Flower and Rock Tribute)）","name_en":"Huashigang (Flower and Rock Tribute)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北宋","艮岳","花石纲","太湖石","运输"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_tribute","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花石纲是北宋修筑艮岳时在江南搜刮的名贵太湖石和奇花异草。赵农记修筑艮岳时在江南搜刮大量“花石纲”，激起民怨而酿成内乱，并直接释“花石纲即名贵的太湖石和奇花异草”。来源把花石纲作为艮岳营建的材料来源与政治后果，未给纲运组织、运输路线、石料尺寸与数量。","path":"terms/huashigang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花石纲是 D 维度下北宋材料征运的条目；其石料与园林材料归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huasi","title":"花丝（Filigree）","name_en":"Filigree","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","金银丝","花丝","编堆穿镶錾","北京"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalwork_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花丝是用金或银制成细丝所作的各种工艺品。来源认为战国青铜器的金银错与唐代的平脱已是它的前身，因金银延展性大、可塑性强而适于制成极细的丝或极薄的片，运用编、堆、穿、镶、錾等技法制作盘、盆、瓶、炉、烟具、酒具、挂屏与各类首饰，产地主要有北京、上海和成都。新中国段记它以液化石油气灯代替吹灯烧焊，并在机械化、模具化方面发展。","path":"terms/huasi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度金银细工技法的条目，首饰与摆件的造型属 C 维度，产地与外销属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huaxiangshi","title":"画像石（Pictorial Stone Relief）","name_en":"Pictorial Stone Relief","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","石刻","墓葬","厚葬","画像石墓"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_relief","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"画像石是李立新《中国设计艺术史论》所称中国设计史上重要的一种石刻装饰形式，西汉末出现，至东汉末共二百余年。来源记其分布于东起海滨、西至甘肃、北自陕西榆林、南至云南昭通的范围，发现的汉画像石墓二百多座、数量超过一万块，产生于两汉厚葬之风。来源分墓室画像石与地面祠堂画像石：前者继承汉代早期木椁墓的帛画与漆棺画，后者模仿先秦以来木结构祠堂的装饰壁画；东汉终结后画像石销声匿迹。来源未给画像石的尺寸、雕刻技","path":"terms/huaxiangshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度汉代石刻图像的术语条目，其石作工艺属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huaxiangzhuan","title":"画象砖（Pictorial Brick）","name_en":"Pictorial Brick","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","砖瓦","空心砖","方砖","模印"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_material","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"画象砖是汉代艺术性较高的砖类，有空心砖与方砖两种。空心砖又称圹砖，流行于河南、山西等中原地区，模印四片泥坯后粘合，中空易烧、体轻、可防潮，南阳出土最多；方砖多为四川成都所产，表现主题内容，已发现 70 余种，题材分生产劳动、车骑出行、社会风俗、神话传说、庭园建筑，以生产劳动最有特色。四川方砖用阴刻花模套印，花纹呈浅浮雕。","path":"terms/huaxiangzhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"画象砖是 C 维度下汉代图像砖的术语条目；空心砖与方砖的模印、粘合、烧制工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huaxue-xianwei","title":"化学纤维（Chemical Fibre）","name_en":"Chemical Fibre","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","人造纤维","合成纤维","混纺","锦纶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_material","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"化学纤维是新中国新兴的纺织原料，分人造纤维与合成纤维两类。来源记人造纤维如人造棉、人造丝、人造毛用天然纤维素经化学加工制成；合成纤维如锦纶、维纶、的确良以煤、石油或天然气为原料。人造纤维光亮轻软但下水后强力减弱，合成纤维耐摩擦、强力高、不虫蛀但吸水性差，故以混纺取长补短。来源称生产十万吨化纤等于节约二三百万亩棉田。","path":"terms/huaxue-xianwei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度纺织材料的条目，原料的国民经济意义属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huaya","title":"花押（Huaya (Personal Cipher Signature)）","name_en":"Huaya (Personal Cipher Signature)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","印章","私印","花押","楷书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"seal_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花押是元代私人印章的一种，为个人化的形象符号。赵农在印章节记此时印章以官印为主、多为铜质铸造，元代出现大量私人印章和花押；花押中大多数以楷书文字为主，字体呈现凝重古朴的风格。来源未给花押的形制分类、使用阶层与存世实例。","path":"terms/huaya.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花押是 C 维度下元代私印符号的条目；其官印制度背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huayou","title":"花釉（Huayou (Splashed Glaze)）","name_en":"Huayou (Splashed Glaze)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","黑釉","斑纹","腰鼓","鲁山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花釉是唐瓷新品种，在黑釉、黄釉、天蓝釉基础上再施蓝白或灰白釉，形成大小斑纹，或规则排列或任意飘洒如波浪、树叶、云彩。烧造地点有河南郏县、鲁山、内乡、禹县等，代表作是河南出土的“花釉腰鼓”。","path":"terms/huayou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"花釉是 B 维度下唐代瓷釉类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huazhuangtu","title":"化妆土（Slip (Ceramic Coating)）","name_en":"Slip (Ceramic Coating)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","六朝","婺窑","胎色"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"化妆土是施于陶器或瓷器表面、用以改善呈色或装饰的涂层。田自秉记母系氏族社会制陶已在陶器表面施化妆土，并进行彩画、刻镂、堆贴等装饰；夏燕靖记婺窑因制品含铁量较高、胎色泛红，为取得较好色彩效果而在烧制中运用化妆土。","path":"terms/huazhuangtu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"化妆土是 B 维度下陶瓷胎釉工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hubi","title":"湖笔（Hubi Writing Brush）","name_en":"Hubi Writing Brush","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","文房四宝","毛笔","湖州","善琏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"writing_brush","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"湖笔是浙江湖州地区制造的毛笔。赵农记南宋移都杭州后，许多制笔名家从宣州向湖州聚集；湖州盛产毛竹，竹子的粗细长短适宜制作笔管，临近嘉兴出产的羊毛柔软绵韧、粗细均匀，是制作笔头的上好原料，善琏镇一带因此兴起毛笔制造业。明清湖笔有羊毫、紫毫、狼毫、兼毫等材质，以羊毫为主，并形成尖、齐、圆、健的检验标准，制笔过程近 100 道工序。来源未给名家字号、笔种尺寸谱与作坊名录。","path":"terms/hubi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"湖笔是 B 维度下明清毛笔制作的条目；其书写功能归 C 维度，制笔业组织归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hubu-guanpiao","title":"户部官票（Hubu Guanpiao）","name_en":"Hubu Guanpiao","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","咸丰","纸币","银票","户部"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper_currency","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"户部官票是咸丰年间清政府发行的纸币，简称银票。赵农记其以银两为单位，有一两、三两、五两、十两、五十两等面值，与咸丰年间发行的大清宝钞同为清代两种纸币。来源未给官票的版式、印造机构、发行总额与流通范围。","path":"terms/hubu-guanpiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"户部官票是 D 维度下清代货币制度的条目；其票面形式归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huchuang","title":"胡床（Folding Stool）","name_en":"Folding Stool","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东汉","魏晋南北朝","唐代","家具","坐具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"胡床是东汉以后传入的可折叠坐具，即后世的马扎。六册均有直接记载，但它在各册中的重要性不在器物本身，而在坐姿与坐礼的改变：席地跽坐转为垂足而坐，进而导向高型家具与椅子。来源在四处不一致：传入方向、改称\"绳床\"的时点、绳床与胡床是否同物、胡床的社会评价。赵农一册内部对绳床的解释亦不自一致。本 KU 全部并列，不裁定。","path":"terms/huchuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"胡床是 B 维度下的坐具形制条目，其坐礼与礼制变动属 D 维度，其自域外传入并本土化属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hudie-zhuang","title":"蝴蝶装（Butterfly Binding）","name_en":"Butterfly Binding","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","册页装","雕版印刷","包背装"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_binding","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蝴蝶装是宋代出现的中国古代册页装订最早形式，也是雕版印刷发展的结果：每页从中缝对折，按页码将折口逐页粘在包背纸上，再装上硬封面而成一册；版心向内、版外空白可裁，阅读翻检与保存较便。叶德辉《书林清话》形容“揭之若蝴蝶翼”；其缺陷是书页均为单页、翻阅不便，南宋因此创包背装，元代广泛应用。","path":"terms/hudie-zhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蝴蝶装是 C 维度下古代书籍装帧形式的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hufu","title":"胡服（Hu Dress (Nomadic Costume)）","name_en":"Hu Dress (Nomadic Costume)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["赵武灵王","胡服骑射","短衣长裤","带钩","跨文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"胡服本是北方草原游牧民族部落的服装，特征是短衣、长裤、靴子；古代中原民族用以总称西域和北方各族胡人所穿服饰，即塞外民族西戎和东胡的服饰。衣身紧窄、活动便利，便于生活与骑射；胡服进入中原始于赵武灵王胡服骑射。","path":"terms/hufu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"胡服是 E 维度下跨文化服饰传播的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hui-tao","title":"灰陶（Grey Pottery）","name_en":"Grey Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","陶器","还原焰","绳纹","灰陶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"灰陶是商代各遗址出土数量最多的陶器，占全部出土陶器百分之九十以上。田自秉记其因烧陶技术提高、利用还原焰烧成而胎质较硬、经久耐用；品种有鼎、鬲、甗、釜等烹煮器，簋、豆、碗、盆等食器，瓮、罍、壶、尊等盛器；装饰简朴，以绳纹和弦纹为主，与制作方式及器物牢固有关。","path":"terms/hui-tao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"灰陶是 B 维度下商代陶器类型的术语条目；其绳纹与弦纹装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hui-wen","title":"回纹（Meander Motif）","name_en":"Meander Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","青铜器","地纹","云雷纹","纹样"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"回纹是商代青铜器的主要地纹。田自秉记商代多用主纹与地纹结合，通常以饕餮纹为主纹、回纹为地纹，以面的大小和线条粗细对比衬托主体；彩陶上常见旋涡纹，青铜器上多方形回纹；古代学者称圆形回纹为云纹、方形为雷纹，合称云雷纹。来源列举郭沫若指纹演变说、水浪说，并认为可看作编织纹的遗留。","path":"terms/hui-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"回纹是 C 维度下青铜装饰地纹的术语条目；其青铜器载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huihui-wenzi","title":"回回文字（普速蛮字）（Huihui Script (Pusuman Script)）","name_en":"Huihui Script (Pusuman Script)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","回回文字","普速蛮字","新波斯文字","经字画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"script","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"回回文字是元代通行的新波斯文字，称普速蛮字，即穆斯林文字。赵农记元代波斯与穆斯林官商人员交流使用回回文字，设回回国子学与回回国子监教授新波斯文字；回回人还流行亦思替非文字，有特殊书写与计算方法，属表意象形文字与符号缩写样式；回回文字在中原发展成书法艺术经字画，有花体、象形体、波斯体、行书体、宫廷体等样式，并采用汉文书法中堂、横幅、对联等形式。来源未给字母系统与语法。","path":"terms/huihui-wenzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"回回文字是 C 维度下元代外来文字书写与装饰的条目；其跨文化传播与在地化归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huimo","title":"徽墨（Hui Ink Cake）","name_en":"Hui Ink Cake","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","文房四宝","墨","徽州","集锦墨"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ink_cake","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"徽墨是明清徽州地区发达的制墨产品。赵农记徽州出现歙派、休派、婺派，徽墨研制注重实用生产技术，进一步演变为具有观赏品玩意义的墨锭；制墨有采料、造窑、取煤、和剂、成型、入灰、出灰、试磨等八道工序，形成实用墨与集锦墨两大用途，集锦墨以线刻、浮雕、圆雕等墨模雕刻萃集山水故事与花卉人物；清代四大家为曹素功、汪近圣、汪节庵、胡开文。来源未给各家墨品目录、配方与年代。","path":"terms/huimo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"徽墨是 B 维度下明清制墨工艺的条目；其墨模雕刻与书画功能归 C 维度，徽州制墨业组织归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huishan-niren","title":"惠山泥人（Huishan Clay Figurines）","name_en":"Huishan Clay Figurines","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","无锡","惠山","泥塑","大阿福"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"clay_figurine_school","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"惠山泥人是江苏无锡惠山泥塑的总称。清代段记它因以制作阿福最有特色而又称大阿福或惠山泥阿福，以大胆的夸张和强烈的色彩取胜，生产旺季在二、三月的香汛时节，并远销南洋一带。新中国段记它约有四百多年历史，早期多制作小花囡、车老虎、大阿福一类，1936 年以后开始采用石膏制品，特点可用简、满、明三字形容，大阿福是著名的传统题材。","path":"terms/huishan-niren.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度民间彩塑品种的条目，夸张省略的造型与强烈色彩属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huluyao","title":"葫芦窑（Gourd Kiln）","name_en":"Gourd Kiln","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","福建","制瓷","窑炉","葫芦窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"葫芦窑是宋代福建地区出现的窑炉形式。赵农记其分为前后两室，单独是馒头窑，连接起来是龙窑，也是综合了龙窑和馒头窑的特点，因地制宜，在一些狭小的坡地就可以建构窑炉，成为家庭式作坊的烧瓷形式。来源未给窑室尺寸、容量、烧成温度与使用年代。","path":"terms/huluyao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"葫芦窑是 B 维度下宋代福建窑炉的条目；其家庭作坊组织归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:humen-an","title":"壶门案（Humen An (Humen-Leg Table)）","name_en":"Humen An (Humen-Leg Table)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","家具","案","壶门","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"带壶门装饰的唐代案类家具。2016 册唐代家具正文列几、案、挟轼、箱、柜、胡床、屏风以及晚期出现的桌椅，未单列壶门案；壶门案只出现在图 6-36 的图注“唐代 壶门案、腰圆凳”中。因此本条只能确认：来源把壶门案作为唐代家具的图例之一，与腰圆凳同图；不能确认其形制、尺寸、壶门轮廓与使用场景。图版未视觉核验，本条不据图像下判断。","path":"terms/humen-an.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代家具器形的条目，证据仅及图注。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hundred-schools","title":"百家争鸣（Baijia Zhengming (Hundred Schools of Thought)）","name_en":"Hundred Schools of Thought","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","思想多元","诸子","工艺文献","设计思想"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"intellectual_movement","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"百家争鸣是春秋战国时期文化开放背景下思想活跃的局面，各家纷纷提出主张，代表人物有孔子、孟子、老子、庄子、墨子、荀子等。2016 册认为这一思想多元局面促成了许多工艺文献的产生，集中体现当时设计思想多元和探索的科学精神。同册另记“诸子百家”之名本于《汉书·艺文志》，列儒家、墨家、道家、法家、阴阳家、名家、农家、纵横家、杂家、小说家，还有兵家等；并记士阶层兴起、打破“学在官府”局面的社会条件，“用与美","path":"terms/hundred-schools.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下春秋战国思想潮流的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hunping","title":"魂瓶（Hunping (Soul Jar)）","name_en":"Hunping (Soul Jar)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["六朝","明器","魂亭","谷仓","五联罐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"burial_object","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"魂瓶是六朝具有宗教性质的明器，又称魂亭、神亭，也称谷仓；由东汉五联罐演变而来，形状如坛，上面堆饰亭台、人物、鸟兽，塑造蜥蜴窜洞、老鼠奔跑、龟鳖爬行、鸟雀飞翔，人物或伫立守望、或执杆驱雀，或塑牌楼碑亭。所有物象均以手捻成堆贴为饰。来源引“所堆之物，取子孙繁衍，六畜繁息之意。以妥死者之魂，而慰生者之望”，并称其为一种奇特的产品。","path":"terms/hunping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"魂瓶是 B 维度下六朝明器类型的条目，其堆塑题材与丧葬观念归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huntian-theory","title":"浑天说（Huntian Theory）","name_en":"Huntian Theory","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","天文","宇宙论","张衡"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cosmology","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"浑天说是东汉张衡提出的宇宙结构主张，以鸡子（蛋）为喻，说明天包于地外、天大而地小。赵农把这一主张与地动仪、地图、指南车并置，视为汉代地理天文知识的组成部分，但没有展开学说源流与仪器结构。本条只据来源的一段概述，不补盖天说、宣夜说或浑天仪的形制细节。","path":"terms/huntian-theory.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"A 维度下的宇宙论术语条目，其天文仪器与地理知识面向列为 B 维度辅助；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:hunyi","title":"浑仪（Armillary Sphere）","name_en":"Armillary Sphere","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","天文仪器","浑仪","李淳风","僧一行"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"astronomical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"浑仪是测绘星象、制定历法的仪器。来源在第六章仪器节把它与水运浑天仪并举为唐代技艺发明成就，并记唐代李淳风改造北魏铁浑仪、于公元 633 年制成浑天黄道铜仪，引《新唐书·方技列传》作“诋摭前世得失”；后来僧一行和梁令瓒于公元 725 年进一步改进浑仪，使之完备精准。来源未载浑仪的圈数、结构、直径、材质细节、安装地点、使用方法与存世实物，也未附结构图或复原图，图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。本条","path":"terms/hunyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"浑仪是 B 维度唐代天文仪器的条目；来源所述定义、改造与年代均属器物技术叙述，不涉及设计史书写或史学方法，故不指派 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huohua","title":"火花（Matchbox Label）","name_en":"Matchbox Label","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["火柴商标","收藏","文革","商品设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"advertising_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"火花即火柴商标的设计。火柴 19 世纪中期由英国传入中国，随后许多地方开设火柴生产厂商；火花为收藏家带来艺术欣赏天地，但随着打火机流行，火柴在 20 世纪末慢慢退出生活范围。文革时期火花是重要收藏对象，设计内容含毛主席语录、革命圣地、工农兵形象、向日葵、三面红旗、长江大桥等“革命性”图案。","path":"terms/huohua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"火花是 C 维度下近现代商业标识与收藏印刷品的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huoshidi","title":"火石底（Huoshidi (Firestone Base)）","name_en":"Huoshidi (Firestone Base)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","陶瓷","胎体","护胎釉","火石底"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"火石底是元代陶瓷胎体处理方式的俗称。来源记元代陶瓷胎质厚重，多有杂质斑点，常在胎上涂一层护胎釉，俗称火石底。来源未给护胎釉的原料、配比、施涂方法、烧成温度与产地差异。","path":"terms/huoshidi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代陶瓷胎体处理的术语，护胎釉与烧成的关系属工艺技术。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huoyao","title":"火药（Gunpowder）","name_en":"Gunpowder","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北宋","南宋","火药","火器","兵器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"火药是宋代已大量用于战争的发明。赵农在绪论与兵器节两处记它：北宋时火药已大量用于战争，宋代兵器作坊已有很大的制造规模，南宋时火枪也出现在战争中；火药在南宋时传入阿拉伯和波斯等地，后来流向欧洲。来源同时引《武经总要》所记引火球、蒺藜火球、毒药烟球的配方，称其已具有近代黑色火药的配方比例。","path":"terms/huoyao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"火药是 B 维度下宋代火药制造与外传的条目；兵器作坊的组织与战争制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huzhong-tiandi","title":"壶中天地（Gourd Heaven）","name_en":"Gourd Heaven","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["江南园林","空间观念","后汉书","方术传","隐逸"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"壶中天地是江南园林借以表达小中见大、躲避现实困境的空间观念。赵农记江南园林的构建加深了园林建筑的壶中天地意义，并引《后汉书·方术传》：市中老翁卖药，悬一壶于肆头，市罢跳入壶中；费长房被邀入壶，唯见玉堂严丽、旨酒甘肴盈衍其中。来源由此说壶中天地成为人们躲避现实困境的精神场所。来源未给该观念在具体园林中的空间做法与尺度处理。","path":"terms/huzhong-tiandi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"壶中天地是 B 维度下江南园林空间观念的术语条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:huzhuang","title":"胡装（Hu Costume）","name_en":"Hu Costume","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["盛唐","妇女服饰","西域","胡帽","胡服"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"胡装指盛唐妇女仿效西域服饰的装束，来源记其形制为翻领细袖上衣与卷沿胡帽，并明言明显受西域服饰影响。来源称波斯、印度等地服饰成为唐朝妇女模仿的对象，又引《旧唐书·舆服志》与元稹诗说明胡食、胡帽、胡装、胡乐的流行，末以胡风荡漾、胡汉合一作结。来源另记与胡装辉映的女扮男装，先起于贵族妇女，后流行于民间，并以《旧唐书·舆服志》及唐画、唐墓壁画为证。来源未给胡装的裁剪尺寸、面料、缝制工艺与流行年代上限。绘画","path":"terms/huzhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"胡装是 B 维度下盛唐妇女服饰形制的条目，其西域文化传入与胡汉交融归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:industrial-design","title":"工业设计（Industrial Design）","name_en":"Industrial Design","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["现代设计","产品设计","学科","工业化","设计教育"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_discipline","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"工业设计是 20 世纪 80 年代初引入中国并逐步制度化的现代设计门类。夏燕靖两版把它定义为“在有序与无序之间，在科技与艺术之间进行的交叉设计活动”，核心是批量生产的工业产品设计，并给出五阶段流程、相关学科与 CAD 手段；李立新则从学科命名出发，指出“工业设计”一词外延含糊，容易把工业布局、工厂管理乃至传统造物排除在外，主张用“艺术设计”或“设计艺术”来限定艺术性造物。三册不是在给同一个定义：前","path":"terms/industrial-design.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"工业设计是 D 维度下现代设计学科与设计教育的术语锚点；批量生产、产品结构与材料工艺属 B；工业化、现代性与中西设计概念移植属 E。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:iron-farm-tools","title":"铁制农具（Tiezhi Nongju (Iron Farm Tools)）","name_en":"Iron Farm Tools","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","铁农具","耒耜","铁犁","冶铁遗址"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铁制农具是春秋战国时期随冶铁业兴起而推广的农业生产工具。2016 册记其种类有耒、耜、铫、镰、耨、铚、铲、鐮、锄、耙、缶等，并称铸铁农具的推广为农业和手工业提供了廉价高效的生产工具。","path":"terms/iron-farm-tools.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下春秋战国铁农具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:iron-three-brothers","title":"铁氏三兄弟（Tieshi Sanxiongdi (The Three Iron Brothers)）","name_en":"The Three Iron Brothers","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["生铁","熟铁","钢","含碳量","块炼铁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铁氏三兄弟是 2016 册对生铁、熟铁和钢三种铁碳合金的通俗称谓。来源以含碳量区分三者，并据三门峡西周晚期铜柄铁剑、六合程桥东周墓铁丸、洛阳铁锛铁铲、长沙战国铁铲等实物，说明块炼法与生铁冶铸同时发展是中国古代钢铁冶金技术的独特途径。","path":"terms/iron-three-brothers.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下铁碳合金分类概念的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ji-furniture","title":"几（Ji Table）","name_en":"Ji Table","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["家具","坐具","凭几","榫卯","春秋战国"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"几是中国先秦至后世低型家具的一种，由几面、腿、足座三部分以榫卯结合，表面少装饰、多呈黑色。三册对它的定性不完全相同：夏燕靖两版以\"凭几\"为核心，描述春秋时期横跗单足与栅形直足两式及江陵九店出土实例；赵农把它与席、床、屏风、案、箱并列，强调它是\"放置东西或者可以倚伏在上面\"的家具，战国墓出土较多、多带漆绘；夏燕靖 2016 另设\"案与几\"知识链接，用《说文》《周礼》界定几、案、桌、俎的差别。本 KU","path":"terms/ji-furniture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"几是 B 维度下低型坐卧家具的条目；三册集中在春秋战国楚地漆木家具，形制与榫卯属造物层，凭几的礼制用法牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ji-halberd","title":"戟（Halberd）","name_en":"Halberd","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","西周","青铜兵器","戈矛复合","贵族"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"戟是将戈与矛复合而成的青铜兵器。赵农记商王朝时期戈和矛分别组成并组装在一起，分为刺、援、秘三部分；河北蒿城商代中期遗址发现最早的青铜戟；西周开始将戈和矛连结一体铸成，用于周王朝军事战争。来源称执青铜戟的士兵往往由贵族担任，因此戟的数量不多，与戈、矛相比使用非常有限，有时也将戈作为仪仗礼节时的器物使用。第三章另记春秋战国戟的形制与战例：车戟长度一般为身高的一倍，是车兵常规长兵器；青铜戟常先分别铸成矛","path":"terms/ji-halberd.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"戟是 B 维度下商周至战国戈矛复合兵器的条目，其贵族使用与仪仗用途见来源论述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jia-ji","title":"假髻（Jiaji (False Chignon)）","name_en":"Jiaji (False Chignon)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","妇女","头饰","发式","假髻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"headwear","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"假髻是魏晋南北朝妇女在多种发式之外普遍使用的头饰，来源将其视为改变头发造型、推动女性头饰变化的重要方式（L3622、L3627）。相关文字在 L3622 起句后被图 5-25 图注隔断，L3627 续接，本条分别引录并以「」标示拼合，不作连续引文。来源又引《北齐书·帝纪第八》描述髻的危邪之状与流行范围，并记假髻对后世的影响。来源未载假髻的材质、制法、尺寸、使用者身份差异与出土实物，图版未核，不据图","path":"terms/jia-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"假髻是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝妇女头饰与发式造型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jia-ting-shou-gong-ye","title":"家庭手工业（Household Handicraft）","name_en":"Household Handicraft","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦至清","家庭手工业","家庭作坊","男耕女织","自然经济"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"production_organization","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"家庭手工业是与农业结合、以家庭为生产单位、产品基本自给的手工业形态。李立新称它是最基本的层次、最古老的造物组织形式，也是中国传统造物的主要存在形态；家庭既是生产制作单位与造物场所，有时又是物品交换的地方，这种家庭作坊与农业紧密结合，是“男耕女织”的持续表现。来源又指出家庭作坊不能从农业生产中分离，家庭分工因此不能成为社会分工，技术水平和劳动生产率难以提高；而官营、民营手工业的一般技术与特殊技巧几乎","path":"terms/jia-ting-shou-gong-ye.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度中国传统造物生产组织的基层条目，其家庭技术与副业生产属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jia-vessel","title":"斝（Jia (Jia Wine Warmer)）","name_en":"Jia Wine Warmer","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","温酒器","五爵","锥足","祭祀"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"斝是青铜温酒器，形制除无流无尾外与爵基本相同。2016 册记其在殷商时是祭祀时盛酒洒地的礼器，容量比爵大，早期陶制，商早期始有铜铸，为锥足平底，殷商时平底向下凸出，西周后绝迹。","path":"terms/jia-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜温酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiaban","title":"夹板（Book Pressing Boards）","name_en":"Book Pressing Boards","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","书籍保护","楠木","丝带","装帧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_press","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夹板是用楠木、梓木或枣木等木料制成的与书籍大小相同的两片薄板。赵农记夹板上下各镂刻两个条孔，条孔之间有带槽，以便用丝带穿孔包扎保护书籍。来源未给尺寸、板厚与使用范围。","path":"terms/jiaban.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"夹板是 C 维度下明清书籍保护装具的条目；其木作工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiading-school","title":"嘉定派（Jiading School）","name_en":"Jiading School","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","嘉定","竹雕","嘉定三朱","深刻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"style_school","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"嘉定派是明代嘉定地区以深刻及透雕见长的竹雕流派。来源记嘉定从事竹雕的艺人很多，是我国的竹雕之乡；万历时朱鹤字松邻、朱小松字清父、朱三松字稚征，作品闻名一世，被称为嘉定三朱；同一风格的秦一爵、沈大生等又统称嘉定派。来源未给嘉定派的师承谱系、作品清单与技法细节。","path":"terms/jiading-school.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代竹雕流派的术语条目，深刻透雕的造型效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiaer-guan","title":"夹耳罐（Jia'er Jar）","name_en":"Jia'er Jar","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","瓷器","夹耳罐","青瓷","水器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夹耳罐是宋代青瓷系的民间水器。赵农记其直口有盖，圆肩深腹，肩部有两组系口，一组为单口，一组为双口，盖上连有两片带孔的瓷片，可以固定罐盖，起到合缝严密的作用。来源未给罐的高度、腹径、容量、窑口与制作工序。","path":"terms/jiaer-guan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"夹耳罐是 B 维度下宋代青瓷水器的条目，材料限于器形与盖系结构。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jian-basin","title":"鉴（Jian (Jian Basin)）","name_en":"Jian Basin","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","水器","盛水","圆鉴","方鉴"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鉴是青铜盛水器，形体较大，有圆和方两种形式。2016 册把鉴列为水器之首，并在缶器条以曾侯乙铜鉴缶作为战国鉴缶实例。","path":"terms/jian-basin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜水器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jian-qun","title":"裥裙（Jian Qun (Pleated Panel Skirt)）","name_en":"Jian Qun (Pleated Panel Skirt)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["南北朝","女裙","裥裙","多幅","间色"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"裥裙是南北朝时兴的女裙。2009 册记其为多幅，由两种以上颜色的纱罗或布帛条片拼成，长裾高腰，色彩华丽。来源把裥裙与百褶裙（羊肠裙）并记于同一段，二者时代与结构不同：百褶裙为西北民族女服，汉末传入中原，窄瘦而皱褶卷曲；裥裙则为南北朝时兴的多幅拼色裙。\n\n源文该段前的标题作“铜镜”，与所述裙装内容不符，疑为版式误植；本条照录来源内容，不据标题把裥裙归入铜镜。","path":"terms/jian-qun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"裥裙是 B 维度下南北朝女裙形制的条目，其色彩与拼幅设计同属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jian-sword","title":"青铜剑（Bronze Sword）","name_en":"Bronze Sword","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","西周","青铜兵器","柳叶形剑","蚩尤"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜剑是商周时期的一种短兵器。赵农记剑分剑身与剑柄两部分，剑身是锋、刃、脊、从，剑柄是格、茎、箍、首；相传蚩尤为炎帝之后的南方部落首领，有“战神”之誉，造剑之说归于蚩尤。商晚期北方草原游牧民族已使用青铜短剑，西周时期剑器在黄河长江地区流行并有多样造型；陕西长安沣镐遗址西周墓出土柳叶形剑，剑体前窄后宽、无剑格是这一时期的特点。商周剑体长度一般不超过30厘米，仅作防卫性武器，车战条件下短剑只在近身搏斗","path":"terms/jian-sword.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜剑是 B 维度下商周短兵器的条目，其形制与使用场景见来源论述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jianben","title":"监本（Jianben (Imperial College Edition)）","name_en":"Jianben (Imperial College Edition)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["五代","宋代","国子监","监本","雕版印刷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"edition_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"监本是指五代时期由国子监校勘的儒家经典印本，是《九经》印制本的俗称。赵农记五代唐、晋、汉、周连续22年印制《九经》，由国子监校勘，俗称“监本”；此后官方印刷和私人印刷书籍越来越多。来源只给监本的由来与一条印本实例，未给监本的版本特征、校勘流程与历代监本差异。","path":"terms/jianben.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"监本是 C 维度下五代官方印本类型的条目；其国子监校勘制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiance-bamboo-slip-books","title":"简策（Bamboo Slip Books (Jiance)）","name_en":"Bamboo Slip Books (Jiance)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","书籍","竹简","木简","韦编三绝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"writing_medium","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"简策是春秋战国时期书籍的两种主要形式之一，用细竹条或细木条编穿而成。赵农记一条竹木条为一简，若干简合编起来就是策或册，上下册的“册”字即源于此；编册一般用麻、丝、皮绳子，孔子“韦编三绝”的“韦”原意是熟皮绳。来源把简策与版牍并列为当时的书籍形式。","path":"terms/jiance-bamboo-slip-books.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"简策是 B 维度下先秦书籍形制的条目，竹木条编穿与麻丝皮绳编册属造物层。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiang-jun-kui","title":"将军盔（General's Helmet Crucible）","name_en":"General's Helmet Crucible","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","青铜铸造","坩埚","熔铜","将军盔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"crucible","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"将军盔是商代熔铜坩埚的俗称，因形状特点得名。田自秉记将铜锡放入坩埚精炼后倒入范模浇铸；每个坩埚只能熔铜十多斤，一件大铜器往往要几十个同时熔铸。司母戊鼎铸造需同时用 100 多个将军盔熔化铜液。来源未给坩埚材质、尺寸与容量实测数据。","path":"terms/jiang-jun-kui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"将军盔是 B 维度下商代青铜铸造工具的术语条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jianghu","title":"匠户（Jianghu (Artisan Household)）","name_en":"Jianghu (Artisan Household)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","明代","匠籍","世袭","系官人匠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_system","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"匠户是元代对军匠、系官人匠等工匠的统称，身份世袭，子孙不能脱籍、婚嫁不得自由。元政府将被俘工匠分配给政府和贵族使用，制造兵器者编为“军匠”，有其他技艺者为“系官人匠”或“官匠”；《元典章》载系官诸色正匠免差，实际是一种工奴。明代改称匠籍，工匠须按规定时间轮班赴京服役，比元代有较多自由：服役有定时，非服役时期可以自由从事自己的手工艺职业。田自秉把明代工匠分为轮班、存留、住坐三类；嘉靖时期改为征银，官","path":"terms/jianghu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"匠户／匠籍是 D 维度下元明工匠户籍与官营手工业制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiangnan-minju","title":"江南民居（Jiangnan Dwelling）","name_en":"Jiangnan Dwelling","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","民居","江南","天井式","三合院"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regional_dwelling","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"江南民居是北宋末年北方士人南渡后，将中原院落文化带入江南并综合地理因素形成的民居样式。赵农记其包括天井式院落、三合院式院落和园林式院落：天井式以四周楼房环绕天井，屋顶雨水流入天井，有“四水归堂”之说；三合院式是浙江中部十三间头，上房正屋三间、左右各五间厢房；园林式是江浙一带带花园或依附园林的院落。来源未给各类院落的尺寸、构造与实例。","path":"terms/jiangnan-minju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"江南民居是 B 维度下江南地域民居的条目；其宗族居住与地域社会归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiangnan-yuanlin","title":"江南园林（Jiangnan Gardens）","name_en":"Jiangnan Gardens","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","私家园林","江南","文人","借景"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden_tradition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"江南园林是赵农对明清江南私家园林整体的称谓。来源把其兴盛归为两个原因：个人经济富裕带来生活水平与文化意识提高，为营造提供经济保证与智慧支持；个人意志拓展与国家政权专制冲突，使不少文人选择独善其身，有时间营造私园。来源列举苏州拙政园、留园、狮子林、网师园、沧浪亭、环秀山庄、退思园、艺圃，扬州个园、寄啸山庄、片石山房，无锡寄畅园、上海豫园、杭州西湖郭庄等。江南园林融住宅与娱乐功能于一体，寄托造园者的人","path":"terms/jiangnan-yuanlin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"江南园林是 B 维度下明清江南私家园林传统的总称条目；其官宦巨商退养的社会背景兼及 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiangren-yingguo","title":"匠人营国（Jiangren Yingguo / Capital Planning Doctrine）","name_en":"Jiangren Yingguo","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","考工记","都城规划","礼制","营造制度"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"planning_doctrine","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"匠人营国是《考工记》中关于都城营建的核心条文，字面为“匠人营建都城”。三册的用法有两层：夏燕靖 2016 的知识链接把“匠人营国”释为“建造都城的营建师”，即指人；夏燕靖 2009 与 2016 正文、赵农则把它作为一套都城规划制度来引述，即指营建规范。三册都引“方九里，旁三门，国中九经九纬，经涂九轨，左祖右社，面朝后市，市朝一夫”，并以道路宽度、居住尺度、奇数与“九”解释其等级秩序。本 KU 兼","path":"terms/jiangren-yingguo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"匠人营国是 B 维度下都城营造制度与空间秩序的术语锚点；其礼制等级、道路分级与王城—诸侯城尺度关系属 D。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jianqi","title":"箭器（Arrow Equipment）","name_en":"Arrow Equipment","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器晚期","新石器时期","弓箭","箭镞","箭杆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"箭器是赵农在第一章“箭器”一节中论述的复合武器系统，来源称它是一种半机械性的并具有特殊杀伤力的武器，分为箭头（镞）、箭身（杆）、羽、栝、弓、弦几部分：杆多为木、竹或藤质，羽在箭杆尾部既作装饰又稳定飞行，栝安置在箭杆底部以备开弓瞄准时扣弦。来源记1963年山西朔县出土的石箭头被考古学证明是距今约28945年前的箭镞，应是中国境内最早的弓箭武器遗存；骨镞在新石器时期遗址中出土较多，箭头已有双翼、扁叶、","path":"terms/jianqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"箭器是 B 维度下旧石器晚期至新石器时期的复合武器系统，其由近及远的设计思维属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jianxinghu","title":"茧形壶（Cocoon-Shaped Jar）","name_en":"Cocoon-Shaped Jar","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦代","陶器","茧形","曲线","比例"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"茧形壶是秦代具有特殊风格的陶器品种，器形作蚕茧状。来源称其在曲线运用、宽高比例与收敛外张的处理上别具特色，造型优美。","path":"terms/jianxinghu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"茧形壶是 B 维度下秦代陶器形制的术语条目；曲线与比例的形式分析归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jianzhi","title":"剪纸（Papercut）","name_en":"Papercut","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东晋","窗花","镂金剪彩","民间工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"folk_craft","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"剪纸是先剪彩、后称窗花的民间剪刻艺术，起源于东晋的民间礼佛活动，即在佛陀涅槃日剪出通草花祭献佛陀。南北朝时期剪纸风行，荆楚一带有“镂金剪彩”的习俗；唐代立春用丝织品剪出春幡和首饰，后来改丝织品剪彩为剪纸。","path":"terms/jianzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"剪纸是 B 维度下民间剪刻工艺的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiao-vessel","title":"角（Jiao (Jiao Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Jiao Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","饮酒器","温酒器","五爵","兽角"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"角是青铜饮酒器，又作温酒用，为五爵中的配器。2016 册记其形制为无柱无流、口沿前后有对称的两尾，其余与爵相似；最初的角以兽角制成，殷商始有铜铸但发现很少，西周后期绝迹。","path":"terms/jiao-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜饮酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiao-zhi","title":"椒纸（Pepper-Treated Paper）","name_en":"Pepper-Treated Paper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","造纸","椒纸","防蛀","建阳"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"treated_paper","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"椒纸是宋代出现的防蛀纸张。赵农记其用胡椒、花椒、辣椒的汁剂调和染纸，防止蛀虫；这种椒纸产于福建建阳，因为此地书坊云集、盛产椒料，人们便利用其天然材质保护图书。来源把椒纸的产地与书坊聚落直接联系，未给椒液配比、染纸工序与防蛀效果的检验记录。","path":"terms/jiao-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"椒纸是 B 维度下宋代防蛀加工纸的条目；其与建阳书坊聚落的关系归 C、D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiaoche","title":"搅车（Cotton Gin (Jiaoche)）","name_en":"Cotton Gin (Jiaoche)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","纺织","棉纺","搅车","黄道婆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"搅车是轧除棉籽的器具。赵农记宋末元初从西域引进的棉花种植进入中原、流播江南，但人们对棉花纺织机械技术的探索还处在初级阶段；黄道婆、王祯、薛景石等人对纺织机械和工具加以改进，研制运用搅车、弹弓、纺车、经架、水力大纺车、织机、布机等；搅车是黄道婆以海南岛黎族纺织的踏车为基础改进的一种轧棉籽器具，《王祯农书》有所记载，并引“凡木棉虽多，今用此法，即去籽得棉，不致积滞”。来源未给搅车的尺寸、材质与效率数值","path":"terms/jiaoche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"搅车是 B 维度下元代棉纺工具的条目；其与黄道婆、王祯等官民技术推广的关系归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiaota-tizong-xiezhi-ji","title":"脚踏提综斜织机（Jiaota Tizong Xiezhi Ji (Treadle Pattern-Lifting Slant Loom)）","name_en":"Jiaota Tizong Xiezhi Ji (Treadle Pattern-Lifting Slant Loom)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","秦汉","斜织机","脚踏提综","慈母投杼图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"以脚踏提综、双手引纬打纬的斜式织机。2016 册以江苏泗洪曹庄出土汉代画像石《慈母投杼图》为图像证据，记图中织工用脚踏一长一短两块踏板（杆）分别带动综线；据史籍记载，从战国开始直至秦汉之际，这种织机在黄河流域广大地区已比较普遍地使用。同册秦汉段又记布机已广泛使用脚踏提综斜织机，大大提高织布速度和质量；秦汉之际长江流域和黄河流域已普遍采用，效率比腰机高 10 倍以上。","path":"terms/jiaota-tizong-xiezhi-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下织造设备的条目，其织物产品归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiaotai","title":"绞胎（Jiaotai (Marbled Clay)）","name_en":"Jiaotai (Marbled Clay)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","绞胎","绞釉","寿州窑","斑纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绞胎是用两种不同色的胎土或釉互相绞合，使器表产生木纹、虎皮状斑纹的陶瓷技法。田自秉记其多发现于河南、陕西，常见碗、盘、碟等小件，并称绞胎是寿州窑的创造；另一处又说绞釉和绞胎出产在寿州，用几种色釉或色泥搅拌成纹理斑驳的自然线纹。两处对创造与出产的措辞不同，条目并录。","path":"terms/jiaotai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"绞胎是 B 维度下唐代陶瓷胎装饰技法的条目，只记来源所给的定义、器类与寿州窑判断。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiaotong-biaozhi","title":"交通标志（traffic sign）","name_en":"traffic sign","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","城市交通","公共标识","交通标志"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"signage_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"交通标志是城市道路中指示通行规则的公共标识系统。赵农称明确的道路交通标志是现代城市生活的需要，并举红绿灯、斑马线、停车标志、站牌与城市交通图。来源未给标志图形标准、设置规范与颁布年代。","path":"terms/jiaotong-biaozhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"交通标志是 C 维度下公共标识系统的条目；其城市管理与制度属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiaoxie","title":"绞缬（Jiaoxie (Tie-Resist Dyeing)）","name_en":"Jiaoxie (Tie-Resist Dyeing)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["防染","扎结","晕色","鹿胎缬","鱼子缬"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绞缬又称“撮缬”“撮晕缬”，民间又称“撮花”，是我国古代纺织品的一种“防染法”染花工艺：按花纹用针线缝扎或直接捆扎，抽紧使织物皱拢，染色时折叠处不易上染，形成晕色效果。魏晋南北朝应用广泛，花纹疏大者有鹿胎缬、玛瑙缬，细密者有鱼子缬等。","path":"terms/jiaoxie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"绞缬是 B 维度下防染印花技术的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiaoyi","title":"交椅（Folding Chair）","name_en":"Folding Chair","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","家具","交椅","圈椅","太师椅"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"交椅是宋代以后的坐具之一。赵农记椅子是宋代以后的主要坐器，除高背椅之外还有交椅；交椅按有无扶手分为两类，其中带扶手的交椅成为圈椅的形状，即搭脑和扶手相连，成为“太师椅”的基本造型。来源未给交椅的尺寸、材料、折叠结构、使用场合与图像实例。","path":"terms/jiaoyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"交椅是 B 维度下宋代坐具的条目，材料限于分类与圈椅造型关系。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiaozi-litter","title":"轿子（Sedan Chair）","name_en":"Sedan Chair","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","交通工具","轿子","高足椅","轿杠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"transport","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"轿子是宋代逐渐成为载人运输工具的坐具。赵农记宋代人对轿子的重视使轿子逐渐成为载人运输工具；由于高足椅的普及，轿子的高度提高，轿杠被固定在轿身的中部，轿身用布料围遮，左右设小窗，前面开轿门，轿顶呈帽盖状，这种形式成为后来轿子的基本固定结构。来源未给轿子的尺寸、抬夫人数、等级规定与制作材料。","path":"terms/jiaozi-litter.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"轿子是 B 维度下宋代载人交通工具的条目；其等级与使用制度归 D 维度，来源未展开。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiaxie","title":"夹缬（Jiaxie (Clamp-Resist Dyeing)）","name_en":"Jiaxie (Clamp-Resist Dyeing)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["镂空版","防染印花","秦汉","唐代","宋代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夹缬是我国一种古老的镂空型版双面防染印花技术：将织物夹持于两块镂空版之间紧固，于镂空处涂刷或注入色浆，解开型版花纹即现；涂防白浆则染色后搓去白浆得色底白花。源流分层：2016 称历史可上溯东汉，唐代趋于成熟；高丰引《事物纪原》转引《二仪实录》称“秦汉间已有之，陈梁间贵贱通服之”，并记盛唐时流行于宫廷；田自秉记隋开皇六年（586）吐鲁番已有夹缬，盛唐极流行。宋代朝廷指定复色夹缬为宫室专用，洛阳染工李","path":"terms/jiaxie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"夹缬是 B 维度下防染印花技术的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiayong-xiao-gongju","title":"家用小工具（Household Hand Tools）","name_en":"Household Hand Tools","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["现代","家庭工具","手工具","维修","日常生活"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_set","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"家用小工具是家庭为解决日常琐碎问题而常备的手工具。赵农列举榔头、手钳、改锥、手锯、剪刀、针线、锥子、刀子、钉子、镊子、多角扳手、管钳、试电笔、压线钳等。来源未给各类工具的形制、材料、产地与设计者。","path":"terms/jiayong-xiao-gongju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"家用小工具是 B 维度下家庭手工具组合的条目；来源只作清单列举，未及制度或机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiazi-chuang","title":"架子床（Canopy Bed）","name_en":"Canopy Bed","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","家具","床","帐","私密性"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bed_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"架子床是明式家具中床与帐密切结合的床型。赵农记明式家具的床在制形上趋于封闭，完全成为私密性空间；架子床以床上带顶的高架为特点，四足承床，床围三面利用木剩料作装饰性设计，使纹饰和功能融为一体；南方棕藤床与北方木板床在制式上大同小异，木料材质差异很大。来源未给尺寸、构件名称与帐的材料。","path":"terms/jiazi-chuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"架子床是 B 维度下明式卧具类型的条目；当前只到 Dimension。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jie-gu","title":"羯鼓（Jiegu (Hourglass Drum)）","name_en":"Jiegu (Hourglass Drum)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["南北朝","乐器","打击乐器","西域","两杖"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"羯鼓是南北朝时期从西域传入中原的打击乐器，来源称其“如桶置于架上，以两杖击之”（L3910）。来源又把羯鼓列入魏晋新见并广为流行的乐器群（L3872）。来源未载鼓身尺寸、鼓皮材质、两杖形制与图像，图版未核；本条不补唐玄宗羯鼓等来源外内容。证据只有形制与流传两句，confidence 定 low。","path":"terms/jie-gu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"羯鼓是 B 维度下南北朝西域传入打击乐器的乐器条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jie-ke-xian-xiang","title":"借壳现象（Skeuomorphism (Jie Ke Xian Xiang)）","name_en":"Skeuomorphism (Jie Ke Xian Xiang)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["造物延续","skeuomorphism","模仿遗留赘物","新材料","造型延续"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"借壳现象是新造物在最初阶段延续旧有物品造型形式的造物延续现象，李立新引现代人类学家的命名，并注为“模仿遗留赘物 skeuomorphism”。它不完全是替代，只延续外形形式，旧有物品仍继续发展。来源以玉器延续石器、陶器延续编织容器与木石器、丝绸延续麻织物、瓷器延续陶器，以及瓷器模仿金银器、陶器模仿青铜器、汽车模仿木制马车、金属椅模仿木椅、塑料制品模仿桶盆勺瓶碗等为例。来源未给该概念的提出者、提出年","path":"terms/jie-ke-xian-xiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度造物延续机制的概念条目，其命名与理论来源属 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jieduanxing-tupo-tuijin","title":"阶段性突破推进（Stage-by-Stage Breakthrough Advancement）","name_en":"Stage-by-Stage Breakthrough Advancement","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["设计史观","设计史运行理论","张道一","代序"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_history_theory","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“阶段性突破推进”是张道一在代序中概括李立新《中国设计艺术史论》提出的设计史运行理论。代序只点出理论名称与评价，未展开其内容；本书上编以汉魏之际、宋元之间为两个大转折，将设计史划为三个时段，可视为该理论在分期上的落实，但来源未在这两处之间建立明确指称关系。","path":"terms/jieduanxing-tupo-tuijin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史运行理论的条目，分期涉及 D 维度的学科史背景。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiegou-well-sweep","title":"桔槔（Well Sweep）","name_en":"Well Sweep","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","汲水器具","杠杆","灌溉","守城"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"桔槔是赵农第三章“工具”一节所述的汲水器具，来源引“引之则俯，舍之则仰”说明其起落动作（L1998）。来源记其构造为井旁立木架、架上系横木，横木一端水桶、一端重物，使用时一升一落，省力而提速（L1998-L2002）。来源还说《墨子》中桔槔是守城必备的战斗武器（L2002）。","path":"terms/jiegou-well-sweep.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"桔槔是 B 维度下春秋战国汲水器具的条目，属于杠杆原理在提水与灌溉上的应用。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jifang","title":"机房（Jifang (Weaving Workshop)）","name_en":"Jifang (Weaving Workshop)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","江南","苏州","杭州","丝织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"workshop_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"机房是明中后期江南苏州、杭州等地丝织业中出现的手工工场，采取「机房出资、机工出力」的生产方式。2016 册在明中晚经济状况段记：手工业发达、商品经济活跃、白银成为普遍流通货币之后，苏杭丝织业出现带有手工工场性质的机房，来源称其「可谓是资本主义雇佣剥削的生产关系萌芽」。","path":"terms/jifang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"机房是 D 维度下明中后期江南丝织生产组织的条目，其织造技术与产品属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiguang-hu","title":"鸡冠壶（Chicken-Crest Ewer）","name_en":"Chicken-Crest Ewer","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","契丹","瓷器","皮囊壶","马背生活"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鸡冠壶是辽代瓷器中最具契丹族特征的壶式，仿皮囊壶而制，上部有孔式或提梁式。五册来源有直接记载（李立新一册无“鸡冠壶”字样）。来源对名称的合理性、器形分类的层级两处不一致：高丰认为“鸡冠壶”之名并不贴切、只是 20 世纪 30 年代以来的习惯提法，田自秉则按鸡冠形有孔大鼻直接释名；高丰分两大类型，田自秉分五种式样。本 KU 并列。","path":"terms/jiguang-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鸡冠壶是 B 维度下辽代瓷器的代表性器形，其皮囊原型、马背功能与定居化改造属 E 维度的跨文化互动。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jili-guche","title":"记里鼓车（Odometer Chariot）","name_en":"Odometer Chariot","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","宋代","制车","机械设计","计程装置"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"记里鼓车是汉代以后按里程自动击鼓计程的机械车，又名记道车、大章车。五册的分工比同批的指南车条更散：**夏燕靖两版给定义、齿轮组原理与“里程表、减速器先驱”的判断**，**高丰给凸轮杠杆的实现方式与李约瑟的评断（附书名、版次、页码）**，**赵农给《晋书·舆服志》引文与宋代改进**，**李立新给“与现代计程表完全相同”的判断与汉代石刻的图像依据**。五册在传动方式（齿轮组／凸轮杠杆）与击打方式（鼓或","path":"terms/jili-guche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"记里鼓车是 B 维度下机械制车类型的条目：齿轮组或凸轮杠杆的传动方式、里程—击鼓的计数逻辑与历代沿革都在此汇合。“汉代官府制车业”一侧归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jin-ban","title":"金钣（Gold Plate）","name_en":"Gold Plate","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","黄金","金属货币","天然货币"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"currency","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金钣是春秋战国时期两种金属货币之一，与青铜铸币并列。赵农在 L2264 称黄金铸成的货币为“金饭”，在 L2274 又作“金钣”；并称黄金是贵重金属，便于分割和携带，因此成为固定的天然货币概念。来源未给金钣的形制、重量、含金量与出土地。","path":"terms/jin-ban.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金钣是 D 维度下春秋战国黄金货币的条目，其贵金属材料属性兼涉 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jin-cao","title":"今草（Modern Cursive Script）","name_en":"Modern Cursive Script","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","书体","草书","今草"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calligraphy_script","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"今草是草书在书体改革中由章草演变而成的独立书体。来源记其去掉章草的波磔、加强笔势转变，并称其运笔流畅飞扬、飘逸变化。来源又说《平复帖》为章草和今草之间的一种书体。来源未给今草的代表书家、作品年代与笔法分类，图版未核。本条只补今草部分，与既有章草条目的记述不冲突。","path":"terms/jin-cao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"C 维度下的书体条目，关注今草从章草演变而来的形态；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jin-cuo-dao","title":"金错刀（Jin Cuo Dao (Gold-Inlaid Knife Coin)）","name_en":"Jin Cuo Dao (Gold-Inlaid Knife Coin)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西汉","王莽","货币","错金"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"currency","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金错刀是西汉末年王莽托古改制时期以错金技术制成的刀形货币（L2641）。王莽一度废除五铢钱，代以刀、布、贝等形式，制币材料除金、铜外还大量使用银、贝、龟甲，并不断改制，造成货币流通的极大混乱（L2641）。东汉张衡《四愁诗》咏“美人赠我金错刀，何以报之英琼瑶”，金错刀钱成为礼品，有馈赠收藏价值而缺乏实用意义（L2641）。来源未给金错刀的尺寸、重量、铭文、铸行年代与存世实物。","path":"terms/jin-cuo-dao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金错刀是 D 维度下西汉末年王莽货币改制的条目，其错金工艺与刀形器式属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jin-dai-jiaochao","title":"金代交钞（Jin Dynasty Jiaochao Paper Money）","name_en":"Jin Dynasty Jiaochao Paper Money","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["金代","货币","纸币","交钞","通货膨胀"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper_money","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金代交钞是金代发行的纸币。赵农记金在南宋货币流通影响下设置交钞库、发行交钞，发行时间是贞元二年（1154），是最早在大范围正式流通的纸币；金代交钞仿制宋代交子和钱引的形状，《金史·食货志》记“交钞之制，外为阑，作花纹，其上衡书贯例，左曰‘某字料’，右曰‘某字号’。料号外，篆书曰‘伪造交钞者斩，告捕者赏钱三百贯’”；交钞发行成就了纸币流通趋势，但随着政治腐败与战争频发，通货膨胀严重、信用度越来越小；","path":"terms/jin-dai-jiaochao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金代交钞是 B 维度下金代纸币形制的条目；其发行制度、通胀与信用危机归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jin-dai-tongjin","title":"金代铜禁（Jindai Tongjin (Jin Bronze Prohibition)）","name_en":"Jindai Tongjin (Jin Bronze Prohibition)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["金代","铜禁","官营作坊","检校","上京巡警院"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"resource_prohibition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金代禁止民间铸造铜器、将民间铜器拘括入官的政策。2016 册记金代禁止民间铸造铜器，并把民间铜器拘括入官；旧有铜器除腰束带、鱼袋、神佛像等以外，必须全部卖给官府，由官营作坊铸造大批铜器。来源以黑龙江阿城出土的“童子攀枝镜”边款“上京巡警院”、另一枚“牡丹花纹镜”边款“上京宜春县”为证，判断这些器物都是在官府控制下的铸铜作坊生产并经过官府“检校”的。来源并记尽管官府铜禁甚严，民间仍私铸出许多铜器，尤","path":"terms/jin-dai-tongjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下金代铜料管制政策的条目，其铸铜工艺与器物归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jin-qi","title":"金漆（Jinqi (Gold Lacquer)）","name_en":"Jinqi (Gold Lacquer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","苏州","宁波","金漆","金漆彩绘"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_craft","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金漆是明代苏州、宁波等地著名的漆器品种，以金漆彩绘为特色。来源记宁波和苏州的金漆很有名，苏州艺人蒋回回是金漆能手，其金漆彩绘制作精湛；又记杨埙赴日本学习制作技术、仿制倭漆而称杨倭漆，作品不只是模仿而更有发展。来源未给金漆的原料、底胎、贴金或描金工序与呈色分类。","path":"terms/jin-qi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代金漆工艺的术语条目，金漆彩绘的装饰属 C 维度，杨埙赴日本学艺属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jindai-ranchou-ye","title":"近代染绸业（Jindai Ranchou Ye (Modern Silk-Dyeing Industry)）","name_en":"Jindai Ranchou Ye (Modern Silk-Dyeing Industry)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["近代","上海","染绸业","染绸工场","蒸汽锅炉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_industry","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"近代染绸业是 2016 册所记上海开埠后由手工染绸工场向机器生产过渡的行业形态。来源称上海开埠后绸庄开设日渐增多、染绸业务日益增加：1890 年上海有手工染绸工场 9 家，如从苏州迁来的张玉堂染绸坊雇工 20 多人、分工较细。1920 年后，有的染绸工场开始改用蒸汽锅炉、电动甩水机、整理机，向近代染绸厂过渡，生产效率提高 10 倍，质量也有提高；到 1928 年，上海规模较大的染绸工场都已向近代染","path":"terms/jindai-ranchou-ye.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"近代染绸业是 B 维度下近代纺织印染生产形态的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jingbian","title":"经变（Jingbian (Sutra Illustration)）","name_en":"Jingbian (Sutra Illustration)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","莫高窟","佛教艺术","经变","壁画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"buddhist_image_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"经变是来源在唐代莫高窟一节使用的佛教图像称谓，来源未给正式定义、所依经名、画面构成与年代序列。来源以经变说明唐代莫高窟艺术改变北朝画风，将秀骨清像的造型演变为丰满华丽，并在佛教活动场面中充满人间欢乐的情趣。来源又称经变故事中的净土世界呈现东土大唐社会的欢愉，菩萨、飞天、佛陀、力士几乎成为唐代社会生活的影像。本条所述限于该段语境义，不补具体经变作品名。图 6-49 敦煌壁画《乐舞图》图版未核，不据图","path":"terms/jingbian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"经变是 C 维度下佛教叙事图像类型的条目；来源所述信仰与世俗化背景属图像内容，不涉及设计史书写或史学方法，故不指派 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jingjin","title":"经锦（Warp-Faced Brocade）","name_en":"Warp-Faced Brocade","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","经线显花","三色经","马王堆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"经锦是汉代“经丝彩色显花”的锦，纬线只用一色，经线多至三色：一种作地色、一种织花纹、一种织轮廓线；同一图案、同一色彩形成直行排列。马王堆汉墓出土多种经锦；高丰记同出的绒圈锦具立体效果，被视为近代漳绒或天鹅绒前身。","path":"terms/jingjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"经锦是 B 维度下汉代提花织锦技术的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jingtai-lan","title":"景泰蓝（Cloisonné）","name_en":"Cloisonné","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["铜胎掐丝珐琅","明代","景泰","北京","掐丝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"enamelware_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"景泰蓝是明代著名金属工艺，正式学名为铜胎掐丝珐琅。“景泰蓝”一词辛亥革命前后才采用，“蓝”非专指蓝色而是“发蓝”的简称；除万历外各代几乎都有生产，以景泰年间最精。其工序涉及掐丝、点蓝，品种含盘、瓶、炉、罐等欣赏品和台灯、果盘、文具、烟具、小盒等实用品，以北京为生产中心。","path":"terms/jingtai-lan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"景泰蓝是 B 维度下金属胎掐丝珐琅工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jingtian-zhi","title":"井田制（Well-Field System）","name_en":"Well-Field System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","土地制度","农业","耒耜","犁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"land_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"井田制是西周的土地与农业组织制度。赵农称周人本是农业部落，西周的井田制对农业发展有很大影响；西周农业生产规模庞大，常常是集体性的奴隶劳作。周朝实行井田制，以人力和畜力为主要生产力，耒耜是上下运动的农具，犁是前后运动的农具，犁的出现使生产水平整体提高。","path":"terms/jingtian-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"井田制是 D 维度下西周土地与农业组织制度的条目，其农具与耕作方式属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jingxiu","title":"京绣（Jing Embroidery）","name_en":"Jing Embroidery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","北京","宫廷绣作","京绣","戳纱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"京绣是以明清两代北京皇室绣作为中心、在为宫廷制作御用绣品时逐渐发展起来的刺绣。其制品多为小品，作工精巧富丽，戳纱、贴绫、挑花、堆绒等种类无所不有；除皇室绣作外也多分布在近郊农村一带，成为一种重要副业。来源未给具体作坊、工匠名与年代。","path":"terms/jingxiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代宫廷刺绣的条目，皇室绣作与农村副业的组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jingzhe-zhuang","title":"经折装（Sutra Fold Binding）","name_en":"Sutra Fold Binding","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","书籍装帧","佛经","折子装","梵夹装"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bookbinding","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"经折装是唐代末年出现的书籍折叠装帧形式之一，又称折子装。赵农称其受卷轴装与梵夹装影响而发展起来，做法是把佛经卷折叠成一定宽度，前后用硬纸或木板夹护，并以硬纸木板裱糊成书皮，便于阅读。来源把经折装的兴起系于佛经流行，未给折数、尺寸、具体经本与存世实物，本条不补。旋风装同属唐代末年的折叠装帧，另见专门条目。","path":"terms/jingzhe-zhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"经折装是 B 维度下唐代末年佛经的折叠装帧形制，其书页展开后的文字界面归 C 维度；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jinling-school","title":"金陵派（Jinling School）","name_en":"Jinling School","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","金陵","竹雕","濮仲谦","浅刻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"style_school","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金陵派是明代以濮仲谦为代表的竹雕流派。来源记金陵派艺人著名的有濮仲谦，其作品用竹之盘根错节、以不事刀斧为奇，勾勒数刀便与凡异，风格用刀较浅、刀法简洁；故宫博物院藏有竹雕松枝小壶，是其著名作品。来源未给金陵派的其他艺人、师承谱系与作品清单。","path":"terms/jinling-school.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代竹雕流派的术语条目，浅刻与盘根错节的造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jinxi-gongyi","title":"金细工艺（Jinxi Gongyi (Fine Goldwork)）","name_en":"Jinxi Gongyi (Fine Goldwork)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","金属工艺","金细工艺","掐","累"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalwork_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金细工艺是元代金器工艺中以掐、累、镶嵌技术为尖端的部分。2016 册记元代金属工艺以金、银、铜、铁、锡为主要原料，以铸、锤、錾、刻、编、累、掐、嵌等技术制成日用器物和高级工艺美术品；贵族阶层和酒楼饭庄普遍使用金、银器，而朝廷对金器如同玉器一样控制极严，只准五品以上官员使用金、玉茶酒器。","path":"terms/jinxi-gongyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金细工艺是 B 维度下元代金器细工的条目，其五品以上用金玉茶酒器的限制属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jinyinse-yinhua-sha","title":"金银色印花纱（Gold- and Silver-Colored Printed Gauze）","name_en":"Gold- and Silver-Colored Printed Gauze","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西汉","马王堆","印花","三套版","阳纹凸版"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金银色印花纱是马王堆汉墓出土的精细印花织物，以阳纹凸版刷浆印花，用三套版分印银色龟背形骨架、银灰色主纹与金色或朱色装饰点；所谓金银色实为矿物染料效果。来源称其线条弯长细密、印纹平滑薄匀并有双面效果，是我国目前见到的最早多套版印花工艺。","path":"terms/jinyinse-yinhua-sha.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金银色印花纱是 B 维度下西汉多套版印花织物的类型条目，其骨架、主纹与装饰点的视觉分层归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jitui-tan","title":"鸡腿坛（Chicken-Leg Jar）","name_en":"Chicken-Leg Jar","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","金代","辽瓷","器形","鸡腿坛"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鸡腿坛是辽瓷中较为特殊的器形，以后一直流行到金代。来源记它体形细长、小口，并并列两种用途推测：有人认为适于装酒并易于发酵，也有人认为置于帐中少占空间并适合抱取。来源未给尺寸、容量、胎釉与具体出土实例。","path":"terms/jitui-tan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度辽金瓷器器形的条目，细长小口的造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jiuliu-shijia","title":"九流十家（Nine Schools and Ten Factions）","name_en":"Nine Schools and Ten Factions","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","诸子百家","士人","私营手工业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"school_of_thought","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"九流十家是李立新用来指称春秋战国儒、墨、道、法等思想流派的说法。他把诸子百家的产生放在社会经济结构与等级秩序变动的背景下：王室衰微、权力下移、官营手工业削弱，私营手工业获得发展，大型制造业主与巨商出现；士人游离旧有的等级秩序，带来思想与精神的自由，其知识背景与技艺修养同新格局下的政治需要结合，遂产生“九流十家”各不相同的思想流派。来源未给九流十家的名目、师承与文献出处。","path":"terms/jiuliu-shijia.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度思想流派的条目，其士人与工商业背景属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jixiang-tu-an","title":"吉祥图案（Auspicious Motifs）","name_en":"Auspicious Motifs","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["图必有意","意必吉祥","明清","象征","谐音"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"吉祥图案是以“图必有意，意必吉祥”为核心的装饰图案体系。高丰称其起源可追溯到原始社会、真正形成于汉代，经长期发展至清代达到高潮；通过象征、比拟、隐喻、谐音、寓意等手法或直接用文字传达吉祥意念，被视为中国古代富有鲜明民族特色的平面创意设计。","path":"terms/jixiang-tu-an.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"吉祥图案是 C 维度下传统装饰纹样体系的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jizuo","title":"跽坐（Jizuo (Kneeling Seated Posture)）","name_en":"Jizuo (Kneeling Seated Posture)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","战国","汉代","跽坐","跪坐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"posture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国古代两膝着地、臀部坐在小腿肚上的跪坐姿势。2016 册引《说文》《史记·范雎蔡泽列传》释“跽”，并列跽受、跽跪、跽跗、跽拜等词；以 1976 年安阳殷墟妇好墓商代跽坐玉人、1974 年三门峡上村岭战国跽坐人漆绘铜灯、汉代跽坐俑与跽坐古玉乐俑为实物例证，并判断跪坐姿势决定我国早期家具的低矮形制。来源又记“两膝相并”的正坐规范与箕踞的礼法禁忌。","path":"terms/jizuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下起居姿势与家具形制关系的条目，其礼法含义另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:juanzhou-zhuang","title":"卷轴装（Scroll Binding）","name_en":"Scroll Binding","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东汉","隋唐","书籍装帧","卷轴","敦煌藏经洞"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bookbinding","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"卷轴装是纸本书籍早期采用的卷子装形制。赵农称东汉后期出现以纸为抄本书籍，其装帧为卷子装，受韦编竹简影响；隋唐时期僧人写经与文人抄本多装潢成手卷，并开始配置卷轴。来源引欧阳修语与敦煌藏经洞文书证明卷轴书籍实物，又引《隋书·经籍志》与《旧唐书·经籍志》记轴、带、签的品第与四库配色。来源未给卷轴尺寸、具体轴头实物与敦煌卷子的编号，本条不补。","path":"terms/juanzhou-zhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"卷轴装是 B 维度下纸本书籍的装帧形制，其卷轴题签与分类标示归 C 维度；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:jue-vessel","title":"爵（Jue (Jue Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Jue Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","饮酒器","温酒器","五爵","二里头"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"爵是青铜饮酒器，也用作温酒，并作为饮酒器的总称，与斝、觚、觯、角合称五爵。2016 册记其基本形制为圆腹、前流后尾、腹侧有鋬、腹下三锥足，铜爵始见于二里头遗址，是发现最早的青铜容器。","path":"terms/jue-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜饮酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:juhua-shi","title":"菊花石（Chrysanthemum Stone）","name_en":"Chrysanthemum Stone","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","湖南","浏阳","石雕","方解石"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"菊花石是湖南浏阳的特产石料，因石质中球形放射状的集合体如菊花花朵而得名。它系一种方解石，以浏阳永和镇浏阳河一带河底石质最佳；菊花形有绣球菊、竹叶菊、蟹爪菊、金钱菊、蒲叶菊等多种。乾隆时期开始用作雕刻材料，制作笔筒、水池等文具，清末发展为花屏、桌面等家具装饰，著名艺人有欧锡潘、程维达等。","path":"terms/juhua-shi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度以石料命名的雕刻工艺条目，菊花形与文具、家具装饰的造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:junbian-zhuang","title":"军便装（Junbian Zhuang (Military-Style Civilian Suit)）","name_en":"Junbian Zhuang (Military-Style Civilian Suit)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","军便装","军便服","中山装","红卫服"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"军便装是 1949 年以后与中山装并列的男服样式，受苏联服饰影响，与中山装、连衣裙、列宁装同为当时服装首选。文化大革命时期，全民化服装由军便服改造成「红卫服」。来源未给军便装的形制、面料、配发制度与设计者。","path":"terms/junbian-zhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"军便装是 B 维度下新中国男服样式的条目；其与政治服装体制的关系属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:junmao","title":"军帽（Junmao (Military Cap)）","name_en":"Junmao (Military Cap)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["20世纪","帽饰","军帽","服饰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hat_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"战争及政治年代的主要帽式，与瓜皮帽、礼帽、鸭舌帽、贝雷帽并列。赵农称不同时期有不同帽式流行，战争及政治年代中主要是军帽。来源只给帽式名称与流行时期，未给形制、军种标识、配发制度与设计者。","path":"terms/junmao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"军帽是 B 维度下 20 世纪帽饰样式的条目；来源只作帽式列举与分期，未及制度或机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:juntian-zhi","title":"均田制（Equal-Field System）","name_en":"Equal-Field System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐初","土地制度","租庸调","经济背景"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"land_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"均田制是唐初推行的土地分配制度。田自秉只在隋唐概说中以一句带过：唐初为恢复生产，在经济上推行均田制的土地分配制度和租庸调的租赋劳役制度，并称其对经济发展起了一定的促进作用。来源未述授田对象、亩数、年限、户籍与实施范围；本条只记这一制度名称及其在工艺美术史叙述中的位置，不补制度史细节。","path":"terms/juntian-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"均田制是 D 维度下唐初土地分配制度的条目，仅作工艺美术史的经济背景；不承担制度史细节。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:juzhiji","title":"踞织机（Juzhiji (Backstrap Loom)）","name_en":"Backstrap Loom","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器","织布机","腰机","骨梭","石寨山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"踞织机是我国最早的织布机，又称腰机。2016 册记其以足抵一端、以颈套另一端使经线平直，腾出双手穿梭纬线；因席地而坐、双腿分开的踞姿得名。来源另以云南晋宁石寨山汉代铜贮贝器盖图像说明其操作方式。","path":"terms/juzhiji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下原始织布机设备的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kai-shu","title":"楷书（Regular Script）","name_en":"Regular Script","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","东汉","书体","文字设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"script","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"楷书是东汉末年出现的新型书体，来源以书法家钟繇的《宣示表》等为最早代表作。赵农记其书写已作横波顿挫，减少隶书的捺挑习惯，形成整洁简练的面貌，并认为这类书体变化对后来中华文明的传播有积极作用。来源仅一段，未给楷书名称来源、笔画体系与传承谱系，图版未核。","path":"terms/kai-shu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"C 维度下的书体术语条目，关注楷书形成初期与隶书笔法的关系；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kaiguang-fa","title":"开光法（Cartouche Method）","name_en":"Cartouche Method","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["装饰手法","彩陶","马家窑型","旋涡纹","开光法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_method","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"开光法是装饰艺术中用一定轮廓外形划分装饰面、突出主体的传统手法。田自秉记其特点是能突出主体、增加层次，最早见于马家窑型彩陶：在陶罐肩部用旋涡纹开光，中间饰蛙纹；半山型旋涡纹实际也是一种开光法，演变到马厂型成为四大圈纹，圈内填几何纹达两百余种。","path":"terms/kaiguang-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"开光法是 C 维度下装饰构图方法的术语条目；其彩陶载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kaipian","title":"开片（Crackle Glaze）","name_en":"Crackle Glaze","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","哥窑","汝窑","金丝铁线","缺陷转化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"开片是瓷器釉面裂纹，因釉与胎的收缩率不同而在冷却过程中形成。最先原是烧制缺陷，因纹理具有特殊效果，以后人为地使它形成自然装饰。哥窑按开片形状大小命名鱼子纹、蟹爪纹、百圾碎，并有“金丝铁线”之称；汝窑釉面也有冰裂纹。","path":"terms/kaipian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"开片是 B 维度下陶瓷釉面装饰与缺陷转化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kaiyuan-tongbao","title":"开元通宝（Kaiyuan Tongbao）","name_en":"Kaiyuan Tongbao","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","货币","钱币","武德","圆形方孔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"coinage","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"开元通宝是唐高祖武德四年（公元 621 年）废除五铢钱后铸造的新币。来源解释其名义为新世开元、流通宝货，并记其以一枚为一钱、十枚为一两，废除铢制，改为厘、分、钱、两的十进位计算，使钱成为固定的重量单位。来源又称通宝钱币以朝代年号为文字标志，仍为圆形方孔制，从唐至清末共流通 1290 年。来源未载钱径、重量、铸局、版别、钱文书法、出土与收藏信息；图 6-36 标注为唐开元通宝，图版未核，不据图补写钱","path":"terms/kaiyuan-tongbao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"开元通宝是 D 维度唐代币制与流通的条目，钱币铸造与计重方式属 B 维度，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kesi","title":"缂丝（Kesi）","name_en":"Kesi","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","丝织","通经断纬","定州"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"缂丝是以生丝作经、各色熟丝作纬，采用“通经断纬”织法织造的丝织品。因纬丝在图案边界处断开、形成细密裂痕，迎光看去如雕镂之像，故又称刻丝、克丝。五册来源都以宋代为缂丝的成熟与鼎盛期，并记其多用于摹织名人书画。","path":"terms/kesi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"缂丝是 B 维度下丝织工艺的术语锚点，其以书画为蓝本的生产方式也涉及 C 维度的图像转译问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kong-hou","title":"箜篌（Konghou (Harp)）","name_en":"Konghou (Harp)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","魏晋南北朝","乐器","卧箜篌","竖箜篌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"箜篌是汉代乐器，来源称其最初为横弹的“卧箜篌”，亦称箜篌瑟；竖箜篌大约在公元2世纪从朝鲜传到中原，汉乐府《箜篌引》诗句叙述了有关箜篌的故事（L3870）。魏晋乐器群中仍有卧箜篌（L3872）。秦汉乐器群中已见箜篌（L3850）。来源未载弦数、尺寸、音箱形制、演奏图像与实物，图版未核。来源关于竖箜篌自朝鲜传入的说法照录，不改为西域。","path":"terms/kong-hou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"箜篌是 B 维度下汉代至魏晋卧箜篌与竖箜篌的乐器条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kouqi","title":"扣器（Kouqi Lacquerware）","name_en":"Kouqi Lacquerware","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["漆器","战国","金属附件","铜箍","胎骨"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"扣器是战国漆器中以金属附件加固器身的一类。高丰的定义最宽：\"在卷木胎的和夹纻胎的漆器上加以金属口及铺首、合页、盖纽、足等金属附件……使用这种金属附件的漆器，称之为扣器\"，并把它定为\"战国漆器的一个特色\"。夏燕靖两版的定义较窄：战国末期出现，\"在器物口沿、底、腹部镶套铜箍（扣）以加固器身\"，耳、钮、足等附件用金属制作后再用漆胶住。两义不是互相否定，而是总类与典型形制的关系；本 KU 并列，不合并为单","path":"terms/kouqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"扣器是 B 维度下战国至汉代漆器的加固与装饰类型条目；金属附件的功能与工艺属 B，铺首等附件的图像含义牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ku","title":"裤（Ku (Trousers)）","name_en":"Ku (Trousers)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉魏","服饰","裤","合裆","坐姿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"裤是来源所记保护腿部、并改变「上衣下裳」旧制的下身服饰。来源在「裙裤」小标题下称裤改变了以前着衣的上衣下裳，形成上衣下裤的衣式，并称这与北方游牧民族马背生活习俗有关。来源又记裤式因袍、衫长短而裆部缝合情况不同。来源在坐具一节称汉魏以后裤裆合缝、裤代替裳，坐姿才随意自由。来源未给裤的裁片、尺寸与出土实例，图版未核。","path":"terms/ku.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的服饰形制条目，记录裤替代裳的过程与坐姿变化；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kuduan","title":"库缎（Kuduan (Self-Colored Satin)）","name_en":"Kuduan (Self-Colored Satin)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","锦缎","库缎","摹本缎","本色花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"库缎是明代锦缎三大类中的“本色花”，通称库缎，又称摹本缎：在缎地上起本色花，依织纹组织变化分亮花、暗花两种。2016 册把明代丝织品种分为妆花、本色花（库缎）与织金银三类，本条只记本色花一类。","path":"terms/kuduan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"库缎是 B 维度下明代锦缎品种的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kui-wen","title":"夔纹（Kui Motif）","name_en":"Kui Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","青铜器","怪兽纹","夔","纹样"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夔纹是商代铜器常见的近似龙纹的怪兽纹。田自秉记其或以两夔相对组成饕餮纹、或仅作饕餮附饰，通常只作侧面描写；《庄子》《山海经》《说文》均释夔为一足神兽，来源认为实为古代爬虫类动物，侧面描写使四足表现为两足、两足表现为一足。变化形象有两头夔纹、蕉叶夔纹、三角夔纹、蟠夔纹等。","path":"terms/kui-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"夔纹是 C 维度下商代青铜装饰纹样的术语条目；其青铜器载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kuilei-xi","title":"傀儡戏（Puppetry）","name_en":"Puppetry","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","傀儡戏","木偶戏","悬丝傀儡","杖头傀儡"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"performing_art","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"傀儡戏即后来的木偶戏。赵农记作偶以戏最早见于《列子·汤问》，其中有巧匠偃师为周穆王表演能歌善舞的木偶人的记载：“窥其颐，则歌合律；捧其手，则舞应节，千变万化，惟意所适”；木偶相传源于汉代从宫廷娱乐成为民间表演艺术；宋代木偶戏最盛、种类最多，据《东京梦华录》《都城纪胜》《武林旧事》《梦梁录》等记载，已有悬丝傀儡、走线傀儡、杖头傀儡、药发傀儡、肉傀儡、水傀儡等。","path":"terms/kuilei-xi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"傀儡戏是 C 维度下木偶表演艺术的条目，材料限于文献记载、宋代种类与演出内容。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kuluzhen","title":"库路真（Kuluzhen (Lacquerware)）","name_en":"Kuluzhen (Lacquerware)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","漆器","襄州","襄样","鲜卑语"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"库路真一词见于《新唐书·地理志》，是唐代襄州所贡漆器的名称，来源称其系鲜卑语。志文记襄州土贡漆器库路真二十品乘、花文五乘；唐代襄州库路真漆器闻名全国，被称“天下以为法”，并称为“襄样”。来源未给器形、胎骨、纹样、工序与实物，也未把它归入平脱等具体技法。","path":"terms/kuluzhen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代漆器类型的条目，作为襄州土贡与地方名产属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:kunfa","title":"髡发（Shaved-Forelock Hairstyle）","name_en":"Shaved-Forelock Hairstyle","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","契丹","金代","发式","髡发"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hairstyle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"髡发是契丹民族剃剪部分头发的风俗。赵农记契丹民族以佩带耳环为主要头饰，并有髡发的风俗，引沈括语“其人剪发，妥其两髦”；作者判断这一习惯究其根本还是游牧民族因骑马射猎、为获得视线便利而剪去前额头发所形成的风俗。同册记金人发式为辫式，头顶留发而前额、耳后、后颈的头发剪去。来源未给剃发范围的分类、辫式细部、男女差别与图像比对。","path":"terms/kunfa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"髡发是 B 维度下契丹发式风俗的条目；其与金人辫式的族别差异归 E 维度观察。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:langhong","title":"郎红（Lang Hong (Lang Family Red Glaze)）","name_en":"Lang Hong (Lang Family Red Glaze)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","康熙","红釉","郎廷极","宝石红"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_glaze","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"郎红是康熙时期红釉瓷的称法。来源记康熙陶瓷从釉色说以红釉为最著，又称宝石红；因当时曾由郎廷极督造，故又有郎红之称，但来源同时认为这一命名并不妥当。呈色特点是红釉鲜艳而挂不住口，口缘部分红釉下淌，呈现淡青色。来源未给郎红的配方、烧成温度、窑址与存世器物。","path":"terms/langhong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代康熙红釉的称名条目，挂口与口缘淡青的呈色效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lanran-gongyi","title":"蓝染工艺（Lanran Gongyi (Indigo Resist Dyeing)）","name_en":"Lanran Gongyi (Indigo Resist Dyeing)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","印染","蓝染","夹缬","蜡防"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蓝染工艺是 2016 册所记元代民间沿用的印染方法：「以蓝染布为斑，其纹极细」。做法是以两片木板镂成细孔夹布，把熔蜡灌入镂孔，释板取布投入蓝靛中，布受蓝后再煮布去蜡，遂成极细斑花。来源判断此法源自唐代夹缬，只是元代把丝绢换成了棉布。","path":"terms/lanran-gongyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蓝染工艺是 B 维度下元代民间防染印花工序的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lantianren","title":"蓝田人（Lantian Man）","name_en":"Lantian Man","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器时代早期","陕西蓝田","打制石器","中更新世"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hominin","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蓝田人是旧石器时代早期人类，1963—1964 年发现于今陕西蓝田县，属中更新世。遗址发掘和采集石器 50 余件，有刮削器、厚重尖状器、多边或单边砍砸器、球形器等，打制和修理均采用捶击法；石器虽粗糙，但已具一定设计形态和加工方法。","path":"terms/lantianren.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蓝田人是 B 维度下旧石器时代早期人类与石器的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:leather-armor","title":"皮甲（Leather Armor）","name_en":"Leather Armor","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","防护装备","合甲","七札","甲札"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"armor","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"皮甲是赵农第三章“兵器”一目中所述的防护装备，来源称春秋战国皮甲生产技术提高，以合甲为主（L1884）。来源记其把数层皮革合制，最多七甲，亦称七札；制革时把牛皮切成小片，用皮条按身体部位串联，连缀如竹简书札，故称甲札（L1884）。甲衣多有彩绘和铜饰，并有吴甲、楚甲的产地之分；战国马甲盛行，曾侯乙墓出土马甲实物（L1884-L1886）。","path":"terms/leather-armor.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"皮甲是 B 维度下春秋战国防护装备的条目，与戈、矛、戟、殳、弩等进攻性兵器相对。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lei-vessel","title":"罍（Lei (Lei Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Lei Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","盛水器","小口广肩","陶罍"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"罍是青铜盛酒器皿，可盛水或贮酒，形制始于陶罍。2016 册记殷商晚期有铜铸但数量极少，造型多小口扩肩、下腹瘦、小平地、肩部有两耳、耳前有鼻，商代有圆形和方形两种，西周多为圆形；原文“小平地”疑为「小平底」，照录不改。","path":"terms/lei-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜盛酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:leisi","title":"耒耜（Leisi (Digging Tool)）","name_en":"Leisi (Digging Tool)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["神农氏","斲木为耜","商周","牛耕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"耒耜是神农氏制作的农具。《周易·系辞传下》称“斲木为耜，揉木为耒，耒耨之利，以教天下”，赵农称耒耜之具的制作是神农氏生产实践经验的总结和发明。2016 记直到商周时期我国大部分农业区域还只是用耒耜而没有犁耕，并引“冉伯牛名耕”推测春秋已有牛耕。","path":"terms/leisi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"耒耜是 B 维度下原始农具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lever","title":"杠杆（Lever）","name_en":"Lever","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["石器时期","力学原理","省力","权衡","衡器"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"杠杆是赵农第三章“工具”一节开篇所述的力学原理，来源称它作为一种平衡的原理有省力的作用（L1994）。来源推测杠杆原理是石器时期原始先民使用木棒猎取食物或撬动石块时体验和发现到的（L1994）。来源认为有意利用杠杆原理制成平衡器具，成为权衡或衡器概念的雏形（L1994）。本条只记原理与概念雏形，来源未给实物。","path":"terms/lever.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"杠杆是 B 维度下工具原理的条目，来源只作概念性叙述，未给实物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:li-bi","title":"犁壁（Moldboard）","name_en":"Moldboard","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","农具","耕犁","铁农具","翻土"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"犁壁是汉代耕犁上用于翻土碎土的装置。2009 册记在耕犁上安装犁壁后提高了耕作效率，比欧洲早近千年；犁壁形式多样，用途不一；东汉时耕犁大体定型渐趋完善。同段并记秦汉铁制农具已达几十种，汉代铁农具推广到中原以外很多地区，铁器至汉代完全占统治地位。","path":"terms/li-bi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"犁壁是 B 维度下汉代铁农具的部件条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:li-cauldron","title":"鬲（Li Cauldron）","name_en":"Li Cauldron","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["陶器","青铜器","炊煮器","袋足","三足器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鬲（音力）是中国史前至青铜时代的三足炊煮器，特征为三足上部肥大中空、下部收为锥足，即《尔雅》所谓\"款足\"、《汉书·郊祀志上》所谓\"空足\"。六册都把它作为独立器形处理，但**起源说法不一**：夏燕靖两版与田自秉、高丰都说由鼎改进而来，夏燕靖 2016 在同册内又有\"从陶鬲再由鼎演变而来\"的表述，李立新则说原形是斝形器或釜。本 KU 以器形为条目，把陶鬲与青铜鬲的形制演变放在一条线上，起源三说并列。","path":"terms/li-cauldron.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鬲是 B 维度下陶器与青铜器共有的三足袋足炊煮器形条目；从新石器晚期到战国、再到龙泉窑仿古器的形制延续牵涉 B/C 两个维度。"},{"id":"terms:li-shu","title":"隶书（Clerical Script）","name_en":"Clerical Script","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","书体","文字设计","隶变"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"script","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"隶书是从秦代民间书写中发展、在汉代定型为汉隶的书体。赵农以传说中程邈所创的秦隶与湖北云梦睡虎地秦简为代表，说明隶书把圆曲笔画改为方折、结体趋于简化，并把这一形成过程称为隶变。来源未给汉碑实例、隶书分期与名称由来，图版未核。","path":"terms/li-shu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"C 维度下的书体术语条目，关注文字书写形态从秦隶到汉隶的演变；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:li-yue-zhidu","title":"礼乐制度（Ritual and Music System）","name_en":"Ritual and Music System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","周公","等级制度","五礼","青铜乐器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"礼乐制度是周代由周公汇集、增补并建立法定制度的等级规范。田自秉称：名义上是礼乐，实际上就是等级制度，反映统治者的尊卑关系和等级特权；一切视听言行，一切吉礼、凶礼、宾礼、嘉礼、军礼，从生活方式到政治活动，都要合乎礼乐制度。来源并记礼与乐器配合，钟的使用按等级分组。来源未给制度条文、执行机构与年代序列。","path":"terms/li-yue-zhidu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"礼乐制度是 D 维度下周代等级制度与礼仪规范的术语条目；其青铜乐器与钟的等级使用属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lian-zi","title":"帘子（Lianzi (Hanging Screen)）","name_en":"Lianzi (Hanging Screen)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","陈设","丝织","竹编","遮蔽"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furnishing","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"帘子是房门口或室内悬挂的丝织或竹编垂具，来源称其有曲隐遮蔽与安全回避的作用（L3836）。该段中段出现明显的重复、脱字与引号错置，“垂帘听政”一处误作「垂帝听政」，句子被截断并重出。本条只引未错乱的分句，不复原被截断的句子，原文照录标疑，不据以补写。来源未载帘子的尺寸、材质与工艺、悬挂构件与图像，图版未核。","path":"terms/lian-zi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"帘子是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝室内外悬挂垂具的陈设条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liangpiao","title":"粮票（grain coupon）","name_en":"grain coupon","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","计划经济","粮食","票证","粮票"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ration_ticket","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"粮票是生活票证中用于购买粮食的凭证。赵农记粮票分地方粮票与全国通用粮票，并把粮票列入六七十年代按人口分发的票证种类。来源未给发行年份、面额、版式、印制单位与设计者。","path":"terms/liangpiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"粮票是 D 维度下粮食计划供应票证的术语条目；其版面与印刷设计属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liangxiang-yanhua","title":"两向演化（Two-Way Evolution）","name_en":"Two-Way Evolution","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["造物演化","一般造物","经典造物","宫廷建筑","民居"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_evolution_pattern","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"两向演化是李立新在讨论造物品类更迭时提出的演化方式：同一物品在发展过程中因渗入社会规范、伦理思想或宗教思想，分化为与本来的物品大为悬殊的经典造物；而普通实用的同类物品仍沿自我生成的路子前行。李立新以冕服、缂丝、刺绣品和陶瓷名窑艺术品与普通服饰、纺织品、刺绣品、陶瓷品对举，认为两向发展体现一般造物与经典造物的关系，也体现造物设计艺术的基本规律，使设计历史在现实中出现多方向、多渠道的延伸。来源又以建筑","path":"terms/liangxiang-yanhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度造物演化机制的术语条目，其史学解释框架属 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liangzhu-culture","title":"良渚文化（Liangzhu Culture）","name_en":"Liangzhu Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","长江下游","黑陶","玉琮","玉璧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"良渚文化是长江下游太湖周围地区的新石器时代晚期考古学文化，1936 年发现于浙江余杭良渚、瓶窑、安溪三镇之间（夏燕靖两版）。六册都承认它是黑陶与玉器高度发达的文化，但**分类归属相互冲突**：田自秉与夏燕靖两版把它列为龙山文化四类型之一，李立新把\"东南良渚文化设计区\"列为六大原生设计区之一，赵农、高丰则按独立文化处理。本 KU 以\"良渚文化\"为条目名，把两种归属并列登记，不合并为单一定性。","path":"terms/liangzhu-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"良渚文化是 B 维度下长江下游太湖地区的新石器时代晚期考古学文化条目；玉琮、神人兽面纹与古城同时牵涉 B/C 两个维度。分类归属（独立文化／龙山文化四类型之一）存在册级分歧。"},{"id":"terms:liangzhu-shili","title":"良渚石犁（Liangzhu Shili (Liangzhu Stone Plough)）","name_en":"Liangzhu Stone Plough","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["良渚文化","石犁","犁耕","稻作农业","破土器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"良渚石犁是良渚文化的三角形石犁。2016 册称江浙良渚文化区为我国最早实现犁耕的地区，许多遗址发现石犁等耘田器；但石犁是否真正用于犁耕、良渚文化是否有犁耕农业，学界尚有争议。","path":"terms/liangzhu-shili.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下良渚文化农具与犁耕争议的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lianhua-wen","title":"莲花纹（Lotus Motif）","name_en":"Lotus Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["六朝","佛教","植物纹","莲花","观莲节"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"莲花纹是六朝最富时代特色的装饰纹样之一，自东晋、北魏以后流行，与佛教的宗教意义结合而达到极盛，除瓷器外还大量用于铜器、金银器、砖瓦、石刻、藻井、柱础。来源考其欣赏传统起于楚国，列芙蓉、芙蕖、水芝、水花、荷华等别名，引《楚辞》“集芙蓉以为裳”“因芙蓉而为媒”，并举新郑立鹤方壶、蔡侯墓铜器与武氏祠、沂南石刻为例，反驳莲花纹因佛教在六朝自印度传来的说法。","path":"terms/lianhua-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"莲花纹是 C 维度下六朝植物纹样的条目，其瓷器、石刻与砖瓦载体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lianpan-duandeng","title":"连盘短灯（Lianpan Short Lamp）","name_en":"Lianpan Short Lamp","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","灯具","连盘短灯","东宫旧事","金涂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"连盘短灯是《东宫旧事》所记汉代灯具名，见于太子纳妃物单中的“金涂二尺连盘短灯”。高丰把连盘短灯与“长灯”并提，用来说明汉代灯具已有长、短两类；同段又指出有的灯具以祥禽瑞兽为装饰、以鎏金方法加工制作。来源未解释“连盘”的确切构造。","path":"terms/lianpan-duandeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"连盘短灯是 B 维度下汉代灯具的器名条目，其金涂装饰旁及 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lianran-ye","title":"练染业（Lianran Ye (Scouring and Dyeing Industry)）","name_en":"Scouring and Dyeing Industry","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","练丝","染色","工官","漂白"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_industry","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"练染业是随纺织业兴旺而发展的丝麻练白与染色行业。2009 册记当时官府设七个工官掌管其事，并举钟人染羽、筐人设色、慌人练丝、梁人掌染草为例；染织技术牵涉漂白、浸晒、浸渍、浸染、着色等化学和物理过程，当时均已掌握。","path":"terms/lianran-ye.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"练染业是 B 维度下春秋战国纺织加工行业的条目，兼涉 D 维度工官制度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lianzhu-wen","title":"联珠纹（Linked-Pearl Motif）","name_en":"Linked-Pearl Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["萨珊","唐代","联珠圈","丝绸之路","唐锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"联珠纹是以圆圈为基本单位、外圈饰联珠、内圆填对称动物纹样的装饰构成，是唐代丝织品对称式构成的典型。高丰认为联珠纹与动物纹在中国原始彩陶已见，但二者组合最早见于公元 3 世纪前后波斯萨珊王朝丝织品，南北朝经丝绸之路传入；唐代一部分直接照搬，一部分融合中国吉祥动物与汉代变形手法，形成中国式联珠纹。田自秉则反对其从波斯传入之说，举中国彩陶、北魏石砚、隋锦、敦煌藻井等说明中国联珠纹历史悠久。","path":"terms/lianzhu-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"联珠纹是 C 维度下唐代装饰纹样的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liao-ci","title":"辽瓷（Liao Ci (Liao Ceramics)）","name_en":"Liao Ci (Liao Ceramics)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","辽瓷","白瓷","鸡冠壶","凤首瓶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"辽代烧造的瓷器。2016 册记从已发现的大量辽代器物看，辽瓷与邢窑、定窑关系最为密切；辽白瓷和邢瓷、定瓷一样胎质细、釉色纯、瓷化程度高。来源把器形分两大类：一类模仿中原传统形式的碗、盘、瓶、罐、盂、壶等，具有定瓷风格；另一类是具有契丹族独特风格的三角碟、四方碟、海棠盘、长颈瓶、凤首瓶、鸡冠壶、鸡腿坛等。装饰设计分素胎装饰与釉色装饰两种，素胎装饰使用划花、印花、堆花等技法，与北宋诸窑相仿，纹样有游鱼","path":"terms/liao-ci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下辽代瓷器的条目，其契丹族器形与中原窑口关系牵涉 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liao-sancai","title":"辽三彩釉陶（Liao Sancai Youtao (Liao Sancai Glazed Earthenware)）","name_en":"Liao Sancai Youtao (Liao Sancai Glazed Earthenware)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","辽三彩","低温铅釉","唐三彩","宋三彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"继承唐、宋三彩技术的辽代釉陶。2016 册在辽瓷一节记：辽瓷中还有在继承唐、宋三彩釉陶技术基础上发展起来的辽三彩釉陶。来源未为辽三彩单列段落，其釉色装饰的说明与辽瓷共用：釉色装饰有多种色釉施于一器，如三彩、两彩或单色釉加彩方法，还有用色釉描绘器皿。同册唐三彩条记唐三彩是低温铅釉陶器，因在色釉中加入不同的金属氧化物，经焙烧形成以黄、赭、绿为基本釉色；辽三彩是否同属低温铅釉，来源在辽瓷段未复述，本条不","path":"terms/liao-sancai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下辽代低温铅釉陶的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liaoqi","title":"料器（Liaoqi (Low-Melting Glass Ware)）","name_en":"Liaoqi (Low-Melting Glass Ware)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","康熙","玻璃","料器","套料"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"glass_ware_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"料器是含铅量较高、熔点低而适于制作欣赏品的玻璃器。清代段记它是新兴发展的品种，康熙时期在造办处设玻璃厂生产，除北京外山东博山有名的料器产地，广东、云南也有生产；品种有料瓶、料碗等，色彩有红黄蓝绿紫白黑金，装饰方法有套料、搅料、刻纹与金星料。新中国段记料器由艺人在几百度火焰喷头前用工具拉制，多制作小鸟兽、花球、料花与器皿，是北京和山东淄博特有的产品。","path":"terms/liaoqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度玻璃器类目的条目，套料配色与花球造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lidao","title":"犁刀（Plough Knife）","name_en":"Plough Knife","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","农具","犁刀","熟铁","开荒"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"farm_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"犁刀是宋代发明的农具。赵农记犁刀缘于熟铁锻造技术的发展，刀刃的坚韧性得到提高，成为开荒土地的必备农具；人们还改进了江东犁的结构，加强了木犁的深耕程度。来源未给犁刀的形制、尺寸、装柄方式与使用工序。","path":"terms/lidao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"犁刀是 B 维度下宋代农具的条目，材料限于技术条件、用途与江东犁改进。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lieding-system","title":"列鼎制度（Graduated Ding System）","name_en":"Graduated Ding System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","礼制","鼎","簋","等级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_system","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"列鼎制度是西周早期形成的以鼎的数量标示社会等级的用鼎制度：天子九鼎、诸侯七、卿大夫五、元士三。鼎用单数，盛饭食的簋用偶数（天子八、诸侯六、大夫四、士二）；九鼎第一鼎盛牛肉称大牢，五鼎第一鼎盛羊肉称小牢。","path":"terms/lieding-system.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"列鼎制度是 D 维度下西周礼制与器物等级制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liening-zhuang","title":"列宁装（Liening Zhuang (Lenin Suit)）","name_en":"Liening Zhuang (Lenin Suit)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","苏联影响","列宁装","女装","工农兵形象"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"列宁装是 1949 年以后受苏联服饰影响、与连衣裙并列的女性服装首选。当时人们摒弃旧中国的长袍马褂，在服饰中有意追求朴素的工农兵形象。来源未给列宁装的形制、面料、传入路径与设计者。","path":"terms/liening-zhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"列宁装是 B 维度下新中国女装样式的条目；其苏联影响与工农兵形象属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lifang-zhi","title":"里坊制（Lifang Ward System）","name_en":"Lifang Ward System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北魏洛阳","隋大兴城","108坊","坊墙","城市规划"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"urban_system","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"里坊制是以方格形里坊组织城市居住区的规划制度。北魏洛阳“方三百步为一里，里开四门，门置里正二人，门士八人，合有二百二十里”（《洛阳伽蓝记·城北》），整齐化一、管理方便；里坊居民有 500 户至 1000 户，贵族王室有自己的庄园，不受里坊限制。市东、市南、市西、市北各分布工商业者聚居的里，城南另有四夷馆和四夷里。隋大兴城以东西、南北大街纵横交错将全城分为 108 个方块，每块称“里”（唐称“坊”）","path":"terms/lifang-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"里坊制是 D 维度下古代城市规划制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:limao","title":"礼帽（Limao (Fedora)）","name_en":"Limao (Fedora)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["20世纪","帽饰","礼帽","服饰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hat_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"民国时期以礼帽为男帽样式之一，与瓜皮帽、鸭舌帽并称。20 世纪 20 年代以后，知识分子多采用长袍、西裤、皮鞋、围巾、礼帽的搭配方式。来源只给帽式名称与搭配场合，未给形制、材质、产地与设计者。","path":"terms/limao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"礼帽是 B 维度下 20 世纪帽饰样式的条目；来源只作帽式列举与分期，未及制度或机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ling-silk","title":"绫（Ling (Twill Silk)）","name_en":"Ling (Twill Silk)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["斜纹提花","唐代","贡绫","缭绫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绫是以素地起两至三枚经斜纹提花的丝织品，也可染成红、黄、绿、紫等色。唐绫品种最多、产量高，据《新唐书》有 24 处贡绫，并出现整幅大花纹“可幅盘缔缭绫”。","path":"terms/ling-silk.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"绫是 B 维度下丝织品类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lingyang-gong-pattern","title":"陵阳公样（Lingyang Gong Pattern）","name_en":"Lingyang Gong Pattern","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","织锦","联珠纹","对称构图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_pattern","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陵阳公样是唐太宗时期由益州大行台检校修造窦师伦创制的瑞锦宫绫纹样，因窦师伦封陵阳公而得名。五册来源都以“对雉、对羊、翔凤、游麟”等成对动物纹与对称构图为特征，并把它视为唐代织锦吸收波斯等外来纹样又承续本土传统的代表。","path":"terms/lingyang-gong-pattern.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陵阳公样是 B 维度下唐代织锦纹样体系的术语锚点，其对称动物纹与联珠纹的组合同时是 E 维度跨文化互动的典型案例。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lishi-wenhua","title":"砾石文化（Pebble Culture）","name_en":"Pebble Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器时代","砾石","石器文化","设计起源"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"砾石文化是李立新用来概括以砾石为原料打制石器的旧石器文化的名称。他判断这种文化的产生并非突进而是渐进的，是按照人预设的形状来选择砾石的结果，并把选择砾石制作工具称为原始人的一种“设计”，认为这种设计意识早已存在于漫长的人使用自然工具的过程中。来源未给出砾石文化的时间下限、地域范围与类型划分。","path":"terms/lishi-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度旧石器石器文化的条目，其“设计”意识判断属 A 维度解释。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liu-shu","title":"六书（Six Scripts）","name_en":"Six Scripts","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","说文解字","许慎","指事","象形"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"character_formation_theory","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"六书是战国文字出现、至《说文解字》由许慎定名的六种造字与用字方式：指事、象形、形声、会意、转注、假借。赵农称至宋代六书已成为通论，并据此观察中国早期文字从甲骨文向钟鼎文演进的象形规律。来源按六类各举字例：指事“上、下、本、末、刃”，会意“人、步、莫、休、爨”，谐声（形声）“止与趾、般与盘、县与悬”，假借“难、易、我、何、之”，转注“大、小、多、少”；象形则以甲骨文“日、月、雨、鱼、木”为例。","path":"terms/liu-shu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"六书是 C 维度下汉字造字与分类理论的条目，其文献定型见《说文解字》。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liuchao-gongjiang-zhidu","title":"六朝工匠制度（Six Dynasties Artisan System）","name_en":"Six Dynasties Artisan System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["六朝","百工","番役","纳资代役","人身依附"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"labor_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"六朝工匠制度是田自秉对这一时期手工业劳动者身份变化的概括：三国已有独立户籍的“百工”，东晋确立番役制度，南朝实行纳资代役；手工业者可在一定范围内经营自己的手工业，部分脱离旧的人身依附关系，较自由地生产与改进技术。来源以这一变化解释某些工艺品种的发展，并称突出成就是瓷器，雕刻、金工、漆器也有发展。","path":"terms/liuchao-gongjiang-zhidu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"六朝工匠制度是 D 维度下手工业劳动者身份与赋役制度的条目，其工艺品种发展的面向归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liuchao-tongjing","title":"六朝铜镜（Six Dynasties Bronze Mirror）","name_en":"Six Dynasties Bronze Mirror","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["六朝","铜镜","龙虎镜","翔鹤飞鸿镜","兽形生肖镜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"六朝铜镜是田自秉对三国两晋南北朝铜镜的分期与类型概括：早期制作草略，晚期铸作纤巧、图案工整，流行纪年铭文，装饰花纹有龙虎纹、翔鹤飞鸿纹、兽形生肖纹。龙虎镜以龙虎对列，龙仍作走兽状而虎近写实；翔鹤飞鸿镜以单独飞翔的鹤或鸿雁为饰，镜纽常以肢体的一部组成；兽形生肖镜多在陕西、河南洛阳一带出土，题材延续到隋唐。浙江绍兴铜镜以浮雕表现立体感，题材多神人车马、神话传说与历史故事。来源并记镜上铸工匠姓氏与“黄龙","path":"terms/liuchao-tongjing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"六朝铜镜是 B 维度下六朝铜镜类型的条目，其纹样题材归 C 维度，工匠姓氏与私人商品生产归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liuda-sheji-quyu","title":"六大设计文化区域（Six Design Culture Regions）","name_en":"Six Design Culture Regions","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","区系类型","设计文化","区域"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"regional_division","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"六大设计文化区域是李立新据苏秉琦区系类型理论提出的新石器时期中国设计文化分区。他列出北方红山、东方龙山、中原仰韶、东南良渚、西南大溪、南方石峡六个设计区，称其与苏秉琦六大考古文化区域完全对应，是中国文明的六个发端地，也是中国设计文化的“总根系”。来源只给区域名称与对应判断，未给各区年代、界线与器物特征。","path":"terms/liuda-sheji-quyu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史分区框架的条目，各区造物属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liuli","title":"琉璃（Ancient Glass and Architectural Glaze）","name_en":"Ancient Glass and Architectural Glaze","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","原始玻璃","铅钡玻璃","琉璃璧","铅釉陶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"glass_material","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"琉璃在田自秉册中有两个义项。战国至汉代文献语境中的琉璃即原始玻璃，中国自制玻璃属铅钡玻璃，西方属钠钙玻璃；战国琉璃已能制作大件，如琉璃璧、剑饰、琉璃印章，多仿玉器作代用品，楚墓出土最多。另一义指建筑砖瓦用的铅釉陶：古时与玻璃一词混用，后玻璃制品称料器，琉璃专指建筑砖瓦品种；汉代已普遍制造，六朝用于建筑，唐称“剪边琉璃”，宋《营造法式》记釉料配方，元代山西产地最著。两义并列，不合并。\n\n李立新 20","path":"terms/liuli.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"琉璃是 B 维度下古代玻璃器与建筑铅釉陶的两义条目；其仿玉与装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liuqi","title":"六齐（Six Bronze Alloy Formulas）","name_en":"Six Bronze Alloy Formulas","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","青铜","考工记","合金配比"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"alloy_formula","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"\"六齐\"是《考工记》所记的六种青铜合金配比，按器物用途规定铜锡比例。六册来源全部有直接记载，但引述方式差异明显：两册逐条引全六种，另四册只取一句或只作概括。更重要的是，各册对\"六分其金而锡居一\"中\"金\"的所指（合金总量还是纯铜）从未明说，而这一读法直接决定配比能否与实测青铜器成分对应。本 KU 并列原文与解释，不裁定。","path":"terms/liuqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"六齐是 B 维度下先秦青铜合金配比规范，其文献出处属 `publications/kaogongji.md`，本条只登记配比本身及其解释分歧。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:liuqing","title":"留青（Liuqing (Retained-Green Bamboo Carving)）","name_en":"Liuqing (Retained-Green Bamboo Carving)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","竹刻","留青","皮雕","张希黄"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bamboo_carving_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"留青即皮雕，是利用竹青外表作为装饰的竹刻技法。清代竹雕的制作技法分竹刻、留青、翻簧等种，留青的著名艺人为张希黄。来源未给留青的刻法细节、产地与器类。","path":"terms/liuqing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度竹刻技法的条目，竹青与竹肌的色差效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lixue","title":"理学（Neo-Confucianism）","name_en":"Neo-Confucianism","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","理学","程朱理学","周敦颐","朱熹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosophical_movement","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"理学是宋代出现的哲学思潮。赵农在第七章绪论中列出周敦颐、张载、二程（程颢、程颐）、朱熹、陆九渊等代表人物，并特别指出程朱理学对儒家学说的发扬光大、融入佛道观点，提出“天理”“去人欲，存天理”“正心诚意”等论点，对后世中国社会文化有很大影响。来源只作思想史概述，未涉及理学与具体造物、服饰或建筑形制之间的因果论证；本条照录这一边界。","path":"terms/lixue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"理学是 D 维度下宋代思想文化背景的条目；其与视觉文化、服饰规范的可能关联归 C 维度，但来源未作因果论证，故只列次要维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:long-wen","title":"龙纹（Dragon Motif）","name_en":"Dragon Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","青铜器","龙","纹样","装饰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙纹是中国装饰纹样中应用最久的一种，最早见于青铜器。田自秉记其巨首而有两角、身有鳞、成蟠曲形状；《说文》称龙为鳞虫之长、能幽能明能细能巨能短能长，来源认为这是神化，龙纹只是综合创造的装饰纹样。来源未给龙纹的型式分类、年代序列与器物分布。","path":"terms/long-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙纹是 C 维度下青铜装饰纹样的术语条目；其青铜器载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:longdun","title":"龙墩（Dragon Throne）","name_en":"Dragon Throne","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","家具","宝座","殿堂陈设","皇权"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"seat_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙墩是明清帝王宝座的别称，与罗汉榻接近。赵农记宝座比罗汉榻窄小一些，却比太师椅宽大，作为殿堂中的陈设，是权力、地位和身份的象征；明代宝座较清代简洁，清代紫禁城中的贴金蟠龙龙墩和御踏极尽豪华富贵。来源未给尺寸、用材与具体殿座名录。","path":"terms/longdun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙墩是 B 维度下明清殿堂坐具的条目；其皇权与礼仪象征归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:longfeng","title":"龙凤（Dragon and Phoenix）","name_en":"Dragon and Phoenix","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["甲骨文","红山文化","商代玉器","权威","吉祥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"auspicious_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙凤是赵农在第一章“上古传说的设计”一节中论述的神话动物组合。来源称甲骨文中已有“龙”“凤”字样，后人不断赋予它们更多象征意义：龙是鱼、蛇、蜥蜴、鹿、马、猪等动物形象的汇聚，是水族与飞禽相统一的灵虫，代表权威的力量；凤是百鸟之王，凤凰合称，凤为雄、凰为雌，综合灵鹫、野雉、孔雀、鹦鹉、鸡一类特征，有富贵吉祥的意义。来源又引《易经》《诗经》《楚辞》《山海经》说明其寓意，并把红山文化玉龙、商代玉器纳入龙","path":"terms/longfeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙凤是 C 维度下神话动物与吉祥纹样的条目，其红山玉龙、商代玉器等物质载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:longshan-culture","title":"龙山文化（Longshan Culture）","name_en":"Longshan Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","黑陶","蛋壳陶","城址","考古学文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙山文化是新石器时代晚期以黑陶为标志的考古学文化；田自秉把它定为\"进入父系氏族社会后\"黄河中下游产生的文化，因最早发现于山东历城（今属章丘）龙山镇而得名（六册均未记发现年份）。六册来源一致把它当作彩陶衰落之后的技术转折点：快轮制陶、蛋壳黑陶、早期城址与凿井都集中在这一时期。来源间的差异主要在它的\"位置\"——是仰韶之后的同一序列阶段，还是与仰韶并存的东方区域文化。","path":"terms/longshan-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙山文化是 B 维度下新石器时代晚期黑陶工艺与早期城址的类型学锚点，兼涉快轮制陶这一关键工艺转折。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:longyang","title":"龙洋（Dragon Silver Dollar）","name_en":"Dragon Silver Dollar","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","光绪","银圆","光绪元宝","机器铸币"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silver_coin","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙洋是光绪年间以机器铸制的银圆，称光绪元宝。赵农记两广总督张之洞利用机器铸制龙洋，背面为蟠龙纹样，净重七钱二分，与白银等同；宣统年间清政府又发行铸造大清银币。来源未给铸局、成色、发行量与流通范围。","path":"terms/longyang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙洋是 D 维度下清末机器铸币的条目；其铸造工艺与纹样归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:longyao","title":"龙窑（Dragon Kiln）","name_en":"Dragon Kiln","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["依山而上","火膛","分段烧成","投柴孔","1300℃"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_kiln","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙窑是依山而上的特殊窑形，从战国秦汉出现以来一直为人们利用，因窑身依山而上、形似火龙而得名。青瓷的出现与窑形改变有很大关系：魏晋南北朝的龙窑已能充分采用火膛与窑室连接的方式，使升焰速度加快、温度提高，获得高温烧瓷的条件，并能一次容纳大量瓷器、增加生产数量；魏晋时期开始改进龙窑形制，以“分段烧成”的方法在窑顶或窑身两侧设置投柴孔，保证烧制温度的平均，防止发生生烧现象。田自秉记汉代早期青瓷使用的窑型烧","path":"terms/longyao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙窑是 B 维度下陶瓷窑炉类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:louchuan","title":"楼船（Tower Ship）","name_en":"Tower Ship","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","战船","多层","水军","女墙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"楼船是春秋战国时期战船的一种，结构一般为三层，也有的达 5 层甚至 10 层，是当时水军的主力船型。杜佑《通典》称其“船上建楼三重，列女墙，战格、树幡帜，开驾窗矛穴，置抛车、垒石、铁斗，状如城垒”。汉代广州船舶以楼船为最大，高三四层，设女墙战格，篙、桨、橹、帆、舵、碇俱全。","path":"terms/louchuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"楼船是 B 维度下先秦两汉战船类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:louke","title":"漏刻（Clepsydra (Water Clock)）","name_en":"Clepsydra (Water Clock)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","计时","漏刻","漏壶","莲花漏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"timekeeping","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"漏刻是古代以漏水计时的器具，“漏”即漏壶，“刻”即刻箭。赵农记漏刻传说在黄帝时期已出现，有水漏和沙漏两种，后以水漏为主，周代出现“铜壶滴漏”记时器；经汉唐不断研制和使用，出现“淹箭法”“沉箭法”“浮箭法”的不同漏壶方式；到宋代，燕肃研制并采用漫流系统，出现浮箭法的“莲花漏”，使多余的水从浮漏上部小孔流出，稳定水流速度和压力，又能根据季节变化以不同刻度的浮箭标志时间。","path":"terms/louke.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"漏刻是 B 维度下古代计时器具的条目，材料限于源流、三种方式与燕肃莲花漏。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lu-chou","title":"潞绸（Lu Chou (Lu Silk)）","name_en":"Lu Chou (Lu Silk)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","清代","山西","长治","高平"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"潞绸是明代山西长治、高平、潞卫三处所产丝织品。2016 册引清代《潞安府志》记三处共有绸机一万三千余张（来源标明所记为明代数字）；又引明郭子章《郭青螺先生遗书》卷十六称「潞城机杼斗巧，织作纯丽，衣天下」，产品因此称为潞绸。","path":"terms/lu-chou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"潞绸是 B 维度下明代山西潞安一带丝织品的条目，其织机数与产地组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lu-oar","title":"橹（Yuloh (Sculling Oar)）","name_en":"Yuloh (Sculling Oar)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西汉","船舶","推进工具","杠杆","连续划水"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"橹是出现于西汉的船舶推进工具。2009 册记造船技术的进步表现在橹、舵和布帆等的发明和使用；橹靠橹板的左右摆动形成推力，从桨的间歇划水变成连续划水，并利用杠杆原理节省体力。来源未给橹长、支点位置、安装方式与图像。","path":"terms/lu-oar.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"橹是 B 维度下汉代船舶推进工具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:luanbai-you-ci","title":"卵白釉瓷（Egg-White Glazed Porcelain）","name_en":"Egg-White Glazed Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","瓷器","景德镇","卵白釉","枢府窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"卵白釉瓷是元代景德镇烧造的白瓷。赵农记经过宋代的发展，江西景德镇瓷器到元代已称誉天下；宋元之间的战乱使南北窑场遭到重创，而景德镇窑场因地理因素和烧制白瓷的缘故被元代政府高度重视；至元十五年（1278）元政府在景德镇设置“浮梁瓷局”制作御烧瓷器，并在各地征集陶瓷工匠，使制瓷技术分工细致规范化，出现青花、釉里红、卵白釉等瓷器；卵白釉瓷胎质硬、白、厚重，釉色泛出淡青的白瓷，犹如蛋青色泽，为元代官方的御烧","path":"terms/luanbai-you-ci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"卵白釉瓷是 B 维度下元代景德镇白瓷品种的条目；浮梁瓷局与御烧制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:luanzhenxiu","title":"乱针绣（Luanzhen Embroidery (Random-Stitch)）","name_en":"Luanzhen Embroidery (Random-Stitch)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["民国","刺绣","乱针绣","正则绣","缤纹绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"乱针绣是杨守玉所创的刺绣针法，又名正则绣，近年又称缤纹绣。它以长短不一、直斜交错的综合针法表现物象的形体和色光效果，富有立体感。来源把乱针绣与双面绣并列为苏绣发展较快的两种针法，未给其具体操作步骤、用线规格与代表作品。","path":"terms/luanzhenxiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度刺绣针法的条目，交差错针造成的色光效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lubu","title":"卤薄（Lubu (Ritual Procession Paraphernalia)）","name_en":"Lubu (Ritual Procession Paraphernalia)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["古代","仪仗","卤薄","卤簿","车舆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_paraphernalia","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"古代仪仗器物的总称。2016 册记卤薄共 35 类，包括辇、辂、舆、车、拂尘、提炉、香盒、盥盆、唾壶、水瓶、马机、交椅、仪刀、橐鞬、豹尾枪、戟、殳、盖、撒、扇、幢、幡、旌、节、氅、麾、纛、钺、星、瓜、仗、灯、象、静鞭、仗马等，并以纹饰区别等级或使用场合，如玉辇、金辇、凤辇之别，黄龙大纛、五色金龙纛、八旗骁骑纛等旗类，旗的纹饰多达 80 种。来源另记西晋大驾卤薄是最早的完整记录，有金银车驾六马、属车","path":"terms/lubu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下仪仗制度的条目，其器物形制另涉 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lujiao-yi","title":"鹿角椅（Antler Chair）","name_en":"Antler Chair","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","家具","鹿角","满族","政治象征"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"chair_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鹿角椅是清代皇宫以大量鹿角拼制而成的椅具。赵农记其巧夺天工，接口以镀金铜片包裹；并指出这本是满族入关之前的技艺，现在却成为武功文治的政治象征。来源未给尺寸、鹿角来源、制作年代与传世实例。","path":"terms/lujiao-yi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鹿角椅是 B 维度下清代宫廷坐具的条目；其满族技艺与政治象征归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lunban-jiang","title":"轮班匠（Rotating Artisan）","name_en":"Rotating Artisan","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","匠籍","官营手工业","工部","明会典"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"artisan_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"轮班匠是明代划入匠籍、按规定时间轮流到京师服役的工匠。高丰把明代官方手工业分为六个部分，以工部为最大管理机构；轮班匠即在这一体系下按班次赴京受役，即所谓“岁率轮班(匠)至京受役”。据洪武二十六年统计，全国轮班工匠共 232,089 名，分布在 62 个行业；《明会典》按五年、四年、三年、两年、一年五档列出各行业班次。来源把这些工匠连同住坐京城的数万人评为明代手工业设计的精华，认为其力量已超过以往任","path":"terms/lunban-jiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"轮班匠是 D 维度下明代官营手工业工匠制度的条目，其班次分工直接影响 B 维度的生产组织。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:luodian","title":"螺钿（Luodian (Mother-of-Pearl Inlay)）","name_en":"Luodian (Mother-of-Pearl Inlay)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","明代","漆器","螺钿","白螺片"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"螺钿是以螺片镶嵌漆面的漆器工艺。来源记宋代螺钿漆器发达，引《齐东野语》记宋高宗幸张循王府进螺钿盒十具、《西湖游览志》记马天骥献螺钿柳箱百支，并引《清波杂志》记高宗时曾禁制螺钿淫巧之物；宋时多用白螺片镶嵌，黑白对比典雅，有的在螺片轮廓周围镶嵌铜丝使螺片更牢固并增富丽效果。来源另在明代漆器段记螺钿分硬螺钿与软螺钿，硬螺钿为厚片、有平面与浅浮雕，软螺钿今称甸螺、为薄片而有美丽光泽，也有用螺片捣成甸砂洒贴","path":"terms/luodian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度漆器镶嵌工艺的条目，螺片黑白对比与铜丝轮廓属 C 维度，宫廷进献与禁制属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:luohan-chuang","title":"罗汉床（Luohan Bed）","name_en":"Luohan Bed","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","清代","家具","床","围屏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bed_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"罗汉床也称罗汉榻，基本保留明代以前床的开放性特征，仅三面围屏作为遮挡。赵农记罗汉床多是休闲会客场所，常在床上安置矮几一类小件家具；因床足粗壮，加之宋元时期多为高僧座谈之器，故以罗汉称谓。清式罗汉床在床足上增加变化，如内翻蹄形，并在围屏中用小木料雕制拼装不同纹饰。来源未给尺寸、用材与传世实例。","path":"terms/luohan-chuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"罗汉床是 B 维度下明清卧具类型的条目；当前只到 Dimension。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:luopan","title":"罗盘（Compass (Luopan)）","name_en":"Compass (Luopan)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["南宋","仪器","罗盘","指南针","航海"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"罗盘是南宋时将指南针与方位标志合为一体的导航工具。赵农记南宋指南针成为罗盘，即将指南针和方位标志合为一体；罗盘也称针盘、地螺、子午盘等，航海时成为导航不可缺少的工具；指南针的应用和普及是中华文明对人类生活的重大贡献。来源未给盘面圈层、刻度、尺寸与制作材料。","path":"terms/luopan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"罗盘是 B 维度下南宋导航仪器的条目；其跨海域航海应用归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:luowo-yi","title":"罗涡椅（Luowo Yi (Luowo Chair)）","name_en":"Luowo Yi (Luowo Chair)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","宋代","家具","罗涡椅","弓背椅"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"罗涡椅是元代在宋代家具基础上发展而来的弓背椅，名称采自民间俗语，形容弓背的罗涡形。2016 册称其充分体现人体尺度，「看形制便有一种舒适之感」，并记《西厢记》插图庭院内廊中常见此椅。","path":"terms/luowo-yi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"罗涡椅是 B 维度下元代弓背椅的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:luzhipin","title":"铝制品（Aluminium Ware）","name_en":"Aluminium Ware","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","铝","轻银","金属器皿","辊压模压"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalware_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铝制品是以铝为材的生活器皿。来源记铝质地轻巧、光泽如银、有轻银之称，其应用取代了传统的铜、锡、铁等金属器皿，已成为生活用品中的重要工艺材料；我国抚顺、包头、郑州等地铝矿蕴藏丰富，20 世纪初已建小型铝制品厂而生产衰落，新中国建立大型铝器厂并实行自动流水线。来源记铝器可用辊压、模压、挤压、拉制等成型方法，装饰用磨光、抛光、洗白、电化与镀色，而造型才是其艺术表现的主要手段。","path":"terms/luzhipin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度金属日用器皿的条目，简洁造型属 C 维度，工业化生产与替代铜锡器属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lv-de-zhonglei","title":"履的种类（Types of Lu (Footwear)）","name_en":"Types of Lu (Footwear)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","服饰","鞋履","礼制"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"dress_term","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"履的种类是汉代鞋履的分类条目，来源举出三种：舄为祭祀用鞋，屦为家居用鞋，屐为雨天践泥的木制鞋（L3063）。来源只有一句，未给三者的形制、材质差异、尺寸、等级规定与出土实物。","path":"terms/lv-de-zhonglei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"履的种类是 B 维度下汉代鞋履形制的条目，其祭祀、家居与雨行的服用场合属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lvchen-qi","title":"绿沉漆（Lüchen Lacquer (Deep-Green Lacquer)）","name_en":"Lüchen Lacquer (Deep-Green Lacquer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["六朝","漆器","色漆","暗绿","调色技术"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绿沉漆是六朝时期流行的深绿色漆，绿沉色即暗绿色，如物沉水中、其色深沉静穆，故名。文献三证：梁简文帝《书案铭》描写漆书案“漆花曜紫，画制舒绿”；宋元嘉时御史中丞刘桢奏折指责广州刺史韦朗作绿沉漆屏风；《书经》记有人送王羲之绿沉漆笔管一件，他认为不亚于金宝雕嵌的名贵笔管。来源判断六朝以前漆色多为朱红、黄、黑，深绿漆是新产品，其出现标志髹漆工艺在调色技术上的新成就。","path":"terms/lvchen-qi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"绿沉漆是 B 维度下六朝色漆类型的条目，其书案铭、屏风与笔管的文人与上层消费面向归 C、D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:lvse-sheji","title":"绿色设计（Green Design）","name_en":"Green Design","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["3R","生态","环保","可持续"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_concept","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绿色设计源于对现代技术文化引起环境及生态破坏的反思，核心是“3R”，即 Reduce（节能）、Recycle（再利用）和 Reuse（循环），要求减少物质能源消耗和有害排放，使产品及零部件便于分类回收再生。夏燕靖认为它不仅是技术考量，更是观念变革，要求把重点放在真正环保意义上的创新。","path":"terms/lvse-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"绿色设计是 D 维度下现代设计观念与方法的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ma-bu","title":"麻布（Mabu (Hemp Cloth)）","name_en":"Hemp Cloth","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","麻纺织","苎麻","平纹组织","长沙楚墓"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"麻布是春秋时期以麻类纤维织成的布。2009 册特别辨明当时所谓的布是麻类织物而非棉布，并以《左传》晏婴赠彩绸、郑相回赠苎衣的记载，以及长沙战国楚墓白色麻布的鉴定结果，说明精细苎麻布可与丝绸媲美。","path":"terms/ma-bu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"麻布是 B 维度下春秋战国麻纺织品的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ma-zhi","title":"麻纸（Hemp Paper）","name_en":"Hemp Paper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","造纸","麻纸","公文","经卷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"麻纸是宋代质地坚韧、便于保存的纸张。赵农记许多麻纸用来书写和印制重要的公文和经卷；四川是盛产麻纸的地方，宋代许多文人喜欢使用麻纸，米芾曾对“川麻纸”非常称赞，认为便于书写。来源未给麻纸的原料配比、帘纹与产地分布；本条只记性能、用途与文人的使用评价。","path":"terms/ma-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"麻纸是 B 维度下宋代造纸材质的条目；其用于公文、经卷与书写归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:machang-xing-caitao","title":"马厂型彩陶（Machang-Type Painted Pottery）","name_en":"Machang-Type Painted Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["马厂","彩陶","四大圈纹","人形纹","蛙纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painted_pottery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"马厂型彩陶是发现于青海乐都县马厂沿新石器时代晚期墓葬的彩陶类型，由半山型发展而来，分布更向西直达河西走廊西端。田自秉记其发展分早、中、晚三期，典型器为小口双耳罐，流行四大圆圈纹与人形纹（或称蛙纹），盛行陶衣与色衬，风格简练、刚劲；年代约 4000 年前。","path":"terms/machang-xing-caitao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"马厂型彩陶是 B 维度下甘青地区彩陶类型的术语条目；其四大圈纹与人形纹属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:magnetite","title":"磁石（Magnetite (Lodestone)）","name_en":"Magnetite (Lodestone)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","铁矿","慈石","指南针","磁性"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mineral","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"磁石是铁砂能聚附其上的矿石。赵农在第三章工具部分记春秋战国时期铁矿的开发和采集使磁石被人们认识，铁砂聚附于磁石之上，当时磁石被写作“慈石”。来源还称磁石的发现为后期指南针的研制提供了充分的条件。","path":"terms/magnetite.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"磁石是 B 维度下天然磁性矿物的条目，来源只记其被认识、异名与对后期指南针的条件作用。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:maishan","title":"麦钐（Wheat Scythe）","name_en":"Wheat Scythe","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","农具","麦钐","麦绰","麦笼"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"farm_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"麦钐是宋代收麦的配套农具。赵农记麦钐由麦钐、麦绰、麦笼三部分组成：收麦时的麦钐是大镰刀，配置一个带两条活动长木柄的麦绰（簸箕），后面有一带轮子的“麦笼”；用麦钐将麦穗收割到麦绰中，再倒入麦笼里，成为一个配套使用的过程。来源未给三件的尺寸、材料与操作人数。","path":"terms/maishan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"麦钐是 B 维度下宋代收割农具的条目，材料限于三件组成与操作流程。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:majiayao-culture","title":"马家窑文化（Majiayao Culture）","name_en":"Majiayao Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","黄河上游","彩陶","甘肃仰韶文化","舞蹈纹盆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"马家窑文化是黄河上游新石器时代晚期的考古学文化，因最早在甘肃临洮县瓦家坪马家窑遗址发现而得名，又称\"甘肃仰韶文化\"。田自秉另记半山型以甘肃宁定县半山地区首次发现得名，马厂型发现于青海乐都县马厂沿的新石器时代晚期墓葬。六册都把它作为中国史前彩陶的最高峰之一，但**分类口径不一致**：夏燕靖两版按考古学文化处理，分为马家窑、半山、马厂三个类型；田自秉按彩陶类型处理，把\"马家窑型\"\"半山型\"\"马厂型\"与","path":"terms/majiayao-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"马家窑文化是 B 维度下黄河上游新石器时代晚期的彩陶文化条目；陶器纹饰与舞蹈纹盆的仪式含义牵涉 C 维度。文化分期与彩陶类型两套分类口径并存。"},{"id":"terms:majiayao-xing-caitao","title":"马家窑型彩陶（Majiayao-Type Painted Pottery）","name_en":"Majiayao-Type Painted Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["马家窑文化","彩陶","舞蹈纹","内彩","螺旋纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painted_pottery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"马家窑型彩陶是分布于甘肃、青海部分地区的彩陶类型，晚于半坡、庙底沟，由庙底沟型发展和分化而来。田自秉记其器形多小口壶、罐，装饰多用同心圆中心图案，流行内彩，纹样几乎饰满器体，点和螺旋纹突出，风格旋动、流畅；1973 年青海大通上孙家寨出土舞蹈纹彩陶盆；年代约 5000 年前。","path":"terms/majiayao-xing-caitao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"马家窑型彩陶是 B 维度下甘青地区彩陶类型的术语条目；其内彩与螺旋纹属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:man-sheng","title":"缦（升）（Man (Sheng) Cloth Measure）","name_en":"Man (Sheng) Cloth Measure","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","布幅","麻缕","经纬","居延汉简"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_measure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"缦是汉代布幅的经纬计量单位，或谓升：一缦等于麻缕80根，布宽2尺2寸，十缦即幅面800根。来源以今之纱支作比，并列七缦、八缦、九缦、十缦布等文献名称，举《居延汉简》《汉书·王莽传》《史记》为例。来源未给“缦”与“升”的异同、地域差异与实测布样。","path":"terms/man-sheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"缦（升）是 B 维度下汉代布幅计量与纺织规格的条目，其等级与价格面向兼涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:man-tuo-luo","title":"曼荼罗（Mandala）","name_en":"Mandala","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["佛教","密宗","曼荼罗","现图曼荼罗","法门寺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_space","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曼荼罗是密宗修持与寺院彩画中的方形或圆形空间图式。李立新记佛教寺院彩画常有由方形和圆形图案构成的曼荼罗形式，是密宗对法器的一种特别要求，有一整套系统性的规范和器物；南亚次大陆密宗修“秘密法”时为防魔鬼侵袭，在地上画出圆形或方形区域，有时建土坛、画佛像菩萨、上摆法器，修行完毕自行撤毁；不以土坛而以图像显示者称现图曼荼罗。来源又记法门寺地宫的实物与放置程序、捧真身菩萨莲花底座均体现曼荼罗形式，并引石兴","path":"terms/man-tuo-luo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下密宗仪式空间与法器规范的条目，其佛教东传与日本流布归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mansheng-hu","title":"曼生壶（Mansheng Teapot）","name_en":"Mansheng Teapot","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","嘉庆","紫砂","宜兴","曼生壶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"teaware_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曼生壶是嘉庆年间由陈曼生设计、杨彭年制作的紫砂壶，被视为清代紫砂中的珍品。来源只给这一句，未给器形、铭文、制作数量与传世情况。","path":"terms/mansheng-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代紫砂器类的条目，文人设计与铭刻的装饰面属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mantouyao","title":"馒头窑（Mantou Kiln (Bun-Shaped Kiln)）","name_en":"Mantou Kiln (Bun-Shaped Kiln)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["南北朝","宋代","制瓷","窑炉","馒头窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"馒头窑是北方地区自南北朝以来流行的窑炉形制，外形犹如馒头。赵农记宋代北方的馒头窑出现全倒焰的烧制技术，即在窑尾设置排烟道，加大火焰燃烧时的抽力，将火焰从窑顶转下，进入侧尾的排烟道，可以获得烧还原焰的效果，提高窑室温度，使窑内烧瓷温度达到1300°C。来源未给窑室尺寸、容量、燃料与装窑方式。","path":"terms/mantouyao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"馒头窑是 B 维度下北方窑炉形制的条目，材料限于源流、外形、倒焰结构与温度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mao","title":"矛（Spear）","name_en":"Spear","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["石器时期","青铜时代","商周","兵器","酋矛"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"矛是赵农在第一章“刀矛”与第二章青铜兵器部分论述的长柄兵器。第一章称矛在石器时期已经发挥作用，是最早的古老兵器；矛与耒同工而异曲，很快将木柄和锐利尖矛结合，有木矛、石矛、角矛等，是一种加长的武器，可以戳、挑、扫、打、掷。第二章称青铜矛由矛头、柄、镦三部分组成，矛头分锋、刃、叶、脊、环钮、骹、秘，矛身一锋二刃、刃间有鼓起的脊梁，具有戳、挑、劈等作用；商周士兵以青铜矛为主要武器，安阳殷墟出土700余支","path":"terms/mao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"矛是 B 维度下从石器时期到春秋战国的兵器条目，其形制演进与车战、步战制度相关。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:maobi","title":"毛笔（Brush）","name_en":"Brush","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","彩陶","战国","书写工具","楚简"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"writing_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"毛笔是赵农在第一章“文字”与第三章“文具”部分论述的书写工具。第一章称新石器时期有了彩陶绘制，因此应该出现了类似毛笔的“笔”；从彩陶器皿的形象化图案看，勾线、平涂、点画若没有软性的“毛笔”根本无法完成，但由于至今没有出土新石器时期的毛笔，这还仅仅是一种推想。来源又记1973年临潼姜寨遗址出现石砚、石砚棒与矿物质黑色颜料，应是墨砚的远祖，笔的概念和运用也应出现在这个时期。第三章称战国已经出现毛笔，湖","path":"terms/maobi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"毛笔是 C 维度下书写工具的条目，其制笔工艺与新石器彩陶绘制技术属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:maobian-zhi","title":"毛边纸（Maobian Paper）","name_en":"Maobian Paper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","造纸","竹纸","毛晋","书籍用纸"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"毛边纸是明清南方竹纸的一种。赵农记毛边纸、黄表纸等竹纸品种是社会生活须臾不可缺少的物品；毛晋印刷书籍用纸量很大，在江西专门定制一种竹纸，被后世称为毛边纸。来源未给纸幅、配料、产地与制作工序。","path":"terms/maobian-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"毛边纸是 B 维度下明清竹纸品种的条目；其书籍印刷用途归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:maohua-shanse-jin","title":"茂花闪色锦（Maohua Flashing-Color Brocade）","name_en":"Maohua Flashing-Color Brocade","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西夏","丝织","锦","分段染色","印经"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"茂花闪色锦是 1975 年宁夏银川市郊西夏陵区所出丝织物，经纬组织与织造方法都比较特别。来源记其经线先经分段染色：按设色要求把不需染色的区段用包裹物包扎后再染色，使经线呈现一段一段不同的色彩，织造后产生直向参差不齐的彩色斑纹；这种方法类似现代新疆和田地区所产印经。来源推测它可能由中原传入，但具体生产地点不得而知，也无文字记载，可能由西域回鹘丝织工匠参用西域印经方法织造。其经线密度每厘米 80～84","path":"terms/maohua-shanse-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度西夏丝织的条目，彩色斑纹与色彩层次属 C 维度，中原传入与回鹘工匠的推测属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:maoyi-ci","title":"贸易瓷（Maoyi Ci (Trade Porcelain)）","name_en":"Maoyi Ci (Trade Porcelain)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋元","对外贸易","市舶司","泉州","萍洲可谈"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"trade_goods","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋元时期销往海外的瓷器商品。2016 册“知识链接”专条记：瓷器是宋元对外贸易的重要商品之一，在海外市场上享有很高的声誉；宋代瓷器的运销范围包括亚洲、非洲和欧洲，东南亚诸国因地缘与转运地位成为主要地区，福建泉州港的输出极为方便，这一地区的窑址便与我国外销东南亚瓷器关系密切。来源引朱彧《萍洲可谈》两则说明贸易瓷的厚利与装船方式，引《宋史·食货志》记开宝四年（971）置市舶司于广州及诸番贸易货单，并记","path":"terms/maoyi-ci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下宋元瓷器对外贸易的条目，其跨文化流通归 E 维度、器物生产归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:maozedong-xiangzhang","title":"毛泽东像章（Mao Zedong Badge）","name_en":"Mao Zedong Badge","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["文化大革命","毛泽东像章","纪念章","收藏","文革初期"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"badge_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"毛泽东像章是文化大革命时期流行的佩带毛泽东头像的纪念章。其材料有铜、铝、锡、瓷、塑料、有机玻璃等，花样很多，有时直径达 15 厘米，挂在胸前宛若护心镜；许多人家以收集像章为乐，成为文革初期的一大社会景象。来源未给制作单位、设计者、发行数量与图样谱系。","path":"terms/maozedong-xiangzhang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"毛泽东像章是 B 维度下文革时期纪念章类型的条目；其政治动员与收集风尚属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:maozhuang","title":"毛装（Rough Binding）","name_en":"Rough Binding","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","书籍装帧","纸捻","四孔","保留资料"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_binding","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"毛装是明清书籍装帧中不裁切书页、不装封面的简易装订形式。赵农记其没有封面，不用剪裁天头地脚和右面书页，只在左面装订处打四孔，用纸捻穿钉，任凭书籍毛糙；毛装书常作为保留资料或送人之用，可以让主人自己选择封面的颜色、纸张和题签。来源未给使用范围与存世实例。","path":"terms/maozhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"毛装是 C 维度下明清书籍装帧形式的条目；其纸捻穿钉工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:matou-qiang","title":"马头墙（Horse-head Fire Wall）","name_en":"Horse-head Fire Wall","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","民居","封火山墙","皖南","天井式院落"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"fire_wall","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"马头墙是天井式院落的高挺封火山墙的俗称。赵农记天井式院落外墙非常高，有高挺的封火山墙，俗称马头墙；这类院落白墙青瓦，屋宇相连，存在于皖南的绿水青山之中。来源未给马头墙的构造、尺度与马头形制分类。","path":"terms/matou-qiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"马头墙是 B 维度下皖南民居封火山墙的条目；当前只到 Dimension。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:meigui-yi","title":"玫瑰椅（Rose Chair）","name_en":"Rose Chair","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","清代","家具","文椅","扶手椅"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"chair_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玫瑰椅是扶手和靠背高低几乎差不多的椅型，明代称文椅。赵农记明式椅中此型称为文椅，俗称玫瑰椅；清式椅在江南私人园林中出现双人联座的玫瑰椅，减少用料并扩大椅子功能。来源未给尺寸、用材与具体园林实例。","path":"terms/meigui-yi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"玫瑰椅是 B 维度下明清坐具类型的条目；当前只到 Dimension。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:meijin-ejin","title":"美金与恶金（Meijin and Ejin (Good and Bad Metal)）","name_en":"Meijin and Ejin (Good and Bad Metal)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","铜","铁","块炼铁","礼器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_concept","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"春秋战国时人称铜为“美金”，用以制作礼器；称铁为“恶金”，用以制作工具。称铁为恶金的原因是当时人工冶铁所得均为块炼铁，色泽发黑、质地较为低劣；随着冶铁技术迅速提高，这一名称逐渐淘汰。","path":"terms/meijin-ejin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"美金与恶金是 B 维度下先秦材料观念与冶铁技术的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:meiping","title":"梅瓶（Meiping (Plum Vase)）","name_en":"Meiping (Plum Vase)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","盛酒器","小口丰肩","定窑","龙泉窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"梅瓶是宋代瓷瓶形制，小口、短颈、圆肩、长身，尤以小口窈窕为特色，有秀丽媚妩之韵、梅骨清像之姿；深腹稳重、容量颇大，多为盛酒器。高丰记其通高一般约 40 厘米、口径仅 4—5 厘米，挺拔刚劲、峻峭雄健；宋以后梅瓶与玉壶春瓶一直沿用，成为中国古代传统酒瓶造型的典型式样。","path":"terms/meiping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"梅瓶是 B 维度下宋代瓷酒器造型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:men-que","title":"门阙（Men Que (Gate Towers)）","name_en":"Men Que (Gate Towers)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","门阙","汉代建筑","礼制建筑","陵墓"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architecture_term","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"门阙是汉代宫殿、坛庙、陵墓、城门等处的标志性建筑，也是人们活动领域的范围象征；来源称“汉代地表建筑现在仅存的是阙”（L2881）。秦代已有“有表南山之巅以为阙”的门阙观念，来源并称如此则“东海仅仅为秦王朝的大门，而南山（秦岭）竟为门阙，天下便为宫室”（L2848）。来源未给门阙的形制、高度、结构、现存数量与具体尺寸。","path":"terms/men-que.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"门阙是 B 维度下汉代建筑类型的条目，其礼制与领域象征的阐释牵涉 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:menggubao","title":"蒙古包（Mongolian Yurt）","name_en":"Mongolian Yurt","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","民居","蒙古族","毡包","游牧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"yurt","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蒙古包是流行于内蒙古、新疆草原的毡包，属于半固定、半流动性的居住样式。赵农记其搭建方法是用皮绳将木骨架捆扎竖立成圆壁，再以骨架搭成穹顶，用皮绳与圆壁连接，外部用毡或羊皮覆盖并以皮绳束绑扎紧；毡包顶部有一小孔，白天采光，室内铺设毛毡和皮垫防潮。来源未给直径、构件名称、搭建人数与时间。","path":"terms/menggubao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蒙古包是 B 维度下草原毡包民居的条目；其游牧生活方式归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:menshen","title":"门神（Door God）","name_en":"Door God","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["年画","神荼","郁垒","钟馗","尉迟敬德"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"folk_image","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"门神是赵农在第一章象征论述与第六章年画论述中两次提到的民俗图像。第一章记传说黄帝时史皇作图画，把“神荼”“郁垒”画在桃木板上以御鬼神，称这是中国最早的门神；第六章则称门神是年画的最早样式，是辟邪驱鬼、护卫家园的精神象征，并续记汉代神荼、郁垒二仙人形象，唐太宗时尉迟敬德与秦琼、唐玄宗时钟馗等门神形象。来源把门神视为借助神力满足精神需要的象征系统。","path":"terms/menshen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"门神是 C 维度下年画与民俗图像的早期样式，其桃木板、印刷流传等物质面属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mian-guan-mian-liu","title":"冕冠与冕旒（Mian Crown and Mianliu Beads）","name_en":"Mian Crown and Mianliu Beads","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋","南朝","冠冕","头饰","政治地位"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"headwear","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"冕冠与冕旒是魏晋时期帝王与贵族士人的头饰，来源称冠冕为地位象征。来源记冕分冕板与冕旒，冕板有宽长与前圆后方的形制，固定在通天冠上，冕板前后垂挂珊瑚珠冕旒。来源以阎立本《历代帝王图》中的晋武帝像为形象例证。来源又记南朝按身份规定旒数。来源未给冕冠的完整结构、制作材料与考古实物，图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"terms/mian-guan-mian-liu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的头饰条目，其旒数等级的制度面向列为 D 维度辅助；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mianfangchang","title":"棉纺厂（Cotton Textile Mill）","name_en":"Cotton Textile Mill","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","棉纺织业","纺织厂","计划经济","市场化转型"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"factory_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"棉纺厂是 20 世纪五六十年代产棉地区纷纷建立的纺织厂，以现代纺织机器生产棉、毛、麻、丝布等产品。随着经济社会发展，在计划经济下建立的纺织厂面临市场化的转型选择。来源未给具体厂名、厂址、纱锭数、建设时间与经营状况。","path":"terms/mianfangchang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"棉纺厂是 D 维度下新中国纺织工厂类型的条目；来源只作行业概述，未及具体企业材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mianfu-zhidu","title":"冕服制度（Mianfu Ritual Dress System）","name_en":"Mianfu Ritual Dress System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","服饰","礼制","冕服","周礼"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"冕服制度是西周形成的服饰礼制体系。李立新称直到西周冕服制度的形成，才让人领略到中国服饰制度的规模，以及制作材料的丰富与品类的更递；形成的一个重要因素是尊祖“敬天”思想的出现，也就是周礼的诞生。周人总结夏殷和殷周更替的经验，认为天意决定于民情、民情决定于王之敬德与否，以“敬天之休”奉答上天，从而构建行为规范与礼仪，以冠饰为开端的一系列制度由此产生。原本属冠饰的冕因此形成庞大的繁复的冕服体系，成为礼的","path":"terms/mianfu-zhidu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度西周服饰制度的条目，其礼制与等级内涵属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:miaodigou-xing-caitao","title":"庙底沟型彩陶（Miaodigou-Type Painted Pottery）","name_en":"Miaodigou-Type Painted Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["仰韶文化","庙底沟","彩陶","鸟纹","双关"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painted_pottery_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"庙底沟型彩陶是在半坡型基础上发展起来的仰韶文化彩陶类型，以陕西关中为中心，东及山西南部、河南西部，西达甘肃陇东、陇西、陇南以至青海东部。田自秉记其典型器为大口鼓腹小平底钵，彩陶占陶器 10%—15%，纹饰多用带状纹、垂弧纹、平行条纹、圆点纹、回旋钩连纹、网格纹，也有花瓣纹、羽状叶纹，鸟纹应用更多；多用直线和曲线结合构成曲边三角形，黑白双关是特色；年代约 6000—5000 年前。\n\n李立新 201","path":"terms/miaodigou-xing-caitao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"庙底沟型彩陶是 B 维度下仰韶文化彩陶类型的术语条目；其鸟纹与黑白双关属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:miaojin","title":"描金（Miaojin (Gold Tracing)）","name_en":"Miaojin (Gold Tracing)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","漆器","金漆","描金","泥金"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"描金是用金粉在漆器上绘画花纹的漆器装饰技法。来源把它与戗金并列为宋代金漆的主要品种，记描金亦称泥金，日本人称为莳绘；广东阳江南宋墓曾出土一件漆盒，是在黑漆底上描出金色装饰花纹。来源未给描金的用金量、胶结材料、绘制工具与产地。","path":"terms/miaojin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度漆器装饰技法的条目，金粉绘画的纹样属 C 维度，日本称莳绘的称名关系属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ming-dai-nvzhuang","title":"明代女装（附凤冠）（Ming Dynasty Women's Dress）","name_en":"Ming Dynasty Women's Dress (with Phoenix Crown)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","女装","遮眉勒","高冠","凤冠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_group","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2009 册在明代服饰一节记士庶女服与贵族女装。士庶女服头扎遮眉勒，遮眉勒由红、蓝色罗、帛制作的围额巾，后变窄而绣小花，或装饰金银珠翠；时装兴窄袖衫、襦、褙子、长裙。明初流行窄瘦长衫，弘治时兴小巧短衫，仅掩裙腰，由纱、罗、绢、缎、织金、绣彩等制作，分外俏丽。贵族女装多用“高冠”，满饰金银珠翠；后妃命妇有凤冠、霞帔。万历时见“九龙四凤冠”“翊龙双冠”“九翠四凤冠”“鸾凤冠”，甚至用龙凤、珠翠装饰，金","path":"terms/ming-dai-nvzhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下明代女装与冠饰的清单级条目，凤冠的品级制度另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ming-style-furniture","title":"明式家具（Ming-style Furniture）","name_en":"Ming-style Furniture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","家具","硬木","榫卯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_style","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明式家具指明代中期至清代早期（约 15—17 世纪）形成的硬木家具式样，以线形造型、木构架结构、榫卯连接和不施重漆显露木纹为特征。五册来源都把它视为中国传统家具的高峰，并注意到“明式”是一个以时代命名样式的风格概念，而非严格的朝代断代。","path":"terms/ming-style-furniture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明式家具是 B 维度下木作工艺与器物风格命名的术语锚点，其“以时代命名式样”的命名史也涉及 A 维度的史学概念问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mingdai-san-da-chuanxing","title":"明代三大船型（Mingdai San Da Chuanxing (Three Major Ship Types of the Ming Dynasty)）","name_en":"Mingdai San Da Chuanxing (Three Major Ship Types of the Ming Dynasty)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","造船","沙船","福船","广船"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明代三大船型是赵农对明代船型的分类：沙船、福船、广船。来源记沙船为平底，吃水浅、航速快，郑和下西洋船只多以沙船为主，由南京和太仓造船工场制造；福船为尖底船，成为系列战斗船只，分大福船与其他小船只；广船在原先民船基础上改进，一度成为东南沿海抗倭的重要工具。来源未给三类的尺度、载重与帆装。","path":"terms/mingdai-san-da-chuanxing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明代三大船型是 B 维度下明代海船分类的条目；其下西洋与抗倭背景属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mingdai-sizhi-sida-changu","title":"明代丝织四大产区（Mingdai Sizhi Sida Changu (Four Major Silk-Weaving Regions of the Ming Dynasty)）","name_en":"Mingdai Sizhi Sida Changu (Four Major Silk-Weaving Regions of the Ming Dynasty)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","丝织","江浙","四川","山西"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_region","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2016 册把明代丝织分为四大产区：一是江浙地区，为全国丝织生产中心，苏州、杭州、嘉兴之外还有吴江震泽镇、盛泽镇等新兴市镇；二是四川地区，蜀锦历史悠久，保宁有丝绫文锦之饶，阆中家种桑而人饲蚕；三是山西地区，长治、高平、潞卫三处绸机众多，产品称潞绸；四是闽广地区，福建改机、漳州天鹅绒、广东纱均全国闻名。","path":"terms/mingdai-sizhi-sida-changu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明代丝织四大产区是 B 维度下明代丝织生产地理格局的条目，其官营与市场组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mingguang-kai","title":"明光铠（Mingguang Armor）","name_en":"Mingguang Armor","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北周","铠甲","圆护","护心镜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"armor_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明光铠是北周新兴的铠甲形制，胸前背后装左右两块“圆护”，由铜铁制成或打磨光亮似镜，俗称“护心镜”。它与晋“筒袖铠”、南北朝“衲裆铠”并列为三种基本铠甲形制。","path":"terms/mingguang-kai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明光铠是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝铠甲形制的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mingqi","title":"明器（Mingqi (Burial Goods)）","name_en":"Mingqi (Burial Goods)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["随葬","冥器","盟器","模型"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"burial_good","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明器是我国古代专为随葬而制作的器物，又称“冥器”或“盟器”。它通常模仿各种礼器或日用器皿、工具、兵器的形状制成，除器皿外还有人、家畜及鸟兽形象，以及车船、家具、建筑物等模型，从新石器时代开始历代墓中都有发现。","path":"terms/mingqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明器是 B 维度下随葬器物与模型化设计的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mingzhuang","title":"明装（Mingzhuang (Ming-Style Dress)）","name_en":"Mingzhuang (Ming-Style Dress)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","民服","服饰","明装","襦裙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_group","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明装是明代庶民服装样式日趋丰富而形成的服饰特色。赵农在民服节先总述这一特色的形成，再分述女装襦裙与裙褶（百褶裙、凤尾裙、玉裙）、霞帔、褙子、比甲与男装方巾圆领：士人戴儒巾、穿斜领大襟宽袖的衣饰，庶民杂役着青布长衣，农夫穿衫、裙、裤、戴皂布巾。来源未给明装的形制规范、流行年代与地域差异。","path":"terms/mingzhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明装是 B 维度下明代庶民服饰组合的条目；其阶层差异与清代满汉融合属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:minnan-tulou","title":"闽南土楼（Minnan Tulou）","name_en":"Minnan Tulou","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","民居","福建","客家","夯土"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"earthen_building","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"闽南土楼是福建客家人的建筑样式，为北方人南迁后根据当地自然环境与气候创造的碉堡式土楼。赵农记圆形外墙厚度约 1.5 米，建筑时常将松枝、竹子加入土墙内起肋筋作用，土墙用石块与土混合夯实；外墙楼层开小型箭窗，内部以隔扇、屏门分割空间并延伸挑檐；底层厨房、二层储藏、三四层住人，院落中心有祖堂、客厅、水井。来源未给直径、层数、住户数与代表性土楼名。","path":"terms/minnan-tulou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"闽南土楼是 B 维度下福建客家夯土民居的条目；其宗族群居与防御组织归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:minsucun","title":"民俗村（Minsucun (Folk Village Park)）","name_en":"Minsucun (Folk Village Park)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["改革开放","公园","民俗村","民族风情","中华民族园"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"park_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"民俗村是现代化程度较高城市修建的新园林类型，集南北不同民族风情于一园，使游人在公共环境中获得人文信息和有益经验。赵农把它与「中华民族园」并列为这类新园林的例子。来源未给民俗村的定义式界说、具体园名、分布与经营方式。","path":"terms/minsucun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"民俗村是 B 维度下现代民族风情园林类型的条目；其作为城市公共文化设施的属性归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:minzu-wenhua-xinli-jiegou","title":"民族文化—心理结构（National Cultural-Psychological Structure）","name_en":"National Cultural-Psychological Structure","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["设计史观","文化心理","费正清","以中国看中国"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historiographical_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"民族文化—心理结构是李立新提出的设计史研究视角：造物历史的进程与一个民族的文化—心理结构的发展过程相一致，应从造物源头弄清这一结构如何在造物进程中显现和表述，再进入各阶段的造物结构。他引费正清“以中国看中国”，并批评把“图腾”观念机械套用于中国早期造物。","path":"terms/minzu-wenhua-xinli-jiegou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史研究视角的条目，造物形态与工艺属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mise-porcelain","title":"秘色瓷（Mise Porcelain）","name_en":"Mise Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","五代","越窑","吴越","贡瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秘色瓷是唐五代越窑烧造的高等级青瓷，长期只见于文献，1987 年法门寺地宫出土实物后始得确认。五册来源有直接记载（高丰一册无“秘色瓷”字样）。来源在两点上不一致：法门寺地宫所出秘色瓷的件数，以及秘色瓷主要归属唐代还是五代吴越。另外“秘色”之名各册均未解释，只记陆龟蒙“秘色越器”之称与“千峰翠色”之诗。本 KU 并列。","path":"terms/mise-porcelain.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秘色瓷是 B 维度下唐五代越窑贡瓷的品种条目，其官府督造、贡奉与外交用途属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mojie-deng","title":"摩羯灯（Makara Lamp）","name_en":"Makara Lamp","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","灯具","摩羯鱼","省油灯","契丹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lamp_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"摩羯灯是辽代瓷灯具，因器形作长鼻上卷、兽首鱼身鱼尾而得名。高丰记内蒙古哲里木盟库伦旗辽墓与辽宁北票水泉辽墓各出一件，过去曾被认作水盘或水滴，后经中国历史博物馆孙机考证，定名为摩羯灯，并指出它具有与汉族省油灯相同的功能。来源把它的设计成功归为两点：把汉族省油灯的夹层结构与印度神话中的摩羯鱼形象结合起来；又依横向造型把隔层由“上下式”改为“前后式”。","path":"terms/mojie-deng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"摩羯灯是 B 维度下辽代瓷灯具的类型条目，其摩羯鱼母题源自印度神话，属 E 维度跨文化互动；造型与省油结构的结合另涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mu-ji","title":"木屐（Wooden Clogs）","name_en":"Wooden Clogs","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["南朝宋","鞋具","木屐","江南","谢灵运"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"footwear","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"木屐是来源所记的一种居家冶游鞋具，脚底有两齿以践踏泥水。来源称此时屐的形式在江南、中原普遍流行。来源又记南朝宋谢灵运好作名山游、多着木屐的传说与李白诗篇。来源把木屐的流行与江南湿润温暖的气候联系起来。来源未给木屐的尺寸、木材种类、制作工艺与出土实物，图版未核。","path":"terms/mu-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的鞋具条目，记录木屐的形制、流行与地域气候条件；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:muban-nianhua","title":"木版年画（Woodblock New Year Picture）","name_en":"Woodblock New Year Picture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["雕版印刷","年画","招贴画","民间美术","清代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"print_genre","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"木版年画是用雕版印刷的民间画，题材多为世俗生活、吉祥人物与节令风俗，因常在岁末新春张贴而得名。四册中只有高丰给出定义与源流：宋代茶肆酒馆张挂名人绘画，南宋出现“纸画儿”行业，民间画家创作后雕版印刷千百张，世俗题材者“人们一般把这些画称之为木版年画”；他还特别指出，其中一些木版年画“并不限于岁末新春时才张贴”，平时也用于商业场合，“已带有招贴画的意味”。夏燕靖两版与赵农只在清代印刷段列产地与外销，不","path":"terms/muban-nianhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"木版年画是 C 维度下民间雕版印刷品与商业招贴的术语锚点；雕版、套色与拱花工艺属 B；产地、作坊与外销属 D。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:mudan","title":"牡丹（Peony）","name_en":"Peony","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","纹样","花卉","牡丹","卷草"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"floral_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"牡丹是唐人所爱赏的花卉。来源引《本草》《唐本注》《通志略》《群芳谱》《异人录》记其异名、得名与国色天香之称，并记唐代赏牡丹成风、多见于诗文。在工艺纹样上，来源称植物纹中多以牡丹为主题，唐代卷草多以牡丹为主花，并认为卷草以牡丹为主体有其社会原因。来源未给牡丹纹的构成式样、年代序列与具体器物实例。","path":"terms/mudan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度唐代花卉纹样的条目，其在织物与器物上的施用属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:muhua","title":"木画（Wood Inlay (Muhua)）","name_en":"Wood Inlay (Muhua)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","漆木器","镶嵌","象牙","鹿角"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"wood_inlay","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"木画是唐代创造的一种精巧华美的镶嵌工艺，用染色的象牙、鹿角、黄杨木等制成装饰花纹，镶嵌在木器上。来源把它列在唐代家具的螺钿、平脱、金银绘、密陀僧绘、夹缬、蜡缬等装饰方法之后，并记正仓院所藏唐代挟轼与棋局都以木画为饰。来源未给工序、胶料、嵌片厚度与产地。","path":"terms/muhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代木器镶嵌工艺的条目，嵌片构成的纹样属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:na-dang","title":"衲裆（Nadang (Two-Panel Vest)）","name_en":"Nadang (Two-Panel Vest)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北朝","男装","女装","衲裆","搭襻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"衲裆是北朝短衣的一种。2009 册记北朝短衣多为折襟，有翻领、窄袖，也有宽袖；另有贯头衫，圆领窄袖、对襟开至胸部、曲袍到膝，多间色横条纹装饰；衲裆用两片组成，前片挡胸、后片挡背，肩上以搭襻联结，腰间扎革带。同册女装段又记北方男式衲裆女子也用，引《搜神记》“著白练衫，彤绣衲裆”。","path":"terms/na-dang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"衲裆是 B 维度下北朝短衣的形制条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:nan-xiu-bei-xiong","title":"南秀北雄（Southern Elegance and Northern Vigor）","name_en":"Southern Elegance and Northern Vigor","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","书法","审美趣味","地域文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"aesthetic_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南秀北雄是赵农概括南北朝文化分化后审美趣味的表述。来源以书法为例，把苍雄的北朝摩崖石刻与柔美的南方文人书札对举，并以《兰亭集序》说明南方文人寻找个人精神家园的心声。来源称此后的南北朝时代继续保持着南朝的旖旎和北方的豪爽。来源在写经一节又称写经的书体习惯也体现着南秀北雄的风格。来源未给这一表述的定义、提出者与系统论证；它属作者概括的审美判断，本条不作风格史定论。","path":"terms/nan-xiu-bei-xiong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"A 维度下的审美概念条目，记录作者对南北朝文化风格的概括；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:nangeng-nvzhi","title":"男耕女织（Nangeng Nvzhi (Men Plow, Women Weave)）","name_en":"Men Plow, Women Weave","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","自然经济","家庭分工","纺织业","布帛货币"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"男耕女织是春秋战国时期以家庭内部分工为标志的自然经济形态。2009 册将其置于封建制度建立、铁器推广、农业与手工业发展的背景中，记城市纺、织、染、缝作坊随之兴旺，官府设作坊由工官指使工匠织造练染，产品供统治者享用、赏赐和馈赠；布帛并作为通用货币与黄金比价交换。","path":"terms/nangeng-nvzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"男耕女织是 D 维度下春秋战国生产组织与设计制度的条目，兼涉 B 维度纺织生产。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:nanjing-yunjin","title":"南京云锦（Nanjing Yunjin Brocade）","name_en":"Nanjing Yunjin Brocade","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","官营织造","妆花缎","库锦","库缎"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南京云锦是官营织造生产的提花多彩丝织物，晚清时因花纹绚烂如云彩得名，包括妆花缎、库锦、库缎。其生产用长 5.6 米、高 4 米、宽 1.4 米的大花楼木质提花机，上下两人操作，一天仅织五至六厘米，故称“寸锦寸金”。2009 册又记云锦花纹样依身份职业区别，分为贡品花样、时新花样、官服花样、吏服花样、商服花样、农服花样和僧道服饰七类。","path":"terms/nanjing-yunjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"南京云锦是 B 维度下明清官营织造与提花丝织的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:nashishi","title":"纳石失（Nasish）","name_en":"Nasish","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","织金锦","丝织","官匠局","波斯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"纳石失是元代对加金织物（织金锦）的称法，以片金线或圆金线作纹纬织成，供蒙古贵族制衣与佩饰。五册来源有直接记载（李立新一册无\"纳石失\"字样）。来源在语源的确定程度上不一致：赵农直接释为波斯语译音，田自秉称\"可能是波斯语的讹译\"。高丰对元代大量加金的风气给出六册中唯一的负面评价。本 KU 并列。\n\n夏燕靖 2016 另补加金织物兴盛的三项原因：除蒙古民族的习俗喜好之外，更重要的是国力扩张时从被征服区域","path":"terms/nashishi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"纳石失是 B 维度下元代织金锦的代表品种，其波斯语源、西域工匠与官方匠局的管理方式属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:nazi-daiyi","title":"纳资代役（Nazi Daiyi (Commutation of Corvée into Payment)）","name_en":"Nazi Daiyi (Commutation of Corvée into Payment)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","中晚唐","纳资代役","力役","庶族地主"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tax_labor_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代中晚期工匠以缴纳资财代替官府力役的制度。2016 册把纳资代役的发生系于庶族地主所有制的确立：中晚唐商品经济在封建经济领域内明显抬头，工匠无须在官府服役，终于可以“纳资代役”。来源给出三层判断：对工匠而言获得较大程度的自由；对经济而言是更便利的生产形式；对劳动生产率而言意味着提高，同时也是一种剥削量的增加，并认为唐中期实行的纳资代役在一定程度上是促进手工业行会自身改进的动力。","path":"terms/nazi-daiyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下唐代工匠役制与商品经济关系的条目，其工艺生产影响归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:niao-wen","title":"鸟纹（Bird Motif）","name_en":"Bird Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","商代","青铜器","装饰纹样","鸟纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鸟纹是周代盛行的青铜器装饰纹样。田自秉以商周对比说明：商代鸟纹头向前、身体成一字形；周代鸟纹头向回看、尾亦下卷，基本上构成 S 形的骨架。来源只有这一组对比，未给型式分类、年代序列与器物分布。","path":"terms/niao-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鸟纹是 C 维度下周代青铜装饰纹样的术语条目；其青铜器载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:nirenzhang","title":"泥人张（Clay Figure Zhang）","name_en":"Clay Figure Zhang","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","天津","彩塑","泥塑","泥人张"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"clay_figurine_school","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"泥人张是天津张姓一家世代相传的彩塑。清代段记它清末闻名于世，第一代张万全、第二代张明山，传至第五代张铭、张钺；特色是能表现人物鲜明个性，体格动态合乎解剖结构，夸张合理，取舍得当，再涂明快色彩而形神兼备。新中国段记它起源于清代，现在已是第五代，具有鲜明的现实主义艺术特色，第四代张景祜钻研新的艺术理论而使作品水平日益提高。","path":"terms/nirenzhang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度民间彩塑流派的条目，形神兼备的造型标准与敷彩属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:niu-che","title":"牛车（Ox Cart）","name_en":"Ox Cart","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","车辆","牛车","出行","舆服"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"牛车是以牛牵引的乘车，来源在魏晋南北朝车辆一节记许多贵族以牛车代步并演变为社会时尚。来源引《晋书·舆服志》说明牛车由贫者所用渐转为天子至士的常乘。来源又记牛车用途扩大、驭牛术提高与乘坐姿势的改变。来源 L3382 为「图 5-8 魏晋 彩绘砖《牛车》」图注，图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。来源未给牛车的具体结构、尺寸、挽具与出土实物。","path":"terms/niu-che.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的车辆条目，其舆服与身份制度面向列为 D 维度辅助；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:nu-crossbow","title":"弩（Crossbow）","name_en":"Crossbow","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","秦汉","远射兵器","弩机","青铜弩机"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"弩是赵农第三章“兵器”一目中的机械性远射兵器，来源称它在弓箭基础上发展，尤其加强了箭簇的威力（L1880）。来源述其由臂、弓、机三部分合成，弩弓竹制、弩臂硬木，弩机包括扳机与钩心，一扳即发（L1882）。来源还引《吴越春秋·勾践阴谋外传》的“鸟不及飞，兽不暇走，弩之所向，无不死也”说明弩的威力（L1882）。","path":"terms/nu-crossbow.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"弩是 B 维度下春秋战国至秦汉的远射兵器条目，与弓箭、戈、矛、戟、殳同列车战常规兵器，秦汉段落在弩机上加刻度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:nvzhen-wenzi","title":"女真文字（Jurchen Script）","name_en":"Jurchen Script","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["金代","女真","文字","女真大字","女真小字"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"script","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"女真文字是金代创制的文字。赵农引《金史·完颜希尹列传》记希尹依仿汉人楷字、因契丹字制度、合本国语而制女真字，熙宗另制女真字，希尹所撰为大字、熙宗所撰为小字；女真文字亦为方块字样式，目前只发现一种；女真早期用契丹文，女真文字创立后废除契丹文，但汉文与契丹文长期交替使用，汉文成为北方许多民族的共同语言。来源未给女真文字的字数与字形结构。","path":"terms/nvzhen-wenzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"女真文字是 C 维度下金代文字设计的条目；其废立与汉化政策归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:oracle-bone-script","title":"甲骨文（Oracle Bone Script）","name_en":"Oracle Bone Script","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","占卜","龟甲","汉字体系","贞人"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"script_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"甲骨文是商代刻写在龟甲、兽骨上的占卜文字，完整规范，使中国汉字第一次成为系统的文化体系。商朝用龟甲卜筮，占卜过程包括打磨龟腹甲背甲、去牛肩胛骨骨臼、钻孔、以蓍草烧灼，正面出现兆纹，“龟曰卜、蓍曰筮”；甲骨文内容广泛、记载明确，常见“王占曰”。","path":"terms/oracle-bone-script.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"甲骨文是 C 维度下商代文字体系的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ou-li","title":"耦犁（Ou Li (Two-Ox Plow)）","name_en":"Ou Li (Two-Ox Plow)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","西汉","农具","耕作技术"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_implement","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"耦犁是汉武帝时期推广的二牛三人耕作方法，由搜粟都尉赵过推行。来源把耦犁与耧车合称耦犁耧车，并说明二牛抬杠、一人前导牛、一人后扶犁、一人中间压辕的分工。来源未给犁体结构、铁犁铧形制与尺寸，图版未核。","path":"terms/ou-li.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的农具术语条目，关注二牛三人耕作法的操作组织；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pai-gan","title":"拍竿（Pai Gan (Shipborne Stone-Throwing Device)）","name_en":"Pai Gan (Shipborne Stone-Throwing Device)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["南朝","战船","拍竿","船具","水战"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"shipboard_device","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"拍竿是南朝大战船上设置的击敌装置。2009 册记其法为竖立数十尺高的巨木，上悬巨石，敌船迫近时发巨木，将敌船击毁。来源把拍竿与飞龙、翔凤、金翅、青雀、舴艋等南朝官府所造大船并记，并据以说明当时造船设计与生产技术都达到很高水平。","path":"terms/pai-gan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"拍竿是 B 维度下南朝战船装置的条目，其战船形制与航运背景同属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:painted-pottery","title":"彩陶（Painted Pottery）","name_en":"Painted Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","仰韶文化","马家窑","陶器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彩陶指新石器时代在打磨光滑的陶坯上用矿物颜料绘纹、再入窑烧成，使纹样固着于器表的陶器。五册来源都把它作为中国史前装饰艺术的主要载体，重点讨论仰韶文化与马家窑文化的纹样。","path":"terms/painted-pottery.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"彩陶是 B 维度下新石器时代陶器装饰工艺的术语锚点，其纹样母题也涉及 C 维度的视觉符号问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:paleolithic-period","title":"旧石器时代（Paleolithic Period）","name_en":"Paleolithic Period","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["石器时代","打制石器","设计起源","原始社会","考古学分期"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"旧石器时代是以打制石器为标志的人类物质文化发展阶段，分早、中、晚三期。在六册设计史中，它不是单纯的年代背景，而是**设计起源叙事的起点**：夏燕靖两版与李立新都把石器视为人类最早的造物产品，高丰称\"旧石器时代生产工具的设计，是人类最早的设计\"，赵农称\"人类的历史就是从设计和制造器具开始的\"，田自秉则把它作为石器时代两阶段中的第一阶段。本 KU 登记定义、分期、中国境内主要遗存、石器技术演进与设计起","path":"terms/paleolithic-period.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"旧石器时代是 B 维度下的史前技术—造物分期条目，同时是六册设计起源叙事的共同起点；石器作为'物质与精神双重特性产品'的判断牵涉 C 维度。"},{"id":"terms:pan-basin","title":"盘（Pan (Pan Basin)）","name_en":"Pan Basin","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盥洗器","沃盥之礼","虢季子白盘","匜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"盘是青铜盥洗器，与匜配合用于沃盥之礼。2016 册记盘为圆形浅腹，商早期数量较少、西周中期逐渐增多，商代无耳圈足、西周中期后加耳并出现长方形盘，虢季子白盘即属此类。","path":"terms/pan-basin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜盥洗器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pan-kou-hu","title":"盘口壶（Dish-Mouth Ewer）","name_en":"Dish-Mouth Ewer","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["六朝","青瓷","壶式","盘口","系耳"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"盘口壶是六朝青瓷的壶式之一，因口呈盘形得名：鼓腹、细颈、平底，肩部有系，或两个一组，或四个等距离分布，有的有盖。它是天鸡壶的直接祖型——天鸡壶在盘口壶基础上于肩部一面加鸡头、另一面安把手。来源未给尺寸、年代序列与窑口归属。","path":"terms/pan-kou-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"盘口壶是 B 维度下六朝青瓷壶式的条目，其盘口与系耳的造型谱系属器物形制层面。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:panchi-wen","title":"蟠螭纹（Coiled Chi-Dragon Pattern）","name_en":"Coiled Chi-Dragon Pattern","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","青铜器","铜镜","蟠螭","蟠虺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蟠螭纹是春秋战国青铜器最主要的装饰纹样。田自秉释“蟠”为缠绕叠压、“螭”为无角的小龙，纹样蟠屈纠结、穿插缭绕；后期流行蟠虺纹，“虺”为小蛇，是龙的简化。同册并记蟠螭纹用于铜镜，方形蟠螭纹镜多作盘绕重叠的镂空装饰。来源未给型式分类与年代序列。","path":"terms/panchi-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蟠螭纹是 C 维度下春秋战国青铜器与铜镜的装饰纹样条目，其铸造与镶嵌工艺属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pei-huang","title":"佩璜（Peihuang (Ornamental Jade Pendant)）","name_en":"Peihuang (Ornamental Jade Pendant)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","佩玉","人纹璜","鸟纹璜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_ornament","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"佩璜是一种玩赏性的佩玉，与礼器上的璜无关。商代佩璜已由素面无纹演变为人纹璜、鸟纹璜、色纹璜、兽纹璜等；其他玉佩有象纹佩、牛纹佩、兔纹佩、龟纹佩、鹿纹佩、鸟纹佩、凤纹佩等，形式变化比较自由。","path":"terms/pei-huang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"佩璜是 B 维度下商代佩玉的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pei-zi","title":"帔子（Peizi (Embroidered Shawl)）","name_en":"Peizi (Embroidered Shawl)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["晋朝","南北朝","女装","帔子","长巾"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_accessory","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"帔子是“披之肩背”的长巾。2009 册记其比披帛颜色更为艳丽，并绣有各种纹饰，像宽领交于胸前；此服式晋朝时兴于贵族间，以后各朝尊卑都用。来源又记北方地区男式“衲裆”女子也用，并引“著白练衫，彤绣衲裆”（参见《搜神记》）。\n\n同段先述魏晋女装以衫、袄、襦、裙宽博为主，褒衣博带、大袖翩翩，对襟为多、领袖缘边，配条纹间色裙、围裳、帔子，为当时女装典型样式，见于敦煌莫高窟壁画与洛阳陶俑；又称当时亦尚“胡服","path":"terms/pei-zi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"帔子是 B 维度下晋朝至南北朝女装披饰的条目，其服用等级与胡服交流另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:peiligang-wenhua","title":"裴李岗文化（Peiligang Wenhua (Peiligang Culture)）","name_en":"Peiligang Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器早期","裴李岗","农业起源","农作物遗迹","生产工具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"裴李岗文化是距今 8000—7000 年的新石器时代早期文化。2016 册以农作物遗迹及农业生产工具为其特点，认为它表明生活方式已从狩猎采集过渡到早期农业，并把 20 世纪 70 年代末发掘的磁山、裴李岗文化并列为新石器时代早期代表。","path":"terms/peiligang-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下新石器时代早期农业文化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pi-pa","title":"琵琶（Pipa (Lute)）","name_en":"Pipa (Lute)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","魏晋南北朝","乐器","弹拨","西域"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"琵琶在秦汉曾是弹拨乐器的总称，来源引刘熙《释名》释其名义，又记汉代马上弹奏之器与曲项琵琶、五弦琵琶的传入与形制（L3850-L3864）。其中“传说汉代”一句在 L3852 末尾被图 5-42、图 5-43、图 5-44 三幅图注隔断，续句在 L3862，本条分别引录并说明，不作连续引文。《释名》引文作「引手却曰杷」，与「推手前曰枇」对文，原文未见重出之「枇杷」，本条照录原句，不另标疑。来源未载琵","path":"terms/pi-pa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"琵琶是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝弹拨乐器形制的条目，其经印度传入与西域流传属 E 维度跨文化互动。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pi-sword-spear","title":"铍（Pi Sword-Spear）","name_en":"Pi Sword-Spear","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","青铜兵器","剑形器","禁卫","秦兵马俑坑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铍是赵农第三章“其他兵器”中所述的剑形兵器，来源称它在春秋战国是禁卫部队的武器（L1917）。来源引《史记·吴太伯世家》的“人皆持铍”说明其规模，并比较铍与矛、剑的差异：比矛多了砍的作用，比剑加大重量，因刺戳与砍劈的综合而成为禁卫防身的利器（L1917-L1922）。来源又称铍后来几乎失传，直到秦兵马俑坑出土秦朝青铜铍，才与文献记载中的铍形吻合（L1922）。","path":"terms/pi-sword-spear.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铍是 B 维度下春秋战国剑形兵器条目，与剑、矛、戈、戟同列短兵与长兵之间。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pi-zhi","title":"皮纸（Bark Paper）","name_en":"Bark Paper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","造纸","皮纸","楮树皮","纸张"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"皮纸是以楮树皮为原料的纸张。赵农记这种造纸材料在隋唐时期已经出现，宋代使其成为重要的造纸材质。来源未给皮纸的产地、楮皮处理与抄造工序，也未说明皮纸与麻纸、竹纸的性能差异；本条只记原料、源流与宋代地位。","path":"terms/pi-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"皮纸是 B 维度下宋代造纸材质的条目，材料限于原料、源流与地位。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:piao-ci","title":"缥瓷（Piao Porcelain）","name_en":"Piao Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["晋代","青瓷","瓯窑","淡青釉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"缥瓷是魏晋南北朝时期出现的淡青色玻璃釉青瓷，即青白色瓷器。田自秉引晋潘岳《笙赋》“倾缥瓷以酌酝”，并称瓯窑胎白釉淡青的制品即晋代诗文所称缥瓷。李立新记当时青瓷胎含铁量增加，出现以淡青色玻璃釉青瓷的“缥瓷”，并形成浙江与河北为中心的南北两大青瓷体系。","path":"terms/piao-ci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"缥瓷是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝青瓷类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pibo","title":"披帛（Pibo (Silk Shawl)）","name_en":"Pibo (Silk Shawl)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["隋唐","女装","纱罗","长条"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_accessory","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"披帛是隋唐女子衣着的组成部分，一般用轻薄的纱、罗或绢裁成长条，长度在两米以上，绕缠于两臂之间，行走时随手臂摆动飘舞；讲究者加饰彩画。","path":"terms/pibo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"披帛是 B 维度下隋唐女子服饰配件的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pilumao","title":"毗卢帽（Pilumao Crown Ornament）","name_en":"Pilumao Crown Ornament","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","家具","架子床","雕饰","佛教文化"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_ornament","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"毗卢帽是清代架子床顶沿的雕饰式样。赵农记清代的架子床在顶沿增添毗卢帽式雕饰，认为这是佛教文化对上流贵族社会的直接影响；许多架子床还在床下设置封闭性床柜，提高私密性的储藏。来源未给毗卢帽的形制来源、纹样细部与实例。","path":"terms/pilumao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"毗卢帽是 B 维度下清式架子床雕饰的条目；其佛教文化影响归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ping-feng","title":"屏风（Folding Screen）","name_en":"Folding Screen","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","春秋战国","汉代","魏晋南北朝","家具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"屏风是起隔档、挡风作用的家具，并延伸到室内空间的分割。赵农记其在西周出现，称“扆”“黼扆”，张置于主人座位后面；春秋战国时放置在床后，屏风上附有彩绘，并有铜构件镶嵌。魏晋南北朝时屏风有完整的制法，也有多扇组合，形态包括围屏、座屏、板屏、插屏、挂屏、折屏。高丰记汉代屏风“最初是一种室内挡风用家具”，所谓“屏其风也”，又用来遮蔽和分隔空间；长沙马王堆汉墓出土两件漆屏风，长方形，下有足座承托，正背中心分","path":"terms/ping-feng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"屏风是 B 维度下家具形制的条目：隔档、挡风与室内空间分割的形制演变在此汇合。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ping-furniture","title":"枰（Ping (Low Square Seat)）","name_en":"Ping (Low Square Seat)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","家具","坐具","席地而坐","望都壁画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"枰是汉代比榻更小的坐具，比榻更矮，枰面为方形，四周不起沿，枰足截面呈矩尺形，足间呈壶门形。河北望都 1 号东汉墓壁画中有独坐板枰的人像。高丰把枰列入汉代漆木家具的品种之一，与床、榻、几、案、屏风并列。原文正文此字作“秤”，同段家具品种名作“枰”，本条以“枰”立目并照录异写。","path":"terms/ping-furniture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"枰是 B 维度下汉代起居家具的形制条目，其席地而坐的生活方式相关背景旁及 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ping-ji","title":"凭几（Pingji (Arm Rest)）","name_en":"Pingji (Arm Rest)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","魏晋","席地而坐","三足几"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"凭几又称倚几、隐几，是席地跪坐疲倦时供胳臂和肘部扶倚、以分散压力的家具。汉代马王堆三号汉墓出土龙纹漆几，几面扁平，下部安高矮两对足；魏晋时期凭几为三足形，几面呈扁平圆弧形，安徽马鞍山东吴朱然墓黑红漆几即此类。","path":"terms/ping-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"凭几是 B 维度下汉魏席坐家具的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pingshiti-goutu","title":"平视体构图（Pingshiti Goutu (Parallel-Projection Composition)）","name_en":"Pingshiti Goutu (Parallel-Projection Composition)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","青铜器","画像纹","装饰构成","横带结构"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"composition_method","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"平视体构图是高丰用来概括战国画像纹装饰构成的术语：把刻画的形象一律作为平面，放在一条平线上，景物一层层、一条条向上方推，使后面与远处的景物也平放在同一条线上。其效果是不作透视缩短而仍层次分明，高丰以《宴乐水陆攻战纹壶》的「上中下三层、中间以横带间隔」为实例，称其“前不遮后,近不挡远”。\n\n高丰把这一手法判为战国青铜器装饰的“大胆的创新”，并指出它对汉代画像砖、画像石影响更直接。本条的实例评价另引庞","path":"terms/pingshiti-goutu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"平视体构图是 C 维度视觉构成方法在战国青铜器装饰上的落实，其载体与技术条件属 B 维度，故本条以 B 为主维度、C 为次维度。本条只记方法与评价；作为实例的《宴乐水陆攻战纹壶》另见 `works/yanle-shuilu-gongzhan-wen-hu.md`。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pinse-yi","title":"品色衣（Pinse Yi (Rank-Coloured Robe)）","name_en":"Pinse Yi (Rank-Coloured Robe)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北周","唐代","品色衣","品服","公服"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"dress_regulation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"封建时代按官品规定颜色的公服。2016 册记品色衣又名“品服”，最早源于北周时期侍卫官的礼服，并引《周书·宣帝纪》原文。来源给出制度沿革：起始于北周，形成于唐朝，宋元明清时沿用，但在局部作了些调整。以唐代为例，官分九品，有着不同品级的服色；着紫穿红者身居高位，穿青色衣者官卑职微；来源以白居易“江州司马青衫湿”说明贬官后的卑微，并记后世以红色为发达标志、以紫色为皇帝之下高官的色彩观念，形成“红得发紫","path":"terms/pinse-yi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下官服等级制度的条目，其服色与形制归 B、C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:piying","title":"皮影（Shadow Puppetry）","name_en":"Shadow Puppetry","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","宋代","皮影","影戏","羊皮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"performing_art","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"皮影是宋代已进入社会娱乐活动的影戏。赵农记皮影源于汉武帝时怀念李夫人，有术士以影人劝慰，随后发展成影戏；随唐代寺院俗讲传播，到宋代已进入社会娱乐活动；宋代初期影人多用白纸板刻制，长期演出容易损坏，后影戏艺人用羊皮替代白纸，引《梦梁录》“自后人巧工精，以羊皮雕形，用以彩色装饰，不致损坏”；影人形象形成脸谱化规范“公忠者雕以正貌，奸邪者刻以丑形”。","path":"terms/piying.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"皮影是 C 维度下影戏表演与影人造型的条目；其羊皮镂刻工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:plank-boat","title":"木板船（Plank Boat）","name_en":"Plank Boat","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["夏商","甲骨文","龙骨","船帆","连舫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"木板船是夏商时期出现并不断改造的船型。赵农认为甲骨文“舟”字可见木板船的建构意识；木板船在独木舟基础上加固木板，使原先的独木成为“龙骨”，扩大船体容量，成为后来制船的基本样式；帆至迟在商代已可用于航行。来源还记西周至春秋战国制船业发达，出现青铜钉、铁钉与连舫，西周设“舟牧”，公元前648年秦船运粮。","path":"terms/plank-boat.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"木板船是 B 维度下夏商至春秋战国船体结构与制船技术的条目，龙骨、船帆、钉接与连舫均属造物工艺。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:plastic","title":"塑料（Plastic）","name_en":"Plastic","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["高分子材料","热塑性","热固性","1958"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"塑料是以天然或合成树脂为基本原料，含填料、增塑剂、着色剂等成分，可在一定条件下塑化成形的材料，分热塑性和热固性两类。具有材质轻巧、绝缘性强、耐腐蚀、颜色美观、易加工等特点；塑型方法有注塑、搪塑、模塑、吹塑、压塑和挤塑。","path":"terms/plastic.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"塑料是 B 维度下现代人工材料与成型工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pointed-bottom-jar","title":"尖底瓶（Pointed-bottom Jar）","name_en":"Pointed-bottom Jar","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","仰韶文化","汲水器","力学设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"尖底瓶是新石器时代仰韶、半坡、北首岭、庙底沟等类型的汲水器，小口、尖底、腹部双耳。六册来源一致把它当作\"功能决定造型\"的典型例证，但在其力学原理的解释路径上分成三种说法，且对尖底的用途给出了不止一种功能。本 KU 合并登记这些解释，不裁定。","path":"terms/pointed-bottom-jar.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"尖底瓶是 B 维度下新石器时代汲水器形制的代表条目，六册一致用它论证功能决定造型的设计逻辑。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:proto-porcelain","title":"原始青瓷（Proto-porcelain）","name_en":"Proto-porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","战国","瓷器起源","青釉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"原始青瓷是商周至战国时期介于陶与瓷之间的青釉器，用高岭土作胎、经 1100—1200℃ 高温烧成、表面有玻璃釉质，但工艺尚未成熟，故称\"原始\"。六册来源均有直接记载，并用它来确定中国瓷器发明的年代上限；高丰一册另用\"原始瓷器\"一名，并记商代至东汉成熟瓷器之间约 1000 多年的过渡时长。来源在\"何时开始\"上给出的时间点不同，本 KU 并存。","path":"terms/proto-porcelain.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"原始青瓷是 B 维度下陶—瓷过渡阶段的技术类型条目，五册来源用以确定中国瓷器发明的上限年代。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pulley","title":"滑轮（Pulley）","name_en":"Pulley","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","起重器具","定滑轮","墨子","墨经"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"滑轮是赵农第三章“工具”一节所述的起重器具，来源称滑车亦称滑轮，利用固定滑轮改变力的运动方向，节省人力（L2004）。来源记滑轮在移动笨重物体时作用显著，是战国时期生产和战争中常见的器具（L2004）。来源引《墨子·墨经》的“绳制挈之也”等文字讲平衡原理，并以汉画像石“泗水捞鼎”说明滑轮的应用（L2011）。","path":"terms/pulley.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"滑轮是 B 维度下战国起重器具的条目，属于杠杆与平衡原理在牵引上的应用。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:pulu","title":"氆氇（Pulu (Tibetan Woollen Cloth)）","name_en":"Pulu (Tibetan Woollen Cloth)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西夏","毛织","氆氇","羊毛","毛褐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"羊毛织品，西夏畜产品加工品种之一。2016 册记西夏畜牧业继续发展，牲畜皮原料相当丰富，使党项人在西夏建立之前就已有发达的畜产品加工业，主要有鞣皮、纺毛线，织造氆氇（pǔ lū，羊毛织品）、毛褐、毡、毯等，产量可观；但早期畜产品仍以牧民就地自行加工为主，专门的皮匠、织匠、裁缝数量很少，生产规模有限。来源并引《马可·波罗游记》记额里合牙（即宁夏）阿剌筛城的驼毛布，作为西夏毛织生产水平较高的旁证。","path":"terms/pulu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西夏毛织品的条目，其畜产品加工与对外贸易牵涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qi-erbei","title":"漆耳杯（Lacquer Ear Cup / Feather Goblet）","name_en":"Lacquer Ear Cup","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","漆器","饮酒器","羽觞","耳杯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"漆耳杯是战国时期流行的饮酒器，木胎髹漆，椭圆形器身、两侧上翘双耳。高丰称其为“战国时期最具特色的漆器新产品”，并记其古名“羽觞”，引《楚辞·招魂》“瑶浆蜜勺，实羽觞些”为证。耳杯以整木块挖制，造型简洁轻薄、用料省工，上、中、下阶层皆可使用，是战国漆器中少见的普及型产品。\n\n与同期的双联漆酒杯相比，耳杯是规范化、共性化的实用产品；其名称来历、形制来源与制作方法，来源均有交代，但未给具体尺寸。","path":"terms/qi-erbei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"漆耳杯是 B 维度下战国漆器器形的条目，饮酒习俗与礼俗用法另涉 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qi-jiuju-baozhuang-he","title":"漆酒（食）具包装盒（Lacquer Wine and Food Vessel Packaging Box）","name_en":"Lacquer Wine and Food Vessel Packaging Box","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","楚墓","漆器","包装设计","酒具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"packaging_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"漆酒（食）具包装盒是战国时期用于成套盛装耳杯、酒壶与漆盘的漆器包装盒，湖北江陵望山、纪城与荆门包山等地先后出土数套。高丰把它看作中国古代包装设计在战国已有较大发展的实物证据：盒体约 70×25×20 厘米，四转角作圆角处理，盖身以子母口扣合，两端短把上留凹槽以便绳缚，盒内以隔板分段分格。\n\n来源记三套盒的内装组合各不相同，但都按同一功能系列配置，装饰统一为内红外黑，据此读作“整体统一、系列配套的设","path":"terms/qi-jiuju-baozhuang-he.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"漆酒（食）具包装盒是 B 维度下战国漆器包装的条目，其商品流通背景另涉 D 维度（商业与设计）。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qi-silk","title":"绮（Qi (Patterned Silk)）","name_en":"Qi (Patterned Silk)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","丝织","绮","斜纹地","金坛南宋墓"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silk_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绮是地纹为斜纹的丝织物。来源引《六书·古文》《释名》《大藏音义》解释其名义、斜纹组织与华次于锦的等级，记一般为一色而宋代发展出两色，花纹有杯文、棋文；江苏金坛南宋墓所出四种小花绮中，几何小花最精美，利用经纬组织循环织出八种不同外形、方向与结构的几何纹；此外还有用单枝星菊和单朵梅花组成的大花朵折枝花绮。来源未给尺寸、密度与织机结构。","path":"terms/qi-silk.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代丝织品种的条目，几何小花与折枝花的组织效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qi-vessel","title":"欹器（Qi Vessel (Tilted Vessel)）","name_en":"Qi Vessel (Tilted Vessel)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋","鲁桓公庙","孔子","注水器","满招损"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_category","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"欹器是置于庙堂、可注水以验证其倾斜状态的容器。赵农引《荀子·宥坐》记孔子在鲁桓公庙见欹器，说明它空虚时倾斜、注水适中时端正、注满时倾覆；孔子让学生用水试验，果然如此。来源由此把欹器解释为以器具象征社会规范的器物，并与《尚书》的“满招损，谦受益”相联系。","path":"terms/qi-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"欹器是 B 维度下先秦庙堂容器的条目，其注水验证与规范象征见来源同段。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qian-you-tao","title":"铅釉陶（Lead-Glazed Pottery）","name_en":"Lead-Glazed Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["低温铅釉","汉代","银釉","黄绿釉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铅釉陶是涂有黄绿色低温铅釉的陶器。铅釉熔点低，约 700℃~800℃ 即可烧成，并能薄薄匀挂在胎上；釉中混有不同金属元素则形成黄、绿、褐、土红等多种色彩。铅釉陶是汉代陶瓷工艺的代表，因釉面泛出银色光彩，又称银釉。2009 册另记北方陶器以铅釉最为出色，由北魏施釉创新，有黄地加绿彩、白地加绿彩、黄绿褐三彩并用等，釉质晶莹明亮；山西大同“深绿釉陶器”为太和八年（484）前烧制，山东高唐“酱色釉陶器”系","path":"terms/qian-you-tao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铅釉陶是 B 维度下汉代至北朝低温釉陶的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qianchao-houshi","title":"前朝后室（Front Court and Rear Chambers）","name_en":"Front Court and Rear Chambers","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","紫禁城","宫殿布局","皇家建筑规范"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architectural_planning_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"前朝后室是明清皇家建筑的布局规范。赵农记紫禁城的宫殿建筑风格将前朝后室的皇家建筑规范体现得淋漓尽致；前朝即前三殿，后室即后三宫。来源未给规范的文献出处、形成年代与具体空间序列。","path":"terms/qianchao-houshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"前朝后室是 B 维度下明清宫殿布局规范的条目；其礼制与朝仪秩序归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qiang-di","title":"羌笛（Qiang Di (Qiang Flute)）","name_en":"Qiang Di (Qiang Flute)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","魏晋南北朝","乐器","羌族","竖吹"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"羌笛是甘肃、四川一带的羌族乐器，来源称其为后来箫的雏形，并与笛以横吹、竖吹相区别（L3866）。秦汉乐器群中已见羌笛（L3850）。来源只给族属、地域与吹奏方式的判断，未载形制、孔数、材质、演奏场合与图像，图版未核。本条证据有限，confidence 定 low。","path":"terms/qiang-di.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"羌笛是 B 维度下秦汉至魏晋羌族竖吹管乐器的乐器条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qiangjin","title":"戗金（Qiangjin (Engraved Gold Lacquer)）","name_en":"Qiangjin (Engraved Gold Lacquer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["漆器","针刻","填金","戗银","辍耕录"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"戗金是在漆面雕刻花纹、在刻纹中上漆后再填金粉的漆器装饰技法，起源于战国针刻。填银称戗银、填彩漆称填彩，花纹仍呈刻划的阴文；与描金同属金漆主要品种。《辍耕录》记戗金戗银法：以黑漆为地、针刻画，再以新罗漆调雌黄（金）或韶粉（银）嵌缝，铺金银薄揩实。","path":"terms/qiangjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"戗金是 B 维度下漆器装饰技法的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qianhai-ling","title":"迁海令（Qianhai Ling (Coastal Evacuation Edict)）","name_en":"Qianhai Ling (Coastal Evacuation Edict)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","康熙","迁海令","海禁","台湾"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"maritime_policy","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"迁海令是康熙时期一度颁布的沿海迁移政策，令沿海地区渔民向内陆迁移 30 里。赵农把它置于清代造船业发展与清初平定台湾的背景下叙述：郑成功父子据守台湾、以造船技术领先在东南沿海攻城掠地，清政府一筹莫展，后勉强打造若干船只收复台湾。来源未给迁海令的颁布与废止年份、执行范围与后果。","path":"terms/qianhai-ling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"迁海令是 D 维度下康熙时期沿海迁移政策的条目；其与清代造船及平台战事的关系属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qidan-wenzi","title":"契丹文字（Khitan Script）","name_en":"Khitan Script","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","契丹","文字","契丹大字","契丹小字"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"script","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"契丹文字是辽代以汉字隶书为样式创制的文字。赵农引《新五代史》“汉人教之以隶书之半增损之，作文字数千，以代刻木之约”，说明其形成过程与替代刻木记事的用途；记契丹文字原有 3000 多个，相对汉字简单，使用仍不便，后有人参照回鹘文字改造为以记录语音为主的契丹小字；辽代契丹文字与汉文字通用并行，大量汉籍译为契丹文，契丹文字用于墓志、碑文、印章、货币、铜镜、鱼符。来源未给字母表、字形对照与创制年代。","path":"terms/qidan-wenzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"契丹文字是 C 维度下辽代文字设计的条目；其行政使用与民族政策背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qiequ-wen","title":"窃曲纹（Qiequ Motif）","name_en":"Qiequ Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","青铜器","装饰纹样","窃曲纹","穷曲纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"窃曲纹是周代青铜器的重要装饰纹样。《吕氏春秋》称“周鼎有窃曲，状甚长，上下皆曲”，又有穷曲纹之名，认为穷则曲。田自秉记其一般组成 S 形，形成直中有圆、圆中有方的特点；并录郭沫若的木材纹模拟说，随即反驳，认为仍是适应装饰部位要求而变形的动物纹样，是动物纹的简化和抽象化。来源未给型式分类、年代序列与器物分布。","path":"terms/qiequ-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"窃曲纹是 C 维度下周代青铜装饰纹样的术语条目；其青铜器载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qijia-wenhua","title":"齐家文化（Qijia Culture）","name_en":"Qijia Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["黄河上游","甘肃广河","铜器","双耳罐","马鞍口陶罐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"齐家文化是黄河上游在马家窑、半山、马厂型之后兴起的文化，时间约等于龙山文化时期，基本上和夏代相始终；彩陶不多，装饰纹样以菱形纹、棋格纹、网格纹为最多，器形以双耳罐和马鞍口式陶罐为典型。2016 记其为黄河上游新石器中晚期文化，位于甘肃广河县齐家坪，并称其出现铜器；马家窑文化在时间顺序上下接齐家文化。","path":"terms/qijia-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"齐家文化是 B 维度下黄河上游新石器时代文化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qimu-jiaju","title":"漆木家具（Lacquer-Wood Furniture）","name_en":"Lacquer-Wood Furniture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","家具","漆器","席地而坐","榫卯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_category","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"漆木家具是中国古代早期家具的主体，以木为胎、髹漆为饰，春秋战国时期大规模发展。高丰把它放在建筑与漆器两条线索之间：一方面，抬梁式木构架至迟春秋时已初步完备，为家具提供了用材与框架基础；另一方面，漆器生产的兴盛为家具提供了髹饰工艺与装饰语汇。\n\n来源记其品种主要有几、案、床、箱、屏风，设计特点是“造型低矮，方便实用”，装饰完全采用漆器手法。信阳长台关的漆木床、江陵望山的漆座屏、曾侯乙的彩绘漆几与漆案","path":"terms/qimu-jiaju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"漆木家具是 B 维度下春秋战国低型家具的类别条目，席地而坐的起居方式与用几等级另涉 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qin-ban-liang","title":"秦半两（Qin Ban Liang）","name_en":"Qin Ban Liang","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","货币","圆形方孔","半两"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"currency","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦半两是秦国形成、秦朝统一推行的圆形方孔铜钱，以半两为重量单位。来源把它置于从贝币记数到铜钱记重的货币史转折中，并把方孔的功能解释与天圆地方的文化联想明确分开。来源未给钱币实测直径、重量与出土实物，图版未核。","path":"terms/qin-ban-liang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"D 维度下的货币术语条目，其铸造形制与工艺面向列为 B 维度辅助；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qin-dai-fu-shi","title":"秦代服饰（Qin Dynasty Dress）","name_en":"Qin Dynasty Dress","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦代","服饰","兵马俑","深衣","交领右衽"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦代服饰是秦统一前后形成的衣装样式。2009 册记秦初有“兼收六国车旗服御”之说，以利于将服制统一；从秦兵马俑可以看出秦代服制的基本形象，衣装形制与战国无大差别。男女服饰多为交领、右衽、衣袖窄小，衣缘及腰带多为彩织装饰；兵士衣长齐膝，左右两襟为对称直裾式，下角如燕尾，保持深衣的基本形制；面料重绢绣，绣纹多山云鸟兽、藤蔓植物与几何菱纹。","path":"terms/qin-dai-fu-shi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秦代服饰是 B 维度下的衣装形制条目，其“兼收六国车旗服御”的服制统一属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qin-liang","title":"秦量（Qin Measure）","name_en":"Qin Measure","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","度量衡","量器","秦诏书","陶量"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"measuring_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦量是秦代量器，来源分铜量与陶量两类：铜量制为 1/2、1/3、1/4 斗量，陶量制为半斗、一斗与一斛（100升）（L2829）。秦始皇廿六年诏书要求“法度量则不壹歉疑者，皆明壹之”，诏书见于各种衡器与量器，近年山东出土的秦陶量上即有诏书（L2821）。来源未给单件容量实测、尺寸、铭文行款与具体出土地点。","path":"terms/qin-liang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秦量是 B 维度下秦代量器的条目，其统一度量衡的制度面属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qin-quan","title":"秦权（Qin Weight）","name_en":"Qin Weight","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","度量衡","衡器","砝码"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"measuring_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦权是秦代衡器中的权，铜质秦权在称量时作砝码使用（L2829）。来源列出的秦权器重量序列为“石、钧、24斤、16斤、9斤、8斤、5斤、1斤和半两”，未说明石、钧与斤的进位关系（L2823）。称量时“衡标的一端是实物，另一端是秦权，而提钮在衡标的中心，衡标平稳则物重相等，衡标不平则物重不等”（L2829）。同段并给秦制单位换算：“秦王朝的一尺相当于今23厘米，一斤相当于今250克，一升相当于今200","path":"terms/qin-quan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秦权是 B 维度下秦代衡器与称量器具的条目，其统一度量衡的制度面属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qin-zhuan-han-wa","title":"秦砖汉瓦（Qin Bricks and Han Tiles）","name_en":"Qin Bricks and Han Tiles","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","建筑材料","画像砖","瓦当","陶制砖瓦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_component","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦砖汉瓦是秦汉陶制砖瓦的合称，涵盖画像砖、砌墙砖、铺地砖、空心砖、条砖、筒瓦、板瓦与圆瓦当。三册的叙述位置不同：夏燕靖两版把它放在\"陶瓷设计\"的彩绘陶之后，以画像砖的图像价值与瓦当的纹饰文字为主，并给出\"烧成后吸水有声，故后世有'秦砖汉瓦'之称\"的得名解释；赵农把它放在\"建筑\"的砖瓦段，以陶制砖瓦技术对土木建筑屋顶与中原建筑样式成型的作用为主，另记楔形、榫头形异形砖与方位性瓦当。本 KU 以两套叙","path":"terms/qin-zhuan-han-wa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秦砖汉瓦是 B 维度下秦汉建筑材料的合称条目；制坯、烧造、砌拱与瓦当方位属 B，画像砖的社会图像与四神方位观念牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qin","title":"琴（Qin）","name_en":"Qin","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","弦乐器","独奏","琴师","师旷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"琴是赵农所记春秋战国时期的一种主要弦乐器，可以合奏、伴奏或独奏，尤其独奏是个人情怀的流露。来源称当时琴师水平很高，举师旷、师文、师冕、伯牙诸人；又记齐人杞梁殖战死后其妻援琴作歌、七日城崩的故事，并引《古诗源·琴歌》“乐莫乐兮新相知，悲莫悲兮生别离”说明琴歌的情怀。来源没有给出琴的形制、弦数、尺寸、材质与出土实物。","path":"terms/qin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"琴是 B 维度下春秋战国弦乐器的条目，来源给演奏形式、琴师名录与琴歌故事。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qing-baochao","title":"大清宝钞（Qing Baochao）","name_en":"Qing Baochao","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","咸丰","纸币","钱票","货币"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper_currency","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大清宝钞是咸丰年间清政府发行的纸币，简称钱票。赵农记其与户部官票同在咸丰年间发行，面值从二百五十文至两千文共八种；并记顺治年间曾发行钞贯，形制基本与明代宝钞相同，面值从十文至一贯。来源未给宝钞的版式、印造机构、发行总额与流通范围。","path":"terms/qing-baochao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大清宝钞是 D 维度下清代货币制度的条目；其票面形式归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qing-ci","title":"青瓷（Celadon）","name_en":"Celadon","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东汉","越窑","瓯窑","婺窑","德清窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青瓷是我国最早出现的瓷器品种，东汉末年出现，浙江越窑的青瓷成就体现了最高水平；江苏宜兴、江西、湖南、四川等地都出现了早期青瓷的窑址。三国两晋南北朝时期瓷器出现北方白瓷和南方青瓷的分流。魏晋时期青瓷产地主要集中在浙江上虞、永嘉、萧山、余姚、绍兴、临海、丽水、吴兴、德清等地，大体分四个系统：曹娥江地区的越窑、瓯江地区的瓯窑、金衢地区的婺窑、浙北东苕溪地区的德清窑。青瓷常常以动物为造型，增加了青瓷的美感","path":"terms/qing-ci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青瓷是 B 维度下瓷器类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qing-dai-shoushi-toushi","title":"清代首饰与头饰（Qing Dynasty Jewelry and Head Ornaments）","name_en":"Qing Dynasty Jewelry and Head Ornaments","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","首饰","头饰","金镂花","银珐琅"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ornament_group","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2009 册在清代服饰一节记当时流行首饰：满族妇女常以金镂花、银珐琅花饰于髻上；汉族妇女则装珠点翠或用纸胎纱裱大花朵。清代中叶，仿效宫装。后期则少女簪钗栉环；中年用缎绣吉纹的“勒子”，髻上罩麻制绸裱周饰金银的“纂”；老年用硬纸绸裱“冠子”或黑纱“网子”；贵妇则“有钿子之制”，常服钿子，珠翠满饰与半饰。\n\n本条是清单级条目，按满族、汉族、年龄与贵妇身份分记；各饰件的材质、工艺与尺寸来源未给。","path":"terms/qing-dai-shoushi-toushi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下清代首饰与头饰的清单级条目，其身份等级与满汉习俗另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qing-dai-sizhi-pinzhong","title":"清代丝织品种（苏州、松江与杭州）（Qing Dynasty Silk Varieties）","name_en":"Qing Dynasty Silk Varieties (Suzhou, Songjiang, and Hangzhou)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","丝织","贡缎","广缎","洋缎"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type_group","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2009 册在南京云锦之后列清代其他丝织品种：苏州和松江地区有贡缎、广缎、洋缎、羽毛缎；杭州自明中叶以后丝织业进一步发展，绸、缎、绵、纺、绉、绫、罗等出现 14 个大类、200 多个品种、2000 余个花色，图案新颖、富丽华贵。来源又把清代丝织品种的艺术特色分为康熙、雍正、乾隆三期：康熙大体承继明代风格，而以“八达晕”一类图案最有特色；雍正改进织机、采用多层经纬织法，纹样较丰富、色彩更华丽；乾隆吸","path":"terms/qing-dai-sizhi-pinzhong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下清代丝织品种的清单级条目，其纹样风格与宫廷趣味另涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qing-style-furniture","title":"清式家具（Qing-style Furniture）","name_en":"Qing-style Furniture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["家具","清代","广作","苏作","京作"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_style","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清式家具是相对于明式家具的风格概念，指康熙晚期至乾隆近百年间形成的、以广式、苏式、京式三大产地风格共同构成的家具类型。高丰给三期说、造办处背景、三作分工与三条整体风格；田自秉给\"明式简练，清式繁琐\"的总判断与苏作、广作、京作在榫、雕、鳔上的工艺差别；赵农给\"繁琐雕琢、富丽华贵\"的定性，并以太师椅、架子床、宝座、鹿角椅、玫瑰椅、摇椅等具体品类展开。三册对清式的评价一致偏低，但落点不同：高丰着眼于宫廷","path":"terms/qing-style-furniture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"清式家具是 B 维度下明清高型家具的风格条目；造型、榫卯、雕刻与镶嵌工艺属 B，宫廷威权与满族政治象征牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qing","title":"磬（Qing (Stone Chime)）","name_en":"Qing (Stone Chime)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","乐器","孔子","石编磬","曾侯乙墓"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"磬是先秦乐器，来源在乐器节以孔子击磬于卫的故事引出。赵农记一挑担者路过孔子住宅，仅从击磬的乐声中就获得音乐感悟，并说“有心哉”的判断是指音从心出的基本认识。来源另有图 3-45“战国 彩绘石编磬”的图注，以及曾侯乙墓随葬乐器中列有编磬的记载，但都没有描述磬的形制。","path":"terms/qing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"磬是 B 维度下先秦打击乐器的条目，来源只有孔子故事、图注与曾侯乙墓乐器清单，未给形制。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingdai-diaoban-chatu","title":"清代雕版插图（Qing Woodblock Illustration）","name_en":"Qing Woodblock Illustration","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","雕版","插图","萧云从","耕织图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_illustration","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清代雕版插图是清代书籍中的木刻版画插图。赵农认为其在明代基础上有所发展，但艺术趣味和质量不如明代；比较突出的有清初萧云从的《离骚》插图、《太平山图画》，康熙年间王原祁《佩文斋书画谱》与焦秉贞《耕织图》。来源未给插图数量、刻工名录与版式分类。","path":"terms/qingdai-diaoban-chatu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"清代雕版插图是 C 维度下清代书籍版画的条目；其雕版工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingdai-jiaju-sanda-mingzuo","title":"清代家具三大名作（Three Great Qing Furniture Styles）","name_en":"Three Great Qing Furniture Styles","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","苏作","广作","京作","地方风格"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_style","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清代家具以苏作、广作和京作为代表，被称为清代家具三大名作。三者造型与装饰设计各具地方特色，并且一直保持到现在。","path":"terms/qingdai-jiaju-sanda-mingzuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"清代家具三大名作是 B 维度下清代家具地域风格的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingshi-ta","title":"清式榻（Qing-style Couch）","name_en":"Qing-style Couch","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","康熙","家具","榻","背屏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"couch_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清式榻是康熙时期开始变化的一种榻。赵农记榻后背屏有五、七、九之分，中间高于两边，呈山字形势态；榻面加大加宽，几乎与大床相似，罗汉床与榻混淆一体；材质有紫檀、花梨木、红木等区别，技术上运用螺钿镶嵌。来源未给尺寸、背屏具体做法与传世实例。","path":"terms/qingshi-ta.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"清式榻是 B 维度下清代卧具类型的条目；当前只到 Dimension。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtian-shidiao","title":"青田石雕（Qingtian Stone Carving）","name_en":"Qingtian Stone Carving","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","浙江","青田","石雕","松鼠葡萄"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青田石雕是产于浙江青田的石雕，清时极为盛行。它以雕刻松鼠葡萄闻名，别称葡萄山，形容葡萄结实累累、娇嫩欲滴。来源只此一句，未给石矿、艺人、作坊与器物类型。","path":"terms/qingtian-shidiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代石雕的产地工艺条目，松鼠葡萄的果实效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-chu","title":"青铜锄（Bronze Hoe）","name_en":"Bronze Hoe","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","青铜农具","横装木柄","凹字形","铜绿山"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜锄是西周时期已见的横装木柄农具。赵农记最早的铜锄出土于湖北蕲春西周遗址，是一件凹字形的青铜锄；锄是横装木柄的农具，从石锄到青铜锄再到铁锄，是中国农具材料演变的一个过程，一次比一次坚韧耐用、轻巧合理。铁锄最早在湖北大冶春秋战国的铜绿山古矿井中发现。","path":"terms/qingtong-chu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜锄是 B 维度下西周青铜农具的条目，其材料演变属生产技术。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-jiuqi","title":"青铜酒器（Bronze Wine Vessels）","name_en":"Bronze Wine Vessels","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["尊","彝","壶","爵","五爵"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_category","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜酒器分盛酒器和饮酒器两类：盛酒器有尊、彝、壶、卣、罍、觥、盉等，饮酒器有爵、斝、角、觚、觯等。尊由陶尊演变而来，彝与尊同作祭奠使用物，壶仿陶壶、陶壶又仿天然瓜瓢；爵、斝、觚、觯、角合称五爵，其中爵是发现最早的青铜容器，始见于二里头遗址。赵农另按饮酒、盛酒、盛水洗手三组列举：饮酒器为爵、角、觚、斝，盛酒器为尊、壶、钫、卣、方彝、缶、罍、盉、瓿、觯、兕、觥、勺等，盛水洗手器为盆、彝、盂、鉴、盘、斗","path":"terms/qingtong-jiuqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜酒器是 B 维度下商周青铜器类的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-jue","title":"青铜镢（Bronze Jue Hoe）","name_en":"Bronze Jue Hoe","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","青铜农具","翻地","陶模具","石锛"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜镢是商代已出现的青铜翻地农具。赵农记商代遗址中已出现青铜镢的作坊，其中2000件陶模具用于铸范青铜镢；镢类似镐，是一种横斫式的翻地农具，作用是挖根除草、翻动土地。《说文解字》称“镢，大锄”，来源认为其最早出现应与石器时期的石锛有关。青铜镢在商代遗址中发现，铁镢则发现于河南扶沟古城墙下春秋文化层。","path":"terms/qingtong-jue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜镢是 B 维度下商代青铜农具的条目，其作坊与铸范属生产技术。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-lian","title":"青铜镰（Bronze Sickle）","name_en":"Bronze Sickle","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","青铜农具","收割","爪镰","铚"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜镰是西周时期已见的青铜收割农具，由石刀演变而来。赵农记青铜镰在收割谷穗时有用于掐割的爪镰；江苏仪征西周墓出土过一件刃口锋利的青铜镰。镰与铚套用：铚形较小，主要收割谷穗，可用绳绑在手指上使用，也称掐刀或爪镰；镰则带木柄，刀刃细长并稍弯下钩，多用于割砍禾秸。","path":"terms/qingtong-lian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜镰是 B 维度下商周青铜收割农具的条目，其与铚的分工属器用设计。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-lihua","title":"青铜犁铧（Bronze Plowshare）","name_en":"Bronze Plowshare","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","青铜农具","犁","三角犁形器"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜犁铧是商代用于农业生产的青铜犁具。赵农记新石器时期已有石制三角犁形器，到了商代，青铜犁铧出现在农业生产活动中并发挥了重要作用。来源只有这一句，未记器形、尺寸、装柄方式与出土地。","path":"terms/qingtong-lihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜犁铧是 B 维度下商代青铜农具的条目，其与石犁、铁犁的承接尚未在来源中展开。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-liqi","title":"青铜礼器（Bronze Ritual Vessels）","name_en":"Bronze Ritual Vessels","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","祭祀","典礼","等级","奴隶主"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_category","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜礼器是商周时期用于祭祀和典礼的青铜日用器。其造型设计除实用外，多考虑放置祭坛上的陈设效果，因而日用器物造型有了不同因素的观念与审美追求，尤其成为奴隶主阶级表达观念、实行统治的重要工具。西周以成套礼制规定使用数量和规格，使贵贱有等、上下有别。","path":"terms/qingtong-liqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜礼器是 B 维度下商周青铜器类的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-qian-chan","title":"青铜钱铲（Bronze Qian Spade）","name_en":"Bronze Qian Spade","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","青铜农具","铲","钱","货币起源"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool_and_currency_prototype","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜钱铲是商周时期由农具“钱”（铲）演变出货币概念的一组器物与制度。赵农称青铜“钱”本是一种农具，在商周遗址中多次出现，是当时主要劳动器具；因农人喜爱而成为比较固定的交换信物，渐渐固定为特殊商品并演变为货币代称。钱与铲同音，钱也称铲；币由帛而来，后世以“币帛”通称，青铜货币铸成铲、刀、耒等形象。商代铜铲在妇好墓出土共7件，有装饰性铲与实用性青铜铲；铁铲最早见于陕西凤翔秦公墓。","path":"terms/qingtong-qian-chan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜钱铲是 D 维度下由农具演变为货币代称的条目，其青铜铸造与器形属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-shidai","title":"青铜时代（Bronze Age）","name_en":"Bronze Age","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["夏商周","三代","礼器","公元前2000年"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜时代是继旧石器时代、新石器时代后第三个文明期。书中把夏商周时期称为“青铜时代”；中国青铜时代从公元前 2000 年左右开始形成，历时大约 15 个世纪。其特点包括使用大量青铜生产工具、兵器和礼器，且在进入青铜时代以前已有漫长的利用铜矿物制造器具的历史。","path":"terms/qingtong-shidai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜时代是 B 维度下技术史分期的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-shiqi","title":"青铜食器（Bronze Food Vessels）","name_en":"Bronze Food Vessels","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["鼎","鬲","甗","簋","簠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_category","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜食器分煮食器和盛食器两类：煮食器有鼎、鬲、甗等，盛食器有簋、簠、盌、豆等。鬲最初由陶鬲、再经鼎演变而来，三足上部肥大内空以增加受热面积；甗由上部甑和下部鬲结合而成，中间隔穿孔铜片；簋圆腹侈口圈足，常以偶数与鼎配置；簠为长方形，盌为方中带圆的椭圆形，豆则上有盘、中有柄、底为圈足。","path":"terms/qingtong-shiqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜食器是 B 维度下商周青铜器类的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-shuiqi","title":"青铜水器（Bronze Water Vessels）","name_en":"Bronze Water Vessels","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["鉴","盘","匜","盂","沃盥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_category","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜水器主要有鉴、盘、匜、盂、缶、瓿等。匜是西周后出现的盥洗器，器形仿自瓜瓢，前有流、后有鋬，与盘配合用于沃盥之礼；盘为圆形浅腹，商代无耳圈足，西周中期后加耳，虢季子白盘即著名盥洗器；鉴形体较大，有圆、方两种；盂为圆腹深腹附耳盛水器。","path":"terms/qingtong-shuiqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜水器是 B 维度下商周青铜器类的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong-zhu","title":"青铜箸（Bronze Chopsticks）","name_en":"Bronze Chopsticks","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","春秋","餐具","筷子","殷墟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tableware","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜箸是商代已出现的青铜取食器具，来源视为中国筷子被利用的证明，并推测木竹一类筷子应在其先而无法保存。赵农引《礼记·曲礼上》“饭黍无以箸，羹之有菜者用桿，其无菜者不用桿”，称此时的箸是辅助性餐具；第三章再记青铜箸在安阳殷墟出土，证实商代饮食习惯，箸为竹筷、桜为木筷；安徽贵池春秋墓出土铜箸，说明当时筷子已流行，湖北当阳楚墓出土竹箸首粗尾细、长24厘米，与后来使用的大体相同。","path":"terms/qingtong-zhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜箸是 B 维度下商周至春秋取食器具的条目，其与匕、勺的分工属器用设计。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtong","title":"青铜（Bronze）","name_en":"Bronze","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["铜锡合金","六齐","红铜","铜石并用"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜是铜、锡、铅等元素的合金，较纯铜熔点低、硬度高，具有较好的铸造与机械性能。田自秉定义为用红铜加锡的一种合金，因颜色灰青故名；红铜指天然铜。并指出青铜时代之前应当还有一个红铜时代，历史学家称为铜石并用时代。高丰引《考工记》“金有六齐”，指出含锡约 17% 的青铜色泽美观、声音好、可铸精细花纹，一般青铜鼎即用此配方。","path":"terms/qingtong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜是 B 维度下金属材料的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qingtongqi","title":"青铜器（Qingtongqi (Bronze Vessels)）","name_en":"Bronze Vessels","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜时代","合金","夏商周","礼器","马厂文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_category","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜器是以铜与锡的合金制成的器物。2009 册称青铜为世界冶金铸造史上最早的合金，中国青铜时代约从公元前 2000 年开始，历时约 15 个世纪，相当于夏商周三代；青铜器具有熔点低、硬度高等特点，不易锈蚀、填充性好，能铸出精细花纹。来源并记目前发现最早的青铜器为甘肃马厂文化遗址出土的一把铜刀。","path":"terms/qingtongqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青铜器是 B 维度下夏商周青铜造物的总类条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qionglu-zhanzhang","title":"穹庐式毡帐（Dome-shaped Felt Tent）","name_en":"Dome-shaped Felt Tent","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","契丹","居住","毡帐","穹庐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"dwelling","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"穹庐式毡帐是契丹早期的居住形式。赵农记契丹民族早期过着“春水秋山”式的迁徙生活，居住在穹庐式毡帐中；这种毡帐有半圆形的毛毡顶，四周用木棍支撑，用皮绳束绑，在东面开有券形小门。辽立国后燕云一带的生活方式已非常接近中原文化，家具采用唐宋风格的木制家具，如木椅、木桌、木床等，并融入契丹民族的特色。来源未给毡帐直径、骨架构造与搭建工序。","path":"terms/qionglu-zhanzhang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"穹庐式毡帐是 B 维度下契丹早期居住形式的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qipao","title":"旗袍（Qipao）","name_en":"Qipao","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","民国","近代","女装","满族"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"旗袍是清代满族妇女长袍演变而来的女装形制，近代经收紧腰身等改造后成为流行时装。四册来源有直接记载（田自秉、李立新两册无\"旗袍\"字样）。来源对\"旗袍\"之名系于何时、清代形态由谁影响谁、以及近代流行由什么媒介推动，三处表述不同。本 KU 并列，不裁定。","path":"terms/qipao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"旗袍是 E 维度下近代女装改良的代表条目，其礼装规定与满汉服制属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qiu","title":"裘（Qiu (Fur Garment)）","name_en":"Qiu (Fur Garment)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","服饰","裘","皮衣","御寒"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"裘是来源在「裘和氅」小标题下所记的皮制御寒保暖衣服。来源称贵族与普通人的裘衣区别仅在皮料差异。来源又把裘与大氅并述，称大氅无袖、比皮裘宽敞肥大。来源未给裘的形制结构、毛皮种类、礼仪等级与出土实例。本条不补「狐裘」「羔裘」等来源未载的礼制内容。","path":"terms/qiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的服饰形制条目，记录裘的皮制御寒属性与皮料差异；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qiwan-lugao","title":"齐纨鲁缟（Qi Silk and Lu Fine Gauze）","name_en":"Qi Silk and Lu Fine Gauze","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","齐鲁","染织","齐纨","鲁缟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_product","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"齐纨鲁缟是春秋战国齐鲁地区最著名的丝织品。田自秉记“齐纨”“鲁缟”已全国闻名，齐国染织生产量最大，有“冠带衣履天下”之喻；同册引《韩非子·说林上》鲁人织屦、其妻织缟的故事与《左传》楚国索鲁国缝工、织工各百人的记载，说明鲁地染织的发达与地域性。来源未给纨、缟的织法、规格与产量。","path":"terms/qiwan-lugao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"齐纨鲁缟是 B 维度下春秋战国齐鲁丝织品的条目，其地域生产与贸易属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:quan-tai","title":"筌台（Quantai (Waist-Drum Stool)）","name_en":"Quantai (Waist-Drum Stool)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","坐具","佛教","腰鼓","筌蹄"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"筌台是腰鼓形坐墩，也称筌蹄。来源称其形象为腰鼓，在魏晋时期佛教造像中屡屡出现，并判断中原原有墩的造型，佛教进入中原后被引入寺院，成为实用的坐具（L3774）。来源未载尺寸、材质、坐高、具体造像实例与图像细节，图版未核。本条不写筌蹄与佛教譬喻的关系等来源外内容，证据仅一段，confidence 定 low。","path":"terms/quan-tai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"筌台是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝腰鼓形坐墩的坐具条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qujialing-wenhua","title":"屈家岭文化（Qujialing Culture）","name_en":"Qujialing Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["屈家岭文化","长江中游","彩陶","彩绘纺轮","蛋壳彩陶"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"屈家岭文化是长江中游新石器时代文化。田自秉记其彩陶以彩绘纺轮和蛋壳彩陶最有特色，时间约在仰韶文化晚期或龙山文化早期；并把它列入母系氏族社会向父系氏族社会转化时期已发现的文化之一。来源未给分布范围、年代测定、遗址清单与陶器分期。","path":"terms/qujialing-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"屈家岭文化是 B 维度下长江中游彩陶文化的术语条目；其彩绘纺轮与蛋壳彩陶属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qun","title":"裙（Qun (Skirt)）","name_en":"Qun (Skirt)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋","服饰","裙","女服","劳动妇女"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"裙是来源所记的下身服饰，亦称裳，多与襦配置。来源在「裙裤」小标题下称因裤的兴起，裙在魏晋以后被裤替代，但仍为正式场合的服饰。来源又在「女服」一节记女裙因身份而异，贵族女子有复裙、双裙等长裙，劳动妇女裙摆紧短。来源未给裙的裁片、尺寸与出土实例，图版未核。本条按 L3597 与 L3620 两处出处分别标注。","path":"terms/qun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的服饰形制条目，记录裙与襦的搭配及其被裤替代；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:qushui-liushang","title":"曲水流觞（Qushui Liushang (Floating Cups on Winding Water)）","name_en":"Qushui Liushang (Floating Cups on Winding Water)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["东晋","兰亭","曲水流觞","修禊","王羲之"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"literati_custom","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"上流置酒杯顺流而下、停于谁前谁饮酒的文人修禊聚会活动。2016 册记东晋永和九年（353）三月三日王羲之与谢安、孙绰等在会稽山阴兰亭修禊，于水边置杯顺流而下，杯停在谁面前谁就饮酒；参加者 41 人，其中 11 人各成两篇、15 人各成一篇、16 人未能成诗各罚酒三觥；王羲之为诗集作序，即《兰亭集序》，被誉为“天下第一行书”，又称“禊帖”。","path":"terms/qushui-liushang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下文人士族礼俗的条目，其书法与器物另涉 C/B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:quxiang-bilei","title":"取象比类（Analogical Thinking through Images）","name_en":"Analogical Thinking through Images","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","思维方式","类比","象","造物观念"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"取象比类是李立新用来指称以“象”把握、创造并与自然世界相联系的类比思维。他称“内圆外方”的设计象征“天圆地方”的观念，具有“取象比类”的思维方法；又称中国造物设计以“天圆地方”为起点，动态地把握相似性原则，通过一系列类比，将自然空间上下四方推演为中央优于四方，并延伸到社会生活中，成为中央帝王领属四方的政治结构依据。他判断这种动态的类比思维比一般的“取象比类”更进一步，将“象”与社会、人事相联系，而","path":"terms/quxiang-bilei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度思维方法的条目，其造物例证属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:quyuan-li","title":"曲辕犁（Curved-Shaft Plow）","name_en":"Curved-Shaft Plow","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","农具","江东犁","犁耕","精耕细作"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"farm_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曲辕犁又称江东犁，是唐代具有代表性的耕犁农具。赵农册在绪论与第六章第四节两处提到它：绪论以简洁语句点出名称、结构与使用便利，第四节则详述其由汉代直长辕改为短曲辕，以及耕作方式由二牛抬杠转为一牛耕犁的变化。来源还称其改变犁辕、犁箭、犁梢、犁底的组合方式，使犁架变小、操作简便、深浅自如，并把它视为传统犁具发展中的重大突破。来源未载犁的尺寸、重量、各部件尺寸比例、制作材料配比与出土实物，也未附结构图或复","path":"terms/quyuan-li.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"曲辕犁是 B 维度唐代农具形制的条目；来源在绪论与农具节的提及均属技术叙述，不涉及设计史书写或史学方法，故不指派 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:rendong-wen","title":"忍冬纹（Honeysuckle Scroll Motif）","name_en":"Honeysuckle Scroll Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["六朝","卷草","植物纹","敦煌","石刻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"忍冬纹是六朝流行的卷草状植物纹，通称卷草。纹样取忍冬花（金银花）枝叶变化或莲叶演变，一般三叶片与一叶片相对排列，有单叶双叶、顺向相背等变化；东晋北魏之后与莲花纹一起渗透于铜器、金银器、砖瓦、石刻、藻井、柱础等造物类型，唐代演变为繁复的卷草，成为中国造物装饰的主题。","path":"terms/rendong-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"忍冬纹是 C 维度下六朝外来植物纹样的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:renliche","title":"人力车（rickshaw）","name_en":"rickshaw","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["民国","城市交通","人力车","拉洋车","平板车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"人力车是 20 世纪中国城市与乡村以人力牵引的车辆类别。赵农记两轮拉车俗称“拉洋车”，是城市短途交通工具，轻便快捷；人力三轮车后面多为平板，多拉货物，也称“平板车”，后来也被改造为载人工具；乡村另有双轮双辕、方型车厢的架子车，也称“劳动车”。来源未给形制尺寸、制造材料、产地与设计者。","path":"terms/renliche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"人力车是 B 维度下人力牵引车辆的术语条目；其城市短途交通属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:renminbi","title":"人民币（Renminbi）","name_en":"Renminbi","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","1948","中国人民银行","货币","人民币"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"currency_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"人民币是中国人民银行 1948 年 12 月开始发行的法定货币。赵农称货币是一个国家的经济标志，记中国人民银行已发行 5 套人民币，以元、角、分为单位，采用十进位制，分铸币与纸币两种形式，并按时更新、引进国际先进技术、精心设计、采取防伪措施。来源未给各套发行年份、面额谱系、设计者与印钞单位。","path":"terms/renminbi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"人民币是 B 维度下现代货币体系的术语条目；其发行制度与国家经济标志属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:renzao-cailiao-jiaju","title":"人造材料家具（Man-Made Material Furniture）","name_en":"Man-Made Material Furniture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","家具","人造板","钢管","塑料"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"人造材料家具是以人造板、钢管和塑料替代天然木材制成的新式家具。来源记我国历代家具大都以木材为主，解放后随着新技术运用，家具的材料与结构都有所突破：材料上逐步以胶合板、纤维板、刨花板、蜂窝板、细木板等人造板以及钢管和塑料代替天然木材；结构上由传统框式向板式发展，使设计更省工、轻便而具简洁明快的效果。来源另记钢管的圆型、方型、异型以及电镀、深冲、冷弯、静电喷涂和红外烘烤，使家具工艺成为现代技艺的综合生","path":"terms/renzao-cailiao-jiaju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度家具材料与结构的条目，工业化生产体制属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:riyongpin-meishuhua-gongyipin-shiyonghua","title":"日用品美术化，工艺品实用化（Aesthetic Daily Goods, Practical Crafts）","name_en":"Aesthetic Daily Goods, Practical Crafts","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","发展方向","日用品","工艺品","双重属性"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_policy","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"日用品美术化、工艺品实用化是新中国工艺美术的发展方向。来源把它建立在工艺美术的双重属性之上：工艺美术具有物质生产与精神生产的双重属性，既要满足物质生活的需要，也要满足精神生活的需要，因此党提出这一方向。来源未给提出年份、文件出处与实施措施。","path":"terms/riyongpin-meishuhua-gongyipin-shiyonghua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度工艺发展方针的条目，生产与政策语境属 D 维度，日用品与工艺品的分工属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:rongquan-jin","title":"绒圈锦（Rongquan Jin (Loop-Pile Brocade)）","name_en":"Rongquan Jin (Loop-Pile Brocade)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","织锦","起绒","提花机","马王堆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绒圈锦又称起毛锦，是汉代织锦中立体感极强的一种。2009 册记其织造艰巨、技艺高超，证明两千多年前我国已有织造起绒的提花机。同段所记的长沙马王堆一号汉墓丝织品，是理解绒圈锦出土背景的直接材料。赵农册在同一批马王堆纺织品中另记“起绒锦”，称其“花形富丽，有明显的浮雕效果”（L3042）；本条把“起绒锦”列为别名，但两书未给织物组织图，不能据此认定两处所指为同一件实物。田自秉册进一步记其用四根一组的重","path":"terms/rongquan-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"绒圈锦是 B 维度下汉代起绒织锦的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ru","title":"襦（Ru (Short Jacket)）","name_en":"Ru (Short Jacket)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉","南北朝","服饰","襦","便装"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"襦是一种短衣，来源称其原为常见的汉衣制式。来源引许慎《说文解字》“襦，短衣也”为训释，并记其多为布制，也有纱、罗一类丝制品。来源在便装一节把襦与袄并述，又在女服一节记日常女服上着襦、衫、下垂长裙。来源未给襦的裁片、尺寸、领襟样式与出土实例，图版未核。本条对来源首句的「補」字照录标疑，不径改为襦。","path":"terms/ru.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的服饰形制条目，记录襦的短衣形制与搭配；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ruan-xian","title":"阮咸（Ruanxian (Moon Lute)）","name_en":"Ruanxian (Moon Lute)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","乐器","弹拨","四弦十二柱","汉琵琶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"阮咸是汉代马上弹奏乐器「汉琵琶」的别称。来源记其形制为中虚外实、盘圆柄直，有四弦、十二柱，并称“此名为‘汉琵琶’，后也称‘阮咸’”（L3862）。图 5-32 图注“竹林七贤《阮咸》”所指为人物阮咸，与乐器同名；来源未言乐器何以得名，本条只记同名，不补命名缘由。图版未核，不据图补写乐器形制。来源未载阮咸的尺寸、弦制、柱位与出土地。","path":"terms/ruan-xian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"阮咸是 B 维度下汉代马上弹奏乐器及其别名的乐器条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:rui-yu-liuqi","title":"瑞玉六器（Six Ritual Jades）","name_en":"Six Ritual Jades","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周礼","大宗伯","玉璧","玉琮","玉圭"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_jade_set","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"瑞玉六器是《周礼·大宗伯》所记以玉祭祀天地四方的六种玉器：玉璧、玉琮、玉圭、玉璋、玉琥、玉璜。赵农引“以玉作六器，以礼天地四方，以苍璧礼天，以黄琮礼地，以青圭礼东方，以赤璋礼南方，以白琥礼西方，以玄璜礼北方”，称六器成为祭祀的“瑞玉”器物，并给形制：璧为圆形环状，内孔小于玉质为璧、大于为瑗、等于为环，原生是纺轮或环形石斧；玉琮外方内圆、中间圆筒状、外周四方形；玉圭是石斧的延续；玉璋是半圭；玉琥是虎","path":"terms/rui-yu-liuqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"瑞玉六器是 B 维度下《周礼》玉礼器成套规范的条目，其祭祀等级含义属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:rumo-zhizheng","title":"儒墨之争（Rumo zhi Zheng (Confucian-Mohist Debate)）","name_en":"Rumo zhi Zheng (Confucian-Mohist Debate)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","儒家","墨家","显学","仁爱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"intellectual_debate","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"春秋末至战国初儒家与墨家在思想主张上的对立。2016 册引《韩非子·显学篇》称儒、墨为“世之显学”，指出两家分歧集中在“仁爱”与“兼爱”，并引《淮南子·要略》说明墨家背周道而用夏政的三条理由，引《孟子·滕文公下》记孟子对墨子的批评。来源未给两派在工艺与器物制度上的具体分歧。","path":"terms/rumo-zhizheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下先秦思想论争的条目，其审美取向另涉 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ruqun","title":"襦裙（Ruqun (Jacket and Skirt)）","name_en":"Ruqun (Jacket and Skirt)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","襦裙","女服","深衣","短衣"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"汉代女服中上穿短襦、下系长裙的组合。2016 册记汉代女子的襦裙由深衣演变而来，一般上襦极短，只到腰间，而裙子很长，下垂至地；同段并列汉代服装的袍、襜褕（直身的单衣）、襦（短衣）、裙四类。来源未给襦裙的裁片、尺寸、面料与穿着场合，也未给图像或出土实物。","path":"terms/ruqun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下汉代女服组合的条目，其裁剪与穿着制度归 B/D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sadalaqi","title":"撒答剌欺（Sadalaqi (Central Asian Silk Brocade)）","name_en":"Sadalaqi (Central Asian Silk Brocade)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","纺织","织锦","粟特","撒答剌村"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"撒答剌欺是元代的一种织锦材料。赵农记元代还有一种“撒答剌欺”的织锦材料，缘起于当时生活在中亚（今乌兹别克）撒答剌村的粟特人；这种丝织品在公元 7 世纪出现，吸收丝绸之路东西方许多国家的丝织技术，不断发展而流行于元代。来源未给织造机构、纹样、金线工艺与具体产地。","path":"terms/sadalaqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"撒答剌欺是 B 维度下元代织锦品种的条目；其粟特来源与丝路技术传播归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sancun-jinlian","title":"三寸金莲（Sancun Jinlian (Three-Inch Golden Lotus Shoes)）","name_en":"Sancun Jinlian (Three-Inch Golden Lotus Shoes)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","汉族","缠足","弓鞋","三寸金莲"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"footwear_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三寸金莲是汉族妇女缠足所穿的小巧木底弓鞋。赵农在清代女服段以满族妇女天足穿高木底鞋（俗称花盆底、马蹄底）作对照，记汉族妇女基本上缠足并穿此类弓鞋。来源未给弓鞋尺寸、缠足方法与地域分布。","path":"terms/sancun-jinlian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"三寸金莲是 B 维度下汉族缠足弓鞋的条目；其性别与族群习俗及满汉分制属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sanleng-jianzhuang-shiqi","title":"三棱尖状石器（Sanleng Jianzhuang Shiqi (Three-Edged Point)）","name_en":"Three-Edged Point","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器","新石器","棱背状","挖掘工具","西侯度"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三棱尖状石器是旧石器和新石器时期都存在的棱尖状石器，主要用于挖掘根茎类植物。2016 册记其以巨厚石片打制、器身呈棱背状，最早发现于山西芮城西侯度，并引贾兰坡的“苍河—丁村文化系”命名。","path":"terms/sanleng-jianzhuang-shiqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下旧石器代表性石器类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sanzhong-zaowu-sheji","title":"三种造物设计（Three Kinds of Artifact Design）","name_en":"Three Kinds of Artifact Design","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["技术性设计","艺术性设计","营销性设计","商品社会"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_division","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三种造物设计是李立新对商品社会中设计分工的划分：技术性设计、艺术性设计、营销性设计。他以电视机为例，线路与显像管属技术设计，外型与操作属艺术设计，推向市场的方针策略属营销设计；三者紧密相扣又相对独立。这一划分用来界定艺术设计的对象领域。","path":"terms/sanzhong-zaowu-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度设计分工概念的条目，技术设计与生产制造属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sanzhuan-yixiang","title":"三转一响（Sanzhuan Yixiang (Three Spinning Wheels and One Sound)）","name_en":"Sanzhuan Yixiang (Three Spinning Wheels and One Sound)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","三转一响","手表","自行车","缝纫机"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"consumption_norm","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三转一响是赵农所记 20 世纪中国一般家庭的最高生活需求，指手表、自行车、缝纫机与收音机四件物品。来源未给这一说法的起源、流行年代上下限、地区差异与具体品牌。","path":"terms/sanzhuan-yixiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"三转一响是 D 维度下 20 世纪家庭消费标准的条目；来源只作一句列举，未及制度或机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sanzu-zun","title":"三足尊（Three-Legged Zun Vessel）","name_en":"Three-Legged Zun Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","瓷器","三足尊","汝窑","仿古"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三足尊是宋代的盛酒器。赵农记其以汝窑仿汉代铜尊为特色，基本特征为广口、直身、平底、三足；同段又记三足洗为文房用品，广口、浅腹、平底、三足，多为汝瓷产品。来源未给三足尊的高度、口径、容量、纹饰与制作工序。","path":"terms/sanzu-zun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"三足尊是 B 维度下宋代汝窑仿古器形的条目，材料限于用途、仿古来源与器形特征。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:saoche","title":"缫车（Reeling Machine）","name_en":"Reeling Machine","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["隋唐","纺织工具","缫丝","手摇","唐诗"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"缫车是抽丝工具，来源记战国已出现手摇轱辘的缫车雏形，唐代手摇缫车广泛使用。来源并以陆龟蒙、王建两家唐诗说明缫车劳作与机器响鸣的声音。来源未给缫车的结构、锭数、传动方式、效率与出土实物，也未交代操作工序。条目所述限于该段文字，不据诗语推补形制。","path":"terms/saoche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"缫车是 B 维度下抽丝工具的条目，来源只记战国雏形、唐代使用与唐诗印证。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shachuan","title":"沙船（Shachuan (Sand Ship)）","name_en":"Shachuan (Sand Ship)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["崇明","平底","多桅多帆","海船"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"沙船是江苏崇明创制的多桅多帆平底船，便于掌握风向，吃水浅、速度快，可载重 5000 石左右；赵农记其为宋代海船制造中出现的一种平底船样式。","path":"terms/shachuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"沙船是 B 维度下古代海船类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shan-liang-dang-shan","title":"衫（两裆衫）（Shan and Liangdang Shan）","name_en":"Shan and Liangdang Shan","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉","服饰","衫","两裆衫","铠甲"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"衫是来源所记的汉制便服，特点是无袖口、衣袖宽大，多为夏季居家便服。来源又记此时出现两裆衫，前后为两片布衣，在肩部用布带连缀，形制缘起于铠甲。来源称两裆衫因简洁适用而逐渐流行。来源未给衫与两裆衫的裁片尺寸、材质与出土实例，图版未核。本条保留来源用字「两裆衫」，不改为「裲裆」。","path":"terms/shan-liang-dang-shan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的服饰形制条目，记录衫与两裆衫的形制来源；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shan-teng-zhi","title":"剡藤纸（Shanteng Paper）","name_en":"Shanteng Paper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西晋","唐代","造纸技术","剡藤纸","纸张"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"剡藤纸是西晋至唐代以剡溪古藤为原料、驰名数百年的纸张。来源在造纸技术一节先记活动帘床纸模与连续抄捞湿纸的工序，再引张华《博物志》说明剡藤纸得名。来源称剡溪在浙江嵊县，剡藤纸从西晋到唐代驰名数百年。来源未给剡藤纸的纸质、尺寸、制作工序、产量与产地沿革，图版未核。","path":"terms/shan-teng-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的造纸技术条目，记录剡藤纸的得名与流传；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shandingdong-ren-guzhen","title":"山顶洞人骨针（Shandingdongren Guzhen (Shandingdong Bone Needle)）","name_en":"Shandingdong Bone Needle","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器晚期","骨针","缝纫","山顶洞人","制衣工具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山顶洞人骨针是旧石器晚期用于缝缀皮衣的骨制工具。夏燕靖 2016 册记其采用鱼刺或鸟兽骨头刮磨钻孔制成，并以此说明制衣工具、缝纫方法与制衣材料已经形成。赵农 2009 册另记骨针使原始先民的生活方式明显改变：动物骨质经打磨可制成纤细骨针，石器时期的钻孔技术已能解决针孔；1933年北京山顶洞遗址出土骨针，南北方许多石器时期遗址都发现骨针，甚至发现保存骨针的贮藏管；骨针与毛线可把兽皮连缀成衣，并对手指","path":"terms/shandingdong-ren-guzhen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下旧石器晚期缝纫工具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shandingdongren","title":"山顶洞人（Shandingdongren (Shandingdong Man (Upper Cave Man))）","name_en":"Shandingdong Man (Upper Cave Man)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器晚期","晚期智人","周口店","钻孔石珠","骨针"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hominin","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山顶洞人是旧石器晚期的晚期智人，1930—1934 年发现于北京房山周口店龙骨山山顶洞穴，距今约 1.8 万年。2016 册以山顶洞人的石器与遗物判断审美观念、弓箭使用、缝纫技术与人工取火四项能力，是旧石器晚期造物水平的关键证据。","path":"terms/shandingdongren.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下旧石器晚期人类造物能力的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shangbiao","title":"商标（Shangbiao (Trademark)）","name_en":"Shangbiao (Trademark)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["近代","商标","津沪","商标注册","马头牌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"trademark_design","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商标是近代商品标记。2016 册称我国近代商标设计的出现，目前可查到的是清末与英、美、日和葡萄牙等国在签订通商条约中写有相互保护商标的条文，因此基本可以认定是受外国产品商标影响所致。当初对商标一词的译法很不固定，有译成“牌子”“牌号”，还有译成“货牌”或“贸易牌号”，到清末光绪皇帝钦定后才统一使用“商标”一词。近代商标设计主要集中于津、沪两地：津、沪海关的商标挂号制度实施，政府商标管理体制出现，清","path":"terms/shangbiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"商标是 D 维度下近代商业制度与设计实践的条目，其标记的视觉设计属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shangdai-baitao","title":"商代白陶（Shangdai Baitao (Shang Dynasty White Pottery)）","name_en":"Shang Dynasty White Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","白陶","贵族用器","制陶业","郑州商代窑场"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商代白陶是商代制陶业在灰陶、红陶、黑陶之外生产的少量白陶，供奴隶主贵族使用。2009 册将其置于商代王室制陶作坊与郑州商代窑场遗址的背景中记述，未展开器形、胎土与装饰特征。赵农另记商代晚期出现刻纹白陶器，胎质坚硬、色泽素白、表面洁净光润，并仿制青铜器上的纹饰和形状；同段把白陶列入泥质细陶、夹砂粗陶、印纹硬陶等制陶种类。","path":"terms/shangdai-baitao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"商代白陶是 B 维度下商代制陶业的器类条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shangdai-qingtongqi-balei","title":"商代青铜器八类（Eight Categories of Shang Bronzes）","name_en":"Eight Categories of Shang Bronzes","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","青铜器","器类","生活用途","八类"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classification","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商代青铜器八类是田自秉按生活用途对青铜器的分类，分烹饪器、食器、酒器、水器、杂器、兵器、乐器、工具八类。来源在八类下逐一列举器名与用途，并称商代后期几乎完备各种酒器造型。来源未给分类原则的进一步说明与各器类数量统计。","path":"terms/shangdai-qingtongqi-balei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"商代青铜器八类是 B 维度下青铜器类的分类术语；其器形与装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shangdai-yuqi-fenlei","title":"商代玉器分类（Classification of Shang Dynasty Jades）","name_en":"Classification of Shang Dynasty Jades","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","玉器","礼仪用品","生活用品","装饰物品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"classification_scheme","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商代玉器分类是赵农对商代玉器按用途所作的三分：礼仪用品、生活用品、装饰物品。来源称商代早期玉器以河南偃师二里头遗址出土者为代表，晚期以安阳殷墟出土者最有典型性；礼仪用品多起祭祀作用、与社会制度需求相关、陪葬居多，形式有戈、矛、钺、刀、戚等仪仗制式，礼器有璧、琮、圭、璋、璜等；生活用品有玉梳、杵臼、调色盘、耳勺等；装饰物品有玉笄、玉钏、柄形器、玉龙、玉虎等。商代贵族大量使用玉器并有佩玉习惯，佩玉不仅","path":"terms/shangdai-yuqi-fenlei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"商代玉器分类是 B 维度下商代玉器用途分类的条目，其礼仪与佩玉的等级含义属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shangdai-zhouchuan","title":"商代舟船（Shangdai Zhouchuan (Shang Dynasty Boats)）","name_en":"Shang Dynasty Boats","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代","舢板船","甲骨文","舵桨","舟船"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商代舟船指商代使用的木板船。2009 册据甲骨文“舟”字八种字形与文献推测，商代舟已不是独木舟，而是平底、方头、方尾、首尾上翘且出角、由多块木板搭接而成的舢板船；并记甲骨文中“艸”“肢”等字为舵桨最早记载，以及武王伐纣渡黄河为船只用于战争的最早记载。","path":"terms/shangdai-zhouchuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"商代舟船是 B 维度下商代交通工具的船类条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shangpin-biaozhi","title":"商品标志（commodity mark）","name_en":"commodity mark","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","商标","品牌","市场竞争","商品标志"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brand_mark","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商品标志是标示商品来源与品牌的视觉记号。赵农称商标在一定程度上能影响商品的市场占有率，并区分长期标志与短期标志，提到欧美日本名牌产品及其品牌标志对设计行业的冲击。来源未给商标法、注册制度与具体品牌案例。","path":"terms/shangpin-biaozhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"商品标志是 C 维度下品牌视觉记号的条目；其市场与商标制度属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shangzhou-sizhiwu","title":"商周丝织物（Shangzhou Sizhiwu (Shang and Zhou Silk Textiles)）","name_en":"Shang and Zhou Silk Textiles","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","丝织","甲骨文","蚕纹","安阳"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商周丝织物指夏商周时期品种大为增加的丝织品。2009 册列举缯、帛、素、练、纨、缟、纱、绢、毂、绮、罗、锦等品种，并以甲骨文蚕、丝、桑、帛、衣、巾等字、青铜器与玉器上的蚕纹，以及安阳铜器丝绢残迹、故宫商代玉戈丝织物残迹、宝鸡西周墓织染品残物作为文字与实物证据。","path":"terms/shangzhou-sizhiwu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"商周丝织物是 B 维度下夏商周纺织品种的丝织类条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shanrang-system","title":"禅让制（Shanrangzhi (Abdication System)）","name_en":"Abdication System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["禅让","尧舜禹","君位继承","传说时代","制度"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"political_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"禅让制是传说时代君位传承的制度，指在位者将君位让与继承人。2016 册记约公元前 5700 年至约公元前 2100 年的约 3600 年间国君产生均采用禅让制，尧禅位于舜、舜禅位于禹，禹之子启建立夏王朝后结束禅让制。","path":"terms/shanrang-system.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下上古君位继承制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shanxi-siheyuan","title":"山西四合院（Shanxi Courtyard Compound）","name_en":"Shanxi Courtyard Compound","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","民居","山西","晋中大院","防卫性"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"courtyard_house","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山西四合院是山西等地以院落狭长为地域特点的四合院。赵农记晋中的一些大院多为地主庄园，除居住之外还有仓库、边墙、碉楼等储存与安全设施，成为以防卫性为主的居住建筑。来源未给具体院名、年代、尺寸与现存状况。","path":"terms/shanxi-siheyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"山西四合院是 B 维度下晋中防卫性民居的条目；其地主庄园与安全组织归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shanzi-wen","title":"山字纹（Mountain-Character Pattern）","name_en":"Mountain-Character Pattern","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","铜镜","山字纹","楚镜","四山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山字纹是战国铜镜具有特色的花纹，数量最多，几达楚镜出土数的80%。四山字为早期，五山字、六山字出现较晚；四山字用对称格式，五山字用环转手法，中间构成五角星状空间。来源列雷纹演变说与古金文山字图案化说，并引《礼记》郑玄注、《释名》《说文》释其含义为山，表安定静止、养物生长。","path":"terms/shanzi-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"山字纹是 C 维度下战国楚镜的装饰纹样条目，其镜式与铸造属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:she-yan","title":"歙砚（She Inkstone）","name_en":"She Inkstone","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["婺源","龙尾砚","眉子","罗纹","金星"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inkstone_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"歙砚相传开采于唐代开元年间的婺源山中，此地属歙州管辖，宋代就颇具规模，当时的歙砚中有“龙尾砚”与南唐澄心堂纸齐名。元末至清初一度停止开采，乾隆年间重新恢复采石制砚的活动；歙砚粒度细腻、匀称密实，质地泛青灰色，并有眉子、罗纹、金星、金纹等天然花纹。","path":"terms/she-yan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"歙砚是 B 维度下文房砚台的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sheji","title":"设计（Design）","name_en":"Design","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["设计概念","Design","词源","造物活动"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“设计”在古汉语中指筹划计策，见于《三国志·魏志》“密因鸩毒，重相设计”与元杂剧“运筹设计”之语。李立新所论设计从英文 Design 译来，指人类造物为实现一定目的而进行的设想、规划、方案等创造性活动；他指出该词作造物专用词有两重问题：内涵过广，且把造物看成单项因素的作用。","path":"terms/sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计概念的条目，学科名称的演变属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sheng","title":"笙（Sheng）","name_en":"Sheng","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["传说时代","女娲","多管乐器","簧管","声学"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"笙是赵农在第一章“乐器”一节中论述的多管吹奏乐器。来源称传说女娲是竹笛和笙的创造者，唐人诗中就有“娲皇遗音寄玉笙，双成传得何凄清”（王毂《吹笙引》）；又称笙是由簧和管配制的多管乐器，声学原理复杂，成为中华民族最早的乐器代表之一。来源另引《吕氏春秋·古乐》“昔黄帝令伶伦作为律……次制十二筒，以之阮踰之下，听凤凰之鸣，以别十二律”，说明原始先民制作乐器的目的，并称乐器可以使天地阴阳和谐、万物秩序、茁壮","path":"terms/sheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"笙是 B 维度下簧管多管乐器的条目，其起源叙述属传说层，声学结构属工艺层。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shenghuo-piaozheng","title":"生活票证（ration coupons）","name_en":"ration coupons","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","计划经济","票证","生活票证"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ration_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"生活票证是 20 世纪中国计划经济时期按人口分发、用于购买生活必需品的凭证总称。赵农称其为 20 世纪中国艺术设计史中的特殊产物，六七十年代关系到千家万户的基本生存状态；种类含工作证、户口本、结婚证等证件与布票、肉票、油票、副食票、粮票、棉花票及工业券，票证有期限、过期作废。来源未给票证的设计者、印制单位与版式谱系。","path":"terms/shenghuo-piaozheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"生活票证是 D 维度下计划经济分配制度的术语条目；票证的版面与印刷设计属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shengyou-deng","title":"省油灯（Fuel-Saving Lamp）","name_en":"Fuel-Saving Lamp","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","灯具","夹瓷盏","夹层结构","冷却"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lamp_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"省油灯又称夹瓷盏，是高丰在宋瓷灯具一节中提出的类型，被称为“宋瓷灯具的一大创造”。其形制为灯身作夹层，一层装灯油、一层装清水；点燃时冷水降低灯盏温度，减少灯油受热损耗，从而省油。来源引陆游《陆放翁集·斋居记事》为文献依据，并记考古已发现唐、宋、辽时期的省油灯实物；李约瑟在《中国科学技术史》中把这种瓷灯视为蒸馏冷凝水套与蒸汽、水循环系统的先声。","path":"terms/shengyou-deng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"省油灯是 B 维度下宋代瓷灯具的类型条目，其夹层降温原理属器物功能设计，来源称之为“科学美”。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shenqu-mianshi","title":"审曲面势（Shenqu Mianshi (Observing Materials and Assessing Circumstances)）","name_en":"Shenqu Mianshi (Observing Materials and Assessing Circumstances)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","考工记","造物观念","天时地气材美工巧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_principle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"审曲面势是李立新列为先秦造物设计主要思想的观念，出自《考工记》“审曲面势，以饬五材，以辨民器，谓之百工”。他释其核心“审视”既是观察又是设想，既是对各要素所做的反应，又是灵活应变的设计；又称这一观念从观察物质材料的特性开始，由物质特性决定制作工艺和设计方法。同段引《考工记》“天有时、地有气、材有美、工有巧，合此四者，然后可以为良”，并逐项解释天时、地气、材美与工巧。来源未给《考工记》的成书、版本与","path":"terms/shenqu-mianshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度造物原则的条目，其思想史定位属 A 维度。四要素另由 `terms/tianshi-diqi-caimei-gongqiao.md` 按 2016 册单列，本条只据李立新册承担同一句的逐项释义。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shenwei-dajiangjun-pao","title":"神威大将军炮（Shenwei Dajiangjun Pao (Shenwei Great General Cannon)）","name_en":"Shenwei Dajiangjun Pao (Shenwei Great General Cannon)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","火炮","神威大将军炮","筑台修城"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"神威大将军炮是清代制造的火炮，与“神威无敌大将军”炮同类并称。赵农记清代造此类火炮用于筑台修城、镇守疆土。来源未给炮身尺寸、重量、射程、铸造年代与部署地点。","path":"terms/shenwei-dajiangjun-pao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"神威大将军炮是 B 维度下清代火炮名目的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shenyi","title":"深衣（Shenyi）","name_en":"Shenyi","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","秦汉","服饰","礼服制度","礼记"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"深衣是先秦至汉代的主要服装形制，把上衣与下裳连为一体、衣襟绕身、以带束腰。五册来源有直接记载（田自秉一册无\"深衣\"字样）。来源在三个点上不一致：起始时代（春秋战国／周代／商代）、直裾是否属深衣、以及服用者的等级范围。本 KU 并列，不裁定。","path":"terms/shenyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"深衣是 B 维度下的服装形制条目，其制度面（礼记规范、等级服用）属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shese-zhigong","title":"设色之工（Shese zhi Gong (Dyeing and Painting Trades)）","name_en":"Shese zhi Gong (Dyeing and Painting Trades)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["考工记","设色之工","染色","画缋","钟氏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_division","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《考工记》六类工种之一，指染色、画绘与刺绣的工种组合。2016 册记设色之工共分四节，其中“筐人”一节阙：画绩之事论五色方位观念与纹章象征，画、绩分为两个工种而此处合并，并包括刺绣；钟氏染羽掌羽毛染色的官职与工匠，记染色方法、次数、名称与技术要求；筐人原文阙，孙诒让疑为治丝帛布帛之工；慌氏涑丝为漂练丝帛的官职与工匠，涑同练。同册另一处又把五工种列作画、缋、钟氏、覩（dǔ）氏、筐人，用字与本节不同，","path":"terms/shese-zhigong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下《考工记》工种分工的条目，其染色与画绘工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shi-class","title":"士（Shi (Scholar-Gentry)）","name_en":"Shi (Scholar-Gentry)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","社会阶层","学在官府","知识分子"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"social_group","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"士是我国古代社会中具有一定身份地位的特定社会阶层，后演变为对知识分子的泛称。它原指原始社会末期与氏族部落首领和显贵同族的武士，进入阶级社会后成为统治阶级的一部分；因古代学在官府，只有士以上的贵胄子弟才有文化知识，故士又成了有一定知识和技能之人的称呼。","path":"terms/shi-class.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"士是 D 维度下先秦社会阶层与知识制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shi-mo","title":"石磨（Stone Quern）","name_en":"Stone Quern","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","汉代","粮食加工","砂岩","面食"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"石磨是赵农第三章“铁器”一节所述的粮食加工器具，来源称战国时期出现（L1986）。来源记河北邯郸赵故城、陕西临潼等地发现下扇磨身，砂岩石制，直径约55厘米（L1986）。来源认为石磨使面食逐渐成为北方人的生活习惯，并促使农耕生活方式与渔猎生活方式开始分离（L1986）。同书第四章“农具”一节又记汉代石磨开始流行，可使小麦加工成为面粉（L2809）。本条所记与石器时代的石磨盘、磨棒不是一物。","path":"terms/shi-mo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"石磨是 B 维度下战国至汉代粮食加工器具的条目，与铁农具同属农业器具谱系。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shi-yi-chang-ji","title":"师夷长技以制夷（Learn the Advanced Techniques of the Foreigners in Order to Resist Them）","name_en":"Learn the Advanced Techniques of the Foreigners in Order to Resist Them","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["晚清","魏源","海国图志","近代设计思想","西学"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_thought","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“师夷长技以制夷”是魏源在《海国图志》中提出的学习西方技术以抵御外侮的主张，三册来源都把它当作中国近代设计思想转向的起点。高丰引其完整三句“以夷制夷，以夷款夷，师夷之长技以制夷”，并把它与张之洞“中学为体，西学为用”并列，称二者对近代艺术设计思想的形成“都产生了非常积极的影响”。赵农把魏源放在「主张变法、放眼世界」的脉络里，突出其介绍蒸汽机、火轮船与西方民主制度的开风气作用。李立新则把它压缩为一句","path":"terms/shi-yi-chang-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"师夷长技以制夷是 A 维度下中国近代设计思想的核心命题之一，其“学习西方制器”的取向属 E 维度跨文化互动，并通向 D 维度的洋务企业与新式教育。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shibaban-bingqi","title":"十八般兵器（Eighteen Kinds of Weapons）","name_en":"Eighteen Kinds of Weapons","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["南宋","兵器","十八般兵器","冷兵器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon_set","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"十八般兵器是南宋时期形成的冷兵器通俗说法。赵农列其名目为「刀、枪、剑、戟、棍、棒、槊、镗、斧、钺、铲、钯、鞭、锏、锤、叉、戈、矛」，并说这仅仅是民间对冷兵器的通俗说法，实际上宋时兵器不止此数；较之以前，说明兵器数量的充足与质量的提高。来源只给名目与一句判断，未给各类兵器的形制、尺寸与用法。","path":"terms/shibaban-bingqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"十八般兵器是 B 维度下南宋冷兵器分类的条目；其军事制度背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shier-pingjun-lv","title":"十二平均律（Twelve-tone Equal Temperament）","name_en":"Twelve-tone Equal Temperament","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","乐律","朱载堉","键盘乐器","声学"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"temperament","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"十二平均律是朱载堉发明的律制。赵农记其对近代乐器制造有积极作用，几乎所有键盘乐器都需要依照十二平均律定音。来源未给律制计算、音分数据与文献出处。","path":"terms/shier-pingjun-lv.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"十二平均律是 B 维度下明代乐律技术的条目；其近代乐器应用与跨文化影响归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shihua-shisui","title":"蚀花石髓（Etched Carnelian）","name_en":"Etched Carnelian","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋","淅川下寺","石髓","玉髓","蚀花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"gemstone_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蚀花石髓是石髓（玉髓）经化学腐蚀显花的装饰品。石髓为半透明、具蜡状光泽的矿物，硬度7，一般呈肉红色，又称肉红石髓。其花纹不用雕刻琢磨，而用碳酸钠或碳酸铅溶液绘画，经炭火烘烤与酸腐蚀，使肉红色变白成纹；形状有枣核形、圆形、方形，纹样有圆圈纹、直线纹、十字纹、曲线纹。河南淅川春秋楚墓发现这种工艺最早的实物。","path":"terms/shihua-shisui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蚀花石髓是 B 维度下石质珠饰表面处理的工艺条目，其纹样属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shijing","title":"石经（Stone Classics）","name_en":"Stone Classics","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","魏晋","唐代","儒家经典","刻石"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription_category","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"石经是赵农《中国艺术设计史》第六章第三节开篇所述的经典刻石样式。来源先述印刷术出现以前文字表达手段的演变，指出铭文、简牍、帛书、印章、刻石、写经等方法中，刻石最为稳定，石经因此受人崇敬。来源随后给出石经的定义与功能，并列出汉、魏、唐三部最著名的石经，作为汉唐时期的文化经典。各经的碑数、字数、书体与存藏，来源分别系于另条，本条不重复。石经的起始年代、碑石尺寸与具体刻立过程，来源未载。","path":"terms/shijing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"石经以刻石保存并复制儒家经典文本，其文字规范与抄录校对功能归 C 维度，刻石工艺归 B 维度；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shikusi","title":"石窟寺（Shikusi (Grotto Temple)）","name_en":"Shikusi (Grotto Temple)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋以后","佛教建筑","石窟寺","敦煌","云岗"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"在山崖上开凿出的窟洞型佛寺。2016 册记石窟寺是佛教建筑的一种，随佛教东传在魏晋以后兴起；最早出现在新疆，其次为敦煌莫高窟，后有云岗、龙门、天龙山等；多由皇室贵族出资开凿，窟外常加木构建筑以保护，窟内保存大量雕刻与绘画，是研究当时建筑、雕塑与绘画的重要实物。","path":"terms/shikusi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下佛教建筑的条目，其宗教与赞助制度另涉 A/D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shilian","title":"石镰（Shilian (Stone Sickle)）","name_en":"Stone Sickle","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器","收割农具","龙山文化","良渚文化","石制工具"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"石镰是新石器时代的收割农具。2016 册把镰与刀并列为收割器具，并在龙山文化、良渚文化的农具组合中记石镰，图 1-6 为石镰。","path":"terms/shilian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下原始收割农具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shiliu-qun","title":"石榴裙（Pomegranate Skirt）","name_en":"Pomegranate Skirt","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","红裙","石榴花","女装"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"石榴裙是唐代流行的鲜艳红裙，其色如石榴之红、绘石榴大花。一般百姓穿不起安乐公主式百鸟毛裙，遂以颜色和式样取胜，石榴裙因而流行；敦煌壁画与唐代绘画可见裙制变化。另有“拜倒在石榴裙下”俗语与唐明皇、杨贵妃传说。","path":"terms/shiliu-qun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"石榴裙是 B 维度下唐代女装裙式的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shimopan-mobang","title":"石磨盘和磨棒（Shimopan he Mobang (Stone Quern and Grinder)）","name_en":"Stone Quern and Grinder","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器","加工器具","石磨盘","石磨棒","原始农业"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"石磨盘和磨棒是新石器时代加工食物的石器组合。2016 册把二者列为原始农业的加工器具，与农耕器具、收割器具并列，图 1-8 为石磨盘和磨棒。","path":"terms/shimopan-mobang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下原始农业加工器具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shiren-gushen-bishou","title":"石刃骨身匕首（Stone-Bladed Bone Dagger）","name_en":"Stone-Bladed Bone Dagger","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","马家窑文化","复合工具","燧石","骨柄"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"composite_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"石刃骨身匕首是赵农在第一章“刀矛”一节中提到的复合工具或武器。来源称制刀时把锋利石片镶嵌在骨柄中，成为复合的工具或武器；这种技术在匕首中多处出现于新石器时期遗址，材料有石、骨、玉、角、陶，亦有骨石复合型，如马家窑文化中的石刃骨身匕首，就是把燧石片用胶质黏在骨身两边的凹槽中。来源只用这一句交代该器类，未给具体遗址、数量、尺寸与收藏地。","path":"terms/shiren-gushen-bishou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"石刃骨身匕首是 B 维度下新石器时期复合工具的条目，其石刃与骨柄的胶黏组合是材料设计的关键案例。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shishizhuang","title":"时世装（Modern Dress）","name_en":"Modern Dress","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["民国","女装","时世装","Modern Dress","裤装"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"时世装是 2016 册所记民国初年标榜新颖的女子时装，即上衣下裤的装束。来源称其在当时较为另类，却广受青睐；民国时期出现这种女子衣装实属不易，因为传统衣着观念中裤子素来不为女子所穿，良家女子成年出门或在正式场合露面皆须系裙；直至民初风气开化，裤装外穿才不分性别和阶层。1912 年开始流行这种上衣下裤的女子着装，时称“Modern Dress”，一时成为女子服饰变革的最大亮点。","path":"terms/shishizhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"时世装是 E 维度下民国女子服饰变革的条目，其上衣下裤形制属 B 维度服饰工艺。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shiyingxing-sheji","title":"适应性设计（Adaptive Design）","name_en":"Adaptive Design","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["设计理论","造物","适应","进化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_theory","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"适应性设计是李立新提出的造物解释概念。他以内外环境的互相适应来把握远古造物的产生与演化，认为造物是一种“适应性设计”，从自然本能的适应到创造性适应，进而推动造物设计向前发展；并引赫伯特·阿·西蒙关于内在环境、外在环境与分界面的定义作理论支撑。来源把生物学的适应与造物设计并论，但未说明二者的类推边界。","path":"terms/shiyingxing-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计理论的条目，其所解释的造物演化属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shiyong-jingji-meiguan","title":"适用、经济、美观（Suitability, Economy, Beauty）","name_en":"Suitability, Economy, Beauty","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","设计原则","适用","经济","美观"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_principle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"适用、经济、美观是新中国工艺美术的设计原则。来源记广大工艺美术工作者按照这一原则，在古为今用、推陈出新的方针指引下取得可喜成果；并在此之前提出工艺美术既要具有民族风格，又要具有时代特色。来源未给这一原则的提出年份、文件出处与逐项释义。","path":"terms/shiyong-jingji-meiguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计原则的条目，政策与教育语境属 D 维度，审美取向属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shiyu-wenhua","title":"峙峪文化（Shiyu Wenhua (Shiyu Culture)）","name_en":"Shiyu Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器晚期","细石器","峙峪","复合工具","装柄"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"峙峪文化是旧石器晚期的细石器文化，位于山西朔县峙峪村，年代为距今 28135±1330 年。2016 册把它列为细石器初期的发生阶段，以细小石器、小石片和复合工具为特征。","path":"terms/shiyu-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下旧石器晚期细石器文化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shizhuang-fabuhui","title":"时装发布会（Fashion Show）","name_en":"Fashion Show","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["改革开放","时装","时装发布会","服装产业","流行预测"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"industry_practice","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"时装即流行的服装；由时装引发的时装发布会是一种服装纺织业的商业活动，通过对流行服饰的预测和设计，对面料、款式、色彩的发展趋势予以推荐和引导，促进服装发展。发布会涉及女装、男装、童装、中老年服装及鞋帽、围巾、领带、腰带、手套、首饰、提包等相关衣物。1980 年以后，时装发布会重新进入中国社会生活，并逐渐与国际服装产业衔接，皮尔·卡丹、花花公子、耐克、鳄鱼、宝姿等时装名牌进入中国市场。来源未给发布会制","path":"terms/shizhuang-fabuhui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"时装发布会是 D 维度下服装纺织业商业活动的条目；其国际产业衔接属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shizu-gongshe","title":"氏族公社（Clan Commune）","name_en":"Clan Commune","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["原始社会","母系氏族","父系氏族","血缘关系","氏族公社"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"social_organization","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"氏族公社是原始社会按血缘关系结成的社会组织。田自秉记旧石器时代向新石器时代过渡之际，祖先结束长期原始群生活，开始按血缘关系结成氏族，进入氏族公社时期；其发展最早为母系氏族社会，后过渡到父系氏族社会。来源未给具体年代、遗址对应与内部制度细节。","path":"terms/shizu-gongshe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"氏族公社是 D 维度下原始社会组织的制度条目；其生计与技术基础属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shou-jin-ti","title":"瘦金体（Slender Gold Script）","name_en":"Slender Gold Script","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北宋","宋徽宗","赵佶","瘦金体","书法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calligraphy_style","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"瘦金体是宋徽宗赵佶的书法风格。赵农在“苏黄米蔡”段把赵佶的瘦金体与苏、黄、米、蔡并列，形容为“内筋外拓，秀逸天象”，称其于宋代书法中别具一格；货币段又记宋徽宗亲笔书写年号“崇宁通宝”“大观通宝”，采用瘦金体书，铸造精致，是宋代钱币中的珍品。来源只给风格评语与钱币应用，未给笔法分析、代表作清单与年代。","path":"terms/shou-jin-ti.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"瘦金体是 C 维度下宋徽宗书体的条目；其钱币铸造应用归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shoubiao","title":"手表（Wristwatch）","name_en":"Wristwatch","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["20世纪","手表","手饰","财富象征","三转一响"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"personal_accessory","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"手表既有实用功能，也有手饰意义，成为人们象征财富的携带之物。人们在手表上贴上透光的颜色纸，红黄蓝绿，既求美观也有炫耀意味；赵农称这说明了贫困年代人们的精神饥渴。当时「三转一响」（手表、自行车、缝纫机、收音机）是一般家庭的最高生活需求。来源未给手表的品牌、机芯、产地、价格与普及率。","path":"terms/shoubiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"手表是 B 维度下 20 世纪个人计时饰物的条目；其财富象征与家庭消费结构属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shougong-bianzhi","title":"手工编织（Hand Weaving and Plaiting）","name_en":"Hand Weaving and Plaiting","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["现代","手工编织","竹编","草编","藤编"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"手工编织是生活中最常见的器物制作方式，主要有竹编、草编、藤编、棕编、柳编、荆编、麦秆编、玉米皮编等材料和方法，因地域形成不同技术特色。竹编以浙江、四川、江西、湖南等南方地区为主，草编以山东、河北、河南、浙江、广东等地为主，藤编盛行于四川、湖南、陕南，柳编、荆编、麦秆编、玉米皮编广泛流行于北方。编织物包括竹制椅具、箱子、书架、盒子、垫子、帽子、篮子，藤制坐椅、箱子，棕编大床、箱子及柳条、荆条篮筐等，","path":"terms/shougong-bianzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"手工编织是 B 维度下传统编织工艺的条目；其作为民生经济手段与地域产业属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shougong-gongchang","title":"手工工场（Handicraft Workshop (Manual Manufactory)）","name_en":"Handicraft Workshop (Manual Manufactory)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","早期工业化","景德镇","分工","手工作坊"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"production_organization","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"手工工场是明清时期使用巨额资本、大量劳力的生产组织。李立新以康熙十九年前后景德镇民窑、陕西联合工场等为例，记其内部分工细密；同时强调工场规模扩大而造物设计变化有限，机器使用不普及，家庭小作坊仍是这一时期一般造物生产的主导力量。","path":"terms/shougong-gongchang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度下明清生产组织的术语条目，其分工与器物变化属 B 维度，早期工业化背景属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shougongye-hanghui","title":"手工业行会（Shougongye Hanghui (Craft Guild)）","name_en":"Shougongye Hanghui (Craft Guild)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","行会","作铺","行首","匠籍"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"guild_system","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代城市手工业按行业组成的团体。2016 册在隋唐手工业一节分三层记述：先记城市中的手工业作坊又称“作铺”，如染行、织锦行、金银行、绢行，规模相当大；再记唐代出现行业性质的社会组织，协调内部各种关系，规定产销条例，甚至涉及价格竞争，并得到官府承认和保护；最后归纳唐代手工业行会组织的三个显著特征——按“团伙”编籍于地方州县的在册匠作户籍、官私营从业者都受地方州县匠作制度约束、通过纳资代役使工匠获得较","path":"terms/shougongye-hanghui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下唐至北宋手工业行业组织的条目，其作坊生产与工艺传承归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shoushan-shidiao","title":"寿山石雕（Shoushan Stone Carving）","name_en":"Shoushan Stone Carving","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","福建","福州","石雕","圆雕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"寿山石雕是福建福州的石雕，以圆雕见长。它始于明代，清乾隆时期得到发展，著名艺人有杨璇、周尚钧等。来源未给石种、雕刻工序、作坊与器物类型。","path":"terms/shoushan-shidiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代石雕的产地工艺条目，圆雕的造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shu-brocade","title":"蜀锦（Shu Brocade）","name_en":"Shu Brocade","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["四川","成都","三国","经锦","加金"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蜀锦是四川生产的高级织锦，三国时为蜀国主要军费来源，魏、吴争求；两晋仍以蜀锦著名，左思《蜀都赋》描写成都织造盛况。具有千年左右历史，按图案组织分方方、雨丝、条花、散花；保持唐代以前经锦传统，是现今唯一用多色经丝与纬线交织起花的织锦。","path":"terms/shu-brocade.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蜀锦是 B 维度下四川织锦类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shu-staff","title":"殳（Shu Staff Weapon）","name_en":"Shu Staff Weapon","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","青铜兵器","五兵","仪仗","无刃"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"殳是商周时期有一定长度的无刃兵器，西周时与戈、戟、酋矛、夷矛合称“五兵”。赵农记武王伐纣时殳已出现在牧野战场；西周遗址已有青铜殳头，圆球状、中有圆孔以便安装木柄，也有带棱刺状的殳头，殳发展到后期成为狼牙棒一类武器。殳常被用作仪仗器具、象征王权，也用作法律刑具，如“杖杀”的杖。第三章另记春秋战国殳的实例：湖北随县曾侯乙墓出土的殳，铜制殳头作三棱矛形，与竹柲相连，兼具击打与刺杀作用，通长约 3.30 ","path":"terms/shu-staff.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"殳是 B 维度下商周至春秋战国无刃长兵器的条目，其仪仗与刑具用途见来源论述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuang-yuan-che","title":"双辕车（Double-Shaft Cart）","name_en":"Double-Shaft Cart","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","车制","双辕","独辀车","交通运输"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"双辕车是秦汉时期与独辀车并列的主要陆路运输工具。2009 册记先秦起独辀车与双辕车就是主要运输工具；秦汉时期车制革新，双辕车开始普及，东汉以后基本取代独辀车。其结构除辕变为两根外，其他各部位与独辀车基本相同。汉代双辕马车又因乘坐者地位高低和用途不同，细分为斧车、轺车、施輜车、轩车、軏车、辎车、栈车等。赵农册把双辕车的出现直接放在汉代“汉车”一目下，并按下车者的身份列出金根车、轩车、轺车、辎车四等（","path":"terms/shuang-yuan-che.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"双辕车是 B 维度下秦汉车制与运输工具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuangguan-fa","title":"双关法（Double-Reading Method）","name_en":"Double-Reading Method","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["装饰手法","彩陶","形体双关","色彩双关","欧普美术"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_method","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"双关法是彩陶工艺的一种装饰手法，分形体双关与色彩双关。形体双关指一种装饰组织正看是一个形、倒看也是一个形；色彩双关指黑白两色都可构成纹样，黑色是一种花纹，白色也是一种花纹。田自秉记半山型葫芦纹是典型形体双关，庙底沟型色彩双关运用出色，并认为与欧美近代欧普美术有相似之处。","path":"terms/shuangguan-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"双关法是 C 维度下装饰构图方法的术语条目；其彩陶载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuangling-wen","title":"双菱纹（Double-Lozenge Pattern）","name_en":"Double-Lozenge Pattern","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","战国","几何纹","杯纹","斜纹组织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"双菱纹是由一个大的菱形两角附以小菱形组成的纹样，形似耳杯，故又称杯纹；它是战国以来常见的传统染织图案，因丝织采用斜纹组织而适于表现斜线菱形，汉代几何纹中最流行。马王堆对鸟菱纹绮以双菱纹为骨骼，纹罗也多用双菱纹；同墓几何纹锦、凸花纹锦与绒圈锦的几何单元有18种之多。","path":"terms/shuangling-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"双菱纹是 C 维度下汉代几何纹样的条目，其斜纹织造约束归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuangliu-ju","title":"双六局（Sugoroku Board）","name_en":"Sugoroku Board","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","漆木器","双六","博戏","螺钿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"game_board","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"双六局是双六博戏所用棋盘。来源称双六是古代博戏，盛行于六朝隋唐时期；双六局呈长方形，两边有月牙形的门，左右有十二个花眼。新疆曾出土螺钿双六棋盘，与日本正仓院格式相同，均为壶门卷口、下加托泥。来源未给尺寸、盘面布局细节、博法规则与掷具。","path":"terms/shuangliu-ju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代博戏器具的条目，盘面装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuangluan-xianshou-wen","title":"双鸾衔绶纹（Double-Phoenix with Ribbon Motif）","name_en":"Double-Phoenix with Ribbon Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","铜镜","纹样","双鸾","绶带"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"双鸾衔绶纹是唐镜上对称双鸾衔飘动绶带的纹样，绶与寿同音，寓祝寿吉祥。来源引玄宗诗与《山海经》鸾鸟记载，称其盛唐流行，可能与千秋节有关。来源未给镜径、鸾鸟细部、绶带长度与出土实例。","path":"terms/shuangluan-xianshou-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐镜纹样的条目，双鸾与绶带的视觉构成属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuilu-gongzhan-tu","title":"水陆攻战图（Shuilu Gongzhan Tu (Water-Land Battle Scene)）","name_en":"Shuilu Gongzhan Tu (Water-Land Battle Scene)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","水陆攻战","铜鉴","铜壶","战船"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"战国铜鉴、铜壶上以水陆战事为题材的图像。2016 册以图 3-32「战国 水陆攻战图（模绘图）」与战国铜鉴、铜壶上的水陆攻战图为据，说明当时战船有两层，上层载士兵，下层载划桨手，行船不靠风帆，全凭划桨。来源未给所据铜器的名称、出土单位、尺寸与摹绘者，图版未视觉核验。","path":"terms/shuilu-gongzhan-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下战国铜器叙事图像的条目，其图像组织另涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuilun-sanshi","title":"水轮三事（Waterwheel Three-in-One Mill）","name_en":"Waterwheel Three-in-One Mill","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","农具","机械","水轮三事","王祯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"machine","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"水轮三事是元代王祯发明改进的粮食加工机械。赵农记王祯不但整理古人的农具图形，自己还动手设计绘制不少农具机械，发明和改进了“水轮三事”，能够集砻稻、碾米、磨面于一体，解决粮食加工的根本问题；王祯自述“一机三事，始终具备，变而能通，兼而不乏，省而有要，诚便民之活法，选物之潜机”；他还设计“水转连磨”，既利用水力推动机械转动、提高灌溉能力，又可用以加工谷物粮食。来源未给结构图、传动方式与效率数据。","path":"terms/shuilun-sanshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"水轮三事是 B 维度下元代粮食加工机械的条目；其与王祯重农实践的关系归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuimi-cang","title":"水密舱（Shuimi Cang (Watertight Bulkhead)）","name_en":"Shuimi Cang (Watertight Bulkhead)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","造船","水密舱","扬州施桥","桐油石灰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_structure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"以隔舱板分隔船体、提高抗沉性的结构。2016 册在唐代造船业一节记唐代造船的密封技术相当发达，已用桐油石灰糊缝；扬州施桥镇出土的唐代木船是世界最早的水密舱结构的实物，也是世界造船史上的创举，对于增强船只远洋航行中的安全性起了很大作用，同时也增强了船体的横向强度。来源把水密舱与同段所记“海鹘”战船的浮板、沙船的多桅多帆并列为唐代造船设计的三项结构成就。","path":"terms/shuimi-cang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代造船结构的条目，其远洋贸易背景牵涉 D、E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuiniaoxing-taohu","title":"水鸟形陶壶（Shuiniaoxing Taohu (Waterbird-Shaped Pottery Hu)）","name_en":"Waterbird-Shaped Pottery Hu","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["良渚文化","陶壶","仿生造型","水鸟","黑皮陶"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"水鸟形陶壶是良渚文化以水鸟形态为造型依据的陶壶。2016 册把它与鱼鳍形足陶鼎并提，认为二者都是模拟自然形态、按生活需要创造人工形态的例证。","path":"terms/shuiniaoxing-taohu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下良渚文化陶壶器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shutie","title":"书帖（Deposit Slip）","name_en":"Deposit Slip","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","西市","金融","钱庄","书帖"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"financial_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"书帖是唐代西市出现的一种类似支票的金融交易凭证。来源记唐朝出现类似支票的金融交易方式，因西市金融市场稳定、商业繁荣，各地商人常将钱币存入西市钱庄；商人购货时只需书写交易账目、列出款项的书帖，由收款者到钱庄凭书帖支取现钱。来源对书帖的形制、书写格式、签发与兑付规则、钱庄名称与手续费均未记载，也未附书帖实物或图版。本条所据关键句在来源中被图版与页眉文字隔断：L4552 止于“是一种”，其后续短语“支票","path":"terms/shutie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"书帖是 D 维度唐代西市金融交易的条目，书写与支取凭证的实物属性属 B 维度，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shutou-ben","title":"书棚本（Shutouben (Book-Stall Edition)）","name_en":"Shutouben (Book-Stall Edition)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["南宋","临安","书坊","书棚本","坊刻"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"edition_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"书棚本是南宋临安棚北大街书坊所刻书籍的称呼。赵农记南宋时期书坊集中在临安的棚北大街，此处的书籍被后世称为“书棚本”；同段又把宋版书分为官刻、家刻、坊刻，书棚本属坊刻一类。来源只给地名与名称由来，未给书棚本的版式、行款、刻工与代表书目。","path":"terms/shutou-ben.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"书棚本是 C 维度下南宋临安坊刻书籍类型的条目；其书坊商业组织归 D 维度。材料为一句得名，confidence 取 low。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuxiang","title":"书箱（Book Chest）","name_en":"Book Chest","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","书籍保护","楠木","樟木","套书"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_chest","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"书箱是保存大规模套书的专用箱具。赵农记《二十一史》《十三经》《道藏》一类书籍需要有专门的书箱保存，书箱常用楠木和樟木制作。来源该句首作“书籍是指大规模的套书”，疑“书籍”为“书箱”之误，本条照录原文并标注，不静默改正。来源未给尺寸、形制与使用范围。","path":"terms/shuxiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"书箱是 C 维度下明清书籍保护装具的条目；其木作工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuxiu","title":"蜀绣（Shu Embroidery）","name_en":"Shu Embroidery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","四川","成都","蜀绣","散线"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蜀绣是以成都为中心并为其主要产地的四川刺绣。它多采用成都生产的各色绸缎，用散线和红线绣制，用线工整厚重、设色明快，富有民间艺术特色；其特点可概括为针脚整齐、线片光亮、紧密柔和、车拧到家四句，产品多为被面、枕套、桌围、椅垫，并远销西北。来源未给蜀绣的形成年代与针法总数。","path":"terms/shuxiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代地方刺绣的条目，设色与针法属 C 维度，产品销路属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:shuzi-meiti-sheji","title":"数字媒体设计（Shuzi Meiti Sheji (Digital Media Design)）","name_en":"Shuzi Meiti Sheji (Digital Media Design)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["数字媒体","艺术与科技","动画影片","现代设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_discipline","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"数字媒体设计是 2016 册所记计算机技术对人类生活介入和影响后产生的一种新的设计艺术语言。来源称数字媒体设计是在科技发展日新月异的信息时代中产生的；它是艺术与科技联姻的产物，在数字媒体设计中艺术与技术交汇融合、相互促进，以艺术形式表达科学，以科学方式体现艺术，艺术的韵味与科学的严谨相互辉映。目前，数字媒体设计比较突出的项目是动画影片（或动漫电影）的创作和生产。","path":"terms/shuzi-meiti-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"数字媒体设计是 D 维度下现代设计领域的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:si-da-ming-yan","title":"四大名砚（Four Famous Inkstones）","name_en":"Four Famous Inkstones","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","砚台","石砚","陶砚","端砚"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inkstone_category","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四大名砚是赵农所述唐代石砚中端砚、歙砚、鲁砚、澄泥砚的并称。来源先记唐代砚台在石砚中有所发展、陶砚为文人普遍使用，再记制砚业进步使石砚中出现四大名砚的说法。来源只列四名并称，未给四砚的产地、石质、优劣次序与具体器物，本条不补。端砚细部另见专门条目，此处不重复。","path":"terms/si-da-ming-yan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"四大名砚是 B 维度下唐代制砚业发展的品名并称条目；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:si-shen","title":"四神（Four Divine Creatures）","name_en":"Four Divine Creatures","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","方位","图像","五行","铜镜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"iconography","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四神指青龙、白虎、朱雀、玄武四种形象，来源用以标志东、西、南、北四个方位。赵农在建筑与城市营造的方位观念中说明其功能，并在汉代规矩四神纹铜镜上记录其与十二地支同出的纹饰组合。田自秉另称四神纹或四灵纹，补其在铜镜、漆器、石刻、砖瓦上的广泛应用、四季配属、玄武龟蛇合体与曹植《神龟赋》，并录《楚辞》注与图腾信仰说。","path":"terms/si-shen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"A 维度下的方位与图像术语条目，其建筑技术面向归 B 维度、纹饰与铭文面向归 C 维度；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sichou-zhilu","title":"丝绸之路（Silk Road）","name_en":"Silk Road","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","隋唐","丝织","西域","海上丝绸之路"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"trade_route","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"丝绸之路是汉代开通的、以丝绸贸易为主的东西方交通通道。五册给出两条不完全重合的定义线：夏燕靖两版以 1877 年李希霍芬、1910 年赫尔曼的命名为核心，把它定为“中国古代经由中亚通往南亚、西亚以及欧洲、北非的陆上贸易交往的通道”；赵农与高丰则同时记陆上干道、西南通道与“海上丝绸之路”，外延大于夏燕靖的陆上定义。田自秉不记命名，只记汉代丝织品作为赏赐、商品与文化交流物品的外销及国外出土。本 KU ","path":"terms/sichou-zhilu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"丝绸之路是 D 维度下汉代丝织品贸易与跨区域流通的术语锚点；丝织生产与织物品种属 B，中西物质文化交流属 E。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sida-chuanxing","title":"四大船型（Sida Chuanxing (Four Major Ship Types)）","name_en":"Sida Chuanxing (Four Major Ship Types)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","造船","沙船","鸟船","福船"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四大船型是 2016 册对明清航海木帆船的四大分类：沙船、鸟船、福船和广船。来源记明清两代为满足漕运和远洋贸易需要，造船设计业达到顶峰；明永乐年间郑和七次下西洋，出动船舰一两百艘，其中宝船 60 多艘，共载 2.7 万多人，宝船长约 150 米、舵杆长 11 米、张 12 帆；各种性能的船型总数有 1000 种左右，仅海洋渔船就有三四百种。","path":"terms/sida-chuanxing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"四大船型是 B 维度下明清航海木帆船分类的条目，其漕运与远洋贸易背景属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sida-mingxiu","title":"四大名绣（Sida Mingxiu (Four Famous Embroideries)）","name_en":"Sida Mingxiu (Four Famous Embroideries)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","四大名绣","苏绣","湘绣","粤绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_genre","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四大名绣是 1949 年以后江南丝绸业恢复过程中形成的苏绣、湘绣、粤绣、蜀绣合称。当时以上海、苏州、杭州为中心重新开发丝绸产品，恢复锦、绸、缎、纱、罗、绫等传统技术，南京云锦、四川蜀锦也有所发展；河南汴绣、山东鲁绣有所突破，少数民族的苗绣、黎绣、土家绣各具特色，蜡染、扎染等技术也有突破性发展。来源未给四绣的针法谱系、代表性传承人与产区规模。","path":"terms/sida-mingxiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"四大名绣是 B 维度下刺绣品类的条目；其产区与丝绸业组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:siheyuan","title":"四合院（Siheyuan Courtyard）","name_en":"Siheyuan Courtyard","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","民居","北京","西安","院落"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"courtyard_house","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四合院是北方城市典型的院落结构，以北京、西安的四合院为代表。赵农记其中轴线是院落建筑的规划点，内门、过厅、天井、大堂均在中轴线上，厢房在两边相互对应；院落多坐北朝南，大门在八卦的东南巽位，以应紫气东来；有一院、两院或多重套院，平民三间宽、官宦五间宽，临街屋墙一般不开窗，进门有影壁，院后可置小型园林。来源未给具体尺寸、构造做法与各地实例统计。","path":"terms/siheyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"四合院是 B 维度下北方院落民居的条目；其家族居住与封闭社会文化归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sinan","title":"司南（Si Nan (South-Pointing Ladle)）","name_en":"Si Nan (South-Pointing Ladle)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","磁石","指向仪器","战国"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mechanism","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"司南是利用磁石指极特性获得方向的仪器，战国时期人们发现并利用磁铁的指极特性而发明，秦汉时期已广为使用（L3161）。东汉王充《论衡·是应篇》有“司南之杓，投之于地，其柢指南”之语（L3161）。司南在唐宋时期被指南针替代，原因是天然磁石在加工中磁性散失、准确性不够（L3161）。本条与既有 `terms/zhinan-che.md` 所记指南车不是一物：司南靠磁石指极，指南车靠齿轮等机械传动保持指","path":"terms/sinan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"司南是 B 维度下秦汉磁性指向器具的条目，属于磁石指极原理的应用。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:siye-wen","title":"四叶纹（Four-Leaf Pattern）","name_en":"Four-Leaf Pattern","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","铜镜","四叶纹","四瓣花纹","荷花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四叶纹是战国铜镜花纹，作四片叶状，叶纹有蟠桃形、枫叶形、团扇形、佛光形、绒球形等，中心也有嵌宝石者；常以羽状纹或回纹作地，回纹地四叶纹流行最久。田自秉引《楚辞》《古今注》《尔雅》论证其可能为荷花，认为称“四瓣花纹”更恰当；四叶纹镜流行于战国中期。","path":"terms/siye-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"四叶纹是 C 维度下战国铜镜的装饰纹样条目，其镜式与铸造属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sizhua-mao","title":"四爪锚（Sizhua Mao (Four-Claw Anchor)）","name_en":"Sizhua Mao (Four-Claw Anchor)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","造船","锚","四爪锚","天工开物"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"shipboard_device","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四爪锚是明代锻造水平较高的锚具。赵农记其制作技术为西方近代造船技术所借鉴，《天工开物》卷 10“锤锻”记载制锚的详细过程；又释锚与猫同音同义，取猫爪锐利之意。来源未给四爪锚的尺寸、重量、锻接工序与出土实物。","path":"terms/sizhua-mao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"四爪锚是 B 维度下明代船用锚具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:song-ci-zhuangshi-shoufa","title":"宋瓷装饰手法（Song Ci Zhuangshi Shoufa (Song Ceramic Decoration Techniques)）","name_en":"Song Ci Zhuangshi Shoufa (Song Ceramic Decoration Techniques)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","瓷器","印花","刻花","划花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decoration_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋代瓷器九种装饰技法的合称。2016 册以“宋瓷的装饰手法”为小节，先总举印花、刻花、划花、剔花、贴花、镂花、弦纹、春字纹、珍珠地划花九种，再逐一说明工具、工序与代表窑口。来源的总判断是：宋代瓷器不仅在烧制技术上超越前代，装饰设计的水准也堪称为杰出代表；北宋末期至南宋又出现更多手法，并在刻花或印花的花纹上用梳栉状工具划出线条，还发展了多种辅助纹饰，磁州窑、耀州窑可谓首开这类装饰纹样之先河。","path":"terms/song-ci-zhuangshi-shoufa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代制瓷装饰技法的清单级条目，其纹样组织与视觉效果牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:song-jin","title":"宋锦（Song Jin (Song Brocade)）","name_en":"Song Jin (Song Brocade)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","苏州","宋锦","织锦","纬锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋锦是宋代盛行的彩纬显色织锦，产地以苏州为代表。2004 册给出较完整的工艺与纹样材料：在唐代纬锦基础上发展，用三枚斜纹组织、两种经纱、三种色纬织成，专用纹纬可按配色横纹需要分段调换色纬，因而常见花形相同而逐段色彩不同；相传宋高宗南渡后为满足宫廷服装与书画装饰需要而大量生产，南宋时品种已达 40 多种。2016 册只记苏州所织宋锦与南京云锦、四川蜀锦并称，都是闻名全国的丝织品，并给出宋代染织管理机","path":"terms/song-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代丝织品种的条目，其几何纹与吉祥寓意属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:song-jing","title":"宋镜（Song Bronze Mirror）","name_en":"Song Bronze Mirror","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","铜镜","湖州","饶州","铸镜局"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mirror_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋镜是宋代铜镜。来源记宋代铜供不应求，日用器皿中主要用于制作铜镜；宋镜早期有一段短暂时间制作精巧，晚期甚为简陋，镜胎轻薄，装饰由唐代的浮雕式转为平刻，图案组织由离心式、求心式、对称式转为旋转式，题材多为缠枝花草，汉魏流行的锯齿纹、绳纹、折线纹绝迹而代之以联珠纹；镜式有圆形、方形、亚形、钟形、葵花形等，有柄镜较流行。南宋产地以湖州、饶州为中心，两地设铸镜局，所产多素地无纹、带长方形阴刻款式。来源未给","path":"terms/song-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代铜镜类型的条目，镜背纹样与款式属 C 维度，铸镜局与铜禁管制属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:song-luo","title":"宋罗（罗）（Song Luo (Leno Silk)）","name_en":"Song Luo (Leno Silk)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","丝织","罗","宋罗","花罗"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silk_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋罗是宋代著名丝织品种。来源记罗与纱基本一样，区别在罗的表面有明显横条纹；素罗中的链式罗结构为链状环环相套，织造费工，清代已经失传。宋代罗生产大发展，被称为宋罗，官府搜括的贡罗每年约十万匹以上；罗以经线左右纠转形成孔眼与花纹，分素罗与花罗。花罗织造复杂，据宋人薛景石《梓人遗制》记花罗织机不用投梭与打纬的常规部件，而以梳形斫刀代投杼和打纬，另挂绞综脚踏带动；花纹效果分实地亮花与亮地暗花。宋代罗名目繁","path":"terms/song-luo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代丝织品种的条目，孔眼显花与名目分类属 C 维度，贡罗与织罗务属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:song-sancai","title":"宋三彩（宋加彩）（Song Sancai）","name_en":"Song Sancai","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","三彩","宋加彩","低温釉","釉上彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋三彩是宋代继承唐三彩风格的三彩陶器，又称宋加彩。来源记它是在白釉的碗、碟上加以红绿色的彩绘，再低温烧制；所绘花卉鱼鸟寥寥数笔，豪迈奔放，富于民间艺术特色；它开启了明清时代釉上五彩的发展。此类作品在禹县扒村及鲁山等宋窑中均有发现。来源未给胎土、烧成温度、铅含量与具体器物清单。","path":"terms/song-sancai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代低温彩绘陶的条目，红绿彩绘与花卉鱼鸟题材属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:songban-shu","title":"宋版书（Song Dynasty Block-Printed Books）","name_en":"Song Dynasty Block-Printed Books","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","雕版印刷","汴本","浙本","建本"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"print_genre","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋版书是宋代雕版印刷的书籍，有雕刻精湛、校对细心、印制清晰等优点，书体整齐规范，主要用皮纸和麻纸，后世成为收藏极品。它在京城开封、浙江杭州、福建建阳、四川眉山等地形成刻印中心，简称汴本、浙本、建本、蜀本，其中以浙江水平最好；又有官刻、家刻、坊刻三种生产方式。","path":"terms/songban-shu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宋版书是 C 维度下雕版印刷书籍与版本类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:songdai-yaoxi","title":"宋代窑系（Song Dynasty Kiln Systems）","name_en":"Song Dynasty Kiln Systems","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","制瓷","窑系","官窑","汝窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋代窑系是赵农对宋代制瓷业地域格局的概括。绪论举出官、汝、钧、哥、定、耀州、景德镇、龙泉、建窑等窑系，称瓷器品种超过前代；制瓷节又记窑址作坊遍及中原和江南各地，分布在全国17个省的130多个县地。来源把“窑系”作为集合名词使用，未给各窑系的统一定义与边界；本条只作分类级条目，具体窑口另立 KU。","path":"terms/songdai-yaoxi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宋代窑系是 B 维度下宋代制瓷地域分类的条目；其国内外贸易背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:songdai-zhuanmu-fota","title":"宋代砖木佛塔（Song Dynasty Brick-and-Wood Pagodas）","name_en":"Song Dynasty Brick-and-Wood Pagodas","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","佛塔","砖木结构","铁塔","料敌塔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋代砖木佛塔是宋代砖瓦烧制技术提高后大量建造的塔型。赵农记现存宋塔数量众多、造型精美，举河南开封“铁塔”（塔身加筑褐色琉璃瓦，如锈铁色泽，坚硬如铁，塔身有螺旋式蹬道，使塔壁和中心塔柱紧密联结）、河北定县开元寺料敌塔、上海龙华寺塔、上海松江兴圣教寺塔、江苏苏州北寺塔、福建泉州开元寺双石塔等；宋代塔制多为六角或八角形，以楼阁式为主，塔身用中心塔柱与外壁构联，加强抗震防风。","path":"terms/songdai-zhuanmu-fota.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宋代砖木佛塔是 B 维度下宋代塔型的条目，材料限于材料、实例、平面与结构作用。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:songti-zi","title":"宋体字（Songti Typeface）","name_en":"Songti Typeface","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["雕版印刷","宋版书","明体字","老宋字"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"typeface","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋体字是宋代雕版印书上出现的印刷字体，结构严谨紧密、端正整齐，笔画横平竖直、横细直粗、起落笔有棱角。其形成综合欧、柳、颜体书法风格，尤其受颜体影响，并适应雕版快速刻字的实际需要。学界有宋体字始于明万历年间、日本称“明体字”的不同看法；高丰据宋版字体特征主张宋体字始创于宋、成熟于明。","path":"terms/songti-zi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宋体字是 C 维度下印刷字体的核心条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:stone-age","title":"石器时期（Stone Age）","name_en":"Stone Age","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["原始社会","旧石器","新石器","公元前22世纪","考古学分期"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"石器时期是赵农在第一章绪论中使用的总体分期概念，指原始社会的旧石器和新石器时期，是人类萌生和发展的初级阶段。对中国历史而言，来源把它大致定为公元前 22 世纪以前的社会形态，并注明依据《我国历代纪元表》。这一分期是第一章“文明的曙光——石器时期的设计”的时间框架，本身不涉及具体器物的形制。","path":"terms/stone-age.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"石器时期是 B 维度下中国原始社会器具设计的总体分期背景，旧石器、新石器等次级分期另有专条。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:su-sancai","title":"素三彩（Su Sancai (Plain Tricolor)）","name_en":"Su Sancai (Plain Tricolor)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","康熙","明代","正德","素三彩"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"素三彩是不用红色的彩绘瓷。田自秉记其为康熙时期的创造，用黄、绿、紫等色施彩而无红色；夏燕靖 2009 则把正德时的素三彩记为以黄、绿、蓝、紫为主而不用红色。两册在始烧年代与色目上不一致，本条并列，不据一说改写另一说。","path":"terms/su-sancai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度彩绘瓷的品种条目，色目与不用红色的界定属 C 维度；两册年代分歧使本条只能并列。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:suanpan","title":"算盘（Abacus）","name_en":"Abacus","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","计算工具","算盘","珠算","横梁隔木"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calculating_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"算盘是宋代典籍中已有明确形制记载的计算工具。赵农记算盘的概念源于春秋时期的筹算，东汉数学著述中有“珠算”概念；只有到了宋代典籍中，才明确记载算盘有“横梁隔木”（《谢察微算经》）的形状，从造型上看已与近代算盘非常相似；珠算将计算方式简化，实用便于携带，南宋末年已有“九归捷法”口诀，如“二一添作五”“逢二进一十”。","path":"terms/suanpan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"算盘是 B 维度下宋代计算工具的条目；其流传与社会使用归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:suantouping","title":"蒜头瓶（Garlic-Head Bottle）","name_en":"Garlic-Head Bottle","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦代","铜器","陶器","蒜头口","六瓣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蒜头瓶是秦代具有浓厚地方艺术特色的器物，因壶的近口处鼓大如蒜头、通常作六瓣形而得名。秦代铜器与陶器均有此形，来源以插图 1-① 记其铜器造型，并在陶器品种中列陶蒜头瓶。","path":"terms/suantouping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蒜头瓶是 B 维度下秦代器物形制的术语条目；六瓣蒜头口的造型归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sufu","title":"速夫（Sufu (Western Region Wool Fabric)）","name_en":"Sufu (Western Region Wool Fabric)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","纺织","羊毛织品","速夫","回回"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"速夫是元代的一种羊毛织品。赵农记在羊毛织品中有一种“速夫”，也是波斯语的译音，为西域回回毛皮制作技术的织品，也成为皇室的服饰面料。来源只此一句，未给产地、织造机构、纹样与工艺，故置信度取 low。","path":"terms/sufu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"速夫是 B 维度下元代毛织品的条目；其波斯语名称与西域技术来源归 E 维度。来源单句，confidence 取 low。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sui-longbing-shuangshen-hu","title":"隋代龙柄双身壶（Sui Double-Bodied Dragon-Handle Ewer）","name_en":"Sui Double-Bodied Dragon-Handle Ewer","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["隋代","龙柄","双身壶","壶式","新品种"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"隋代龙柄双身壶是隋代新出现的壶式，两身共一龙柄；田自秉称其为六朝所未见的新品种，至唐代变为单身。来源只有一句，附图1为隋代陶瓷造型总图，未给该壶的单体图注、尺寸、釉色与出土地。","path":"terms/sui-longbing-shuangshen-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"隋代龙柄双身壶是 B 维度下隋代陶瓷壶式的条目，只记来源所给的时代与形制要点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:suniboqing","title":"苏泥勃青（Sumali Blue (Cobalt Pigment)）","name_en":"Sumali Blue (Cobalt Pigment)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","青花","钴料","宣德","波斯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_material","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"苏泥勃青是明代景德镇青花采用的青料，来自波斯（赵农）或南洋输入（田自秉）；宣德青花用之，色调深沉雅静，浓厚处与釉汁渗合形成斑点，产生深浅浓淡的自然美。使用这种青料使瓷器呈现深蓝、淡蓝、紫蓝等不同效果。","path":"terms/suniboqing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"苏泥勃青是 B 维度下青花钴料的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:sushi-caihua","title":"苏式彩画（Suzhou-Style Architectural Painting）","name_en":"Suzhou-Style Architectural Painting","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","建筑彩画","烟云退晕","枋心","拙政园"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architectural_painting","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"苏式彩画是清代建筑彩画南派，最大特征是枋心轮廓作烟云式退晕，黑、白、灰由外到内、由深到浅画出起伏弧线；枋心主花为山水、人物、花草、鸟兽的中国画形式，藻头、箍头以鱼子纹、鱼鳞纹、万字流水等几何纹衬托。它适宜装饰园林亭榭楼阁，苏州拙政园、北京颐和园长廊和谐趣园、香山见心斋为代表。","path":"terms/sushi-caihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"苏式彩画是 B 维度下清代建筑彩画的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:suxiu","title":"苏绣（Suzhou Embroidery）","name_en":"Suzhou Embroidery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","苏州","刺绣","留水路","双面绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"苏绣是苏州一带的刺绣体系，清代已与粤绣、蜀绣、湘绣、京绣并列为地方刺绣体系之一。来源引《上海县志》记其擗丝为线、针细如毫发，主要特点是针脚细密、色调典雅，图案多用留水路的分面推晕法；并把特点归为平、齐、细、密、匀、顺、和、光八字，针法发展到 43 种。新中国段记苏绣是从业人员最多的刺绣品种，1957 年成立苏州刺绣研究所，以猫和金鱼为欣赏品代表作，双面绣与乱针绣是发展较快的两种针法。","path":"terms/suxiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度地方刺绣体系的条目，针法与设色的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:taiping-che","title":"太平车（Taiping Cart）","name_en":"Taiping Cart","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","交通工具","太平车","畜力车","双轮车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"transport","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"太平车是宋代以运输货物为主的畜力车。赵农记宋代人们重视坐轿，对车辆研制不够，仅制造出以运输货物为主的畜力车，出现数头牛力牵引的“太平车”；其有单辕和双辕的形式，双轮大车的车轮高度几乎与车厢平齐，承载货物较多，运输方便省力。来源未给车长、载重、轮径与制作材料。","path":"terms/taiping-che.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"太平车是 B 维度下宋代畜力货运车的条目，材料限于牵引、辕制、轮高与性能。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:taishi-yi","title":"太师椅（Taishi Chair）","name_en":"Taishi Chair","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","家具","太师椅","交椅","圈椅"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"太师椅是宋代由带扶手交椅演化出的椅式。赵农记交椅按有无扶手分为两类，其中带扶手的交椅成为圈椅的形状，即搭脑和扶手相连，成为“太师椅”的基本造型。来源只给太师椅与交椅、圈椅的造型关系，未给尺寸、材料、装饰、使用阶层与图像实例。","path":"terms/taishi-yi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"太师椅是 B 维度下宋代椅式的条目，材料限于与交椅、圈椅的造型关系。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tali","title":"踏犁（Tread Plough）","name_en":"Tread Plough","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","农具","踏犁","长镵","耒耜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"farm_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"踏犁也称长镵，是宋代南方农家常见的生产工具。赵农记其在长柄上加以横木，使用时以脚踏镵，使其深入土中；原为石器时期耒耜样式的流传，宋代开始为南方农家常见的生产工具。来源未给踏犁的尺寸、材料、操作人数与翻土效率。","path":"terms/tali.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"踏犁是 B 维度下宋代南方农具的条目，材料限于结构、源流与使用。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tang-dai-qingci-yao","title":"唐代著名青瓷窑（Tangdai Zhuming Qingci Yao (Famous Tang Celadon Kilns)）","name_en":"Tangdai Zhuming Qingci Yao (Famous Tang Celadon Kilns)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","青瓷","瓯窑","婺州窑","岳州窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_group","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2016 册“知识链接”以“唐代著名青瓷窑”为题，逐一记瓯窑、婺州窑、岳州窑、长沙窑、洪州窑、寿州窑、邛窑七个窑场，并在正文另段记越窑与秘色瓷。来源的总判断是：唐代形成我国陶瓷史上第一个高峰，青瓷是主流，窑场众多，南方几乎各省区皆有，尤以浙江、江西、湖南、福建、广东为盛，北方青瓷也得到发展；青瓷器仍是唐代居民最钟爱、使用最普遍的瓷器。同段还记越窑“几乎是专供宫廷的用品，由官府督造”，是之后历代御器","path":"terms/tang-dai-qingci-yao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代青瓷窑场的清单级条目，其官窑性质与贡御关系牵涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tang-sancai","title":"唐三彩（Tang Sancai）","name_en":"Tang Sancai","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","铅釉陶","明器","低温釉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐三彩是唐代盛行的低温铅釉陶器，以白（黄）色黏土或高岭土制胎，施以铜、铁、钴、锰等金属氧化物着色的铅釉，经约 900℃ 低温烧成。五册来源都强调其釉色以黄、绿、赭（褐）、白为主并可出现蓝彩，产品主要用作随葬明器。","path":"terms/tang-sancai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"唐三彩是 B 维度下低温铅釉陶工艺与唐代明器体系的术语锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tangcao-wen","title":"唐草纹（Tangcao Wen (Tang Scroll Motif)）","name_en":"Tangcao Wen (Tang Scroll Motif)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","染织纹样","唐草纹","卷草纹","忍冬"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_motif","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"以“S”形波状曲线组织的传统装饰纹样。2016 册记唐草纹是我国传统图案之一，多取忍冬、荷花、兰花、牡丹等花草，经处理后作“S”形波状曲线排列，构成二方连续图案花草造型，多曲卷圆润，通称卷草纹；因盛行于唐代故名唐草纹。田自秉 2010 册另记卷草是唐代装饰纹样中应用最广的一种，日本人称为“唐草”；卷草汉代已有，六朝常见于石刻边饰而大多简朴，唐代更繁复华美，多以牡丹为主花，明代中期以后渐变为以莲花为","path":"terms/tangcao-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下唐代装饰纹样的条目，其织造、印染与碑刻载体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tangci","title":"搪瓷（Enamelware）","name_en":"Enamelware","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["珐琅","金属胎","洋瓷","1958","脸盆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"enamelware_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"搪瓷是在金属表面附有珐琅质层的制品，瓷釉以铅、锡、硼砂、石英等制成。制造先冲压金属坯胎，利用洒喷、浸渍等方法涂敷一层或多层珐琅浆，采用印花、喷花、描花、贴花、洒花等装饰，经干燥、烧制而成；瓷釉和金属坯胎的热涨系数应相同，否则会出现珐琅质龟裂。","path":"terms/tangci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"搪瓷是 B 维度下金属胎珐琅制品的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tangjing-tuzhi-wushi","title":"唐镜图案组织五式（Five Tang-Mirror Pattern Organizations）","name_en":"Five Tang-Mirror Pattern Organizations","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","铜镜","图案组织","对称式","散点式"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_composition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐镜图案组织五式是田自秉对唐镜纹样组织方式的分类：对称式、散点式、单独式、旋转式、满花式。来源逐式给出例纹，未给各式年代序列、数量比例与镜例清单。","path":"terms/tangjing-tuzhi-wushi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度唐镜图案组织的分类条目，其镜背工艺属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tangjing","title":"唐镜（Tang Mirror）","name_en":"Tang Mirror","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","铜镜","扬州","金银平脱","螺钿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代铜镜的断代条目。2016 册记唐代铜器制造业主要是佛像和铜镜，铜镜属日常生活用品，各地均有出产，扬州铸镜十分著名，浑厚富丽，是重要的贡品。来源给出兴盛原因：许多铜制生活用品已为瓷器替代，金属工艺技术集中到铜镜上；唐代又形成以铜镜作为献礼和馈赠的社会风尚。装饰加工方法有金银平脱、鎏金、错金银、镶嵌、螺钿、著彩与涂珐琅。来源另记唐镜“非常符合科学原理”：铜锡铅比例约70:25:5，加锡量较多故一般","path":"terms/tangjing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代铜镜的断代条目，其纹样与外来工艺因素牵涉 C、E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tangzhuang","title":"唐装（Tangzhuang (Tang-Style Jacket)）","name_en":"Tangzhuang (Tang-Style Jacket)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["当代","唐装","锦缎","对襟盘扣","传统复兴"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐装是伴随人们对传统中式衣衫的怀念而近年流行的服饰。它以锦缎为面料，对中国传统对襟盘扣的服装样式进行改造，在肩部加上垫衬，将原先与肩部连接的衣袖重新接缝，形成别具一格的样式。来源未给唐装的命名由来、具体流行年份、设计者与产业规模。","path":"terms/tangzhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"唐装是 B 维度下当代中式服装样式的条目；其传统复兴与身份建构属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tao-gui","title":"陶鬶（Pottery Gui (Tripod Pourer)）","name_en":"Pottery Gui (Tripod Pourer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["龙山文化","款足","鸟喙流","炊煮器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陶鬶是龙山文化常见炊煮器，由陶鼎演变而来，以三条肥大中空的款足代替鼎的实心足，扩大受热面积；颈部高拔，口前部有冲天鸟喙状长流，形似昂首挺胸的大鸟。书中认为其形态别致，体现陶匠师实用与美观有机结合的造型设计思想。\n\n田自秉另记鬶从大汶口文化到龙山文化的完整演变：大汶口时期圆腹、小颈、口在腹上部，口部捏出小流、底有三足；以后腹变扁、口移至器体前侧成鸟喙状；再后口部扩大、三实足变三空足、把手作绳纽状；到","path":"terms/tao-gui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陶鬶是 B 维度下龙山文化炊器的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tao-wa","title":"陶瓦（Ceramic Roof Tile）","name_en":"Ceramic Roof Tile","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","屋顶材料","板瓦","筒瓦","瓦钉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_material","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陶瓦是西周时期普遍使用的屋顶建筑材料，此前一直是“茅茨”式的草顶房。赵农记陕西扶风西周中期宫室建筑用瓦已非常普遍、屋顶全部用瓦覆盖；西周板瓦长40厘米、宽20厘米、厚1.3厘米，板瓦上下有瓦钉和瓦环，可以套连和粘接。同段还出现实心砖、空心砖、筒瓦、瓦当等，实心砖背面四角有乳钉，贴在墙面使墙面光洁。来源另称西周瓦上的瓦钉或瓦环用以连结两瓦之间、固定防滑，使房屋具有防雨、防暑、保暖功能。","path":"terms/tao-wa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陶瓦是 B 维度下西周屋顶建筑材料的条目，其铺挂与连接构造属生产技术。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tao-zeng","title":"陶甑（Pottery Zeng (Steamer)）","name_en":"Pottery Zeng (Steamer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["河姆渡","蒸食","蒸汽孔","炊器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陶甑是底部有通蒸汽小孔的蒸食器，功能类似“蒸屉”。河姆渡文化陶甑有盆形或罐形，两侧有耳，底部有许多通蒸汽的小孔；其功能是利用蒸汽熟化食物。书中认为陶甑的出现促进了人类从煮食向蒸食的过渡，是陶器功能设计的一项重要进展。","path":"terms/tao-zeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陶甑是 B 维度下新石器时代炊器的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:taolun","title":"陶轮（Pottery Wheel）","name_en":"Pottery Wheel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","制陶","陶钧","慢轮","快轮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陶轮是赵农在第一章“陶器的技术”一节中论述的制陶工具，又称陶钧，是木质的转盘。来源称原始先民通过观察，利用转动中的力学原理，改变手制泥条盘筑的方法，提高了制陶的效率和产量；仰韶文化早期采用泥条盘筑法，后来出现慢轮修整技术，到仰韶文化后期又出现快轮制陶技术。陶轮可以转动，陶泥在陶轮上随转动拉条成坯，最后修整成所需器形，来源把它视为改变制陶初步阶段的重要设计工具。","path":"terms/taolun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陶轮是 B 维度下新石器时期制陶工具的条目，其转动成形原理与慢轮/快轮技术分期是设计史重点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:taoqi-qixing","title":"陶器器形（Pottery Forms）","name_en":"Pottery Forms","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","陶器","器形","瓶盆壶罐","三足鼎"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陶器器形是赵农在第一章“陶器的造型”一节中归纳的新石器时期陶器类型与造型样式。来源称陶器类型最常见的有瓶、盆、壶、罐、瓮、钵、杯、豆等，并出现平口、提梁、双耳、单耳、长颈、高足、尖底等丰富样式；又分述瓶、盆、壶、罐、瓮、钵、杯、豆的形体特征，认为这些器形基本上都是容器，其使用特点分明、制造合理、技术完善。来源还以彩陶三足鼎说明三足与钵的组合是中国鼎文化的开端。","path":"terms/taoqi-qixing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陶器器形是 B 维度下新石器时期陶器造型的清单级聚合条，其造型比例与装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:taoqi","title":"陶器（Taoqi (Pottery)）","name_en":"Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","黏土","羼和料","轮制","陶窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陶器是新石器时代设计的重要领域。2009 册记其传说由舜设计制造，已发现的最早实物为 1962 年江西万年县仙人洞出土的 8000 多年前陶器；原料多加入羼和料，制作有手制、泥条盘筑与轮制，表面处理有压磨、压印、堆贴和刻划，新石器时代晚期陶窑、陶轮和封窑技术的应用使陶器设计达到很高水平。","path":"terms/taoqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陶器是 B 维度下新石器时代制陶与器形设计的总类条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:taotie-motif","title":"饕餮纹（Taotie Motif）","name_en":"Taotie Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","青铜器","兽面纹","纹样","礼器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"饕餮纹是商代至西周早期青铜器上最有代表性的兽面纹样，通常表现为被夸张或幻想的动物头部正面：横眉咧口、宽鼻瞪眼、口中有獠牙或锯齿形牙，额上有一对立耳或大犄角，并有一对利爪；也有用相对的两个夔纹组成一个兽面。四册的界定有宽窄：高丰与田自秉把它定为商代至西周早期或殷代青铜器的主纹；夏燕靖 2016 把商早期纹饰主体称为“兽面纹”，到殷商早期才说“饕餮纹处于松散状态”，把饕餮纹作为后段名称；赵农只给图题与","path":"terms/taotie-motif.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"饕餮纹是 B 维度下商周青铜器装饰母题的术语锚点；其图像构成、对称与地纹处理属 C；礼器制度与祭祀功能可在后续 Topic 中与 D 连接。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:taoxun","title":"陶埙（Pottery Xun）","name_en":"Pottery Xun","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","半坡","河姆渡","一音孔","二音孔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陶埙是赵农在第一章“乐器”一节中论述的新石器时期陶制吹奏乐器。来源称西安半坡遗址、余姚河姆渡遗址均发现陶埙，有一音孔、二音孔，造型中有椭圆形、橄榄形、球形等，其作用是可以模仿鸟鸣的声音，在诱捕禽兽时发挥作用。来源又记仰韶文化时期出现牛角制作的号角，声音宏大，常用于狩猎报警，也有陶质号角模仿牛角的造型和声音。","path":"terms/taoxun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陶埙是 B 维度下新石器时期陶制乐器与仿声设计的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:taoyan","title":"洮砚（Tao Inkstone）","name_en":"Tao Inkstone","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","文房四宝","砚","甘肃","洮河"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inkstone","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"洮砚是甘肃卓尼洮河河岸所产的石砚，属水云母泥质板岩，北宋开始采石。赵农记洮砚石往往需要在河底采集，非常辛苦，因而石质细密、石色泛绿，深受人们喜爱。来源未给砚坑、开采组织、砚式与传世实物。","path":"terms/taoyan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"洮砚是 B 维度下明清石砚材质的条目；其书写功能归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:taoyao","title":"陶窑（Pottery Kiln）","name_en":"Pottery Kiln","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时期","仰韶文化","半坡","竖穴窑","横穴窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陶窑是赵农在第一章“陶器的技术”一节中论述的烧陶设施。来源称在仰韶文化的西安半坡遗址中已经出现竖穴窑和横穴窑，这种不同结构的烧窑炉成为不同陶器的烧制场所；不同的陶窑使不同陶器在接受火力时均匀变化，减少了龟裂现象，获得了颜色统一的效果。来源认为陶窑为陶器不同性能的实现与质量的提高提供了技术上的便利条件。","path":"terms/taoyao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"陶窑是 B 维度下新石器时期烧陶设施的条目，其结构改进直接影响陶器质量与颜色。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tezhong-gongyi","title":"特种工艺（Special Crafts (Tezhong Gongyi)）","name_en":"Special Crafts (Tezhong Gongyi)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","牙雕","玉雕","欣赏品","外销"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_category","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"特种工艺是牙雕、玉雕等因材料昂贵、作工精细而逐渐由实用品转为欣赏品的工艺类称。来源记这一转变发生在历史演变过程中，人们因此往往通称它们为特种工艺；在旧中国这类工艺被洋行买办掠夺和摧残，仅为适应资本主义市场需要而生产，艺术上带有半殖民地烙印；解放后经改造，剔除糟粕、吸收精华，保存了内容健康、形式优美的传统作品并开展创新。","path":"terms/tezhong-gongyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度工艺分类与生产体制的条目，工艺门类属 B 维度、外销与半殖民地语境属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tian-cai","title":"填彩（Tiancai (Filling Colours)）","name_en":"Tiancai (Filling Colours)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","成化","青花加彩","填彩","景德镇"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"填彩是明代成化时期青花加彩的一种装饰方法，与斗彩并列。来源记其法先在胎上用苏泥勃青画出花纹轮廓，再在轮廓内填以彩色釉料；同段把青花加彩分为斗彩与填彩两种，并称斗彩为五彩的一种、以成化时期制作最为精美。来源未给填彩的烧成温度、彩料成分与具体器物。","path":"terms/tian-cai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代青花加彩的装饰技法条目，轮廓与填色的视觉关系属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tianbai","title":"甜白（Sweet White Porcelain）","name_en":"Sweet White Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","景德镇","白瓷","釉色"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"甜白是明代景德镇白瓷的俗称。赵农记明代景德镇白瓷胎薄釉润、有纯净透亮的细腻质感，因而有甜白的俗称。来源未给甜白的烧造年代、典型器形、胎釉配方与窑口区分。","path":"terms/tianbai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"甜白是 B 维度下明代景德镇白瓷釉色的术语条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tianji-hu","title":"天鸡壶（Tianji Ewer (Chicken-Head Ewer)）","name_en":"Tianji Ewer (Chicken-Head Ewer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["六朝","隋代","鸡首","壶式"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"天鸡壶是六朝至隋代流行的壶式。它在盘口壶基础上，于肩部一面加鸡头、另一面安把手接盘口：早期鸡头纯作装饰，东晋以后鸡头加长，也有改作羊头、牛头、虎头或两侧刻双翅者，壶体渐高瘦长，至唐代演变为龙耳壶。与六朝相比，隋代天鸡壶腹部修长、上圆下瘦，鸡头雄健，鸡颈较粗；六朝则腹矮底大、鸡头较小、鸡颈呈管状。另有“一边鸡头、一边龙柄、颈部作竹节形”的壶式描述，见于隋和初唐。","path":"terms/tianji-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"天鸡壶是 B 维度下六朝隋代壶式的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tianqi-lacquer","title":"填漆（Tianqi (Filled Lacquer)）","name_en":"Tianqi (Filled Lacquer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","填漆","雕填","戗金","漆器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"填漆是在漆器上雕刻花纹、在刻纹处填以彩漆的工艺。来源记其两种作法：一是填彩与漆面相平，引《遵生八笺》所记填漆刻成花鸟、彩填稠漆、磨平如画；二是雕填后花纹凹陷、不与漆面平，显出刀刻味。刻纹处施以金粉的称为戗金。来源未给填漆的胎骨、刻纹深度、彩漆成分与烧成或干燥条件。","path":"terms/tianqi-lacquer.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代填漆工艺的术语条目，填彩与凹陷的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tianren-xiangfen","title":"天人相分（Tianren Xiangfen (Separation of Heaven and Humanity)）","name_en":"Separation of Heaven and Humanity","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["荀子","天论","唯物主义","自然观","战国"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosophical_proposition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"天人相分是《荀子·天论》提出的自然观命题。2009 册引“天行有常，不为尧存，不为桀亡”，说明荀子否定天有意志，把自然界的客观规律与人类社会的发展状况区分开来，并在天人相分的基础上提出“制天命而用之”的唯物思想；来源认为这一自然观对认识古代造物观念有较大帮助。","path":"terms/tianren-xiangfen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"天人相分是 A 维度下战国设计思想的命题条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tianshi-diqi-caimei-gongqiao","title":"天时地气材美工巧（Tianshi Diqi Caimei Gongqiao (Timing, Terrain, Materials and Craftsmanship)）","name_en":"Tianshi Diqi Caimei Gongqiao (Timing, Terrain, Materials and Craftsmanship)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["考工记","工艺原则","天时","地气","材美"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_principle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《考工记》提出的四项造物条件与优质产品标准。2016 册引原文“天有时，地有气，材有美，工有巧，合此四者方可为良”，逐项释义为季节气候、地理环境、材料质地与制作技艺，指出四者合一方为良器；并称这一原则含阴阳五行思想，是第一次提出朴素的工艺观，把“材美工巧”作为衡量优质产品的标准。","path":"terms/tianshi-diqi-caimei-gongqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下《考工记》造物原则的条目，其思想史评价另涉 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tianyuan-difang","title":"天圆地方（Round Heaven and Square Earth）","name_en":"Round Heaven and Square Earth","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","三代","玉琮","宇宙观","造物观念"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"天圆地方是李立新用来解释中国早期造物设计的宇宙观与造型观念。他以良渚玉琮的内圆外方、柱形中空为例，称其内部圆形中空象征天穹、外部方形实体系大地，并引《周礼》“以苍璧礼天，以黄琮礼地”说明圆器礼天、方器礼地。他判断这种造物设计观念实施于造物之中，始于原始设计时期，盛行于中国早期设计时期；三代青铜器“内圆外方”的造型并非完全重新创造，而与原始玉琮有密切联系。来源未给这一观念的最早文献出处、年代序列与流","path":"terms/tianyuan-difang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度造物设计观念的条目，其宇宙观与政治结构延伸属 A 维度解释。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tianzu-yundong","title":"天足运动（Tianzu Yundong (Anti-Footbinding Movement)）","name_en":"Tianzu Yundong (Anti-Footbinding Movement)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["近代","缠足","天足运动","女权运动","女学"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"social_movement","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"天足运动是辛亥革命前后与思想解放、女权运动、女学兴起相呼应的放足运动。2016 册称西方传教士、商人、革命党人竞相创办女学，向寻求解放的女性灌输新潮观念；妇女从缠足陋习中被彻底解放出来，时称“天足运动”。来源只给这一句判断，未及推行组织、章程与过程。","path":"terms/tianzu-yundong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"天足运动是 E 维度下近代妇女解放与社会变革的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tieda","title":"铁搭（Iron Rake）","name_en":"Iron Rake","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","农具","铁搭","铁齿","南方"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"farm_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铁搭也称铁齿，是宋代非常流行的农具。赵农记其似耙非耙，齿锐钩弯，为四齿和六齿，引王桢《农书》“兼有耙镢之效”，在南方被普遍使用，是钢铁锻造技术在农具制造中的充分体现。来源未给铁搭的尺寸、装柄方式与使用工序。","path":"terms/tieda.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铁搭是 B 维度下宋代南方农具的条目，材料限于形制、齿数与功能。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tieqi-shidai","title":"铁器时代（Iron Age）","name_en":"Iron Age","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["赫梯","陨铁","铸铁鼎","生产力"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铁器时代是人类文明史中的重要转折时期。人们最早知道的铁是陨石中的铁，古埃及人称之为神物；世界上最早制造铁器的是小亚细亚的赫梯人，约在公元前 1400 年左右。我国最早使用铁制工具的文字记载是春秋《左传》中的晋国铸铁鼎；铁器广泛使用使工具制造进入全新领域，生产力极大提高。","path":"terms/tieqi-shidai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铁器时代是 B 维度下技术史分期的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tihuaji","title":"提花机（Figured Loom）","name_en":"Figured Loom","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","多综多蹑","花楼","束综","马王堆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"提花机是按花纹要求提综开口、织造复杂织物的织机。汉代已普遍使用，出现多综多蹑织机，能织复杂花纹；蹑为脚踏杆，汉时已达 120 蹑。东汉还发明花楼式束综提花机，以线综调配提花经线，提高图案质量，使纹饰有大面积花样变化。","path":"terms/tihuaji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"提花机是 B 维度下织造设备的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tixi","title":"剔犀（Tixi (Carved Black-Red Lacquer)）","name_en":"Tixi (Carved Black-Red Lacquer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","雕漆","剔犀","红黑相间","剔犀执镜盒"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"剔犀是雕漆的一种：用红黑色漆相间涂漆后再雕花纹，使花纹斜面形成红黑相间的线纹。来源把雕漆分为剔红、剔彩、剔黄、剔绿、剔黑等，剔犀另立一类；并以插图21剔犀执镜盒（南宋）与江苏镇江金坛宋墓雕漆扇柄为例，称扇柄斜面可见十多道红漆、每层又有黑漆间隔，显然是采用剔犀方法。来源未给剔犀的漆层总数、髹涂遍数与产地。","path":"terms/tixi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度雕漆工艺的条目，红黑相间的斜面线纹属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tong-xiu-kai","title":"筒袖铠（Tongxiu Kai (Tube-Sleeve Armor)）","name_en":"Tongxiu Kai (Tube-Sleeve Armor)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["晋代","铠甲","筒袖","鱼鳞甲片","龟背甲片"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"armor_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"筒袖铠是晋代铠甲形制，由小块鱼鳞或龟背甲片将前后连缀成筒形甲身，护肩装有筒袖。2009 册把晋筒袖铠、南北朝衲裆铠、北周明光铠列为三种基本铠甲形制；同段记头盔仍用“兜鍪”，装饰因时因人而异。","path":"terms/tong-xiu-kai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"筒袖铠是 B 维度下晋代铠甲形制的条目，其防护结构与编缀工艺同属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tongche","title":"筒车（Waterwheel）","name_en":"Waterwheel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","筒车","灌溉","水转筒车","水力"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"irrigation_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"筒车是唐代出现的大型提水灌溉工具，来源又称水转筒车。赵农册在绪论与第六章农具节两处提到它：绪论以曲辕犁与南方筒车并举，称筒车利用水的冲力把低处水流引向高地；农具节则把它与唐代广泛推广的马钧龙骨水车并列，并说明木轮、水边木架、小水桶依次携水上升的工作原理。来源没有给出筒车的尺寸、木轮直径、桶数、架设地点、制作材料配比与灌溉效率，也没有说明它与龙骨水车在具体结构上的传承关系。图 6-30 标注为筒车，","path":"terms/tongche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"筒车是 B 维度唐代提水灌溉农具的条目，来源所述水力结构与灌溉用途均归于造物与生产技术，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tonggu","title":"铜鼓（Bronze Drum）","name_en":"Bronze Drum","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","西南少数民族","青铜器","滇系","粤系"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜鼓是中国古代西南少数民族的青铜制品，原为打击乐器，后渐演化为权力象征。来源称其制作自春秋战国、汉六朝直到明清，而以汉代制作精美、式样最多。按流行地区与式样分滇系、粤系：滇系体型较小、单弦分晕；粤系体型高大、鼓面多有立体青蛙。装饰常见太阳纹、蛙纹、鹭鸟纹、竞渡纹。","path":"terms/tonggu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铜鼓是 B 维度下西南少数民族青铜乐器的术语条目；鼓面纹样与图像解释归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tonghua-bu","title":"橦华布（Tonghua Cloth）","name_en":"Tonghua Cloth","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["晋代","蜀都赋","永昌","棉布","黄润布"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"橦华布是晋左思《蜀都赋》所记的布名，据晋代刘逵注，橦华是树名，其花柔毳可绩为布，出永昌；田自秉判断它实际上是一种棉布。同赋另记黄润布，刘逵注为筒中细布，筒指装布的竹筒，也称筒中黄润。来源未给幅宽、产量、棉种与织法。","path":"terms/tonghua-bu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"橦华布是 B 维度下晋代布类与棉纺织的条目，其《蜀都赋》注疏与地方贡赋面向兼涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tongjin","title":"铜禁（Bronze Jin (Altar Table)）","name_en":"Bronze Jin (Altar Table)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","青铜器","家具","祭器","禁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜禁是商周青铜器中用于放置祭品和祭器的家具，功能相当于后世的箱、橱、柜。高丰在讨论中国古代家具起源时把它与俎并举：俎用于祭祀时切牲、陈牲，铜禁用于承放祭品祭器，二者都还带着祭器的性质，而造型已可见后世箱柜类家具的原始形态。\n\n来源对铜禁只给功能与家具史定位，未给形制、尺寸与出土实例；春秋中晚期的云纹铜禁另见 `works/yunwen-tongjin.md`。","path":"terms/tongjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铜禁是 B 维度下早期青铜家具的器类条目，其祭祀礼制用法另涉 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tongjing","title":"铜镜（Bronze Mirror）","name_en":"Bronze Mirror","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","梳妆用具","战国","唐代","鉴"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜镜是以铜（及锡、铅等合金）铸造、用以梳妆照脸的生活日用品。四册对它的起点判断不一致：夏燕靖两版说“铜镜从战国时期开始出现并流行”；赵农说铜镜“起源是在新石器时期晚期的齐家文化”，商周已开始发达、战国初步兴盛；田自秉引 1976 年妇好墓出土的早期铜镜，把铜镜产生时间推前几百年，在起点上接近赵农的早期说，但未提齐家文化。本 KU 把两套起点并列，并以战国形制、唐代繁盛两段为主体；汉代一段另立 `t","path":"terms/tongjing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铜镜是 B 维度下青铜生活用具的器类条目；从鉴水到鉴镜的观念转变、镜背纹样的信仰含义牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tou-lou-shou","title":"透、漏、瘦（Transparency, Perforation and Thinness）","name_en":"Transparency, Perforation and Thinness","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","李渔","闲情偶记","山石","赏石"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden_aesthetic","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"透、漏、瘦是李渔在《闲情偶记》中所说的山石审美三字标准。赵农在综述明清造园成就时引其说，言山石之美俱在透、漏、瘦三字，并以石寓志、极尽风骨；同段把李渔的芥子园与《芥子园画谱》中的树石山水并提，称其对造园艺术有深远影响。来源未给三字的具体定义、衡量尺度与在造园中的用法；书名照录作《闲情偶记》。","path":"terms/tou-lou-shou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"透、漏、瘦是 B 维度下明清山石审美标准的术语条目；其文献表述兼及 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:touguang-jing","title":"透光镜（Light-Transmitting Mirror）","name_en":"Light-Transmitting Mirror","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","铜镜","铸造应力","光学"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"透光镜是西汉出现的一种特殊铜镜，外形与普通镜相同，并非真正透光；日光照射镜面时，对面墙上能映出镜背花纹的影像。赵农把它列为汉代铜镜技术中最令人叹为观止的品种，并记其工艺与样式在隋唐仍有流传；田自秉记近代研究以铸造应力和研磨压应力造成的镜面曲率解释这一效应。","path":"terms/touguang-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"透光镜是 B 维度下汉代铜镜铸造与光学效应结合的专门条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tu-an","title":"图案（Tu'an (Pattern/Design)）","name_en":"Tu'an (Pattern/Design)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["图案","Design","工艺美术","设计艺术","学科名称"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_design_term","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图案是 20 世纪中国造物设计的最初名称，与 Design 一致，兼指平面图形与立体形态的设计。李立新把百年名称改动列为“图案—工艺美术—设计艺术”三次，并指出图案侧重造物过程的创意前阶段，“制一物，必先有一物之图案”。该词在 80 年代又与 Design 发生争论。","path":"terms/tu-an.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度学科名称史的条目，平面图形与立体形态属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tuanhua-wen","title":"团花纹（Tuanhua Wen (Medallion Flower Motif)）","name_en":"Tuanhua Wen (Medallion Flower Motif)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","丝织品","装饰纹样","四方连续","散点构成"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"团花纹是唐代丝织品上以圆形花头为单位、作散点排列的花卉纹样。高丰把它与联珠纹对举：联珠纹是中西艺术融合的产物，团花纹的自由式散点构成则是典型的中国传统装饰风格。其基本单位是一朵平面的盛开的花头，作重复整齐的四方连续排列，在团花之间形成的方形或菱形空间点缀小簇花作陪衬。\n\n来源以新疆阿斯塔那 381 号墓出土的“飞鸟团花锦”为完整实例，并记团花纹可与联珠纹组合，也可穿插飞鸟瑞兽与枝干绿叶；同一实例据","path":"terms/tuanhua-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"团花纹是 B 维度下唐代丝织装饰纹样的条目，其构成方式属视觉传达层，故列 C 为次维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tuoche-xiche","title":"驼车（奚车）（Camel Cart (Xiche)）","name_en":"Camel Cart (Xiche)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辽代","车具","驼车","奚车","奚族"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"驼车是辽代车具的代表，也称奚车，为奚族人的发明。赵农记辽代在上京设车子院管理车具，由于游牧民族不断迁徙的生活方式，车成为重要交通工具，游牧迁徙时的大车、毡车和小车有不同的车制和用途；驼车在辽代的日常生活与军事战争中发挥重大作用；金代延续辽宋许多制车技艺，日常社会生活中多用牛车和驴车；元代因战争运输需要与地域广大，对车辆的重视超过前人，牛车也多作为生活出行的主要交通工具。来源未给驼车的车制尺寸、篷帐","path":"terms/tuoche-xiche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"驼车（奚车）是 B 维度下辽代车具的条目；其游牧迁徙与车具管理制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tuotai-qiqi","title":"脱胎漆器（Tuotai (Bodiless) Lacquerware）","name_en":"Tuotai (Bodiless) Lacquerware","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["夹纻","乾隆","福州","三宝","轻巧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"脱胎漆器是以泥作模型、再用布或绸粘贴、然后上漆的夹纻技法制成的漆器，色泽华美、器体轻巧；乾隆时期由沈沼安创造，作法一直沿袭至今。2016 记其为福州传统漆器工艺，作品造型古朴大方、工艺精巧细致，大型脱胎漆器“荷叶瓶”“提篮仙子”“竹节瓶”被称为福州脱胎漆器“三宝”。田自秉另记福州脱胎是清代以来的传统产品，特点是器体轻巧、色彩艳丽，代表作赤宝砂由漆艺老艺人李芝卿创始，装饰方法有沉花、平花、浮花三种；","path":"terms/tuotai-qiqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"脱胎漆器是 B 维度下夹纻漆器类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:tuteng","title":"图腾（Totem）","name_en":"Totem","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["原始社会","氏族","表号","装饰","图腾"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_symbol","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图腾是原始装饰中具有普遍意义的标志性表号图案。田自秉记图腾原为印第安语，意为“他的家族”，大约与氏族公社同时产生；每个氏族往往采用一种动物或植物作为本氏族标志，并认为祖先由这种图腾演变而来。图腾或被黥刺在身体上，或被绘刻在器皿和武器上，是最早的具有实用意义的装饰。","path":"terms/tuteng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"图腾是 C 维度下原始标志性表号图案的术语条目；其器物装饰与氏族制度背景分属 B、D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:twelve-symbols","title":"纹饰十二章（Wenshi Shier Zhang (Twelve Ornamental Symbols)）","name_en":"Twelve Ornamental Symbols","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["十二章纹","冕服","礼服","政治象征","虞舜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"纹饰十二章又称十二章纹，是商周奴隶主阶级专用服饰纹样冕服上的十二种纹样。2016 册记前六种绘于服装、后六种绣于服装，并称其自出现后历经两千多年朝代更替而意义与图形始终保持原状。\n\n田自秉另据《书经·益稷篇》记十二章的完整文献与逐章释义：十二章是具有宗教意义的十二种图案，自西周以来为历代帝王所采用，民国初年袁世凯亦以十二章制定服式；前六章作会绘于衣，后六章絺绣绣于裳；日、月、星辰取其照临，山取其镇","path":"terms/twelve-symbols.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下服饰纹样制度的条目；田自秉另记十二章的宗教意义、历代沿用与儒家逐章释义。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:underglaze-color","title":"釉下彩（Underglaze Color）","name_en":"Underglaze Color","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["三国","唐代","长沙窑","瓷器装饰","釉下彩绘"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"釉下彩（又称窑彩）是在素坯上绘纹、罩透明或浅色面釉、经高温一次烧成的瓷器装饰类别，青花、釉里红、釉下三彩、釉下五彩都属其下品种。五册都把它当作彩瓷的两大工序类型之一（与釉上彩对举）。分歧有两处：**三国时期的点彩算不算釉下彩的起点**，以及**唐代釉下彩的窑口范围**。本 KU 并列，不裁定。\n\n**立条类型说明**：本 KU 定为 `term` 而非 `procedure`。赵农一册的候选（`2","path":"terms/underglaze-color.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"釉下彩是 B 维度下瓷器装饰分类条目：施彩与罩釉的工序、烧成温度属工艺，纹饰被釉膜覆盖的视觉效果属装饰。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:v-shaped-iron-ploughshare-cap","title":"V形铁铧冠（V-Shaped Iron Ploughshare Cap）","name_en":"V-Shaped Iron Ploughshare Cap","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋","铁农具","犁铧","牛耕","国语"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"V形铁铧冠是赵农第三章“铁器”一节所述的农具部件，来源称春秋时出现，做法是在木犁铧上套上铁铧冠（L1982）。来源说它可以用牛力作为耕地的辅助，并引《国语·晋语》的“畎田之勤”说明牛耕的作用（L1982）。来源对它的尺寸、形制细节与出土地点均未展开。","path":"terms/v-shaped-iron-ploughshare-cap.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"V形铁铧冠是 B 维度下春秋铁农具的条目，属于木犁铧的金属套刃。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wa-wen","title":"瓦纹（Tile Motif）","name_en":"Tile Motif","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","青铜器","装饰纹样","瓦纹","横线纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"瓦纹是周代青铜器的一种简朴装饰纹样，又称横线纹，陶瓷上也称弦纹。田自秉记其由一条条平行的横条组成，如同屋上的覆瓦；是周代装饰中最简朴的一种，多用于铜簋的腹部。来源未给横条的间距、粗细与年代序列。","path":"terms/wa-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"瓦纹是 C 维度下周代青铜装饰纹样的术语条目；其青铜器载体与铜簋施用属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wadang","title":"瓦当（Tile End）","name_en":"Tile End","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","战国","秦汉","建筑陶饰","文字瓦当"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_component","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"瓦当是覆于屋面筒瓦前端的陶制构件，起装饰作用，别称\"瓦头\"。六册中高丰最详，田自秉次之，夏燕靖两版与李立新各取一面，赵农另有形制、护椽功能与燕下都大瓦的文字论述。来源间的实质差异在汉代瓦当的分类体系：高丰分三类、田自秉分四类，两套分类并非同一标准的加细。","path":"terms/wadang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"瓦当是 C 维度下汉代图案与文字装饰的代表载体，同时是 B 维度建筑陶构件。本批按六册讨论的重心（装饰纹样与文字设计）归主维度 C。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wailaishi-jianzhu","title":"外来式建筑（Wailaishi Jianzhu (Foreign-Style Architecture)）","name_en":"Wailaishi Jianzhu (Foreign-Style Architecture)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["近代","租界","外来式建筑","折中主义","钢筋混凝土"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"外来式建筑是外国列强在中国各租界按照他们的建筑传统和审美观念建造、异于中国传统式的建筑。来源称这类建筑模仿欧洲文艺复兴风格和具有折中主义风格的西方建筑形式，虽采用现代建筑的钢筋混凝土材料和钢结构，却往往用石头墙面将建筑包砌起来，以体现西方古典建筑的庞大气势；设计师大多为西方建筑师。此类建筑在当时上海和天津等地各国租界盛行，上海汇丰银行、沙逊大厦、百老汇大厦、雅斯脱饭店，天津德界市议会、英界戈登堂，","path":"terms/wailaishi-jianzhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"外来式建筑是 E 维度下近代跨文化建筑输入的条目，其材料与结构属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:war-chariot","title":"战车（War Chariot）","name_en":"War Chariot","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","车战","独辕双轮","毂辐结构","驷马战车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"战车是赵农第三章第二节“车辆与兵器”中单列的车辆类型，来源称车战是春秋战国最重要的作战形式，战车既是车战兵器，也是“千乘之国”的国力标志（L1824-L1830）。来源记其形制以独辕双轮木车为主，车轮为毂辐结构，车箱门在后，重要部位以铜片包裹，并列举三门峡虢国墓与淮阳楚墓的车马坑实物（L1832-L1834）。来源又称战国出现双辕驾一马的车形，但大量仍是单辕战车，骑兵兴起后车战减少（L1836-L","path":"terms/war-chariot.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"战车是 B 维度下春秋战国车战与车辆形制的条目，上承先秦马车，下接车战兵器与骑兵兴起。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:washe","title":"瓦舍（Washe (Urban Entertainment Quarter)）","name_en":"Washe (Urban Entertainment Quarter)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","商业","娱乐","瓦舍","瓦子"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"entertainment_venue","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"瓦舍是宋代都城出现的商业娱乐场所。赵农记瓦舍也叫瓦子、瓦肆，引《梦梁录》“瓦舍者，谓其来时瓦舍，去时瓦解之义，易聚易散也”，称有瓦合与瓦解之意；瓦舍以游艺活动为主，寓娱乐与商业于一体，汇粹杂技、魔术、皮影、傀儡戏、杂剧、说书等民间艺术形式；据《东京梦华录》《梦梁录》《武林旧事》等书记载，开封城有瓦舍50多所，南宋临安有24所。","path":"terms/washe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"瓦舍是 D 维度下宋代城市娱乐商业场所的条目；其内部勾栏与演出视觉形式归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:weft-brocade","title":"纬锦（Weft-faced Brocade）","name_en":"Weft-faced Brocade","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","丝织","织锦","纬线显花","经锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"纬锦是以纬线显花的锦，与唐以前以经线显花的经锦相对。四册都把“汉锦/经锦”与“唐锦/纬锦”作为一对技术—时代类型：经锦以经线起花，纬锦以纬线起花；唐代的锦以纬锦为主，织物因此能织出更繁复的花纹、更宽幅的面料和更华丽的色彩。差异在出现时间与技术描述：夏燕靖两版说“南北朝后出现斜纹的纬线显花的纬锦，以两组纬线与一组经线交织而成”；高丰说“唐代新创造了纬锦。纬锦是利用多重多色的纬线起花”；田自秉说“唐锦","path":"terms/weft-brocade.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"纬锦是 B 维度下丝织工艺与织物类型的术语锚点；唐代织造机构、生产规模与外销属 D。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wei-bei","title":"魏碑（Wei Stele Style）","name_en":"Wei Stele Style","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北魏","北齐","北周","碑刻","书法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calligraphy_style","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"魏碑是来源对北魏时期碑刻书风的称法，来源在碑刻与墓志一节以「魏碑」为小标题。来源举《龙门二十品》中的《始平公造像记》《杨大眼造像记》与摩崖《石门铭》为例，并引清人康有为的评语。来源又记北齐《泰山经石峪金刚经》的混合书体与北周《西岳华山碑》对北魏的承袭。来源未给魏碑的定义、分期与书家谱系，图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"terms/wei-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"C 维度下的书风条目，记录北魏碑刻及其后续碑刻的用笔品评；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:weisuo-jingguan-gongyuan","title":"微缩景观公园（Weisuo Jingguan Gongyuan (Miniature Landscape Park)）","name_en":"Weisuo Jingguan Gongyuan (Miniature Landscape Park)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["改革开放","公园","微缩景观","世界之窗","世界公园"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"park_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"微缩景观公园是现代化程度较高城市修建的新园林类型，集世界各地建筑精华于一园。赵农以深圳「世界之窗」和北京「世界公园」为例，称其采集世界各地建筑精华、浓缩人类诸多文化现象，作为微缩景观展示在国人面前；来源并称世界公园作为一种微缩景观在国外一些发达国家早已出现。来源未给两园的面积、建成年代、景点数量与设计者。","path":"terms/weisuo-jingguan-gongyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"微缩景观公园是 B 维度下现代园林类型的条目；其作为城市公共文化设施的属性归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:weizhang","title":"帷帐（Curtain and Canopy）","name_en":"Curtain and Canopy","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","室内分隔","马王堆","防尘避风"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"interior_textile","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"帷帐是汉代室内空间分隔与组织的主要手段之一。帷多单幅横面，用于分隔堂、室；帐笼罩四面，施于床上。湖南长沙马王堆一号汉墓出土丝绸帷帐全长约 7.3 米、宽约 1.45 米；帷帐移动方便、可开可合，兼有保暖、避虫、挡风、防尘和装饰功能。","path":"terms/weizhang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"帷帐是 B 维度下汉代室内空间分隔的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wenzhi-tongyi","title":"文质统一（Wenzhi Tongyi (Unity of Ornament and Substance)）","name_en":"Wenzhi Tongyi (Unity of Ornament and Substance)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","周易","易经","贲卦","离卦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"philosophical_proposition","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"文质统一是高丰从《易经》贲卦与离卦中提出的设计思想，列为《周易》设计思想三条之三。他先立“装饰，是艺术设计的一个重要组成部分”，再分释两卦：贲卦“象征纹饰”，《彖传》讲刚美柔美交相错杂，“上九，白贲”则经王弼注“饰终反素”落到质素；离卦讲附丽与美丽，宗白华释为“器具的雕饰能够引起美感”。由此他归纳出装饰设计的两个关键问题——文与质的关系、附丽与美丽的关系——并把“崇尚自然的美”定为装饰美的最高境界","path":"terms/wenzhi-tongyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"文质统一是 A 维度下《周易》设计思想的条目，为高丰所举三条中的第三条；其落点是器物装饰的文与质、附丽与美丽，故兼有 B 维度成分。本条与 `terms/wenzhi.md` 分列：后者为《论语》系统的文质概念（另三册来源），本条为《易经》贲卦、离卦的装饰美学阐释，两支出处不同，不合并。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wenzhi","title":"文质（Wen and Zhi (Ornament and Substance)）","name_en":"Wen and Zhi (Ornament and Substance)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["孔子","论语","文采","实质","设计准则"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"aesthetic_concept","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"文质是我国古代文论的基本概念，包括“文”与“质”两个方面：文指文采，质指实质。出典为孔子《论语·雍也》“质胜文则野，文胜质则史，文质彬彬，然后君子”，意即只有学问而无文采则粗野，过分渲染文采而无内涵实质则虚饰，君子须文采与内涵兼具。后世文论多指语言风格的华美与质朴。","path":"terms/wenzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"文质是 A 维度下先秦设计审美观念的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:windlass","title":"辘轳（Windlass）","name_en":"Windlass","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","提水装置","矿井升降","滑轮","铜绿山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"辘轳是架设于井口、以绳缠绕圆柱形卷筒来提水或升降重物的装置。赵农在第三章「农具与工具」一节的工具部分记其原理为井上架圆横木、横木套圆柱形辘轳、绳在辘轳上缠绕，产生滑动省力的效果；用途包括饮水、灌溉与矿井吊筐。来源又记商代中期矿冶遗址出现木辘轳实物，湖北大冶铜绿山古矿址有两件战国至西汉时期的辘轳。","path":"terms/windlass.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"辘轳是 B 维度下井上提水与升降装置的条目，其滑轮原理与商代矿冶实物见来源同段。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wooden-kite","title":"木鸢（Wooden Kite）","name_en":"Wooden Kite","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","墨子","公输般","木制飞行器","风筝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"木鸢是战国文献所记的木制机械飞行器。赵农引《韩非子·外储说左上》墨子为木鸢三年而成、飞一日而败，又引《墨子·鲁问》公输般削竹木为鹊、成而飞之三日不下，称木鸢是战国时期人们想象力的实践。来源还认为木鸢有助于人们认识空间原理，后来的风筝延伸了这种飞行创造力。","path":"terms/wooden-kite.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"木鸢是 B 维度下战国木制飞行器想象的条目，来源以《韩非子》《墨子》两说并置。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wu-deng","title":"杌凳（Stool）","name_en":"Stool","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["隋唐","家具","坐具","杌凳","高足家具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"seating_furniture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"杌凳是无背无扶手的坐具，由床榻前的踏具与杌演变、联称而来。来源记床榻前面的踏登与几有相似之处，后成为凳；又称杌本有树桩之意，魏晋以来成为一种坐具，因凳与杌制形接近，南北朝开始以杌凳联称。隋唐高足坐具流行，杌凳因无背无扶手而区别于椅子，也广泛应用于世俗社会。唐代绘画资料中杌凳形象很多，张萱《捣练图》、周昉《簪花仕女图》等作品中的杌凳为当时妇女常备坐具，高凳、矮凳、方凳、圆凳、半圆凳的造型出现在日常生","path":"terms/wu-deng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"杌凳是 B 维度隋唐坐具形制的条目，来源所述渊源、联称与高足坐具用途均属造物与生活器用，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wu-gong","title":"五供（Five Offerings (Wu Gong)）","name_en":"Five Offerings (Wu Gong)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["佛教","供具","三具足","五具足","五供"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_category","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"五供是汉化佛教供具的组合称法。李立新记“三具足”即香炉一具、烛台一对、花瓶一对，按个数为五，又称“五具足”，民间称“五供”，是一套通用的、流行至今的佛教造物设计。来源并举两例：唐咸通九年王玠刻印《金刚经》卷首图佛前有一带盖香炉、左右一对高足高盖形器皿；元刻本《金刚经》卷首图有一炉、二台烛、二花瓶的五供组合。来源未给三具足／五具足的定名年代、器物尺寸与材质。","path":"terms/wu-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下汉化佛教供具组合的条目，其佛教中国化与跨文化背景归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wucai","title":"五彩（Wucai (Polychrome Porcelain)）","name_en":"Wucai (Polychrome Porcelain)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明嘉靖万历","釉上彩","景德镇","彩瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"五彩是明嘉靖、万历时期盛行的釉上彩瓷，用红、黄、绿、紫、孔雀蓝等多种彩料直接在烧成瓷器上描绘花纹、再经焙烧而成。赵农把它列为明清白瓷、青花之外的瓷器品种之一；2016 称其色调多变、富丽堂皇，具有浓郁民族风格。","path":"terms/wucai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"五彩是 B 维度下明代釉上彩瓷的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wuda-mingyao","title":"五大名窑（Five Great Kilns）","name_en":"Five Great Kilns","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","官窑","汝窑","钧窑","哥窑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_kiln_group","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"五大名窑是宋瓷中“官、汝、钧、哥、定”五个窑系的合称。赵农指出这仅仅是一种习惯说法，不同地域的窑制自然体现区域特点；2016 以汝窑、官窑、定窑、钧窑、哥窑概括宋代制瓷业的地域流派与工艺成就。","path":"terms/wuda-mingyao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"五大名窑是 B 维度下宋瓷分类的总目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wudai-shiguo","title":"五代十国（Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms）","name_en":"Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐末宋初","五代","十国","分期"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_period","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"五代十国是唐亡后北方五个短命王朝与南方十个地方政权并立的时期。赵农记五代共 53 年、两宋 319 年，合计 372 年；2016 记其历时约半个世纪，南方十国经济文化胜于北方。","path":"terms/wudai-shiguo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"五代十国是 B 维度下的历史分期框架，用于安放唐宋之间的工艺与设计史材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wugou-hook","title":"吴钩（Wu Hook）","name_en":"Wu Hook","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋","吴国","阖闾","吴越春秋","钩"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"吴钩是赵农第三章“剑器”一节末“其他兵器”中与剑器接近的器物，来源只说它与剑器接近，未描述形制（L1915）。来源引《吴越春秋》记吴王阖闾悬赏善钩者，吴国制钩者甚众，有人为贪重赏而杀子以血涂钩（L1915）。来源称这种制钩方式有些离奇古怪（L1915）。","path":"terms/wugou-hook.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"吴钩是 B 维度下春秋吴国兵器的条目，来源只把它作为与剑器接近的器物附论。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:wule-gongming","title":"物勒工名（Wu Le Gong Ming (Inscribing the Artisan's Name)）","name_en":"Wu Le Gong Ming (Inscribing the Artisan's Name)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","礼记月令","工匠署名","质量责任","上林苑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"quality_control_institution","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"物勒工名是自西周起对工匠制物的规定，要求工匠在所造器物上署名的质量责任制度。《礼记·月令》记“物勒工名，以考其诚。功有不当，必行其罪，以究其情”。李立新以西安三桥镇出土的汉代上林苑宫馆铜鉴、铜鼎铭文为例，记阳朔、鸿嘉、甘露年间工匠杨政、李骏、周博、杨放、周霸、黄通、王意、左恽等人所造件数，说明工匠对所造之物负有责任，不达要求将受严厉制裁；又以《晋书·赫连勃勃载记》所记射甲、铠匠的处置说明制裁之严。","path":"terms/wule-gongming.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度下工匠署名与质量责任制度的条目，其制器与检验环节属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xi-liang-yue","title":"西凉乐（Xiliang Music）","name_en":"Xiliang Music","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","音乐","凉州","龟兹","中原古乐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"music_genre","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西凉乐指凉州音乐，凉州即今甘肃武威；来源称其在吸收西域龟兹音乐的基础上加以改变，并融入一部分中原古乐（L3887）。西凉本为十六国之一，在酒泉敦煌一带立国。来源又据《隋书·音乐志》列西凉、龟兹、天竺、康国、安国、疏勒、高丽等外来乐器来源国（L3885），并释龟兹在今新疆库车（L3889）。来源未载西凉乐的曲目、乐器组合、乐工人数、乐律与演出场景。","path":"terms/xi-liang-yue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"西凉乐是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝凉州音乐形态的条目，其吸收龟兹音乐并融入中原古乐属 E 维度跨文化互动。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xi-mat","title":"席（Mat (Seating Mat)）","name_en":"Mat (Seating Mat)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","坐卧铺垫","礼制","连席","席子"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"席是中国古代古老而原始的家具，供坐卧铺垫。商代席的使用逐渐普及，周代已有莞席、藻席、次席、蒲席、熊席等名称，并设专掌五席的官吏；席的材质、装饰和使用方式在礼制中有严格等级规定。春秋战国人们以坐席形式接人待客，铺席设筵，席上置案、几等低矮家具。赵农则把席子列为家具部分的第一项，称其为「最初家具」，记其从兽皮延伸、以编织技术完成，新石器时期已有大量芦苇编织残片，并把“席地而坐”的“地”释为席面而非地面","path":"terms/xi-mat.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"席是 B 维度下先秦起居家具的原点条目，高丰、2016 与赵农三册分别承载礼制、坐席礼俗与起源编织。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xia-bo","title":"匣钵（Saggar）","name_en":"Saggar","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["南北朝","窑具","匣钵","制瓷技术","瓷器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kiln_furnishing","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"匣钵是南北朝窑址中出土的窑具，来源称其使用对瓷器成型起重要作用。来源记其可防止瓷胎挤压变形、隔离烟尘熏染并避免釉色减弱。来源又说匣钵的使用体现窑工制瓷技术经验，可在有限窑炉空间中掌握温度变化、提高瓷器质地纯度。来源未给匣钵的材质、形制、尺寸与装烧工序，图版未核。本条只写来源所给的隔离、防变形、防熏染与控温四点。","path":"terms/xia-bo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的窑具条目，记录匣钵在瓷器成型与烧制中的作用；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xia-li","title":"夏历（Xia Calendar）","name_en":"Xia Calendar","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["夏代","历法","天干","时间观念","自然观"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calendrical_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夏历是赵农在第二章第一节叙述夏代自然观时提到的历法。来源称夏人的自然观形成了后来中华民族时空的基本概念，夏历将一年定为366天测算，并有十天一旬的折算方法，用天干记日，作者认为这几乎是一种现代的时间观念。来源只给这一句概括，未记月序、闰法、节气与实测依据。","path":"terms/xia-li.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"夏历是 B 维度下夏代时间测算与记日方式的条目，其天干记日属 C 维度符号应用。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiaguo-jian","title":"夏国剑（Xiaguo Jian (Xia State Sword)）","name_en":"Xiaguo Jian (Xia State Sword)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西夏","兵器","夏国剑","鎏金","文献记载"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西夏典籍记载的质地精良的武器。2016 册在“西夏工艺技术成就”知识链接中记：西夏银器、铜器铸造加工以及鎏金技术有较高的水平，西夏典籍中记载的质地精良的武器——“夏国剑”，便是极好的印证；据说宋朝高官以及文人雅士，往往以得到该剑为荣；该剑不仅外表美观，而且犀利无比，不仅铸造技术高超，而且剑把上的鎏金装饰更是精美绝妙，可称得上是西夏铜制器中的珍宝。来源未给剑的尺寸、形制、出土或传世实例，本条只作名物","path":"terms/xiaguo-jian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西夏金属工艺名物的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiandai-gongyi","title":"现代工艺（Modern Craft）","name_en":"Modern Craft","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","新材料","新技术","美术设计品","玻璃"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_category","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"现代工艺是与传统工艺相对而言的类称。来源认为它的含义应指运用现代新材料、新技术所生产的各种美术设计品，但范围很广，在各工艺品种的发展中也产生新的变化而相互交错，例如染织的化学纤维与光电提花、陶瓷的新釉彩与滚压成型和隧道窑烧制，因此很难定出绝对的划分标准。来源只就现代兴起并大量生产的玻璃、塑料、搪瓷、铝制品、人造材料家具等作简略介绍。","path":"terms/xiandai-gongyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度现代工艺类称的条目，工业化生产体制属 D 维度、与传统工艺的对照属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiangjiao","title":"橡胶（Rubber）","name_en":"Rubber","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["现代","橡胶","天然橡胶","合成橡胶","高分子材料"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"橡胶是高分子化合物，有天然和合成两大类。天然橡胶以橡胶树上割取的橡浆（胶乳）加工而成，合成橡胶由各种单体聚合而成。通过加热、液化、模制，橡胶可形成标准物件，广泛应用于轮胎、电线、电缆、胶带、胶垫等工业生产以及雨鞋、胶靴等日常生活用品。来源未给中国橡胶工业的产量、厂址与历史分期。","path":"terms/xiangjiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"橡胶是 B 维度下现代高分子材料的条目；其工业应用与生产组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xianglian","title":"项链（Necklace）","name_en":"Necklace","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器时期","新石器时期","装饰品","贝壳","彩石"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ornament","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"项链是赵农在第一章“饰物”一节中论述的主要装饰物，来源称它是通俗意义上的项链，即用绳子穿上贝壳或彩石，形成链状的饰物，这是人的感官审美的发生。来源称项链的外观有充分的美感因素，同时也会成为个人或部落财富的象征，或许还有部落专门标志的意味，或含有巫术辟邪的成分。来源又记旧石器时期北京山顶洞人遗址已出现饰物，半坡等地遗址中饰物频繁出现；新石器时期还有头饰、耳饰、颈饰、胸饰、腰饰、肢饰等，材料包括牙、骨","path":"terms/xianglian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"项链是 C 维度下原始饰物与感官审美的条目，其贝壳、彩石穿孔与串联工艺属 B 维度，财富象征属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiangqi","title":"象棋（Chinese Chess (Xiangqi)）","name_en":"Chinese Chess (Xiangqi)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","象棋","楚汉河界","程颢","智力娱乐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"game","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"象棋是宋代定型的棋类。赵农记宋代的象棋与后来相同，定型为一种双方16子的楚汉河界的对峙格局；相传北宋程颢热衷于象棋，以棋喻兵，再论楚汉争霸，有“欲凭纹楸聊自笑，雄如刘项亦争闲”的诗句；宋代以后象棋成为中国社会雅俗士庶的智力娱乐。来源未给棋盘尺寸、棋子材料、规则细节与棋谱。","path":"terms/xiangqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"象棋是 C 维度下宋代棋类的条目，材料限于定型格局、程颢诗与社会传播。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiangsheng-xing","title":"象生形（Xiangsheng Xing (Life-like Vessel Form)）","name_en":"Xiangsheng Xing (Life-like Vessel Form)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","商周","青铜器","象生造型","鸟兽尊"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form_group","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"象生形是高丰用来指称“模拟动物、植物、人物造型的器皿”的器形类别，也称象生造型、象生器。他把这一形式的起点定在新石器时代中期，列举甘肃玉门人形彩陶罐、秦安大地湾人头形器口彩陶瓶、华县太平庄鹰尊、西安半坡葫芦瓶、大汶口猪形罂等，年代约在距今五六千年；并判断原始时代的象生形“设计和制作也都比较简单”。象生形的真正发展在商周青铜时代，以鸟兽尊为主体，兼具祭器功能与观赏价值。\n\n来源把象生形与几何形对置：","path":"terms/xiangsheng-xing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"象生形是 B 维度下依造型来源划分的器形类别，跨陶器与青铜器两类载体；来源把它作为“商周青铜器造型的基本形式”之一与几何形、组合形并列论述，其中含设计观念成分，故旁及 A 维度。具体器物如妇好鸮尊、象尊各为独立 work 条目，本条只承载类型层面的定义与特征。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiangxie","title":"相缬（Xiangxie (Xiangzhou Resist Dye)）","name_en":"Xiangxie (Xiangzhou Resist Dye)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["金代","相州","防染","贡品","套染"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"相缬是金代纺织工艺品种，继承古代纺织品“防染法”染花工艺“缬”，多为民间所用，一般作单色加工，朴实大方；少数供官府呈作贡品的相缬加工复杂，套染出多彩纹样，具晕渲烂漫、变幻迷离的装饰效果。相州产相缬。","path":"terms/xiangxie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"相缬是 B 维度下金代防染印花品种的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiangxiu","title":"湘绣（Xiang Embroidery）","name_en":"Xiang Embroidery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","湖南","长沙","湘绣","施针"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"湘绣是形成独立系统于清代后期的湖南刺绣。来源引徐崇立《沪渎羁居记》记长沙光绪末叶湘绣盛行、超越苏绣而不沿顾绣之名，法在改蓝本、染色丝。湘绣以写实作风与施针见长，传统题材以狮虎等猛兽最有特色，并以色彩衬地后施绣增加层次。来源另记马王堆汉墓刺绣为湘绣先声的一说，但明确不排斥湘绣在近代始成体系的立论。","path":"terms/xiangxiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代地方刺绣的条目，写实作风与色彩衬地属 C 维度，绣坊与艺人传播归 D 维度另条。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiangyazhu","title":"象牙球（Ivory Ball (Nested Spheres)）","name_en":"Ivory Ball (Nested Spheres)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","广州","牙雕","象牙球","翁五章"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ivory_carving_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"象牙球是广州牙雕的代表性器类，由层层相套、可以转动的球体构成。清代段记牙雕用染色与拼镶等技法，象牙球已能刻制十余层。新中国段记广州牙雕以象牙球闻名，系清代翁五章创始、现已传艺第四代，几十层球体层层相套而可转动，目前能刻制四十层左右。","path":"terms/xiangyazhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度牙雕器类的条目，层球镂空与表面纹饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xianqin-mache","title":"先秦马车（Pre-Qin Horse-Drawn Chariot）","name_en":"Pre-Qin Horse-Drawn Chariot","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","车制","独辀","车舆","车轮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"先秦马车是以木制为主、以独辀驾马的车，由车轮、车辀、车舆（车箱）、车盖等部分组成。高丰按功能把它分为战争用的战车、贵族出行用的乘车与田间运输用的田车，并据《考工记》“一器而工聚焉者，车为多”说明制车是分工严格的生产部门：车人为车，轮人为轮、为盖，舆人为舆，辀人为辀。\n\n来源从功能与结构两面论证先秦车制的成就：车轮以轮径规定兼顾登车与人马受力，车辀以曲直结合兼顾利行与耐久，车舆以“叁分车广，去一以为","path":"terms/xianqin-mache.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"先秦马车是 B 维度下车制与交通工具的条目，其等级象征与礼制用法另涉 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xianqin-sandai","title":"先秦三代（Xianqin Sandai (Pre-Qin Three Dynasties)）","name_en":"Pre-Qin Three Dynasties","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","夏商周","三代","青铜时代","历史分期"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_period","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"先秦三代是先秦史内部的分期概念，特指秦朝以前的夏、商、周三代，周包括西周与东周的春秋、战国两个时期。2016 册先界定先秦为公元前 221 年秦统一以前的历史，再以先秦三代指夏商周的时段，并把这一时期定为继旧石器、新石器之后的第三个文明期“青铜时代”。","path":"terms/xianqin-sandai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下中国上古史分期的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiaopin-diaoke","title":"小品雕刻（Minor Carving）","name_en":"Minor Carving","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","牙雕","犀角","黄杨木雕","匏器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"carving_genre","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"小品雕刻是清代种类繁多、制作精巧的小件雕刻。常见材料有牙、骨、紫檀、黄杨、果核与匏瓜等；牙雕用染色和拼镶等技法，象牙球已能刻制十余层；犀角、紫檀、黄杨、胡桃与匏器各有名手。来源逐类列名而不分述各家作品，未给工序与尺寸。","path":"terms/xiaopin-diaoke.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代小件雕刻的类目条目，染色、拼镶与器形属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiaozhuan","title":"小篆（Small Seal Script）","name_en":"Small Seal Script","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦代","书同文","李斯","标准文字","汉字设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calligraphy_script","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"小篆是秦始皇“书同文”所确立的规范书体，由大篆演变而来。字形规整修长、笔画匀称圆润，具线条化、符号化、规律化特点，是古文字阶段最后一种字体；高丰视其为汉字设计走向成熟的标志。赵农记秦始皇统一六国后采用丞相李斯创意的小篆并颁布全国，以《泰山刻石碑》《峄山刻石碑》《会稽刻石碑》石刻确立规范。","path":"terms/xiaozhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"小篆是 C 维度下秦代标准书体与文字设计的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiapei","title":"霞帔（Xiapei Stole）","name_en":"Xiapei Stole","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["服饰","明代","宋代","命妇","禽纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"clothing_accessory","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"霞帔是宋明女性服饰中的披挂类附件。三册对它的时代、形态与制度属性说法不同：夏燕靖两版只说明代，称其为\"'恩赐贵妇专用'饰品\"，记深青缎地、云霞禽纹与一至七品的禽纹等级；赵农把霞帔列为宋代一般女服的组成（\"大袖、长裙、霞帔\"），又在明清段称其为\"佩带的饰物，是用彩带连缀的金玉坠子，多为贵族妇女所佩\"。两套描述不仅时代不同，形态也不同：一为绣禽纹的深青缎饰，一为彩带连缀金玉坠子。本 KU 并列，不合并","path":"terms/xiapei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"霞帔是 B 维度下宋明女性服饰附件的条目；织物、绣纹与佩挂结构属 B，命妇品级与恩赐制度牵涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xie-gong-jian","title":"谢公笺（Xie Gong Paper）","name_en":"Xie Gong Paper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北宋","造纸","色纸","谢师厚","十色笺"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorated_paper","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"谢公笺是北宋谢师厚研制的笺纸。赵农在染纸段记其有10种颜色，称为十色笺，并以晚唐薛涛笺的五色小笺作前后对照。来源只给研制者、颜色数与名称，未给染色原料、纸幅与用途；本条作为色纸谱系中的一条立目。","path":"terms/xie-gong-jian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"谢公笺是 B 维度下北宋染色笺纸的条目；其色样与装饰归 C 维度。材料仅一句，confidence 取 low。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiehong","title":"斜红（Xiehong (Slant Red)）","name_en":"Xiehong (Slant Red)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","面妆","斜红","太阳穴","魏文帝"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cosmetic_custom","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"太阳穴处涂一抹斜红的唐代面妆。2016 册在唐女面妆一段记：还有在太阳穴各涂一抹斜红；据说这是魏文帝爱妃夜来误撞屏风，明明破了相，却被魏文帝以为是特地涂的妆容，后遂被嫔妃效仿。来源只用一句话交代部位与传说来源，未给形制、颜色深浅与流行时段，也未说明“斜红”与额黄、花钿的搭配规则。","path":"terms/xiehong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代面妆习俗的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xieshixing-sheji","title":"写实性设计（Realistic Design）","name_en":"Realistic Design","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["写实性设计","意匠化设计","院体画","宋代","设计风格转折"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_style_periodization","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"写实性设计是李立新用来概括宋以后设计倾向的风格概念，与宋之前的意匠化设计相对。其成因是工笔绘画直接进入设计领域、院体画讲求格法与形似；其后果是写实花鸟与山水界画束缚设计意匠的发挥，按实描摹成为桎梏，意匠化设计急剧衰退。","path":"terms/xieshixing-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计风格分期的条目，写实绘画与装饰的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xifu","title":"西服（Xifu (Western Suit)）","name_en":"Xifu (Western Suit)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["20世纪","西服","西装","上海","制衣行业"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西服是欧洲传统服装，20 世纪初由西方商业人士及中国留学欧美的学生引入，西服制衣行业开始在上海盛行。其形制有拨折领、前衣片三只开袋、肩部衬垫、后背背缝，分便服与礼服两种；礼服又有晨礼服、晚礼服、常礼服等样式。20 世纪上半叶西服仅在上流阶层流行，文化大革命时期几乎销声匿迹，80 年代以后在普通社会各阶层迅速流行，逐渐演变为无明显阶层特征的平民化服饰。来源未给具体裁剪尺寸、面料规格与上海西服店的完整","path":"terms/xifu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"西服是 B 维度下近代西式男装的条目；其西方引入与跨文化传播属 E 维度，制衣行业与市场属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xikesuosi-ren","title":"喜克索斯人（Hyksos）","name_en":"Hyksos","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["古埃及","前17世纪","马拉战车","复合弓","技术传播"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"social_group","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"喜克索斯人是古代亚洲西部的一个混合民族，于前 17 世纪进入埃及东部，建立第十五和第十六王朝（约前 1674 年至前 1548 年），统治中埃及和下埃及一百多年，并将复合弓、马和马拉战车等新技术引入埃及。","path":"terms/xikesuosi-ren.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"喜克索斯人是 E 维度下古代跨文化技术传播的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xin-tongqi","title":"新铜器（Xin Tongqi (Song Bronze Ware)）","name_en":"Xin Tongqi (Song Bronze Ware)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","铜器","新铜器","句容","台州"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalware_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"新铜器是后人为区别商周铜器而对宋代铜器的称法。来源记宋代铜器的著名产地有江苏句容和浙江台州等地，并引清人唐秉钧《文房肆考》称新铜器为唐宋所铸之物，唐天宝年间至南唐及宋于句容县铸，宋又于台州铸。来源未给新铜器的器形清单、胎质合金与断代标准。","path":"terms/xin-tongqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代铜器类型的条目，句容与台州铸地及官方铜禁背景属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xindian-wenhua","title":"辛店文化（Xindian Culture）","name_en":"Xindian Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["辛店文化","彩陶","双大耳罐","双钩纹","商周"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"辛店文化是黄河上游继齐家文化之后兴起的彩陶文化，时间约相当于商周。田自秉记其彩陶工艺再度兴盛，双大耳罐上常绘双钩纹，中间饰人物、小狗或太阳，罐颈饰回纹，装饰手法几乎千篇一律。来源未给分布范围、年代测定、遗址清单与陶器分期。","path":"terms/xindian-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"辛店文化是 B 维度下黄河上游彩陶文化的术语条目；其双钩纹装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xing-shu","title":"行书（Running Script）","name_en":"Running Script","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","魏晋南北朝","书体","行书","王羲之"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calligraphy_script","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"行书是介于楷书与草书之间的书体，来源记其在魏晋南北朝时期成熟并流行。来源称行书本出现于汉代，但其独立与楷书有关。来源以王羲之《兰亭集序》为行书代表，并转述其有「天下第一行书」之誉。来源未给行书的笔法分类、代表书家谱系与作品年代，图版未核。本条只记来源所给的行书成熟、源流、特点与代表作品。","path":"terms/xing-shu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"C 维度下的书体条目，关注行书成熟及其与楷书、草书的关系；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xingsheng-zhidu","title":"行省制度（Xingsheng Zhidu (Provincial Administration System)）","name_en":"Xingsheng Zhidu (Provincial Administration System)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","行省","中书省","地方行政","制度形态"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"administrative_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代创设的地方行政制度。2016 册在元代一章开篇记：元朝在中央设中书省，左右丞相和平章政事处理政务，地方实行行省制度，此政体对后世影响极大，乃至明清两朝皆仿其制。同章“元朝制度形态”知识链接把“立行省”列为采行汉唐旧制、随时变通的三项之一，称“立行省，为全国行省制度的创始”。来源随即把制度条件与手工业联系起来：元代对手工业采取鼓励和保护政策，大一统条件下各地各类手工业得到较充分的汇集与交流，许多","path":"terms/xingsheng-zhidu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下元代地方行政制度的背景条目，与工艺生产的制度条件相关而非工艺本体。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xinqi-xiu","title":"信期绣（Xinqi Embroidery）","name_en":"Xinqi Embroidery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西汉","马王堆","刺绣","长尾小鸟","候鸟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"信期绣是马王堆汉墓最精巧的刺绣品种，用线细、单元小、花纹精密；纹样布满长尾小鸟，来源疑为燕，并因燕为候鸟而与“信期”之意相联系。信期绣出土最多，共19件。来源未给19件的墓葬分配、尺寸、底料与针法。","path":"terms/xinqi-xiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"信期绣是 B 维度下西汉刺绣类型的条目，其长尾小鸟纹样与命名观念归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xinshiqi-shidai","title":"新石器时代（Neolithic Period）","name_en":"Neolithic Period","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["磨制石器","农业","定居","制陶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"新石器时代是以使用磨制石器为标志的石器时代最后阶段，约从距今 1 万至 8 千年开始，结束于距今 5000 至 2000 多年不等；出现农业、牧业、定居村落和制陶。田自秉以磨制石器的工艺特征定义该时代：把经过选择的石头打成石斧、石刀、石锛、石铲、石凿，并磨光、钻孔、装柄或穿绳。","path":"terms/xinshiqi-shidai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"新石器时代是 B 维度下的考古分期框架，用于安放农业、聚落与制陶材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xinshiqi-shiqi-leixing","title":"新石器时期石器类型（Neolithic Stone Tool Types）","name_en":"Neolithic Stone Tool Types","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器晚期","石器","农具","复合工具","器类"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"新石器时期石器类型是赵农在第一章第三节第二目“石器的类型”中给出的清单级聚合。来源称到新石器时期晚期，石器已具有斧、铲、锄、刀、矛、凿、锛、镰、杵臼、磨盘、磨棒等不同功能的类型，并逐一说明石斧、斤、石刀、石锄、石铲、石镰、磨盘磨棒、石杵、石凿、石锛的用途。本条按来源用语立一个聚合条，不把每一种石器拆成独立 KU。","path":"terms/xinshiqi-shiqi-leixing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下新石器晚期石器功能类型的清单级聚合条，不逐件立目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xipi","title":"犀皮（Xipi (Marbled Lacquer)）","name_en":"Xipi (Marbled Lacquer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["斑纹漆","六朝","宋代","虎皮漆","菠萝漆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"犀皮是以多层色漆形成凹凸漆层、打磨后显出斑纹的漆器品种。田自秉记其做法：先用稠厚色漆在器胎上涂出凹凸不平漆层，干后用对比鲜明的色漆分层涂，最后用磨炭打磨，因漆层高度不同显出片云、圆花、松鳞等斑纹；实为六朝斑漆的发展，俗称虎皮漆或菠萝漆，宋时有犀皮行专门生产、成本低廉。高丰记安徽马鞍山东吴朱然墓出土的一对犀皮鎏金铜扣漆耳杯，为迄今所发现最早的犀皮实物。","path":"terms/xipi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"犀皮是 B 维度下斑纹漆器工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xiqin","title":"奚琴（Xiqin (Two-String Fiddle)）","name_en":"Xiqin (Two-String Fiddle)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","宋代","乐器","奚琴","胡琴"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"奚琴即胡琴，是北方游牧民族奚部的乐器，唐代已经流行。赵农记又相传奚琴为嵇康所制，南宋改称嵇琴；宋代民间生活中广泛应用拉弦乐器，如在瓦肆中出现奚琴和轧筝；北宋西北边塞有“马尾胡琴”，沈括诗有“马尾胡琴随汉车，曲声犹自怨单于”的吟唱，亦见胡琴为胡汉文化交融的产物，后逐渐演变成二胡的样式。","path":"terms/xiqin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"奚琴是 B 维度下拉弦乐器的条目；其胡汉文化交融归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xishiqi","title":"细石器（Microlith）","name_en":"Microlith","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器晚期","峙峪文化","下川文化","复合工具","镶嵌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tool_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"细石器是旧石器晚期器形普遍变小的石器类型，造型设计趋于多样化和复杂化。山西朔县峙峪文化属细石器初期（距今 28135±1330 年），发现石箭头、钺形小石刀等复合工具；山西沁水下川文化（距今 23900 年）出土上万件石制品，细石器镶嵌在木棍上使用。","path":"terms/xishiqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"细石器是 B 维度下旧石器晚期石器类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xixia-wenzi","title":"西夏文字（Tangut Script）","name_en":"Tangut Script","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西夏","党项","文字","西夏文","八分书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"script","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西夏文字是西夏仿汉字规格创制的文字。赵农记其相传为李元昊创制，分楷、行、草、隶、篆，字体方正、类八分书；沈括《梦溪笔谈》记西夏文字由元昊同党遇乞创造、元昊推广；作者并作一般判断，称任何文字的形成都是社会生活积累的结果，最后仅由某个人整理完成。来源另记西夏文与汉文长期并行，西夏印制西夏文典籍，包括西夏文《大藏》3579 卷，图8-7 为西夏文《孙子兵法》。来源未给字数与字形对照。","path":"terms/xixia-wenzi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"西夏文字是 C 维度下西夏文字设计的条目；其创制与推行的官方背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xu-vessel","title":"盨（Xu (Xu Food Vessel)）","name_en":"Xu Food Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛食器","西周","兽耳","圈足"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"盨是西周后新增的青铜盛食器，与簠同类。2016 册记其形状方中带圆而似椭圆形，两旁有兽耳或附耳，下为圈足或四足，有盖；原文器名作“盞（xǔ）”，据读音与器类当为「盨」。","path":"terms/xu-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西周青铜盛食器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuan-zhi","title":"宣纸（Xuan Paper）","name_en":"Xuan Paper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","明清","安徽泾县","宣州","青檀皮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"material_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宣纸是宋代具有区域特色的纸张之一，与蜀纸、越纸并称；明清时期与湖笔、徽墨、歙砚并列为文房四宝名品。赵农记其产地在安徽泾县，泾县为宣州府辖，宣纸因此得名；属皮纸类，主要原料是榆科类青檀皮。宣纸因配料分为绵料、净皮、特净，因厚度分为夹宣、单宣，因工序分为生宣、熟宣、笺纸。同书另记五代南唐李煜汲取四川造纸技术改进宣纸技术，用楮皮制成澄心堂纸。","path":"terms/xuan-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宣纸是 B 维度下造纸材料与工艺的条目：产地、原料、分类与明清书画用途在此汇合。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuande-censer","title":"宣德炉（Xuande Censer）","name_en":"Xuande Censer","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","宣德","铜炉","风磨铜","鎏金"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"metalware_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宣德炉是明宣宗三年工部用南洋风磨铜铸造的一批小型铜器，因多为香炉式而以炉名之。来源记其制作精巧、多至十二炼，用铜数万斤并镶嵌金六百两、银二千多两，采用鎏金、渗金、金屑等法合金冶炼，制成青绿、黄褐、古铜等六十多种颜色；造型参照古代铜器与瓷器而加以变化，耳、边、口、足各有数十种式样。来源又记后世仿造与私家制作都统称宣德炉，并列出北铸、南铸、苏铸及胡文明等铸铜能手。","path":"terms/xuande-censer.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代宣德炉的金属工艺类型条目，造型式样与呈色属 C 维度，工部铸炉与后世仿造流派属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuanfeng-pao","title":"旋风炮（Whirlwind Catapult）","name_en":"Whirlwind Catapult","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西夏","兵器","旋风炮","骆驼鞍","石球"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"旋风炮是西夏的一种独特兵器。赵农记西夏最初是对北宋兵器的模仿，基本是冷兵器的箭、剑、刀、斧等，但在战争中形成了一些独特兵器，如安置在骆驼鞍上、发射石球的“旋风炮”。来源只此一句，未给尺寸、射程、弹重、配重方式与操作用法，故本条只作兵器名目条目，置信度取 low。","path":"terms/xuanfeng-pao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"旋风炮是 B 维度下西夏兵器的条目；其军事用途与游牧作战背景归 D 维度。来源单句，置信度低。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuanfeng-zhuang","title":"旋风装（Whirlwind Binding）","name_en":"Whirlwind Binding","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","书籍装帧","音韵工具书","王仁昫","故宫博物院"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bookbinding","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"旋风装是一种特殊的书籍装帧形式，吸收经折装与卷轴装的优点而自有特色。赵农称此类书籍多为音韵类工具书，做法是把单页折起成为双面文字，从右向左排压，后一页压在前一页下面，留出书页边以便检索，展开宛如鱼鳞或旋风；所有书页又装裱在一张长纸上，可以卷起。来源以故宫博物院藏唐抄本《王仁昫刊谬补缺切韵》为典型实例，并记旋风装与龙鳞装应是一物两名。","path":"terms/xuanfeng-zhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"旋风装是 B 维度下唐代音韵工具书的特殊装帧形制，其书页翻检与文字界面归 C 维度；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuanhe-zhuang","title":"宣和装（Xuanhe Mounting Style）","name_en":"Xuanhe Mounting Style","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北宋","宣和","书画装裱","宣和装","宣和画谱"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mounting_style","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宣和装是宋代的书画装裱样式。赵农记书画创作促进了装裱技术的发展，宋代有专门的官员来管理、装裱书画；鉴于书画装裱的需要，宋裱的“宣和装”作为一种样式广泛流行于后世。来源只给样式名称、形成背景与流行判断，未给宣和装的天头、地脚、隔水、引首等具体形制与尺寸。","path":"terms/xuanhe-zhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宣和装是 C 维度下宋代书画装裱样式的条目；其官方管理背景归 D 维度。材料仅两句，confidence 取 low。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuanhuahui","title":"选花会（Xuanhuahui (Pattern Selection Fair)）","name_en":"Xuanhuahui (Pattern Selection Fair)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","印花布","图案设计","选花会","群众意见"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_institution","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"选花会是新中国为提高印花布艺术设计而建立的群众性征询活动。来源记建国以来曾多次召开印花布设计会议并建立选花会，以了解人民对花布的需要和喜爱、广泛听取群众对花布图案的意见，并称它是社会主义制度的产物，体现党和政府对人民生活的关怀。来源未给起始年份、举办频次、组织者与评选程序。","path":"terms/xuanhuahui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度印花布设计征询制度的条目，图案风格与色彩属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuanji","title":"璇玑（Xuanji Disc）","name_en":"Xuanji Disc","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","玉器","有牙玉环","天文仪器","璇玑"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_jade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"璇玑是周代玉器，圆形，中有孔，周边有牙。田自秉记有说它从天文仪器演变而来，并称其意义难以明了。来源只有这一句，未给尺寸、年代、出土单位与用途。","path":"terms/xuanji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"璇玑是 B 维度下周代玉器的术语条目；来源对其意义存疑，仅记形制与一说。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuanxue","title":"玄学（Xuanxue (Neo-Daoism)）","name_en":"Xuanxue (Neo-Daoism)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋","玄学","老庄","园林"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"intellectual_current","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玄学是魏晋时期以何晏、王弼、嵇康为代表的思想学说，来源把它置于汉代经学衰败之后的思想脉络中。来源称其以老庄、易经的精神为依托，关注个人的生存现实，讨论人与社会、人与自然的特殊关系。来源又在园林一节把魏晋玄学视为园林繁盛的文化因素。来源未给玄学的概念谱系、代表人物生卒与著作信息，本条不展开来源之外的哲学史内容。","path":"terms/xuanxue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"A 维度下的学术思想术语条目，记录玄学作为魏晋文化观念背景及其与园林的关联；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuanzi-caihua","title":"旋子彩画（Xuanzi Caihua (Xuanzi Architectural Painting)）","name_en":"Xuanzi Caihua (Xuanzi Architectural Painting)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","建筑","彩画","旋子彩画","漩涡团花"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architectural_painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"旋子彩画是清代建筑彩画北派三类之一。藻头均用漩涡团花一个或一个半，多用「碾玉装」，以金、黄、朱红、白粉、墨色勾边，边线凸起；有「金琢黑石碾玉」「雄黄碾玉」等 7 种。枋心主纹有升龙、降龙、夔、花鸟等图案。","path":"terms/xuanzi-caihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"旋子彩画是 B 维度下清代官式建筑彩画的条目，其纹样与用色属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuejiagang-wenhua","title":"薛家岗文化（Xuejiagang Wenhua (Xuejiagang Culture)）","name_en":"Xuejiagang Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器晚期","薛家岗","七孔石刀","穿孔技术","砍杀长兵器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"薛家岗文化是距今约 5500 年的新石器时代晚期文化，因安徽潜山薛家岗遗址得名。2016 册以 1980 年出土的七孔石刀为该文化代表性器物，并据形制推测其为装柄的砍杀长兵器。","path":"terms/xuejiagang-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下新石器晚期石器文化的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xueju","title":"穴居（Xueju (Cave Dwelling)）","name_en":"Cave Dwelling","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["原始居住","天然洞穴","半地穴式","仰韶文化","庙底沟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"穴居是原始居住形式之一，指以天然洞穴为栖身之处，并逐步过渡到半地穴式房屋。2016 册引《礼记·礼运篇》“冬则居管窑”，记黄河流域仰韶文化遗址中大量半地穴式泥木房屋的构造。","path":"terms/xueju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下原始居住形态的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:xuetao-jian","title":"薛涛笺（Xuetao Paper）","name_en":"Xuetao Paper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","成都","纸张","薛涛","花色纸"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"薛涛笺是唐代成都所产的一种花色纸张。赵农在述唐代成都纸张材质精美、品种繁多时举其为名品，称因女诗人薛涛所制花色纸张而闻名。来源只给产地、材质评价与制作者三项，未给尺寸、花色种类、制法与价格，也未给薛涛生卒与生平。本条只写唐代成都原产，不把后世仿制混入。","path":"terms/xuetao-jian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"薛涛笺是 B 维度下唐代成都所产的花色加工纸，其文房使用与题咏关联归 C 维度；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:ya-xing","title":"亚形（Yaxing (Ya-Shaped Frame)）","name_en":"Yaxing (Ya-Shaped Frame)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代晚期","西周中期","族徽","青铜器","图形文字"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"graphic_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"亚形是商代晚期至西周中期青铜器族徽常用的外框图形，因轮廓近似“亚”字而得名。高丰记亚形在族徽设计中使用非常普遍，其含义至今众说纷纭，至少有宗庙或庙室建筑平面、殷人爵称或武官职称、古老信仰观念三种解释。亚形作为外框与框内图形结合，构成当时比较流行的族徽式样。\n\n来源对亚形的讨论集中在功能与含义两面，未涉及笔画、比例或尺寸；本条只记其在族徽设计中的用法与诸说，不对含义作裁定。","path":"terms/ya-xing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"亚形是 C 维度下图形文字设计中的外框形态条目，铸刻工艺归 B 维度。族徽整体见 terms/zuhui.md。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yan-jin-liu-gu","title":"颜筋柳骨（Yan's Sinew and Liu's Bone）","name_en":"Yan's Sinew and Liu's Bone","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","碑刻","书法","颜真卿","柳公权"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calligraphic_style_term","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"颜筋柳骨是来源在唐代碑刻段概括颜真卿、柳公权两家书风的并称。来源先以“数量众多、结体丰厚、气象磅礴、雄伟壮美”评颜真卿书法石刻，并称“实为唐代书法的最高峰”；再记柳公权书“刚劲饱满、工稳清晰”，与颜书并称“颜筋柳骨”。来源只给并称与两家书风评语，未分别解释「筋」「骨」的所指，也未给并称的出处与最早用例。本条不把并称拆解为来源未说的笔画或结体理论，也不补后世书论。","path":"terms/yan-jin-liu-gu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"颜筋柳骨在 C 维度下作为唐代碑刻书风的并称术语；来源对两家的书风评语属审美评价，不涉及设计史书写或史学方法，故不指派 A 维度。来源未释「筋」「骨」所指。Theme 与 Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yan-steamer","title":"甗（Yan (Yan Steamer)）","name_en":"Yan Steamer","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","煮食器","蒸锅","甑","鬲"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"甗是青铜煮食器，功能与蒸锅相似。2016 册记其由上部甑与下部鬲结合而成，中间隔以穿孔铜片，有方、圆两种，流行于商周至春秋，春秋时出现上下分铸的形制。","path":"terms/yan-steamer.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜炊器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yang-chang-qun","title":"羊肠裙（Yangchang Qun (Sheep-Intestine Pleated Skirt)）","name_en":"Yangchang Qun (Sheep-Intestine Pleated Skirt)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉末","魏晋","西北民族","女服","百褶裙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"羊肠裙是西北民族的女服，汉末传入中原。2009 册记其为百褶裙，窄瘦而皱褶卷曲，俗称“羊肠裙”；魏晋贵族视之为时髦的服装。来源把长裙、复裙、百褶裙、裥裙依次并记：长裙袭汉代式样，晋时又兴“复裙”，太子妃有绛纱复裙、丹碧纱纹双裙等（《东宫旧事》）；南北朝时兴“裥裙”。\n\n源文该段前的标题作“铜镜”，与所述裙装内容不符，疑为版式误植；本条照录来源内容，不据标题把羊肠裙归入铜镜。","path":"terms/yang-chang-qun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"羊肠裙是 B 维度下汉末至魏晋女裙形制的条目，其族属与服饰交流另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yang-sui-burning-mirror","title":"阳燧（Yang Sui (Burning Mirror)）","name_en":"Yang Sui (Burning Mirror)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西周","战国","凹面镜","取火","光学"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"阳燧是一种凹面镜，用来聚集太阳光热取火。赵农记其原理为利用太阳的光热，经凹面镜反射聚焦产生光点而燃烧，并称西周时期的凹面镜已经普遍使用。来源又引《庄子·天下》两镜相照、重影无穷的说法，把它视为战国时期光学在生活器具中的运用。","path":"terms/yang-sui-burning-mirror.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"阳燧是 B 维度下凹面镜取火器的条目，其光学认识见来源同段所引《庄子》。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yangbu","title":"洋布（Yangbu (Machine-Made Imported Cloth)）","name_en":"Yangbu (Machine-Made Imported Cloth)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["晚清","洋布","现代纺织技术","沿海地区","传统纺织"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_product","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"洋布是 19 世纪末大量现代纺织技术进入中国沿海地区后生产的价廉物美的机织布。它冲击中国社会现实生活，破坏传统纺织技术的生存条件，使传统纺织仅成为乡村社会底层妇女在农闲时期的劳作，少许手工纺织品仅在周围集市交换，赵农称「丝绸大国」的盛景已不复存在。来源未给洋布的具体品类、价格、产地与市场份额。","path":"terms/yangbu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"洋布是 B 维度下近代机织布产品的条目；其外来技术冲击属 E 维度，市场替代属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yanghuo","title":"洋货（Foreign Goods）","name_en":"Foreign Goods","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["晚清","通商口岸","洋货","报纸广告","商业文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"foreign_goods","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"洋货是晚清沿海城市开放后迅速进入日常社会的进口商品统称。赵农记汉语中由此出现洋火、洋烟、洋药、洋瓷、洋布、洋油、洋碱等名称，认为这也标志着一个时代尴尬的真实；晚清出现大量报纸广告，洋货充斥其中，广告缭乱，既有商业广告也有文化广告，广告形式发生根本变化。来源未给各类洋货的品牌、价格、输入量与广告主名录。","path":"terms/yanghuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"洋货是 D 维度下晚清商业与广告变迁的条目；其视觉广告形式归 C 维度，近代通商与跨文化输入归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yangshao-culture","title":"仰韶文化（Yangshao Culture）","name_en":"Yangshao Culture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新石器时代","彩陶","黄河中游","考古学文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_culture","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"仰韶文化是中国新石器时代黄河中游的核心考古学文化，因 1921 年发现于河南渑池仰韶村而得名，以彩陶为标志性器物。六册来源都用它作为彩陶工艺、聚落建筑与早期造物观念的类型学基准。名称层面存在一个需要辨析的问题：六册中有来源把\"仰韶文化\"与\"彩陶\"直接等同，另一来源则分设两条并给出独立的年代与分布。","path":"terms/yangshao-culture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"仰韶文化是 B 维度下黄河中游新石器时代彩陶工艺与聚落形态的类型学锚点，同时是'彩陶文化'这一旧称的所指。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yangzhou-luodian","title":"扬州螺钿（Yangzhou Mother-of-Pearl Inlay）","name_en":"Yangzhou Mother-of-Pearl Inlay","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清代","扬州","漆器","螺钿","平嵌"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"扬州螺钿是清代已著名的漆器品种，将贝壳按图案要求切成片块平嵌成装饰花纹，因壳片反光而在不同光线折射下呈现变幻莫测的光泽色彩，朴素典雅、黑白分明。它分大件与小件两类：大件有椅、桌、箱、柜、屏风、家具等，小件有盘、盒、瓶、罐、烟具、台灯等。解放前夕生产已近停滞，解放后又恢复。","path":"terms/yangzhou-luodian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度扬州漆器品种的条目，黑白对比与变幻光泽属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yanju-fu","title":"燕居服（Yanju Fu (Dwelling Robe)）","name_en":"Yanju Fu (Dwelling Robe)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","常服","燕居服","服色","明黄色"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋代男子闲居常服。2016 册记宋代男子常服时称“燕居服”（即闲居服饰），宋官与平民百姓的燕居服形式上没有太大区别，只是在用色上有较为明显的规定和限制；其依据是自隋代开始的帝王统用明黄色制衣、官宦不得乱用。来源又记宋朝廷内赐佩金银鱼袋的公服以紫、绯色原料制作，故一般低级官吏不得乱用，只可服用黑白两种服色。同节另记宋代平民百姓的服饰大多是短衣、紧腿、缚鞋、褐布，便于劳作；其他工商各行均有特定服饰，素","path":"terms/yanju-fu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代男子常服的条目，其服色等级与行业服饰规定牵涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yanmo-caihui","title":"研磨彩绘（Ground-and-Polished Painted Lacquer）","name_en":"Ground-and-Polished Painted Lacquer","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","重庆","漆器","研磨彩绘","金鱼漆盘"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"研磨彩绘是解放后才在重庆兴起的漆器装饰方法。它先在漆胎上描绘金银花纹、加以彩漆，待干后全面罩漆，再经研磨而显出花纹，使纹样隐现在漆层之内。来源以金鱼漆盘为代表作品。来源未给所用金银材料、彩漆层数、研磨用料与工序时长。","path":"terms/yanmo-caihui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度漆器装饰技法的条目，纹样隐现的层次效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yaobian","title":"窑变（Kiln Transmutation）","name_en":"Kiln Transmutation","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["钧窑","铜红","还原焰","紫红斑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"窑变是钧瓷釉中铜元素经还原焰烧制呈现绿或紫红斑，在青釉上打破一色釉的单调、形成对比妍丽效果；最初可能偶然形成，后在实践中认识规律、人工安排达到预期效果。2016 记钧窑烧制过程中因配料掺入铜的气化物（原文如此）而产生釉色变化，使红、蓝、青、白、紫交相融汇、灿若云霞，称此为我国制瓷史上的一大发明。","path":"terms/yaobian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"窑变是 B 维度下钧窑呈色工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yaodong","title":"窑洞（Yaodong Cave Dwelling）","name_en":"Yaodong Cave Dwelling","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","民居","黄土高原","下沉式","生土建筑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cave_dwelling","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"窑洞是黄土高原常见的居住场所，分布陕北、晋南、陇东、豫西一带。赵农记其一般有下沉式、开敞式、砖石砌式等：下沉式在平地挖矩形大坑，四周开挖窑洞，坑中挖水井与渗井；开敞式利用崖畔向内深挖，有单孔、套联、母子窑、拐窑等形式；砖石砌式用青砖石条箍窑后覆黄土。来源并称窑洞由原始社会地穴式建筑演变而来。","path":"terms/yaodong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"窑洞是 B 维度下黄土高原生土民居的条目；其聚落与生活方式归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yaoyuan-deng","title":"腰圆凳（Yaoyuan Deng (Waist-Round Stool)）","name_en":"Yaoyuan Deng (Waist-Round Stool)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","家具","凳","腰圆","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"腰圆形的唐代坐凳。2016 册唐代家具正文列几、案、挟轼、箱、柜、胡床、屏风以及晚期出现的桌椅，未单列腰圆凳；腰圆凳只出现在图 6-36 的图注“唐代 壶门案、腰圆凳”中。因此本条只能确认：来源把腰圆凳作为唐代家具的图例之一，与壶门案同图；不能确认其座面尺寸、腿式、有无托泥与使用场合。图版未视觉核验，本条不据图像下判断。","path":"terms/yaoyuan-deng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代家具器形的条目，证据仅及图注。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yaozhou","title":"腰舟（Waist Float (Yaozhou)）","name_en":"Waist Float (Yaozhou)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["腰舟","浮具","葫芦","筏子","水上交通"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"float_device","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"腰舟是李立新所述最初的复合浮具：将多个葫芦串连一起，缚在腰间。单体浮具浸入水中，束缚手足又不安全，先民由此转向复合浮具；腰舟之后，复合材料扩展到树木、竹竿、芦苇，出现筏子。来源未给腰舟的形制、尺寸、使用地域、年代与实物，葫芦数量与缚系方式也未展开。","path":"terms/yaozhou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下原始水上交通工具的概念条目，其在规范化进程中的位置另涉 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yashed-mao","title":"鸭舌帽（Yashed Mao (Flat Cap)）","name_en":"Yashed Mao (Flat Cap)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["20世纪","帽饰","鸭舌帽","服饰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hat_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"民国时期以鸭舌帽为男帽样式之一，与瓜皮帽、礼帽并列。来源只给帽式名称与流行时期，未给形制、材质、产地与设计者。","path":"terms/yashed-mao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鸭舌帽是 B 维度下 20 世纪帽饰样式的条目；来源只作帽式列举与分期，未及制度或机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yeshi","title":"夜市（Night Market）","name_en":"Night Market","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北宋","南宋","商业","夜市","开封"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_practice","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"夜市是宋代城市取消夜禁后出现的夜间商业活动。赵农记北宋开封城市管理取消夜禁制度，出现“夜市”，夜市直至三更方尽，冬月寒风大雪也不停止；南宋临安商业效仿开封，出现早市和夜市，引《梦梁录》“杭城大街，买卖昼夜不绝，夜交三四鼓，游人始稀；五鼓钟鸣，卖早市者又开店矣”。来源把夜市作为城市商业制度变化的标志，未给摊贩数量、税制与管理机构。","path":"terms/yeshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"夜市是 D 维度下宋代城市商业制度的条目；其招幌、灯烛等视觉形式归 C 维度，但来源未展开。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yi-bi-qian","title":"蚁鼻钱（Ant Nose Money）","name_en":"Ant Nose Money","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","楚国","铜铸仿贝","象形币","贝币"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"currency","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蚁鼻钱是贝币演变而来的铜铸仿贝，因中间凸出的部分像人的鼻子而得名。赵农记其携带方便、制作精巧，主要在楚国流通。来源只在“圜形钱”标题下用一句话叙述蚁鼻钱，未给尺寸、重量、出土地与年代。","path":"terms/yi-bi-qian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蚁鼻钱是 D 维度下战国楚国铜铸仿贝的货币条目，其仿贝造型与铸造属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yi-pourer","title":"匜（Yi (Pouring Vessel)）","name_en":"Yi (Pouring Vessel)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","水器","沃盥之礼","青铜器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"匜是周代新增的水器、注水器皿，形如瓢，四足一鋬、有流，后由有足变无足；最早似由觥演变，常与盘组合用于沃盥之礼。2016 记其器身长椭圆形，前有流、后有鋬，少量带盖，西周多为四足，至春秋出现三足或无足且数量大增。","path":"terms/yi-pourer.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"匜是 B 维度下周代青铜水器的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yi-settlement","title":"邑（Settlement (Yi)）","name_en":"Settlement (Yi)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["夏商西周","聚落","邑制","都城","分封"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"settlement_system","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"邑是夏商西周时期群居的地点，与称居住建筑为“室”相对。赵农引《吕氏春秋·恃君览·恃君篇》说明聚邑与立君的关系，认为建立邑的目的也是为了“立君”，即建立邑制、统治民众，这是早期城市的雏形；其规模形成是为了组成有效的社会组织，以完成政治活动、促进经济发展。邑又分大邑与小邑，小邑连结密集，是城镇人口不断衍生的结果，也是诸侯分封之地；《左传》以有宗庙先君之主为都、无为邑，偃师商城、郑州商城、安阳殷墟应为王","path":"terms/yi-settlement.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"邑是 D 维度下早期聚落与邑制的条目，其建筑形态与城市设施属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yi-shu-yi-zhi","title":"艺术意志（Artistic Will (Kunstwollen)）","name_en":"Artistic Will (Kunstwollen)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["19世纪","里格尔","风格论","装饰艺术","Kunstwollen"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"艺术意志是里格尔在《风格问题——装饰艺术史的基础》中提出的理论。李立新记其强调设计艺术是一种心智的精神性活动，批评森珀的机械性被动性反应理论，认为设计艺术的风格发展既服从技术材料的多样性要求，又是创造性的一种选择；李立新又评这种将艺术发展完全独立于外界条件的艺术意志是对森珀理论的否定，其实也是一种补充，并借此理解庞薰琹所说的中国造物装饰艺术持续吸收融化创新而保持特有风格。来源未给 Kunstwol","path":"terms/yi-shu-yi-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度下设计史风格理论的条目，其装饰纹样与材料分析归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yi-vessel","title":"彝（Yi (Yi Ritual Vessel)）","name_en":"Yi Ritual Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","方彝","祭器","扉棱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彝是青铜礼器，与尊同为祭奠用器，鸟兽尊也以彝相称。2016 册另记方彝为盛酒器，商代与西周较多，西周中期以后少见，形制为高方身、带盖、盖似大屋顶、顶部有钮、器身多带扉棱。","path":"terms/yi-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜礼器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yichi-sanshan","title":"一池三山（Yichi Sanshan (One Pond, Three Mountains)）","name_en":"Yichi Sanshan (One Pond, Three Mountains)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","皇家园林","一池三山","蓬莱","方丈"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden_layout","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"皇家园林中一池象征大海、池中设三座仙山的布局范式。2016 册记秦始皇上林苑开一池三山之滥觞，引《三秦记》“作长池，引渭水，筑土为蓬莱山”；汉武帝修复并扩大上林苑，建章宫太液池中设蓬莱、方丈、瀛洲三岛，又称“一池三岛”。来源称这一布局模仿海上仙山，是秦汉园林设计的重要主题。","path":"terms/yichi-sanshan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下秦汉皇家园林布局的条目，其神仙思想另涉 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yijianghua-sheji","title":"意匠化设计（Yijianghua Sheji (Intentional Design)）","name_en":"Yijianghua Sheji (Intentional Design)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["设计史观","意匠化设计","写实性设计","宋代","院体画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_history_theory","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"意匠化设计是李立新概括宋之前中国造物设计整体风格的概念，与宋之后倾向写实性设计相对。来源称中国古代造物设计曾经有过出色的意匠化设计，彩陶、青铜器、玉器、丝织品、画像石、金银器都证实了这种具有象征性或寓意性的装饰意匠水准；又称汉代以来中国造物意匠化的设计到宋代画上了一个句号，院体画的扩张使写实风气渗入造物设计，导致了意匠化设计的衰退，元明清的设计甚至近代设计都受其影响而缺乏意匠设计的生动表现。来源未","path":"terms/yijianghua-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史风格分期的概念条目，象征性与寓意性的装饰效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yikeyin","title":"一颗印（Yikeyin Dwelling）","name_en":"Yikeyin Dwelling","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","民居","云南","夯土","穿斗式"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"courtyard_house","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"一颗印是云南流行的民居形式，四周呈方形，如同一颗印章。赵农记其以夯土筑墙，墙体非常厚重，梁架采用穿斗式结构，是阁楼和小四合院的结合，具有封闭安全的功能。来源未给一颗印的尺寸、层数、平面与实例。","path":"terms/yikeyin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"一颗印是 B 维度下云南方形民居的条目；当前只到 Dimension。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yin-nang","title":"隐囊（Yinnang (Cushion)）","name_en":"Yinnang (Cushion)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","家具","坐具","棉锦","靠垫"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"隐囊是棉锦织物制成的靠垫，与可移动的三足几配套使用，供身体前后左右依靠，以减轻长期跽坐的疲劳（L3770、L3772）。来源只在凭几条末句提到“与三足几配套使用的是隐囊”，随后以一条小项说明其功用，未载尺寸、颜色、纹样、填充物与出土实物。图版未核，不据图补写形制。本条证据仅两句，confidence 定 low。","path":"terms/yin-nang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"隐囊是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝凭几配套靠垫的家具条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yindanshilin-sebu","title":"阴丹士林色布（Indanthrene dyed cloth）","name_en":"Indanthrene dyed cloth","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["民国","纺织品","广告","阴丹士林","色布"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_product","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"阴丹士林色布是民国时期以阴丹士林染料染制的色布，曾作为商业广告的主体出现在月份牌与报刊广告中。赵农所举广告画面以“她何以充满了愉快”为题，宣传色布耐晒、耐洗等特性。来源所录广告文字 OCR 残缺，本条只作语义概述，不逐字引用。","path":"terms/yindanshilin-sebu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"阴丹士林色布是 B 维度下民国染色纺织品的产品条目；其月份牌广告与市场竞争属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yingbin-fu","title":"迎宾服（Yingbin Fu (Reception Dress)）","name_en":"Yingbin Fu (Reception Dress)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","迎宾服","青年女性","平领","对襟花布衣"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"迎宾服是 1949 年以后青年女性穿着的平领服装，与日常对襟花布衣并列。来源只给名称、领型与穿着群体，未给使用场合、形制细节、设计者与流行年代。","path":"terms/yingbin-fu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"迎宾服是 B 维度下新中国青年女性服装样式的条目；来源只作名称与领型列举，未及制度或机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yinghuang-zhi","title":"硬黄纸（Hard Yellow Paper）","name_en":"Hard Yellow Paper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","黄纸","加蜡","写经","敦煌藏经洞"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"硬黄纸是唐代黄纸中经过加蜡处理的一种名贵纸张。赵农在述隋唐纸张生产时提到它，并以敦煌藏经洞出土的唐人写经作为实物例证。来源对硬黄纸只有两句：一句说其加蜡与名贵，一句说敦煌写经中有实物。尺寸、颜色深浅、加蜡工序、产地与价格，来源均未交代，本条不据来源外知识补写。","path":"terms/yinghuang-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"硬黄纸是 B 维度下唐代纸张加蜡处理的材料条目；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yingqing","title":"影青（Yingqing (Qingbai Ware)）","name_en":"Yingqing (Qingbai Ware)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","北宋","景德镇","青白瓷","映青"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"影青是宋代盛行的青白釉瓷，特征是釉厚处或花纹凹线处微呈淡青色，又称“映青”“隐青”“罩青”；烧造地点遍及江西、福建、广东、广西、安徽、浙江、云南，景德镇影青为代表作品。因胎质白薄、透光玉润而有「假玉」之说；宋代景德镇吸收定窑方法，在青白釉下刻画花卉纹饰，形成「影青刻花」。\n\n夏燕靖 2016 补出更完整的品名与断代：影青又称映青瓷，前身是青白瓷，又称「色白花青」；该瓷是北宋中期景德镇所独创，釉色青","path":"terms/yingqing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"影青是 B 维度下宋代青白瓷类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yinhua-fucai-sha","title":"印花敷彩纱（Printed and Painted Gauze）","name_en":"Printed and Painted Gauze","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["西汉","马王堆","印花","彩绘","茱萸纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"印花敷彩纱是马王堆汉墓出土的印花与彩绘结合织物：先印菱形地纹，再依地纹手绘添枝加叶，以朱红、黑、浅银、灰、白粉等设色；共发现五件，成幅者宽470毫米、长540毫米，另有绵袍三件、素地衣物一件与衾被残片。花纹多为茱萸纹而色彩不同。来源另记印版有凹版刷浆之说，但未定论。","path":"terms/yinhua-fucai-sha.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"印花敷彩纱是 B 维度下西汉印花与彩绘结合织物的类型条目，其纹样与设色归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yinyang-wuxing","title":"阴阳五行（Yin-Yang and Five Phases）","name_en":"Yin-Yang and Five Phases","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","阴阳","五行","五色","造物观念"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cosmological_scheme","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"阴阳五行是李立新列为春秋战国“动态造物观念”的宇宙模式，由原始阴阳观与五行说结合而成，用于社会人事历史，建构物质运动与时空统一的一体化动态模式；五行相生与四时五方的流转变换契合无间，万事万物变化有序，形成对立统一的和谐整体观念，影响春秋战国的造物思想。他以《考工记》五色与五方对应及曾侯乙墓漆衣箱天象图为例，说明其影响服色规范与造物。来源未给阴阳五行说的起源、成型年代与文献谱系。","path":"terms/yinyang-wuxing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度宇宙观与思维模式的条目，其造物与服色例证属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yiqi-er-gongju","title":"一器而工聚（One Vessel Made by Assembled Crafts (Yi Qi Er Gong Ju)）","name_en":"One Vessel Made by Assembled Crafts (Yi Qi Er Gong Ju)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","考工记","天工开物","分工","生产密集型"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"production_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"一器而工聚是李立新用来概括自先秦以来制物生产方式的概念。来源以《天工开物·陶埏》“共计一杯功，过手七十二方克成器”说明分工细微，又以汉时漆器“一杯卷用百人之力，一屏风就万人之功”说明生产密集型特点；并指出这种生产方式既反映分工，也反映传统造物设计的局限。","path":"terms/yiqi-er-gongju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下制物生产方式的术语条目，其分工组织面向归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yishu-sheji","title":"艺术设计（Art Design）","name_en":"Art Design","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["1980年代","现代设计","1998","学科目录"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_discipline","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"艺术设计是中国真正的现代设计运动在 1980 年以后逐步形成的学科与行业概念。文化思想解禁、现代主义文艺引进使设计运动及成就引起设计家重视，人们对住宅、服饰、家具、电器等生活用品的需求从外观装饰转向功能要求；1998 年教育部高等教育专业目录以“艺术设计”替代“工艺美术”。夏燕靖另把艺术设计界定为“人类有意识的、用艺术创造力所体现的造物活动”。李立新则从汉语表义的精确性出发，主张用“艺术”一词限定","path":"terms/yishu-sheji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"艺术设计是 D 维度下现代设计学科名称与教育体制的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yishu-shejishi","title":"艺术设计史（History of Art Design）","name_en":"History of Art Design","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["导论","设计史","器具史","工艺美术史","学科方法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_historiography","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"艺术设计史是赵农在《中国艺术设计史》导论中界定的学科对象：它从器具的立场出发，研究具体器具的功能和美感，并推陈出新、古为今用。赵农把它与科技史、美术史、建筑史以及陶瓷、兵器、农具、服饰、家具、文字、钱币、乐器等专门史区分开来，并强调“过去的工艺史研究的往往是材料史，而设计史首先是器具史”。这一界定是全书取材与叙述方法的纲领，不是对某一历史时期的具体描述。","path":"terms/yishu-shejishi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度下设计史学科对象与方法的界定，向下关联具体器具史条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yisilan-wenhua","title":"伊斯兰文化（Yisilan Wenhua (Islamic Culture)）","name_en":"Yisilan Wenhua (Islamic Culture)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","元代","明代","伊斯兰","釉彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cultural_influence","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2016 册所论唐代起影响中国设计的西域文化因素。来源的总判断是：伊斯兰文化自唐代开始对我国设计产生较大影响，主要在釉彩工艺、金银工艺、纺织工艺、建筑工艺，以及各类装饰艺术领域中留下持久的痕迹。论证分三支：其一，将青瓷与同时代伊斯兰釉彩器比较，认为釉料配制上存在联系；我国传统高温釉彩经1250℃以上焙烧颜色不甚鲜艳，而伊斯兰釉彩呈色鲜艳丰富，故学界公认高温釉彩中釉色鲜艳者可能受伊斯兰釉彩工艺影响。","path":"terms/yisilan-wenhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 E 维度下跨文化工艺影响的条目，其釉彩、钴料与纹样机制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yiyi","title":"祎衣（Yiyi (Empress's Ceremonial Robe)）","name_en":"Yiyi (Empress's Ceremonial Robe)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","服饰","祎衣","皇后","命妇"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"祎衣是明代皇后及命妇在受册、朝会时所穿的礼服。2016 册记皇后冠服「冠上饰九龙四凤」，穿祎衣，配素纱中单、玉革带与青色加金饰的袜、舄；同段并记皇帝衮冕与皇后常服。","path":"terms/yiyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"祎衣是 B 维度下明代皇后礼服的条目，其冠服制度属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yizi","title":"椅子（Chair）","name_en":"Chair","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["隋唐","家具","坐具","高足家具","佛教"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"seating_furniture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"椅子是隋唐时期出现并广泛使用的坐具。来源把椅子的出现称为隋唐家具中最重要的现象，称其广泛使用改变了中华民族的生活习惯，并追溯其从西域渐入中原、随佛教文化传播而成为日常家具的经过：先为佛教高僧登台说法的宝座，后从上流社会转入民间居家生活。来源又释椅子本意为倚，多以木制；椅子提升人的身体重心，改变盘、跪、箕等传统坐姿，靠背、扶手、脚踏对身体重量有明显分散作用。隋唐椅子在西域传来样式基础上经过中原文化改","path":"terms/yizi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"椅子是 B 维度隋唐高足坐具形制的条目；来源所述坐姿与生活习惯变化属器物使用层面，不涉及设计史书写或史学方法，故不指派 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:you-vessel","title":"卣（You (You Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"You Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","秬鬯","提梁","鸮卣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"卣是青铜盛酒器，专盛高级酒类。2016 册引青铜铭文“秬鬯一卣”，记其形制多为圆或椭圆形口、深腹、圈足、有盖和提梁，基本形体源于瓜瓢，殷商长颈、晚商短颈椭圆，西周中期以后少见。","path":"terms/you-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜盛酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:youlihong-ci","title":"釉里红瓷（Underglaze Red Porcelain）","name_en":"Underglaze Red Porcelain","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["铜红","高温还原焰","景德镇","元代","青花釉里红"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"釉里红瓷以铜红料为呈色剂，在瓷胎上彩绘后施透明釉，于窑中经 1300℃ 左右高温一次烧成的釉下彩瓷器。其烧造工艺源于唐代长沙窑，元代江西景德镇烧造出釉里红瓷并创制青花釉里红。元代釉里红有线条描绘、拔白、涂绘三种装饰特征，后两种能减少飞红现象，形成期应早于线绘。","path":"terms/youlihong-ci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"釉里红瓷是 B 维度下元代釉下彩瓷的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:youlihong","title":"釉里红（Underglaze Red）","name_en":"Underglaze Red","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","明代","景德镇","铜红","釉下彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"釉里红是以铜红料在瓷胎上绘纹、施透明釉后高温还原焰一次烧成的釉下彩瓷，元代景德镇烧造成功。六册均有直接记载。来源对它的**工艺来源**给出三种互不相同的说法（唐代长沙窑／钧瓷紫红釉／元代景德镇创烧），对元代产品的**质量评价**亦正反并存。本 KU 并列，不裁定。","path":"terms/youlihong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"釉里红是 B 维度下元代景德镇铜红釉下彩的品种条目，其白底红彩的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:youpiao","title":"邮票（postage stamp）","name_en":"postage stamp","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","邮政","招贴","集邮","邮票"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"postal_artifact","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"邮票在本节被赵农视为一种特殊的招贴。来源举《梅兰芳》《西厢记》《中国民居》《十二生肖》等邮票，称其已成为众多集邮爱好者的珍藏。来源未给邮票发行制度、面值、齿孔与印制工艺。","path":"terms/youpiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"邮票是 C 维度下兼具招贴与收藏属性的邮政物件的条目；其发行制度属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:youshang-cai","title":"釉上彩（Overglaze Decoration）","name_en":"Overglaze Decoration","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["红炉","低温彩烧","五彩","粉彩","珐琅彩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"釉上彩是在已烧成的瓷器釉面上用彩料绘饰，再经 750～860℃ 红炉彩烧的装饰品种。烤烧温度不高，可用色料很多、色彩丰富，但画面在釉上，使用中摩擦、接触酸碱后易褪损变色。釉上彩包括红彩、红绿彩、五彩、粉彩、珐琅彩、墨彩、广彩、新彩等。","path":"terms/youshang-cai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"釉上彩是 B 维度下瓷器彩饰工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yu-basin","title":"盂（Yu (Yu Basin)）","name_en":"Yu Basin","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛水器","附耳","方盂","圆盂"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"盂是青铜盛水器，形制为圆腹、侈口、圈足、深腹、有附耳，主要见于商和西周，除圆形外还有方盂。","path":"terms/yu-basin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜水器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yu-dai","title":"鱼袋（Fish Tally Bag）","name_en":"Fish Tally Bag","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","官服","章服","佩鱼","品级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"official_accessory","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鱼袋是宋代官服配饰。北宋初年沿袭唐朝章服佩鱼遗制；有资格穿紫、绯色公服的官员都须在腰间佩挂“鱼袋”，袋内装有金、银、铜制成的鱼，以区别官品。此制仅用于官服中的礼服，一般人很少穿着。","path":"terms/yu-dai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鱼袋是 D 维度下宋代官服配饰制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yu-instrument","title":"竽（Yu）","name_en":"Yu","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","乐器","笙","36簧","定调"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"竽是赵农所记春秋战国时期最有影响的乐器之一，是笙的一种变体，有36簧。来源称竽是当时乐器合奏时定调的主器，并引《韩非子》“竽先，则钟瑟皆随；竽唱，则诸乐皆和”，说明竽在合奏中的领奏作用；又称先秦多以竽定音调，因而竽在器乐合奏中尤为重要。来源没有给出竽的尺寸、管数、材质与出土实物。","path":"terms/yu-instrument.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"竽是 B 维度下春秋战国簧管乐器的条目，来源给簧数、合奏定调功能与《韩非子》引文。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yu-yue-cong-bi","title":"玉钺、玉琮、玉璧（Jade Yue, Cong and Bi）","name_en":"Jade Yue, Cong and Bi","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["良渚文化","玉礼器","兵权","神器","财富"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_jade_set","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玉钺、玉琮、玉璧是赵农在第一章“玉器的出现”一节中并称的三种良渚文化玉器重物。来源称在良渚文化遗址中发现了钺、琮、璧等玉器重物，反映出玉与王权的关系密切：玉钺是兵权，玉琮是神器，而玉璧是财富；这种现象在新石器时期中国东部地区的出现，说明玉器一开始便成为政治权力和个人财富的表现。来源在第二章论礼器时又引《周礼·春官》“以苍璧礼天，以黄琮礼地”，把玉琮、玉璧纳入祭祀礼器系统。第二章玉器节另给玉琮形制：","path":"terms/yu-yue-cong-bi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"玉钺、玉琮、玉璧是 B 维度下良渚文化玉礼器的清单级聚合条，其兵权、神权、财富象征属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuan-dai-ciqi-qixing","title":"元代瓷器器形（壶、杯、匜、炉）（Yuan Dynasty Porcelain Vessel Forms）","name_en":"Yuan Dynasty Porcelain Vessel Forms (Hu, Cup, Yi, Lu)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","瓷器","壶","高足杯","匜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form_group","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2009 册在元代瓷器工艺一节分述壶、杯、匜、炉四种器形。壶以玉壶为基础，加上壶流和把手，流长通腹、柄长通身；来源引明曹昭《格古要论》说明古壶不必有嘴，元代以后才将有嘴的称壶、无嘴的称瓶。杯以高足杯为代表，口微撇，近底处较丰厚，承以上小下大的竹节式高足，是元代瓷器中最为流行的器物。匜是元代流行的造型样式，除瓷制品外，常见的还有金银制品和铜制品。炉则腹大、高耳、矮足。\n\n本条为清单级条目，合记四种器","path":"terms/yuan-dai-ciqi-qixing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下元代瓷器器形的清单级条目，其造型来源与金银器交流另涉 B 维度内部的其他器类。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuan-dai-cixiu-zhenfa","title":"元代刺绣针法（Yuan Embroidery Stitch Types）","name_en":"Yuan Embroidery Stitch Types","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","刺绣","针法","辫针","平针"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代刺绣针法是田自秉册所举元代已使用的七种刺绣针法。来源称现今刺绣工艺中的一些主要针法在元代就已使用，并分别介绍辫针、平针、打子、抢针、鳞针、网针、切针的名称、别称与表现效果。来源未给各针法的起落、行针方向、用线股数、底料与针具。","path":"terms/yuan-dai-cixiu-zhenfa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代刺绣针法的清单级术语，针法形成的纹样效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuan-dai-jianzhu-caihua","title":"元代建筑彩画（Yuan Dai Jianzhu Caihua (Yuan Dynasty Architectural Painting)）","name_en":"Yuan Dai Jianzhu Caihua (Yuan Dynasty Architectural Painting)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","建筑","彩画","拐子纹","直棂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architectural_painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代建筑彩画是元代梁枋等建筑构件的彩绘装饰。2016 册记其留存至今较少，只能从永乐宫壁画分析其绘制手法：仍大量运用唐宋以来的图案形式，梁枋上彩画图案连续转折、难分彼此，反映中原传统纹样在整体上的统一性；纹样结构以拐子纹、直棂、菱花、几何纹为主，表现手法吸取唐宋织锦纹彩或民间印花纹饰的造型特点，注重赋色的层叠丰厚与线条勾勒的层次。","path":"terms/yuan-dai-jianzhu-caihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"元代建筑彩画是 B 维度下元代建筑装饰做法的条目，其纹样形式属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuan-dai-qiqi-zhuangshi","title":"元代漆器装饰技法（Yuan Dynasty Lacquer Decoration Techniques）","name_en":"Yuan Dynasty Lacquer Decoration Techniques","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","漆器","剔红","剔犀","螺钿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_craft","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代漆器装饰技法指元代江南漆器所用的剔红、剔犀、螺钿镶嵌、戗金、金漆等工艺。赵农记漆器生产并未得到元代的重视，但江南的漆器生产延续南宋漆器技术，产生了许多漆雕佳品；剔红是在胎具上髹漆几十遍后进行雕刻，形成寓装饰与使用于一体的漆具；剔犀是红黑相间的髹漆雕刻；螺钿镶嵌是将贝壳薄片镶嵌在漆胎上形成图案，并饰以髹漆，此外还运用戗金、金漆等技术。来源未给漆层数、刀法、代表工匠、作坊地点与传世品清单。","path":"terms/yuan-dai-qiqi-zhuangshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"元代漆器装饰技法是 B 维度下元代髹漆工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuan-dai-simiao-bihua","title":"元代寺庙壁画（Yuan Dynasty Temple Murals）","name_en":"Yuan Dynasty Temple Murals","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","寺庙壁画","建筑壁饰","道释","植物纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architectural_mural","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2009 册在元代城市建筑一节指出，元代因国内民族众多、宗教信仰不一，出现富有民族特色和宗教特色的建筑风格，式样多种；寺庙壁画同时成为重要的建筑壁饰，随处可见，所反映的主题为道释内容。以道、佛教风格为主的植物纹和几何纹饰随处可见，构成独特的建筑装饰形式。来源并把建筑兴盛与建筑学著作的出现联系起来，称官方编纂的《经世大典》记述了元代建筑的详细方式。\n\n本条是类型级条目，只记来源对元代寺庙壁画与建筑装","path":"terms/yuan-dai-simiao-bihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下元代建筑壁饰的类型级条目，壁画题材与宗教政策另涉 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuan-dai-zhibi","title":"元代纸币（Yuan Dynasty Paper Money）","name_en":"Yuan Dynasty Paper Money","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","货币","纸币","交钞","丝本位"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper_money","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代纸币是元代以交钞为主的纸币。赵农记元代初期的纸币以丝作为本位，《元史·食货志》记“世祖中统元年，始造交钞，以丝为本。每银五十两易丝钞一千两，诸物之直，并从丝例”；中统年间因发行交钞数量太大、不能兑现，政府强制推行交钞并禁止金属货币交易，交钞一度成为社会唯一货币样式，结果通货膨胀、导致信用危机；后来又以白银作为本位发行交钞，以铜币面值为交换单位，交钞可在不同地区和范围中流通。元代纸币为长方形、制","path":"terms/yuan-dai-zhibi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"元代纸币是 B 维度下元代纸币形制的条目；其本位、强制推行与信用危机归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuan-ti-hua","title":"院体画（Academy-Style Painting (Yuan Ti Hua)）","name_en":"Academy-Style Painting (Yuan Ti Hua)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","宫廷画院","格法","形似","工笔花鸟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting_style","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"院体画是宋代宫廷画院中形成的绘画样式。李立新记其以严守古人“格法”、写实“形似”并具“新意”的工笔花鸟画和界画为代表，既是画院制度对绘画的贡献，也通过文思院、甲库、文绣院、绫锦院等机构影响宫中工艺生产；来源同时批评其过度写实束缚了设计意匠。","path":"terms/yuan-ti-hua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度宋代绘画样式的条目，其写实风气对宫中工艺生产的影响属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuanling-paoshan","title":"圆领袍衫（Round-Collar Robe）","name_en":"Round-Collar Robe","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["隋唐","男子服饰","横襕","六合靴"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"圆领袍衫是隋唐男子的主要服装：小圆领、窄袖，袍长至膝下，齐膝处设横襕。腰系红鞏带，足登乌皮六合靴。从皇帝到官吏样式几乎相同，差别只在材料、颜色和皮带头的装饰。","path":"terms/yuanling-paoshan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"圆领袍衫是 B 维度下隋唐男子服饰形制的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuanmouren","title":"元谋人（Yuanmou Man）","name_en":"Yuanmou Man","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器时代早期","云南元谋","直立人","打制石器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"hominin","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元谋人是我国发现最早的直立人，距今约 170 万年，1965 年发现于云南元谋县。1973 年在其化石层位发现 6 件石器，后增至 22 件，以石英、石英岩、砾石为原料，包括刮削器、尖状器、石片和石核，均为轻型工具，外貌简单、不规范。","path":"terms/yuanmouren.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"元谋人是 B 维度下中国旧石器时代早期人类与最早石器的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuanshi-fuzhuang","title":"原始服装（Yuanshi Fuzhuang (Prehistoric Clothing)）","name_en":"Prehistoric Clothing","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["旧石器","新石器","上衣下裳","衣其羽皮","骨针"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"原始服装指纺织品出现以前的衣着方式及其向成形衣服的过渡。2016 册记人类最初以动物羽毛、兽皮遮身御寒，夏天用树叶或野草披身；新石器时代中晚期开始有纺织衣料，黄帝、尧、舜时代有成形的衣服，服装形式定形为上衣下裳。","path":"terms/yuanshi-fuzhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下服饰起源与上衣下裳形制的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuanshi-nongju","title":"原始农具（Yuanshi Nongju (Prehistoric Farm Tools)）","name_en":"Prehistoric Farm Tools","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["原始农业","农具","石骨蚌木","良渚文化","农耕收割加工"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"原始农具是原始农业所用器具的总称。2016 册记原始农业为粗放式生产，农具材料以石、骨、蚌、木为主，按用途分为农耕、收割和加工三类，良渚文化遗址发现石犁、石镰、石刀等成套农具。","path":"terms/yuanshi-nongju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下原始农业器具总类的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuanzaoxing","title":"元造型（Proto-Form）","name_en":"Proto-Form","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["设计史","造型","石器","几何"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元造型是李立新对石器造型中对称、圆形形式的称谓。他把这类形式既看作目前所知最早的“初始造型”，也看作以后相当长时期造物形态具有基础性质的“元造型”，并认为后世更多造型形式只是圆形与对称形在空间上的组合、变换与繁殖。来源只用一段提出该概念，未给类型清单与考古分期。","path":"terms/yuanzaoxing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度造物造型概念的条目，其初始与元两个层级的判断属 A 维度解释。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuanzhuwen","title":"圆朱文（Yuanzhuwen (Round Vermilion Seal Script)）","name_en":"Yuanzhuwen (Round Vermilion Seal Script)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","印章","篆刻","阳文","赵孟頫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"seal_style","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"圆朱文是元代出现的印章样式。赵农记元代出现圆朱文印章，以汉文字篆书体入印，吸收唐宋官印特点，呈现阳文，光滑整洁、圆润雅致；由于书画家赵孟頫倡导并身体力行，圆朱文风行于世，成为印章流变中一种优雅妩媚的艺术样式。来源未给刀法、印材与代表印人。","path":"terms/yuanzhuwen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"圆朱文是 C 维度下元代篆刻样式的条目；其文人倡导与用印阶层归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuban-xuan","title":"玉版宣（Yuban Xuan Paper）","name_en":"Yuban Xuan Paper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","宣纸","檀皮","张彦远","历代名画记"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玉版宣是赵农所记唐代晚期产生的名贵纸张，以檀皮为原料。来源先引《历代名画记》论江南环境与置宣纸摹写之语，再记张彦远曾任舒州刺史、唐代舒州与宣州隔江相望，最后落到玉版宣。来源只给原料与名贵两项，未给尺寸、纸面纹理、加工程序、具体作坊与价格。本条只写唐代玉版宣的原料与文献线索，不重复宣纸整体沿革。","path":"terms/yuban-xuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"玉版宣是 B 维度下唐代以檀皮为原料的名贵纸张条目；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yue-battle-axe","title":"钺（Battle-Axe）","name_en":"Battle-Axe","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商周","青铜兵器","礼器","王权象征","妇好墓"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"钺是从石斧发展而来的兵器，也是王朝政权与地位的象征。《说文解字》称“大者为钺，小者称斧”；赵农记钺与斧的区别除大小外还有捆绑方式不同：钺是穿绳捆绑，斧是銎孔穿木柄，因此钺常作为礼仪形式代表地位和权力，良渚文化中的玉钺应是王权象征。商周青铜钺一方面作战争兵器，一方面作王朝政权和地位的象征；妇好墓出土重达9公斤的双虎食人青铜钺，是已出土青铜钺中最重的武器；商周钺常用镂空透雕与镶嵌浮雕增加装饰效果。","path":"terms/yue-battle-axe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"钺是 B 维度下商周青铜兵器与礼器的条目，其王权象征与仪仗含义见来源论述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuefenpai","title":"月份牌（Yuefenpai Calendar Poster）","name_en":"Yuefenpai Calendar Poster","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["上海","商业广告","水彩","石印","郑曼陀"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"advertising_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"月份牌是把中国传统农历本形式与商业广告相结合、把传统木版年画与西方水彩技法相结合而形成的广告形式。最早产生于 19 世纪末的上海，流行于 20 世纪上半叶；最早标有“月份牌”字样者为 1896 年上海鸿福来票行随彩票赠送的《沪景开彩图》，二三十年代达到鼎盛。","path":"terms/yuefenpai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"月份牌是 C 维度下近代商业广告形式的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuexiu","title":"粤绣（Yue Embroidery）","name_en":"Yue Embroidery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["广东","潮州","百鸟","马尾缀绣","广绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"粤绣是广东刺绣，花纹繁缛、喜用百鸟鸡、色彩浓艳对比强烈，用马尾于轮廓缀绣并绣“间道风”飞白花纹，富有广东地方特色；潮州刺绣别称潮绣，另有高绣与金线勾边特点。洋人称从广州工部购得的货物为“广货”，对刺绣也称“广绣”或“粤绣”。","path":"terms/yuexiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"粤绣是 B 维度下地方刺绣工艺的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuhuchun-ping","title":"玉壶春瓶（Yuhuchun Vase）","name_en":"Yuhuchun Vase","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","元代","喇叭口","长颈","圈足"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玉壶春瓶是宋代典型瓷瓶造型，口部外斜、长颈削肩、鼓腹圆足；2016 记其为元代最有特色的瓶式，口部呈喇叭形，颈部修长，腹圆圈足，稳重优美，其他各种瓶类大多由玉壶春为基本形态变化而成，如蒜头瓶、凤尾瓶等。","path":"terms/yuhuchun-ping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"玉壶春瓶是 B 维度下宋元瓷瓶造型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yunjian","title":"晕絰（Yunjian Striped Brocade）","name_en":"Yunjian Striped Brocade","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","织锦","晕絰","色条","阿斯塔那"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"晕絰是唐代织锦中以色条相间排列、构成斑斓复杂条纹的品种，田自秉称其为织锦中最华丽的一种。原文写作晕絰，与常见晕裥、晕繝等写法不同，条目照录不改。阿斯塔那出土的晕絰提花锦裙与云头锦鞋里衬是来源所举实例。","path":"terms/yunjian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"晕絰是 B 维度下唐代晕絰锦的品种条目，其色条构成与视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yunqi-wen","title":"云气纹（Cloud-Scroll Pattern）","name_en":"Cloud-Scroll Pattern","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","染织","流云纹","纹样骨骼","漆器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"云气纹是汉代染织的主要装饰纹样，也称流云纹，以线条舒卷起伏为形式。它常作纹样组织的骨骼，在云气空间布置飞禽走兽，兼有分割画面与联系呼应的构图作用，并见于漆器、金银错、石刻、壁画。来源又记局部出现鸟头、兽头的云气纹，可能是动物纹长期演变的结果，但对单一形象演变说保留怀疑。","path":"terms/yunqi-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"云气纹是 C 维度下汉代装饰纹样的构图条目，其染织、漆器与金银错载体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yunse","title":"晕色（Yunse (Graduated Colour)）","name_en":"Yunse (Graduated Colour)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","色彩构成","丝织品","退晕","晕绸锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"color_technique","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"晕色是唐代装饰中用以产生色彩渐变的设色手法：同一纹样由深至浅层层过渡，形成同类色的色阶。高丰把它列为唐代装饰的三大特点之一，称其运用“丰富了装饰色彩的表现力”；在纹样上，晕色以“退晕”的方式实现，即主体纹样从中心到边缘由深至浅层层淡化。\n\n来源把晕色看作中国古代具有民族风格的色彩构成手法，并记其载体有唐代新创造的晕绸锦，后世又用于织锦、刺绣与建筑彩画。","path":"terms/yunse.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"晕色是 C 维度下色彩构成手法的条目，其在丝织、建筑彩画上的工艺载体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yuqixingzu-taoding","title":"鱼鳍形足陶鼎（Yuqixingzu Taoding (Fish-Fin-Leg Pottery Ding)）","name_en":"Fish-Fin-Leg Pottery Ding","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["良渚文化","陶鼎","鱼鳍形足","仿生造型","黑皮陶"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鱼鳍形足陶鼎是良渚文化的代表性陶鼎，以鱼鳍形鼎足得名。2016 册称其具有代表性并显示南方地方色彩，并与水鸟形陶壶一起被视为模拟自然形态、按生活需要造型的例证。","path":"terms/yuqixingzu-taoding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下良渚文化陶鼎器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:yushi","title":"玉石（Jade Stone）","name_en":"Jade Stone","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["美石","硬玉","软玉","翡翠","透闪石"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"raw_material","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玉石是赵农在第一章“玉器的出现”一节中界定的制器材料，来源称“玉石也称美石”，为天然隐晶质材料，一般分为硬玉和软玉两种：硬玉又称翡翠，原始制玉多以软玉为主，软玉是透闪石、阳起石。赵农称玉质材料有质感光洁、色泽鲜艳、温润清亮的特点，自人类发现玉质、制造玉器以来一直是人类喜爱的器物。来源把玉石视为原始先民在大量石器制作中发现的“不同于普通砾石的美石”。","path":"terms/yushi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"玉石是 B 维度下史前玉器材料的条目，其质感与色泽的审美评价属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zaju-chuishao-fu","title":"杂裾垂髾服（Zaju Chuishao Fu (Layered Skirt Robe)）","name_en":"Zaju Chuishao Fu (Layered Skirt Robe)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋南北朝","女服","深衣","杂裾垂髾","纤髯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"魏晋南北朝女服中由深衣下摆尖角加长、去曳地长带形成的样式。2016 册记深衣至晋有“纤髯”之美称，下摆三角形上宽下尖、层层相叠为“髯”，围裳中伸出的长带为“纤”，行走时如燕飞舞，称“华带飞髯”；南北朝时去曳地长带，尖角加长，形成“杂裾垂髯”。来源同段记同期女装衫、袄、襦、裙宽博，褒衣博带，条纹间色裙与帔子流行，北魏则左衽窄袖。","path":"terms/zaju-chuishao-fu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下魏晋南北朝女服的条目，其服制等级另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zaoqi-gongyehua","title":"早期工业化（Early Industrialization）","name_en":"Early Industrialization","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","清代","工场手工业","资本主义萌芽","近代设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_periodization","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"早期工业化是李立新用来表示明代中后期以来与近代欧洲早期相似的工场手工业阶段的术语，以区别于近现代工业化。来源认为其主要特征仍是手工业而不是机械化，与近代工业化没有必然因果关系，但为近代设计准备了必要条件；并以此反驳西方现代设计传入前中国造物基础为空白的看法。","path":"terms/zaoqi-gongyehua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 E 维度下传统设计向近代转型的时期概念，其生产组织面向归 D 维度，史学分期面向归 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhadou","title":"渣斗（Zhadou (Waste Bowl)）","name_en":"Zhadou (Waste Bowl)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","瓷器","渣斗","定窑","宴饮"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"渣斗是宋代宴饮的盛渣器具。赵农记其阔沿、浅腹、圆足，定窑多此产品。来源未给渣斗的高度、口径、容量、具体用途细分与制作工序。","path":"terms/zhadou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"渣斗是 B 维度下宋代瓷器形制的条目；材料仅器形、用途与窑口，confidence 取 low。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhan-dao","title":"栈道（Plank Road）","name_en":"Plank Road","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","道路","山地交通","栈道"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"road","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"栈道是秦汉山地交通中依河谷岩壁修筑的道路形式，来源称其为中华民族对山地地形因地制宜的利用。赵农记其施工方式为在岩壁凿孔、嵌入方木，并分上中下三层；又以褒斜道为例，引《史记·货殖列传》与刘邦烧绝栈道的故事说明其军事交通意义。来源未给栈道宽度、承重与遗址实测数据，图版未核。","path":"terms/zhan-dao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"B 维度下的山地道路术语条目，关注依壁临水的构筑方式；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhang-cao","title":"章草（Zhangcao Cursive）","name_en":"Zhangcao Cursive","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["秦汉","书体","草书","文字设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"script","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"章草是东汉时期在民间汉隶草书基础上规范而成的官方文件书写方式，名称缘于奏章之意。来源先记西汉末年已出现草书字体，以甘肃居延汉简为代表，再说明其进一步规范为章草，并把它列为由隶变楷的重要阶段。来源未给章草代表书家、作品与年代序列，图版未核。","path":"terms/zhang-cao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"C 维度下的书体术语条目，关注草书形态与官方书写方式的关系；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhao-tie","title":"招贴（Poster）","name_en":"Poster","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","广告","年画","四美图","宣传画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"advertising_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"招贴是一种海报形式，与广告关系密切，分商业类、文化类、政治类、风俗类等，渐渐成为极具独立价值的设计形式。赵农记招贴在宋代已经出现，应为年画性质的文化广告，以《四美图》为著名例证；宋代主要的广告形式即招贴广告，包括店堂门脸匾额、布幌子与悬挂菜单。20 世纪中国因政治、经济活动的不同需要，招贴形成此起彼伏的浪潮。","path":"terms/zhao-tie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"招贴是 C 维度下广告形式的条目：宋代年画性文化广告与 20 世纪分类体系在此汇合。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhaopai","title":"招牌（Shop Signboard）","name_en":"Shop Signboard","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","商业广告","匾额","书法","店铺信誉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_sign","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"招牌是商铺的匾额。赵农记其常常邀请名流雅士题写店名，将书法艺术和店铺信誉连接在一起，以获得众人注目的广告效果，甚至成为历史的文化传说；举北京明代六必居酱菜铺与王麻子剪刀铺为例，并记有的店堂高悬名人字画以招徕顾客。来源未给招牌的材质、尺寸、字体与制作工艺。","path":"terms/zhaopai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"招牌是 D 维度下明清商铺广告形式的条目；其书法与匾额视觉形式归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhedie-zhuo","title":"折叠桌（Folding Table）","name_en":"Folding Table","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","家具","折叠桌","胡床","清明上河图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"furniture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"折叠桌是宋代利用胡床原理制作的桌具。赵农记桌有方桌、长方桌、折叠桌等，其中折叠桌利用胡床的原理，可任意折叠，便于携带；《清明上河图》的虹桥上有一摊贩在折叠桌前叫卖，可证为宋代的折叠桌形象。来源未给桌的尺寸、材料、折叠构件与制作工序。","path":"terms/zhedie-zhuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"折叠桌是 B 维度下宋代家具的条目；其《清明上河图》图像证据归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhenmushou","title":"镇墓兽（Tomb Guardian Beast）","name_en":"Tomb Guardian Beast","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["战国","楚墓","木雕","辟邪","冥福"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"burial_figure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"镇墓兽是李立新在讨论春秋战国天神、地祇、人鬼观念时提到的楚墓随葬木雕。他称春秋到战国的楚墓迄今出土数百件“镇墓兽”，共同特征是兽首插有真正的鹿角；楚人把这类神秘诡谲、形象奇特的木雕置于墓室，一是辟邪驱鬼，二是争取冥福、祈祷神灵先祖的庇护和保佑。来源未给镇墓兽的形制分类、尺寸、墓号、统计口径与图像细部。","path":"terms/zhenmushou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度楚墓镇墓木雕的类型条目，其辟邪驱鬼与冥福观念属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zheshan","title":"折扇（Folding Fan）","name_en":"Folding Fan","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北宋","扇子","折扇","日本","大相国寺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"fan","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"折扇是北宋时期从日本传入的扇子样式。赵农记随着造纸技术的提高，纸扇在隋唐时期出现，在宋代也非常流行，并很快成为文人的喜爱之物；相传在北宋时期折扇从日本传入，当时汴京的大相国寺里有日本纸扇出售；折扇经后人改进，增大扇骨和扇面，并以文人书画作为装饰，明清时期成为社会人士文雅风流的象征。来源未给折扇的尺寸、扇骨数、制作材料与传入年代。","path":"terms/zheshan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"折扇是 B 维度下宋代扇具样式的条目；其自日本传入与后世文化象征归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhi-book-wrapper","title":"帙（Book Wrapper）","name_en":"Book Wrapper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["书籍装帧","卷轴装","麻布","丝织品","说文解字"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bookbinding","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"帙是卷轴书籍的外覆装具。赵农引《说文解字》称帙为书衣，记其以麻布为里、丝织品为面，常以10卷或15卷为一帙，后演变为书函或书套。来源又记卷头硬纸部分称襦，也称玉池、包头，襦上丝带为带，带上有签，卷轴轴头另标书签。来源未给帙的尺寸、色彩、具体实例与出土实物，本条不补。“襦”字照录，不径改。","path":"terms/zhi-book-wrapper.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"帙是 B 维度下卷轴书籍的外覆装具，兼及卷头装裱部件；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhi-hu","title":"执壶（Zhi Hu (Ewer)）","name_en":"Zhi Hu (Ewer)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","酒器","执壶","注子","青瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"执壶是唐代酒壶的称呼，又称注子。2009 册记唐代青瓷中出现大量酒壶、酒杯；执壶的典型形制为盘口短颈、鼓腹、短嘴，嘴作六棱或圆筒形，与嘴相对的一侧安有曲柄短把。到了晚唐，壶身增高，多作瓜棱形，嘴和柄也逐渐增长，造型轻盈雅致。来源同段还记茶碗要求器身浅、器壁成直线形、敞口、玉壁形碗足，以及酒杯有高足杯、小环耳杯、圈足小杯等。","path":"terms/zhi-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"执壶是 B 维度下唐代酒器器形的条目，其青瓷窑口与饮酒风尚另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhi-vessel","title":"觯（Zhi (Zhi Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Zhi Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","饮酒器","五爵","小瓶形","方柱形觯"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"觯是青铜饮酒器，形制为圆腹、侈口束颈鼓腹、圈足、有盖，整器似一小瓶。2016 册记其始见于商，西周时发现方柱形觯，于西周晚期绝迹；原文“解始见于商”的“解”当为“觯”。","path":"terms/zhi-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜饮酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhijin-yin","title":"织金银（Zhijin Yinyin (Brocade with Gold and Silver Threads)）","name_en":"Zhijin Yinyin (Brocade with Gold and Silver Threads)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","锦缎","织金银","金线","银线"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"织金银是明代锦缎三大类中的第三类：在缎地上用金线或银线织出花纹的锦缎。2016 册与妆花、本色花（库缎）并列，作为明代丝织品种分类的第三类，未展开金线制法、织物组织与用途。","path":"terms/zhijin-yin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"织金银是 B 维度下明代锦缎品种的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhijin","title":"织锦（Zhijin (Brocade)）","name_en":"Zhijin (Brocade)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["丝织","织锦","蜀锦","宋锦","云锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"织锦是丝织品中的精品，为我国传统工艺之一。2016 册记民国年间四川的蜀锦、苏州的宋锦、南京的云锦仍保持着传统的势头，流传极盛。同段交代丝织工艺仍以苏州、杭州、四川、福建、广东以及南京等地为主要产区，保持明清以后南方为中心的特点；并由织锦带出苏州缂丝的新面貌，称缂丝又名刻丝、与织锦不同，可根据需要投梭挖花，制作山水、花鸟、人物等各种图像，在丝织工艺中具有极强的艺术观赏价值。","path":"terms/zhijin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"织锦是 B 维度下丝织品类的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhinan-che","title":"指南车（South-pointing Chariot）","name_en":"South-pointing Chariot","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","魏晋南北朝","宋代","制车","机械设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"device_type","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"指南车是汉代以来屡次研制、屡次失传又屡次重造的指向机械车，又称司南车。四册的关注点各不相同：**夏燕靖两版给装置原理与李约瑟的评断**（联合运用车轮、滑轮、各种齿轮和绳索；人类历史上第一架有共协稳定的机械），**赵农给机械原理与宋代燕肃的复原形制**（引《宋史·舆服志》），**李立新给历代复制的失败谱系**（《宋书·礼志》周公始作，张衡再造，马钧恢复，令狐生再造，祖冲之复制）。**四册在“指南车与","path":"terms/zhinan-che.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"指南车是 B 维度下机械制车类型的条目：指向原理、历代重造谱系与宋代复原形制都在此汇合。“官府制车业”一侧归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhinanzhen","title":"指南针（Magnetic Compass）","name_en":"Magnetic Compass","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","仪器","指南针","指南鱼","沈括"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"指南针是宋代制造并用于航海的磁性指向工具。赵农记最初标识方向的工具是战国时期的司南；宋代人制造出带有磁性的铁片，称指南鱼，同时将铁针在天然磁石上摩擦，使铁针带有磁性；沈括《梦溪笔谈》分析指南针的四种装置应用方法——水浮法、指抓法、碗唇法、缕悬法，尤以缕悬法最为妥当；宋代指南针开始用于航海，宣和五年（1123）北宋出使朝鲜的船队在天阴时用指南针辨别方向。","path":"terms/zhinanzhen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"指南针是 B 维度下宋代磁性指向仪器的条目；其航海应用与跨海域传播归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhiqi-shangxiang","title":"制器尚象（Zhiqi Shangxiang (Making Vessels by Observing Images)）","name_en":"Zhiqi Shangxiang (Making Vessels by Observing Images)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["先秦","周易","易传","卦象","设计思想"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_concept","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"制器尚象是高丰从《易传·系辞上传·第十章》“以制器者尚其象”一语中提出的设计思想，列为《周易》设计思想三条之首（另两条为道器统一、文质统一）。他的解释路径是：先把“象”限定为卦象，再说明卦象不是对天地万物的简单模仿，而是观察自然之后高度概括、抽象出的象征符号；由此推出制器也应“观象”而更应“象意”，即把有形之器当作抽象符号，通过模拟、类比与象征表现更深层次的“意”。\n\n本条记的是高丰的阐释，不是《","path":"terms/zhiqi-shangxiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"制器尚象是 A 维度下《周易》设计思想的条目，也是高丰所举《周易》三条设计思想中的第一条；其内容落在“象形寓意”的造物观念上，故兼有 B 维度成分。本条与 `terms/zhu-ding-xiang-wu.md`（“铸鼎象物”）分列：前者是《易传》的制器原则，后者是《左传》所记的铸鼎事象。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhisun-fu","title":"质孙服（Zhisun Robe）","name_en":"Zhisun Robe","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["元代","官服","一色衣","蒙古","等级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"质孙服是元代官服，汉语称“一色衣”，为较短的长袍，较紧较窄，腰部多衣褶，便于骑马上下。1321 年元英宗参照古制制定为上衣连下裳、上紧下短，腰间加襞积、肩背挂大珠。冬服 11 等、夏服 15 等，含衣帽带靴，仅皇帝即位、寿诞、册立、朝会等场合穿用；它是糅合汉族与蒙古民族特点的服制。","path":"terms/zhisun-fu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"质孙服是 D 维度下元代官服制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhiye-zhuang","title":"职业装（Zhiye Zhuang (Occupational Uniform)）","name_en":"Zhiye Zhuang (Occupational Uniform)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["20世纪","职业装","制服","解放军","校服"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"职业装是由于社会分工需要而演变出的服饰。赵农称 20 世纪中国职业装中士兵服饰最具特色，尤其 1949 年之后解放军战士的服装一度成为全民服装样式；现代职业装以警察、法官、医师、厨师、清洁工、中小学生校服最为引人注目。工商、税务、保安人员服饰模仿警察服，加上佩饰、皮带，常使市民误识，被视为职业装设计的误区。来源未给各职业装的具体形制、配发制度与设计者。","path":"terms/zhiye-zhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"职业装是 B 维度下按社会分工形成的制服类别条目；其职业群体与配发制度属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhong-ti-xi-yong","title":"中体西用（Chinese Learning as Substance, Western Learning for Application (Zhong Ti Xi Yong)）","name_en":"Chinese Learning as Substance, Western Learning for Application (Zhong Ti Xi Yong)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清末","中体西用","中体西器","师夷长技","西学中源"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_thought","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中体西用是清末在西方器物冲击下形成的思想主张，主张立足中国传统、吸取西方制器技艺以补中之短。李立新把它放在从“师夷长技以制夷”到“采西学”“制洋器”的思想链条末端，称其为知识阶层与开明官僚在新旧抉择中的“折中”选择，并以“中体西器”“中体西用”并称。L1303 又把它追溯到明末清初的“西学中源”，并指出新式设计教育出现向西方式现代转化的趋势。来源未给命题的提出者、提出年份与原典出处。","path":"terms/zhong-ti-xi-yong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度清末设计思想命题的条目；“中体西用”与设计教育制度化的关系属 D 维度，其实业救国与西器输入属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhong-xin-ta-zhu-shi","title":"中心塔柱式（Central-Pillar Cave Type）","name_en":"Central-Pillar Cave Type","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["北朝","石窟","莫高窟","千佛洞","支提窟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cave_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中心塔柱式是北朝洞窟的主要结构：主室后部建中心塔柱，四周开佛龛，主室前部凿成人字披屋顶，窟壁绘画以千佛为主，故有“千佛洞”之称（L3968）。来源又称中心柱窟，并称其形制与印度支提窟有渊源关系，但支提窟塔顶与窟顶分离；北朝莫高窟的中心柱窟吸收斗拱、枋子、椽子等中原木构特点，出现方形塔的意味（L3970）。来源未载具体窟号、塔柱尺寸、佛龛数量与实测数据，图版未核。","path":"terms/zhong-xin-ta-zhu-shi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中心塔柱式是 B 维度下北朝石窟结构与制窟方法的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongguo-donghua-xuepai","title":"中国动画学派（Zhongguo Donghua Xuepai (Chinese Animation School)）","name_en":"Zhongguo Donghua Xuepai (Chinese Animation School)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["动画","上海美术电影制片厂","1957-1965","中国动画学派","大闹天宫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"style_school","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国动画学派是 2016 册所记 1957—1965 年我国动画片第一个繁荣时期形成的创作群体与风格。来源称 1957 年上海美术电影制片厂建立，拍摄了不少动画影片在国际电影节上获奖，成为被世界公认的“中国动画学派”。这一时期生产出《大闹天宫》（上、下集），成为经典作品；1961 年第一部水墨动画片《小蝌蚪找妈妈》诞生，为动画影坛增添了最能代表中国风格的新片种；1963 年拍摄的水墨动画片《牧笛》","path":"terms/zhongguo-donghua-xuepai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国动画学派是 C 维度下现代影视动画风格的条目，其国际获奖与影响属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongguo-feng","title":"中国风（Chinoiserie）","name_en":"Chinoiserie","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["17世纪","18世纪","欧洲","中国风","中西交流"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cross_cultural_style","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国风是 17、18 世纪欧洲社会形成的对中国工艺与文化的风尚。赵农记中国的瓷器、丝织品、漆器、壁纸、印刷术、火药、文化典籍对欧洲产生深远影响，欧洲社会在摆脱中世纪宗教压迫后形成“中国风”，并把它视为欧洲转型进入新文化环境的重要因素。来源未给具体国家、年代分段、设计师与器物谱系。","path":"terms/zhongguo-feng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国风是 E 维度下欧洲对中国工艺文化的接受风尚的术语条目；其工艺品类与材料基础属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongguo-gongyi-meishu-dashi","title":"中国工艺美术大师（Zhongguo Gongyi Meishu Dashi (Master of Chinese Arts and Crafts)）","name_en":"Zhongguo Gongyi Meishu Dashi (Master of Chinese Arts and Crafts)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["工艺美术","大师评审","传统工艺美术保护条例","2006","第五届"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"honor_title","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国工艺美术大师是依据《传统工艺美术保护条例》评审产生的国家级工艺美术人才称号。2016 册记根据《条例》规定，2006 年经国务院批准，国家发展和改革委员会会同国家民委、监察部、民政部、财政部、人事部、国土资源部、文化部、国资委组成第五届中国工艺美术大师评审工作领导小组，本着客观公正、公平公开、科学规范的原则，组织专家评审产生了 161 名新一届中国工艺美术大师。来源称这次评审激发了传统工艺美术","path":"terms/zhongguo-gongyi-meishu-dashi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国工艺美术大师是 D 维度下当代工艺美术人才制度的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongguo-gudai-leishu","title":"类书（Leishu (Leishu (Encyclopedic Compendium))）","name_en":"Leishu (Encyclopedic Compendium)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["类书","设计史料","艺文类聚","太平御览","古今图书集成"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reference_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"类书是按类编排、分类辑录文献的古代工具书。2016 册在说明中国设计史料的来源时指出，数千年来中国文化典籍中的类书记载条目数千；若按传统学科分类法，设计当属“技艺”与“营造”诸门类。来源以唐《艺文类聚》、宋《太平御览》、清《古今图书集成》为例，说明设计史料在类书中的分布。","path":"terms/zhongguo-gudai-leishu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 A 维度下设计史料文献类型的条目，说明设计知识在传统类书中的分布方式。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongguo-guyou-shi-jianzhu","title":"中国固有式建筑（Chinese Inherent-Style Architecture）","name_en":"Chinese Inherent-Style Architecture","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["20世纪二三十年代","民族形式","折中主义","上海"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国固有式建筑是五四运动以来伴随反帝爱国情绪和民族意识高涨而发展起来的建筑形式，主要建于 20 世纪二三十年代。它并非纯传统的“宫室式”，而是受西方建筑思潮强烈影响、近于折衷主义的新形式；《上海市市中心区域规划》明确规定市府新屋应用中国式建筑。","path":"terms/zhongguo-guyou-shi-jianzhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国固有式建筑是 B 维度下近代民族形式建筑的类型条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongshanzhuang","title":"中山装（Zhongshan Suit）","name_en":"Zhongshan Suit","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["民国","孙中山","礼服","五权分立","四口袋"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment_form","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中山装是由孙中山亲自设计并带头穿着的男装，被誉为“中山国服”，1912 年民国政府通令定为礼服。其形制以日本陆军士官服装和南洋华侨的“企领文装”为参照，直翻领、四口袋、前襟五纽、袖口三纽；相传最初制作者为上海南京路“荣昌祥呢绒西服店”裁缝王才运。","path":"terms/zhongshanzhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中山装是 D 维度下民国服制改革与政治象征设计的代表条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongshiqi-shidai","title":"中石器时代（Zhongshiqi Shidai (Mesolithic Period)）","name_en":"Mesolithic Period","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["中石器时代","细石器","渔猎采集","黄河流域","过渡阶段"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_period","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中石器时代是旧石器时代与新石器时代之间的过渡阶段，约距今 1.5 万—1 万年，以石片石器和细石器为代表工具。2016 册强调其特征是渔猎与采集经济、尚未出现农业，并认为黄河流域自中石器时代起成为远古文化发展的中心。","path":"terms/zhongshiqi-shidai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下石器时代分期的过渡阶段条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhongxi-hunheshi-jianzhu","title":"中西混合式建筑（Zhongxi Hunheshi Jianzhu (Sino-Western Hybrid Architecture)）","name_en":"Zhongxi Hunheshi Jianzhu (Sino-Western Hybrid Architecture)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["清末民初","建筑类型","中西混合式","现代中国式"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"building_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中西混合式建筑是清末民初西方建筑样式和建筑技术传入后形成的建筑类型之一，又称现代中国式。2016 册称清末民初西方建筑样式和建筑技术开始传入我国，使几千年发展而来的传统建筑形式发生急剧变化，其间形成 3 种类型的建筑风格，即外来式建筑、中国固有式建筑及中西混合式建筑（又称现代中国式），而民初年间以前两种为多见。来源只列名，未给形制、实例与设计师。","path":"terms/zhongxi-hunheshi-jianzhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"E","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中西混合式建筑是 E 维度下近代跨文化建筑类型的条目，其建造技术属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhou-yu-liqi","title":"周代玉礼器（Zhou Ritual Jades）","name_en":"Zhou Ritual Jades","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["周代","玉礼器","伦理道德","陪葬","等级名分"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_jade_set","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"周代玉礼器是周代用于祭祀、朝聘、礼仪与陪葬的玉器组合。田自秉称周代玉器因与伦理道德直接联系而受社会特别重视，成为修身的标准与等级名分的标志；主要作礼器使用，不同种类有不同用途，除礼器外也作陪葬品与佩带品。来源据《周礼》记陪葬位置：圭在左、璋在首、琥在右、璜在足、璧在背、琮在腹。来源未给成套实物、组合数量与年代序列。","path":"terms/zhou-yu-liqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"周代玉礼器是 B 维度下周代玉器礼制组合的术语条目；其伦理、等级与陪葬制度属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhouxin-shidai","title":"轴心时代（Axial Age）","name_en":"Axial Age","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["春秋战国","历史分期","雅斯贝斯","造物思想"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"historical_period","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"轴心时代是雅斯贝斯提出的历史分期概念，指公元前800—公元前200年间众多哲学家在世界不同地区同时出现、人类意识觉醒的阶段。李立新引“中轴”之说，把春秋战国置于中国历史前后转折的位置：向前是造物设计尚未定型的神化时代，向后到秦汉完成结构体系的建构；同时指出“轴心”说的框架不足以完全把握中国历史的演进与中国造物历史文化的特殊性，因为以儒家思想规范造物设计并未在这一时期完成，诸子思想仍属精英思想，并未","path":"terms/zhouxin-shidai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度历史分期概念的条目，其用于解释造物设计转型的部分属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhu-chang-she-ji-shi","title":"驻厂设计师（In-House Designer (Zhu Chang She Ji Shi)）","name_en":"In-House Designer (Zhu Chang She Ji Shi)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["20世纪20—30年代","驻厂设计师","自由设计师","烟草公司","商业设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_profession","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"驻厂设计师是从属于工厂、商行设计室并为该企业服务的设计师。李立新在 20 世纪 20、30 年代设计艺术发展的第三项下提出这一身份，与自由设计师并列，并举南洋、英美、华成三家烟草公司为例：陈之佛刚回国时曾短期担任驻厂设计师，张光宇 1921 至 1925 年在南洋兄弟烟草公司，之后在英美烟草公司任驻厂设计师。来源未给这一职务的职责、薪酬、编制与起止制度。","path":"terms/zhu-chang-she-ji-shi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 D 维度近代设计职业化的条目，其商业设计面向属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhu-ding-xiang-wu","title":"铸鼎象物（Casting Ding to Image Things）","name_en":"Casting Ding to Image Things","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["左传","鼎","德行","造物观念","象征"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"design_concept","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“铸鼎象物”是《春秋左氏传》记载的当时流行造物观点，也可以说是指导器物制作的方法核心。当时人认为鼎的大小、轻重象征统治者的德行、地位，因而具有很强的精神作用。","path":"terms/zhu-ding-xiang-wu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铸鼎象物是 A 维度下先秦造物观念的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhu-lin-qi-xian","title":"竹林七贤（Seven Sages of the Bamboo Grove）","name_en":"Seven Sages of the Bamboo Grove","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["魏晋","士族","玄学","竹林","嵇康"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"social_group","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"竹林七贤是魏晋时期以高迈散淡著称的士人群体，来源将其置于庄园、朝廷与山水之间的政治文化脉络中讨论（L3307、L3705）。来源行文只点到嵇康、阮籍、山涛、王戎，图 5-32 图注出现阮咸，未列全七人姓名，也未给群体成员的生卒、籍贯与活动时间。图 5-1、图 5-32 图版均未核，不据图补写人物形貌、服饰与器物。来源未载七贤名称的由来与完整名录，本条不补。","path":"terms/zhu-lin-qi-xian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"竹林七贤是 A 维度下魏晋士人思想风气与后世文化评价的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhu-zhi","title":"竹纸（Bamboo Paper）","name_en":"Bamboo Paper","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宋代","造纸","竹纸","纸张","印刷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"竹纸是以竹子为材料的纸张。赵农在宋代造纸节记：以竹子为材料的造纸方法使纸张更加洁白柔韧、光滑细腻，因此竹纸在宋代十分流行；由于书籍印刷技术的需要，造纸作坊还专门生产了相应尺寸规格的纸张。来源未给竹纸的产地、纤维处理与抄造工序；本条只记材质、性能与印刷需求的关系。","path":"terms/zhu-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"竹纸是 B 维度下宋代造纸材质的条目；其为书籍印刷配套的规格生产归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhuanghua","title":"妆花（Zhuanghua (Polychrome Brocade Weave)）","name_en":"Zhuanghua (Polychrome Brocade Weave)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","云锦","过管","挖花回纬","金宝地"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_technique","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"妆花是明代锦缎三类之一，用许多不同色线织成的多彩丝织物，花纹色彩异常丰富、花纹一般较大，有“走马看妆花”之喻。它是云锦中最华美的一种，用“过管”方法边织边配色，彩色一般 6 或 9 色、多至 18 色，同一排花朵可出现完全不同色彩。","path":"terms/zhuanghua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"妆花是 B 维度下明代提花丝织工艺与品种的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhuangjin","title":"壮锦（Zhuang Brocade）","name_en":"Zhuang Brocade","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["壮族","广西","菱形几何","棉经丝纬"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"壮锦是广西壮族地区的民族民间织锦。装饰构成以菱形几何图案为骨架，以粗线条菊、梅等花卉作主题花填充，或用回纹、字纹、波纹作地纹，龙凤鸟作有规则的散点排列；色彩对比强烈，风格端庄大方又浓艳粗犷，用于衣裙、中被、背包、台布等。","path":"terms/zhuangjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"壮锦是 B 维度下少数民族织锦的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhuangshi-tianjia","title":"装饰的添加手法（Decorative Additive Method）","name_en":"Decorative Additive Method","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","织物","纹样","构图手法","奇禽异兽"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"composition_method","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“装饰的添加手法”是高丰在讨论汉代织物动物纹样时使用的一个表述：在卷曲的茱萸纹和云气纹之间穿插七八种奇禽异兽，用丰富的想像力表现一个理想的世界。来源没有给这个手法下独立定义，本条按上下文记其用法：在主体纹样之间添加另一类题材，使画面既有穿插又有寓意。","path":"terms/zhuangshi-tianjia.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"装饰的添加手法是 C 维度下汉代织物纹样的构图手法条目，其织造载体属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhuo-qi","title":"桌器（Table Service）","name_en":"Table Service","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明代","嘉靖","隆庆","成套瓷器","系列化设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_set","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"桌器是明代嘉靖年间出现的成套系列化瓷器，高丰释为“整桌瓷器之意”。其设计方式是按一桌筵席的用器需要，配出一套品种规格不同、造型风格统一、纹饰与色彩完全一致的系列产品。来源记嘉靖三十三年烧造桌器 1,340 套，每套 27 件；隆庆时期在 27 件之外又增加 36 件、61 件两种。高丰把这种成套设计评为中国古代瓷器产品设计的一个重大突破。","path":"terms/zhuo-qi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"桌器是 B 维度下明代成套瓷器的类型条目，其按筵席配置成套的做法涉及 D 维度的消费制度与 C 维度的统一装饰。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zhuyu-wen","title":"茱萸纹（Dogwood Pattern）","name_en":"Dogwood Pattern","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["汉代","唐代","丝织","刺绣","叉刺纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"decorative_motif","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"茱萸纹是汉代流行的丝织与刺绣纹样，以茱萸植物为题材，形式为椭圆心形叉刺状、线条流畅，外国学者又称叉刺纹。来源引晋《风土记》与王维诗说明重阳佩茱萸辟邪的习俗，并称其流行至唐代；马王堆长寿绣的云纹、花蕾与叶瓣，来源也判断“实即茱萸纹”。","path":"terms/zhuyu-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"茱萸纹是 C 维度下汉代丝织与刺绣纹样的条目，其织绣载体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zikou-tiezu","title":"紫口铁足（Purple Mouth, Iron Foot）","name_en":"Purple Mouth, Iron Foot","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["哥窑","官窑","黑褐胎","边缘呈色"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_decoration","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"紫口铁足是宋代官窑、哥窑的特征之一：瓷胎呈黑褐色，器皿的足部和口沿因釉薄而露出铁褐色胎质，形成一条褐色的边。赵农记其为哥窑南宋官窑产品的样式。","path":"terms/zikou-tiezu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"紫口铁足是 B 维度下宋瓷外观特征的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zisha-tao","title":"紫砂陶（Zisha Pottery）","name_en":"Zisha Pottery","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["宜兴","紫砂泥","不挂釉","茶具","顾景舟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_type","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"紫砂陶是宜兴窑的特色产品，原料紫砂泥色泽紫红，另有白泥、绿泥、大红泥；深藏岩层下，风化研磨制器，经 1000 多度烧成，不挂釉，以造型取胜，“方非一式，圆不一样”。多做茶具，紫砂壶有泡茶色纯、隔夜不馊、用久味永、泥色生辉的特点。\n\n2009 册补出宜兴窑的烧造序列与紫砂器的分期：宜兴窑从汉代始烧红陶、灰陶和原始青瓷，烧制陶瓷的历史一直延续不断，故称老窑口；紫砂器始烧于宋代，明代紫砂器闻名于世，清代","path":"terms/zisha-tao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"紫砂陶是 B 维度下宜兴陶器类型的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zixingche","title":"自行车（bicycle）","name_en":"bicycle","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["新中国","交通工具","自行车","凤凰","永久"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vehicle_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"自行车是 20 世纪中国家庭常用的两轮人力交通工具。赵农记其最初只有少量进口，随着国产自行车增加成为家庭必备交通工具；六七十年代成为家庭生活富裕的象征，国产“凤凰”“永久”“飞鸽”“红旗”等品牌深受欢迎。来源未给车型、尺寸、材料、产量与设计者。","path":"terms/zixingche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"自行车是 B 维度下两轮人力交通工具的术语条目；其家庭消费与国产品牌市场属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zouma-deng","title":"走马灯（Pinwheel Lantern）","name_en":"Pinwheel Lantern","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","走马灯","彩灯","热气流","灯影"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"festival_object","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"走马灯是唐代出现的一种彩灯。赵农 2009 册在第七节「杂品」记花灯之后，用一句话记走马灯：利用灯光产生的热气流推动灯罩内人物马形流转，产生光怪陆离的灯影效果。来源只给名称、年代、原理与效果，未给灯体结构、灯罩材料、尺寸、图样与流传情况。图 6-66 走马灯图版未核，本条不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"terms/zouma-deng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"走马灯是 B 维度下唐代彩灯以热气流驱动灯影的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zu-ritual-vessel","title":"俎（Zu (Ritual Chopping Stand)）","name_en":"Zu (Ritual Chopping Stand)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["礼器","祭祀","家具雏形","商代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"俎是古代祭祀时切牲、陈牲的礼器。考古所见较早实物有辽宁义县商代青铜俎和河南安阳大司空村商代石俎；其整体造型已具有后世几、案、桌类家具的雏形。2016 记其历史最久，传说有虞氏时已有，为后世桌、案、几、椅、凳等家具奠定基础。","path":"terms/zu-ritual-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"俎是 B 维度下礼器—家具过渡形态的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zuhui","title":"族徽（Zuhui (Clan Emblem)）","name_en":"Zuhui (Clan Emblem)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["商代晚期","西周中期","青铜器","图形文字","族名"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"graphic_emblem","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"族徽是商代晚期至西周中期部分青铜器的器盖、器身所铸的图形化徽记。高丰把这类图形文字看作中国古代以器物为载体的信息设计，其源头是原始社会陶器上的陶符，商周时期仍在延续，而“图形文字设计和应用的典范，当是商代晚期至西周中期青铜器上的族徽”。族徽不带商业色彩，而服务于亲族政治与宗教，在青铜器上承担识别、标识与权威象征的功能。\n\n来源把族徽的表现手法归为三类：以图形为主、图文结合、以文（图形化的文字）为主","path":"terms/zuhui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"族徽是 C 维度下以器物为载体的图形文字设计条目，其铸刻工艺归 B 维度。青铜礼器的器形与纹饰另有条目承载。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zun-vessel","title":"尊（Zun (Zun Wine Vessel)）","name_en":"Zun Wine Vessel","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["青铜器","盛酒器","鸟兽尊","圈足","祭器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"vessel_form","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"尊是青铜盛酒器，青铜铭文中常与彝统称整个青铜礼器。2016 册记其始见于商早期，一般为圆形、侈口、圈足，由陶尊演变而来；另有鸟兽形尊，以动物造型为体，背部开口有盖，是专用祭器。","path":"terms/zun-vessel.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下青铜盛酒器器形的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zuo-zu-you-she","title":"左祖右社（Ancestral Temple on the Left, Altar of Soil and Grain on the Right）","name_en":"Ancestral Temple on the Left, Altar of Soil and Grain on the Right","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","北京","太庙","社稷坛","五色土"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_layout","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"左祖右社是中国古代宫廷建筑的组成部分。赵农记承天门（清天安门）东面是太庙，主体由大戟门、太庙、中殿、后殿几部分构成，以苍松翠柏点缀；西侧为社稷坛，社为国土神，稷为五谷神，按阴阳五行观念设计，以五色土为中心，体现中黄、东青、南红、西白、北黑的地理方位象征。来源未给两坛的占地、坛制尺寸与祭祀仪注。","path":"terms/zuo-zu-you-she.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"左祖右社是 B 维度下明清宫廷礼制建筑布局的条目；其礼制秩序与祭祀制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zuopu","title":"作铺（Zuopu (Tang Urban Workshop)）","name_en":"Zuopu (Tang Urban Workshop)","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐代","城市手工业","作坊","行"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"craft_system","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"作铺是唐代城市手工业作坊的称谓，如染行、织锦行、金银行、绢行等，规模相当大，大城市往往有一至两个以上行当。","path":"terms/zuopu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"作铺是 D 维度下唐代城市手工业组织条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zuosichou","title":"柞丝绸（Zuosichou (Tussah Silk (Shandong Silk))）","name_en":"Zuosichou (Tussah Silk (Shandong Silk))","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["明清","山东","柞蚕","柞丝绸","山东绸"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile_type","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明清时期山东蚕农掌握成熟柞蚕方法后所产的柞蚕丝织品，驰名中外，被称为「山东绸」。2016 册在明清纺织印染业段记：明代江南区域、珠江三角洲逐渐成为主要养蚕区，山东蚕农「甚至已掌握一套成熟的柞蚕方法」，柞丝绸由此得名；明末清初柞蚕放养又传到河南、陕西、云贵和辽东地区，进一步推广了养蚕织绸业。","path":"terms/zuosichou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"柞丝绸是 B 维度下明清山东柞蚕丝织品的条目，其产地传播与明清丝绸经济属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"terms:zuyongdiao","title":"租庸调（Zu-Yong-Diao Tax System）","name_en":"Zu-Yong-Diao Tax System","type":"term","type_zh":"术语","color":"#10B981","tags":["唐初","均田制","绢绵","输庸代役"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tax_system","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"租庸调是唐初的租赋劳役制度，与均田制并行。每丁年纳绢 2 丈、绵 3 两，或麻布 2 丈 5 尺、麻 3 斤；唐创制“输庸代役”法以减轻民众负担。田自秉称其对经济发展起一定促进作用。","path":"terms/zuyongdiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"租庸调是 D 维度下唐代赋役制度与纺织生产的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:anle-gongzhu-yuqun","title":"安乐公主羽裙（Princess Anle's Feather Skirt）","name_en":"Princess Anle's Feather Skirt","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","安乐公主","羽裙","百鸟毛裙","服饰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐中宗李显幼女安乐公主的羽裙，见《旧唐书·五行志》与《朝野佥载》。原文记其“正看为一色，侧看为一色，目中为一色，影中为一色，百鸟之状，尽在裙中”，并记贵族纷纷效仿，“以至奇禽异鸟毛羽，采之殆尽”。女服段又以安乐公主所穿羽裙为例，与民间流行的石榴裙对举：一般百姓穿不起这种昂贵的百鸟毛裙，只能以颜色和式样取胜。田自秉所引《旧唐书·五行志》作“正看为一色，旁看为一色，日中为一色，影中为一色，百鸟之状并见","path":"works/anle-gongzhu-yuqun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代服饰的文献锚点，材料为史书转述两处。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:aoyun-2008-biaozhi","title":"2008年北京奥运会标志（Beijing 2008 Olympic emblem）","name_en":"Beijing 2008 Olympic emblem","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["改革开放","2008","奥运会","标志设计","北京"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"emblem","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2008年北京奥运会标志是赵农在“文化标志”段举为具有中国文化特殊意义的设计作品之一，与申办奥运标志并列。来源未给设计者、发布年份、图形构成与色彩规范。","path":"works/aoyun-2008-biaozhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"2008年北京奥运会标志是 C 维度下标志设计的作品条目；其以中国文化符号面对国际赛事的取向属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ba-bridge","title":"灞桥（Ba Bridge）","name_en":"Ba Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","汉代","桥梁","灞河","灞柳"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"灞桥是西安灞河上的汉代古桥，初为木桥，王莽时被烧毁，此后屡毁屡修。来源以“地盛桥古，声誉久远”概括其历史地位，并记“十里相送，灞柳相别”在汉唐成为人们友谊的象征（L2729）。来源未给桥长、桥墩、构造与重修次数。","path":"works/ba-bridge.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度汉代桥梁的器物条目，关联交通设施与都城近郊景观，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:bai-ma-si","title":"白马寺（Baima Temple (White Horse Temple)）","name_en":"Baima Temple (White Horse Temple)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉明帝","洛阳","白马寺","佛寺","西域"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"temple","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"白马寺是东汉明帝时所立佛寺，来源称其至今完好，并引《洛阳伽蓝记·城西》述寺名由来与方位，结句称其为中国佛教传入之初的建筑。来源未载寺院规模、布局、历代重修与现存建筑年代。引文中的「佛入中国之始」是《洛阳伽蓝记》语，不是本条判断；「帝梦金神」云云是典籍叙述，本条不作史实核证。引文「谴使」原文如此，疑为「遣使」，照录标疑，不径改。","path":"works/bai-ma-si.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条以 B 维度东汉佛寺的营造为主，兼及 A 维度《洛阳伽蓝记》的文献记述，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:bai-you-lv-cai-si-xi-lian-ban-gang","title":"白釉绿彩四系莲瓣缸（White-Glazed Four-Lug Lotus-Petal Jar with Green Splash）","name_en":"White-Glazed Four-Lug Lotus-Petal Jar with Green Splash","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北齐","白瓷","绿彩","莲瓣","北方风格"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"白釉绿彩四系莲瓣缸是北齐白瓷的代表器。2009 册记其从肩到腹堆塑成凸起的丰肥莲瓣，使造型与装饰融为一体，表现为典型的北方风格。同段记北齐白瓷使用低含铁量的胎釉，胎料较为细腻，釉薄而滋润、呈乳白色，釉厚处则泛青；白瓷碗、白瓷杯（河南安阳范粹墓出土，武平六年 575 前）胎釉白净细润；与东汉白瓷“灰釉高足碗”相比有质的飞跃，从此瓷分青、白两大体系。","path":"works/bai-you-lv-cai-si-xi-lian-ban-gang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度北齐白瓷的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:baici-pankou-changjing-ping","title":"白瓷盘口长颈瓶（White Porcelain Dish-Mouth Long-Neck Bottle）","name_en":"White Porcelain Dish-Mouth Long-Neck Bottle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["辽代","白瓷","盘口长颈瓶","赤峰","朱彩画龙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"白瓷盘口长颈瓶是 1953 年赤峰西大营子村西山辽墓出土的辽瓷。来源称盘口长颈瓶是辽瓷中常见的式样，可以看出与唐瓷、宋瓷有传统联系；所出白瓷瓶上有朱彩画龙贴金，是一件精美的作品。来源未给尺寸、釉色细节、藏地与图版。","path":"works/baici-pankou-changjing-ping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度辽代白瓷的单器锚点，朱彩画龙与贴金装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:baici-tiehua-dou","title":"白瓷贴花豆（White Porcelain Dou with Applied Decoration）","name_en":"White Porcelain Dou with Applied Decoration","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","白瓷","贴花","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-8. 唐代 白瓷贴花豆”。图注所在的段落却属隋代“1）造型设计的特点”：原文先论隋代陶瓷的器形和装饰设计基本上与前代相似而仍有明显变化，以桥形耳和钮状耳较多、最富于特色，纹饰也增加了几何纹、弦纹、绳纹、双圈纹、联珠纹与莲瓣、忍冬、葵瓣、团花、宝相花、梅花、树叶等植物纹及龙纹、凤纹、蟠螭、象首等动物纹；随后记当时陶瓷的制作技术也有较大改进，洁白的胎体薄而细腻，护胎釉不仅可以掩盖胎体的细孔","path":"works/baici-tiehua-dou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代白瓷的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:baidum","title":"《白度母》唐卡（Thangka of White Tara）","name_en":"Thangka of White Tara","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","唐卡","白度母","藏族","宗教艺术"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"thangka","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐卡作品，图11-40 的图注为：11-40. 新中国 唐卡《白度母》。正文在 2005 年全国工艺美术产业统计一段末以（图11-38、11-39、11-40）并引三图，但该段只记企业与产值数据，未描述此唐卡；少数民族工艺品一段（L5243）只列织锦、地毯、花帽、蜡染等实用品，未及唐卡。原文未记尺寸、作者、绘制年代、产地与藏地。","path":"works/baidum.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国唐卡艺术的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:baiyou-lianhua-tuo-zhuhu","title":"白釉莲花托注壶（White-Glazed Ewer with Lotus Stand）","name_en":"White-Glazed Ewer with Lotus Stand","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["辽代","白釉","注壶","莲花托","河北省文物研究所"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_ewer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"白釉莲花托注壶是辽代注壶，高 17.7cm。把、颈、口细长别致，盖似覆杯形套于壶口，托碗形似莲花，圈足，形体饱满。窑口、出土地点与釉色细节未载，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/baiyou-lianhua-tuo-zhuhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度辽代注壶的单器条目，莲花托与覆杯盖的造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:baiyou-lianzuo-zhutai","title":"白釉莲座烛台（White-Glazed Lotus-Pedestal Candlestick）","name_en":"White-Glazed Lotus-Pedestal Candlestick","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","白釉","莲座","烛台","邢窑"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"白釉莲座烛台是唐代白瓷烛台，图注见插图3。正文在邢窑白瓷段称邢窑器形光素大方，除瓶、壶外也有白瓷烛台与葵形盒；来源未单述此件，莲座层数、烛插孔径与尺寸均未载。","path":"works/baiyou-lianzuo-zhutai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"白釉莲座烛台是 B 维度下唐代白瓷烛台的图版锚点，只记器名与邢窑白瓷的器类背景。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:baiyu-qianjin-hongbaoshi-wan","title":"白玉嵌金红宝石碗（White Jade Bowl with Gold Inlay and Rubies）","name_en":"White Jade Bowl with Gold Inlay and Rubies","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","乾隆","玉雕","白玉","错金"],"confidence":"high","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"白玉嵌金红宝石碗是乾隆时期的一件玉雕珍品，与《大禹治水图玉山》并列为故宫博物院藏的代表性作品。玉碗用新疆和田白玉为材料，浅腹敞口，有两个桃形耳，外壁以错金饰花草纹，红色花朵上嵌 180 颗红宝石，碗心刻乾隆诗；来源据《高宗御制诗集》注判断它是国家大典时帝王在御殿赐奶茶之器。","path":"works/baiyu-qianjin-hongbaoshi-wan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代玉雕单器的条目，错金花草与红宝石镶嵌属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:baiyu-shuangchi-guwen-bi","title":"白玉双螭谷纹璧（White Jade Bi with Double Chi-Dragon and Grain Pattern）","name_en":"White Jade Bi with Double Chi-Dragon and Grain Pattern","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","天津博物馆","玉璧","谷纹","粟纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"白玉双螭谷纹璧是天津博物馆藏汉代玉璧，璧身满布粟纹，上半镂雕动物卷草，来源评为精巧玲珑。来源把它放在汉代玉雕发展透雕、刻线、浮雕、粟纹等多种装饰加工方法的叙述中；未给尺寸、玉质、出土信息与图版细节。","path":"works/baiyu-shuangchi-guwen-bi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"白玉双螭谷纹璧是 B 维度下汉代玉璧的器物条目，其谷纹与透雕卷草的视觉组织归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:baodai-qiao","title":"宝带桥（Baodai Bridge）","name_en":"Baodai Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","桥梁","石拱桥","苏州","王仲舒"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宝带桥是唐元和十一年（816）建于苏州葑门外六里的多孔石拱桥。赵农 2009 册在桥梁一节用两段记它：前段记建桥年代、地点、桥型与得名由来，后段记长度、孔数、桥两端与桥中央的尺度、最大跨度、泄水能力、拱石做法与整体形态。因刺史王仲舒捐赠宝带资助而得名，但来源只说他是资助者，没有说他是设计者。来源未给建桥起讫、设计者姓名、桥基做法与历代重修记录。","path":"works/baodai-qiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宝带桥是 B 维度下唐代多孔石拱桥的形制与施工样本；王仲舒以刺史身份捐资属 D 维度的制度与赞助关系。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:baolian-zaojing","title":"宝莲藻井（Lotus Caisson Ceiling at Binyang Cave）","name_en":"Lotus Caisson Ceiling at Binyang Cave","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","龙门石窟","宾阳洞","藻井","莲花纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cave_ceiling","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"洛阳龙门宾阳洞窟室装饰。原文在“石刻与纹饰设计”一节把北朝石窟造像与南朝陵墓石雕并论之后，特别提出与建筑浑然一体的浮雕纹饰设计，其中藻绘边饰以莲花、卷草纹样最为出色，举例即宾阳洞：窟顶中部藻井为一重瓣莲花，围绕流苏构成莲花宝盖。图5-29 图注作“魏晋南北朝 宝莲藻井”。","path":"works/baolian-zaojing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度北朝石窟装饰的器物锚点，材料为正文一句加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:baoxie-road","title":"褒斜道（Baoxie Road）","name_en":"Baoxie Road","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","战国","秦国","栈道","秦岭"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"road","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"褒斜道是秦惠王时修筑的秦岭山地道路，利用山谷地形把北麓陕西眉县斜水谷与南麓褒水谷打通，全长200余公里。来源记栈道在河谷岩壁凿孔、嵌方木，分上中下三层；并引《史记·货殖列传》说明其在关中入蜀交通中的绾毂地位。来源未给道路宽度、现存遗迹、施工年代细目与工程主持人。","path":"works/baoxie-road.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"褒斜道是 B 维度下战国秦代山地道路的条目，来源给修筑、路线、石孔做法、文献与军事用途。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:beihai","title":"北海（Beihai Park）","name_en":"Beihai Park","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","皇家园林","北京","西苑","琼华岛"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"imperial_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北海是北京西苑三海之一，赵农将其列为明清皇家园林的代表。来源记明代朱棣修紫禁城时保留元大都太液池、开挖南海，将三海合称西苑；乾隆时期在三海周围广置屋舍亭台楼阁，西苑因此具江南园林风光。北海本体的营造集中在琼华岛：乾隆时岛上修筑大量楼、廊、殿、馆，岛北面的海边建长廊；东岸濠濮间、画舫斋与北岸静心斋并称园林雅制，濠濮间借《庄子·秋水》濠梁之辩立意。来源未给建园年代、面积、工程主持与各景点的尺度。","path":"works/beihai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"北海是 B 维度下清代皇家园林的器物条目；其皇家营建制度与西苑沿革兼及 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:beijing-olympic-poster-2008","title":"2008年北京奥运会海报（Poster for the 2008 Beijing Olympic Games）","name_en":"Poster for the 2008 Beijing Olympic Games","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["2008","北京奥运会","海报","广告设计"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"poster","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2008年北京奥运会海报，图11-44 图注作“新中国 2008 北京奥运会海报”。本条可用的材料只有这一行图注：原文在“广告设计信息语意传达”一段末以（图11-44）回指，但该段讲的是广告设计信息语意传达的一般过程与要素，未描述海报本身。原文未记设计者、尺寸、印制数量与系列构成。","path":"works/beijing-olympic-poster-2008.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度当代海报设计的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:beijing-zijincheng","title":"北京紫禁城（The Forbidden City in Beijing）","name_en":"The Forbidden City in Beijing","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明清","北京","紫禁城","宫殿","明史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palace_complex","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明清北京紫禁城，图9-35、9-36 所附为明故宫城址与皇城复原模型。原文以《明史·地理志》《明太祖实录》《明史·舆服志》引文梳理营建过程：洪武元年（1368）以应天府为南京而建都；吴元年（1367）新内城，正殿奉天殿，前为奉天门，后为华盖殿、谨身殿，左右文楼武楼，谨身殿之后为宫，前乾清宫、后坤宁宫；洪武八年改建大内宫殿，十年告成；永乐元年（1403）建北京于顺天府称行在，四年建成北京宫殿并修城垣","path":"works/beijing-zijincheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明清宫殿建筑的器物锚点，材料为夏燕靖 2016 册《明史》等引文与赵农 2009 册布局描述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:beiwei-muban-qihua","title":"北魏木板漆画（Northern Wei Painted Wooden Panel）","name_en":"Northern Wei Painted Wooden Panel","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北魏","大同","石家寨村","木板漆画","屏风"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北魏木板漆画是1966年在大同东南郊石家寨村北魏墓发现的木板漆画，来源推测可能是一座屏风的装饰。木板以榫卯连接，板面涂红漆，上用黑色线条描绘人物故事；人物面部与服饰涂白、黄、绿、橙、蓝等色漆；画面有文字题记与榜题说明人物身份和故事内容，题材为帝王将相、高士、孝子、烈女之类。来源称其既反映六朝漆工艺水平，也具体反映当时的服饰与家具面貌。","path":"works/beiwei-muban-qihua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"北魏木板漆画是 C 维度下北魏漆绘图像的器物条目，其木板榫卯、髹漆与屏风形制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:beiyang-jiqiju-biaozhi","title":"北洋机器局标志（Beiyang Machinery Bureau Emblem）","name_en":"Beiyang Machinery Bureau Emblem","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","标志","北洋机器局","机构标识"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"logo","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北洋机器局标志，图10-2 图注作“民国 北洋机器局标志”。原文在“近现代史上的设计更新”一章开篇以（图10-1、10-2）统摄两图，正文只述近代工业与商业美术的转折，未描述标志本身。图注标“民国”，而北洋机器局为清末机构，图注年代与机构名称所指的时段需按原书核对。","path":"works/beiyang-jiqiju-biaozhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度近代机构标志的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:beizhen-huanghe-daqiao","title":"山东北镇黄河大桥（Beizhen Yellow River Bridge）","name_en":"Beizhen Yellow River Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","桥梁","山东北镇黄河大桥"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山东北镇黄河大桥是赵农所列黄河上陆续架起的大桥之一，于 1971 年建成。来源只给桥名、年份与所在河流，未给桥长、跨度、材质、设计者与桥址。","path":"works/beizhen-huanghe-daqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"山东北镇黄河大桥是 B 维度下现代黄河桥梁的条目；其现代桥梁技术背景属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:bishu-shanzhuang","title":"避暑山庄（Chengde Mountain Resort）","name_en":"Chengde Mountain Resort","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","皇家园林","承德","热河行宫","七十二景"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"imperial_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"避暑山庄是河北承德的清代皇家宫苑，又称热河行宫。赵农记其经康熙、乾隆连续修建，成为中国古代最大的皇家宫苑；地处燕山深处，是秋季行猎之地，也是帝王后妃避暑的离宫。山庄分宫殿区与风景区：宫殿区在南部，有澹泊敬诚、烟波致爽、万壑松风等殿，多为皇帝理政读书之处；风景区又分湖泊、平原、山地三部分，有 72 景之说，湖泊区有小金山、水心榭、如意洲、烟雨楼，平原区有蒙古包、鹿群、万树园、文津阁、永佑寺，山地区有","path":"works/bishu-shanzhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"避暑山庄是 B 维度下清代最大皇家宫苑的器物条目；其行宫制度与理政功能兼及 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:bronze-ewer","title":"宋代铜执壶（Song Bronze Ewer）","name_en":"Song Bronze Ewer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","铜器","执壶","山西襄汾","葫芦宝顶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_ewer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋代日用铜器。原文在“1）铜器工艺”一节先总述宋代的日用品铜器多为杯、盘、罐、壶、盒、炉之类，出土较有代表性的有杭州老和山宋墓、长沙宋墓、苏州虎丘云岩寺塔、山西忻县宋墓，以及1975年在山西襄汾县赵康镇东汾阳村陶罐内埋藏的几件铜器，特点表现出质朴的风格。随后举两件为例：其一是这把铜执壶，鼓肩收颈，细长的流插入成八棱的流座，把手精巧，与盖用活扣相连，壶的造型和瓷器执壶有共同之处，盖钮作葫芦宝顶形也和","path":"works/bronze-ewer.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代铜器的器物锚点，材料为正文一段形制描述加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:bronze-owl-zun","title":"铜鸮尊（Bronze Owl-Shaped Zun）","name_en":"Bronze Owl-Shaped Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["妇好墓","殷墟","青铜酒器","鸮形","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜鸮尊见于本册对殷墟妇好墓青铜器的评述：妇好墓出土 4 件以鸟兽浮雕和圆雕为主要装饰的酒器——铜鸮尊、偶方彝、圈足觥，标志着青铜工艺与设计达到新高峰。同段括注图为 2-6、2-7、2-8。原文未单列形制描述。","path":"works/bronze-owl-zun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度商代鸟兽形青铜酒器的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:budala-gong","title":"布达拉宫（Potala Palace）","name_en":"Potala Palace","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西藏","宫堡式建筑","藏族建筑","清代","政教合一"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palace_complex","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"布达拉宫在拉萨玛布日山（红山）上，是宫堡式建筑群。三册的用法很不对称：**夏燕靖两版给规模数字**（999 间、占地 41 万平方米、建筑面积 13 万平方米、主楼 13 层 115 米），**赵农给历史层累与形制构成**（原建、被毁、清初重建，白宫红宫，碉楼与住宅的融合），两者**在高度与结构表述上并不一致**。高丰一册只在唐代铜镜一节提到布达拉宫壁画中的“金城公主照容图”，是铜镜史证据而非建筑","path":"works/budala-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"布达拉宫是 B 维度下宫堡式建筑群的形制样本：碉楼与住宅形式的融合、白宫红宫的分区、石木与土木石两种结构表述都在此汇合。宫顶镏金铜瓦与金顶归 C 维度；五世达赖受册封后重建与政教合一中心地位归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:buniantu","title":"《步辇图》（Emperor Taizong Receiving the Tibetan Envoy）","name_en":"Emperor Taizong Receiving the Tibetan Envoy","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","阎立本","舆服","幞头袍衫","品色衣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代阎立本画作，图6-22。原文两处引用：男服“品色衣”段记唐代官员袍衫主要是以颜色来区别等级，据《旧唐书·舆服志》列出贞观四年（630）与高宗上元元年（674）两套规定，随后以《步辇图》为证——画中描绘吐蕃丞相禄东赞晋见唐太宗李世民的故事，汉族男子（包括太宗）都着幞头袍衫，只以颜色为别，可佐证上述记载。女服段又把《步辇图》与张萱《捣练图》、周昉《簪花仕女图》、顾闳中《韩熙载夜宴图》并列，说明可以","path":"works/buniantu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代服饰制度的图像锚点，材料为正文两处引用加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:caihou-ding","title":"蔡侯鼎（Cai Hou Ding）","name_en":"Cai Hou Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋","蔡侯","青铜鼎","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蔡侯鼎是田自秉册插图1所记的春秋青铜鼎。来源只有图注“蔡侯鼎(春秋)”，未述其形制、尺寸、铭文、出土墓与藏地；图注置于鼎的形制演变段之后，但不能据此把该段所述形制归到蔡侯鼎。","path":"works/caihou-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蔡侯鼎是 B 维度下春秋青铜鼎的作品条目，仅有图注层证据。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:caihui-fengniao-shuanglian-qi-jiubei","title":"彩绘凤鸟双联漆酒杯（Painted Double-Linked Phoenix Lacquer Cup）","name_en":"Painted Double-Linked Phoenix Lacquer Cup","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","包山楚墓","漆器","酒杯","合卺杯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彩绘凤鸟双联漆酒杯是湖北荆门市包山二号战国楚墓出土的漆酒杯，通高 9.2 厘米、通长 17.6 厘米。整器以竹木结合雕制，造型为一只凤鸟背负两个相连的大杯，杯径 7 厘米；杯为竹壁木底，近杯底处用一根竹管将两杯联通。高丰把它与规范化的耳杯对举，称其为“极具个性、极富创意”的作品，并推测其功能是古代婚礼上新婚夫妇喝交杯酒的合卺杯。\n\n来源给出的尺寸、结构与装饰均较完整，但未给胎厚、容量与收藏单位；图","path":"works/caihui-fengniao-shuanglian-qi-jiubei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"彩绘凤鸟双联漆酒杯是 B 维度下战国漆器器物的条目，其合卺功能的推断另涉 A 维度（婚俗与礼制）。包山楚墓的墓葬材料留在 places/ 下相应条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:caihui-lugu","title":"彩绘鹿鼓（Painted Deer Drum）","name_en":"Painted Deer Drum","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","江陵拍马山","漆器","鹿形","小鼓"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彩绘鹿鼓是1972年江陵拍马山楚墓出土的战国漆器，共二件。鹿高28厘米、身长33厘米，作伏卧状、头侧视；鹿背用凹凸榫安置一面小鼓，鼓径1.4厘米；黑漆鹿身饰朱、黄色漆斑纹，鼓面饰卷云纹。来源未给藏地、墓号与木质。","path":"works/caihui-lugu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"彩绘鹿鼓是 B 维度下战国楚国漆器的作品条目；其鹿形与卷云纹漆饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:caihui-niaoshou-yuwen-qi-ge","title":"彩绘鸟兽鱼纹漆槅（Painted Lacquer Tray with Birds, Beasts and Fish）","name_en":"Painted Lacquer Tray with Birds, Beasts and Fish","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["三国","东吴","漆器","朱然墓","七格"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彩绘鸟兽鱼纹漆槅是安徽马鞍山东吴朱然墓出土的漆器。高丰记其以木、竹胎成型，侧面绘蔓草纹和放鹰图；槅内分为七格，在朱漆底上分别绘出天鹿、凤鸟、神鱼、麒麟、蜚蠊、双鱼、白虎，纹样生动，色彩华丽。来源把朱然墓的 60 多件漆器作为东汉以后漆器低潮期中的实用漆器例证，并指出其纹饰以各种人物故事画为主。","path":"works/caihui-niaoshou-yuwen-qi-ge.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"彩绘鸟兽鱼纹漆槅是 B 维度下三国东吴漆器的器物条目，其分区彩绘与叙事图像属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:caihui-taocanglou","title":"彩绘陶仓楼（Painted Pottery Granary Tower）","name_en":"Painted Pottery Granary Tower","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","陶仓楼","建筑明器","斗拱","河南省博物院"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_model","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彩绘陶仓楼是东汉陶制建筑明器，高 78.2cm。设计成悬山式二层楼，有平台栏杆，檐下有枋和五朵斗拱；窗下饰人物形象，底层墙面绘乐舞图。出土地点、陶质与施彩细节未载，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/caihui-taocanglou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度东汉建筑明器的单器条目，悬山、斗拱与彩绘装饰的视觉形制属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:cailian-huaxiangzhuan","title":"采莲画象砖（Pictorial Brick of Lotus Gathering）","name_en":"Pictorial Brick of Lotus Gathering","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","德阳","黄浒镇","画象砖","采莲"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_brick","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"采莲画象砖是四川德阳黄浒镇出土的汉代方形画象砖，画面为宽广莲塘，荷叶点点，水鸭游动，采莲船上一人在船尾采莲，远处有山树飞鸟。来源称其既是劳动图也是风景画，并分析远山分割与人物偏右形成的均衡节奏。","path":"works/cailian-huaxiangzhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"采莲画象砖是 C 维度下汉代画象砖的器物条目；砖的模印与烧制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:caiqi-mudiao-dongwu-zuoping","title":"彩漆木雕动物座屏（Painted Lacquered Animal Screen）","name_en":"Painted Lacquered Animal Screen","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","江陵望山","透雕","楚漆器","50余动物"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_furniture","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彩漆木雕动物座屏是江陵望山出土的战国漆器，透雕和浮雕有蛇、鹿、凤、雀、蛙等 50 余个形态逼真的动物形象，周身以黑漆为底，彩绘朱红、金银、灰绿等漆色。它被用作战国漆器种类繁多、纹饰精细、色彩艳丽的代表，也是楚国髹漆业高超水平的例证。\n\n田自秉 2010 册作“彩绘漆座屏”，给出高 15 厘米、长 51.8 厘米与动物 51 只的数目，并记 1978 年天星观墓发现一件近似的漆屏座。其工艺作“镂空”","path":"works/caiqi-mudiao-dongwu-zuoping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下战国楚国漆器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:caitao-tiaowen-hu","title":"彩陶条纹壶（Striped Painted Pottery Jar）","name_en":"Striped Painted Pottery Jar","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["仰韶文化","彩陶","图版著录","新石器时代"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painted_pottery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彩陶条纹壶在本册卷一出现于图版，图注为“1-10. 仰韶文化 彩陶条纹壶”。正文在仰韶文化彩陶一节讨论彩陶的纹样母题与器形系列，但没有对这一件作单独描述：器形、尺寸、出土单位、收藏地、条纹的排列方式均未交代。","path":"works/caitao-tiaowen-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新石器彩陶的图版锚点，材料只有一行图注。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:caiwen-rentou-ping","title":"彩陶人头形瓶（Painted Pottery Human-Head Bottle）","name_en":"Painted Pottery Human-Head Bottle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时代","大地湾","人头形","象生器","彩陶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painted_pottery_bottle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"彩陶人头形瓶是甘肃秦安大地湾出土的象生彩陶瓶。李立新记其只在口径部以象生形作表现，其他部位完全是几何化的，用以说明象生器与几何器之间的区别与联系。来源未给尺寸、年代与文化归属细节，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/caiwen-rentou-ping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度象生彩陶的单器条目，人头形口部与几何化器身的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:canglangting","title":"沧浪亭（Canglang Pavilion）","name_en":"Canglang Pavilion","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","园林","沧浪亭","苏舜钦","苏州"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"沧浪亭是北宋诗人苏舜钦在苏州营造的别墅园林。赵农记其立意深远、造型古朴；苏舜钦《沧浪亭记》有“形骸既适，则神不烦；观听无邪，则道以明”的议论，反映了宋人造园的哲学意识；沧浪亭后历经元明清复修，保留至今，波光粼粼，古风幽远。来源未给园址、面积、建筑清单与历次修葺年代。","path":"works/canglangting.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"沧浪亭是 B 维度下北宋苏州私家园林的条目；其记文与造园观念归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chan-guo-shan-bei","title":"禅国山碑（Changuo Shan Bei (Stele of Mount Changuo)）","name_en":"Changuo Shan Bei (Stele of Mount Changuo)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","东吴","碑刻","篆书","隶意"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"禅国山碑是东吴碑刻。来源在记《天发神谶碑》之后，以「同时期」系之，称其以篆书中寓隶意、浑厚苍雄（L3452）。来源未给具体年份、形制、尺寸、字数、书丹者与现存地点。来源无对应图题，图版未核，本条不据图补写，也不补碑文内容与立碑缘起。","path":"works/chan-guo-shan-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度东吴碑刻的条目，来源仅一句记其篆中寓隶的书风，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:changcheng-bigua","title":"长城壁挂（Great Wall Tapestry）","name_en":"Great Wall Tapestry","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","挂毯","长城","联合国","地毯"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tapestry","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"长城壁挂是新中国送给联合国的一幅巨型挂毯。来源在地毯段记我国地毯生产主要分布于北方和西北边疆，品种有踏毯、卧毯、挂毯，并用长城壁挂作为巨型挂毯的例证。来源未给尺寸、制作单位、设计者、完成年代与陈列地点。","path":"works/changcheng-bigua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度地毯类单件的条目，画面设计与对外交流属 C、E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:changfangdeng","title":"长方凳（Rectangular Stool）","name_en":"Rectangular Stool","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","黄花梨","家具","长方凳","中国建筑艺术史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"wooden_stool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"长方凳是明代黄花梨家具。长方形束腰，腿端向内兜转，线型富有弹性，实用、简洁、优美，在民间普遍使用。来源为图注，未给尺寸、出土地点与制作年代，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/changfangdeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代家具的单器条目，束腰与腿端线型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:changlegong-zhong","title":"长乐宫钟（Changle Palace Zhong）","name_en":"Changle Palace Zhong","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","满城汉墓","铜壶","鎏金","琉璃"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_wine_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"长乐宫钟是河北满城汉墓出土的西汉铜壶，因铭文得名。器身布满方格纹，方格上鎏金并嵌淡蓝色琉璃，金色与蓝色形成对比。来源把它与错金银鸟篆文壶并列为汉代铜壶定式的精美作品。","path":"works/changlegong-zhong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"长乐宫钟是 B 维度下西汉鎏金嵌琉璃铜壶的器物条目；方格与蓝金对比的装饰面向兼涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:changling-lengendian","title":"长陵棱恩殿（Leng'en Hall of Changling）","name_en":"Leng'en Hall of Changling","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","长陵","棱恩殿","金丝楠木","重檐庑殿顶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mausoleum_hall","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"长陵棱恩殿是明十三陵长陵的享殿。赵农记其为单层重檐庑殿顶，殿内有 32 根金丝楠木巨柱，最大的明柱直径 1.17 米、高 12 米；整个大殿宽 66.75 米、深 29.31 米，面积与紫禁城太和殿相近，为中国古代第二大殿。来源未给殿高、台基与始建重修年代。","path":"works/changling-lengendian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"长陵棱恩殿是 B 维度下明代陵寝殿宇的条目；陵寝制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:changxin-palace-lamp","title":"长信宫灯（Changxin Palace Lamp）","name_en":"Changxin Palace Lamp","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","青铜器","鎏金","环保设计","满城汉墓"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_lamp","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"长信宫灯是西汉青铜鎏金宫灯，1968 年出土于河北满城中山靖王刘胜之妻窦绾墓。五册来源都以它为中国古代灯具设计的代表作，强调其可拆卸清洗、可调节光照、以烟道净化烟气的结构设计。","path":"works/changxin-palace-lamp.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"长信宫灯是 B 维度下汉代青铜灯具结构与消烟设计的器物锚点，其整体造型的人物化处理也涉及 C 维度的形态表现问题。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chao-zhong-tong-fa","title":"朝钟同法（Same Method for Court Bells (Chao Zhong Tong Fa)）","name_en":"Same Method for Court Bells (Chao Zhong Tong Fa)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","天工开物","朝钟","铸造","插图"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_illustration","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"朝钟同法是《天工开物》的图3-3 图注。来源只在图注中记此名，正文未展开说明其工艺、钟制或与同段冶铸诸图的关系；图版未视觉核验。本条只登记图注，不据图补写。","path":"works/chao-zhong-tong-fa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下《天工开物》铸造插图的单件图注锚点，其图像表现属 C 维度；材料只有图注，故置信度低。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chaoyuan-tu","title":"《朝元图》（Chaoyuan Tu (Mural of the Assembly of Immortals)）","name_en":"Chaoyuan Tu (Mural of the Assembly of Immortals)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","壁画","永乐宫","道教","三清殿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mural","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《朝元图》是元代永乐宫三清殿的道教壁画。赵农记永乐宫位于山西永济，是元代著名道观；三清殿是永乐宫的重要建筑，为七间阔单檐四坡顶结构，因供奉玉清元始天尊、上清灵宝天尊、太清道德天尊而名为“三清殿”；三清殿四壁绘有著名壁画《朝元图》，由当时的洛阳民间画工马君祥父子等人参与绘制，以道教题材的绘画粉本为样式，绘画面积达 400 多平方米；壁画为工笔重彩、铁线勾勒、青绿彩绘，表现道教人物高古大气、生动富丽的","path":"works/chaoyuan-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《朝元图》是 C 维度下元代道教壁画的条目；壁画绘制工艺与建筑载体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chengde-waibamiao","title":"承德外八庙（Eight Outer Temples of Chengde）","name_en":"Eight Outer Temples of Chengde","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","承德","避暑山庄","蒙藏建筑","普陀宗乘之庙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"temple_complex","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"承德外八庙是清代康熙至乾隆时期在避暑山庄外修筑的寺庙建筑群。赵农记其包括溥仁寺、普乐寺、安远庙、普佑寺、普宁寺、须弥福寿之庙、普陀宗乘之庙、殊像寺八座；寺院采用蒙藏建筑风格，作为接待蒙藏贵族拜谒清朝皇帝的行宫；普乐寺旭光阁仿北京天坛祈年殿，高 21 米、直径 24 米；普陀宗乘之庙仿西藏布达拉宫，是外八庙中最大的一座，俗称“小布达拉宫”。来源未给各庙营建年代、占地与僧侣人数。","path":"works/chengde-waibamiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"承德外八庙是 B 维度下清代寺庙建筑群的条目；其蒙藏接待与政治功能归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chenghua-jigang-cup","title":"成化斗彩鸡缸杯（Chenghua Doucai Chicken Cup）","name_en":"Chenghua Doucai Chicken Cup","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","成化","斗彩","鸡缸杯","子母鸡"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_cup","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"成化斗彩鸡缸杯是明代成化时期以子母鸡为装饰题材的小型酒杯。来源记成化鸡纹酒杯又称鸡缸杯，纹样表现母鸡带领小鸡觅食、玩耍，造型小巧玲珑，制作精致，为人们珍爱；并引《陶说》《饮流斋说瓷》的评语，称鸡缸杯为成化精品。来源未给尺寸、窑口、款识、藏地与图版。","path":"works/chenghua-jigang-cup.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代成化斗彩单器的锚点，子母鸡纹样与平涂装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chengjisihan-ling","title":"成吉思汗陵（Mausoleum of Genghis Khan）","name_en":"Mausoleum of Genghis Khan","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","内蒙古","纪念建筑","成吉思汗陵","区域建筑水平"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"memorial_building","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"内蒙古成吉思汗陵是赵农在第十章第二节末尾与重庆人民大会堂并列提及的建筑，被视为不同区域建筑水平的标志。来源只给这一句判断，未给建成年代、形制、尺度、设计者与祭祀功能。","path":"works/chengjisihan-ling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"成吉思汗陵是 B 维度下内蒙古纪念建筑的条目；来源只作区域建筑水平的判断，未给制度、机构或祭祀材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chengkun-tielu","title":"《成昆铁路》象牙雕刻（Ivory Carving 'Chengdu-Kunming Railway'）","name_en":"Ivory Carving 'Chengdu-Kunming Railway","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1974","象牙雕刻","成昆铁路","联合国","国家礼品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ivory_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1974年制作的大型象牙雕刻《成昆铁路》。原文记 1974年5月由国务院下达设计和生产任务，制作大型艺术壁毯《长城》和大型象牙雕刻《成昆铁路》（高1.10米、长1.50米），作为国家礼品赠送联合国总部。原文未给该牙雕的图版（图11-32 图注只标壁毯），也未记设计者与制作单位。","path":"works/chengkun-tielu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国牙雕工艺的器物锚点，材料为正文一句。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chongning-tongbao","title":"崇宁通宝（Chongning Tongbao Coin）","name_en":"Chongning Tongbao Coin","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","货币","崇宁通宝","宋徽宗","瘦金体"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"coin","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"崇宁通宝是北宋崇宁年间的年号钱。赵农记“宋徽宗亲自书写年号的‘崇宁通宝’、‘大观通宝’，采用瘦金体书，铸造精致，是宋代钱币中的珍品”。来源把崇宁通宝与大观通宝并提，未分别给钱径、重量、铸量与钱监；本条只记来源对崇宁通宝的书体与铸造评价。","path":"works/chongning-tongbao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"崇宁通宝是 C 维度下北宋年号钱书体设计的条目；其铸造归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chongping-huiqi-tu","title":"重屏会棋图（Playing Chess Behind Screens）","name_en":"Playing Chess Behind Screens","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["五代","周文矩","重屏会棋图","人物画","屏风"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《重屏会棋图》是五代周文矩的人物画。赵农记它与顾闳中《韩熙载夜宴图》一同描绘了五代时期士大夫的社会生活景象。来源把此图作为五代人物画的代表作，未给材质、尺寸、画面人物、屏风重数与递藏；图7-62为局部图版，未核。","path":"works/chongping-huiqi-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《重屏会棋图》是 C 维度下五代人物画的条目；屏风家具的可能关联归 B 维度，但来源未作说明。材料仅一句，confidence 取 low。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chongqing-renmin-dahuitang","title":"重庆人民大会堂（Chongqing People's Great Hall）","name_en":"Chongqing People's Great Hall","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","重庆","公共建筑","人民大会堂","区域建筑水平"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"public_building","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"重庆人民大会堂是赵农在第十章第二节末尾与内蒙古成吉思汗陵并列提及的建筑，被视为不同区域建筑水平的标志。来源只给这一句判断，未给建成年代、形制、尺度、设计者与功能。与北京人民大会堂（`works/renmin-dahuitang-1959.md`）为不同建筑，不合并。","path":"works/chongqing-renmin-dahuitang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"重庆人民大会堂是 B 维度下重庆大型公共建筑的条目；来源只作区域建筑水平的判断，未给制度、机构或教育材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chongsheng-si-qianxun-ta","title":"崇圣寺千寻塔（Qianxun Pagoda of Chongsheng Temple）","name_en":"Qianxun Pagoda of Chongsheng Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","佛塔","密檐式","大理","崇圣寺"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"崇圣寺千寻塔在云南大理崇圣寺，是唐代密檐式塔。赵农 2009 册在寺塔一节记它两层：L4303 给地点、塔型与层数，L4309 给高度与外观评价，两行之间隔着图版与页眉，不是连续的一行文字。来源未给建塔具体年份、平面形制、塔刹、设计者与工匠。材料两行且被图版隔断，仅能立目。","path":"works/chongsheng-si-qianxun-ta.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"崇圣寺千寻塔是 B 维度下西南地区唐代密檐式塔的形制样本，材料两行且被图版隔断，未涉制度与人物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chu-boshu","title":"楚帛书（Chu Silk Manuscript）","name_en":"Chu Silk Manuscript","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","楚墓","帛书","长沙","子弹库"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"manuscript","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"楚帛书是 1942 年长沙东郊楚墓出土的战国帛书，纵约 38 厘米、横约 45 厘米，上有墨书文字 900 多个，内容记古史传说及对天神的崇拜。版面中心安排两篇一多一少、一正一反、顺序颠倒的文字，两篇之间留白；四周环绕树木、三头人、兽首人身像等图形与文字，用青、棕、红色绘成。高丰称其为“目前所见到的最早的保存较为完整的帛书实物”，并评为“精彩生动的古代早期平面设计佳作”。李立新 2011 把长沙子","path":"works/chu-boshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"楚帛书是 C 维度下战国帛书的图文编排条目，其缣帛载体与书写材料属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chuanxing-caitao-hu","title":"船形彩陶壶（Boat-Shaped Painted Pottery Jar）","name_en":"Boat-Shaped Painted Pottery Jar","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["半坡型","彩陶","菱形壶","船形壶","船形彩陶壶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"船形彩陶壶是半坡型彩陶中的菱形壶，壶体两头尖，形如菱角，正中有口，口两边器体上各有一耳，造型别致灵巧。田自秉以插图 5 著录，称其为一件优美的工艺品。来源未给尺寸、出土地点、藏地与年代。","path":"works/chuanxing-caitao-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"船形彩陶壶是 B 维度下半坡型彩陶壶的作品条目；其仿船造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chui-mao-tu","title":"锤锚图（Illustration of Forging an Anchor）","name_en":"Illustration of Forging an Anchor","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","天工开物","锤锻","锚","插图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_illustration","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"锤锚图是《天工开物》所载锤锚场面插图，图3-5。李立新记锤锚一图集合十五人之多，上下协调，同时操作，劳动强度极大，用以说明造物生产的密集型特点。来源只给图注与正文描述，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/chui-mao-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下《天工开物》锤锻插图的单件锚点，其图像表现属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:chunhua-yuanbao","title":"淳化元宝（Chunhua Yuanbao Coin）","name_en":"Chunhua Yuanbao Coin","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","货币","淳化元宝","宋太宗","对钱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"coin","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"淳化元宝是北宋淳化年间的年号钱。赵农在对钱段记“宋太宗书写的‘淳化元宝’，有行书、草书、楷书几种字样”，用来说明对钱书体不同而形制相同的做法。来源只给钱文书者、书体种类与对钱属性，未给钱径、重量、铸量、钱监与存世状况。","path":"works/chunhua-yuanbao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"淳化元宝是 C 维度下北宋年号钱书体设计的条目；其铸造归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:cimu-touzhu-tu","title":"慈母投杼图（Picture of a Mother Throwing the Shuttle）","name_en":"Picture of a Mother Throwing the Shuttle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","画像石","斜织机","踏板","纺织技术"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_relief","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《慈母投杼图》是本册论证脚踏提综斜织机普及的画像石证据。原文称在江苏泗洪曹庄出土的汉代画像石上刻有《慈母投杼图》，图上就有脚踏提综斜织机的机型，图中的织工用脚踏一长一短两块踏板（杆）分别带动综线；并据史籍记载，从战国开始直至秦汉之际，这种织机在我国黄河流域的广大地区已经比较普遍地使用。","path":"works/cimu-touzhu-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度汉代纺织机械的图像锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:cixi-zhuanyongche","title":"慈禧太后专用车（Empress Dowager Cixi's automobile）","name_en":"Empress Dowager Cixi's automobile","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晚清","1902","汽车","进口","慈禧太后"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"automobile","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"慈禧太后专用车是 1902 年进口的汽车。赵农称中国汽车的出现以该车为标志，并记 1949 年以前中国汽车主要是政府用车。来源未给车型、制造国、制造厂、功率、车身结构与现存状态。","path":"works/cixi-zhuanyongche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"慈禧太后专用车是 B 维度下晚清进口汽车的作品条目；其西器东传的现代性意义属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:cuan-bao-zi-bei","title":"爨宝子碑（Cuan Baozi Bei (Stele of Cuan Baozi)）","name_en":"Cuan Baozi Bei (Stele of Cuan Baozi)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","东晋","碑刻","方笔","汉制"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"爨宝子碑是东晋碑刻。来源在记东晋禁碑、墓志盛行的段落中，称此碑仿汉制而立，以方笔运行，字体错落笨拙而古朴凝重、寓静于动（L3454）。来源未给具体年份、形制、尺寸、字数、书丹者与现存地点。来源无对应图题，图版未核，本条不据图补写。","path":"works/cuan-bao-zi-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度东晋碑刻的条目，来源记其仿汉制而立与方笔、错落的书风，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:cuan-long-yan-bei","title":"爨龙颜碑（Cuan Longyan Bei (Stele of Cuan Longyan)）","name_en":"Cuan Longyan Bei (Stele of Cuan Longyan)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","南朝宋","碑刻","楷书"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"爨龙颜碑是南朝宋碑刻。来源在“南朝碑刻开始出现，以楷书文字风格刻碑”的叙述中举此碑，称其生动雄强、姿态奇逸（L3463）。来源未给具体年份、形制、尺寸、字数、书丹者与现存地点。来源无对应图题，图版未核，本条不据图补写。","path":"works/cuan-long-yan-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度南朝宋碑刻的条目，来源以之为南朝楷书刻碑之例并评其书风，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:cuo-jinyi-longfenglu-fangan","title":"错金银龙凤鹿方案（Gold- and Silver-Inlaid Dragon-Phoenix-Deer Stand）","name_en":"Gold- and Silver-Inlaid Dragon-Phoenix-Deer Stand","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","青铜器","家具","错金银","中山国"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_furniture","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"错金银龙凤鹿方案是战国中山王墓出土的青铜方案（案面为漆木，已朽），以四只卧鹿为足、四条有翼飞龙蟠曲成镂空球状、龙体空隙处各出一凤、每龙头顶一斗拱形饰件承托案框。四册对**结构**的描述高度一致，几乎可以逐句对应；分歧集中在三处：**出土年份**（1977／1997）、**尺寸**（长 47.5×高 36.2 与高 37.4×长宽 48 两套数字）、**案面材质**（高丰作“以青铜材料为主”而“可镶","path":"works/cuo-jinyi-longfenglu-fangan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"错金银龙凤鹿方案是 B 维度下战国青铜家具的结构锚点：以鹿为足、龙凤盘绕成镂空球、龙头承斗拱托案框，四册对结构的描述高度一致。其错金银工艺与造型装饰归 C；以斗拱承案框所反映的建筑与家具关系归 D（制度与技术传承）为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:cuojin-boshanlu","title":"错金博山炉（Gold-Inlaid Boshan Censer）","name_en":"Gold-Inlaid Boshan Censer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","满城汉墓","错金","博山","云气纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_censer","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"错金博山炉是河北满城汉墓（西汉中山靖王墓）出土的铜薰炉，炉柄镂空，炉体饰错金云气纹，造型庄重饱满、线条优美，是汉代博山炉的典型作品。李立新将其作为帝王贵族奢侈性造物消费的例证。","path":"works/cuojin-boshanlu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西汉铜薰炉的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:cuojin-yin-niaozhuanwen-hu","title":"错金银鸟篆文壶（Gold- and Silver-Inlaid Bird-Script Hu）","name_en":"Gold- and Silver-Inlaid Bird-Script Hu","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","满城汉墓","错金银","鸟虫书","铜壶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_wine_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"错金银鸟篆文壶是河北满城汉墓出土的西汉铜壶，遍体布满纤细流畅的鸟虫文字。来源录铭文“心佳都卍，盛兄盛味”“口味充闾，益肤延寿”，并称其反映既要物质享受又求健康长寿的欲望。","path":"works/cuojin-yin-niaozhuanwen-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"错金银鸟篆文壶是 B 维度下西汉错金银铜壶的器物条目；鸟虫书的字形与排版面向归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:da-ke-ding","title":"大克鼎（Da Ke Ding）","name_en":"Da Ke Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","青铜鼎","兽蹄足","半球腹","毛公鼎"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_ding","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大克鼎是西周青铜鼎。2016 记其为西周后期鼎耳渐外移、口渐敞、下腹内收使器身成半球形、足成兽蹄形的代表器之一，与毛公鼎并举；田自秉仅以“插图 1 大克鼎（周）”图注形式收录，作为西周鼎形演变的示例。","path":"works/da-ke-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西周青铜鼎的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:da-nao-hua-shi","title":"《大闹画室》（Uproar in the Studio）","name_en":"Uproar in the Studio","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1926","万氏兄弟","动画","中国动画学派","默片"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"animation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1926年万氏兄弟绘制的动画片。原文在“我国动画影片的发展历史”知识链接中把我国动画影片分为6个发展时期：1922-1945年为萌芽和探索时期，以万籁鸣、万古蟾、万超尘为代表的我国第一代动画人，成为我国动画影片的开山鼻祖，万氏兄弟于1926年绘制动画片《大闹画室》为这一时期的代表作品。原文未记片长、出品机构、放映情况与图版。","path":"works/da-nao-hua-shi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度中国早期动画的影片锚点，材料为正文一段。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:da-nao-tian-gong","title":"《大闹天宫》（Uproar in Heaven）","name_en":"Uproar in Heaven","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1960年代","上海美术电影制片厂","动画","中国动画学派","经典作品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"animation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"动画长片《大闹天宫》（上、下集），图11-43 图注作“动画片《大闹天宫》”。原文记 1957-1965年是我国动画片第一个繁荣时期，1957年上海美术电影制片厂建立，拍摄了不少动画影片在国际电影节上获奖，成为被世界公认的“中国动画学派”，这一时期生产出的《大闹天宫》（上、下集）成为经典作品。原文未记完成年份、片长、主创名单与获奖明细。","path":"works/da-nao-tian-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度中国动画繁荣期的影片锚点，材料为正文一句加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:da-yu-ding","title":"大盂鼎（Da Yu Ding）","name_en":"Da Yu Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周早期","青铜器","康王","铭文","金文"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大盂鼎是西周康王时期铸作的有铭铜鼎，清道光年间出土于陕西郿县礼村，今陈列于中国历史博物馆。四册来源分工清楚：田自秉一册给出制作年代、出土、收藏、铭文结构与赏赐奴隶数；赵农两处以它为金文范本，给字数与文献价值，另有一处器影；夏燕靖两版只把它当作西周中期后鼎腹变浅、足跟外延这一形制趋势的代表器。**四册均未给尺寸、重量、纹饰与铸造方法**，铭文只给字数与大意，不录原文。来源之间另有一处时间张力：田自秉","path":"works/da-yu-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大盂鼎是 B 维度下西周早期有铭铜鼎的标本，四册对它的用法集中在两处：铭文（金文的字数、内容与文献价值，属 C 维度）与鼎形演变序列中的位置（属 B）。铭文所记“商亡由于百官沉溺于饮酒”“用德治为规范”涉及周初政治伦理，归 D 维度为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:da-yulong","title":"大玉龙（Large Jade Dragon）","name_en":"Large Jade Dragon","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["红山文化","新石器时代","玉器","C 型","大玉龙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_artifact","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大玉龙是红山文化玉器。田自秉记红山文化玉器多动物纹，有龙、虎、龟、鱼、鸟、蝉等，其中大玉龙最为精彩，呈 C 型，长 42.2 cm，系绿玉佩饰品；图版彩版 1。来源未给出土地点、年代测定、藏地与同出器物。","path":"works/da-yulong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大玉龙是 B 维度下红山文化玉器的作品条目；其 C 型造型与动物纹属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dabaoensi-liuli-ta","title":"大报恩寺琉璃塔（Porcelain Tower of Dabao'en Temple）","name_en":"Porcelain Tower of Dabao'en Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","南京","琉璃","佛塔","大报恩寺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明初南京大报恩寺九层琉璃塔，图9-29 为复原图。原文在琉璃烧造一节记明初在南京设琉璃窑72座，用于建造宫殿和大报恩寺九层琉璃塔，迁都北京后窑址移至门头沟琉璃渠村。知识链接“明大报恩寺”补充：永乐十年（1412）重建，寺址在南京中华门外东侧秦淮河畔长干里；寺内有殿阁20多座、画廊118处、经房38间；历时19年建造，耗银250万两，征调工役10多万人。塔为九层八面，高达78.2米，数十里外长江上也","path":"works/dabaoensi-liuli-ta.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代琉璃建筑的器物锚点，材料为正文一段、知识链接一段、另一节一句与图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dafu-gao","title":"素面青铜器大府镐（Plain Bronze Dafu Hao）","name_en":"Plain Bronze Dafu Hao","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","青铜器","素面","日用化","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"素面青铜器大府镐是见于李立新第一章图版的战国青铜器，图1-28 图题作“素面青铜器大府镐”。正文以素面青铜器与铜镜、带钩、铜灯并列，说明战国造物日用化的趋势，未给形制、尺寸、铭文与出土信息。图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/dafu-gao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度战国素面青铜器的单件图版条目，其日用化取向属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:daiyuegui","title":"《戴月归》彩锦绣（Colored Silk Embroidery 'Returning Under the Moon'）","name_en":"Colored Silk Embroidery 'Returning Under the Moon","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","彩锦绣","南通","刺绣","戴月归"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"江苏彩锦绣作品，图11-36 的图注为：11-36. 新中国 江苏彩锦绣《戴月归》。原文在列江苏工艺美术品种时提到南通彩锦绣（L5230，该段并引图11-11、11-12、11-13），未单述此作；另在 1978 年全国工艺美术展览一段末以（图11-36、11-37）回指（L5407）。两处均未记这件作品本身，尺寸、作者、制作年代与藏地皆缺。","path":"works/daiyuegui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国刺绣工艺的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dalong-youpiao","title":"大龙邮票（Large Dragon Stamp）","name_en":"Large Dragon Stamp","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","邮票","海关邮政","赫德","龙纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"postage_stamp","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大龙邮票是中国清代的第一张邮票，由外国人发行。赵农记 1858 年《中英南京条约》签订后，英国人赫德被清政府任命为海关总税务司；1878 年赫德开始在北京、天津、烟台、营口、上海办理邮政，并发行第一套大龙邮票；邮票正面有龙形，四周有“大清”、“CHINA”等字样。来源未给设计者、版别、面值、印制数量与齿孔。","path":"works/dalong-youpiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大龙邮票是 C 维度下清代邮票设计的条目；其海关邮政制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:daming-gong","title":"大明宫（Daming Palace）","name_en":"Daming Palace","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","长安","龙首原","含元殿","麟德殿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palace_complex","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大明宫是唐代长安城禁苑宫殿，位于城东北龙首原，原名永安宫，唐太宗时为太上皇李渊建造，高宗迁入执政。赵农记其原是太极宫的一处，后加修成大型宫殿，地处龙首原上，在唐高宗时加以扩建，成为后来唐朝历代帝王理朝和居住之处；含元殿为其前殿。2016 记遗址范围相当于北京故宫面积 3 倍多，由 30 多所宫殿组成，麟德殿面积约太和殿 3 倍、5000 多平方米、可宴 3500 人。","path":"works/daming-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代宫殿建筑的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:danba-zhitong-bei","title":"单把直筒杯（Single-Handled Cylindrical Cup）","name_en":"Single-Handled Cylindrical Cup","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["马厂型","彩陶","河西走廊","单把直筒杯","泥突"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"单把直筒杯是马厂型彩陶中流行于河西走廊的陶杯。田自秉记其下腹前方有一个泥突，把和器口相接的地方也有一个泥突，十分别致；图版插图 20、插图 21-④。来源未给尺寸、出土地点、藏地与年代。","path":"works/danba-zhitong-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"单把直筒杯是 B 维度下马厂型彩陶杯的作品条目；其泥突与单把造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:danke-heitao-gaojiaobei","title":"蛋壳黑陶高脚杯（Eggshell Black Pottery Stem Cup）","name_en":"Eggshell Black Pottery Stem Cup","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时代","龙山文化","黑陶","蛋壳陶","高脚杯"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蛋壳黑陶高脚杯是龙山文化的一件黑陶器，见于李立新第一章图版。来源在列举六大设计文化区域时，把黑陶、蛋壳陶与袋足列为以山东为中心的东方龙山文化设计区的主要设计特征，并以此图为例；图1-14 图题作“蛋壳黑陶高脚杯（龙山文化）”。来源未给尺寸、壁厚、出土地点、器形细目与收藏，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/danke-heitao-gaojiaobei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度龙山文化黑陶器的单器条目，杯形与高脚造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:daolian-tu","title":"《捣练图》（Court Ladies Preparing Newly Woven Silk）","name_en":"Court Ladies Preparing Newly Woven Silk","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","张萱","风俗画","捣练","披帛"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代张萱风俗画，图注作“6-6. 唐代 风俗画《捣练图》(张萱作)”。原文三处引用：印染业段记宫中亦有染坊，“著名的张萱《捣练图》中描绘的就是专业捣练的操作情景”；女服段把《捣练图》与《步辇图》《簪花仕女图》《韩熙载夜宴图》并列，说明可以间接看出唐300年来裙子的变化；披帛段记“《捣练图》《宫乐图》等绘画作品中女子肩上均有披帛”，陶俑、唐三彩、墓室壁画、石刻画也能见到众多披帛样式。","path":"works/daolian-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代织造与服饰的图像锚点，材料为图注一行加正文三处引用。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:daqing-yinbi","title":"大清银币（Daqing silver coin）","name_en":"Daqing silver coin","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晚清","宣统","银元","货币","大清银币"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"coin","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大清银币是清宣统年间铸造的银币。赵农把它放在光绪年间龙洋之后、铜币作为辅币的币制演变中叙述，未给具体年份、版别、重量、成色与设计者。","path":"works/daqing-yinbi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大清银币是 B 维度下晚清机制银币的作品条目；其币制改革属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dawankou-chong","title":"大碗口铳（Dawankou Chong (Large-Muzzle Bombard)）","name_en":"Dawankou Chong (Large-Muzzle Bombard)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","洪武","火炮","铁炮","大碗口铳"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"firearm","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大碗口铳是洪武年间的铁炮，赵农称其为现存最早的明代火炮，用以证明明代大炮从铜制到铁制的过程。来源未给铳身尺寸、口径、重量、出土地点与收藏单位。","path":"works/dawankou-chong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大碗口铳是 B 维度下明初铁炮实物的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dayan-ta-652","title":"大雁塔（Giant Wild Goose Pagoda）","name_en":"Giant Wild Goose Pagoda","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","佛塔","楼阁式砖塔","慈恩寺","玄奘"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大雁塔在西安大慈恩寺内，原名慈恩寺塔，唐永徽三年（652）为安置玄奘自印度带回的经籍而建。三册的用法分成两层：夏燕靖两版给**形制与尺寸**（初建五层土心、重建十层、武则天改为七层，塔基与塔身的分项尺度，明代包砖，两通褚遂良碑），赵农给**缘起与观感**（雁故事、玄奘生平、岑参诗、方形角锥与内部楼梯），另有图版两幅。**两版夏燕靖几乎逐字相同**，赵农与它们不冲突，但各给一部分细节，合起来才完整。","path":"works/dayan-ta-652.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"大雁塔是 B 维度下唐代楼阁式砖塔的形制与结构样本：塔基塔身的尺寸、砖砌扁柱与大斗、明代包砖都在此汇合。塔基座南侧褚遂良书两碑与石门楣线刻画归 C 维度；慈恩寺与玄奘译经、皇家追念母后的建塔缘起归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dayu-zhishui-yushan","title":"大禹治水图玉山（Jade Mountain of Yu Taming the Waters）","name_en":"Jade Mountain of Yu Taming the Waters","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","乾隆","玉雕","玉山","扬州"],"confidence":"high","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大禹治水图玉山是乾隆时期的一件巨型玉雕，故宫博物院藏品。它高 2.24 米、宽 0.96 米、重约 7 吨，前后花了 13 年才完成；青玉采自新疆和田的密勒塔山，经约三年运到北京，以清宫所藏《大禹开山图》为蓝本，由造办处制模型出坯后再运至南方，由扬州玉雕工人制作。来源另记画面内容、乾隆题诗与同类大型玉雕三件。","path":"works/dayu-zhishui-yushan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代巨型玉雕的单器条目，山水人物构图与题诗属 C 维度，造办处与扬州的分工及运输组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dayunhe","title":"大运河（Grand Canal）","name_en":"Grand Canal","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋代","五大水系","扬州","漕运","人工河流"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"waterway_engineering","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大运河是隋炀帝开凿的水利交通工程，将海河、黄河、淮河、长江、钱塘江五大水系连结起来，促进了南北文化经济的交流和发展，是世界上最长的一条人工河流。隋代大运河开通后，扬州成为长江和大运河的交通枢纽；2016 称其“为南北沟通与经济繁荣开创了新的局面”。","path":"works/dayunhe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下隋代水利工程的器物锚点，也涉及 D 维度的漕运制度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dazhi-chanshi-bei","title":"大智禅师碑（Stele of Chan Master Dazhi）","name_en":"Stele of Chan Master Dazhi","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","碑刻","石雕","牡丹","带状花边"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_stele","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大智禅师碑是西安碑林所藏唐碑，其碑侧花纹被来源称为唐代碑侧石雕最典型的作品。花纹用卷曲波折的牡丹构成带状花边，其间点缀凤凰、鸳鸯、狮子、仙佛等人物鸟兽图案，花叶繁茂、形态丰满；制作上仅用剔雕法刻出花纹以外的空地，又在花纹上用线刻表现轮廓转折，具有层次感。来源未给碑主法号、立碑年代、撰书人、碑高与图版细节。","path":"works/dazhi-chanshi-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代碑刻石雕的实例锚点，牡丹带状花边属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dazhongsi-bell","title":"大钟寺大钟（Dazhongsi Bell）","name_en":"Dazhongsi Bell","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","永乐","北京","大钟寺","铜钟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_bell","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"大钟寺大钟是北京西郊大钟寺所藏明代永乐年间铸造的铜钟。来源记其高6.75米、口径3.3米、重量44.6吨，是我国目前存在的一座最大的铜钟；从美术角度看并无特别出色引人之处，但足以反映当时冶铜工艺的庞大规模和技术成就。来源未给铸造工场、铜料配比、钟钮与钟身纹饰。","path":"works/dazhongsi-bell.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代大型铜钟的单器锚点，永乐官铸与冶铜规模属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dengfeng-guanxingtai","title":"登封观星台（Dengfeng Observatory）","name_en":"Dengfeng Observatory","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","天文","建筑","观星台","郭守敬"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"observatory","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"登封观星台是元代天文观测台。赵农记郭守敬与尼泊尔的阿尼哥合作，设计修建了元大都的司天台（观象台），创制了许多天文仪器，改进了浑仪、制造了仰仪；郭守敬改进了圭表，除加长表竿外，还设计了“景符”和“窥几”，使圭表准确度提高，并能在月光下观测，其圭表样式在河南登封观星台被保留下来，郭守敬曾亲自在此测验晷影。观星台以高台为表，观测台为四方形、下大上小，台高约 9.5 米，以台下的 36 块石板铺砌成圭面、","path":"works/dengfeng-guanxingtai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"登封观星台是 B 维度下元代天文观测建筑的条目；其国家修历与仪器研制归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:di-hou-li-fo-tu","title":"帝后礼佛图（Dihou Lifo Tu (Emperors and Empresses Worshipping the Buddha)）","name_en":"Dihou Lifo Tu (Emperors and Empresses Worshipping the Buddha)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北魏","浮雕","龙门石窟","宾阳中洞","佛教艺术"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_relief","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"帝后礼佛图是洛阳龙门石窟宾阳中洞的北魏浮雕，来源说它最能代表北魏时期的风格。来源对图本身的直接记述只有两句：利用浮雕效果表现帝后礼佛的场面，以及体现佛教文化与中原艺术的结合；同段其余文字讲的是宾阳中洞的营构、佛像与地面花饰。来源未记浮雕的尺寸、在洞中的位置、人物数目、残损与流转情况，本条不补。图 5-55 图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"works/di-hou-li-fo-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度北魏石窟浮雕的条目，题材的宗教图像属性列为 C 维度辅助；来源只给地位判断、题材手法与一句结论，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:diaojin-xiangyu-yin-daigou","title":"雕金镶玉银带钩（Gold-Carved Jade-Inlaid Silver Belt Hook）","name_en":"Gold-Carved Jade-Inlaid Silver Belt Hook","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","辉县固围村","带钩","包金镶嵌","蟠龙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"belt_hook","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"雕金镶玉银带钩是1953年河南辉县固围村出土的战国带钩。田自秉记其用包金镶嵌的方法制作，并浮雕蟠龙、鹦鹉等装饰，称其为一件精美的作品。同册另记带钩约始于春秋初期、广泛流行于战国至西汉。来源未给尺寸、重量、藏地、墓号与钩体全形。","path":"works/diaojin-xiangyu-yin-daigou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"雕金镶玉银带钩是 B 维度下战国带钩的作品条目；其包金镶嵌与蟠龙鹦鹉装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:diaoqi-shanbing","title":"雕漆扇柄（Carved Lacquer Fan Handle）","name_en":"Carved Lacquer Fan Handle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","雕漆","剔犀","团扇","金坛宋墓"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_fan_handle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"雕漆扇柄是 1975 年江苏镇江金坛宋墓出土团扇的扇柄。来源记其精巧处在于套在扇轴上，扇轴可在扇柄内转动，既不能上下移动也不会脱落；由漆工中的雕镂与脱胎两种工艺结合制造：扇轴一头做成橄榄形，刷脱离剂或用皮纸隔离，再上漆雕镂，完工后用热水溶化脱离剂或从雕孔取出皮纸，使扇轴既可固定又可转动。扇柄透雕三组云头如意纹饰，刻有君玉二字，雕刻斜面可见十多道红漆、每层又有黑漆间隔，来源判定为剔犀做法。来源未给扇","path":"works/diaoqi-shanbing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度南宋漆器与扇具的单件锚点，云头如意纹与君玉铭属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:diaoqi-small-box","title":"雕漆小盒（Carved-Lacquer Small Box）","name_en":"Carved-Lacquer Small Box","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","雕漆","果园厂","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_box","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"雕漆小盒是田自秉册插图6图注所记的明代雕漆器。图注只记器名与时代；正文果园厂雕漆段记永乐、宣德时期雕漆刀法明快、讲究磨工、花纹浑厚圆润、题材广泛，早期不刻锦地、宣德后多刻锦纹为地，并注明插图6。本条据图注与同段工艺背景立条，不把明代雕漆总述全归此盒。来源未给尺寸、胎骨、漆层数、藏地与图版核验。","path":"works/diaoqi-small-box.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代雕漆单器的图注锚点，花纹与锦地属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dingling","title":"定陵（Dingling Mausoleum）","name_en":"Dingling Mausoleum","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","万历","十三陵","地宫","考古发掘"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mausoleum","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"定陵是明代万历皇帝的陵墓，位于明十三陵。赵农记 1958 年的发掘使地宫真实面貌呈现：地宫以坡道通过墓门进入墓室，中央券洞与左、右、后方向的券室连接；后部券室有汉白玉石台，安置帝王皇后棺椁；地宫用石质仿制地上的门檐斗拱及宝座，既是明代工匠雕刻技艺的证明，也是帝王奢侈生活的写照。来源未给地宫面积、深度与随葬品清单。","path":"works/dingling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"定陵是 B 维度下明代帝陵地宫的条目；陵寝制度与考古管理归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dingxian-kaiyuansi-liaodi-pagoda","title":"定县开元寺瞭敌塔（Liaodi Pagoda, Kaiyuan Temple, Dingxian）","name_en":"Liaodi Pagoda, Kaiyuan Temple, Dingxian","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","砖石建筑","佛塔","84米","最高古建筑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"定县开元寺瞭敌塔高达 84 米，相当于一座 20 层的高楼，是现存我国古代最高的建筑物，属宋代砖石建筑中以佛塔最为突出的代表。","path":"works/dingxian-kaiyuansi-liaodi-pagoda.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代砖石佛塔的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dingyao-haier-zhen","title":"定窑孩儿枕（Ding Ware Boy Pillow）","name_en":"Ding Ware Boy Pillow","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","定窑","瓷枕","瓷塑","故宫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_pillow","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"定窑孩儿枕是宋代定窑瓷枕，故宫博物院所藏一件塑一卧着的小孩，神态天真活泼；原文称它既是一件生活用品，也是一件瓷塑珍品。赵农以图 7-45“宋 定窑孩儿枕”收录，并在定窑部分述及其刻花、划花、印花装饰与覆烧法。","path":"works/dingyao-haier-zhen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代定窑瓷枕的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dongfeng-sedan","title":"东风牌小轿车（Dongfeng Sedan）","name_en":"Dongfeng Sedan","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1958","长春","第一汽车制造厂","轿车","仿制与自行设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"automobile","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1958年5月5日，我国第一辆自己制造的小轿车在一汽诞生，牌名“东风”，图11-27。原文记 1957年5月一机部向长春一汽下达设计轿车的命令，样车设计在1957年11月开始；车身底盘参考法国希姆卡维迪蒂（Simca Vedetee）车型，发动机参考奔驰190，变速器为三档、属自行设计；没有零件时工程师到本溪钢铁厂的进口废钢中找适合的零件测绘，在卡车总装配车间用玻璃隔出场地，设计处4个昼夜绘出样车","path":"works/dongfeng-sedan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国轿车试制的器物锚点，材料为正文一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:donghan-qingci-gaozu-wan","title":"东汉青瓷高足碗（Eastern Han Celadon Bowl with High Foot）","name_en":"Eastern Han Celadon Bowl with High Foot","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","青瓷","瓷器起源","高足碗"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"东汉青瓷高足碗见本册图版 4-18，图注为“东汉 青瓷高足碗”。原文在瓷器一节称我国瓷器真正出现是在东汉时期，主要依据浙江绍兴上虞上浦小仙坛发现的东汉晚期瓷窑址和青瓷：瓷片质地细腻，釉面有光泽，胎釉结合紧密牢固，青瓷残片釉下已无残留石英，这种釉已摆脱原始青瓷的本性，符合真正瓷器的标准；早期青瓷的品种有壶、钟、罐、碗、洗、盘，还有五联罐、耳杯、唾壶等，这些瓷器往往挂釉不到底，有弦纹、波纹等简朴的装饰","path":"works/donghan-qingci-gaozu-wan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度瓷器起源的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:doucai-bagua-censer","title":"斗彩八卦炉（Doucai Bagua Censer）","name_en":"Doucai Bagua Censer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","嘉靖","斗彩","八卦纹","道教"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"censer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"斗彩八卦炉是田自秉册插图3图注所记的明代斗彩香炉。图注只记器名与时代；正文嘉靖、万历陶瓷段记当时因道教流行，常用八卦、云鹤、璎珞纹和卍字纹作装饰，并注明插图3。本条据图注与同段装饰背景立条，不把嘉靖彩瓷总述全归此器。来源未给尺寸、窑口、藏地与图版核验。","path":"works/doucai-bagua-censer.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代嘉靖斗彩单器的图注锚点，八卦纹与道教装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:doucai-cock-cup","title":"斗彩斗鸡杯（Doucai Cockfighting Cup）","name_en":"Doucai Cockfighting Cup","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","成化","斗彩","斗鸡纹","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_cup","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"斗彩斗鸡杯是田自秉册插图2图注所记的明代成化斗彩酒杯。图注与斗彩葡萄杯同列一行，只记两器器名与时代；正文成化斗彩段说明斗彩工艺与成化斗彩最精，未单独描述斗鸡杯的尺寸、纹样与藏地。本条只据图注立条，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/doucai-cock-cup.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代成化斗彩单器的图注锚点，斗鸡纹样属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:doucai-grape-cup","title":"斗彩葡萄杯（Doucai Grape Cup）","name_en":"Doucai Grape Cup","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","成化","斗彩","葡萄纹","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_cup","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"斗彩葡萄杯是田自秉册插图2图注所记的明代成化斗彩酒杯。图注与斗彩斗鸡杯同列一行，只记两器器名与时代；正文成化斗彩段说明斗彩工艺与成化斗彩最精，未单独描述葡萄杯的尺寸、纹样与藏地。本条只据图注立条，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/doucai-grape-cup.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代成化斗彩单器的图注锚点，葡萄纹样属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:du-ling-fang-ding","title":"杜岭方鼎（Duling Square Ding）","name_en":"Duling Square Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代早期","郑州","杜岭","方鼎","青铜礼器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"杜岭方鼎是郑州张寨南街杜岭土岗出土的两件商代早期大型铜方鼎，考古界以此命名。田自秉记两鼎均为斗形鼎身、立耳、圆柱形空足，饰饕餮纹和乳丁文，是目前所见的商代早期重要铜器。来源未给两鼎尺寸、重量、铭文、藏地与出土层位，也未分别命名。","path":"works/du-ling-fang-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"杜岭方鼎是 B 维度下商代早期青铜礼器的作品条目；其饕餮纹与乳丁文装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:duiniao-duiyang-baoshou","title":"对鸟对羊刺绣包首（Embroidery with Paired Birds and Sheep）","name_en":"Embroidery with Paired Birds and Sheep","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","刺绣","包首","对鸟对羊","新疆阿拉尔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidered_textile","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"对鸟对羊刺绣包首是新疆阿拉尔出土的北宋刺绣包首，绣有对鸟对羊的图案花纹。来源把它列在宋绣于新疆、山西宋墓出土的实例中，并记宋绣除以平绣针法为主外还兼用锁线针法。来源未给尺寸、地色、绣线与藏地。","path":"works/duiniao-duiyang-baoshou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度北宋刺绣的单件锚点，对鸟对羊图案属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dujiangyan","title":"都江堰（Dujiangyan）","name_en":"Dujiangyan","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","秦国","李冰","岷江","都江"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"waterway_engineering","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"都江堰是战国时期秦国蜀郡太守李冰在岷江上兴建的无坝引水工程。赵农记李冰于公元前256年起用六年时间烧山凿石，利用岷江沙洲修筑鱼嘴分流，在沙洲尾部与离堆构筑“飞沙堰”，把一部分江水引入宝瓶口，形成内外江；又称这是世界上历史最长的无坝引水工程，并总结“深掏滩，低作堰”“水竭不见足，盛不没肩”等经验，使成都平原成为“天府之国”。来源未记渠道长度、灌溉面积与工程尺寸。","path":"works/dujiangyan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"都江堰是 B 维度下战国秦国无坝引水工程的条目，来源给主持者、年代、工程结构与治水经验。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dule-si-guanyin-ge","title":"独乐寺观音阁（Guanyin Pavilion of Dule Temple）","name_en":"Guanyin Pavilion of Dule Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["辽代","建筑","寺院","独乐寺","观音阁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"temple_hall","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"独乐寺观音阁是辽代重修的木构楼阁。赵农记现存河北蓟县独乐寺观音阁、山西大同下华严寺、辽宁义县奉国寺、山西应县佛宫寺释迦塔等是辽代佛教文化的证明；独乐寺建于唐代，辽代统和二年（984）重修，现存观音阁和山门是辽代建筑，据记载独乐寺曾经历 28 次地震而观音阁巍然屹立；观音阁面阔 5 间、进深 4 间，外观两层、内为三层，中有高 16 米的辽代观音塑像；山门 3 间宽、进深 2 间，单檐四坡顶。来源同","path":"works/dule-si-guanyin-ge.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"独乐寺观音阁是 B 维度下辽代木构建筑与塑像的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:duleyuan","title":"独乐园（Dule Garden）","name_en":"Dule Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","园林","独乐园","司马光","洛阳"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"独乐园是北宋司马光在洛阳构筑的私人园林。赵农记宋代洛阳有诸多私人园林，李格非《洛阳名园记》记载19所；著名的园林有司马光在洛阳构筑的“独乐园”，其一反古人“与众乐乐”的观点，认为“自乐恐不足，安能及人？”，这是宋人自我情怀在现实中的遭遇的结果。来源未给园址、布局、景物与存废。","path":"works/duleyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"独乐园是 B 维度下北宋洛阳私人园林的条目；其立意与记文归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dunhuang-125-126-ku-xiu","title":"敦煌莫高窟125～126窟北魏刺绣（Northern Wei Embroidery from Mogao Caves 125-126）","name_en":"Northern Wei Embroidery from Mogao Caves 125-126","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北魏","敦煌莫高窟","刺绣","辫绣","一佛二菩萨"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"敦煌莫高窟125～126窟北魏刺绣是1965年在该窟发现的刺绣残片，内容为一佛二菩萨说法图：在黄褐色丝织品上以辫绣针法，用红、黄、绿、紫、蓝等色绣出佛像与男女供养人。女供养人头戴高冠、身着满饰桃形忍冬纹与卷草纹边饰的对襟长衫；横幅花边以圆圈纹与龟背纹互相套叠，忍冬纹被龟背纹垂直隔开，龟背纹被两个圆圈分割成三部分，用色分列。来源称其为六朝时期一件珍贵的刺绣作品，未给尺寸、残片数、藏地与出土编号。","path":"works/dunhuang-125-126-ku-xiu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"敦煌莫高窟125～126窟北魏刺绣是 C 维度下刺绣图像与纹样的器物条目，其辫绣针法与织物载体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:dushan-dayuhai","title":"渎山大玉海（Dushan Jade Sea）","name_en":"Dushan Jade Sea","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","玉器","酒器","渎山大玉海","黑玉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"渎山大玉海是元代的大型酒器，有“黑玉酒瓮”的称呼。赵农记元代玉器中最著名的是渎山大玉海，其他多以小物件的首饰、酒具为主；渎山大玉海先置于北京北海琼华岛广寒殿，明万历年间迁于紫禁城西华门外的真武庙，清乾隆年间又被安放在北海团城；经多次修磨，已非元代旧貌；现存高 70 公分、口径最宽处 182 公分、重达 3500 公斤，为中国古典玉器之最。来源未给制作年代、玉料产地、雕刻工匠与纹饰内容。","path":"works/dushan-dayuhai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"渎山大玉海是 B 维度下元代玉雕器物的条目；其元明清三代的宫廷流转归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:epang-palace","title":"阿房宫（Epang Palace）","name_en":"Epang Palace","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","秦代","宫殿","阿房宫","夯土台"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palace","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"阿房宫是秦王朝宫殿建筑的重要代表，在夯土高台上以大型木构架技术营造，使用大量木材；来源称四川、湖北木材源源不断运往关中。秦亡后宫室被焚，阿房宫是否建成成为悬疑；今西安西郊阿房宫遗址尚存（L2893、L2895、L2909、L2911）。","path":"works/epang-palace.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度秦代宫殿建筑的条目，同时涉及 A 维度史观与文献层累问题：秦汉宫殿记载、唐代辞赋与考古遗址三种材料并存，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:erlitou-bronze-jue","title":"二里头铜爵（Bronze Jue from Erlitou）","name_en":"Bronze Jue from Erlitou","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["二里头文化","青铜爵","青铜酒器","平底束腰"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"二里头铜爵是田自秉 2010 册所记二里头遗址出土的青铜爵，高 13.3 厘米，平底束腰，流和尾都比较长，把上有 3 个镂孔。原文称其造型别致优美，反映出当时的制铜技术已具有一定水平，并引彩版5、插图1 为图。原文把二里头文化置于龙山文化与商文化之间，称其大体和传说中的夏代相一致，同时记考古界对二里头文化是否就是夏文化尚有不同看法；本条不把夏代当作已定年代。夏燕靖 2016 册另记 1975 年偃","path":"works/erlitou-bronze-jue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度二里头文化青铜器的器物锚点；二里头文化与夏文化的关系来源未定，本条不据外部研究补写。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:erlitou-long-spout-jue","title":"二里头青铜长流爵（Long-Spouted Bronze Jue from Erlitou）","name_en":"Long-Spouted Bronze Jue from Erlitou","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["二里头","青铜爵","商代早期","饮酒器","中国最早青铜器之争"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"二里头青铜长流爵是本册讨论中国青铜器起源时举出的两说之一。原文先述甘肃东乡林家村出土的马家窑文化青铜刀具（约公元前 3000 年）为“最早青铜器”一说，再述商代早期遗址出土较大型青铜器，即 1975 年偃师二里头遗址出土的这件长流爵。原文对它的形制与尺寸交代得比较具体。","path":"works/erlitou-long-spout-jue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度青铜器起源问题的器物锚点。原文把它放在“最早青铜器两说”的争点上，本条只记器物，不裁定哪一说成立。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:falangcai-zhuju-anchun-ping","title":"景德镇窑珐琅彩竹菊鹌鹑瓶（Falangcai Vase with Bamboo, Chrysanthemum and Quail）","name_en":"Falangcai Vase with Bamboo, Chrysanthemum and Quail","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","乾隆","珐琅彩","景德镇","竹菊"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vase","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"景德镇窑珐琅彩竹菊鹌鹑瓶是田自秉清代陶瓷段著录的一件乾隆珐琅彩瓷瓶，只见于图注。图注编号为插图2，以景德镇窑冠首。同段的乾隆三朝总评称乾隆的珐琅彩制作工艺达到了很高的水平。来源未给尺寸、款识、收藏与纹样细目，本条未做视觉核验。","path":"works/falangcai-zhuju-anchun-ping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代珐琅彩单器的图注锚点，竹菊鹌鹑的装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fanche-longgu-shuiche","title":"翻车（龙骨水车）（Fanche (Dragon-Bone Water Lift)）","name_en":"Fanche (Dragon-Bone Water Lift)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["三国","马钧","翻车","龙骨水车","灌溉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_machine","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"翻车是三国时期马钧制作的一种提水农具，来源本节标题作「2. 龙骨水车」，正文则以「翻车」称之，并引《三国志·魏书·方技》记其运转方式与灌溉效果。来源交代马钧为陕西扶风人、字德衡，有「巧思绝世」之评，但未载翻车的尺寸、部件名称与传动结构。图 5-5 为龙骨水车模型、图 5-6 为翻车，均未视觉核验。本条据 L3342、L3345、L3347、L3349 写成，未做来源外核对。","path":"works/fanche-longgu-shuiche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度三国曹魏提水农具的条目，关联马钧的造物设计，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fanchuan-tujing-cipan","title":"帆船图景瓷盘（Pair of Plates with Dutch East India Company Ship）","name_en":"Pair of Plates with Dutch East India Company Ship","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","乾隆","外销瓷","东印度公司","中西合璧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清乾隆后期外销瓷盘一对，图9-34 图注作“清代 帆船图景的中西合璧图案”。原文记其为上海博物馆揭幕的“海帆留踪——荷兰倪汉克捐赠明清贸易瓷展”展品，是中西合璧之作：盘壁图案是典型的中国传统纹样，上面画有青鱼、白鱼、鳜鱼各1条和3名手执莲花的童子，原文括注明清时期景德镇瓷器上常见有青、白、鲤、鳜4种鱼，象征士人标榜的清高气节；盘心所绘帆船是荷兰东印度公司的海船形式，当时的东印度公司就是用这样的帆船","path":"works/fanchuan-tujing-cipan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代外销瓷中西合璧纹样的器物锚点，材料为正文一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fangzhi-tu-huaxiangshi","title":"纺织图（曾母投杼）画象石（Pictorial Stone of Weaving (Zeng Mu Throwing the Shuttle)）","name_en":"Pictorial Stone of Weaving (Zeng Mu Throwing the Shuttle)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","泗洪曹庄","铜山青山泉","画像石","纺织图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_stone","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"纺织图是苏北徐州地区出土的汉代画像石，泗洪曹庄与铜山青山泉所出最著名。曹庄“曾母投杼”据《战国策》曾参杀人故事，画曾母坐织机转身投杼训子；图像显示织机由立机向平机过渡、脚踏移综开口、双手投梭打纬。青山泉图兼有织机与纺车，织者转身接抱婴儿。来源称描写纺织的画象石共8块，5块在山东、3块在江苏。","path":"works/fangzhi-tu-huaxiangshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"纺织图（曾母投杼）画象石是 B 维度下汉代织机技术的图像条目，其历史故事构图归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:feiniao-tuanhua-jin","title":"飞鸟团花锦（Flying-Bird Medallion Brocade）","name_en":"Flying-Bird Medallion Brocade","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","织锦","阿斯塔那","团花","散点构成"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"飞鸟团花锦是新疆阿斯塔那 381 号墓出土的唐代织锦。高丰记其纹样以五彩大团花为中心，周围绕以四只飞鸟，飞鸟尾部附有近红、蓝六瓣花四朵，花下部衬以枝干绿叶相扶；整体构图统一而有变化，既有疏密对比，又有动静结合，被来源评为团花散点式构成的精彩之作。来源另记此锦用 8 种色彩织成，是唐代丝织品中用色最多的一例。","path":"works/feiniao-tuanhua-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"飞鸟团花锦是 B 维度下唐代织锦的实物条目，其团花散点构成属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fengniaoxing-shao","title":"凤鸟形勺（云梦睡虎地三十四号墓）（Phoenix-Shaped Lacquer Spoon）","name_en":"Phoenix-Shaped Lacquer Spoon","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦代","云梦睡虎地","漆器","象生","凤鸟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"凤鸟形勺是 1975 年湖北云梦睡虎地三十四号秦墓出土的漆勺，高 14 厘米。整器作凤鸟形：凤头为柄首，凤颈为柄，凤身为勺体；涂黑漆，以红、赭色画羽毛。来源称其象生漆器特别出色。","path":"works/fengniaoxing-shao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"凤鸟形勺是 B 维度下秦代象生漆器的器物条目；凤鸟造型与彩绘羽毛的视觉处理归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fengshou-longbing-hu","title":"凤首龙柄壶（Ewer with Phoenix Head and Dragon Handle）","name_en":"Ewer with Phoenix Head and Dragon Handle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","青瓷","故宫博物院","凤首","龙柄"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"凤首龙柄壶是唐代青瓷壶，现藏故宫博物院，又称青瓷凤头龙柄壶。高丰记其壶柄为一条由口沿延伸到底部的螭龙，壶盖塑成栩栩如生的凤头，整体造型兼有异国情调与中国本土传统；壶身满布带浮雕效果的联珠、忍冬、莲瓣、宝相花、力士等波斯萨珊王朝风格图案，与凤头龙柄融为一体。夏燕靖 2016 册只在越窑青瓷段落末以图注形式著录“6-9. 唐代 凤首龙柄壶”，未作描述。田自秉在越窑段落称其为青釉凤头龙柄壶，评为造型别致","path":"works/fengshou-longbing-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代青瓷的器物条目，其凤首、螭龙柄与萨珊式装饰纹样属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:flying-pigeon-bicycle","title":"飞鸽牌自行车（Flying Pigeon Bicycle）","name_en":"Flying Pigeon Bicycle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1950","天津","自行车","飞鸽","轻工业产品设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bicycle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"新中国第一代自行车，图11-10 的图注为：11-10. 新中国 天津“飞鸽”牌自行车标志和“飞鸽”牌第一代自行车。原文记该车于1950年4月开始研制，是天津自行车厂在开展“造新中国一代坚固、耐用、美观、轻快的自行车”活动中，由20多名工人和技术人员组成的试制组设计制造；设计时解剖分析了荷兰菲利浦、日本堀井和英国凤头等各国名牌车，取其所长、避其所短；技术人员用木板当图板，综合各方人士上百条建议制订","path":"works/flying-pigeon-bicycle.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国轻工业产品设计的器物锚点，材料为正文一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:foguang-si-dadian","title":"佛光寺大殿（Main Hall of Foguang Temple）","name_en":"Main Hall of Foguang Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","五台山","木构","斗拱","单檐庑殿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"timber_architecture","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"佛光寺大殿位于山西五台山，建于公元 857 年（唐宣宗大中十一年），面宽七间、进深四间，是以立柱、斗拱、梁枋等组成的梁柱式木结构典型建筑。整个建筑以榫卯衔接，严谨规范、稳定坚固；屋顶为单檐庑殿式，屋檐由斗拱挑撑、翼角上翘，殿内结构合理，宽敞明亮，朴素大方。","path":"works/foguang-si-dadian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代木构建筑的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fu-geng-zisun-gu","title":"父庚子孙觚（Gu Vessel Inscribed Fu Geng Zi Sun）","name_en":"Gu Vessel Inscribed Fu Geng Zi Sun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商","青铜觚","族徽铭文","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"父庚子孙觚见本册图版 2-12，图注为“商 父庚子孙觚”。原文未展开形制描述。器名含“父庚子孙”，属铭文内容进入器名的情形，本条照录器名，不对铭文作释读。","path":"works/fu-geng-zisun-gu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度商代饮酒器的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fuhao-changfang-bianzu-ding","title":"妇好长方扁足鼎（Fuhao Rectangular Flat-Legged Ding）","name_en":"Fuhao Rectangular Flat-Legged Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","青铜器","鼎","妇好","饕餮纹"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"妇好长方扁足鼎是商代青铜鼎，见于李立新第一章图版，图题作“妇好长方扁足鼎饕餮纹饰”。来源在讨论兽面纹、饕餮纹由自然物象综合而成、并体现将自然人化、社会化与伦理化倾向时以（图1—16）引及此图；未描述鼎的形制、尺寸、纹饰细部与出土情况，图版未视觉核验。图题所标为“饕餮纹饰”，不是全器图。","path":"works/fuhao-changfang-bianzu-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度商代青铜鼎的单器条目，饕餮纹饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fuhao-jade-figure","title":"妇好墓玉雕人俑（Jade Figure from the Tomb of Fu Hao）","name_en":"Jade Figure from the Tomb of Fu Hao","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","妇好墓","玉雕","深衣","服饰史"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_figure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"妇好墓玉雕人俑是本册讨论深衣起源与商代服饰的实物证据。原文论上衣下裳相连接一段的句首为“的基础上将上衣和下裳围裙连接起来”，其前被两行图版及图注 2-36 隔断，句首残缺，据文义当是“在此基础上…”；本条照录残句并标疑。该段称这种连接成为我国历代服装的基本特征，也是上衣下裳形制与冠服制度、服章制度逐步确立的时期；并称在商代妇好墓中发现的一件玉雕人物俑，可见到深衣服饰的样式，衣服上刻有清晰的龙纹和云","path":"works/fuhao-jade-figure.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度商代服饰史的实物锚点。原文用它支持深衣起源判断，本条只记材料，不裁定深衣成立年代。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fuhao-mu-yuren","title":"妇好墓玉人（Jade Figure from Fuhao Tomb）","name_en":"Jade Figure from Fuhao Tomb","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代后期","妇好墓","殷墟","玉人","圆雕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_figure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"妇好墓玉人是殷墟五号墓出土的商代圆雕玉人。田自秉记其高 7 厘米、黄褐色，作跪坐状，双手抚膝，长脸尖颌、大鼻小口；头梳长辫，辫根从右耳后向前盘在头上绕向左耳，戴束发圆箍形“颊”，颊前有卷筒状装饰；身穿交领衣、长袖、腰束宽带、腹前悬“蔽膝”，衣上有云纹、回纹，腰左挂宽柄器。来源未给玉料、藏地与同出玉人数量。","path":"works/fuhao-mu-yuren.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"妇好墓玉人是 B 维度下商代玉雕的作品条目；其发式、服饰与云纹回纹属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fuhao-sanlian-yan","title":"妇好三联甗（Fuhao Triple Yan Steamer）","name_en":"Fuhao Triple Yan Steamer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代后期","妇好墓","殷墟","三联甗","青铜炊器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_steamer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"妇好三联甗是殷墟妇好墓出土的商代炊煮器。田自秉记其长方形器身有三个等距圈口、下底 6 足，腹足有烟迹，应为实用器；上置三个甑，总高 64 厘米、总重 138.2 公斤；器身案面三圈口各由三条龙纹环绕，龙身饰回纹、与当时丝织物图案相似，侧面夔纹与圆涡纹相间。来源未给各甑尺寸、铭文与藏地。","path":"works/fuhao-sanlian-yan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"妇好三联甗是 B 维度下商代青铜炊器的作品条目；其龙纹、夔纹与回纹装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:fuzi-miaotang-bei","title":"《夫子庙堂碑》（Confucius Temple Stele）","name_en":"Confucius Temple Stele","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","武德","碑刻","书法","虞世南"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stele","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《夫子庙堂碑》是来源在唐代碑刻中举出的虞世南作品。来源记其为武德九年（公元629年），并评其书“方中见圆、平中见奇、笔力秀健、精气饱满”。原文所记武德九年与括注公元629年不能对应（武德九年对应公元626年），本条照录原文并标疑，不径改年份。来源未给碑址、碑文、翻刻、尺寸与存藏，也未给撰者与书写缘起。来源此段未配本碑图版，图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"works/fuzi-miaotang-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"夫子庙堂碑在 C 维度下作为唐初碑刻书法的条目；碑刻形制归 B 维度。其年号纪年与括注公元纪年不合，是原文内部疑点。Theme 与 Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:gao-yi-que","title":"高颐阙（Gaoyi Que (Pillar Gate)）","name_en":"Gaoyi Que (Pillar Gate)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","汉阙","石构建筑","汉代建筑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_architecture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"高颐阙见本册图版 4-28，图注为“东汉 高颐阙”。原文在汉代建筑一节称历史上的汉代建筑早已荡然无存，但现存的大量汉代建筑遗址，如汉阙等石结构建筑以及房基地下的建筑遗址仍可佐证；另外从墓葬遗存的陶楼看，汉代建筑以楼阁形式较为典型，一般由台基、门楼和五层楼阁组成，各层门窗、屋脊、栏杆等部位都饰有人物、花鸟等装饰纹样，楼阁与底部基座、栏杆、门楼浑然一体、结构严谨、装饰繁多。原文未单独描述高颐阙的形制与","path":"works/gao-yi-que.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度汉代建筑遗存的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:gaoyi-tu","title":"《高逸图》（Gao Yi Tu, Lofty Scholars）","name_en":"Gao Yi Tu (Lofty Scholars)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","孙位","家具","琴几","图像资料"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-35. 唐代 孙位《高逸图》中的琴几”。图注在唐代家具段末，与图6-36“唐代 壶门案、腰圆凳”、图6-37“唐代箱”同被（图6-35、6-36、6-37）统摄。原文论几、案、挟轼都是传统家具，几发展为凭几、挟轼，用于身体前伏或侧身依靠，并借图6-35 的琴几作形象证据；画作本身未作介绍，作者孙位只见于图注。","path":"works/gaoyi-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代家具的图像锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:gengzhi-tu","title":"耕织图（Gengzhi Tu (Pictures of Tilling and Weaving)）","name_en":"Gengzhi Tu (Pictures of Tilling and Weaving)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","康熙","焦秉贞","朱圭","书籍插图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"illustration_series","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《耕织图》是清代康熙年间由宫廷画家焦秉贞绘图、宫廷刻工朱圭刻板、内府用铜版印刷的插图作品。高丰在清代书籍装帧一节把它列为清代书籍插图的代表作，评为“精细生动”。来源只给这一句，图的幅数、题材分目、版式与流传情况均未展开。","path":"works/gengzhi-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度下清代书籍插图的代表作，其耕织题材另涉 B 维度的农业与纺织生产。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:genyue","title":"艮岳（Genyue Imperial Garden）","name_en":"Genyue Imperial Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","园林","艮岳","宋徽宗","花石纲"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"艮岳是北宋徽宗时期在大内东北方建构的皇家园林。赵农记其原为宋徽宗因风水原因改造地势而建，有方圆十里的构筑，集天地之精华、聚人间之财富，炫耀一时；根本上却是宋徽宗对灾难重重的现实国事的避难之地；修筑时在江南搜刮大量“花石纲”，激起民怨而酿成内乱；靖康之变中被人毁坏，后来金人运出许多瑞石，相传今北京北海中的许多瑞石即为艮岳遗物。","path":"works/genyue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"艮岳是 B 维度下北宋皇家园林的条目；其花石纲与政治后果归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:geyuan","title":"个园（Ge Garden）","name_en":"Ge Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","扬州园林","私家园林","四季假山","青竹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"个园是扬州名园。赵农记园中广置青竹，竹叶形小如个，寄予挺拔向上之意，因此得名；园有宜雨轩、壶天自春等建筑，壶天自春构筑庞大，在江南园林中闻名。另一景致是春、夏、秋、冬四季假山，利用不同石质堆叠山体，为清代江南私人园林的佳品。来源未给建园年代、园主、面积、叠山工匠与各季假山用石。","path":"works/geyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"个园是 B 维度下清代扬州私家园林的器物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:great-wall-tapestry","title":"大型壁毯《长城》（Large Tapestry 'The Great Wall'）","name_en":"Large Tapestry 'The Great Wall","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1974","壁毯","长城","联合国","国家礼品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tapestry","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1974年制作的大型艺术壁毯《长城》，图11-32 图注作“文革期间天津织成的大型壁毯《长城》”。原文记 1974年5月由国务院下达设计和生产任务，制作大型艺术壁毯《长城》（高5米、宽10米）和大型象牙雕刻《成昆铁路》，作为国家礼品赠送联合国总部。原文同节另记 1973年全国工艺美术企业达2000余家、产值15亿元以上、出口值14亿元，1976年全国工艺美术产值23.4亿元。","path":"works/great-wall-tapestry.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国织毯工艺的器物锚点，材料为正文两句加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:guang-wu-jiang-jun-bei","title":"广武将军碑（Guangwu Jiangjun Bei (Stele of General Guangwu)）","name_en":"Guangwu Jiangjun Bei (Stele of General Guangwu)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","十六国","前秦","碑刻","游牧民族"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"广武将军碑是十六国前秦碑刻。来源单列一句，称其随意纵横、体格多变，体现了北方游牧民族的文化特征（L3461）。来源未给具体年份、形制、尺寸、字数、书丹者与现存地点。来源无对应图题，图版未核，本条不据图补写，也不补碑主事迹。","path":"works/guang-wu-jiang-jun-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度十六国前秦碑刻的条目，来源记其体格多变与北方游牧民族文化特征，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:guanghan-palace-luodian-plate","title":"广寒宫螺钿漆盘残片（Guanghan Palace Mother-of-Pearl Lacquer Plate Fragment）","name_en":"Guanghan Palace Mother-of-Pearl Lacquer Plate Fragment","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","螺钿","漆器","后英房","广寒宫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_plate","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"广寒宫螺钿漆盘残片是北京后英房出土的元代螺钿漆器。来源记残盘表现出广寒宫秀丽的建筑和云树，五彩斑斓，嵌片精细，虽已残破，仍可看出是一件十分精美的作品；图注作广寒宫螺钿漆盘残片。来源未给尺寸、胎骨、嵌片材质、藏地与图版核验。","path":"works/guanghan-palace-luodian-plate.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代螺钿漆器的单器锚点，广寒宫建筑与云树的嵌片画面属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:guangxu-caiyou-diaoci-fangping","title":"清光绪彩釉雕瓷四季花鸟纹方瓶（Carved Porcelain Square Vase with Four Seasons Flowers and Birds）","name_en":"Carved Porcelain Square Vase with Four Seasons Flowers and Birds","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","光绪","雕瓷","彩釉","外销瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清光绪彩釉雕瓷方瓶，图9-33。原文在明清贸易瓷一节记：此瓶外销以后被欧洲人改为台灯底座使用，原文称之为颇为有趣的移植设计品种。图注文字与图9-34 的说明在源文同一行交错，图版与图注的对位需按原书核对。原文未记瓶的尺寸、款识、雕瓷工序与改造的具体做法。","path":"works/guangxu-caiyou-diaoci-fangping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代外销瓷二次改制的器物锚点，材料为正文一句加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:guiguxiashan-qinghua-guan","title":"元代“鬼谷下山”青花瓷罐（Yuan \"Guiguxiashan\" Blue-and-White Jar）","name_en":"Yuan \"Guiguxiashan\" Blue-and-White Jar","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","青花","拍卖","克里斯蒂","埃斯凯纳齐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_jar","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代“鬼谷下山”青花瓷罐高 27.5 厘米、直径 33 厘米，是目前世间仅存的 8 件同类古董之一。2005 年 7 月 12 日，古董商埃斯凯纳齐在伦敦克里斯蒂拍卖行以 1568.8 万英镑（约 2.45 亿人民币）投得，创下历来亚洲艺术品拍卖的最高成交价。西方收藏家自 1968 年克利夫兰美术馆举办蒙古统治下的中国艺术展览后开始青睐元代瓷器。","path":"works/guiguxiashan-qinghua-guan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下元代青花瓷器的器物锚点，也涉及 D 维度的艺术市场。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:guo-shoujing-jianyi","title":"郭守敬简仪（Guo Shoujing's Abridged Armilla）","name_en":"Guo Shoujing's Abridged Armilla","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","郭守敬","天文仪器","简仪","授时历"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"astronomical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代郭守敬创制的天文仪器简仪，图8-34 图注作“元代 郭守敬发明的简仪模型（现设在南京紫金山天文台）”。原文记 1276 年忽必烈诏令编制新历法，设太史局，以王恂与郭守敬为主要负责人，1280 年编成授时历；在 4 年编历过程中，郭守敬共创制设计了简仪、高表等 17 种天文仪器。原文评简仪“非但简化了浑仪观测坐标系统，而且精度也高于浑仪”，并采用“与近代滚珠轴承作用相同的圆柱体轴承”。同段另记郭","path":"works/guo-shoujing-jianyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代天文仪器设计的器物锚点，材料为正文一段仪器评述加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:guohui-1950","title":"中华人民共和国国徽（National Emblem of the People's Republic of China）","name_en":"National Emblem of the People's Republic of China","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","国徽","标志设计","天安门","梁思成"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"national_emblem","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中华人民共和国国徽于 1950 年 9 月 20 日公布。三册的覆盖极不平衡：**夏燕靖两版给完整过程**（1949 年 7 月征集启事与三项要求、清华大学营建系与另一设计组并行、图案要素、1950 年 6 月与 9 月两道程序），**赵农只给一幅图题和一句总评**（“应是中国 20 世纪设计作品中最重要的一个”）。**“另一设计组”的机构名在 2009 版同一段内就不统一**：前句作“国立北平艺","path":"works/guohui-1950.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"国徽是 C 维度下国家标志设计的核心样本：征集要求的三项、两个设计组的并行、齿轮麦稻穗五星绶带与天安门的组合都在此汇合。1949—1950 年的征集与通过程序归 D 维度；“中国特征”如何被转译为图形语汇归 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:guoji-zibai-pan","title":"虢季子白盘（Guoji Zibai Basin）","name_en":"Guoji Zibai Basin","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周晚期","青铜器","宣王","铭文","盥洗器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"虢季子白盘是西周宣王时期铸作的长方形青铜大盘，今陈列于中国历史博物馆，铭文 111 字，记虢季子白抗击外族有功、王设宴庆功。四册对它的定位沿两条线分开：夏燕靖两版把它当作**盥洗器**（盘、匜配合的沃盥之礼）中“长方形盘”的代表，完全不提铭文；赵农在**食器**一节内列“盘”，正文却明确说盘是“盛水或沐浴的器具”，并给出四册中唯一的尺寸“长有 1.5 米”；田自秉把它列在周代长篇铭文诸器之间，给年","path":"works/guoji-zibai-pan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"虢季子白盘在四册中承担两重角色：作为盥洗器样本，它是西周中期后盘类加耳、出现长方形大盘的形制证据（B）；作为有铭重器，它提供宣王时期抗击外族与庆功宴飨的史料（C 之铭文，D 之礼制）。四册均不描述纹饰。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:haigu-zhanchuan","title":"海鹘战船（Haigu Warship）","name_en":"Haigu Warship","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","战船","浮板","抗沉性","稳定性"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"warship","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"海鹘战船是唐代出现的战船，造型独特，头低尾高、前大后小，船舷两侧设浮板起平衡作用；如此设计使船具有良好的抗沉性和稳定性。","path":"works/haigu-zhanchuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代战船的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:han-xizai-yeyan-tu","title":"韩熙载夜宴图（The Night Revels of Han Xizai）","name_en":"The Night Revels of Han Xizai","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["五代","顾闳中","韩熙载夜宴图","人物画","家具"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《韩熙载夜宴图》是五代顾闳中的人物画。赵农记它与周文矩《重屏会棋图》一同描绘了五代时期士大夫的社会生活景象；家具节又据图中形象记“六件无扶手高背椅，椅背上部的搭脑向两边延伸出头，翻卷成牛角状”。来源把此图同时作为绘画作品与家具形制的图像证据，未给材质、尺寸、分段、人物数与递藏。","path":"works/han-xizai-yeyan-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《韩熙载夜宴图》是 C 维度下五代人物画的条目；其家具形制材料归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:hanjiang-niudeng","title":"邗江甘泉二号汉墓牛灯（Ox-Form Lamp from Hanjiang Ganquan Tomb 2）","name_en":"Ox-Form Lamp from Hanjiang Ganquan Tomb 2","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","邗江","甘泉二号墓","铜灯","虹管"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_lamp","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"邗江甘泉二号汉墓牛灯是 1980 年江苏邗江甘泉二号汉墓出土的牛形铜灯。牛背有灯盏，盏上镂空菱格瓦状灯罩，罩上有穹顶形盖，虹管通向牛头，使灯烟收集到牛腹内；牛体错银云气纹。来源称其与长沙牛灯不同，制作精美。","path":"works/hanjiang-niudeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"邗江甘泉二号汉墓牛灯是 B 维度下西汉虹管铜灯的器物条目；错银云气纹与牛形造型的视觉设计归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:hao-da-wang-bei","title":"好大王碑（Haodawang Bei (Stele of King Haodawang)）","name_en":"Haodawang Bei (Stele of King Haodawang)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","吉林","碑刻","方正古朴"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"好大王碑是立于吉林的碑刻。来源在东晋禁碑、墓志盛行的段落末句提到它，称其也有方正古朴的寓意（L3454），但未称其为东晋碑，也未给具体年份。碑的形制、尺寸、字数、书丹者与吉林境内的具体地点，原文未载。来源无对应图题，图版未核，本条不补碑文内容与族属背景。","path":"works/hao-da-wang-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度碑刻的条目，来源仅一句记其在吉林与方正古朴的书风，未系明确年代，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:he-xian-yu-wen-caitao-gang","title":"鹤衔鱼纹彩陶缸（Painted Pottery Jar with Crane-and-Fish Motif）","name_en":"Painted Pottery Jar with Crane-and-Fish Motif","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["庙底沟型","彩陶","鸟纹","鹤衔鱼","彩陶缸"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鹤衔鱼纹彩陶缸是庙底沟型彩陶缸，图版彩版 3。田自秉在庙底沟型鸟纹段记陕西华县、华阴，河南陕县，山西芮城等地都有鸟纹发现，有的作停立观望状，有的展翅欲飞；图版与正文未逐句对应。来源未给该缸尺寸、出土地点、藏地与图像细部。","path":"works/he-xian-yu-wen-caitao-gang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鹤衔鱼纹彩陶缸是 B 维度下庙底沟型彩陶缸的作品条目；其鸟纹与鹤衔鱼母题属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:he-zun","title":"何尊（He Zun）","name_en":"He Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周早期","青铜器","铭文","中国","中央"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"何尊是赵农在导论中提到的西周早期青铜器。来源只就铭文立论：称其铭文是目前古籍文献中最早出现“中国”一词的例证，原铭文是周成王的训词，其中已有“中央”“京师”的概念。第二章礼器部分另以图 2-43“西周 何尊”、图 2-44“西周 何尊铭文”著录此器，但正文未再展开形制、尺寸或出土信息。","path":"works/he-zun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"何尊是 B 维度下西周早期青铜器的器物条，其铭文“中国”一词的语词史意义属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:hehua-wen-taohong-liaogang","title":"荷花纹套红料缸（Red-Overlay Glass Vat with Lotus Motif）","name_en":"Red-Overlay Glass Vat with Lotus Motif","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","料器","套料","荷花纹","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"glass_ware","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"荷花纹套红料缸是田自秉清代料器段著录的一件清代料器，只见于图注，编号为插图6。图注紧接康熙时期造办处设玻璃厂的叙述。料器即玻璃器，但含铅量较高、熔点低，适于制作各种欣赏品；套红是套料的一种配色方式。来源未给尺寸、收藏与纹样细目，本条未做视觉核验。","path":"works/hehua-wen-taohong-liaogang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代料器单器的图注锚点，荷花纹与套红配色属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:hei-you-si-xi-pan-kou-hu","title":"黑釉四系盘口壶（Black-Glazed Four-Lug Dish-Mouth Ewer）","name_en":"Black-Glazed Four-Lug Dish-Mouth Ewer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晋代","德清窑","黑瓷","盘口壶","四系"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黑釉四系盘口壶是上海博物馆收藏的德清窑黑瓷典型器。2009 册记其盘口微敞、壶身浑圆、颈上饰双平行凸弦纹、盘棱连肩、肩上凸出四个桥形系；下体微收、足略展、底不挂釉；造型幽雅明朗，浑圆中含有劲秀之气势；胎细釉厚，乌黑中带有赭紫色，黑体中犹有变色之妙。","path":"works/hei-you-si-xi-pan-kou-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下晋代德清窑黑瓷的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:heiqizhuhui-niaozu-qian","title":"黑漆朱绘鸟足漆案（Black-Lacquered Table with Bird-Foot Legs and Red Painting）","name_en":"Black-Lacquered Table with Bird-Foot Legs and Red Painting","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","漆器","鸟足","兽面纹","湖北省博物馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_table","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黑漆朱绘鸟足漆案是战国漆案。四案足雕刻成鸟形，二足间安立柱，案面有浮雕兽面纹，全案通体髹黑漆，技法精细、庄重典雅。来源为图注，未给尺寸、出土地点与木质，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/heiqizhuhui-niaozu-qian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度战国漆家具的单器条目，鸟足与兽面纹的装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:hemudu-zhui-muwan","title":"河姆渡朱漆木碗（Hemudu Red-Lacquered Wooden Bowl）","name_en":"Hemudu Red-Lacquered Wooden Bowl","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时代","河姆渡","漆器","生漆","朱漆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"河姆渡朱漆木碗是浙江余姚河姆渡文化出土的漆器，距今约 7000 年，同出尚有朱漆木筒。高丰称它是迄今考古发掘最早的漆器用品，并据化学方法与光谱分析确认其涂料为生漆，据此推断中国漆器生产至少已有 7000 年以上历史。河姆渡人在生漆中掺入朱砂矿物质使漆器呈现朱红色，高丰把这一步读作漆器审美追求的开始。\n\n来源未给碗的通高、口径、胎厚与收藏单位；图 2-22 的图注只作“河姆渡文化朱漆碗”，与正文“朱","path":"works/hemudu-zhui-muwan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"河姆渡朱漆木碗是 B 维度下中国漆器起源的器物锚点。河姆渡遗址的聚落、稻作与陶器留在 places/hemudu-site.md，漆器工艺的一般流程不在本条展开。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:heye-changkou-yinbei","title":"荷叶敞口银杯（Lotus-Leaf-Mouth Silver Cup）","name_en":"Lotus-Leaf-Mouth Silver Cup","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["辽代","金银器","银杯","巴林窖藏","光学效果"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silver_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"荷叶敞口银杯是辽代窖藏所出银器。来源把它列在内蒙古巴林窖藏出土的八楞錾花银执壶、海棠形錾花银盘、柳斗形银杯、八楞錾花银温碗、莲花口银杯等一组金银器之中，称制作都十分精美；其中特别举出荷叶敞口银杯，说它利用光学原理，杯内荷叶曲线细纹在注入水酒后能给人以涟漪荡漾之感。来源未给尺寸、重量、容量、藏地与图版。","path":"works/heye-changkou-yinbei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度辽代金银器的单器锚点，荷叶曲线与注入水酒后的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:hongqi-chashang-zhumulangmafeng","title":"红旗插上珠穆朗玛峰玉雕（Jade Carving Red Flag on Mount Everest）","name_en":"Jade Carving Red Flag on Mount Everest","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","上海","玉雕","登山","大型玉雕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"红旗插上珠穆朗玛峰是新中国上海玉雕艺人创作的大型玉雕。来源记它刻划四十一个不同姿态的登山运动员不畏艰险、把红旗插上世界最高峰的场面，重达三吨，是世界上少有的大型玉雕之一。来源未给创作年份、作者姓名、玉料种类与收藏地点。","path":"works/hongqi-chashang-zhumulangmafeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国玉雕单件的条目，群像构图与主题表达属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:hongqiao","title":"虹桥（Rainbow Bridge）","name_en":"Rainbow Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","桥梁","虹桥","汴河","清明上河图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"虹桥是《清明上河图》所绘跨越汴河的木桥。赵农记其采取无柱的木结构，骨架交错，非拱非梁，跨越汴河，证实了北宋的造桥技术；同段说其他宋画也大量描绘桥梁形象，如王希孟《千里江山图》中长桥卧波、飞渡关山，大大小小五六座，有长桥、亭桥、小桥等。来源未给虹桥的跨度、拱矢、用材与建造年代；图7-37为复原图。","path":"works/hongqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"虹桥是 B 维度下北宋木桥的条目；其《清明上河图》图像证据归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:horse-treading-xiongnu","title":"马踏匈奴（Horse Treading a Xiongnu Warrior）","name_en":"Horse Treading a Xiongnu Warrior","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","西汉","霍去病墓","石雕","纪念碑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sculpture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《马踏匈奴》是霍去病墓石刻群的纪念碑式中心作品。来源记霍去病墓石刻与陵墓环境结合，以陵为山、封土筑山、纪功表彰；《马踏匈奴》采取写意雕凿，以石赋形、化形寓意；石刻群作品采用浮雕、线雕、圆雕结合，约16件，形象包括马、牛、虎、羊、象、猪、鱼、怪兽、熊与人（L2973、L2982）。","path":"works/horse-treading-xiongnu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度西汉陵墓石雕的条目，其以石赋形、化形寓意的写意手法与纪功表彰观念涉及 A 维度，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:houfeng-dizhenyi","title":"候风地动仪（Houfeng Seismograph）","name_en":"Houfeng Seismograph","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","张衡","铜制","都柱","八道"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scientific_instrument","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"候风地动仪是东汉张衡等制成的世界上第一架候风地动仪。原文引《后汉书·张衡传》称其“以精铜制成，圆径八尺，合盖隆起，形似酒尊”；内部有“都柱”“八道”等机械装置，尊外八条含铜珠的龙及龙头下面设置的相应蟾蜍，使整个地动仪如精巧工艺品。","path":"works/houfeng-dizhenyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下东汉铜制科学仪器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:houma-mengshu","title":"侯马盟书（Houma Covenant Texts）","name_en":"Houma Covenant Texts","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋","侯马盟书","盟书","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_artifact","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"侯马盟书在本册中只以图注形式出现：图 3-49 的图注为“▲ 图 3-49 春秋 侯马盟书”。赵农正文没有介绍盟书的数量、材质、字数、出土时间地点与收藏，也没有描述其器形或文字内容；本条只登记图注给出的时代与名称，不据图补写任何形制。图版未作视觉核验。","path":"works/houma-mengshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"侯马盟书是 B 维度下春秋考古器物的条目，来源只有图 3-49 的图注，无正文描述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:houzhu-chuan","title":"后渚船（Houzhu Shipwreck）","name_en":"Houzhu Shipwreck","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","南宋","泉州","海船","后渚船"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"shipwreck","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"后渚船是泉州出土的宋代海船残骸。赵农记近年在泉州不断发现出土的宋代海船，如一艘“后渚船”的残骸，长24.20米、宽9.15米，推测当时载重量应在200吨以上；同段记宋代海船坚固高大、技术精妙、设计合理，海船有尖底福船和平底沙船两类。赵农未给船体结构、隔舱数、桅帆配置、出土年份与收藏单位。\n\n李立新 2011 册在结论章论“延续性”时插入一幅木制海船图注，未称后渚船，只题“木制海船”：长约 3500","path":"works/houzhu-chuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"后渚船是 B 维度下宋代海船考古遗存的条目；泉州港市舶制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:hua-falang-kuihua-pan","title":"画珐琅葵花式盘（Painted-Enamel Sunflower-Form Dish）","name_en":"Painted-Enamel Sunflower-Form Dish","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","康熙","乾隆","画珐琅","葵花式"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"enamel_ware","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"画珐琅葵花式盘是田自秉清代画珐琅段著录的一件清代画珐琅器，只见于图注，编号为插图4。图注的葵花式是本条唯一的造型信息。来源未给尺寸、釉色、款识与收藏，本条未做视觉核验。","path":"works/hua-falang-kuihua-pan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代画珐琅单器的图注锚点，葵花式的器形属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:hua-falang-xiaoping","title":"画珐琅小瓶（Small Painted-Enamel Vase）","name_en":"Small Painted-Enamel Vase","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","康熙","乾隆","画珐琅","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"enamel_ware","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"画珐琅小瓶是田自秉清代画珐琅段著录的一件清代画珐琅器，只见于图注，编号为插图3。图注紧接画珐琅造型与色彩的叙述，正文以插图3、插图4并列引图。来源未给尺寸、釉色、款识与收藏，本条未做视觉核验。","path":"works/hua-falang-xiaoping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代画珐琅单器的图注锚点，釉色与彩绘属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:hua-ji-tu","title":"花机图（Illustration of a Draw Loom）","name_en":"Illustration of a Draw Loom","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","天工开物","花机","织造","插图"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_illustration","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花机图是《天工开物》所载织机插图，图3-2，图注称“织造过程及构件说明”。来源在 L1200 以图3-2 作为冶铸、锤锻、陶埏、舟车等系统设计安排的示意图解，而 L1207 图注却作花机图，图号与图题所指不一致；本条照录两处，不据图补写构件。","path":"works/hua-ji-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下《天工开物》织造插图的单件锚点，其图像表现属 C 维度；图号与图题不一致使本条只能低置信度并列。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huaguo-leilei","title":"花果累累（Stone Carving Huaguo Leilei）","name_en":"Stone Carving Huaguo Leilei","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","寿山石雕","花果","大型作品"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花果累累是一件较大的寿山石雕精品。来源在寿山石雕段把它与蟹篓并举，只记它是一件较大的精美作品。来源未给作者、尺寸、石种、创作年份与收藏地点。","path":"works/huaguo-leilei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度寿山石雕单件的条目，花果题材与构图属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huang-di-zhi-jin-wu-long-man-cao-wen-zhong-jin-kao-bei","title":"黄地织金五龙蔓草纹重锦靠背（Yellow-Ground Brocade Backrest with Five Dragons and Scrolling Grass）","name_en":"Yellow-Ground Brocade Backrest with Five Dragons and Scrolling Grass","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","织金","重锦","龙纹","蔓草纹"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"textile","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黄地织金五龙蔓草纹重锦靠背是李立新《中国设计艺术史论》图4-2 图注所载的清代织金重锦靠背。来源只在官营手工业论述中以图版举例，未给尺寸、藏地、织造机构、纹样布局与递藏。图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/huang-di-zhi-jin-wu-long-man-cao-wen-zhong-jin-kao-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代织金重锦的器物锚点，其龙纹与蔓草纹装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huangdi-chuiyishang-sculpture","title":"黄帝垂衣裳雕塑（Modern Sculpture of the Yellow Emperor）","name_en":"Modern Sculpture of the Yellow Emperor","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["黄帝","垂衣裳","今雕塑","图版著录","传说"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"modern_sculpture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"本册图版 1-18 是一件今人所作雕塑，图注为“新石器时代，黄帝垂衣裳而天下治（今雕塑作品）”。图注把“新石器时代”与“今雕塑作品”并列，时代口径本身是矛盾的：题材属于传说时代，作品是当代创作。原文未注明作者、年代、尺寸与收藏地，也未在正文讨论这件雕塑。","path":"works/huangdi-chuiyishang-sculpture.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度“传说如何被图像化”的样本，不是史前器物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huanghe-muqin","title":"黄河母亲（Huanghe Muqin (Mother Yellow River)）","name_en":"Huanghe Muqin (Mother Yellow River)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","城市雕塑","黄河母亲"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sculpture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《黄河母亲》是兰州城市雕塑的代表作品之一，赵农在改革开放后城市雕塑段把它列入能代表城市历史文化的作品。来源只给作品名与所在城市，未给作者、材质、尺度、建成年代与造型。","path":"works/huanghe-muqin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《黄河母亲》是 B 维度下改革开放后城市雕塑作品的条目；来源只作作品列举，未及制度或机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huanghu-hao","title":"黄鹄号（Huanghu Hao (Huanghu Steamship)）","name_en":"Huanghu Hao (Huanghu Steamship)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晚清","1865年","轮船","黄鹄号","徐寿"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黄鹄号是 1865 年徐寿等人制造的机械轮船。赵农称其成为近代造船业的开始；同年江南制造总局成立，开始造船和修船，此后福州船政局、天津机器局、广东军装机器局、旅顺船坞等造船工场陆续兴建。来源未给船体尺度、吨位、动力参数与试航记录。","path":"works/huanghu-hao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"黄鹄号是 B 维度下晚清机械轮船的条目；其作为近代造船业开端的跨文化技术引进意义归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huangyou-ci-bianhu","title":"黄釉瓷扁壶（Yellow-Glazed Porcelain Flat Flask）","name_en":"Yellow-Glazed Porcelain Flat Flask","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北齐","河南安阳","黄釉","扁壶","舞乐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"黄釉瓷扁壶是河南安阳北齐墓出土的黄釉扁壶，壶体两面饰舞乐浮雕人物：一人在莲花上舞蹈，左右各二人在弹琵琶、击钹、吹笛、打拍。来源称其为精美的陶瓷工艺品，并认为它反映了六朝时期的中外文化艺术交流。扁壶是战国以来北方出现的一种特殊壶式。","path":"works/huangyou-ci-bianhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"黄釉瓷扁壶是 B 维度下北齐黄釉瓷器的器物条目，其舞乐浮雕与莲花舞的图像内容归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huaniao-renwu-luodian-jing","title":"花鸟人物螺钿镜（Mother-of-Pearl Mirror with Figures and Birds）","name_en":"Mother-of-Pearl Mirror with Figures and Birds","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","洛阳","螺钿","平脱","人物"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花鸟人物螺钿镜是 1956 年洛阳唐墓出土的螺钿铜镜。镜面花树下老者弹琴、另一老者持杯倾听、后立侍童，镜纽下刻山石、鸳鸯、小鸟、仙鹤，人物衣纹、鸟羽、叶脉均细线刻划，螺片空间似用松石屑填饰且多脱落。李立新将其作为青铜器失去礼制作用后转向日用、仍有珍稀之品的例证之一。","path":"works/huaniao-renwu-luodian-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代铜镜的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huanxiu-shanzhuang","title":"环秀山庄（Huanxiu Villa）","name_en":"Huanxiu Villa","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","苏州园林","私家园林","叠山","戈裕良"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"环秀山庄是苏州名园，赵农记园中有清代乾隆年间造园高手戈裕良的叠山，假山占全园近一半面积。叠山运用幽径、山涧、石窟、悬崖等造型，使山景不断变幻，形成奥妙无穷的险境；主峰与次峰遥相呼应，气连势合。园中补秋山房、问泉亭、半潭秋水等建筑以隐为主，暗含风雨，构成房屋半隐的意境。来源未给建园年代、园主、面积与假山尺度。","path":"works/huanxiu-shanzhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"环秀山庄是 B 维度下清代苏州私家园林的器物条目，以戈裕良叠山著称。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huayan-si","title":"华严寺（Huayan Temple）","name_en":"Huayan Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["辽代","金代","建筑","寺院","华严寺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"temple","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"华严寺是大同的辽金寺院。赵农记大同华严寺分为上、下二寺，下寺是辽代建筑，上寺是金代建筑，上寺的大殿是现存古代最大单檐木结构的建筑；大同善化寺的大雄宝殿是辽代建筑，而山门、普贤阁、三圣殿为金代修建；大同是辽金时期的西京，建筑比邻相连，佛教建筑成为辽金城市的重要象征。来源未给华严寺的平面、塑像、壁藏与营建年代。","path":"works/huayan-si.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"华严寺是 B 维度下辽金木构寺院的条目；其作为辽金西京佛教建筑群的制度背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huayou-yaogu","title":"花釉腰鼓（Mottled-Glaze Waist Drum）","name_en":"Mottled-Glaze Waist Drum","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","花釉","腰鼓","河南","陶瓷器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceramic_drum","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花釉是唐瓷中的新品种，原文在“重要的陶瓷类别”之下把它与青瓷、白瓷、唐三彩并列。其法是在黑釉、黄釉、天蓝釉的基础上再装饰另外一种色釉，一般以蓝白、灰白釉为多，形成大小不同的斑纹；烧造地点有河南的郏县、鲁山、内乡、禹县等地，品种大部分是罐、壶、瓶等，代表作举出河南出土的花釉腰鼓。原文记其造型设计是鼓形两头大、中间纤细，整器施黑釉，装饰月白色大斑纹，并以“如夏日夜空，醒目生动”状其效果。原文没有交代本","path":"works/huayou-yaogu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代花釉陶瓷的器物锚点，材料为正文一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huitonghe","title":"会通河（Huitong River Canal）","name_en":"Huitong River Canal","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","大运河","水利","山东","船闸"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"canal","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"会通河是山东临清与东平之间的河道。赵农记元代多次疏浚运河，并在至元年间开凿通惠河和会通河，使运河从大都到杭州全线贯通；会通河全长 250 里，建有船闸 13 座，以保障船只顺利航行。来源未给开凿年份、主持者、土方量与闸座位置。","path":"works/huitonghe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"会通河是 B 维度下元代漕运水利工程的条目；其国家漕运背景归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huizi","title":"会子（Huizi (Southern Song Paper Money)）","name_en":"Huizi (Southern Song Paper Money)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","纸币","会子","关子","铜版印刷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"paper_money","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"会子是南宋时期发行的纸币。赵农记南宋发行的纸币“会子”“关子”证明社会交易中的大量需求；“会”“关”与“交”的字意相同；会子在南宋绍兴十三年（1160年）正式流通，以三套颜色铜版印刷，今存南宋会子上有“行在会子库”的字样，并配以城池、祥云图案，以及防伪造的赏罚文告。来源原文的年号纪年与公元年份不合：绍兴十三年为公元1143年，此处照录并标疑。","path":"works/huizi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"会子是 C 维度下南宋纸币印刷的条目；其发行制度与储备归 D 维度，铜版印刷归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:human-face-bronze-yue","title":"人面纹铜钺（Bronze Yue with Human-Face Motif）","name_en":"Bronze Yue with Human-Face Motif","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["殷商","青铜兵器","人面纹","造型怪诞"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"人面纹铜钺与食人卣并列，是本册说明殷商青铜器“被夸张到怪诞的程度，给人以神秘，甚至恐怖之感”的例证。原文未描述钺的形制、尺寸与人面纹构图。","path":"works/human-face-bronze-yue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度殷商青铜兵器的评述性锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:humen-huopao","title":"虎门火炮（Humen Huopao (Humen Battery Cannon)）","name_en":"Humen Huopao (Humen Battery Cannon)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","道光","鸦片战争","炮台","虎门火炮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"firearm","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"虎门火炮是道光年间铸造的铁铸筒形火炮，长约 2.3 米、口径 0.14 米，每次装填火药和铁弹各 15 斤。赵农在虎门炮台段记其在鸦片战争中发挥了重要作用；来源末句作“龙门火炮”，承上文疑为“虎门”之讹，照录并存疑。来源未给炮数、射程与炮台布置。","path":"works/humen-huopao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"虎门火炮是 B 维度下清代虎门炮台铁炮的条目；鸦片战争的中西军事冲突背景归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huntianyi","title":"浑天仪（Armillary Sphere）","name_en":"Armillary Sphere","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","张衡","铜制科学仪器","天文仪器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scientific_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"浑天仪是本册“铜制科学仪器”一节的例子。原文称漏壶、圭表、浑天仪以及地动仪、指南车等铜制科学仪器，都是融艺术与实用技术相结合的“产品”；东汉时张衡等用青铜制作浑天仪，能演示天象，并制成世界上第一架候风地动仪；原文接着引《后汉书·张衡传》“以精铜制成，圆径八尺，合盖隆起，形似酒尊”，并描述中间的“都柱”“八道”等机械装置与尊外八条含铜珠的龙、龙头下设置的蟾蜍——这一段实际描述的是地动仪，原文在浑天仪","path":"works/huntianyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度铜制科学仪器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huolang-tu","title":"货郎图（The Peddler）","name_en":"The Peddler","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","李嵩","货郎图","风俗画","广告"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《货郎图》是南宋李嵩的风俗画。赵农在广告段记“宋画李嵩《货郎图》中，杂货满目，妇呼童嘻，货郎进村，一片欢声”，用来说明实物广告与走村串巷的推销形式。来源只给作者、画面气氛与广告功能，未给材质、尺寸、人物数、货担品类与递藏。","path":"works/huolang-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《货郎图》是 C 维度下南宋风俗画的条目；其广告史用途归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huoshaogou-renxing-guan","title":"火烧沟人形罐（Huoshaogou Human-Shaped Jar）","name_en":"Huoshaogou Human-Shaped Jar","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时代","火烧沟","人形罐","象生器","彩陶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painted_pottery_jar","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"火烧沟人形罐是甘肃玉门火烧沟出土的象生陶罐。李立新记其口部仍是双肩耳短领的形式，罐底座设计成象形的双足，形成鼓腹站立的人形；以此说明象生器只在局部采用象生形，其他部位仍为几何化。来源未给尺寸、年代与文化归属细节，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/huoshaogou-renxing-guan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度象生陶器的单器条目，人形造型的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huwang-jin","title":"胡王锦（Huwang Brocade）","name_en":"Huwang Brocade","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋代","吐鲁番","阿斯塔那","织锦","牵驼"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"胡王锦是新疆吐鲁番阿斯塔那古墓出土的隋代丝织品，图案表现一个人牵着骆驼。田自秉在同段还列联珠小花锦、棋局锦、彩条锦、套环贵字绮、套环对鸟纹绮，并称用套环与贵字装饰是隋代丝织的一种特色。来源只给胡王锦一句描述，未给尺寸、组织与藏地。","path":"works/huwang-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"胡王锦是 B 维度下隋代丝织的器物条目，其人物牵驼图像属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:huwen-da-shiqing","title":"虎纹大石磬（Tiger-Engraved Stone Chime）","name_en":"Tiger-Engraved Stone Chime","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","安阳武官村","石磬","双钩线刻","编磬"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"musical_instrument","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"虎纹大石磬是 1950 年安阳武官村大墓出土的商代石磬，长 84 厘米、高 42 厘米、厚 2.5 厘米。用双钩线刻表现一个张口伸腰的虎形，虎身布满装饰斑纹，原文称是一件精巧的石雕珍品，制作水平较高。同时已有三枚组成的编磬；夏代已有石磬，但大多制器粗糙。","path":"works/huwen-da-shiqing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下商代石制乐器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:iron-blade-bronze-yue","title":"铁刃铜钺（Bronze Yue with Iron Blade）","name_en":"Bronze Yue with Iron Blade","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","冶铁起源","陨铁","兵器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铁刃铜钺是本册讨论冶铁术起源的考古证据。原文先列史学界两说：一说据《尚书》《诗经》《左传》判断商代已有铁器、西周开始使用铁器，一说冶铁术发明于春秋战国之交；随后以考古资料为证——1972 年河北藁城台西村一座商代墓葬发掘 1 件随葬铁刃铜钺，1977 年北京平谷刘家河一座早期商墓也发掘 1 件铁刃铜钺，同时期陕西雍城秦公墓内出土铁器。原文据此判断商代已有金属铁的生产，是把铁加热锻打后制成器件加以利","path":"works/iron-blade-bronze-yue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度冶铁技术起源的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jade-handle-iron-sword","title":"玉柄铁剑（Iron Sword with Jade Handle）","name_en":"Iron Sword with Jade Handle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周晚期","人工冶铁","虢国墓","块炼铁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"iron_sword","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玉柄铁剑是本册判定人工冶铁起始年代的实物依据。原文称三门峡市出土的西周晚期虢国国君随葬玉柄铁剑就是人工冶铁制品，说明至迟在西周晚期我国已有人工冶铁；此前春秋中期之前我国冶铁技术尚未成熟，生产的都是海绵状的块炼铁，质量不高。同章“铁氏三兄弟”知识链接则称河南三门峡出土的西周晚期铜柄铁剑，是采用铁矿石多次加热、反复锤打、排出铁中杂质的方法制成——同一地点的西周晚期剑在正文与知识链接中分别作“玉柄”“铜","path":"works/jade-handle-iron-sword.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度冶铁技术史的断代锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jiading-zhu-xiaosong-bamboo-censer","title":"嘉定朱小松竹刻香薰（Jiading Zhu Xiaosong Bamboo Censer）","name_en":"Jiading Zhu Xiaosong Bamboo Censer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","嘉定派","朱小松","竹刻","香薰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bamboo_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"嘉定朱小松竹刻香薰是田自秉册插图11图注所记的明代嘉定竹刻器。图注只记器名、作者与时代；正文嘉定派段记朱小松以刻古佛闻名、嘉定派以深刻及透雕见长。本条据图注立条，不据器名补写香薰的形制、尺寸、纹样与藏地；图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/jiading-zhu-xiaosong-bamboo-censer.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代嘉定竹刻单器的图注锚点，香薰形制与竹刻装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jiangyin-changjiang-daqiao","title":"江阴长江大桥（Jiangyin Yangtze River Bridge）","name_en":"Jiangyin Yangtze River Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","桥梁","江阴长江大桥"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"江阴长江大桥是赵农所列长江上陆续架起的大桥之一，于 1999 年建成。来源只给桥名、年份与所在河流，未给桥长、跨度、材质、设计者与桥址。","path":"works/jiangyin-changjiang-daqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"江阴长江大桥是 B 维度下现代长江桥梁的条目；其现代桥梁技术背景属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jichangyuan","title":"寄畅园（Jichang Garden）","name_en":"Jichang Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","无锡园林","私家园林","惠山","锦汇漪"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"寄畅园是明代中期建成的无锡园林，初名凤谷行窝，后改名寄畅园，以王羲之诗命名。赵农记其西倚惠山，南望锡山，山体逶迤连绵，清泉飞流直下，汇聚成锦汇漪；园中有知鱼槛、涵碧亭等名胜，曾作为颐和园谐趣园的蓝本。寄畅园依托惠、锡两山之势，自然朴素、庄重典雅，可借景入园。来源未给建园年份、园主、面积、设计与叠山工匠。","path":"works/jichangyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"寄畅园是 B 维度下明代无锡私家园林的器物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jiefang-truck","title":"解放牌载重卡车（Jiefang (Liberation) Truck）","name_en":"Jiefang (Liberation) Truck","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1956","长春","第一汽车制造厂","载重汽车","工业产品设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"truck","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1956年7月13日，第一辆被毛泽东命名为“解放”牌的载重卡车在长春第一汽车制造厂总装线试制成功，首批12辆驶下装配线，结束了我国不能批量设计和制造汽车的历史，图11-26。原文记该车以苏联生产的吉斯150型汽车为范本，根据我国实际情况改进部分结构后设计与制造；装备90匹马力6缸汽油发动机，最高时速可达到65公里，载重量为4吨；适合当时国内道路和桥梁的负荷条件，并能根据需要改装成适合各种特殊用途的","path":"works/jiefang-truck.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国汽车工业产品设计的器物锚点，材料为正文两段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jihexingwen-fengniaowen-jin","title":"几何纹凤鸟纹锦（Brocade with Geometric and Phoenix Patterns）","name_en":"Brocade with Geometric and Phoenix Patterns","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","江陵马山","织锦","双色锦","凤纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"几何纹凤鸟纹锦是江陵马山砖厂一号墓出土的战国双色锦。花纹作带状排列，用凤纹、六边形纹、菱形纹等组成并列的二方连续图案；色彩交替使用，使简单纹样构成复杂装饰效果。来源未给尺寸、经纬密度、织物组织与藏地。","path":"works/jihexingwen-fengniaowen-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"几何纹凤鸟纹锦是 B 维度下战国织锦的作品条目；其二方连续与色彩交替属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jin-gu-yuan","title":"金谷园（Jingu Yuan (Jingu Garden)）","name_en":"Jingu Yuan (Jingu Garden)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西晋","石崇","私家园林","庄园","士族"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金谷园是西晋石崇的私家园林，来源把它放在魏晋庄园一节，视为政治势力较量的结果。来源引杜牧《金谷园》诗句，指石崇失败后家姬绿珠坠楼的史实，又引石崇《金谷诗序》写园中清泉茂林、众果竹柏、草药、水碓、鱼池与土窑。作者由此判断，园居先从经济需要的物备，进而达到娱目欢心。来源未给园的规模、布局、今地名与兴废年份，本条不补。","path":"works/jin-gu-yuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度西晋私家园林的条目，园林与士族政治、经济的关系列为 A、D 维度辅助；来源只给一句性质判断、一段自序引文与一句作者评断，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jin-wudi-simayan-mianfu","title":"晋武帝司马炎冕服（Ceremonial Robe of Emperor Wu of Jin）","name_en":"Ceremonial Robe of Emperor Wu of Jin","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晋代","冕服","冠服制度","帝王服饰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ceremonial_robe","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"晋武帝司马炎冕服见本册图版 5-14，图注为“晋代 晋武帝司马炎冕服”。原文在男装部分讨论晋代以后“汉装”与“胡服”的交融演变，记“禅衣”仍为仕宦礼服、“长袍”为交领右衽式、“大衫”袖口宽敞且领袖有缘边，未对冕服形制作单独描述。本条只记图注给出的时代、人物与服类。","path":"works/jin-wudi-simayan-mianfu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度冠服制度的图版锚点，只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jinan-huanghe-daqiao","title":"济南黄河大桥（Jinan Yellow River Bridge）","name_en":"Jinan Yellow River Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","桥梁","济南黄河大桥"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"济南黄河大桥是赵农所列黄河上陆续架起的大桥之一，于 1982 年建成。来源只给桥名、年份与所在河流，未给桥长、跨度、材质、设计者与桥址。","path":"works/jinan-huanghe-daqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"济南黄河大桥是 B 维度下现代黄河桥梁的条目；其现代桥梁技术背景属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jinan-liujia-zhenpu-tongban","title":"济南刘家功夫针铺铜版（Jinan Liu Family Needle Shop Copper Printing Plate）","name_en":"Jinan Liu Family Needle Shop Copper Printing Plate","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","印刷","商标","广告","铜版"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"copper_print_block","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"济南刘家功夫针铺铜版是北宋济南一家针铺的印刷广告铜版，今藏中国国家博物馆。四册的写法差别极大：**夏燕靖 2016 给版面分层、逐字铭文与制作方法**（双线为框、内分三层、28 字全文），**高丰给尺寸、构图评析与中西印刷广告的年代比较**（欧洲 1480 年第一张印刷广告、领先至少 400 年），**赵农只给商标功能与两句铭文**（白兔为记、钢针精制），**夏燕靖 2009 在本条只存一条图题，","path":"works/jinan-liujia-zhenpu-tongban.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"济南刘家功夫针铺铜版是 B 维度下宋代印刷与商业设计的实物锚点：铜版雕刻、版面分层与图文编排都在此可量。版面构成与黑白对比归 C 维度，商标与广告的经营功能归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jinci-shengmu-dian","title":"晋祠圣母殿（Hall of the Holy Mother at Jinci Temple）","name_en":"Hall of the Holy Mother at Jinci Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","木构建筑","太原","晋祠","秀丽风格"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"timber_frame_hall","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山西太原晋祠圣母殿，图7-30。原文在“1）建筑与建筑彩绘设计”一节把宋代建筑技术与艺术定位为已经达到成熟的阶段：两宋的建筑设计规模虽不及唐代，但风格已趋于秀丽和多样化，在建筑布局和造型设计上出现了若干新手法。举例即北宋京城汴梁改变汉以来历代都城采用的封闭式里坊制，改为沿街设店的方式，更加有利于商业和手工业的发展；又举遗存至今的两宋木构架建筑，如现存的山西太原晋祠圣母殿具有的秀丽风格。同段记北方辽","path":"works/jinci-shengmu-dian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代木构建筑的器物锚点，材料为夏燕靖 2016 的一句风格评语加图注，加赵农 2009 的五间重檐歇山、檐柱八龙与43尊彩塑。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jinci","title":"晋祠（Jinci Temple）","name_en":"Jinci Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","建筑","晋祠","圣母殿","鱼沼飞梁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"temple_complex","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"晋祠是山西太原西南晋水发源地悬瓮山的园林式建筑群。赵农记西周成王之弟叔虞封地唐国，后人为纪念唐叔虞因晋水改唐为晋，晋祠经北齐、隋唐不断营造，穿水筑池、立楼起殿、巍峨壮观；宋代仁宗时为祭祀叔虞之母姜氏修筑圣母祠，并重建“鱼沼飞梁”的形制。来源未给建筑群总平面、现存殿宇年代序列与祠内碑刻。","path":"works/jinci.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"晋祠是 B 维度下宋代园林式建筑群的条目；其祭祀制度与历代营建归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jing-shi-jun-bei","title":"敬史君碑（Jing Shijun Bei (Stele of Jing Shijun)）","name_en":"Jing Shijun Bei (Stele of Jing Shijun)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","东魏","碑刻","楷书"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"敬史君碑是东魏碑刻。来源在魏碑书风评述的末段以一句评其清婉秀丽、细巧宜人（L3479），与北魏《张猛龙碑》、《张黑女墓志》并列。来源未给具体年份、形制、尺寸、字数、书丹者与现存地点。来源无对应图题，图版未核，本条不据图补写。","path":"works/jing-shi-jun-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度东魏碑刻的条目，来源仅一句评其书风，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jingyiyuan","title":"静宜园（Jingyi Garden）","name_en":"Jingyi Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","皇家园林","香山","见心斋","琉璃宝塔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"imperial_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"静宜园是北京香山的皇家园林，赵农将其列入清代皇家园林代表。来源记其原为辽金旧苑，康熙年间扩建许多景物，形成以山为体的园景；1860 年被英法联军毁坏，现存仅琉璃宝塔及见心斋等。见心斋以水池为主，环池列楼、廊、榭、轩，圆墙蓝瓦，古木苍翠。来源未给建园与扩建的具体年份、范围、景点总数与毁后复建情况。","path":"works/jingyiyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"静宜园是 B 维度下清代香山皇家园林的器物条目；其皇家营建与毁废史兼及 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jingyun-er-nian-dazhong","title":"景云二年大钟（Jingyun Second-Year Bronze Bell）","name_en":"Jingyun Second-Year Bronze Bell","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","铜钟","景云二年","唐睿宗","舞狮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_bell","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"景云二年大钟是唐睿宗景云二年铭文铜钟，西安博物馆陈列。来源记其重约一万二千多斤，饰舞狮、翔鹤、云纹、宝相花等图案，具有粗犷雄健的气派。来源未给通高、口径、钟纽形制、铭文内容与铸造地点。","path":"works/jingyun-er-nian-dazhong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代铜钟的单器锚点，其舞狮、翔鹤、云纹、宝相花的装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jingzhang-tielu","title":"京张铁路（Jingzhang Railway）","name_en":"Jingzhang Railway","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清末","铁路","詹天佑","人字形铁路","青龙桥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"railway","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"京张铁路是 1909 年詹天佑设计并主持修建的铁路。赵农记因山地复杂、工程艰巨，詹天佑采用“人”字形的爬坡铁轨，借助两台机车使火车翻越高山；来源称其完成是近代中国设计技术的辉煌成就，也是中国人智慧和设计思维的体现。来源另记詹天佑童年赴美留学、毕业于耶鲁大学铁路科；京张铁路地形复杂、山重水复、财政困难，列强意欲插手并散布不利舆论，他在北京八达岭青龙桥车站修筑“人”字形铁路以减缓坡度，并以石拱桥减少工","path":"works/jingzhang-tielu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"京张铁路是 B 维度下近代铁路工程的条目；其作为近代性技术引进与自主设计的意义归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jininglu-cixiu-jiashan","title":"集宁路刺绣夹衫（Jininglu Embroidered Jacket）","name_en":"Jininglu Embroidered Jacket","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","刺绣","夹衫","集宁路","内蒙古"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidered_garment","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"集宁路刺绣夹衫是内蒙古集宁路故城遗址元代窖藏所出刺绣服饰。来源记夹衫在两肩及前胸部位用刺绣装饰，绣有多种动物、植物与人物故事纹样；并判断其具有江南刺绣特点，可能在江南制作，或由江南绣工在北方官府工场制作。来源未给尺寸、形制、底色、针法组合与藏地。","path":"works/jininglu-cixiu-jiashan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代刺绣服饰的单器锚点，纹样题材属 C 维度，江南与北方官府工场的制作推测属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jinqi-diaolong-baozuo","title":"金漆雕龙宝座（Gilt-Lacquer Dragon Throne）","name_en":"Gilt-Lacquer Dragon Throne","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","太和殿","故宫","金漆","雕龙"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"throne","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金漆雕龙宝座是故宫太和殿所陈的清式宝座。高丰记其上部椅圈部位雕 13 条金龙，盘绕在 6 根“金漆元柱”上；靠背板分三格，上格盘金龙、中格浮雕云纹与火珠、下格透雕卷草纹；座面下设高束腰，四面开光透雕双龙戏珠，其余部位雕满花草；座后设七扇屏风，屏面满布“海小纹”或云龙纹、双龙戏珠纹。来源以“雕绩满眼、金碧辉煌”收束，并把它作为清式宝座体现皇者权势与威严的顶点。","path":"works/jinqi-diaolong-baozuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下清式宫廷家具的器物锚点，其龙纹雕刻与屏风配置属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jinsheng-han","title":"金胜（邗江甘泉山汉墓）（Gold Sheng Ornaments from Ganquan Mountain）","name_en":"Gold Sheng Ornaments from Ganquan Mountain","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","邗江","甘泉山","金器","掐丝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"gold_ornament","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金胜是 1980 年江苏邗江甘泉山汉墓出土的一批黄金首饰中的七件金胜。一对金胜重七克，由两个相对的三角形和圆组成，圆形凸起如球面，圆心掐丝镶嵌绿松石，外有小金珠组成联珠纹；小金珠多面反光，形成金碧辉煌的效果。","path":"works/jinsheng-han.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金胜是 B 维度下西汉金细工的器物条目；几何组合与联珠装饰的视觉设计归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jinxing-pen","title":"金星牌金笔（Jinxing Gold Pen）","name_en":"Jinxing Gold Pen","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1956","上海","金笔","轻工业产品","造型设计"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pen","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"上海产金笔。原文在社会主义建设时期工业产品设计一段记：轻工业产品的设计到1956年初有所调整，此时期上海生产的金星牌金笔开始讲究造型设计；随之火柴、塑料、制笔、食品、印刷、纸盒、皮革、文教等轻工业领域也开始提倡产品的造型或是包装设计，以适销市场；当时上海轻工业行业所属的数十家企业都配备有专门的设计室和产品设计人员。本条无图版，原文未记笔的型号、材质与设计者。","path":"works/jinxing-pen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国轻工业产品造型设计的器物锚点，材料只有正文一句。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jinyincuo-shouliewen-tongcheshi","title":"金银错狩猎纹铜车饰（Gold- and Silver-Inlaid Bronze Chariot Fitting with Hunting Scene）","name_en":"Gold- and Silver-Inlaid Bronze Chariot Fitting with Hunting Scene","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","定县汉墓","金银错","狩猎纹","绿松石"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_chariot_fitting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金银错狩猎纹铜车饰是 1965 年河北定县汉墓出土的金银错工艺品，长 26.5 厘米、径 3.6 厘米。器作竹管状，表面凸起轮节，将纹饰分为四段；以狩猎为主题，嵌圆形与菱形绿松石。四段分述大象与骑者、猎人射虎、骆驼与兽斗、孔雀开屏，段间以菱形纹、波纹、锯齿纹分隔。","path":"works/jinyincuo-shouliewen-tongcheshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"金银错狩猎纹铜车饰是 B 维度下西汉金银错车器的器物条目；四段狩猎图像与动物组合的视觉设计归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jinyu-qipan","title":"金鱼漆盘（Goldfish Lacquer Dish）","name_en":"Goldfish Lacquer Dish","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","重庆","漆器","研磨彩绘","金鱼"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"金鱼漆盘是重庆研磨彩绘的代表作品，金鱼隐现在黑漆层里，犹如游在清澈的水中。来源记它曾两次在世界青年联欢节上获得奖状和奖章。来源未给尺寸、作者、制作年份与收藏地点，也未附图像。","path":"works/jinyu-qipan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度漆器单件的条目，画面层次属 C 维度，国际获奖属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jiu-hua-tie","title":"韭花帖（Jiuhua Tie (Letter on Daylily)）","name_en":"Jiuhua Tie (Letter on Daylily)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["五代","杨凝式","韭花帖","书法","行书"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calligraphy","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《韭花帖》是五代杨凝式的书法作品。赵农记其“看似似奇趋正、以险寓平、放浪形骸、佯狂韬晦的大隐姿态”，又说它“实为小题大做，将一段寻常品尝韭花的心态，通过笔端汩汩流淌于后世”。来源把《韭花帖》作为杨凝式书风的代表，未给材质、尺寸、行数、递藏与现存状况，也未录释文。","path":"works/jiu-hua-tie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《韭花帖》是 C 维度下五代书法作品的条目；材料仅风格评语与内容性质，confidence 取 low。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jiuchenggong-liquan-ming","title":"《九成宫醴泉铭》（Jiucheng Palace Spring Inscription）","name_en":"Jiucheng Palace Spring Inscription","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","贞观","碑刻","书法","欧阳询"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stele","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《九成宫醴泉铭》是来源在唐代碑刻中首先举出的作品，由欧阳询书写，贞观六年（公元632年）立。来源称此碑为欧阳询75岁时的作品，乃奉唐太宗之诏而书。书风方面，来源以“笔力刚劲、峻利凝重、法度严谨”评之，并称此碑“有唐楷之冠的称誉”。来源未给碑文内容、撰者姓名、碑址、尺寸与存藏，也未给拓本谱系与翻刻情况。来源配有图 6-21 唐 九成宫醴泉铭，图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"works/jiuchenggong-liquan-ming.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"九成宫醴泉铭在 C 维度下作为唐代碑刻书法与唐楷称誉的代表；碑刻的碑身形制归 B 维度。Theme 与 Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jiujiang-changjiang-daqiao","title":"九江长江大桥（Jiujiang Yangtze River Bridge）","name_en":"Jiujiang Yangtze River Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","桥梁","九江长江大桥"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"九江长江大桥是赵农所列长江上陆续架起的大桥之一，于 1993 年建成。来源只给桥名、年份与所在河流，未给桥长、跨度、材质、设计者与桥址。","path":"works/jiujiang-changjiang-daqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"九江长江大桥是 B 维度下现代长江桥梁的条目；其现代桥梁技术背景属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jiulongbi","title":"九龙壁（Nine-Dragon Wall）","name_en":"Nine-Dragon Wall","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","琉璃","照壁","九龙壁","建筑琉璃"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"glazed_tile_wall","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清代琉璃照壁，图9-31 图注作“清代 九龙壁琉璃建筑”。原文在琉璃烧造一节记：山西也是出产琉璃制品的重要地方，至今遗存一些完全用琉璃砖瓦建造的宝塔、楼阁、照壁等大型建筑，如山西太原的晋祠、大同和北京的九龙壁等。原文未说明图注所指为大同或北京，也未记尺寸、建造年代与龙数。","path":"works/jiulongbi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代琉璃照壁的器物锚点，材料为同段列名加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jiuxi-shibajian","title":"都锦生丝织风景《九溪十八涧》（Du Jinsheng Silk Tapestry of Nine Creeks and Eighteen Gullies）","name_en":"Du Jinsheng Silk Tapestry of Nine Creeks and Eighteen Gullies","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","都锦生","丝织风景","杭州","费城博览会"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"woven_picture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"民国丝织风景，图10-12 图注作“民国 都锦生织品”。原文记杭州的都锦生（1897-1943）在丝织工艺上有突出成就：他在1921年试织成功的丝织西湖名景“九溪十八涧”，成为我国丝织风景的创始产品；第二年，都锦生创办的丝织厂正式投入批量生产；1926年，他创作的丝织风景参加美国费城国际博览会，获金质奖，使我国的丝织工艺享誉中外。","path":"works/jiuxi-shibajian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度民国丝织风景的器物锚点，材料为正文一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:jixiao-shanzhuang","title":"寄啸山庄（Jixiao Mountain Villa）","name_en":"Jixiao Mountain Villa","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","扬州园林","私家园林","复廊","片石山房"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"寄啸山庄是扬州最大的明清园林，名称取自陶渊明《归去来兮辞》倚南窗以寄傲、登东皋以舒啸的辞句。赵农记山庄分东西两部分，以复廊将院落隔开，西院有方亭、蝴蝶厅、潜山馆等建筑，并以二层楼廊环绕。与寄啸山庄关联的片石山房，相传有清代大画家石涛的叠石作品。来源未给建园年代、园主、面积与各建筑的形制。","path":"works/jixiao-shanzhuang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"寄啸山庄是 B 维度下清代扬州最大私家园林的器物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:juyan-han-slips","title":"居延汉简（Juyan Han Slips）","name_en":"Juyan Han Slips","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","西汉","简牍","草书","居延"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"manuscript","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"居延汉简是甘肃居延出土的汉简，赵农把它列为西汉末年草书字体的代表。来源称其运笔以隶书为基点，风格飘逸活泼、笔意连缀，已具草书风格。来源未记简数、简文内容、尺寸、出土年月与现藏，本条不补；本条所据原句从 L2603 起，在 L2605 续完。","path":"works/juyan-han-slips.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"居延汉简是 C 维度下西汉简牍书迹的条目，来源只以一句说明其在草书形成中的代表位置。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:kaicheng-shijing","title":"开成石经（Kaicheng Stone Classics）","name_en":"Kaicheng Stone Classics","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","唐文宗","开成","楷书","十三经"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《开成石经》是公元837年（唐文宗开成二年）以楷书刊刻的儒家经典石碑。来源记初刻儒家经典12种，后补刻《孟子》，共13种，称为十三经，并列出全部经目。来源又称《开成石经》今存西安碑林，规模宏大，气象壮观。来源未记碑石数量、尺寸、行款与书写者，本条不补。","path":"works/kaicheng-shijing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《开成石经》是 C 维度下唐代儒家经典文字标准化的刻石实物，其刻石工艺归 B 维度；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:kaifeng-xiangguosi-pagoda","title":"开封相国寺塔（Pagoda of Xiangguo Temple, Kaifeng）","name_en":"Pagoda of Xiangguo Temple, Kaifeng","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","琉璃砖塔","仿木楼阁式","飞天","50多种纹样"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"开封相国寺塔是宋代仿木楼阁式砖塔，造型高耸挺秀；塔身采用 28 种琉璃砖砌造，雕刻有飞天、麒麟、菩萨、力士、狮子等 50 多种纹样，雕工精细，整座塔宛如一件大型的琉璃工艺品。","path":"works/kaifeng-xiangguosi-pagoda.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下宋代琉璃砖塔的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:kehua-jinwan","title":"刻花金碗（Engraved Gold Bowl）","name_en":"Engraved Gold Bowl","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","金银器","何家村","莲瓣纹","珍珠地纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"gold_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"刻花金碗是陕西西安何家村出土的唐早期金器。高丰记其在碗体周壁装饰两层莲瓣纹，两层莲瓣纹形成面积与形状统一的装饰区；装饰区内雕刻形态各异的鸳鸯、鹦鹉、鹿、狐和卷草纹，碗身衬以珍珠地纹。来源把它的装饰设计评为具有典型早期唐代风格，整体繁密而不凌乱、变化丰富而又统一协调。","path":"works/kehua-jinwan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"刻花金碗是 B 维度下唐代金银器装饰设计的器物条目，其莲瓣分区与纹样构成属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:kongzi-shengjitu","title":"《孔子圣迹图》（Illustrated Life of Confucius）","name_en":"Illustrated Life of Confucius","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["席","跽坐","低型家具","图像资料"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《孔子圣迹图》见本册图版 3-35，图注作“春秋《孔子圣迹图》”。原文在“席”一节称春秋战国时人们通常以坐席形式接人待客，铺席设筵，席上设低矮家具如案和几；席的形状大小多样，长的可坐多人甚至几十人，称“连席”，长者或尊者单人单坐或坐头排，称首席；《孔子圣迹图》就形象地描绘了孔子跽坐在席上游说诸侯王的情景。同节“跽坐”知识链接解释跪坐姿势，并指出跪坐决定了我国早期家具低矮的形制、这一形制一直延续至汉","path":"works/kongzi-shengjitu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度先秦起居方式与低型家具的图像锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lan-ting-ji-xu","title":"兰亭集序（Lanting Ji Xu (Preface to the Orchid Pavilion Gathering)）","name_en":"Lanting Ji Xu (Preface to the Orchid Pavilion Gathering)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","东晋","行书","书法","王羲之"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calligraphy","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"兰亭集序是东晋王羲之的法书。来源在论行书时举此作，称其挥洒自如、风韵雅逸，并转述其有「天下第一行书」之誉（L3444）；又于论园林与结论处引其文句（L3717、L4087）。来源称《兰亭集序》等现存诸帖均为勾摹本，存有20余种（L3503）。创作年月、篇幅、尺寸、递藏与现藏，原文未载；图版未核，本条不据图补写。","path":"works/lan-ting-ji-xu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度东晋法书的条目，来源记其行书之誉、勾摹本存世与文句引用，并以文句支撑 A 维度文化史论述，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lanbai-yinhuabu","title":"新疆民丰蓝白印花布（Blue-and-White Printed Cloth from Minfeng, Xinjiang）","name_en":"Blue-and-White Printed Cloth from Minfeng, Xinjiang","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","蜡染","蜡缬","阑干斑布","新疆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_textile","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"新疆民丰蓝白印花布是本册判断汉代蜡染水平的实物证据。原文称凸版印花技术在西汉时达到相当水平，当时印工已熟练掌印染涂料配制与多套色印花技术，并兼用印花、刺绣和绘画；西南地区少数民族在秦汉时期已掌握蜡染（蜡缬）技术，当时称“阑干斑布”，蜡染布面上设计者巧妙运用点、线结合，图像色彩饱满、层次丰满、疏密有致；蜡染技术后来逐步传入中原，再传到亚洲各国。新疆民丰出土的汉代蓝白印花布反映出当时蜡染工艺已相当精湛","path":"works/lanbai-yinhuabu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度汉代印染工艺的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lanyou-bailongwen-meiping","title":"蓝釉白龙纹梅瓶（Blue-Glazed White-Dragon Meiping）","name_en":"Blue-Glazed White-Dragon Meiping","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","瓷器","蓝釉","白龙纹","梅瓶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蓝釉白龙纹梅瓶是元代瓷器釉色装饰的例证。赵农记元代制瓷的一个显著特点是大量采取花卉蔬果、神话故事、山水动物来装饰瓷器，造型别致、色彩富丽，瓷枕有透雕，书法也成为装饰内容；装饰手法多利用胎质的釉色变化，蓝釉白龙纹梅瓶就是以贴纸敷遮在已绘制好的龙纹图案上，施以蓝釉，揭去纸张后再在龙纹上涂以白釉，烧制成型后蓝白相间、精彩纷呈。来源未给尺寸、藏地、胎釉成分与烧成温度。","path":"works/lanyou-bailongwen-meiping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蓝釉白龙纹梅瓶是 B 维度下元代瓷器釉色装饰的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lanyou-miaojin-yi","title":"蓝釉描金匜（Blue-Glazed Gilt-Decorated Yi Ewer）","name_en":"Blue-Glazed Gilt-Decorated Yi Ewer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","景德镇窑","蓝釉","描金","保定"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蓝釉描金匜是1964年保定出土的元代中期景德镇窑瓷器。来源记瓷匜通体蓝釉，内面用金绘出流云及折枝花；蓝釉和金彩互相衬托，有的器物突出花纹部分，而将花纹以外的地方挂蓝釉，产生蓝与白的色彩对比，显得庄重而高雅。来源未给尺寸、窑口、藏地与图版。","path":"works/lanyou-miaojin-yi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代景德镇窑蓝釉描金瓷匜的单器锚点，金绘流云折枝花的纹样属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lanzhou-tieqiao","title":"兰州铁桥（Lanzhou Iron Bridge）","name_en":"Lanzhou Iron Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","黄河","桥梁","兰州铁桥","天下黄河第一桥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"兰州铁桥是清代晚期建设的黄河大桥，俗称「兰州铁桥」，有「天下黄河第一桥」之称，结束了黄河上游千百年来没有永久性桥梁通行的历史。赵农又称后来黄河上陆续建构了许多大桥，举早期的郑州京汉铁路桥与 1976 年建成的洛阳黄河大桥、1971 年建成的山东北镇黄河大桥、1982 年建成的济南黄河大桥。来源未给桥长、跨度、材质、设计者与建造年份。","path":"works/lanzhou-tieqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"兰州铁桥是 B 维度下清代黄河桥梁的条目；其近代桥梁技术意义属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lenovo-et960","title":"联想ET960智能手机（Lenovo ET960 Smartphone）","name_en":"Lenovo ET960 Smartphone","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["2005","联想","智能手机","IDSA","工业设计奖"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mobile_phone","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"联想ET960智能手机，图11-41 图注记 2005年联想凭借ET960智能手机被美国工业设计协会（IDSA）和《商业周刊》联合评选为年度“全球工业产品杰出设计奖”铜奖。原文在工业设计一节以该机为国内工业设计获奖之例，同段述工业设计的范围、流程与相关学科，并称计算机辅助设计（CAD）已成为现代工业设计最重要的手段。原文未记产品参数、设计团队与上市时间。","path":"works/lenovo-et960.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度当代中国工业设计产品的器物锚点，材料为图注一行加同段工业设计通说。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:leshan-dafo","title":"乐山大佛（Leshan Giant Buddha）","name_en":"Leshan Giant Buddha","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","佛教造像","摩崖","乐山","海通和尚"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cliff_buddha","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"乐山大佛地处四川乐山，依山造像，来源记其缘起于唐开元年间海通和尚的舍身开凿，前后用了 90 年时间，高达 71 米。大佛位于岷江、大渡河、青衣江三江汇流之地的凌云山摩崖，佛像身披袈裟、袒胸倚坐、面目和蔼、法相庄严。来源以传说语气记海通见三江汹涌、舟船翻覆而立志造像，化缘遭州官戏弄，手抠双目以明心志，历数十年而石破山开。来源称其建造过程是中华民族精神意志的张扬，并把佛教造像东渐视为外来文明与中华文化","path":"works/leshan-dafo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"乐山大佛是 B 维度下唐代摩崖造像的条目；来源所述佛教盛行与造像缘起属跨文化宗教传播，归 E 维度，不指派 A。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:li-ning-banpo-basketball-shoe","title":"李宁半坡专业篮球鞋（Li-Ning Banpo Professional Basketball Shoe）","name_en":"Li-Ning Banpo Professional Basketball Shoe","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["2007","李宁","篮球鞋","iF设计奖","工业设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"footwear","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2007年李宁公司推出的半坡专业篮球鞋。原文只有一句：2007年，李宁公司的半坡专业篮球鞋被德国历史最悠久的工业设计机构——汉诺威工业设计论坛举办的“if design award china 2007”评为设计大奖。原文未记产品参数、设计说明、上市时间与图版。","path":"works/li-ning-banpo-basketball-shoe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度当代中国工业设计产品的器物锚点，材料只有正文一句。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:liangtou-jian-chuan","title":"两头尖船（Double-Ended Boat）","name_en":"Double-Ended Boat","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋唐","造船","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-34. 隋唐 两头尖船”，与图6-33 同摄于造船业段末（图6-33、6-34），正文未作描述。图注行插入家具业段中：L2864 起为“2）家具业”，图注位于“家具逐渐向高型、成套化发展，其种类也有增加”一句与所用木料一段之间，与家具文字交错。","path":"works/liangtou-jian-chuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度隋唐造船的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lianhe-fanghu","title":"莲鹤方壶（Lotus and Crane Square Hu）","name_en":"Lotus and Crane Square Hu","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋","青铜器","新郑","方壶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"莲鹤方壶是河南新郑出土的一对春秋青铜方壶，因壶顶莲瓣中立一展翅欲飞的鹤而得名。六册来源都把它视为青铜器由商周静态、肃穆、礼制化风格转向轻巧活泼风格的代表作，是中国设计史叙述中春秋青铜器设计转变的关键物证。","path":"works/lianhe-fanghu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"莲鹤方壶是 B 维度下春秋青铜器设计转变的代表作；年代、尺寸与收藏信息在来源间不完全一致。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lianhua-lou","title":"莲花漏（Lotus Clepsydra）","name_en":"Lotus Clepsydra","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","燕肃","莲花漏","漏刻","漫流系统"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"timekeeping_device","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"莲花漏是北宋燕肃研制的一种浮箭法漏壶。赵农记燕肃研制并采用漫流系统，使多余的水从浮漏上部小孔流出，稳定漏壶的水流速度和压力，又能根据季节变化以不同刻度的浮箭标志时间；由于浮箭插入莲花的花心，浮箭平稳，时间准确。来源说莲花漏被当时朝廷冷落，不予使用，未给尺寸、材料、水位刻度与制作年份。","path":"works/lianhua-lou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"莲花漏是 B 维度下北宋计时器具的条目；其被朝廷冷落的遭遇归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lianhua-qingci-tuowan","title":"莲花青瓷托碗（Lotus-Shaped Celadon Bowl with Stand）","name_en":"Lotus-Shaped Celadon Bowl with Stand","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["五代十国","青瓷","莲花纹","托碗","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-47. 五代十国 莲花青瓷托碗”。正文在五代木漆工艺段之后总述五代十国时期的艺术设计：由于各地区发展不甚平衡，总的气势与唐代已无法相比；从艺术风格上讲，已经失去了初唐的清秀、盛唐的华丽，而只继承了中、晚唐的洗练和沉稳，随后便渐渐形成比较拘谨、秀气、柔弱的时代风格，并以（图6-50）统摄。图注编号6-47 至6-50 与正文引用的（图6-50）不衔接。","path":"works/lianhua-qingci-tuowan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度五代青瓷的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lianhua-zaoxing-wenjiuqi","title":"莲花造型温酒器（Lotus-Shaped Wine Warmer）","name_en":"Lotus-Shaped Wine Warmer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["五代十国","莲花造型","温酒器","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-48. 五代十国 莲花造型温酒器”。图注夹在“## 9. 唐代设计理论述要”标题与《唐六典》一段之间，前后没有对应的正文叙述；同页图注序列为6-47 莲花青瓷托碗、6-48 莲花造型温酒器、6-49 金耳环、6-50 螺钿花鸟纹经函。","path":"works/lianhua-zaoxing-wenjiuqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度五代器物造型的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lianhua-zun","title":"莲花尊（Lotus Zun）","name_en":"Lotus Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南北朝","青瓷","仰覆莲瓣","佛教","七层"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"6","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"莲花尊是南北朝时期（主要是齐、梁和北魏）的特殊青瓷品种，设计别致、意匠新颖，具有较高艺术性。尊体以腹为中心，上下部塑饰成各为相向的三层莲花瓣，层层相接，故又名仰覆莲花瓷尊；尊底也塑成莲花瓣形，全尊共 7 层，肩部有耳，颈部塑出花鸟云龙。此尊高 66.5 厘米、口径 19.2 厘米，现陈列于北京故宫博物院。河北景县出土四件仰覆莲花尊，最高 40 厘米，综合印贴、刻划、堆塑；南京林山梁代大墓出土两件同","path":"works/lianhua-zun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下南北朝青瓷的器物锚点，也涉及 E 维度的佛教艺术传播。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:liantang-ruya-tu","title":"莲塘乳鸭图（Ducks and Lotus Pond (Kesi)）","name_en":"Ducks and Lotus Pond (Kesi)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","缂丝","朱克柔","云间","书画缂丝"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kesi_painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《莲塘乳鸭图》是南宋缂丝名手朱克柔的代表作品。来源把朱克柔与沈子蕃、吴煦并列为南宋云间缂丝名家，称朱克柔作品古澹清雅，《莲塘乳鸭图》是其代表作品。来源未给尺寸、材质、藏地、画面内容与缂织工序，也未说明是否据画稿织造。","path":"works/liantang-ruya-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度南宋缂丝作品的单件锚点，其书画化取向属 C 维度。来源只有一句代表作评价。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lianzhu-luwen-jin","title":"联珠鹿纹锦（Brocade with Linked-Pearl Roundels and Deer）","name_en":"Brocade with Linked-Pearl Roundels and Deer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","织锦","联珠纹","纬锦","图版著录"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-15. 唐代 联珠鹿纹锦”。正文没有对这件锦作单独描述，只在“锦”一节总述：唐代的锦以纬锦为主，达到很高的水平；唐锦的艺术风格以“富丽绚烂，清新流畅”为特征，图案花纹多以各种花草禽兽几何图案及文字为题材，又可分为联珠纹、团窠纹（团花）、对称纹、散花、几何纹、对称纹、晕绸等，段末以（图6-15、6-16）统摄本图与联珠野猪头纹锦。田自秉把此锦列入吐鲁番阿斯塔那所出唐锦清单，图注见插图10","path":"works/lianzhu-luwen-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代织锦的图版锚点，材料为图注一行加同节通说。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lianzhu-yezhutou-wen-jin","title":"联珠野猪头纹锦（Brocade with Linked-Pearl Roundels and Boar-Head Motif）","name_en":"Brocade with Linked-Pearl Roundels and Boar-Head Motif","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","织锦","联珠纹","纬锦","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-16. 唐代 联珠野猪头纹锦”，与图6-15 同被“锦”节段末（图6-15、6-16）统摄。原文在这一节先论锦是古代丝织品中最精美、最贵重的品种，早期为平纹经线显花，南北朝后出现斜纹纬线显花的纬锦；随重型打纬机的出现和多色大花织造的需要，纬显花织法逐渐占据优势，多综多蹑和束综提花相结合，能织出更为丰富多彩的花纹和宽幅织物，唐代的锦以纬锦为主，达到很高的水平。随后总述唐锦风格与联珠纹、团","path":"works/lianzhu-yezhutou-wen-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代织锦的图版锚点，材料为图注一行加同节通说。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lienv-renzhi-tu","title":"列女仁智图（Illustrations of Exemplary Women）","name_en":"Illustrations of Exemplary Women","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东晋","顾恺之","列女仁智图","列女传","插图"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《列女仁智图》是东晋顾恺之绘制的作品，为汉代刘向《列女传》作插图。赵农在书籍插图段两次提及：一次说顾恺之绘制过《列女仁智图》，为《列女传》作插图；一次说宋版《列女传》借用顾恺之的名望，书上标有“晋大司马参军顾恺之图画”字样。来源未给画卷的材质、尺寸、构图、人物数与递藏，也未说宋版所据是否即此图；本条只记来源所载的作者、功能与题名关系。","path":"works/lienv-renzhi-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《列女仁智图》是 C 维度下东晋插图性绘画的条目；材料只有作者、功能与题名，confidence 取 low。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lindian","title":"麟德殿（Lindian Hall）","name_en":"Lindian Hall","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","大明宫","宫殿建筑","宴飨","复原图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palace_hall","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐长安大明宫内宫殿。原文记麟德殿的面积约是故宫太和殿的3倍，宫殿分为上下两层，有前中后3殿，面积5000多平方米，可一次宴请3500人之多。同段记大明宫位于城东北部的龙首原，是唐代乃至当时世界上最宏伟的宫殿建筑群，原名永安宫，唐太宗时建造，初衷是为给太上皇李渊居住，未建成而李渊离世，之后扩建，唐高宗迁入执政；现存遗址范围相当于北京故宫面积的3倍多，由30多所宫殿组成。原文并指出这时候的宫殿与陵墓建","path":"works/lindian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代宫殿建筑的器物锚点，母体为大明宫。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ling-ding","title":"另鼎（音勿）（Ling Ding）","name_en":"Ling Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","恭王","铭文","奴隶买卖","另鼎"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"另鼎是西周恭王时制作的青铜鼎，清末毁于兵火。田自秉记其有铭文 410 字，其中有用一匹马和一束丝买五个奴隶的记载，反映奴隶在当时价值还不如马匹。来源原文作“另(音勿)鼎”，字形与注音不合，未给器名正字；本条照录，不据来源外材料改题。来源未给尺寸、形制、藏地与原藏处。","path":"works/ling-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"另鼎是 B 维度下西周青铜鼎的作品条目；其铭文所记奴隶买卖属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ling-qu","title":"灵渠（Ling Qu）","name_en":"Ling Qu","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","秦代","水利","运河","灵渠"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"waterway_engineering","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"灵渠是秦始皇于公元前219年派史禄在广西兴安开凿的水利航运工程，沟通湘江与漓江，全长33公里，使长江与珠江水系连通。来源记其以船闸提高和平衡水位，又设分水工程保持水源，使船只不受河流落差限制。来源未给渠宽、比降、船闸数量、具体线路与现存状况。","path":"works/ling-qu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"灵渠是 B 维度下秦代水利航运工程的条目，来源给主持者、年代、路线、长度与船闸分水技术。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lingtai","title":"灵台（Lingtai Terrace）","name_en":"Lingtai Terrace","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","园苑","灵沼","周文王","诗经"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden_structure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"灵台是赵农所述西周园苑中的台观，与灵沼相配，建于丰邑，来源依《诗经·大雅·灵台》与《孟子·梁惠王上》立说。赵农称中国古典园林的建立一般认为从西周开始；灵台的作用最初是登台受命于天，在丰邑修建本是为了政治目的；灵沼则带神秘色彩，是周民族传说的心理寄托。来源把灵台、灵沼、神鸟异木与祭天拜地连成人与自然对话的园苑场景。","path":"works/lingtai.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"灵台是 B 维度下西周园苑台观的条目，其与灵沼的配置和祭天功能见来源论述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:liu-guandao-xiaoxia-tujuan","title":"刘贯道《消夏图卷》（Liu Guandao's Handscroll of Summer Leisure）","name_en":"Liu Guandao's Handscroll of Summer Leisure","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","刘贯道","家具","榻","屏风"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代画家刘贯道所绘《消夏图卷》，图8-46。原文以此画为元代家具的图像证据：画中出现榻、桌、屏风、足承等多种家具样式；其中桌和足承非常有特色——桌结合案几制作，呈四角回形，并且在回形结构内饰有弧形嵌板，表面刻有复线，整个桌形给人稳重精致的感觉；足承既是居室中与榻相伴的用品，又是大户人家居室中的主要点缀饰品，原本起着盆架的作用，但在此画幅中装饰成分强烈，表明元代的家具雕饰工艺仍然发达。原文同段另述高","path":"works/liu-guandao-xiaoxia-tujuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代家具的图像证据，材料为正文一段形制描述加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:liujin-tong-jiuzun","title":"鎏金铜酒樽（Gilt Bronze Wine Zun）","name_en":"Gilt Bronze Wine Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","青铜器","酒器","山西右玉","鎏金"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_wine_vessel","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鎏金铜酒樽是山西右玉出土的汉代青铜酒器，高 24.5 厘米、口径 23.4 厘米。器身饰满动物纹，有虎、豹、熊、狐、猴、鹿、兔、羊、骆驼、龙、凤、鸟等，高丰认为这些动物“在当时是作为祥禽瑞兽来表现的，具有吉祥的意味”。来源把它作为汉代青铜酒器由商代晚期“大、厚、重、繁”转向实用优美的例证。\n\n田自秉 2010 册把同一件称作“铜奁”，记其高 24.5 厘米、腹部两带动物纹、动物种类与高丰所记相同，","path":"works/liujin-tong-jiuzun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鎏金铜酒樽是 B 维度下汉代青铜酒器的器物条目，其动物纹装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:liujin-wuma-xianbei-yinhu","title":"鎏金舞马衔杯银壶（Gilt Silver Ewer with Dancing Horse）","name_en":"Gilt Silver Ewer with Dancing Horse","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["盛唐","何家村","皮囊壶","鎏金","舞马"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silverware","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鎏金舞马衔杯银壶是盛唐银器，1970 年 10 月西安何家村唐代窖藏出土，通高 18.5 厘米。器腹两面锤出马衔杯纹，仿北方游牧民族皮囊与马镫综合形状，圈足墨书“十三两半”。舞马部分采取鎏金技术，使银壶与鎏金相互辉映。","path":"works/liujin-wuma-xianbei-yinhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下盛唐金银器的器物锚点，也涉及 E 维度的游牧文化影响。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:liujin-yin-huntianyi","title":"鎏金银浑天仪（Gilt-Silver Armillary Sphere）","name_en":"Gilt-Silver Armillary Sphere","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","天文仪器","浑天仪","鎏金银","地平线"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"scientific_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鎏金银浑天仪是李立新 2011 册结论章“规范化”一节所插图注记的清代天文仪器。图注称其上有地平线、子午环、赤道环、太阳、月亮、地球等，地球上刻有经纬线及各大洲名称，设计精巧，可手工操作观察天体运转关系，并注明引自《中国文物精华大辞典》。图注未给尺寸、重量、制作年代、作坊与现藏单位。图注插在 L1948 与 L1956 之间，正文此处正在论述中国造物设计规范化的雏形可上溯到新石器时代晚期、周代专设","path":"works/liujin-yin-huntianyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代天文仪器的器物锚点；图注所在“规范化”论证属 A、B 维度的设计原则讨论。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:liujin-yinzhu-jie-xunlu","title":"鎏金银竹节高柄铜薰炉（Gilt Silver Bamboo-Joint High-Stem Censer）","name_en":"Gilt Silver Bamboo-Joint High-Stem Censer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","茂陵","鎏金银","竹节柄","薰炉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_censer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鎏金银竹节高柄铜薰炉是 1981 年陕西兴平茂陵附近一号无名冢出土的西汉铜薰炉，高 58 厘米。炉柄作五节竹节形，圆形座上塑蟠龙，柄端衔于龙口；炉体下部十组三角形内饰龙纹，中为银带，饰四条金龙；盖作山峦形。盖口有字铭，记器名、重量、制作与输送年份及编号。来源称其为造形特殊的罕见薰炉作品。","path":"works/liujin-yinzhu-jie-xunlu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鎏金银竹节高柄铜薰炉是 B 维度下西汉鎏金银铜器的器物条目；竹节、蟠龙与山峦盖的图像面向兼涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:liuyuan","title":"留园（Lingering Garden）","name_en":"Lingering Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明清","苏州园林","私家园林","冠云峰","游廊"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"留园是明清时期苏州名园。赵农记其园景丰富、名胜繁多，从入口曲廊起，步移景迁、曲境通幽，借透窗逐渐展示园景；中部景区由明瑟楼、涵碧山房、闻木樨香轩、清风池馆、西楼等构成，东部由五峰山馆、还我读书处、林泉耆硕之馆、冠云楼等组成，冠云楼前冠云峰高 6.5 米，相传为北宋花石纲遗石；西部有活泼泼地等建筑，北部多为田园风物。留园的特点在以游廊为导引，曲折反复，园中套园，使游人从不同视点观察景色变化。来源未给","path":"works/liuyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"留园是 B 维度下明清苏州私家园林的器物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:longfenghuwen-xiuyi","title":"龙凤虎纹绣衣（Embroidery Garment with Dragon, Phoenix and Tiger）","name_en":"Embroidery Garment with Dragon, Phoenix and Tiger","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","江陵马山","刺绣","龙凤虎纹","辫绣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidery_garment","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙凤虎纹绣衣是湖北江陵马山砖厂一号墓出土的战国刺绣衣物。蟠曲的龙与飞舞的凤穿插自然、线条流畅，昂首扬尾的猛虎张嘴似与龙搏斗，虎身红黑相间斑纹成为画面点缀；绣地多用绢，针法主要为辫绣、局部间以平绣。来源未给尺寸、墓号与藏地。","path":"works/longfenghuwen-xiuyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙凤虎纹绣衣是 B 维度下战国刺绣衣物的作品条目；其龙凤虎纹样与构图属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:longhao-jiche","title":"龙号机车（Longhao Locomotive）","name_en":"Longhao Locomotive","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晚清","1881年","机车","龙号机车","唐胥铁路"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"locomotive","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙号机车是唐胥铁路上由中国人自己制造的机车。赵农以 1881 年通车的唐胥铁路为背景，称该路虽只有 10 公里长，“龙号”机车却是中国人自己制造的。来源未给机车型式、轴式、功率、制造厂与现存状态。","path":"works/longhao-jiche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙号机车是 B 维度下晚清自造机车的条目；其自主制造的技术近代性归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:longhu-bangsu","title":"龙虎蚌塑（Dragon and Tiger Shell Mosaic）","name_en":"Dragon and Tiger Shell Mosaic","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时代","濮阳","西水坡","蚌塑","龙虎"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"shell_mosaic","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙虎蚌塑是河南濮阳西水坡遗址出土的蚌壳摆塑，见于李立新第一章图版。来源记新石器时期濮阳有三组蚌壳摆塑，其中一组龙背骑有一人，认为与巫觋关系有关；并引张光直说其不用真兽随葬而以艺术品表示，表明艺术形象似乎也可以发挥实际的作用。图1-21 图题作“龙虎蚌塑（河南濮阳西水坡遗址出土）”。来源未给三组摆塑的各自内容、尺寸、年代与共存关系，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/longhu-bangsu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新石器时代蚌塑的单件条目，龙虎形象与摆塑构图属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:longhu-zun","title":"龙虎尊（Dragon-Tiger Zun）","name_en":"Dragon-Tiger Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["殷商","青铜酒器","凝重浑厚","龙虎纹"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"龙虎尊是本册说明殷商青铜器“给人以凝重、浑厚之感”一类的例证，与司母戊鼎、四羊尊并列。原文未描述其形制与纹饰。","path":"works/longhu-zun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度殷商青铜酒器的评述性锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:longwen-kuihua-jing","title":"龙纹葵花镜（Mallow-Shaped Mirror with Dragon Design）","name_en":"Mallow-Shaped Mirror with Dragon Design","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","铜镜","葵花形","龙纹","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-4. 唐代 龙纹葵花镜”，位置在“隋唐文化”章首图组，前为图6-3“五代十国 历史地图”，后为图6-5“唐代 三彩”，不在铜镜专节。正文铜镜专节（L2821-L2847）讨论唐镜兴盛的原因、装饰加工方法（金银平脱、贴金银或称包金银、鎏金、错金银、镶嵌、螺钿、著彩、涂珐琅）以及铜锡铅配比与镜面微凸之理，但没有回指本图。","path":"works/longwen-kuihua-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代铜镜的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:longzang-si-bei","title":"《龙藏寺碑》（Longzang Temple Stele）","name_en":"Longzang Temple Stele","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋代","碑刻","书法","书风","初唐"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stele","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《龙藏寺碑》是来源在隋唐碑刻一节举出的隋代碑刻，立于开皇六年（公元586年）。来源先总述隋唐碑刻的碑额、碑身与碑座形制，以及其书法“湛精高古，丰姿绰约”，再以本碑为一例，给出两条评语与“隋碑第一”的俗称，并判断它对初唐虞世南、褚遂良书风的形成有一定作用。来源未给碑址、撰书人姓名、行数、尺寸与存藏情况，也未说明两条评语与俗称的出处。来源此段未配本碑图版，图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"works/longzang-si-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"龙藏寺碑在 C 维度下作为隋代碑刻书法的代表；其碑额、碑身与碑座的形制语汇兼及 B 维度。Theme 与 Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lu-zigang-tea-crystal-vase","title":"陆子冈梅花茶晶花插（Lu Zigang Tea-Crystal Vase with Plum Blossom）","name_en":"Lu Zigang Tea-Crystal Vase with Plum Blossom","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","陆子冈","茶晶","花插","巧色"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陆子冈梅花茶晶花插是明代苏州琢玉艺人陆子冈所作茶晶花插，田自秉册插图10图注称梅花茶晶花插。来源记茶晶花插运用巧色琢出白梅和枝干，处理巧妙，结构自然；未给尺寸、胎料、款识、藏地与图版核验。","path":"works/lu-zigang-tea-crystal-vase.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代苏州玉雕单器的锚点，巧色白梅与枝干的处理属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:luanshu-fou","title":"栾书缶（Luan Shu Fou）","name_en":"Luan Shu Fou","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋","错金铭文","错金银","青铜缶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"栾书缶是春秋时期青铜缶，上有错金铭文 40 余字，被用作春秋中期错金银工艺有所发展的例证；该器铭文是说明当时错金技术水平的实物材料。","path":"works/luanshu-fou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下春秋青铜器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lugou-qiao","title":"卢沟桥（Lugou Bridge (Marco Polo Bridge)）","name_en":"Lugou Bridge (Marco Polo Bridge)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["金代","桥梁","石桥","卢沟桥","石狮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"卢沟桥是金代建成的石拱桥。赵农记其建成于金明昌三年（1192），《马可·波罗游记》称其为当时“世界上最好的独一无二的桥”，是金代建筑史上的杰作，历经 800 余年风雨侵蚀仍安然无恙；卢沟桥地处卢沟河（清代改名永定河），全长 266.5 米、桥宽 7.5 米、共 11 孔、桥高约 10 米，桥孔为圆拱形、中心桥孔跨度约 21.6 米，是北方最长的石拱桥；桥墩靠河流上游方向有尖嘴的石础，以分冰凌和洪流","path":"works/lugou-qiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"卢沟桥是 B 维度下金代石桥工程的条目；其驿路交通与军事区位归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lujiao-lihe","title":"鹿角立鹤（Antlered Crane）","name_en":"Antlered Crane","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","楚墓","鹿角","神怪观念","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ritual_object","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鹿角立鹤是见于李立新第一章图版的器物，图题只作“图1-24 鹿角立鹤”。正文在讨论春秋战国天神、地祇、人鬼观念时以（图1—24）引及此图，未描述形制、材质、尺寸与出土信息。图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/lujiao-lihe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度战国器物的单件图版条目，其神怪形象属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lunyu-yuzhu","title":"论语玉烛（Lunyu Yuzhu (Analects Wine-Game Vessel)）","name_en":"Lunyu Yuzhu (Analects Wine-Game Vessel)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","金银器","涂金","龟座","酒筹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silver_wine_game_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"涂金龟负“论语玉烛”是1982年江苏丹徒丁卯桥出土的银器。龟形座背负圆筒，筒上刻龙凤卷草与“论语玉烛”四字，内装五十支刻《论语》章句的银酒筹，是古代行酒令器具，来源称尚属首见。来源未给尺寸、重量、涂金范围、酒筹长度与藏地。","path":"works/lunyu-yuzhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代金银器的单器锚点，龙凤卷草与筒身刻字属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:luo-shen-fu-tu","title":"洛神赋图（Luoshen Fu Tu (Nymph of the Luo River)）","name_en":"Luoshen Fu Tu (Nymph of the Luo River)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东晋","绘画","顾恺之","女服","右衽"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"洛神赋图是东晋顾恺之的绘画，来源在本册只把它当作魏晋女服的图像证据。来源说图中妇女形象多为当时写照，用以印证日常女服上襦下裙、襦衫以右衽为主的形制。图 5-25、图 5-26、图 5-27 三条图注都标为东晋顾恺之《洛神赋图》局部，图版未核。来源未记画卷的材质、尺寸、卷数、题跋、完整画面内容与收藏地，本条不补，也不据画名补写洛神故事。","path":"works/luo-shen-fu-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下以服饰形象为证据的绘画条目，图的视觉传达属性列为 C 维度辅助；来源只给女服形制的一句判断与三条图注，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:luodian-huaniao-wen-jinghan","title":"螺钿花鸟纹经函（Mother-of-Pearl Sutra Box with Bird-and-Flower Design）","name_en":"Mother-of-Pearl Sutra Box with Bird-and-Flower Design","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["五代十国","螺钿","漆器","经函","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_box","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-50. 五代十国 螺钿花鸟纹经函”。正文在五代木漆工艺一段只记前蜀王建墓出土门、棺、椁、册匣、宝盌、镜盒等6种漆器，其中银铅胎漆碟为这一类器物中最引人注意者；又记1975年蔡庄五代墓出土44个木俑（男俑、女俑、生肖俑、镇墓兽及人首蛇身、人首鱼身、人首龙身、人首兽身等），均以桫木雕刻。原文没有提到经函，也没有描述螺钿工艺。","path":"works/luodian-huaniao-wen-jinghan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度五代漆器的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:luodian-wuxian-pipa","title":"螺钿五弦琵琶（Mother-of-Pearl Five-String Pipa）","name_en":"Mother-of-Pearl Five-String Pipa","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","漆器","螺钿","琵琶","正仓院"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_pipa","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"螺钿五弦琵琶是日本正仓院所藏唐代螺钿乐器，来源把它列在螺钿花鸟纹镜、螺钿紫檀琵琶、螺钿紫檀阮咸等唐代螺钿器之后，称五弦琵琶最为精美。来源引《正仓院考古记》描述其背板满布螺钿鸟蝶花卉云形与宝相华文，花心叶心间涂红碧粉彩、以金线描之、上覆琥珀玳瑁。来源未给通长、弦制、螺钿片数与入藏经过。","path":"works/luodian-wuxian-pipa.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代螺钿乐器的单器锚点，镶嵌画面与彩绘属 C 维度，藏于日本正仓院属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:luodian-zhuiqi-zanhe","title":"螺钿朱漆攒盒（Mother-of-Pearl-Inlaid Red Lacquer Tiered Box）","name_en":"Mother-of-Pearl-Inlaid Red Lacquer Tiered Box","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","扬州","螺钿","朱漆","攒盒"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_box","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"螺钿朱漆攒盒是田自秉清代扬州螺钿段著录的一件清代漆盒，只见于图注，编号为插图5。图注排在扬州螺钿段与卢映之、卢葵生祖孙段之间，正文的引图标记则在漆沙砚一段之末。来源未给尺寸、嵌片工艺、纹样与收藏，本条未做视觉核验。","path":"works/luodian-zhuiqi-zanhe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代螺钿漆器的图注锚点，朱漆与嵌片的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:luoxuanwen-caitao-weng","title":"螺旋纹彩陶瓮（Painted Pottery Jar with Spiral Pattern）","name_en":"Painted Pottery Jar with Spiral Pattern","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["马家窑型","彩陶","螺旋纹","同心圆","彩陶瓮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"螺旋纹彩陶瓮是马家窑型彩陶瓮，图版彩版 4。田自秉记马家窑型彩陶装饰多同心圆中心图案、曲线与直线组合，点的外面围以螺旋纹而有动感，艺术风格可称旋动、流畅。来源未给该瓮尺寸、出土地点与藏地。","path":"works/luoxuanwen-caitao-weng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"螺旋纹彩陶瓮是 B 维度下马家窑型彩陶瓮的作品条目；其螺旋纹与同心圆构图属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:luoyang-huanghe-daqiao","title":"洛阳黄河大桥（Luoyang Yellow River Bridge）","name_en":"Luoyang Yellow River Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","桥梁","洛阳黄河大桥"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"洛阳黄河大桥是赵农所列黄河上陆续架起的大桥之一，于 1976 年建成。来源只给桥名、年份与所在河流，未给桥长、跨度、材质、设计者与桥址。","path":"works/luoyang-huanghe-daqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"洛阳黄河大桥是 B 维度下现代黄河桥梁的条目；其现代桥梁技术背景属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lushan-si-bei","title":"《麓山寺碑》（Lushan Temple Stele）","name_en":"Lushan Temple Stele","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","开元","碑刻","书法","李邕"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stele","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《麓山寺碑》是来源在唐代碑刻中举出的李邕作品。来源记其为开元十八年（公元703年）所立，有“李北海第一”的说法，并以“天姿矫健、英华高卓”评其书。原文所记开元十八年与括注公元703年不能对应（开元十八年对应公元730年），本条照录原文并标疑，不径改年份。来源未给碑址、碑文、行数、尺寸、存藏与拓本谱系，也未给撰者与立碑缘起。来源此段未配本碑图版，图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"works/lushan-si-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"麓山寺碑在 C 维度下作为李邕所书唐碑的条目；碑刻形制归 B 维度。其年号纪年与括注公元纪年不合，是原文内部疑点。Theme 与 Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lushan-yao-ci-paigu","title":"鲁山窑瓷拍鼓（Lushan Kiln Porcelain Drum）","name_en":"Lushan Kiln Porcelain Drum","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","鲁山窑","花瓷","拍鼓","乐器"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鲁山窑瓷拍鼓是唐代鲁山窑烧制的瓷质拍鼓，图注见插图4。正文在彩瓷段称斑纹釉瓷的烧造地点有河南郏县、禹县、鲁山，以鲁山为主要产地；来源未单述此鼓，鼓形、鼓钉、皮膜与尺寸均未载。","path":"works/lushan-yao-ci-paigu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鲁山窑瓷拍鼓是 B 维度下唐代鲁山窑花瓷乐器的图版锚点，只记器名与鲁山窑的产地背景。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:lv-you-tao-lou","title":"绿釉陶楼（Green-Glazed Pottery Tower）","name_en":"Green-Glazed Pottery Tower","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","明器","楼阁式建筑","庄园坞堡","绿釉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tomb_model","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绿釉陶楼是汉代墓葬出土的绿釉陶质明器，能体现汉代楼阁式建筑式样。汉代建筑以楼阁形式较为典型，一般由台基、门楼和五层楼阁组成，各层门窗、屋脊、栏杆等部位饰有人物、花鸟等纹样；绿釉陶楼直观再现建筑的形制特征和建造技巧，是汉代陶塑中不可多得的上乘之作，并反映东汉末年皇室衰微、地方豪强构筑庄园坞堡、拥兵自卫的社会现实。","path":"works/lv-you-tao-lou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下东汉建筑明器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:man-eating-you","title":"食人卣（You Vessel with Human Figure）","name_en":"You Vessel with Human Figure","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["殷商","青铜酒器","造型怪诞","图版著录"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"食人卣是本册讨论殷商与西周青铜器造型差别时举出的例子。原文称殷商时期超出实用功能的审美追求异常强烈但缺乏统一标准：一部分器物给人以凝重、浑厚之感，如司母戊鼎、四羊尊、龙虎尊；另一部分则被夸张到怪诞的程度，给人以神秘甚至恐怖之感，如食人卣、人面纹铜钺。原文没有展开这一件的形制。\n\n李立新 2011 在讨论商周青铜器动物纹样与巫觋通天时，以虎食人卣为例转引张光直的解释：张光直认为这不是食人的举动，而是","path":"works/man-eating-you.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度殷商青铜器的样本条目，两册分别给审美评述与张光直的通天解释。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:mao-badge","title":"毛主席像章（Mao Zedong Badges）","name_en":"Mao Zedong Badges","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["文革","像章","政治宣传","徽章","毛泽东"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"badge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“文革”时期的毛泽东像章，原文在“文革时期的政治宣传设计和书籍设计”一节记：作为政治宣传的有效形式，这一时期风靡全国的“毛主席像章”设计是一项代表；像章大小不一，花色品种繁多；据统计，仅“文革”期间制作的各种不同类型、不同图案和不同材质的毛泽东像章就超过4万余种。原文未给具体某枚像章的图版、尺寸、材质分类与制作单位。","path":"works/mao-badge.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度文革政治宣传品设计的品类锚点，材料为正文一段。本条记品类而非单件实物。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:mao-gong-ding","title":"毛公鼎（Mao Gong Ding）","name_en":"Mao Gong Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","青铜鼎","长篇铭文","479字","兽蹄足"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_ding","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"毛公鼎是西周青铜鼎。2016 在叙述西周后期鼎形演变时，以耳渐外移、口渐敞、下腹内收使器身成半球形、足成兽蹄形为特征，将毛公鼎与大克鼎并举为这一形制的代表器。赵农以图 2-42“西周 毛公鼎”收录，称其长篇铭文是西周珍贵文献，与《史墙盘》《大盂鼎》《虢季子白盘》《多友鼎》并列；《毛公鼎》有 479 个文字，记述当时复杂的社会事件。","path":"works/mao-gong-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西周青铜鼎的器物锚点，铭文内容另涉 A 维度的文献价值。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:mawangdui-boditu","title":"马王堆帛地图（Mawangdui Silk Maps）","name_en":"Mawangdui Silk Maps","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","西汉","马王堆","帛地图","测绘"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"map","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"马王堆帛地图是1973年长沙马王堆出土的三幅帛上地图，包括地形图、驻军图、城邑图。来源称其为西汉时期重要的地图资料，反映当时测绘水平；地图繁密而井然、详备而明晰，地形图为18万分之一、驻军图为8万分之一（L3183、L3189、L3191）。","path":"works/mawangdui-boditu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度西汉地图绘制的条目，兼涉 B 维度测绘技术，地图以符号与比例传达地理信息，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:meique-tu","title":"梅鹊图（Magpies and Plum Blossoms (Kesi)）","name_en":"Magpies and Plum Blossoms (Kesi)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","缂丝","沈子蕃","云间","书画缂丝"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kesi_painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《梅鹊图》是南宋缂丝名手沈子蕃的作品。来源把沈子蕃与朱克柔、吴煦并列为南宋云间缂丝名家，称《梅鹊图》甚为精美。来源未给尺寸、材质、藏地、画面内容与缂织工序。","path":"works/meique-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度南宋缂丝作品的单件锚点，其书画化取向属 C 维度。来源只有一句并称。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:mengshu-gongjitu","title":"孟蜀宫妓图（Court Ladies of Meng Shu）","name_en":"Court Ladies of Meng Shu","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","唐寅","仕女画","服饰","中国衣经"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《孟蜀宫妓图》是唐寅所作的绘画，李立新绪言以图注引之。图注称除头饰外，画中妇女所穿窄袖直襟背子、披肩、裙等均为明代妇女典型的服饰形制；来源未给尺寸、材质、收藏地与创作年代，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/mengshu-gongjitu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度明代服饰图像的条目，衣料与剪裁工艺属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:mengtian-jiangjun-yuhuchun-ping","title":"蒙恬将军玉壶春瓶（Yuhuchun Vase with the Story of General Meng Tian）","name_en":"Yuhuchun Vase with the Story of General Meng Tian","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","青花","玉壶春瓶","历史故事纹","瓷器装饰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代瓷器，图8-12 的图注为：8-12. 元代“蒙恬将军”玉壶春瓶。原文在元代瓷器装饰纹样一段说元代瓷品的装饰对历史故事题材的创作十分重视，如萧何月下追韩信、蒙恬将军等，这对明清两代瓷器上人物故事的题材有重大影响，句末以（图8-11、8-12）统摄两器。原文未描述此瓶的尺寸、窑口、出土与藏地，也未展开画面情节。","path":"works/mengtian-jiangjun-yuhuchun-ping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代瓷器装饰题材的器物锚点，材料为图注一行加同段题材列举。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:miaojin-duidiao-qihe","title":"描金堆雕漆盒（Gold-Traced Carved Lacquer Box）","name_en":"Gold-Traced Carved Lacquer Box","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","漆器","描金","堆贴","须弥座"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_box","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"描金堆雕漆盒是浙江瑞安出土的宋代漆盒精品。来源记盒为四方形，盒脚仿须弥座，顶部呈内倾斜状；四面用连弧纹开光，中心以描金绘人物、波涛、火焰、散花等，开光外堆贴卷草纹；盒脚须弥座处也有开光，除描金棋格、小枝花外还有堆贴动物；盒顶斜面堆贴牡丹、莲荷等串枝花；连弧相接处与盒顶开光折线处用珍珠嵌饰。来源称其形式与河南密县出土宋代三彩琉璃舍利盒基本相似，可能作舍利盒使用。来源未给尺寸、漆色层次与藏地。","path":"works/miaojin-duidiao-qihe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代漆器的单器锚点，开光、描金与堆贴纹样属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:miaoying-si-baita","title":"北京妙应寺白塔（Miaoying Temple White Stupa）","name_en":"Miaoying Temple White Stupa","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","阿尼哥","覆钵式塔","尼泊尔","铜华盖"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"religious_architecture","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北京妙应寺白塔建于至元八年（1271），由尼泊尔名匠阿尼哥设计，为覆钵式塔（喇嘛塔），年代最早、规模最大。塔高 50.9 米，塔基三层、平面呈亚字形、须弥座式，砖雕莲座承塔身；塔肚顶部华盖由 40 块铜板瓦构成，四周悬 36 只铜质透雕流苏和风铃，刹顶置铜制小喇嘛塔高 5 米、重约 40 吨。","path":"works/miaoying-si-baita.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下元代宗教建筑的器物锚点，也涉及 E 维度的跨文化技术流动。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ming-changcheng","title":"万里长城（Ming Great Wall）","name_en":"Ming Great Wall","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","长城","军事防御","边镇","墙体构筑"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"defensive_wall","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"万里长城是明代重新构筑的北部防御工程。赵农记战国以来北方不断出现长城，秦朝曾把燕赵等地旧长城连缀起来，但真正意义的万里长城是明代重新构筑的：西起嘉峪关，东达山海关，并延伸辽东边墙至鸭绿江畔，部分地区筑内长城，全长 12700 多里、合 6000 多公里，沿线设九所边镇。墙体以巨砖和石条包裹外表，内部用黄土、石灰、江米质黏合一体，外墙有垛口，相隔不远建烽火台。清代疆域辽阔，长城几乎失去军事战略的实用","path":"works/ming-changcheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"万里长城是 B 维度下明代军事防御工程的条目；边镇制度与军事管理归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ming-shisanling","title":"明十三陵（Ming Thirteen Tombs）","name_en":"Ming Thirteen Tombs","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","北京昌平","天寿山","帝陵","长陵"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mausoleum","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明十三陵是明代朱棣及以后十三位帝王（除明景泰帝外）的陵墓群。赵农记其以北京昌平天寿山为依托，坐北朝南，利用山势，以小丘为门阙，采取公共神道，加强墓园空旷肃穆的气氛；以朱棣长陵为中心，设有陵门、享殿、明楼、宝城，其余各陵仿长陵规格而尺寸略小。来源未给陵域总面积、各陵名称与营建年代序列。","path":"works/ming-shisanling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明十三陵是 B 维度下明代帝陵群的条目；陵寝制度与祭祀管理归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ming-xiaoling","title":"明孝陵（Ming Xiaoling Mausoleum）","name_en":"Ming Xiaoling Mausoleum","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","南京","钟山","帝陵","宝顶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mausoleum","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明孝陵是明代葬于南京钟山南麓的帝陵。赵农记其主体部分为工字形的院落和宝顶，棱恩殿规模与北京长陵棱恩殿差不多，但仅存石基；方城明楼是建在方形城门上的城楼，宝顶有圆墙环绕，宝顶下面为地宫；这种陵墓建制使北京明十三陵有了基本参照样式。来源未给陵域面积、神道长度与营建年代。","path":"works/ming-xiaoling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"明孝陵是 B 维度下明代帝陵建筑的条目；陵寝制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:minhang-fenghuang-biaozhi","title":"中国民航“凤凰”标志（CAAC phoenix logo）","name_en":"CAAC phoenix logo","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","中国民航","标志设计","凤凰","中国民航标志"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"corporate_logo","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国民航“凤凰”标志是赵农在标志设计段举为成功设计之一的企业标志。来源称其利用中国远古传说中凤鸟的吉祥美丽来表现现代文明。来源未给设计者、启用年份、图形构成与色彩规范。","path":"works/minhang-fenghuang-biaozhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国民航“凤凰”标志是 C 维度下企业标志设计的作品条目；其民航机构属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:minzu-wenhua-gong","title":"民族文化宫（Cultural Palace of Nationalities）","name_en":"Cultural Palace of Nationalities","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1959","北京","十大建筑","民族形式","高层建筑"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"public_building","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北京国庆十大建筑之一的民族文化宫，图11-24 图注作“新中国 北京十大建筑（民族文化宫）”。原文记：为迎接新中国成立10周年，中央人民政府从1958年9月确定国庆工程的建设任务，决定在北京兴建人民大会堂等十项大型建筑项目；人民大会堂是新中国建筑设计和施工集体创造的典范，追求“中而新”的设计风格；民族文化宫建筑则是民族形式在高层建筑中的尝试，具有现代建筑亮丽亲和特色；中国美术馆的建筑装饰如彩画、木","path":"works/minzu-wenhua-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国国庆工程的建筑锚点，材料为正文一句加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:moxige-yingyang","title":"墨西哥鹰洋（Mexican silver dollar）","name_en":"Mexican silver dollar","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晚清","墨西哥","银元","中外贸易","鹰洋"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"coin","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"墨西哥鹰洋是晚清在中国市场流通的外国银元。赵农称其造型、质量均属上乘，记数和携带方便，人们愿用十足银两换取；清政府光绪年间铸龙洋时，重量与鹰洋一致并可互为通用。来源未给鹰洋的成色、版别、流入数量与铸造年代。","path":"works/moxige-yingyang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"墨西哥鹰洋是 B 维度下晚清流通外国银元的作品条目；其中外贸易与币制属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:mozi-jiu-song-tu","title":"《墨子救宋图》（Mozi Saving Song）","name_en":"Mozi Saving Song","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["墨子","公输","云梯","守城器械","图像资料"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《墨子救宋图》见本册图版 3-38。原文在“墨家思想”知识链接中引《墨子·公输》记约公元前 444 年公输盘为楚造云梯预备攻宋、被墨子制止的事迹：“子墨子解带为城，以堞为械，公输盘九设攻城之机变，子墨子九距之，公输盘之攻械尽，子墨子守围有余……臣之弟子禽滑厘等三百人，已持臣守围之器，在宋城上而待楚寇矣”，由此留下“墨守成规”的成语；随后插图 3-38。图注只作“墨子救宋图”，未标时代、绘者与材质。","path":"works/mozi-jiu-song-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度兵器与设计思想交叉处的图像锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:muhua-qiju","title":"唐代木画棋局（Tang Wood-Inlay Go Board）","name_en":"Tang Wood-Inlay Go Board","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","漆木器","木画","棋局","正仓院"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"wood_inlay_go_board","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代木画棋局是日本正仓院所藏棋局，用木画装饰雉、雁、狮、象、鹿及胡人牵驼等花纹。来源记棋局两侧各有金环抽屉，中有机关，一方开启则另一方同时打开，屉内有龟形盒可装棋子，称其构思巧妙。来源未给尺寸、木质、棋盘道数与图版。","path":"works/muhua-qiju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代家具的单器锚点，木画纹样属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:muniu-liuma","title":"木牛流马（Wooden Ox and Flowing Horse）","name_en":"Wooden Ox and Flowing Horse","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["三国","诸葛亮","蒲元","独轮车","山地运输"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"transport_device","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"木牛流马是三国时期蜀汉在山地军事运输中使用的独轮车。赵农记诸葛亮在蜀国山地军事运输中推广使用，被传奇地称为“木牛流马”，它利用独轮车的结构改善山地长途运输功能，提高蜀国军队的战斗供需能力；《三国志·蜀书·诸葛亮传》载“九年，亮复出祁山，以木牛运……十二年春，亮悉大众由斜谷出，以流马运”，木牛“载一岁粮，日行二十里，而人不大劳”。夏燕靖则记其为蜀汉蒲元为解决山道运粮困难而发明，称“廉仰双辕，人行六尺","path":"works/muniu-liuma.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下三国运输工具的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:namo-shakyamuni-fo","title":"《南无释迦牟尼佛》夹缬（Woodblock-Resist Print of Sakyamuni Buddha）","name_en":"Woodblock-Resist Print of Sakyamuni Buddha","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["辽代","夹缬","应县","佛画","印染"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_textile","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山西应县出土的辽代夹缬品《南无释迦牟尼佛》，纵65.8厘米、横82厘米。原文记其上佛像众多，且层次分明，染印清晰，足可看出当时染工的技术水平已经相当高超。同段先论辽代纺织业主要是纺麻和织麻，技术基础承自东北地区（原渤海国属地）与燕云十六州的汉人地区；契丹得燕云十六州后丝织业渐成规模，辽都上京有绫锦院诸工作坊，织工主要是汉人，祖州绫锦院有契丹、汉、肃慎（渤海）等族手工业者300人纺织，供辽皇室需用；","path":"works/namo-shakyamuni-fo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度辽代印染织物的器物锚点，材料为正文一段含尺寸与工艺评价。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:nanchan-si-dadian","title":"南禅寺大殿（Main Hall of Nanchan Temple）","name_en":"Main Hall of Nanchan Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","五台山","木构","现存最古","782年"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"timber_architecture","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南禅寺大殿位于山西五台山，建于公元 782 年，是目前现存最古老的木结构建筑。大殿为长宽各三间的格式，四周以 12 根列柱环绕、略微内收，使梁柱枋结构稳定严密；屋顶舒缓，椽檐以斗拱上挑、出檐深远，气象浑厚，殿内无柱，佛坛上还保存着唐代佛像精品。","path":"works/nanchan-si-dadian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代木构建筑的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:nanhai-one","title":"南海一号（Nanhai One Shipwreck）","name_en":"Nanhai One Shipwreck","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","沉船","阳江","海上丝绸之路","尖头船"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"shipwreck","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南海一号是南宋时期的木质古沉船，沉没于广东阳江市东平港以南约 20 海里处，1987 年在广东阳江海域发现。为尖头船，船长 30.4 米、宽 9.8 米，船身（不算桅杆）高 8 米，排水量估计可达 600 吨，载重可能近 800 吨，是我国目前发现的最大的宋代船只。船体保存相当完好，专家推测其从中国驶出，赴新加坡、印度等东南亚地区或中东地区进行海外贸易。","path":"works/nanhai-one.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下南宋沉船的器物锚点，也涉及 E 维度的海上贸易。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:nanjing-changjiang-daqiao","title":"南京长江大桥（Nanjing Yangtze River Bridge）","name_en":"Nanjing Yangtze River Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","1968","桥梁","长江","南京长江大桥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南京长江大桥于 1968 年修建通车，为双层钢梁的铁路、公路两用桥。上层为 4 车道公路桥，车行道宽 15 米，两侧人行道各 2.25 米；下层为双线铁路桥，加上引桥的铁路为 6772 米、公路桥 4589 米，正桥两侧的桥头有一对桥头堡。来源未给桥址、正桥跨度、通航净空、造价与设计者。","path":"works/nanjing-changjiang-daqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"南京长江大桥是 B 维度下新中国长江桥梁的条目；其现代桥梁技术意义属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:nanjing-chengqiang","title":"南京城墙（Nanjing City Wall）","name_en":"Nanjing City Wall","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","南京","城墙","瓮城","外郭城"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"defensive_wall","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"南京城墙是明洪武年间修筑的都城墙。赵农记其周长 33.70 公里，高度在 14~21 米之间，因山就势，高低不等，多为砖石包砌，上有城垛和窝铺；设 13 座城门并建瓮城；周围还建土夯外郭城。来源称南京数百年间多次被攻破，仅靠城墙坚固不能获得持久安定。来源未给墙体厚度、用砖来源与城门名称。","path":"works/nanjing-chengqiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"南京城墙是 B 维度下明代都城墙体的条目；都城制度与防御管理归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:niao-xian-chong-caitao-xijing-hu","title":"鸟衔虫彩陶细颈壶（Painted Pottery Flask with Bird-and-Insect Motif）","name_en":"Painted Pottery Flask with Bird-and-Insect Motif","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["半坡型","彩陶","鸟纹","北首岭","细颈壶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鸟衔虫彩陶细颈壶是宝鸡北首岭出土的半坡型彩陶细颈壶，壶上绘有鸟衔虫图案。田自秉在论述半坡型鸟纹时一句提及，图版见插图 9。来源未给尺寸、藏地、年代与图像细部。","path":"works/niao-xian-chong-caitao-xijing-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鸟衔虫彩陶细颈壶是 B 维度下半坡型彩陶壶的作品条目；其鸟衔虫母题属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:niaoshou-wen-qi","title":"鸟兽纹绮（Bird-and-Beast Pattern Qi Silk）","name_en":"Bird-and-Beast Pattern Qi Silk","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晋代","绮","鸟兽纹","波状骨架","几何分割线"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silk","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鸟兽纹绮是晋代绮织物，来源以插图11著录。同段总述六朝丝织纹样的变化：改变汉代云气纹高低起伏的不规则格式，构成有规则的波状骨架，更加样式化，形成几何分割线，并称这是六朝丝织主要的艺术特点。图注只给“鸟兽纹绮(晋)”，未给尺寸、组织、出土墓号与藏地。","path":"works/niaoshou-wen-qi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鸟兽纹绮是 C 维度下晋代绮织物纹样的器物条目，其斜纹二重经组织归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:niutou-lujiao-jin-shijian","title":"牛头鹿角金饰件（Gold Ornament with Ox Head and Deer Antlers）","name_en":"Gold Ornament with Ox Head and Deer Antlers","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["三国","金银细工","花丝","错采镂金","饰件"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"gold_ornament","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"牛头鹿角金饰件见本册图版 5-21，图注为“三国 牛头鹿角金饰件”。原文在“金银细工设计的进步”一节称此时期金银细工有很大发展，统治阶层争相豪奢以致“斗富”赌盛，金银器物设计与用金银装饰器物竟成风气；三国东吴有“花形金饰”（南昌出土）雕有“大吉”文字，西晋盛行花丝首饰，洛阳金村出土“金狮子”“金簪”“金叶”，金制首饰达 60 多种，多用金银细丝盘绕成各种花形纹样；这时期金银装（首）饰工艺以“错采镂","path":"works/niutou-lujiao-jin-shijian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度三国金银细工的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:olduvai-kanzhuoqi","title":"奥杜韦砾石砍斫器（Olduvai Gravel Chopper）","name_en":"Olduvai Gravel Chopper","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["旧石器时代","奥杜韦文化","坦桑尼亚","砾石","砍斫器"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"奥杜韦砾石砍斫器是坦桑尼亚奥杜韦峡谷发现的距今 200 万年前的石器，以砾石为原料打制，被李立新举为世界范围内最典型的砾石石器工具。来源只有一句正文与一条图注，未给尺寸、数量、编号与收藏，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/olduvai-kanzhuoqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度旧石器时代石器的单器条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ou-fangyi","title":"偶方彝（Ou Fangyi (Paired Square Ritual Vessel)）","name_en":"Ou Fangyi (Paired Square Ritual Vessel)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","妇好墓","青铜酒器","斗拱雏形","鸟兽浮雕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_wine_vessel","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"偶方彝是安阳殷墟妇好墓出土的青铜酒器，与铜鸮尊、圈足觥同出，器身饰鸟兽浮雕／圆雕，标志青铜工艺与设计的新高峰。赵农另记妇好墓“偶方彝”上有斗的雏形，作为商周斗拱已见雏形的青铜器例证。","path":"works/ou-fangyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下商代青铜酒器的器物锚点，斗拱雏形说另涉建筑史。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:pantao-tu","title":"蟠桃图（Peaches of Immortality (Kesi)）","name_en":"Peaches of Immortality (Kesi)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","缂丝","吴煦","云间","书画缂丝"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kesi_painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《蟠桃图》是南宋缂丝名手吴煦的作品。来源把吴煦与朱克柔、沈子蕃并列为南宋云间缂丝名家，称《蟠桃图》甚为精美。来源未给尺寸、材质、藏地、画面内容与缂织工序。","path":"works/pantao-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度南宋缂丝作品的单件锚点，其书画化取向属 C 维度。来源只有一句并称。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:peiligang-shimopan","title":"裴李岗石磨盘石磨棒（Peiligang Stone Quern and Pestle）","name_en":"Peiligang Stone Quern and Pestle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时代","裴李岗文化","石磨盘","石磨棒","农具"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_tool_set","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"裴李岗石磨盘石磨棒是裴李岗文化的一组粮食加工石器，见于李立新第一章图版。来源只有图题，正文把石磨盘、石磨棒列入新石器时代“石器家族”的系统种类，未给尺寸、数量、用法与出土地点，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/peiligang-shimopan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新石器时代农具的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:penglai-yuan-zhanshu","title":"蓬莱元代战船（Yuan War Ship from Penglai）","name_en":"Yuan War Ship from Penglai","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","造船","战船","蓬莱","刀鱼战棹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蓬莱元代战船是 1984 年山东蓬莱水城出土的元代战船。赵农记其残长 28.6 米、残宽 5.6 米、残深 0.9 米，是目前发现最长的古船；船内有铁炮、铜炮、石弹、石灰瓶等兵器；属宋元时期“刀鱼战棹”的战舰样式；其龙骨、首柱、舱壁板、外板、桅座制形严谨、技术精湛，木构以麻丝、桐油、石灰捻合，细密坚实。同段记元代造船规模与能力：围攻襄阳造战船 5000 艘，1273 年攻占襄阳，后又造 3000 ","path":"works/penglai-yuan-zhanshu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蓬莱元代战船是 B 维度下元代造船技术的条目；其军事用途与船队规模归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:pianshi-shanfang","title":"片石山房（Pianshi Shanfang）","name_en":"Pianshi Shanfang","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["扬州园林","叠石","石涛","私家园林"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"片石山房是扬州著名园林之一，赵农将其与个园、寄啸山庄并列为扬州园林代表。来源记其与寄啸山庄关联，相传其中有清代大画家石涛的叠石作品。来源未给建园年代、园主、面积、布局与叠石的具体形制，也未说明它与寄啸山庄的产权或空间关系。","path":"works/pianshi-shanfang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"片石山房是 B 维度下扬州园林中相传有石涛叠石的园景条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ping-fu-tie","title":"平复帖（Pingfu Tie (Letter of Recovery)）","name_en":"Pingfu Tie (Letter of Recovery)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西晋","陆机","书法","章草","今草"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calligraphy","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"平复帖是西晋文学家陆机手书的墨迹，来源称其为现存最早的书法作品真迹。来源记其书体在章草与今草之间，含隶含篆，笔法奇倔，并认为它的存在使后人看到魏晋时期书法的真实面貌。图 5-18 注为晋陆机《平复帖》，图版未核。来源未记帖的材质、尺寸、行数、字数、释文、收藏地与递藏经过，本条不补。","path":"works/ping-fu-tie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度西晋书迹的条目，来源给真迹地位、书体判断、作者身份与书法史意义，并配一条图注，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:pingjiang-tu","title":"平江图（Pingjiang Map Stele）","name_en":"Pingjiang Map Stele","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","苏州","平江图","碑刻","城市地图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"map_stele","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《平江图》是流传至今的南宋苏州城市碑刻地图。赵农记该碑刻反映了宋代苏州城市的基本格局：城市为南北略长的方形，街巷纵横、石桥绿水、粉墙黛瓦、河流密布，官府与民宅、园林与寺观布局合理严密。来源把《平江图》作为苏州城市形态的图像证据，未给碑石尺寸、刻制年份、比例尺与绘制者。","path":"works/pingjiang-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《平江图》是 C 维度下南宋城市地图碑刻的条目；其反映的城市制度与功能分区归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:prc-national-flag","title":"中华人民共和国国旗（五星红旗）（National Flag of the People's Republic of China）","name_en":"National Flag of the People's Republic of China","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1949","国旗","五星红旗","曾联松","国家象征"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"national_symbol","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中华人民共和国国旗，图11-1 图注作“中华人民共和国国旗”。知识链接“国旗图案设计”记：国旗图案的征集在1949年6月由新政协发出，收到海内外的应征稿件3012份，许多图稿未获国旗、国徽方案征集筹备小组认可；毛泽东原来主张采用一颗星加一条象征黄河的黄线方案，张治中等委员表示另选方案；后来田汉从淘汰的图案中看中了上海“现代经济通讯社”文书曾联松设计的五星红旗，大家表示同意，只是去掉了原设计中大五星","path":"works/prc-national-flag.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度新中国国家象征物设计的锚点，材料为知识链接一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:prince-ziwu-ding","title":"王子午鼎（Ding of Prince Ziwu）","name_en":"Ding of Prince Ziwu","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋","青铜鼎","图版著录","楚国"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"王子午鼎见本册图版 2-11，图注为“春秋 王子午鼎”。原文未展开形制描述；器名中的“王子午”是春秋楚国的人物，本条只记图注给定的时代与器名，不代补铭文或出土信息。","path":"works/prince-ziwu-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度春秋青铜鼎的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qi-shuangfeng-gu","title":"漆双凤鼓（Lacquer Double-Phoenix Drum）","name_en":"Lacquer Double-Phoenix Drum","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","江陵楚墓","漆器","双凤","悬鼓"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_musical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"漆双凤鼓是江陵楚墓出土的战国漆器。田自秉称其用双凤作为鼓架、两兽作为鼓座，以双凤首悬一圆鼓，造形优美、极富装饰性；图注作“漆双凤鼓”。来源未给尺寸、藏地、墓号、木质与鼓面材质。","path":"works/qi-shuangfeng-gu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"漆双凤鼓是 B 维度下战国楚国漆器的作品条目；其双凤造型与装饰性属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qian-li-chuan","title":"千里船（Qianli Chuan (Thousand-Li Boat)）","name_en":"Qianli Chuan (Thousand-Li Boat)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南齐","祖冲之","造船","千里船","新亭江"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"watercraft","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"千里船是南齐时期的一种船，来源引《南齐书·祖冲之传》记其在新亭江试航、日行百余里，并推断为人力脚踏车轮推动船。来源未载船体尺寸、车轮数量与传动方式、载重量与制造地点。新亭江的具体位置来源未考，本条不作地理定位。本条据 L3367 一段写成。","path":"works/qian-li-chuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度南齐船舶技术的条目，关联祖冲之的造船记载，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qianjin-tao","title":"千金绦（Qianjin Silk Ribbon）","name_en":"Qianjin Silk Ribbon","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","马王堆","丝带","千金","两组经线"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silk_ribbon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"千金绦是马王堆汉墓出土的丝带，用两组经线编出图案花纹与“千金”二字，故名。来源引《尚书·禹贡》“荆州产玄纁玑组”，说明楚国的荆州、长沙地区是丝带的传统产地。来源未给长度、宽度、组织、墓号与藏地。","path":"works/qianjin-tao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"千金绦是 C 维度下汉代丝带文字装饰的器物条目，其两组经线编织工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qianli-jiangshan-tu","title":"千里江山图（A Thousand Li of Rivers and Mountains）","name_en":"A Thousand Li of Rivers and Mountains","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","王希孟","千里江山图","青绿山水","桥梁"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《千里江山图》是宋代王希孟的绘画。赵农在筑桥段用它说明宋画中的桥梁形象：“长桥卧波，飞渡关山，大大小小的五六座，有长桥、亭桥、小桥等，构筑巧妙，造型各异”；瓷窑段图7-39标“宋 王希孟《千里江山图》局部”。来源把此图作为宋代桥梁与山水图像的证据，未给材质、尺寸、构图、题跋与递藏。","path":"works/qianli-jiangshan-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《千里江山图》是 C 维度下宋代山水画的条目；其桥梁图像证据归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qianlong-huayuan","title":"乾隆花园（Qianlong Garden）","name_en":"Qianlong Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","皇家园林","紫禁城","宁寿宫","乾隆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"imperial_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"乾隆花园是紫禁城东北角的寿宁宫花园（来源作寿宁宫），赵农称其为乾隆退养之地。来源记该园在狭长空间中建造，长 160 米、宽 37 米，被分割成四个院落，包括古华轩、契赏亭、遂初堂、耸秀亭、萃赏楼、符望阁等建筑；树石花木与亭台楼阁巧妙融合，全园兼具观赏性与实用性。来源未给建园年份、设计者、工程做法与各院落尺寸。","path":"works/qianlong-huayuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"乾隆花园是 B 维度下清代紫禁城内皇家园林的器物条目；其宫廷退养制度背景兼及 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qiantangjiang-daqiao","title":"钱塘江大桥（Qiantang River Bridge）","name_en":"Qiantang River Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","1937","桥梁","茅以升","钱塘江大桥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"钱塘江大桥于 1937 年建成，由中国桥梁设计家茅以升主持修建。它是中国最早自行设计建造的一座双层铁路、公路两用桥，分引桥和正桥两部分，共长 1453 米；1991 年在原桥东侧又建成新桥，为铁路、公路并行分离的两用桥。来源未给桥址、跨度、通航净空、造价与施工组织。","path":"works/qiantangjiang-daqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"钱塘江大桥是 B 维度下近代自行设计桥梁的条目；其现代技术自主意义属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qidan-an","title":"契丹鞍（Khitan Saddle）","name_en":"Khitan Saddle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["辽代","马具","鞍饰","契丹鞍","袖中锦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"saddle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"契丹鞍是辽代马具中的名品。来源称辽代金银制品中马鞍非常有名，引宋太平老人《袖中锦》记契丹鞍与定瓷、蜀锦、端砚齐名，称为天下第一；又记 1954 年赤峰大营子辽墓曾出土银质鎏金鞍饰。来源未给鞍的形制、尺寸、材质组合与藏地，也未说明所出鞍饰是否即《袖中锦》所称的契丹鞍。","path":"works/qidan-an.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度辽代马具的单器锚点，鞍饰纹样属 C 维度，契丹鞍与定瓷、蜀锦并称反映辽宋间的物品流通与声名属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qihui-mushu-mubi","title":"漆绘木梳、木篦（Lacquer-Painted Wooden Comb and Fine-Tooth Comb）","name_en":"Lacquer-Painted Wooden Comb and Fine-Tooth Comb","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦代","江陵凤凰山","漆绘","木梳","木篦"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"漆绘木梳、木篦是 1975 年湖北江陵凤凰山秦墓出土的两件木器，上部呈弧形，正反两面以黑漆勾线、红黄等色敷彩人物图案。木梳正面宴饮、反面歌舞；木篦正面送别、反面相扑。来源称其人物形象生动，具有浓厚生活气息和装饰性。","path":"works/qihui-mushu-mubi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"漆绘木梳、木篦是 B 维度下秦代漆绘木器的器物条目；四面人物图案的题材与构图归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qikong-shidao","title":"七孔石刀（Seven-Holed Stone Knife）","name_en":"Seven-Holed Stone Knife","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["薛家岗文化","新石器时代","长兵器","钻孔","绑缚"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_tool","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"七孔石刀是 1980 年安徽潜山薛家岗出土的新石器时代石器，属距今约 5500 年的薛家岗文化。器略呈长方形，长 325 毫米、宽 95 毫米、厚约 10 毫米，刀背平直，沿背排列 7 个圆孔。原文推测以木柄开槽嵌刀背，用麻绳或皮革穿孔绑缚，为作战用砍杀长兵器。","path":"works/qikong-shidao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下新石器时代石质兵器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qin-bing-ma-yong","title":"秦兵马俑（Terracotta Army）","name_en":"Terracotta Army","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦代","秦始皇陵","陶塑","模塑结合","写实"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"tomb_figurines","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦兵马俑是 1974 年秦始皇陵东侧出土的陶制兵马俑群，共 7000 余件（一说推测约 8000 余件），身高 1.75–1.85 米、最高 1.98 米。采用模塑结合、分工制作、套合粘接初胎，再覆细泥并综合塑、堆、贴、刻、画技法，兼具整体造型与局部刻画。一号坑东西长 230 米、南北宽 62 米，为步兵和战车混编的主力部队；二号坑是战车、射手、骑兵混编；三号坑是统帅指挥部。兵马俑造型以写实为主，","path":"works/qin-bing-ma-yong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下秦代陶俑群的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qin-chi-dao","title":"秦驰道（Qin Chi Dao）","name_en":"Qin Chi Dao","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","秦代","道路","交通","车同轨"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"road","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦驰道是秦始皇统一六国后，以咸阳为中心向全国辐射的交通干线。赵农记其宽约60米、道路高出两边地平面，分为中心皇帝专用车道、军事车道和常人行道，每隔10里设管理亭；北通九原的驰道长约1400公里，由太子扶苏和大将蒙恬修筑。汉代又扩为以长安为中心的道路。来源未给驰道总里程、完整路线、路面材料与工程管理机构。","path":"works/qin-chi-dao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秦驰道是 B 维度下秦代道路工程的条目，兼及 D 维度的交通制度与军事控制。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qin-gong-bo","title":"秦公镈（Qin Gong Bo）","name_en":"Qin Gong Bo","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋早期","青铜钟","镈","正挂","编钟"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_bell","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦公镈是赵农所述春秋早期著名的青铜镈，用来说明西周后期出现的正挂之镈。来源正文只有一句“到了西周后期出现了正挂的镈，如春秋早期著名的秦公镈”，另有图 3-46“秦公镈”图注；未记尺寸、铭文、件数、出土时间地点与收藏地。本条仅登记来源所给的两点属性：春秋早期、正挂的镈。","path":"works/qin-gong-bo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秦公镈是 B 维度下春秋早期青铜镈的条目，来源只有一句正文与一条图注，形制细节未展开。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qin-han-changcheng","title":"秦汉长城（Qin-Han Great Wall）","name_en":"Qin-Han Great Wall","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","长城","军事防御","夯土","烽燧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"defensive_wall","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦汉长城是在战国诸国边墙基础上形成的北方防御工事。秦统一后拆毁中原城墙关隘，保留北方边域城墙，并于公元前214年派蒙恬率30万军民连结秦、赵、燕旧长城，形成西起临洮、东入辽东的万里长城；汉武帝又将长城向西延续2000里至阳关，并在阴山以北修筑外长城（L2917、L2922、L2924）。长城以板筑夯土构建，因地制宜使用草木、芦苇、石块，沿线设烽燧报警（L2926）。","path":"works/qin-han-changcheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度秦汉长城防御工程的条目，其修筑与边防制度、烽燧报警体系相关，涉及 D 维度制度层面，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qin-shi-huang-ling","title":"秦始皇陵（Mausoleum of the First Qin Emperor）","name_en":"Mausoleum of the First Qin Emperor","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦代","临潼","水银","覆斗形封丘","70万人"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mausoleum","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦始皇陵位于陕西临潼，是秦代最具代表性的营造之作。陵区规模宏大，墓冢高 76 米、底边宽 485 米、长 515 米；据史料记载征用民夫 70 万人、用 37 年建成。陵内宛如地下宫殿，棺椁周围铸满铜汁，设百官、摆珍宝，以人鱼膏为烛，宫室之外灌输水银象征江河湖海，“上具天文，下具地理”；陵墓南屏骊山、北临渭水，陵东 1.5 公里处为兵马俑坑。","path":"works/qin-shi-huang-ling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下秦代陵墓的器物锚点，也涉及 A 维度的帝王观念。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qing-ci-gu-cang-guan","title":"青瓷谷仓罐（Celadon Granary Jar）","name_en":"Celadon Granary Jar","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["三国吴","青瓷","明器","孙吴","殉葬品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_jar","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青瓷谷仓罐是来源在论三国两晋南北朝瓷器时举出的典型随葬青瓷造型。来源记其口沿以人物、飞禽为雕饰，罐腹以羊、龟、蛇、鱼等动物作浮雕，整体由两个罐粘接而成，把制器与雕塑融为一体。来源另举一件带永安三年字样的孙吴时期谷仓罐，称其造型繁密、制器精美。此句原文写作“碑文标志”，照录标疑，不径改为铭文。图 5-36 注为南朝青瓷谷仓罐，与前述孙吴纪年罐不是同一表述，图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"works/qing-ci-gu-cang-guan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度三国吴青瓷明器的器物条目，来源给造型构成、装饰题材与一处纪年实例，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qing-dongling","title":"清东陵（Eastern Qing Tombs）","name_en":"Eastern Qing Tombs","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","河北遵化","昌瑞山","帝陵","慈禧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mausoleum","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清东陵是清代著名的帝王后妃陵墓群。赵农记其位于河北遵化市，依昌瑞山南麓排列，山峦起伏、气象宏伟；陵墓包括享殿、明楼、宝城、地宫、宫墙等建筑群，安葬顺治、康熙、乾隆、咸丰、同治及慈禧太后等 5 位清代皇帝和 14 位皇后、136 位皇妃。来源未给陵域面积、各陵名与营建年代。","path":"works/qing-dongling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"清东陵是 B 维度下清代帝陵群的条目；陵寝制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qing-xiling","title":"清西陵（Western Qing Tombs）","name_en":"Western Qing Tombs","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","河北易县","帝陵","昌陵","隆恩殿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mausoleum","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清西陵是清代安葬雍正、嘉庆、道光、光绪四位皇帝及后妃的陵墓群。赵农记其位于河北易县西的群山之中，以嘉庆昌陵最具特色；昌陵周边为繁茂松林，以碑亭、石拱桥、望柱、神道、三孔桥、大碑亭为引导，进入隆恩殿和方城明楼，宝城的宝顶下方为地宫；整个建筑结构秩序紧凑、排列合理，利用地形完成帝王陵寝格局。来源未给陵域面积、各陵名与营建年代。","path":"works/qing-xiling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"清西陵是 B 维度下清代帝陵群的条目；陵寝制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qingbaiyou-huzhen","title":"青白釉虎枕（Qingbai Glazed Tiger Pillow）","name_en":"Qingbai Glazed Tiger Pillow","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","青白釉","瓷枕","虎形","河北省博物馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_pillow","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青白釉虎枕是宋代瓷枕，长 19.4cm。虎作立式、背托枕面，枕面造型为四瓣花形，来源称其“为适用而设计成凹形”。窑口、出土地点与胎釉成分未载，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/qingbaiyou-huzhen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代瓷枕的单器条目，虎形与花瓣枕面的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qinghua-baleng-longwen-ping","title":"青花八棱海水龙纹瓶（Blue-and-White Octagonal Dragon-and-Wave Vase）","name_en":"Blue-and-White Octagonal Dragon-and-Wave Vase","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","青花","八棱瓶","海水龙纹","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青花八棱海水龙纹瓶是田自秉册插图1所注的元代青花器。图注只记器名与时代，正文青花段未对这件瓶作形制、纹样、尺寸或藏地说明。本条只据图注立条，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/qinghua-baleng-longwen-ping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代青花单器的图注锚点，海水龙纹的纹样属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qinghua-wugu-fengdeng-tu-pan","title":"青花五谷丰登图盘（Blue-and-White Plate with Bumper Harvest Design）","name_en":"Blue-and-White Plate with Bumper Harvest Design","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","万历","青花","五谷丰登","吉祥纹样"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明代青花瓷盘，图9-5-2 的图注为：9-5-2. 明万历 青花五谷丰登图盘。本章明代丝织品种一段（L4155）在段末以（图9-5-1、图9-5-2）并引两图，但该段讲的是丝织品种，未描述此盘；盘为瓷器，与该段丝织主题并不相称。原文未记尺寸、款识、窑口与纹样细节。","path":"works/qinghua-wugu-fengdeng-tu-pan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代青花瓷纹样的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qinghua-youlihong-guan","title":"青花釉里红盖罐（Blue-and-Underglaze-Red Lidded Jar）","name_en":"Blue-and-Underglaze-Red Lidded Jar","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","景德镇","青花","釉里红","保定"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青花釉里红盖罐是河北保定出土的元代瓷器，高丰用它作为“将青花和釉里红两种装饰用于同一件器皿”的实例。来源只给出一句例证与一句评价：这种设计“只能当作是一种尝试，同样也不适合于大规模生产”。本条的可用材料仅此，器形、纹样、尺寸、藏地均未见于来源。","path":"works/qinghua-youlihong-guan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下元代景德镇青花与釉里红同器装饰的实物锚点，材料只有两句。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qingming-shanghe-tu","title":"清明上河图（Along the River During the Qingming Festival）","name_en":"Along the River During the Qingming Festival","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","张择端","汴梁","商业美术","幌子"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清明上河图是宋代张择端所绘长卷，描绘汴梁繁华社会景象，绘城楼、桥梁、船只、车马、旅店、酒肆、商铺、寺院及各类人物 810 多个，是研究宋代城市和环境设计的重要资料。图中还可见商业广告幌子、虹桥、折叠桌、大小船 28 余艘等细节。2016 记其描绘东京汴梁商号店铺、招牌、幌子、横匾、对联等商业设计，以及数百名各行各业人士的各异服式，是研究宋代商业美术与服饰的重要图像材料。","path":"works/qingming-shanghe-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下宋代商业美术图像的器物锚点，也涉及 B 维度的城市与家具。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qingtong-lianzhideng","title":"青铜连枝灯（Bronze Multi-branch Lamp）","name_en":"Bronze Multi-branch Lamp","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","青铜灯","连枝灯","灯具类型","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_lamp","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青铜连枝灯是李立新在汉代灯具品类中列出的类型，图1-36 图题只作“青铜连枝灯”。正文把连枝灯与器皿灯、动物灯、人物灯并列为灯具造型类型，未给形制、尺寸、出土与收藏。图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/qingtong-lianzhideng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下汉代灯具类型的图版条目，其造型分类属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qingyou-ci-zun","title":"青釉瓷尊（Celadon-Glazed Porcelain Zun）","name_en":"Celadon-Glazed Porcelain Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","原始瓷器","青釉","郑州铭功路","瓷尊"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"青釉瓷尊是郑州铭功路商墓出土的原始瓷器。田自秉记釉陶釉色青绿而带褐黄、胎较硬呈灰白色，学术界把这种釉陶又称原始瓷器，视为瓷器萌芽；郑州铭功路商墓出土青釉瓷尊一件，釉质青黄而细润，是重要珍品。来源未给尊的尺寸、藏地、胎釉化学分析数据与共出器物。","path":"works/qingyou-ci-zun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"青釉瓷尊是 B 维度下商代原始瓷器的作品条目；其釉色与刻划装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qinling-tongchema","title":"秦陵铜车马（Bronze Chariots and Horses from the Qin Mausoleum）","name_en":"Bronze Chariots and Horses from the Qin Mausoleum","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦代","青铜器","车制","系驾","秦始皇陵"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_carriage","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"秦陵铜车马是秦始皇陵西侧出土的两乘青铜车马，1980 年发掘，各按真车真马约二分之一缩制。五册的关注点分化明显：**夏燕靖两版逐车给车舆、伞盖、门窗与随车器物的尺寸**（2009 与 2016 近乎逐字相同，2016 另补破碎块数与修复年数），**高丰给形制与《考工记》的对读**（辐条 30 根、盖弓 22 根、伞通高 114 厘米、立车 3064 件与安车 3462 件），**赵农给整体尺寸与御","path":"works/qinling-tongchema.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"秦陵铜车马是 B 维度下秦代车制的实物锚点：车舆尺度、系驾方式、伞盖与门窗构造、分铸组装工艺都在此可量。它同时是“以明器证车制”这一研究方法的样本，方法论一侧归 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qixia-si-sheli-ta","title":"栖霞寺舍利塔（Qixia Temple Sarira Pagoda）","name_en":"Qixia Temple Sarira Pagoda","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋代","南唐","佛塔","舍利塔","南京"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"栖霞寺舍利塔在南京栖霞寺，隋文帝仁寿元年（601）始建，南唐时期重建。赵农 2009 册在寺塔一节只用一句记它，给出始建年、重建时代、外形与层数、檐部样式，并称其为南方佛塔秀丽玲珑的样式。来源未给塔高、塔基与地宫、材料、设计者与南唐重建的具体年份，本条只记录这一句所能支撑的内容。材料单薄，仅能立目。","path":"works/qixia-si-sheli-ta.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"栖霞寺舍利塔是 B 维度下南方密檐式塔的形制样本，来源只有一句，未涉制度、人物与工艺细节。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qiyingshao","title":"耆英号（Qiyingshao, Guangzhou-Type Ship）","name_en":"Qiyingshao, Guangzhou-Type Ship","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋唐","广船","图版著录","船名待考"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-33. 隋唐 广船耆英号”。图注所在造船业段末以（图6-33、6-34）统摄本图与两头尖船。正文论隋唐造船业的兴旺与技术水平：举隋代五牙大战舰，唐代在扬子县、浙东、洪州、嘉州、金陵等地设船场，崇明创制多桅多帆平底沙船，德宗时李皋造车轮战舰，唐代出现头低尾高的海鹘战船，造船已用桐油石灰糊缝，扬州施桥镇出土的唐代木船是世界最早的水密舱结构实物。原文未及“耆英号”。图注以“隋唐”系年、以“耆","path":"works/qiyingshao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度隋唐造船的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:qiyu-yunmeng-shuihudi-33","title":"漆盂（云梦睡虎地三十三号墓）（Lacquer Yu from Shuihudi Tomb 33）","name_en":"Lacquer Yu from Shuihudi Tomb 33","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦代","云梦睡虎地","漆器","木胎","鱼纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"漆盂是 1975 年湖北云梦睡虎地三十三号秦墓出土的漆器，木胎，红里黑外。盂底黑漆上绘两条鱼与一只鹭鸟，鱼形简练，鹭鸟提一足、俯首注视，来源称其为优美的漆器作品。","path":"works/qiyu-yunmeng-shuihudi-33.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"漆盂是 B 维度下秦代漆器的器物条目；鱼、鹭纹样的构图与写实手法兼涉 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:quanzhou-luoyang-qiao","title":"泉州洛阳桥（Luoyang Bridge in Quanzhou）","name_en":"Luoyang Bridge in Quanzhou","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","桥梁","泉州","洛阳桥","蔡襄"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"泉州洛阳桥是宋仁宗时由蔡襄主持修建的石桥。赵农记该桥以石块作为石堤，上筑石桥，运用“筏形基础”的方法，并利用牡蛎生长的特点，以牡蛎衍生连接石基，加强桥梁基础；桥墩以尖形为主，减缓潮汐的压力。来源称洛阳桥的建构成功促进了建桥技术水平的提高，各地石桥建筑随之兴盛。来源未给桥长、桥孔数、石梁尺寸与历代修葺。","path":"works/quanzhou-luoyang-qiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"泉州洛阳桥是 B 维度下北宋石梁桥工程的条目；蔡襄主持与地方建桥制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:quanzhou-qingjing-si","title":"泉州清净寺（Quanzhou Qingjing Mosque）","name_en":"Quanzhou Qingjing Mosque","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","泉州","伊斯兰教建筑","清净寺","色目人"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mosque","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代伊斯兰教建筑遗存之一，图8-38 图注作“元代 伊斯兰泉州清净寺”。原文在“元时随着色目人（外国人）移民遍布全国，伊斯兰教建筑层出不穷”一段列出三处遗存：新疆霍城的吐虎鲁克麻札、泉州清净寺、杭州真教寺；随后总述其建筑风格，称既有保持中亚风格形式的建筑，又出现了以汉族传统建筑布局和结构体系为基础、结合伊斯兰教特有功能要求的中国的伊斯兰教建筑形式。原文未描述清净寺的形制、创建年代、尺寸与现状。","path":"works/quanzhou-qingjing-si.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代伊斯兰教建筑的遗存锚点，材料只有同段列名加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:renmian-yuwen-caitao-pen","title":"人面鱼纹彩陶盆（Human-Face-and-Fish Painted Pottery Basin）","name_en":"Human-Face-and-Fish Painted Pottery Basin","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时代","半坡","彩陶","人面鱼纹","图腾"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painted_pottery_basin","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"人面鱼纹彩陶盆是陕西西安半坡出土的彩陶盆，高丰记半坡遗址共出 5 件。盆内人面作圆形或椭圆形，眼鼻特征明显，嘴角两侧各衔一条小鱼，头部两边有的画有上翘的曲线、有的饰两条鱼纹。高丰把它作为原始彩陶“装饰题材的丰富性”的首要例证，并在讨论原始图形文字时把盆上人面与鱼的复合图形读作鱼类氏族的徽志性符号。赵农记同一器物为“西安半坡彩陶器皿中有一件《人面鱼纹盆》，造型是一种普通陶盆的样式”，但明确拒绝在捕鱼","path":"works/renmian-yuwen-caitao-pen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"人面鱼纹彩陶盆是 B 维度下新石器时代彩陶的器物锚点，其纹样释读与徽志性质同时属 C 维度。半坡遗址的年代、聚落与陶系统计留在 places/banpo-site.md。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:renmin-dahuitang-1959","title":"人民大会堂（Great Hall of the People）","name_en":"Great Hall of the People","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","国庆工程","十大建筑","室内设计","中而新"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"public_building","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"人民大会堂是为迎接新中国成立 10 周年而建的“国庆工程”十项大型建筑之一，1958 年 9 月确定任务。三册的写法差别很大：**夏燕靖两版给组织过程与室内设计**（1958 年 9 月确定任务、首次聘请装饰设计专家与画家雕塑家配合建筑师、“水天一色”天花、周恩来把近 30 个厅分包各省市、梁思成 1961 年文章的引文），**赵农只把它放进“十大建筑”与天安门广场改造的框架里**，并给出一幅华灯","path":"works/renmin-dahuitang-1959.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"人民大会堂是 B 维度下国家大型公共建筑的样本：1958 年国庆工程的十项建筑之列、室内设计首次引入装饰专家与画家雕塑家协作、万人大会堂的天花处理都在此汇合。“中而新”与民族形式的取向归 A 维度；国家任务与各省市分包的组织方式归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:rhinoceros-horn-cup","title":"花纹犀角杯（Rhinoceros-Horn Cup with Decoration）","name_en":"Rhinoceros-Horn Cup with Decoration","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","犀角雕","犀角杯","德化窑","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"rhinoceros_horn_cup","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"花纹犀角杯是田自秉册插图12图注所记的明代犀角雕酒杯。来源记据云犀角有解毒作用，故多制成酒杯，称为犀角杯；明代德化瓷中也有仿犀角杯者，流行一时；著名犀角雕艺人有鲍天成、蒋烈卿等。本条据图注与同段犀角雕背景立条，不据器名补写杯身花纹、尺寸与藏地；图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/rhinoceros-horn-cup.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代犀角雕单器的图注锚点，杯身花纹与德化瓷仿制属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ring-foot-gong","title":"圈足觥（Ring-Footed Guang Vessel）","name_en":"Ring-Footed Guang Vessel","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["妇好墓","殷墟","青铜酒器","鸟兽形装饰","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"圈足觥见本册图版 2-8，图注为“商周 圈足觥”。正文在讨论殷墟妇好墓青铜器时称：妇好墓出土的 4 件以鸟兽浮雕和圆雕为主要装饰的酒器——铜鸮尊、偶方彝、圈足觥，标志着青铜工艺与设计达到新高峰。原文写“4 件”而只列出三名，第四件未举。","path":"works/ring-foot-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度商代鸟兽形青铜酒器的锚点。原文只作类属性评述，未展开单件形制。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ruding-shishi-liujin-yinzhan","title":"乳钉狮纹鎏金银盏（Gilt Silver Cup with Bosses and Lion Design）","name_en":"Gilt Silver Cup with Bosses and Lion Design","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","金银器","鎏金","乳钉纹","狮纹"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silver_cup","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“7-29. 宋代 乳钉狮纹鎏金银盏”。图注嵌在金银器段一句之中：L3391 以“据文献记载，宋”收尾，L3393 为图注，L3395 续以“代金银制器仍作为财富宝藏”，一句话被图注与断行隔开，图版行也未见于相邻位置。正文金银器段记宋代金银器工艺随地区性经济中心城市的出现而发展，大中城市均有专门的店铺交易金银制器；引《梦梁录》记南宋临安自五间楼北至官巷南街、两行多是金银盐钞引交易铺，前列金银","path":"works/ruding-shishi-liujin-yinzhan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代金银器的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ruihe-tu","title":"瑞鹤图（Auspicious Cranes）","name_en":"Auspicious Cranes","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","赵佶","瑞鹤图","宣德门","界画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《瑞鹤图》是宋徽宗赵佶的绘画。赵农在城市段记“从宋徽宗的《瑞鹤图》中描绘的京城宣德门屋顶看出，构制宏丽，气象辉煌”；同段说宋代开封府大部分湮灭在黄河河床之下，仅可通过张择端《清明上河图》感受当时京城的热闹氛围。来源只用《瑞鹤图》证明宣德门屋顶的宏丽，未给材质、尺寸、画面构图与递藏。","path":"works/ruihe-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《瑞鹤图》是 C 维度下北宋绘画的条目；其宣德门屋顶的建筑图像价值归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sajia-si","title":"萨迦寺（Sakya Monastery）","name_en":"Sakya Monastery","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","西藏","萨迦派","萨迦寺","元代壁画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"monastery","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代西藏萨迦寺，图8-36 图注作“元代 西藏萨迦寺”。原文记寺位于现今西藏自治区萨迦县的仲曲河两岸，创建于宋熙宁六年（1073），由西藏喇嘛教萨迦派（俗称花教）创始人衮却杰布主持建造，后多次修建；分南寺与北寺，殿宇宏伟、布局紧凑，富有元代建筑风格。寺庙内有大批关于萨迦派创始人萨班与八思巴等形象的造像，以及反映早期坛城的巨幅元代壁画，壁画画工精细、色彩鲜明；寺庙门廊、佛龛底座等的装饰纹样，大量吸收","path":"works/sajia-si.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代藏传佛教建筑的遗存锚点，材料为正文两段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:san-jiao-lou","title":"三脚耧（Three-Legged Seed Drill）","name_en":"Three-Legged Seed Drill","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","赵过","播种机","开沟","下种"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_machine","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三脚耧是汉武帝时搜粟都尉赵过在一脚耧、二脚耧基础上设计发明的播种工具，大大提高播种效率，是现代播种机的雏形。现代全功能播种机把开沟、下种、覆盖、压实四道工序接连完成，而我国两千年前的三脚耧已能把前三道工序合并于一机完成。","path":"works/san-jiao-lou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下西汉农业机械的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sancai-guan","title":"三彩罐（Sancai Jar）","name_en":"Sancai Jar","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","唐三彩","罐","低温铅釉","明器"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sancai_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三彩罐是唐代三彩器皿，图注见插图6。正文唐三彩段称三彩为低温铅釉陶器，器皿类有壶、杯、盘、盒、炉、奁、柜、枕等，样式新颖、色彩绚丽；未单述此罐。图版未核，罐的器形、釉色组合与尺寸未载。","path":"works/sancai-guan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"三彩罐是 B 维度下唐代三彩器皿的图版锚点，只记器名与唐三彩的器类背景。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sancai-longfeng-liuliyou-xianglu","title":"三彩龙凤琉璃釉香炉（Sancai Dragon-and-Phoenix Glazed Censer）","name_en":"Sancai Dragon-and-Phoenix Glazed Censer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","琉璃","三彩","香炉","元大都"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sancai_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三彩龙凤琉璃釉香炉是元大都出土的元代琉璃器。来源记炉身浮雕凤纹（原文作风纹），炉顶塑成山形，有一龙盘绕其间，蓝色和黄色琉璃釉相互衬映，形象庄重大方；来源把它与任塘刻铭琉璃香炉并列为出色的元代琉璃作品。来源未给尺寸、藏地、窑口与图版。","path":"works/sancai-longfeng-liuliyou-xianglu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代琉璃香炉的单器锚点，龙凤纹与蓝黄釉配色属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sancai-nv-yong","title":"三彩女俑（Sancai Female Figurine）","name_en":"Sancai Female Figurine","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","唐三彩","女俑","人物俑","贵妇"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sancai_figurine","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三彩女俑是唐代三彩人物俑，图注见插图7。正文唐三彩人物段称人物有妇女、文官、武士、牵马俑、胡俑、天王等，贵妇面部胖圆、肌肉丰满、梳各式发髻、着彩缬服装；来源未单述此俑，尺寸、发髻式样与服饰细节未载。","path":"works/sancai-nv-yong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"三彩女俑是 B 维度下唐代三彩人物俑的图版锚点，其发髻与服饰形象属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sancai-shuangyu-hu","title":"三彩双鱼壶（Sancai Double-Fish Ewer）","name_en":"Sancai Double-Fish Ewer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","唐三彩","双鱼","冥器","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sancai_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-13. 唐代 三彩双鱼壶”。唐三彩一节以（图6-12、6-13）统摄本图与图6-12“唐代 三彩（黄、绿、紫）”。正文没有对双鱼造型作描述，只总述三彩的二次烧成（素胎经1000℃-1100℃素烧，施釉后再以850℃-950℃釉烧）、以黄、赭、绿为基本釉色、题材范围（人物、动物、碗盘、水器、酒器、文具、家具、房屋、骨灰壶坛）以及冥器性质：三彩曾列入官府丧葬的明文规定，按品级不同配不同随葬","path":"works/sancai-shuangyu-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐三彩的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行加三彩通说。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sandian-jiaota-fangmianche","title":"三锭脚踏纺棉车（Three-Spindle Treadle Cotton Spinning Wheel）","name_en":"Three-Spindle Treadle Cotton Spinning Wheel","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","黄道婆","棉纺","纺车","松江"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"spinning_wheel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代棉纺织工具。原文在黄道婆一节记：黄道婆是江苏松江乌泥泾人，生于宋末元初，小时为童养媳，逃到崖州（今海南）向黎族人学习种棉纺织技术，晚年回乡推广；其业绩载于元代陶宗仪《辍耕录》、王逢《梧溪集》及明代徐启光《农政全书》。原文引《辍耕录》“黄道婆教以做造捍弹纺织之具，至于错纱配色，综线挈花，各有其法”，并称这表明黄道婆对纺织技术、工具进行了变革；特别是黄道婆和木匠将纺丝麻的三锭脚踏纺车，改革成三锭脚","path":"works/sandian-jiaota-fangmianche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代棉纺工具的器物锚点，材料只有正文一句技术改进记述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sanxingdui-bronze-statue","title":"三星堆青铜人雕像（Bronze Figure from Sanxingdui）","name_en":"Bronze Figure from Sanxingdui","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","三星堆","巴蜀文化","青铜人像","服饰等级"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_figure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三星堆青铜人雕像是本册讨论商代服饰与身份等级时最重要的形象材料。原文称在为数不多的商代服饰文物中，以四川广汉三星堆（巴蜀文化遗址）发现的商代青铜人雕像最具代表；从殉葬俑的形象看，商代人的身份有等级区别，衣着的材料、式样及配饰随之有差异，并反映商代衣服材料主要以皮、革、丝、麻为主；由于纺织技术进步，商代人已能织造极薄的绸和提花几何纹的锦、绮，奴隶主和贵族以穿着此类材质为荣。","path":"works/sanxingdui-bronze-statue.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度商代服饰与身份等级的图像锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sanzu-jia","title":"三足斝（Three-Legged Jia Vessel）","name_en":"Three-Legged Jia Vessel","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["龙山文化","陶斝","袋足","轮制","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"三足斝见于本册图版 1-12，图注为“龙山文化 三足斝”。正文在河南、陕西龙山文化一节把斝列入常见陶器组合（鼎、鬲、斝、豆、甑、盆与双耳罐），并记当地制陶大量使用轮制技术；同节还记制陶工艺使用空心锥体形陶内模，或以原有陶器袋足为模、外部敷泥拍打，制作鬲、斝、鬶、盉等器的袋足部分。原文没有对图版这一件作单独描述。","path":"works/sanzu-jia.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度龙山陶器的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sassoon-house","title":"沙逊大厦（Sassoon House）","name_en":"Sassoon House","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","上海","外滩","外来式建筑","芝加哥学派"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"commercial_building","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"上海沙逊大厦，图10-39、10-40。原文在“外来式建筑”一节先总述此类建筑：外国列强在租界按本国建筑传统与审美建造，模仿欧洲文艺复兴与折中主义风格，采用钢筋混凝土与钢结构而用石头墙面包砌，设计师大多为西方建筑师。随后记上海沙逊大厦是钢架结构的10层大楼，建于1926-1928年间，平面布局为“A”字形，立面外形前部耸立一座高达19米的锥字体屋顶的装饰物，墙面贴以花岗石，简洁而明朗，吸取了当时美","path":"works/sassoon-house.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度近代外来式建筑的器物锚点，材料为正文一段加图注两行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shandingdong-zuankong","title":"山顶洞人钻孔雕刻品（Upper Cave Drilled Ornaments）","name_en":"Upper Cave Drilled Ornaments","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["旧石器时代晚期","山顶洞人","钻孔","磨光","雕刻"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ornament","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山顶洞人钻孔雕刻品是李立新举出的旧石器时代晚期工艺例证，用以说明北京人不断提升的设计能力最终产生出钻孔、磨光和刮挖的新工艺。来源只有一条图注与一句正文，未给件数、材质、尺寸、出土层位与收藏，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/shandingdong-zuankong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度旧石器时代晚期装饰品的条目，钻孔与雕刻的视觉效果属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shandong-juxian-taozun","title":"山东莒县陶尊（Shandong Juxian Pottery Zun）","name_en":"Shandong Juxian Pottery Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时期","山东莒县","陶尊","刻画符号","旦"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_artifact","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山东莒县陶尊是赵农在第一章“文字”一节中提到的带刻画符号的新石器时期陶器。来源称在山东莒县出土的新石器时期陶尊上，曾出现“”的形象化符号，后人疑为是“旦”的源出，表示东方民族对日出东方、太阳升起的心理崇拜，亦与原始先民氏族部落的祭祀活动有关。图 1-51 的图注作“山东莒县陶尊 ‘旦’”。来源只用这两句交代该器，未给尺寸、文化归属、出土层位与收藏地；正文引号内的符号在 Markdown 中为空，无","path":"works/shandong-juxian-taozun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"山东莒县陶尊是 C 维度下陶器符号与日出崇拜的单件实物条，其陶尊器形与刻划工艺属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shang-elephant-zun","title":"商代象尊（Shang Elephant Zun）","name_en":"Shang Elephant Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","湖南醴陵","鸟兽形尊","祭器","象鼻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_ritual_vessel","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商代象尊是湖南醴陵出土的鸟兽形青铜尊，整器形象逼真而具装饰性，满身饰纹，象鼻外雕一虎形兽，器盖为一小象，体现工匠高超技艺。象尊属鸟兽形尊，背部凿口并加盖以注酒，是当时专用祭器。","path":"works/shang-elephant-zun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下商代鸟兽形青铜器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shang-yang-fang-sheng","title":"商鞅方升（Shang Yang Fang Sheng）","name_en":"Shang Yang Fang Sheng","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","秦国","商鞅变法","度量衡","量器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"measuring_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"商鞅方升是商鞅变法时的量器，器上铭刻文字。赵农把它的铭文与石鼓文并列为李斯制定小篆的书写依据，并引《战国策·秦策》述商鞅统一秦国度量衡；秦始皇又沿用秦国旧时的度量衡标准，将其颁行全国。来源未记方升的尺寸、容积、铭文字数、出土地点与现藏，也未展开铭文全文，本条不补。","path":"works/shang-yang-fang-sheng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"商鞅方升是 B 维度下秦国度量衡器物的条目，兼及 D 维度的制度统一。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shanghai-cifu","title":"上海磁悬浮列车（Shanghai maglev train）","name_en":"Shanghai maglev train","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["改革开放","上海","磁悬浮","轨道交通","磁悬浮列车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"rail_vehicle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"上海磁悬浮列车是上海成功运行的磁悬浮轨道交通车辆。赵农称其高速安全、无震动和噪声，是中国交通工具最先进的标志，并以它与 1881 年“龙”号机车对举，说明火车印证交通工具设计对社会大众的积极影响。来源未给线路长度、通车年份、最高速度、制造方与设计者。","path":"works/shanghai-cifu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"上海磁悬浮列车是 B 维度下轨道交通车辆的作品条目；其技术引进与现代化意义属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shanghai-expo-china-pavilion-2010","title":"2010年上海世博会中国馆（China Pavilion, Expo 2010 Shanghai）","name_en":"China Pavilion, Expo 2010 Shanghai","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["2010","上海","世博会","中国馆","国家展馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition_pavilion","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"2010年上海世博会中国馆是赵农《中国艺术设计史》中以图版出现的当代建筑。导论图导论-6 与第十章图10-67 两处图注均以该馆为题，图10-67 图注作“东方既白，知者创物”。两处均只有图注，来源未记设计者、尺寸、材料、结构等信息；两幅图版均未做视觉核验。本条只登记来源可证的图注信息，不据外部知识补全。","path":"works/shanghai-expo-china-pavilion-2010.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本项目是 B 维度下当代国家展馆建筑的图注条目：仅登记赵农两处图版所标对象与图注文字。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shanghai-huifeng-yinhang","title":"上海汇丰银行（HSBC Building, Shanghai）","name_en":"HSBC Building, Shanghai","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["外滩","公和洋行","古典主义","钢筋混凝土","1923"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"architecture","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"上海汇丰银行由英商公和洋行设计，建于 1921～1923 年间，地处上海外滩，高 8 层、占地 14 亩，建筑为钢筋混凝土浇灌、外观仿砖石结构。整个造型中部圆顶高耸，内部为爱奥尼柱式的柱廊和藻井式天花，是典型的古典主义样式建筑。","path":"works/shanghai-huifeng-yinhang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下近代外滩建筑的器物锚点，也涉及 D 维度的通商口岸制度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shanxi-shuoxian-shijiantou","title":"山西朔县石箭头（Shanxi Shuoxian Stone Arrowhead）","name_en":"Shanxi Shuoxian Stone Arrowhead","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["旧石器晚期","山西朔县","石箭头","箭镞","燧石"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"archaeological_artifact","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"山西朔县石箭头是赵农在第一章“箭器”一节中提到的早期箭镞实物。来源称1963年山西朔县曾出土石箭头，被考古学证明是距今约28945年前的箭镞，这应该是中国境内最早的弓箭武器遗存；其石箭镞长2.8厘米，为小燧石片精制而成。来源只用这一句交代该器物，未给遗址名称、层位、共存器物与收藏地。","path":"works/shanxi-shuoxian-shijiantou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"山西朔县石箭头是 B 维度下旧石器晚期箭镞的单件实物条，其年代与形制是早期弓箭技术的关键物证。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shaoxing-bazi-qiao","title":"绍兴八字桥（Bazi Bridge in Shaoxing）","name_en":"Bazi Bridge in Shaoxing","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","桥梁","绍兴","八字桥","街巷"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"绍兴八字桥是南宋时期建造的石桥。赵农记其在两条河流交汇之处，人们因地制宜，将桥梁与街巷并联，形成一座构思奇特的八字桥。来源只给位置、时代与“桥梁与街巷并联”的布局特点，未给桥长、桥宽、桥孔、材料与现存状况。","path":"works/shaoxing-bazi-qiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"绍兴八字桥是 B 维度下南宋石桥的条目；材料仅位置与布局，confidence 取 low。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shen-zifan-hua-niao-tu","title":"沈子蕃缂丝《花鸟图》（Shen Zifan's Kesi Flower-and-Bird Painting）","name_en":"Shen Zifan's Kesi Flower-and-Bird Painting","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","缂丝","沈子蕃","故宫博物院","书画缂丝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kesi_painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"沈子蕃缂丝《花鸟图》是南宋缂丝高手沈子蕃的作品，现藏故宫博物院。李立新把它与朱克柔《莲塘乳鸭图》《牡丹》并列，作为缂丝直接将绘画引入设计、以针线表现原画面貌的例证。来源只给作者、藏地与图2-36 图注，未给尺寸、画面内容、缂织工序与入藏经过。","path":"works/shen-zifan-hua-niao-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度南宋缂丝作品的单件锚点，其书画化取向属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shenbi-gong","title":"神臂弓（Shenbi Bow）","name_en":"Shenbi Bow","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","兵器","神臂弓","弩","梦溪笔谈"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"神臂弓是宋代的一种强弩。赵农引《梦溪笔谈·卷十九》记“以镫距地而张之，射三百步，能洞重札，谓之‘神臂弓’，最为利器”；同段又引“郓州发地得一铜弩机，甚大，制作极工”，并记弩机“望山”甚长、“小矩”如尺之有分寸，制弩原理用算家勾股法计算，以提高命中程度。来源未给神臂弓的尺寸、拉力、制作材料与产量。","path":"works/shenbi-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"神臂弓是 B 维度下宋代强弩的条目，材料限于性能、弩机结构与瞄准原理。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shenren-shoumianwen-yucong","title":"神人兽面纹玉琮（Jade Cong with Deity-and-Animal Mask）","name_en":"Jade Cong with Deity-and-Animal Mask","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["良渚文化","玉琮","神人兽面纹","原始宗教","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_ritual_object","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"神人兽面纹玉琮见于本册图版 1-14，图注为“良渚文化 神人兽面纹玉琮”。正文在良渚文化的知识链接中讨论良渚玉器的整体情况：仅反山墓地就出土 1100 余件组，按单件计 3200 余件，其中有作仪仗的斧钺、用于宗教法事的琮与璧、用于装饰的璜、珠、项饰、佩饰、手镯、带钩等，并记线割、锯切、管钻、抛光等加工手段，以及有学者判断高档玉器上可能使用了砣具。原文没有对图版这一件玉琮作单独描述。","path":"works/shenren-shoumianwen-yucong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度良渚玉器的图版锚点，正文只提供同类器群的统计与工艺判断。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shensi-xiu-bei","title":"神丝绣被（Divine-Silk Embroidered Quilt）","name_en":"Divine-Silk Embroidered Quilt","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","刺绣","同昌公主","杜阳杂编","丝绣笔记"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidered_quilt","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"神丝绣被是唐同昌公主出嫁时所备的绣被。《丝绣笔记》转引《杜阳杂编》记其绣三千鸳鸯、间以奇花异叶，并缀灵粟之珠，五色辉焕。来源只给这一条文献，未给尺寸、地色、针法与藏地，也未给同昌公主的父系与嫁年；田自秉把它列在唐代刺绣精巧华美的例证中。","path":"works/shensi-xiu-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代刺绣织物的文献锚点，材料为《杜阳杂编》转引一条。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shenyang-gugong","title":"沈阳故宫（Shenyang Imperial Palace）","name_en":"Shenyang Imperial Palace","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","沈阳","盛京","宫城","井字形街道"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palace_complex","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"沈阳故宫是清初在沈阳修建的宫城。赵农记沈阳为辽金元故地，旧称营州，元代为沈阳路；明代万历年间努尔哈赤建国大金，后来迁都沈阳，改称盛京，城市规模随之扩大，修建宫城即沈阳故宫；在城市中心建钟鼓楼与宫殿呼应，四周城墙各开两座城门，形成街道井字形布局。来源未给宫殿群组成、建筑面积与营建年代。","path":"works/shenyang-gugong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"沈阳故宫是 B 维度下清初宫殿建筑的条目；盛京都城制度与军事驻防归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shenyuan","title":"沈园（Shen Garden）","name_en":"Shen Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","园林","沈园","绍兴","陆游"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"沈园是南宋绍兴的园林。赵农记其素雅大方、精致巧妙，为南宋人们游园意识的见证；当时许多私人园林定期向公众开放，在沈园中便发生了诗人陆游和唐婉的爱情悲剧故事。来源未给园址、面积、布局、景物与现存状况。","path":"works/shenyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"沈园是 B 维度下南宋绍兴园林的条目；其定期向公众开放的游园制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shenzhenren-de-yitian","title":"深圳人的一天（Shenzhenren de Yitian (A Day of Shenzhen People)）","name_en":"Shenzhenren de Yitian (A Day of Shenzhen People)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","城市雕塑","深圳人的一天"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sculpture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《深圳人的一天》是深圳城市雕塑的代表作品之一，赵农在改革开放后城市雕塑段把它列入能代表城市历史文化的作品。来源只给作品名与所在城市，未给作者、材质、尺度、建成年代与造型。","path":"works/shenzhenren-de-yitian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《深圳人的一天》是 B 维度下改革开放后城市雕塑作品的条目；来源只作作品列举，未及制度或机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shenzhou-wuhao","title":"神舟五号载人飞船（Shenzhou-5 spacecraft）","name_en":"Shenzhou-5 spacecraft","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","2003","航天","载人飞船","神舟五号"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"spacecraft","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"神舟五号载人飞船是中国载人航天工程的飞船。赵农在“其他器具”段只泛称载人太空飞船的发射回收成功证明中国科学技术具有国际先进水平；图 10-52 图注写作“神州五号载人飞船发射”。正文未点名神舟五号，来源未给发射年份、乘员、飞船结构与设计者。","path":"works/shenzhou-wuhao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"神舟五号载人飞船是 B 维度下航天器设计的作品条目；其尖端技术与国家现代化意义属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shi-gu-wen","title":"石鼓文（Stone Drum Inscriptions）","name_en":"Stone Drum Inscriptions","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","秦国","文字","大篆","籀文"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"石鼓文是赵农所记秦国文字的代表，亦称大篆或籀文。来源说它与西周以来的金文有一定关联，并把石鼓文与商鞅方升铭文并列为李斯制定小篆的书写依据。来源未记石鼓的数量、字数、刻制年代、出土时间地点、尺寸与现藏，本条不补，也不据名称推写形制。","path":"works/shi-gu-wen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"石鼓文是 C 维度下秦国文字遗存的条目，来源只给名称、别称、与金文的关系及其对李斯小篆的影响。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shi-men-ming","title":"石门铭（Shimen Ming (Inscription of the Stone Gate)）","name_en":"Shimen Ming (Inscription of the Stone Gate)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","北魏","摩崖石刻","魏碑","褒斜谷道"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"石门铭是北魏摩崖石刻。来源在论魏碑时记其描写褒斜谷道的开拓情景，并引清人康有为的评语（L3465）；来源另配图 5-14（L3468）。石面形制、尺寸、字数、书丹者、具体刻立年份与现存地点，原文未载。图版未核，本条不据图补写。","path":"works/shi-men-ming.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度北魏摩崖石刻的条目，来源记其内容题材、石刻类型与康有为评语，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shi-qiang-pan","title":"史墙盘（Shi Qiang Pan）","name_en":"Shi Qiang Pan","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","青铜盘","铭文","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_basin","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"史墙盘是西周青铜盘，因铭文而在赵农的钟鼎文叙述中被列为长篇记事铭文的实例。来源共有三处材料：图 2-48“西周 史墙盘”、图 2-49“西周 史墙盘铭文”，以及正文把《史墙盘》与《毛公鼎》《大盂鼎》《虢季子白盘》《多友鼎》并列为西周长篇铭文，称其一方面记载西周社会文化，一方面体现青铜铭文的文字规范。来源未给器形、尺寸、铭文字数与出土收藏信息。","path":"works/shi-qiang-pan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"史墙盘是 C 维度下西周青铜铭文实例的条目，其器形与铸造属 B 维度。来源只有图注与列举，未展开。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shihu-yuan","title":"十笏园（Shihu Garden）","name_en":"Shihu Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北方园林","山东潍坊","私家园林","江南影响"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"十笏园是山东潍坊的名园。赵农在江南园林一节的结尾记北方的名园多取江南园林之精华，举山东潍坊十笏园与济南万竹园为例。来源只给园名与这一总体判断，未给建园年代、园主、面积、布局与造园手法。","path":"works/shihu-yuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"十笏园是 B 维度下北方取法江南造园的私家园林条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shihuangling-kuifengwen-dawadang","title":"始皇陵夔凤纹大瓦当（Large Kui-Phoenix Tile End from the Qin Mausoleum）","name_en":"Large Kui-Phoenix Tile End from the Qin Mausoleum","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦代","瓦当","始皇陵","夔凤纹","建筑材料"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"roof_tile_end","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"始皇陵夔凤纹大瓦当是秦始皇陵出土的大型建筑瓦当。2009 册记其直径约 40 厘米，形体之大是建筑瓦当中少有的；同段记秦代渭河一带有官营陶窑成片，以烧制砖瓦等建筑材料为主，秦砖有纹饰、质地坚硬，有“铅砖”之美称。来源只给尺寸与大小评价，未描述夔凤纹的构图与瓦当形制。","path":"works/shihuangling-kuifengwen-dawadang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度秦代建筑材料的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shiwu-lianzhan-tongdeng","title":"十五连盏铜灯（Fifteen-Lamp Bronze Lamp）","name_en":"Fifteen-Lamp Bronze Lamp","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","中山国","树形灯","连枝灯","河北平山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_lamp","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"十五连盏铜灯是河北平山战国中山王墓出土的铜灯，高达 84.5 厘米，以树形灯架为主体，上饰有龙、鸟、猴、人物等形象，造型奇特；15 盏灯可聚可散，可根据照明需要加以调节。田自秉记其一树为灯杆，上有 15 个灯盏，树身塑造一群动态各异的猴子。高丰称此器为“十五连枝铜灯”，并归入“连枝灯”一类，补出树体与树下有螭龙盘绕、猴戏鸟鸣与戏猴人物，灯座由 3 只双身虎承托，15 个灯盘分布在枝头与灯柱顶端。\n","path":"works/shiwu-lianzhan-tongdeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下战国青铜灯具的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shizhuzhai-jianpu","title":"《十竹斋笺谱》（Shizhuzhai Jianpu (Ten Bamboo Studio Letter Paper Album)）","name_en":"Shizhuzhai Jianpu (Ten Bamboo Studio Letter Paper Album)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","十竹斋","饾版","拱花","彩色套印"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明末《十竹斋笺谱》，图9-52 图注作“明代《十竹斋笺谱》”。原文在明清印刷工艺一节记：明代后期发明了分色分版套印与用雕版压印凸出花纹的拱花，南京是彩色套印的中心；1626年刊刻的《萝轩变古笺谱》是现存最早的短版、拱花印本；明末用短版印的《十竹斋画谱》和用短版、拱花印的《十竹斋笺谱》，色彩艳丽、浓淡分明，阴阳向背酷似原画，可谓画、刻、印三绝的短版代表作。原文该段六次用“短版”、一处用“饱版”，均未","path":"works/shizhuzhai-jianpu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度明代彩色套印的代表作，材料为正文一段加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shizilin","title":"狮子林（Lion Grove Garden）","name_en":"Lion Grove Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","苏州园林","私家园林","假山","倪云林"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"狮子林是苏州名园，赵农记其因元代在此筑寺而得名，为纪念佛教人物及佛陀狮子座等佛教含义而建造。来源称相传元代画家倪云林参与狮子林的规划设计，园中假山叠石高低错落、变化多姿，如群狮翻舞；园内以燕誉堂、指柏轩、卧云轩、荷花厅、湖心亭、问梅阁的设置引人入胜，山石叠异、翠荷摇波、复路遥指、花丛闲卧。来源并记狮子林后为当代建筑家贝聿铭的祖宅。来源未给建园与改园年代、面积、叠山工匠与建筑形制。","path":"works/shizilin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"狮子林是 B 维度下元代起源的苏州私家园林的器物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shou-mian-tong-pai-shi","title":"兽面铜牌饰（Bronze Plaque with Animal-Mask Design）","name_en":"Bronze Plaque with Animal-Mask Design","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["二里头文化","青铜","牌饰","兽面纹","镶嵌"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_plaque","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"兽面铜牌饰是李立新《中国设计艺术史论》图5-3 图注所载的二里头文化镶嵌青铜牌饰，二里头发现两件。来源记其造型形式与技术在同期的其他造物类型中未见相同者，饰精致的兽面纹，与良渚玉器兽面纹在构成方法上相同；是新的设计还是模仿品难以断定，与良渚文化镶嵌漆器是否有关联尚待考古发现。来源未给尺寸、藏地、出土单位、年代与镶嵌材料。","path":"works/shou-mian-tong-pai-shi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度二里头文化青铜牌饰的器物锚点，其兽面纹属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shouwen-heitao-yaxingzun","title":"兽纹黑陶鸭形尊（Duck-Shaped Black Pottery Zun with Beast Motif）","name_en":"Duck-Shaped Black Pottery Zun with Beast Motif","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","黑陶","鸭形尊","象生器","河北省文物研究所"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_zun","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"兽纹黑陶鸭形尊是战国泥质黑陶器，高 27.8cm。造型仿野鸭蹒跚欲行之状，鸭头为流、鸭尾为鋬（原文作“鳌”，疑即鋬字），设计古朴典雅；来源称其由新石器时期“象生器”发展而来，但没有完全脱离与实用功能的联系。","path":"works/shouwen-heitao-yaxingzun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度战国陶器的单器条目，鸭形造型与装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuanglu-wadang","title":"双鹿瓦当（Roof-Tile End with Twin Deer）","name_en":"Roof-Tile End with Twin Deer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","瓦当","建筑材料","模印纹样"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"roof_tile_end","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"双鹿瓦当见本册图版 3-27，图注为“战国 双鹿瓦当”。原文在“建筑材料”一节记春秋战国为适应城市与宫室建筑需要，砖、瓦、瓦当、瓦钉、下水管道等大量使用陶制材料，洛阳、邯郸、易县、曲阜、临淄、侯马、江陵等地都发现各种瓦件和陶制下水管道；瓦的结构有所改进，瓦钉与瓦身分离，使瓦的固定连接增强、瓦坯制作也较容易；瓦当一般呈半圆形、模印装饰花纹，主要有涡状纹、“r”形纹、对鸟兽纹、树木纹、几何纹、星云纹、","path":"works/shuanglu-wadang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度战国建筑材料的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuangluan-ruishou-kuihua-jing","title":"双鸾瑞兽葵花镜（Mallow-Shaped Mirror with Double Phoenixes and Auspicious Beasts）","name_en":"Mallow-Shaped Mirror with Double Phoenixes and Auspicious Beasts","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","铜镜","葵花形","双鸾","瑞兽"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-32. 唐代 双鸾瑞兽葵花镜”。图注前为“伊斯兰文化”一节，图注后紧接唐镜工艺的总结：唐镜制作非常符合科学原理，铜锡铅的比例约为70:25:5，由于加锡量较多所以一般呈白色，花纹清晰、表面匀净；为了能在小小的镜面上照到人的全脸，将镜面微向外凸，类似现代汽车的反光镜，并引宋代沈括《梦溪笔谈》“鉴大则平，鉴小则凸”一段申说。图6-31 图注只作“唐代 铜镜”，与本条同页。","path":"works/shuangluan-ruishou-kuihua-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代铜镜的器物锚点，材料为图注一行加唐镜工艺总结一段。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuangniao-wen-gubi","title":"双鸟纹骨匕（Bone Ladle with Double-Bird Motif）","name_en":"Bone Ladle with Double-Bird Motif","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["河姆渡","骨器","双鸟纹","骨匕","新石器时代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bone_artifact","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"双鸟纹骨匕是河姆渡出土的骨器。田自秉记其双鸟异首同身，组成两组图案，骨匕两端用平行线和点线组成有节奏的几何纹装饰，形成完整装饰画面；图版插图 34。来源未给尺寸、年代、藏地与同出器物。","path":"works/shuangniao-wen-gubi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"双鸟纹骨匕是 B 维度下河姆渡骨器的作品条目；其双鸟纹与几何边饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shui-dui","title":"水碓（Water-Powered Trip Hammer）","name_en":"Water-Powered Trip Hammer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","西汉末年","水力","齿轮","舂米"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"grain_machine","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"水碓是以水为动力的粮食加工机械。2016 记其为西汉末年出现，利用水力驱动碓头舂米，极大提高了舂米效率，图 4-35 为西汉水碓模型。赵农记东汉时期出现水碓和畜力碓，利用自然和牲畜的力量加工粮食作物：水碓将水流作为动力，带动齿轮旋转，然后用杵棒敲击谷物，减轻了人们的劳作；东汉《新语》有“及役水而舂，其利乃百倍”的说法。","path":"works/shui-dui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下汉代粮食加工机械的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuihudi-qin-bamboo-slips","title":"睡虎地秦简（Shuihudi Qin Bamboo Slips）","name_en":"Shuihudi Qin Bamboo Slips","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","秦代","简牍","秦隶","云梦"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"manuscript","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"睡虎地秦简是湖北云梦睡虎地出土的秦简文字。赵农在叙述秦隶时，把这种文字的代表作品指为睡虎地出土秦简，并保留程邈造字属于传说的语气。田自秉则引简文“工禀髒它县，到官试之”，据以说明秦代制漆的组织管理与统一质量标准。两册所取面向不同：一为文字与书体，一为手工业管理；来源均未给简数、简文全貌、墓主、书写年代、尺寸与现藏，本条不补。","path":"works/shuihudi-qin-bamboo-slips.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"睡虎地秦简是 C 维度下秦代简牍文字的条目；田自秉所引漆器管理一句的生产与制度面向归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuijinggong","title":"水晶宫（Crystal Palace）","name_en":"Crystal Palace","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1851","英国","万国博览会","钢铁","玻璃"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"exhibition_building","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"水晶宫是 1851 年英国“万国博览会”的钢铁、玻璃结构建筑。赵农称其出现揭开了现代艺术设计的序幕。来源未给设计者、建筑面积、结构尺寸、建造与拆除年份。","path":"works/shuijinggong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"水晶宫是 B 维度下钢铁玻璃建筑的作品条目；其世界博览会与跨文化展示意义属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuilu-gongzhan-jian","title":"水陆攻战纹鉴（Water-Land Battle Scene Jian）","name_en":"Water-Land Battle Scene Jian","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","汲县山彪镇","红铜镶嵌","战船","约300人"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_basin","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"水陆攻战纹鉴是战国青铜鉴，1935 年河南汲县山彪镇出土。外壁用红铜镶嵌水陆射杀、格斗等战争场面，战士束腰佩剑，有张弓、持戟、架梯、荡桨、首级落地、奔跑呼叫等姿态，共约 300 人；器现藏台湾省。李立新据其纹样说明战船分两层、上层作战下层划桨、船底双层。赵农 2009 册称此器为“水陆攻战纹铜鉴”，同样记其为河南汲县出土，并具体到上层士兵击鼓、挥戈、射箭，下层水手划棹行船，视为楚国水战的生动描写；","path":"works/shuilu-gongzhan-jian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下战国青铜鉴的器物锚点，纹样内容另涉 C 维度的叙事图像。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuiyun-huntianyi","title":"水运浑天仪（Water-Driven Armillary Sphere）","name_en":"Water-Driven Armillary Sphere","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","天文仪器","水运浑象","僧一行","梁令瓒"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"astronomical_instrument","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"水运浑天仪是唐代僧一行与梁令瓒改造张衡水运浑象而成的水力天文装置。来源在仪器节先把它与浑仪并举为唐代技艺发明成就，随后记僧一行和梁令瓒进一步改造张衡的水运浑象，注水激轮使其自转，一日一夜天转一周，并安装自动报时器，成为原始的天文钟。来源称其既能表示天象又能记时，是一种真正意义的机械钟，较之早期刻漏有其先进性；后因后人缺乏保养，铜铁材料生锈而无法延续转动。来源又记僧一行在浑仪测量基础上制定大衍历。来","path":"works/shuiyun-huntianyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"水运浑天仪是 B 维度唐代水力天文仪器的条目；来源所述驱动、报时与失传均属器物技术叙述，不涉及设计史书写或史学方法，故不指派 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuochangyong","title":"说唱俑（Storytelling Figurine）","name_en":"Storytelling Figurine","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","成都","天回山","陶塑","明器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_figurine","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"说唱俑是四川成都天回山东汉墓出土的汉代陶塑，塑造一说唱艺人左手抱鼓、右手持鼓棒，表情有声有色，右足翘起，似已进入故事高潮。来源称其为雕塑珍品。","path":"works/shuochangyong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"说唱俑是 B 维度下东汉陶塑人物俑的器物条目；表情、姿态与叙事性的视觉处理归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuxia-duiniao-duiyang-wenjin","title":"树下对鸟对羊纹锦（Brocade with Trees, Paired Birds and Paired Sheep）","name_en":"Brocade with Trees, Paired Birds and Paired Sheep","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北魏","织锦","对鸟对羊","中西交流","锦纹"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"树下对鸟对羊纹锦见本册图版 5-11，图注原文作“北魏 树下对乌对羊纹锦和树纹锦”，“对乌”疑为“对鸟”之讹，本条按候选名“对鸟”建档并保留原文说明。原文在北朝纺织一节称北魏统一中原后设立官营丝织作坊，平城宫中“婢使千余人织绫锦”；孝文帝重视农桑，遣宫中机织工匠帮助民间织造；当时锦的织造和锦纹设计多为平纹经线彩锦、兼有纬线起花，还引进了中亚、西亚的织锦纹样，如“菱纹锦”“龙纹锦”“瑞兽锦”“狮纹锦","path":"works/shuxia-duiniao-duiyang-wenjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度北朝织锦的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:shuxia-liyang-tu-jiaxie-pingfeng","title":"树下立羊图夹缬屏风（Woodblock-Resist Screen with a Standing Ram under a Tree）","name_en":"Woodblock-Resist Screen with a Standing Ram under a Tree","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","夹缬","屏风","印染","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_textile","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-17. 唐代 树下立羊图夹缬屏风”。图注与6-18“唐代 蜡染屏风的纺织纹样”、6-19“唐代 夹缬”同被印染业段末（图6-17、6-18、6-19）统摄。正文记隋唐印染业空前发展，官府掌管其事，据《唐六典》织染署下设练染之作有六：青、绛、黄、白、皂、紫，染大抵以草木而成，有以花叶、有以茎叶、有以根皮，出有方土，采以时月；宫中亦有染坊；染料以植物染料为主，靛蓝等已作为外贸商品出口到西亚","path":"works/shuxia-liyang-tu-jiaxie-pingfeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代印染织物的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:si-ma-sheng-mu-zhi-ming","title":"司马升墓志铭（Sima Sheng Muzhiming (Epitaph of Sima Sheng)）","name_en":"Sima Sheng Muzhiming (Epitaph of Sima Sheng)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","东魏","墓志铭","楷书"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"司马升墓志铭是东魏墓志铭。来源在论楷书时，把它与北魏《张猛龙碑》并举，称其与《张猛龙碑》等作品已属成熟的楷书（L3440）。来源只此一句提及，未给志主生平、出土地、形制、尺寸、字数、书丹者、具体刻立年份与现存地点。来源无对应图题，图版未核，本条不据其他材料补写。","path":"works/si-ma-sheng-mu-zhi-ming.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度东魏墓志铭的条目，来源仅以之与《张猛龙碑》并举为楷书成熟例证，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sichou-zhilu-xian-diaosu","title":"丝绸之路（西安城市雕塑）（Sichou Zhilu (Silk Road, Xi'an Urban Sculpture)）","name_en":"Sichou Zhilu (Silk Road, Xi'an Urban Sculpture)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","城市雕塑","丝绸之路（西安城市雕塑）"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sculpture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《丝绸之路》是西安城市雕塑的代表作品之一，赵农在改革开放后城市雕塑段把它列入能代表城市历史文化的作品。来源只给作品名与所在城市，未给作者、材质、尺度、建成年代与造型。","path":"works/sichou-zhilu-xian-diaosu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《丝绸之路》是 B 维度下改革开放后城市雕塑作品的条目；来源只作作品列举，未及制度或机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sihe-ruyi-jinpan","title":"四合如意金盘（Four-Ruyi-Headed Gold Plate）","name_en":"Four-Ruyi-Headed Gold Plate","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","金银器","金盘","吴县元墓","四合如意"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"gold_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四合如意金盘是1959年江苏吴县元墓所出金银器之一。来源记金盘用四个如意头组成四瓣花式，中间作柿蒂纹，并刻饰西番莲缠枝花纹，评为作工细致、造型优美。来源未给尺寸、重量、藏地与图版。","path":"works/sihe-ruyi-jinpan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代金银器单器锚点，如意头与西番莲缠枝的纹样组织属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:simajinlong-mu-qi-pingfeng","title":"司马金龙墓漆屏风（Lacquer Screen from the Tomb of Sima Jinlong）","name_en":"Lacquer Screen from the Tomb of Sima Jinlong","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北魏","漆器","彩绘","司马金龙墓","大同"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_screen","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"司马金龙墓漆屏风是本册北魏漆器的代表。原文称北魏时期最著名的漆器就是 1965 年在山西大同司马金龙墓出土的漆屏风：屏风的主色调为红色，上有彩绘，用黄、白、青、绿、橙等颜色绘有许多历史故事，还题有墨书文字；有学者认为这些彩绘是用核桃油调制漆色制作，《北齐书·祖传》中记载“善为胡桃油以涂画”。原文推测这件漆屏风很可能是主人生前使用过的心爱之物，因而随葬入土。","path":"works/simajinlong-mu-qi-pingfeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度北朝漆器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:simei-tu","title":"四美图（Four Beauties Print）","name_en":"Four Beauties Print","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["金代","平阳","姬家雕印","招贴","年画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"print_poster","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四美图是金代平阳府（今山西临汾）姬家刻印的雕版印刷招贴画，高 57.5 厘米、宽 32.5 厘米；画面为王昭君、赵飞燕、班姬（婕妤）、绿珠四位美人，花冠绣裳、体姿生动、线条流畅、刻工精细。画面上方刻“随朝窈窕呈倾国之芳容”楷书字样，并有“平阳姬家雕印”题识。赵农另记其高二尺五寸、宽一尺多，并推测为北宋末年山西临汾商家印制的年画、“对屏”中左边一幅。","path":"works/simei-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下金代雕版印刷招贴的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:simen-ta","title":"四门塔（Simen Pagoda）","name_en":"Simen Pagoda","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋代","佛塔","石塔","神通寺","济南"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四门塔在济南青龙山神通寺，建于隋大业七年（611），是现存最早的仿木单檐石塔。赵农 2009 册在寺塔一节用一整段记它，内容包括塔的所在地、建年、石塔性质、塔身材料与高度、塔室塔心柱与佛像、塔顶构件、四面拱门与得名，最后给出整体评价。来源未给平面边长、塔基做法、佛像数目与像主，也未说设计者与工匠。本条按原文一段立目，并用图版未核的说明限制形制描述。","path":"works/simen-ta.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"四门塔是 B 维度下隋代仿木单檐石塔的形制与做法样本，来源只有一段，未涉制度、人物与图版细节。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:simuwu-ding","title":"司母戊大方鼎（Simuwu Ding）","name_en":"Simuwu Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代晚期","青铜器","殷墟","方鼎","铸造工艺"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"司母戊大方鼎是商代晚期殷墟出土的巨型青铜方鼎，重 875 公斤、通高 133 厘米，为已知最大的商代青铜器。五册来源有直接记载（李立新一册无\"司母戊\"字样）。尺寸与重量五册完全一致，但**范铸方式的记述互不相同**：腹范究竟是四块（每块内嵌六块分范）、鼎身八块外范，还是每边八块外范；鼎耳是\"接铸\"、在鼎上加范浇铸，还是\"单独铸造后再合铸（分铸法）\"。这些不是措辞差异，而是工艺复原层面的分歧，本 K","path":"works/simuwu-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"司母戊大方鼎是 B 维度下商代晚期青铜铸造规模与范铸技术的器物锚点，其兽面纹、夔纹与虎食人耳纹饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:sishui-laoding","title":"泗水捞鼎画象石（Pictorial Stone of Retrieving the Tripod from the Si River）","name_en":"Pictorial Stone of Retrieving the Tripod from the Si River","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","武氏祠","画像石","泗水捞鼎","历史故事"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_stone","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"泗水捞鼎画象石是武氏祠画像石之一，故事见于《史记》始皇二十八年过彭城求周鼎。画面以两堤与河岸分割构图，堤口两人监督取鼎，河岸人群用绳索拉鼎，河中有两船，一船以竿抵鼎底；鼎中龙头咬断绳索，两岸拉绳者因紧张用力而向地上倾倒。来源称画面表现断绳时刻的一刹那，并以飞鸟游鱼填满空间。","path":"works/sishui-laoding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"泗水捞鼎画象石是 C 维度下东汉历史故事画像石的器物条目，其平面剔地与石作载体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:siyang-fangzun","title":"四羊方尊（Four-Ram Square Zun）","name_en":"Four-Ram Square Zun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","青铜尊","四羊","图注","年代分歧"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_ritual_vessel","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"四羊方尊是商代青铜尊，见于赵农图 2-10（图注“商 四羊方尊”）与夏燕靖 2016 图 2-5（图注作西周器）。两册正文均未对其器形、纹饰、尺寸作进一步说明，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/siyang-fangzun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下商周青铜礼器的器物锚点，证据仅到图注层级。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:song-xiu-jingang-bore-boluomi-jing","title":"宋绣《金刚般若波罗蜜经》（Song Embroidered Diamond Sutra）","name_en":"Song Embroidered Diamond Sutra","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","刺绣","绫地","金刚经","存素堂丝绣录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"embroidered_sutra","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宋绣《金刚般若波罗蜜经》是《存素堂丝绣录》所记宋代在绫地上绣成的佛经。来源只记其共五十六页、五千九百九十六字，未给绣工、藏地、尺寸、字体与刺绣针法。它与唐咸通九年雕版印本《金刚经》同名而异媒，本条不把两者合并。","path":"works/song-xiu-jingang-bore-boluomi-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代刺绣佛经的条目，绫地与文字篇幅属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:songshan-three-que","title":"嵩山三阙（Three Que of Mount Song）","name_en":"Three Que of Mount Song","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","东汉","门阙","嵩山","祭祀建筑"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_architecture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"嵩山三阙是东汉营造的石质阙，属坛庙性祭祀建筑遗迹。来源在论汉代门阙时称汉代地表建筑现在仅存的是阙，嵩山三阙即其中之一；来源未给三阙各自的名称、具体位置与尺寸（L2881）。","path":"works/songshan-three-que.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度东汉石质门阙的条目，属坛庙祭祀建筑遗存，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:songyue-si-ta-523","title":"嵩岳寺塔（Songyue Temple Pagoda）","name_en":"Songyue Temple Pagoda","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北魏","佛塔","密檐式砖塔","十二边形","登封"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"嵩岳寺塔在河南登封嵩岳寺，建于公元 523 年（北魏），是中国现存最古老的砖塔。四册里三册给描述，李立新一册以图版图注加塔的类型分类出现。**赵农给的结构细节最细**（首层十二边形、塔室八角形、厚壁空心式木板楼、空筒状至塔顶），**夏燕靖两版给的地位判断最直**（现存最早高层砖石建筑），**三册在高度上分成 41 米与 39.5 米两说**。李立新正文只谈塔的材料与形式分类，把本塔作插图，故本 K","path":"works/songyue-si-ta-523.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"嵩岳寺塔是 B 维度下北魏密檐式砖塔的结构样本：十二边形首层、八角形塔室、厚壁空心式木板楼、空筒状塔身都在此汇合。北魏佛教寺院数量与舍宅为寺的制度背景归 D 维度。李立新一册只提供塔的类型分类与图版图注，不含该塔的描述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:susha-chanyi","title":"素纱禅衣（Plain Silk Gauze Robe）","name_en":"Plain Silk Gauze Robe","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","马王堆","丝织","服饰","纱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silk_garment","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"素纱禅衣是湖南长沙马王堆一号汉墓出土的西汉单衣，衣长 128 厘米、重 49 克。三册的用法不同：**高丰给形制、镶缘与礼制出处**（领边袖边 5.6 厘米夹层绢缘，引《礼记·玉藻》郑玄注），**田自秉给织造组织与感官评价**（方孔平纹，类似现今的乔其纱，引“轻薄如空”“举之若无”），**赵农两处提到而只给数据与赞叹**（一处引“其水平之精湛，令人叹为观止”，一处给尺寸与重量）。**袖长在两册间相","path":"works/susha-chanyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"素纱禅衣是 B 维度下汉代丝织与服饰工艺的器物锚点：纱的平纹组织、单衣形制与不足一两的重量都在此可量。其“轻薄如空”“举之若无”的感官评价与后世纱罗的形态关联归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tai-shan-jing-shi-yu-jin-gang-jing","title":"泰山经石峪金刚经（Diamond Sutra at Sutra Stone Valley, Mount Tai）","name_en":"Diamond Sutra at Sutra Stone Valley, Mount Tai","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北齐","摩崖刻石","隶书","泰山","书法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"泰山经石峪金刚经是来源在论北朝碑刻时记下的摩崖刻石，年代只称相传为北齐时期。来源记其字大径尺，以隶书为主而兼有篆、楷、行书体，并以气吞河山、雄浑无比评其气势。同一节的两条图注称名不一：图 5-16 作“泰山金刚经”，图 5-17 作“北齐《泰山金刚经》”，都省去经石峪三字。来源未记刻经的书写者、字数、行数、经石面积、具体方位与保存状况，本条不补。","path":"works/tai-shan-jing-shi-yu-jin-gang-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度北齐摩崖刻经的文字遗存条目，来源只给年代传闻、刻石方式、字径、书体构成与风格评语，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:taihedian","title":"太和殿（Hall of Supreme Harmony）","name_en":"Hall of Supreme Harmony","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明清","紫禁城","前三殿","皇极殿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palace_hall","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"太和殿是紫禁城前三殿之一，明代称皇极殿。赵农记紫禁城建筑以前三殿：皇极殿（清太和殿）、中极殿（清中和殿）、建极殿（清保和殿），后三宫：乾清宫、交泰殿、坤宁宫为主体；长陵棱恩殿面积与紫禁城太和殿相近，为中国古代第二大殿。来源未给太和殿的面阔、进深、高度与重建年代。","path":"works/taihedian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"太和殿是 B 维度下明清宫殿建筑的条目；前三殿制度与朝仪归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:taiyangxingqi","title":"太阳形器（Sun-Shaped Bronze Object）","name_en":"Sun-Shaped Bronze Object","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代","三星堆","青铜","太阳神","嵌铸"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_ritual_object","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"太阳形器是三星堆文化（商）的青铜器，直径 85cm。器物正中阳部突起，周围五芒呈放射状，芒外围以晕圈，用嵌铸法和铆铸法分五部分二次铸成，表现蜀人对太阳神的崇敬。来源为图注并注明引自《三星堆祭祀坑》，出土地点与共存关系未载。","path":"works/taiyangxingqi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度三星堆青铜器的单器条目，五芒与晕圈的视觉构成属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tan-yao-wu-ku","title":"昙曜五窟（Five Caves of Tan Yao）","name_en":"Five Caves of Tan Yao","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["昙曜","云冈石窟","石窟","佛像","武州塞"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cave_temple","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"昙曜五窟是云冈石窟最早开凿的五所石窟。来源记大约在公元 453 年，和尚昙曜白帝，于京城西武州塞凿山石壁、开窟五所、各镌佛像一躯，并记佛像高度与雕饰；后文在「石窟形制」综述中称其基本上是穹隆式大洞结构，以大佛为主，为云冈石窟的标志性雕塑。来源未载五窟各自名称与编号、佛像尺数的米制换算、窟内造像组合与工匠名录。本条据 L3992、L3998 写成。","path":"works/tan-yao-wu-ku.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条以 B 维度北魏石窟开凿与造像工程为主，兼及 A 维度对云冈开凿的文献记述，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tang-dai-tong-zhenzhi","title":"唐代铜镇纸（Tang Bronze Paperweight）","name_en":"Tang Bronze Paperweight","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","铜器","镇纸","吉木萨尔","蹲兽"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_paperweight","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代铜镇纸是新疆吉木萨尔出土的蹲兽形铜镇纸。来源称其形态简练生动，既可镇纸实用，又可作案头摆设，是一件优秀作品。来源未给尺寸、重量、兽形种类、铸地与藏地。","path":"works/tang-dai-tong-zhenzhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代铜器的单器锚点，材料为一段出土与形制描述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tang-dai-yin-xunlu","title":"唐代银薰炉（Tang Silver Censer）","name_en":"Tang Silver Censer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","金银器","薰炉","机环","平衡装置"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silver_censer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代银薰炉是来源所述设计精巧的银器：炉体圆球、遍体镂空，子母口开合，球内有同心圆机环与焚香杯，利用底部重心与活轴保持平衡，使焚香杯随之转动而不翻倒。来源未给尺寸、重量、出土地与藏地，也未说明所据实物。","path":"works/tang-dai-yin-xunlu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代金银器的单器锚点，重点是机环平衡结构。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tang-yin-xiangnang","title":"唐代银香囊（Tang Silver Perfume Pouch）","name_en":"Tang Silver Perfume Pouch","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","何家村","沙坡村","法门寺","平衡环"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silverware","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代银香囊是唐代银质熏香器，高丰称“银熏球”。已出土实物集中于陕西关中：1963 年西安沙坡村 4 件、1970 年西安何家村窖藏 1 件、1987 年扶风法门寺地宫 2 件（2009、2016）；除最大一件（法门寺出土）直径 12.8 厘米外，其余直径大多在五厘米左右（两版）。高丰另记何家村一件“直径不过4.5厘米”，沙坡村出 4 件（2004）。器作圆球，上下两个半球可关启，上半球顶部环纽系链","path":"works/tang-yin-xiangnang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐代金银器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tangxu-tielu","title":"唐胥铁路（Tangxu Railway）","name_en":"Tangxu Railway","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晚清","1881年","铁路","唐胥铁路","龙号机车"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"railway","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐胥铁路是 1881 年通车的唐山—胥各庄铁路，长仅 10 公里，为轻便铁路。赵农记其“龙号”机车由中国人自己制造；清政府曾以火车惊扰皇陵为由，出现用骡马拉火车的“马拉铁路”笑话。来源未给轨距、造价、线路走向与运量。","path":"works/tangxu-tielu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"唐胥铁路是 B 维度下晚清轻便铁路的条目；其官办背景与皇陵禁忌的决策约束归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:taojing","title":"陶井（Pottery Well Model）","name_en":"Pottery Well Model","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","陶井","井架","滑轮","河南省博物院"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_model","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"陶井是东汉时期的陶制井模型，见于李立新绪言图版。图注称其表现了汉代井架的设计和滑轮的安装与使用方法，并记河南省博物院藏品；尺寸、出土地点与井架结构未载，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/taojing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度汉代陶制建筑明器的单器条目，井架与滑轮的结构示意属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ti-hua-ling-ji","title":"提花绫机（马钧改进）（Improved Pattern Loom of Ma Jun）","name_en":"Improved Pattern Loom of Ma Jun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["三国魏","马钧","提花机","织机","踏板"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"loom","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"提花绫机（马钧改进）见本册图版 5-10，图注为“魏国 马钧改进的提花绫机”。原文称魏国的马钧是一位杰出的机械发明家，他根据当时织锦的需要改进提花绫机，即用 12 根踏杆控制 60 片综，操作简易方便，效率大为提高，且织出的花纹变幻无穷，使魏国的提花织物质量堪与蜀锦媲美。","path":"works/ti-hua-ling-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度织机技术的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tian-fa-shen-chen-bei","title":"天发神谶碑（Tianfa Shenchen Bei (Stele of the Divine Prophecy)）","name_en":"Tianfa Shenchen Bei (Stele of the Divine Prophecy)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","东吴","碑刻","篆隶"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"天发神谶碑是东吴碑刻。来源在论墓志铭与南方碑刻时，以它代表南方碑刻，并记其原碑刻于公元276年、笔意介于篆隶之间、字势雄伟而以方见圆（L3452）。来源未给碑的形制、尺寸、字数、书丹者与现存地点，也未言原碑存佚。来源无对应图题，图版未核，本条不据图补写。","path":"works/tian-fa-shen-chen-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度东吴碑刻的条目，来源以之代表南方碑刻并记其刻年与篆隶之间的书风，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tian-gong-si-shi-jia-li-xiang","title":"天宫寺释迦立像（Standing Sakyamuni Statue of Tiangong Temple）","name_en":"Standing Sakyamuni Statue of Tiangong Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","洛阳","天宫寺","释迦立像","铜像"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"buddhist_statue","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"天宫寺释迦立像是《洛阳伽蓝记》所载洛阳天宫寺的佛像。2009 册引其文：洛阳在迎佛日，各庙宇的金、铜佛像多达 3000 余尊；天宫寺的释迦立像高 43 尺，用铜 10 万斤、黄金 600 斤。来源据此说明魏晋南北朝佛教流行、广铸佛像耗铜极多，促使冶铜业大规模发展；并以唐代杜牧“南朝四百八十寺，多少楼台烟雨中”诗及“据考证寺庙数目远不止此数”作旁证，说明铜的用量仅佛身而言就已相当大。","path":"works/tian-gong-si-shi-jia-li-xiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度魏晋南北朝佛教造像的器物锚点，材料为《洛阳伽蓝记》的转引记录。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tianjin-qiao","title":"天津桥（Tianjin Bridge）","name_en":"Tianjin Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋代","桥梁","浮桥","洛阳","铁链"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pontoon_bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"天津桥是隋大业元年（605）建于洛阳的浮桥，由铁链联接的船只组成。赵农 2009 册在桥梁一节只用一句话带过，把它与西安灞桥并列为隋唐时期天下闻名的桥梁。来源没有给桥长、船数、铁链形制、桥址变迁与设计者，本条只记录这一句所能支撑的事实。材料单薄，仅能立目。","path":"works/tianjin-qiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"天津桥是 B 维度下隋代浮桥的形制样本，来源只有一句，无制度、人物或工艺细节可归其他维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tiantan","title":"天坛（Temple of Heaven）","name_en":"Temple of Heaven","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明清","北京","祭天","祈年殿","圜丘"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"temple_complex","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"天坛是明清北京城南冬至祭天的场所。赵农记其由斋宫、祈年殿、丹陛桥、皇穹宇、圜丘等组成；祈年殿为金顶三重檐形式，屋顶饰蓝色琉璃瓦，底座为三层圆形汉白玉石基，石基周边有龙、凤、云纹装饰；圜丘以汉白玉砌成三层圆形石台，四周有低矮方形蓝色琉璃瓦围墙，寓意天圆地方，并以 9 和 9 的倍数用于石板、石栏、石柱、石阶，使中心点的声音清晰传达四方。来源未给坛域面积、建筑年代与祭祀仪注。","path":"works/tiantan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"天坛是 B 维度下明清礼制建筑群的条目；祭天制度与皇家祭祀归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tibi-chaju","title":"提璧茶具（Tibi Tea Set）","name_en":"Tibi Tea Set","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["紫砂","顾景舟","高庄","1950年代","玉文化"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"teaset","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"提璧茶具是 20 世纪 50 年代紫砂工艺师顾景舟与中央工艺美术学院高庄教授合作创作的紫砂茶具，开创了玉文化与紫砂造型艺术融于一体的设计新理念。","path":"works/tibi-chaju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下现代紫砂茶具的器物锚点，也涉及 D 维度的工艺美术教育合作。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tihei-diaoqi-flower-bird-plate","title":"剔黑雕漆花鸟纹盘（Carved-Black Lacquer Bird-and-Flower Plate）","name_en":"Carved-Black Lacquer Bird-and-Flower Plate","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","雕漆","剔黑","剔彩","花鸟纹"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_plate","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"剔黑雕漆花鸟纹盘是田自秉册插图6图注所记的元代雕漆器。图注作剔黑雕漆花鸟纹盘，正文同号插图却系于剔彩定义之后，图注与正文的品种名不一致。来源未给尺寸、胎骨、纹样细节、藏地与图版核验。","path":"works/tihei-diaoqi-flower-bird-plate.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代雕漆单器的图注锚点，花鸟纹样属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tixi-zhijinghe","title":"剔犀执镜盒（Tixi Mirror-Handle Box）","name_en":"Tixi Mirror-Handle Box","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","剔犀","漆器","执镜盒","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_box","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"剔犀执镜盒是来源插图21 的图注所记南宋漆器，图注只作“剔犀执镜盒（南宋）”。来源正文未描述其尺寸、形制、纹样、藏地与出土信息，也未说明执镜盒与铜镜的配套关系。本条只据图注立条，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/tixi-zhijinghe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度南宋剔犀漆器的单件锚点，只有图注证据。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tong-lianzuo-liren","title":"铜连座立人（Bronze Standing Figure with Base）","name_en":"Bronze Standing Figure with Base","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商末周初","三星堆","祭祀坑","青铜立人","青铜器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_figure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜连座立人是四川广汉三星堆 1986 年两座祭祀坑出土的商末周初青铜器。田自秉记其通高 262 厘米，粗眉大眼，头戴高冠，两手作开合状、原有握物，赤足站在饰有类似饕餮纹的方座上；同出铜人头像眼珠突出、鼻梁高直。来源未给立人重量、铸造工艺、所握器物与藏地。","path":"works/tong-lianzuo-liren.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铜连座立人是 B 维度下商末周初青铜雕塑的作品条目；其冠式、手势与座面纹饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tong-niu-deng","title":"铜牛灯（Bronze Ox Lamp）","name_en":"Bronze Ox Lamp","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","长沙","虹管灯","虹吸","灯烟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_lamp","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜牛灯是长沙出土的汉代铜灯，灯体为牛形，以两角顺背向上做成虹吸管，有一向下的碗状灯罩以吸收灯烟。原文以此说明虹管灯利用虹吸原理防止烟尘污染空气的设计。","path":"works/tong-niu-deng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下汉代青铜灯具的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tongbenma","title":"铜奔马（Galloping Horse in Bronze）","name_en":"Galloping Horse in Bronze","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","武威雷台墓","青铜器","汉代冶铜"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_sculpture","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜奔马是本册举出的汉代青铜器实例。原文在“冶铜业的发展与青铜制器的提升”一节称汉代冶铜业仍然兴盛，举例 1968 年出土于河北满城中山靖王刘胜之妻窦绾墓的长信宫灯（原文作“西代青铜鎏金灯具”，疑为“汉代”之讹），以及 1969 年在甘肃武威雷台墓出土的“铜奔马”，为东汉青铜器。原文只作举例，未展开造型描述。\n\n田自秉 2010 册另作“马踏飞燕铜塑，也称铜奔马”，记其 1969 年甘肃武威雷台东汉","path":"works/tongbenma.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度汉代青铜器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tongguan-yao-you-guan","title":"铜官窑釉罐（Tongguan Kiln Glazed Jar）","name_en":"Tongguan Kiln Glazed Jar","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","铜官窑","釉下彩","罐","长沙"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铜官窑釉罐是唐代铜官窑器物，图注见插图5。正文在釉下彩瓷段记湖南铜官瓦渣坪唐窑与四川邛崃窑，称其往往在青黄釉或白釉下用褐彩或绿彩绘几何纹、云水、花鸟，并称釉下彩在陶瓷装饰史上具有重要意义。图版未核，罐的具体纹样、釉色与尺寸未载。","path":"works/tongguan-yao-you-guan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"铜官窑釉罐是 B 维度下唐代铜官窑釉下彩器物的图版锚点，其彩绘纹样属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tonghuihe","title":"通惠河（Tonghui River Canal）","name_en":"Tonghui River Canal","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","大运河","水利","郭守敬","船闸"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"canal","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"通惠河是大都到通州的河道。赵农记大运河自隋代开通后形成南北交通纽带，但旧河道年久淤积常使运河堵塞，元代多次疏浚，并在至元年间开凿通惠河和会通河，使运河从大都到杭州全线贯通；通惠河全长 160 里，建有郭守敬设计的复式船闸 10 座，合理解决河流水位落差问题；大运河自元代全线开通，南北漕运畅通无阻，泽及明清。来源未给开凿年份、土方量、用工与闸座位置。","path":"works/tonghuihe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"通惠河是 B 维度下元代漕运水利工程的条目；其国家漕运制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:toudiao-xiangya-shu","title":"透雕象牙梳（Openwork Ivory Comb）","name_en":"Openwork Ivory Comb","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["大汶口","象牙器","透雕","象牙梳","新石器时代"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ivory_artifact","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"透雕象牙梳是大汶口墓葬出土的象牙梳。田自秉记大汶口墓葬曾出土象牙梳两件，梳为象牙皮制成，长方形，长 16.7 厘米；下端有十六个细密梳齿，顶端刻四个开口，附近有圆孔三个；梳身用平行三道条孔组成“8”字形镂空装饰，内填 T 字形花纹。来源未给第二件尺寸、藏地与年代。","path":"works/toudiao-xiangya-shu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"透雕象牙梳是 B 维度下大汶口象牙器的作品条目；其透雕与 T 字纹属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tuhua-renwu-gushipan","title":"凸花人物故事盘（Repoussé Figure-Story Silver Plate）","name_en":"Repoussé Figure-Story Silver Plate","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","金银器","银盘","金坛窖藏","唐明皇游月宫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silver_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"凸花人物故事盘是1966年江苏金坛元代窖藏所出银盘，置于青花云龙罐内。来源记盘径17.2厘米，盘口刻饰云纹一圈，盘内凸刻唐明皇游月宫的人物故事，成浅浮雕效果，盘外腹刻徐宅造匠款记，采用模压、捶打和錾刻相结合的方法。来源称其为最优秀的作品，未给重量、藏地与图版。","path":"works/tuhua-renwu-gushipan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代金银器窖藏的单器锚点，唐明皇游月宫的人物故事与构图属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tuisiyuan","title":"退思园（Retreat and Reflection Garden）","name_en":"Retreat and Reflection Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清末","吴江同里","私家园林","住宅园林","退思草堂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"退思园是清末吴江同里镇的住宅式园林。赵农记主人罢官归隐后，取退而思过之意，将西部住宅与东部园林联成一体；东部园林有退思草堂、琴房、眠云亭等建筑，萃集游、歇、听、视的趣味，以回廊、曲桥、花厅点缀，形成退而卧、游而思的园居生活。来源未给建园年份、园主姓名、面积、设计与叠山工匠。","path":"works/tuisiyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"退思园是 B 维度下清末吴江住宅式私家园林的器物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:tuohuang-niu","title":"拓荒牛（Tuohuang Niu (Pioneering Bull)）","name_en":"Tuohuang Niu (Pioneering Bull)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","城市雕塑","拓荒牛"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sculpture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《拓荒牛》是深圳城市雕塑的代表作品之一，赵农在改革开放后城市雕塑段把它列入能代表城市历史文化的作品。来源只给作品名与所在城市，未给作者、材质、尺度、建成年代与造型。","path":"works/tuohuang-niu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《拓荒牛》是 B 维度下改革开放后城市雕塑作品的条目；来源只作作品列举，未及制度或机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:waguan-si-jiazhu-foxiang","title":"瓦棺寺夹纻佛像（Lacquer Buddha Statues of Waguan Temple）","name_en":"Lacquer Buddha Statues of Waguan Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晋代","南京","瓦棺寺","夹纻","行像"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_sculpture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"瓦棺寺夹纻佛像指晋代戴逵为南京瓦棺寺制作的五躯夹纻佛像，与顾恺之的维摩诘像、狮子国的玉像合称瓦棺寺三绝。夹纻作法以漆灰造形、麻布粘贴为胎，战国两汉已流行；魏晋南北朝因佛教盛行而用于塑佛，装车游行，称为行像。来源称夹纻佛像比铜佛轻便、比泥佛坚固，一时极为流行，并引《洛阳伽蓝记》多记制造夹纻佛像。五躯的尺寸、形制、存佚与瓦棺寺沿革未载。","path":"works/waguan-si-jiazhu-foxiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"瓦棺寺夹纻佛像 是 B 维度下晋代夹纻佛教造像的器物条目，其三绝并称与维摩诘像的图像关系归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wangchengtu-dai-zhen","title":"王城图（戴震）（Plan of the Royal Capital by Dai Zhen）","name_en":"Plan of the Royal Capital by Dai Zhen","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","考工记","王城图","营国制度","复原图"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reconstruction_drawing","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"王城图（戴震）见本册图版 3-29，图注为“清代学者戴震根据《考工记》所绘的王城图”。原文以图 3-28、3-29 两幅后人依《考工记》所绘的王城图，作为“匠人营国”制度的示意；同节并记《考工记》对居住尺度的规定（“室中度以几，堂上度以寻，野度以步，涂度以轨”）与营国数量多用奇数、最高等级用“九”的做法。本条只记图注给出的绘者、时代与依据。","path":"works/wangchengtu-dai-zhen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史文献与图式传统的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wangchengtu-nie-chongyi","title":"王城图（聂崇义）（Plan of the Royal Capital by Nie Chongyi）","name_en":"Plan of the Royal Capital by Nie Chongyi","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["五代","考工记","王城图","营国制度","复原图"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reconstruction_drawing","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"王城图（聂崇义）见本册图版 3-28，图注为“五代学官聂崇义根据《考工记》所绘的王城图”。原文在“营造制度”一节引《考工记》“匠人营国，方九里，旁三门。国中九经九纬，经涂九轨。左祖右社，面朝后市……”说明按封建等级需求建立与等级秩序吻合的城市空间格局：王宫建在国都中心或城市中轴线上，主要殿堂形制与体量最高最大，强调左右对称、前后有序、宫城居中、划分整齐；并以图 3-28、3-29 两幅后人依《考工","path":"works/wangchengtu-nie-chongyi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"A","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 A 维度设计史文献与图式传统的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wangdafan-fugui-shoukao-ciban","title":"王大凡《富贵寿考瓷板》（Wang Dafan's Porcelain Plaque of Wealth and Longevity）","name_en":"Wang Dafan's Porcelain Plaque of Wealth and Longevity","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","王大凡","瓷板画","巴拿马赛会","博览会"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_plaque","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"民国瓷板画，图10-5 的图注为：10-5. 民国 参加“巴拿马赛会”的王大凡《富贵寿考瓷板》作品。原文在巴拿马赛会一节记：全称“太平洋万国巴拿马博览会”，是美国为庆祝巴拿马运河正式通航而举办；1912年我国表示参加，各地经两年筹备于1914年5月至7月在江苏、浙江、山东等15个地区预展；1914年年底全国展品分两批、重约1500吨海运至美国；赛会1915年2月20日开幕，历时280天，陈列馆有美","path":"works/wangdafan-fugui-shoukao-ciban.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度民国瓷板画的器物锚点，材料为图注一行加赛会背景一段。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wangwen-boli-bei","title":"网纹玻璃杯（Network-Patterned Glass Cup）","name_en":"Network-Patterned Glass Cup","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北魏","景县","封氏墓群","祖氏墓","玻璃器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"glass_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"网纹玻璃杯是1948年河北景县封氏墓群北魏祖氏墓出土的玻璃杯：高6.7厘米，口径10.3厘米，青绿色，杯壁下部有网状凸线装饰，现陈列在中国历史博物馆。来源以它同定县塔基北魏石函玻璃器、北票北燕冯素弗墓五件吹制玻璃器、南京象山东晋王氏墓玻璃杯等一起，证明当时国内确已制造玻璃器皿，并反对我国古代玻璃器都来自西方的看法。","path":"works/wangwen-boli-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"网纹玻璃杯是 B 维度下北魏玻璃器的器物条目，其外来与本土制造之辨归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wanjian-wuyue-huaxiangzhuan","title":"丸剑舞乐画象砖（Pictorial Brick of Juggling, Sword and Music）","name_en":"Pictorial Brick of Juggling, Sword and Music","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","成都","扬子山","画象砖","宴饮"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_brick","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"丸剑舞乐画象砖是成都扬子山出土的汉代画象砖，表现贵族宴饮舞乐。画面以大小两个奁为中心分上下两组：上组男女二人观杂技，一人玩丸、一人舞瓶；下组二人奏乐，一人长袖起舞、一人摇鼗鼓。来源分析其对角线穿插与线面对比、动静对比。","path":"works/wanjian-wuyue-huaxiangzhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"丸剑舞乐画象砖是 C 维度下汉代画象砖的器物条目；砖的模印与烧制归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wanshi-ruyi-jin","title":"万世如意锦（Wanshi Ruyi Brocade）","name_en":"Wanshi Ruyi Brocade","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","新疆","织锦","吉祥文字","万世如意"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"万世如意锦是新疆出土的汉代织锦，织有“万世如意”吉祥语，来源以插图23著录。同批汉锦还有“延年益寿”“长乐明光”“韩仁绣”“子孙无极”“（永）昌长乐”等文字；内蒙古一件汉锦织“新神灵广成寿万年”八字。来源称用文字作丝织装饰图案是汉锦的突出特点。","path":"works/wanshi-ruyi-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"万世如意锦是 C 维度下汉代文字纹样织锦的器物条目，其织造载体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wanxian-changjiang-daqiao","title":"重庆万县长江大桥（Wanxian Yangtze River Bridge）","name_en":"Wanxian Yangtze River Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","桥梁","重庆万县长江大桥"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"重庆万县长江大桥是赵农所列长江上陆续架起的大桥之一，于 1997 年建成。来源只给桥名、年份与所在河流，未给桥长、跨度、材质、设计者与桥址。","path":"works/wanxian-changjiang-daqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"重庆万县长江大桥是 B 维度下现代长江桥梁的条目；其现代桥梁技术背景属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wanzhu-yuan","title":"万竹园（Wanzhu Garden）","name_en":"Wanzhu Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北方园林","济南","私家园林","江南影响"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"万竹园是济南名园。赵农在江南园林一节的结尾记北方的名园多取江南园林之精华，举山东潍坊十笏园与济南万竹园为例。来源只给园名与这一总体判断，未给建园年代、园主、面积、布局与造园手法。","path":"works/wanzhu-yuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"万竹园是 B 维度下北方取法江南造园的私家园林条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wei-ding","title":"卫鼎（Wei Ding）","name_en":"Wei Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","青铜鼎","鼎腹演变","兽蹄足"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"卫鼎是本册讨论青铜鼎形制演变的代表器之一。原文记西周中期后鼎腹进一步趋浅、下腹趋于平底、下腹壁外移、柱足上端渐粗而足跟部有外延成兽蹄形的趋势，以“大盂鼎”“卫鼎”为代表；西周后期又变为耳渐外移、口渐敞、下腹内收使器身成半球形、足成兽蹄形，以“大克鼎”“毛公鼎”为代表。","path":"works/wei-ding.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度西周青铜鼎形制序列的锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:weishui-three-bridges","title":"渭水三桥（Three Bridges over the Wei River）","name_en":"Three Bridges over the Wei River","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","秦代","汉代","桥梁","渭水"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"渭水三桥是咸阳渭水上的东、西、中三座桥梁的总称。来源记中渭桥在战国时已修筑，秦始皇时加固翻修，桥长约525米、宽约13.8米，以750根木桩组成67个桥墩，上架横梁、铺架桥面，桥侧有雕花护栏，桥身中间高、两边斜下呈八字形，并设石灯、华表。汉代又增修东西两桥。来源未给三桥总长、东西两桥的具体尺度、施工者与现存遗迹。","path":"works/weishui-three-bridges.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"渭水三桥是 B 维度下秦汉渭水桥梁的条目，来源给三桥组成、中桥尺度、木桩桥墩与桥面附件。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:weiyang-palace","title":"未央宫（Weiyang Palace）","name_en":"Weiyang Palace","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","西汉","宫殿","汉长安城","萧何"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palace","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"未央宫是汉长安城中的重要建筑，汉高祖时由萧何营作，立东阙、北阙、前殿、武库、太仓。今存遗址为一座夯土高台。来源引《史记·高祖本纪》记刘邦见宫阙壮甚而怒、萧何以“非壮丽无以重威”作答的经过，并引张衡《西京赋》描写其盛况（L2856、L2858、L2860）。来源同时把未央宫置于汉长安城夯土板筑城墙与木构技术背景中。","path":"works/weiyang-palace.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度西汉宫殿建筑的条目，关联建筑规模与皇权礼制，并涉及 D 维度制度层面，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wenjiu-tongbeilu","title":"温酒铜杯炉（Bronze Cup-and-Stove Wine Warmer）","name_en":"Bronze Cup-and-Stove Wine Warmer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","青铜器","温酒","四神纹","山西浑源"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_wine_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"温酒铜杯炉是山西浑源、太原等地出土的汉代青铜温酒器具，全器由耳杯、炭炉、底盘三部分组成。炉体上部椭圆形，四壁雕镂四神，口沿四个支钉承托铜耳杯；下部长方形，炉底铸两排长条形镂孔火簟，一侧有曲柄可提动，底盘为圆角长方形。高丰从功能角度解释其散烟、通氧、除灰与盛渣的分工，并记另有以耳杯盛酱烹煎的一说。","path":"works/wenjiu-tongbeilu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"温酒铜杯炉是 B 维度下汉代青铜温酒器具的器物条目，其四神纹装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wensiyuan-yin-xunlu","title":"文思院造鎏金朵带银熏炉（Gilt Silver Censer Made by the Wensiyuan Workshop）","name_en":"Gilt Silver Censer Made by the Wensiyuan Workshop","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","金银器","法门寺","文思院","咸通十年"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silver_censer","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"唐代文思院所造鎏金熏炉，图6-28。原文给出较完整的实测与工艺记录：炉通高29.5厘米，盖径25.9厘米，腹深7厘米，重5.363千克；银板锤鑠成型，附件浇铸，纹饰鎏金。炉体由盖、身两部分构成，直口、平折沿、方唇、深腹、平底，盖面高隆呈覆碗状，宽平折沿与炉身口沿相扣合；莲花形盖钮，钮底镂刻莲瓣一周，瓣尖上翘，呈瓣状气孔，便于烟香外熏。盖面饰缠枝莲一周，五朵莲花上各卧有一龟，龟首反顾、口衔瑞草；腹壁","path":"works/wensiyuan-yin-xunlu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代金银器的器物锚点，材料为正文一段实测记录加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:winnowing-machine","title":"风车（Winnowing Machine）","name_en":"Winnowing Machine","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","汉代","农业机具","风车","粮食加工"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"agricultural_machine","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"风车是汉代发明的粮食加工器具。来源记其内装叶形风扇，摇动生风，使秕壳与籽粒分离，并把粮食中的杂草吹去，因而成为粮食加工的便利器具（L2805）。","path":"works/winnowing-machine.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度汉代农业机具的条目，以风力分离秕壳与籽粒，属粮食加工环节，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wu-wang-fuchai-spear","title":"吴王夫差矛（Wu Wang Fuchai Spear）","name_en":"Wu Wang Fuchai Spear","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋","青铜兵器","矛","吴王夫差","江陵楚墓"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_weapon","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"吴王夫差矛是湖北江陵楚墓出土的春秋青铜矛。赵农在春秋战国兵器部分用它说明青铜矛形制的变化：矛长29.5厘米，宛如短剑，矛脊上铸有血槽，脊上错金铭文为“吴王夫差自作用口”，并称其为当时青铜矛的典型。来源没有记出土墓葬编号、同出器物与收藏单位；铭文末字作“口”，系缺字照录，原文未说明所缺何字。","path":"works/wu-wang-fuchai-spear.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"吴王夫差矛是 B 维度下春秋青铜矛的器物条目，来源一段给形制、尺寸、铭文与评价。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wu-zixu-huaxiang-jing","title":"伍子胥画像镜（Wu Zixu Portrait Mirror）","name_en":"Wu Zixu Portrait Mirror","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["六朝","铜镜","画像镜","绍兴","上海博物馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"伍子胥画像镜是六朝时期浙江绍兴一带铸造的画像镜，镜背以浮雕手法表现吴王、伍子胥、越王、范蠡、越女等人物，所取为春秋吴越争霸的历史故事。三册来源分工恰好互补：夏燕靖两版给**地位与收藏**（“魏晋南北朝时期最为突出的铜镜”，现藏上海博物馆，“所表现的重大历史题材，尚属首见”），田自秉给**产地、工艺与图像内容**（绍兴、浮雕、立体感、五名人物），并把伍子胥谏吴王的历史本事与“反映人民对他的追念……反","path":"works/wu-zixu-huaxiang-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"伍子胥画像镜是 B 维度下六朝铜镜的工艺样本（绍兴铸镜、浮雕手法、立体感），其以历史故事为镜背图像、人物多达五名，归 C 维度的图像叙事。四册均不描述其纹样布局与铭文。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wucai-figure-washer","title":"五彩人物洗（Wucai Figure Washer）","name_en":"Wucai Figure Washer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","万历","五彩","人物纹","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"五彩人物洗是田自秉册插图4图注所记的明代万历五彩器。图注只记器名与时代；正文嘉靖、万历陶瓷段记万历时期多大面积敷彩、莲瓣逐渐图案化并常用婴戏作题材，又记万历多制作大件器皿并注明插图4。本条据图注与同段背景立条，不把万历彩瓷总述全归此器。来源未给尺寸、窑口、藏地与图版核验。","path":"works/wucai-figure-washer.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代万历五彩单器的图注锚点，人物题材与敷彩属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wucai-flower-bird-vase","title":"五彩花鸟纹瓷瓶（Wucai Vase with Flower-and-Bird Motif）","name_en":"Wucai Vase with Flower-and-Bird Motif","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","康熙","五彩","花鸟","景德镇"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vase","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"五彩花鸟纹瓷瓶是田自秉清代陶瓷段著录的一件康熙五彩瓷瓶，只见于图注。图注编号为插图1，正文的引图标记在古彩段末，图注本身排在康熙陶瓷造型段之后。来源未给尺寸、窑口、款识、收藏与纹样细目，本条未做视觉核验。","path":"works/wucai-flower-bird-vase.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代五彩单器的图注锚点，花鸟纹样属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wudang-jinding-tongdian","title":"武当山金顶铜殿（Gilded Bronze Hall on Wudang Golden Summit）","name_en":"Gilded Bronze Hall on Wudang Golden Summit","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","武当山","天柱峰","铜殿","真武像"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_hall","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"武当山金顶铜殿是武当山天柱峰顶的镏金铜殿。赵农记其为现存最大的镏金铜殿，高 5.45 米，宽 5.8 米，深 4.4 米，中有 12 根立柱，筑成重檐庑殿顶铜殿；供奉的真武神像为铸造的鎏金铜像，相传以朱棣的形象为原型。来源未给铸造年代、铜料来源与铸造工匠。","path":"works/wudang-jinding-tongdian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"武当山金顶铜殿是 B 维度下明代铜铸建筑的条目；其与朱棣的政治关联归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wudangshan-daoguan","title":"武当山道观（Wudang Mountain Taoist Temples）","name_en":"Wudang Mountain Taoist Temples","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","武当山","道观","朱棣","紫霄宫"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"taoist_temple","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"武当山道观是明代湖北均县武当山的道教建筑群。赵农记武当山为二水环拥、山势壮丽、奇花异草、古木参天，吕洞宾、张三丰均修炼于此；朱棣起兵时武当山道士鼎力襄助，传出真武“显彰圣灵，始终佑助”的神话，即位后大兴土木，修筑宫观、庵堂、房舍约 1500 间，赐田奉养，有“五里一庵，十里一宫”之称；紫霄宫是保存最完好的明代建筑，建成于永乐十一年（1413 年）。来源未给各宫观名称、占地与建筑形制。","path":"works/wudangshan-daoguan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"武当山道观是 B 维度下明代道教建筑群的条目；其政治缘起与赐田制度归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wudao-renwu-dongwu-wen-sanse-jin","title":"舞蹈人物动物纹三色锦（Three-Color Brocade with Dancers and Animals）","name_en":"Three-Color Brocade with Dancers and Animals","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","江陵","提花机","经纬密度","7单元"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"舞蹈人物动物纹三色锦是湖北江陵出土的战国锦，为其中纹样最复杂者。它由 7 个单元组成横贯全幅的花纹，经向长 5.5 厘米、纬向宽 49.1 厘米，经纬密度为 156×52 根/平方厘米，表明战国时已有较先进的提花机和熟练的织造技术。\n\n田自秉 2010 册作“舞人动物纹锦”，亦称三色锦，出江陵马山砖厂一号墓；图案由龙凤、麒麟和舞蹈人组成，以连续波折状三角形为骨架，点缀双菱纹、S 纹。田自秉称舞蹈人","path":"works/wudao-renwu-dongwu-wen-sanse-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下战国织锦的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wudaowen-caitao-pen","title":"舞蹈纹彩陶盆（Painted Pottery Basin with Dancing Figures）","name_en":"Painted Pottery Basin with Dancing Figures","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时代","马家窑文化","彩陶","舞蹈纹","青海大通"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painted_pottery_basin","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"舞蹈纹彩陶盆是青海大通上孙家寨马家窑型墓葬出土的彩陶盆，内壁绘三组各五人的集体舞蹈图像。五册用到它的方式差别很大：田自秉给**尺寸与纹样结构**，细到“盆里盛的水到四道圈纹的部位，我们将会看到水面反映出的舞蹈人的倒影”；夏燕靖两版给**五种文化解释**，把学界对舞蹈纹的分歧一次列出；赵农给**图像读法与艺术源流**（“为现代舞蹈、音乐、武术、杂技等艺术形式提供了源头”）；高丰只给一句**艺术评价*","path":"works/wudaowen-caitao-pen.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"舞蹈纹彩陶盆是 B 维度下新石器时代彩陶的器形与装饰样本（马家窑型、内彩、舞蹈人三组五人），其人物纹的构图与人像解读归 C；夏燕靖两版所列五种文化解释涉及原始宗教与氏族制度，归 D 为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wugu-fengdeng-denglongwen-zhijin","title":"五谷丰登灯笼纹织锦（Brocade with Lantern and Bumper Harvest Motifs）","name_en":"Brocade with Lantern and Bumper Harvest Motifs","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","织锦","灯笼纹","五谷丰登","吉祥纹样"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"明代织锦，图9-5-1 的图注为：9-5-1. 明代 五谷丰登灯笼纹织锦。本章明代丝织品种一段（L4155）在段末以（图9-5-1、图9-5-2）并引两图，但该段讲的是妆花、本色花、织金银三类与织造特点，未描述此锦。原文未记尺寸、产地、组织与纹样寓意。","path":"works/wugu-fengdeng-denglongwen-zhijin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代织锦纹样的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wuhan-changjiang-daqiao","title":"武汉长江大桥（Wuhan Yangtze River Bridge）","name_en":"Wuhan Yangtze River Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","1957","桥梁","长江","武汉长江大桥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"武汉长江大桥是 1957 年建成的公路、铁路两用桥，结束了长江自古无大桥的历史。大桥包括引桥全长 1670.4 米，体现了 20 世纪 50 年代中国高跨度钢桥技术的最高水平。来源未给桥址、正桥跨度、通航净空、造价与设计者。","path":"works/wuhan-changjiang-daqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"武汉长江大桥是 B 维度下新中国长江桥梁的条目；其现代钢桥技术意义属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wuhu-changjiang-daqiao","title":"芜湖长江大桥（Wuhu Yangtze River Bridge）","name_en":"Wuhu Yangtze River Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","桥梁","芜湖长江大桥"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"芜湖长江大桥是赵农所列长江上陆续架起的大桥之一，于 2000 年建成。来源只给桥名、年份与所在河流，未给桥长、跨度、材质、设计者与桥址。","path":"works/wuhu-changjiang-daqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"芜湖长江大桥是 B 维度下现代长江桥梁的条目；其现代桥梁技术背景属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wunv-qilian","title":"舞女漆奁（Lacquer Toilet Box with Dancers）","name_en":"Lacquer Toilet Box with Dancers","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","长沙楚墓","漆奁","舞女","人物画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_toilet_box","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"舞女漆奁是长沙楚墓出土的战国漆奁。奁身以黑色和红色带状分割，在红色地上绘出黑色衣服与白色袖、领，形成色彩对比；共绘11个不同动态的舞女，有立有坐、有正有侧。来源未给尺寸、胎质、藏地与墓号。","path":"works/wunv-qilian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"舞女漆奁是 B 维度下战国楚国漆奁的作品条目；其人物画与色彩配置属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wusong-tielu","title":"吴淞铁路（Wusong Railway）","name_en":"Wusong Railway","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晚清","1876年","铁路","吴淞铁路","窄轨"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"railway","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"吴淞铁路是 1876 年英国商行在上海私自修筑的窄轨铁路，用于商业贸易运输。赵农称其一般被认为是中国晚清时期修筑的第一条铁路；第二年被清政府赎回拆毁。来源未给线路长度、起讫站点、造价与拆卸去向。","path":"works/wusong-tielu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"吴淞铁路是 B 维度下晚清第一条铁路的条目；其英国商行私筑与清政府赎回拆毁的制度背景归 D 维度，跨文化技术传入归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wuya-dazhanjian","title":"五牙大战舰（Five-Toothed Great Warship）","name_en":"Five-Toothed Great Warship","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋代","造船","战舰","隋炀帝","龙舟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"warship","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"隋代水师战舰，原文作为隋唐造船技术水平的例证之一列出：五牙大战舰高10余丈，可乘800人；同段并记隋炀帝下江南时随行船只有数千艘，龙舟上有4层殿堂，长20余丈。原文没有说明“五牙”是单船之名还是船型等级，也未给船长、船宽、用材与建造地点。","path":"works/wuya-dazhanjian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度隋代造船技术的器物锚点，材料为正文一句列尺度与载员。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:wuyang-diaosu","title":"五羊（Wuyang (Five Rams)）","name_en":"Wuyang (Five Rams)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","城市雕塑","五羊"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sculpture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《五羊》是广州城市雕塑的代表作品之一，赵农在改革开放后城市雕塑段把它列入能代表城市历史文化的作品。来源只给作品名与所在城市，未给作者、材质、尺度、建成年代与造型。","path":"works/wuyang-diaosu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《五羊》是 B 维度下改革开放后城市雕塑作品的条目；来源只作作品列举，未及制度或机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xi-yue-hua-shan-bei","title":"西岳华山碑（Xiyue Huashan Bei (Stele of Mount Hua)）","name_en":"Xiyue Huashan Bei (Stele of Mount Hua)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北周","北朝","碑刻","北魏","书法"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西岳华山碑是来源在论北朝碑刻时一句话带过的北周碑刻。来源只说它“上承北魏”，风格清朗和平、端庄雅致，未记碑的形制、尺寸、书者、碑文内容与所在地。本条只登记这句评价，不据碑名补写碑文或祠庙内容。来源亦未配此碑图版，图版未核。","path":"works/xi-yue-hua-shan-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度北周碑刻的文字遗存条目，来源只有一句关于承袭与书风的评语，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiangya-bei","title":"象牙杯（Ivory Cup）","name_en":"Ivory Cup","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["商代后期","妇好墓","牙雕","镶嵌绿松石","象牙杯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ivory_artifact","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"象牙杯是殷墟妇好墓出土的商代牙雕。田自秉记其高 30.5 厘米，杯身利用象牙管口制成筒状，旁有把手几与杯身等高；运用线刻、浮雕和镶嵌，杯身以镶嵌绿松石相隔组成四段装饰面，第一、三段刻夔纹，第二、四段刻兽面纹；把手上部雕鹰形、下部雕夔形。来源未给杯口径、壁厚、藏地与镶嵌工艺细节。","path":"works/xiangya-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"象牙杯是 B 维度下商代牙雕的作品条目；其四段纹样与鹰夔把手属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiangyang-leigutai-qiren-wen-qilian","title":"襄阳擂鼓台人物纹漆奁（Figure-Painted Lacquer Cosmetics Box from Leigutai, Xiangyang）","name_en":"Figure-Painted Lacquer Cosmetics Box from Leigutai, Xiangyang","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉早期","襄阳擂鼓台","漆奁","人物纹","黑漆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"襄阳擂鼓台人物纹漆奁是1978年湖北襄阳擂鼓台西汉早期墓出土的漆奁，盖径25厘米、高9.7厘米、体径23.8厘米、高8.8厘米。内底在红漆上用黑漆绘人物三组，以树分隔；盖内亦有人物三组。来源称其为两幅少见的装饰漆画，也是汉代人物画的杰作。","path":"works/xiangyang-leigutai-qiren-wen-qilian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"襄阳擂鼓台人物纹漆奁是 B 维度下西汉人物纹漆奁的器物条目，其人物画构图归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiangyun-huoju","title":"北京奥运会火炬“祥云”（Beijing 2008 \"Xiangyun\" Olympic Torch）","name_en":"Beijing 2008 \"Xiangyun\" Olympic Torch","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["2008奥运","祥云","纸卷轴","铝材","丙烷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"product_design","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"北京奥运会火炬“祥云”造型灵感来自中国传统纸卷轴，长 72 厘米、重 985 克，燃烧时间 15 分钟，零风速火焰高度 25 至 30 厘米。采用锥体曲面异形一次成型和铝材腐蚀、着色技术，燃料为丙烷，外形材料可回收；火炬能在每小时 65 公里强风和每小时 50 毫米大雨下保持燃烧，是我国自主设计研发、拥有完全知识产权的产物。","path":"works/xiangyun-huoju.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 D 维度下当代中国产品设计与国家形象工程的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiannongtan","title":"先农坛（Altar of Agriculture (Xiannongtan)）","name_en":"Altar of Agriculture (Xiannongtan)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明清","北京","籍田","劝农","祭祀"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"temple_complex","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"先农坛是明清北京城南与天坛相对的祭祀建筑，又称山川坛。赵农记每年二月由皇帝举行籍田耕作仪式，祈求风调雨顺、五谷丰登；籍田是帝王在每年春天举行的劝农耕作仪式，也是皇帝身体力行从事农事的象征。来源未给坛制、占地与祭祀仪注。","path":"works/xiannongtan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"D","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"先农坛是 D 维度下明清劝农礼制的条目；坛庙建筑实体归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xianyang-palace","title":"咸阳宫（Xianyang Palace）","name_en":"Xianyang Palace","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","秦代","宫殿","咸阳","六国宫殿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"palace","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"咸阳宫是秦王朝的重要宫殿，位于咸阳原上，为多重楼台建筑群，主殿、侧殿、卧室、浴室以回廊和甬道连通，并设复杂的陶制下水管道。来源称秦每灭一国，即按该国宫殿样式在咸阳原上复制重建，故咸阳原有六国宫殿的别称；考古出土的六国纹饰瓦当被引为佐证（L2852、L2854）。","path":"works/xianyang-palace.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度秦代宫殿建筑的条目，涉及都城宫苑制度与六国建筑元素的移植，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xianyang-yuma","title":"咸阳玉马（Xianyang Jade Horse）","name_en":"Xianyang Jade Horse","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","陕西咸阳","玉马","白玉","云状托板"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"咸阳玉马是1966年陕西咸阳出土的白玉玉马，质地坚细温润，昂首扬尾作奔跃状，上骑一人束巾短衣、双手紧拉鬃毛，下有云状托板。来源称马的姿态富有动感，云状托板又增加画面的安定感，是一件杰出的珍品。","path":"works/xianyang-yuma.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"咸阳玉马是 B 维度下西汉玉雕的器物条目，其奔马、骑者与云状托板的造型关系归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiao-jing-mu-shizhu","title":"肖景墓石柱（Stone Pillar at Xiao Jing's Tomb）","name_en":"Stone Pillar at Xiao Jing's Tomb","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["六朝","南京","石柱","陵墓","莲瓣"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_pillar","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"肖景墓石柱是六朝陵墓石柱的代表，位于南京肖景墓前。来源记柱身有棱，宛如希腊殿柱；柱顶有莲瓣，上立辟邪。同段并记六朝石兽多为天禄、辟邪：天禄有角，立于墓前右方；辟邪有翼而垂舌，立于墓前左方。来源未给石柱的高度、柱径、棱数、材质与保存状况，也未给肖景其人其墓的沿革。","path":"works/xiao-jing-mu-shizhu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"肖景墓石柱是 B 维度下六朝陵墓石雕的器物条目，其柱身棱线与莲瓣辟邪的形制比较归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiao-jinzao","title":"小金灶（Miniature Gold Stove）","name_en":"Miniature Gold Stove","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","西安","沙坡","金器","微雕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"gold_ornament","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"小金灶是 1966 年西安南郊沙坡出土的汉代金器，只有指尖大小，灶上釜中的米粒历历可数，上有“日利”二字。来源称其制作极为精巧。","path":"works/xiao-jinzao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"小金灶是 B 维度下汉代金工微制的器物条目；铭文“日利”与微型造型的视觉设计归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiao-ke-dou-zhao-ma-ma","title":"《小蝌蚪找妈妈》（Where Is Mama (Little Tadpoles Searching for Mother)）","name_en":"Where Is Mama (Little Tadpoles Searching for Mother)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1961","水墨动画","上海美术电影制片厂","中国动画学派","片种"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"animation","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"1961年诞生的我国第一部水墨动画片《小蝌蚪找妈妈》。原文记 1961年第一部水墨动画片《小蝌蚪找妈妈》诞生，为动画影坛增添了最能代表中国风格的新片种；1963年拍摄的水墨动画片《牧笛》，用水墨表现人物、家畜和山水，扩大了水墨动画片的表现领域。原文未记片长、主创名单、出品机构与图版。","path":"works/xiao-ke-dou-zhao-ma-ma.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度水墨动画片种的影片锚点，材料为正文一句。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiaomie-qingting","title":"消灭清廷石雕（Stone Carving Xiaomie Qingting）","name_en":"Stone Carving Xiaomie Qingting","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["太平天国","石雕","谐音","蜻蜓","凤凰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"消灭清廷是太平天国的一件石雕，与直捣清廷同属以蜻蜓谐指清廷的作品。来源记它表现一只凤凰傲然而立，回首怒视身后的一只蜻蜓，表示清廷即将灭亡之意。来源只有一句描述，未给尺寸、石料、出土或收藏地点。","path":"works/xiaomie-qingting.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度太平天国装饰题材的单器条目，石雕工艺属 B 维度、政治寓意属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiaoyan-ta","title":"小雁塔（Small Wild Goose Pagoda）","name_en":"Small Wild Goose Pagoda","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","佛塔","密檐式砖塔","荐福寺","西安"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"小雁塔在西安荐福寺，又称荐福寺塔，建于公元 707 年，原为纪念唐高宗而修造。赵农 2009 册在寺塔一节用两段记它：前段记名称、建年与俗称由来，后段记材料、层数、地震后的残存层数、塔身轮廓与整体观感。来源把它与大雁塔作风格对举，认为两塔一坚挺一柔和，共同诠释大唐风韵。来源未给塔高、平面边长、塔刹形制、寺院布局与地震的具体年份，本条不补。","path":"works/xiaoyan-ta.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"小雁塔是 B 维度下唐代密檐式砖塔的形制样本；来源以大小雁塔风格对举作审美评价，该评价不涉及设计史书写或史学方法，故不指派 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiaoyi-zhuan-lanting-tu","title":"萧翼赚兰亭图（Xiao Yi Tricking Lan Ting (Painting)）","name_en":"Xiao Yi Tricking Lan Ting (Painting)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","绘画","家具","竹椅","藤椅"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《萧翼赚兰亭图》是唐代画家阎立本的画作，表现唐太宗遣监察御史到会稽骗取辨才和尚所藏王羲之《兰亭序》真迹的情景，画面中穿袈裟的辨才和尚所坐的是高背竹椅。来源另引《唐语林》记颜鲁公晚年立藤子事，并结论竹椅和藤椅在唐代早期就已使用。来源未给材质、尺寸、收藏地与画面其余细节，也未视觉核验图像。","path":"works/xiaoyi-zhuan-lanting-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代家具图像的画作锚点，绘画本身属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiche-tu-kongxinzhuan","title":"戏车图空心砖（Hollow Brick with Acrobatic Chariot Scene）","name_en":"Hollow Brick with Acrobatic Chariot Scene","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","新野","空心砖","画象砖","百戏"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pictorial_brick","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"戏车图空心砖是河南新野县出土的汉代画象空心砖，表现两辆戏车上的杂技表演。前车驾马飞奔，车上橦木顶端横木两侧悬伎、立伎、蹲伎；后车橦木与绳连接前车，伎人履绳。来源称其反映汉代百戏之精华，举世罕见。","path":"works/xiche-tu-kongxinzhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"戏车图空心砖是 C 维度下汉代画象砖的器物条目；其空心砖制法与模印工艺归 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xie-ling-yun-mu-ji","title":"谢灵运木屐（Xie Lingyun's Clogs）","name_en":"Xie Lingyun's Clogs","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东晋","谢灵运","木屐","登山","木作"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"wooden_footwear","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"东晋谢灵运制作的木屐，是一种木底鞋，前后装活齿，可用于登山。2009 册称其“可谓是一件设计精良的生活木用品”。原文只给这一句，未记尺寸、材质、活齿结构、制作地点与传世实物。\n\n同段先述魏晋以来房屋增高扩大，家具也相应加高加大，出现圆案、橱柜、扶手椅、束腰圆凳、方凳、长杌等高形家具；床明显加高，并增加顶、帐和围屏；坐类家具品种增多，垂足而坐渐推广；家具结构更加简化，甚至出现金属连接件。","path":"works/xie-ling-yun-mu-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度东晋生活木作的器物锚点，材料为正文一句加同段家具背景。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xielou-shoushan","title":"蟹篓寿山石雕（Shoushan Stone Carving Crab Basket）","name_en":"Shoushan Stone Carving Crab Basket","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","寿山石雕","蟹篓","镂空"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蟹篓是寿山石雕的出色产品。来源记寿山石雕多用镂空手法表现多层次的景物，蟹篓描写鱼篓内外一些螃蟹的各种动态，刻划入微。来源未给作者、尺寸、石种与收藏地点。","path":"works/xielou-shoushan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度寿山石雕单件的条目，蟹篓内外的动态安排属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:ximen-canal","title":"西门渠（Ximen Canal）","name_en":"Ximen Canal","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","魏国","西门豹","邺令","漳水"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"waterway_engineering","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西门渠是战国时期魏国邺地的水利工程，由西门豹主持修筑。赵农记魏文侯派西门豹做邺令，当时漳水从太行山奔流而出，在邺地常常泛滥成灾；西门豹治邺、破除迷信，兴建漳水十二渠，使邺地成为物产丰富、土地肥沃的地区。来源未记渠道长度、灌溉面积与十二渠的具体渠线。","path":"works/ximen-canal.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"西门渠是 B 维度下战国魏国水利工程的条目，来源给主持者、任职、水患与兴修漳水十二渠的效果。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xinzhui-fushi","title":"马王堆贵夫人辛追服饰（Garments of Lady Xinzhui of Mawangdui）","name_en":"Garments of Lady Xinzhui of Mawangdui","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","马王堆","深衣","女服","绕襟"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"马王堆贵夫人辛追服饰见本册图版 4-17，图注为“西汉 马王堆贵夫人辛追服饰”。原文在“秦汉女服”一节称秦汉妇女的礼服仍承古仪、以深衣为尚；《后汉书》记载贵妇入庙助蚕之服“皆深衣制”，但衣襟绕襟层数有所增加，下摆部分肥大，腰身裹得很紧，衣襟角处缝一根绸带系在腰或臀部；并称长沙马王堆汉墓女主人在帛画中的穿着服式是可信的具体形象资料。","path":"works/xinzhui-fushi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度汉代服饰的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiping-shijing","title":"熹平石经（Xiping Stone Classics）","name_en":"Xiping Stone Classics","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东汉","汉灵帝","熹平","儒家经典","八分书"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《熹平石经》是东汉灵帝熹平四年（公元175年）官方刊立的儒家经典石碑。来源记官方选定七种儒家经典，约20余万字，由蔡邕书写，刻在46块石碑上作为标准，树立在洛阳太学门外，供儒生学习对照。今存残石显示其书体为八分书。来源未记碑石尺寸、每碑行款字数、现存残石数量与收藏地点。","path":"works/xiping-shijing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《熹平石经》是 C 维度下儒家经典文字标准化的刻石实物，其刻石工艺归 B 维度；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xique-dengmei","title":"《喜鹊登梅》大挂屏（Large Hanging Screen 'Magpies on Plum Branches'）","name_en":"Large Hanging Screen 'Magpies on Plum Branches","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","雕漆","嵌玉","挂屏","喜鹊登梅"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_screen","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"新中国雕漆嵌玉挂屏，图11-6 的图注为：11-6. 新中国 雕漆嵌玉《喜鹊登梅》大挂屏。正文在“全国民间美术工艺品展览会”一段末以（图11-5、11-6）并引两图，但该段只记展览时间、地点、展品数与巡展国家，未描述挂屏本身。原文未记尺寸、作者、制作单位与工艺细节。","path":"works/xique-dengmei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新中国雕漆嵌玉工艺的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xixia-movable-type-print","title":"西夏活字印本（Tangut Movable-Type Printings）","name_en":"Tangut Movable-Type Printings","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西夏","活字印刷","印刷史","传播"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"printed_book","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"原文在“西夏工艺技术成就”一节把西夏砖雕、金银铜制器、雕版印刷工艺列为重要部分，随后指出：宋朝发明的活字印刷术虽成为印刷史上伟大的里程碑，然而却无一件流传下来；西夏文物中保存着与宋朝同时的西夏活字印本。又从时间的演进和交流地域推见，西夏的活字印刷术在向西方传播过程中起到了桥梁的作用。原文未记具体件名、文种、装帧、行款与藏地，也未举实物编号。","path":"works/xixia-movable-type-print.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度西夏印刷技术的类别锚点，材料为一段论断，无单件实物记录。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xixia-wangling","title":"西夏王陵（Western Xia Imperial Tombs）","name_en":"Western Xia Imperial Tombs","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西夏","陵墓","建筑","夯土","琉璃鸱吻"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mausoleum","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"西夏王陵是西夏的皇家陵园。赵农记其建于银川贺兰山东麓环山的平坦地面，以帝王先后顺序从南向北，形成南北 10 公里、东西 4 公里的巨大皇家陵园区域；每位帝王的陵园都以角台、阁台、碑亭、月城、内城构成独立完整的建筑群；陵园近年考古发现许多建筑遗物，如宫殿正脊的琉璃鸱吻高达 1.52 米，是目前发现的最大的建筑鸱吻，瓦当、琉璃瓦、琉璃滴水、琉璃花砖、条砖、柱础等物比比皆是，陵园附近有许多大型砖瓦石灰窑","path":"works/xixia-wangling.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"西夏王陵是 B 维度下西夏陵墓建筑的条目；其帝陵制度与皇家营建归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xiyi-wen-caitao-ping","title":"蜥蜴纹彩陶瓶（Painted Pottery Vase with Lizard Motif）","name_en":"Painted Pottery Vase with Lizard Motif","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["庙底沟型","彩陶","蜥蜴纹","武山西坪","彩陶瓶"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蜥蜴纹彩陶瓶是庙底沟型彩陶瓶。田自秉记在武山西坪发现陶壶上有描绘类似蜥蜴的动物纹，也很有特色；图版插图 11 题作蜥蜴纹彩陶瓶（庙底沟型）。来源正文作陶壶、图注作瓶，称名不一致；未给尺寸、藏地与年代。","path":"works/xiyi-wen-caitao-ping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"蜥蜴纹彩陶瓶是 B 维度下庙底沟型彩陶瓶的作品条目；其蜥蜴纹属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xuan-shi-biao","title":"宣示表（Xuanshi Biao）","name_en":"Xuanshi Biao","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦汉","东汉","书法","楷书","钟繇"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"calligraphy","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《宣示表》是东汉末年书法家钟繇的代表作之一。赵农在叙述最早楷书时，举《宣示表》等作品，称其书写已将横波顿挫，减少以往隶书的捺挑习惯，形成整洁简练的新型书体。来源未给内容、篇幅、流传、拓本、尺寸与现藏，本条不补。","path":"works/xuan-shi-biao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宣示表是 C 维度下东汉末年楷书作品的条目，来源只以一句把它列为钟繇代表作并描述笔法。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xuande-blue-white-pot","title":"宣德青花缠枝花卉执壶（Xuande Blue-and-White Lotus-Scroll Ewer）","name_en":"Xuande Blue-and-White Lotus-Scroll Ewer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","宣德","青花","执壶","缠枝花卉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宣德青花缠枝花卉执壶是田自秉册插图1图注所记的明代宣德青花器。图注只记器名与时代；正文宣德青花段记瓷胎用景德镇东乡麻仓土，青花原料用南洋输入的苏泥勃青，色调深沉雅静，浓厚处与釉汁渗合形成斑点，装饰花纹多用海水云龙和缠枝牡丹，并注明插图1。本条据图注与同段正文立条，不把正文的宣德青花总述全归此一器。来源未给尺寸、款识、藏地与图版核验。","path":"works/xuande-blue-white-pot.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代宣德青花单器的图注锚点，缠枝花卉与青花呈色属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:xuwen-jin","title":"续纹锦（Xu-Pattern Brocade, Fragment）","name_en":"Xu-Pattern Brocade, Fragment","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","织锦","绫","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"图注作“6-14. 唐代 续纹锦（局部）”。图注系于“绫”段末：原文记绫一般为素地起两至三枚经斜纹提花，也有染成红、黄、绿、紫等色，引《释名》“其纹望之似冰凌之理”；唐代各类丝织品中绫的品种最多、产量很高，许多地方以绫作贡品，据《新唐书》载共有24处之多；唐绫开始追求大花纹的艺术形式，出现“可幅盘缔缭绫”，即整幅的大花纹，段末以（图6-14）统摄。图注称“锦”，所系段落在论“绫”，绫锦类别不衔接；","path":"works/xuwen-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代丝织品的图版锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yang-mao-ti-hong-guan-pu-tu-ba-fang-pan","title":"杨茂剔红观瀑图八方盘（Yang Mao Carved-Red Eight-Lobed Dish with Waterfall View）","name_en":"Yang Mao Carved-Red Eight-Lobed Dish with Waterfall View","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","剔红","雕漆","杨茂","院画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_plate","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"杨茂剔红观瀑图八方盘是李立新《中国设计艺术史论》图4-5 图注所载的元代剔红八方盘。来源称其已受院画风格影响，但四周相连花卉浮雕效果极佳。来源未给尺寸、藏地与递藏；图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/yang-mao-ti-hong-guan-pu-tu-ba-fang-pan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代剔红漆器的器物锚点，其院画风格与花卉浮雕属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yangling-hufu","title":"阳陵虎符（Yangling Tiger Tally）","name_en":"Yangling Tiger Tally","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["秦代","虎符","错金","小篆","汉字设计"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"official_insignia","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"阳陵虎符是秦始皇颁发给阳陵驻守将领的铜制虎符，作虎形，分左右两半，铭文为“甲兵之符，右在皇帝，左在阳陵”。文字作篆体，字形端庄、笔画圆润，以错金制作。高丰把它列为“秦代汉字设计与应用的最佳作品”。","path":"works/yangling-hufu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"阳陵虎符是 C 维度下秦代汉字设计与应用的器物条目，其错金工艺与铜铸形制属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yangxinjia-tonglu","title":"阳信家铜炉（Yangxin Family Bronze Hand-Warmer）","name_en":"Yangxin Family Bronze Hand-Warmer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西汉","兴平","阳信家","提链铜炉","温手炉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_brazier","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"阳信家铜炉是 1981 年陕西兴平西汉墓出土的提链铜炉，高 37.4 厘米。炉作圆鼎形，体壁有九条直线孔，炉身有二链条，体下三蹄状高足；铭文“阳信家铜炉，容斗五升”。","path":"works/yangxinjia-tonglu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"阳信家铜炉是 B 维度下西汉温手铜炉的器物条目；铭文与器形装饰归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yanle-shuilu-gongzhan-wen-hu","title":"宴乐水陆攻战纹壶（Yanle Shuilu Gongzhan Wen Hu (Banquet and Water-Land Battle Hu)）","name_en":"Yanle Shuilu Gongzhan Wen Hu (Banquet and Water-Land Battle Hu)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","四川成都百花潭","画像纹","宴乐","水陆攻战"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"宴乐水陆攻战纹壶是四川成都百花潭出土的战国青铜壶，《宴乐水陆攻战纹壶》为高丰所记器名。壶身画像纹上段有宴乐、采桑、射箭、弋射、狩猎等场面，下段为徒兵搏斗、攻城、水军攻战等场面。高丰把它列为春秋战国“反映时代风貌、表现时代精神的装饰题材”的代表，并在论平视体构图时作为分层横带结构的实例；据其转引庞薰琹语，此器以金银错装饰。赵农 2009 册称此器为“镶嵌宴乐水陆攻战纹壶”，同样记其为四川成都出土，并","path":"works/yanle-shuilu-gongzhan-wen-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"宴乐水陆攻战纹壶是 B 维度下战国青铜容器的器物锚点，其画像纹的题材与三层横带构成同时属 C 维度。同期的水陆攻战纹鉴另见 `works/shuilu-gongzhan-jian.md`，水陆攻战图像题材见 `terms/shuilu-gongzhan-tu.md`，三者不合并。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yannian-yishou-jin","title":"“延年益寿大宜子孙”锦（Yannian Yishou Brocade）","name_en":"Yannian Yishou Brocade","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","织锦","吉祥文字","新疆民丰","茱萸纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brocade","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“延年益寿大宜子孙”锦是新疆民丰出土的汉代织锦。它在卷曲的茱萸纹和云气纹之间穿插七八种奇禽异兽，运用装饰的添加手法表现理想世界，是汉代织物动物纹与吉祥图案的实例；李立新又以它说明汉字进入设计、与图形纹样结合，在织物上表现对世间生活幸福的企盼。","path":"works/yannian-yishou-jin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 C 维度下汉代织锦文字纹样的器物锚点，同时涉及 B 维度的织造工艺。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yanta-shengjiao-xu","title":"《雁塔圣教序》（Yanta Sacred Edict）","name_en":"Yanta Sacred Edict","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","碑刻","书法","褚遂良","唐太宗"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stele","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《雁塔圣教序》是来源在唐代碑刻中举出的褚遂良作品。来源只记其为奉唐太宗之命而书，并以“婉媚遒逸、波拂如铁”评其书。来源未给立碑年、碑址、碑文内容、字数、尺寸与存藏，也未给书写缘起与拓本谱系。题名中的「雁塔」在本段仅作题名语境，来源未说明其与具体塔寺的位置关系，本条不据以补立碑位置。来源此段未配本碑图版，图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"works/yanta-shengjiao-xu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"雁塔圣教序在 C 维度下作为褚遂良奉唐太宗命所书的唐碑条目；碑刻形制归 B 维度。来源未给碑址与立碑年，题名中的「雁塔」不作定位依据。Theme 与 Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yanyu-tongdeng","title":"雁鱼铜灯（Goose-and-Fish Bronze Lamp）","name_en":"Goose-and-Fish Bronze Lamp","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","青铜灯","雁鱼铜灯","山西朔县","灯罩"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_lamp","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"雁鱼铜灯是山西朔县城西照什八庄出土的汉代青铜灯。李立新图1-34 的图题作“雁鱼铜灯（山西朔县城西照什八庄出土）”，正文把它与满城长信宫灯、邗江牛型灯并列为青铜灯具功能设计的典型，说明灯罩可调节光照方向与强度，灯座贮水、虹管导烟以防污染，构件均可卸装。来源未给尺寸、铭文、收藏与铸造工艺，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/yanyu-tongdeng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下汉代青铜灯具的单件条目，其灯罩与雁鱼造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yi-he-ming","title":"瘗鹤铭（Yihe Ming (Epitaph for a Buried Crane)）","name_en":"Yihe Ming (Epitaph for a Buried Crane)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","南朝梁","石刻","南北书风"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"瘗鹤铭是南朝梁石刻。来源在记南朝碑刻时，称其仙气逼人、萧散飞动，却厚重古朴，有南北书风合一的气象（L3463）；来源另配图 5-13（L3459）。来源只称南朝梁《瘗鹤铭》，未言石质、形制、是否摩崖、尺寸、字数、书丹者与现存地点，本条照录，不补。图版未核，不据图补写。","path":"works/yi-he-ming.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度南朝梁石刻的条目，来源记其书风兼有南北合一气象，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yi-xian-wan-fo-tang","title":"义县万佛堂（Wanfo Tang at Yi County）","name_en":"Wanfo Tang at Yi County","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北朝","辽宁义县","万佛堂","石窟","造像"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"cave_temple","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"义县万佛堂是北朝时期开凿于辽宁义县的石窟，来源将其与巩义石窟寺、南北响堂山石窟、南京栖霞山石窟并列为丝绸之路以外的石窟。来源记其后受河流影响，加上明清时期的改造，原始风貌已经丧失，但作为北朝造像的系统仍有研究价值。来源前后名称不一致：L4069 作「辽宁义县万佛寺」，L4079 小标题与正文均作「义县万佛堂」，本条标题取「万佛堂」。来源未载窟数、各窟形制、造像内容与开凿的具体年代。","path":"works/yi-xian-wan-fo-tang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度北朝石窟的条目，属丝绸之路以外石窟之一，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yichiwen-jinzhan-loukong-jinshi","title":"蟻螭纹金盏、镂空金匙（Gold Cup with Yi-Chi Motif and Openwork Gold Spoon）","name_en":"Gold Cup with Yi-Chi Motif and Openwork Gold Spoon","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","金银器","金盏","金匙","随县"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"gold_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"蟻螭纹金盏、镂空金匙是田自秉 2010 册彩版15 图注合列的两件战国金银器：金盏饰蟻螭纹，金匙作镂空。正文另记“如随县出土的金匙、金盏（彩版15）”，把它们作为战国时期单纯用金银制作器皿和工艺品的例证，与辉县固围村出土的镂花银片、银制小人并列。来源未记两器的尺寸、重量、容量、配套关系、制作工艺、铭文与现藏单位，也未点明所属墓葬，出土地只到随县一级。图注作“蟻螭纹”，“蟻螭”不词，疑为蟠螭纹的排印","path":"works/yichiwen-jinzhan-loukong-jinshi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度战国金银饮食器的器物锚点，纹饰与镂空装饰效果归 C 维度为次。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yiheyuan","title":"颐和园（Summer Palace (Yiheyuan)）","name_en":"Summer Palace (Yiheyuan)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","皇家园林","清漪园","长廊","十七孔桥"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"imperial_garden","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"颐和园的前身是乾隆年间建成的清漪园，清漪园原为金元时期的行宫，明代为“好山园”；乾隆年间大肆修复构筑、扩建湖面水域，改瓮山为万寿山，成为清漪园。1860 年英法联军入侵北京，清漪园与圆明园同时被掠夺毁灭，1893 年修复后称为颐和园，1900 年八国联军又毁坏此园，1905 年清政府重新修复。颐和园以东宫门内仁寿殿为中心，形成寝宫乐寿堂、戏楼德和园等建筑群；万寿山下有 728 米长的彩画长廊，南面","path":"works/yiheyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下清代皇家园林的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yin-xunlu","title":"银熏炉（Silver Censer）","name_en":"Silver Censer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","宋代","文思院","德阳","同名异器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silverware","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"银熏炉在本批来源中指两件不同器物。其一为唐代文思院造鎏金银熏炉：通高 29.5 厘米、盖径 25.9 厘米、腹深 7 厘米、重 5.363 千克；银板锤揲成型，盖面缠枝莲上五朵莲花各卧一龟，腹壁流云纹并铆五兽足，器内錾“咸通十年（公元 869 年）文思院造”等 40 余字。其二为宋代银器：1959 年四川德阳孝泉镇清真寺出土的 117 件宋代银器之一，设计作圆球形，上面镂空成卷草纹，还保存着一些唐","path":"works/yin-xunlu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下唐宋银熏炉的器物锚点，因同名而合条，内部按唐器／宋器分列。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yingqing-zhihu","title":"影青执壶（带温酒器）（Yingqing Ewer with Wine Warmer）","name_en":"Yingqing Ewer with Wine Warmer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","影青","景德镇窑","执壶","温酒器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_ewer","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"影青执壶是安徽宿松出土的宋代影青器，带温酒器。来源记壶体有细长的流和把手，壶盖作覆杯状，其上塑出蹲兽作为盖纽；温酒器作花瓣状碗形，碗足还有一环堆贴的垂瓣；胎质洁白精细，釉色明澈青翠。来源称同类作品在宋墓和辽墓都出土较多，是当时流行的一种形式，其源流可能来自金银器。来源未给尺寸、窑口与藏地。","path":"works/yingqing-zhihu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代影青酒器的单器锚点，盖纽蹲兽与花瓣形温酒器属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yingshou-hu","title":"鹰首壶（Eagle-Head Hu）","name_en":"Eagle-Head Hu","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","山东诸城","鹰首","活环","象生造型"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鹰首壶是1970年山东诸城出土的战国青铜壶。田自秉记其壶口和盖作成鹰首形，盖与壶体用活环相联，既能开启又免脱落，称其为一件具有特色的作品。来源未给尺寸、藏地、墓号与同出器物；图注作“鹰首壶(战国)”。","path":"works/yingshou-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鹰首壶是 B 维度下战国青铜壶的作品条目；其鹰首象生造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yinguohe","title":"银果盒（Silver Fruit Box）","name_en":"Silver Fruit Box","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","金银器","银果盒","合肥","双凤纹"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silver_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"银果盒是1955年安徽合肥小南门内原孔庙大成殿西陶瓮所出元代金银器之一。来源记果盒由十个莲瓣形组成，分器盖、格层、底部三部分，重76两；盖面细刻双凤与折枝花卉，格层刻牡丹，器盖边缘十莲瓣转折处各刻折枝花一种，圈足外刻卷草图案。来源未给尺寸、藏地与图版。","path":"works/yinguohe.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代金银器窖藏的单器锚点，双凤与折枝花的纹样组织属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yingxian-muta","title":"应县木塔（Yingxian Timber Pagoda）","name_en":"Yingxian Timber Pagoda","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["辽代","建筑","佛塔","应县木塔","榫卯"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pagoda","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"应县木塔即山西应县佛宫寺释迦塔，俗称“应县木塔”，建于辽清宁二年（1056）。赵农记其为高 9 层楼阁式结构，高 67.31 米，底层直径 30.27 米，塔身平面呈八角形，以木构架柱网组成内外槽制，外槽为行人活动空间，内槽为供奉佛像的地方；木塔利用木构榫卯技术、合理运用木料尺寸，历经近千年风雨与数次地震而挺立，证明中国木结构建筑的杰出成就。来源未给斗拱数量、用材树种、暗层划分与修缮记录。","path":"works/yingxian-muta.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"应县木塔是 B 维度下辽代木构佛塔的条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yinshou-renxing-deng","title":"银首人形灯（Silver-Headed Human-Form Lamp）","name_en":"Silver-Headed Human-Form Lamp","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","中山国","铜灯","人形灯","合金冶炼"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_lamp","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"银首人形灯是战国中山国出土的铜灯，人形双手高举托灯盏。来源把它与十五连盏铜灯并举，称其既反映卓越设计意匠，也反映高度合金冶炼技术。","path":"works/yinshou-renxing-deng.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"银首人形灯是 B 维度下战国中山国铜灯的器物条目；人形托灯的造型设计归 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yipu","title":"艺圃（Garden of Cultivation）","name_en":"Garden of Cultivation","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","苏州园林","私家园林","文震孟","浴鸥池"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"艺圃是苏州文衙弄的明代私家园林，原名药圃，为文震孟的住宅。赵农记其造园特色主要体现在水园：视野博阔，临水依山，高堂阔榭，有博雅堂、延光阁、乳鱼亭等建筑，多继承明代遗风。西南处有浴鸥池，由芹庐、南斋、香草居组成园中园，以红枫、青藤、白石、圆门诸物点缀，形成雅致幽静的小园景物，以小见大、疏朗明快。来源未给建园年代、面积、文震孟生平与建筑尺度。","path":"works/yipu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"艺圃是 B 维度下明代苏州私家园林的器物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yishe-shouhuo-huaxiangzhuan","title":"弋射收获画像砖（Yi She Shou Huo Pictorial Brick）","name_en":"Yi She Shou Huo Pictorial Brick","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["汉代","画像砖","四川成都","凤凰山","弋射"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brick_relief","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"弋射收获画像砖是四川成都凤凰山出土的汉代方砖。砖面在 1/3 处以横线分割为上下两景：上层为弋射，两名射者隐蔽在池树下，以带绳的箭射雁鹫；下层为收稻，农人分组劳作，另有一人挑担提篮送饭。高丰称其为“汉代画像砖中的一件典型作品”，并评为“表现农家射猎、农耕劳动的优美的装饰小品”。\n\n田自秉 2010 册作“弋射收获画象砖”，同样记成都凤凰山出土与三分之一处横分上下，但上层作两人“一向上射，一向右上方","path":"works/yishe-shouhuo-huaxiangzhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"弋射收获画像砖是 C 维度下汉代画像砖的图像条目，其模制工艺属 B 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yong-ning-si","title":"永宁寺（Yongning Temple）","name_en":"Yongning Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北魏","洛阳","永宁寺","佛寺","木塔"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"temple","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"永宁寺是北魏洛阳的著名佛寺，来源据《洛阳伽蓝记》称北魏洛阳有1300余座佛教寺院，永宁寺与白马寺最著名。正文记其兴建于公元 516 年、公元 534 年毁于大火，并据考古勘探记寺院位置、长方形平面、周长、中心塔基与出土物，末称原为九层木塔、推测高度不低于 75 米。来源未载寺院殿宇布局、塔的平面与结构细节、始建主持者与毁后沿革。高度为来源推测，照录限定语。","path":"works/yong-ning-si.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条以 B 维度北魏佛寺与木塔的营造为主，兼及 A 维度《洛阳伽蓝记》与考古勘探的记述，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yongjiu-zixingche","title":"“永久”牌自行车（Forever bicycle）","name_en":"Forever bicycle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","自行车","品牌","字体变形","永久"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"industrial_product","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"“永久”牌自行车是赵农在标志设计段举为成功设计之一的品牌。来源称其字体变形与自行车形结合密切。来源未给生产厂家、创牌年份、车型与产量。","path":"works/yongjiu-zixingche.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"“永久”牌自行车是 C 维度下品牌字形与产品形态结合的作品条目；其工业企业与市场属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yongle-gong","title":"永乐宫（Yongle Palace）","name_en":"Yongle Palace","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","道观","三清殿","朝元图","迁建"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"taoist_temple","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"永乐宫位于山西永济，是元代著名的道观。三清殿是永乐宫的重要建筑，为七间阔单檐四坡顶结构，因供奉玉清元始天尊、上清灵宝天尊、太清道德天尊而名“三清殿”；四壁绘有著名壁画《朝元图》，绘画面积达 400 多平方米。永乐宫因 20 世纪 50 年代修建黄河三门峡水库而迁移到山西芮城。2016 记其为元代为皇帝祈福而建的道教建筑群，宫墙基座、门廊、石阶石雕融会道佛纹饰，既有道家植物花草，又有西汉以来西域忍冬","path":"works/yongle-gong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下元代道教建筑的器物锚点，也涉及 E 维度的纹样传播。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yongzheng-fencai-sangnv-pan","title":"清雍正粉彩仕女采桑图盘（Famille Rose Plate with Ladies Gathering Mulberry Leaves）","name_en":"Famille Rose Plate with Ladies Gathering Mulberry Leaves","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","雍正","粉彩","外销瓷","贸易瓷"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清雍正粉彩外销瓷盘，图9-32 图注作“清代 雍正粉彩仕女采桑图盘”。原文在明清贸易瓷一节举为清代高档外销瓷之例：该盘曾在首都博物馆举办的“清代外销瓷展”中展出，绘图极其精美，众多仕女神形兼备，配景中的房舍器具、树石围栏无不精细入微，画工水平堪比官窑，原文称可说是很高明的画家作品。原文未记尺寸、款识、收藏单位与画稿来源。","path":"works/yongzheng-fencai-sangnv-pan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代外销瓷的器物锚点，材料为正文一段评述加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yu-ben","title":"玉锛（Jade Adze）","name_en":"Jade Adze","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["龙山文化","玉器","玉锛","两城镇","半成品玉材"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_tool","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玉锛是龙山文化遗址出土的玉质工具。田自秉记山东日照两城镇和龙山文化遗址曾发现成坑的半成品玉材，其中有一个玉锛，厚 0.2～0.5 厘米，顶端刻着极为精细的花纹，甚为精巧优美。来源未给出土层位、年代、藏地与长宽尺寸。","path":"works/yu-ben.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"玉锛是 B 维度下龙山文化玉质工具的作品条目；其顶端花纹属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yu-lu","title":"玉鹿（宝鸡西周墓）（Jade Deer）","name_en":"Jade Deer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","宝鸡","玉鹿","佩饰","玉雕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_ornament","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玉鹿是宝鸡西周墓出土的西周玉器。田自秉记大鹿向前奔走、小鹿回首张望，形象十分生动；并把它与洛阳东郊西周墓玉人并举，称二者都是非常精巧的工艺品，反映周代玉器工艺的高度水平。来源未给尺寸、玉料、藏地、墓号与同出器物。","path":"works/yu-lu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"玉鹿是 B 维度下西周玉雕佩饰的作品条目；其双鹿造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yu-pingtuo-shuang-putao-jing","title":"玉平脱双葡萄镜（Jade Pingtuo Double-Grape Mirror）","name_en":"Jade Pingtuo Double-Grape Mirror","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["五代","前蜀王建墓","平脱","漆","玉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_mirror","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玉平脱双葡萄镜是五代平脱器中的精美者，在前蜀王建墓出土镜匣中得见；其做法是在铜镜背面用漆平脱出双玉葡萄，可知当时在铜器上也可髹漆并平嵌宝石花纹。","path":"works/yu-pingtuo-shuang-putao-jing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下五代铜镜的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yu-ren-luoyang","title":"玉人（洛阳东郊西周墓）（Jade Figure from Luoyang）","name_en":"Jade Figure from Luoyang","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","洛阳","玉人","佩饰","玉雕"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_figure","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"玉人是洛阳东郊西周墓出土的西周玉器。田自秉记其头戴高冠、拱手而立；并把它与宝鸡西周墓玉鹿并举，称二者都是非常精巧的工艺品，反映周代玉器工艺的高度水平。来源未给尺寸、玉料、藏地、墓号与同出器物。","path":"works/yu-ren-luoyang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"玉人是 B 维度下西周玉雕人物的作品条目；其冠式与姿态属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuan-huoqiang","title":"元代火铳（Yuan Dynasty Hand Cannon）","name_en":"Yuan Dynasty Hand Cannon","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","兵器","火铳","铜铸","浸铜法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"firearm","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代铜质火铳，图8-27 图注作“元代 火铳”。原文在“元代兵器”一节以火铳为元代兵器制造技术提高的例证：火铳设计科学，用材选择优质铜，且铸造工艺十分讲究，铸造出来的铜质火铳表面光净、质地细腻，符合兵器的技术要求。同段另记提炼铜的方法大有改进，已运用科学方法，原文称之为世界上最早用浸铜法生产铜的工艺方法，也是水法冶金技术的起源。赵农 2009 册另在火器段给出类型序列：元代出现火铳，成为火枪、火炮","path":"works/yuan-huoqiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代火铳铸造与器形的器物锚点，材料为工艺评语、类型序列与两件实物尺寸。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuan-yinjingjia","title":"元代银镜架（Yuan Silver Mirror Stand）","name_en":"Yuan Silver Mirror Stand","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元末","苏州","张士诚","折叠式","银皮雕镂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silverware","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代银镜架 1964 年出土于苏州盘门外吴门桥东南元末吴王张士诚之父母合葬墓，现藏苏州博物馆。镜架作折叠式，由前后两个支架构成，通高 32.8 厘米、宽 17.8 厘米，仿木制框架结构，在整体支架上镶三片经过雕镂的银皮。","path":"works/yuan-yinjingjia.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下元代银器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuandatou","title":"袁大头（Yuan Shikai silver dollar）","name_en":"Yuan Shikai silver dollar","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","1914","银元","袁世凯","袁大头"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"coin","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"袁大头是中华民国政府 1914 年铸造、铸有袁世凯头像的银元俗称。赵农称其质量稳定、币型统一、便于交易，很快流通全国，对民国初年金融经济稳定起过重要作用；又记钱商打戳使银圆变形而成“烂板”。来源未给重量、成色、版别、铸造局与设计者。","path":"works/yuandatou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"袁大头是 B 维度下民国机制银币的作品条目；其币制与金融属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuanmingyuan","title":"圆明园（Old Summer Palace (Yuanmingyuan)）","name_en":"Old Summer Palace (Yuanmingyuan)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","皇家园林","西洋楼","英法联军","三山五园"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"imperial_garden","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"圆明园原为雍正皇帝做皇子时赐获的花园，后经乾隆扩建，加修长春园和绮春园。长春园的一部分是欧洲风格的花园，俗称“西洋楼”；圆明园后被英法联军火烧而毁。2016 记其为清代皇家园林，属“三山五园”之一，包括圆明、长春、万春三园。","path":"works/yuanmingyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下清代皇家园林的器物锚点，也涉及 E 维度的跨文化造园。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yudiaolong","title":"红山玉雕龙（Hongshan Jade Dragon）","name_en":"Hongshan Jade Dragon","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时代","红山文化","玉器","龙形"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"jade_work","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"红山玉雕龙是红山文化的一件玉器，见于李立新第一章图版。来源只有图题“玉雕龙（红山文化）”，未给尺寸、出土地点、玉料、造型细目与收藏，图版未视觉核验；本条只登记图题与所属文化，不据外部资料补写器形。","path":"works/yudiaolong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度红山文化玉器的单器条目，龙形造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yue-kiln-lianhua-wan-heye-tuo","title":"越窑莲花碗荷叶形托（Yue Ware Lotus Bowl with Lotus-Leaf Stand）","name_en":"Yue Ware Lotus Bowl with Lotus-Leaf Stand","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","越窑","莲花碗","荷叶形托","青瓷"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"越窑莲花碗荷叶形托是唐代越窑的一套碗与托，图注见插图2。正文没有单独描述这套器物，只在越窑段总述其胎骨较薄、施釉均匀、釉色青翠莹润，并称越窑为“诸窑之冠”。图版未视觉核验，碗与托的瓣数、尺寸、是否同出一墓均未载。","path":"works/yue-kiln-lianhua-wan-heye-tuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"越窑莲花碗荷叶形托是 B 维度下唐代越窑器物的图版锚点，其莲花与荷叶造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuehan-tielu-huizhang","title":"粤汉铁路徽章（Yuehan Railway Badge）","name_en":"Yuehan Railway Badge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","徽章","粤汉铁路","标志设计"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"badge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"民国时期徽章，图10-1 图注作“民国 粤汉铁路徽章”。原文在“近现代史上的设计更新”一章开篇，以（图10-1、10-2）统摄两图，正文只述鸦片战争后手工业的转折、清政府创办机器生产企业、辛亥革命后资本主义工商业与机器印花、流行时装、商业美术等线索，未描述徽章本身。","path":"works/yuehan-tielu-huizhang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度民国徽章设计的器物锚点，材料只有图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuewang-goujian-jian","title":"越王勾践剑（Sword of Goujian, King of Yue）","name_en":"Sword of Goujian, King of Yue","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋晚期","青铜器","兵器","剑","江陵"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_weapon","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"越王勾践剑是春秋晚期吴越之地的青铜剑，湖北江陵出土，剑格嵌饰、剑身铸菱形花纹并错金鸟篆铭文，埋藏两千四百余年仍完好锋利。五册对它的用法分三路：夏燕靖两版给兵器工艺与防锈原理（成分、剑鞘密封、地下水浸泡），赵农给剑格兽面纹的错石工艺，高丰与田自秉各给一句“剑柄嵌有珐琅釉料”，且都用在**景泰蓝／珐琅源流**的论证里。**五册对剑格与剑柄的装饰说法不一**：同一件器物，一处说剑格嵌蓝色琉璃与绿松石，一","path":"works/yuewang-goujian-jian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"越王勾践剑在五册中承担三重论证：兵器形制与冶铸水平（B）、剑格镶嵌与错金鸟篆铭文的装饰与文字（C）、珐琅釉料用于金属器的早期例证（B 之材料工艺，并被高丰、田自秉两册用于景泰蓝源流之争）。五册均不描述剑身尺寸与整体造型。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuezu-nu-tong-li","title":"刖足奴铜鬲（Bronze Li with Amputated-Foot Slave）","name_en":"Bronze Li with Amputated-Foot Slave","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","铜鬲","刖刑","奴隶","特殊作品"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"刖足奴铜鬲是西周青铜鬲。田自秉称其为一件特殊的作品：鬲下方座的守门者，是一个受了刖刑（即断足）的奴隶。来源另记西周前期鬲少见，后期鬲体由纵深式演变为横宽式。图注作“削足奴铜鬲”，与正文“刖足奴铜鬲”不一致。来源未给尺寸、铭文、藏地与出土地点。","path":"works/yuezu-nu-tong-li.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"刖足奴铜鬲是 B 维度下西周青铜鬲的作品条目；其守门者造型与座面装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yunjian-jin-qun","title":"晕絰提花锦裙（Yunjian Jacquard Brocade Skirt）","name_en":"Yunjian Jacquard Brocade Skirt","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","阿斯塔那","晕絰","提花锦","五色经线"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"garment","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"晕絰提花锦裙是新疆阿斯塔那出土的唐代织锦裙，用黄、白、绿、粉红、茶褐五色经线织成，彩条上用细纬线织出金黄色蒂形小团花，被称为锦上添花锦；田自秉称其为一件精美的作品。来源未给裙长、腰围、幅宽、组织与藏地。","path":"works/yunjian-jin-qun.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"晕絰提花锦裙是 B 维度下唐代织锦服饰的器物条目，其五色条纹与团花属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuntou-jin-xie","title":"云头锦鞋（Cloud-Head Brocade Shoes）","name_en":"Cloud-Head Brocade Shoes","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","阿斯塔那","云头","锦鞋","晕絰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"footwear","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"云头锦鞋是新疆阿斯塔那出土的唐代锦鞋，鞋的里衬采用有蓝、绿、浅红等色的彩条晕絰锦。田自秉只给这一句，未给鞋长、鞋头形制、鞋面材料、墓号与藏地。云头所指的鞋头云形，来源未作解释。","path":"works/yuntou-jin-xie.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"云头锦鞋是 B 维度下唐代锦鞋的器物条目，只记来源所给的一句里衬描述。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yunwen-tongjin","title":"云纹铜禁（Bronze Altar (Jin) with Cloud Patterns）","name_en":"Bronze Altar (Jin) with Cloud Patterns","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["春秋中晚期","楚墓","分铸焊接","镂空"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_furniture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"云纹铜禁是本册说明春秋战国青铜冶铸技术提高的实物例证。原文称此时期青铜器使用转向“钟鸣鼎食”器具的组合，失去祭祀和礼器特性而转向日用生活器具；铸造技术提高，普遍采用器身与耳、足、钮等附件分铸，再用熔铸或焊接加工成器，铸件器壁变薄、一般在 2 厘米左右。1978 年河南淅川下寺楚墓出土的、由多层镂空云纹铜梗组成的铜禁（桌），便是春秋中晚期使用青铜冶铸技术制作的实物例证。同段以 1978 年 5 月湖","path":"works/yunwen-tongjin.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度春秋战国青铜铸造技术的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuxing-gubi","title":"鱼形骨匕（Fish-Shaped Bone Ladle）","name_en":"Fish-Shaped Bone Ladle","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时代","马家浜文化","骨器","鱼形","南京博物馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bone_ladle","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鱼形骨匕是马家浜文化的一件骨器，约公元前 4500 年，长 24.5cm，鹿骨制成，鱼形、磨光、刻有纹饰，制作精良。来源只有一条图注，未给出土地点、用途与纹饰细目，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/yuxing-gubi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新石器时代骨器的单器条目，鱼形造型与刻纹属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuyuan","title":"豫园（Yu Garden）","name_en":"Yu Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","上海园林","私家园林","玉玲珑","花石纲"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"豫园是上海明代中后期所建园林。赵农记豫即安泰，取娱亲安老之意；园有点春堂、万花楼、玉华堂、湖心亭等景区，玉玲珑为江南名石，传为北宋花石纲遗石。来源称豫园虽处闹市之中，却有山林之趣。来源未给建园年份、园主、面积、设计与叠山工匠。","path":"works/yuyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"豫园是 B 维度下明代上海私家园林的器物条目。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:yuzhao-feiliang","title":"鱼沼飞梁（Yuzhao Flying Bridge）","name_en":"Yuzhao Flying Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["北宋","晋祠","鱼沼飞梁","石柱","斗拱"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"鱼沼飞梁是晋祠圣母殿前的十字形梁桥。赵农记“方池为沼，蓄鱼其中，飞梁架桥，跨于沼上”；其结构是在沼中矗立34根八角石柱，上置木制斗拱，以承接梁枋；梁桥为十字分布，筑栏铺路，有殿前平台的作用，又如大鸟欲翔之状。来源未给桥的跨度、柱高、栏板做法与重建的具体年份。","path":"works/yuzhao-feiliang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"鱼沼飞梁是 B 维度下北宋十字形梁桥的条目，材料限于名称、柱数、结构与平面。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zangzu-siyangyuan-huangyangmudiao","title":"藏族饲养员黄杨木雕（Boxwood Carving Tibetan Herder）","name_en":"Boxwood Carving Tibetan Herder","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","黄杨木雕","藏族","饲养员","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"wood_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"藏族饲养员是一件现代黄杨木雕，只见于插图 2 的图注。来源在木雕段记黄杨木生长缓慢、有千年矮之称，质地坚细、色黄而温润、有象牙效果，黄杨木雕以小型、精巧、细腻为特色，新中国时期在圆雕、镂雕、深浅浮雕之外还创造了镶嵌等方法。来源未给作者、尺寸与收藏地点。","path":"works/zangzu-siyangyuan-huangyangmudiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度现代木雕单件的图注锚点，人物造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zanhua-shinv-tu","title":"《簪花仕女图》（Court Ladies Adorning Their Hair with Flowers）","name_en":"Court Ladies Adorning Their Hair with Flowers","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["唐代","周昉","女服","广眉","披帛"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中唐周昉画作，图6-24。原文三处引用：女服段记盛唐以后衣袖放大，到中晚唐一般妇女服装“袖宽超过四尺”，举例即“中唐画家周昉的《簪花仕女图》中所描绘的贵族妇女及南唐二陵出土的陶塑妇女服式”；裙装段把《簪花仕女图》列入唐300年裙子变化的图像序列；面妆段记唐代妇女黛眉名目甚多，“《簪花仕女图》中贵族妇女的眉饰，就是一种广眉”。","path":"works/zanhua-shinv-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度唐代女服与妆容的图像锚点，材料为正文三处引用加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zenghouyi-bianzhong","title":"曾侯乙编钟（Bells of Marquis Yi of Zeng）","name_en":"Bells of Marquis Yi of Zeng","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国早期","青铜器","编钟","曾侯乙墓","礼乐"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_bell_set","source_count":"5","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曾侯乙编钟是 1978 年湖北随县（今随州）曾侯乙墓出土的成套青铜编钟，分上中下三层悬挂，是先秦乐器中体量与音律规模最大的一例。来源之间首先在**件数**上不一致：高丰作“64 件之多”，夏燕靖两版与赵农均作“65 枚”。其次在**论证用途**上分流：夏燕靖两版用它证青铜冶铸的规模与推广（浑铸法、分范合铸、复印花纹），赵农用它证音律成就（五个八度、五声七声音阶、十二个半音）与同墓乐器的组合规模，高","path":"works/zenghouyi-bianzhong.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"曾侯乙编钟是 B 维度下战国青铜铸造与乐器设计的规模锚点：件数、层次、音域与铸造工艺在此汇合。其“钟鸣鼎食”的礼乐组合、用钟的等级规定归 D 维度；钟体铭文作为乐律与文字资料归 C 维度。田自秉一册只给编钟作为器类的形制术语，全册未提曾侯乙。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zenghouyi-bronze-jianfou","title":"曾侯乙铜鉴缶（Bronze Jian-Fou from the Tomb of Marquis Yi of Zeng）","name_en":"Bronze Jian-Fou from the Tomb of Marquis Yi of Zeng","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","曾侯乙墓","鉴缶","缶","鉴"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曾侯乙铜鉴缶出现在本册“缶器”一节。原文从 2008 年北京奥运会开幕式“击缶而歌”说起，指出其中的缶并非真正的乐器缶：缶作为乐器在我国古代大多为陶制，同时又是食物器皿，如战国曾侯乙铜鉴缶。原文随后引《说文解字》《谏逐客令》《史记·廉颇蔺相如列传》说明缶的形制（圆腹、有盖、肩上有环耳，也有方形）与用途（盛水或酒），并记其盛行于春秋战国。赵农册在青铜器部分另称此器为曾侯乙墓所出冰鉴，记“鉴中有一方壶","path":"works/zenghouyi-bronze-jianfou.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度战国青铜容器与“缶”类器物概念的锚点，并承载曾侯乙墓鉴缶的套合结构与冰镇用途。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zenghouyi-lacquer-clothing-chests","title":"曾侯乙墓漆木衣箱（Lacquer Clothing Chests from the Tomb of Marquis Yi of Zeng）","name_en":"Lacquer Clothing Chests from the Tomb of Marquis Yi of Zeng","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","曾侯乙墓","漆木","衣箱","紫锦之衣"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquerware","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曾侯乙墓漆木衣箱是湖北随县曾侯乙墓出土的5件漆木长方形衣箱。赵农在家具一节记这5件衣箱：盖部隆起绘有纹饰，其中一件箱盖上有“紫锦之衣”的字样，用来储存衣服。来源对衣箱只有这些描述，未记尺寸、纹饰内容与箱内遗物。","path":"works/zenghouyi-lacquer-clothing-chests.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"曾侯乙墓漆木衣箱是 B 维度下战国漆木家具的条目，来源只给件数、器形、盖部纹饰与一件箱盖的铭文用途。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zenghouyi-tianxiang-tu","title":"曾侯乙墓漆衣箱天象图（Astronomical Diagram on the Lacquer Chest from the Tomb of Marquis Yi of Zeng）","name_en":"Astronomical Diagram on the Lacquer Chest from the Tomb of Marquis Yi of Zeng","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","曾侯乙墓","漆衣箱","天象图","二十八宿"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"astronomical_diagram","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曾侯乙墓漆衣箱天象图是绘于曾侯乙墓漆衣箱上的天象图，见于李立新第一章图版。来源记图两旁分别为东宫与西宫的青龙、白虎，中有北斗，环以二十八宿古文；并按阴阳五行的宇宙模式解释一年四季十二月分属五行、五行转换与二十八宿位置移动对应，称其为对宇宙天地“仰观俯察”、由东至西再环视苍穹一周的图形。来源未给衣箱尺寸、图像尺寸、绘制技法与衣箱编号，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/zenghouyi-tianxiang-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度战国漆器天象图的单件条目，其青龙白虎与二十八宿的图像构成属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zenghouyi-zunpan","title":"曾侯乙尊盘（Zenghouyi Zun and Pan）","name_en":"Zenghouyi Zun and Pan","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","曾侯乙墓","透雕","熔模铸造","失蜡法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_ritual_vessel","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曾侯乙尊盘出土于湖北随县曾侯乙墓，尊立于盘上。尊盘上下以繁缛的透雕处理，体现了春秋战国时期的熔模设计技术；2016 记墓中出土铜尊、铜盘均由内外两层铜梗组成，透空附饰纤细齐整，是春秋战国青铜冶铸与设计精品。\n\n田自秉 2010 册把曾侯乙墓铜尊、铜盘列为失蜡法的代表实例，并给出失蜡法的四项特点与两条文献线索：其名又称蜡模法、拔蜡法、出蜡法，记载最早见于《唐会要》《洞天清录集》；1979 年河南淅川","path":"works/zenghouyi-zunpan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下战国青铜礼器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zengzhongyoufu-fanghu","title":"曾中游父方壶（Zeng Zhongyoufu Square Hu）","name_en":"Zeng Zhongyoufu Square Hu","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","青铜器","方壶","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"曾中游父方壶是田自秉 2010 册彩版8 图注所记的西周青铜方壶。原文只有一行图注，未记尺寸、重量、纹饰、铭文、出土时间与地点、同出器物和现藏单位，正文亦无对应叙述。器名“曾中游父”照录图注；其中“中”字与西周器铭常见的仲字写法不同，疑为排印或 OCR 误写，来源内无铭文或同器异文可校，本条只记疑点，不改写也不裁定。图版未做视觉核验，凡形制与装饰一概不补。","path":"works/zengzhongyoufu-fanghu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度西周青铜方壶的图注锚点，仅据彩版8 一行图注，图版未视觉核验。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhang-cheng-tihong-box","title":"张成剔红山水人物圆盒（Zhang Cheng Carved-Red Landscape and Figure Round Box）","name_en":"Zhang Cheng Carved-Red Landscape and Figure Round Box","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","雕漆","剔红","张成","故宫博物院"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_box","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"张成剔红山水人物圆盒是故宫博物院所藏元代剔红漆器。来源记其呈枣红色，底及里为栗皮色，涂漆约80层，有针刻张成造字铭，盒面刻观瀑图，人物山石树木都富装饰性；并说与上海博物馆所藏青浦元墓出土的剔红山水人物圆盒同一风格。来源前后器名作圆盒与圆盘，本条照录两存。来源未给尺寸、重量与图版。","path":"works/zhang-cheng-tihong-box.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代剔红漆器的单器锚点，观瀑图与人物山石的装饰属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhang-cheng-yun-wen-ti-xi-qi-he","title":"张成云纹剔犀漆盒（Zhang Cheng Cloud-Pattern Tixi Lacquer Box）","name_en":"Zhang Cheng Cloud-Pattern Tixi Lacquer Box","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","剔犀","雕漆","张成","安徽省博物馆"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_box","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"张成云纹剔犀漆盒是李立新《中国设计艺术史论》图4-4 图注所载的元代剔犀漆盒。来源记其为张成所作，盒呈圆形，雕云纹三组，雕刻刀口深达1cm，刻法深峻，古朴醇厚，今藏安徽省博物馆。来源未给尺寸、递藏与款识；图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/zhang-cheng-yun-wen-ti-xi-qi-he.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代剔犀漆器的器物锚点，其云纹雕刻属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhang-hei-nv-mu-zhi","title":"张黑女墓志（Zhang Heinv Muzhi (Epitaph of Zhang Heinv)）","name_en":"Zhang Heinv Muzhi (Epitaph of Zhang Heinv)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","北魏","墓志","楷书"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"张黑女墓志是北魏墓志。来源在魏碑书风评述的末段以一句评其端庄媚妩、遒厚精古（L3479），与《张猛龙碑》、《敬史君碑》并列。来源未给具体年份、志主生平、出土地、形制、尺寸、字数、书丹者与现存地点。来源无对应图题，图版未核，本条不据图补写。","path":"works/zhang-hei-nv-mu-zhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度北魏墓志的条目，来源仅一句评其书风，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhang-meng-long-bei","title":"张猛龙碑（Zhang Menglong Bei (Stele of Zhang Menglong)）","name_en":"Zhang Menglong Bei (Stele of Zhang Menglong)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["魏晋南北朝","北魏","碑刻","楷书","书法"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"张猛龙碑是北魏碑刻。来源在论楷书时以它为例，称南北朝时期已是楷书发达的开端，《张猛龙碑》与东魏《司马升墓志铭》等作品已属成熟的楷书（L3440）。来源后文又评其书风（L3479），并配图 5-15（L3471）。碑的形制、尺寸、字数、书丹者、具体刻立年份与现存地点，原文未载；图版未核，本条不据图补写。","path":"works/zhang-meng-long-bei.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度北魏碑刻的条目，来源以之为例说明南北朝楷书的成熟并评其书风，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhaozhou-qiao-595-605","title":"赵州桥（Zhaozhou Bridge）","name_en":"Zhaozhou Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["隋代","石拱桥","敞肩拱","李春","赵县"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_arch_bridge","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"赵州桥在河北赵县南洨河上，隋代李春造，又称安济桥。三册都把它当技术史的高点，但**给数的口径不同**：夏燕靖两版给约数（长 50 余米、跨度 37 米多、1300 多年），赵农给精确值（52.82 米、37.4 米、28 道狭拱各 43 块石、9 道铁拉杆）并附唐碑引文。**年代一说 595～605 年设计修建、一说建于 605 年**，两说可相容但不能互证。","path":"works/zhaozhou-qiao-595-605.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"赵州桥是 B 维度下石拱桥的结构样本：敞肩拱、并列式砌筑、铁拉杆、跨高比都在此汇合，也是“结构即形式”的设计观念样本（A 维度）。来源在年代、尺寸、类型名三处均不一致，KU 并列不裁。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhengding-longxingsi-tongfo","title":"正定龙兴寺铜佛（Bronze Buddha of Zhengding Longxing Temple）","name_en":"Bronze Buddha of Zhengding Longxing Temple","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["宋代","铜佛","正定","龙兴寺","42臂"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_buddha","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"正定龙兴寺铜佛是河北正定龙兴寺的宋代铜佛。来源称其极其宏伟，高七丈三尺，有 42 臂，分 7 次铸成，并引《正定县志》记七次铸造自莲花台座逐层升至头顶、上下七接铸就；仅铜佛地基建造就用工役 3000 人。来源未给铜佛的始铸年代、主持者、铜料用量与现存状况。","path":"works/zhengding-longxingsi-tongfo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度宋代大型铜铸佛像的实例锚点，42臂造像属 C 维度，分七次铸造与3000人地基工役反映生产组织属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhengguo-canal","title":"郑国渠（Zhengguo Canal）","name_en":"Zhengguo Canal","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["战国","秦国","郑国","疲秦计","韩国"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"waterway_engineering","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"郑国渠是战国时期秦国在泾水与洛水之间开凿的灌溉水渠。赵农把它写成由韩国“疲秦”计引出的工程：公元前246年，韩国水利专家郑国以间谍身份入秦，建议穿凿水渠，阴谋败露后以“为韩延数岁之命，而为秦建万世之功”自辩，秦王仍用他主持完工，使关中平原北部大量盐碱地变成良田。来源未记渠道长度、灌溉面积与工程形制。","path":"works/zhengguo-canal.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"郑国渠是 B 维度下战国秦国灌溉水渠的条目，来源给工程起因、年代、主持者与改土效果。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhenghe-baochuan","title":"郑和宝船（Zheng He's Treasure Ship）","name_en":"Zheng He's Treasure Ship","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","造船","航海","郑和下西洋","沙船"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"ship","source_count":"4","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"郑和宝船是明永乐至宣德年间郑和七下西洋船队中最大的船。四册的记载角度不同：**夏燕靖两版给主尺度、桅帆数与船队编制**（长 150 米、宽 60 米、9 桅 12 帆、可载 1000 余人），**赵农给出使年表与船上仪器**（1405—1433、28 年、七次、27000 余人、30 余国，配水密隔舱与牵星板等），**高丰只给一句总评与米制尺寸**（146.7 米 × 60 米，“中国古代船舶设计","path":"works/zhenghe-baochuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"郑和宝船是 B 维度下明代造船设计的器物锚点：主尺度、桅帆数、舵杆与船队编制都在此汇合。远洋出使的组织与国家造船业归 D 维度，海禁前后的技术进退归 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhengshi-shijing","title":"正始石经（Zhengshi Stone Classics）","name_en":"Zhengshi Stone Classics","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["三国","曹魏","正始","石经","三体石经"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_inscription","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《正始石经》是三国魏曹芳正始年间的刻石。来源只用一句话交代其时代、帝号与书体：因用古文、篆、隶三种书体书写，又称三体石经。来源未记碑数、经目、碑石尺寸、出土情况与存藏地点，本条不补。该条只据此一句立目，confidence 记为 low。","path":"works/zhengshi-shijing.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《正始石经》是 C 维度下以三种书体刊刻儒家经典的石经实例；Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhengxie-huihui","title":"中国人民政治协商会议会徽（CPPCC emblem）","name_en":"CPPCC emblem","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","人民政协","会徽","标志设计","政协"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"emblem","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国人民政治协商会议会徽是赵农在“标志”节图 10-45 中展示的徽章。来源只有图注一行，正文未展开其设计者、年代、图形构成与象征含义。","path":"works/zhengxie-huihui.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国人民政治协商会议会徽是 C 维度下徽章设计的作品条目；其政治机构属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhengzhou-jinghan-tieluqiao","title":"郑州京汉铁路桥（Zhengzhou Jinghan Railway Bridge）","name_en":"Zhengzhou Jinghan Railway Bridge","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","桥梁","郑州京汉铁路桥"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bridge","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"郑州京汉铁路桥是赵农所列黄河上陆续架起的大桥之一，属早期铁路桥。来源只给桥名与所在河流，未给桥长、跨度、材质、设计者与桥址。","path":"works/zhengzhou-jinghan-tieluqiao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"郑州京汉铁路桥是 B 维度下现代黄河桥梁的条目；其现代桥梁技术背景属 E 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhidao-qingting","title":"直捣清廷石雕（Stone Carving Zhidao Qingting）","name_en":"Stone Carving Zhidao Qingting","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["太平天国","石雕","谐音","蜻蜓","战船"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_carving","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"直捣清廷是太平天国的一件石雕，用谐音与象征手法以蜻蜓指清朝朝廷。来源记它表现一艘战船的前方有一只向下坠落的蜻蜓，以此表示直捣清廷之意。来源只有一句描述，未给尺寸、石料、出土或收藏地点，亦未给图像。","path":"works/zhidao-qingting.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度太平天国装饰题材的单器条目，石雕工艺属 B 维度、政治象征属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhishun-sannian-tong-huoqiang","title":"至顺三年铜火铳（Bronze Bombard of the Third Year of Zhishun）","name_en":"Bronze Bombard of the Third Year of Zhishun","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","火器","铜火铳","回回炮","盏口铳"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"firearm","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"至顺三年铜火铳是元代铸造的大型铜火铳。赵农记元代出现火铳，成为火枪、火炮的基本结构；火铳从 13 世纪开始先以竹筒为枪身，后来改进为金属枪身，充填火药和碎铁成为喷射火枪，铳即筒的转音；火铳分大小两类，小的为手铳，大的为盏口铳即火炮。至顺三年（1332）铸造的铜火铳长 35.5 公分、铳口内径 10.5 公分、重 6.94 公斤，来源称其俗称“回回炮”、是目前保存下来的最早火炮。按通常兵器史，“回回","path":"works/zhishun-sannian-tong-huoqiang.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"至顺三年铜火铳是 B 维度下元代金属管形火器的条目；其军队编制与官方制造归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhongguo-tielu-biaozhi","title":"中国铁路标志（China Railway logo）","name_en":"China Railway logo","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","铁路","标志设计","中国铁路标志"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"corporate_logo","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国铁路标志是赵农在标志设计段举为成功设计之一的企业标志。来源称其稳定庄重、简洁明快，给人以特殊思考的印象。来源未给设计者、启用年份、图形构成与色彩规范。","path":"works/zhongguo-tielu-biaozhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国铁路标志是 C 维度下企业标志设计的作品条目；其铁路机构属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhongguo-yinhang-biaozhi","title":"中国银行标志（Bank of China logo）","name_en":"Bank of China logo","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","中国银行","标志设计","古币","中国银行标志"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"corporate_logo","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中国银行标志是赵农在标志设计段举为成功设计之一的企业标志。来源称其以圆形方孔的古币为依托，演绎出新的精神意义。来源未给设计者、启用年份、图形比例与色彩规范。","path":"works/zhongguo-yinhang-biaozhi.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中国银行标志是 C 维度下企业标志设计的作品条目；其金融机构属性属 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhongguo-yiri-guanggao","title":"《中国一日》广告（Advertisement for China in One Day）","name_en":"Advertisement for China in One Day","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["1930年代","茅盾","书籍广告","版面设计","仿宋字"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"advertisement","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《中国一日》广告是 20 世纪 30 年代为茅盾主编的《中国一日》一书所作的书籍广告。高丰在“书刊、杂志广告”一节记其版面：右侧直排通栏大字书名，书名上方横题“现代中国的总面目”；版面中间直排四行长仿宋字，列出“这里有”四句；另以两行四句仿宋字列出第二组四句；左上角放全书缩影图片，注明字数、装别、定价等。来源评为“非常简洁醒目”“中心突出，主题鲜明”。","path":"works/zhongguo-yiri-guanggao.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"C","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 C 维度下近代书刊广告的版面设计实例，其商业传播属性另涉 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhonghua-minzuyuan","title":"中华民族园（Zhonghua Minzuyuan (China Ethnic Culture Park)）","name_en":"Zhonghua Minzuyuan (China Ethnic Culture Park)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["改革开放","北京","公园","民族风情","中华民族园"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"park","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中华民族园是赵农所述在现代化程度较高的城市中修建的新园林，与「民俗村」一类并列，集南北不同民族风情于一园，使游人在公共环境中获得大量人文信息和有益经验。来源未给园址、建成年代、面积、民族村寨数量与设计者。","path":"works/zhonghua-minzuyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中华民族园是 B 维度下民族风情园林的条目；其作为城市公共文化设施的属性归 D 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhongshan-ling-1929","title":"中山陵（Sun Yat-sen Mausoleum）","name_en":"Sun Yat-sen Mausoleum","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["民国","陵墓建筑","中国固有式","吕彦直","南京"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"mausoleum","source_count":"3","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"中山陵在南京紫金山南麓，吕彦直设计，是近代中国以公开竞图方式选定方案的大型纪念建筑群。三册的关注点不同：**夏燕靖两版抄录征稿条例与评判报告**（含“木铎警世”的钟形释义，并判为近代建筑史上首次具有规划设计意识的大型建筑群组），**赵农给年代、空间序列与风格评断**（1929 年设计、“晨钟暮鼓”、传统陵墓设计的“一曲绝唱”）。**两册对“设计”与“征图”的年份记载不一致**，且钟形平面在两册中的","path":"works/zhongshan-ling-1929.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"中山陵是 B 维度下近代纪念性建筑群的样本：牌坊—墓道—陵门—碑亭—石阶—祭堂—墓室的空间序列与钟形平面都在此汇合。竞图制度、征稿条例与评判报告归 D 维度；“中国固有式”“民族形式”的取向归 A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhu-bishan-yincha","title":"朱碧山银槎（龙槎杯）（Silver Raft Cup by Zhu Bishan）","name_en":"Silver Raft Cup by Zhu Bishan","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","朱碧山","银器","槎杯","至正乙酉"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"silver_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代银工朱碧山所制银槎杯，图8-28 图注作“元代 银龙槎”。原文称银槎为一件酒器，又称槎杯：杯高15.2厘米，长19.8厘米；造型作枝干杈桠的老树，树皮纹理清丽细密，有一老者坐于槎内，手持长石，石上有篆书“支机”二字。槎底刻篆书“槎杯”和“至正乙酉（1345）造”年款，另有七言诗一首：“欲造银河隔上阑，时人浪说贯银湾，如何不觅天孙锦，止带支机片石还。”诗下镌“碧山子”印。原文说乘槎老者的形象与纹","path":"works/zhu-bishan-yincha.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代金银器的器物锚点，材料为正文一段实测记录加图注一行。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhu-ding-tu","title":"铸鼎图（Illustration of Casting a Ding）","name_en":"Illustration of Casting a Ding","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","天工开物","冶铸","铸鼎","插图"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"book_illustration","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"铸鼎图是《天工开物》所载铸造场面插图，图3-4。李立新记其鼓风、熔铜、浇铸，人多、繁忙、紧张，“甲炉既顷，乙炉疾继之，丙炉又疾继之”，各就其位、动作迅捷有序，用以展示“一器而工聚”的密集型生产。来源只给图注与正文描述，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/zhu-ding-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下《天工开物》冶铸插图的单件锚点，其图像表现属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhu-kerou-mu-dan","title":"朱克柔缂丝《牡丹》（Zhu Kerou's Kesi Peony）","name_en":"Zhu Kerou's Kesi Peony","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["南宋","缂丝","朱克柔","辽宁省博物馆","书画缂丝"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"kesi_painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"朱克柔缂丝《牡丹》是南宋高宗时缂丝名手朱克柔的作品，藏于辽宁省博物馆。李立新把它与《莲塘乳鸭图》、沈子蕃《花鸟图》并列，作为缂丝直接将绘画引入设计的例证。来源未给尺寸、画面内容、缂织工序与入藏经过。","path":"works/zhu-kerou-mu-dan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度南宋缂丝作品的单件锚点，其书画化取向属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhu-ran-mu-hei-hong-qi-ji","title":"朱然墓黑红漆几（Black-Red Lacquer Ji from Zhu Ran's Tomb）","name_en":"Black-Red Lacquer Ji from Zhu Ran's Tomb","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["三国吴","漆家具","凭几","朱然墓","马鞍山"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"lacquer_furniture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"朱然墓黑红漆几是来源在论凭几时举出的实物例证，出土于安徽马鞍山东吴朱然墓。来源记魏晋凭几为三足形、几面扁平圆弧，并以这件漆几高26厘米、弧形弦长69.5厘米、几面宽13厘米为据，判断此类凭几的使用已相当成熟。来源没有给器物的专名、木质、髹饰细节与收藏地，本条不补。来源亦未配此几图版，图版未核。","path":"works/zhu-ran-mu-hei-hong-qi-ji.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度三国吴漆木家具的器物条目，来源给凭几的定义、三足形制、一件纪年墓例与三处尺寸，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhuangbing-shican-fuyuan-tu","title":"装柄石铲复原图（Reconstruction of a Hafted Stone Spade）","name_en":"Reconstruction of a Hafted Stone Spade","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时代","装柄","石铲","农业","复原图"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"reconstruction_drawing","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"装柄石铲复原图是李立新用来说明磨制石器与农耕关系的复原图，图题注明“用于农业生产”。来源只给图题与图号，正文以农耕生产为磨制石器出现的最直接因素，未给原器出土信息、复原依据与绘者，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/zhuangbing-shican-fuyuan-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度农具复原图的条目，装柄结构与线图表现属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhuhai-yunv","title":"珠海鱼女（Zhuhai Yunv (Zhuhai Fisher Girl)）","name_en":"Zhuhai Yunv (Zhuhai Fisher Girl)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新中国","现代","城市雕塑","珠海鱼女"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"sculpture","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"《珠海鱼女》是珠海城市雕塑的代表作品之一，赵农在改革开放后城市雕塑段把它列入能代表城市历史文化的作品。来源只给作品名与所在城市，未给作者、材质、尺度、建成年代与造型。","path":"works/zhuhai-yunv.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"《珠海鱼女》是 B 维度下改革开放后城市雕塑作品的条目；来源只作作品列举，未及制度或机构材料。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhuhui-shifu","title":"朱绘有孔石斧（Red-Painted Perforated Stone Axe）","name_en":"Red-Painted Perforated Stone Axe","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["新石器时代晚期","薛家岗","石斧","朱绘","礼器"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"stone_axe","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"朱绘有孔石斧是安徽潜山薛家岗出土的新石器时代晚期石器。李立新把它列为未见使用痕迹、通体磨光的非实用石器之一，称其比实用石器磨得更光、更规范，造型更装饰化，费时费工而更显珍贵，并推测这类石器是原始宗教的礼器。尺寸、朱绘纹样与收藏未载，图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/zhuhui-shifu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度新石器时代石器的单器条目，朱绘与有孔造型属 C 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhui-hanxin-tu-meiping","title":"追韩信图梅瓶（Meiping Vase with the Story of Xiao He Pursuing Han Xin）","name_en":"Meiping Vase with the Story of Xiao He Pursuing Han Xin","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["元代","青花","梅瓶","历史故事纹","瓷器装饰"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"porcelain_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"元代瓷器，图8-11 的图注为：8-11. 元代“追韩信图”梅瓶。原文在元代瓷器装饰纹样一段说元代瓷品的装饰对历史故事题材的创作十分重视，如萧何月下追韩信、蒙恬将军等，这对明清两代瓷器上人物故事的题材有重大影响，句末以（图8-11、8-12）统摄两器。原文未描述此瓶的尺寸、窑口、出土与藏地，也未展开画面情节。","path":"works/zhui-hanxin-tu-meiping.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度元代瓷器装饰题材的器物锚点，材料为图注一行加同段题材列举。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhui-pian","title":"追篇（Zhui Vessel (as Captioned)）","name_en":"Zhui Vessel (as Captioned)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["西周","青铜器","图版著录","器名存疑"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"bronze_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"追篇见本册图版 2-9，图注仅一行“西周 追篇”。原文未在任何段落讨论此器，形制、尺寸、铭文、出土与收藏均无着落。器名“篇”在此语境下可疑：西周青铜器通行器名有“簋”而无“篇”，“追簋”是常见器名，故“篇”很可能是形近讹字或排版误植，但原文没有其他线索可以确证，本条只标疑不改字。","path":"works/zhui-pian.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度西周青铜器的图版锚点，材料只有一行图注且器名存疑。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhulin-qixian-huaxiang-zhuan","title":"竹林七贤画像砖（Brick Relief of the Seven Sages of the Bamboo Grove）","name_en":"Brick Relief of the Seven Sages of the Bamboo Grove","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["晋代","画像砖","文人服饰","玄学","褒衣博带"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brick_relief","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"竹林七贤画像砖是本册论证晋代文人衣着的图像证据。原文称晋代后“汉装”与“胡服”虽各有承袭，但交融演变、样式复杂：“禅衣”仍为仕宦礼服，“长袍”为交领右衽式、袖端收有祛口或为窄袖，“大衫”为袖口宽敞、领和袖都有缘边、衣衫肥长到膝部并束大带；文人则受佛道两教的影响崇尚玄学，衣着突破礼法，敞领宽衫、袒胸露怀成为习俗，这从《竹林七贤画像砖》中可以得到佐证。","path":"works/zhulin-qixian-huaxiang-zhuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度魏晋服饰与士人文化的图像锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhulin-qixian-rongqiqi-zhuanhua","title":"竹林七贤和荣启期砖画（Brick Relief of the Seven Sages of the Bamboo Grove and Rong Qiqi）","name_en":"Brick Relief of the Seven Sages of the Bamboo Grove and Rong Qiqi","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["六朝","南京西善桥","丹阳胡桥","丹阳建山","砖画"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"brick_relief","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"竹林七贤和荣启期砖画是六朝大型砖印壁画，发现于南京西善桥、丹阳胡桥、丹阳建山三处，以西善桥为代表。画面表现嵇康、阮籍、山涛、王戎、向秀、刘伶、阮咸七贤与春秋高士荣启期共八人，逐人表现其典故与神态：或手捧酒杯、蹙额沉思，或赤足趺坐、两目凝视，或披襟抱膝、若有所思。来源称砖画用200多块砖拼合而成，是制陶工艺的杰作。","path":"works/zhulin-qixian-rongqiqi-zhuanhua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"竹林七贤和荣启期砖画是 B 维度下六朝大型砖印壁画的器物条目，其名士题材与玄学背景归 C、A 维度。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhuo-qin-tu","title":"斫琴图（Zhuoqin Tu (Making a Qin)）","name_en":"Zhuoqin Tu (Making a Qin)","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["东晋","绘画","顾恺之","古琴","乐器制作"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"painting","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"斫琴图是来源在论魏晋乐器制作时提到的绘画，相传为东晋顾恺之所作。来源只用一句，把它当作南方制琴工序严格的旁证。来源未记画卷的材质、尺寸、卷数、画面内容与收藏地，也未说明相传的依据，本条不补。来源亦未配此图图版，图版未核，不据图补写形制、纹样与尺寸。","path":"works/zhuo-qin-tu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度东晋乐器制作记载中的绘画条目，来源只有一句，兼含相传的作者归属与工序严格的推论，Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhuozhengyuan","title":"拙政园（Humble Administrator's Garden）","name_en":"Humble Administrator's Garden","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","苏州园林","文征明","远香堂","72亩"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"private_garden","source_count":"2","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"拙政园是明代中期修筑的苏州园林，“拙政”出自西晋潘岳《闲居赋》“灌园鬻蔬，以供朝夕之膳，是亦拙者之为政也”。明代大画家文征明绘有《拙政园图》并著《拙政园记》；园分中、西、东三部分，占地 72 亩，为最大的苏州园林，中部以远香堂为中心，有倚玉轩、小飞虹、香洲、见山楼、雪香云蔚亭、梧竹幽居、荷风四面亭及枇杷园等。","path":"works/zhuozhengyuan.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本 KU 是 B 维度下明代私家园林的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zhuwen-heitao-bo","title":"猪纹黑陶钵（Black Pottery Bowl with Pig Motif）","name_en":"Black Pottery Bowl with Pig Motif","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["河姆渡文化","黑陶","猪纹","图版著录"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"pottery_vessel","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"猪纹黑陶钵见于本册图版 1-16，图注为“河姆渡文化 猪纹黑陶钵”。原文没有展开描述：器形、尺寸、陶质、出土层位、猪纹的构图与刻画方式均未交代，正文也未在河姆渡文化段落提到这一件。","path":"works/zhuwen-heitao-bo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度河姆渡文化陶器的图版锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zi-sha-gua-xing-hu","title":"紫砂瓜形壶（Zisha Melon-Form Teapot）","name_en":"Zisha Melon-Form Teapot","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["明代","宜兴","紫砂","瓜形壶","图注"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"teapot","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"紫砂瓜形壶是李立新《中国设计艺术史论》图4-6 图注所载的明代宜兴紫砂壶。来源只在宜兴紫砂“方非一式，圆不一样”的论述中以图版举例，未给制作者、尺寸、藏地与递藏，也未描述壶形细部与装饰。图版未视觉核验。","path":"works/zi-sha-gua-xing-hu.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度明代宜兴紫砂器的器物锚点。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zisha-donglinggua","title":"紫砂“东陵瓜”（Yixing Zisha 'Dongling Melon' Vessel）","name_en":"Yixing Zisha 'Dongling Melon' Vessel","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","宜兴","紫砂","东陵瓜","紫砂壶"],"confidence":"low","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"teapot","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"清代宜兴紫砂器，图9-27 的图注为：9-27. 清代 紫砂“东陵瓜”。原文在同段总述紫砂陶：紫砂陶是宜兴最有名的陶器，多做茶具；紫砂壶有泡茶色纯、隔夜不馊、用久味永、泥色生辉的特点；陶色有赤褐、淡黄、紫黑等，由紫砂细泥、白泥、绿泥、大红泥等高温烧成；质地本色自然纯朴，以造型取胜，“方非一式，圆不一样”，塑造精致，浅刻花卉、文字装饰。原文未单独描述“东陵瓜”的形制、作者与尺寸。","path":"works/zisha-donglinggua.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度清代宜兴紫砂的器物锚点，材料为图注一行加同段紫砂通说。Theme/Topic 尚未 materialize。"},{"id":"works:zitan-tihong-baozuo","title":"紫檀嵌剔红宝座（Zitan Throne Inlaid with Carved Red Lacquer）","name_en":"Zitan Throne Inlaid with Carved Red Lacquer","type":"work","type_zh":"作品","color":"#F59E0B","tags":["清代","故宫博物院","紫檀","剔红","宝座"],"confidence":"medium","consensus":"tentative","sub_type":"throne","source_count":"1","evidence_status":"source_backed","description":"紫檀嵌剔红宝座是故宫博物院所藏的清式宝座。高丰记其造型作三屏风式，足下有托泥，座前附脚踏；整体雕刻（原文作“回放”），靠背嵌剔红灵仙祝寿图，座面另髹漆描金花卉。来源把它与太和殿金漆雕龙宝座并举，作为清式宫廷家具“最豪华富丽”一类的代表。","path":"works/zitan-tihong-baozuo.md","primary_domain":"chinese-design-history","secondary_domains":[],"primary_dimension":"B","primary_theme":"","secondary_themes":[],"role_in_theme":"","topic_memberships":[],"hierarchy_scope_note":"本条是 B 维度下清式宫廷家具的器物锚点，其多工艺并施的装饰属 C 