-{"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-02-88","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L1188-L1188"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"definition":"横斫式翻地农具，作用为挖根除草、翻动土地","term":"青铜镢"},"proposed_slug":"qingtong-jue","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0044"],"chapter":"第二章 沉痛的狞厉——夏商西周时期的设计","line_end":1188,"line_start":1188,"section":"第二节 工具与农具"},"summary":"商代遗址中已出现青铜镢的作坊，其中有2000件陶模具用于铸范青铜镢。镢类似镐，是一种横斫式的翻地农具，作用是挖根除草、翻动土地；《说文解字》称“镢，大锄”，最早出现应与石器时期的石锛有关。青铜镢在商代遗址中被发现，铁镢则发现于河南扶沟古城墙下春秋文化层之中。","title":"青铜镢","unit_type":"term"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00"}
-{"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-02-89","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L1206-L1206"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"definition":"由石刀演变、带木柄的收割农具","term":"青铜镰"},"proposed_slug":"qingtong-lian","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0044"],"chapter":"第二章 沉痛的狞厉——夏商西周时期的设计","line_end":1206,"line_start":1206,"section":"第二节 工具与农具"},"summary":"青铜镰是在石刀的基础上加以演变的。在收割谷穗时候，有用于掐割的爪镰；在江苏仪征西周墓中出土过一件青铜镰，刃口锋利。镰与铚套用，铚形较小，主要是收割谷穗，可以用绳绑在手指上使用，也称掐刀或爪镰；而镰则带有木柄，刀刃细长并稍弯下钩，多用于割砍禾秸。","title":"青铜镰","unit_type":"term"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00"}
-{"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-02-90","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L1208-L1208"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"definition":"横装木柄的锄地农具","term":"青铜锄"},"proposed_slug":"qingtong-chu","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0044"],"chapter":"第二章 沉痛的狞厉——夏商西周时期的设计","line_end":1208,"line_start":1208,"section":"第二节 工具与农具"},"summary":"最早的铜锄出土于湖北蕲春的西周遗址，是一件凹字形的青铜锄。锄，是横装木柄的一种农具；从石锄到青铜锄再到铁锄，是中国农具材料演变的一种过程，一次比一次坚韧耐用，一次比一次轻巧合理。铁锄最早是在湖北大冶春秋战国的铜绿山古矿井中发现的。","title":"青铜锄","unit_type":"term"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00"}
-{"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-02-91","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L1210-L1210"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"definition":"商代用于农业生产的青铜犁铧","term":"青铜犁铧"},"proposed_slug":"qingtong-lihua","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0044"],"chapter":"第二章 沉痛的狞厉——夏商西周时期的设计","line_end":1210,"line_start":1210,"section":"第二节 工具与农具"},"summary":"在新石器时期就有石制的三角犁形器出现，而到了商代，青铜犁铧出现在了农业生产活动之中，并发挥了重要作用。","title":"青铜犁铧","unit_type":"term"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00"}
-{"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-02-92","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L1347-L1349"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"definition":"如杖状、有一定长度的无刃兵器，西周与戈、戟、酋矛、夷矛合称五兵","notes":"西周材料；春秋战国材料另见“殳（春秋战国）”。","term":"殳"},"proposed_slug":"shu-weapon-zhou","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0049"],"chapter":"第二章 沉痛的狞厉——夏商西周时期的设计","line_end":1349,"line_start":1347,"section":"第四节 兵器与车辆"},"summary":"殳是一种如杖状的兵器，西周与戈、戟、酋矛、夷矛合称五兵，即五种兵器。武王伐纣时，双方在河南牧野大战，殳就已出现在战场之中。殳是有一定长度的无刃兵器，西周时期的遗址中已有一些圆球状、中有圆孔、是方便安装木柄所用的青铜殳头，同时也有带棱刺状的青铜殳头；殳发展到后期成为狼牙棒一类的武器，常常被用作仪仗的器具，象征王权，以至法律的刑具，如“杖杀”的杖。","title":"殳（西周）","unit_type":"term"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T20:07:33+08:00"}
-{"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-02-93","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L797-L799"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"definition":"由削刮器、砍砸器发展而来，以石片镶嵌骨柄制成的复合工具或武器","term":"刀"},"proposed_slug":"dao-weapon","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0026"],"chapter":"第一章 文明的曙光——石器时期的设计","line_end":799,"line_start":797,"section":"第五节 骨器与箭器"},"summary":"旧石器时期晚期开始出现制刀，是削刮器、砍砸器的良性发展。新石器时期的刀具磨制水平已大大提升，已经出现了骨刀、蚌刀、石刀。制刀时将锋利的石片镶嵌在骨柄中，最后成为一种复合的工具或武器。","title":"刀","unit_type":"term"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00"}
-{"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-02-94","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L799-L799"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"culture":"马家窑文化","material":"骨、燧石","name":"石刃骨身匕首"},"proposed_slug":"shiren-gushen-bishou","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0026"],"chapter":"第一章 文明的曙光——石器时期的设计","line_end":799,"line_start":799,"section":"第五节 骨器与箭器"},"summary":"新石器时期遗址中多处出现匕首，不但有石、骨、玉、角、陶等材料出现，亦有骨石复合型；如马家窑文化中有石刃骨身的匕首，就是将燧石片用胶质黏在骨身两边的凹槽中。","title":"石刃骨身匕首","unit_type":"work"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00"}
-{"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-02-95","candidate_type":"claim","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L789-L791"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"claim_scope":"evaluative_claim","claim_text":"西安半坡出土的磨制骨角质渔钩，是一种奇异的设计发明。这是一种设计思想的成熟。利用渔钩钓鱼，远比渔网、鱼叉或弓箭捕鱼的心理活动丰富。钓鱼是一种意志和耐力的体现，钓鱼的过程就是一种哲学观念的形成。这个过程有着特殊的文化意义。原始先民在渔猎活动中，也可以得到许多设计文化的启迪。","knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_confidence":"tentative","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0025"],"chapter":"第一章 文明的曙光——石器时期的设计","line_end":791,"line_start":789,"section":"第五节 骨器与箭器"},"support_note":"作者在渔钩段连续以“奇异的设计发明”“设计思想的成熟”评价半坡骨角质渔钩，并引申钓鱼的意志、耐力与哲学意义。"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00"}
-{"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-02-96","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L941-L949"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"definition":"用绳子穿上贝壳或彩石形成的链状饰物","term":"项链"},"proposed_slug":"xianglian","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0034"],"chapter":"第一章 文明的曙光——石器时期的设计","line_end":949,"line_start":941,"section":"第七节 纺织与饰品"},"summary":"主要的装饰物是通俗意义上的项链，即用绳子穿上贝壳或彩石，形成了链状的饰物，这是人的感官审美的发生。项链的外观有着充分的美感因素，同时也会成为个人或部落财富的象征；或许还有着部落的专门标志的意味，或含有巫术辟邪的成分。","title":"项链","unit_type":"term"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00"}
-{"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-02-97","candidate_type":"claim","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L954-L956"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"claim_scope":"interpretive_claim","claim_text":"从艺术设计的角度看，由饰物到图案的递进是一步之遥。原始先民的饰物连缀有贝壳、彩石等，这种断断续续的串联，既是秩序与变化的法则体现，也包含着色彩与线条的装饰观念。因为，在新石器时期的彩陶图案中，二方连续图案十分成熟，这应与广泛地制作和使用这些饰物有着明确的关系。","knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_confidence":"tentative","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0034"],"chapter":"第一章 文明的曙光——石器时期的设计","line_end":956,"line_start":954,"section":"第七节 纺织与饰品"},"support_note":"作者由饰物连缀直接推论二方连续图案的成熟与广泛制作、使用饰物有明确关系。"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T19:51:48+08:00"}
