 {"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-03-123","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:30:47+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":"2026-10-25","decided_by":"Agent","reason":"已判定 applied：更新 04-knowledge/units/places/yong-cheng.md。新增赵农 L2106：城址东西长约 3300 米、南北长约 3200 米；夯土板筑四步工序（挖槽—夯实地基—板筑—木板换圆木）、平夯与窝夯痕迹（咸阳城旁证，不并入雍城本体）；source_count 2→3、version 1→2","status":"approved"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L2106-L2106"],"lifecycle_class":"terminal","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"location":"陕西凤翔","name":"凤翔雍城","period":"秦国早期"},"proposed_slug":"fengxiang-yongcheng","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0080"],"chapter":"第三章 霸业的冲撞——春秋战国时期的设计","line_end":2139,"line_start":2100,"section":"第四节 城市与建筑"},"summary":"陕西凤翔雍城遗址是秦国早期的城池，东西长约3300米，南北长约3200米。其构筑采用夯土板筑技术：先处理地基、将地面挖出凹槽、夯土坚实，然后板筑。","title":"凤翔雍城","unit_type":"place"},"state":"applied","target_ref":"04-knowledge/units/places/yong-cheng.md","updated_at":"2026-10-25"}
 {"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-03-124","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:30:47+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":"2026-10-25","decided_by":"Agent","reason":"已按 exact change-set 新建 04-knowledge/units/procedures/rammed-earth-board-construction.md","status":"approved"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L2106-L2114"],"lifecycle_class":"terminal","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"name":"夯土板筑","steps":"处理地基、挖槽、夯土坚实、板筑；后世以圆木替木板，并有平夯、窝夯。"},"proposed_slug":"rammed-earth-board-construction","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0080"],"chapter":"第三章 霸业的冲撞——春秋战国时期的设计","line_end":2139,"line_start":2100,"section":"第四节 城市与建筑"},"summary":"夯土板筑是构筑城墙的技术：先处理地基，将地面挖出凹槽，夯土坚实，然后板筑。这种方法在后来的筑墙过程中一直延续使用，只是将木板换成木棍、用圆木替代木板，使夯土受力均匀。秦国咸阳城遗址中发现平夯和窝夯痕迹，窝夯是用木棍用力戳实以保证城墙坚固结实。","title":"夯土板筑","unit_type":"procedure"},"state":"applied","target_ref":"04-knowledge/units/procedures/rammed-earth-board-construction.md","updated_at":"2026-10-25"}
