 {"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-10-101","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:30:47+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":"2026-10-25","decided_by":"Agent","reason":"已按 exact change-set 更新 04-knowledge/units/procedures/duanban-taoyin.md","status":"approved"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L7195-L7195"],"lifecycle_class":"terminal","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"name":"短版技术","steps":"将画面分刻成小块木版，逐色套印，从朱、墨扩展到朱、墨、黛、紫、黄等色。"},"proposed_slug":"duanban-jishu","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0295"],"chapter":"第九章 专制的文化——明清时期的设计","line_end":7209,"line_start":7125,"section":"第四节 文具与书籍"},"summary":"明代书籍印刷技术明显提高的标志，是明末短版技术的出现。短版技术是指分小块的套印，由小零碎的木刻版组成的印刷，犹如堆砌的短钉，称为短版。短版技术使画面色调层次、阴阳变化得以加强，从原来的朱、墨色到朱、墨、黛、紫、黄的套色印刷，增加了版面的丰富感。","title":"短版技术","unit_type":"procedure"},"state":"applied","target_ref":"04-knowledge/units/procedures/duanban-taoyin.md","updated_at":"2026-10-25"}
 {"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-10-102","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:30:47+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":"2026-10-25","decided_by":"Agent","reason":"已按 exact change-set 新建 04-knowledge/units/procedures/gong-hua.md","status":"approved"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L7202-L7202"],"lifecycle_class":"terminal","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"name":"拱花","steps":"用刻版压印，使花纹凸显，效果犹如钢印。"},"proposed_slug":"gong-hua","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0295"],"chapter":"第九章 专制的文化——明清时期的设计","line_end":7209,"line_start":7125,"section":"第四节 文具与书籍"},"summary":"吴发祥和胡正言在印制笺谱的过程中，还采取了拱花印刷技术，用刻版压印，使花纹凸显，犹如后来的钢印。作者称这种“化旧翻新，穷工极变”的创造思想，正是明代书籍印刷不断进步的根本原因。","title":"拱花","unit_type":"procedure"},"state":"applied","target_ref":"04-knowledge/units/procedures/gong-hua.md","updated_at":"2026-10-25"}
