+{"candidate_id":"2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-10-35","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:30:47+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":"2026-10-26","decided_by":"Agent","reason":"写入 04-knowledge/units/works/ming-shisanling.md（新建）；引用 L6801。","status":"approved"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md#L6801-L6803"],"lifecycle_class":"terminal","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国艺术设计史_赵农_2009_高等教育出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"category":"帝王陵墓群","location":"北京昌平天寿山","period":"明代","title":"明十三陵"},"proposed_slug":"ming-shisanling","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0285"],"chapter":"第九章 专制的文化——明清时期的设计","line_end":6812,"line_start":6790,"section":"第二节 城市与建筑"},"summary":"明代十三陵是朱棣及以后历代（除明景泰帝外）十三位明代帝王的陵墓，以北京昌平天寿山为依托，坐北朝南，利用山势，以小丘为门阙，采取公共神道，加强墓园空旷肃穆的气氛。十三陵以朱棣长陵为中心，设有陵门、享殿、明楼、宝城，其余各陵仿长陵规格而尺寸略小。","title":"明十三陵","unit_type":"work"},"state":"applied","target_ref":"04-knowledge/units/works/ming-shisanling.md","updated_at":"2026-10-26"}
