 {"candidate_id":"2010-tianzibing-zhongguo-gongyi-meishushi:cand-01-39","candidate_type":"claim","created_at":"2026-10-24T22:29:05+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国工艺美术史（修订本）_田自秉_2010_东方出版中心.md#L413-L413"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国工艺美术史（修订本）_田自秉_2010_东方出版中心.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"claim_scope":"evaluative_claim","claim_text":"制陶工艺更是这时手工业的一个重要部分，也是氏族社会形成后的一项重要成就。……这时的制陶工艺，不只是求其更合于实用，而且体现了对美的要求。","knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_confidence":"tentative","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0020"],"line_end":413,"line_start":413},"support_note":"作者对制陶在母系氏族社会手工业中地位及其审美意义的评价；同段 2010-tianzibing-zhongguo-gongyi-meishushi:cand-01-34 只论制陶改变泥土内在性质的技术差异，本条不重复该判断。"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T22:29:05+08:00"}
