 {"candidate_id":"2010-tianzibing-zhongguo-gongyi-meishushi:cand-03-35","candidate_type":"claim","created_at":"2026-10-24T22:17:39+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国工艺美术史（修订本）_田自秉_2010_东方出版中心.md#L1103"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国工艺美术史（修订本）_田自秉_2010_东方出版中心.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"claim_scope":"interpretive_claim","claim_text":"被称为饕餮的兽面纹,应是牛、羊、猪等作为祭祀牺牲的形象的表现。……这类纹样是富有宗教意义。它的社会意义大于其审美意义。","knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_confidence":"tentative","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0056"],"line_end":1103,"line_start":1103},"support_note":"作者主张结合器物祭祀用途与象征化、抽象化处理来推断纹样含义。"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T22:17:39+08:00"}
-{"candidate_id":"2010-tianzibing-zhongguo-gongyi-meishushi:cand-03-36","candidate_type":"unit","created_at":"2026-10-24T22:17:39+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国工艺美术史（修订本）_田自秉_2010_东方出版中心.md#L1105-L1107"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国工艺美术史（修订本）_田自秉_2010_东方出版中心.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_fields":{"definition":"近似龙纹的怪兽纹，常见于商代铜器，通常作侧面描写；可两夔相对组成饕餮纹。","name":"夔纹","notes":"变化有两头夔纹、蕉叶夔纹、三角夔纹、蟠夔纹等。","period":"商代"},"proposed_slug":"kui-motif","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0056"],"line_end":1107,"line_start":1105},"summary":"近似龙纹的怪兽纹，常见于商代铜器纹饰中；可两夔相对组成一个饕餮纹，或仅作饕餮纹的附饰，通常只作侧面描写。原文引《庄子·秋水》《山海经·大荒东经》《说文》释其“一足”，并解释侧面描写中四足表现为两足、两足表现为一足。","title":"夔纹","unit_type":"term"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T22:17:39+08:00"}
