 {"candidate_id":"2011-lilixin-zhongguo-sheji-yishu-shilun:cand-01-62","candidate_type":"claim","created_at":"2026-10-24T22:04:50+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国设计艺术史论_李立新_2011_人民出版社.md#L352"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国设计艺术史论_李立新_2011_人民出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"claim_scope":"interpretive_claim","claim_text":"中国设计艺术的历史是一个延续的历史，而在西亚、印度、埃及、希腊以及美洲玛雅，造物设计都有一次或多次的断裂过程。","knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_confidence":"tentative","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0016"],"line_end":352,"line_start":352},"support_note":"作者对中外造物设计延续与断裂所作的比较性历史解释，并据此推出中国设计艺术史是工业革命前最完整、最成功范例的评价；非可直接核验的事实。"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T22:18:54+08:00"}
