 {"candidate_id":"2011-lilixin-zhongguo-sheji-yishu-shilun:cand-04-48","candidate_type":"claim","created_at":"2026-10-24T22:04:50+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国设计艺术史论_李立新_2011_人民出版社.md#L1232-L1232"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国设计艺术史论_李立新_2011_人民出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"claim_scope":"interpretive_claim","claim_text":"手工工场的规模虽然扩大了，而其中造物设计自身的发展又十分有限，器物变化不大，仍延续着传统设计的路子，未见跳跃式的发展，这与工业发展的速度并不同步。","knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_confidence":"tentative","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0062"],"line_end":1232,"line_start":1232},"support_note":"作者以手工工场扩大与器物设计停滞的对比作判断，未提供逐行业器物测量数据。"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T22:04:50+08:00"}
