 {"candidate_id":"2011-lilixin-zhongguo-sheji-yishu-shilun:cand-05-68","candidate_type":"claim","created_at":"2026-10-24T22:04:50+08:00","decision":{"decided_at":null,"decided_by":null,"reason":null,"status":"pending"},"evidence_refs":["03基础书籍-md文档/中国设计艺术史论_李立新_2011_人民出版社.md#L1999-L2001"],"lifecycle_class":"active","origin_ref":"03基础书籍-md文档/中国设计艺术史论_李立新_2011_人民出版社.md","origin_type":"source","payload":{"claim_scope":"factual_claim","claim_text":"中国造物设计现代化的转型始于19世纪50、60年代，是在洋务运动兴办近代新式工业的活动中正式开始的……到甲午之时，新式企业已达300多个，但洋务运动是由政府控制的，缺少商业资本应有的活力……很少涉及普通民用器物的制造。","knowledge_match":{"notes":"04-knowledge 当前无 KU；待人工复核。","status":"novel","target_refs":[]},"proposed_confidence":"tentative","source_span":{"block_ids":["b0114"],"line_end":2001,"line_start":1999},"support_note":"作者对洋务运动时期工业转型的阶段性与局限性的叙述。"},"state":"needs_evidence","updated_at":"2026-10-24T22:04:50+08:00"}
